	file.0000000000000001.title: "Kronwerke Season 2"
	quest.10154E2A9EFDAEFA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Copper&r: &e151&r durability, speed &e5&r, copper mining level, Soft I."
		""
		"Soft slows the speed the more worn the tool is. Enchants well (15)."
	]
	quest.10154E2A9EFDAEFA.quest_subtitle: "151 durability, speed 5."
	quest.10154E2A9EFDAEFA.title: "&6Copper"
	quest.1021176E185BAD4C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/the_end_dragon.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Hit the &5Ender Dragon&r with arrows while it flies. When it lands on the fountain in the middle, it is the sword's turn."
		""
		"Get out of the purple clouds of dragon's breath. Its head butt throws you far, in the worst case over the edge. Beds explode here as in the Nether, only with distance and agreement."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The first fight runs on stream. Check this off if you were there, only one lands the last hit anyway."
	]
	quest.1021176E185BAD4C.quest_subtitle: "The first shared boss of the season."
	quest.1021176E185BAD4C.title: "&5&lDefeat the Ender Dragon"
	quest.1023FB2248B920D6.quest_desc: [
		"&b100 mB of plant oil&r and &b100 mB of ethanol&r give &b200 mB of biodiesel&r in the mixer, without heat. It is the fuel for the diesel engines in the next step and for the trains' Fuel Tanks."
		"{image:createdieselgenerators:textures/item/biodiesel_bucket.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"The &6Canister&r (Andesite Alloy, iron sheets, barrel) holds 4,000 mB, keeps its contents when mined and is filled at the Spout. The &6Oil Barrel&r (two iron sheets and a barrel) is a tank that also works lying down."
		""
		"Immersive Engineering's biodiesel burns in the engines just the same. And the &6Blaze Burner with a straw&r from Crafts & Additions heats for &e20 minutes&r with one bucket of biodiesel, so steam boilers too."
	]
	quest.1023FB2248B920D6.quest_subtitle: "Oil and ethanol, one to one."
	quest.1023FB2248B920D6.title: "&6Mix Biodiesel"
	quest.102BC3916E92EB8B.quest_desc: [
		"Build &e2 Warp Plates&r. Put a &6Dormant Shard&r (2 Warp Dust, flint) into the first, take out the attuned shard and put it into the second."
		""
		"From then on each plate takes you to the other, free of charge. Good for fixed routes, like from the base to the mine."
	]
	quest.102BC3916E92EB8B.quest_subtitle: "Step on and gone."
	quest.102BC3916E92EB8B.title: "&6Lay two Warp Plates"
	quest.10397CE49B00E2C8.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6Mana Pearl&r, middle Manasteel, &6crafting table&r, Manasteel, bottom Manasteel."
		""
		"In hand the halo shows a ring of recipe slots. Right click on the crafting table in the ring opens a crafting window. Right click on an empty slot saves the last crafted recipe, right click on a saved one crafts it from your inventory."
		""
		"With a &bMana Diamond&r it becomes the &6Manufactory Halo&r, which crafts saved recipes on its own as long as you are not holding it. For example, it presses ores and ingots into blocks on the side while you mine."
	]
	quest.10397CE49B00E2C8.quest_subtitle: "The crafting table you always have with you."
	quest.10397CE49B00E2C8.title: "&6Forge an Assembly Halo"
	quest.103E0D07B09DD4A1.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/the_end_arrival.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Jump into the &5End portal&r. It was activated on stream with the event for &estage 4&r, and since then the End is open to everyone."
		""
		"You land on an obsidian platform next to the main island. &eYUNG's Better End Island&r rebuilds the island: a new platform, a tower in the middle, its own gateway portals."
		""
		"&cBelow the islands there is only the void.&r Whoever falls dies, and their things are gone. On your first trip, only take what you need."
	]
	quest.103E0D07B09DD4A1.quest_subtitle: "The portal has been open to everyone since the event."
	quest.103E0D07B09DD4A1.title: "&5&lEnter the End"
	quest.103F22E76C4B53C6.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Pressure Chamber Valve&r und ein &6Reinforced Air Canister Array&r formlos ergeben ein &6Unassembled Reinforced Pressure Chamber Valve&r. Mit dem Programm &eLaser&r macht die Montagestraße daraus das &6Reinforced Pressure Chamber Valve&r."
		""
		"Tausch die Ventile deiner Druckkammer gegen verstärkte, und die Kammer hält &e20 bar&r statt 5. Sie speichert damit viermal so viel Luft. Wände, Gläser und Schnittstellen bleiben, wie sie sind."
	]
	quest.103F22E76C4B53C6.quest_subtitle: "Ein Ventil, viermal so viel Luft."
	quest.103F22E76C4B53C6.title: "&3Rüste die Druckkammer auf 20 bar auf"
	quest.1040C139EA8F7DF9.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Basic Filter&r and an &6observer&r, shapeless, give the &6Counting Filter&r."
		""
		"Beyond saying &ewhich&r items may pass, it also sets &ehow many&r. In an insert card the node fills the target only up to that number: exactly 64 coal in the generator, exactly 16 ore in every machine."
	]
	quest.1040C139EA8F7DF9.quest_subtitle: "The Counting Filter."
	quest.1040C139EA8F7DF9.title: "&cKeep a fixed stock"
	quest.104DB73B74E08E81.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_wood_set.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Mach aus Brettern einer Productive-Trees-Art Treppen, Stufen, Zaun, Zauntor, Tür, Falltür, Knopf, Druckplatte, Schild, Hängeschild und ein &6Bücherregal&r (sechs Bretter um drei Bücher). Die Rezepte sind die von Eichenholz."
		""
		"Bücherregale aus diesen Hölzern zählen am Zaubertisch wie Eichenregale, auch für Apotheosis. Die Create-Säge schneidet Bretter in alle diese Blöcke, und Supplementaries hat für jedes Holz einen Wegweiser."
		""
		"Die Hölzer unterscheiden sich stark in der Farbe: Ebenholz fast schwarz, Balsa fast weiß, Padauk dunkelrot, Purpleheart lila, Pink Ivory rot, Mahagoni rotbraun. Für Bauer ist das der eigentliche Schatz des Mods."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r Mit &6Productive Bees&r gibt es den Fortgeschrittenen Bienenstock und die Erweiterungsbox in jedem dieser Hölzer: Bretter, zwei Waben, ein Stock, Lagerfeuer und Schere."
	]
	quest.104DB73B74E08E81.quest_subtitle: "163 Holzsorten, jede mit kompletter Blockfamilie."
	quest.104DB73B74E08E81.title: "&6Bau mit einem neuen Holz"
	quest.1058D6E92DC60F55.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Dark Power Gems&r in a V give a &6Bowl of Empty Promises&r. With two &6Crushed Dark Gems&r it becomes the &6Dusted&r bowl, and 5 buckets of blood in the infuser turn it into a &6Bowl of Promises&r."
		""
		"Plus a &6Promise Acceptor&r: an &6iron block&r with 10 buckets in the infuser. Bowl, acceptor and a &6spider eye&r in the crafting table give the &6Promise of Tenacity I&r. Put it into an upgrade slot of the infuser."
		""
		"&eWhat it brings:&r The tank doubles and tier 1 recipes open: book becomes &6Blook&r, rotten flesh becomes leather, coal becomes &6Blood Waxed Coal&r, a &6Potentia Sphere&r (redstone, glowstone, slimeball, lapis) for 2 buckets becomes an &6ender pearl&r."
		""
		"Once the infuser has tier 1, the same way with a redstone block instead of the spider eye gives the &6Promise of Velocity&r (faster), with a lapis block the &6Promise of Productivity&r (less blood)."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Botania needs ender pearls for the Mana Pearls in the stage goal. Two buckets of blood per pearl are often cheaper than a night of hunting endermen."
	]
	quest.1058D6E92DC60F55.quest_subtitle: "The infuser keeps its promise."
	quest.1058D6E92DC60F55.title: "&6Make a Promise of Tenacity I"
	quest.105CEFE3C09F8743.quest_desc: [
		"&6Emerald&r: &e1,080&r durability, speed &e10&r, Brittle I, Synergistic II."
		""
		"As a tip: +512 durability and +2 speed."
	]
	quest.105CEFE3C09F8743.quest_subtitle: "1,080 durability, speed 10."
	quest.105CEFE3C09F8743.title: "&aEmerald"
	quest.10675807C38F2CB9.quest_desc: [
		"&5Posuc's Convocation&r: Odus' circle plus &e8 red&r signs. Everything with the Afrit book."
		"&6Warden:&r &e6 sculk&r, &cSacrifice:&r cow. Drops at least &e6 echo shards&r. &6Hoglin:&r netherite scrap, leather, 2 netherrack, 3 porkchops, Crystal, sacrifice pig."
		"&6Elder Guardian:&r 2 prismarine bricks, 2 dark prismarine, sea lantern, water bucket, emerald, sacrifice fish. &6Guardian Familiar:&r 4 diamonds, 2 golden apples, sacrifice villager."
		""
		"The Guardian Familiar sacrifices a limb when you would die. The possessed Shulker needs dragon's breath and comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.10675807C38F2CB9.quest_subtitle: "Afrit in guardians, hoglins and wardens."
	quest.10675807C38F2CB9.title: "&5Draw Posuc's Convocation"
	quest.10683B41B8A2569B.quest_desc: [
		"Iron in the corners, glass at the top and bottom, an Annihilation Core on the left, a Formation Core on the right."
		""
		"Set in the upper slots what it should keep in stock, then it fills itself from the network. What you push into it and is not set moves on into the network. It needs one channel and is the ingredient for the storage bus."
	]
	quest.10683B41B8A2569B.quest_subtitle: "A chest that fills itself."
	quest.10683B41B8A2569B.title: "&6Build an ME Interface"
	quest.10727BE5079CE08E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Enchanter's Sword&r: diamond sword with diamond, 2 gold blocks, 2 Source Gem blocks. &6Enchanter's Shield&r: shield with 2 gold blocks, 2 Source Gem blocks."
		""
		"The sword casts its inscribed spell (without a form, like &eIgnite, Amplify&r) on every hit. The shield gives mana regeneration and spell damage while blocking and repairs itself with mana."
	]
	quest.10727BE5079CE08E.quest_subtitle: "A spell on every hit."
	quest.10727BE5079CE08E.title: "&6Enchant a sword and shield"
	quest.1074C5EB305F9E40.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6diamond ore&r with &eSilk Touch&r and put the block into the Liquefaction Cauldron: &e4 Diamond Sulfur&r for &e100 mB&r of Sal Ammoniac."
		""
		"The Incubator makes one &6diamond&r from each Sulfur with Mineral Salt and a Mercury Shard. A finished diamond only gives one Sulfur back, so never dissolve diamonds, always the ore."
	]
	quest.1074C5EB305F9E40.quest_subtitle: "Silk Touch pays off."
	quest.1074C5EB305F9E40.title: "&bQuadruple Diamond Ore"
	quest.1080DB56E0991988.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_wood_saw.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6Mechanical Bearing&r, on it an arm of blocks with &6Mechanical Saws&r at the tip, joined with &6Super Glue&r, saplings in a ring around it. When the bearing turns, every saw fells the tree it passes, leaves and all."
		""
		"A glued chest catches the wood, a &6Portable Storage Interface&r unloads it as it passes. Without a chest the logs fall to the ground, where hoppers collect them."
		""
		"In stage 1 you still replant the saplings by hand. The &6Deployer&r from stage 2 takes that over, see the right side. For small amounts, the pots are quieter and cheaper."
	]
	quest.1080DB56E0991988.quest_subtitle: "A saw carousel for big trees."
	quest.1080DB56E0991988.title: "&6Let saws fell trees"
	quest.108211ED2A00C4F6.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6redstone&r, one &6comparator&r in the middle, at the bottom repeater, plating, repeater."
		""
		"Right click opens the settings: redstone at the addon turns the machine off, a comparator reads power, inventory or progress. The laser handles redstone by itself already."
	]
	quest.108211ED2A00C4F6.quest_subtitle: "Control Unit Addon."
	quest.108211ED2A00C4F6.title: "&aControl by Redstone"
	quest.10861B93B2E7A489.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_first_tree.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Pflanz den &6Walnuss-Setzling&r auf Erde oder Gras und lass ihn wachsen, mit &6Knochenmehl&r geht es sofort. Etwa 60 Prozent der Blätter sind &eFruchtblätter&r, die erst grün und dann braun werden. Rechtsklick auf ein reifes Blatt gibt &63 Walnüsse&r, das Blatt bleibt und trägt wieder."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/fruit/walnut.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Jedes Fruchtblatt hat &e7 Reifestufen&r und braucht Licht 9 oder mehr. Von allein dauert eine Stufe bei den meisten Bäumen im Schnitt knapp eine Stunde, Bananen und Paranüsse brauchen das Zweieinhalbfache. &6Knochenmehl&r auf das Blatt schaltet eine Stufe weiter, sieben Stück machen es reif."
		""
		"Abbauen lohnt nicht: Ein abgeschlagenes reifes Blatt gibt nur eine Nuss, dazu mit 5 Prozent einen Setzling. Rohe Nüsse geben 1 Hunger, geröstet im Ofen oder Räucherofen (6 Sekunden) sättigen sie dreimal so gut. Nüsse und Obst im Pflanztopf gehen viel schneller, siehe weiter rechts."
	]
	quest.10861B93B2E7A489.quest_subtitle: "Früchte reifen am Blatt, Rechtsklick pflückt."
	quest.10861B93B2E7A489.title: "&aPflanz die Walnuss und ernte Nüsse"
	quest.1088CC6818EB9DDB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Applied Energistics 2&r, &6ME-Laufwerk&r mit zehn Zellen: 1k &e8 128&r Stück bei einer Sorte, 4 160 bei 63 Sorten, 16k 130 048. Jede Zelle fasst höchstens 63 Typen. Konsole mit Suche, Busse, Autocrafting mit Molekularen Assemblern, drahtlose Konsolen. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Das Laufwerk braucht zwei Fortgeschrittene Steuerschaltkreise, der Controller einen Geistgebundenen Edelstein aus Occultism, der Assembler zwei Präzisionsgetriebe. 64k und 256k öffnen in Stufe 4. Siehe Kapitel Applied Energistics 2."
	]
	quest.1088CC6818EB9DDB.quest_subtitle: "AE2, ME-Netz: Zellen mit Bytes und Typen, Autocrafting."
	quest.1088CC6818EB9DDB.title: "Lies: Applied Energistics 2"
	quest.10A0A019F1B3EAFB.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: &6Pattern Provider&r and &6Accumulation Processor&r give the &6MEGA Pattern Provider&r, &6ME Interface&r and processor the &6MEGA Interface&r."
		""
		"Both have twice as many slots as the original. The MEGA Pattern Provider only takes processing patterns."
	]
	quest.10A0A019F1B3EAFB.quest_subtitle: "Twice as many slots."
	quest.10A0A019F1B3EAFB.title: "&eUpgrade Providers to MEGA"
	quest.10B8062FA1D734E9.quest_desc: [
		"With Inferium Essence alone you can build &e10 seeds&r: Inferium in the crafting table and nine kinds in the Infusion Altar, always with 4 Inferium Essence, 4 material and a Prosperity Seed Base."
		""
		"Every seed on the right is a checkmark. You only have to have held it once. What the essence can do afterwards is under Turn Essence into Blocks, the element seeds only become really important in stage 4."
		""
		"All other seeds, from coal upward, need Prudentium Essence or higher and come with their stages."
	]
	quest.10B8062FA1D734E9.quest_subtitle: "Ten kinds, ten checkmarks."
	quest.10B8062FA1D734E9.title: "&6&lCollect All Stage 1 Seeds"
	quest.10C78A2E961A0ECA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/logistics_mg_gadget.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Blank Upgrade Module:&r redstone, lapis, diamonds and a glass pane. From it, with diamonds, iron, gold and redstone, the &6Mining Gadget&r. &eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The &6Mining Gadget MK3&r takes a &6Basic Control Circuit&r in place of redstone, MK1 and MK2 stay as in the mod."
		""
		"Hold the right mouse button and the laser mines what you aim at. It holds &d1,000,000 FE&r, one block costs about 200 FE. It recharges, for example, in the charging slot of a Mekanism Energy Cube. Sneak and right click opens size, range and mode."
	]
	quest.10C78A2E961A0ECA.quest_subtitle: "A laser in place of a pickaxe."
	quest.10C78A2E961A0ECA.title: "&bBuild a Mining Gadget"
	quest.10D30790540AD224.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Infernal Claw&r is leather, &6Molten Core&r, &6Rib Bone&r and &6Slime Pearl&r shapeless. Three claws and a Slime Pearl give the &6Infernal Claws&r."
		""
		"In your inventory they catch fire damage and cost a little hunger for it. Burning and fire blocks become harmless. They do not protect against &clava&r."
		""
		"&eOutlook:&r The claws also go into the &6Pyromancer's Staff&r, which shoots blaze and ghast fireballs."
	]
	quest.10D30790540AD224.quest_subtitle: "Fire costs hunger instead of health."
	quest.10D30790540AD224.title: "&cBuild Infernal Claws"
	quest.10D8416A9B416603.quest_desc: [
		"&6Dark Temples&r stand in almost every Overworld biome, with an &6Environmental Accumulator&r in the middle. Craft a &6Weather Container&r (Dark Gem, glass bottle, sugar in a row) and throw it at the accumulator: it sucks the current weather into the bottle and flips the weather."
		""
		"With a clear sky you get a &6Clear&r container and it starts to rain, in rain a &6Rain&r container, in a thunderstorm &6Lightning&r. Between two rounds the temple needs a 60 second break, and it slowly corrupts the biome around it."
		""
		"&eWorth it:&r A Rain container with 7 glass panes and a Dark Block gives 4 &6Eternal Water&r, an endless water source as a block. With 3 Dark Gems instead of the panes you get 4 &6Buckets of Eternal Water&r. Lightning containers empower the Inverted Potentia for the Mace of Distortion."
	]
	quest.10D8416A9B416603.quest_subtitle: "Weather in bottles, water without end."
	quest.10D8416A9B416603.title: "&5Find a Dark Temple"
	quest.10D995194745CEB3.quest_desc: [
		"Leg ein &6Buch&r in den &6Ofen&r. Heraus kommt &6Cooking for Blockheads I&r, das Kochbuch. Rechtsklick öffnet es: Es zeigt dir jedes Essen, das du mit dem Inhalt deines Inventars gerade machen kannst, Vanilla und alle Mods zusammen."
		""
		"{image:cookingforblockheads:textures/item/recipe_book.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Das Buch allein craftet noch nichts, es zeigt nur. Klick ein Gericht an, und du siehst das Rezept. Oben kannst du nach Name, Hunger oder &eSättigung&r sortieren, das ist die schnellste Art, die besten Mahlzeiten zu finden."
		""
		"Dasselbe Buch formlos in die Werkbank gelegt wird zur &6NoFilter-Ausgabe&r, die alle Rezepte zeigt, auch die, für die dir noch Zutaten fehlen."
	]
	quest.10D995194745CEB3.quest_subtitle: "Ein Buch im Ofen, und du siehst, was du kochen kannst."
	quest.10D995194745CEB3.title: "&6&lBacke das Kochbuch"
	quest.10DF5349940BE080.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r At the top a &6Construction Core&r, enriched iron, a &6Destruction Core&r. In the middle &6chest&r, &6Cable&r, chest. At the bottom enriched iron, an &6Improved Processor&r, enriched iron."
		""
		"The &6External Storage&r sits on the cable and makes the block in front of it part of the network. A chest, a drawer wall, a Mekanism bin, a fluid tank: everything in it shows up in the Grid, and the network stores into it. It needs 6 FE/t."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A drawer wall on External Storage is the cheapest bulk storage for cobblestone, dirt and ores. Give it a high priority in the window, then the wall fills before the disks."
	]
	quest.10DF5349940BE080.quest_subtitle: "Chests, drawers, barrels as storage."
	quest.10DF5349940BE080.title: "&6Hook a Chest onto the Network"
	quest.10E08601498360A2.quest_desc: [
		"One pellet is the start, the obelisk wants a hundred. Bring together &e10 antimatter pellets&r before they go into the chest."
		""
		"Ten pellets are ten million mB of polonium from your fission reactors, processed in the SPS. Once this is done, your antimatter line runs, and the rest is a matter of time."
	]
	quest.10E08601498360A2.quest_subtitle: "Ten pellets, ten million mB of polonium."
	quest.10E08601498360A2.title: "&6&lFill the Antimatter Store"
	quest.10E321A328F2FFE3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nether_structures.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Find one of these structures and tick this off: &6Nether Keep&r, &6harbour&r at a lava lake, &6piglin donjon&r, piglin outpost and piglin camp, or a &6skeleton tower&r."
		""
		"Skeleton towers and skeleton camps come in four styles depending on the biome: wastes, crimson, warped and soul sand. All chests are Lootr chests, so new for every player."
	]
	quest.10E321A328F2FFE3.quest_subtitle: "Castles, harbours and towers in every biome."
	quest.10E321A328F2FFE3.title: "&6Find a Dungeons and Taverns structure"
	quest.10EA5410ED9559AD.quest_desc: [
		"The Quarry Card in the middle, &6Dimensional Shards&r in the corners, plus a &6ghast tear&r, &6emerald&r, &6diamond&r and &6redstone&r. It mines like a pickaxe with Fortune."
		""
		"Every block costs &etwice&r as much power. You find Dimensional Shards as ore in all three dimensions."
	]
	quest.10EA5410ED9559AD.quest_subtitle: "More ore per block."
	quest.10EA5410ED9559AD.title: "&aBuild a Fortune Card"
	quest.10F5975BE0FF3E12.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Nether quartz&r or one quartz block give one &6Fused Quartz&r. A &6glass&r on its own becomes &6Clear Glass&r."
		""
		"Clear Glass goes into the fluid conduit, Fused Quartz into the Soul Vial and the fast fluid conduits. With glowstone added it glows, with amethyst it turns dark."
	]
	quest.10F5975BE0FF3E12.quest_subtitle: "See through, and some of it glows."
	quest.10F5975BE0FF3E12.title: "&fSmelt Fused Quartz and Clear Glass"
	quest.10F8558625071230.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Steel Casing&r in the middle, &64 lead ingots&r around it. Gives 4 &6Fission Reactor Casing&r."
		""
		"With &6stage 5&r Mekanism opens the fission reactor, polonium, plutonium, the SPS and antimatter. A reactor is a closed box, plan on a few dozen casings."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The tech pillar of stage 5 wants &e100 antimatter pellets&r (grows with the player count), each 30 points. The Induction Matrix and fusion are in the chapter &dMekanism: Elite&r."
	]
	quest.10F8558625071230.quest_subtitle: "The shell of the fission reactor."
	quest.10F8558625071230.title: "&5&lBuild Fission Reactor Casing"
	quest.10F8B03ECAD2F8A6.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6Conductive Alloy Ingots&r around a &6Void Chassis&r make the &6Wired Charger&r. Item in, power on, full item out."
		""
		"The &6Wireless Charger&r (an &6Ender Resonator&r at the bottom instead of an alloy) charges the items of all players within &e16 blocks&r without you putting them in. The Slice'N'Splice makes the Ender Resonator from an enderman head, Soularium, silicon and Vibrant Alloy."
	]
	quest.10F8B03ECAD2F8A6.quest_subtitle: "Full batteries for the staff and friends."
	quest.10F8B03ECAD2F8A6.title: "&eCharge Tools at the Charger"
	quest.10FACE4768501B1F.quest_desc: [
		"&eSo geht es:&r Die &6Aufzug-Seilrolle&r von Create hebt eine Kabine, &6Redstone-Kontakte&r am Schacht markieren die Stockwerke, eine Vorrichtungs-Steuerung in der Kabine wählt das Ziel. Alles im Kapitel &6Create: Messing&r."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r Von der Werkstatt hinunter in die Mine oder hinauf auf den Turm, ohne Leiter und ohne Wasserfall. Die Rolle kostet 4 SU pro RPM."
	]
	quest.10FACE4768501B1F.quest_subtitle: "Create: Stockwerke auf Knopfdruck. Stufe 2."
	quest.10FACE4768501B1F.title: "&6Bau einen Aufzug in den Schacht"
	quest.10FC0C3B2554BEF2.quest_desc: [
		"A &6256M component&r needs three 64M, each of those three 16M. Together 13 Awakened nuggets and 27 4M components."
		""
		"Do the math first. A drive full of 16M cells already carries a lot."
	]
	quest.10FC0C3B2554BEF2.quest_subtitle: "Enough room for the rest of the season."
	quest.10FC0C3B2554BEF2.title: "&bBuild a 256M Cell"
	quest.11062793CCC81271.quest_desc: [
		"Schick die &6Klumpen&r durch den &6Zerkleinerer&r. Jeder Klumpen wird ein &6Dreckiger Staub&r, eins zu eins, für etwa &d20 FE/t&r."
		""
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Stahlgehäuse in die Mitte, links und rechts ein &6Mahlwerkrad&r von Create statt der Lavaeimer, Schaltkreise oben und unten, Redstone in die Ecken. Die Räder kommen aus den Mechanischen Handwerkseinheiten, zwei pro Rezept, siehe Kapitel Create: Messing."
		""
		"Der Zerkleinerer ist Stufe 2. Hast du ihn schon aus dem Kapitel Mekanism, stell ihn einfach hinter die Klärkammer."
	]
	quest.11062793CCC81271.quest_subtitle: "Klumpen wird Dreckiger Staub."
	quest.11062793CCC81271.title: "&4Zerkleinere die Klumpen"
	quest.110707208D725711.quest_desc: [
		"&6Extended Machine Frame&r: four Entro Infused Ingots, copper, iron, quartz glass. A frame, a crafting terminal, two Logic Processors, two glass cables and a Sky Stone Tank give the &6Crystal Assembler&r."
		""
		"It replaces throwing things into water: from four each of charged certus, redstone and nether quartz with water it makes eight fluix. The side with the screen does not connect to the network."
		""
		"&eOpen in stage 3:&r &6Crystal Fixer&r (repairs budding blocks), &6Circuit Slicer&r, &6Tag&r and &6Mod Storage Bus&r, &6Threshold Level Emitter&r, &6Pattern Modifier&r, &6ME Void Cell&r. &cStage 4:&r the Ex machines."
	]
	quest.110707208D725711.quest_subtitle: "Recipes that do not fit on the crafting table."
	quest.110707208D725711.title: "&3Build a Crystal Assembler"
	quest.1111000A32B2AB97.quest_desc: [
		"Put &bsoul fire&r right in front of an &6Encased Fan&r: fire on &6soul sand&r or a &6soul campfire&r. The air stream &5haunts&r whatever flies through."
		""
		"&6Ink sacs&r become glow ink sacs, &6sweet berries&r glow berries, &6bricks&r Nether bricks, torches and lanterns their soul variants. EMI shows everything under &eHaunting&r."
		""
		"A &6block of brass&r over a &6brass sheet&r makes the &6Peculiar Bell&r. Haunted it becomes the &6Haunted Bell&r: held or rung, it shows dark spots where monsters can appear."
	]
	quest.1111000A32B2AB97.quest_subtitle: "Soul fire instead of water or lava."
	quest.1111000A32B2AB97.title: "&5Let the fan haunt"
	quest.11132E911E20825A.quest_desc: [
		"Die Bienen deiner Zuchtstation füllen den Stock mit Honig. Ist er voll, tropft er außen. Eine &6Glasflasche&r holt eine &6Honigflasche&r heraus, die &6Schere&r Honigwaben. Ein &6Lagerfeuer&r unter dem Stock hält die Bienen dabei friedlich."
		""
		"Honig brauchst du für den Honigglasierten Schinken und den Gleaming Salad aus dem Kapitel &6Kochen&r, Waben für Kerzen und die Bienenstöcke von Stufe 2."
	]
	quest.11132E911E20825A.quest_subtitle: "Die Bienen arbeiten ohnehin."
	quest.11132E911E20825A.title: "&eErnte Honig an der Zuchtstation"
	quest.1116F2A117F62841.quest_desc: [
		"Forge all four pieces from &6Thermal Springstone Ingots&r, like iron. Worn, it sets enemies that damage you on fire."
		""
		"Against the &5Lunar Monstrosity&r fire is worth gold, against the Freezes and the Permafrost too."
	]
	quest.1116F2A117F62841.quest_subtitle: "Whoever hits you catches fire."
	quest.1116F2A117F62841.title: "&cWear Full Springstone Armor"
	quest.112AC0A1331E07F9.quest_desc: [
		"Lithium from the Thermal Evaporation Plant (stage 3) into the &6Chemical Crystallizer&r: &e100 mB&r become one &6Lithium Dust&r."
		""
		"You know the crystallizer from ore quintupling in the chapter &5Mekanism: Ore Step by Step&r. Every Induction Cell needs four dust."
	]
	quest.112AC0A1331E07F9.quest_subtitle: "Lithium gas becomes dust."
	quest.112AC0A1331E07F9.title: "&fCrystallize Lithium Dust"
	quest.1131CB21A6634931.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Darkstone Pedestal&r: three &6Arcane Polished Darkstone Slabs&r on top, an &6Arcane Polished Darkstone Pillar&r in the middle (two Arcane Polished Darkstone on top of each other), three &6Polished Darkstone&r at the bottom."
		""
		"Pedestals go on the &eeight outer gilded blocks&r. Right clicking with an item puts exactly one on it, right clicking with an empty hand takes it back. The forge sees every pedestal within &e4 blocks&r."
		""
		"Four pedestals are enough for the first rituals. Later rituals need more: the forge upgrade to tier 2 lays out eight ingredients, the Ferrognetic Mixture seven. Build all eight over time."
	]
	quest.1131CB21A6634931.quest_subtitle: "This is where a ritual's ingredients lie."
	quest.1131CB21A6634931.title: "&7Place Darkstone Pedestals"
	quest.1135AEBB7F2BE32C.quest_desc: [
		"First the &6Diamond Sickle&r: &e3 diamonds&r in an arc, a stick bottom left. Then the sickle in the middle, &e2 Inferium Ingots&r left and right, &e2 Inferium Gemstones&r top and bottom."
		""
		"The sickle clears plant material over a large area, the Inferium Sickle farther than the diamond one. Ideal for removing grass and flowers before building a farm, or getting leaves off trees. For ripe essence crops stay with the scythe, it does not uproot them."
	]
	quest.1135AEBB7F2BE32C.quest_subtitle: "Grass, leaves and flowers gone in one sweep."
	quest.1135AEBB7F2BE32C.title: "&aBuild an Inferium Sickle"
	quest.1135C188C41A2A52.quest_desc: [
		"Eight basic cables, transporters, pipes or tubes around an &6Infused Alloy&r give eight advanced ones. Or right click a placed pipe with the alloy."
		""
		"&eValues:&r cable &d51,200 FE/t&r, transporter 16 items per move and twice as fast, pressurized tube 2,000 mB per move, pipe 1,000 mB."
	]
	quest.1135C188C41A2A52.quest_subtitle: "More throughput for the larger line."
	quest.1135C188C41A2A52.title: "&eUpgrade your pipes"
	quest.114064CF7BCEAD0A.quest_desc: [
		"&5Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion&r, 9x9: &e16 white&r and &e12 purple&r signs, &e8 candles&r."
		"It is started with the Foliot book. Out comes no spirit, but an item."
		""
		"&eWhat it makes:&r Research Fragment Dust, Nature Paste, Fragile Soul Gem, Vitality Compass, Knowledge Tablet, Infused Lenses and two satchels. In stage 3 also: Foliot Miner, storage base, Stable Wormhole, Storage Stabilizer tier 1."
	]
	quest.114064CF7BCEAD0A.quest_subtitle: "The pentacle for Foliot items."
	quest.114064CF7BCEAD0A.title: "&5Draw Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion"
	quest.11406E459331DEF9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Zuckerrohr&r wächst im Pflanztopf auf &6Sand&r, &6Süßbeeren&r und &6Leuchtbeeren&r auf Erde. Alle drei brauchst du ständig: Zucker für Kuchen und Kakao, Süßbeeren für den Honigglasierten Schinken und den Lachs, Leuchtbeeren für den Gleaming Salad."
		""
		"Je ein Trichter-Topf über einer Theke, und die Zutaten für die Spitzengerichte rechts kommen von allein."
	]
	quest.11406E459331DEF9.quest_subtitle: "Zucker und Beeren für die besten Gerichte."
	quest.11406E459331DEF9.title: "&aZieh Beeren und Zuckerrohr im Topf"
	quest.1145E95636FC59C3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_dynamo.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Two &6redstone&r and an &6Iron Mechanical Component&r on top, &6iron ingot&r, &6Copper Coil Block&r, iron ingot below make the &6Kinetic Dynamo&r."
		""
		"It only takes rotation from the &6Windmill&r or &6Water Wheel&r of Immersive Engineering, no shafts from Create. &ePlace the dynamo first&r, then the windmill or wheel on its shaft side."
	]
	quest.1145E95636FC59C3.quest_subtitle: "Rotation becomes power."
	quest.1145E95636FC59C3.title: "&e&lSet up a Kinetic Dynamo"
	quest.1149FC31C6D283BD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Marimorphosis&r (grey, yellow, green, red, Runes of Earth and Fire, Redstone Root): turns stone into eight kinds of metamorphic stone, depending on the biome."
		"&6Hyacidus&r (2 purple, 2 magenta, 1 green, Runes of Water and Autumn, Redstone Root): poisons mobs until one hit is enough."
		"&6Vinculotus&r (2 black, 2 purple, 1 green, Runes of Water, Sloth and Lust, Redstone Root): endermen in a wide radius teleport to it."
	]
	quest.1149FC31C6D283BD.quest_subtitle: "Three flowers with special effects."
	quest.1149FC31C6D283BD.title: "&6Transform stone and hunt mobs"
	quest.1157E7370025048C.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Deployer&r with &6shears&r in front of the sheep pen shears everything standing 2 blocks in front of it. In punch mode (wrench) with a sword it kills animals and monsters. The Reliquary &6Pedestal&r does the same without rotation: a sword in it strikes 5 blocks far, shears shear sheep."
		""
		"An andesite funnel on the floor or the Hopperhock from Botania collects wool and meat."
		""
		"See the &6Create: Brass&r (Deployer) and &dReliquary&r (Pedestal) chapters."
	]
	quest.1157E7370025048C.quest_subtitle: "Deployer and Reliquary pedestal."
	quest.1157E7370025048C.title: "&6Stage 2: shears and swords on their own"
	quest.115F30162901E42F.quest_desc: [
		"At the front end of every &5End Ship&r hangs a &6dragon head&r. Break it and take it with you."
		""
		"It looks nice on the wall, moves its jaw with redstone, and it is the crown of the best bookshelf for the enchanting table (quest &6Draconic Endshelf&r further right)."
	]
	quest.115F30162901E42F.quest_subtitle: "At the bow of every End Ship."
	quest.115F30162901E42F.title: "&5Take the Dragon Head Along"
	quest.116242A29E7AC583.quest_desc: [
		"Planks, a &6hay bale&r and a &6golden carrot&r, see EMI. Fill it with wheat, carrots or seeds."
		""
		"Animals nearby eat from it and breed on their own. Leather, meat and wool come along on the side."
	]
	quest.116242A29E7AC583.quest_subtitle: "The animals feed themselves."
	quest.116242A29E7AC583.title: "&6Build a Feeding Trough"
	quest.116A9D90E68C7E9B.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6lesser focus&r in the middle, a &6Mark of Mastery&r on the pedestal, &d5,000 source&r."
		""
		"The greater focus strengthens its school without weakening the others. &cFire&r: Spell Damage II while you burn. &bWater&r: mana regeneration when you are wet. &fAir&r: mana regeneration above Y 200. &aEarth&r: mana regeneration below Y 0."
		""
		"With an Enchanted Spell Turret, 3 essences and the focus in the chamber (&d5,000 source&r) you get an elemental turret: 65 percent cheaper for spells of its school."
	]
	quest.116A9D90E68C7E9B.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: master of one school."
	quest.116A9D90E68C7E9B.title: "&6Grind a Greater Focus"
	quest.116F76D0D44979A5.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &6Otherworld Logs&r into Spiritfire. They crumble into &6Otherworld Ashes&r, one ash per log."
	]
	quest.116F76D0D44979A5.quest_subtitle: "The first half of every chalk."
	quest.116F76D0D44979A5.title: "&6Burn Otherworld Ashes"
	quest.117235BCD3B8A2A8.quest_desc: [
		"Top steel, glass, steel, middle &6Elite Control Circuit&r, &6Steel Casing&r, Elite Control Circuit, bottom steel, &6Network Reader&r, steel. The reader is glass, Infused Alloy, an Energy Tablet and steel."
		""
		"The desk is the control center for everything you own: here you enter &etrusted players&r and set the security of all your machines at once, instead of switching each one."
		""
		"On a server with many players it is the quickest way to protect teleporters, QIO and factory from strangers and still give friends access."
	]
	quest.117235BCD3B8A2A8.quest_subtitle: "Secure every machine at once."
	quest.117235BCD3B8A2A8.title: "&8Set Up a Security Desk"
	quest.1173BB99F35C5533.quest_desc: [
		"With &6iron dust&r in the middle. Lowers the gas consumption of Purification, Injection and Dissolution Chamber, which Speed Upgrades drive up."
	]
	quest.1173BB99F35C5533.quest_subtitle: "Less gas per operation."
	quest.1173BB99F35C5533.title: "&8Build a Chemical Upgrade"
	quest.1173CCA07DACD7FB.quest_desc: [
		"&aAttraction&r (Flourishing log, 2 iron ingots, Earth Essence): pulls creatures within &e8 blocks&r to the brazier."
		"&aRepulsion&r (Flashing log, 2 Air Essences, piston): pushes creatures within &e15 blocks&r away, with a bone only undead."
		"&aDetection&r (Flashing log, 2 spider eyes, glowstone dust, Source Gem block): monsters within &e128 blocks&r glow for 10 minutes."
		"&aZapping&r (Flashing log, Air Essence, 2 diamonds, lightning rod, Source Gem block): lightning on everything that approaches."
	]
	quest.1173CCA07DACD7FB.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: a checklist for the base."
	quest.1173CCA07DACD7FB.title: "&aMake the guardian rituals"
	quest.117715D863B98139.quest_desc: [
		"With &6Carry On&r you lift chests, barrels, furnaces and many machines with their contents: &esneak&r, both hands empty, &eright click&r. A right click on the ground puts the load down again. You carry animals the same way."
		""
		"While carrying you are slower and cannot hold anything else. The load comes with you through a portal into another world. If you die, it stands where you died."
		""
		"Some things stay put: everything from the Kronwerk, waystones, other players and monsters, plus what the mod excludes by itself, such as blocks from Botania and Immersive Engineering. In the protected spawn you lift nothing."
	]
	quest.117715D863B98139.quest_subtitle: "With empty hands, with its contents."
	quest.117715D863B98139.title: "&7Carry a Chest Away"
	quest.117F837D68603172.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Electrum Plate&r plus wire cutters gives &6Electrum Wire&r, four of them around a stick make four &6MV Wire Coils&r. &6MV connectors&r like LV, only with electrum ingots."
		""
		"MV wire carries &d8 192 FE/t&r over 16 blocks, an MV connector &d1 024 FE/t&r. The loss per stretch is four times smaller than with copper."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/wirecoil_electrum.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.117F837D68603172.quest_subtitle: "Four times the power of copper."
	quest.117F837D68603172.title: "&eWind MV Wire Coils"
	quest.117F8F7ECFD66576.quest_desc: [
		"Deactivate the core, raise it one tier with &eTier Up&r in its window, turn on &eToggle Build Guide&r and place the blocks: &6150 Draconium Blocks&r and &6178 redstone blocks&r."
		""
		"&eStorage:&r &e356,000,000,000&r energy."
	]
	quest.117F8F7ECFD66576.quest_subtitle: "150 and 178 blocks, 356 billion."
	quest.117F8F7ECFD66576.title: "&cCore Tier 6"
	quest.1180EF03053017BE.quest_desc: [
		"Alloy, Energy Tablet, alloy at the top. Alloy, &6Atomic Alloy&r, alloy in the middle. A Refined Obsidian Ingot at the bottom."
		""
		"It builds, digs and hits with power in place of durability, with modes for more speed. In stage 4 it is built into the middle of the &6Meka-Tool&r."
	]
	quest.1180EF03053017BE.quest_subtitle: "An electric tool for everything."
	quest.1180EF03053017BE.title: "&cBuild an Atomic Disassembler"
	quest.1181A9249AFE8A26.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Wooden Grips&r, two &6Steel Rods&r and a &6Heavy Engineering Block&r make the &6Buzzsaw&r. At the Engineer's Workbench you insert a &6Sawblade&r, fueling works like the drill."
		""
		"It fells whole trees, even big jungle trees. With the &6Rockcutter Blade&r (diamonds and steel plates) it cuts stone out cleanly, as if with Silk Touch."
		""
		"The &6Blade Quiver&r carries two spare blades, sneak and scroll to switch."
	]
	quest.1181A9249AFE8A26.quest_subtitle: "Whole trees at once."
	quest.1181A9249AFE8A26.title: "&6Build a Buzzsaw"
	quest.1196FCD847967DA4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Waystones&r stand in villages and scattered in the wild. A &eright-click&r activates one for you; from then on you travel from any waystone to any other you already know. The one at spawn takes you to the obelisk with one click."
		""
		"The trip costs &eexperience levels&r: about one level per 100 blocks in a straight line, at most 27. Into another dimension it is always 27 levels. Global waystones, warp plates and return scrolls cost nothing. What a destination costs is shown next to it in the selection menu."
		""
		"Your own waystones, warp stones and scrolls are shown in the chapter &aExploration&r."
	]
	quest.1196FCD847967DA4.quest_subtitle: "Click it once, travel there again and again."
	quest.1196FCD847967DA4.title: "&6Activate a waystone"
	quest.1197C995813373E1.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding."
		"&6Bowls:&r an &6ender chest&r, &e2 leather&r, a &6string&r, a &6silver&r and a &6gold ingot&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book, 150 seconds."
		""
		"Right click opens your ender chest wherever you are. Sneaking right click binds the satchel to you: whoever uses it then opens your ender chest. This way you send items to other players over any distance."
	]
	quest.1197C995813373E1.quest_subtitle: "The ender chest in your pocket."
	quest.1197C995813373E1.title: "&6Bind an Ender Satchel"
	quest.119D0028D1464DA6.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6grindstone&r, a &6glass&r, a &bSpirit Attuned Crystal&r, a &6prismarine crystal&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book, 150 seconds."
		""
		"Unlike the normal grindstone it removes &eonly curses&r and leaves all other enchantments on. You get the full experience of the curses back."
		""
		"If you combine two items, the enchantments of the upper one stay. The repair gives the durability of both plus &d20 percent&r."
	]
	quest.119D0028D1464DA6.quest_subtitle: "Curses gone, enchantments stay."
	quest.119D0028D1464DA6.title: "&6Bind a Spirit Grindstone"
	quest.11A153DA0A016018.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6Blank Module&r and a &6lava bucket&r, shapeless. A &6Void Module&r."
		""
		"It deletes whatever is in the buffer, irreversibly. &eAlways&r enter a whitelist (cobblestone, gravel, dirt), otherwise one day the diamond is gone."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The &eT&r button below the filter slots means &6Termination&r. If it is on, the router stops after this module when it has done something. Void with a cobblestone whitelist and T first, then the sender: that way only cobblestone goes away and the rest moves on."
	]
	quest.11A153DA0A016018.quest_subtitle: "The Void Module, with care."
	quest.11A153DA0A016018.title: "&cVoid the Surplus"
	quest.11A651F50710E9D5.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Skelette&r mit dem Learner im Inventar, das bringt ein frisches Modell bis &9Advanced&r. Eiswanderer und Sumpfskelette zählen mit."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d128 FE/t&r. Eine Vorhersage wird im Fabrikator zu &632 Pfeilen&r, 24 Knochen, 4 Skelettschädeln oder 2 Rippenknochen von Reliquary. Knochen heißt Knochenmehl, und das braucht jede Farm."
	]
	quest.11A651F50710E9D5.quest_subtitle: "Pfeile und Knochen ohne Spawner."
	quest.11A651F50710E9D5.title: "&7Lerne das Skelett"
	quest.11ACBB04C125D6E9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Polished Rose Quartz&r over an &6iron sheet&r makes an &6Electron Tube&r."
		"{image:create:textures/item/electron_tube.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"It goes into deployer, brass funnel, train signal and display board. Every round of the precision mechanism eats one, and Mekanism makes its first circuit from it."
	]
	quest.11ACBB04C125D6E9.quest_subtitle: "The logic in every brass machine."
	quest.11ACBB04C125D6E9.title: "&6Build electron tubes"
	quest.11B4C1BD496F1FC7.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Large C. Infuser&r: Robit in the middle, Ultimate max Chemical Tanks left and right, Ultimate Control Circuits at the top and bottom, steel blocks in the corners."
		""
		"There are also the large Electrolytic Separator, Rotary Condensentrator, Solar Neutron Activator, Heat and Gas Generator. Look at the recipes in EMI. The large Wind Generator comes in stage 5."
	]
	quest.11B4C1BD496F1FC7.quest_subtitle: "Robit in the middle, steel blocks around it."
	quest.11B4C1BD496F1FC7.title: "&3Build a Large Machine"
	quest.11BA3B9F87029256.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r oben drei &6Ziegel&r, in der Mitte Eisenbarren, &6Werkbank&r, Eisenbarren, unten drei &6Holzstämme&r. Das ist der &6Steinmetztisch&r (Mason Table) von &6Chipped&r."
		""
		"&eSo geht es:&r Leg einen Stein hinein, zum Beispiel Stein, Bruchstein, Tiefenschiefer oder Ziegelsteine. Rechts erscheinen alle Varianten, 62 bei Stein, 66 bei Bruchstein, 65 bei Ziegeln. Klick eine an, dann &eCraft&r für einen oder &eCraft All&r für den ganzen Stapel. Jede Variante tauscht eins zu eins und lässt sich wieder zurückwandeln."
		""
		"Die Vorschau zeigt den Block einzeln, als 2x2 oder als waagerechte oder senkrechte Reihe, damit du siehst, wie Muster zusammenlaufen."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Chipped ändert nur das Aussehen. Für den Obelisken zählt &6Bruchstein&r in jeder Variante gleich, das Ziel von Stufe 1 will 20 000 davon."
	]
	quest.11BA3B9F87029256.quest_subtitle: "Über 60 Varianten aus jedem Stein."
	quest.11BA3B9F87029256.title: "&7&lBau einen Steinmetztisch"
	quest.11BAD0579630355B.quest_desc: [
		"New biomes, waystones, structures full of loot and the mining dimension for digging without holes in the landscape."
	]
	quest.11BAD0579630355B.quest_subtitle: "Biomes, waystones, the mining dimension."
	quest.11BAD0579630355B.title: "&6Open Exploration"
	quest.11BDE9774E219B5D.quest_desc: [
		"With &6Dynamic Lights&r a &6torch&r already glows while you hold it. In your off hand it does not get in the way of mining."
		""
		"That way you see the path in caves without placing torches everywhere straight away. Monsters still spawn in moving light: where you stay, place real torches."
	]
	quest.11BDE9774E219B5D.quest_subtitle: "Light wherever you are."
	quest.11BDE9774E219B5D.title: "&6Carry a torch in your hand"
	quest.11C72FC6B80F731C.quest_desc: [
		"Put a &6Carved Gloomgourd&r on a &6Block of Forgotten Metal&r. The block costs 9 Forgotten Ingots."
		""
		"The &6Forgotten Minion&r defends its spot with projectiles. Expensive, but a fine guard for the portal."
	]
	quest.11C72FC6B80F731C.quest_subtitle: "A sentry like an iron golem."
	quest.11C72FC6B80F731C.title: "&dSummon a Forgotten Minion"
	quest.11CEFF6355AD455F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Every &cstabilizer&r for Draconic Evolution's Energy Core has a &aGaia Spirit&r in the top middle, diamonds in the corners and a Particle Generator in the middle."
		""
		"An Energy Core needs four stabilizers, so four spirits. Put them aside for the techs, see the chapter &5Draconic Evolution&r."
	]
	quest.11CEFF6355AD455F.quest_subtitle: "Draconic Evolution needs your fights."
	quest.11CEFF6355AD455F.title: "&7Deliver Spirits to the Dragon Builders"
	quest.11CFC27A4C0E9C0B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Life Aggregator&r: &e4 Gaia Spirits&r in the corners, &e2 Elementium&r, &e2 Pure Ender Essence&r and a &6Dragonstone&r in the middle. It picks up a monster spawner or trial spawner and carries it to another place. Then it breaks."
		""
		"&6Life Imbuer&r: at the top 2 blaze rods and Elementium, below prismarine bricks, a &6Manasteel block&r and ender essence. Placed on a spawner it makes it spawn with mana from a spreader, even when nobody is nearby."
	]
	quest.11CFC27A4C0E9C0B.quest_subtitle: "Life Aggregator and Life Imbuer."
	quest.11CFC27A4C0E9C0B.title: "&5Pack Up a Spawner"
	quest.11D263EF5B3745A7.quest_desc: [
		"The &6obelisk&r stands at world spawn. If you forget where that is: there is a &6waystone&r at spawn, and every waystone you have activated brings you back there."
		""
		"A &eboss bar&r at the top of the screen shows the active goal and how far along it is. You see it everywhere, not only at the obelisk."
	]
	quest.11D263EF5B3745A7.quest_subtitle: "It stands at spawn."
	quest.11D263EF5B3745A7.title: "&6Go to the obelisk"
	quest.11D290BB658AA853.quest_desc: [
		"Gewürzbäume stehen in Generation 6 bis 8, keiner im Markt. Vier Gewürze wachsen als Frucht: &6Piment&r (2 pro Blatt), &6Gewürznelke&r (3), &6Muskat&r (3) und &6Sternanis&r (3). &6Zimt&r (Palisander und Teak) kommt nicht vom Blatt, sondern von der Rinde: Zimtstämme im Entrinder oder mit der Axt entrindet geben je einen Zimt."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/fruit/cinnamon.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Die Gewürze sind keine Nahrung, und kein Rezept im Pack verwendet sie, sie landen in Kisten als Deko. Ihr Wert liegt im Stammbaum: Nelke und Piment ergeben den Sternanis, Mango und Sternanis die Sternfrucht, die letzte Kreuzung überhaupt."
		""
		"Der &6Lorbeer&r steht im Mod, hat aber weder Rezept noch Marktplatz, den gibt es auf Kronwerke nicht."
	]
	quest.11D290BB658AA853.quest_subtitle: "Piment, Nelke, Muskat, Sternanis und Zimt."
	quest.11D290BB658AA853.title: "&6Züchte Gewürzbäume"
	quest.11D564C54335FD80.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_thermoelectric.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Thermoelektrischer Generator:&r drei Stahl oben, LV-Spule zwischen zwei Constantanblechen, unten drei Constantanbleche. Heiß auf die eine Seite, kalt gegenüber, Strom an jeder freien Seite."
		""
		"&eIE, Thermoelektrisch:&r Brennstoff keiner. Je gegenüberliegendem Paar Wurzel aus dem Temperaturunterschied halbiert: &bLava&r (1 300 K) gegen &bWasser&r (300 K) gibt &d15 FE/t&r, mit drei Paaren &d45 FE/t&r. Eis und Packeis sind kälter als Wasser, ein Uranblock heißer als Lava."
		""
		"&eIE, Blitzableiter:&r ein Sockel aus Blitzableiterblöcken mit einer Stange aus Stahlzäunen obendrauf. Ein Einschlag bringt &d16 000 000 FE&r in den Sockel, abgegeben nach und nach über die Anschlüsse. Nur bei Gewitter, dafür umsonst. Offen ab Stufe 2."
	]
	quest.11D564C54335FD80.quest_subtitle: "Immersive Engineering, Thermoelektrischer Generator und Blitzableiter."
	quest.11D564C54335FD80.title: "&6Spann Lava gegen Wasser"
	quest.11E71EFEA3CF26B2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Ice Spider Den&r lies in snow and ice biomes, but not in the mountains and not in the ocean. In snowy weather &bice spiders&r patrol outside too. Each drops &e4 to 16 Arcane Essence&r and 2 to 5 string, sometimes an &6Icy Fang&r."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r In the basement a 60 percent chance of a &6Blank Runestone&r and always 10 to 30 essence, plus Frozen Bones, ice, cobwebs and sometimes a ring. In the tower scrolls and another 5 to 20 essence, in the dungeon ink or a scroll."
		""
		"No place in stage 1 gives more essence. Take torches and a shield along, the spiders come in groups."
	]
	quest.11E71EFEA3CF26B2.quest_subtitle: "Four to sixteen essences per spider."
	quest.11E71EFEA3CF26B2.title: "&bClear the Ice Spider Den"
	quest.11F01E509D869534.quest_desc: [
		"&6Glowing Bee&r and &6Chocolate Mining Bee&r (dirt nest). Flower: redstone block, redstone ore, redstone torch or redstone lamp. The comb gives 1 to 2 &6redstone&r with 50 percent. It likes to escape, a hive with a filter helps."
	]
	quest.11F01E509D869534.quest_subtitle: "Redstone from combs."
	quest.11F01E509D869534.title: "&cBreed the Redstone Bee"
	quest.11F659D5C5C764D0.quest_desc: [
		"Two stages open with an event that runs live on every stream: stage 2 lights the &cNether portal at spawn&r, stage 4 activates the &dEnd portal&r. The &5Ender Dragon&r is the first boss the server fights together."
		""
		"Then there are the finales of the stage goals, several fights against the &aGaia Guardian&r in stage 4, and at the very end the fight against the &cChaos Guardian&r that ends the season."
		""
		"Whoever joins later gets the &6starter kits&r of every stage that is already open and catches up quickly. Nobody starts from zero in week four."
	]
	quest.11F659D5C5C764D0.quest_subtitle: "Four evenings when the server comes together."
	quest.11F659D5C5C764D0.title: "&6Be there for the events"
	quest.11F768CC20126B4C.quest_desc: [
		"At the top &6two iron ingots&r and a &6Refined Soulstone&r. Below a stick and an iron ingot, a stick at the bottom left."
		""
		"Only what dies by the scythe drops arcana. It also hits to the sides. Keep it ready in your hotbar."
	]
	quest.11F768CC20126B4C.quest_subtitle: "A blade that hits the soul too."
	quest.11F768CC20126B4C.title: "&5Forge a Crude Scythe"
	quest.11FBA6B7C921C274.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &62 Utherium Crystals&r over &61 stick&r make the &6Utherium Sword&r."
		""
		"{image:undergarden:textures/item/utherium_crystal.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Utherium weapons deal &e1.5 times&r as much damage against rotspawn. There are also tools and armor made of Utherium. Old Utherium parts turn back into crystals in a blast furnace."
	]
	quest.11FBA6B7C921C274.quest_subtitle: "The weapon against rotspawn."
	quest.11FBA6B7C921C274.title: "&cForge a Utherium Sword"
	quest.11FBF871F00AFDEF.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r four &6Soulstained Steel&r in the corners, an empty &6Soul Vial&r at the top, middle &6Energized Gear, Ensouled Chassis, Energized Gear&r, a &6Z-Logic Controller&r at the bottom."
		""
		"The Soul Binder makes Ender IO's spawner recipes and soul items. Build it yourself or bring the ingots to the tech people."
	]
	quest.11FBF871F00AFDEF.quest_subtitle: "The Soul Binder on Kronwerke."
	quest.11FBF871F00AFDEF.title: "&3Bring Soulstained Steel to Ender IO"
	quest.11FC2FD44440810E.quest_desc: [
		"&eDie Regel:&r Das End ist bis &6Stufe 4 (Sternwerk)&r gesperrt. Festungen findest du vorher, Enderaugen kannst du einsetzen, hindurch kommst du nicht."
		""
		"&eDas Event:&r Wenn das Ziel der Stufe 3 bei 98 Prozent steht, gibt es einen Termin. Auf Stream wird das &5Endportal&r aktiviert, und der &5Enderdrache&r ist der erste Boss, den der ganze Server gemeinsam bekämpft. Wartet mit dem Drachen auf die anderen."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Stufe 4 braucht Draconium, und das gibt es nur im End. Deshalb ist dieses Event das wichtigste der Season für die Techniker."
	]
	quest.11FC2FD44440810E.quest_subtitle: "Das Endportal wird auf Stream aktiviert."
	quest.11FC2FD44440810E.title: "&5Warte auf das End-Event"
	quest.11FEA3136D5BAA40.quest_desc: [
		"VoidShimmer Goo (mit Chorusfrucht oder Enderperlen geweckt) macht aus Diamantblöcken &6Celestigem&r. Template am Schmiedetisch wie bei Blazegold."
		""
		"1 561 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 10, +4 Schaden. Hammer 5x5, Drops-Teleporter, der &6Celestigem-Paxel&r und der &6Voidshift Wand&r, der dich dorthin bringt, wohin du schaust."
	]
	quest.11FEA3136D5BAA40.quest_subtitle: "Just Dire Things: 5x5 und Voidshift."
	quest.11FEA3136D5BAA40.title: "&bSchleif Celestigem"
	quest.12071FDFA1DDC340.quest_desc: [
		"&eSo geht es:&r &6Gleise&r kommen vom Fließband aus Eisen und Robustem Blech, ein &6Bahnhof&r setzt den Zug zusammen, &6Zugsteuerung&r und &6Fahrplan&r lassen ihn allein fahren. Alles im Kapitel &6Create: Züge&r."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r Ein Zug trägt Fracht, Flüssigkeiten und Mitspieler, kostet keine Level und fährt weiter, auch wenn die Chunks unterwegs nicht geladen sind. Für den Weg Fabrik, Spawn, Obelisk ist er der bequemste Weg."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Ein gemeinsamer Hauptbahnhof am Spawn mit einem Gleis pro Basis ist schöner als dreißig Stummelgleise. Fragt im Chat, bevor ihr verlegt."
	]
	quest.12071FDFA1DDC340.quest_subtitle: "Gleise, Bahnhof, Fahrplan. Stufe 2."
	quest.12071FDFA1DDC340.title: "&6Fahr mit dem Zug zur anderen Basis"
	quest.1209E058EB1AF92A.quest_desc: [
		"Catch a &6Gwibling&r with a water bucket. Gwiblings swim in the seas."
		""
		"&eThe seas:&r &6Ancient Sea&r, &6Dead Sea&r and &6Icy Sea&r. &6Glitterkelp&r grows there, which you can cook. Cooked Gwibling is good food."
	]
	quest.1209E058EB1AF92A.quest_subtitle: "The seas of the Undergarden."
	quest.1209E058EB1AF92A.title: "&3Catch a Gwibling"
	quest.120BD5C808DBF981.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Cloggrum Ore&r (Depthrock or Shiverstone, &eY -64 to 64&r, most at the bottom). It gives &6Raw Cloggrum&r, which the furnace turns into a &6Cloggrum Ingot&r."
		""
		"{image:undergarden:textures/item/cloggrum_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Cloggrum makes tools, armor, shield, bucket, lanterns and bars. &6Munchers&r drop Cloggrum and Froststeel nuggets."
	]
	quest.120BD5C808DBF981.quest_subtitle: "The iron of the Undergarden."
	quest.120BD5C808DBF981.title: "&7&lSmelt Cloggrum"
	quest.120D28E8E18E4715.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/powah_orb.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r glass, a &bMana Diamond&r, glass at the top. Glass, &6Dielectric Casing&r, glass in the middle. Three horizontal Dielectric Rods at the bottom. In the original there is only glass at the top."
		""
		"Every botanist makes the Mana Diamond from a diamond in the Mana Pool. No pool? Ask in the chat."
		""
		"The orb charges items with power until they change. Open it and put the ingredients in, EMI shows all recipes with their FE need under &eEnergizing&r."
	]
	quest.120D28E8E18E4715.quest_subtitle: "No mana, no power."
	quest.120D28E8E18E4715.title: "&d&lBuild the Energizing Orb"
	quest.120DBA3E6237920F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Graphite blocks&r or &6beryllium blocks&r directly next to a cell are &6moderators&r."
		""
		"Each moderator side on a cell gives about &e17 percent more power&r and &e33 percent more heat&r. One between two cells counts for both."
	]
	quest.120DBA3E6237920F.quest_subtitle: "More power, more heat."
	quest.120DBA3E6237920F.title: "&aPlace Graphite Blocks as Moderators"
	quest.120E466F21A0C847.quest_desc: [
		"Bring Elite Control Circuits and draconium ingots to the obelisk and hand them in by hand. &e/kw goals&r shows the status."
		""
		"&eTech pillar of stage 4:&r &6150 Elite Control Circuits&r and &61,000 draconium ingots&r. The magic pillar wants Gaia Spirits and Mystic Staffs, both have to fill up."
		""
		"Draconium dust that does not go into circuits becomes an ingot in the furnace and counts there."
	]
	quest.120E466F21A0C847.quest_subtitle: "Circuits for the obelisk."
	quest.120E466F21A0C847.title: "&5&lBring Light of the Dragon to the Obelisk"
	quest.121FA56ECD84E569.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/antimatter_sps.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Casings as a box, ports in the shell, coil on a port, power to the coil, polonium into the input port."
		""
		"&e1,000 mB of polonium&r give &e1 mB of antimatter&r. Every mB of polonium costs &e1 million J&r. One pellet is 1,000 mB of antimatter, so 1,000,000 mB of polonium, 10,000,000 mB of nuclear waste and a trillion J."
		""
		"Several fission reactors, a long row of activators and power from everything you have."
	]
	quest.121FA56ECD84E569.quest_subtitle: "Polonium becomes antimatter."
	quest.121FA56ECD84E569.title: "&5&lForm the SPS"
	quest.1221F8A483DFF2DA.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Abras' Conjure, both with the Afrit book and a &6cow&r as sacrifice, 90 seconds."
		"&6Rain:&r sand, dried kelp, cactus, dead bush."
		"&6Thunderstorm:&r bone, &e2 gunpowder&r, ghast tear."
		""
		"The spirit changes the weather once and disappears. You need thunderstorms for charged creepers and some mob farms. Say so in chat beforehand."
	]
	quest.1221F8A483DFF2DA.quest_subtitle: "Afrit make weather."
	quest.1221F8A483DFF2DA.title: "&5Summon rain or a thunderstorm"
	quest.122377A76DEDA108.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_cloche.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Glass, &6Incandescent Light Bulb&r, glass on top, glass, &6Iron Mechanical Component&r, glass in the middle, a &6Basic Engineering Block&r at the bottom. Light bulbs: Components blueprint, glass, three paper, one copper, gives three."
		""
		"Soil and seeds into the middle, water in, &d8 FE/t&r of power. The harvest comes out at the front. It also grows hemp, flowers, nether wart and chorus fruit."
	]
	quest.122377A76DEDA108.quest_subtitle: "A plant that harvests itself."
	quest.122377A76DEDA108.title: "&2Set up a Garden Cloche"
	quest.122D0F42C3CD2423.quest_desc: [
		"Throw colourless &6glass&r into the pool. Each block costs &d150 mana&r and comes back as &6Managlass&r."
		""
		"Every infusion works like this: item in, and as long as there is enough mana it is transformed piece by piece. EMI shows every recipe with its price under the Mana Pool."
		""
		"You need Managlass for the brewery's vials and as trade goods for Alfheim in stage 3."
	]
	quest.122D0F42C3CD2423.quest_subtitle: "Your first infusion."
	quest.122D0F42C3CD2423.title: "&6Infuse Managlass"
	quest.122E41C394FECF3B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rose bush&r on the brazier. On the hands: &6golden apple&r, two &6red dye&r, two &6Soul Shards&r."
		""
		"Peaceful animals from far away slowly walk to the brazier."
	]
	quest.122E41C394FECF3B.quest_subtitle: "Ritual of Alluring."
	quest.122E41C394FECF3B.title: "&aLure Animals"
	quest.123034F796E93A0F.quest_desc: [
		"An &6iron ingot&r and an &6ender pearl&r give two &6Pulsating Alloy Ingots&r."
		""
		"The middle of every item conduit. Eight nuggets around a &6diamond&r make the &6Pulsating Crystal&r for the Vacuum Chest and the Travel Anchor."
	]
	quest.123034F796E93A0F.quest_subtitle: "Iron with a pinch of the End."
	quest.123034F796E93A0F.title: "&bAlloy Pulsating Alloy"
	quest.123725C13E555178.quest_desc: [
		"First &6two redstone&r and a &6Soul Shard&r into the boiling Crucible, then &6two gold ingots&r. Out come &etwo&r Arcane Gold."
		""
		"From it: Goblet, Gold Inlay, Soul Enchanter and the rings and amulets."
	]
	quest.123725C13E555178.quest_subtitle: "Two steps in the cauldron."
	quest.123725C13E555178.title: "&6Brew Arcane Gold"
	quest.123EFB3944F66D54.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Drygmy Charm&r in the middle, &6Focus of Summoning&r and &6Conjuration Essence&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"The spawner looks into the &6Containment Jars&r near it and creates the same creatures. Each creature costs source from jars next to it, a different amount depending on the kind."
		""
		"A redstone signal turns it off, a comparator reads its progress."
	]
	quest.123EFB3944F66D54.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: a spawner that runs on source."
	quest.123EFB3944F66D54.title: "&6Build a Source Spawner"
	quest.12466FA1A517329B.quest_desc: [
		"Deactivate the core, raise it one tier with &eTier Up&r in its window, turn on &eToggle Build Guide&r and place the blocks: &6210 Draconium Blocks&r and &6328 redstone blocks&r."
		""
		"&eStorage:&r &e2,140,000,000,000&r energy."
		""
		"Tier 8 needs 378 Awakened and 786 normal Draconium Blocks and has no limit anymore. It comes in stage 5."
	]
	quest.12466FA1A517329B.quest_subtitle: "210 and 328 blocks, 2.14 trillion."
	quest.12466FA1A517329B.title: "&cCore Tier 7"
	quest.1247E03EB52D21ED.quest_desc: [
		"First the &6Dictionary&r: a circuit over a book. Then the &6Oredictionificator&r: top steel, glass pane, steel, middle circuit, Dictionary, circuit, bottom steel, chest, steel."
		""
		"Give it a filter with a tag, like &ec:ingots/copper&r, and pick with the arrows which ingot should come out. Everything with this tag is then swapped into exactly this kind. With the Dictionary in hand, right click shows you the tags of any item."
		""
		"&eAllowed on Kronwerke:&r dusts, ingots, nuggets, ores, raw ore and storage blocks. Placed behind the steel line, steel from Immersive Engineering and steel from Mekanism land in the chest as one kind."
	]
	quest.1247E03EB52D21ED.quest_subtitle: "Copper is copper, no matter which mod."
	quest.1247E03EB52D21ED.title: "&3Unify metals"
	quest.124CFA5C2B1613E0.quest_desc: [
		"The farm world is reset &cevery three days at 4:45&r. The tab list counts down, and chat warns beforehand. Whoever is over there then travels home with everything they carry."
		""
		"&cWhatever stands in the farm world is gone afterwards:&r machines, chests, quarries, your body after a death. Bring your loot home in time."
	]
	quest.124CFA5C2B1613E0.quest_subtitle: "It is new every three days."
	quest.124CFA5C2B1613E0.title: "&cRemember the rules of the farm world"
	quest.124DBFC71F224682.quest_desc: [
		"The CNC Stamper in the middle, Elite Control Circuits left and right, pistons at the top and bottom, Reinforced Alloy in the corners."
		""
		"It presses three ingredients into one part: printed circuit, redstone and printed silicon become a finished &6AE2 processor&r. Also for Applied Flux and Advanced AE."
	]
	quest.124DBFC71F224682.quest_subtitle: "AE2 processors in one step."
	quest.124DBFC71F224682.title: "&3Build a CNC Stamper"
	quest.124EDDA24E72E84C.quest_desc: [
		"Planks, wooden slabs and a lever, in a different pattern for each variant; EMI shows all four."
		""
		"&6I&r: one compartment with &e32 stacks&r. &6II&r: two with 16 each. &6III&r: three with 10 each. &6IV&r: four with 8 each. Unlike Functional Storage, they can be upgraded to copper and iron and take Sophisticated upgrades."
	]
	quest.124EDDA24E72E84C.quest_subtitle: "Drawer or barrel? Both."
	quest.124EDDA24E72E84C.title: "Build a Limited Barrel"
	quest.1258B180FD76A96D.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Mana Diamonds&r, &e1 Mana Quartz&r, catalysts Winter and Fire. &d12,000 mana&r. Every sin rune costs the same, only the catalysts change."
		""
		"You need Gluttony for the &6Munchdew&r, in stage 3 for Kekimurus and Loonium."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Every sin rune eats two Mana Diamonds that the Terrasteel then lacks. Only build what you use."
	]
	quest.1258B180FD76A96D.quest_subtitle: "The first of the seven sin runes."
	quest.1258B180FD76A96D.title: "&5Make the Rune of Gluttony"
	quest.1268725CEAC4C6AA.quest_desc: [
		"Put &6Nether quartz&r into a furnace or blast furnace, out comes &6Silicon&r. One quartz, one silicon."
		""
		"Silicon goes into every processor, the Controller and every 1k Storage Part. A stack is enough to start, two are better."
		""
		"&eTip:&r AE2's silicon (from certus quartz dust) counts the same in all RS recipes, and the other way around. Anyone playing both mods needs only one silicon source."
	]
	quest.1268725CEAC4C6AA.quest_subtitle: "Nether quartz in the furnace."
	quest.1268725CEAC4C6AA.title: "&7Smelt Silicon"
	quest.126A56CDB69A34BA.quest_desc: [
		"Worktable: Pewter, Pewter Inlay, ender pearl diagonally, plus &6gold nugget&r and &6silver nugget&r extra."
		""
		"Click plants with the Athame: fern gives Avennian Sprig, oxeye daisy or lily of the valley Merammer Root, lily pad Oanna Bloom, jungle leaves Sildrian Seed, Nether fungi Mirecap."
	]
	quest.126A56CDB69A34BA.quest_subtitle: "Rare plants for the altar and incense."
	quest.126A56CDB69A34BA.title: "&7Harvest Herbs with the Athame"
	quest.127D84087F7EB2D6.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &63 Glacite Shards&r at the top, &62 sticks&r below make the &6Glacite Scythe&r."
	]
	quest.127D84087F7EB2D6.quest_subtitle: "Same pattern, different material."
	quest.127D84087F7EB2D6.title: "&fBuild a Glacite Scythe"
	quest.128344D4FB2BEBDC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/food_f_rice.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put &6rice&r into water exactly one block deep with dirt underneath. You find wild rice in swamps and on riverbanks."
		""
		"&6Rice panicles&r grow on top. At the cutting board the knife turns them into rice and straw."
	]
	quest.128344D4FB2BEBDC.quest_subtitle: "Grows with wet feet."
	quest.128344D4FB2BEBDC.title: "&6Plant rice in water"
	quest.1284ED7119CBE5A5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Stone&r in the corners, &6steel&r on the sides, a &6copper ingot&r in the middle make two &6Copper Reinforced Plating&r."
		""
		"Plating carries almost every machine, every addon and the Exo armor. The Assembler makes eight from two steel, one copper and one Plastic Sheet."
	]
	quest.1284ED7119CBE5A5.quest_subtitle: "The outer skin of almost every machine."
	quest.1284ED7119CBE5A5.title: "&7Press Copper Reinforced Plating"
	quest.129598F846CD6A32.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Prosperity Ingot&r and &e2 Inferium Essence&r shapeless in the crafting table give an &6Inferium Ingot&r."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/inferium_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Inferium Ingots sit left and right in every Inferium tool and armor piece, and later they repair the tool in the anvil. In &cstage 2&r a finished Inferium tool is upgraded further with Prudentium Ingots and Prudentium Gemstones and keeps its enchantments."
	]
	quest.129598F846CD6A32.quest_subtitle: "A Prosperity Ingot swallows two essence."
	quest.129598F846CD6A32.title: "&aRefine into Inferium Ingots"
	quest.1298361CE320525B.quest_desc: [
		"Iron sheets, shafts, alloy and andesite casing make the &6Rolling Mill&r (8 SU per RPM). A copper ingot becomes two &6copper rods&r, a copper sheet two &6copper wires&r."
		""
		"Four copper wires around an &6empty spool&r (iron sheets and iron rod, 24 pieces) make a &6copper spool&r."
	]
	quest.1298361CE320525B.quest_subtitle: "Crafts & Additions: the Rolling Mill."
	quest.1298361CE320525B.title: "&6Roll wire and rods"
	quest.1299F490C34A698A.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r drei &6Bretter&r in einer Reihe, eine &6Andesitlegierung&r rechts darunter. Rechtsklick gedrückt halten, und die Welle dreht sich."
		""
		"&eCreate, Handkurbel:&r Brennstoff deine Zeit, &d32 RPM&r, &d256 SU&r. Für die erste Presse und den Mahlstein, bevor das Wasserrad steht. Das &6Kupferventilrad&r macht dasselbe mit 8 SU pro RPM, nur langsamer."
	]
	quest.1299F490C34A698A.quest_subtitle: "Create, 32 RPM, 256 SU, solange du festhältst."
	quest.1299F490C34A698A.title: "&6Dreh eine Handkurbel"
	quest.129B699332552A54.quest_desc: [
		"An &5Awakened Draconium Block&r at the crafting table gives 9 &5Awakened ingots&r, an ingot 9 &5nuggets&r."
		""
		"Ingots go into cores, tools and modules. The storage people need the nuggets: from 16M on every MEGA component has one in its recipe."
	]
	quest.129B699332552A54.quest_subtitle: "Nine ingots, nine nuggets."
	quest.129B699332552A54.title: "&5Split a Block into Ingots"
	quest.12A0A8C0F29E767D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron Sulfur&r, &6Mineral Salt&r and &6Mercury Shards&r into the vessels, heat it. One Sulfur, one Salt and one Shard give one iron ingot."
		""
		"This works with almost every ore in the pack: copper, gold, osmium, tin, lead, zinc and more. EMI shows which at the Liquefaction Cauldron."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Deliberately as strong as Mekanism's tripling, only with fire instead of power. The stage goal wants &e4,000 steel&r, and every steel ingot starts as iron."
	]
	quest.12A0A8C0F29E767D.quest_subtitle: "What the furnace wastes, you get back."
	quest.12A0A8C0F29E767D.title: "&d&lMake Three Ingots from One Ore"
	quest.12A9F572E7CCF75D.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r like the item pipe, but with two &6buckets&r instead of the dispensers. &616 Fluid Pipes&r."
		""
		"They move &e50 mB per tick&r without an upgrade, that is one bucket per second. Extracting and disconnecting work exactly like the item pipe, except the source is a tank, a cauldron or a machine."
		""
		"A lava source in the Nether, a pipe, the Mekanism Heat Generator: that is the first sensible use."
	]
	quest.12A9F572E7CCF75D.quest_subtitle: "Water, lava and everything Mekanism spits out."
	quest.12A9F572E7CCF75D.title: "&9Build Fluid Pipes"
	quest.12AA0D4A1CE026D3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Coal&r through the Enrichment Chamber: &6Enriched Carbon&r, which gives &e80 mB&r in the infuser instead of 10."
		""
		"That way a stack of coal is enough for over 250 steel ingots instead of 32. Always send your steel line's coal through the chamber first."
	]
	quest.12AA0D4A1CE026D3.quest_subtitle: "Eight times as much from one coal."
	quest.12AA0D4A1CE026D3.title: "&8Enrich coal"
	quest.12B08B1025D23D2B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Waystones&r, &6Wegstein&r: einmal aktivieren, dann von jedem anderen Wegstein, mit dem &6Warpstein&r oder aus dem Inventar hinreisen. Kostet &e1 Level je 100 Blöcke&r, höchstens 27, zwischen Dimensionen immer 27. &6Schriftrollen&r und &6Warpplatten&r reisen umsonst. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Rückkehr-Schriftrolle: zwei Goldnuggets und ein Tintenbeutel über drei Papier, bringt dich zum zuletzt aktivierten Wegstein. Wilde Wegsteine stehen alle 25 Chunks und in Dörfern. Siehe Kapitel Erkundung."
	]
	quest.12B08B1025D23D2B.quest_subtitle: "Waystones, Wegsteine: ein Level je 100 Blöcke, Schriftrollen kostenlos."
	quest.12B08B1025D23D2B.title: "Schreib eine Rückkehr-Schriftrolle"
	quest.12C42435D584F285.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_watermill.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Four &6Waterwheel Segments&r (Treated Wood and Treated Sticks) around a &6steel ingot&r make the &6Water Wheel&r."
		""
		"The more flowing water runs around the wheel, the faster it turns. Up to three wheels in a row drive one shared shaft. It does not care about the weather."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_waterwheel_segment.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.12C42435D584F285.quest_subtitle: "Steady, day and night."
	quest.12C42435D584F285.title: "&9Build a Water Wheel"
	quest.12C525B242BDF26A.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6Coke Dust&r in the Industrial Squeezer make one &6HOP Graphite Dust&r, for 19,200 FE."
		""
		"Four of them become one Graphite Electrode, one a HOP graphite plate for the HV Accumulator. So for three electrodes you need &e96 Coke Dust&r."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_dust_hop_graphite.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.12C525B242BDF26A.quest_subtitle: "Eight Coke Dust, one graphite."
	quest.12C525B242BDF26A.title: "&8Squeeze HOP Graphite Dust"
	quest.12CB480E03948751.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_compacting.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put the &6press&r over a &6Basin&r instead of a depot. Two &6flint&r, one &6gravel&r and &b100 mB lava&r get compacted into one &6andesite&r."
		""
		"The millstone and gravel washing provide the flint, a pump from a lava lake the lava. Over the basin the press also compacts nine ingots into a block."
	]
	quest.12CB480E03948751.quest_subtitle: "Andesite that never runs out."
	quest.12CB480E03948751.title: "&6Compact andesite"
	quest.12CE3B645569B51A.quest_desc: [
		"Pressurized Reaction Chamber: &6Substrate&r with 50 mB of liquid ethene and 10 mB of oxygen gives one &6HDPE Pellet&r. Three pellets in the Enrichment Chamber give one &6HDPE Sheet&r."
		""
		"Substrate multiplies in the same chamber with water and ethene, one becomes eight. How ethene is made is in the chapter &5Mekanism&r."
	]
	quest.12CE3B645569B51A.quest_subtitle: "Plastic from ethene."
	quest.12CE3B645569B51A.title: "&fPress HDPE Sheets"
	quest.12D5E27A63081433.quest_desc: [
		"Each piece is a &6leather piece&r with &6phantom membranes&r around it. The helmet keeps radioactive gases out of your lungs. More pieces protect more."
		""
		"Blocks between you and the source shield you, dense ones like lead best. At the smithing table you reinforce any armor with one &6radiation shielding plate&r per piece."
	]
	quest.12D5E27A63081433.quest_subtitle: "Four pieces, four kinds of radiation."
	quest.12D5E27A63081433.title: "&ePut On the Hazmat Suit"
	quest.12DA47F7E7862DF2.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_runes_gourmaryllis.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Apothecary: &e2 light grey&r, &e2 yellow&r, &e1 red&r petal, Runes of &eFire&r and &eSummer&r."
		""
		"It eats food right next to it, one after another. Mana: &dnutrition times nutrition times 70&r, a steak (8) gives 4,480 after 4 seconds. Always the same food brings less and less; up to seven different ones in a row up to 1.8 times."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Farmer's Delight has dozens of dishes, see the &aCooking&r chapter. A belt that drops different meals in turn is one of the strongest sources of this stage."
	]
	quest.12DA47F7E7862DF2.quest_subtitle: "A gourmet among flowers."
	quest.12DA47F7E7862DF2.title: "&6Plant a Gourmaryllis"
	quest.12DB5706111A2D3F.quest_desc: [
		"Circle without cloth: &e2 emerald, 1 quartz&r. For twelve hours around the time it was placed it gives &d10 mana per second&r, the other twelve it takes the same amount."
		""
		"The &aDurability Exchange&r (&e2 emerald, 1 diamond&r) eats the durability of tools on the circle or from a chest below it. Old iron tools from the mob farm fit perfectly."
	]
	quest.12DB5706111A2D3F.quest_subtitle: "Mana from the time of day."
	quest.12DB5706111A2D3F.title: "&aLay a Chronal Exchange"
	quest.12DDB1C6EF3BC223.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_amber.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Pinsle &everdächtigen Kies&r in kalten Ozeanruinen. Jeder zehnte Fund ist ein &6Brown-Amber-Setzling&r. Er wächst nur als &e3x3&r (oder 5x5) und seine Fruchtblätter tragen nichts, sie tropfen: Unter dem Baum sammeln sich &6Bernsteinpfützen&r, Schicht für Schicht, bis sie überlaufen."
		""
		"Die Pfützen sind reine Deko, man kann sie nicht aufsammeln. Das Holz ist feuerfest, die Blätter durchscheinend wie Glas. Ein Baum für den Garten, nicht für die Fabrik."
		""
		"Brown Amber ist Elternteil von nichts, braucht also keinen Partner. Der Setzling kommt beim Fällen aus den Blättern zurück, einer reicht für immer."
	]
	quest.12DDB1C6EF3BC223.quest_subtitle: "Ein Baum, der Bernstein tropft."
	quest.12DDB1C6EF3BC223.title: "&6Grab den Brown Amber aus"
	quest.12DE5F17BDC6601E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_crusher.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Plastic, &6Gold Gear&r, plastic at the top, &6iron swords&r left and right of the Pity Frame, &6iron axes&r and redstone at the bottom make the &6Mob Slaughter Factory&r."
		""
		"It kills animals and mobs in its area, without loot or experience, for &d400 FE&r per operation. Out come &6Liquid Meat&r and &dPink Slime&r. Peaceful animals give more slime."
		""
		"A chicken farm with an Animal Feeder next to it is enough to start."
	]
	quest.12DE5F17BDC6601E.quest_subtitle: "The Mob Slaughter Factory."
	quest.12DE5F17BDC6601E.title: "&dCollect Pink Slime"
	quest.12DF6DFB3E28091F.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6Darkstone&r around a &6Blood Infusion Core&r give the &6Blood Infuser&r. Its tank holds &e10 buckets&r. On the left goes a container that fills the tank or fills itself from it, in the middle the item, on the right the result."
		""
		"Without upgrades it can do little, but the important part: &6Dark Gem&r plus 250 mB becomes a &6Dark Power Gem&r in 10 seconds, a Dark Block with 2,250 mB a Power Gem block, a &6dead bush&r with 800 mB an &6Undead Sapling&r. Everything else needs Promises, more on that shortly."
		""
		"A redstone signal stops the machine. Dark Tanks or pipes from other mods fill the tank from all sides."
	]
	quest.12DF6DFB3E28091F.quest_subtitle: "Blood in, something new out."
	quest.12DF6DFB3E28091F.title: "&4&lBuild the Blood Infuser"
	quest.12E91EC55D17EDB2.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r A &6Cable&r, a &6Destruction Core&r and an &6Improved Processor&r, shapeless."
		""
		"The &6Importer&r sits on the cable and points at a chest, a furnace or a machine. It pulls everything in there into the network. It needs 2 FE/t. With the &6Wrench&r (enriched iron and a Basic Processor) you turn it in the right direction."
		""
		"&eFilter:&r In the window you put items into the nine filter slots. Switch between &eAllow&r (only these) and &eBlock&r (everything but these). Empty means: everything."
	]
	quest.12E91EC55D17EDB2.quest_subtitle: "Pulls everything from a chest into the network."
	quest.12E91EC55D17EDB2.title: "&aPlace an Importer"
	quest.12EF3D2245AD78FA.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Bowl of Promises&r from the tier 2 infuser, a &6diamond block&r with &e160 buckets&r of blood and an &6eye of ender&r give the &6Promise of Tenacity III&r. That is the highest tier."
		""
		"Tier 3 turns a &6bone&r into a &6blaze rod&r for 2.5 buckets, sand into soul sand, wheat seeds into nether wart and a &6ghast tear&r into a &6Corrupted Tear&r for 10 buckets. The tear with 6 gold and 2 Dark Gems gives two &6Entangled Chalices&r, which have the same contents everywhere."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Blaze rods from bones means blaze powder for brass without having to go to the Nether. &cOutlook:&r &6Garmonbozia&r needs essence of killed spirits, and the focus for it needs chorus fruit from the End. That comes in &6stage 4&r."
	]
	quest.12EF3D2245AD78FA.quest_subtitle: "160 buckets of blood for a diamond block."
	quest.12EF3D2245AD78FA.title: "&6Make a Promise of Tenacity III"
	quest.12F09A3BCE9C4DCB.quest_desc: [
		"&62³ Spatial Component:&r glowstone, four fluix pearls, an Engineering Processor. Four 2³ make a &616³&r, four 16³ a &6128³&r. With a housing it becomes a cell."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r A used cell keeps its size forever. Everything in the area is taken along, you too. Never stand between the pylons when someone presses the button."
		""
		"That is how you bring, for example, a &6Flawless Budding Certus Quartz&r from a meteorite into your base."
	]
	quest.12F09A3BCE9C4DCB.quest_subtitle: "Used once, fixed forever."
	quest.12F09A3BCE9C4DCB.title: "&3Build a Spatial Storage Cell"
	quest.12F0B504A60EC51D.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 clay balls&r on the altar, &e2 Arcane&r, &e2 Earthen&r and &e2 Aqueous&r each: four Calx."
		""
		"The base for Impetus, rings and many parts."
	]
	quest.12F0B504A60EC51D.quest_subtitle: "Clay, but magical."
	quest.12F0B504A60EC51D.title: "&6Infuse Alchemical Calx"
	quest.12F84047970172E8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Utrem Jar&r: &e7 glass&r as a jar with an open lid, an &6Edelwood Plank&r top middle."
		"&6Soul Extractor&r: the Utrem Jar top left, in the middle &e2 nether bricks&r and a &6quartz block&r, bottom left a &6nether quartz&r."
		""
		"Hold right click on &6soul sand&r: it becomes Soulless Sand, and you get a &6Soul&r. A Nether visit with the extractor fills the forge's souls faster than any Lost Soul hunt."
	]
	quest.12F84047970172E8.quest_subtitle: "Souls from soul sand."
	quest.12F84047970172E8.title: "&bBuild a Soul Extractor"
	quest.12FFA45EAC31C4F5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Lost Souls&r are small pale ghosts that show up everywhere in the Overworld, often in twos or threes. Each drops a &6Soul&r, and one Soul is &e1 soul&r in the forge."
		""
		"The &6Soul Extractor&r (a Utrem Jar top left, below two nether bricks and a quartz block, a nether quartz at the bottom) pulls a Soul out of &6soul sand&r: hold right click, the sand becomes Soulless Sand. The Utrem Jar is eight glass around an Edelwood Plank, until then borrow one or collect by hand."
		""
		"&eTenfold:&r Right clicking a Lost Soul with an &6Aureal Bottle&r turns it into an &6Enchanted Lost Soul&r. Its &6Enchanted Soul&r counts &e10 souls&r and is the best fuel for the Clibano."
	]
	quest.12FFA45EAC31C4F5.quest_subtitle: "Lost Souls, soul sand and an extractor."
	quest.12FFA45EAC31C4F5.title: "&bCatch Souls"
	quest.130C3E1F3FC193D0.quest_desc: [
		"After the victory the &5Chaos Crystal&r in the middle of the island can be mined. It gives &e5 Chaos Shards&r."
		""
		"More islands lie 10,000 blocks further, each with a Guardian of its own."
	]
	quest.130C3E1F3FC193D0.quest_subtitle: "Five shards per crystal."
	quest.130C3E1F3FC193D0.title: "&8Mine the Chaos Crystal"
	quest.1318044860D7CA81.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r The &6Constructor&r is enriched iron in the corners, a &6Construction Core&r at the top, two &6diamonds&r left and right, a cable in the middle, an Improved Processor at the bottom. The &6Destructor&r is the same with a &6Destruction Core&r at the top."
		""
		"The Constructor places the block from its filter into the world in front of it, the Destructor breaks what stands in front of it and puts it into the network. 3 FE/t each."
		""
		"Together they are a cobblestone generator without hoppers, an obsidian miner or an item thrower, because the Constructor can also drop items. With the Silk Touch Upgrade the Destructor even brings glass back whole."
	]
	quest.1318044860D7CA81.quest_subtitle: "Place and break blocks."
	quest.1318044860D7CA81.title: "&cConstructor and Destructor"
	quest.132DD0CAAE8EFC95.quest_desc: [
		"Vier &6Druckeisenbarren&r um eine &6Truhe&r (zwei oben außen, zwei in der Mitte, einer unten) ergeben den &6Rundum-Trichter&r (Omnidirectional Hopper). Er braucht keine Luft."
		""
		"Beim Setzen zeigt der Eingang zu dir, der Ausgang auf den Block, an den du ihn gesetzt hast. &eRechtsklick mit dem Schlüssel&r dreht den Eingang, &eSchleichen und Rechtsklick&r den Ausgang. So zieht er aus einer Truhe oben heraus und schiebt seitlich in die Kammerschnittstelle."
		""
		"Jedes &6Geschwindigkeits-Upgrade&r verdoppelt sein Tempo. Mit einem &6Spender-Upgrade&r wirft er Gegenstände in die Welt, was du für flüssigen Kunststoff noch brauchen wirst. Der &6Flüssigkeitstrichter&r (Liquid Hopper: kleiner Tank über einem Trichter) macht dasselbe mit Flüssigkeiten."
	]
	quest.132DD0CAAE8EFC95.quest_subtitle: "Ein Trichter, der in jede Richtung zeigt."
	quest.132DD0CAAE8EFC95.title: "&eBau einen Rundum-Trichter"
	quest.133D2F88D3F438C7.quest_desc: [
		"&aSunrise&r: Blazing log, 3 dandelions, clock (or Blazing log and sunflower). &aMoonfall&r: Cascading log, ink sac, block of coal, clock (or Cascading log and Wilden Wing)."
		""
		"Sets the time to day or night. Moonfall is the fastest way to Wilden and witches."
	]
	quest.133D2F88D3F438C7.quest_subtitle: "Day or night at the push of a button."
	quest.133D2F88D3F438C7.title: "&aMake Sunrise and Moonfall"
	quest.134205C461FAB7B1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Energy Trash Can&r: like the trash can, only with redstone instead of the chest. Item, Fluid and Energy Trash Can together, shapeless, make the &6Ultimate Trash Can&r."
		""
		"One block that swallows everything. Handy behind a setup that spits out items and fluid at the same time."
	]
	quest.134205C461FAB7B1.quest_subtitle: "Items, fluid and power in one."
	quest.134205C461FAB7B1.title: "Build the everything bin"
	quest.13557040AE9FFDB5.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbchunks.map\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" for the map, then \"},{\"text\":\"C\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" for the claim view. Dragging the \"},{\"text\":\"left mouse button\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" over chunks claims them, the \"},{\"text\":\"right\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" one releases them. Your team has up to \"},{\"text\":\"500 chunks\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
		""
		"In your chunks only you, your team and your allies can break and place blocks and open chests. Creepers and ghasts blow up nothing there, endermen steal nothing. &cPvP stays on&r, claims do not make you invulnerable."
		""
		"&eTip:&r You add allies in the team settings. Whoever sets up a machine with a fake player (a router with a Breaker Module) has to &eallow fake players&r or give the router a Security Upgrade, otherwise it may do nothing in your claim."
	]
	quest.13557040AE9FFDB5.quest_subtitle: "FTB Chunks: drag claims with the mouse."
	quest.13557040AE9FFDB5.title: "&6Secure your base"
	quest.135DB4FE3287DE36.quest_desc: [
		"First the &6Angelheart Vial&r: glass pane, &6milk bucket&r, glass pane on top, glass pane, &6Infernal Claw&r, glass pane in the middle, Fertile Essence, glass pane, Fertile Essence at the bottom. It saves you from death once, heals &e25 percent&r of your health, removes bad effects and breaks."
		""
		"Three Angelheart Vials and an &6Angelic Feather&r shapeless give the &6Phoenix Down&r. It brings you back with full health, briefly gives Resistance and Regeneration and then turns back into the Angelic Feather. As long as it is whole, it also works like the feather."
		""
		"The Infernal Claw is leather, Molten Core, Rib Bone and Slime Pearl."
	]
	quest.135DB4FE3287DE36.quest_subtitle: "A second life in your pocket."
	quest.135DB4FE3287DE36.title: "&6Make a Phoenix Down"
	quest.136493FB82A58D3C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_sawmill_run.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Leg Stämme in das &6Sägewerk&r (Rezept im Kapitel &6Kochen&r). Alle &e10 Sekunden&r wird ein Stamm zu &e6 Brettern&r und &e2 Sägemehl&r, an der Werkbank wären es nur 4 Bretter. Trichter oben hinein, Trichter unten heraus, fertig ist die Bretterfabrik."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/sawdust.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Das geht mit jedem Stamm, auch Vanilla. &6Blauholz&r und &6Brasilholz&r geben zusätzlich &5Hämatoxylin&r, &6Gelbholz&r gibt &eFustik&r, mehr dazu bei den Farbbäumen. Acht &6Sägemehl&r um einen Wassereimer oder eine Wasserflasche ergeben 2 Papier."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Für die Mühle und die Pressen der Technikziele brauchst du Unmengen Bretter. Ein Sägewerk am Baumgarten liefert 50 Prozent mehr aus demselben Holz."
	]
	quest.136493FB82A58D3C.quest_subtitle: "Sechs Bretter und zwei Sägemehl pro Stamm, 10 Sekunden."
	quest.136493FB82A58D3C.title: "&6Säge Stämme im Sägewerk"
	quest.136D3B24716092EE.quest_desc: [
		"A &6drawer&r in the middle, &6eight obsidian&r around it."
		""
		"The drawer keeps accepting when it is full and deletes the surplus. No conveyor line clogs up anymore. Behind a cobblestone machine it stays at 2,048; bring the stock to the obelisk first."
	]
	quest.136D3B24716092EE.quest_subtitle: "The Void Upgrade."
	quest.136D3B24716092EE.title: "Let full drawers delete"
	quest.1379F4079A3F6F71.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Andesite Alloys&r above two &6dried kelp&r make two &6Andesite Tunnels&r. Put one on top of a belt."
		""
		"It splits single items off passing stacks onto belts or funnels next to it. Only the Brass Tunnel can sort on purpose."
	]
	quest.1379F4079A3F6F71.quest_subtitle: "One belt feeds several machines."
	quest.1379F4079A3F6F71.title: "&6Split items with a tunnel"
	quest.137D13B8A5EFAA20.quest_desc: [
		"&6Dynamic FPS&r spares your computer: when you click out of Minecraft, say into Discord, the browser or OBS, the game only runs at &d1 frame per second&r and &d25 percent&r volume. Minimised it stands completely still and is muted. If the mouse is just over the window, it runs at 60 frames."
		""
		"&cImportant for streamers:&r If you click into OBS during the stream, your audience sees a frozen picture for that time. You change this in the Dynamic FPS settings (in the &eMods&r menu), for example a higher frame rate for the &eunfocused&r state."
	]
	quest.137D13B8A5EFAA20.quest_subtitle: "Dynamic FPS slows down as soon as you click somewhere else."
	quest.137D13B8A5EFAA20.title: "&6Watch out when the game runs in the background"
	quest.13844516D73F8074.quest_desc: [
		"The Basic Energy Cube in the middle, osmium left and right, Energy Tablets at the top and bottom, alloy in the corners. &d6.4 million FE&r, &d6,400 FE/t&r output."
		""
		"The Induction Matrix for billions of FE needs Elite Control Circuits and lithium and comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.13844516D73F8074.quest_subtitle: "6.4 million FE."
	quest.13844516D73F8074.title: "&aBuild an Advanced Energy Cube"
	quest.138F2D1FBD28707E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_master_golem_bookwyrm.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Awakening next to &6budding amethyst&r gives an &6Amethyst Golem Charm&r. With a &6book and quill&r as an addition you get &6Bookwyrm Charms&r."
		""
		"The golem harvests amethyst within &e10 blocks&r of its home, turns amethyst blocks into budding amethyst and makes buds grow faster. The bookwyrm extends the &6Storage Lectern&r (lectern, 4 chests): &e8&r more connected inventories per wyrm, up to &e30 blocks&r away."
	]
	quest.138F2D1FBD28707E.quest_subtitle: "Gem supply and storage for everything."
	quest.138F2D1FBD28707E.title: "&dAwaken an Amethyst Golem and Bookwyrm"
	quest.139110C5F8434A03.quest_desc: [
		"Programm &eLaser&r in den Controller, &6Empty PCBs&r in die Eingangskiste. Jedes wird zu einem &6Unassembled PCB&r, ohne UV Light Box, ohne Etching Tank und ohne Fehlversuche."
		""
		"Empty PCBs kommen weiter aus der Druckkammer: zwei Redstone-Fackeln, drei Nuggets (Gold oder Kupfer) und ein Plastic Sheet bei 1,5 bar ergeben drei. Mit zwei &6Transistoren&r und zwei &6Kondensatoren&r um das Unassembled PCB wird daraus das fertige &6Printed Circuit Board&r, wie im Kapitel &bPneumaticCraft&r."
		""
		"Der Laser ist bequem und schnell genug für ein Dutzend Platinen. Für hunderte ist die Säure mit Heizung am Ende schneller, siehe nächste Aufgabe."
	]
	quest.139110C5F8434A03.quest_subtitle: "Kein UV-Kasten, keine Säure mehr."
	quest.139110C5F8434A03.title: "&aLaser dir Unassembled PCBs"
	quest.1397CD657DFF33E0.quest_desc: [
		"Tracks also work in areas where no player is at the moment. Trains keep running there without problems and stop at stations and red signals."
		""
		"When a player comes near, the train appears again. Only machines on the train, such as drills, do not work in unloaded chunks."
	]
	quest.1397CD657DFF33E0.quest_subtitle: "What happens in unloaded chunks."
	quest.1397CD657DFF33E0.title: "&6Let trains run without you"
	quest.139C6B0CD4570B26.quest_desc: [
		"&6MEGA Crafting Unit:&r four Crafting Units, two Logic Processors, two smart cables, an Accumulation Processor. With a 1M or 4M component it becomes large crafting storage, with an Engineering Processor the &6MEGA Crafting Co-Processing Unit&r."
		""
		"That way a CPU plans many Elite Control Circuits at once without the intermediate products bursting the storage."
	]
	quest.139C6B0CD4570B26.quest_subtitle: "Bigger storage, more threads."
	quest.139C6B0CD4570B26.title: "&8Build a MEGA Crafting CPU"
	quest.139EDB014A88C776.quest_desc: [
		"Cooking table, planting pots and the meals with the most saturation. A kitchen saves you a lot of walking on long streams."
	]
	quest.139EDB014A88C776.quest_subtitle: "The Blockhead kitchen and the best meals."
	quest.139EDB014A88C776.title: "&6Open Cooking"
	quest.139EF5EA4E974EA6.quest_desc: [
		"Acht &6Stein&r um einen &6Druckeisenbarren&r ergeben acht &6Verstärkten Stein&r (Reinforced Stone). Vier davon im Quadrat werden zu vier &6Verstärkten Ziegeln&r (Reinforced Bricks)."
		""
		"Aus den Ziegeln baust du den Luftkompressor und die Wände der Druckkammer, aus den Stufen des Steins fast jede andere Maschine. Mach gleich einen Stapel Stein zu Ziegeln, du brauchst für die erste Kammer über 50."
	]
	quest.139EF5EA4E974EA6.quest_subtitle: "Das Baumaterial aller Druckluftmaschinen."
	quest.139EF5EA4E974EA6.title: "&7Verstärke Stein"
	quest.13A03F6B13A07371.quest_desc: [
		"&6Harvester Pylon&r (top 3 quartz slabs, iron bars, hay bale, iron bars, bottom 3 polished blackstone) placed in the water block of the field or at the height of the plants, a &6hoe&r inside, a chest above it. Every &e3 seconds&r it harvests &e3 by 3 up to 9 by 9&r crops and puts the harvest into the chest."
		""
		"Each harvest costs the hoe 1 durability, Unbreaking enchantments count. A redstone signal stops it."
		""
		"Quartz and blackstone come from the Nether, hence stage 2."
	]
	quest.13A03F6B13A07371.quest_subtitle: "Pylons: a hoe in a block, a chest above it."
	quest.13A03F6B13A07371.title: "&aStage 2: Harvester Pylon"
	quest.13B1AD70D0753150.quest_desc: [
		"Right click on the ripe &6Yellow Dock&r gives &6Yellow Dock Leaves&r and &6Yellow Dock Flowers&r."
		""
		"As with Mugwort: leaves into the normal brush, flowers into the Enhanced Brush, dried both into the crow ankh and into the Replacer Satchel."
	]
	quest.13B1AD70D0753150.quest_subtitle: "The last bush in the garden."
	quest.13B1AD70D0753150.title: "&eHarvest Yellow Dock"
	quest.13B2273D97A9464A.quest_desc: [
		"Keep &e4 bound Djinni books&r and &e2 Lime Chalk&r ready. That is your stock for the start of stage 3."
		""
		"You now know seven pentacles: Aviar, Hedyrin, Eziveus, Ophyx, Strigeor, Ihagan and Susje. Crusher, Smelter, Transporter and Lumberjack work for you."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r &6Stage 3&r opens Afrit and Marid. The magic goal then wants &e150 Afrit Essences&r, each one a summoned and defeated Afrit, and every Elven Star two. Continue in the chapter &5Occultism: Afrit and Marid&r."
	]
	quest.13B2273D97A9464A.quest_subtitle: "Spirits work while you sleep."
	quest.13B2273D97A9464A.title: "&5&lBecome a summoner"
	quest.13BB52981D33238D.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r Four &6Importers&r on the sides, four &6iron blocks&r in the corners, an &6Advanced Processor&r in the middle: an &6Elite Importer&r. Elite Exporter, Elite Constructor, Elite Destructor, Elite Interface and Elite Autocrafter work the same way."
		""
		"&6Cable Tiers&r extends RS's devices in three tiers. &eElite:&r twice as fast, &e18 filter slots&r instead of 9, 4 FE/t. &eUltra:&r four Elite devices, four &6diamond blocks&r and an Advanced Processor, five times as fast, 36 filter slots, Stack Upgrade built in, 8 FE/t."
		""
		"Elite filters can also filter by &etags&r: clicking a filter slot opens the extended filter with tag selection. The Elite Autocrafter works twice as fast as the normal one, for 5 FE/t."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r The Mega tier needs netherite blocks and a &6dragon head&r, so stage 4."
	]
	quest.13BB52981D33238D.quest_subtitle: "Cable Tiers: faster, more filters."
	quest.13BB52981D33238D.title: "&5Upgrade to Elite"
	quest.13BDC551D5250B0B.quest_desc: [
		"Sieben Dimensionen, vier Stufen, zwei Events, ein Dutzend Arten zu reisen. Wer diese Liste abgehakt hat, verläuft sich nicht mehr und zahlt keine 27 Level für einen Weg, den eine Warpplatte umsonst macht."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Die Portale am Spawn gehören allen. Bau ihnen eine Hütte aus Bruchstein, lass einen Wegstein daneben stehen und erklär dem nächsten Neuen, was du hier gelesen hast."
	]
	quest.13BDC551D5250B0B.quest_subtitle: "Du weißt, wohin es geht und wie du hinkommst."
	quest.13BDC551D5250B0B.title: "&6&lAlle Wege gegangen"
	quest.13C377F1066A64A3.quest_desc: [
		"Fell &e16 crimson stems&r in the &6crimson forest&r. The wood doesn't burn and is good building timber."
		""
		"&6Hoglins&r and piglins live here. The glowing &6shroomlights&r in the crowns are bright light without power."
	]
	quest.13C377F1066A64A3.quest_subtitle: "Crimson forest: red fungus trees, hoglins and piglins."
	quest.13C377F1066A64A3.title: "&cFell crimson stems"
	quest.13CC7CBA4391431C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Bottle and Cork&r (glass bottle and a plank); click into the air with it in the Overworld: &6Bottled Sunlight&r. On the stands: Bottled Sunlight, Gold Leaf, a flower, an apple, a torch, an iron ingot. In the middle an &6oak sapling&r."
		""
		"The ritual gives &e2 Tokens of Joy&r. You need one for the altar."
	]
	quest.13CC7CBA4391431C.quest_subtitle: "Sunlight in a bottle, then your first ritual."
	quest.13CC7CBA4391431C.title: "&aMake a Token of Joy"
	quest.13CDD1AB8FAB07A3.quest_desc: [
		"An &6iron ingot&r on top, &6pistons&r next to the chest upgrade base, at the bottom &6redstone&r, iron ingot, redstone."
		""
		"Put a chain of the same kind into consecutive slots, like iron nuggets, iron ingots and block of iron. The upgrade then presses and breaks down back and forth on its own, up to &e5 slots&r long. You simply take out whichever level you need right now."
		""
		"One upgrade of this kind per storage."
	]
	quest.13CDD1AB8FAB07A3.quest_subtitle: "The Compression Upgrade."
	quest.13CDD1AB8FAB07A3.title: "Store nuggets, ingots and blocks together"
	quest.13D7DC252C756384.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Pyromancer Tower&r stands in hills, forests, plains and swamps. The &cPyromancer&r lives at the top and throws fire spells. Take water or a potion of fire resistance along and keep moving."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r 0 to 8 &6Arcane Essence&r, a &6scroll&r and 1 to 3 &6inks&r, mostly Common or Uncommon, with luck Rare or Epic. The chests in the tower: essence, paper, ink, scrolls and &6blaze rods&r, which are locked until stage 2. Keep them anyway."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Looting a chest near a mage makes it angry. First the mage, then the chests."
	]
	quest.13D7DC252C756384.quest_subtitle: "The first mage, and the most common one."
	quest.13D7DC252C756384.title: "&c&lStorm the Pyromancer Tower"
	quest.13E3AAA6DCCD8D36.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crimson Cloth&r is red wool, black wool and two &6Nebulous Hearts&r. Iron, cloth, iron on top, below that twice black wool, cloth, black wool give the &6Twilight Cloak&r."
		""
		"Shift right click turns it on. Then at light level &e4&r or lower you are invisible, and monsters cannot target you, even if you hit them."
		""
		"&eTip:&r In unlit caves and the Deep Dark you walk past everything this way."
	]
	quest.13E3AAA6DCCD8D36.quest_subtitle: "In the dark nobody sees you."
	quest.13E3AAA6DCCD8D36.title: "&8Sew a Twilight Cloak"
	quest.13FDC94071DCFD69.quest_desc: [
		"A box of casing, the columns inside, ports in the shell. Water in, fuel in, then start at &e0.1 mB/t&r."
		""
		"Water becomes steam. You send it into the &6Industrial Turbine&r from stage 3. Only raise the burn rate once cooling and turbine keep up."
		""
		"&c&lHonestly:&r Meltdowns are &cactive&r. Above 100 percent damage it can explode (radius 8), and its radiation is spread fifty times over. Causes: too little coolant, steam backing up, waste not pumped out."
	]
	quest.13FDC94071DCFD69.quest_subtitle: "Heat, steam and nuclear waste."
	quest.13FDC94071DCFD69.title: "&6&lStart the Fission Reactor"
	quest.1400ABE7C8241782.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &6Mana Spark&r, &6Pixie Dust&r and &6ender essence&r make &64 Corporea Sparks&r. A spark and a Dragonstone make the &6Master Corporea Spark&r."
		""
		"Put a spark on every chest that belongs to the network. Sparks connect within about 8 blocks. Every network needs &eexactly one&r master spark."
		""
		"Dyed sparks form separate networks. Corporea Blocks carry sparks without a chest and extend the network."
	]
	quest.1400ABE7C8241782.quest_subtitle: "Sparks that carry items instead of mana."
	quest.1400ABE7C8241782.title: "&dBuild Corporea Sparks"
	quest.14042D0E4B70B4FF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Extractor&r: copper over Mercury Shard. &6Inserter&r: Mercury Shard over copper. Right click a block with an inventory to attach them."
		""
		"The extractor (red band) pulls from its block, the inserter (green band) pushes in. For fluids there are both with blue dye."
	]
	quest.14042D0E4B70B4FF.quest_subtitle: "Mercury carries items."
	quest.14042D0E4B70B4FF.title: "&bPlace an Extractor and Inserter"
	quest.140A199B9A2126CC.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a placed &6ME P2P Tunnel&r with a &6bucket&r, and it turns into this type. Breaking it gives you the tunnel as an item of its own."
	]
	quest.140A199B9A2126CC.quest_subtitle: "Fluids without a pipe."
	quest.140A199B9A2126CC.title: "Build a fluid tunnel"
	quest.14101AE7D155D8AE.quest_desc: [
		"Leg &6Schwefelstaub&r in den &6Chemischen Oxidierer&r (den aus der Sole-Quest oder einen zweiten). Jeder Staub gibt &e100 mB Schwefeldioxid&r."
		""
		"Schwefel kommt aus Schießpulver in der Injektionskammer. Der Oxidierer nimmt jeden Schwefelstaub: drei &6Schwefelessenzen&r von Mystical Agriculture ergeben an der Werkbank acht, und der Zerkleinerer von Immersive Engineering lässt bei Kohleerz zu 15 Prozent einen fallen."
		""
		"Der Oxidierer braucht etwa &d80 FE/t&r. Sein Gas geht per Druckschlauch weiter in den Chemischen Injektor."
	]
	quest.14101AE7D155D8AE.quest_subtitle: "Schwefelstaub in den Oxidierer."
	quest.14101AE7D155D8AE.title: "&eMach Schwefeldioxid"
	quest.14119DE9625B3AFE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Revolver Barrel:&r steel ingot, Steel Rod and the hammer. &6Revolver Drum:&r four steel plates around a Steel Rod. &6Revolver Hammer:&r two steel ingots, flint, Steel Rod. Plus a &6Steel Mechanical Component&r and a &6Wooden Grip&r as for the drill make the &6Revolver&r."
		""
		"&6Cartridges:&r Five copper plates make five &6Empty Casings&r. The &6Projectiles blueprint&r (gunpowder, casing, gunpowder, three blue dye, three paper) at the workbench turns four casings, gunpowder and a lead nugget into four &6Casull Cartridges&r."
		""
		"Sneak and right click opens the drum. Shots are loud and attract monsters."
	]
	quest.14119DE9625B3AFE.quest_subtitle: "Five parts, then cartridges at the workbench."
	quest.14119DE9625B3AFE.title: "&cBuild a Revolver"
	quest.14127434D45A5A93.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ornate Ring&r: one &6Soulstained Steel&r at the top left, &e4 leather&r as a ring around it."
		"The ring on the altar, &e8 Refined Soulstone&r on the stands, plus &e8 Wicked&r, &e8 Arcane&r and &e8 Eldritch&r each."
		""
		"Worn, every shattered soul gives one extra arcana. Worth it mostly for rare kinds like Eldritch."
	]
	quest.14127434D45A5A93.quest_subtitle: "One more arcana per soul."
	quest.14127434D45A5A93.title: "&5Infuse the Ring of Esoteric Spoils"
	quest.1416DBEF41E814E7.quest_desc: [
		"Osmium, Infused Alloy, two Energy Tablets and a circuit. It supplies &d24 FE/t&r from Y 24 and more the higher it stands, up to &d192 FE/t&r."
		""
		"It reaches several blocks high and needs free space. A few on a peak, cabled to the cube, replace a coal supply."
	]
	quest.1416DBEF41E814E7.quest_subtitle: "The higher, the more."
	quest.1416DBEF41E814E7.title: "&bPut up a Wind Generator"
	quest.1418C05012C55DA7.quest_desc: [
		"With server &6stage 3&r &eforge tier 3&r opens: 5,000 Aureal, 100 Souls, 30,000 Blood. Plus the &6Eternal Stella&r (a diamond, three Xpetrified Orbs and a Stellarite Piece), which makes tools unbreakable, the &6Quantum Injector&r and the Sea Prism."
		""
		"In &6stage 4&r follow forge tiers 4 and 5 (Stellarite, runes, sculk catalysts, two Dark Nether Stars), the &6Draco Arcanus&r armor from netherite armor, dragon scales and Obsidiansteel, and above it the Tyr armor."
		""
		"Dragon scales only come from the Ender Dragon and End cities. Until then: hoard Stellarite and Obsidiansteel."
	]
	quest.1418C05012C55DA7.quest_subtitle: "What waits beyond the second tier."
	quest.1418C05012C55DA7.title: "&dOutlook on Stage 3 and 4"
	quest.141BD828F55C274C.quest_desc: [
		"&e5 Livingrock slabs&r make a &6Diluted Mana Pool&r with &d10,000 mana&r, one hundredth."
		""
		"Good as a buffer next to a single functional flower. Wherever the Lexica talks about Mana Pools, it always means the big one."
	]
	quest.141BD828F55C274C.quest_subtitle: "Small, cheap, quickly full."
	quest.141BD828F55C274C.title: "&6Build a Diluted Pool"
	quest.142280707274E735.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_latex_unit.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Iron in the corners, a &6block of redstone&r at the top, &6buckets&r left and right, a &6furnace&r at the bottom, the Pity Frame in the middle."
		""
		"It turns &e750 mB of latex&r and &e500 mB of water&r into one &6Dry Rubber&r and draws &d20 FE/t&r. Place it right next to the extractors and give it a water source."
	]
	quest.142280707274E735.quest_subtitle: "Latex and water become rubber."
	quest.142280707274E735.title: "&eBuild a Latex Processing Unit"
	quest.1429B65ED6193623.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r top three iron, middle planks, osmium, planks, bottom copper, furnace, copper."
		""
		"With fuel &d80 FE/t&r. Every adjacent &blava source&r adds &d12 FE/t&r without being used up, in the Nether another 40 FE/t. That is enough for three to four basic machines."
		""
		"Place it right next to the infuser; power goes across without cables too."
	]
	quest.1429B65ED6193623.quest_subtitle: "Power from anything that burns."
	quest.1429B65ED6193623.title: "&6&lBuild a Heat Generator"
	quest.142D9BD38196A6BA.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 pink&r, &e2 purple&r, &e1 lime&r petal, &dRune of Mana&r."
		""
		"Drains experience from players right next to it, eats experience orbs and pulls the enchantments out of enchanted items on the ground. &d50 mana per experience point&r."
		""
		"&eTip:&r At the exit of a mob farm; bad books from fishing are fuel here."
	]
	quest.142D9BD38196A6BA.quest_subtitle: "Experience becomes mana."
	quest.142D9BD38196A6BA.title: "&6Plant a Rosa Arcana"
	quest.1438A506F83E986D.quest_desc: [
		"In the heated lava cauldron: a &6diamond&r, &e6 glass&r, a &6stone&r. That is the &6Crystal Ball&r."
		""
		"It shows the moon phase, during the day the sun. Handy for the Moon Dust Brush, which flies fastest at full moon."
	]
	quest.1438A506F83E986D.quest_subtitle: "What is the moon doing?"
	quest.1438A506F83E986D.title: "&bMelt a crystal ball"
	quest.145619584FEB7A01.quest_desc: [
		"&aWarping&r (Vexing log, Warp Scroll): takes all creatures nearby to the place on an additionally inserted scroll."
		"&aConjure Island: Plains&r (Flourishing log, grass block, Earth Essence) and &aConjure Island: Desert&r (Blazing log, sand, Earth Essence): a round island with radius 7, each source gem +1. Frostaya makes snow, terracotta mesas."
	]
	quest.145619584FEB7A01.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: travel and terrain."
	quest.145619584FEB7A01.title: "&aMake Warping and the Islands"
	quest.1457450B314AB46D.quest_desc: [
		"Put raw meat or fish on the &6Cutting Board&r and click it with the knife. A &6pork chop&r gives two &6bacon&r, a &6cod&r two &6cod slices&r and a bone meal. Chicken and mutton turn into cuts the same way."
		""
		"You need the cuts for sandwiches, wraps and skewers. &eTip:&r A knife with &6Fortune&r raises the chance of rare results at the board by &d10 percent&r per level."
	]
	quest.1457450B314AB46D.quest_subtitle: "One chop, two strips of bacon."
	quest.1457450B314AB46D.title: "&6Cut up meat and fish"
	quest.1460AD2C9D62D06E.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &dSuperior&r-Modell gibt &e18 Datenpunkte pro Kill&r und ist bei &e1.254 Datenpunkten&r fertig: &6Self Aware&r. Das sind &e50 Kills&r, insgesamt 98 für ein komplettes Modell."
		""
		"Self Aware heißt &e100 Prozent Genauigkeit&r. Jede Simulation liefert eine Vorhersage, nichts geht mehr verloren, und nur Self-Aware-Modelle dürfen später ins Rechenzentrum."
		""
		"Das ist die Handarbeit, von der im ersten Quest die Rede war. Etwa 100 Kills pro Mobart, einmal. Danach arbeitet die Technik für dich, für immer."
	]
	quest.1460AD2C9D62D06E.quest_subtitle: "Fünfzig Kills, und das Modell weiß alles."
	quest.1460AD2C9D62D06E.title: "&6&lBring ein Modell auf Self Aware"
	quest.14650F4827AE0381.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Seismic Sensor&r oben, Plastic Sheet, &6Verstärker&r (Repeater), Plastic Sheet in der Mitte, Plastic Sheet, &6Pressure Tube&r, Plastic Sheet unten."
		""
		"Er misst, was um ihn herum passiert, und gibt ein &cRedstone-Signal&r aus: Druck in einem Rohr, Licht, Regen, Zeit, ein Spieler oder Monster in Reichweite, ein Block an einer Koordinate. Über 15 Bedingungen, jede im Fenster erklärt. Er braucht 1 mL Luft pro Tick."
		""
		"&eUpgrades schalten frei:&r Ein &6Entity Tracker Upgrade&r (Knochen, fermentiertes Spinnenauge) für alles mit Lebewesen, ein Block Tracker Upgrade plus GPS Tool für Blöcke an einer Koordinate. Welcher Sensor welches Upgrade will, steht im Fenster. Range Upgrades vergrößern die Reichweite."
		""
		"&eBeispiel:&r Entity Tracker hinein, Entity, Within Range, Filter &ecow&r: Das Signal geht an, wenn genug Kühe im Gehege sind, und startet die Schlachtmaschine."
	]
	quest.14650F4827AE0381.quest_subtitle: "Redstone aus Bedingungen."
	quest.14650F4827AE0381.title: "&3Bau einen Universal Sensor"
	quest.146623D846D8F44F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r vier &6Turbine Rotors&r um eine &6Feldfrucht&r, zum Beispiel Weizen."
		""
		"Sie erntet reife Pflanzen und Bäume in einem Würfel von &e17 Blöcken&r um ihren Startpunkt. Setz sie mit &eShift-Rechtsklick&r gegen eine Kiste, in der nur eine &6Hacke&r liegt, dann pflanzt sie nach und arbeitet nur mit Hacke. Gegen jeden anderen Block gesetzt, erntet sie ohne nachzupflanzen."
		""
		"Aufsammeln tut sie nichts. Dafür gibt es die &6Collector Drone&r (vier Rotoren um einen Trichter): gegen eine Kiste gesetzt sammelt sie alles im 17er-Würfel ein, was auf dem Boden liegt, und filtert auf das, was schon in der Kiste liegt."
	]
	quest.146623D846D8F44F.quest_subtitle: "Ein Bauer, der nie schläft."
	quest.146623D846D8F44F.title: "&aSetz eine Harvesting Drone ein"
	quest.146984CF36C14623.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_source_berries.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Plant &6Sourceberry bushes&r from the archwood forest in rows, between them an &6Agronomic Sourcelink&r (2 Source Gems, 2 gold ingots, wheat) and a &6Source Jar&r. Every growth step within &e15 blocks&r brings Source, the link fills jars up to 5 blocks away."
		""
		"A &6Starbuncle&r harvests the ripe bushes into a chest, the berries feed the Mycelial Sourcelink or you. &6Magebloom&r in the same bed counts as magical plants and gives more."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r An &6Imbuement Chamber&r no more than 2 blocks from the jar, hoppers for amethyst on top and gems below, and the Source Gems for the obelisk come on their own. See the &dArs Nouveau&r chapter (Source)."
	]
	quest.146984CF36C14623.quest_subtitle: "A bed that makes Source while it grows."
	quest.146984CF36C14623.title: "&dPlant Sourceberries"
	quest.146B81741AB4AAA1.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Open the map with \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbchunks.map\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\", claim the chunk of the machine and its storage and force load it (Shift and left click). Each team has at most \"},{\"text\":\"25\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" chunks for that.\"}]"
		""
		"Do not take the whole mining area. If an ME network stands at the quarry, the &6Spatial Anchor&r from the chapter Applied Energistics 2: Advanced keeps the whole network awake."
	]
	quest.146B81741AB4AAA1.quest_subtitle: "No player, no quarry."
	quest.146B81741AB4AAA1.title: "&eKeep the Quarry Loaded"
	quest.146C9B3D40018F33.quest_desc: [
		"Gravel in the corners and middle, &6clay&r at the top and bottom, &6sand&r left and right: eight &6Conduit Binder Composite&r. In a furnace each piece becomes &6two binders&r."
		""
		"Every conduit is two thirds binder."
	]
	quest.146C9B3D40018F33.quest_subtitle: "Gravel, sand and clay."
	quest.146C9B3D40018F33.title: "&7Make Conduit Binder"
	quest.146DE743DB58F87B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Censer&r: &6Arcane Gold&r at the top, &e2 silver ingots&r left and right, at the bottom Arcane Gold, Pewter, Arcane Gold."
		"&6Restoration Incense&r, shapeless: &6Merammer Resin&r (Merammer Root), &6Oanna Bloom&r, &6pink petals&r, &6glistering melon slice&r."
		""
		"Fill the censer and light it. Restoration heals the living nearby and harms the undead. In the Crucible you brew more kinds: Tough for more armor, Bloodlust for more melee damage, Soul Harvest for more loot and experience."
		""
		"On the altar the censer gives &e+2 Capacity&r."
	]
	quest.146DE743DB58F87B.quest_subtitle: "Incense for the altar and combat."
	quest.146DE743DB58F87B.title: "&6Light a Censer"
	quest.147222A2E72EC38E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_gear_wyvern.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Six Wyvern injectors. Catalyst: a &6diamond pickaxe&r. Into the injectors: &61 Draconium Core&r, &62 Draconium Ingots&r, &62 relay crystals&r, &61 Wyvern Energy Controller&r. Costs 8 million energy."
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"It runs on power and never breaks. \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.tool_modules\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" (the Tool Modules key) opens its module grid.\"}]"
	]
	quest.147222A2E72EC38E.quest_subtitle: "A tool with power and modules."
	quest.147222A2E72EC38E.title: "&d&lFuse a Wyvern Pickaxe"
	quest.147692EDD311083C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_power_steam_engine.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Golden sheet&r, &6andesite alloy&r and &6block of copper&r on top of each other make the &6Steam Engine&r. Place it on a boiler of at least &e4 fluid tanks&r with &bwater&r and &6Blaze Burners&r below."
		""
		"Click it with a &6shaft&r, that is its output. A fully supplied engine supplies &d1,024 SU per RPM&r, 32 times as much as a water wheel."
	]
	quest.147692EDD311083C.quest_subtitle: "Serious power from water and heat."
	quest.147692EDD311083C.title: "&6Build a steam engine"
	quest.147FE01F3C49853B.quest_desc: [
		"Shovel &e16 soul sand&r in the &6soul sand valley&r. Nether wart grows on soul sand, and it belongs under the Wither."
		""
		"Soul sand slows you down. Skeletons and ghasts see you from far away here, so work quickly and look for cover."
	]
	quest.147FE01F3C49853B.quest_subtitle: "Soul sand valley: slow, open and full of skeletons."
	quest.147FE01F3C49853B.title: "&8Shovel soul sand"
	quest.148710E83268A906.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Mana Diamonds&r and &e1 Mana Quartz&r on the altar, plus the runes Summer and Air as catalysts. &d12,000 mana&r."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r Pollidisiac and Vinculotus."
	]
	quest.148710E83268A906.quest_subtitle: "Catalysts: Summer and Air."
	quest.148710E83268A906.title: "&5Make the Rune of Lust"
	quest.148DD1118AF7A40B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Nether Brick Nest&r in Nether fortresses, attracted with magma cream. Flower: magma block, fire or nether wart. The comb gives &6magma cream&r with 30 percent. Fed a lava bucket it becomes the Lava Bee."
	]
	quest.148DD1118AF7A40B.quest_subtitle: "Magma cream, and lava from cobblestone."
	quest.148DD1118AF7A40B.title: "&6Keep a Magmatic Bee"
	quest.148E13F49394D961.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ender IO&r, &6Fluid Conduit&r &e200 mB&r, &6Energetic&r 1 000, &6Vibrant&r 8 000 pro Netztakt. Eine Leitung führt eine Flüssigkeit, Energetic und Vibrant mehrere, mit Flüssigkeitsfilter an jeder Verbindung. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"Liegt im selben Block wie Strom- und Gegenstandsleitungen. Siehe Kapitel Ender IO."
	]
	quest.148E13F49394D961.quest_subtitle: "Ender IO, Fluid Conduit: 200, 1 000 oder 8 000 mB pro Netztakt."
	quest.148E13F49394D961.title: "Lies: Ender-IO-Flüssigkeitsleitungen"
	quest.1491084B193A3E66.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6andesite alloys&r around a &6shaft&r make the &6Mechanical Grindstone&r. Click an &6Item Drain&r with it (it becomes a grindstone drain) and put a second one on top."
		""
		"Experience nuggets become &bliquid experience&r, enchanted items lose their enchantments to the drain. On the side it polishes rose quartz."
	]
	quest.1491084B193A3E66.quest_subtitle: "Enchantment Industry: the Mechanical Grindstone."
	quest.1491084B193A3E66.title: "&5Grind off experience"
	quest.1498CEFF2DC8B959.quest_desc: [
		"&66 Wolle&r, zwei breit und drei hoch, ergeben ein Cape: &cRed Cape&r, &eYellow Cape&r, &fWhite Cape&r oder &9Blue Cape&r (auch aus Cyan oder Hellblau). Reine Zierde, aber sichtbar."
		""
		"Die Capes mit Wirkung kommen aus den Dungeons: das &6Swet Cape&r zum Reiten auf Swets, das &6Agility Cape&r, mit dem du Blöcke hochgehst ohne zu springen, der &6Invisibility Cloak&r, der dich unsichtbar macht, und in Stufe 3 das &6Valkyrie Cape&r."
	]
	quest.1498CEFF2DC8B959.quest_subtitle: "Sechs Wolle, ein Cape."
	quest.1498CEFF2DC8B959.title: "&cNäh einen Umhang"
	quest.149B7F0FB9F7BFD9.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r two &6iron sheets&r top and bottom, in the middle fence, &6Andesite Casing&r and &6Electron Tube&r give four &6Semaphores&r. Put a mast of fences or metal girders above a &6Train Signal&r and hang the semaphore on it."
		""
		"The semaphore shows the state of the signal below the mast with arm and light, clear or occupied. In front of a junction signal with several exits you can put a second semaphore above: the lower one closes as soon as one of the routes is blocked, the upper one only when all are blocked."
		""
		"Purely visual, but at a station with six tracks you can see from the locomotive what is going on."
	]
	quest.149B7F0FB9F7BFD9.quest_subtitle: "Signals you can see from afar."
	quest.149B7F0FB9F7BFD9.title: "&6Hang Up Semaphores"
	quest.149E9A5BBE9D9BBC.quest_desc: [
		"Ultimative Schaltkreise, Konfigurator, HDPE-Platten, der &6Atomic Disassembler&r in der Mitte, unten 2 Polonium Pellets und eine Induktionszelle."
		""
		"Spitzhacke, Axt, Schaufel, Hacke, Schwert. Module: Abbaubeschleunigung, Behutsamkeit oder Glück, Aderabbau, in Stufe 5 Teleportation mit Antimaterie."
	]
	quest.149E9A5BBE9D9BBC.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism: ein Werkzeug für alles, mit Modulen."
	quest.149E9A5BBE9D9BBC.title: "&bBuild the Meka-Tool"
	quest.14A0D801856449FD.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_gloves.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Zwei &6Zanite Gemstones&r nebeneinander ergeben &6Zanite Gloves&r, genauso Handschuhe aus Leder, Eisen, Gold oder Diamant. Sie geben Rüstung und machen ein Set erst komplett: Auf Kronwerke brauchen Set-Fähigkeiten die passenden Handschuhe."
		""
		"&eDas Menü:&r Der Aether nutzt den &6Accessories&r-Rahmen mit einem eigenen Menü, der Knopf dafür sitzt im Inventar. Die Slots: &e1 Gloves&r, &e2 Rings&r, &e1 Pendant&r, &e1 Cape&r, &e1 Shield&r und &e2 Misc&r für Dinge wie Iron Bubble oder Regeneration Stone."
		""
		"Curios-Gegenstände anderer Mods (Ars Nouveau, Iron's Spells) gehören in das getrennte Curios-Menü, nicht hierher."
	]
	quest.14A0D801856449FD.quest_subtitle: "Das fünfte Rüstungsteil und das Accessoire-Menü."
	quest.14A0D801856449FD.title: "&6Trag Handschuhe"
	quest.14A7B89153B487BA.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &63 Dreamwood Logs&r each at the top and bottom, &61 Elementium Ingot&r and &61 petal&r in the middle."
		""
		"It fires bigger mana bursts, faster and farther, and loses less on the way. Swap the spreaders at your best flowers, then the pools at the portal stay full."
	]
	quest.14A7B89153B487BA.quest_subtitle: "More mana, faster, farther."
	quest.14A7B89153B487BA.title: "&6Build Elven Mana Spreaders"
	quest.14AA6E5793BFA6B0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Manaseer Monocle&r (Managlass, 3 gold nuggets, Manasteel): shows mana bursts through walls and the areas of flowers."
		"&6Tiny Planet&r (4 Livingrock, 4 stone, Mana Pearl): pulls mana bursts into an orbit around you."
		"&6Benevolent Goddess' Charm&r (2 pink, Runes Water and Spring, Mana Diamond): explosions don't destroy blocks."
		"&6The Spectator&r (5 iron, eye of ender, emerald): makes the held item glow in chests and mobs."
		"&6Third Eye&r (4 golden carrots, Rune of Earth, 2 quartz blocks, eye of ender, Mana Diamond): mobs glow through walls."
		"&6Invisibility Cloak&r (2 prismarine, 2 wool, 4 Managlass, Mana Pearl): makes you invisible."
	]
	quest.14AA6E5793BFA6B0.quest_subtitle: "Six pieces for head, body and charm."
	quest.14AA6E5793BFA6B0.title: "&6Collect trinkets and cloaks"
	quest.14B18FEB229F27A2.quest_desc: [
		"Hol je einen Eimer &bDiesel&r und &bLPG&r aus den Ausgängen. Im Flüssigkeitskompressor gibt ein Eimer Öl 200 000 mL Luft, &bDiesel&r 1 000 000, &bKerosin&r 1 100 000, &bBenzin&r 1 500 000 und &bLPG&r 1 800 000. Benzin und LPG brennen dabei schneller als Diesel, also mehr Luft pro Tick."
		""
		"&eWofür du sie brauchst:&r &bLPG&r wird zu Kunststoff, &bDiesel&r zu Schmiermittel für Geschwindigkeits-Upgrades. &bKerosin&r brennt in der &6Kerosinlampe&r (drei Druckeisen, zwei Glasscheiben, ein kleiner Tank), die bis zu 30 Blöcke weit ausleuchtet; ein Eimer reicht bei 10 Blöcken etwa 40 echte Minuten."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Der Diesel läuft auch im &6Dieselmotor&r von Create Diesel Generators, mit 96 RPM und 6 144 SU pro Motor (siehe Kapitel Create: Erweiterungen). Ein Raffinerie-Diesel treibt also die Präzisionslinie für das Stufenziel an. Ein Eimer LPG im Ofen schmilzt außerdem 450 Gegenstände."
		""
		"Zu viel von einer Sorte? Die &6Thermopneumatische Anlage&r knackt bei 300 Grad und 2 Bar Diesel zu Kerosin, Kerosin zu Benzin und Benzin zu LPG, mit 80 Prozent Ausbeute."
	]
	quest.14B18FEB229F27A2.quest_subtitle: "Vier Brennstoffe, vier Aufgaben."
	quest.14B18FEB229F27A2.title: "&eDiesel, Kerosin, Benzin und LPG"
	quest.14B34EE27BD94109.quest_desc: [
		"At the &6Smithing Table&r: the &6Blaze Upgrade Smithing Template&r, a &6Blaze Burner&r and an &6anvil&r give the &6Blaze Forger&r. The template is the same as for the Blaze Enchanter, where it comes from is in &6Create: Brass&r. On Kronwerke the Blaze Burner needs two source gems."
		""
		"Give it &bliquid experience&r by pipe (tank 4,000 mB). In normal mode it combines enchantments of two identical items like an anvil, but without rising repair costs. With the side box you switch: &eApply&r transfers an Enchanting Template onto an item, &eExtract&r pulls an enchantment from a tool, book or template onto a blank template."
		""
		"A &6Mechanical Arm&r puts items in, refills experience and takes the result out. That way a chest of old enchanted books becomes a storage of sorted templates."
	]
	quest.14B34EE27BD94109.quest_subtitle: "An anvil that never gets more expensive."
	quest.14B34EE27BD94109.title: "&5Build the Blaze Forger"
	quest.14C021452814BEF9.quest_desc: [
		"Position yourself so the Guardian hits a &5Guardian Crystal&r when it attacks you. Once that crystal's shield is unstable, you have &e10 seconds&r: everyone on that crystal."
		""
		"Call out in voice which crystal is open. As long as one stands, you cannot get at the Guardian's shield."
	]
	quest.14C021452814BEF9.quest_subtitle: "Lure its attacks onto a crystal, then strike."
	quest.14C021452814BEF9.title: "&5Crack the Guardian Crystals"
	quest.14C8B1A307A5278A.quest_desc: [
		"One &6Nether quartz&r and eight &6redstone&r in the crafting grid make one &6Rose Quartz&r."
	]
	quest.14C8B1A307A5278A.quest_subtitle: "One quartz, eight redstone."
	quest.14C8B1A307A5278A.title: "&6Dye quartz into rose quartz"
	quest.14D5258ACC4A915E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pickaxe blueprint&r plus &ethree&r units of material. An ingot, a gem or a cobblestone is one unit."
		""
		"The head decides durability, speed, damage and mining level. An iron head has 250 durability and speed 6 and mines diamond ore."
	]
	quest.14D5258ACC4A915E.quest_subtitle: "Blueprint plus three material."
	quest.14D5258ACC4A915E.title: "&6Build a pickaxe head"
	quest.14D74A089FE60670.quest_desc: [
		"&6Magic Capacity&r (3 Sourceberries, 3 Magebloom): &e+10&r percent mana per level."
		"&6Repairing&r (anvil, 2 Manipulation Essences): repairs all mage gear with mana."
		"&6Feather&r (4 feathers, 2 Abjuration Essences): less fall damage. &6High Step&r (3 Air Essences): one block more step height."
		"The helper threads from 3 tokens each: &6Starbuncle&r 20 percent faster, &6Whirlisprig&r more saturation, &6Wixie&r longer potions, &6Drygmy&r more loot."
	]
	quest.14D74A089FE60670.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: mana, repair, movement."
	quest.14D74A089FE60670.title: "&6Sew Threads for Everyday Use"
	quest.14E08F74C89000B7.quest_desc: [
		"Four fruits you find in the chests of Nexus towers and Arcane Libraries:"
		"&6Bastion Fruit&r: potion of defense, less damage."
		"&6Frostaya&r: potion of freezing, freezes the target bit by bit. Makes the island tablet snowy."
		"&6Mendosteen&r: potion of recovery, every heal works more strongly. Also goes into the Life Drain thread."
		"&6Bombegranate&r: potion of blasting, the target explodes when the effect ends."
	]
	quest.14E08F74C89000B7.quest_subtitle: "Ingredients for Ars Nouveau's potions."
	quest.14E08F74C89000B7.title: "&aCollect the Archwood Fruits"
	quest.14E5685EB07B804E.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Andesite Alloy&r on top, a &6wool&r below it and three Andesite Alloys in the bottom row make the &6Nozzle&r. Put it on the front of an &6Encased Fan&r."
		""
		"Instead of a straight air stream the nozzle spreads the fan's effect all around onto mobs and players. Good for keeping mobs away from a spot or sucking them together."
	]
	quest.14E5685EB07B804E.quest_subtitle: "Air in every direction."
	quest.14E5685EB07B804E.title: "&6Put a nozzle on the fan"
	quest.14F76136DDBFFFE1.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r three Blueprint Paper and a stick. The blade needs &ethree&r material."
		""
		"The &6machete&r is above all a sword, a bit faster and weaker than the normal one. On top of that it fells wood and mows plants around the block like a sickle, just over a smaller area. Just right for the jungle."
	]
	quest.14F76136DDBFFFE1.quest_subtitle: "Sword, axe and sickle in one."
	quest.14F76136DDBFFFE1.title: "&7Build a machete"
	quest.14FBA11A9BC492A6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Powdered Lapis Lazuli&r, &6Powdered Coal&r and &6Silicon&r, shapeless, make one &6Photovoltaic Composite&r. Two of them in the Alloy Smelter make a &6Photovoltaic Plate&r. The SAG Mill supplies the powder and silicon."
		""
		"&6Energetic Photovoltaic Module:&r gold, glass, gold at the top, three Photovoltaic Plates in the middle, Basic Capacitor, redstone, Basic Capacitor at the bottom."
		""
		"In daylight it gives up to &d4 µI/t&r and needs a clear view of the sky. Not much, but forever and without upkeep. Good for topping up a capacitor bank during the day."
	]
	quest.14FBA11A9BC492A6.quest_subtitle: "Power from sunlight, no fuel."
	quest.14FBA11A9BC492A6.title: "&eBuild Photovoltaic Modules"
	quest.14FCB31E83345B2E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/draconic_stabilizer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Energiekern&r: Draconiumbarren oben und unten, zwei Wyvern-Energiekontroller und ein Wyvern-Kern. Tier Up und Build Guide im Fenster zeigen die Hülle aus Draconium- und Redstoneblöcken, vier &6Stabilisatoren&r (Kronwerke: ein Gaia-Geist) rundherum, dann Activate."
		""
		"&eDraconic Evolution, Energiekern:&r Stufe 1 &d45,5 Millionen FE&r, 2: 273 Millionen, 3: 1,64 Milliarden, 4: 9,88 Milliarden, 5: 59,3 Milliarden, 6: 356 Milliarden, 7: &d2,14 Billionen&r, Stufe 8 ohne Grenze, aber mit Erwachtem Draconium (Stufe 5). &6Energiepylonen&r bringen den Strom hinein und heraus. &eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r der Stabilisator braucht einen Gaia-Geist. Offen ab Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.14FCB31E83345B2E.quest_subtitle: "Draconic Evolution, 45,5 Millionen bis 2,14 Billionen FE, Stufe 8 ohne Grenze."
	quest.14FCB31E83345B2E.title: "&cBau den Energiekern"
	quest.14FE22C633678D6D.quest_desc: [
		"Enderman farm, belt to a pool with a &6brass casing&r underneath, a Hopperhock at the edge of the pool, a chest. Done."
		""
		"600 pearls are &d3.6 million mana&r and 600 ender pearls. They are handed in by hand at the obelisk, a backpack full at a time."
	]
	quest.14FE22C633678D6D.quest_subtitle: "Six hundred pearls have to be earned."
	quest.14FE22C633678D6D.title: "&bBuild a pearl factory"
	quest.15012F1389F55928.quest_desc: [
		"Crafter recipe: &6andesite alloy&r, &6precision mechanism&r, three &6fluid pipes&r, two &6copper ingots&r. The air comes from the copper backtank."
		"{image:create:textures/item/potato_cannon.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Also from the crafters: the &6Extendo Grip&r for more reach and the &6Wand of Symmetry&r, which mirrors every placed block."
	]
	quest.15012F1389F55928.quest_subtitle: "The tool nobody needs and everybody wants."
	quest.15012F1389F55928.title: "&6Shoot potatoes"
	quest.1507CAA88B395BE2.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &6Earth Essence&r, &e5 bone blocks&r, &e3 seeds&r."
		""
		"&eTouch, Grow, AOE, AOE&r and then &eTouch, Harvest, AOE, AOE&r: a 5x5 field from seed to harvest. Like bone meal it brings nothing to the Agronomic Sourcelink."
	]
	quest.1507CAA88B395BE2.quest_subtitle: "Bone meal from the book."
	quest.1507CAA88B395BE2.title: "&dLearn Grow"
	quest.150B19122018682E.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e1 purple, lime, green&r petal each, &eRune of Spring&r, &6Redstone Root&r."
		""
		"With mana it keeps growing new Mystical Flowers of every colour on dirt near it. With a Hopperhock and a chest the supply collects itself."
	]
	quest.150B19122018682E.quest_subtitle: "Never search for flowers again."
	quest.150B19122018682E.title: "&6Plant a Jaded Amaranthus"
	quest.150E6494E7D3E1C4.quest_desc: [
		"Jede Maschine hat ein &eVolumen&r in mL. Der Druck ist: &bLuft geteilt durch Volumen, minus 1&r. Eine Maschine mit 5 000 mL Volumen und 20 000 mL Luft darin steht bei &e3 Bar&r. 0 Bar ist normale Luft, minus 1 Bar ein Vakuum."
		""
		"Luft fließt immer von hohem zu niedrigem Druck, bis alles gleich ist. Ein kleines Rohr an einer großen Kammer bekommt deren Druck. Maschinen verbrauchen &eLuft&r, nicht Druck: Die Anzeige fällt, weil weniger Luft im selben Volumen steckt."
		""
		"&eDie Anzeige:&r Im Fenster jeder Maschine sitzt eine runde Druckanzeige. Der &crote Bereich&r beginnt bei der Gefahrengrenze (5 Bar für alles in diesem Kapitel). Wie weit darüber es knallt, ist Zufall. Der Reiter &eProbleme&r am Fensterrand sagt dir, wenn Druck fehlt."
	]
	quest.150E6494E7D3E1C4.quest_subtitle: "Druck ist Luft geteilt durch Volumen."
	quest.150E6494E7D3E1C4.title: "&bVersteh, was Bar bedeutet"
	quest.15115DED00A268E2.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.inventorytweak.sort_inventory_key\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" in your inventory or an open chest, and \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Tweak\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" sorts by type, name or rarity, depending on the setting. If a tool drops below \"},{\"text\":\"10 percent\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" durability, it warns you with text and sound.\"}]"
		""
		"&6Crafting Tweaks&r puts three small buttons next to the crafting table: &eRotate&r, &eBalance&r (spreads stacks evenly) and &eClear&r. Right clicking the result crafts a whole stack at once."
		""
		"&eTip:&r B is also JourneyMap's waypoint key. That does not get in the way, because it only applies outside of menus."
	]
	quest.15115DED00A268E2.quest_subtitle: "Inventory Tweak and Crafting Tweaks."
	quest.15115DED00A268E2.title: "&7Tidy Up Your Inventory"
	quest.1511FADB80273BAF.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_source_berries.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Like the Volcanic one, but &6wheat&r instead of a lava bucket in the middle."
		""
		"Every plant and tree growing within &e15 blocks&r brings Source. Magebloom, Sourceberries and archwood saplings bring extra."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Bone meal does not count, the plants have to grow on their own."
	]
	quest.1511FADB80273BAF.quest_subtitle: "Growing plants make Source."
	quest.1511FADB80273BAF.title: "&aBuild an Agronomic Sourcelink"
	quest.1518C78A930F0F34.quest_desc: [
		"&6Netherite Tip:&r selenite, &e3 netherite ingots&r, &e4 netherite scrap&r in the heated cauldron with &e2 buckets of lava&r. Flies through lava and fire, &e200&r durability."
		"&6Waterproof Tip:&r conduit, &e4 dark prismarine&r, &e2 prismarine shards&r, prismarine in the water cauldron. You stay seated under water, &e800&r durability."
		"Both go into the accessory slot."
	]
	quest.1518C78A930F0F34.quest_subtitle: "Through lava or under water."
	quest.1518C78A930F0F34.title: "&6Put a tip on the broom"
	quest.151B9379079F445C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Advanced Pattern Provider:&r Pattern Provider, redstone, ender pearl and Logic Processor. With an Ex provider it becomes the large version with 36 slots."
		""
		"Put a processing pattern into the &6Advanced Pattern Encoder&r (right click in hand), choose a side for every ingredient and take out the new pattern. No more pipe tangle on Mekanism machines."
	]
	quest.151B9379079F445C.quest_subtitle: "Every ingredient to its side."
	quest.151B9379079F445C.title: "&5Build a Directional Provider"
	quest.15395000DC1488E3.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r six Blueprint Paper and two sticks. The head needs &efive&r material."
		""
		"A bit slower than the single tools, but saves two hotbar slots."
	]
	quest.15395000DC1488E3.quest_subtitle: "Pickaxe, axe and shovel in one."
	quest.15395000DC1488E3.title: "&7Build a paxel"
	quest.1545A0CB3299D6C2.quest_desc: [
		"Draconic tier. Catalyst: a &6Draconic Core&r. Into the injectors: Draconic &6pickaxe, shovel and sword&r, a &6Draconic Energy Controller&r, &66 Awakened ingots&r. Costs 256 million energy."
		""
		"Nice, but not needed. Whoever wants to save blocks for the obelisk leaves it out."
	]
	quest.1545A0CB3299D6C2.quest_subtitle: "Three tools in one."
	quest.1545A0CB3299D6C2.title: "&dFuse the Staff of Power"
	quest.154825C6F24644CF.quest_desc: [
		"Neun Rohe Erze ergeben an der Werkbank einen &6Block aus Rohem Erz&r. Die Anreicherungskammer macht daraus &e12 Staub&r, genau so viel wie aus neun einzelnen Rohen Erzen."
		""
		"Der Unterschied: Der Block ist &eein&r Arbeitsgang. Drei Rohe Erze brauchen genauso lange wie ein ganzer Block. Eine Kammer schafft mit Blöcken also neunmal so viel Erz pro Minute, und der Transporter trägt ein Stück statt neun."
		""
		"Die Klärkammer in Stufe 3 macht aus einem Block 18 Klumpen, auch dort in einem Gang."
	]
	quest.154825C6F24644CF.quest_subtitle: "Neunmal so viel pro Arbeitsgang."
	quest.154825C6F24644CF.title: "&6Pack Rohes Erz in Blöcke"
	quest.1549162C4F3362AB.quest_desc: [
		"When you die, your &6body&r stays where it is with everything you had on you. Walk back, &eright click&r the body, take your things. It never disappears as long as something is in it, and turns into a skeleton after an hour, contents and all."
		""
		"If you can't remember where it was: &eU&r opens the &edeath history&r with dimension, position and time of every death. Write down the coordinates or set a waypoint."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Anyone can open your body. In the mining dimension and in deep caves, better get back quickly. A &6bed&r sets your spawn point so you don't wake up at world spawn."
	]
	quest.1549162C4F3362AB.quest_subtitle: "Your body waits where you fell."
	quest.1549162C4F3362AB.title: "&cGet your things back"
	quest.156929E2C5EB9FA6.quest_desc: [
		"&ekronwerke.com&r has the stages, the mod list, an installation guide, the most common questions and a &elive status page&r with the goals."
		""
		"The status page shows the obelisk even when you are not online."
	]
	quest.156929E2C5EB9FA6.quest_subtitle: "kronwerke.com"
	quest.156929E2C5EB9FA6.title: "&6Check the website"
	quest.1578E32783E066D2.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Eisenbarren&r oben links, ein &6Goldbarren&r unten rechts, ein &6Tonklumpen&r in der Mitte und vier &6Glasscheiben&r auf den freien Feldern dazwischen. Ergibt &e16 Prediction Matrix&r."
		""
		"Jede Simulation verbraucht genau &eeine Matrix&r. Ein Tonklumpen reicht also für 16 Simulationen, ein Stapel Ton für tausend. Teuer sind eher die Glasscheiben: vier pro Rezept."
		""
		"Der Ausgang für die Grundvorhersage und der für die Mob-Vorhersage müssen frei sein, sonst startet die Kammer nicht. Ein Trichter oder Rohr an der Kammer löst das."
	]
	quest.1578E32783E066D2.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 3. Das Papier, auf das die Kammer schreibt."
	quest.1578E32783E066D2.title: "&bDie Vorhersagematrix"
	quest.157ABCC6AB733128.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &9Advanced&r-Modell gibt &e10 Datenpunkte pro Kill&r und wird bei &e354 Datenpunkten&r zu &dSuperior&r. Das sind &e30 Kills&r, insgesamt 48."
		""
		"Superior startet mit &e65 Prozent&r Genauigkeit. Ab hier lohnt sich ein Modell schon richtig in der Kammer: zwei von drei Simulationen bringen eine Vorhersage."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Ein Schwert mit Plünderung ändert nichts an den Daten, aber es gibt dir nebenbei mehr Drops. Spawner in Verliesen und Minenschächten sind die schnellste Quelle für Zombies und Skelette."
	]
	quest.157ABCC6AB733128.quest_subtitle: "Dreißig Kills, jetzt wird es ernst."
	quest.157ABCC6AB733128.title: "&dBring ein Modell auf Superior"
	quest.157F48D0F5296D8F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Solar Recharging Unit:&r Reinforced Alloy, an &6Advanced Solar Generator&r, Module Base and polonium. In sunlight it charges the MekaSuit, several charge faster."
		""
		"&6Geothermal Generator Unit:&r the same with a &6Heat Generator&r. It charges from heat, per the config lava counts five times as much as fire, and with the full number of units the leggings absorb up to &e80 percent&r of heat damage."
		""
		"With both you get through a long day in the Nether without a charging pad."
	]
	quest.157F48D0F5296D8F.quest_subtitle: "Sun on the helmet, heat on the legs."
	quest.157F48D0F5296D8F.title: "&eCharge the Suit on the Go"
	quest.1589BDCFE3F743A6.quest_desc: [
		"A train only runs in the direction its &6Train Controls&r point. For a line without a turning loop it needs a second set at the other end, with the front facing out."
		""
		"Then it shuttles back and forth between two terminal stations. That saves space and many tracks, a turning loop needs a large circle."
	]
	quest.1589BDCFE3F743A6.quest_subtitle: "Train Controls at each end."
	quest.1589BDCFE3F743A6.title: "&6Run in both directions"
	quest.158DEDBA440C2530.quest_desc: [
		"3 wool stacked on top of each other: a &6Sleeping Bag&r from Comforts. With it you skip the night on the road while your spawn point stays at your bed."
		""
		"The &6Hammock&r (wool, string, sticks) does the same for the day. Any color works."
	]
	quest.158DEDBA440C2530.quest_subtitle: "Sleep on the road without losing your spawn point."
	quest.158DEDBA440C2530.title: "&6Make a sleeping bag"
	quest.158E22BE3CD78D49.quest_desc: [
		"Glass, glass cable, an &6ME IO Port&r, iron and an Engineering Processor. It hangs in the same network as the pylons, only one setup per network."
		""
		"Cell in, redstone pulse, and the contents of the pylons swap with the space in the cell. The port draws its power all at once."
	]
	quest.158E22BE3CD78D49.quest_subtitle: "The button that swaps the world."
	quest.158E22BE3CD78D49.title: "&3Build a Spatial IO Port"
	quest.1594B2996DD40ED9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hexerei_willow_broom.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the water cauldron: &6Bottle of Blood&r, &e2 Willow Logs&r, &e2 gold blocks&r, &e2 wheat&r, a &6Mandrake Root&r."
		""
		"Set the broom down like a boat, right click puts you on it. It is the slowest, good for building. Sneaking right click opens three slots: accessory, satchel, brush."
		""
		"&eTip:&r In &ehover mode&r the broom stays in the air when you get off. Without it, it glides to the ground with you."
	]
	quest.1594B2996DD40ED9.quest_subtitle: "Fly!"
	quest.1594B2996DD40ED9.title: "&2&lFly on a willow broom"
	quest.159897AC9FA16B2A.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Druckluftrohr&r oben, ein &6Kleiner Tank&r zwischen zwei Rohren in der Mitte, drei &6Verstärkte Steinstufen&r unten ergeben den &6Gaslift&r (Gas Lift). Drei Rohre übereinander ergeben drei &6Bohrrohre&r (Drill Pipe), leg sie in sein Inventar."
		""
		"Stell den Gaslift über den Treffer des Sensors und gib Luft darauf. Er bohrt mit den Bohrrohren nach unten, Erde und Stein werden ohne Ausbeute entfernt, und sobald er Flüssigkeit trifft, pumpt er sie in seinen Tank. Je tiefer, desto mehr Druck braucht er, höchstens 4,9 Bar."
		""
		"Der Modus &ePumpen und Flüssigkeit im Filter lassen&r behält 1 000 mB im Tank, damit kein Wasser dazukommt. &eBohrrohre einziehen&r holt alles wieder hoch. Das Öl pumpst du mit Rohren von Mekanism oder Pipez oder einem Flüssigkeitstrichter in Tanks."
		""
		"&eNotnagel:&r Rohöl ist selbst ein schlechter Brennstoff, 200 000 mL Luft pro Eimer. Erst die Raffinerie macht etwas daraus."
	]
	quest.159897AC9FA16B2A.quest_subtitle: "Der erste Eimer Rohöl."
	quest.159897AC9FA16B2A.title: "&8Pump Öl mit dem Gaslift"
	quest.159E09196BDDFFAA.quest_desc: [
		"&dWhirlisprig&r: Earth glyphs cost half, food fills you more."
		"&dDrygmy&r: &e+2&r damage for Earth spells, chance of more loot."
		"&dWixie&r: your potions last longer, in combat it throws harmful potions at enemies."
		""
		"Amethyst Golem and Bookwyrm come with the Awakening ritual in stage 3."
	]
	quest.159E09196BDDFFAA.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: Whirlisprig, Drygmy, Wixie."
	quest.159E09196BDDFFAA.title: "&dBind the other familiars"
	quest.159F51EC3C4E4C86.quest_desc: [
		"&6Shovel blueprint&r plus &eone&r material, plus a rod."
		""
		"The cheapest tool for trying out a new material. Gold with speed 12 digs dirt and sand very fast."
	]
	quest.159F51EC3C4E4C86.quest_subtitle: "Only one material for the head."
	quest.159F51EC3C4E4C86.title: "&7Build a shovel"
	quest.15B154669CC87683.quest_desc: [
		"Walk into a new biome and read the name that &6Traveler's Titles&r shows."
		""
		"New biomes mean new woods, flowers and plants. Botania needs flowers in every colour, Farmer's Delight wild plants: tomatoes where it is warm, rice in shallow water, cabbage on the coast."
	]
	quest.15B154669CC87683.quest_subtitle: "Every biome has its own plants."
	quest.15B154669CC87683.title: "&aRead the biome names"
	quest.15B5D6500C58AF72.quest_desc: [
		"Stock up &e32 source gem blocks&r and build a spell with tier 3 glyphs."
		""
		"With &6stage 4&r come the Sorcerer's robes, the third armor tier, the Void Prism and the glyphs with dragon's breath. Continue in the chapter &dArs Nouveau: Epic&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r On the magic side the obelisk wants Elementium, Afrit Essence and Elven Stars. Your chambers charge the techs' certus quartz, and with Lightning and Burst you are the best company at every Afrit summoning."
	]
	quest.15B5D6500C58AF72.quest_subtitle: "Ready for the stars."
	quest.15B5D6500C58AF72.title: "&d&lBecome an Archmage"
	quest.15B8249EF0C1A236.quest_desc: [
		"Drei &6Holzstufen&r in einer Reihe ergeben zwei &6Regale&r (Item Shelf). Sie hängen an der Wand, und jedes zeigt einen Gegenstand, den du darauf legst. Das &6Schwarze Brett&r (acht Bretter um ein Papier) zeigt den Text eines Buches oder eine Karte."
		""
		"Auf der &6Tafel&r (zwei Holzstufen, zwei Schwarzstein, ein weißer Farbstoff oder Quarz, ergibt zwei) zeichnest du Pixel für Pixel. Mit einer Honigwabe wird die Zeichnung fest, dann kann niemand mehr darüber malen."
		""
		"&eFür den Stream:&r Ein Schwarzes Brett mit den Koordinaten der Basis, der Wegsteine und der Farmen spart dir die Frage im Chat."
	]
	quest.15B8249EF0C1A236.quest_subtitle: "Zeig, was du hast."
	quest.15B8249EF0C1A236.title: "&6Stell Regale und Tafeln auf"
	quest.15BA31F131B09ED0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluid Interface:&r chunks with a bucket. &6Energy Interface:&r chunks with an Energy Battery. With transformers they become importers and exporters, as with items."
		""
		"A network with all three kinds replaces pipes, cables and conveyor belts in a workshop."
	]
	quest.15BA31F131B09ED0.quest_subtitle: "The same parts, a different load."
	quest.15BA31F131B09ED0.title: "&3Move fluids and power"
	quest.15BBD662E2DBC3C3.quest_desc: [
		"Eine &6Andesitlegierung&r wird im &6Steinschneider&r zu zwei &6Andesitgerüsten&r, zwei &6Andesitleitern&r oder vier &6Andesitgittern&r. Drei &6Eisenbleche&r über drei Legierungen ergeben acht &6Metallträger&r, die sich zu Fachwerk aus Stahl verbinden."
		""
		"Fenster gibt es für jedes Holz: ein Glas zwischen drei Brettern ergibt zwei &6Holzfenster&r. &6Gerahmtes Glas&r kommt aus dem Steinschneider aus Glas, als Block oder Scheibe, dazu Glasfliesen und die senkrechte Variante."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Jede Legierung im Steinschneider ist eine weniger für den Obelisken. Das Ziel von Stufe 1 will 1 500 davon. Der Mixer macht aus einem Andesit und einem Eisenklumpen zwei Legierungen, die Werkbank nur eine. Wer dekorieren will, baut vorher die Mixer-Linie aus dem Create-Kapitel."
	]
	quest.15BBD662E2DBC3C3.quest_subtitle: "Industrie-Look aus Andesitlegierung."
	quest.15BBD662E2DBC3C3.title: "&6Schneide Gerüst und Träger"
	quest.15BE6537FF06CEDF.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlank Upgrade:&r four &6paper&r on the left, a &6lapis lazuli&r in the middle, three &6gold nuggets&r on the right, gives four. &eSpeed Upgrade:&r redstone, gold, redstone on top, nugget, Blank Upgrade, nugget in the middle, gunpowder, &6blaze rod&r, gunpowder at the bottom, gives three."
		""
		"Every Speed Upgrade takes &e2 ticks&r off the cycle of 20, down to a cycle of 2 ticks with nine pieces. The &6Stack Upgrade&r (Blank Upgrade, stone bricks, bricks) doubles the items per run, six pieces turn 1 into a full 64."
		""
		"Use Stack Upgrades wherever you can, they are easy on the server. Five upgrade slots, several identical ones fit into one slot."
		""
		"More upgrades: &6Energy&r (50,000 FE buffer and 1,000 FE per cycle each), &6Security&r (only you open it, the router works in claims as you), &6Camouflage&r, &6Muffler&r against sounds and particles, &6Sync&r for router groups."
	]
	quest.15BE6537FF06CEDF.quest_subtitle: "Blank Upgrades, speed and stacks."
	quest.15BE6537FF06CEDF.title: "&6Speed Up the Router"
	quest.15BEC326A8052C3E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_runes_baubles_rings.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Band of Aura&r (Rune of Mana, 4 Manasteel): slowly generates mana for tablets in the inventory."
		"&6Ring of Magnetization&r (Magnetizing Lens, 4 Manasteel): pulls items in, not while sneaking."
		"&6Ring of Dexterous Motion&r (emerald, Rune of Air, 4 Manasteel): double tapping dodges."
		"&6Ring of the Mantle&r (Rune of Earth, golden pickaxe, 4 Manasteel): haste, hard stone breaks like normal stone."
		"&6Ring of Correction&r (clay, 4 Manasteel): always takes the right tool."
		"&6Ring of Chordata&r (Rune of Water, pufferfish, cod, Heart of the Sea, 4 Manasteel): breathe under water and swim fast."
	]
	quest.15BEC326A8052C3E.quest_subtitle: "Six rings, one line per ring."
	quest.15BEC326A8052C3E.title: "&6Forge Manasteel rings"
	quest.15C097739210059A.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Spikes&r over a &6heavy pressure plate&r give the &6Spiked Plate&r. Every monster that walks over it takes &e4 damage&r per hit, players do not. The drops count as a player kill, so with everything that otherwise only drops by hand."
		""
		"As long as it bites, the plate gives a redstone signal. A row of them at the end of a mob trap replaces the player with the sword."
	]
	quest.15C097739210059A.quest_subtitle: "A pressure plate that bites."
	quest.15C097739210059A.title: "&4Build a Spiked Plate"
	quest.15C8A97E51E1DD37.quest_desc: [
		"A Purification Chamber with the basic, then the Advanced Tier Installer, or at the crafting table: the Basic Purifying Factory in the middle, osmium, circuits, alloy."
		""
		"The crusher and Enrichment Chamber behind it need the same speed, otherwise things back up. The line for it: chapter &5Mekanism: Ore Step by Step&r."
	]
	quest.15C8A97E51E1DD37.quest_subtitle: "Five ores at once into the Purification Chamber."
	quest.15C8A97E51E1DD37.title: "&dBuild an Advanced Purifying Factory"
	quest.15CAA2B40617AB32.quest_desc: [
		"&6Diamantbohrkopf:&r ein &6Diamantblock&r und &b8 000 mB Schmiermittel&r in der Thermopneumatic Processing Plant bei &e7,5 bar&r und mindestens 500 Grad. Er bricht &e3x3&r Blöcke auf einmal."
		""
		"&6Netheritbohrkopf:&r Diamantbohrkopf und ein &6Netheritbarren&r formlos ergeben den unfertigen Kopf, das Programm &eDrill&r der Montagestraße macht ihn fertig. Er ist der schnellste und kann die meisten Abbaumodi."
		""
		"Den Presslufthammer selbst baust du wie im Kapitel &bPneumaticCraft&r beschrieben."
	]
	quest.15CAA2B40617AB32.quest_subtitle: "Diamant und Netherit für den Bohrkopf."
	quest.15CAA2B40617AB32.title: "&6Härte den Presslufthammer"
	quest.15CE1B1CCE2C7E16.quest_desc: [
		"An &6iron ingot&r, a &6Powdered Coal&r and an &6obsidian&r give two &6Dark Steel Ingots&r. Without the powder, two regular coal work too."
		""
		"Hard and blast proof: ladders, doors, the Enchanter and the sword &6The Ender&r, which sometimes takes a mob's head. &6End Steel&r needs end stone and comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.15CE1B1CCE2C7E16.quest_subtitle: "Iron, powdered coal, obsidian."
	quest.15CE1B1CCE2C7E16.title: "&8Alloy Dark Steel"
	quest.15CFA200525E0A1B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crystal Binder:&r a &6Draconium Core&r at the bottom left, a &6blaze rod&r in the middle, Draconium Ingots next to and above it, a &6diamond&r at the top right. A relay crystal shapeless gives two &6I/O crystals&r."
		""
		"Put one I/O crystal on the pylon, one on the machine. Sneak right click the first with the binder, then right click the second: the power flows through the air. Relay crystals pass it on, a &6Wireless Energy Crystal&r supplies blocks without any crystal on them."
	]
	quest.15CFA200525E0A1B.quest_subtitle: "Crystal Binder and energy crystals."
	quest.15CFA200525E0A1B.title: "&bDistribute Power without Cables"
	quest.15D0EA25D2FC2B24.quest_desc: [
		"Plastic, &6Pink Slime&r ball, plastic at the top, three &6iron bars&r in the middle, &6Gold Gears&r around the &6Advanced Frame&r at the bottom."
		""
		"&eIn:&r Fermented Ore Meat and &6sand&r. &eOut:&r dust of the ore everything started with. &d40 FE/t&r. You smelt the dust into ingots in a furnace."
		""
		"Pink Slime ball: a glass pane and 300 mB of Pink Slime in the Dissolution Chamber."
	]
	quest.15D0EA25D2FC2B24.quest_subtitle: "Fermented Ore Meat and sand become dust."
	quest.15D0EA25D2FC2B24.title: "&4&lSieve Ore Dust from the Meat"
	quest.15DF5F6346BEB7E0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hexerei_cauldron.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e5 Infused Iron&r from Nature's Aura as a U, a &6cauldron&r in the middle, &e2 torches&r at the top left and right. That is the &6Mixing Cauldron&r."
		""
		"It holds up to &b2 buckets&r of fluid: water, lava, tallow, blood or potion. Solid ingredients you throw in from above, push in with a hopper or put into the menu. If everything is right, it mixes by itself."
		""
		"&eHeat:&r Many recipes want fire, a campfire, magma or lava right below. Build two cauldrons, one with water and a heated one with lava."
	]
	quest.15DF5F6346BEB7E0.quest_subtitle: "Where every witch recipe ends."
	quest.15DF5F6346BEB7E0.title: "&2&lBuild the Mixing Cauldron"
	quest.15E03EFBFAC50228.quest_desc: [
		"Kill a &cMimic&r. It looks like a chest until you try to open it, and then it strikes hard."
		""
		"Whoever defeats it gets an artifact. Hit a campsite chest once as a test before you open it."
	]
	quest.15E03EFBFAC50228.quest_subtitle: "Some chests bite back."
	quest.15E03EFBFAC50228.title: "&cDefeat a Mimic"
	quest.15E3804A31A1BA56.quest_desc: [
		"Summon the &5Ender Dragon&r again: four &6End Crystals&r on the rims of the exit portal. When it dies, a &cDragon Heart&r floats above the portal. It does not disappear."
		""
		"Every dragon also brings about 64 draconium dust and, on this server, a new &5dragon egg&r every time."
		""
		"&eThe math:&r 64 blocks in the goal are 16 fusions, so &e16 dragon fights&r. Agree on who summons the dragon when."
	]
	quest.15E3804A31A1BA56.quest_subtitle: "Every dragon leaves one behind."
	quest.15E3804A31A1BA56.title: "&cGet a Dragon Heart"
	quest.15E663D04F193E70.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/exploration_e_yung_dungeon.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Find a dungeon from &6YUNG's Better Dungeons&r and tick this off: skeleton dungeons, zombie dungeons, spider caves or small dungeons."
		""
		"Each has spawners. Leave them standing if you plan a farm, or take them with Apotheosis (&6Apotheosis&r and &6First Farms&r chapters)."
	]
	quest.15E663D04F193E70.quest_subtitle: "YUNG's Better Dungeons: skeletons, zombies, spiders."
	quest.15E663D04F193E70.title: "&8Clear out a dungeon"
	quest.15F4B91A255154E7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Bearing&r, &6Piston&r, &6Rope Pulley&r and &6Turntable&r: &d4 SU per RPM&r each. The &6Chain Conveyor&r 1, the &6Weighted Ejector&r 2."
	]
	quest.15F4B91A255154E7.quest_subtitle: "Contraptions cost as much as a millstone."
	quest.15F4B91A255154E7.title: "&7Bearings and pistons: 4 SU per RPM"
	quest.161098343E743312.quest_desc: [
		"The ores lie in the Overworld between height -60 and 60. &6Uranium&r for fuel, &6boron&r for ferroboron, &6lithium&r for the tough alloy. &6Thorium&r is a second, gentler fuel."
		""
		"Raw uranium and lithium dust from Mekanism work too. Grind raw ore in the Manufactory, one ore gives two dust. You need lead in large amounts."
	]
	quest.161098343E743312.quest_subtitle: "The ores for the reactor."
	quest.161098343E743312.title: "&7Mine Uranium, Boron and Lithium"
	quest.16153C5F8F8E85AA.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6Sturdy Sheet&r on top, &6Fluid Tank&r in the middle, &6Sturdy Sheet&r at the bottom give a &6Fuel Tank&r. &6Train Casing&r and &6chute&r give the &6Portable Fuel Interface&r, which fills the tank at the station, just like the Portable Fluid Interface fills a tank car."
		""
		"A train that burns fuel runs at &e40 instead of 28 blocks per second&r and 20 instead of 14 in curves. Without a Fuel Tank that also works with a chest full of coal on the train, the tank instead takes &bDiesel&r and &bBiodiesel&r from the diesel engines further down in this chapter."
		""
		"On Kronwerke trains need no fuel to run at all. The tank is a turbo, not a must. It does not accept water."
	]
	quest.16153C5F8F8E85AA.quest_subtitle: "With fuel trains run 40 instead of 28 blocks per second."
	quest.16153C5F8F8E85AA.title: "&6Fuel the Train with Diesel"
	quest.16192D32943C61EB.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Equip the book, choose the spell with \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.irons_spellbooks.spell_bar_modifier\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" + mouse wheel\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" or in the spell wheel (hold \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.irons_spellbooks.spell_wheel\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\"), press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.irons_spellbooks.spellbook_cast\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\". Done.\"}]"
		""
		"Every scroll's tooltip names the kind of spell. &eInstant&r works immediately. &eLong Cast&r and &eCharge&r need a charge time during which you hold the cast key. Spells with &eHold&r in the description (Fire Breath, Cone of Cold, Electrocute) run as long as you hold the cast key and cost mana per second."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Four common spells cover everything: an attack (Magic Missile, Firebolt, Icicle), an escape (Burning Dash, Volt Strike), a protection (Shield, Oakskin) and a heal (Healing Circle, Blessing of Life)."
	]
	quest.16192D32943C61EB.quest_subtitle: "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Book on, choose a spell, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.irons_spellbooks.spellbook_cast\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
	quest.16192D32943C61EB.title: "&dCast Your First Spell"
	quest.162379C67E14B4C2.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: a &6Utheric Shard&r on a &6stick&r makes a &6Shard Torch&r."
		""
		"It glows like a torch and harms rotspawn nearby. A ring of them around the portal, bed and shaft, and things get calmer."
	]
	quest.162379C67E14B4C2.quest_subtitle: "Light that bites back."
	quest.162379C67E14B4C2.title: "&bBuild Shard Torches"
	quest.162A01626BD35D4C.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &6obsidian&r between two &6crushing wheels&r. Every block gives one &6Powdered Obsidian&r, and with 75 percent the obsidian comes back and goes through once more."
		"{image:create:textures/item/powdered_obsidian.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Obsidian forms where water flows onto a lava source. Mine it with a diamond pickaxe."
	]
	quest.162A01626BD35D4C.quest_subtitle: "The start of every Railway Casing."
	quest.162A01626BD35D4C.title: "&6Grind obsidian to powder"
	quest.16303DC9162B0830.quest_desc: [
		"While digging, collect &6lead&r, &6uranium&r, &6fluorite&r and &6salt blocks&r (in clay under water) in a chest of their own. For the tick: eight lead ingots."
		""
		"&6Lead&r is needed for reactor glass, QIO and radiation protection, &6fluorite&r for the crystallizer, &6salt&r becomes brine and chlorine. &6Uranium&r only in stage 5."
	]
	quest.16303DC9162B0830.quest_subtitle: "Unimportant today, sought after tomorrow."
	quest.16303DC9162B0830.title: "&7Set up a chest for lead and salt"
	quest.1635091111ED4E18.quest_desc: [
		"First the head: &e5 clay balls&r in a T shape, three on top, two below offset, give a &6Blacksmith Gavel Head&r. Then the hammer like a pickaxe: &6iron ingot&r, head, iron ingot on top, iron, stick, iron in the middle, stick at the bottom: an &6Iron Blacksmith Gavel&r."
		""
		"Right clicking the forge with the gavel starts the ritual when ingredients and essences match. That costs &e50 durability&r, so the iron hammer manages 5 rituals, the diamond hammer 31."
		""
		"&eOn the side:&r The gavel is a real pickaxe, and when mining ore it doubles the drops with a &e30 percent&r chance (not with Silk Touch)."
	]
	quest.1635091111ED4E18.quest_subtitle: "The hammer that starts a ritual."
	quest.1635091111ED4E18.title: "&7Build a Blacksmith Gavel"
	quest.163DCE4E887875BF.quest_desc: [
		"Werkbank: &6Gebratenes Kaninchen&r, &6Ofenkartoffel&r, &6Karotte&r, ein &6Pilz&r und eine &6Schüssel&r. Farmer's Delight wertet das Vanilla-Gericht auf, und es stapelt sich bis 16."
		""
		"{image:minecraft:textures/item/rabbit_stew.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.163DCE4E887875BF.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.163DCE4E887875BF.title: "&6Koch Kaninchenragout"
	quest.1651DE21FE7B797B.quest_desc: [
		"A &6composter&r eats seeds, leaves, saplings and plant leftovers. When it is full, it gives one &6bone meal&r. A hopper on top refills it, a hopper below takes the bone meal out."
		""
		"Route the surplus seeds from your pots and the harvester into it. You need bone meal for saplings, flowers and the &aRitual of the Forest&r from Nature's Aura."
	]
	quest.1651DE21FE7B797B.quest_subtitle: "Seeds and leftovers become bone meal."
	quest.1651DE21FE7B797B.title: "&aCompost what is left"
	quest.165246D8B7236EBA.quest_desc: [
		"Coal in the Manufactory gives coal dust, coal dust gives &6graphite dust&r. In a furnace it becomes a &6graphite ingot&r, nine ingots a &6graphite block&r."
		""
		"Graphite goes into plates, Hard Carbon and the reactor's moderators. Build up a large stock."
	]
	quest.165246D8B7236EBA.quest_subtitle: "Twice through the Manufactory."
	quest.165246D8B7236EBA.title: "&8Grind Coal into Graphite"
	quest.1654F7187C4B104F.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 diamonds&r top left and in the middle, &e3 sticks&r diagonally from top right to bottom left: the &6Diamond Scythe&r. With 2 Inferium Ingots and 2 gemstones it becomes the &6Inferium Scythe&r."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/gear/inferium_scythe.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Right clicking&r the field harvests all ripe crops around you, &e7 by 7&r tiles, without uprooting them. The seed stays, only the yield drops. That is the tool for every essence farm, and on the side a weapon with area hits."
		""
		"The &6Sickle&r (3 diamonds in an arc, a stick bottom left) is the counterpart: it mows away grass, leaves and plants around you. The Prudentium Scythe harvests 9 by 9, from stage 2."
	]
	quest.1654F7187C4B104F.quest_subtitle: "Seven by seven tiles with one click."
	quest.1654F7187C4B104F.title: "&aBuild a Scythe"
	quest.16562A44D4FBE105.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Stahlgehäuse in die Mitte, Ultimative Schaltkreise links und rechts, &6Fluorit&r oben und unten, Raffiniertes Obsidian in die Ecken. Fluorit liegt tief, ein Fluoriterz gibt in der Anreicherungskammer 6 Stück."
		""
		"Aus &e200 mB Sauberem Schlamm&r wird ein &6Kristall&r. Ein Erzblock (1 000 mB) gibt also &e5 Kristalle&r, drei Rohe Erze 10. Etwa &d160 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Der Kristall ist wieder ein Gegenstand. Ab hier geht es mit Transportern weiter."
	]
	quest.16562A44D4FBE105.quest_subtitle: "Fünf Kristalle aus einem Erz."
	quest.16562A44D4FBE105.title: "&bBau einen Chemischen Kristallisator"
	quest.165955F81144DBD7.quest_desc: [
		"Catalyst: a &6Wyvern Core&r. In eight injectors: &64 Wyvern Energy Controllers&r and &64 Draconium Ingots&r. Costs 8 million energy."
		""
		"It charges tools and armor in your inventory. Charge it yourself at a pylon or a charging station."
	]
	quest.165955F81144DBD7.quest_subtitle: "A battery for tools and armor."
	quest.165955F81144DBD7.title: "&dFuse a Wyvern Capacitor"
	quest.165D0CA7D15D818F.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Basic Capacitors&r left and right, a &6Powdered Coal&r in the middle, an &6Energetic Alloy Ingot&r at the top and bottom."
		""
		"In the slot it makes the machine faster and gives it more storage. It also goes into the Advanced Capacitor Bank."
	]
	quest.165D0CA7D15D818F.quest_subtitle: "The second tier for every machine."
	quest.165D0CA7D15D818F.title: "&eBuild a Double-Layer Capacitor"
	quest.165FAFAE6B59FA85.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &bWater Essence&r and &6water bucket&r."
		""
		"Places water at the target or puts out burning creatures, you included. In the Nether, the rescue after falling into lava."
	]
	quest.165FAFAE6B59FA85.quest_subtitle: "A spring in your pocket."
	quest.165FAFAE6B59FA85.title: "&dLearn Conjure Water"
	quest.166111557EAA4D5A.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Blank Thread&r, &6Totem of Undying&r, &6phantom membrane&r, &e2 Abjuration Essences&r."
		""
		"Once per sleep it saves you from death like a totem. Needs a thread slot of &esize 3&r, so a tier 3 robe."
	]
	quest.166111557EAA4D5A.quest_subtitle: "A totem that recharges every night."
	quest.166111557EAA4D5A.title: "&6Sew the Thread of Undying"
	quest.16644EDBD8298526.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6villagers&r with beds in a small room, next to them a &6zombie&r they can see but not reach. The villagers get scared and call an &6iron golem&r for help."
		""
		"The golem appears nearby. Guide it with water to a spot where lava hits it. A golem drops &e3 to 5 iron ingots&r, a hopper below collects them."
		""
		"Iron in bulk means nuggets for the alloy, buckets and tools. &cCareful:&r Protect the zombie from the sun, or it burns on the first morning."
	]
	quest.16644EDBD8298526.quest_subtitle: "Iron from villagers who are scared."
	quest.16644EDBD8298526.title: "&cBuild an iron golem farm"
	quest.166708881713633F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brute:&r Brute Tusk, which becomes bone meal."
		"&6Forgotten:&r carries Cloggrum weapons, with luck a battleaxe."
		"&6Sploogie:&r Depthrock Pebble. &6Nargoyle&r and &6Gwib:&r no loot."
		"&6Denizen:&r Mysterious Mask, only in the Depths."
		"&6Stoneborn:&r Depthrock Pebble, better to trade with it."
		"&6Forgotten Guardian:&r Forgotten Nuggets, see catacombs."
	]
	quest.166708881713633F.quest_subtitle: "What else walks in the dark."
	quest.166708881713633F.title: "&8Checklist: Other Creatures"
	quest.1685BEEF797367AB.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Treated Wood Planks&r on top of each other make four &6Treated Sticks&r."
		""
		"They and Treated Wood become Windmill Blades, Waterwheel Segments, Treated Wood Fences and the posts for your wires."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_stick_treated.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1685BEEF797367AB.quest_subtitle: "For blades, segments and fences."
	quest.1685BEEF797367AB.title: "&6Carve Treated Sticks"
	quest.168C26275A5D318C.quest_desc: [
		"&63 blaze rods&r, &62 netherite scrap&r and &62 chains&r make a &6lava fishing rod&r. With it you fish in the Nether's lava lakes."
		""
		"Whatever bites comes out as a live fish: &6Searing Cod&r, &6Bonefish&r, &6Glowdine&r, lava pufferfish and more. Some kinds only live in certain biomes, like the &6Soul Sucker&r in the soul sand valley."
		""
		"Shears on a &6Fortress Grouper&r give scraps, on an &6Eyeball Fish&r an eye. Eye and blaze powder make an eye of ender, without any ender pearl."
	]
	quest.168C26275A5D318C.quest_subtitle: "Nether Depths Upgrade: fish that live in fire."
	quest.168C26275A5D318C.title: "&6Fish in the lava"
	quest.16901522C6F1E271.quest_desc: [
		"Spitzhacke-Blaupause plus drei &6Eisenbarren&r ergibt den Kopf, dazu ein Stiel. Eine &6Diamantspitze&r (Spitze-Blaupause plus ein Diamant) gibt +256 Haltbarkeit und die Diamant-Abbaustufe."
		""
		"Eisenkopf: 250 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 6, Biegsam III. Kaputte Teile tauschst du einzeln, siehe Kapitel &6Silent Gear&r."
	]
	quest.16901522C6F1E271.quest_subtitle: "Silent Gear: Kopf, Stiel, Spitze."
	quest.16901522C6F1E271.title: "&7Bau eine Spitzhacke aus Teilen"
	quest.16919085E2D5EED9.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Einfache Stufen Installateur&r (Redstone in die Ecken, Schaltkreise oben und unten, Eisen links und rechts, ein Brett in die Mitte) macht per Rechtsklick aus jeder Maschine eine &6Einfache Fabrik&r. Oder an der Werkbank: dasselbe Muster mit der Maschine statt dem Brett."
		""
		"Eine Einfache Fabrik hat &e3 Plätze&r und arbeitet an drei Gegenständen gleichzeitig. Fabriken gibt es für Anreicherungskammer, Schmelzer, Zerkleinerer, Klärkammer, Injektionskammer, Infusionsanlage, Kompressor, Kombinierer und Sägewerk. Auflösungskammer, Waschanlage und Kristallisator bleiben Einzelmaschinen."
		""
		"Der Knopf mit den Pfeilen im Fenster verteilt Stapel auf alle Plätze. Jede Fabrik der Straße braucht das gleiche Tempo, sonst staut es sich vor der langsamsten."
	]
	quest.16919085E2D5EED9.quest_subtitle: "Three slots instead of one."
	quest.16919085E2D5EED9.title: "&aMach eine Einfache Fabrik"
	quest.16ADC81D8EEB6C5D.quest_desc: [
		"Four steel around a copper ingot give four &6Thermal Evaporation Blocks&r. For a small tower you need about three dozen."
		""
		"Four blocks around an Advanced Control Circuit give a &6valve&r."
	]
	quest.16ADC81D8EEB6C5D.quest_subtitle: "Copper in steel."
	quest.16ADC81D8EEB6C5D.title: "&6Build Thermal Evaporation Blocks"
	quest.16B19AD46F39E477.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"6 cobblestone\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"1 petal\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Petal Apothecary\",\"color\":\"green\"},{\"text\":\". Fill it with \"},{\"text\":\"water\",\"color\":\"aqua\"},{\"text\":\", throw in the petals of the recipe (key \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.drop\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\") and finally a \"},{\"text\":\"seed\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\". The flower pops out.\"}]"
		""
		"Right click with an empty hand takes back the last thing thrown in. Lexica and EMI show which flower needs which petals."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Up to 20 seconds after a finished flower, a right click with an empty hand (refill the water first) takes the same ingredients from your inventory."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Filled with lava it destroys everything that falls in."
	]
	quest.16B19AD46F39E477.quest_subtitle: "All the special flowers are made here."
	quest.16B19AD46F39E477.title: "&aBuild a Petal Apothecary"
	quest.16BEAA0377506D18.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_vortex.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Zwei &6Druckluftrohre&r übereinander in der Mitte, zwei &6Kupferbarren&r links und rechts in der mittleren Reihe, der Rest &6Druckeisen&r (sechs Stück) ergeben das &6Wirbelrohr&r (Vortex Tube)."
		""
		"Es teilt die Luft, die hineinströmt, in eine &cheiße&r und eine &bkalte&r Seite. Beim Setzen zeigt die heiße Seite zu dir, ein roter und ein blauer Ring markieren die Enden. Mehr Druck gibt mehr Temperaturunterschied, verbraucht aber auch mehr Luft."
		""
		"Die heiße Seite kommt an die Raffinerie oder die Anlage. Auf die kalte Seite gehört ein &6Kühlkörper&r, denn beide Seiten hängen schwach zusammen: Wird die kalte Seite nicht entlüftet, bremst sie die heiße."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Ein Komparator an der Raffinerie gibt 15, solange sie Arbeit hat. Damit schaltest du die Luft zum Wirbelrohr ab, wenn nichts zu tun ist."
	]
	quest.16BEAA0377506D18.quest_subtitle: "Druckluft wird zu heiß und kalt."
	quest.16BEAA0377506D18.title: "&c&lBau ein Wirbelrohr"
	quest.16C0A3D421647E75.quest_desc: [
		"Each needs two Advanced Control Circuits, two Reinforced Alloys, one draconium dust. Make &e16&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stage 4 goal wants &e150 Elite Control Circuits&r (20 points each) and 1,000 draconium ingots."
	]
	quest.16C0A3D421647E75.quest_subtitle: "The obelisk counts every single one."
	quest.16C0A3D421647E75.title: "&aStock Up 16 Elite Control Circuits"
	quest.16C1D483756D31F5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Control Rod Assembly:&r lead, steel and an &6Elite Control Circuit&r. Exactly one goes on top of each column."
		""
		"Without a control rod the column does not count. How well it cools, the reactor shows later as boil efficiency."
	]
	quest.16C1D483756D31F5.quest_subtitle: "One per column."
	quest.16C1D483756D31F5.title: "&7Put Control Rods on Top"
	quest.16CB29001843ACA5.quest_desc: [
		"On the left of the book the chapters are in groups: &6Tech&r, &dMagic&r, &aWorld and Exploration&r, &6Storage and Tools&r and &6Checklists&r. To the right of here every chapter of stage 1 is a checkmark."
		""
		"The pillars need &etech and magic&r. If you can't decide, ask around what is missing right now. Chapters of later stages appear once their stage is open."
	]
	quest.16CB29001843ACA5.quest_subtitle: "Every chapter of stage 1, by group."
	quest.16CB29001843ACA5.title: "&6Pick a path"
	quest.16D75FCFEEA0FCB8.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6iron ingots&r in the corners, &6glass&r on top and bottom, two &6Blank Modules&r left and right, a &6diamond&r in the middle. A &6Bulk Item Filter&r."
		""
		"It fits into a filter slot and knows up to &e54 items&r. Sneak and right click a chest to copy its contents into the filter. If it sits in a Sender Mk2 with a target, &e+&r (add target contents) and &e=&r (take over target contents) appear in the window."
		""
		"More filters come from the bulk filter: &6Mod Filter&r (repeater and redstone torch, everything from one mod), &6Tag Filter&r (paper and black dye), &6Regex Filter&r (comparator, patterns like _ore), &6Inspection Filter&r (spider eyes and paper, filters by durability, fill level or enchantment)."
	]
	quest.16D75FCFEEA0FCB8.quest_subtitle: "The Bulk Item Filter remembers a whole chest."
	quest.16D75FCFEEA0FCB8.title: "&bFilter Smartly"
	quest.16DBDEAA4E7DA896.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sourceberry Pie&r: shapeless &6egg&r, &6sugar&r, &6Magebloom&r and &e3 Sourceberries&r. &6Sourceberry Roll&r: shapeless &e3 wheat&r and &e1 Sourceberry&r."
		""
		"Like the berries themselves, both give mana regeneration when eaten. A pie before a long mining spell, and the bar fills faster."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Sourceberry food is the best food for the Mycelial Sourcelink."
	]
	quest.16DBDEAA4E7DA896.quest_subtitle: "Food with mana regeneration."
	quest.16DBDEAA4E7DA896.title: "&6Bake Sourceberry Pie"
	quest.16DC70DFAA10B102.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sal Ammoniac Ore&r lies in the Overworld between Y -64 and Y 200, also as a deepslate variant. Mining it gives &6Sal Ammoniac Crystal&r."
		""
		"In the accumulator one crystal turns a bucket of water into a whole bucket of solvent instead of only 100 mB."
	]
	quest.16DC70DFAA10B102.quest_subtitle: "Crystals for the solvent."
	quest.16DC70DFAA10B102.title: "&7Mine Sal Ammoniac Ore"
	quest.16E4A34E23E054B5.quest_desc: [
		"Into the pot: &6carrot&r, &6potato&r, &6beetroot&r and &6cabbage&r or a cabbage leaf. Plus a bowl."
		""
		"A pot cooks several servings one after another if you put in enough ingredients."
	]
	quest.16E4A34E23E054B5.quest_subtitle: "Your first real meal."
	quest.16E4A34E23E054B5.title: "&6Cook a vegetable soup"
	quest.16E57009060AEC86.quest_desc: [
		"A &6saw&r cuts stone into slabs, they run onto the belt, two deployers with nuggets, a press, output into a chest."
		""
		"Unlike with the precision mechanism nothing goes wrong here: every slab becomes a track."
	]
	quest.16E57009060AEC86.quest_subtitle: "A line needs hundreds."
	quest.16E57009060AEC86.title: "&6Build a track factory"
	quest.16EEA302D699A46A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_master_charged_certus.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &bCertus Quartz Crystal&r into the chamber, &eredstone&r and &eglowstone dust&r on the pedestals, &d2,000 source&r. One charged crystal."
		""
		"{image:ae2:textures/item/certus_quartz_crystal_charged.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Without charged certus no fluix and no ME network. Powah's Energizing Orb later makes two per run, but the chamber makes the start. Several chambers on the relay network and a hopper make you the most important supplier."
	]
	quest.16EEA302D699A46A.quest_subtitle: "Kronwerke: the ME network needs a mage."
	quest.16EEA302D699A46A.title: "&bCharge certus quartz"
	quest.16F22FA10118CF3F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_sower.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Plastic, &6flower pot&r, plastic at the top, &6pistons&r left and right of the Pity Frame, &6Iron Gears&r and redstone at the bottom."
		""
		"Its nine slots are colored, each color belongs to one ninth of the field, as the marking on top of the machine shows. &d1,000 FE&r per operation."
	]
	quest.16F22FA10118CF3F.quest_subtitle: "Plants seeds and saplings."
	quest.16F22FA10118CF3F.title: "&2Set Up a Plant Sower"
	quest.16F522DCB6C730BC.quest_desc: [
		"Spawn egg of the &6Iron Bee&r or the &6Coal Bee&r into the Casting Table, &e810 mB of molten steel&r over it. Flower: &6steel block&r. Every comb surely gives 7 to 12 &6steel nuggets&r, so about one ingot. &eKronwerke:&r Steel is the bulk goal of stage 3."
	]
	quest.16F522DCB6C730BC.quest_subtitle: "Seven to twelve steel nuggets per comb."
	quest.16F522DCB6C730BC.title: "&8Cast the Steel Bee"
	quest.16F94E5CB7B33208.quest_desc: [
		"Werkbank, formlos: zwei &6Leuchtbeeren&r, eine &6Honigflasche&r, eine &6Tomate&r, eine &6Goldene Karotte&r, eine &6Rote Bete&r, zwei &6Weißkohl&r und eine &6Schüssel&r. Ein Festmahl-Block wie die anderen."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/gleaming_salad.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.16F94E5CB7B33208.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.16F94E5CB7B33208.title: "&6Tisch den Gleaming Salad auf"
	quest.16FDEAE8FE6F38F3.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Soulstone Ore&r and smelt the raw piece."
		""
		"Build up a stock. Soulstained Steel wants four Refined Soulstone per ingot, the Impetus and the better scythe four each as well."
	]
	quest.16FDEAE8FE6F38F3.quest_subtitle: "Stone that is half stuck in another world."
	quest.16FDEAE8FE6F38F3.title: "&7Mine Soulstone"
	quest.170155E0A2D53967.quest_desc: [
		"&6Raw Iesnium&r from the Nether into the Liquefaction Cauldron: &e5 Iesnium Sulfur&r for &e50 mB&r of Sal Ammoniac. An Iesnium ore block gives just as much."
		""
		"In the Incubator each Sulfur becomes one &6Iesnium ingot&r with a Mineral Salt and a Mercury Shard. Five ingots instead of one from the furnace."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Every summoning of an Unbound Afrit costs one Iesnium ingot, see &5Occultism: Afrit and Marid&r. With Theurgy one find is enough for five summonings."
	]
	quest.170155E0A2D53967.quest_subtitle: "Five ingots from one raw piece."
	quest.170155E0A2D53967.title: "&5Multiply Iesnium"
	quest.1702A3135D8B054C.quest_desc: [
		"Six &6Tough Fabric&r make a &6Windmill Sail&r. Right click with the sail on the Windmill puts it on a blade."
		""
		"With all eight sails a free Windmill delivers around &d50 FE/t&r, in a thunderstorm about twice that."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_windmill_sail.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1702A3135D8B054C.quest_subtitle: "More surface, more power."
	quest.1702A3135D8B054C.title: "&bPut sails on the Windmill"
	quest.170B41317E141485.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Iron Hook&r is made from iron nuggets. With gold, feathers, redstone or more iron around it, it becomes the Gold, Light, Redstone or Heavy Hook."
		""
		"Each hook changes something about fishing; the tooltip says what. Put it into the rod."
	]
	quest.170B41317E141485.quest_subtitle: "The right hook for every catch."
	quest.170B41317E141485.title: "&7Bend a hook"
	quest.17173F13860F6730.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_portal.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Geh durch das Portal. Beim ersten Besuch bekommst du einen &6Golden Parachute&r und das &6Book of Lore&r geschenkt. Das Buch erklärt jeden Gegenstand des Aethers, leg einfach einen hinein."
		""
		"Der Aether besteht aus Inseln, die in den Wolken schweben. &cWer von einer Insel fällt, fällt in die Oberwelt zurück&r, hoch über dem Boden. Der Fallschirm öffnet sich dabei von selbst. Hier ist immer Tag, bis jemand den Sun Spirit besiegt hat."
		""
		"Betten funktionieren hier, anders als im Nether. Ein Wegstein neben dem Portal spart dir später viele Wege."
		""
		"Der Aether hat keine deutsche Übersetzung, darum stehen die Namen in diesem Kapitel auf Englisch, so wie du sie im Spiel siehst."
	]
	quest.17173F13860F6730.quest_subtitle: "Schwebende Inseln, ewiger Tag, kein Boden."
	quest.17173F13860F6730.title: "&b&lBetritt den Aether"
	quest.171A711FCBA75243.quest_desc: [
		"&6Golden sheet&r over a &6copper ingot&r makes the &6Steam Whistle&r. Put it on a heated boiler and give it a redstone signal."
		""
		"More whistles stacked onto the placed one lower the tone, the wrench switches between 3 octaves."
	]
	quest.171A711FCBA75243.quest_subtitle: "Factory siren or organ."
	quest.171A711FCBA75243.title: "&6Sound the steam whistle"
	quest.171A859BCBDB1A9F.quest_desc: [
		"In stage 5 the fission reactor, SPS and antimatter open in the chapter &5Mekanism: Antimatter&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stage 5 goal wants &e100 antimatter pellets&r. The SPS eats polonium and power, and a fusion plant and a full Induction Matrix that already stand now will carry it then."
	]
	quest.171A859BCBDB1A9F.quest_subtitle: "What plutonium and antimatter open."
	quest.171A859BCBDB1A9F.title: "&5Look Toward Stage 5"
	quest.172457095726767C.quest_desc: [
		"Der &4Shriek-Wurm&r steigt aus Befallenem Sculk auf, kreischt und schlägt zu, wer in Reichweite steht: &e100 Lebenspunkte, 7 Schaden&r. Er bewegt sich nicht vom Fleck."
		""
		"&eTaktik:&r Zwei Schritte zurück und mit dem Bogen arbeiten. Er lässt nichts fallen, aber er zählt für den Sculk-Jäger am Ende des Kapitels."
	]
	quest.172457095726767C.quest_subtitle: "Er kommt aus dem Boden und bleibt dort stehen."
	quest.172457095726767C.title: "&4&lErlege einen Shriek-Wurm"
	quest.1730217F0940D4E7.quest_desc: [
		"Motor, &6Electrum&r, Motor at the top, &6Unholy Intelligence&r, comparator, Unholy Intelligence in the middle, three plating at the bottom."
		""
		"Each chamber lets the machine process one more recipe at the same time, for &e50 percent&r more usage. Better than speed for long recipes."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The &6Soul Binder&r from Ender IO binds the Unholy Intelligence: a Dubious Container with the soul of an allay, phantom or vex."
	]
	quest.1730217F0940D4E7.quest_subtitle: "Auxiliary Processing Chamber."
	quest.1730217F0940D4E7.title: "&aProcess Twice with the Auxiliary Chamber"
	quest.1730DFD7EEF30884.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6ferroboron&r at the top left and right, in the middle &6redstone, steel, redstone&r, at the bottom &6steel, copper, steel&r."
	]
	quest.1730DFD7EEF30884.quest_subtitle: "For the port, melter and chemical reactor."
	quest.1730DFD7EEF30884.title: "&7Build a Servo"
	quest.173D201980468B57.quest_desc: [
		"&6Glistering melon slice&r on the brazier. On the hands: two &6Enchanted Ash&r, a &6potion of healing&r, two &6Soul Shards&r."
		""
		"Cures zombie villagers nearby. Zombified piglins and zoglins return to normal."
	]
	quest.173D201980468B57.quest_subtitle: "Ritual of Purifying."
	quest.173D201980468B57.title: "&fPurify Zombie Villagers"
	quest.1746B9436369F1FF.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6plastic&r, one &6diamond pickaxe&r in the middle, at the bottom wool, plating, wool."
		""
		"Destroyers and lasers mine blocks as themselves. Together with a Yield Addon, Silk Touch wins."
	]
	quest.1746B9436369F1FF.quest_subtitle: "Silk Touch Addon."
	quest.1746B9436369F1FF.title: "&aMine with Silk Touch"
	quest.174C898FB90A67BB.quest_desc: [
		"&eDas Portal:&r In der Oberwelt stehen kleine Ruinen mit einem Rahmen aus &6Chiseled Voidstone&r, in Ebenen, Wäldern, Wüsten, Dschungeln und kalten Biomen. Davor wartet der &bTorwächter&r. Rechtsklick, &eChallenge&r wählen, gewinnen."
		"&eDer Lohn:&r die &bOrb of Prophecy&r. Benutz sie am Rahmen, und das Portal öffnet sich. Weitere Kugeln sind 5 blaue Sternenlicht-Kristallscherben und 4 Glas."
		""
		"&eDrüben:&r ewige Nacht unter Sternen, Lunar-Wälder, die Kristallwüste, der ewige Frost, drei Bosse. &eMitnehmen:&r gute Rüstung, Essen, Fackeln, Blöcke für einen sicheren Raum am Portal. Alles Weitere im Kapitel &bEternal Starlight&r."
	]
	quest.174C898FB90A67BB.quest_subtitle: "Ein Torwächter, eine Kugel, ein Rahmen. Stufe 4."
	quest.174C898FB90A67BB.title: "&bÖffne Eternal Starlight"
	quest.174F520608227318.quest_desc: [
		"A &6bee nest&r and a &6diamond helmet&r shapeless give the &6Bee Nest Helmet&r."
		""
		"With it on your head angry bees do not attack you. If you get hit, a &6KamikazBee&r hatches with a &e30 percent&r chance and dives at the attacker."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Handy for moving nests and working at a full bee house."
	]
	quest.174F520608227318.quest_subtitle: "Angry bees leave you alone."
	quest.174F520608227318.title: "&ePut on a Bee Nest Helmet"
	quest.1760522667E003B6.quest_desc: [
		"Right clicking a brown or red &6mushroom&r with a &edye&r turns it into a &6Shimmering Mushroom&r of that colour. It counts as a petal of the same colour in every recipe."
		""
		"Deep underground you sometimes find them in small patches too."
	]
	quest.1760522667E003B6.quest_subtitle: "A mushroom that counts as a petal."
	quest.1760522667E003B6.title: "&6Dye a mushroom"
	quest.17617FAA55C09B6D.quest_desc: [
		"A &6wooden chest&r surrounded by &6eight iron nuggets&r."
		""
		"To clad it in the grid: first slot the block for the outside, second for the inside, third the drawer, a fourth block colours the trim. Goes well with andesite casings or stone bricks."
	]
	quest.17617FAA55C09B6D.quest_subtitle: "Framed Drawers in your building style."
	quest.17617FAA55C09B6D.title: "Clad a drawer"
	quest.1761F3A1D3D8DB7E.quest_desc: [
		"Some recipes tie the sides together. Already in stage 1: the gearbox needs &6Infused Iron&r, the keystone &bMana Diamonds&r and &6Andesite Alloy&r."
		""
		"From stage 2: the &6Blaze Burner&r needs 2 &6Source Gems&r, the Runic Altar a &6brass ingot&r, &6Mana Pearls&r a &6Brass Casing&r under the pool, Mekanism's Metallurgic Infuser &6Manasteel&r."
		""
		"The quests concerned name the recipe as &eRecipe on Kronwerke&r. Settle early who takes on what."
	]
	quest.1761F3A1D3D8DB7E.quest_subtitle: "Tech needs magic, magic needs tech."
	quest.1761F3A1D3D8DB7E.title: "&dCoordinate with the other side"
	quest.1767F6A0307AF055.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_connectors.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6copper ingot&r on top, below twice terracotta, copper, terracotta make four &6LV Wire Connectors&r. The upper two rows of that make eight &6LV Wire Relays&r."
		""
		"&eConnectors&r take in or give out up to &d256 FE/t&r. &eRelays&r are only nodes. A copper wire carries &d2 048 FE/t&r, if more connectors hang on it, it burns through."
		""
		"Per 16 blocks of copper wire 1.25 percent are lost. Uninsulated wires under power hurt everyone who touches them."
	]
	quest.1767F6A0307AF055.quest_subtitle: "Connectors on machines, relays in between."
	quest.1767F6A0307AF055.title: "&cString your first wire"
	quest.17690437D3197151.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 soul sand&r in a T shape, &e3 wither skeleton skulls&r on top."
		""
		"&cThe Wither destroys blocks.&r Summon it deep underground or far from bases, ideally with several people. One Wither gives one star. Skulls come from Nether fortresses, or deliberately with a wither skeleton model from Hostile Neural Networks."
	]
	quest.17690437D3197151.quest_subtitle: "The Wither has to fall too."
	quest.17690437D3197151.title: "&fGet a Nether Star"
	quest.176C1F6B6F509DB6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_lava_seeds.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Fire Seeds&r in the Infusion Altar: seed base, 4 Inferium Essence, 4 &6Fire Agglomeratio&r (lava bucket, gravel, dirt, clay ball in a 2x2). 4 &6Fire Essence&r around a bucket make a &6lava bucket&r, an &6Item Drain&r empties it into the tank."
		""
		"That makes lava infinite in stage 1, without the Nether: field, crafting table, drain, tank. The same essence gives sand with Earth Essence and flint with Stone Essence."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Lava from fire seeds and flint from the millstone make andesite in the press, and the mixer turns it into andesite alloy for the obelisk."
	]
	quest.176C1F6B6F509DB6.quest_subtitle: "Fire seeds, essence, lava bucket."
	quest.176C1F6B6F509DB6.title: "&cGrow lava in the field"
	quest.1777A8458BF84651.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_source_berries.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Sourceberries&r grow wild in taiga and archwood forests. Plant them at home like sweet berries."
		""
		"Eaten, they give mana regeneration. As &6Sourceberry Pie&r or &6Sourceberry Roll&r they are the best food for the Mycelial Sourcelink, and Starbuncles harvest ripe bushes on their own."
	]
	quest.1777A8458BF84651.quest_subtitle: "Food that gives mana back."
	quest.1777A8458BF84651.title: "&6Plant Sourceberries"
	quest.177AE47237E3CB18.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Kupplung&r: trennt die Welle, solange ein Redstone-Signal anliegt. &6Gangschaltung&r: kehrt die Drehrichtung um, solange ein Signal anliegt. So hältst du einen Bohrer an oder lässt ein Band rückwärts laufen. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Kupplung: Andesitgehäuse, Welle und Redstone, formlos. Gangschaltung: Andesitgehäuse, Zahnrad und Redstone."
	]
	quest.177AE47237E3CB18.quest_subtitle: "Create, Kupplung und Gangschaltung: aus und umgekehrt."
	quest.177AE47237E3CB18.title: "Schalt Drehung mit Redstone"
	quest.1787C8DEB600BA0C.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: Basic Spell Turret, &6Source Gem block&r and &e2 blaze rods&r."
		""
		"The &6Enchanted Spell Turret&r casts at half the Source price. With a greater focus from Ars Elemental it becomes the elemental turret from stage 3."
	]
	quest.1787C8DEB600BA0C.quest_subtitle: "Half the cost, same effect."
	quest.1787C8DEB600BA0C.title: "&aEnchant the turret"
	quest.1789AA72A0A5D0A9.quest_desc: [
		"&5Necromancers&r roam the catacombs and call undead. Keep moving and go for the mage first, not his servants."
		""
		"He drops 0 to 4 &6Arcane Essence&r and has a &e25 percent&r chance to drop a scroll, only if you kill him yourself. Looting raises both."
	]
	quest.1789AA72A0A5D0A9.quest_subtitle: "The mage of the catacombs."
	quest.1789AA72A0A5D0A9.title: "&5Take Down a Necromancer"
	quest.178B2DFFBE0F2430.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: two &6hoppers&r."
		""
		"Collects all items at the target. Put it &ebehind&r the effect: &eProjectile, Break, Pickup&r. With AOE (tier 2) the radius gets bigger."
	]
	quest.178B2DFFBE0F2430.quest_subtitle: "The loot lands right in your inventory."
	quest.178B2DFFBE0F2430.title: "&dLearn Pickup"
	quest.179650EABEFBB8BD.quest_desc: [
		"A &6hay bale&r or rice bale, two &6apples&r and a &6golden carrot&r, see EMI."
		""
		"A tamed mount gets effects from it for a while, which the tooltip lists."
	]
	quest.179650EABEFBB8BD.quest_subtitle: "For fast travel."
	quest.179650EABEFBB8BD.title: "&7Mix horse feed"
	quest.17988C752E737E82.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6Electrum&r at the top and sides, a &6Motor&r in the middle, at the bottom &6iron axe&r, plating, iron axe make the &6Tree Cutter&r."
		""
		"With power it fells any tree in front of it, logs and leaves, up to &e8,000 blocks&r big. Saplings and fruit from the leaves land in its inventory."
		""
		"A Placer replants, a pipe takes the wood away: the wood farm is done."
	]
	quest.17988C752E737E82.quest_subtitle: "Whole trees, block by block."
	quest.17988C752E737E82.title: "&2Set Up a Tree Cutter"
	quest.179CF2AACC3D7BAE.quest_desc: [
		"A router with a &6Puller Mk1&r from the input chest. Next to it one &6Sender Mk2&r per kind with a &6Bulk Item Filter&r that has learned the contents of its target chest via &e=&r. As the last module a Sender Mk2 without a filter into the leftovers chest."
		""
		"The router works through the modules from left to right: whatever fits into a target chest goes there, the rest out on the far right. A few &6Stack Upgrades&r, and one stack per second is sorted. The filter remembers the kind even when the chest is empty in between."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Send brass and mana pearls from the leftovers chest into a chest of their own for the obelisk. What you hand in from it by hand counts for you towards the goal of stage 2."
	]
	quest.179CF2AACC3D7BAE.quest_subtitle: "One chest in, twenty chests right."
	quest.179CF2AACC3D7BAE.title: "&6&lBuild a Sorting System"
	quest.179FC6925ECB4AB2.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r three &6copper sheets&r on top, in the middle &6iron pickaxe&r, &6Smithing Table&r and &6iron axe&r, at the bottom two &6Gem Dust&r with a &6lava bucket&r between them."
		""
		"Put affix items in that you do not wear. Each gives one to four &6rarity materials&r of its tier. Gems become Gem Dust, and normal gear gives back part of its metal: iron armor one to three iron ingots, diamond armor one to three diamonds."
		""
		"{image:apotheosis:textures/blocks/salvaging_table_front.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.179FC6925ECB4AB2.quest_subtitle: "Loot becomes materials."
	quest.179FC6925ECB4AB2.title: "&6&lBuild a Salvaging Table"
	quest.17A8D8F1BA111955.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6carbon fibre&r, one &6Processing Unit&r in the middle, at the bottom chest, Motor, chest."
		""
		"You pick one slot of the machine, and everything that goes into or out of the addon only affects that slot. Handy on the Assembler."
	]
	quest.17A8D8F1BA111955.quest_subtitle: "Inventory Proxy Addon."
	quest.17A8D8F1BA111955.title: "&aGive a Slot Its Own Access"
	quest.17AEFC7B30729BAB.quest_desc: [
		"Mine a log with an &6axe&r, and the whole tree falls. The axe wears for every log. Whoever &esneaks&r mines only that one block, so a tree house stays standing."
		""
		"The leaves of a felled tree disappear by themselves after a few seconds, saplings and apples drop as usual."
	]
	quest.17AEFC7B30729BAB.quest_subtitle: "One log, and everything comes down."
	quest.17AEFC7B30729BAB.title: "&aFell the Whole Tree"
	quest.17B161F925A01E59.quest_desc: [
		"Schild-Blaupause (drei Blaues Papier, ein Eisenbarren, drei Stöcke), die Schildplatte aus &ezwei&r Material. Kapitel &6Silent Gear&r."
		""
		"Blockt wie der Vanilla-Schild, die Haltbarkeit kommt aus dem Material, repariert wird mit dem Reparaturkit."
	]
	quest.17B161F925A01E59.quest_subtitle: "Silent Gear: blockt, solange das Material hält."
	quest.17B161F925A01E59.title: "&7Bau einen Schild aus Teilen"
	quest.17BAC4745A5B11D3.quest_desc: [
		"A casing with redstone around it makes the &6Fission Reactor Logic Adapter&r. Put it into the shell."
		""
		"Set it to shut the reactor down at too high a temperature or on damage, and test that once at a low burn rate. That is the most important quarter hour of this chapter."
	]
	quest.17BAC4745A5B11D3.quest_subtitle: "The Logic Adapter saves your base."
	quest.17BAC4745A5B11D3.title: "&cBuild the Emergency Stop"
	quest.17BFB9C5252AD792.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cobblestone&r, dirt, sand or clay into the Calcination Oven: &6Strata Salt&r, one per block."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A second oven that a hopper feeds with cobblestone only keeps the Incubator supplied with salt for good."
	]
	quest.17BFB9C5252AD792.quest_subtitle: "Salt without sacrificing ore."
	quest.17BFB9C5252AD792.title: "&6Burn Strata Salt from Cobblestone"
	quest.17C225C6121E91CD.quest_desc: [
		"Productive Trees hat &e148 Kreuzungen&r und 163 Baumarten. Fast jede neue Art ist ein Elternteil für die nächste: Buche und Birke ergeben die Erle, und so weiter bis zu Mahagoni, Ebenholz, Zuckerahorn und dem Gummibaum. EMI unter Baumbestäubung ist dein Stammbaum."
		""
		"Sechs Setzlinge wachsen nicht aus Kreuzungen, sondern liegen in Truhen: &6Blue Yonder&r in Schiffswrack-Schatztruhen, &6Flickering Sun&r in Wüstentempeln, &6Firecracker&r in Antiken Städten, &6Brown Amber&r beim Ausgraben in kalten Ozeanruinen. &6Black Ember&r (Bastionen) kommt mit dem Nether in Stufe 2, &6Soul Tree&r (Endsiedlungen) mit dem End in Stufe 4."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r &6Productive Bees&r öffnet. Ein fortgeschrittener Bienenstock mit dem &6Pollensieb-Upgrade&r sammelt Pollen nebenbei, und die &6Allergie-Biene&r ist darauf spezialisiert."
	]
	quest.17C225C6121E91CD.quest_subtitle: "148 Kreuzungen, sechs Setzlinge aus Truhen."
	quest.17C225C6121E91CD.title: "&dAusblick: Hybriden und Fundstücke"
	quest.17C62B7217169529.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_bio.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Bioreactor:&r plastic, Diamond Gear, plastic at the top, slime balls around the frame, bricks, sugar, bricks at the bottom. &6Biofuel Generator:&r plastic, furnace, plastic at the top, pistons around the frame, Gold Gear, piston, Gold Gear at the bottom."
		""
		"The reactor turns water and seeds, saplings, dyes and heads into &dBiofuel&r. One kind gives 80 mB per piece, four different kinds 110 mB each. The generator makes &d160 FE/t&r from it and stops when its buffer of 1 million is full."
	]
	quest.17C62B7217169529.quest_subtitle: "160 FE/t from seeds and saplings."
	quest.17C62B7217169529.title: "&dRun a Biofuel Generator"
	quest.17C91AA3D7D43887.quest_desc: [
		"In the water cauldron: &e2 Mandrake Roots&r, &e4 wheat&r, &6Mugwort Leaves&r, &6Yellow Dock Leaves&r make a &6Wet Broom Brush&r."
		"On the Drying Rack it dries into the &6Broom Brush&r in &e50 seconds&r."
		""
		"Every new broom already has a brush. It has &e100&r durability and wears down while flying. Unbreaking and Mending can be enchanted onto brushes."
	]
	quest.17C91AA3D7D43887.quest_subtitle: "No flight without a brush."
	quest.17C91AA3D7D43887.title: "&6Tie a broom brush"
	quest.17CA3655D2C5898B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r drei &6Turbine Rotors&r oben und an den Seiten, ein &6Printed Circuit Board&r in der Mitte, unten ein &6Präzisionsgetriebe&r von Create. Fliegende Maschinen brauchen auf Kronwerke ein Getriebe, wie der Assembler von AE2."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/item/drone.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Das Präzisionsgetriebe entsteht auf dem Depot mit dem Einsatzgerät, siehe Kapitel &6Create: Messing&r. Frag die Create-Spieler, die machen die am laufenden Band."
		""
		"&eLaden:&r Eine Drohne läuft mit Luft, 1 mL pro Tick. Leg sie in eine &6Charging Station&r. Steck ein &6Dispenser Upgrade&r in die Station, dann wird sie zum Ladefeld: Jede Drohne mit wenig Luft fliegt von selbst zur nächsten Station mit Dispenser Upgrade im Umkreis von 80 Blöcken, tankt und arbeitet weiter."
		""
		"&cAchtung:&r Geht die Luft aus, fällt die Drohne und nimmt Fallschaden. Zerstört lässt sie sich als Item fallen. Mit einem Pneumatic Wrench nimmst du sie sauber auf."
	]
	quest.17CA3655D2C5898B.quest_subtitle: "Ein fliegender Roboter mit Präzisionsgetriebe."
	quest.17CA3655D2C5898B.title: "&d&lBau eine Drone"
	quest.17CAF7CDCF6B9A76.quest_desc: [
		"First &6two redstone&r and &6two lapis&r. Then &6four Soul Shards&r and stir twice. Finally a &6Soul Crystal&r from Deeper and Darker."
		""
		"The soul gem goes into wands and the Sanguine Amulet. With a Soul Gem on the brazier you recharge empty wands."
	]
	quest.17CAF7CDCF6B9A76.quest_subtitle: "Three steps, stir twice."
	quest.17CAF7CDCF6B9A76.title: "&dBrew a Lesser Soul Gem"
	quest.17CDD0332811C550.quest_desc: [
		"Von 256 SU am Bach bis zu Reaktoren, die Millionen FE pro Tick machen: alles, was in Kronwerke Strom oder Rotation erzeugt, steht in diesem Kapitel. Hak ab, was du gebaut hast, und schau vor jeder neuen Stufe hier nach, bevor du Kabel ziehst."
		""
		"&eDie Faustregel:&r Stufe 1 Wasserräder, Stufe 2 Wärmegenerator und Dampf, Stufe 3 Powah-Reaktor und Flux, Stufe 4 Nitro, RTGs und Fusion, Stufe 5 Spaltung und Turbine. Wer eine Stufe früher mehr will, baut Ethen."
		""
		"&eKronwerke-Rezepte in diesem Kapitel:&r Flux-Kern (Quellenedelstein) und Flux-Controller (Fortschrittlicher Schaltkreis), Pneumatischer Dynamo und Flux-Kompressor (Einfacher Schaltkreis), die Laser-Fokusmatrix der Fusion (Quellenedelsteinblock) und der Energiekern-Stabilisator (Gaia-Geist). Alles andere ist wie in den Mods."
	]
	quest.17CDD0332811C550.quest_subtitle: "Jede Quelle im Pack kennst du jetzt beim Namen."
	quest.17CDD0332811C550.title: "&6&lZieh Bilanz"
	quest.17CDE921479E3CAD.quest_desc: [
		"&eCtrl+F&r jumps into the search field at the bottom centre. Type part of the name and the list filters at once. &e@create&r shows everything from one mod, for example all blocks from Create."
		""
		"&eA&r over an item makes it a &efavorite&r. Favorites are on the left of the inventory and stay until you remove them with A. Handy for the ingredient list of a bigger machine."
		""
		"&eCtrl+O&r hides EMI completely and shows it again, in case you need the room."
		""
		"These keys are EMI's own and are not in the controls settings. Change them with the &eEMI&r button at the bottom left."
	]
	quest.17CDE921479E3CAD.quest_subtitle: "Search field, mod filter, favorites."
	quest.17CDE921479E3CAD.title: "&6Search EMI"
	quest.17CDF17B55F34B16.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_laser.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Enderic Lens&r in the Assembler: Adamant, carbon fibre, two Enderic Compound. Laser: carbon fibre, lens, carbon fibre at the top, Motor, Electrum, Motor, three plating at the bottom."
		""
		"Right click a block with the &6Target Designator&r to store it, &eShift&r right click the laser to give it the direction. It fires up to &e128 blocks&r and mines everything in that direction, it passes through glass."
		""
		"Pointed at &6amethyst clusters&r it makes &dFluxite&r, pointed at machines it charges them. Whatever does not fit into its inventory is lost: attach a pipe."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The laser does not charge Certus Quartz. Ars Nouveau and Powah's Energizing Orb do that."
	]
	quest.17CDF17B55F34B16.quest_subtitle: "A beam that mines and brings power."
	quest.17CDF17B55F34B16.title: "&5&lBuild the Enderic Laser"
	quest.17D4A9EF17E2314F.quest_desc: [
		"First the &6Passive Pedestal&r: a carpet on top, two gold nuggets around a quartz block, three quartz slabs at the bottom. Then four &6diamonds&r in the corners around the Passive Pedestal, that gives the real &6Pedestal&r. The carpet color decides the color."
		""
		"Whatever lies in the pedestal works: a &6Mob Charm&r protects all players within &e21 blocks&r, a sword strikes 5 blocks far, shears shear sheep, a bucket scoops, a fishing rod fishes, redstone gives a signal."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A pedestal with a Creeper Charm next to the base, and nobody blows up the facade anymore."
	]
	quest.17D4A9EF17E2314F.quest_subtitle: "The stand that uses things for you."
	quest.17D4A9EF17E2314F.title: "&aBuild a Pedestal"
	quest.17E0779259F190F4.quest_desc: [
		"Every essence has its recipes in the crafting table, the Guide and EMI show them all. The most important ones for stage 1:"
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/essence/stone_essence.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eStone Essence:&r 8 in a ring give 24 cobblestone, 2 Stone and 2 Dirt Essence 16 gravel."
		"&eDirt Essence:&r 8 in a ring give 24 dirt, 2 Dirt and 2 Water Essence 24 clay."
		"&eWood Essence:&r 3 in a row give 16 oak logs, other patterns other wood types."
		"&eIce Essence:&r 8 in a ring give 24 ice, 9 give 20 packed ice."
		"&eDeepslate Essence:&r 8 in a ring give 24 cobbled deepslate."
		"&eWater Essence:&r 4 around a bucket give a water bucket, 1 in 8 concrete powder gives 8 concrete."
		"&eFire Essence:&r 4 around a bucket give a &6lava bucket&r, 2 Fire and 2 Dirt Essence 16 sand, 2 Stone and 2 Fire Essence 8 flint."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Lava from Fire Seeds is an endless fuel source for Iron Furnaces and later for the Mekanism Heat Generator, without any Nether at all."
	]
	quest.17E0779259F190F4.quest_subtitle: "What you can build from the stage 1 seeds."
	quest.17E0779259F190F4.title: "&6Turn Essence into Blocks"
	quest.17E8FDE47210D7F1.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r &6Eisenbarren&r in die Ecken, &6schwarzes Glas&r an die Seiten, ein &6Redstoneblock&r in die Mitte."
		""
		"Der &6Data Center IO Port&r ersetzt einen beliebigen Wand- oder Deckenblock der Hülle. &eRechtsklick&r schaltet seinen Modus: &dEnergy&r nimmt Strom, &6Models&r die Modelle, &aInputs&r die Matrizen, &eOutputs&r gibt die Drops heraus."
		""
		"Vier Ports, einer pro Modus, und du musst die Hülle nie wieder öffnen. Rohre an Inputs und Outputs, ein Flux Point an Energy, fertig."
	]
	quest.17E8FDE47210D7F1.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 4. Die Steckdose in der Glaswand."
	quest.17E8FDE47210D7F1.title: "&5Der IO-Port"
	quest.17E9A2D481705080.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_overcast_columns.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Die &7Bewölkten Säulen&r bestehen aus &6Düsterschiefer&r, mit Magma, Seelensand und &6Düsterem Sculk&r am Boden. Hier spawnt kein Monster von selbst."
		""
		"Zwischen den Säulen steckt &6Kristallisierter Bernstein&r. Darin ist etwas eingeschlossen, mal ein Gegenstand (Amethyst, Diamant, Smaragd, verzauberte Stiefel), mal ein &cSculk-Egel&r. Mit &eBehutsamkeit&r nimmst du ihn mit, der Tooltip verrät den Inhalt. Ohne kommt der Inhalt heraus."
		""
		"Jeder hundertste Fleck Düsterer Sculk ist ein &6Düsterer Geysir&r. Er ist heiß, 2000 Grad für PneumaticCraft, falls du eine Wärmequelle suchst."
	]
	quest.17E9A2D481705080.quest_subtitle: "Düsterschiefer, Geysire und Bernstein."
	quest.17E9A2D481705080.title: "&7Finde die Bewölkten Säulen"
	quest.17EED24FB3E047DC.quest_desc: [
		"With the Components blueprint: &6glass&r, a &6Nickel Plate&r, a &6Copper Wire&r and &6redstone&r make three &6Vacuum Tubes&r."
		""
		"They are in the Charging Station and in stage 3 in the Advanced Electronic Component. Create's electron tube is a different part."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_electron_tube.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.17EED24FB3E047DC.quest_subtitle: "Three tubes per recipe, at the workbench."
	quest.17EED24FB3E047DC.title: "&dMake Vacuum Tubes"
	quest.17F2803C43A50024.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Andesite Alloys&r and a &6clock&r give the &6Basin Lid&r. Put it on a &6basin&r: &6sugar&r, &6apples&r, &6potatoes&r or &6sugar cane&r with &6bone meal&r ferment in it into &b200 mB of ethanol&r. No mixer, no heat."
		""
		"The &6Bulk Fermenter&r (two Andesite Alloys and a barrel) gives more: the same ingredients give &b400 mB&r. It also turns four sugar cane and water into pulp for cardboard and &6cobblestone&r into &c50 mB of lava&r, an endless lava drip from the cobblestone generator."
		""
		"&6Plant oil&r is the second half of biodiesel: a press over a basin compacts &6seeds&r into &b100 mB&r. A wheat farm with a harvester delivers both, sugar from sugar cane and seeds from the wheat."
	]
	quest.17F2803C43A50024.quest_subtitle: "Create Diesel Generators: sugar and bone meal."
	quest.17F2803C43A50024.title: "&6Ferment Ethanol"
	quest.17F70E299E6DCB46.quest_desc: [
		"&6Awakened ingots&r in the corners, a &6potion&r at the top, a &6Draconic Shield Module&r at the bottom, a &6Wyvern Core&r left and right, the &6Wyvern Undying Module&r in the middle. The Wyvern module needs a Totem of Undying."
		""
		"At least one belongs in the chestpiece for the Chaos Guardian."
	]
	quest.17F70E299E6DCB46.quest_subtitle: "Catches one deadly hit."
	quest.17F70E299E6DCB46.title: "&dBuild a Draconic Undying Module"
	quest.17FE743033197C17.quest_desc: [
		"With Farmer's Delight, &6mushroom stew&r, &6beetroot soup&r and &6rabbit stew&r stack up to &d16&r, like the meals from Farmer's Delight. They also give &dNourishment&r, and rabbit stew fills you up much more than in vanilla."
		""
		"Mushrooms grow in the mushroom colony, rabbits you find in deserts and snowy areas."
	]
	quest.17FE743033197C17.quest_subtitle: "Mushroom stew by the sixteen."
	quest.17FE743033197C17.title: "&6Stack your soups"
	quest.17FFAA591909DA98.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e6 Ghasts&r mit dem Learner im Inventar, am besten mit dem Bogen über der Lavasee. Sechs Kills machen das Modell gerade Basic."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d256 FE/t&r. Eine Vorhersage wird zu &616 Ghast-Tränen&r oder 32 Schwarzpulver. Tränen braucht jeder Trank der Regeneration und der Endkristall."
	]
	quest.17FFAA591909DA98.quest_subtitle: "Tränen für die Regeneration."
	quest.17FFAA591909DA98.title: "&fLerne den Ghast"
	quest.17FFFD7527916731.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Kuchen&r braucht drei Milch, und genau die holt der Kochtisch aus dem &6Milchglas&r an der Küche. Zucker, Ei und Weizen nimmt er aus den Theken. Ein Klick, und der Kuchen ist da."
		""
		"Leg ihn aufs &6Schneidebrett&r von Farmer's Delight und schneid mit dem Messer: &e7 Kuchenstücke&r, die du einzeln mitnehmen kannst."
	]
	quest.17FFFD7527916731.quest_subtitle: "Milch aus dem Glas, sieben Stücke vom Brett."
	quest.17FFFD7527916731.title: "&6Back einen Kuchen am Kochtisch"
	quest.180C17CAE1E36A20.quest_desc: [
		"Die &eGenauigkeit&r ist die Chance, dass eine Simulation eine &6Vorhersage&r für den Mob abwirft. Basic 5 Prozent, Advanced 22, Superior 65, Self Aware 100. Dazwischen steigt sie mit jedem Datenpunkt ein Stück."
		""
		"Ein Basic-Modell braucht also im Schnitt 20 Simulationen, jede 12 Sekunden lang und mit vollem Strom, für eine einzige Vorhersage. Ein Self-Aware-Modell braucht eine. Trainier fertig, bevor du Strom verbrennst."
		""
		"Auf Kronwerke ist das gewollt: Wer in Stufe 2 die Kills sammelt, hat in Stufe 3 die beste Kammer auf dem Server."
	]
	quest.180C17CAE1E36A20.quest_subtitle: "Warum die letzten 50 Kills die wichtigsten sind."
	quest.180C17CAE1E36A20.title: "&eVerstehe die Genauigkeit"
	quest.180E5A7BB23F44FA.quest_desc: [
		"Like Basic, only with &6Energized Steel&r in place of iron, two &6Hardened Capacitors&r and the Basic Furnator at the bottom."
		""
		"A Hardened Furnator makes &e200 FE/t&r, ten times as much as the Starter."
	]
	quest.180E5A7BB23F44FA.quest_subtitle: "Energized Steel from the orb."
	quest.180E5A7BB23F44FA.title: "&8Upgrade to Hardened"
	quest.18115C7028F2DE4B.quest_desc: [
		"Look for an &dEnd City&r on the outer islands: tall towers of &6purpur&r with bridges and chests."
		""
		"The chests are Lootr chests, everyone gets their own loot, often enchanted diamond gear. Shulkers sit in the walls. Build railings where you fight."
	]
	quest.18115C7028F2DE4B.quest_subtitle: "Purple towers in the void."
	quest.18115C7028F2DE4B.title: "&dFind an End City"
	quest.18128235F86E882E.quest_desc: [
		"An &6ender pearl&r and an &6amethyst shard&r make &e4 Warp Dust&r."
		""
		"{image:waystones:textures/item/warp_dust.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Endermen drop pearls, amethyst grows in the geodes deep down. The dust goes into the Warp Stone and the Warp Plate."
	]
	quest.18128235F86E882E.quest_subtitle: "The stuff journeys are made of."
	quest.18128235F86E882E.title: "&6Make Warp Dust"
	quest.1814B959E487186A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Zanite Gemstones&r und &6Skyroot Sticks&r ergeben Werkzeug wie Eisen: 3 Gemstones und 2 Stöcke für die &6Zanite Pickaxe&r, 2 Gemstones und ein Stock für das &6Zanite Sword&r. Rüstung kostet 24 Gemstones, die &6Zanite Gloves&r 2 dazu."
		""
		"Zanite-Werkzeug wird &eschneller, je abgenutzter&r es ist. Kurz vor dem Bruch ist es am besten. Reparierst du es im Altar, ist es wieder so langsam wie am Anfang."
		""
		"Die &6Zanite Axe&r ist die einzige Axt dieser Stufe, die aus Golden Oaks &6Golden Amber&r holt."
	]
	quest.1814B959E487186A.quest_subtitle: "Werkzeug, das mit jedem Schlag schneller wird."
	quest.1814B959E487186A.title: "&5Schmiede Zanite"
	quest.18159E5664289ADE.quest_desc: [
		"Drei &6Angelheart Vials&r und eine &6Angelic Feather&r formlos. Die Feder allein fängt Fallschaden gegen Hunger ab, &6Kraken Shell&r und &6Infernal Claws&r tun dasselbe gegen Ertrinken und Feuer. Kapitel &5Reliquary&r."
		""
		"Das Phoenix Down holt dich einmal mit vollem Leben zurück, gibt kurz Resistenz und Regeneration und wird dann wieder zur Angelic Feather."
	]
	quest.18159E5664289ADE.quest_subtitle: "Reliquary: ein zweites Leben in der Tasche."
	quest.18159E5664289ADE.title: "&6Trag ein Phoenix Down"
	quest.1817D2FB52533855.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Gold, 1 Powdered Iron&r, cloth."
		""
		"A large shield in front of you. Monsters bounce off, projectiles vanish, sneaking you can jump on it yourself. Costs &d300 mana&r."
	]
	quest.1817D2FB52533855.quest_subtitle: "A shield in front of you."
	quest.1817D2FB52533855.title: "&6Draw Rho Aias"
	quest.1825A78DA30476AE.quest_desc: [
		"A burning &6campfire&r gives every player within &e16 blocks&r &eRegeneration I&r for &e60 seconds&r. That comes from &6Healing Campfire&r and is refreshed every two seconds."
		""
		"A &6soul campfire&r works the same way, and it heals animals nearby too. If the fire is out, nothing happens."
		""
		"&eTip:&r One in the middle of the base, one at the entrance to the mine. After a fight you stand next to it briefly instead of using up your food."
	]
	quest.1825A78DA30476AE.quest_subtitle: "A burning fire heals everyone nearby."
	quest.1825A78DA30476AE.title: "&6Warm Up at the Campfire"
	quest.18302206258B4B4E.quest_desc: [
		"&eFlashing archwood log&r, Starbuncle Shards, sugar, rabbit's foot. You get the yellow sapling shapeless from an archwood sapling and Air Essence."
		""
		"All Starbuncles within &e15 blocks&r get Speed for a long time, refreshed every 30 seconds. A gold block as an addition doubles the radius."
	]
	quest.18302206258B4B4E.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: Starbuncles on espresso."
	quest.18302206258B4B4E.title: "&aMake the Fast Squirrels tablet"
	quest.183250A2C01779E4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_nouveau_apparatus.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Corners &6gold nuggets&r, top and bottom middle &6sourcestone&r, middle gold ingot, &6diamond&r, gold ingot. Place it on the Arcane Core."
		""
		"Side ingredients on pedestals within &e3 blocks&r, then click the apparatus with the main ingredient. It draws Source from jars nearby."
		""
		"It also enchants tools and armour directly, up to Mana Boost and Mana Regen. EMI shows every recipe."
	]
	quest.183250A2C01779E4.quest_subtitle: "The magician's workbench."
	quest.183250A2C01779E4.title: "&a&lBuild the Enchanting Apparatus"
	quest.183BC0A0E2E3D785.quest_desc: [
		"&6Azure Silver Ore&r only exists in the &5End&r, so practically from stage 4."
		""
		"&6Azure Silver&r: &e197&r durability, speed &e19&r, Moonwalker IV (less gravity)."
		""
		"&6Azure Electrum&r (block of Azure Silver, two gold, ender pearl, gives three): &e1,259&r durability, speed &e29&r."
	]
	quest.183BC0A0E2E3D785.quest_subtitle: "197 durability, speed 19."
	quest.183BC0A0E2E3D785.title: "&bFind Azure Silver in the End"
	quest.185514AA89041936.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r five &6iron ingots&r (the whole left column plus top and bottom middle), a &6lapis lazuli&r top right, an &6ender pearl&r in the middle, a &6redstone&r bottom right. A &6Basic Magnet&r."
		""
		"It sits anywhere in your inventory and pulls items and experience from up to &e5 blocks&r away to you. &eRight click&r turns it on and off, a sound and a message confirm it."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Turn it off before you walk past other people's farms or dispensers. Otherwise your neighbor's output suddenly ends up in your pocket."
	]
	quest.185514AA89041936.quest_subtitle: "Never bend down again."
	quest.185514AA89041936.title: "&bBuild a Magnet"
	quest.185B2AEAEA3A0142.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/logistics_menril.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put a &6Menril Log&r on the Squeezer and jump on it until it is flat. That gives &d1,000 mB of Menril Resin&r, which flows into the Drying Basin next to it and dries to a &6Crystalized Menril Block&r. At the crafting table the block gives nine &6chunks&r."
		""
		"&6Menril trees&r are tall and blue with glowing leaves, easiest to find in the &6Meneglin&r biome. Take saplings with you. A redstone signal resets the Squeezer."
	]
	quest.185B2AEAEA3A0142.quest_subtitle: "Blue trees full of resin."
	quest.185B2AEAEA3A0142.title: "&9Press menril resin"
	quest.186E8C9E5402781E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_ophyx.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Ophyx' Calling&r, 13x13: &e36 lime&r, &e16 white&r and &e8 light grey&r signs, &e8 candles&r, &e4 skeleton skulls&r."
		"You get the skulls from the Possessed Skeleton. Let the Ritual Satchel draw; it saves a lot of counting."
		""
		"&eWhat it summons:&r Djinni Crusher, Smelter and Crystallizer, day, night and clear weather, the gambler, the Wandering Trader, the machine operator and the demonic partner."
	]
	quest.186E8C9E5402781E.quest_subtitle: "The pentacle for Djinni."
	quest.186E8C9E5402781E.title: "&5Draw Ophyx' Calling"
	quest.187BC868E08BDE4B.quest_desc: [
		"Put the &6steel axe&r, &6steel pickaxe&r and &6steel shovel&r next to each other in the top row, two &6iron ingots&r below as the handle. Out comes the &6steel paxel&r."
		""
		"It mines stone, wood and dirt equally fast; you never switch tools while digging again. You can enchant it like any pickaxe."
		""
		"Paxels exist for every Mekanism Tools material, also for wood, stone, iron, diamond and netherite."
	]
	quest.187BC868E08BDE4B.quest_subtitle: "Three tools, one slot."
	quest.187BC868E08BDE4B.title: "&7Build a steel paxel"
	quest.187DA804F6421655.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Guardian Crystals&r around the island protect the Guardian. Each has a shield of &e512&r. If an attack by the Guardian itself hits it, the shield is unstable for &e10 seconds&r. Then strike."
		""
		"So: lure the Guardian to the crystal, dodge, smash the crystal. Chaotic weapons break the shields directly, but those only exist after the first victory."
	]
	quest.187DA804F6421655.quest_subtitle: "Phase one: the crystals."
	quest.187DA804F6421655.title: "&8Break a Guardian Crystal"
	quest.188710AF3DD1233F.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6brass casing&r, &6precision mechanism&r, brass casing. Middle &6Electron Tube&r, &cRune of Fire&r, Electron Tube. Bottom brass casing, &6Blaze Burner&r, brass casing."
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/item/brass_heart.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"A botanist makes the Rune of Fire at the Runic Altar (&aBotania: Runes&r chapter). Trade brass casings for it."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The obelisk wants &e8 Brass Hearts&r, fixed for any number of players. Each counts as much as 300 brass ingots. It only takes them while the stage 2 goal is active."
	]
	quest.188710AF3DD1233F.quest_subtitle: "The milestone of the Brass Works."
	quest.188710AF3DD1233F.title: "&6Build a Brass Heart"
	quest.18874B5E77D1E9E0.quest_desc: [
		"Kauf einen &6Cashewbaum&r (Teak und Mangrove, 2 Smaragde): &e3 Cashews&r pro Blatt. Nussbäume tragen fast alle drei Nüsse (Mandel, Buche, Paranuss, Butternuss, Kerzennuss, Cashew, Ginkgo, Hasel, Pekan, Pistazie, Walnuss), nur die Edelkastanie zwei."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/fruit/roasted_cashew.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Roh geben Nüsse 1 Hunger und kaum Sättigung, im Ofen oder Räucherofen in 6 Sekunden geröstet dreimal so viel Sättigung. Die &6Bucheckern&r und ihr Rösten stehen im Kapitel &6Kochen&r."
		""
		"Die &6Kaffeebohne&r (4 pro Blatt am Kaffeebaum) röstet genauso. Hasel, Mandel, Pistazie und Kaffee gibt es nur durch Züchten: Espe und Buche ergeben die Hasel, Mandel und Cashew die Pistazie."
	]
	quest.18874B5E77D1E9E0.quest_subtitle: "Zwölf Nussbäume, geröstet dreimal so sättigend."
	quest.18874B5E77D1E9E0.title: "&6Pflanz einen Cashewbaum"
	quest.188B5DA5652EFC13.quest_desc: [
		"&6Import Bus:&r an Annihilation Core at the top, below it iron, piston, iron. &6Export Bus:&r iron, Formation Core, iron, below that a piston. Both sit on a cable and face a block."
		""
		"The Import Bus pulls everything out of the inventory in front of it into the network, the Export Bus pushes the items you set out of it. Together they automate a furnace: export in at the top, import out at the bottom."
		""
		"Without cards they move little, see the next quest."
	]
	quest.188B5DA5652EFC13.quest_subtitle: "Into the network, out of the network."
	quest.188B5DA5652EFC13.title: "&6Place an import and an export bus"
	quest.1896B36AB2BFB13A.quest_desc: [
		"Plastic in the corners, &6logs&r on the sides, a &6Gold Gear&r in the middle, the &6Simple Frame&r at the bottom make the &6Fermentation Station&r."
		""
		"&eIn:&r Raw Ore Meat. It seals once the set fill level is reached, and ferments. &eOut:&r Fermented Ore Meat: double after 5 seconds, triple after 45, quadruple after 2 minutes, fivefold after 5 minutes. &d40 FE/t&r."
	]
	quest.1896B36AB2BFB13A.quest_subtitle: "Ferment longer, more output."
	quest.1896B36AB2BFB13A.title: "&4Ferment Ore Meat"
	quest.189757E99790A33C.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &5Abjuration Essence&r and &e3 milk buckets&r."
		""
		"Removes all potion effects from the target and sends summoned helpers back into their charm. On a &6witch&r at half health or less it gives &6Wixie Shards&r for stage 2."
	]
	quest.189757E99790A33C.quest_subtitle: "Away with all effects."
	quest.189757E99790A33C.title: "&dLearn Dispel"
	quest.189F82BBD4851952.quest_desc: [
		"Sechs &6Druckeisen&r in zwei Säulen ergeben die &6Drucklufttür&r (Pneumatic Door). Ein &6Druckluftzylinder&r oben in der Mitte, ein &6Druckluftrohr&r rechts in der Mitte, der Rest &6Druckeisen&r (sechs Stück) ergeben den &6Türantrieb&r (Pneumatic Door Base)."
		""
		"Setz die Tür und daneben den Antrieb, und zwar auf Höhe der &eoberen Hälfte&r der Tür. Mit Luft öffnet sie sich, sobald ein Spieler im Umkreis von 2 Blöcken steht. Jedes &6Reichweiten-Upgrade&r gibt einen Block dazu."
		""
		"Im Fenster des Antriebs wählst du: &eSpieler in der Nähe&r, &eNähe und hinsehen&r oder &eHolztür&r (dann verhält sie sich wie eine normale Tür). Zwei Türen nebeneinander ergeben eine Doppeltür. In Stufe 3 öffnet sie mit einer Sicherheitsstation nur noch für Freunde."
	]
	quest.189F82BBD4851952.quest_subtitle: "Geht auf, wenn du kommst."
	quest.189F82BBD4851952.title: "&aBau eine Drucklufttür"
	quest.18AB2B55C51DA457.quest_desc: [
		"&6Magnet:&r redstone, gold and iron around a blank module. &6Void Junk:&r redstone, obsidian and ender pearls around a blank module."
		""
		"The magnet collects everything, Void Junk destroys cobblestone, dirt and the like. Remember: cobblestone counts for the obelisk only in stage 1. Against lava and water the &6Freezing&r upgrade helps."
	]
	quest.18AB2B55C51DA457.quest_subtitle: "Magnet and Void Junk."
	quest.18AB2B55C51DA457.title: "&bCollect and throw away junk"
	quest.18AD624776BFD260.quest_desc: [
		"&6Creature Salt&r: &6rotten flesh&r or &6bones&r into the Calcination Oven, one per piece."
		"&6Arrows&r into the Liquefaction Cauldron: one &6Arrow Sulfur&r per arrow."
		""
		"Arrow Sulfur on the Source Pedestal, an &6Ender Pearl Sulfur&r on the Target Pedestal. &e100&r flux per conversion. In the Incubator with Creature Salt and a Mercury Shard it becomes an &6ender pearl&r."
		""
		"Arrow Sulfur also becomes blaze rods and slime balls the same way. A skeleton farm thus becomes a pearl farm."
	]
	quest.18AD624776BFD260.quest_subtitle: "Reformation among creatures."
	quest.18AD624776BFD260.title: "&5Make Ender Pearls from Arrows"
	quest.18AEB2BD64542C78.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6source gem block&r in the middle, &6Wilden Horn&r, &6Spike&r, &6Wing&r, &5Wilden Tribute&r, &6gold ingot&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Summoned creatures last longer, are stronger and faster. Self spells also work on them as a copy. Ars Elemental turns it into the &6Focus of Necromancy&r with 2 wither roses, a wither skeleton skull and anima: your summons rise once more."
	]
	quest.18AEB2BD64542C78.quest_subtitle: "Stronger summons, with a tribute."
	quest.18AEB2BD64542C78.title: "&6Build the Focus of Summoning"
	quest.18B2462389B61992.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &62 purple&r, &62 green&r, &61 black&r petal, &6Rune of Earth&r, &6Rune of Pride&r, &6Pixie Dust&r."
		""
		"It eats apothecary flowers you plant around it. The more different ones in a row, the more mana."
	]
	quest.18B2462389B61992.quest_subtitle: "Eats flowers, the more colorful the better."
	quest.18B2462389B61992.title: "&6Plant a Rafflowsia"
	quest.18B75BDBBDC20C9A.quest_desc: [
		"&66 crying obsidian&r and &63 glowstone&r make a &6respawn anchor&r. Piglins trade you crying obsidian for gold."
		""
		"Charge it with glowstone blocks, up to &d4&r charges, and click it. If you die, you wake up in the Nether next to it; every respawn costs one charge."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r In the overworld it explodes when used, just like a bed in the Nether."
	]
	quest.18B75BDBBDC20C9A.quest_subtitle: "A bed that doesn't explode in the Nether."
	quest.18B75BDBBDC20C9A.title: "&5Build a respawn anchor"
	quest.18B77899B3CAA40B.quest_desc: [
		"Cowl, Robe Bottom and Boots from &6Manaweave Cloth&r. For the whole set you need &e24 cloth&r."
		""
		"Only with all four pieces do Botania's tools and rods cost much less mana, and the rods get stronger. Anyone who works a lot with rods is best off wearing this robe."
	]
	quest.18B77899B3CAA40B.quest_subtitle: "Only all four pieces bring the bonus."
	quest.18B77899B3CAA40B.title: "&6Complete the Manaweave robe"
	quest.18B85AFB69D742D5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Jade&r shows at the top of the screen what you are looking at: name, mod, for furnaces and machines the &eprogress&r, for tanks and batteries the &efill level&r, for chests the contents, for crops the growth, for mobs the health."
		""
		"Hold &eShift&r, then Jade shows more details. Which lines appear you set in the Jade menu, you find its key in the controls under Jade."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Jade also tells you which tool a block needs, and whether your pickaxe is good enough for it."
	]
	quest.18B85AFB69D742D5.quest_subtitle: "Jade shows what you are looking at."
	quest.18B85AFB69D742D5.title: "&eRead the Block in Front of You"
	quest.18BC64D28A326B3F.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6string&r, middle &6bone&r, &6pumpkin&r, &6rotten flesh&r, bottom &6gunpowder&r."
		""
		"Put the &6Fel Pumpkin&r on two stacked &6iron bars&r, like a snow golem. A &cblaze&r appears. It is weaker than a real one and drops some &6blaze powder&r instead of a blaze rod."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r Blaze powder plus an ender pearl gives eyes of ender, long before you find a Nether fortress."
	]
	quest.18BC64D28A326B3F.quest_subtitle: "Blaze powder without the Nether."
	quest.18BC64D28A326B3F.title: "&6Carve a Fel Pumpkin"
	quest.18BE4FEA72C52A2B.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Electrolytic Separator from &e2 mB water&r (2 mB hydrogen, 1 mB oxygen). The Pressurized Reaction Chamber makes it from coal, water and oxygen."
		"&eUsed by:&r gas generator, jetpack, ethene, hydrogen chloride."
	]
	quest.18BE4FEA72C52A2B.quest_subtitle: "Electrolytic Separator: water into hydrogen and oxygen."
	quest.18BE4FEA72C52A2B.title: "&fHydrogen"
	quest.18D3447E793BAC9F.quest_desc: [
		"A &6diamond&r under the Engineering Press, then finish it with &6redstone&r and &6Printed Silicon&r."
		""
		"Engineering Processors go into the ME Drive, the controller, P2P tunnels and the pattern encoding terminal."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The milestone &6Steel Core&r for stage 3 needs two Engineering Processors apiece, and the obelisk wants to see eight Steel Cores."
	]
	quest.18D3447E793BAC9F.quest_subtitle: "The most expensive of the three, and the most important."
	quest.18D3447E793BAC9F.title: "&b&lBuild Engineering Processors"
	quest.18D8DE96327D89F9.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6rotes Glas&r (Red Stained Glass) oben links, drei &6Pneumatic Cylinders&r, unten Compressed Iron, &6PCB&r, Compressed Iron."
		""
		"Auch der Laser muss direkt an die Plattform. Mit dem Programm &eLaser&r macht er aus 20 Pressure Chamber Valves acht &6Advanced Pressure Tubes&r, aus einem Empty PCB ein &6Unassembled PCB&r und aus einem Quarzblock vier Aphorism Tiles."
	]
	quest.18D8DE96327D89F9.quest_subtitle: "Schneidet, was der Bohrer nicht kann."
	quest.18D8DE96327D89F9.title: "&bBau einen Assembly Laser"
	quest.18DE4A64C81C52E7.quest_desc: [
		"Leg einem &6Phyg&r, dem geflügelten Schwein des Aethers, einen &6Sattel&r an und steig auf."
		""
		"Es fliegt nicht so weit und hoch wie ein Moa und gleitet langsam nach unten, aber dafür musst du es nicht erst ausbrüten. Phygs laufen überall auf den Wiesen herum."
	]
	quest.18DE4A64C81C52E7.quest_subtitle: "Schweine können doch fliegen."
	quest.18DE4A64C81C52E7.title: "&dSattel ein Phyg"
	quest.18EEE34AB9BDB8CB.quest_desc: [
		"Sägewerk, Entrinder und Pollensieber haben je &e4 Upgrade-Slots&r für die Zeit-Upgrades von Productive Lib. &6Upgrade: Speed&r ist eine Upgrade-Basis mit vier Uhren und vier Honigwabenblöcken."
		""
		"&eSägewerk und Sieber:&r jedes Speed-Upgrade plus eine Geschwindigkeitsstufe, vier Stück machen das Sägewerk fünfmal so schnell, ein Stamm in 2 Sekunden. &6Upgrade: Speedier&r zählt doppelt, braucht aber Netherstern und Herz des Meeres."
		"&eEntrinder:&r jedes Speed-Upgrade entrindet &e4 Blöcke&r pro halbe Sekunde statt einem, Speedier 8. Die Axt verliert entsprechend mehr Haltbarkeit."
		""
		"&cStufe 2:&r Die &6Upgrade-Basis&r braucht ein &6Honey Treat&r aus Productive Bees, das Rezept steht im Kapitel &6Bienen&r. Vorher läuft alles in der Grundgeschwindigkeit."
	]
	quest.18EEE34AB9BDB8CB.quest_subtitle: "Sägewerk, Entrinder und Sieb werden schneller."
	quest.18EEE34AB9BDB8CB.title: "&6Ausblick: Zeit-Upgrades"
	quest.18F0A7B8A9B56687.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/powah_orb.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Energizing Rod (Starter):&r nether quartz at the top, two Tiny left and right of the casing, a vertical Dielectric Rod at the bottom."
		""
		"Put the rods within &e4 blocks&r around the orb and give each power from below: a cable, a cell or a generator. If a rod does not join in, link it with the &6Wrench&r in the mode &eLink&r."
		""
		"A Starter rod pushes &e100 FE/t&r. Several rods work together."
	]
	quest.18F0A7B8A9B56687.quest_subtitle: "The rods bring the power."
	quest.18F0A7B8A9B56687.title: "&eSet up Energizing Rods"
	quest.18F2861A799E6CC9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_ride.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Leg einem erwachsenen, selbst gezogenen Moa einen &6Sattel&r an und steig auf. Mit der Sprungtaste springst du, und in der Luft noch einmal: &e3-mal&r beim blauen, &e4-mal&r beim weißen, &e8-mal&r beim schwarzen Moa. Die Anzeige über der Hungerleiste zeigt die restlichen Sprünge, am Boden füllen sie sich auf."
		""
		"So kommst du zwischen den Inseln hin und her, ohne Brücken zu bauen. Ein Sturz ins Leere endet trotzdem in der Oberwelt, also mit Fallschirm fliegen."
		""
		"&eAuch ein Reittier:&r &6Phygs&r, die fliegenden Schweine, lassen sich satteln und gleiten langsam nach unten. Kein Ersatz für ein Moa, aber lustig."
	]
	quest.18F2861A799E6CC9.quest_subtitle: "Sprünge in der Luft, so viele wie die Farbe erlaubt."
	quest.18F2861A799E6CC9.title: "&eReite ein Moa"
	quest.18F38B9AEDA7F6B0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Energy Card:&r like the Item Card, only with a redstone block in place of lapis."
		""
		"An Energy Card manages up to &d1,000,000 FE/t&r. An extract card at the generator, insert cards at every machine, and the power grid without cables is done."
	]
	quest.18F38B9AEDA7F6B0.quest_subtitle: "Up to a million FE per tick."
	quest.18F38B9AEDA7F6B0.title: "&cSend power by laser"
	quest.18FE9C1329DBE9BB.quest_desc: [
		"An &6emerald&r in the middle, &64 ender pearls&r on the sides, &64 Source Gems&r from Ars Nouveau in the corners make the &6Warp Stone&r."
		""
		"{image:waystones:textures/item/warp_stone.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Hold right click until it is charged, then you pick an activated waystone. After that it needs a cooldown, shown in the tooltip."
	]
	quest.18FE9C1329DBE9BB.quest_subtitle: "Travel from anywhere."
	quest.18FE9C1329DBE9BB.title: "&6Build a Warp Stone"
	quest.190EC49EB41141C7.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Item Pipes&r at the top, &6Fluid Pipe&r, &6Motor&r, Fluid Pipe in the middle, three Item Pipes at the bottom make the &6Pipe Booster&r."
		""
		"With power and placed right at an &eextracting&r pipe section it pulls a whole stack per tick from the inventory, for fluids up to 50 buckets per tick."
	]
	quest.190EC49EB41141C7.quest_subtitle: "One stack per tick."
	quest.190EC49EB41141C7.title: "&9Speed Up Pipes with the Pipe Booster"
	quest.19169A02C0545372.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6zirconium ingots&r in the corners, &6glass&r on the sides, middle empty. Gives one &6Solid Fuel Cell&r."
		""
		"Every cell in the reactor makes heat and power. More cells means more of both and faster consumption."
	]
	quest.19169A02C0545372.quest_subtitle: "Where the fission happens."
	quest.19169A02C0545372.title: "&aBuild Fuel Cells"
	quest.191E3FF2B0EB77D9.quest_desc: [
		"Soularium, &6Broken Spawner&r, Soularium at the top, Soularium, &6Ensouled Chassis&r, Soularium in the middle, &6Vibrant Crystal&r, &6Z-Logic Controller&r, Vibrant Crystal at the bottom. In the Soul Binder it gets its mob from a full Soul Vial."
		""
		"It has two modes: &espawn mobs&r or &ecapture mobs&r. If there are too many mobs or too many spawners nearby, it stops and shows the reason in its window."
		""
		"With a Vacuum Chest and the sword The Ender or a Mob Crusher next to it, this becomes a farm."
	]
	quest.191E3FF2B0EB77D9.quest_subtitle: "A spawner that runs on power."
	quest.191E3FF2B0EB77D9.title: "&cBuild a Powered Spawner"
	quest.191E5992C63081AB.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &62 gray&r, &61 yellow&r, &61 green&r, &61 red&r petal, &6Rune of Pride&r, &6Rune of Greed&r, &6Redstone Root&r, &6Pixie Dust&r."
		""
		"With mana it gradually turns &estone&r near it into ores. A Mechanical Drill mines the ores, a Deployer places new stone."
		""
		"The &6Orechid Ignem&r does the same with netherrack, but only in the Nether."
	]
	quest.191E5992C63081AB.quest_subtitle: "Stone becomes ore."
	quest.191E5992C63081AB.title: "&6Plant an Orechid"
	quest.192FB7D25FFEA23C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Stage 3:&r &6VoidShimmer Goo&r, woken with chorus fruit or ender pearls, turns diamond blocks into &6Celestigem&r. With it come the &eadvanced machines&r with area and filter (breaker, placer, dropper, sensor, clicker), the &6Energy Transmitter&r for wireless power, Celestigem tools with a 5x5 hammer and drop teleporter, the Paxel and the Voidshift Wand."
		""
		"&6Stage 4:&r &6Shadowpulse Goo&r (sculk) turns netherite blocks into &6Eclipse Alloy&r: 7x7 hammer, flight, lava protection. Plus the &6time crystals&r, which ripen in the Overworld, Nether and End one after another, the &6Time Wand&r, which speeds up blocks up to 256 times, the &6Paradox Machine&r, which brings back mined raw ore blocks and mobs from a snapshot, and the Portal Gun V2."
	]
	quest.192FB7D25FFEA23C.quest_subtitle: "What stage 3 and 4 open."
	quest.192FB7D25FFEA23C.title: "&dOutlook on Celestigem"
	quest.1931ED5B42A4DB77.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6Ferricore Ingots&r in the corners, a &6dispenser&r in the middle, an &6eye of ender&r on top, &6redstone&r at the bottom, &6lapis&r left and right."
		""
		"The &6Simple Clicker&r clicks on whatever is in front of it like a player, with the item from its slot or with an empty hand. Buttons for right, left or hold click, sneaking, target (block, air, monsters, animals, adults, children, players) and direction. &eShow Fake Player&r shows where it clicks."
		""
		"&eFor the goo line:&r A clicker with &6sugar&r in its slot, target block, pointed at the goo, wakes it up again when it dies. With shears it shears sheep, with a sword it kills mobs from a spawner."
	]
	quest.1931ED5B42A4DB77.quest_subtitle: "Right click, left click, hold, automatically."
	quest.1931ED5B42A4DB77.title: "&cBuild the Clicker"
	quest.193A0D3F29761CB0.quest_desc: [
		"In the Depths the &6Denizens&r live in camps with a campfire. Find one."
		""
		"&cDo not destroy their campfire:&r That turns everyone nearby against you."
		""
		"The camp chests hold Mysterious Masks and totems. You can make a totem yourself too: an Ancient Root for 10 seconds in the Infuser."
	]
	quest.193A0D3F29761CB0.quest_subtitle: "The inhabitants of the Depths."
	quest.193A0D3F29761CB0.title: "&6Find a Denizen Camp"
	quest.193C649EBF3BADD6.quest_desc: [
		"Slay each kind once. Each drops &6Utheric Shards&r."
		""
		"&6Rotling:&r small and weak."
		"&6Rotwalker:&r fast and big."
		"&6Rotbeast:&r heavy, takes a lot."
		"&6Rotbelcher:&r spits from a distance."
	]
	quest.193C649EBF3BADD6.quest_subtitle: "All four kinds, all give shards."
	quest.193C649EBF3BADD6.title: "&4Checklist: Rotspawn"
	quest.193FA889F193EA2D.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Hedyrin's Lure."
		"&6Bowls:&r &e4 sticks&r, &e2 string&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r a &6cow&r."
		""
		"The deer gives speed and jump boost and lets you walk up whole blocks. Whoever travels on foot a lot takes it first."
	]
	quest.193FA889F193EA2D.quest_subtitle: "Speed, jump boost, step assist."
	quest.193FA889F193EA2D.title: "&dSummon a Deer"
	quest.19418287F3BACF7D.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Photoelectric Panes&r at the top (a glass pane with lapis and paste), two Tiny left and right of the casing, three paste at the bottom."
		""
		"&eFE/t:&r Starter 20, Basic 60, Hardened 100, Blazing 200, Niotic 400, Spirited 800. With a &6Lens Of Ender&r on it, it sees through blocks."
	]
	quest.19418287F3BACF7D.quest_subtitle: "Power from the sky, by day only."
	quest.19418287F3BACF7D.title: "&eLay out a Solar Panel"
	quest.19442DD35A319456.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pressure Disperser:&r steel in the corners, iron bars on the sides, alloy in the middle. They fill the whole layer around the Rotational Complex, each lets &e1,280 mB&r of steam through per tick."
		""
		"&6Electromagnetic Coil:&r steel, gold and an Energy Tablet. Coils sit above the complex, touch it and each other, &eone coil for every four blades&r."
	]
	quest.19442DD35A319456.quest_subtitle: "The layer around the complex."
	quest.19442DD35A319456.title: "&7Build dispersers and coils"
	quest.1946B09BF07B2AA9.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Draconic Chestpiece&r with at least one &6Draconic Undying Module&r: it catches one deadly hit, then recharges. Fill the rest of the grid with shield modules and energy."
		""
		"How to build both is in the chapter &5Draconic: Awakened and Chaos&r. Whoever has no Draconic armor takes totems along, see &ePack Your Bags&r."
	]
	quest.1946B09BF07B2AA9.quest_subtitle: "Shield and a second life."
	quest.1946B09BF07B2AA9.title: "&dEquip the Draconic Chestpiece"
	quest.1946BDB9D5AB99DC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/the_end_crystals.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Place &64 End Crystals&r on the rim of the exit portal, one on each side. A crystal is &67 glass&r, an &6eye of ender&r and a &6ghast tear&r."
		""
		"Pillars, crystals and cages come back, the dragon appears, the bell of YUNG's Better End Island rings."
		""
		"&eWhy:&r Every dragon brings a heart, an egg, 8 scales, dragon's breath and about &e64 draconium dust&r. And everyone who missed the first time gets their chance."
	]
	quest.1946BDB9D5AB99DC.quest_subtitle: "Four crystals on the rim of the portal."
	quest.1946BDB9D5AB99DC.title: "&dSummon the Dragon Again"
	quest.194B37408D83BEE1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Awakened nuggets&r at the top and bottom, in the middle &6Wyvern Energy Module, Wyvern Core, Wyvern Energy Module&r."
		""
		"It stores &d16 million&r energy and charges at &d256,000&r per tick. Bows, shield and flight draw a lot in the fight, so several belong in the bow and the chestpiece."
	]
	quest.194B37408D83BEE1.quest_subtitle: "16 million per module."
	quest.194B37408D83BEE1.title: "&dBuild a Draconic Energy Module"
	quest.195ADCC0BB0D868B.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Arcane Anvil&r (on Kronwerke three source gem blocks, a diamond, an anvil between two polished deepslate) is locked on Kronwerke until &6stage 2&r, just like Uncommon and Rare Ink."
		""
		"&eWhat it can do:&r A scroll plus the ink of the next higher rarity raises the spell one level. A spell book or armor piece plus an &6Upgrade Orb&r gets up to &e3 upgrades&r (mana, cooldown, protection or the spell power of a school). A sword plus a scroll becomes a spell weapon."
		""
		"The orbs need &6Mithril&r (Overworld below Y -38, only with a netherite pickaxe) and &6Cinder Essence&r from Ancient Knights in the Nether. The kind comes from an empty orb and eight runes. So collect runes and mithril ore already now."
	]
	quest.195ADCC0BB0D868B.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade scrolls, improve armor, enchant weapons."
	quest.195ADCC0BB0D868B.title: "&cOutlook: Arcane Anvil"
	quest.1966207637FA2283.quest_desc: [
		"The rolling mill makes two &6iron wires&r from one &6iron sheet&r. Four iron wires in a diamond shape make two &6barbed wire&r."
		""
		"Whoever walks through takes damage. As a fence around the base it stops monsters, in a mob farm shaft it helps finish them off."
	]
	quest.1966207637FA2283.quest_subtitle: "Crafts & Additions: protection for the farm."
	quest.1966207637FA2283.title: "&6Put up barbed wire"
	quest.196C6C2FCAF9CE9A.quest_desc: [
		"If you die, a &6body&r with all your gear stays behind. Walk back, &eright click&r opens it like a chest. The JourneyMap waypoint leads you there, and with &eU&r you open the &6death history&r with location, time and dimension of every death."
		""
		"An empty body disappears after 30 seconds, a full one never. After an hour it becomes a skeleton, the contents stay."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r On Kronwerke &eanyone&r can open your body. Whoever dies in the mining dimension should hurry or ask a friend."
	]
	quest.196C6C2FCAF9CE9A.quest_subtitle: "Your body stays behind, the waypoint points to it."
	quest.196C6C2FCAF9CE9A.title: "&cGet your things back"
	quest.196F5378B667B85E.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 glass panes&r around a &bSpirit Attuned Gem&r make &6Lenses&r. In Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion with &e2 silver&r and &e1 gold ingot&r (Foliot book) they become &6Infused Lenses&r."
		"Lenses at the bottom, &6Lens Frame&r (6 Otherstone, 2 silver) above, &e3 leather&r added: the goggles."
		""
		"The goggles give permanent Third Eye without side effects. With them you see Iesnium ore in netherrack. You can only mine it with an Infused or Iesnium Pickaxe."
	]
	quest.196F5378B667B85E.quest_subtitle: "See what hides in netherrack."
	quest.196F5378B667B85E.title: "&6Build the Otherworld Goggles"
	quest.1972D89B7EF32F06.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6iron sheet&r on top, &6redstone&r in the middle, &6Train Casing&r at the bottom give a &6Train Coupler&r. Right click a track with it and place it next to it, like a station."
		""
		"The coupler marks two points on the track. If the middle of a bogey stands over each point, both cars facing the same way, a &credstone signal&r couples the trains or separates them. With the wrench you switch between coupling, uncoupling and both, scrolling with the wrench changes the distance between the two points."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A station directly in front of it helps with alignment. That way a freight train swaps its cars at the platform while the locomotive drives on. The Ponder view (&eW&r) shows the whole process."
	]
	quest.1972D89B7EF32F06.quest_subtitle: "Couple and uncouple cars without taking the train apart."
	quest.1972D89B7EF32F06.title: "&6Place a Train Coupler"
	quest.197804BC1727BDAC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/powah_transmitter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Aerial Pearl&r: an ender pearl in the middle, paste and iron bars around it. A right click with it on a &6zombie&r or a &6husk&r makes a &6Player Aerial Pearl&r. Transmitter: the pearl at the top, Tiny, casing, Tiny, a vertical rod at the bottom."
		""
		"Plus a &6Binding Card&r (two rods to the Blank Card, with redstone and rotten flesh). A right click binds it to you, and it goes into the transmitter."
		""
		"It then charges the powered items in your inventory, Starter at &e500 FE/t&r. Use the card on an enderman or an endermite, then it becomes the &6Dimensional&r card."
	]
	quest.197804BC1727BDAC.quest_subtitle: "The Player Transmitter."
	quest.197804BC1727BDAC.title: "&dCharge your tools anywhere"
	quest.1978F0DBCC126085.quest_desc: [
		"The Purifying Factory alone does little if basic machines are waiting behind it. Upgrade the &6Crushing Factory&r, &6Enriching Factory&r and &6Smelting Factory&r to advanced too, each with the Advanced Tier Installer."
		""
		"Then five ores run at every station at once, and the advanced transporters keep up. Put the same upgrades into all factories, otherwise things back up in front of the slowest."
	]
	quest.1978F0DBCC126085.quest_subtitle: "Five slots at every station."
	quest.1978F0DBCC126085.title: "&a&lUpgrade the whole line"
	quest.197AD24AEA823E90.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluix Upgrade:&r shapeless from paper and a Fluix Crystal. At the smithing table the template, a &6quartz pickaxe&r (certus or nether quartz) and a &6fluix block&r come together."
		""
		"Fluix tools are like iron, but last three times as long and hit a little harder. Each works as if it had at least &eFortune I&r or &eLooting I&r, with no enchanting table at all."
		""
		"Just right for nether quartz, which you need in bulk for fluix."
	]
	quest.197AD24AEA823E90.quest_subtitle: "Iron, only three times as durable."
	quest.197AD24AEA823E90.title: "&5Forge a Fluix Pickaxe"
	quest.197AFF566957D32D.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Kinetische Batterie&r (Präzisionsgetriebe, Messingrahmen, Eisenbleche, Redstone) nimmt Rotation auf und gibt sie später wieder ab. Die &6Batterie&r von Power Grid speichert Strom im Power-Grid-Netz, die &6Tragbare Batterie&r ist dasselbe für die Tasche."
		""
		"&eCrafts & Additions, Netzanschlüsse:&r der kleine &6Anschluss&r trägt &d1 000 FE/t&r über 16 Blöcke Draht, der &6Große Anschluss&r &d5 000 FE/t&r über 32 Blöcke, mit einer Kupferspule in der Hand verbindest du zwei. Der &6Modulare Akkumulator&r (2 Millionen FE je Block, bis 3 x 3 x 5 Blöcke, also 90 Millionen, je 5 000 FE/t rein und raus) kommt in Stufe 3. Offen ab Stufe 2."
	]
	quest.197AFF566957D32D.quest_subtitle: "Create Connected, Power Grid und Crafts & Additions: Batterien und Netzanschlüsse."
	quest.197AFF566957D32D.title: "&6Speichere Rotation und FE bei Create"
	quest.197EC4C400B2FEF2.quest_desc: [
		"Hitze wandert von Block zu Block, immer vom heißen zum kalten, und nur zwischen Blöcken, die Hitze kennen. &bLava&r neben einer Maschine heizt sie und wird dabei langsam zu &7Obsidian&r. &6Magma&r heizt und wird zu Netherrack. Fackeln und Lagerfeuer heizen nur schwach."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Der &6Lohenbrenner&r von Create ist eine Hitzequelle, die &enicht verbraucht&r wird. Entzündet überträgt er gut, überhitzt (mit Lohenkuchen) noch fünfmal besser. Du hast einen im Startpaket dieser Stufe. Stell ihn direkt an die Raffinerie und spar dir das Wirbelrohr fürs Erste."
		""
		"&bKälte&r kommt von Eis, Packeis, Blaueis und Schnee, die dabei schmelzen. Ein &6Druckeisenblock&r leitet Hitze fast ohne Widerstand weiter, ein &6Wärmerohr&r (Heat Pipe: Wärmedämmung um Druckeisenblöcke, sechs Stück) genauso, nur ohne Verlust an die Luft."
		""
		"Ein normaler &6Ofen&r neben einer heißen Maschine braucht ab 100 Grad keinen Brennstoff mehr, er läuft auf der Hitze. Das gilt auch für Schmelzofen und Räucherofen."
		""
		"&cStufe 3:&r Der fortgeschrittene Luft- und der fortgeschrittene Flüssigkeitskompressor erzeugen beim Arbeiten selbst Hitze und müssen gekühlt werden, die Hitze heizt dann nebenbei die Raffinerie."
	]
	quest.197EC4C400B2FEF2.quest_subtitle: "Lava, Magma, Lohenbrenner, Eis."
	quest.197EC4C400B2FEF2.title: "&cWas heizt und was kühlt"
	quest.1985BAF435D6A8A8.quest_desc: [
		"Fill the cauldron with water, heat it from below, &e8 Animal Fat&r (or candles and honeycomb) in. The water becomes liquid &6tallow&r."
		""
		"A glass bottle fills a &6Bottle of Tallow&r (250 mB), a full bottle tips the tallow back in."
	]
	quest.1985BAF435D6A8A8.quest_subtitle: "Fat becomes fluid."
	quest.1985BAF435D6A8A8.title: "&6Melt tallow"
	quest.199036A08D2100E8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Runic Stone&r is rare rock with glowing signs, below &eY 2&r, most common below Y -20, also as Runic Deepslate and Runic Darkstone. Mined, it gives a &6Rune&r, more with Fortune. With Silk Touch the stone stays whole and can be smelted into a rune in the furnace."
		""
		"{image:forbidden_arcanus:textures/item/rune.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"You need runes for the &6Test Tube&r (glass bottle and rune), the &6Quantum Core&r and &6Runic Glass&r (eight glass around a rune). Four runes are enough for now."
	]
	quest.199036A08D2100E8.quest_subtitle: "Stones with signs on them."
	quest.199036A08D2100E8.title: "&3Break Runic Stone"
	quest.199342F33A3546F7.quest_desc: [
		"Draconic tier. Catalyst: a &6Draconic injector&r. In nine injectors: &64 diamonds&r, &64 Large Chaos Fragments&r, a &5dragon egg&r. Costs 8 million energy."
		""
		"A Chaotic injector charges in 3 seconds. You get a new dragon egg from every dragon."
	]
	quest.199342F33A3546F7.quest_subtitle: "The last tier of fusion."
	quest.199342F33A3546F7.title: "&8Fuse Chaotic Injectors"
	quest.199535D60605F9A5.quest_desc: [
		"Place an &6enchanting table&r and hover over the bars. Apothic Enchanting works with four values: &bEterna&r is the level maximum (one bookshelf gives 2, fifteen give level 30). &dQuanta&r is the randomness up and down, &5Arcana&r makes rare enchantments more common and from 25 percent always gives two, from 75 always three enchantments."
		""
		"&eClues&r are the lines in the preview, every table has one. Put an item in and click the &equestion mark&r top right: there you see for every slot which enchantments are in it with which chance."
		""
		"&cWorld tier:&r Your Eterna is capped by the world tier. Haven 30, Frontier 45, Ascent 60, Summit 75 (Wither, stage 2), Pinnacle 100 (dragon, stage 4). The table tells you in the tooltip when the limit applies."
		""
		"Level costs are fair with Apotheosis: you always pay as much experience as if you had exactly the levels required, no matter how many you have right now."
	]
	quest.199535D60605F9A5.quest_subtitle: "Four values instead of one."
	quest.199535D60605F9A5.title: "&b&lLook into the Enchanting Table"
	quest.199B3CD9BAEC1C95.quest_desc: [
		"&6Aechor Plants&r sind die großen, grünen Pflanzen mit Zähnen, die auf dem Gras sitzen und nicht laufen können. Sie spucken &6Poison Needles&r. Komm von hinten oder von oben, dann lassen sie ein &6Aechor Petal&r fallen, mit Plünderung mehr."
		""
		"{image:aether:textures/item/materials/aechor_petal.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Rechtsklick mit einem &6Skyroot Bucket&r auf eine lebende Pflanze füllt ihn mit &6Gift&r, Zutat für Poison Darts und, im Altar verzaubert, für den &6Remedy Bucket&r gegen Vergiftung."
		""
		"Eine Blume auf Enchanted Grass neben deinem Haus hält Aechor Plants vom Spawnen ab."
	]
	quest.199B3CD9BAEC1C95.quest_subtitle: "Das Lieblingsfutter der Moas, mit Dornen."
	quest.199B3CD9BAEC1C95.title: "&dPflück Aechor Petals"
	quest.199E588067D9CF9F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r iron in the corners, crafting tables at the top and bottom, an Annihilation Core on the left, a &6Precision Mechanism&r from Create in the middle, a Formation Core on the right."
		""
		"The provider pushes the ingredients of a pattern into the block next to it and takes the result back. It needs one channel. Put your crafting pattern into it."
	]
	quest.199E588067D9CF9F.quest_subtitle: "It sends the ingredients off."
	quest.199E588067D9CF9F.title: "&aBuild a pattern provider"
	quest.19AC1C924F37C21D.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ophyx' Calling."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6block of coal&r, a &6gold ingot&r, an &6iron ingot&r, a &6furnace&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book, 120 seconds. Its Book of Calling appears with it."
		""
		"With the book you link the Storage Actuator, the machine and, if you like, a separate extraction point. In the Actuator you then set what should be processed: the Djinni brings the ingredients to the machine and the result back into storage."
		""
		"It can also empty a chest into storage at regular intervals."
	]
	quest.19AC1C924F37C21D.quest_subtitle: "The storage serves your machines."
	quest.19AC1C924F37C21D.title: "&dSummon a Djinni Machine Operator"
	quest.19B62475343876E0.quest_desc: [
		"Eisen im Goo-Block zu Ferricore, drei Barren über zwei Stöcken. Upgrades am Schmiedetisch: Erzadern, Erzsuche, Baumfällen, Mob Scanner. Kapitel &aJust Dire Things&r."
		""
		"500 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 7, +2,5 Schaden, Eisen-Abbaustufe. Die Rüstung nimmt Step Assist, Sprung und Laufgeschwindigkeit."
	]
	quest.19B62475343876E0.quest_subtitle: "Just Dire Things: Werkzeug mit Upgrades."
	quest.19B62475343876E0.title: "&7Schmiede Ferricore"
	quest.19BBEBE3BC261DCA.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Stahlgehäuse in die Mitte, &6Ultimative Steuerschaltkreise&r links und rechts, Einfache Chemikalienbehälter oben und unten, &6Raffiniertes Obsidian&r in die Ecken. Ultimative Schaltkreise sind &6Stufe 4&r (ein Elite-Schaltkreis zwischen zwei Atomlegierungen)."
		""
		"&eWas herauskommt:&r Ein Erzblock gibt &e1 000 mB Schmutzigen Schlamm&r, drei Rohe Erze &e2 000 mB&r, ein Block aus Rohem Erz &e6 000 mB&r. Dabei rund 1 mB Schwefelsäure pro Tick und etwa &d160 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Schlamm ist ein Gas. Er geht in Druckschläuche oder Chemikalienbehälter, nie in eine Kiste. Jedes Metall hat seinen eigenen Schlamm, misch die Leitungen nicht."
	]
	quest.19BBEBE3BC261DCA.quest_subtitle: "Aus Erz wird Schlamm. Stufe 4."
	quest.19BBEBE3BC261DCA.title: "&d&lBau eine Chemische Auflösungskammer"
	quest.19C83A4649BF475E.quest_desc: [
		"A &6copper ingot&r and a &6brass nugget&r give the &6Conductor Whistle&r. Right click your conductor sitting on a train with it, then it is bound to them. Right click a track or a station, and the train comes there."
		"{image:railways:textures/item/conductor_whistle.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"A deployer with the whistle can call a train to a station, and a click into the air cancels the trip again."
		""
		"The &6Remote Lens&r (Precision Mechanism, eye of ender, brass sheet) you bind to a conductor with &6Engineer's Goggles&r. After that you see through their eyes, even when the train is at the other end of the map."
	]
	quest.19C83A4649BF475E.quest_subtitle: "Conductor Whistle and Remote Lens."
	quest.19C83A4649BF475E.title: "&6Whistle for the Train"
	quest.19CF0376D422B0A7.quest_desc: [
		"Two steps: 36 Basic reactors become 36 &8Hardened&r ones (2,500 FE/t) with Hardened Capacitors and uraninite, which then become 36 &6Blazing&r ones with Blazing Capacitors. The pattern is always the same: four old blocks in the corners, four capacitors on the sides, uraninite in the middle."
		""
		"A Blazing reactor makes up to &e10,000 FE/t&r, more than twelve Blazing Furnators. Cool it with Dry Ice and keep feeding coal and redstone."
		""
		"&eDo not forget the cables:&r from here on Basic cables (2,000 FE/t) are no longer enough."
	]
	quest.19CF0376D422B0A7.quest_subtitle: "Ten thousand FE per tick."
	quest.19CF0376D422B0A7.title: "&6&lBuild a Blazing reactor"
	quest.19D95AC6E580C602.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Copper Sheets&r and a &6copper ingot&r make four &6Fluid Pipes&r. They connect by themselves to tanks, basins and other mods' machines."
		""
		"Pipes alone move nothing; for that you need a pump. An open end in water pulls it from the world. A &6Fluid Valve&r (pipe and Iron Sheet) closes the line."
	]
	quest.19D95AC6E580C602.quest_subtitle: "Water where you need it."
	quest.19D95AC6E580C602.title: "&6Lay fluid pipes"
	quest.19DAA25D08DA54B3.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Empty Fan Catalyst&r (brass ingot and iron bars) goes in front of the fan. Right click with a water bucket, lava bucket or soul sand makes it washing, smelting or haunting."
		""
		"No water that runs off, no lava that sets something on fire. More catalysts are in &6Create: Addons&r."
	]
	quest.19DAA25D08DA54B3.quest_subtitle: "Create Connected: fan catalysts."
	quest.19DAA25D08DA54B3.title: "&6Wash without a water block"
	quest.19DCC02A7DC489B3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crafty Crate&r: at the top Dreamwood planks, &6crafting table&r, Dreamwood planks, below that two Dreamwood planks each on the left and right. &6Crafting Placeholder&r: crafting table and Livingrock, shapeless, make &e32&r."
		""
		"The crate fills its 9 slots from top left to bottom right. A placeholder stands for an empty slot. Once all 9 slots are filled, it crafts at once and throws out the result, placeholders and leftovers."
		""
		"A right click with the Wand of the Forest crafts at once and throws out the contents, a dispenser with the wand can do that too. Patterns on the crate lock fixed slots like placeholders."
	]
	quest.19DCC02A7DC489B3.quest_subtitle: "A crafting table that understands hoppers."
	quest.19DCC02A7DC489B3.title: "&6Build a Crafty Crate"
	quest.19E6B4F9832A34B0.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Jetpack&r is a recipe for the crafting units: a &6Copper Backtank&r in the middle, an &6elytra&r below it, two &6Precision Mechanisms&r, a shaft, four chutes and six &6brass sheets&r around it. The elytra only exists in the End, and that opens with &6stage 4&r."
		""
		"It flies on the backtank's compressed air, which you charge at a shaft as usual: &ejump&r rises, &esneak&r sinks, &eG&r toggles the engine, &eH&r hover mode. One fill lasts 450 seconds of flight or 900 seconds of hovering. With a Netherite Backtank or at the Smithing Table with netherite it becomes the &6Netherite Jetpack&r."
		""
		"Until then: backtank and diving gear from &6Create&r stage 1 already pay off now, and the backtank is half the recipe later."
	]
	quest.19E6B4F9832A34B0.quest_subtitle: "Create Jetpack needs an elytra, so stage 4."
	quest.19E6B4F9832A34B0.title: "&7Fly with Compressed Air"
	quest.19EA6DAA0CE81B6C.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a &6gold ingot&r to a &6piglin&r. After a few seconds it throws something back at you."
		""
		"&eWhat you get:&r ender pearls, fire resistance, obsidian, crying obsidian, string, quartz, leather, soul sand, iron nuggets, spectral arrows, rarely a book with Soul Speed."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A piglin in a boat behind glass, a hopper below, and you have a small trading factory."
	]
	quest.19EA6DAA0CE81B6C.quest_subtitle: "Throw an ingot, see what comes."
	quest.19EA6DAA0CE81B6C.title: "&eTrade with a piglin"
	quest.19FA704D6B46F06D.quest_desc: [
		"Some &6Forgotten&r in the catacombs carry a &6Cloggrum Battleaxe&r. Slay them until one drops it. You cannot craft it."
		""
		"At the smithing table, with template and Forgotten Ingot, it becomes the &6Forgotten Battleaxe&r."
	]
	quest.19FA704D6B46F06D.quest_subtitle: "The only source of the Cloggrum Battleaxe."
	quest.19FA704D6B46F06D.title: "&7Take the Battleaxe from a Forgotten"
	quest.1A0BED7B0A6A3FBA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_transmitter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Den &6Sculksender&r findest du in der Geheimtruhe des Antiken Tempels. &eRechtsklick auf eine Truhe&r, ein Fass, einen Ofen, eine Werkbank, einen Amboss oder einen Zaubertisch verbindet ihn. &eRechtsklick in die Luft&r öffnet den verbundenen Block, egal wo du bist, auch aus einer anderen Dimension."
		""
		"Der Tooltip zeigt Position und Dimension. Mit einem Farbstoff färbst du ihn, so unterscheidest du mehrere. Ist der Chunk nicht geladen, meldet er das und passiert nichts."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Ein Sender auf der Lagerkiste zu Hause, und du holst dir am Obelisken Nachschub für das Stufenziel, ohne zurückzulaufen."
	]
	quest.1A0BED7B0A6A3FBA.quest_subtitle: "Deine Truhe, von überall aus."
	quest.1A0BED7B0A6A3FBA.title: "&bVerbinde einen Sculksender"
	quest.1A12D84D157968AD.quest_desc: [
		"Plant the four element seeds and collect &e40&r of each essence: Air, Earth, Water, Fire."
		""
		"The &6Awakening Altar&r in &cstage 4&r needs exactly these four essences in its &6Essence Vessels&r, each vessel holds up to 40 of one kind. If you grow them now, the stock is already in storage then."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Element seeds give extra yield on Inferium Farmland."
	]
	quest.1A12D84D157968AD.quest_subtitle: "Forty of each element for later."
	quest.1A12D84D157968AD.title: "&bBuild an Element Stock"
	quest.1A2054719BDD8AD1.quest_desc: [
		"Stumble upon a &6stronghold&r and tick this off. &6YUNG's Better Strongholds&r builds them bigger, with libraries, prisons and traps."
		""
		"You only find them on purpose with eyes of ender, and those need blaze powder from the Nether (stage 2). The End portal inside only opens in stage 4."
	]
	quest.1A2054719BDD8AD1.quest_subtitle: "YUNG's Better Strongholds, deep underground."
	quest.1A2054719BDD8AD1.title: "&5Find a stronghold"
	quest.1A2AC9C2E76DB05F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/flux_networks_setup_reactor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Setz einen &6Stecker&r direkt an den Powah-Reaktor oder an die Energiezelle dahinter und schalte am Stecker &eChunk laden&r ein. Zu Hause ein &6Punkt&r pro Maschine. Mehr ist es nicht."
		""
		"Ein Spirited-Reaktor macht bis zu &d100.000 FE/t&r und gibt bis zu &d400.000 FE/t&r ab, der Stecker nimmt &d800.000&r. Ein Stecker reicht also für den ganzen Reaktor, auch für die Nitro-Stufe aus Stufe 4."
		""
		"So steht das Kraftwerk da, wo das Uraninit liegt, und die Basis da, wo es schön ist. Das geht auch über Dimensionen hinweg. Wie der Reaktor gebaut und gekühlt wird, steht im Kapitel &bPowah&r."
	]
	quest.1A2AC9C2E76DB05F.quest_subtitle: "Powah-Reaktor hier, Basis dort."
	quest.1A2AC9C2E76DB05F.title: "&aReaktorstrom in die Ferne"
	quest.1A2F1D25417D3AEE.quest_desc: [
		"Das &6Mining Gadget&r speichert 1 000 000 FE und braucht 200 FE pro Block. Am &6Modification Table&r steckst du Upgrades hinein."
		""
		"Reichweite, Größe 3x3, Glück oder Behutsamkeit, Magnet, Müll-Löschen, Licht setzen, Lava einfrieren. Batterie 1 bis 3 bringen 2, 5 und 10 Millionen FE, Stufe 3 der Upgrades kommt in Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.1A2F1D25417D3AEE.quest_subtitle: "Mining Gadgets: ein Laser statt einer Spitzhacke."
	quest.1A2F1D25417D3AEE.title: "&bBau das Mining Gadget"
	quest.1A33962F72337913.quest_desc: [
		"&eHarvest&r erntet jede reife Pflanze und jeden Baum im &eArea&r. Aufsammeln tut sie nichts, dafür wieder &ePick up Items&r dahinter oder eine Sammeldrohne."
		""
		"Lass sie eine &6Hacke&r importieren, dann pflanzt sie &enach&r. Mit Haken bei &eRequires Hoe&r erntet sie nur mit Hacke und holt sich eine neue, wenn die alte bricht. Ein Filter rechts mit dem Samen bestimmt, welche Pflanze sie erntet."
		""
		"Das war die Grundausstattung. Alles weitere (Bedingungen, Schleifen, Flüssigkeiten, Kämpfen, Crafting) steht im Patchouli-Buch von PneumaticCraft unter Programming."
	]
	quest.1A33962F72337913.quest_subtitle: "Erntet reife Felder und Bäume."
	quest.1A33962F72337913.title: "&7Puzzleteil: Harvest"
	quest.1A35F04F63E9A5FD.quest_desc: [
		"&dVenom Spores&r (spore blossom, red mushroom, Earth Essence): spores jump onto poisoned targets."
		"&dEnvenom&r (poisonous potato, fermented spider eye, suspicious stew): poison that grows into venom."
		"&dSpike&r (pointed dripstone, netherite ingot, Earth Essence): a dripstone spike out of the ground."
		"&dSummon Bees&r (Earth and Conjuration Essence, Magebloom, honeycomb), &dSummon Slimes&r (Water and Conjuration Essence, 2 slimeballs): three fighters each."
	]
	quest.1A35F04F63E9A5FD.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2 checklist: Ars Elemental, part 2."
	quest.1A35F04F63E9A5FD.title: "&dLearn Ars Elemental earth and conjuration"
	quest.1A39A7E5F622433E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Impure White Chalk&r, &6Cursed Honey&r, &6glow berries&r and &6blaze powder&r shapeless, then into Spiritfire."
		""
		"Afrit are impressed by lime but don't follow it. Orange lures them. The next pentacle needs &e40 orange signs&r, so make three pieces of chalk right away."
	]
	quest.1A39A7E5F622433E.quest_subtitle: "A sweet lure for Afrit."
	quest.1A39A7E5F622433E.title: "&6Mix orange chalk"
	quest.1A39EE189239CD6B.quest_desc: [
		"&eStufe 1:&r Es gibt keinen Strom, nur &6Drehkraft&r von Create. Wellen, Zahnräder und Riemen tragen sie, ein Getriebe lenkt sie um."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r &6Universalkabel von Mekanism&r (3 200 FE/t) für alles in der Basis, &6IE-Drähte&r, wenn Strom über Land soll. Pipez-Stromrohre nur für den Anfang, 256 FE/t sind schnell zu wenig."
		""
		"&eStufe 3:&r &6Flux Networks&r, weil ein Plug und ein Point jedes Kabel ersetzen, auch zwischen Dimensionen. &6Ender-IO-Leitungen&r (bis 192 000 FE/t) oder Powah-Kabel, wo Kabel bleiben sollen."
		""
		"&eStufe 4:&r Elite- und Ultimativkabel von Mekanism bis über 3 Millionen FE/t und Nitro-Kabel von Powah mit einer Million."
	]
	quest.1A39EE189239CD6B.quest_subtitle: "Zwei Wahlen pro Stufe."
	quest.1A39EE189239CD6B.title: "&d&lWas wann: Strom"
	quest.1A3ECCB16419ADC0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Electron Tube&r, two &6brass ingots&r and two &6dried kelp&r make two &6Brass Tunnels&r. Put them on top of a belt."
		""
		"At the value panel you choose: split, round robin, to the nearest exit, random or synchronised. With a filter it only sends certain items to the side."
	]
	quest.1A3ECCB16419ADC0.quest_subtitle: "Split, round robin or synchronised."
	quest.1A3ECCB16419ADC0.title: "&6Sort with the brass tunnel"
	quest.1A3F6AFC11C46B75.quest_desc: [
		"Material: &e4 stone&r (smelted, not cobblestone)."
		""
		"Plus &e4 Inferium Essence&r and a &6Prosperity Seed Base&r in the Infusion Altar."
	]
	quest.1A3F6AFC11C46B75.quest_subtitle: "One seed, one checkmark."
	quest.1A3F6AFC11C46B75.title: "Seed: Stone"
	quest.1A4AE1916414EFF9.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Electron Tube&r is &6Polished Rose Quartz&r on an &6iron sheet&r. The mixer makes rose quartz from Nether quartz and eight redstone, it is polished with sandpaper."
		""
		"Everything about it is in the &6Create: Brass&r chapter. No Create? Trade osmium or steel for a stack of tubes."
	]
	quest.1A4AE1916414EFF9.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism thinks with Create tubes."
	quest.1A4AE1916414EFF9.title: "&6Get electron tubes"
	quest.1A4B773D269B58C8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sophisticated Backpacks&r, &6Rucksack&r: &e27 Plätze&r und ein Upgrade-Platz, Kupfer und Eisen (Stufe 2), Gold und Diamant (Stufe 3), Netherit (Stufe 4). Pickup, Magnet, Lager- und Auffüll-Upgrade bewegen Gegenstände zwischen dir und den Kisten, jedes mit Filter. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eine Truhe, vier Leder, vier Fäden. \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sophisticatedbackpacks.open_backpack\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" öffnet ihn. Siehe Kapitel Lager.\"}]"
	]
	quest.1A4B773D269B58C8.quest_subtitle: "Sophisticated Backpacks, Rucksack: 27 Plätze zum Mitnehmen."
	quest.1A4B773D269B58C8.title: "Näh einen Rucksack"
	quest.1A53E760EB884BAC.quest_desc: [
		"Smithing table: &6Flowglaze Upgrade Smithing Template&r, &6Glacite Scythe&r, &6Flowglaze&r. Out comes the &6Flowglaze Scythe&r."
		""
		"&6Flowglaze:&r Throw Starfire on Twilight Sand, mine the Raw Flowglaze that forms and smelt it in a furnace. Flowglaze weapons grow stronger the more often you hit the same target in a row."
		""
		"The template lies in the chests of the Golem Forge and the Cursed Garden. Copying: template, 7 Glacite Shards and 1 Eternal Ice make 2."
	]
	quest.1A53E760EB884BAC.quest_subtitle: "Glacite plus Flowglaze."
	quest.1A53E760EB884BAC.title: "&bUpgrade to the Flowglaze Scythe"
	quest.1A5942A994C46EF6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_blooming_caverns.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Die &dBlühenden Höhlen&r sind hell: &6Blühendes Moos&r, leuchtende Blumen und Gras, Tümpel mit &6Anglerfischen&r. An den &6Leuchtenden Ranken&r hängen &6Blütenbeeren&r, die du mit Rechtsklick pflückst."
		""
		"&eEssen:&r Beeren roh, Anglerfisch gebraten. Es ist das einzige Biom, in dem du dich hier unten satt essen kannst."
		""
		"&eAchtung:&r Der &6Schlamm&r (Sludge) lebt hier, ein Schleim aus Sculk. Die kleinsten lassen &6Resonarium&r fallen, siehe unten."
	]
	quest.1A5942A994C46EF6.quest_subtitle: "Das einzige Biom mit Wasser und Essen."
	quest.1A5942A994C46EF6.title: "&dFinde die Blühenden Höhlen"
	quest.1A5E0B3BA2BF74D5.quest_desc: [
		"Irgendwo in der Fabrik steht &cThe Harbinger&r still und wartet. Rechtsklick mit einem &6Netherstern&r weckt ihn. Der Stern kommt vom Wither, also erst in Stufe 2, wenn der Nether offen ist."
		""
		"Er hat &e390 Lebenspunkte&r, Rüstung 12 und fliegt. Witherraketen machen 8, Laser 5, der Todeslaser 5 plus 5 Prozent, der Ansturm 6 Prozent. Jeder Treffer heilt ihn um 5, dazu heilt er 2 von selbst. Treffer über 22 werden gekappt, 14 pro Sekunde, Reichweite 35 Blöcke. Ein Bogen lohnt sich hier."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r ein &6Witheritblock&r, also 9 Barren. Daraus baust du den &6Mechanischen Fusionsamboss&r (6 Witherit, 2 Redstoneblöcke, Amboss), der Bosswaffen miteinander verschmilzt, zum Beispiel den Fluchbogen mit dem Sandsturm zum &6Zorn der Wüste&r. Dazu die &6Laser-Gatling&r (2 Witherit, lädt mit Redstone nach), der &6Fleischschredder&r (2 Witherit) und die &6Wither-Schulterwaffe&r (2 Witherit, Schießpulver, Redstoneblock)."
		""
		"Der Wiederbeleber nimmt ein &6Mechanisches Auge&r."
	]
	quest.1A5E0B3BA2BF74D5.quest_subtitle: "Ein Netherstern weckt die Maschine. Stufe 2."
	quest.1A5E0B3BA2BF74D5.title: "&c&lWeck den Harbinger und zerstör ihn"
	quest.1A7CDAB05109A076.quest_desc: [
		"On top &6stick&r and &6gold&r, in the middle &6purple dye, iron, gold&r, at the bottom &6iron&r and &6purple dye&r. EMI shows the exact layout."
		""
		"Right click makes you bleed, and you have the damage for the circle. The dagger also cuts the spell cloth."
	]
	quest.1A7CDAB05109A076.quest_subtitle: "Damage at the push of a button."
	quest.1A7CDAB05109A076.title: "&cForge a Dagger"
	quest.1A83E832A9F554FE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Netherite ingots&r in the corners, a &6Draconium Core&r at the top, a &6Wyvern Core&r at the bottom, &6Awakened ingots&r left and right, the &6Wyvern Shield Module&r in the middle."
		""
		"Pack the chestpiece full with them. Every hit the shield swallows does not hit you."
	]
	quest.1A83E832A9F554FE.quest_subtitle: "Shield first."
	quest.1A83E832A9F554FE.title: "&dBuild Draconic Shield Modules"
	quest.1A8625F561A62E98.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Sacrificial Bowl&r with &e8 golden sheets&r from the Create press around it makes the &6Golden Ritual Bowl&r. It always stands in the middle."
		""
		"Right click with the activation item (usually a bound book of binding) starts the ritual. A hopper can also put the activation item in. A sacrificial bowl upside down up to three blocks above catches the result."
		""
		"Redstone signal of the bowl: &e1&r waits for a sacrifice, &e2&r waits for a used item, &e8&r running."
	]
	quest.1A8625F561A62E98.quest_subtitle: "The middle of every pentacle."
	quest.1A8625F561A62E98.title: "&6Build the golden ritual bowl"
	quest.1A98FA4E62659939.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &6Mana Pearls&r into the portal. A &dPixie Dust&r comes back for each."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/pixie_dust.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Pixie Dust goes into the new flowers, the Corporea Spark, the Conjuration Catalyst, the Great Fairy Ring and twice into every &dElven Star&r. The pearl factory from stage 2 (brass casing below the pool) just keeps running."
	]
	quest.1A98FA4E62659939.quest_subtitle: "A pearl turns into dust that sparkles."
	quest.1A98FA4E62659939.title: "&dTrade Mana Pearls for Pixie Dust"
	quest.1A9D0C59B14AED26.quest_desc: [
		"Die letzten sieben Kreuzungen. Mit der Sternfrucht ist der Stammbaum vollständig."
		""
		"&6Johannisbrot&r: Edelkastanie + Copoazu, 10 %"
		"&6Grapefruit&r: Pomelo + Orange, 10 %"
		"&6Mango&r: Orange + Mangrove, 10 %"
		"&6Satsuma&r: Mandarine + Kumquat, 10 %"
		"&6Sternanis&r: Gewürznelke + Piment, 10 %"
		"&6Tangerine&r: Mandarine + Kumquat, 10 %"
		"&6Sternfrucht&r: Mango + Sternanis, 10 %"
	]
	quest.1A9D0C59B14AED26.quest_subtitle: "7 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.1A9D0C59B14AED26.title: "&aGeneration 8 und 9: bis zur Sternfrucht"
	quest.1AA2F8018F442A14.quest_desc: [
		"A &6book&r top middle, below it three &6Archwood slabs&r from Ars Nouveau, one &6wooden fence&r each bottom left and middle."
		""
		"&eHow it works:&r Right click the table. Your &6spell book&r goes in on the left, the &6scroll&r next to it. Choose a free slot on the right and press &eInscribe&r. The spell is now in the book, as often as you like."
		""
		"If you click an occupied slot, you get the scroll back and the slot becomes free. So you never lose a spell, only time."
	]
	quest.1AA2F8018F442A14.quest_subtitle: "This is where the scroll goes into the book."
	quest.1AA2F8018F442A14.title: "&6&lBuild an Inscription Table"
	quest.1AA38A1615B41384.quest_desc: [
		"&6ME Throughput Monitor:&r shapeless from an &6ME Storage Monitor&r and a Calculation Processor."
		""
		"Like the Storage Monitor it shows an item, but also how fast its amount changes: per second, per minute or per ten minutes. That way you see whether your ore processing keeps up or a farm is weakening."
	]
	quest.1AA38A1615B41384.quest_subtitle: "How fast does the stock grow?"
	quest.1AA38A1615B41384.title: "&dMeasure Your Throughput"
	quest.1AA80C9F8759399D.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &cFire Essence&r, &e4 blast furnaces&r, &6blaze rod&r."
		""
		"Smelts blocks and items in the world. &eProjectile, Break, Smelt, Pickup&r delivers ingots right away. With AOE more at once, with Amplify harder blocks."
	]
	quest.1AA80C9F8759399D.quest_subtitle: "The furnace in the spell book."
	quest.1AA80C9F8759399D.title: "&dLearn Smelt"
	quest.1AA957E46D3A8EEA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Pump&r (cogwheel, pipe) on a shaft, an open &6fluid pipe&r into a pond of at least 2 by 2 source blocks, the other end into a &6Fluid Tank&r (8 buckets per block). The pond refills itself, the pump runs forever."
		""
		"The pump reaches &e16 blocks&r per side and costs 4 SU per RPM. A &6Spout&r over a depot fills buckets and bottles from it, the mixer takes water for dough and pulp by pipe."
		""
		"For long distances: the &6Hose Pulley&r sucks up to 128 blocks deep, and a lake with over 10,000 blocks counts as infinite. Pipes and pump are in the &6Create&r chapter (fluids)."
	]
	quest.1AA957E46D3A8EEA.quest_subtitle: "A pond, a pipe, a tank."
	quest.1AA957E46D3A8EEA.title: "&bPump endless water"
	quest.1AAAFD04D2721064.quest_desc: [
		"A Silent Gear pickaxe is a &6head&r plus a &6rod&r. On top of that come &6binding&r, &6grip&r and &6tip&r if you want. Each part may be made of a different material."
		""
		"&eThe process:&r get a blueprint. Blueprint plus material in the grid makes the part. The parts together in the grid make the tool."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r In stage 1, Silent Gear goes up to diamond. The Nether metals (Crimson Iron, Blaze Gold, Crimson Steel) and steel come in stage 2, the azure metals from the End in stage 4."
	]
	quest.1AAAFD04D2721064.quest_subtitle: "Head plus rod, the material decides."
	quest.1AAAFD04D2721064.title: "&6&lBuild tools from parts"
	quest.1AB7B71E7A9DBD86.quest_desc: [
		"Put a &6log&r on the stone anvil and click it with the &6Crude Knife&r: &esix Template Boards&r."
		""
		"You need them for templates, repair kits, the modkit and the blueprint book."
	]
	quest.1AB7B71E7A9DBD86.quest_subtitle: "Six boards from one log."
	quest.1AB7B71E7A9DBD86.title: "&7Cut Template Boards"
	quest.1ABA02C2563297F6.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Ferricore Ingot&r on two sticks gives the &6Ferricore Shovel&r. &6Sky Sweeper&r (two gravel left and right, sand on top and bottom around a blank) mines the whole column above the gravel or sand along with it."
		""
		"&6Lawn Mower&r (two grass tufts around a blank) is active: trigger it, and all grass and flowers nearby drop to the ground as items."
		""
		"The &6Ferricore Hoe&r (two ingots, two sticks) turns dirt into &6Primogel Soil&r: farmland nobody tramples, on which crops grow a little faster. The Blazegold hoe makes &6Blazebloom Soil&r, which harvests ripe crops by itself."
	]
	quest.1ABA02C2563297F6.quest_subtitle: "Ferricore shovel and hoe."
	quest.1ABA02C2563297F6.title: "&eDig without Falling Gravel"
	quest.1AC343C22B140EAE.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Source Jar&r in the middle, &e4 ender pearls&r and &e4 popped chorus fruit&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"All Ender Source Jars share one stock. Fill one at the link farm, the second one in the outpost has the same source. Popped chorus fruit comes from the furnace."
	]
	quest.1AC343C22B140EAE.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: one source in every place."
	quest.1AC343C22B140EAE.title: "&bBuild an Ender Source Jar"
	quest.1AC6CDBCF96FAF14.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/alfheim_frame.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Frame: &68 Livingwood&r and &63 Glimmering Livingwood&r, the core in the bottom middle. Plus &62 Mana Pools&r with a &aNatura Pylon&r on each, within 5 blocks."
		""
		"&6Glimmering Livingwood:&r Livingwood Log and glowstone dust. &6Natura Pylon:&r Mana Pylon, 3 Terrasteel Nuggets, 1 Eye of Ender."
		""
		"The Lexica shows the frame as a preview you can project into the world. Build it block by block."
	]
	quest.1AC6CDBCF96FAF14.quest_subtitle: "Livingwood, glimmer and two full pools."
	quest.1AC6CDBCF96FAF14.title: "&aSet Up the Frame and Pylons"
	quest.1ACAC5CE0A057784.quest_desc: [
		"A greater rite with four runes: &5Eldritch&r, &dArcane&r and two &eSacred&r, on Runewood."
		""
		"Animals nearby age by &d25 seconds&r with every pulse. Young animals grow faster, chickens lay eggs more often, sheep eat grass more often, bees pollinate faster."
		""
		"A totem in the middle of the animal farm is worth it."
	]
	quest.1ACAC5CE0A057784.quest_subtitle: "Animals grow faster."
	quest.1ACAC5CE0A057784.title: "&2Light the Rite of Nurturing"
	quest.1ACBAA8F12DFC3F2.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Utherium Ore&r below &eY 32&r. It gives a &6Utheric Cluster&r, not a finished crystal. &69 Utheric Shards&r also make a cluster."
		""
		"The cluster only becomes a &6Utherium Crystal&r in the &6Infuser&r, and you build that with Rogdorium from the Depths. Start collecting now."
	]
	quest.1ACBAA8F12DFC3F2.quest_subtitle: "Deep down, and not finished yet."
	quest.1ACBAA8F12DFC3F2.title: "&cMine Utherium Ore"
	quest.1ADC26DE74E315D7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cybernetic Augmentation Center:&r Dubious Container, carbon fibre, Dubious Container, Motor, chest, Motor, three plating, ten cores. Next to it the &6Cybernetic Research Station&r (five Electrum, block of redstone, brewing stand, plating)."
		""
		"&6Steel-Infused Frame&r: three more hearts. Research 64 plating, 32 coal dust, 8 Biosteel, 10 million RF, installation 8 plating. &6Synthetic Muscles&r: 25 percent faster, 16 motors, 32 Biosteel, 64 redstone, 30 million RF."
		""
		"The Foundry casts &6Biosteel&r from Raw Biopolymer and iron. The crafting table builds the &6Dubious Container&r from plastic, four Enderic Compound and two Adamant."
	]
	quest.1ADC26DE74E315D7.quest_subtitle: "Three more hearts, from plating and Biosteel."
	quest.1ADC26DE74E315D7.title: "&dRebuild Yourself"
	quest.1AE3147C2291C179.quest_desc: [
		"Loot with random affixes, gems in sockets, the enchanting table and spawners. In stage 1 up to the Rare rarity."
	]
	quest.1AE3147C2291C179.quest_subtitle: "Affixes, gems, reforging."
	quest.1AE3147C2291C179.title: "&6Open Apotheosis"
	quest.1AEC60ECEA6B6092.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6Andesite Alloy&r, &6slime ball&r, Andesite Alloy, bottom &6cobblestone&r, &6redstone&r, cobblestone: that makes the &6Sticker&r."
		""
		"Every redstone signal flips its state: extended it sticks to the block in front of it, and a contraption takes that block along. On the next signal it lets go again."
		""
		"That way a piston picks up a block and sets it down somewhere else, for sliding doors or a storage that swaps chests."
	]
	quest.1AEC60ECEA6B6092.quest_subtitle: "The Sticker."
	quest.1AEC60ECEA6B6092.title: "&6Glue blocks with redstone"
	quest.1AF560D8CEFC2713.quest_desc: [
		"In the Dissolution Chamber: three &6diamond blocks&r, a &6diamond shovel&r, the addon &6Range Tier 12&r (redstone, glass panes and four emeralds in latex), three &6Gold Gears&r and &e2,000 mB of Pink Slime&r."
		""
		"The more power it has stored, the higher its tier can be, from &ePoor&r to &eArtifact&r, seven tiers. Higher tiers drill larger areas. Sneak and right click to open its window."
		""
		"Everything it mines goes straight to you. With &6Biofuel&r in its tank it uses the fuel instead of power. You charge it in the &6Infinity Charger&r: plastic, repeaters, Diamond Gear, redstone blocks and an Advanced Frame."
	]
	quest.1AF560D8CEFC2713.quest_subtitle: "A drill that grows with power."
	quest.1AF560D8CEFC2713.title: "&5Build an Infinity Drill"
	quest.1B0B5B0BDEC1203C.quest_desc: [
		"Top &e3 archwood slabs&r, middle left and right one &6gold nugget&r each, bottom left and right one &6archwood log&r each."
		""
		"Click the table with the spell book, pick a glyph, press &eSelect&r and throw the listed ingredients onto the table with &eQ&r. It also pulls them from chests next to it."
		""
		"Each glyph also costs experience: tier 1 &e27 points&r, tier 2 &e55&r, tier 3 &e160&r. The finished glyph drops as an item, right click learns it for good."
	]
	quest.1B0B5B0BDEC1203C.quest_subtitle: "New glyphs are made here."
	quest.1B0B5B0BDEC1203C.title: "&aBuild the Scribe's Table"
	quest.1B0FDB7860008B62.quest_desc: [
		"Wait for a &emeteor shower&r. Big meteors strike and leave &6Raw Aethersent&r behind. In a furnace it becomes an &6Aethersent Ingot&r. Collect 4."
		""
		"With the meteors come &6Creteors&r, star shaped creepers. An &6Aethersent Golem&r (carved Lunaris cactus fruit on an Aethersent block) shoots meteors down before they strike."
	]
	quest.1B0FDB7860008B62.quest_subtitle: "Ore that falls from the sky."
	quest.1B0FDB7860008B62.title: "&eCollect Aethersent"
	quest.1B1A6C917E3CFB01.quest_desc: [
		"Goldrüstung mit 4 Magieblütenfasern im Apparat ergibt die &6Zaubererrobe&r. Zweite Aufwertung: 2 Enderperlen, Chorusfrucht, 5 000 Quelle pro Teil. Kapitel &dArs Nouveau: Episch&r."
		""
		"Der &6Faden des Gleitens&r (leerer Faden, 2 Luftessenzen, Elytra) braucht einen Platz der Größe 3 und gleitet wie Elytren, der Brustplatz bleibt frei."
	]
	quest.1B1A6C917E3CFB01.quest_subtitle: "Ars Nouveau: Goldrüstung, die besten Fäden."
	quest.1B1A6C917E3CFB01.title: "&6Näh die Zaubererrobe"
	quest.1B1C17CC6F76555D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Arcane Essence&r is this mod's raw material: armor, staff, runes, everything needs it. Mages drop 0 to 8, ice spiders 4 to 16, the Dead King 28 to 45. Chests hold 1 to 10, often more in the towers."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/arcane_essence.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"You need a lot: one Arcane Cloth costs 8, the wizard robe 64. Set up a chest for it from the start."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Eight essences around an iron, copper or gold ingot give an &6Arcane Ingot&r. You need it for rings and spell weapons, but only later. Armor first, then ingots."
	]
	quest.1B1C17CC6F76555D.quest_subtitle: "The raw material for everything."
	quest.1B1C17CC6F76555D.title: "&d&lCollect Arcane Essence"
	quest.1B205E95FF765410.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r oben drei Steinziegel, in der Mitte Farbstoff, &6Warpstein&r, Farbstoff, unten drei Obsidian. Das ist ein &6Teilstein&r in der Farbe des Farbstoffs."
		""
		"&eSo geht es:&r Alle Teilsteine &eeiner Farbe&r sind miteinander verbunden, und zwar für jeden Spieler, ohne dass er sie erst aktivieren muss. Eine Reise kostet wie bei einem Wegstein."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Ein orangefarbener Teilstein am Spawn und einer an jedem Gemeinschaftsprojekt, und jeder Neue findet sofort hin. Sprecht ab, welche Farbe wofür steht."
	]
	quest.1B205E95FF765410.quest_subtitle: "Gleiche Farbe, ein Netz, für alle."
	quest.1B205E95FF765410.title: "&6Stell Teilsteine auf"
	quest.1B31D4AAD9A6BB6A.quest_desc: [
		"Keep &e8 Afrit Essences&r and a &9Blue Chalk&r ready. With that you are through everything stage 3 offers in Occultism."
		""
		"&5Uphyxes Inverted Tower&r (21x21, 88 purple signs) binds Marid into items: the tier 4 stabiliser and the Iesnium Anvil, which never breaks and pays half the levels. In &5Xeovrenth Adjure&r an Iesnium Golem is summoned."
		""
		"&cStage 4:&r Marid Smelter, Marid Miner, dragon dust, possessed Shulker and Ronaza's Contact need dragon's breath and the End."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Until then, every Afrit Essence counts for the obelisk."
	]
	quest.1B31D4AAD9A6BB6A.quest_subtitle: "Afrit work for you, Marid answer to your name."
	quest.1B31D4AAD9A6BB6A.title: "&9&lBecome a master of the Otherworld"
	quest.1B34C1F6E7AC9249.quest_desc: [
		"In the pattern encoding terminal choose the mode &eCrafting&r, lay the recipe into the grid (from EMI with the plus), put in a blank pattern, press the arrow. Out comes a &6Crafting Pattern&r."
		""
		"Start with something simple, for example logs to planks. A pattern may also say 8 cobblestone to 8 stone, then the machine works in larger steps."
	]
	quest.1B34C1F6E7AC9249.quest_subtitle: "A crafting table recipe on paper."
	quest.1B34C1F6E7AC9249.title: "&aWrite a crafting pattern"
	quest.1B35E9F6839801CB.quest_desc: [
		"&bCascading log&r, &bWater Essence&r, &6sea lantern&r."
		""
		"Within &e32 blocks&r no hostile monsters spawn naturally. Each rotten flesh as an addition gives &e+1&r block, up to &e128&r. It only costs Source when it prevents a spawn, at most once per minute."
	]
	quest.1B35E9F6839801CB.quest_subtitle: "No more monsters at home."
	quest.1B35E9F6839801CB.title: "&aMake the Sanctuary tablet"
	quest.1B37A19EEAA27DF1.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r lever on top, &6Andesite Casing&r in the middle, &6cogwheel&r at the bottom give an &6Andesite Switch&r. First right click a track with a junction with it, then place it up to 64 blocks next to it."
		""
		"Right click sets the switch to the right, sneak and right click to the left. A redstone signal sets it too, a signal from below locks it. A comparator reads 1 for left, 0 for straight and 2 for right."
		""
		"This chapter collects the Create addons that have no chapter of their own yet: the rest of &6Steam 'n' Rails&r, Create Connected, Dragons Plus, Enchantment Industry, the Mechanical Spawner and the &6diesel engines&r. All of it is open with &6stage 2&r. The basics are in &6Create: Brass&r and &6Create: Trains&r."
	]
	quest.1B37A19EEAA27DF1.quest_subtitle: "Steam 'n' Rails: switches you throw yourself."
	quest.1B37A19EEAA27DF1.title: "&6&lPlace a Switch"
	quest.1B411A4878DCEE89.quest_desc: [
		"&dKnockback&r (Air Essence, 3 pistons): pushes the target a bit away."
		"&dLaunch&r (Air Essence, 3 rabbit hides): throws the target into the air."
		"&dWind Burst&r (Air Essence, 4 wind charges): a wind charge at the target."
		"&dBounce&r (Abjuration Essence, 3 slimeballs): whoever falls bounces back up."
		"&dWololo&r (Abjuration Essence, 3 dyes): colours creatures and blocks in your spell colour."
	]
	quest.1B411A4878DCEE89.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1 checklist: air, bounce, colour."
	quest.1B411A4878DCEE89.title: "&dLearn the air glyphs"
	quest.1B4737AEDBFCC751.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6Otherworldly Tablet&r in the middle, &bSpirit Attuned Gem&r on top, &6silver ingot&r below, &e6 Iesnium nuggets&r on the sides. That is the &6Inert Storage Accessor&r."
		""
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding."
		"&6Bowls:&r the Inert Storage Accessor, &e2 ender pearls&r, a &6nether quartz&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book, 150 seconds."
		""
		"Sneaking click on the Storage Actuator links it. After that you open your storage from anywhere, even from another dimension."
	]
	quest.1B4737AEDBFCC751.quest_subtitle: "Your storage in your pocket."
	quest.1B4737AEDBFCC751.title: "&6Bind a Storage Accessor"
	quest.1B47A9F155721187.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6brass sheets&r and one &6andesite alloy&r make a &6Brass Hand&r: alloy on top, three sheets in the middle, one at the bottom."
		"{image:create:textures/item/brass_hand.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1B47A9F155721187.quest_subtitle: "Fingers made of sheet metal."
	quest.1B47A9F155721187.title: "&6Form a Brass Hand"
	quest.1B52DAC4F1E35022.quest_desc: [
		"Find a When Dungeons Arise structure at sea and tick this off: Undead Pirate Ship, Illager Corsair or Galley, the &6Typhon&r, a lighthouse or a fishing hut."
		""
		"A boat and blocks to build up help with boarding."
	]
	quest.1B52DAC4F1E35022.quest_subtitle: "Pirates, illagers and a sea monster."
	quest.1B52DAC4F1E35022.title: "&3Board a ship"
	quest.1B5369556D2FD7CD.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_afrit_marid_crusher.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&9Blue Chalk:&r impure chalk, Marid Essence, lapis dust, tube coral. &5Fatma's Incentivized Attraction&r, 21x21: &e60 blue&r, 40 orange, 36 lime, 16 red, 16 foundation, 8 black, 8 Crystals, 8 skulls, 4 wither skulls, 8 candles."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6diamond&r, &6Iesnium&r, &6emerald&r and &6netherite block&r, &6ghast tear&r. Marid book, 240 seconds, no sacrifice."
		""
		"It makes &esix dusts from one ore&r and needs only 30 percent of the Djinni time. The Marid Crystallizer (Gray Paste, Iesnium block, budding amethyst, sea lantern, sculk catalyst) even turns obsidian into crying obsidian."
	]
	quest.1B5369556D2FD7CD.quest_subtitle: "Fatma's Incentivized Attraction: one ore, six dusts."
	quest.1B5369556D2FD7CD.title: "&9Summon a Marid Crusher"
	quest.1B6DDCE4570E6AEA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eidolon_stone_altar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Worktable: &6Stone Altar&r from smooth stone slabs, stone, Pewter Inlay, Soul Shard in the extra slot (gives three). &6Elder Statue&r from stone and smooth stone, Unholy Symbol and Gold Inlay extra."
		""
		"Only here do the great rites work: a villager as a sacrifice or turned into a zombie. The light path cures zombie villagers here."
	]
	quest.1B6DDCE4570E6AEA.quest_subtitle: "For the more powerful rites."
	quest.1B6DDCE4570E6AEA.title: "&5Build a Stone Altar and Elder Statue"
	quest.1B81E126757BB138.quest_desc: [
		"&6Redstone&r, &6steel&r, redstone at the top, Electrum, &6Industrial Support Girder&r, Electrum in the middle, three plating at the bottom."
		""
		"The machine runs &eeight times as fast&r until the burst gauge is empty, 12 seconds per addon. After that it runs throttled until it has cooled down. Good for bursts of work, bad for continuous running."
	]
	quest.1B81E126757BB138.quest_subtitle: "Eight times the speed, for 12 seconds."
	quest.1B81E126757BB138.title: "&aSpeed Up Briefly with the Burst Addon"
	quest.1B838BB3540E8390.quest_desc: [
		"&6Short grass&r in the pool becomes &6Pasture Seeds&r for &d2,500 mana&r. Right click on dirt, by hand or with a dispenser, grows grass all around."
		""
		"Floral Fertilizer only works on grass; this is how you lay out a bed on bare dirt."
	]
	quest.1B838BB3540E8390.quest_subtitle: "Grass wherever you want it."
	quest.1B838BB3540E8390.title: "&6Infuse Pasture Seeds"
	quest.1B859A0C402A281A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/antimatter_waste.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Solar Neutron Activator:&r Reinforced Alloy, HDPE Sheet, Elite Control Circuits, Steel Casing, bronze. In sunlight it turns &e1 mB of lithium into 1 mB of Tritium&r."
		""
		"It needs open sky and rests at night. Set up several, one alone is slow."
	]
	quest.1B859A0C402A281A.quest_subtitle: "Lithium under the sun."
	quest.1B859A0C402A281A.title: "&bActivate Tritium"
	quest.1B9414D2647002C8.quest_desc: [
		"Slay &65 Freezes&r in the Golem Forge. They guard the Permafrost's room."
		""
		"Their hits cause frostbite. Wear armor that protects against cold and bring enough food."
	]
	quest.1B9414D2647002C8.quest_subtitle: "Preparing for the second boss."
	quest.1B9414D2647002C8.title: "&bTake Out the Freezes"
	quest.1B9A3D6CD72A4F71.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r die &6Klärkammer&r in die Mitte, Goldbarren links und rechts, &6Elite-Steuerschaltkreise&r oben und unten, &6Verstärkte Legierung&r in die Ecken. Elite-Schaltkreise brauchen Draconiumstaub aus dem End, also &6Stufe 4&r."
		""
		"&eWas herauskommt:&r Ein Erzblock gibt &e4 Splitter&r, drei Rohe Erze &e8&r, ein Block aus Rohem Erz &e24&r. Sie frisst rund 1 mB Chlorwasserstoff pro Tick und etwa &d160 FE/t&r, doppelt so viel wie die Klärkammer."
		""
		"Die Kammer kommt vor die Dreifach-Straße. Du baust nichts um, du stellst eine Maschine davor."
		""
		"Hak die Quest ab, sobald sie steht. Vorher kannst du nichts davon bauen, die Zutaten sind gesperrt."
	]
	quest.1B9A3D6CD72A4F71.quest_subtitle: "Vier Splitter aus einem Erz. Stufe 4."
	quest.1B9A3D6CD72A4F71.title: "&d&lBau eine Chemische Injektionskammer"
	quest.1BA383CB538934F3.quest_desc: [
		"First the &6Anti Teleport Upgrade&r: Upgrade Base, four &6ender pearls&r on the sides, four honeycomb blocks in the corners. Then that one in the middle, an ender pearl on top, three &6blaze rods&r left, right and bottom, honeycomb blocks in the corners: the &6Simulator Upgrade&r."
		""
		"The bees no longer fly out, the trip is only calculated. The flower then has to stand directly below the hive entrance, the Feeding Slab supplies three kinds at once."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Hundreds of flying bees cost the server performance. A bee house with simulators is quiet, clean and fast."
	]
	quest.1BA383CB538934F3.quest_subtitle: "Simulator Upgrade: trips are only calculated."
	quest.1BA383CB538934F3.title: "&bKeep the Bees at Home"
	quest.1BAF095A8D0F5B04.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_apprentice_ritual_scrying.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Vexing log&r, &e3 spider eyes&r, &6glowstone&r, &6Source Gem block&r."
		""
		"Before starting, throw a block onto the brazier, like zinc ore. After that you see every block of that kind through the ground: white close, green medium, blue far. With a Manipulation Essence added, for &e15 minutes&r."
	]
	quest.1BAF095A8D0F5B04.quest_subtitle: "See one block through all the others."
	quest.1BAF095A8D0F5B04.title: "&aMake the Scrying tablet"
	quest.1BAF2C84EE920765.quest_desc: [
		"&6Deepslate Uranium Ore&r sits with &6Uranite Crystals&r in small nests in the lowest 40 blocks of the world. Pulverizer: raw uranium becomes uranium dust. Atomic Forge: one copper dust and two uranium dust become one &6Uranium Gem&r."
		""
		"Assembler: two gems, one Plastic Sheet and one nickel give two &6Uranium Pellets&r, three with Adamant instead of nickel."
		""
		"The laser breaks the Uranite Crystal into plutonium dust. A plutonium pellet burns ten times as long as a uranium one."
	]
	quest.1BAF2C84EE920765.quest_subtitle: "Raw uranium, gem, pellet."
	quest.1BAF2C84EE920765.title: "&aMake Uranium Pellets"
	quest.1BB37084A4AB6D92.quest_desc: [
		"First the &6ME Crafting Terminal&r (shapeless: ME Terminal, crafting table, Calculation Processor), from it with an &6Engineering Processor&r the &6ME Pattern Encoding Terminal&r. &6Blank Patterns&r: quartz glass, glowstone, certus, iron and copper, gives two."
		""
		"Autocrafting needs three things: an order, a &6crafting CPU&r and a &6pattern provider&r with a pattern. The next quests build them step by step."
	]
	quest.1BB37084A4AB6D92.quest_subtitle: "Here you write recipes down."
	quest.1BB37084A4AB6D92.title: "&aBuild a pattern encoding terminal"
	quest.1BB61C3F5F8A6961.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crystalline Bee&r and &6Mason Bee&r, or a &6Nether Gold Nest&r (diamond sword and nether gold ore) in the Nether, attracted with a gold ingot. Flower: gold block, gold ore or gilded blackstone. The comb gives &6raw gold&r with 40 percent."
	]
	quest.1BB61C3F5F8A6961.quest_subtitle: "Raw gold from combs."
	quest.1BB61C3F5F8A6961.title: "&eBreed the Gold Bee"
	quest.1BC1B05B26C2505F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brass sheet&r, &6fluid pipe&r and &6Electron Tube&r on top of each other make the &6Smart Fluid Pipe&r. Right click its filter slot with an item that contains the fluid, like a lava bucket."
		""
		"Right at the source it only pumps out that fluid. Further down the line it only lets that fluid through. That way you separate water and lava coming from the same tank or basin."
	]
	quest.1BC1B05B26C2505F.quest_subtitle: "The Smart Fluid Pipe."
	quest.1BC1B05B26C2505F.title: "&6Filter fluids"
	quest.1BC47FEDF2DE0457.quest_desc: [
		"&6Creepers&r give three, &6blazes&r three, piglins and zombified piglins two."
		""
		"For the Spirit Crucible, Arcane Charcoal and the Rite of Quickening."
	]
	quest.1BC47FEDF2DE0457.quest_subtitle: "Hellish arcana."
	quest.1BC47FEDF2DE0457.title: "&cInfernal"
	quest.1BD27D3045508B31.quest_desc: [
		"Drei &6Flachs&r übereinander oder drei &6Fäden&r diagonal ergeben drei &6Seile&r. Häng sie an einen Block, und sie fallen nach unten, so weit du Seile hast. Du kletterst daran wie an einer Leiter, und sie lassen sich auch waagerecht von Pfosten zu Pfosten spannen."
		""
		"{image:supplementaries:textures/item/flax.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Flachs&r wächst wild in der Welt, und seine Samen liegen in Truhen von Minen, Verliesen und Schiffswracks. Angebaut wächst er zwei Blöcke hoch und gibt Flachs und neue Samen."
	]
	quest.1BD27D3045508B31.quest_subtitle: "Rauf, runter und über den Abgrund."
	quest.1BD27D3045508B31.title: "&6Knüpf Seile"
	quest.1BD3D6869EA17129.quest_desc: [
		"Gem-Fused Slate, Stein und oben ein Bergungsmaterial ergeben zwei &6Upgrade-Vorlagen&r. Mysterious Scrap Metal: Stein oder Kette wird Eisen (4 Eisen). Timeworn Fabric: Eisen wird Gold. Luminous Crystal Shard: Gold wird Diamant (4 Diamanten)."
		""
		"Am Schmiedetisch, die Affixe bleiben. So lohnt sich auch ein Rare-Schwert aus Stein. Kapitel &6Apotheosis&r."
	]
	quest.1BD3D6869EA17129.quest_subtitle: "Apotheosis: gute Affixe, besseres Material."
	quest.1BD3D6869EA17129.title: "&9Wert Affix-Beute auf"
	quest.1BD3F8E4CA33C156.quest_desc: [
		"&6Andesite Casing&r, &6Cogwheel&r and &6redstone&r make a &6Gearshift&r. With a redstone signal everything behind it turns the other way."
		""
		"That is how pistons, rope pulleys and gantries move back and forth with a lever."
	]
	quest.1BD3F8E4CA33C156.quest_subtitle: "The gearshift, forward and back with a lever."
	quest.1BD3F8E4CA33C156.title: "&6Reverse the direction"
	quest.1BDB06C5A22FC75F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_runes_plate_base.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"3x3 under the plate: &6Livingrock&r in the middle and the four corners, &9lapis blocks&r on the four edges. The plate stands on the middle Livingrock."
		""
		"On the Terrasteel page the Lexica projects the pattern into the world as a preview."
	]
	quest.1BDB06C5A22FC75F.quest_subtitle: "A checkerboard of lapis and Livingrock."
	quest.1BDB06C5A22FC75F.title: "&7Lay the foundation"
	quest.1BE3F59805996FA5.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r three &6quartz slabs&r on top, &6iron bars&r, &6hay bale&r, &6iron bars&r in the middle, three &6polished blackstone&r at the bottom. A &6Harvester Pylon&r."
		""
		"Place it in or above your field's water block, a &6chest&r directly above it and a &6hoe&r into the pylon. Every &e3 seconds&r it harvests ripe crops in the set area, replants and puts the yield into the chest. Every harvest costs the hoe one durability point."
		""
		"&cNote:&r Quartz and blackstone come from the Nether, the pylon opens with &estage 2&r. Collect the hay bale and the bars until then. In stage 1 the Hopper Botany Pot and the Create harvester do the harvesting, see the First Farms chapter."
		""
		"The hoe cannot be refilled by pipe. An unbreakable hoe from Silent Gear or simply a stack of stone hoes next to it helps."
	]
	quest.1BE3F59805996FA5.quest_subtitle: "A field that harvests itself, from stage 2."
	quest.1BE3F59805996FA5.title: "&dRead What the Harvester Pylon Does"
	quest.1BE4DAFDA978406F.quest_desc: [
		"EMI zeigt unter &eBaumbestäubung&r zu jedem Setzling die beiden Elternblätter und die Chance. &e116 Kreuzungen&r haben 10 Prozent, &e27&r nur 5 Prozent, die ersten Vanilla-Paare 35 bis 55 Prozent. Die Westliche Hemlocktanne gelingt bei jedem Versuch."
		""
		"&eZwei Kinder, ein Paar:&r Eiche und Birke ergeben Buche oder Silberlinde, Buche und Birke Erle oder Pekannuss, Silberlinde und Kirsche Walnuss, Vogelkirsche oder Hartriegel, Pflaume und Pfirsich Aprikose oder Nektarine. Die Biene würfelt jedes Mal neu, welches Rezept sie versucht."
		""
		"&eMehrere erlaubte Blätter:&r Beim Red-Delicious-Apfel darf statt Eiche auch Schwarzeiche stehen, bei Silberweide und Silberpappel Eiche oder Birke. EMI zeigt die Alternativen im Wechsel."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Der Markt nimmt dir die ersten drei Generationen ab. Ab &eGeneration 4&r (Hasel, Holunder, Korkeiche, Zitronatzitrone und 83 weitere) führt kein Weg am Züchten vorbei, und EMI zeigt dir zu jedem Ziel die Eltern, die du kaufen kannst."
	]
	quest.1BE4DAFDA978406F.quest_subtitle: "5, 10 oder 50 Prozent, und ein Paar mit zwei Kindern."
	quest.1BE4DAFDA978406F.title: "&eLies die Chancen richtig"
	quest.1BE95EF7C01720A4.quest_desc: [
		"The Nucleosynthesizer makes one &3UU Matter&r from &e64 Empty Crystals&r and 2 mB of antimatter."
		""
		"The Oxidizer turns one piece into 500 mB of UU Matter as a chemical. The replicators live on that."
	]
	quest.1BE95EF7C01720A4.quest_subtitle: "The ingredient of the replicators."
	quest.1BE95EF7C01720A4.title: "&3Make UU Matter"
	quest.1BF157B8422B52AE.quest_desc: [
		"Der große &6Reforging Table&r (Netheritbarren, 2 Arcane Sands, 3 Netherziegel, Stufe 3) schmiedet Epic für 30 Level und Mythic für 50 Level, 3 Godforged Pearls und 5 Siegel. Der &6Augmenting Table&r (Netherstern, 2 Godforged Pearls) verbessert einen Affix um 25 Prozent."
		""
		"Mythic: vier Attribute, zwei Effekte, eine Fähigkeit, selten Unzerstörbarkeit. Kapitel &6Apotheosis&r."
	]
	quest.1BF157B8422B52AE.quest_subtitle: "Apotheosis: vier Attribute, zwei Effekte."
	quest.1BF157B8422B52AE.title: "&6Trag Mythic"
	quest.1BFAAF2C6B540335.quest_desc: [
		"64 &6Iron Sulfur&r and 4 &6Gold Sulfur&r in your inventory."
		""
		"You multiply ores, make salt from cobblestone, heat with flux and turn lapis into quartz and iron into gold."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Keep the Incubators running and bring the iron to the steelmakers. Every ingot not lost in the furnace counts toward the 4,000 steel."
	]
	quest.1BFAAF2C6B540335.quest_subtitle: "Any material from any other."
	quest.1BFAAF2C6B540335.title: "&d&lComplete the Magnum Opus"
	quest.1C394BA0A8B05470.quest_desc: [
		"Climb a Dungeons and Taverns &6fire watchtower&r and tick this off. It comes in nine biome styles, from birch to mangrove."
		""
		"From the top you see far. On top of that the mod builds wells, bunkers, a trident monument and small combat shrines in five tiers."
	]
	quest.1C394BA0A8B05470.quest_subtitle: "A view and chests in nine kinds of wood."
	quest.1C394BA0A8B05470.title: "&6Climb a fire watchtower"
	quest.1C3B1246BF2F4CD8.quest_desc: [
		"Top three &6red dyes&r, middle &6gold nugget, wheat seeds, gold nugget&r, bottom three &6bone meal&r: four fertilizer."
		""
		"Click farmland with it. It becomes fertilized farmland on which everything grows faster."
	]
	quest.1C3B1246BF2F4CD8.quest_subtitle: "Plants grow faster."
	quest.1C3B1246BF2F4CD8.title: "&cSpread red fertilizer"
	quest.1C3B7E2EEA87A725.quest_desc: [
		"Der Knopf mit der Erfahrungsflasche schaltet die Kammer auf &6Training&r: eine Simulation dauert dann &e15 Sekunden&r, kostet &e120 Prozent&r Strom, gibt &ekeine Ausgabe&r und bringt dem Modell &e1 Datenpunkt&r."
		""
		"Rechne nach: Ein Kill bringt 4 bis 18 Datenpunkte, das Training einen in 15 Sekunden. Von Basic bis Self Aware wären das über fünf Stunden Strom. Trainieren lohnt sich nur für Mobs, an die du nicht herankommst, oder für die letzten paar Punkte."
		""
		"Der normale Modus heißt &6Inference&r (das Enderauge). Dort gibt es Ausgaben, aber das Modell lernt nichts dazu."
	]
	quest.1C3B7E2EEA87A725.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 3. Die Kammer lernt, aber langsam."
	quest.1C3B7E2EEA87A725.title: "&bDer Trainingsmodus"
	quest.1C41349412676BFC.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r vier &6Pressure Chamber Walls&r in die Ecken, ein &6Omnidirectional Hopper&r oben, zwei &6Enderperlen&r an den Seiten, ein &6Netherstern&r in der Mitte, ein &6Advanced Pressure Tube&r unten."
		""
		"Unter Druck verhält sich der Block wie ein Inventar, nur dass alles, was hineingeht, &edirekt bei dir&r landet, egal wo du bist. Ein &9Requester&r-Rahmen darauf, 64 Fackeln eingestellt, und du hast immer Fackeln dabei. Über die Seitenkonfiguration erreichst du auch Rüstung, Zweithand und Endertruhe."
		""
		"&eMehr:&r Mit FE am Block lädt er jedes Strom-Item in deinem Inventar (100 000 FE Puffer). Mit einem &6Dispenser Upgrade&r füttert er dich mit Essen aus dem Netz, sobald du hungrig genug bist, und pumpt flüssige Erfahrung hinein oder heraus. Für 80 mL pro Tick atmest du unter Wasser."
		""
		"Der Netherstern kommt vom Wither, siehe Kapitel &cNether&r. Tu das nicht in der Nähe einer Basis."
	]
	quest.1C41349412676BFC.quest_subtitle: "Eine Kiste, die direkt in deine Taschen führt."
	quest.1C41349412676BFC.title: "&d&lBau ein Aerial Interface"
	quest.1C5237FB9264571A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brass casing&r, &6cogwheel&r and &6Electron Tube&r make the &6Sequenced Gearshift&r. On redstone it plays back up to five instructions: turn by an angle, move pistons by blocks, wait, reverse."
		""
		"A lift travels exactly three floors, a gate opens by 90 degrees."
	]
	quest.1C5237FB9264571A.quest_subtitle: "The Sequenced Gearshift."
	quest.1C5237FB9264571A.title: "&6Program a rotation"
	quest.1C53A547829E958B.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Wooden Grips&r, a &6Heavy Engineering Block&r and an &6Iron Mechanical Component&r make the &6Mining Drill&r. Wooden Grip: five Treated Sticks and a copper nugget."
		""
		"&6Drill head:&r four steel ingots and a steel block make the &6Steel Drill Head&r, with iron the Iron Drill Head. Put the drill into the &6Engineer's Workbench&r and insert the head. The head wears out, you repair it in an anvil."
		""
		"It runs on &6Biodiesel&r. Fill it at the Refinery, a barrel or a tank. While sneaking it drills only one block."
	]
	quest.1C53A547829E958B.quest_subtitle: "Ore and stone in passing, on Biodiesel."
	quest.1C53A547829E958B.title: "&6&lBuild a Mining Drill"
	quest.1C53D98CE08A136C.quest_desc: [
		"Zweite Generation, zweiter Teil. Nashi-Birne bis Hartriegel und die Silberweide stehen für 2 Smaragde im Markt, die leuchtende Reihe nicht."
		""
		"&6Nashi-Birne&r: Red-Delicious-Apfel + Blühende Azalee, 10 %"
		"&6Walnuss&r: Silberlinde + Kirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Vogelkirsche&r: Silberlinde + Kirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Eibe&r: Europäische Lärche + Fichte, 10 %"
		"&6Hartriegel&r: Silberlinde + Kirsche, 5 %"
		"&6Foggy Blast&r: Cave Dweller + Soul Tree, 5 %"
		"&6Night Fuchsia&r: Purple Spiral + Sparkle Cherry, 5 %"
		"&6Slimy Delight&r: Rippling Willow + Soul Tree, 5 %"
		"&6Time Traveller&r: Blue Yonder + Rippling Willow, 5 %"
		"&6Silberweide&r: Silberlinde + Eiche oder Birke, 5 %"
	]
	quest.1C53D98CE08A136C.quest_subtitle: "10 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.1C53D98CE08A136C.title: "&aGeneration 2: Nashi-Birne bis Silberweide"
	quest.1C58857CA43411EE.quest_desc: [
		"A &6flint&r over a &6stick&r."
		""
		"With the knife you cut on the cutting board, harvest straw from grass and wheat and cut cakes into slices. Pigs you kill with it drop ham."
	]
	quest.1C58857CA43411EE.quest_subtitle: "The most important tool in the kitchen."
	quest.1C58857CA43411EE.title: "&6Build a Flint Knife"
	quest.1C5DFC4BF6B519DC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_dimensions_d_mining.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r 4 Andesit-Gehäuse, 4 Infundiertes Eisen und ein Quellstein in der Mitte ergeben 2 Grubenrahmen. Zehn davon und ein Quellstein öffnen das Portal."
		""
		"Dahinter liegt eine eigene Welt nur zum Graben, alle drei Tage neu. Kapitel &6Erkundung&r."
	]
	quest.1C5DFC4BF6B519DC.quest_subtitle: "The frame for the gate to the farm world."
	quest.1C5DFC4BF6B519DC.title: "&6Bau den Grubenrahmen"
	quest.1C6AB50CF6C9C109.quest_desc: [
		"&6Millstone&r: &d4 SU per RPM&r. 128 SU at 32 RPM, so one water wheel carries two."
	]
	quest.1C6AB50CF6C9C109.quest_subtitle: "Mills calmly at low speed."
	quest.1C6AB50CF6C9C109.title: "&7Millstone: 4 SU per RPM"
	quest.1C6FCD3B9D470860.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: relay with &e4 quartz&r and &e4 lapis lazuli&r."
		""
		"Draws from several jars and delivers to several targets, with much more throughput than a relay. Ars Elemental turns it into the Water Relay with more storage and throughput with 2 Water Essences and 2 diamonds."
	]
	quest.1C6FCD3B9D470860.quest_subtitle: "One source, many targets."
	quest.1C6FCD3B9D470860.title: "&aBuild a Splitter"
	quest.1C73B22811770C4C.quest_desc: [
		"Hold an empty &6glass bottle&r into the dragon's purple clouds until you have &e4 dragon's breath&r."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r lingering potions in the brewing stand, the glyphs &eLinger&r and &eWall&r from Ars Nouveau, several rituals from Occultism, including the &6Possessed Shulker&r."
		""
		"Collect during the first fight already, after that you have to summon the dragon again."
	]
	quest.1C73B22811770C4C.quest_subtitle: "The purple clouds, in bottles."
	quest.1C73B22811770C4C.title: "&dBottle Dragon's Breath"
	quest.1C73E7DE9BF8CAA8.quest_desc: [
		"In manchen Tiefen Dunkelheiten steht eine &6Antike Stadt&r aus Tiefenschiefer, mit einem großen Rahmen aus &6Verstärktem Tiefenschiefer&r in der Mitte. Folge den Seelenlaternen, die Stadt liegt meist in der Mitte des Bioms."
		""
		"&eIn den Truhen:&r &6Echoscherben&r, Plattenbruchstücke, Bücher mit Flinkes Schleichen, und von Deeper and Darker die &6Resonarium-Schmiedevorlage&r (etwa jede zweite Truhe), der &6Wärterpanzer&r (jede fünfte) und die &6Wärter-Schmiedevorlage&r für Stufe 4."
		""
		"&eEchoscherben&r brauchst du gleich für den Portalrahmen, nimm alle mit. Occultism kann sie auch herstellen, aus Grauer Paste und Echostaub."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Hier liegt auch der &6Echosplitter&r für den Afrit Miner, siehe Kapitel Occultism: Afrit und Marid. Ein Ausflug lohnt sich doppelt."
	]
	quest.1C73E7DE9BF8CAA8.quest_subtitle: "Truhen, Scherben, Schmiedevorlagen."
	quest.1C73E7DE9BF8CAA8.title: "&8Finde eine Antike Stadt"
	quest.1C75BD1FD19521C8.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/quarries_coe_netherite.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Diamond drill:&r an iron drill with &6diamonds&r and a &6diamond block&r. At the smithing table it becomes the &6netherite drill&r with netherite."
		""
		"Only the netherite drill opens two veins: &6hardened diamond&r (1,024 SU, 500 mB lava, a raw diamond every 20 seconds, 10 percent chance of an extra diamond) and &6netherite&r in the Nether (2,048 SU, 1,000 mB lava, every 200 seconds, 20 percent ancient debris)."
	]
	quest.1C75BD1FD19521C8.quest_subtitle: "For netherite and diamond veins."
	quest.1C75BD1FD19521C8.title: "&6Build a Netherite Drill"
	quest.1C76F044A6C17945.quest_desc: [
		"Hold the &eCompare Hovered Equipment&r key (controls settings under Apotheosis) over an item in your inventory, and the piece you are wearing appears next to the tooltip. So you see right away whether the find is better."
		""
		"With &eLink Hovered Item to Chat&r you send an item to chat, one every 5 seconds. Everyone in chat can hover over it and read the full tooltip. Handy for trading and for showing off."
		""
		"&eLuck:&r The &6Luck&r attribute shifts the weights toward better rarities and purities with every find. Frontier gives 20 percent, potions of luck and affixes with Luck count too. &eDetailed Info&r in the world tier menu already includes your luck, with Shift you see the base values."
	]
	quest.1C76F044A6C17945.quest_subtitle: "Two keys every collector needs."
	quest.1C76F044A6C17945.title: "&eCompare and Link"
	quest.1C79E8F0E3E0364C.quest_desc: [
		"The Chaos Guardian is dead, and with it &6Kronwerke Season 2&r ends. The fireworks go up."
		""
		"From cobblestone and waterwheels to antimatter and chaos: you built this together. Thanks to everyone who played, watched and helped."
	]
	quest.1C79E8F0E3E0364C.quest_subtitle: "Thanks for playing."
	quest.1C79E8F0E3E0364C.title: "&5&lCelebrate the End of the Season"
	quest.1C7BD39CB453595A.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Bauplantisch&r von Create (Holzstufen und glatter Stein) ist schon offen. Mit &6Bauplan und Feder&r markierst du ein Gebäude, speicherst es als Datei und lädst es am Tisch wieder hoch. So sicherst du heute schon, was du gebaut hast."
		""
		"Die &6Bauplankanone&r, die den Plan Block für Block aufbaut, öffnet mit &6Stufe 2&r, sie braucht Messing und ein Präzisionsgetriebe. Alles dazu im Kapitel &6Create: Messing&r."
		""
		"Ebenfalls Stufe 2: der &6Symmetriestab&r, der jeden gesetzten Block gespiegelt setzt, und der &6Extendo Griff&r für Reichweite beim Bauen."
	]
	quest.1C7BD39CB453595A.quest_subtitle: "Der Bauplantisch jetzt, die Kanone in Stufe 2."
	quest.1C7BD39CB453595A.title: "&dAusblick: Baupläne"
	quest.1C8989D406E1974B.quest_desc: [
		"Just like the tool: a &6diamond armor piece&r in the middle, &e2 Inferium Ingots&r left and right, &e2 Inferium Gemstones&r top and bottom."
		""
		"Inferium armor lasts longer than diamond (factor 40 instead of 33) and gives &e21 armor points&r for the full set instead of 20, with the same toughness. It is repaired with Inferium Ingots, and every piece has an augment slot for stage 2. The &6Inferium Chestplate&r is the best start, it takes the most damage."
	]
	quest.1C8989D406E1974B.quest_subtitle: "Diamond armor with Inferium."
	quest.1C8989D406E1974B.title: "&aUpgrade an Armor Piece"
	quest.1C89DF95F9768432.quest_desc: [
		"&5Osorin's Unbound Calling&r, 13x13: &e16 pink&r, &e16 light blue&r and &e16 green&r signs, no candles, no skulls."
		"&6Pink:&r impure chalk, 3 Demonic Meat. &6Light blue:&r impure chalk, ice, packed ice and blue ice dust (Djinni Crusher). &6Green:&r impure chalk, Nature Paste."
		""
		"Wild spirits need no binding book, the start item is different for each ritual. &eWild Hunt&r: copper, silver, gold block, diamond, netherrack, soul sand, start skeleton skull, sacrifice villager. It brings wither skeleton skulls."
		""
		"Plus hordes (husk, drowned, charged creeper, silverfish), Breeze, illagers with totem, bee nest, bell, budding amethyst and horse armour."
	]
	quest.1C89DF95F9768432.quest_subtitle: "No protection, only calling."
	quest.1C89DF95F9768432.title: "&5Draw Osorin's Unbound Calling"
	quest.1C8B47411C5768DE.quest_desc: [
		"Finde den &6Hain der Umvuthana&r in einer Savanne. Seine Krieger tragen Masken, auf dem Thron sitzt &cUmvuthi&r mit &e150 Lebenspunkten&r. Er ruft seine Krieger zu Hilfe und schießt mit Sonnenfeuer."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r die &6Sol Visage&r. Sie zerbricht nie. Trägst du sie und hältst eine Umvuthana-Maske in der Hand, rufst du mit Rechtsklick einen Krieger, der für dich kämpft. Rechtsklick auf ihn schickt ihn zurück in die Maske."
	]
	quest.1C8B47411C5768DE.quest_subtitle: "Der Herrscher des Hains in der Savanne."
	quest.1C8B47411C5768DE.title: "&6Besiege Umvuthi, den Sonnenvogel"
	quest.1C92CB282D5FECF5.quest_desc: [
		"Look at a place from the outside first before you storm in, and tick this off."
		""
		"On the right you find a checklist of the structures in the pack, mod by mod. There are chests almost everywhere; some places are harmless, others guarded."
	]
	quest.1C92CB282D5FECF5.quest_subtitle: "Something waits everywhere."
	quest.1C92CB282D5FECF5.title: "&6&lExplore structures"
	quest.1C92E630E7985B10.quest_desc: [
		"Every basic storage with alloy and osmium around it becomes advanced. &6Fluid Tank&r 64,000 mB, &6Chemical Tank&r 256,000 mB, &6Bin&r 8,192 items."
		""
		"The contents stay when you upgrade at the crafting table."
	]
	quest.1C92E630E7985B10.quest_subtitle: "Double, fourfold, double as much."
	quest.1C92E630E7985B10.title: "&bUpgrade tanks and bins"
	quest.1CA0F494A591D58E.quest_desc: [
		"Top left a &6Promise of Velocity&r, gold next to it. Middle iron, &6Promise of Productivity&r, iron. At the bottom gold."
		""
		"If the ring is anywhere in your inventory, you walk faster, jump higher and step up whole blocks. Sneaking suppresses the step assist."
	]
	quest.1CA0F494A591D58E.quest_subtitle: "Walk faster, jump higher."
	quest.1CA0F494A591D58E.title: "&6Forge an Effortless Ring"
	quest.1CA43B0168D34FA6.quest_desc: [
		"&66 Rotten Blisterberries&r and a &6Twistytwig&r on top make a &6Blisterbomb&r. The rotten berries drop from Blisterberry Bushes next to the good ones."
		""
		"Throw them into a group of rotspawn before they reach you. Eight bombs around a &6Gloomgourd&r make a &6Boomgourd&r, an explosive block for bigger holes."
	]
	quest.1CA43B0168D34FA6.quest_subtitle: "Rotten berries with a bang."
	quest.1CA43B0168D34FA6.title: "&cBuild Blisterbombs"
	quest.1CA94B2BC2861B20.quest_desc: [
		"Iron, copper, iron at the top, a glass cable below in the middle. MEGA Cells' &6ME Cell Dock&r holds exactly one cell."
		""
		"It is like a small ME Chest without a terminal, but a flat cable part: several docks fit on the same piece of cable. Handy as a buffer in a small subnetwork."
	]
	quest.1CA94B2BC2861B20.quest_subtitle: "One cell, flat on the cable."
	quest.1CA94B2BC2861B20.title: "&7Place an ME Cell Dock"
	quest.1CAC05AB22B596CC.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &63 Alfglass&r in a V shape make &63 Alfglass Flasks&r."
		""
		"With an empty flask you catch ender essence: right click the little cloud before it fades. A dispenser in front of the cloud does that too."
	]
	quest.1CAC05AB22B596CC.quest_subtitle: "Empty flasks for the essence."
	quest.1CAC05AB22B596CC.title: "&bBlow Alfglass Flasks"
	quest.1CB2BB336E1C636F.quest_desc: [
		"Tiara plus a &6quartz kind&r at the crafting table changes the wings. You can swap them back any time."
		""
		"The quartz kinds are in the Lexica under decorative blocks, the elves trade you Elven Quartz for Nether quartz."
	]
	quest.1CB2BB336E1C636F.quest_subtitle: "Every quartz kind, a pair of wings."
	quest.1CB2BB336E1C636F.title: "&bGive the Tiara Wings"
	quest.1CB4D625B817C55B.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Glacite&r and smelt it in a furnace into &68 Glacite Shards&r. Glacite lies in the &6Starlight Permafrost Forest&r and on the &6Permafrost Peaks&r, from &eY -64 to 45&r."
		""
		"It becomes armor (freezes attackers), tools, arrows and, with Starcore, the &6Frozen Bombs&r. Below the forest lies a layer of Ashen Snow."
	]
	quest.1CB4D625B817C55B.quest_subtitle: "The ice of the eternal frost."
	quest.1CB4D625B817C55B.title: "&fSmelt Glacite"
	quest.1CB83D6658D893E5.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6Andesite Alloy&r, &6clock&r, &6Andesite Alloy&r on top, two &6iron sheets&r around an &6iron ingot&r in the middle, an &6iron ingot&r at the bottom give the &6Oil Scanner&r. Right click, wait a moment, and it tells you whether under this chunk there is &cno oil&r, &ea little&r, &aa lot&r or an &binexhaustible&r supply. It does not work too high up."
		""
		"Some biomes have more oil than others. Whoever finds and marks the rich chunks near the base now saves the search later."
		""
		"&eStage 3:&r Then the &6Pumpjack&r (bearing, crank, head and a pipe down to bedrock), the &6Distillation Tower&r (a controller on a tank at least three blocks high, heated) and the &6Huge Diesel Engine&r open. 100 mB of crude oil become 50 mB of &bdiesel&r and 50 mB of &bgasoline&r, superheated 75 mB each. Crude oil with gravel and sand also gives asphalt in the heated mixer."
	]
	quest.1CB83D6658D893E5.quest_subtitle: "The Oil Scanner shows what lies under the chunk."
	quest.1CB83D6658D893E5.title: "&6Search for Oil"
	quest.1CBB52F9CEC18DAE.quest_desc: [
		"Apply a &6brass ingot&r to &6stripped wood&r with right click, that gives a &6Brass Casing&r. The Create mixer over a Blaze Burner makes brass."
		""
		"{image:create:textures/block/brass_casing.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"You need a casing under the pearl pool, an ingot in the Runic Altar and two casings in the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate. Without a brass line of your own: trade Manasteel or Runes of Fire with the engineers."
	]
	quest.1CBB52F9CEC18DAE.quest_subtitle: "Pearls, runes and Terrasteel need the technology."
	quest.1CBB52F9CEC18DAE.title: "&6Get brass casings"
	quest.1CC45297F418C1C6.quest_desc: [
		"&62 gold nuggets&r, an &6ink sac&r and &63 paper&r make three &6Return Scrolls&r. Each takes you once to the nearest activated waystone."
		""
		"{image:waystones:textures/item/return_scroll.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Travelling with scrolls costs no levels on Kronwerke. One belongs in every bag that goes into a cave."
	]
	quest.1CC45297F418C1C6.quest_subtitle: "The quick way back, free of charge."
	quest.1CC45297F418C1C6.title: "&6Pack a Return Scroll"
	quest.1CC96C3B9616C7C4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/enderio_smelter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6copper ingot&r in the middle, four &6gold nuggets&r on the sides, two &6grains&r in two opposite corners."
		""
		"Every Ender IO machine has a &ecapacitor slot&r. If it is empty, the machine does nothing and says so in its window."
		""
		"&eNote on names:&r In the German game this part is wrongly called a capacitor bank. In English it is the &6Basic Capacitor&r. The real bank is a block, further down."
	]
	quest.1CC96C3B9616C7C4.quest_subtitle: "Without it, no machine moves."
	quest.1CC96C3B9616C7C4.title: "&eBuild a Basic Capacitor"
	quest.1CD3D976FC257AAE.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6Blank Module&r, a &6hopper&r and an &6eye of ender&r, shapeless. A &6Vacuum Module&r."
		""
		"It collects all items in a cube with &e13 blocks&r edge length around the router into the buffer. With Range Augments up to 25 blocks, with a direction only on one side."
		""
		"Under a mob farm, behind a Create drill, next to the bee house: wherever something drops, a router with vacuum and sender replaces a pile of hoppers."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The &6XP Vacuum Augment&r (Augment Core and soul sand) sucks up experience instead and turns it into &6bottles of enchanting&r, one per 7 XP."
	]
	quest.1CD3D976FC257AAE.quest_subtitle: "The Vacuum Module gets whatever lies around."
	quest.1CD3D976FC257AAE.title: "&aVacuum the Floor"
	quest.1CDEECC369D87ED6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Energy Unit:&r Infused Alloy, Module Base, a Basic Induction Cell, HDPE. More battery for everything. &6Jetpack Unit:&r Reinforced Alloy, Module Base, a jetpack, polonium."
		""
		"&eRule of thumb:&r simple modules (energy, Geiger, radiation shielding) need HDPE, strong ones (jetpack, servo, night vision, magnet) polonium."
	]
	quest.1CDEECC369D87ED6.quest_subtitle: "The most important first."
	quest.1CDEECC369D87ED6.title: "&bBuild Energy and Jetpack Units"
	quest.1CE952977530DD6E.quest_desc: [
		"Ein zweiter &6Elektrolyseur&r mit &6Sole&r statt Wasser: &e10 mB Sole&r werden &e1 mB Natrium&r und &e1 mB Chlor&r. Die Sole macht der &6Chemische Oxidierer&r aus &6Salz&r, 15 mB pro Stück."
		""
		"&6Chemischer Oxidierer:&r Infundierte Legierung in die Ecken, Schaltkreise oben und unten, links eine Persönliche Truhe, in der Mitte ein &6Dynamischer Tank&r, rechts ein Einfacher Chemikalienbehälter. Etwa &d80 FE/t&r."
		""
		"&eSalz:&r Salzblöcke liegen in Tonablagerungen unter Wasser, ein Block gibt in der Anreicherungskammer 4 Salz. Ohne Salz macht eine &6Wärmeverdampfungsanlage&r aus 10 mB Wasser 1 mB Sole, langsam und mit Sonne."
		""
		"&eAbkürzung für den Anfang:&r Salz direkt in den Chemikalien-Slot der Injektionskammer gibt &e2 mB Chlorwasserstoff&r pro Stück, ganz ohne Gase."
	]
	quest.1CE952977530DD6E.quest_subtitle: "Salz, Oxidierer, zweiter Elektrolyseur."
	quest.1CE952977530DD6E.title: "&aMach Chlor aus Sole"
	quest.1CF2818FA37F7E3D.quest_desc: [
		"On the left of the book the chapters are sorted into groups: &6Start&r, &6Tech&r, &dMagic&r, &aWorld and Exploration&r and &6Storage and Tools&r. Clicking the group name folds it in and out."
		""
		"Every chapter is a mod or a topic and starts with the easiest step. Quests are connected by lines: what depends on a quest only becomes visible or doable once it is done."
		""
		"Chapters of later stages appear as soon as the stage is open. In stage 1 there are seven chapters, by the end of the season about 45."
	]
	quest.1CF2818FA37F7E3D.quest_subtitle: "Five groups, one chapter per mod."
	quest.1CF2818FA37F7E3D.title: "&6Find your way around the chapters"
	quest.1CF535A43EB8DF37.quest_desc: [
		"Eight advanced transmitters around a &6Reinforced Alloy&r give Elite, eight Elite around an &6Atomic Alloy&r give Ultimate."
		""
		"&eUltimate:&r cable &d3,276,800 FE/t&r, transporter 64 items per pull, pressurized tube 256,000 mB, pipe 32,000 mB per pull."
	]
	quest.1CF535A43EB8DF37.quest_subtitle: "One alloy, eight transmitters."
	quest.1CF535A43EB8DF37.title: "&eLay Ultimate Transmitters"
	quest.1CFF37EBE286FADE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_master_tribute.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Start the ritual outside on an open field. &cWhen it appears the Chimera destroys the blocks around the brazier&r, and so does its dive on this server."
		""
		"According to the handbook a fight for mages with tier 2 spells and good gear. It resists cold. Go in twos or threes, bring Heal, Slowfall and Dispel."
		""
		"{image:ars_nouveau:textures/item/wilden_tribute.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1CFF37EBE286FADE.quest_subtitle: "Spike, horn and wing in one body."
	quest.1CFF37EBE286FADE.title: "&5Defeat the Wilden Chimera"
	quest.1D014BD9B00876E4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/theurgy_wire.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Copper, Mercury Shard, copper&r in a row: ten wires. Right click a logistics block, then the next one."
		""
		"Everything that is connected is one network. Several inserters get served in turn. A &6Connection Node&r (Mercury, iron, three bricks, gives three) bridges long distances."
	]
	quest.1D014BD9B00876E4.quest_subtitle: "A network as long as you like."
	quest.1D014BD9B00876E4.title: "&bConnect Them with Copper Wire"
	quest.1D0771FD5F02EF27.quest_desc: [
		"Mana Spreader plus &e1 redstone&r. It fires one burst on every &eredstone pulse&r, even without a target."
		""
		"With the mana lenses from stage 2 it becomes a tool that mines blocks or pushes items."
	]
	quest.1D0771FD5F02EF27.quest_subtitle: "Only fires on command."
	quest.1D0771FD5F02EF27.title: "&6Build a Pulse Mana Spreader"
	quest.1D08E4F559D9BD58.quest_desc: [
		"Drakonisches Stück, 6 Erwachte Draconiumbarren, Chaotischer Kern, Chaotischer Energiekern, 128 Millionen OP."
		""
		"Chaotische Waffen knacken die Kristalle eines Chaoswächters direkt. Für weitere Inseln wird der Kampf damit deutlich leichter."
	]
	quest.1D08E4F559D9BD58.quest_subtitle: "Draconic Evolution: das letzte Werkzeug."
	quest.1D08E4F559D9BD58.title: "&8Fusioniere Chaotisch"
	quest.1D0A4C58515E58C0.quest_desc: [
		"Kreuz &6Lawson-Zypresse&r und &6Eiche&r (10 Prozent) zur &6Korkeiche&r und schick ihre Stämme durch den &6Entrinder&r: pro Stamm ein &6Kork&r im Rindenslot. Zimtstämme geben &6Zimt&r, die Stämme des &6Slimy Delight&r einen &aSchleimball&r."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/cork.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Kork hat im Pack kein Rezept, er ist ein Sammelstück. Der Schleimball dagegen ist ein echter Grund für den Slimy Delight: eine Schleimfarm aus Holz, ohne Sumpf und ohne Schleimkreide. Der Baum ist ein leuchtender Hybrid aus Rippling Willow und Soul Tree, siehe rechts."
		""
		"Von Hand geht es auch: Axt-Rechtsklick auf den Stamm entrindet ihn und lässt den Kork oder Schleim fallen. Holz-Blöcke (4 Stämme) geben beim Entrinden nichts, nur Stämme."
	]
	quest.1D0A4C58515E58C0.quest_subtitle: "Drei Bäume verstecken etwas unter der Rinde."
	quest.1D0A4C58515E58C0.title: "&6Züchte die Korkeiche"
	quest.1D1C996FA3524154.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Sevira's Permanent Confinement."
		"&6Bowls:&r your &6Apprentice Ritual Satchel&r, an &cAfrit Essence&r, &e4 ender pearls&r. The contents are kept."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Afrit book, 180 seconds."
		""
		"If all chalks, candles, Crystals and skulls are inside, the Afrit draws the whole pentacle at once. Right click on the golden bowl of a finished pentacle packs everything back in. For the many Kandar summonings that saves minutes every time."
	]
	quest.1D1C996FA3524154.quest_subtitle: "A whole pentacle with one click."
	quest.1D1C996FA3524154.title: "&6Bind the Artisanal Ritual Satchel"
	quest.1D1FBF42CFAB8E96.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Rutsche&r: trägt Gegenstände senkrecht von einem Inventar ins nächste, nach unten von allein, nach oben mit einem Ummantelten Lüfter oben oder unten. Schräg, wenn sie seitlich an eine andere Rutsche gesetzt wird. Kein Filter. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Zwei Eisenbleche um einen Eisenbarren ergeben vier. Mit dem Schraubenschlüssel bekommt sie ein Fenster."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r Die &6Intelligente Rutsche&r (Messingblech, Rutsche, Elektronenröhre) filtert und zählt Stapel."
	]
	quest.1D1FBF42CFAB8E96.quest_subtitle: "Create, Rutsche: senkrecht nach unten, mit Lüfter nach oben."
	quest.1D1FBF42CFAB8E96.title: "Bau eine Rutsche"
	quest.1D20F14FEFA15259.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6campfire&r in the middle, &e3 gold ingots&r and &e3 archwood planks&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Bind a Potion Jar to the diffuser with the Dominion Wand. Every &e10 minutes&r it takes a potion from the jar and gives the effect to everyone nearby every few seconds."
		""
		"A jar with night vision or fire resistance in the workshop, and nobody has to drink anymore."
	]
	quest.1D20F14FEFA15259.quest_subtitle: "One potion for the whole base."
	quest.1D20F14FEFA15259.title: "&dSet up a Potion Diffuser"
	quest.1D25DFC8891F045F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Repository&r: &e4 Archwood logs&r in a cross, &e4 gold nuggets&r in the corners, the middle empty. &6Repository Catalog&r: shapeless Repository and Magebloom Fiber."
		""
		"A Repository holds as much as a double chest and keeps its name when mined. Named inventories get their own &etab&r in the lectern."
		""
		"The catalog manages a chain of Repositories placed next to each other as a single inventory and is easy on the server while doing so. For large storage it is better than many single chests at the lectern."
	]
	quest.1D25DFC8891F045F.quest_subtitle: "The storage that goes with the lectern."
	quest.1D25DFC8891F045F.title: "&aBuild Repositories and a Catalog"
	quest.1D274D6E98168F3E.quest_desc: [
		"Leg &6Eisenbarren&r in die Kammer und gib &e2 Bar&r darauf. Jeder Barren wird zu einem &6Druckeisenbarren&r, nichts geht verloren. Ein &6Eisenblock&r wird genauso zu einem &6Druckeisenblock&r."
		""
		"Nimm Blöcke statt Barren: Die Schnittstelle kostet 1 000 mL pro Gegenstand, ein Block ist neun Barren für den Preis von einem. Neun Druckeisenblöcke ergeben an der Werkbank wieder 81 Barren."
		""
		"Ab hier ist Druckeisen kein Engpass mehr. Druckeisenblöcke sind außerdem sehr gute Wärmeleiter, dazu mehr im Abschnitt Hitze."
	]
	quest.1D274D6E98168F3E.quest_subtitle: "2 Bar statt TNT."
	quest.1D274D6E98168F3E.title: "&7Presse Eisen ohne Verlust"
	quest.1D2E9747531D6EE6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Feeding Trough&r (planks, hay bale, golden carrot) into the pen, filled with &6wheat&r, carrots or seeds. Animals nearby eat from it and breed as long as there is food inside."
		""
		"A hopper from the wheat pot into the top of the trough, and the supply comes on its own. A fence and a gate, that is all the pen needs."
		""
		"Trough, nest and market are in the &6Food and Farming&r chapter (animals and market)."
	]
	quest.1D2E9747531D6EE6.quest_subtitle: "The herd feeds itself."
	quest.1D2E9747531D6EE6.title: "&6Set up a feeding trough"
	quest.1D36723ED39C884B.quest_desc: [
		"Refined Obsidian in the corners, Ultimate Control Circuits at the top and bottom, Atomic Alloy left and right, a diamond block in the middle."
		""
		"It keeps the chunks around it loaded, you choose which in the window. For whole factory halls it is better than an anchor upgrade per machine."
	]
	quest.1D36723ED39C884B.quest_subtitle: "Keeps chunks loaded."
	quest.1D36723ED39C884B.title: "&7Build a Dimensional Stabilizer"
	quest.1D435C6A3BC3D3CA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_pure_daisy.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e4 white petals&r in the apothecary. Plant it and put blocks on the &e8 spaces around it&r, at the same height. After about a minute everything is transformed."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/block/pure_daisy.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Stone&r becomes &6Livingrock&r, every &6log&r a &6Livingwood log&r."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r It has to be stone, not cobblestone. Smelt cobblestone in the furnace. Build two or three daisies right away, you need huge amounts of both."
	]
	quest.1D435C6A3BC3D3CA.quest_subtitle: "Nothing in Botania works without this flower."
	quest.1D435C6A3BC3D3CA.title: "&aPlant a Pure Daisy"
	quest.1D444AAC25024D92.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a placed &6brass casing&r with a &6Sturdy Sheet&r. It becomes a &6Railway Casing&r. A deployer does that at the belt too."
		""
		"Railway Casings become station, signals, observers, doors and Train Controls. Clicked onto a track it becomes a bogey."
	]
	quest.1D444AAC25024D92.quest_subtitle: "Every train is built from it."
	quest.1D444AAC25024D92.title: "&6Make a Railway Casing"
	quest.1D527FD4BD11E420.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Railway Casing&r and an &6electron tube&r make four &6Train Signals&r. Click them onto the track and set them down next to it."
		""
		"Signals divide the line into &esections&r. A train only enters a free section. On double track lines each direction needs its own signals."
	]
	quest.1D527FD4BD11E420.quest_subtitle: "Several trains, no accidents."
	quest.1D527FD4BD11E420.title: "&6Divide the line with signals"
	quest.1D58EEC36BD48654.quest_desc: [
		"A &6bucket&r in the middle, &6eight planks&r around it. 1x2 and 2x2 exist with two and four buckets."
		""
		"A bucket in hand and right click fills or empties it. Create pipes can fill and empty it as well."
	]
	quest.1D58EEC36BD48654.quest_subtitle: "One kind of fluid per compartment."
	quest.1D58EEC36BD48654.title: "Build a fluid drawer"
	quest.1D5D474B475C6466.quest_desc: [
		"&eFilter:&r A tag filter with &ec:ores&r takes every ore. Without a filter it mines nothing. The &eInverse mode&r mines everything that matches no filter."
		""
		"&eHeight and radius:&r min and max Y limit the work, the radius goes up to &e32&r. A narrow band around the height of your ore saves a lot of time."
		""
		"&eReplacement:&r Per filter you can choose a block that is placed in place of the ore, cobblestone for example, which you put into its inventory. That way no holes are left behind."
		""
		"&eSilk Touch&r costs twelve times as much power. Per block it needs 80 ticks without upgrades, Speed Upgrades make it faster."
	]
	quest.1D5D474B475C6466.quest_subtitle: "Filter, height, replacement block."
	quest.1D5D474B475C6466.title: "&6Set up the miner properly"
	quest.1D60F7B9916F92B1.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Lohen&r am Spawner mit dem Learner im Inventar. Du bist dort ohnehin für Create."
		""
		"Das Lohen-Modell kostet &d256 FE/t&r, und eine Vorhersage wird im Fabrikator zu &616 Lohenruten&r. Schon in Stufe 3 ergeben zwei &6Nether-Vorhersagen&r und ein Knochen an der Werkbank eine Rute, ganz ohne Fabrikator."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Messing braucht Lohenstaub, und das Messingziel am Obelisken verlangt 2.000 Barren. Ein fertiges Lohen-Modell ist der bequemste Nachschub, den es gibt."
	]
	quest.1D60F7B9916F92B1.quest_subtitle: "Sechzehn Ruten pro Vorhersage."
	quest.1D60F7B9916F92B1.title: "&6Lerne die Lohe"
	quest.1D676F3F50213DC1.quest_desc: [
		"An &6ender pearl&r on top, &6two iron ingots&r next to the upgrade base, at the bottom &6redstone&r, a &6wooden chest&r and &6redstone&r."
		""
		"In the filter you set which items you always want to have with you. When a stack of them gets smaller in your inventory, the upgrade tops it up from the backpack. Torches, building blocks, food: you never notice something running out."
	]
	quest.1D676F3F50213DC1.quest_subtitle: "The hotbar never runs empty."
	quest.1D676F3F50213DC1.title: "Build a Refill Upgrade"
	quest.1D68228F76A8678F.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.voice_chat\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" for the \"},{\"text\":\"Simple Voice Chat\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" menu: choose microphone, volume, push to talk or voice activation. Anyone up to \"},{\"text\":\"48 blocks\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" away hears you, quieter with distance. Whispering reaches 24 blocks.\"}]"
		""
		"In the same menu you create a &6group&r or join one. Group members hear each other everywhere, even across dimensions. An icon at the edge of the screen shows who is talking right now, and recordings via the menu are allowed on the server."
	]
	quest.1D68228F76A8678F.quest_subtitle: "Simple Voice Chat, by distance."
	quest.1D68228F76A8678F.title: "&6Talk to Your Neighbors"
	quest.1D7A624C62E60CB1.quest_desc: [
		"Into the basin over a heated burner: &6leaves&r, &b250 mB water&r and &b250 mB milk&r. The mixer makes &b500 mB tea&r from it. A &6spout&r fills 250 mB each into a &6glass bottle&r: &6Builder's Tea&r."
		"{image:create:textures/item/builders_tea.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"It fills you up and makes you faster at mining, ideal for long building evenings."
		""
		"&6Tip:&r Heated, &6sugar&r, &6cocoa beans&r and 250 mB milk make liquid &6chocolate&r. The press over the basin presses chocolate bars from it."
	]
	quest.1D7A624C62E60CB1.quest_subtitle: "The heated mixer can cook too."
	quest.1D7A624C62E60CB1.title: "&6Brew Builder's Tea"
	quest.1D8329C22BA9ED50.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r eine &6Kerze&r über einem &6Eisenbarren&r. Mit einer gefärbten Kerze bekommst du einen Kerzenständer in deren Farbe."
		""
		"Stell ihn auf den Tisch oder häng ihn an die Wand und zünde ihn mit Feuerstein und Stahl an. Weniger hell als eine Fackel, dafür sieht ein Speisesaal damit nach Burg aus und nicht nach Mine."
	]
	quest.1D8329C22BA9ED50.quest_subtitle: "Warmes Licht für Tisch und Wand."
	quest.1D8329C22BA9ED50.title: "&eStell Kerzenständer auf"
	quest.1D892FB5E1EED654.quest_desc: [
		"&6Display Table:&r drei &6Reinforced Stone Slabs&r über zwei Compressed Iron. Ein &6Buch und Feder&r darüber ergibt die &6Tag Workbench&r."
		""
		"Leg links einen Gegenstand hinein, wähl seine Tags per Doppelklick, leg Papier in die Mitte und drück auf das Buch: heraus kommt ein &6Tag Filter&r."
		""
		"Den Tag Filter steckst du in die Filter der Logistics Frames oder in Item-Filter-Teile im Programmer. Er passt auf jeden Gegenstand mit einem der Tags, etwa alle Stämme oder alle Rohen Erze."
	]
	quest.1D892FB5E1EED654.quest_subtitle: "Alle Stämme, alle Erze, ein Filter."
	quest.1D892FB5E1EED654.title: "&6Filter nach Tags"
	quest.1D92AB179B32250C.quest_desc: [
		"A &6nickel&r in the top middle, below it &6steel&r, &6Magnetic Coil&r, steel make one &6Motor&r."
		""
		"The Pulverizer, Foundry, Assembler, laser and frame machines need two each. In the Assembler you get two motors from nickel, steel and two coils."
	]
	quest.1D92AB179B32250C.quest_subtitle: "Whatever moves needs a motor."
	quest.1D92AB179B32250C.title: "&bBuild Motors"
	quest.1D983D6CE06150E6.quest_desc: [
		"&dFell&r (Earth Essence, diamond axe): harvests whole trees, mushrooms and cacti."
		"&dSnare&r (Earth Essence, 4 cobwebs): the target can't move."
		"&dFreeze&r (Water Essence, 2 snow blocks): freezes water and lava, slows creatures."
		"&dBubble&r (Water Essence, 3 feathers, water bucket, boat): creatures float up in a bubble."
	]
	quest.1D983D6CE06150E6.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1 checklist: nature."
	quest.1D983D6CE06150E6.title: "&dLearn the earth and water glyphs"
	quest.1DA3D76FDF9593AD.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6Andesite Alloys&r in a U shape make a &6Basin&r. It takes items and fluids, by hand, through a chute, a funnel or a pipe."
		""
		"The mixer or the press works above the basin. The result stays in the basin until a funnel on its side takes it out."
	]
	quest.1DA3D76FDF9593AD.quest_subtitle: "Where things are mixed and compacted."
	quest.1DA3D76FDF9593AD.title: "&6Set up a basin"
	quest.1DA56D1142D5F0E0.quest_desc: [
		"Both on a &6Runewood&r totem base, three runes:"
		"&eHowling Gale:&r one &dArcane&r, two &fAerial&r. Movement and attack speed &d+40 percent&r."
		"&eFlowing Grasp:&r one &dArcane&r, two &bAqueous&r. Reach and pickup radius &d+40 percent&r."
		""
		"Flowing Grasp in the storage room or at the building site: you reach chests and blocks from farther away."
	]
	quest.1DA56D1142D5F0E0.quest_subtitle: "Rite of the Howling Gale and Flowing Grasp."
	quest.1DA56D1142D5F0E0.title: "&2Light Movement Auras"
	quest.1DBE949A46E884B0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Redstone-Modul&r (Redstone Module): ein Redstone über Druckluftrohr, &6Verstärker&r, Druckluftrohr. Es schickt Redstone-Signale durch das Rohrnetz zu anderen Redstone-Modulen, auf bis zu &e16 Kanälen&r. Den Kanal wählst du mit Farbstoff, der Schlüssel schaltet zwischen Eingang und Ausgang."
		""
		"&6Durchflussmesser&r (Flow Detector Module): vier &6Turbinenblätter&r in die Ecken um ein Druckluftrohr. Es misst, wie viel Luft durchströmt, und gibt &e0,2 mal mL pro Tick&r als Signal aus. So siehst du, ob eine Maschine gerade arbeitet."
		""
		"Mit einer &6Modul-Erweiterungskarte&r aus dem Abschnitt Platine kann das Redstone-Modul Signale verknüpfen, etwa umkehren oder mit einem zweiten Kanal verrechnen."
	]
	quest.1DBE949A46E884B0.quest_subtitle: "Redstone durchs Rohr, Luftstrom messen."
	quest.1DBE949A46E884B0.title: "&7Steck Module an deine Rohre"
	quest.1DC1331FA523CAC6.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r oben &6Tonklumpen&r, &6Redstone-Verstärker&r, Tonklumpen. Mitte &6Redstone&r, &6Glatter Stein&r, Redstone. Unten Tonklumpen, &6Goldbarren&r, Tonklumpen."
		""
		"{image:hostilenetworks:textures/item/blank_data_model.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Das &6Model Framework&r ist ein Datenmodell ohne Mob. Erst wenn du es auf ein Monster richtest, weiß es, was es lernen soll. Bau gleich drei oder vier, du wirst mehr als ein Modell wollen."
	]
	quest.1DC1331FA523CAC6.quest_subtitle: "Ein leerer Chip, der noch nichts weiß."
	quest.1DC1331FA523CAC6.title: "&7Bau ein Modellgerüst"
	quest.1DC314F2E335E176.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 brown&r, &e1 red&r, &e1 blue&r petal, &e1 Redstone Root&r. No mana needed."
		""
		"Near it, the &6Ring of Magnetization&r (from stage 2) pulls nothing in. Plant it next to the Endoflames, then your ring won't steal the coal."
	]
	quest.1DC314F2E335E176.quest_subtitle: "A zone without magnets."
	quest.1DC314F2E335E176.title: "&6Plant a Solegnolia"
	quest.1DC8862C667BE2D0.quest_desc: [
		"Steel, &6dispenser&r, steel at the top, &6Energy Pipe&r, &6block of redstone&r, Energy Pipe in the middle, three &6chests&r at the bottom make the &6Equipment Charger&r."
		""
		"It charges tools and armor with power, buffer 500,000 RF, and fills fluids into gear such as the jetpack, up to 16 buckets in its tank."
	]
	quest.1DC8862C667BE2D0.quest_subtitle: "Power and fuel for your gear."
	quest.1DC8862C667BE2D0.title: "&eBuild an Equipment Charger"
	quest.1DCDAF2EF0DEA6C0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/malum_healing_rite.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Runewood Logs stacked upright on the base. Right click with an arcana carves a rune: one &dArcane&r and two &eSacred&r. Right click the base to start."
		""
		"Everyone nearby slowly heals. An axe scrapes off wrong runes. The &6Totemic Staff&r (two sticks, one Runewood plank) shows the range."
	]
	quest.1DCDAF2EF0DEA6C0.quest_subtitle: "A totem that closes wounds."
	quest.1DCDAF2EF0DEA6C0.title: "&2Light the Rite of Healing"
	quest.1DCE65F307FDCDFB.quest_desc: [
		"&eKronwerke Core&r makes hostile mobs stronger with every open stage. In &estage 4&r they have &d120 percent&r more health, &d75 percent&r more damage and &d7&r extra armor points."
		""
		"So an enderman now takes more than twice as much as in stage 1. Go over with enchanted armor and a good weapon."
		""
		"&eBosses&r like the dragon and the Ender Guardian also grow with the group: for each additional player &d60 percent&r more health and &d15 percent&r more damage, up to eight players. From two players on they use lightning and a shockwave every twelve seconds."
	]
	quest.1DCE65F307FDCDFB.quest_subtitle: "They get tougher with every stage."
	quest.1DCE65F307FDCDFB.title: "&cKnow the Strength of the Monsters"
	quest.1DD1601A67C2C27F.quest_desc: [
		"An &6enderman head&r on top, Energetic Alloy, Soularium, Energetic Alloy in the middle, Soularium, &6Ensouled Chassis&r, Soularium at the bottom. The sword &6The Ender&r sometimes takes enderman heads along."
		""
		"With power, &d20 µI/t&r, it stops the mobs you enter in the soul filter from spawning within &e16 blocks&r. Without a soul filter it does nothing."
		""
		"&6Basic Soul Filter:&r four paper around a &6Soul Vial&r. You choose which mobs it means in the filter itself."
	]
	quest.1DD1601A67C2C27F.quest_subtitle: "No monsters around the base."
	quest.1DD1601A67C2C27F.title: "&5Set Up an Aversion Obelisk"
	quest.1DD703E08D9A6368.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Source Motor&r braucht einen Calibrated Precision Mechanism und ein &6Quellglas&r daneben. Er zieht Quelle aus dem Glas und dreht eine Welle, ganz ohne Wasser und Wind."
		""
		"&eArs Technica, Source Motor:&r Brennstoff Quelle. Die Seiten stellen die Drehzahl, die Front das Verhältnis von Last zu Drehzahl. Mehr Kraft kostet mehr Quelle. Für Magier mit vollen Quellgläsern der Weg zu Create. Offen ab Stufe 2, siehe Kapitel &dArs Nouveau: Magier&r."
	]
	quest.1DD703E08D9A6368.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: der Source Motor macht aus Quelle Rotation."
	quest.1DD703E08D9A6368.title: "&dTreib Create mit Quelle an"
	quest.1DDCF058D133D244.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_presses.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Right in the middle of the meteorite sits the &6Mysterious Cube&r. Break it and you have all four presses: &6Silicon&r, &6Logic&r, &6Calculation&r and &6Engineering&r."
		""
		"You never need more meteorites: the Inscriber copies a press when you put it in the top slot and an &6iron block&r in the middle. That way your team mate gets a set too."
	]
	quest.1DDCF058D133D244.quest_subtitle: "Find them once, copy them forever."
	quest.1DDCF058D133D244.title: "&7Get the four presses"
	quest.1DE73DA24F01B600.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Iron Mechanical Component&r on top, a &6Basic Engineering Block&r, a &6Conveyor Belt&r at the bottom make the &6Item Router&r."
		""
		"Every side has a colour and its own filter slots. What comes in goes to a side whose filter matches, otherwise to a side without a filter. If nothing matches at all, it does not accept it."
		""
		"Buttons above every filter: filter by tag (all ores, all ingots), ignore durability, respect enchantments. The &6Fluid Router&r does the same with fluids, with a Fluid Pipe instead of the Conveyor Belt."
	]
	quest.1DE73DA24F01B600.quest_subtitle: "Six sides, each with its own filter."
	quest.1DE73DA24F01B600.title: "&9Sort with the Item Router"
	quest.1DE8A2FA39111898.quest_desc: [
		"&6Drowned&r and &6squid&r give two, fish one, &6guardians&r three."
		""
		"For Calx, the Spirit Crucible and the Impetus."
	]
	quest.1DE8A2FA39111898.quest_subtitle: "Watery arcana."
	quest.1DE8A2FA39111898.title: "&bAqueous"
	quest.1DED5582591FB3EB.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6leather&r on top, &6iron&r, &6redstone&r, iron below make eight &6Conveyor Belts&r."
		""
		"They carry items and animals and push into any inventory at the end. The hammer turns them, sneaking it sets the slope. For more belts see the chapter &6Transport&r."
	]
	quest.1DED5582591FB3EB.quest_subtitle: "Transport without power."
	quest.1DED5582591FB3EB.title: "&7Lay Conveyor Belts"
	quest.1DF41A1FA0AF60BA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blood Orb&r: &e4 glass&r around an iron ingot, then fill it in the infuser (tier 1) with &e10 buckets&r of blood."
		"Kineticator: top right Blood Infusion Core and Dark Stick, middle gold, Blood Orb, gold, bottom Dark Stick and &6diamond&r."
		""
		"Sneak right click turns it on, right click changes the radius. It pulls items and experience orbs to you, near ones cost almost no blood, far ones a little more. Crafted the other way round, it pushes them away."
	]
	quest.1DF41A1FA0AF60BA.quest_subtitle: "A magnet for items and experience."
	quest.1DF41A1FA0AF60BA.title: "&cBuild a Kineticator"
	quest.1DF7740937C9656B.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Aviar's Circle."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6minecart&r, a &6chest&r, a &6dispenser&r, a &6hopper&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Its &6Book of Calling&r appears with it."
		""
		"Clicking a chest with the book while sneaking sets where it takes from, the target the same way. It also delivers into spirits, for example ore straight into the Crusher."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r It starts on &ewhitelist&r and carries nothing. Click it while sneaking and enter the items."
	]
	quest.1DF7740937C9656B.quest_subtitle: "A carrier who never gets tired."
	quest.1DF7740937C9656B.title: "&dSummon a Foliot Transporter"
	quest.1DF911F8B18CBBEF.quest_desc: [
		"Like the trash can, only with a &6bucket&r instead of the chest."
		""
		"Useful when a Create setup pumps more than you need. Its own filter for up to 9 fluids."
	]
	quest.1DF911F8B18CBBEF.quest_subtitle: "For surplus water and lava."
	quest.1DF911F8B18CBBEF.title: "Build a fluid trash can"
	quest.1DFC70D288521B7E.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: &6book&r (or the notebook), &6iron sword&r, &6iron pickaxe&r, &6iron axe&r, &6iron shovel&r."
		""
		"The &6Novice Spell Book&r already holds five glyphs: &dProjectile&r, &dTouch&r and &dSelf&r as forms, &dBreak&r and &dHarm&r as effects. It can only use &etier 1&r glyphs."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Whoever picks the &dArcanist&r role starts with this book already."
	]
	quest.1DFC70D288521B7E.quest_subtitle: "Four iron tools become a book."
	quest.1DFC70D288521B7E.title: "&dBuild the Novice Spell Book"
	quest.1E0E1D1128CCEFAC.quest_desc: [
		"Deal &d20&r damage or more with a single &6Depthrock Pebble&r from the slingshot."
		""
		"How you get there is your puzzle. The slingshot can be enchanted: &eRicochet&r makes projectiles bounce off walls, &eLongevity&r gives more durability, &eSelf Sling&r shoots yourself instead of ammo."
	]
	quest.1E0E1D1128CCEFAC.quest_subtitle: "A single pebble, a single hit."
	quest.1E0E1D1128CCEFAC.title: "&6Hit for Twenty Damage"
	quest.1E0EDE401E04DF28.quest_desc: [
		"Divide the overworld coordinates of your destination by &e8&r, go there in the Nether and build a portal. One block in the Nether counts as eight up top."
		""
		"A shared cobblestone tunnel at Y 100 to 120 is usually quieter than the plain below. Coordinate with the others, and the server gets small."
		""
		"The quest is done when you cover &e7,000 overworld blocks&r in one go this way."
	]
	quest.1E0EDE401E04DF28.quest_subtitle: "One block here is eight blocks up top."
	quest.1E0EDE401E04DF28.title: "&dTravel through the Nether"
	quest.1E118E55C75843AE.quest_desc: [
		"Wer diese Liste von oben bis unten abgehakt hat, hat jede Werkzeugleiter des Packs einmal gesehen. Für den Chaoswächter zählt am Ende: Schild, Flug, Untod und ein schneller Bogen."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Ausrüstung kostet Material, das auch der Obelisk will. Rüste die Leute zuerst aus, die für den Server kämpfen."
	]
	quest.1E118E55C75843AE.quest_subtitle: "Von der Eisenspitzhacke bis zum Drakonischen Bogen."
	quest.1E118E55C75843AE.title: "&6&lVoll ausgerüstet"
	quest.1E2CAD1F8BA3B7CF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Lapis Sulfur&r on a Source Pedestal, a &6Quartz Sulfur&r on the Target Pedestal. The emitter converts one to one, the target Sulfur stays where it is."
		""
		"That is also how lapis becomes &6Certus Quartz&r for AE2. EMI shows all sources at the target Sulfur."
	]
	quest.1E2CAD1F8BA3B7CF.quest_subtitle: "Same kind, same tier, one to one."
	quest.1E2CAD1F8BA3B7CF.title: "&5Reform Lapis into Quartz"
	quest.1E2E4A6498A30B7D.quest_desc: [
		"Die Anreicherungskammer nimmt auch Erzblöcke ohne Barren: &6Redstone-Erz&r gibt &e12 Redstone&r, &6Lapislazulierz&r &e12 Lapislazuli&r, Kohle-, Diamant-, Smaragd- und Quarzerz je &e2&r."
		""
		"&eWas sich lohnt:&r Bei Redstone schlägt die Kammer Glück III deutlich, hier also mit Behutsamkeit abbauen. Bei Diamant, Smaragd, Kohle, Quarz und Lapislazuli bringt Glück III im Schnitt etwas mehr. Die bleiben bei der Glück-Spitzhacke."
	]
	quest.1E2E4A6498A30B7D.quest_subtitle: "Mit Behutsamkeit, nicht mit Glück."
	quest.1E2E4A6498A30B7D.title: "&cReichere Redstone-Erz an"
	quest.1E320F71192A7347.quest_desc: [
		"Kauf am Markt Teak, Balsa, Ipe, Rotahorn und Eibe und säge je 16 Bretter. Balsa ist fast weiß, die anderen reichen von hell bis dunkel."
		""
		"Fünf Holzfarben, die es in Vanilla nicht gibt, alle aus den ersten beiden Generationen. Die Eibe wächst nur aus vier Setzlingen im Quadrat, im Pflanztopf reicht einer."
	]
	quest.1E320F71192A7347.quest_subtitle: "Fünf Farben Holz für den nächsten Bau."
	quest.1E320F71192A7347.title: "&6Leg dir eine Holzpalette an"
	quest.1E39E98230DB3998.quest_desc: [
		"A &6diamond tool&r in the middle, &e2 Inferium Ingots&r left and right, &e2 Inferium Gemstones&r top and bottom: an &6Inferium tool&r. That works with a diamond pickaxe, axe, shovel, hoe and sword, and the same way with normal shears, a bow, a crossbow or a fishing rod."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/gear/inferium_pickaxe.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Inferium has &e2,000 durability&r instead of 1,561, mines at speed 9 instead of 8 and hits one point harder. It is repaired in the anvil with Inferium Ingots. The tool keeps its enchantments when upgraded to Prudentium later."
		""
		"Every essence tool has &e1 slot for an augment&r (Luck, Absorption, Path area). You can already build augments from shards, iron and essence, but the &6Tinkering Table&r to put them in needs Soulium and comes in &cstage 2&r."
	]
	quest.1E39E98230DB3998.quest_subtitle: "More durability, more speed, one augment slot."
	quest.1E39E98230DB3998.title: "&aUpgrade a Diamond Tool"
	quest.1E3E4CB8EA60759B.quest_desc: [
		"At the crafting table a &5Chaos Shard&r becomes 9 &5Large Chaos Fragments&r, one of those 9 &5Small&r ones, one of those 9 &5Tiny&r ones. Back works the same way."
		""
		"You need large fragments for injectors and cores, small ones for modules and the Chaotic Energy Controller."
	]
	quest.1E3E4CB8EA60759B.quest_subtitle: "Large, small, tiny."
	quest.1E3E4CB8EA60759B.title: "&8Split a Chaos Shard"
	quest.1E4B963527511B01.quest_desc: [
		"Drei &6Diamanten&r über zwei Stöcken. Diamanterz liegt tief, am meisten um Y -58, und die Minendimension (Kapitel Erkundung) ist voll davon."
		""
		"1 561 Haltbarkeit statt 250, Tempo 8 statt 6, baut Obsidian ab. Die Diamantrüstung gibt 20 Punkte statt 15, dazu Zähigkeit 2 pro Teil."
	]
	quest.1E4B963527511B01.quest_subtitle: "Die Spitzhacke, die alles abbaut."
	quest.1E4B963527511B01.title: "&bSteig auf Diamant um"
	quest.1E4F8C120BF2D79D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_resonanz.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e20 Steel Scaffolding, 9 concrete, 5 Steel Framed Windows, 4 Steel Fences, 3 Light and 2 Resonanz Engineering Blocks, 1 Redstone Engineering Block, 1 calibrated sculk sensor&r. Resonanz block: lead sheetmetal, Advanced Electronic Component, an echo shard."
		""
		"&eIn:&r &d128 FE/t&r on the right and &6paper&r on the left, one sheet lasts 60 seconds. &eOut:&r machines within about 32 blocks keep running, even when nobody is nearby."
	]
	quest.1E4F8C120BF2D79D.quest_subtitle: "3x5x3, keeps 32 blocks around it active."
	quest.1E4F8C120BF2D79D.title: "&bForm a Resonanz Observer"
	quest.1E550CA0FCC62D8E.quest_desc: [
		"Sechs Dielectric Rods, zwei Eisennuggets und ein Tiny-Kondensator geben zwölf &6Energy Cables&r. Die &6Energy Cell&r: Eisen in die Ecken, Kondensatoren an die Seiten, Casing in die Mitte. Seiten stellst du mit dem &6Wrench&r ein."
		""
		"&ePowah, Kabel:&r Starter &d500 FE/t&r, Basic 2 000, Hardened 5 000, Blazing 20 000, Niotic 50 000, Spirited 200 000. &eEnergy Cell:&r Starter &d1 Million FE&r, Basic 4, Hardened 10, Blazing 40, Niotic 100, Spirited 400 Millionen, Übertragung 1 000 bis 400 000 FE/t."
		""
		"&ePowah, drahtlos:&r &6Ender Cells&r teilen einen Speicher über Kanäle, egal wo sie stehen. Der &6Player Transmitter&r lädt mit einer Binding Card deine Werkzeuge in der Tasche, überall. Offen ab Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.1E550CA0FCC62D8E.quest_subtitle: "Powah: Kabel 500 bis 200 000 FE/t, Zellen 1 bis 400 Millionen FE."
	quest.1E550CA0FCC62D8E.title: "&bVerkabel mit Powah"
	quest.1E59922B01A1E873.quest_desc: [
		"&6Spell Power&r (all 7 essences, Magebloom): more spell damage per level."
		"&6Life Drain&r (Mendosteen, sculk catalyst, 2 Abjuration Essences): 20 percent of the spell damage heals you."
		"&6Kindling&r (magma cream, Fire Essence, fire charge) and &6Chilling&r (blue ice, 2 Water Essences, powder snow bucket): burning or freezing before every hit."
		"&6Warding&r (8 Magebloom Fiber): less magic damage."
	]
	quest.1E59922B01A1E873.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: all threads come from the apparatus."
	quest.1E59922B01A1E873.title: "&6Sew Threads for Combat"
	quest.1E616E48FA1AEB02.quest_desc: [
		"An &6eye of ender&r, a &6Dielectric Casing&r and a Tiny capacitor give an &6Ender Core&r for &e50,000 FE&r."
		""
		"From it you build Ender Cells and Ender Gates, below in the storage section."
	]
	quest.1E616E48FA1AEB02.quest_subtitle: "The core of the wireless cells."
	quest.1E616E48FA1AEB02.title: "&5Charge an Ender Core"
	quest.1E66081B7C2F3495.quest_desc: [
		"Kauf am Markt die Setzlinge und ernte je vier &6Granny-Smith-Äpfel&r, &6Nashi-Birnen&r, &6Vogelkirschen&r, &6Bananen&r, &6Oliven&r und &6Golden-Delicious-Äpfel&r. Alle sechs stammen aus Generation 2 und 3 und kosten 2 oder 4 Smaragde."
		""
		"Dazu ein &6Fruchtkorb&r von Cooking for Blockheads (Holzstufe, Holzdruckplatte, Holzstufe nebeneinander). Er lagert Obst sichtbar an der Wand, und berührt er die Küche, nimmt der Kochtisch daraus."
	]
	quest.1E66081B7C2F3495.quest_subtitle: "Sechs Früchte von Bäumen aus dem Markt."
	quest.1E66081B7C2F3495.title: "&aFüll einen Obstkorb"
	quest.1E688BEACAAA3251.quest_desc: [
		"&eStufe 1:&r Mahlwerkräder, nur für Erzblöcke mit Behutsamkeit (bis 2,25) und für Nebenprodukte. Rohes Erz in den Ofen, Glück III an die Spitzhacke."
		"&eStufe 2:&r Gießerei für zwei Barren ohne Strom. Anreicherungskammer für zwei Barren mit Strom und Angereichertem Kohlenstoff nebenbei, mit Glück rund 2,9 pro Block."
		"&eStufe 3:&r Klärkammer, drei pro Erz, rund 4,4 mit Glück. Fragment Forge etwa 2,7 pro Rohem Erz. IE-Zerkleinerer zwei plus Nickel."
		"&eStufe 4:&r Injektionskammer vier, Auflösungskammer fünf, mit Glück rund 5,9 und 7,3. Ab hier sind Strom und Gas die Grenze, nicht das Erz."
		""
		"&eRezepte auf Kronwerke, die hier zählen:&r Stahlgehäuse mit Andesitlegierung statt Glas. Zerkleinerer mit zwei Mahlwerkrädern statt Lavaeimern. Einfacher Steuerschaltkreis nur aus Elektronenröhre und 20 mB Redstone. Fortschrittlicher Schaltkreis mit Gedrucktem Silizium (Stufe 3), Elite-Schaltkreis mit Draconiumstaub (Stufe 4)."
	]
	quest.1E688BEACAAA3251.quest_subtitle: "Was sich wann lohnt."
	quest.1E688BEACAAA3251.title: "&6&lWähl die richtige Mühle für deine Stufe"
	quest.1E69C11A934E712D.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Ring of Potential&r in the middle, &e4 diamonds&r, &e2 ender pearls&r and &e2 Source Gems&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"The ring lowers the cost of every spell and gives a little more mana and regeneration on top."
		""
		"Later, in the apparatus, it becomes the &6Ring of Greater Discount&r."
	]
	quest.1E69C11A934E712D.quest_subtitle: "Every spell gets cheaper."
	quest.1E69C11A934E712D.title: "&6Forge a Ring of Lesser Discount"
	quest.1E6A70DE20166D82.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_cobble_gen.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Lava and water so that cobblestone forms between them, a &6Mechanical Drill&r in front. Every stone it breaks forms again at once; a funnel collects."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stone pillar wants &620,000 cobblestone&r (for 30 players). Several generators on one shaft fill the chests in your sleep; you carry them to the obelisk yourself."
		""
		"Handing in is done by hand only: sneak and right-click at the obelisk hands in everything that fits from your inventory."
	]
	quest.1E6A70DE20166D82.quest_subtitle: "Endless stone for the obelisk."
	quest.1E6A70DE20166D82.title: "&6Build a cobblestone generator"
	quest.1E706BDDF037AF6F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_extractor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Iron, &6heavy weighted pressure plate&r, iron at the top, &6cobblestone&r, Pity Frame, cobblestone in the middle, iron, &6piston&r, iron at the bottom."
		""
		"Place its front against a &6log&r. It pulls out &6latex&r: &eacacia and mangrove 4 mB&r per operation, cherry and dark oak 3, oak, birch, spruce and jungle 2, all other logs 1. The log is stripped first, then used up."
		""
		"Power is optional, &d500 FE&r per operation makes it faster. Several extractors may tap the same log."
	]
	quest.1E706BDDF037AF6F.quest_subtitle: "It taps latex from a log."
	quest.1E706BDDF037AF6F.title: "&6Build a Fluid Extractor"
	quest.1E70DD338A79C4E3.quest_desc: [
		"&eSo geht es:&r Teil die Oberwelt-Koordinaten deines Ziels durch 8, geh im Nether genau dorthin und bau dort ein Portal. Die beiden Portale finden sich, wenn sie nah genug beieinander liegen."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r 800 Blöcke Oberwelt sind 100 Blöcke Nether. Ein gemeinsamer Tunnel aus Bruchstein auf etwa &eY 100 bis 120&r verbindet alle Basen des Servers mit dem Spawn, und Create-Gleise dürfen durch das Portal hindurch (Kapitel &6Create: Züge&r)."
		""
		"Sprecht euch im Chat ab, wer wo baut. Der Undergarden macht dasselbe mit 4 zu 1, nur ungemütlicher."
	]
	quest.1E70DD338A79C4E3.quest_subtitle: "Ein Block dort, acht Blöcke hier. Stufe 2."
	quest.1E70DD338A79C4E3.title: "&cNutze den Nether als Abkürzung"
	quest.1E76EBF8CFF3E113.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_duroplast.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the Bottling Machine: &6Metal Press Mold: Plate&r on the belt, &e250 mB of Phenolic Resin&r in the tank make a &6Duroplast Sheet&r. The mold comes back."
		""
		"Duroplast insulates and counts as a plastic sheet. Duroplast blocks replace terracotta in connectors."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_plate_duroplast.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1E76EBF8CFF3E113.quest_subtitle: "Resin into the plate mold."
	quest.1E76EBF8CFF3E113.title: "&dCast Duroplast Sheets"
	quest.1E83D0230D353EA6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_fragment.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Clumps into the &6Centrifuge&r: one clump becomes one &6Iron Gem&r and three small nickel dusts, no water needed. Two gems in the &6Foundry&r become &ethree&r iron ingots, the same in Create's heated mixer."
		""
		"All in all one raw iron gives &e2 ingots&r here, 1.33 in the Pulverizer, 1 in the furnace. Plus nickel on the side. Gold, copper, nickel and platinum run the same way."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r More iron means more steel for &6The Furnace Never Sleeps&r. Hang a Foundry with coal dust behind it, and the ore line becomes a steel line."
	]
	quest.1E83D0230D353EA6.quest_subtitle: "Two ingots from every raw iron."
	quest.1E83D0230D353EA6.title: "&6&lClose the Ore Line"
	quest.1E94209EC38D1030.quest_desc: [
		"Bring together &e64 draconium ingots&r and &e8 Elite Control Circuits&r and hand them in at the obelisk."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The tech side of the goal &6Light of the Dragon&r wants &e1,000 draconium ingots&r and &e150 Elite Control Circuits&r, the magic side &e128 Gaia Spirits&r and &e30 Mystic Staffs&r."
		""
		"A few people with pickaxes in the End, a circuit line at home, and the bar fills up."
	]
	quest.1E94209EC38D1030.quest_subtitle: "What the End gives for the stage goal."
	quest.1E94209EC38D1030.title: "&5&lFill the Light of the Dragon"
	quest.1E95204A707575B3.quest_desc: [
		"A &6barrel&r between two &6iron sheets&r gives an &6Item Silo&r, between two &6copper sheets&r a &6Fluid Vessel&r."
		""
		"The silo is a &evertical&r Item Vault, the vessel a &ehorizontal&r fluid tank. With the wrench you switch the vessel's window shape. As a steam boiler it is less suited than a standing tank."
	]
	quest.1E95204A707575B3.quest_subtitle: "Vault and tank, just the other way round."
	quest.1E95204A707575B3.title: "&6Build Silo and Vessel"
	quest.1E958EEC8D2F80D4.quest_desc: [
		"&6L_Ender's Cataclysm&r stellt fünf Bauwerke in die Oberwelt, und in jedem wartet ein Boss mit 390 bis 450 Lebenspunkten. Kein Boss zählt für den Obelisken. Ihre Beute macht dich aber stärker, und darum geht es hier."
		""
		"&eDie Reihenfolge in diesem Kapitel:&r"
		"&e1.&r Wüste, &6Verfluchte Pyramide&r: Ancient Remnant. Geht mit Diamantrüstung aus Stufe 1."
		"&e2.&r Schneeebene, &6Frosted Prison&r: Maledictus. Geht ebenfalls mit Stufe 1, zu mehreren."
		"&e3.&r Tiefsee, &6Sunken City&r: The Leviathan. Besser mit Ausrüstung aus Stufe 2."
		"&e4.&r Untergrund, &6Ancient Factory&r: The Harbinger. Braucht einen Netherstern, also Stufe 2."
		"&e5.&r Himmel über dem warmen Meer, &6Akropolis&r: Scylla. Nimm Ausrüstung aus Stufe 3 mit."
		""
		"Dazu kommen die Nachtmonster aus &6Born in Chaos&r und die Kreaturen aus &6Mowzie's Mobs&r, unten im Kapitel. Die Zauberer aus &dIron's Spells&r (Pyromancer, Necromancer, der Dead King) haben ihr eigenes Kapitel."
		""
		"&cIgnis&r und die &cNetherite Monstrosity&r stehen im Kapitel &cDer Nether&r, der &cEnder Guardian&r im Kapitel &5Das End&r."
	]
	quest.1E958EEC8D2F80D4.quest_subtitle: "Fünf Bauwerke, fünf Bosse, in der richtigen Reihenfolge."
	quest.1E958EEC8D2F80D4.title: "&c&lBosse der Oberwelt"
	quest.1E96E6534BC0343F.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless from an &6Advanced Card&r and a &6Superdense Energy Cell&r."
		""
		"It fits into portable cells and wireless terminals like the normal Energy Card, only with much more buffer. Portable MEGA cells only take this card."
	]
	quest.1E96E6534BC0343F.quest_subtitle: "A bigger battery for everything portable."
	quest.1E96E6534BC0343F.title: "&eBuild a Greater Energy Card"
	quest.1E9B264981B65A97.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 iron ingots&r in the corners, &e4 redstone&r on the sides, a &6stone&r in the middle give a &6Machine Frame&r."
		""
		"Every machine of Mystical Agriculture sits in such a frame: the furnace now, later the Harvester, the Seed Reprocessor and the Soul Extractor."
	]
	quest.1E9B264981B65A97.quest_subtitle: "The frame for every machine of the mod."
	quest.1E9B264981B65A97.title: "&7Build a Machine Frame"
	quest.1EA3C3DBE67D7E81.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &63 Thermal Springstone Ingots&r at the top, &62 sticks&r below, like a pickaxe. That makes the &6Thermal Springstone Scythe&r."
		""
		"Scythes are a weapon type of their own next to sword and axe. You put accessories into them like into a bundle. If the item breaks, the accessories are gone."
	]
	quest.1EA3C3DBE67D7E81.quest_subtitle: "The first scythe."
	quest.1EA3C3DBE67D7E81.title: "&cBuild a Springstone Scythe"
	quest.1EA412607DB8DC09.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 iron nuggets&r around &e1 Source Gem&r. With only 4 nuggets in a cross you get the &6Dull Trinket&r, the base for amulets."
		""
		"The ring itself is only a blank. In the apparatus it becomes the &6Ring of Lesser Discount&r (4 diamonds, 2 ender pearls, 2 Source Gems), which makes every spell cheaper, or the &6Ring of Jumping&r."
	]
	quest.1EA412607DB8DC09.quest_subtitle: "The start of every trinket."
	quest.1EA412607DB8DC09.title: "&6Forge a Ring of Potential"
	quest.1EA4C5BC5788F0ED.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mouse Tweaks&r makes the inventory faster. Hold &eShift&r and drag over several stacks with the &eleft mouse button&r held: they all move to the other inventory."
		""
		"Dragging over empty slots with an item on the cursor and the &eright mouse button&r held puts one into each slot. The &emouse wheel&r over a stack moves single items back and forth between chest and inventory."
	]
	quest.1EA4C5BC5788F0ED.quest_subtitle: "Drag instead of clicking a hundred times."
	quest.1EA4C5BC5788F0ED.title: "&6Move stacks with the mouse"
	quest.1EA4F45543676377.quest_desc: [
		"&b1 000 mB Diesel&r und ein &6Redstone&r ergeben in der Anlage ab 100 Grad &b1 000 mB Schmiermittel&r (Lubricant). Schöpf es in einen Eimer, das ist die Zutat für jedes Geschwindigkeits-Upgrade."
		""
		"Biodiesel aus der Fermentation (siehe Kapitel Create: Erweiterungen) geht genauso. Und wer gar kein Öl findet: Amadron tauscht einen Eimer Öl gegen einen Smaragd."
	]
	quest.1EA4F45543676377.quest_subtitle: "Diesel und Redstone, heiß."
	quest.1EA4F45543676377.title: "&eKoch Schmiermittel"
	quest.1EA9E3F1AEF780DD.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r Transmitter and Receiver each have three &6ender pearls&r, a &6Construction&r and a &6Destruction Core&r, a Machine Casing, two &6Advanced Processors&r and a &6netherite ingot&r. The &6Network Card&r is enriched iron, paper and an Advanced Processor."
		""
		"Place the &6Network Receiver&r at the remote network, sneak and right click it with the card to bind the card to it. Put the card into the &6Network Transmitter&r at the main network: both are now one network. The transmitter needs 32 FE/t, the receiver 8."
		""
		"That way the ore factory at the edge of the world hangs on your storage at home."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r This also works between the worlds. Bind the card to a receiver in the main world and put it into a transmitter in the farm world, the Nether or the End. The network there then sees your storage at home, as long as the receiver's chunk is loaded."
	]
	quest.1EA9E3F1AEF780DD.quest_subtitle: "Network Transmitter, Receiver and Card."
	quest.1EA9E3F1AEF780DD.title: "&dConnect Two Networks without Cable"
	quest.1EABFB9EC82043D8.quest_desc: [
		"Cows, pigs and sheep sometimes drop a &6Sinew&r. In the furnace it becomes &6Dried Sinew&r, in the grid &ethree Sinew Fiber&r."
		""
		"Sinew Fiber is Flexible IV, as a bowstring Flexible II and +20 percent ranged damage."
	]
	quest.1EABFB9EC82043D8.quest_subtitle: "The best binding in stage 1."
	quest.1EABFB9EC82043D8.title: "&7Dry sinew"
	quest.1EAD067E49C19340.quest_desc: [
		"&6Plate Basic&r in the corners, &6bricks&r left and right, &6redstone&r at the top, a &6blast furnace&r in the middle, a &6Coil Copper&r at the bottom."
		""
		"It smelts two dusts into an alloy. Hook it permanently to a dust line, you need it for the whole chapter."
	]
	quest.1EAD067E49C19340.quest_subtitle: "Two dusts, one alloy."
	quest.1EAD067E49C19340.title: "&6Build an Alloy Smelter"
	quest.1EB2679182ED50A9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Seismic Vibrator:&r top tin, lapis lazuli, tin, middle circuit, &6steel casing&r, circuit, bottom three tin. &6Seismic Reader:&r steel all around, lapis lazuli at the top middle, an &6Energy Tablet&r in the middle."
		""
		"Set up the vibrator and give it power. It makes its whole chunk vibrate. Stand in the same chunk and use the charged reader: it shows you every block of the column below you down to bedrock, with how often each kind appears."
		""
		"That way you know before the first dig whether osmium, diamond or just stone lies under the base."
	]
	quest.1EB2679182ED50A9.quest_subtitle: "Seismic Vibrator and Seismic Reader."
	quest.1EB2679182ED50A9.title: "&6Listen into the ground"
	quest.1EBD80B5168BEC29.quest_desc: [
		"Zähl zusammen, was dieses Kapitel an &6Printed Circuit Boards&r will: Programmer, Solar Compressor, Security Station, Programmable Controller, jede Drohne, jede Charge Puzzleteile. Sechzehn sind ein guter Anfang."
		""
		"&eWenn die Säure schneller sein soll:&r Ein &6Etching Tank&r ohne Wärme braucht 150 Sekunden pro Platine, aber ätzt 25 auf einmal. Geheizt sinkt die Zeit auf &e30 Sekunden&r, dafür verbraucht er dabei etwas Säure. Speed Upgrades in der &6UV Light Box&r drücken die 10 Minuten Belichtung."
		""
		"&eFehlversuche:&r Ein &6Failed PCB&r wird im Schmelzofen (Blast Furnace) wieder zum Empty PCB. Ein Trichter unter dem Etching Tank in einen Blast Furnace und zurück, und nichts geht verloren."
	]
	quest.1EBD80B5168BEC29.quest_subtitle: "Sechzehn PCBs, dann reicht es für alles hier."
	quest.1EBD80B5168BEC29.title: "&a&lMach Leiterplatten in Serie"
	quest.1EC7DBE5AE3B7A5E.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6Brass Casing&r top and bottom, &6shaft&r, &6clutch&r, &6shaft&r in the middle give the &6Kinetic Bridge&r. It passes a fixed amount of stress capacity, which you set in the value box, from one shaft network to a second one and keeps both separate: if one is overstressed, the other keeps running."
		""
		"The &6Overstress Clutch&r (Andesite Casing, shaft, iron sheet, Electron Tube) disengages after an adjustable delay as soon as the network is overstressed, and the wrench engages it again. The &6Shear Pin&r is a shaft from the Mechanical Saw: it breaks once on overstress and so protects the rest."
		""
		"&eTip:&r An Overstress Clutch in front of the bridge frees the capacity an overstressed bridge would otherwise keep using. The Ponder scene does the math."
	]
	quest.1EC7DBE5AE3B7A5E.quest_subtitle: "Kinetic Bridge, Overstress Clutch, Shear Pin."
	quest.1EC7DBE5AE3B7A5E.title: "&6Secure Your Network"
	quest.1EDCCD0D152C6A6A.quest_desc: [
		"Leg &6Rohes Eisen&r in einen Ofen oder Schmelzofen. Ein Rohes Erz wird ein &6Eisenbarren&r, ein Erzblock mit Behutsamkeit ebenso."
		""
		"Das ist die Zahl, an der sich alles misst: &e1 Barren pro Erz&r. Jede Stufe der Leiter legt einen Barren drauf, bis es in Stufe 4 fünf sind."
		""
		"Mit &6Glück III&r fallen aus einem Erzblock im Schnitt etwa 2,2 Rohe Erze. Schon für den Ofen ist Glück also eine Verdopplung."
	]
	quest.1EDCCD0D152C6A6A.quest_subtitle: "Ein Rohes Erz, ein Barren. Die Null-Linie."
	quest.1EDCCD0D152C6A6A.title: "&7Schmilz Rohes Eisen im Ofen"
	quest.1EEBAD3477910989.quest_desc: [
		"&6Tangleberrie&r: &e2 cyan, 1 grey, 1 light grey&r, Runes of Air and Earth. Keeps animals and monsters inside its circle."
		"&6Jiyuulia&r: &e2 pink, 1 purple, 1 light grey&r, Runes of Water and Air. Keeps them out."
		""
		"Both need only a little mana. A Jiyuulia in the middle of the base, and no creeper gets in."
	]
	quest.1EEBAD3477910989.quest_subtitle: "Tangleberrie keeps in, Jiyuulia keeps out."
	quest.1EEBAD3477910989.title: "&6Put up fences of magic"
	quest.1EEDF8B5BC5C01E4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_exo.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"All four pieces are &6plating&r in armor shape. Helmet with an &6Enderic Lens&r, leggings with a &6Motor&r, boots with &6Silicon&r, chest with an &6Advanced Battery&r (Electrum at the top, below it steel, Energite, steel twice)."
		""
		"Helmet night vision, leggings faster walking, boots no fall damage. The chest holds &e5 million RF&r and charges the power tools in your inventory."
		""
		"The &6Exo Jetpack&r (Ion Thruster, chestplate, jetpack, small tanks) holds 5 million RF and flies much faster. See also the checklist &eEquipment&r."
	]
	quest.1EEDF8B5BC5C01E4.quest_subtitle: "Night vision, speed, no fall damage."
	quest.1EEDF8B5BC5C01E4.title: "&ePut On the Exo Armor"
	quest.1EFCF559720990BB.quest_desc: [
		"Top three &6iron ingots&r. Middle &6bricks&r left and right. Bottom bricks, &6campfire&r, bricks."
		""
		"It grills up to six pieces without fuel and is the best heat source for pot and skillet. Campfire, lava or a magma block work too."
	]
	quest.1EFCF559720990BB.quest_subtitle: "Heat for the whole kitchen."
	quest.1EFCF559720990BB.title: "&6Build a Stove"
	quest.1F00C065BD608F54.quest_desc: [
		"Kauf einen &6Granny-Smith-Apfelbaum&r. Jedes reife Blatt gibt einen Apfel mit &e4 Hunger&r, so viel wie ein Steak-Bissen. Dasselbe liefern Golden Delicious, Beliy Naliv, die drei Holzäpfel, Kulturbirne, Nashi-Birne, Avocado, Kaki, Granatapfel und Zimtapfel."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/fruit/granny_smith_apple.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eSteinobst:&r Pflaume (2 pro Blatt), Pfirsich, Nektarine, Aprikose, Kirschpflaume, Vogelkirsche (2), Sauerkirsche, Schwarzkirsche (5), Olive (2), Datteln (3), Feigen (2) und Kumquat geben ebenfalls 4 Hunger."
		""
		"Der &6Red-Delicious-Apfelbaum&r trägt echte Vanilla-Äpfel, zwei pro Blatt. Mit Gold wird daraus der Goldene Apfel, ein Baum für die Bosse."
	]
	quest.1F00C065BD608F54.quest_subtitle: "Äpfel, Birnen, Pflaumen, Pfirsiche: 4 Hunger pro Frucht."
	quest.1F00C065BD608F54.title: "&aPflanz einen Apfelbaum"
	quest.1F166311ADC91093.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sojourner's Sash&r (Runes Earth and Air, 4 leather, Manasteel): faster, jump higher, walk up steps."
		"&6Planestrider's Sash&r (Sojourner's Sash, map, 2 Pasture Seeds, sugar): gets faster and faster the longer you run."
		"&6Tectonic Girdle&r (Runes Fire and Earth, 4 leather, Manasteel): no more knockback."
	]
	quest.1F166311ADC91093.quest_subtitle: "Three belts for speed and footing."
	quest.1F166311ADC91093.title: "&6Buckle on belts"
	quest.1F34E754EA763450.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/start_here_o_obelisk.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"The &eboss bar&r at the top shows the active goal. In stage 1 it is called &6The Foundation of the Kronwerk&r and has three pillars: &7Stone&r, &6Tech&r and &dMagic&r."
		""
		"The stage only opens when &eall&r pillars are full. A server that only builds machines or only casts spells gets nowhere."
	]
	quest.1F34E754EA763450.quest_subtitle: "One goal, several pillars, all of them have to fill up."
	quest.1F34E754EA763450.title: "&6Read the boss bar"
	quest.1F3598B183138DFD.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: a Create &6precision mechanism&r in the middle, &e4 amethyst shards&r and &e4 Source Gems&r on the pedestals, &d500 Source&r."
		""
		"The &6Calibrated Precision Mechanism&r goes into the Source Motor, the Spy Monocle and the Arcane Wrench (Create wrench with gold and Manipulation Essence). Precision mechanisms are also a stage goal; coordinate with the Create builders."
	]
	quest.1F3598B183138DFD.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: precision meets magic."
	quest.1F3598B183138DFD.title: "&6Calibrate a precision mechanism"
	quest.1F39DA19C699832B.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: &6one slimeball&r and &6one paper&r."
		""
		"Right click a full chest with the tape, then mine it. It drops as one item with its contents. One roll holds several uses; the tooltip shows what is left."
	]
	quest.1F39DA19C699832B.quest_subtitle: "Packing Tape."
	quest.1F39DA19C699832B.title: "Move house without emptying"
	quest.1F3D0C194EC97397.quest_desc: [
		"Build a &6Charger&r (iron all around, a &6copper ingot&r at the top centre, the right side open) and put a normal &6compass&r in it. Power comes through a cable or from a &6Wooden Crank&r on top (three sticks, a copper ingot) that you turn by hand."
		""
		"&bApplied Energistics 2&r stores items as data on &6storage cells&r. A cable network links cells, terminals and machines, and later the network builds things by itself."
		""
		"&eOpen in stage 3:&r cells up to &616k&r, controller, buses, P2P, wireless, autocrafting, plus &6Extended AE&r, &6Applied Flux&r and &6Applied Mekanistics&r. &cStage 4:&r 64k and larger, quantum bridge, spatial storage, MEGA and Advanced AE, see the chapter &bAE2: Advanced&r."
		""
		"Rather without channels and types? The chapter &3Refined Storage&r is the simpler alternative."
	]
	quest.1F3D0C194EC97397.quest_subtitle: "It points to the nearest meteorite."
	quest.1F3D0C194EC97397.title: "&b&lBuild a Meteorite Compass"
	quest.1F43AD9667DA2153.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Trichter-Pflanztopf&r wirft seine Ernte in das Inventar unter sich, und eine &6Küchentheke&r ist eins. Stell Töpfe mit Weizen, Karotten, Kartoffeln, Kohl und Tomaten direkt auf die Theken deiner Küche."
		""
		"Ab dann wachsen die Zutaten dort, wo der Kochtisch sie holt. Mit einer &6Konservierungskammer&r im Kühlschrank und einer Kuh im Glas fehlt dir beim Kochen kaum noch etwas."
	]
	quest.1F43AD9667DA2153.quest_subtitle: "Die Küche, die sich selbst nachfüllt."
	quest.1F43AD9667DA2153.title: "&aLass Töpfe die Theken füllen"
	quest.1F4878BA75F6A16B.quest_desc: [
		"For whoever actually slays the Chaos Guardian. Everyone else can safely leave this quest empty."
	]
	quest.1F4878BA75F6A16B.quest_subtitle: "Only one gets it."
	quest.1F4878BA75F6A16B.title: "&4Land the Last Hit"
	quest.1F4C4D8429EE73BD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Copper Plates&r in the corners, &6LV Wire Coils&r on the sides, an &6Iron Sheetmetal&r in the middle, &6redstone&r at the bottom in the middle make the &6External Heater&r."
		""
		"Next to a normal furnace it heats with &d8 FE/t&r, once the furnace is fully hot with up to &d32 FE/t&r for double speed. It is also in the Blast Furnace Preheater."
	]
	quest.1F4C4D8429EE73BD.quest_subtitle: "The External Heater replaces the coal."
	quest.1F4C4D8429EE73BD.title: "&cHeat a furnace with power"
	quest.1F4D464886477BCF.quest_desc: [
		"A Create &6clutch&r and one &6andesite alloy&r make the &6generator coupling&r. It is the base of every generator and sits on your drive shaft."
		""
		"It only weakly couples grid and generator shaft; a redstone signal changes the strength. It costs &d32 SU per RPM&r."
	]
	quest.1F4D464886477BCF.quest_subtitle: "The generator coupling, 32 SU per RPM."
	quest.1F4D464886477BCF.title: "&3Couple the generator"
	quest.1F59313B69E3CBA4.quest_desc: [
		"Feindliche Mobs spawnen seit 1.18 nur noch bei &eLichtstärke 0&r. Eine Fackel leuchtet mit 14 und verliert pro Block eins. Alle &e12 Blöcke&r eine Fackel in jede Richtung, und auf dem Boden dazwischen spawnt nichts mehr."
		""
		"Hübscher als Fackeln: &6Wandfackeln&r und &6Kerzenständer&r aus Supplementaries, &6Laternen&r in 32 Chipped-Varianten, die &6Rahmenlaterne&r aus der Säge. Ab Stufe 2 kommt Glowstone dazu: ein getarnter Rahmenblock mit &6Glowstone-Staub&r leuchtet mit Lichtstärke 15 und sieht aus wie vorher."
		""
		"&eUnterwegs:&r &6Dynamic Lights&r ist im Pack. Eine Fackel in der Hand oder in der Nebenhand leuchtet beim Laufen, auch in der Mine. Das ist nur Anzeige auf deinem Bildschirm, Mobs hält es nicht ab."
	]
	quest.1F59313B69E3CBA4.quest_subtitle: "Kein Creeper im Stream-Hintergrund."
	quest.1F59313B69E3CBA4.title: "&eLeuchte alles aus"
	quest.1F5D332A3E7B6248.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r the &6Upgrade Base&r in the middle, four &6clocks&r on the sides, four &6honeycomb blocks&r in the corners."
		""
		"In the Expansion Box the bees stay in the hive for a shorter time, so there are more combs per hour. Several upgrades stack. The same upgrade also speeds up the centrifuge, incubator and Breeding Chamber, and in the Honey Generator it gives more power at higher consumption."
	]
	quest.1F5D332A3E7B6248.quest_subtitle: "Shorter breaks in the hive."
	quest.1F5D332A3E7B6248.title: "&bBuild a Time Upgrade"
	quest.1F695A1D2AE81876.quest_desc: [
		"&6Purpur-Eisenerz&r im Netherrack und Schwarzstein, Rohes Purpur-Eisen im Ofen schmelzen. Kopf aus drei Barren wie bei Eisen."
		""
		"420 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 10, +3 Schaden, Biegsam III, Hart II, Hitzebeständig IV. Als Spitze +224 Haltbarkeit und Feurig. Kapitel &6Silent Gear&r."
	]
	quest.1F695A1D2AE81876.quest_subtitle: "Silent Gear: Tempo 10 aus dem Nether."
	quest.1F695A1D2AE81876.title: "&cSchmiede Purpur-Eisen"
	quest.1F7281F66B996839.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 Livingwood Twigs&r and &e2 petals&r diagonally in the crafting grid. The colours of the petals colour the wand."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/wand_of_the_forest.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"A sneaking right click into the air switches the mode. &eBind mode:&r sneak click a spreader, then the target. &eFunction mode:&r a sneak click turns a spreader towards the clicked side."
		""
		"With the wand in hand you see the mana in flowers, spreaders and pools, and the aiming beams of the spreaders."
	]
	quest.1F7281F66B996839.quest_subtitle: "Binds, rotates and measures everything in Botania."
	quest.1F7281F66B996839.title: "&aBuild the Wand of the Forest"
	quest.1F7A2EEE3F0CDC02.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &6Infused Iron&r into the Mana Pool, &d3,000 mana&r per ingot. An iron ingot just stays in the pool."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/manasteel_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Infused Iron comes from the &aNatural Altar&r (15,000 aura per ingot). Hopper onto the altar, belt to the pool, and the Manasteel factory runs. Manasteel blocks now only come from nine ingots."
	]
	quest.1F7A2EEE3F0CDC02.quest_subtitle: "The way for large amounts."
	quest.1F7A2EEE3F0CDC02.title: "&bInfuse Manasteel in the pool"
	quest.1F82C8B834DEE977.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 snow blocks&r, &e1 wool&r, &e1 cake&r, catalysts Water and Earth. &d8,000 mana&r."
		""
		"Catalyst for Gluttony, Wrath and Envy, plus the Snowflake Pendant and Terrasteel Boots."
	]
	quest.1F82C8B834DEE977.quest_subtitle: "Water and earth make frost."
	quest.1F82C8B834DEE977.title: "&bMake the Rune of Winter"
	quest.1F8A26B2CF9B4756.quest_desc: [
		"&6Verstärkte Echoscherbe&r: 4 Warden-Panzer, 4 Phantomhaut, eine Echoscherbe. Mit der Warden-Vorlage (Kopie: 7 Diamanten, Sculk) am Schmiedetisch auf Netheritausrüstung."
		""
		"&6Seelenelytra&r: Elytra, Seelenkristall, Sculk-Knochen, Seelenstaub. &6Sonorous Staff&r aus dem Herz der Tiefe vom Warden. Eine Stufe früher gibt es &6Resonarium&r aus der Otherside als Platte auf Diamantausrüstung."
	]
	quest.1F8A26B2CF9B4756.quest_subtitle: "Deeper and Darker: Netherit und Echo."
	quest.1F8A26B2CF9B4756.title: "&3Schmiede Wardenrüstung"
	quest.1F8C8CC82C55E789.quest_desc: [
		"Plastic, &6brewing stand&r, plastic at the top, &6Gold Gear&r, &6Advanced Frame&r, Gold Gear in the middle, repeater, Gold Gear, repeater at the bottom."
		""
		"With power it brews potions from the ingredients you give it. It fills empty bottles from its water tank, and the water is not used up."
		""
		"&eImportant:&r In the green filter you set which potion should come out. Without an entry there, it lets nothing out."
	]
	quest.1F8C8CC82C55E789.quest_subtitle: "The Potion Brewer."
	quest.1F8C8CC82C55E789.title: "&dBrew Potions Automatically"
	quest.1FA36163E8BA2478.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r three &6iron ingots&r each on top and bottom, in the middle two &6dispensers&r left and right of a &6redstone&r. That gives &616 Item Pipes&r."
		""
		"&6Pipez&r is the simplest pipe system in the pack. Pipes connect by themselves to chests, machines and each other. A pipe only moves items when one side is set to &eextract&r, how that works is in the next quest."
		""
		"Without an upgrade a pipe pushes &e4 items per second&r, always into the &enearest&r chest or machine that still has room."
		""
		"&eWhat is open in stage 2:&r all four pipe kinds, the wrench, the Basic and the Improved Upgrade. Filters and the Universal Pipe come in stage 3."
	]
	quest.1FA36163E8BA2478.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen pipes, and the chests talk to each other."
	quest.1FA36163E8BA2478.title: "&b&lBuild Item Pipes"
	quest.1FA638AB5008D393.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6bamboo&r top middle, bamboo left and right in the middle, a &6carpet&r in the middle, three bamboo at the bottom. The &6Picnic Basket&r from Supplementaries."
		""
		"It holds &e6 stacks&r of food and takes only one slot in your inventory. With the &eattack key&r you switch it between open and closed, from an open basket you eat directly."
		""
		"Placed down it is also a block, good for the table in the kitchen."
	]
	quest.1FA638AB5008D393.quest_subtitle: "Six stacks of food in one slot."
	quest.1FA638AB5008D393.title: "&6Pack a Picnic Basket"
	quest.1FAEA6214F17BB8B.quest_desc: [
		"Open the chapter &6Tips and Tricks&r on the left of the book. It explains how to claim rewards, find recipes, start a team, set up voice chat and get your things back after dying."
		""
		"If you have never played a modpack, read all of it. Everyone else should at least look at the &ekeys&r; some are bound twice."
	]
	quest.1FAEA6214F17BB8B.quest_subtitle: "Quest book, EMI, map, team, voice chat, death."
	quest.1FAEA6214F17BB8B.title: "&6Read Tips and Tricks"
	quest.1FB345A23360C5FA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Schematic Table&r (wooden slabs, smooth stone), &6Empty Schematics&r (paper, light blue dye), &6Schematicannon&r (two iron blocks, logs, smooth stone, dispenser)."
		"{image:create:textures/item/schematic.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"With &6Schematic and Quill&r you save a building; at the table you upload files from your &eschematics&r folder. The cannon rebuilds it from chests, one gunpowder is enough for 400 blocks."
	]
	quest.1FB345A23360C5FA.quest_subtitle: "Whole buildings block by block."
	quest.1FB345A23360C5FA.title: "&6Build with the Schematicannon"
	quest.1FB4483D3BF7F348.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &e4 Inferium Essence&r in the corners, &e4 Andesite Alloy&r on the sides and an &6Inferium Gemstone&r in the middle give &e3 Inferium Growth Accelerators&r."
		""
		"An accelerator gives the &efirst crop above it&r a random growth tick every &e10 seconds&r. The Inferium accelerator reaches &e9 blocks&r up, and you can stack as many as you like: a column of accelerators under every field block, and each one counts."
		""
		"&eHow to build:&r farmland, the accelerators below. An accelerator may stand on another one, all in the column work on the same crop. Four to six per tile are a good start, more is always possible."
	]
	quest.1FB4483D3BF7F348.quest_subtitle: "A growth tick every ten seconds, without you being there."
	quest.1FB4483D3BF7F348.title: "&aPut Growth Accelerators under the Field"
	quest.1FBCF2DA97111521.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Electrolytic Separator, alongside chlorine."
		"&eUsed by:&r nobody in stage 2. Vent it or collect it; the fission reactor in stage 5 is cooled with it."
	]
	quest.1FBCF2DA97111521.quest_subtitle: "The leftover from chlorine."
	quest.1FBCF2DA97111521.title: "&fSodium"
	quest.1FD04F305DDCBF59.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Starlit Diamond Ore&r. Crafting table: &63 Starlit Diamonds&r and &62 sticks&r make the &6Starlit Diamond Pickaxe&r."
		""
		"Starlit Diamond armor and tools are the next step after Deepsilver."
	]
	quest.1FD04F305DDCBF59.quest_subtitle: "Diamonds under the stars."
	quest.1FD04F305DDCBF59.title: "&bBuild a Starlit Pickaxe"
	quest.1FDDDEC3ACEFDA33.quest_desc: [
		"Place &e15 bookshelves&r around the enchanting table, one block gap, as always. Each gives &b2 Eterna&r, but bookshelves of this kind give no more than 30."
		""
		"It does not have to be an oak shelf: everything Minecraft counts as a bookshelf counts here too. The &6Skyroot Bookshelf&r from the Aether, the &6Wisewood shelf&r from Iron's Spells, the shelves from all Productive Trees woods and the Chipped variants also give 2 Eterna."
		""
		"&eQuanta:&r Every &6skull&r (skeleton, zombie, creeper) in a shelf position adds 5 percent Quanta. The table starts at 15 percent. A lot of Quanta means: sometimes clearly better, sometimes clearly worse than your level."
	]
	quest.1FDDDEC3ACEFDA33.quest_subtitle: "Every bookshelf counts, from whatever mod."
	quest.1FDDDEC3ACEFDA33.title: "&6Place Fifteen Shelves"
	quest.1FDFA0956359CF09.quest_desc: [
		"Agree on fixed evenings for fights against the &aGuardian of Gaia&r. Every player in the fight gets &e6 Gaia Spirits&r, whoever lands the last hit &e8&r."
		""
		"The math: 128 ingots for the obelisk and 32 for the fusions are 160 ingots, so &e640 Gaia Spirits&r. With four people per fight that is a good 25 fights."
		""
		"Each ingot handed in counts 25 points. The fights are in the chapter &aBotania: Gaia&r."
	]
	quest.1FDFA0956359CF09.quest_subtitle: "About 640 spirits, that is many evenings."
	quest.1FDFA0956359CF09.title: "&dPlan the Gaia Fights"
	quest.1FE059D1A0AD661A.quest_desc: [
		"Collect &e1,024 steel ingots&r and &e32 Heavy Engineering Blocks&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stage goal &e\"The Furnace Never Sleeps\"&r wants &e4,000 steel ingots&r, &e250 Advanced Control Circuits&r and &e8 Steel Cores&r. One Steel Core: four Heavy Engineering Blocks, one Advanced Control Circuit, two Engineering Processors from AE2, one Steel Casing, one Elementium Ingot."
		""
		"This chapter supplies steel and blocks. Let the steel line run into chests and bring the ingots to the obelisk."
	]
	quest.1FE059D1A0AD661A.quest_subtitle: "The furnace never sleeps."
	quest.1FE059D1A0AD661A.title: "&c&lBuild a Steelworks for the Server"
	quest.1FEF5053A121D8CB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Refinery:&r 5x3x3, 34 blocks. Oil and Ethanol in, Biodiesel out."
		"&6Arc Furnace:&r 5x5x5, 77 blocks. Ore in, ingots out."
		"&6Diesel Generator:&r 3x3x5, 38 blocks. Biodiesel in, 4,096 FE/t out."
		"&6Excavator:&r 3x7x8 with wheel, 68 blocks. Power in, ore out."
		"&6Automated Engineer's Workbench:&r 3x2x3, 18 blocks."
		"&6Lightning Rod:&r 3x3x3, 27 blocks. &6Radio Tower:&r 5x19x6, 207 blocks. &6Resonanz Observer:&r 3x5x3, 45 blocks."
		""
		"The stage 2 blocks are in the &6Immersive Engineering&r chapter."
	]
	quest.1FEF5053A121D8CB.quest_subtitle: "Seven multiblocks for the advanced."
	quest.1FEF5053A121D8CB.title: "&6&lCheck Off the Large Plants"
	quest.1FF0EC2CE1084B84.quest_desc: [
		"In the &6Infusion Altar&r: a prosperity seed base, 4 &6Inferium Essence&r, 4 stone (smelted). The &6Stone Seeds&r on farmland, &6Growth Accelerators&r below. 8 &6Stone Essence&r in a ring give &e24 cobblestone&r."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/essence/stone_essence.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Each accelerator gives the plant above it a growth tick every &e10 seconds&r, stacked up to 9 blocks high. Bone meal does not work on essence crops, the watering can does. Harvest with the &6Sickle&r, 7 by 7 crops per click."
		""
		"Altar, pedestals and accelerators are in the &aMystical Agriculture&r chapter."
	]
	quest.1FF0EC2CE1084B84.quest_subtitle: "Cobblestone from the field, without any lava."
	quest.1FF0EC2CE1084B84.title: "&7Plant stone seeds"
	quest.1FF3E7840F0F5373.quest_desc: [
		"A &6zombie&r into a Z-Logic Controller gives &6Frank'N'Zombie&r. A &6villager&r into an emerald gives the &6Enticing Crystal&r. An &6enderman&r into a Vibrant Crystal gives the &6Ender Crystal&r for the Staff of Travelling."
		""
		"A &6Broken Spawner&r (drops when you mine a spawner) takes any soul and becomes the heart of the &6Powered Spawner&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A Dubious Container from Oritech with the soul of an allay, phantom or vex becomes &6Unholy Intelligence&r, which Oritech needs for late addons."
	]
	quest.1FF3E7840F0F5373.quest_subtitle: "Frank'N'Zombie and friends."
	quest.1FF3E7840F0F5373.title: "&dBind Your First Soul"
	quest.1FF6A4979CED34EA.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6copper ingots&r and one &6tin ingot&r make &e4 bronze ingots&r in the Alloy Kiln. Tin comes with Mekanism."
		""
		"Bronze is needed for the tool set of Mekanism Tools and some recipes of other mods."
	]
	quest.1FF6A4979CED34EA.quest_subtitle: "Three copper and one tin give four bronze."
	quest.1FF6A4979CED34EA.title: "&6Alloy bronze in the Alloy Kiln"
	quest.1FFC803246C51DE4.quest_desc: [
		"In the Dissolution Chamber: two &6dirt&r, two &6rotten flesh&r, one &6Pity Frame&r and &e1,000 mB of Liquid Meat&r."
		""
		"It spawns mobs at a fast pace, for &d1,000 FE&r and &e20 mB of Liquid Meat&r per operation. The normal spawn rules apply: light level 7 or lower, and the chunk has to be loaded."
		""
		"It shares power and meat with all adjacent blocks of Mechanical Dirt. Lay out an area, put a Mob Crusher above it, and the mob farm is done."
	]
	quest.1FFC803246C51DE4.quest_subtitle: "A floor where mobs spawn fast."
	quest.1FFC803246C51DE4.title: "&cLay Out Mechanical Dirt"
	quest.20041F74AE63F761.quest_desc: [
		"Awakened ingots in the corners, a &6Wyvern Core&r at the top, a &6Draconic Core&r at the bottom, &6Large Chaos Fragments&r left and right, a &6Draconic Shield Module&r in the middle."
		""
		"It holds clearly more shield than the Draconic one and only fits into Chaotic armor."
	]
	quest.20041F74AE63F761.quest_subtitle: "Chaos Fragments in the shield."
	quest.20041F74AE63F761.title: "&8Build a Chaotic Shield Module"
	quest.2006E7A7C37A3884.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_gear_wyvern.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Fusion mit 6 Wyvern-Injektoren: Diamantwerkzeug als Katalysator, dazu Draconiumkern, 2 Draconiumbarren, 2 Relaiskristalle, Wyvern-Energiekontroller, 8 Millionen Energie. Kapitel &5Draconic Evolution&r."
		""
		"Geht nicht kaputt, lädt mit Strom. Module: AOE, Speed, Damage, Auto Feed, Undying. Die &6Wyvern-Brustplatte&r trägt einen Energieschild und mit Elytra und Rakete das &6Flugmodul&r."
	]
	quest.2006E7A7C37A3884.quest_subtitle: "Draconic Evolution: Strom statt Haltbarkeit."
	quest.2006E7A7C37A3884.title: "&dFusioniere Wyvern-Ausrüstung"
	quest.20077B13AB29AB47.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &6arrow&r, &6snowball&r, &6slimeball&r, &6ender pearl&r."
		""
		"Flies in an arc like a thrown potion. Each Pierce lets it bounce off the ground once. Good for targets behind walls."
	]
	quest.20077B13AB29AB47.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: a form that flies in an arc."
	quest.20077B13AB29AB47.title: "&dLearn Arc Projectile"
	quest.200A4990D4AC9336.quest_desc: [
		"Siebte Generation, zweiter Teil."
		""
		"&6Nektarine&r: Pflaume + Pfirsich, 10 %"
		"&6Muskat&r: Teak + Gewürznelke, 10 %"
		"&6Orange&r: Mandarine + Pomelo, 10 %"
		"&6Osagedorn&r: Kapok + Gelbholz, 10 %"
		"&6Pink Ivory&r: Brasilholz + Rosen-Eukalyptus, 10 %"
		"&6Pistazie&r: Mandel + Cashew, 10 %"
		"&6Purpleheart&r: Brasilholz + Kapok, 10 %"
		"&6Sandelholz&r: Brasilholz + Mahagoni, 10 %"
	]
	quest.200A4990D4AC9336.quest_subtitle: "8 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.200A4990D4AC9336.title: "&aGeneration 7: Nektarine bis Sandelholz"
	quest.200CD0947E173E23.quest_desc: [
		"The &dSourceborn&r origin gives &e+50&r maximum mana in Ars Nouveau and &e+50&r in Iron's Spells. In return you have &cone heart less&r and can't wear iron, gold, diamond or netherite armour."
		""
		"The sorcerer robes from stage 3 do not count as heavy armour. Leather until then, then robes."
		""
		"The &dArcanist&r role fits with it: &e+1&r mana per second, potions last 25 percent longer. You choose on your first login, later only with the orb."
	]
	quest.200CD0947E173E23.quest_subtitle: "Neo Origins: 50 more mana, one heart less."
	quest.200CD0947E173E23.title: "&dPick the Sourceborn"
	quest.20126811246AC3FC.quest_desc: [
		"Right click the &eobelisk&r at spawn with gems; sneaking hands in everything that fits."
		""
		"The magic pillar: &e800 Source Gems&r (scaled to the number of players) and &e12 Source Keystones&r. One keystone counts for a good 60 gems: &e4 Source Gem blocks&r, Source Jar, 2 mana diamonds from Botania, andesite alloy, Gold Leaf from Nature's Aura. Recipe in the &6Start here&r chapter."
		""
		"Keep a supply: from stage 2 every &6Blaze Burner&r needs two Source Gems."
	]
	quest.20126811246AC3FC.quest_subtitle: "The magic half of stage 1."
	quest.20126811246AC3FC.title: "&dBring gems to the obelisk"
	quest.201400F32E9DF3E4.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Steinmetztisch&r und ein &6Eisenbarren&r formlos ergeben den &6Meißel&r. Rechtsklick in der Hand öffnet dieselbe Oberfläche wie der Tisch, überall, auch auf dem Gerüst in 40 Blöcken Höhe."
		""
		"{image:chipped:textures/item/chisel.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"{image:chipped:textures/item/saw.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Genauso gibt es die &6Säge&r aus dem Zimmermannstisch, die &6Nadeln&r aus dem Webstuhltisch (mit einem Stock), das &6Multimeter&r aus dem Bastlertisch (mit Redstone), die &6Gießkanne&r aus dem Botanikertisch (mit einem Eimer) und das &6Alchemiebuch&r aus dem Alchemietisch (mit einem Buch)."
	]
	quest.201400F32E9DF3E4.quest_subtitle: "Der Steinmetztisch für die Hosentasche."
	quest.201400F32E9DF3E4.title: "&6Schnitz einen Meißel"
	quest.2020A0C0A744D54E.quest_desc: [
		"Fast alle Technikmods reden &dFE&r (Forge Energy). Was Ender IO &dµI&r nennt, Immersive Engineering &dIF&r oder Flux und Draconic &dOP&r, ist dasselbe, eins zu eins. Ein Kabel von Mod A versorgt eine Maschine von Mod B."
		""
		"&eMekanism&r rechnet in &dJoule&r: &e1 FE = 2,5 J&r. Alle Mekanism-Zahlen in diesem Kapitel sind schon in FE umgerechnet. &eCreate&r hat keinen Strom, sondern Rotation: &dRPM&r ist die Drehzahl, &dSU&r die Belastbarkeit. Alternator und Elektromotor übersetzen zwischen SU und FE."
		""
		"&ePneumaticCraft&r arbeitet mit Druckluft in &dbar&r und mL, Dynamo und Flux-Kompressor übersetzen. &eBotania&r-Mana wird im Manaflussfeld zu FE (&e1 Mana = 10 FE&r), &eNature's Aura&r kann Aura zu FE machen (20 Aura = 1 FE)."
		""
		"Jede Zeile hier: Mod, Generator, Brennstoff, FE pro Tick, Puffer, und ab welcher Stufe. Die &eWelche Quelle wann&r-Quest am Anfang jeder Stufe sagt dir, was sich lohnt."
	]
	quest.2020A0C0A744D54E.quest_subtitle: "FE, SU, Joule, bar und Mana, und wie sie zusammenhängen."
	quest.2020A0C0A744D54E.title: "&6&lLies die Einheiten einmal"
	quest.20210ADA8839D3DA.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Livingrock&r, &e2 gold ingots&r, &e2 brewing stands&r and &e1 Mana Pearl&r. Under a Mana Pool it makes the pool transform things instead of infusing them."
		""
		"EMI shows all recipes under the catalyst. A functional flower thrown into a pool with a catalyst gets smaller for some mana: same effect, smaller area."
		""
		"In stage 3 it becomes the Conjuration Catalyst, see &aBotania: Alfheim&r."
	]
	quest.20210ADA8839D3DA.quest_subtitle: "The pool learns transformation."
	quest.20210ADA8839D3DA.title: "&6Build an Alchemy Catalyst"
	quest.20263DB2F2483463.quest_desc: [
		"Gather &e16 Afrit Essences&r. Per summoning: a cow, an Iesnium ingot, netherrack, flint and steel, gunpowder."
		"Hand in at the &6obelisk&r at spawn, by right click."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The goal wants &e150 essences&r (the amount adapts to the number of players), each worth 10 points. The eight Elven Stars need another 16."
		""
		"&eWhat helps:&r a cow farm next to the pentacle, a weapon with Looting III, an Afrit Crusher for more Iesnium, and people who take turns fighting."
	]
	quest.20263DB2F2483463.quest_subtitle: "A hundred and fifty essences for the server."
	quest.20263DB2F2483463.title: "&cDeliver Afrit Essence to the obelisk"
	quest.2028305A0B04BDE2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Stage 2:&r copper and iron backpacks, the &6Compacting Drawer&r (nuggets, ingots and blocks in one), copper and gold upgrades for drawers, gold chests and barrels, advanced backpack upgrades. With Nether quartz, the Functional Storage &6Storage Controller&r, which gathers all drawers within 8 blocks at one front."
		""
		"&6Stage 3:&r gold and diamond backpacks, diamond chests, the &6Ender Drawer&r, and &bApplied Energistics 2&r or &3Refined Storage&r with search and autocrafting."
		""
		"Locked items show in the tooltip when they open. You may already collect them."
	]
	quest.2028305A0B04BDE2.quest_subtitle: "More space with every stage."
	quest.2028305A0B04BDE2.title: "Read what the next stages bring"
	quest.20289A0EF28C852A.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a &6Charged Certus Quartz Crystal&r, a &6redstone&r and a &6nether quartz&r into water together. A few seconds later &etwo Fluix Crystals&r lie there."
		""
		"The same trick multiplies certus: a charged crystal and a &6Certus Quartz Dust&r in water give two normal crystals."
		""
		"Fluix goes into cables, cores, the controller and the growth accelerator. You need nether quartz in bulk, put Fortune on your pickaxe."
	]
	quest.20289A0EF28C852A.quest_subtitle: "Three ingredients in, two crystals out."
	quest.20289A0EF28C852A.title: "&5Make fluix in water"
	quest.2029076869FC26F5.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &fAir Essence&r, &e3 lightning rods&r, &bheart of the sea&r."
		""
		"Calls a lightning bolt. Those hit get &eShocked&r, which grows up to level III and strengthens further lightning damage. Wet enemies are hit harder. &eProjectile, Lightning, Amplify&r is simple and strong."
	]
	quest.2029076869FC26F5.quest_subtitle: "A thunderstorm from the spell book."
	quest.2029076869FC26F5.title: "&dLearn Lightning"
	quest.203431A086674ED6.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6plastic&r, one &6iron sword&r in the middle, at the bottom Motor, plating, Motor."
		""
		"The laser aims at mobs instead of blocks. &eShift&r right click with the designator to switch: all mobs, hostile and neutral, hostile only. Loot lands in the laser, experience does not."
	]
	quest.203431A086674ED6.quest_subtitle: "Hunter Addon."
	quest.203431A086674ED6.title: "&aTurn the Laser into a Weapon"
	quest.20375037881AC816.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Runewood Logs&r on the altar, &e6 Runewood planks&r and &e2 Hex Ash&r on the stands, plus &e2 Aerial, Aqueous, Earthen, Infernal, Eldritch&r each. Gives four."
		""
		"Eldritch is the hardest kind. Endermen give it most reliably."
	]
	quest.20375037881AC816.quest_subtitle: "The foot of every totem."
	quest.20375037881AC816.title: "&2Infuse Totem Bases"
	quest.203871EB493A423A.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r gold nugget, &6iron bars&r, gold nugget on top, gold nugget, &6note block&r, gold nugget in the middle, three gold nuggets at the bottom."
		""
		"Shift right clicking a block that the nest type you are looking for is made of tunes the &6Nest Locator&r to it. Right clicking then searches the area and tells you how many meters in which direction the next nest is."
		""
		"With it you find quartz nests in the Nether and rare wood nests without cutting down the forest."
	]
	quest.203871EB493A423A.quest_subtitle: "It shows you where the next bee lives."
	quest.203871EB493A423A.title: "&2Build a Nest Locator"
	quest.203B0E0C696824A8.quest_desc: [
		"&eSneak&r and &eright click&r the obelisk to hand in everything in your inventory that the current goal takes. The first click asks, the second one gives. Hotbar and offhand stay."
		""
		"Handing in is done by hand only, at the obelisk. There is no command, no menu button and no machine that hands in for you."
	]
	quest.203B0E0C696824A8.quest_subtitle: "Sneak and right click the obelisk."
	quest.203B0E0C696824A8.title: "&6Tip: everything at once"
	quest.203FF09F26BF9F08.quest_desc: [
		"Iron in the corners, &6iron bars&r on the sides, &6glass&r in the middle."
		""
		"In the window you fill and empty buckets. A fluid conduit set to extract pumps it out. The &6Drain&r sucks fluid from a source block below it."
	]
	quest.203FF09F26BF9F08.quest_subtitle: "Where the water waits."
	quest.203FF09F26BF9F08.title: "&bSet Up a Fluid Tank"
	quest.2049A8B037D98CD5.quest_desc: [
		"A &6leather cap&r on the altar, on the stands &e4 Soulwoven Silk&r, &e4 Refined Soulstone&r, &e2 leather&r, plus &e8 Aerial&r and &e8 Earthen&r. Robe, leggings, boots the same way."
		""
		"Soulstained Steel as armor touches your own soul. The silk cloth is the way out."
	]
	quest.2049A8B037D98CD5.quest_subtitle: "Light armor made of silk cloth."
	quest.2049A8B037D98CD5.title: "&7Dress as a Soul Hunter"
	quest.204BC55FA2CD7C85.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hold \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbultimine\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" while you break a block. All matching blocks next to it come along: ore veins, trees, a row of stone.\"}]"
		""
		"It costs hunger, so bring food. For the stone pillar Ultimine is your best friend."
	]
	quest.204BC55FA2CD7C85.quest_subtitle: "A whole vein at once."
	quest.204BC55FA2CD7C85.title: "&6Mine with Ultimine"
	quest.205C9F7DC2AC9FA2.quest_desc: [
		"Top three &6cocoa beans&r, middle three &6milk bottles&r, bottom &6sugar&r, &6pie crust&r, &6sugar&r."
		""
		"Like the apple pie, a block for the table. The knife cuts it into slices, four slices in a square make a whole pie again."
	]
	quest.205C9F7DC2AC9FA2.quest_subtitle: "Cocoa, milk, sugar, crust."
	quest.205C9F7DC2AC9FA2.title: "&7Bake a chocolate pie"
	quest.20621856B534C213.quest_desc: [
		"Reinforced Alloy in the corners, Elite Control Circuits at the top and bottom, stone left and right, Steel Casing in the middle."
		""
		"It combines two items into one, such as raw ore and cobblestone into an ore block. With the &6Stone Generator Upgrade&r it needs no cobblestone."
	]
	quest.20621856B534C213.quest_subtitle: "Raw ore becomes an ore block again."
	quest.20621856B534C213.title: "&7Build a Combiner"
	quest.20647737C53774E1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Bat Wing&r, &6blaze rod&r, &6Molten Core&r and &6Nebulous Heart&r shapeless give the &6Interdiction Torch&r."
		""
		"Placed, it pushes monsters within &e5 blocks&r away from itself. One at the door, and nothing pushes its way inside anymore. It does not stop arrows."
	]
	quest.20647737C53774E1.quest_subtitle: "A torch that pushes monsters away."
	quest.20647737C53774E1.title: "&ePlace an Interdiction Torch"
	quest.2064B8A353821057.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_excavator.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eMotor:&r 16 Steel Sheetmetal, 9 Light and 4 Heavy Engineering Blocks, 3 Radiator Blocks, 6 Steel Scaffolding, 1 Redstone Engineering Block. &eWheel:&r 9 steel blocks, 20 Steel Scaffolding. Hammer on the rear middle Heavy block."
		""
		"&eIn:&r &d4,096 FE/t&r through the three connectors on the side, one Diesel Generator per Excavator. &eOut:&r ore at the back of the motor. A vein gives at most &e38,400&r ores, the farther from the center, the more waste rock."
	]
	quest.2064B8A353821057.quest_subtitle: "Motor 3x3x6 and bucket wheel 7x7, vein in, ore out."
	quest.2064B8A353821057.title: "&6&lForm an Excavator"
	quest.20674BCB83B73A35.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r 3 &64M components&r, an &6Accumulation Processor&r at the top, &6ender pearl dust&r in the corners, an &5Awakened Draconium nugget&r in the middle."
		""
		"64M and 256M build on the previous one the same way, with Matter Balls in the corners and again an Awakened nugget. You craft the cell from component and MEGA housing."
	]
	quest.20674BCB83B73A35.quest_subtitle: "Storage needs Awakened Draconium."
	quest.20674BCB83B73A35.title: "&bBuild a 16M Component"
	quest.206F07EC971C7521.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r top Source Gem, iron sheet, Source Gem. Middle iron sheet, &6netherrack&r, iron sheet. Bottom middle one iron sheet."
		""
		"No Blaze Burner, no brass; no brass, no stage 2 goal. The engineers need your gems: build burners or trade gems for brass."
	]
	quest.206F07EC971C7521.quest_subtitle: "Kronwerke: brass needs a magician."
	quest.206F07EC971C7521.title: "&6Build an Empty Blaze Burner"
	quest.20773ED6F473E146.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Hopper&r (Import) oder ein &6Dropper&r (Export) oben links, drei &6Pneumatic Cylinders&r, unten Compressed Iron, &6PCB&r, Compressed Iron. Eine Import Unit wird an der Werkbank ohne Zutat zur Export Unit und zurück."
		""
		"Die Straße braucht &egenau zwei&r: eine &9blaue&r Import Unit, die Werkstücke aus einer Kiste auf die Plattform legt, und eine &6orange&r Export Unit, die das Ergebnis in eine Kiste räumt. Die Arme greifen auch &ediagonal&r, Kiste und Plattform müssen also nur in Reichweite stehen."
	]
	quest.20773ED6F473E146.quest_subtitle: "Ein Arm, der hineinlegt, einer, der herausnimmt."
	quest.20773ED6F473E146.title: "&bBau zwei Assembly IO Units"
	quest.207CCFAD971797F7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron&r in the corners, a &6Draconium Ingot&r at the top, a &6diamond sword&r left and right, a &6Wyvern Energy Controller&r in the middle, any &6head&r at the bottom."
		""
		"With power it kills monsters in its area, &eShow AOE&r shows it. It needs &e80 energy per health point&r of the monster. A weapon in the slot brings its enchantments."
		""
		"&eCollect Items&r pushes the loot into an inventory next to it, &eCollect XP&r stores the experience. Placed under a spawner it saves you the hitting."
	]
	quest.207CCFAD971797F7.quest_subtitle: "Kills monsters in an area."
	quest.207CCFAD971797F7.title: "&cBuild a Mob Grinder"
	quest.207D8B35CFC434C4.quest_desc: [
		"&dSiren&r: &e+2&r water damage, Dolphin's Grace II in water."
		"&dFlashjack&r: &e+2&r lightning damage, movement spells 20 percent cheaper. Flashpine fed to it gives speed and night vision."
		"&dFlarecannon&r: &e+2&r fire damage, projectile spells 20 percent cheaper. Charm in the apparatus: magma block, 2 Fire Essences, netherite scrap, 2 Nether bricks."
	]
	quest.207D8B35CFC434C4.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: Siren, Flashjack, Flarecannon."
	quest.207D8B35CFC434C4.title: "&dBind the elemental familiars"
	quest.2081521B6FEC7EBA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Impure White Chalk&r, an &cAfrit Essence&r, a &6torchflower&r and &6redstone&r shapeless, then into Spiritfire."
		""
		"Torchflowers grow from seeds that the &esniffer&r digs up. Sniffer eggs are found in suspicious sand in the warm ocean ruins. Plant the seeds right away."
		""
		"Only red chalk binds an Afrit that works for you."
	]
	quest.2081521B6FEC7EBA.quest_subtitle: "Chalk from the essence of the Afrit themselves."
	quest.2081521B6FEC7EBA.title: "&cMix red chalk"
	quest.208E02F95486BC7D.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Ferricore Ingots&r in a diamond shape (top, bottom, left, right) give a &6Blank Upgrade&r. Every ability needs a blank plus two to four matching ingredients."
		""
		"They are installed at the &6Smithing Table&r: tool in the middle slot, upgrade to the right of it, the template slot stays empty. The upgrade is used up and then sits firmly in the tool."
		""
		"Make four right away: two for the pickaxe, one each for axe and sword."
	]
	quest.208E02F95486BC7D.quest_subtitle: "The blank for every ability."
	quest.208E02F95486BC7D.title: "&eMake Blank Upgrades"
	quest.208EBDB907C592AB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_dimensions_r_plates.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eSo geht es:&r Zwei &6Warpplatten&r, ein &6Ruhender Splitter&r (2 Warppulver, Feuerstein) in die erste Platte gelegt wird eingestellt, den trägst du zur zweiten. Ab dann bringt dich jede Platte zur anderen, sobald du eine Dreiviertelsekunde darauf stehst."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r Warpplatten kosten laut Serverconfig &ekeine Erfahrung&r, auch zwischen Dimensionen nicht. Eine Platte an der Basis, eine am Portal in der Mine oder im Nether, und du sparst dir die 27 Level jedes Mal."
		""
		"Angeleinte Tiere nimmt die Platte mit, Haustiere nicht."
	]
	quest.208EBDB907C592AB.quest_subtitle: "Draufstellen, weg, und es kostet nichts."
	quest.208EBDB907C592AB.title: "&6Verbinde zwei Orte mit Warpplatten"
	quest.20A63A41ED633ABF.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6LV Wire Coils&r on the sides, five &6Tough Fabric&r in the corners and the middle make four &6Insulated LV Wire Coils&r."
		""
		"Insulated wire carries power like copper wire, but hurts nobody who touches it. Use it everywhere players or animals get to: in the base, along paths, above the pasture."
		""
		"It hangs on the same LV connectors and relays, and a stretch may likewise be &e16 blocks&r long at most."
	]
	quest.20A63A41ED633ABF.quest_subtitle: "Power that hurts nobody any more."
	quest.20A63A41ED633ABF.title: "&6Insulate your LV wires"
	quest.20AC1121F3B1DE67.quest_desc: [
		"Vier kleine Werkzeuge, jedes aus Stöcken und einem oder zwei &6Rahmenblöcken&r: der &6Schraubenschlüssel&r dreht einen gesetzten Rahmen, der &6Schraubendreher&r dreht die Tarnung darauf (Stämme längs oder quer), der &6Rahmenschlüssel&r (dazu zwei Eisenklumpen) sperrt den Zustand eines Blocks, damit sich Zäune und Wände nicht mehr neu verbinden."
		""
		"{image:framedblocks:textures/item/framed_wrench.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"{image:framedblocks:textures/item/framed_blueprint.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Der &6Bauplan&r (vier Rahmenblöcke um ein Papier) kopiert mit Schleichen und Rechtsklick einen fertigen Rahmen samt Tarnung. Danach setzt du mit Rechtsklick Kopien, solange du Rahmen und Tarnblöcke im Inventar hast. Der Tooltip zeigt, was fehlt."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Die &6Rahmenaxt&r (zwei Eisenbarren, zwei Rahmenblöcke) baut Rahmen ab, ohne die Tarnung einzeln fallen zu lassen. Umbauen geht damit ohne Sortierarbeit."
	]
	quest.20AC1121F3B1DE67.quest_subtitle: "Drehen, sperren, kopieren."
	quest.20AC1121F3B1DE67.title: "&6Nimm das Rahmenwerkzeug"
	quest.20ACF671564976EB.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a gem you do not need on the ground and drop an &6anvil&r on it. What remains is &6Gem Dust&r."
		""
		"Gem Dust goes into every table and every sigil of this chapter, and cutting gems eats it by the stack. A Cracked gem gives one to two dust, a Flawed gem two to four."
		""
		"The anvil is only for the start. As soon as the Salvaging Table stands, you take gems apart there."
	]
	quest.20ACF671564976EB.quest_subtitle: "An anvil, a gem, dust."
	quest.20ACF671564976EB.title: "&7Shatter a Gem"
	quest.20AE535EE804F883.quest_desc: [
		"&eFire Resistance&r: Potion of Fire Resistance. &eWater Breathing&r: Potion of Water Breathing."
		""
		"The fire candle belongs next to the lava cauldrons and in the Nether camp, the water candle at the underwater building site. There is no night vision candle in this version, its recipe makes water breathing as well."
	]
	quest.20AE535EE804F883.quest_subtitle: "Fire resistance and water breathing."
	quest.20AE535EE804F883.title: "&eSoak candles for water and fire"
	quest.20B338BCE21915E3.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &65 Thermal Springstone Ingots&r and &62 sticks&r make the &6Thermal Springstone Hammer&r. Trigger its special attack: a critical hit at full strength, so while falling."
	]
	quest.20B338BCE21915E3.quest_subtitle: "Full strength, critical hit."
	quest.20B338BCE21915E3.title: "&cStrike with the Hammer"
	quest.20B8D7B3372EC244.quest_desc: [
		"A &6lever&r in the middle, &6four sticks&r top, bottom and on the sides: the &6Basic Tier Upgrade&r."
		""
		"Right clicking a placed vanilla chest or vanilla barrel turns it into the Sophisticated version, everything stays inside. After that it goes on to copper and iron."
	]
	quest.20B8D7B3372EC244.quest_subtitle: "With contents, without emptying."
	quest.20B8D7B3372EC244.title: "Convert vanilla chests"
	quest.20C1E1177B3D5FDE.quest_desc: [
		"The &2Fae&r float near leylines, their laughter sounds like little bells. You can only see them with Fay Sight. Defeated, they drop &2Fae Essence&r. With a powder they can be bred."
		""
		"Clicking the ground with essence creates a &2fae circle&r. Anyone may use scrolls from it, the user pays the mana."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Do not eat a &cFaecake&r, or the Fae will avoid you."
	]
	quest.20C1E1177B3D5FDE.quest_subtitle: "What the Fae leave behind."
	quest.20C1E1177B3D5FDE.title: "&2Collect Fae Essence"
	quest.20C3EAE570CBC7DA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_nouveau_drygmy.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Throw a &6Wilden Horn&r next to a wild &dDrygmy&r and it gives you &6Drygmy Shards&r. In the apparatus with fish, wheat, apple, carrot, seeds and &e3 Source Gems&r it becomes the charm."
		""
		"Charm on &6mossy cobblestone&r: it becomes a &6Drygmy Henge&r. Chest and Source Jar next to it, and the Drygmy produces the loot of the creatures within &e10 blocks&r. Each round costs &d1,000 Source&r, every additional kind of animal brings &e2&r extra items."
	]
	quest.20C3EAE570CBC7DA.quest_subtitle: "Loot without anyone dying."
	quest.20C3EAE570CBC7DA.title: "&6Summon a Drygmy"
	quest.20C468130E41EA87.quest_desc: [
		"In the assembler: an &6electrum plate&r, &6bioplastic&r, &6Energetic Blend&r, &6redstone&r and a &6Coil Copper&r."
		""
		"The Manufactory makes &6bioplastic&r from two sugar cane. The assembler mixes &6Energetic Blend&r from glowstone, quartz, redstone and emerald dust."
	]
	quest.20C468130E41EA87.quest_subtitle: "Two for the controller."
	quest.20C468130E41EA87.title: "&bBuild Basic Electric Circuits"
	quest.20C83E43A1C35408.quest_desc: [
		"&aTerra Blade&r, &e2 Pure Ender Essence&r, &bMana Diamond&r, &dElementium Ingot&r."
		""
		"A hit in a crowd triggers a lightning chain that strikes hostile mobs nearby."
	]
	quest.20C83E43A1C35408.quest_subtitle: "Lightning that jumps from monster to monster."
	quest.20C83E43A1C35408.title: "&eForge the Thundercaller"
	quest.20CA7AFF5AFFCCF3.quest_desc: [
		"Bring a &6frog&r into the Nether, easiest in a boat through the portal. When it eats a small &6magma cube&r, a &6froglight&r is left behind."
		""
		"The colour depends on the frog: the orange frog from the swamp makes &6Ochre Froglight&r, the green one from cold biomes green, the white one from warm biomes pearlescent. Froglight is a bright light source that looks good."
	]
	quest.20CA7AFF5AFFCCF3.quest_subtitle: "What it eats becomes light."
	quest.20CA7AFF5AFFCCF3.title: "&6Feed magma to a frog"
	quest.20CF533BDB0144AF.quest_desc: [
		"On Kronwerke only Create's &6Mechanical Mixer&r makes brass: two copper, one zinc and one &6blaze powder&r heated make one ingot, &csuperheated&r two ingots without powder. See the chapter &6Create: Brass&r."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The &6Light Engineering Block&r needs a &6brass sheet&r instead of a copper ingot, the &6Heavy Engineering Block&r a &6precision mechanism&r instead of a steel component. Both open in stage 3."
		""
		"Whoever puts brass sheets and precision mechanisms aside now builds the large machines at once in stage 3. Trade your coke and steel for the brass of the Create players."
	]
	quest.20CF533BDB0144AF.quest_subtitle: "Brass only comes from Create's mixer."
	quest.20CF533BDB0144AF.title: "&6Read why there is no brass here"
	quest.20CF8543D5E5B278.quest_desc: [
		"&6Golden Sheet&r, &6depot&r and &6Cogwheel&r stacked make the &6Weighted Ejector&r. Hold it, sneak and right-click the target, then place it."
		""
		"With rotation it winds up (&d2 SU per RPM&r). When an item lands on it, it throws it to the target, up to &e32 blocks&r far and to any height, but only straight ahead. If it aims at a chest, it waits until there is room."
		""
		"In the value box you set a count: then it only throws once that many items are on it. Players and mobs who step on it always fly along. With a redstone signal it stays still."
	]
	quest.20CF8543D5E5B278.quest_subtitle: "No belt needed, up to 32 blocks far."
	quest.20CF8543D5E5B278.title: "&6Throw items with the Weighted Ejector"
	quest.20D56D3606BBA234.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 redstone&r in the corners, &e4 eyes of ender&r on the sides, &6obsidian&r in the middle."
		""
		"The block gives a redstone signal when a player within &e64 blocks&r looks straight at it. Anyone wearing a &6pumpkin&r on their head doesn't trigger it."
		""
		"&eIdea:&r A door that opens when you look at the sign above it from outside."
	]
	quest.20D56D3606BBA234.quest_subtitle: "Redstone when someone looks at you."
	quest.20D56D3606BBA234.title: "&6Build an Ender Overseer"
	quest.20DF4FDBAAA146AF.quest_desc: [
		"Cobblestone, ore and ingredients have to go somewhere: backpacks from Sophisticated Backpacks, drawers from Functional Storage and bigger chests."
	]
	quest.20DF4FDBAAA146AF.quest_subtitle: "Backpacks, drawers, chests."
	quest.20DF4FDBAAA146AF.title: "&6Open Storage"
	quest.20E04C1C72E49A84.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &68 raw osmium&r. The big veins sit in the mountains above &eY 72&r, medium ones between Y -32 and Y 56, small ones everywhere below Y 64."
		""
		"&5Mekanism&r is Kronwerke's big tech mod: machines with power, gases in tubes, and in the end fusion and antimatter. Almost every part of it contains osmium."
		""
		"&eStage 2:&r basic machines, generators, steel, tanks. &cLater:&r advanced in stage 3, elite and fusion in stage 4, antimatter in stage 5. An item's tooltip tells you when it opens."
	]
	quest.20E04C1C72E49A84.quest_subtitle: "The metal Mekanism is built from."
	quest.20E04C1C72E49A84.title: "&5&lDig up osmium"
	quest.20EF2EB6442B2645.quest_desc: [
		"Yellow Cake into the &6Chemical Oxidizer&r. One piece gives &e250 mB of uranium oxide&r."
		""
		"Hang a Chemical Tank on the output, the oxide waits there for the acid."
	]
	quest.20EF2EB6442B2645.quest_subtitle: "Step 2: uranium oxide."
	quest.20EF2EB6442B2645.title: "&aOxidize the Yellow Cake"
	quest.20F91A666115D6A2.quest_desc: [
		"&dMark&r (Manipulation Essence, ender pearl, Containment Jar, Containment tablet): stores the target in an &6Unstable Reliquary&r in the off hand."
		"&dRecall&r (Conjuration Essence, ender pearl, Scryer's Scroll, wizard's eye): casts the spell on the stored target."
		"&dRetaliate&r (netherite sword, enchanted book): hits whoever hurt you within the last 5 seconds."
	]
	quest.20F91A666115D6A2.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: remember targets and strike back."
	quest.20F91A666115D6A2.title: "&dLearn Mark, Recall and Retaliate"
	quest.2102387B34DA5072.quest_desc: [
		"A &6scroll&r carries a spell with a level, like an enchanted book. Right click casts it instantly, without mana and without cooldown, but the scroll is gone afterwards. Better: inscribe it, next quests."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/scroll.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eWhere:&r Chests in dungeons, mineshafts, temples, outposts, shipwrecks, ruined portals, mansions and village churches often hold a scroll. The &6library of a fort&r always has 3 to 5. Every mage of this mod drops one, and the Wandering Trader sells some for emeralds."
		""
		"The tooltip shows school, level, rarity, mana cost and cooldown. Keep scrolls above &fCommon&r: what you cannot forge now is worth gold in stage 2."
	]
	quest.2102387B34DA5072.quest_subtitle: "Every scroll is a spell with a level."
	quest.2102387B34DA5072.title: "&eFind a Scroll"
	quest.2104FD313A4700DF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Machine Upgrade Base:&r &e4 Prosperity Shards&r in the corners, &e4 Prosperity Ingots&r on the sides, a &6diamond&r in the middle. Around it &e4 Inferium Ingots&r on the sides and &e4 Inferium Essence&r in the corners: the &6Inferium Machine Upgrade&r."
		""
		"In a machine's upgrade slot it makes the machine work faster, and it uses more fuel for that. The upgrade's tooltip shows the factors."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r Prudentium upgrades, the &6Harvester&r (harvests and replants by itself) and the &6Seed Reprocessor&r (turns spare seeds into essence) come with &cstage 2&r."
	]
	quest.2104FD313A4700DF.quest_subtitle: "Faster, but hungrier."
	quest.2104FD313A4700DF.title: "&aPut an Inferium Upgrade into the Machine"
	quest.210DAD7590BAA085.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Der &6Grundlegende Generator&r ist Nickel oben und an den Seiten, Kupfer in der Mitte, unten Spule, Andesitgehäuse, Spule, dazu Maschinenkerne um ihn herum. Bio-, Lava- und Brennstoffgenerator sind größere Multiblöcke mit Kernen."
		""
		"&eOritech, Generatoren:&r Grundlegender Generator &d32 FE/t&r aus allem Brennbaren, Puffer 50 000. &6Biogenerator&r &d64 FE/t&r aus Biomasse, &6Lavagenerator&r &d64 FE/t&r aus Lava, &6Brennstoffgenerator&r &d256 FE/t&r aus Öl-Brennstoff, Puffer 100 000 bis 250 000. Das &6Große Solarmodul&r &d32 FE/t&r bei Tag. Mit dem Dampfkessel-Addon machen die Generatoren statt Strom Dampf, den die &6Dampfmaschine&r eins zu eins zurück in FE wandelt. Offen ab Stufe 3, siehe Kapitel &6Oritech&r."
	]
	quest.210DAD7590BAA085.quest_subtitle: "Oritech: 32 FE/t Basis, 64 Bio und Lava, 256 Brennstoff, 32 Solar."
	quest.210DAD7590BAA085.title: "&cStell die Oritech-Generatoren"
	quest.210F792C17475B19.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r vier &6Redstone&r um einen &6Logistics Core&r, unten zwei &6Pressure Tubes&r."
		""
		"Das Modul sitzt am Rohr und zeigt auf eine Kiste oder einen Tank mit &6Logistics Frame&r. Alle Module, die über Rohre verbunden sind, bilden ein Netz und verschieben Gegenstände und Flüssigkeiten nach den Regeln der Rahmen, wie die Logistics Drone."
		""
		"Es braucht mindestens &e3 bar&r. Weiter weg und mehr Ware kostet mehr Luft, verbraucht am empfangenden Modul. Mit Farbstoff wählst du einen von 16 Kanälen. &aGrün&r heißt bereit, &9blau&r blinkend heißt, es läuft gerade etwas."
	]
	quest.210F792C17475B19.quest_subtitle: "Logistik durch Rohre, ganz ohne Drohne."
	quest.210F792C17475B19.title: "&6Verbinde Kisten mit Logistics Modules"
	quest.210FED59F901CC41.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6Arcane Essence&r around an &6iron&r, &6copper&r or &6gold ingot&r give an &6Arcane Ingot&r. Use copper, you need it least otherwise."
		""
		"Arcane Ingots make the &6Ring of Mana&r, the handle of the &6Ice Staff&r and later weapon parts with mithril."
	]
	quest.210FED59F901CC41.quest_subtitle: "Eight essences around an ingot."
	quest.210FED59F901CC41.title: "&7Smelt an Arcane Ingot"
	quest.2113895AA38387CC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Leather&r in the middle, &6four iron ingots&r on the sides, &6four string&r in the corners."
		""
		"Upgrades go left of the backpack inventory. The leather backpack has only one slot, so you swap them depending on the day: mining, building, farming."
		""
		"&6Tip:&r Sophisticated Storage has its own upgrade base for chests. Check in EMI which mod the recipe belongs to."
	]
	quest.2113895AA38387CC.quest_subtitle: "Every backpack upgrade starts here."
	quest.2113895AA38387CC.title: "Build an Upgrade Base"
	quest.211A49A54F69E444.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &6sticks&r in a frame, a &6Twistytwig&r in the top middle. The twigs drop from the leaves of Wigglewood trees."
		""
		"Ammo is &6Depthrock Pebbles&r from the ground, Scintling Goo Balls (make the target sticky), Rotten Blisterberries (explode) and Gronglets."
		""
		"Twistytwigs and sticks also make scaffolding, 6 pieces per recipe."
	]
	quest.211A49A54F69E444.quest_subtitle: "Pebbles as ammo, found everywhere."
	quest.211A49A54F69E444.title: "&6Build a Slingshot"
	quest.2120F756911D7443.quest_desc: [
		"All upgrades go into the drill at the Engineer's Workbench:"
		"&6Additional Augers:&r two steel ingots and an Iron Mechanical Component. Faster and more damage, up to three times."
		"&6Pressurized Air Tank:&r iron plates, blue dye, a fluid pipe. Drills underwater without slowing down."
		"&6Large Tank:&r more fuel. &6Advanced Lubrication System:&r a bucket of Plant Oil in the recipe, the head wears out more slowly."
		"&6Rock Softening Acid:&r a bucket of Redstone Acid in the recipe, works like Fortune on ores."
	]
	quest.2120F756911D7443.quest_subtitle: "Faster, underwater, with more ore."
	quest.2120F756911D7443.title: "&6Upgrade the Drill"
	quest.2127879A6CFC403D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Darkstone&r lies at the very bottom, in the &e13 blocks above bedrock&r (Y -64 to Y -51), in large veins up to 20 blocks, 28 per chunk. Four darkstone in a square give four &6Polished Darkstone&r."
		""
		"The Hephaestus Forge needs &e48 Polished Darkstone&r for the floor, plus about 20 more for the decorated blocks and three per pedestal. One stack of darkstone is just enough, two are comfortable."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Darkstone also replaces stone bricks: Polished Darkstone Bricks, slabs, stairs, walls, all in the crafting table or the stonecutter."
	]
	quest.2127879A6CFC403D.quest_subtitle: "The black stone just above bedrock."
	quest.2127879A6CFC403D.title: "&8Find Darkstone"
	quest.21324CDB81511DAA.quest_desc: [
		"A &6dispenser&r with &6shears&r inside, pointed at a sheep: every redstone signal shears the sheep in front of it. A small clock or a button is enough."
		""
		"The sheep stands on &6grass&r, eats and grows new wool. A hopper under the floor collects it. Dyed sheep give dyed wool, for beds, sleeping bags and carpets."
	]
	quest.21324CDB81511DAA.quest_subtitle: "Wool without picking up the shears."
	quest.21324CDB81511DAA.title: "&6Shear sheep with the dispenser"
	quest.213F49D33BE87C43.quest_desc: [
		"There are two maps in the pack. &eM&r opens the big map of &6FTB Chunks&r, where you also claim your chunks. &eJ&r opens &6JourneyMap&r with the minimap at the top right. Both record what you have seen."
		""
		"&eB&r sets a &ewaypoint&r at your position in JourneyMap. Activated waystones show up on the map as waypoints automatically. &eF3&r shows your exact coordinates."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A waypoint at the portal to the mining dimension and one at your base save you most wrong turns."
	]
	quest.213F49D33BE87C43.quest_subtitle: "M for FTB Chunks, J for JourneyMap."
	quest.213F49D33BE87C43.title: "&6Open the map"
	quest.2141CE3A9F03BC9B.quest_desc: [
		"3 &6Holystone&r und 2 &6Skyroot Sticks&r ergeben die &6Holystone Pickaxe&r, genauso Axt, Schaufel, Hacke und Schwert. Sie zählt wie Stein und ist die erste Spitzhacke, die &6Zanite&r abbauen kann."
		""
		"Beim Abbauen lässt Holystone-Werkzeug ab und zu einen &6Ambrosium Shard&r zusätzlich fallen, egal was du gerade abbaust."
	]
	quest.2141CE3A9F03BC9B.quest_subtitle: "Steinwerkzeug mit einem Nebenverdienst."
	quest.2141CE3A9F03BC9B.title: "&7Bau Holystone-Werkzeug"
	quest.2141E58DFDFB0285.quest_desc: [
		"In the Refinery: &6Ethanol&r alone, with a &6silver plate&r as catalyst, makes &6Acetaldehyde&r, 8 mB to 8 mB."
		""
		"You swap the catalyst for the Nitrate Dust by hand. A second Refinery only for plastic saves the swapping."
	]
	quest.2141E58DFDFB0285.quest_subtitle: "Ethanol over silver."
	quest.2141E58DFDFB0285.title: "&dRefine Acetaldehyde"
	quest.214BD8F87F380F6B.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 orange&r, &e1 yellow&r petal, &eRune of Earth&r, &6Redstone Root&r."
		""
		"Picks up placeable items and places them as blocks nearby, but only on the kind of block that lies directly under its own soil. With daisies it becomes a Livingrock factory."
	]
	quest.214BD8F87F380F6B.quest_subtitle: "Places blocks where they belong."
	quest.214BD8F87F380F6B.title: "&6Plant a Rannuncarpus"
	quest.214CE55749B67920.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nuclearcraft_geiger.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Geiger Counter:&r three iron at the top, redstone, glass pane, redstone, iron, copper, iron at the bottom. In hand it clicks faster the stronger the radiation and shows Sv/h. &6Dosimeter:&r iron at the top, glass panes left and right, comparator, redstone at the bottom. In the inventory a bar shows your dose."
		""
		"From 1 mSv/h or 0.5 Sv total dose you get sick. From 10 Sv/h or 5 Sv you take damage. From 100 Sv/h you die quickly."
	]
	quest.214CE55749B67920.quest_subtitle: "Hear what you cannot see."
	quest.214CE55749B67920.title: "&eBuild a Geiger Counter and Dosimeter"
	quest.214F844BB9B5A18C.quest_desc: [
		"&aAnimal Summon&r (Vexing log, 3 magical shards, lapis block): animals of the biome appear."
		"&aChallenge&r (Vexing log, block of emerald, ink sac): starts a raid in a village."
		"&aBurrow&r (Flourishing log, iron pickaxe, block of coal): four holes down to bedrock."
		"&aGravity&r (Flourishing log, Air and Earth Essence, feather, anvil): forces players nearby to the ground."
	]
	quest.214F844BB9B5A18C.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: animals, raid, digging, gravity."
	quest.214F844BB9B5A18C.title: "&aMake the four small rituals"
	quest.2150A004C512D253.quest_desc: [
		"Bring &e4 rose quartz chunks&r from the &6Crystalline Chasm&r. They are a building material, not Create's rose quartz."
		""
		"&eThe others:&r &6Undergrowth&r (hellbark forests), &6Visceral Heap&r (blocks of flesh, harmless), &6Withered Abyss&r (very deep ravines) and &6Erupting Inferno&r (lava, fire, brimstone, only with fire resistance)."
	]
	quest.2150A004C512D253.quest_subtitle: "Biomes O' Plenty brings five Nether biomes of its own."
	quest.2150A004C512D253.title: "&dFind the Crystalline Chasm"
	quest.215E4B15BA7B91FF.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_elite_induction_matrix.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Close the shell, cells and providers inside, ports in the wall. Right clicking a port shows contents, input and output."
		""
		"Hang turbine and fusion on the input, the factories on the output. In stage 5 the SPS eats it empty."
	]
	quest.215E4B15BA7B91FF.quest_subtitle: "Billions of FE in one cube."
	quest.215E4B15BA7B91FF.title: "&9&lAssemble the Induction Matrix"
	quest.215F973C3412D461.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &e8 glass&r."
		""
		"Places a glowing block that disappears after a short time. With &dAmplify&r it stays, &dDispel&r removes it. &eProjectile, Mageblock&r builds steps onto any wall."
	]
	quest.215F973C3412D461.quest_subtitle: "A bridge out of nothing."
	quest.215F973C3412D461.title: "&dLearn Conjure Mageblock"
	quest.2161E8B8597659D3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_laser.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Plastic, &6diamond pickaxe&r, plastic at the top, &6iron ore&r left and right of the &6Advanced Frame&r, &6Diamond Gears&r and redstone at the bottom."
		""
		"Fully charged by the Laser Drills, it produces one ore. Every ore has a weight depending on biome and the depth you set: raw iron between Y 5 and 68 weight 20, otherwise 3. EMI shows all values."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A laser on iron is the most comfortable iron source in the pack. Behind an ore tripling it turns into steel for the goal &6The Furnace Never Sleeps&r."
	]
	quest.2161E8B8597659D3.quest_subtitle: "Ores without mining."
	quest.2161E8B8597659D3.title: "&c&lBuild an Ore Laser Base"
	quest.2166FA7D96245830.quest_desc: [
		"&eMana Powder&r, &eManasteel ingot&r, &estone&r, &emud&r, &ebrown or red mushroom&r. &d5,200 mana&r, gives &e2 runes&r."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/rune_of_earth.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Mud&r: empty a water bottle onto dirt. For the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate, Rune Core, Thermalily, Clayconia, Rannuncarpus, Tangleberrie."
	]
	quest.2166FA7D96245830.quest_subtitle: "Stone, mud and mushroom."
	quest.2166FA7D96245830.title: "&6Make the Rune of Earth"
	quest.2167ECF6D0B5ABD4.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &61 Alchemy Catalyst&r in the middle, &63 Elementium Ingots&r, &61 Pixie Dust&r, &64 Livingrock&r around it."
		""
		"Placed below a Mana Pool, the pool makes two of each from &eredstone&r, &eglowstone dust&r, &equartz&r, &ecoal&r, snow, netherrack, soul sand, gravel, leaves or grass."
	]
	quest.2167ECF6D0B5ABD4.quest_subtitle: "The pool doubles resources."
	quest.2167ECF6D0B5ABD4.title: "&6Build the Conjuration Catalyst"
	quest.216A245196723867.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_addon_quarry.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Five &6plastic&r, one &6diamond pickaxe&r in the middle, at the bottom Motor, plating, Motor."
		""
		"On the Destroyer it multiplies the depth by eight: one addon 8 blocks, two 64, three 512. On the laser the beam gets one block wider per addon. Add Speed and Efficiency, otherwise it is slow."
	]
	quest.216A245196723867.quest_subtitle: "Dig eight times as deep."
	quest.216A245196723867.title: "&aMake a Quarry with the Quarry Addon"
	quest.217A0BFE64EE5773.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_advanced_first_run.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eAufbau:&r Plattform in die Mitte, Drill und Laser direkt daneben, die beiden IO Units an die freien Seiten, dahinter je eine Kiste. Der Controller steht irgendwo in der Reihe, alle Maschinen müssen sich &ewaagerecht berühren&r. Nur der Controller bekommt ein Pressure Tube."
		""
		"Leg das Programm &eDrill&r in den Controller und einen &6Compressed Iron Block&r in die Eingangskiste. Die Import Unit legt ihn auf die Plattform, der Bohrer arbeitet, die Export Unit räumt &e20 Pressure Chamber Valves&r in die Ausgangskiste."
		""
		"Die Anzeige auf dem Controller sagt dir, was fehlt. Rot heißt meistens: eine Maschine fehlt, steht doppelt oder nicht in der Reihe."
	]
	quest.217A0BFE64EE5773.quest_subtitle: "Ein Block hinein, zwanzig Ventile heraus."
	quest.217A0BFE64EE5773.title: "&b&lLass die Straße laufen"
	quest.217A679D035F1E09.quest_desc: [
		"Imperium-Werkzeug in die Mitte, 2 Supremiumbarren und 2 Supremium-Edelsteine drumherum. Erwachtes Supremium kommt aus dem Erweckungsaltar."
		""
		"Supremium: unzerstörbar, Tempo 25, +20 Schaden. Erwachtes Supremium: Tempo 30, +25 Schaden. Die Rüstung nimmt Augmente wie Flug und Nachtsicht."
	]
	quest.217A679D035F1E09.quest_subtitle: "Mystical Agriculture: unzerstörbar."
	quest.217A679D035F1E09.title: "&cVeredle auf Supremium"
	quest.217EFB1D8A58F4CF.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r three &6redstone&r at the top, &6nether quartz&r, &6Logic Chip&r, nether quartz in the middle, three &6gold nuggets&r at the bottom."
		""
		"In a node the card reads the redstone signal at its side or gives one out. Sender and receiver find each other through their &eredstone channel&r, like Item Cards through their channel."
		""
		"That way a lever in the workshop switches off the machines at the other end of the laser network."
	]
	quest.217EFB1D8A58F4CF.quest_subtitle: "The Redstone Card."
	quest.217EFB1D8A58F4CF.title: "&cSend redstone by laser"
	quest.2183016795B877E2.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Dark Power Gems&r on top of each other, below a &6Dark Stick&r between two &6Spikes&r give the &6Vein Sword&r. It comes ready with &eLooting II&r."
		""
		"If you kill with it, the Blood Extractor in your inventory gets &etwice as much blood&r. Its durability is tiny at 32 hits, so put it in the Blood Chest now and then. It is a tool for collecting blood, not a combat sword."
	]
	quest.2183016795B877E2.quest_subtitle: "Twice as much blood per kill."
	quest.2183016795B877E2.title: "&cForge a Vein Sword"
	quest.219338E3E3059AC9.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Hedyrin's Lure."
		"&6Bowls:&r iron &6shovel&r, &6pickaxe&r and &6axe&r, an &6anvil&r, &e4 stone&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r a &6zombie&r."
		""
		"When you pick up stone, it repairs your gear a bit with a 33 percent chance. Give it &e18 iron&r and it upgrades another familiar. Upgraded ones get a star next to their name and an extra effect."
	]
	quest.219338E3E3059AC9.quest_subtitle: "Repairs you and improves the others."
	quest.219338E3E3059AC9.title: "&dSummon a Blacksmith"
	quest.2198D782FADB864F.quest_desc: [
		"When you first joined, you picked an &6origin&r and a &6role&r. With &eO&r you open the overview of your powers at any time, with strengths and weakness."
		""
		"Most powers work on their own. Active ones need a key: the Starshard's &eStar Leap&r is on the first ability key (&eZ&r), the Trader's &epack bag&r on the role key (&eH&r), the Deepdigger's night vision on &eK&r."
		""
		"No origin can fly or skip a stage. If your choice really doesn't fit, talk to the team."
	]
	quest.2198D782FADB864F.quest_subtitle: "O shows you what you can do."
	quest.2198D782FADB864F.title: "&6Use your origin"
	quest.21A78DEEAE931C17.quest_desc: [
		"&6Emerald&r on the brazier. On the hands: &6emerald&r, &6fermented spider eye&r, a &6mushroom&r, two &6Soul Shards&r."
		""
		"Villagers forget faster what you did to them."
	]
	quest.21A78DEEAE931C17.quest_subtitle: "Ritual of Deceit."
	quest.21A78DEEAE931C17.title: "&2Deceive the Villagers"
	quest.21AF38196989803D.quest_desc: [
		"&eAugment Core:&r a &6Blank Module&r and a &6Blank Upgrade&r, shapeless, gives four. &eRange Up:&r a quartz on top, quartz, core, quartz in the middle, a stick at the bottom, gives four."
		""
		"Augments are upgrades for a single module, four slots per module. &6Range Up&r or &6Down&r one block each, stackable. The &6Regulator&r (comparators and quartz around a core) only sends until a number is reached, or only pulls while there is more: that way a router keeps exactly 64 coal in a machine."
		""
		"The &6Redstone Augment&r (redstone torches) gives the module its own redstone rules, the &6Stack Augment&r (core and Stack Upgrade) doubles only this module."
	]
	quest.21AF38196989803D.quest_subtitle: "Range, regulator, redstone."
	quest.21AF38196989803D.title: "&6Put Augments into the Module"
	quest.21B54E19F5889F04.quest_desc: [
		"Items of a stage that is not open yet are drawn &eveiled&r: a dark slot with a question mark, whether in your inventory, a chest or EMI. The tooltip says &7???&r, with &cOpens in stage 2 (Brass Works).&r and &8You can carry it, not use it yet.&r below."
		""
		"That is exactly how it is meant: you may pick up and store everything. Holding, wearing, placing or crafting only works once the stage is open. If such an item lands in your hand, it moves back into your inventory by itself."
		""
		"If you find something veiled in a chest, take it along. On the day the stage opens it shows its name and you can use it right away."
	]
	quest.21B54E19F5889F04.quest_subtitle: "Dark slot, question mark, three tooltip lines."
	quest.21B54E19F5889F04.title: "&cRecognize locked items"
	quest.21B68B28F1236932.quest_desc: [
		"4 &6leaves&r in the corners, 4 &6gold nuggets&r on the sides, &6grass&r in the middle: 4 &6Brilliant Fiber&r."
		""
		"Both milestones of stage 1 need &aNature's Aura&r: the gearbox needs &6Infused Iron&r, the keystone &6Gold Leaf&r. This row takes you there in six steps."
		""
		"The &6Book of Natural Aura&r (2 paper, leather, a sapling) explains every step with pictures."
	]
	quest.21B68B28F1236932.quest_subtitle: "The first step into Nature's Aura."
	quest.21B68B28F1236932.title: "&aMake Brilliant Fiber"
	quest.21BA3E883012520F.quest_desc: [
		"Fell &616 Smogstem Logs&r. That is the building wood of the Undergarden."
		""
		"&eThe forest biomes:&r &6Smogstem Forest&r, &6Dense Forest&r, &6Wigglewood Forest&r, &6Gronglegrowth&r and the &6Smog Spires&r with their smoking vents. The catacombs stand in the &6Forgotten Field&r."
	]
	quest.21BA3E883012520F.quest_subtitle: "Smogstem, Wigglewood and Grongle."
	quest.21BA3E883012520F.title: "&2Cross the Forests"
	quest.21BAD57C35D63EE0.quest_desc: [
		"&dNourishment&r: the hunger bar doesn't drop as long as you are not healing through saturation. &dComfort&r: you regenerate health no matter how hungry you are."
		""
		"Soups and stews usually give Comfort, big meals usually Nourishment. The duration is in the tooltip."
	]
	quest.21BAD57C35D63EE0.quest_subtitle: "Why good food does more."
	quest.21BAD57C35D63EE0.title: "&dUnderstand Nourishment and Comfort"
	quest.21C041B791510B65.quest_desc: [
		"Collect steel and circuits in chests and hand them in by hand at the obelisk, sneak and right click takes everything that fits. &e/kw goals&r shows the state."
		""
		"&eTech pillar of stage 3:&r &64,000 steel ingots&r, &6250 Advanced Control Circuits&r, &68 Steel Cores&r. The magic pillar wants elementium, Afrit Essence and Elven Stars, and both have to fill up."
		""
		"The mages need your Reinforced Alloy for the Elven Stars, you need their elementium for the Steel Cores."
	]
	quest.21C041B791510B65.quest_subtitle: "The furnace never sleeps."
	quest.21C041B791510B65.title: "&5&lFeed the obelisk"
	quest.21C0F8215FA94C81.quest_desc: [
		"Get two &dSource Gems&r from the Ars Nouveau &aImbuement Chamber&r, made yourself or from a magician."
		"{image:ars_nouveau:textures/item/source_gem.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The Blaze Burner's casing needs two Source Gems. Two gems for a few brass ingots is a fair trade."
	]
	quest.21C0F8215FA94C81.quest_subtitle: "No magic, no Blaze Burner."
	quest.21C0F8215FA94C81.title: "&dGet two Source Gems"
	quest.21C1BE6B89DF8EA1.quest_desc: [
		"Kreuz &6Espe&r und &6Erle&r (10 Prozent, beide im Markt), und du bekommst den &6Holunder&r oder die Eberesche. Der Holunder trägt &e5 Holunderbeeren&r pro Blatt. Beeren geben nur 1 Hunger, werden aber schnell gegessen und immer, auch mit vollem Magen. Wacholder (3), Weißdorn (3), Eberesche, Acai (3) und die Schlehen (3) sind die anderen Beerenbäume."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/fruit/elderberry.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Der &6Weißdorn&r und die &6Stechpalme&r kommen beide über die Eberesche, Holunder und Weißtanne ergeben den Wacholder. Beeren brauchst du vor allem als Zwischenschritt, Kisten voller Beeren sind hübsche Deko."
	]
	quest.21C1BE6B89DF8EA1.quest_subtitle: "Beeren: schneller Snack, fünf pro Blatt."
	quest.21C1BE6B89DF8EA1.title: "&dZüchte einen Holunder"
	quest.21C442B20A631710.quest_desc: [
		"Redstone in the corners, iron on top, left and right, a &6furnace&r at the bottom, the upgrade base in the middle."
		""
		"In its own tab there are input, fuel and output like in a furnace, just as fast. Raw iron smelts on the way home that way."
	]
	quest.21C442B20A631710.quest_subtitle: "A furnace that comes along."
	quest.21C442B20A631710.title: "Smelt in the backpack"
	quest.21D638ADBE933116.quest_desc: [
		"Iron in the corners, a &6bucket&r at the top, &6redstone, diamond, redstone&r in the middle, a &6Marker&r between two iron at the bottom."
		""
		"It stands on its own: placed over a fluid, it pumps the whole area empty. With &eDelete On&r the fluid is destroyed, good against groundwater in the quarry hole. With &eDelete Off&r it lands in its tank, and you pump off lava."
	]
	quest.21D638ADBE933116.quest_subtitle: "A lake disappears."
	quest.21D638ADBE933116.title: "&9Build an Advanced Pump"
	quest.21D70A0798C0D3AC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Spell Prism&r: gold in the corners, archwood planks on the sides, quartz block in the middle. Turns projectile spells in the direction it faces."
		"&6Advanced Prism&r (Ars Elemental): prism with 4 quartz and 4 Source Gems, aimed at a block with the Dominion Wand, with lenses."
		"&6Spell Mirror&r (Ars Elemental, in the apparatus from Source Gem block, 2 archwood logs, 2 quartz, 2 gold, gives 2): throws projectiles back at the mirror angle."
	]
	quest.21D70A0798C0D3AC.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: prism, advanced prism, mirror."
	quest.21D70A0798C0D3AC.title: "&aSteer spells with prisms"
	quest.21E7079F2662BCD5.quest_desc: [
		"Like the iron hammer, only with &e4 diamonds&r: on top diamond, &6Blacksmith Gavel Head&r, diamond, in the middle diamond, stick, diamond, a stick at the bottom."
		""
		"Every ritual costs the hammer &e50 durability&r. The diamond hammer lasts &e31&r rituals, the iron one only 5. Whoever stands at the forge regularly saves a lot of replacement hammers."
	]
	quest.21E7079F2662BCD5.quest_subtitle: "31 rituals instead of 5."
	quest.21E7079F2662BCD5.title: "&7Build a Diamond Blacksmith Gavel"
	quest.21EAF3D437CB31C9.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 iron, 1 diamond&r. All around, within &e10 blocks&r, an invisible wall appears. You walk through it, monsters, arrows and other creatures do not."
		""
		"It does not replace solid blocks except grass, nor water. So lay it on flat ground, then it closes cleanly."
	]
	quest.21EAF3D437CB31C9.quest_subtitle: "A wall only you walk through."
	quest.21EAF3D437CB31C9.title: "&7Lay a Tangible Boundary"
	quest.21EB6C3BF0F05359.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6Spirit Attuned Gem&r in the middle, &e2 gold ingots&r top and bottom, &e2 glass&r left and right. That is the &6Divination Rod&r."
		""
		"Clicking a block while sneaking sets it: andesite looks for Otherstone, oak wood for Otherworld Logs, oak leaves for Otherworld leaves, netherrack for Iesnium. Then hold right click until the animation is done."
		""
		"The find glows through the walls. White crystals mean nothing found; the more purple, the closer. Set to leaves or wood, it leads you to an Otherworld Grove."
	]
	quest.21EB6C3BF0F05359.quest_subtitle: "Finds what the eye doesn't see."
	quest.21EB6C3BF0F05359.title: "&6Build a Dowsing Rod"
	quest.21F5E8D8D5381565.quest_desc: [
		"&6Copper Casing&r and &6Chute&r make the &6Portable Fluid Interface&r. Tanks on the train, one interface on the carriage, one at the platform, a pump on the fixed side."
		""
		"That way a tank train brings lava to your fans or water to the steam boiler."
	]
	quest.21F5E8D8D5381565.quest_subtitle: "Tank wagons."
	quest.21F5E8D8D5381565.title: "&bCarry fluids"
	quest.21FB5CD917828F41.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gold&r: only &e32&r durability, but speed &e12&r, enchantability 22, Soft III."
		""
		"Better as a tip (+6 speed) than as a whole head."
	]
	quest.21FB5CD917828F41.quest_subtitle: "32 durability, speed 12."
	quest.21FB5CD917828F41.title: "&eGold"
	quest.21FC348F17CFFDEB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Thorn Chakram&r: &e8 vines&r around a &aTerrasteel Ingot&r, makes two. &6Flare Chakram&r: two Thorn Chakrams with &6Pixie Dust&r in the middle, &e3 blaze powder&r each at the top and bottom, also makes two."
		""
		"Thrown, a chakram pierces enemies, can poison them, bounces off walls and returns after about three seconds. Up to &e6&r stack, and the Flare Chakram also sets enemies on fire."
		""
		"In the tight arena they hit many targets at once."
	]
	quest.21FC348F17CFFDEB.quest_subtitle: "Boomerangs against the Guardian's minions."
	quest.21FC348F17CFFDEB.title: "&aThrow Chakrams"
	quest.21FFCB8D71BB913D.quest_desc: [
		"Ruined warp portals stand where normal ruined portals appear. Next to the portal is a chest with sourcestone, codex pages and an &6Explorer's Warp Scroll&r."
		""
		"The scroll picks a target nearby: a temple, a stronghold, an ancient city, a Wilden den, a Nexus tower or an Arcane Library. If the frame is damaged, repair it. Then throw the scroll in, and the portal opens without source."
		""
		"The &6Codex Entry&r from the chest teaches you a random glyph when used."
	]
	quest.21FFCB8D71BB913D.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: an old gate with a ticket."
	quest.21FFCB8D71BB913D.title: "&aFind a Ruined Warp Portal"
	quest.22026B4EDB5B0C43.quest_desc: [
		"&6Basic Card:&r gold, iron, redstone and a Calculation Processor, gives two. With diamond in place of gold it is the &6Advanced Card&r. From those, shapeless: &6Acceleration Card&r (Advanced Card and fluix), &6Capacity Card&r (Basic Card and certus)."
		""
		"Acceleration makes buses, the Inscriber and the assembler faster. Capacity gives buses more filter slots. &6Redstone&r, &6Fuzzy&r and &6Inverter Card&r handle the rest."
	]
	quest.22026B4EDB5B0C43.quest_subtitle: "Faster, more filters, more logic."
	quest.22026B4EDB5B0C43.title: "&dPut cards into the buses"
	quest.2204C95C148D2A7B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r lapis lazuli in the corners, &6glass&r at the top and bottom, &6diamonds&r left and right, a Blank Upgrade Module in the middle: &6Range I&r."
		""
		"The laser reaches further, and you mine from a safe distance, across lava for example or at the ceiling of a large cave. Range II is also there in stage 3 already."
	]
	quest.2204C95C148D2A7B.quest_subtitle: "The Range upgrade."
	quest.2204C95C148D2A7B.title: "&bReach further"
	quest.22069EFD07BB1C25.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Treated Wood Slabs&r on top, &6Treated Sticks&r left and right, a normal &6crafting table&r in the middle make the &6Engineer's Crafting Table&r."
		""
		"It keeps the ingredients in the grid when you close it, and it has a drawer. It is also the ingredient for the Engineer's Workbench."
	]
	quest.22069EFD07BB1C25.quest_subtitle: "A crafting table that keeps its ingredients."
	quest.22069EFD07BB1C25.title: "&6Build an Engineer's Crafting Table"
	quest.2208D975D4A14794.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Source Relay&r with &e4 ender pearls&r and &e4 popped chorus fruit&r."
		""
		"Like a splitter, but between Warper Relays with no range limit. Beyond &e30 blocks&r part of the source is lost. Ars Elemental turns it into the Wind Warper Relay with 2 Air Essences and 2 diamonds, which loses nothing anymore."
	]
	quest.2208D975D4A14794.quest_subtitle: "Source over any distance."
	quest.2208D975D4A14794.title: "&bBuild a Warper Relay"
	quest.221089DDA582A04B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Redstone, Legierung, Redstone oben, Biobrennstoff, Schaltkreis, Biobrennstoff in der Mitte, Eisen, Legierung, Eisen unten. Der &6Zerkleinerer&r macht aus Samen, Setzlingen und Pflanzen &6Biobrennstoff&r."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Biogenerator:&r Brennstoff Biobrennstoff (Tank 24 000 mB), &d140 FE/t&r. Eine Weizenfarm mit Erntemaschine davor, und er läuft ohne Kohle. Offen ab Stufe 2."
	]
	quest.221089DDA582A04B.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, Biogenerator, 140 FE/t aus Pflanzenresten."
	quest.221089DDA582A04B.title: "&6Verfeuere Biobrennstoff"
	quest.2210ED2A8D9BD49A.quest_desc: [
		"Right click on the ripe &6Mandrake&r gives &6Mandrake Root&r and &6Mandrake Flowers&r."
		""
		"The root is in every broom brush, every broom and the crow amulet. The flowers you need for the Enhanced and the Moon Dust Brush."
	]
	quest.2210ED2A8D9BD49A.quest_subtitle: "Root and flower."
	quest.2210ED2A8D9BD49A.title: "&2Harvest Mandrake"
	quest.221D83290E829480.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_arm.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Three &6brass sheets&r, &6andesite alloy&r, &6precision mechanism&r and &6brass casing&r make the &6Mechanical Arm&r. Before placing it, click its targets: once for &einput&r, twice for &eoutput&r."
		""
		"It reaches &e5 blocks&r and serves depots, belts, chests, basins, Blaze Burners and crafters. It costs &d2 SU per RPM&r."
	]
	quest.221D83290E829480.quest_subtitle: "Takes here, puts there."
	quest.221D83290E829480.title: "&6Let the Mechanical Arm grab"
	quest.221FDC201D52BB6D.quest_desc: [
		"Put &6coal&r into the Coke Oven and take &6Coal Coke&r out."
		""
		"In the Crude Blast Furnace &eone coke is enough for one steel ingot&r. Charcoal works too, but burns only a quarter as long there. Every coal you find now is a steel ingot later."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_coal_coke.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.221FDC201D52BB6D.quest_subtitle: "The fuel for every steel ingot."
	quest.221FDC201D52BB6D.title: "&8Make coke in stock"
	quest.22221FD1BB9A6413.quest_desc: [
		"&6Source Gems&r only come from the &aImbuement Chamber&r: amethyst in, a &6Source Jar&r with &dsource&r next to it."
		""
		"{image:ars_nouveau:textures/item/source_gem.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Each gem counts 4 points. A small setup with a source link makes a few dozen an hour. See the chapter &dArs Nouveau&r."
	]
	quest.22221FD1BB9A6413.quest_subtitle: "800 Source Gems and 12 Source Keystones."
	quest.22221FD1BB9A6413.title: "&dFill the magic pillar"
	quest.222490603A8FDD4B.quest_desc: [
		"Fell &e16 warped stems&r in the &6warped forest&r. This wood doesn't burn either."
		""
		"Almost only &6endermen&r wander the warped forest. For a base in the Nether this is the safest place, and you take the ender pearls along right away."
	]
	quest.222490603A8FDD4B.quest_subtitle: "Warped forest: turquoise trees, endermen, the quietest place here."
	quest.222490603A8FDD4B.title: "&3Fell warped stems"
	quest.22362A8D563ED2E0.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Inferium Essence&r top right, a &6stick&r in the middle and a &6stone&r bottom left give the &6Wand&r."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/wand.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Right clicking the filled altar with the wand starts the infusion. The pedestals send their items into the altar one after another, and at the end the seed lies in it. A button or lever on the altar does the same, but the wand is handier."
	]
	quest.22362A8D563ED2E0.quest_subtitle: "One click, and the altar works."
	quest.22362A8D563ED2E0.title: "&dCarve a Wand"
	quest.223E32DC044F6206.quest_desc: [
		"&6Two wooden chests&r at the top and bottom middle, &6seven planks&r around them. Gives &etwo&r drawers."
		""
		"Two compartments on top of each other with &e16 stacks&r each. Good for pairs: coal and charcoal, iron and copper ingots, seeds and wheat."
	]
	quest.223E32DC044F6206.quest_subtitle: "Two kinds, one front."
	quest.223E32DC044F6206.title: "Build a 1x2 drawer"
	quest.2242B89C69770C2E.quest_desc: [
		"&ePress:&r calculation press at the top, engineering press at the bottom, a &6Singularity&r in the middle of the Inscriber. After that you copy it with an iron block."
		"&eProcessor:&r sky steel under the press, then &6fluix dust&r in the middle and printed silicon at the bottom."
		""
		"Every MEGA device needs this processor."
	]
	quest.2242B89C69770C2E.quest_subtitle: "A press from a singularity."
	quest.2242B89C69770C2E.title: "&eBuild Accumulation Processors"
	quest.224479AAA0A4414E.quest_desc: [
		"&e7 Livingwood planks&r in a U shape. Whatever a hopper pushes into it falls straight down onto the ground below."
		""
		"Place it two blocks high next to the Endoflames, chest and hopper above it."
	]
	quest.224479AAA0A4414E.quest_subtitle: "A crate with a hole in the bottom."
	quest.224479AAA0A4414E.title: "&6Build an Open Crate"
	quest.2245341EDCCB4659.quest_desc: [
		"A &6compass&r on an &6Andesite Casing&r makes the &6Speedometer&r. Put on its own into the grid it becomes the &6Stressometer&r and back."
		""
		"The speedometer shows the speed at its spot, the stressometer the free capacity of the whole network. Both give a redstone signal that a comparator reads."
	]
	quest.2245341EDCCB4659.quest_subtitle: "Speedometer and stressometer."
	quest.2245341EDCCB4659.title: "&6Measure speed and stress"
	quest.224DCBA53BB0D930.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Encased Fan&r blowing through &dliquid dye&r dyes everything in the air stream: wool, glass, concrete powder and everything else that can be dyed in the crafting table, plus animals and armor. It is tidier with the &6Empty Fan Catalyst&r from Create Connected and a bucket of dye on it."
		""
		"A fan through &bpowder snow&r (or the catalyst with a powder snow bucket) &efreezes&r: ice becomes packed ice, packed ice blue ice, magma cream slime and a blaze rod a breeze rod. The catalyst with &6sand&r &esands&r like sandpaper, for example rose quartz for Electron Tubes, without a deployer using up paper."
		""
		"The fourth process, &5Ending&r behind a dragon head (cobblestone to end stone, apple to chorus fruit, leather to phantom membrane), comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.224DCBA53BB0D930.quest_subtitle: "Four new fan processes."
	quest.224DCBA53BB0D930.title: "&dDye and Freeze with the Fan"
	quest.2263E27B807021B9.quest_desc: [
		"Zwei &6Druckeisenbarren&r mit einem &6Flüssigkeitsrohr&r aus Create dazwischen ergeben acht &6Druckluftrohre&r (Pressure Tube). Sie fassen je 1 000 mL Luft und halten &e5 Bar&r aus."
		""
		"Ein offenes Rohrende zischt und verliert Luft. Verbinde jedes Rohr mit einer Maschine oder einem anderen Rohr, oder schließ die Seite später mit dem Druckluftschlüssel. Rohre lassen sich außerdem mit Modulen bestücken, dem Sicherheitsventil zum Beispiel."
	]
	quest.2263E27B807021B9.quest_subtitle: "Acht Rohre aus zwei Barren und Glas."
	quest.2263E27B807021B9.title: "&bLeg Druckluftrohre"
	quest.2264CC5EE2BEAD6A.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Splash Flask Cannon&r (dispenser with 2 gold, 2 blaze rods, 4 gunpowder), &5dragon's breath&r, &e2 Air Essences&r."
		""
		"It fires potions from your potion flasks as a lingering cloud. Together with Wixie potions a good weapon against groups."
	]
	quest.2264CC5EE2BEAD6A.quest_subtitle: "Potion clouds at the push of a button."
	quest.2264CC5EE2BEAD6A.title: "&6Build the Lingering Flask Cannon"
	quest.226A79805651EEA1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Immolation&r (3 Fire Essences): if you burn while casting, the fire goes out and you get Immolation. Fire spells then deal more damage and last longer."
		"&6Spores&r (Ars Elemental: 2 Earth Essences, sporeblossom, spider eye): damage spells poison the target or make it hungry."
		"&6Shocking&r (2 Air Essences, lightning rod, Flashpine): damage spells shock the target shortly before."
		"&6Summoning&r (2 Conjuration Essences, echo shard, 2 Wilden parts): &e10 percent&r less summoning sickness per level, stronger summons from level 2."
	]
	quest.226A79805651EEA1.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: fire, spores, lightning and summoning."
	quest.226A79805651EEA1.title: "&6Sew Threads of the Elements"
	quest.226CA070D5BBB183.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/exploration_e_dnt_tavern.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Go into a Dungeons and Taverns &6tavern&r. A villager there trades &e14 emeralds&r and a &6compass&r once for a map to a structure."
		""
		"The map leads to crypts, ruins, an ancient city and other places of the mod. Taverns come in eleven styles, from oak to mangrove."
	]
	quest.226CA070D5BBB183.quest_subtitle: "14 emeralds and a compass, once per tavern."
	quest.226CA070D5BBB183.title: "&6Buy a map in the tavern"
	quest.226F853EEE067C56.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ophyx' Calling."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6Gray Paste&r, &6lapis&r, &6amethyst shard&r, &6emerald&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book."
		""
		"Twice as fast as the Foliot and more gems per ore. It also breaks down amethyst and quartz blocks."
	]
	quest.226F853EEE067C56.quest_subtitle: "More gems from every ore."
	quest.226F853EEE067C56.title: "&dSummon a Djinni Crystallizer"
	quest.227164CFA50C5EBE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_connectors.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Copper, &6Bucket of Redstone Acid&r, copper on top, &6Lead Plate&r, &6Basic Engineering Block&r, Lead Plate at the bottom make the &6LV Accumulator&r."
		""
		"It stores &e100 000 FE&r, &d256 FE/t&r per side. Right click with the hammer sets a side to &9blue&r (input), &6orange&r (output) or off, sneaking the opposite side."
	]
	quest.227164CFA50C5EBE.quest_subtitle: "100 000 FE of buffer for days without wind."
	quest.227164CFA50C5EBE.title: "&c&lBuild an LV Accumulator"
	quest.22780E218606BF6A.quest_desc: [
		"&dIgnite&r (flint and steel, 3 coal): sets blocks and creatures on fire. With Sensitive only creatures."
		"&dSummon Steed&r (4 leather): a saddled horse for a few minutes."
		"&dRandomize&r (2 pink carpets): mixes blocks from the hotbar for Place Block and Exchange."
	]
	quest.22780E218606BF6A.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1 checklist: three for the road."
	quest.22780E218606BF6A.title: "&dLearn fire, steed and chance"
	quest.22799574E2574DF6.quest_desc: [
		"&dCraft&r (crafting table): opens a crafting window anywhere."
		"&dPull&r (fishing rod): pulls the target to you."
		"&dSensitive&r (scaffolding, poppy, water bucket): forms also hit grass, fluids and air."
		"&dUnderfoot&r (iron boots, wooden pressure plate): a form, hits the block under you."
		"&dPantomime&r (8 glass): a form, hits the nearest block in the direction you look."
		"&dReset&r (target block): the rest of the spell hits the original target again."
		""
		"The quest counts as soon as the glyph is in your inventory. Only learn it with right click after that."
	]
	quest.22799574E2574DF6.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1 checklist: no essences needed."
	quest.22799574E2574DF6.title: "&dLearn the utility glyphs"
	quest.227F132D6A4F1186.quest_desc: [
		"Crafter recipe with &6brass sheets&r, &6copper spools&r, &6iron rod&r, alloy and a &6capacitor&r (zinc and copper sheet with a redstone torch)."
		""
		"It turns adjustably up to 256 RPM, supplies up to 16,384 SU and needs &d480 FE per tick&r at full speed. That way a mixer runs even without a stream."
	]
	quest.227F132D6A4F1186.quest_subtitle: "The Crafts & Additions electric motor."
	quest.227F132D6A4F1186.title: "&6Make rotation from FE"
	quest.228646B7F01B74D8.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6Biosteel&r at the top and sides, a &6Flux Gate&r in the middle, at the bottom coil, &6Basic Generator&r, coil make the &6Bio Generator&r. It needs &etwo cores&r."
		""
		"It makes &e64 RF/t&r from &6Biomass&r and other plant matter, buffer 100,000 RF. The Pulverizer makes biomass from plants, saplings and crops, 16 at once from one Packed Wheat."
		""
		"A tree farm with a Destroyer and Crop Filter supplies endless saplings and leaves."
	]
	quest.228646B7F01B74D8.quest_subtitle: "Power from biomass."
	quest.228646B7F01B74D8.title: "&2Set Up a Bio Generator"
	quest.22880A314291C832.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Blaze Upgrade Smithing Template&r lies in chests of Nether fortresses and bastions. Put it in the middle of the top row, &6netherrack&r below it and seven &6blaze rods&r around it: out come &etwo&r templates."
		""
		"You need one for the Blaze Enchanter, one for the Blaze Forger, and with an &6Affix Augmentor&r a Blaze Burner also becomes the &6Blaze Composer&r. Better copy one too many."
	]
	quest.22880A314291C832.quest_subtitle: "Create: Dragons Plus. One template becomes two."
	quest.22880A314291C832.title: "&5Copy the Blaze Template"
	quest.229483C1400B3FF7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Andesite Casing&r, &6Shaft&r and &6redstone&r make a &6Clutch&r. As long as it gets a &credstone signal&r, everything behind it stands still."
		""
		"Everything in front keeps running. That way you stop one setup without stopping the whole network."
		""
		"&6Tip:&r The &6Encased Chain Drive&r (casing and three iron or zinc nuggets) passes rotation to chain drives right next to it, also around corners."
	]
	quest.229483C1400B3FF7.quest_subtitle: "The clutch disconnects with redstone."
	quest.229483C1400B3FF7.title: "&6Switch a shaft off"
	quest.22A6D32889B2CC5E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Furnator&r (Starter): drei Paste oben, zwei Tiny-Kondensatoren um ein Dielectric Casing, unten Paste, Ofen, Paste. Der &6Magmator&r hat einen Eimer statt des Ofens und trinkt Lava."
		""
		"&ePowah, Furnator und Magmator:&r Brennstoff alles Brennbare oder heiße Flüssigkeit, &d30 FE je Brenntick&r, eine Kohle also 48 000 FE in jeder Stufe. Erzeugung Starter &d20 FE/t&r, Basic 80, Hardened 200, Blazing 800, Niotic 2 000, Spirited 8 000. Puffer 20 000 bis 8 Millionen, Abgabe das Vierfache der Erzeugung. Offen ab Stufe 3, siehe Kapitel &6Powah&r. Nitro (40 000 FE/t) kommt in Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.22A6D32889B2CC5E.quest_subtitle: "Powah, 20 bis 8 000 FE/t je nach Stufe, 30 FE je Brenntick."
	quest.22A6D32889B2CC5E.title: "&bBau Furnator und Magmator"
	quest.22AB88F3BE2CEC25.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Basic Filter&r in a card lets only certain items through or blocks them, and there are filters by count, tag, mod and data as well. The &6Card Overclocker&r raises how much a card moves per operation, the &6Node Overclocker&r (diamonds, redstone, Logic Chip) makes the whole node faster."
		""
		"The &6Card Holder&r keeps cards at hand, the &6Card Cloner&r copies a card you have set up."
	]
	quest.22AB88F3BE2CEC25.quest_subtitle: "Sort finer, push faster."
	quest.22AB88F3BE2CEC25.title: "&cFilter and overclock"
	quest.22B2CF5D1284331D.quest_desc: [
		"Put &clava&r right in front of the fan and send items on a belt through the stream. They are smelted like in a furnace: raw zinc into zinc ingots, sand into glass."
		""
		"The lava is not used up. &6Fire&r instead of lava smokes food like a smoker."
	]
	quest.22B2CF5D1284331D.quest_subtitle: "A furnace without fuel."
	quest.22B2CF5D1284331D.title: "&6Smelt with the fan"
	quest.22B567B43404FD85.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Deepsilver Ore&r in Voidstone or Grimstone. It gives &6Raw Deepsilver&r, which the furnace turns into a &6Deepsilver Ingot&r."
		""
		"{image:eternal_starlight:textures/item/deepsilver_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"It becomes armor, tools, shield, bucket and cauldron. In the alloy furnace 2 Raw Deepsilver and 1 Saltpeter Powder even give 3 ingots."
	]
	quest.22B567B43404FD85.quest_subtitle: "The iron of the star world."
	quest.22B567B43404FD85.title: "&7&lSmelt Deepsilver"
	quest.22B9CC4B559873BD.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Arcane Cloth&r on top of each other in the middle and three at the bottom give the &6Wizard Hat&r. Three on top and two below on the left give the &6Wizard Hood&r, same values, different look."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/wizard_helmet_hat.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Every piece of the &6Wizard&r armor gives &e+125 mana&r and &e+5 percent spell power&r, so the set +500 mana and +20 percent, with protection like diamond (3, 8, 6, 3). Robe, leggings and boots follow the leather armor pattern, only made of cloth."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The armor can be dyed like leather. And it is the base for the school armor in the next quest."
	]
	quest.22B9CC4B559873BD.quest_subtitle: "125 mana and 5 percent spell power per piece."
	quest.22B9CC4B559873BD.title: "&5&lPut On the Wizard Hat"
	quest.22BF723CE4303798.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_bronze.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Bronze Dungeons&r stecken im Inneren von Inseln. Du erkennst sie an &6Carved Stone&r und dem hellen &6Sentry Stone&r, oft schaut ein Stück aus dem Hang. Sie sind häufig, in Abständen von wenigen hundert Blöcken."
		""
		"&eDrinnen:&r &6Sentries&r, hüpfende Steinwürfel, die explodieren, und &6Chest Mimics&r, Truhen, die beim Öffnen aufspringen und beißen. Die Wände sind gesperrt, solange der Boss lebt."
		""
		"&eDie Truhen:&r Zanite-Werkzeug, Golden Darts, Iron und Golden Rings, Swet Cape, Ice Pendant, Gummy Swets. Dank Lootr hat jede für jeden Spieler eigenen Inhalt (siehe Kapitel &6Erkundung&r). Bring einen Stapel Carved Stone als Beweis."
	]
	quest.22BF723CE4303798.quest_subtitle: "Graue Gänge in den Inseln, mit Wachen und falschen Truhen."
	quest.22BF723CE4303798.title: "&6&lBronze-Dungeon"
	quest.22C1332ED7FAEE7F.quest_desc: [
		"In the water cauldron: &e2 black dye&r, &e4 leather&r, &e2 strings&r make &e2 Infused Fabric&r."
		"Hat from &e5&r, robe from &e7&r, boots from &e4&r fabric, shaped like normal armour. That is 16 fabric, so eight mixes."
		""
		"The whole set gives a few advantages. Every piece can be dyed, named it changes colour."
	]
	quest.22C1332ED7FAEE7F.quest_subtitle: "Hat, robe and boots."
	quest.22C1332ED7FAEE7F.title: "&5Sew the witch costume"
	quest.22CB07376FA940F8.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6straw&r on top of each other make &efour rope&r."
		""
		"Rope above a tomato vine lets it climb up. You climb it yourself into shafts, and four rope become a &6Safety Net&r against falls."
	]
	quest.22CB07376FA940F8.quest_subtitle: "Tomatoes like to climb."
	quest.22CB07376FA940F8.title: "&7Twist rope"
	quest.22CBF9FB64E02066.quest_desc: [
		"In the &6Pressurized Reaction Chamber&r: &e1,000 mB of polonium&r, 1,000 mB of water and 1 fluorite dust give a &bPolonium Pellet&r. What remains is spent nuclear waste."
		""
		"You need pellets for SPS casings (4) and coils (3). The polonium for antimatter stays a gas and runs straight into the SPS. In stage 4 pellets only came through NuclearCraft, see the chapter &dMekanism: Elite&r."
	]
	quest.22CBF9FB64E02066.quest_subtitle: "For casings and coils."
	quest.22CBF9FB64E02066.title: "&bPress Polonium Pellets"
	quest.22CEF6D0015D619D.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Cogwheels&r around an &6Andesite Casing&r make a &6Gearbox&r. It takes rotation on one side and passes it to the others, also at 90 degrees."
		""
		"The opposite side turns the other way. Lying down it is called a &6Vertical Gearbox&r; you turn one into the other in the grid. Gearboxes cost no stress capacity."
	]
	quest.22CEF6D0015D619D.quest_subtitle: "Rotation in all four directions."
	quest.22CEF6D0015D619D.title: "&6Build a gearbox"
	quest.22D20AE07EF7575D.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Das &6Tempad&r sind 3 getöntes Glas oben, Quarz, &6Warpstaub&r und Redstonelampe in der Mitte, unten Zeitstahl, &6Chronon-Batterie&r, Zeitstahl. Es speichert Orte und öffnet eine &6Zeittür&r dorthin, Dimension egal."
		""
		"&eWas es kostet (Serverconfig):&r &e1 000 Chronon&r für 10 Sekunden Tür, jede weitere Sekunde 10. Das Tempad fasst 6 000, also sechs Türen. Chronon macht das &6Chronometer&r in der Hand (1 je 36 Ticks) oder das &6Metronom&r als Block (1 je 24 Ticks, 6 000 Speicher)."
		""
		"Wer Zeitstahl und Warpstaub schon in Stufe 2 sammelt, baut sein Gerät am ersten Abend von Stufe 3. Siehe Kapitel &6Rohre und Router&r."
	]
	quest.22D20AE07EF7575D.quest_subtitle: "Tempad: 1 000 Chronon pro Tür, auch zwischen Welten. Stufe 3."
	quest.22D20AE07EF7575D.title: "&dÖffne eine Zeittür"
	quest.22D3854A540448FE.quest_desc: [
		"Alloy in the corners, Advanced Control Circuits at the top and bottom, buckets left and right, a Steel Casing in the middle."
		""
		"Put &6Osmium Ingots&r into the chemical slot, each gives &e200 mB&r of osmium. The machine uses it up while it presses."
	]
	quest.22D3854A540448FE.quest_subtitle: "Presses dust with osmium into ingots."
	quest.22D3854A540448FE.title: "&7Build an Osmium Compressor"
	quest.22DBFB934D418C90.quest_desc: [
		"&6Magebloom Block&r: &e4 Magebloom Fiber&r in a square. &e8&r of them around an essence make &e8&r illusion blocks:"
		"&6Mirrorweave&r (Conjuration Essence): looks like the block you click it with, with its collision and light."
		"&6Falseweave&r (Air Essence): looks the same, but you walk through it."
		"&6Ghostweave&r (Abjuration Essence): becomes an invisible wall with &dInvisibility&r, &dDispel&r shows it again."
		"&6Skyweave&r (Manipulation Essence): shows the sky of the dimension."
		""
		"&dSense Magic&r reveals every illusion. Good for secret passages in the End base."
	]
	quest.22DBFB934D418C90.quest_subtitle: "Walls that are not walls."
	quest.22DBFB934D418C90.title: "&dBuild with Illusion Blocks"
	quest.22E0E03F4FD890C4.quest_desc: [
		"In the chamber: &5Wilden Tribute&r in, all &e8 essences&r on the pedestals (earth, fire, water, air, abjuration, conjuration, manipulation, anima), &d10,000 source&r. Makes &e5 Marks&r."
		""
		"You need Marks for the greater foci, the elemental armors from stage 4 and the Nullify Defense glyph."
	]
	quest.22E0E03F4FD890C4.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: one tribute, five Marks of Mastery."
	quest.22E0E03F4FD890C4.title: "&6Split the Tribute into Marks"
	quest.22E942AC131830D5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_advanced_spawner_extractor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r Compressed Iron, &6Pressure Tube&r, Compressed Iron oben, &6Pressure Chamber Wall&r, &6Spawner Agitator&r, Pressure Chamber Wall in der Mitte, Obsidian, &6Drill Pipe&r, Obsidian unten. Der Agitator: acht Compressed Iron um eine &6Ghast-Träne&r."
		""
		"Setz ihn &eauf&r einen Spawner aus einem Verlies und gib ihm &c-0,5 bar&r Unterdruck oder weniger (Vacuum Pump, siehe Kapitel &bPneumaticCraft&r). Dann wehr dich: Der Spawner spawnt wie wild, jedes Monster in der Nähe bremst, zu viele halten alles an. Du musst in der Nähe bleiben."
		""
		"Nach etwa &e60 Sekunden&r springt ein &6Spawner Core&r heraus, zu 100 Prozent mit diesem Monster gefüllt, und der Spawner wird zum &6Empty Spawner&r. Bau den ab, du brauchst ihn für den Pressurized Spawner."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Wer Apotheosis-Spawner mit Behutsamkeit holt (Kapitel &dApotheosis&r), stellt sie zu Hause auf und extrahiert dort, mit Licht und Mauern nach Wunsch."
	]
	quest.22E942AC131830D5.quest_subtitle: "Reiß dem Spawner sein Herz heraus."
	quest.22E942AC131830D5.title: "&2Bau einen Spawner Extractor"
	quest.22EE3CFB439CE226.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nuclearcraft_reactor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Inside a cell in the middle, one or two graphite blocks next to it, water heat sinks on the remaining sides. Outside the shell, controller and port in the wall. LEU into the port, a redstone signal on the controller or port."
		""
		"The net heat in the controller has to be at zero or below, otherwise it rises until meltdown."
		""
		"&cMeltdown:&r an explosion about like TNT, right in the middle of the reactor. Do not build it under your base."
	]
	quest.22EE3CFB439CE226.quest_subtitle: "Cells, moderators, cooling, shell."
	quest.22EE3CFB439CE226.title: "&a&lStart the First Fission Reactor"
	quest.22F80B8DD1443E01.quest_desc: [
		"&eMana Powder&r, &eManasteel ingot&r, a &ecarpet&r, a &efeather&r, a &estring&r. &d5,200 mana&r, gives &e2 runes&r."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/rune_of_air.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"For the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate, Rune Core, Hopperhock, Daffomill, Tangleberrie, Jiyuulia and several pieces of jewellery."
	]
	quest.22F80B8DD1443E01.quest_subtitle: "Light as a feather."
	quest.22F80B8DD1443E01.title: "&fMake the Rune of Air"
	quest.22FA0CD5D7FD2963.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eternal_starlight_orb.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Find a &6portal ruin&r in the Overworld with a frame of &6Chiseled Voidstone&r. Talk to the &bGatekeeper&r, choose &eChallenge&r and defeat him. He drops the &bOrb of Prophecy&r."
		""
		"{image:eternal_starlight:textures/item/orb_of_prophecy.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"He parries attacks and throws fireballs. Come with good armor and food. His loot: the book of the dimension, Glistering weapons, Seeking Eyes."
		""
		"Ruins appear in plains, savannas, forests, deserts, the jungle and cold biomes."
	]
	quest.22FA0CD5D7FD2963.quest_subtitle: "He gives you the Orb of Prophecy."
	quest.22FA0CD5D7FD2963.title: "&b&lDefeat the Gatekeeper"
	quest.230593507CE17849.quest_desc: [
		"Upgrades kommen über die &6Charging Station&r in die Drohne, Pfeil über dem Slot. &6Inventory Upgrade&r (Lapis in die Ecken, Bretter an die Seiten, Truhe in die Mitte): ein Platz mehr und &e16 000 mB&r mehr Tank je Upgrade. Ohne trägt sie nur einen Stapel."
		""
		"&6Magnet Upgrade&r (Lapis, Compressed Iron, Plastic Sheet in der Mitte): Die Drohne sammelt Gegenstände in &e2 Blöcken&r Umkreis ein, jedes weitere Upgrade einen Block mehr."
		""
		"&6Speed Upgrade:&r 10 Prozent schneller je Stück. &6Standby Upgrade:&r Sie ruht, wenn sie nichts zu tun hat, und spart Luft. &6Chunkloader Upgrade:&r hält ihren Chunk geladen, mit drei Upgrades 3x3 Chunks."
	]
	quest.230593507CE17849.quest_subtitle: "Mehr tragen, Dinge anziehen, Chunks laden."
	quest.230593507CE17849.title: "&5Rüste deine Drohnen auf"
	quest.230AC4A57074C657.quest_desc: [
		"Kunststoffplatte, &6Druckeisenblock&r, Kunststoffplatte oben, Druckeisen, Druckluftrohr, Druckeisen in der Mitte, Diamant, &6Druckluftzylinder&r, Diamant unten ergeben den &6Presslufthammer&r (Pneumatic Jackhammer)."
		""
		"Ohne &6Bohrkopf&r taugt er nichts. In der Thermopneumatischen Anlage: ein Eisenbarren und &b2 000 mB Schmiermittel&r bei 3 Bar geben den &6Eisenbohrkopf&r, ein Druckeisenbarren und 4 000 mB bei 4 Bar und mindestens 300 Grad den &6Druckeisenbohrkopf&r. Rechtsklick öffnet das Fenster, der Kopf kommt oben rechts hinein."
		""
		"Er baut jeden Block gleich schnell ab, für &e50 mL&r Luft pro Block. Bessere Köpfe schalten Modi bis zum Aderabbau frei. Ein Buch mit Behutsamkeit oder Glück im Buchplatz gibt ihm diese Verzauberung."
	]
	quest.230AC4A57074C657.quest_subtitle: "Ein Bohrer für jeden Block."
	quest.230AC4A57074C657.title: "&6Bau einen Druckluft-Presslufthammer"
	quest.230D09B8D849AF55.quest_desc: [
		"In the Crystal Assembler: an &6ME Extended Interface&r, an &6ME Ingredient Buffer&r (iron, 1k components, quartz glass), two Concurrent Processors and two Annihilation and two Formation Cores."
		""
		"It has as many slots as the Extended Interface, but each holds &d16 times&r as much: 1,024 items instead of 64. Ideal as a stock next to machines that eat large amounts at once."
	]
	quest.230D09B8D849AF55.quest_subtitle: "1,024 items per slot."
	quest.230D09B8D849AF55.title: "&3Build an ME Oversize Interface"
	quest.2317887B956B082D.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Water Wheel&r and eight &6planks&r make the &6Large Water Wheel&r, 3 x 3 blocks big. It turns at &d4 RPM&r and gives &d512 SU&r (128 SU per RPM)."
		""
		"You get the speed back with cogwheels: large onto small makes 8 RPM, one more step 16. The SU stay the same."
	]
	quest.2317887B956B082D.quest_subtitle: "Half the speed, twice the power."
	quest.2317887B956B082D.title: "&6Build a Large Water Wheel"
	quest.232810208ED5820D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Livingrock&r is made by Botania's &6Pure Daisy&r: put stone around the flower, and after a while it turns into Livingrock."
		""
		"The &6Natural Altar&r needs three. How to get the daisy is at the very beginning of the chapter &aBotania&r."
	]
	quest.232810208ED5820D.quest_subtitle: "The altar needs three."
	quest.232810208ED5820D.title: "&aMake Livingrock"
	quest.232CEE39D6999281.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Netherziegel in die Ecken, Eisen an die Seiten, ein Ofen in die Mitte, ein &6Draconiumkern&r unten in die Mitte. Im Fenster wählst du den Modus."
		""
		"&eDraconic Evolution, Generator:&r Brennstoff alles Brennbare. Eco Plus &d5 FE/t&r (50 FE je Brenntick, also 80 000 aus einer Kohle), Eco 20 FE/t, Normal &d40 FE/t&r, Performance 80 FE/t, Overdrive &d300 FE/t&r (5 FE je Brenntick). Kein Kraftwerk, aber ein sparsamer Notstrom. Offen ab Stufe 4, siehe Kapitel &6Draconic Evolution&r."
	]
	quest.232CEE39D6999281.quest_subtitle: "Draconic Evolution, 5 bis 300 FE/t, je nach Modus."
	quest.232CEE39D6999281.title: "&5Bau den Draconic-Generator"
	quest.23355607F2145B57.quest_desc: [
		"&eShift + right click&r with the tool in hand opens the &6Tool Settings&r. Every installed ability is shown there as an icon: &eleft click&r turns it on or off, &eright click&r opens its settings."
		""
		"In the settings you choose what triggers an active ability: right click, left click or a key of its own (&eSet Binding&r). For passive abilities the key toggles them. With &eActivate from Inventory&r that even works when the tool is only in your inventory."
		""
		"&eV&r switches all abilities of the tool in hand off and on again at once. A key for opening the Tool Settings is not bound by default, you find it in the controls options under Just Dire Things."
		""
		"Armor has no window of its own: open the Tool Settings of any tool and click the armor piece there."
	]
	quest.23355607F2145B57.quest_subtitle: "Shift right click, V and your own keys."
	quest.23355607F2145B57.title: "&eSet the Keys"
	quest.233692AE146258BD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Item Interface:&r chunks with a chest, gives four. An interface plus an Input Transformer is the &6Item Importer&r, plus an Output Transformer the &6Item Exporter&r."
		""
		"Interfaces on chests make their contents the network's storage. An importer with an empty Variable Card fetches everything from its target, an exporter delivers what is on its card."
	]
	quest.233692AE146258BD.quest_subtitle: "Interface, importer, exporter."
	quest.233692AE146258BD.title: "&3Move items with Integrated Tunnels"
	quest.2346F74D8D59B247.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Aviar's Circle."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &bSpirit Attuned Crystal&r (4 gems in a square), &6amethyst, lapis&r and &6emerald dust&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book."
		""
		"It turns gem dust back into gems and multiplies gem ores. The Foliot is very slow at it, the Djinni twice as fast."
	]
	quest.2346F74D8D59B247.quest_subtitle: "Dust becomes a gem again."
	quest.2346F74D8D59B247.title: "&dSummon a Foliot Crystallizer"
	quest.2351FBBABD5119FB.quest_desc: [
		"Like with gold, only twice: in the Digestion Vat &e4 Common Gems Niter&r with a &6Purified Gold&r and &e15 mB&r of Sal Ammoniac become &e1 Rare Gems Niter&r. From that, with &e4 Rare&r, a Purified Gold and &e50 mB&r, a &6Precious Gems Niter&r."
		""
		"Reform it with a &6Diamond Sulfur&r on the target into Diamond Sulfur, the Incubator makes a diamond from it. With an Emerald Sulfur on the target it becomes an emerald."
		""
		"&eThe math:&r 16 Common Gems Niter (from lapis or quartz) and 5 Purified Gold per diamond. Expensive, but without ore."
	]
	quest.2351FBBABD5119FB.quest_subtitle: "Two tiers up."
	quest.2351FBBABD5119FB.title: "&bRaise Lapis to Diamond"
	quest.235350BB35FCBF76.quest_desc: [
		"&aFlourishing log&r, &e3 wheat&r, &6golden apple&r, &e2 blaze powder&r."
		""
		"Makes animals nearby have young regularly as long as there is Source. From &e20 animals&r nearby it pauses. With a Vitalic Sourcelink next to it, Source comes back."
	]
	quest.235350BB35FCBF76.quest_subtitle: "The animals breed on their own."
	quest.235350BB35FCBF76.title: "&aMake the Fertility tablet"
	quest.2353D73EE5816450.quest_desc: [
		"&6Holystone&r ist der Stein des Aethers. Grab mit der &6Skyroot Pickaxe&r, dann fallen zwei pro Block. Vier ergeben &6Holystone Bricks&r, der Steinschneider macht Treppen, Stufen und Mauern daraus."
		""
		"Du brauchst viel davon: 8 für den Altar, 8 für den Incubator, 5 für den Freezer, dazu Werkzeug und Brücken zwischen den Inseln."
	]
	quest.2353D73EE5816450.quest_subtitle: "Der Stein, aus dem die Inseln sind."
	quest.2353D73EE5816450.title: "&7Grab Holystone"
	quest.23623105DB6D5A1D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crimson Pendant&r (Pyroclast Pendant, 5 blaze rods, 2 Nether bricks, Gaia Spirit): immune to fire and lava."
		"&6Nimbus Amulet&r (Cirrus Amulet, 4 ghast tears, Elementium, 2 wool, Gaia Spirit): triple jump."
		"&6Globetrotter's Sash&r (Sojourner's Sash, 2 Elementium, Gaia Spirit): much faster."
		"&6Charm of the Diva&r (2 Gaia Spirits, 3 gold, Tiny Planet, Rune of Pride): monsters that hit you go after other monsters."
	]
	quest.23623105DB6D5A1D.quest_subtitle: "Four upgrades, one line each."
	quest.23623105DB6D5A1D.title: "&6Refine Your Baubles with Gaia"
	quest.23696C7BCABFF6AA.quest_desc: [
		"&6One cobblestone&r over &6Crude Tool Parts&r makes the &6Crude Knife&r."
		""
		"Every cut costs one point of durability. Make two right away. A Silent Gear knife (blade plus rod) carves the same way and can be repaired."
	]
	quest.23696C7BCABFF6AA.quest_subtitle: "A tool for the stone anvil."
	quest.23696C7BCABFF6AA.title: "&7Carve a crude knife"
	quest.2370380F3F646B9D.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Andesite Alloy&r in the stonecutter makes an &6Andesite Table Cloth&r. Click the seller at the Stock Ticker with it, place it, put the goods on top and the price below."
		""
		"Buyers take a &6Shopping List&r and pay at the seller. Your network ships the goods, the payment lands in your storage."
	]
	quest.2370380F3F646B9D.quest_subtitle: "Trading between players without chat."
	quest.2370380F3F646B9D.title: "&6Open a shop"
	quest.2370451E2D9B08CE.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Blaze Rod&r or four &6Blaze Powder&r give one &6Blazing Crystal&r for &e120,000 FE&r. A single Starter rod needs a minute for that."
		""
		"{image:powah:textures/item/crystal_blazing.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The material of the &6Blazing&r tier. Nine crystals make a block, which has &e2,800 degrees&r as a heat source under the Thermo Generator."
	]
	quest.2370451E2D9B08CE.quest_subtitle: "A blaze rod full of power."
	quest.2370451E2D9B08CE.title: "&6Charge Blazing Crystals"
	quest.237F2F27DF3947E6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_trains_welcome.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6stone slab&r, &6smooth stone slab&r or &6andesite slab&r onto the belt. Two &6deployers&r each put an iron or zinc nugget on it, a &6press&r presses it tight. One round, one track."
		"{image:create:textures/item/track.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"You learn deployers and sequenced assembly in &6Create: Brass&r. Trains need neither fuel nor rotation and run at up to &e28 blocks per second&r, &e14&r in curves."
	]
	quest.237F2F27DF3947E6.quest_subtitle: "Trains need tracks of their own, and those come off the belt."
	quest.237F2F27DF3947E6.title: "&6&lAssemble your first tracks"
	quest.237F7C564CD01B52.quest_desc: [
		"Hammer-Blaupause (6 Blaues Papier, 1 Stock) plus &6sechs Eisenbarren&r ergibt den Kopf. Sehnen-Verbindung und Ledergriff gleichen den Verschleiß aus."
		""
		"Baut 3x3 ab, nutzt sich pro Block ab. Für Adern nimm &6Ultimine&r, für Tunnel den Hammer."
	]
	quest.237F7C564CD01B52.quest_subtitle: "Silent Gear: 3x3 schon in Stufe 1."
	quest.237F7C564CD01B52.title: "&7Grab Tunnel mit dem Hammer"
	quest.2386BFCEF1D05EEB.quest_desc: [
		"Lenses go on the &6Advanced Prism&r and change what it does with projectiles. Most are made in the Imbuement Chamber: &6quartz&r in, &6Manipulation Essence&r and a glyph on the pedestals, &d2,000 source&r. The glyph stays where it is."
		""
		"&eHoming&r (Homing Projectile) and &eArc&r (Arc Projectile) make the projectile homing or arcing. &eAcceleration&r and &eDeceleration&r change its speed, &ePiercing&r gives it Pierce against source."
		""
		"The &6Chaining Prism Lens&r (apparatus: quartz, Manipulation Essence, source gem block, blank parchment) is inscribed at the table and attaches its glyphs to every projectile that passes through. That costs source depending on the spell."
	]
	quest.2386BFCEF1D05EEB.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: prisms that rebuild spells."
	quest.2386BFCEF1D05EEB.title: "&dGrind Lenses for the Prism"
	quest.2388E279E0CADF62.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a placed &6ME P2P Tunnel&r with &6redstone&r, a &6lever&r or a &6redstone torch&r, and it turns into this type. Breaking it gives you the tunnel as an item of its own."
	]
	quest.2388E279E0CADF62.quest_subtitle: "A signal right across the base."
	quest.2388E279E0CADF62.title: "Build a redstone tunnel"
	quest.23896ACA781626DA.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Shape Card&r in the middle, a &6water bucket&r at the top, a &6lava bucket&r at the bottom, an empty &6bucket&r left and right, &6redstone&r in the corners."
		""
		"With it the Builder sucks fluids out of the area. Each costs 300 RF. Good for a lava lake in the Nether."
	]
	quest.23896ACA781626DA.quest_subtitle: "Water and lava out of the area."
	quest.23896ACA781626DA.title: "&9Build a Pump Card"
	quest.238F01D2DC1BBF06.quest_desc: [
		"Iron, &6Slime Pearl&r, iron on top, glass, &6Molten Core&r, glass in the middle, one iron at the bottom give the &6Lantern of Paranoia&r. Shift right click turns it on."
		""
		"Then it places &6torches&r from your inventory by itself at every dark spot within &e6 blocks&r. While caving, on the building site or around the mob farm nothing stays dark. It also takes torches from a Sojourner's Staff in your inventory."
	]
	quest.238F01D2DC1BBF06.quest_subtitle: "Place torches without looking."
	quest.238F01D2DC1BBF06.title: "&eBuild a Lantern of Paranoia"
	quest.238FEB979A78FADB.quest_desc: [
		"Draconium Ingots at the top left and right, redstone below them, at the bottom &6Awakened ingot&r, &6Item Dislocator&r, &6Awakened ingot&r."
		""
		"Like the normal Item Dislocator it pulls items to you and can be switched on and off by key, only stronger. Two Awakened ingots are not much for a tool you wear every day."
	]
	quest.238FEB979A78FADB.quest_subtitle: "The magnet from stage 4, only stronger."
	quest.238FEB979A78FADB.title: "&bBuild an Awakened Item Dislocator"
	quest.23938CD44A5C1C8D.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6polished blackstone pressure plates&r on top, below them steel, &6Energy Tablet&r, steel."
		""
		"Cable it to your cube. Whoever stands on it gets everything with energy storage in their inventory and armour charged, from any mod. Later the Robit parks here too."
		""
		"Put it in front of the workshop door, then the tablet is full every time you go out."
	]
	quest.23938CD44A5C1C8D.quest_subtitle: "Charging in passing."
	quest.23938CD44A5C1C8D.title: "&aStand on a charging pad"
	quest.239A1A3F6C28A402.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &62 white&r, &62 orange&r, &62 brown&r petals, &6Rune of Gluttony&r, &6Pixie Dust&r."
		""
		"It eats &ecakes&r placed next to it, slice by slice. A cake factory with Create's Mechanical Crafters makes it a strong mana source."
	]
	quest.239A1A3F6C28A402.quest_subtitle: "Cake becomes mana."
	quest.239A1A3F6C28A402.title: "&6Plant a Kekimurus"
	quest.239EED114B7EA3A5.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Hedyrin's Lure, both with the Foliot book."
		"&6Witch:&r glass bottle, redstone, brown and red mushroom, &cSacrifice:&r a chicken. Drops experience, honey or ominous bottles."
		"&6Phantom:&r &e2 leather&r, &e2 feathers&r, &cSacrifice:&r a flying animal. Always drops &6phantom membrane&r."
		""
		"You need phantom membrane for the Gray Paste. You summon random animals with 8 ingredients (seeds and crops, feathers and sugar, seagrass and mud) and an egg or snowball instead of a sacrifice."
	]
	quest.239EED114B7EA3A5.quest_subtitle: "Bottles and membranes to order."
	quest.239EED114B7EA3A5.title: "&5Summon witch and phantom"
	quest.239FE15687A7641D.quest_desc: [
		"One &6coal&r and &e2 Inferium Essence&r shapeless give &6Inferium Coal&r. It burns &e120 seconds&r, normal coal 80. Nine of them give an &6Inferium Coal Block&r."
		""
		"Only worth it when essence comes from the field in abundance. The higher essence coals each burn twice as long as the previous one and come with their stages."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r Agradditions also places &6Inferium and Prosperity Ore&r in the Nether and the End. The Nether opens with stage 2, the End with stage 4."
	]
	quest.239FE15687A7641D.quest_subtitle: "Mystical Agradditions: coal with essence."
	quest.239FE15687A7641D.title: "&8Press Inferium Coal"
	quest.23A9E0041A4918F2.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_meteorite.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Follow the compass and dig into the crater. Take &616 Certus Quartz Crystals&r and &616 Sky Stone&r with you. In a furnace Sky Stone becomes the &6Sky Stone Block&r for the controller."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Never break a &6Flawless Budding Certus Quartz&r. Even with Silk Touch it turns flawed, and you do not get it back flawless. Leave it standing and harvest the clusters on it."
	]
	quest.23A9E0041A4918F2.quest_subtitle: "A crater of sky stone with certus inside."
	quest.23A9E0041A4918F2.title: "&7Find a meteorite"
	quest.23B4ED8AC87648BC.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6daylight detector&r on top, &6hay bale&r in the middle, seven &6iron ingots&r. The &6BaBee Incubator&r needs &d10 FE/t&r."
		""
		"{image:productivebees:textures/item/spawn_egg.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Put an &6egg&r and a Honey Treat with a bee's &etype gene&r inside. After &e3 minutes&r you hold a &6spawn egg&r of exactly that bee. Only the type gene counts, other genes on the treat are lost."
		""
		"This is the bridge to the other mods: an Iron Bee egg becomes a &6Manasteel Bee&r egg in the &aMana Pool&r with 10,000 mana, an &6Infused Iron Bee&r egg on the &aNatural Altar&r with 15,000 Aura, a &6Steel Bee&r egg in the &6Foundry&r with molten steel. EMI shows everything there is at the spawn egg."
		""
		"&eOn the side:&r A baby bee in a cage grows up in the incubator with 20 Honey Treats in 3 minutes."
	]
	quest.23B4ED8AC87648BC.quest_subtitle: "A type gene becomes an egg of that bee."
	quest.23B4ED8AC87648BC.title: "&d&lHatch a Spawn Egg"
	quest.23C1BF990844FCC7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rod blueprint&r plus &6two sticks&r makes &efour rods&r. Two bones or two iron rods work the same way."
		""
		"&cNote:&r The rod is the part in your hand; the &egrip&r is an optional extra part."
		""
		"Wood and iron give Flexible II, bone +20 percent damage. Stone rods are Brittle II, better not."
	]
	quest.23C1BF990844FCC7.quest_subtitle: "The part you hold in your hand."
	quest.23C1BF990844FCC7.title: "&6Build four rods"
	quest.23C2815B15F0590F.quest_desc: [
		"Im Reiter &eNetzwerkmitglieder&r trägst du einen Spielernamen ein und setzt ihn als &6Benutzer&r oder &6Admin&r. Benutzer dürfen Geräte anschließen und bedienen, Admins auch Einstellungen ändern und Mitglieder verwalten."
		""
		"Nur der &6Besitzer&r kann das Netz löschen oder den Besitz übertragen. Für ein gemeinsames Team-Kraftwerk macht einer das Netz auf und setzt die anderen als Admins. Wer nicht eingetragen ist, gilt als &7Fremder&r."
		""
		"Mitglieder zählen auch fürs drahtlose Laden: Nur wer im Netz ist, kann sich daraus laden lassen."
	]
	quest.23C2815B15F0590F.quest_subtitle: "Besitzer, Admin, Benutzer."
	quest.23C2815B15F0590F.title: "&eLade Mitglieder ein"
	quest.23C500BB8EBF1F7D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cloak of Virtue&r (4 white wool, 4 glowstone dust): blocks a hit entirely."
		"&6Cloak of Sin&r (4 black wool, 4 redstone): passes the damage on to monsters nearby."
		"&6Cloak of Balance&r (4 light gray wool, 4 emeralds): shares the damage with the attacker."
		""
		"After triggering they need a ten second break."
	]
	quest.23C500BB8EBF1F7D.quest_subtitle: "Three cloaks, one Gaia Spirit each."
	quest.23C500BB8EBF1F7D.title: "&6Sew the Cloaks of Judgement"
	quest.23C67BDA5D52E4E9.quest_desc: [
		"The Crusher with an installer. Good for bio fuel and obsidian dust."
	]
	quest.23C67BDA5D52E4E9.quest_subtitle: "Three Crushers in one."
	quest.23C67BDA5D52E4E9.title: "&aBasic Crushing Factory"
	quest.23C6FE122EC13A6C.quest_desc: [
		"Bring &616 netherrack&r and &68 Nether quartz&r from the Nether. Netherrack goes into the burner, quartz into rose quartz."
		""
		"You find blazes and their rods in &cNether fortresses&r. Take fire resistance along, blazes shoot fireballs. More in &6The Nether&r chapter."
	]
	quest.23C6FE122EC13A6C.quest_subtitle: "The Nether supplies what brass needs."
	quest.23C6FE122EC13A6C.title: "&cGet netherrack and quartz"
	quest.23CF74838C078848.quest_desc: [
		"Start the ritual and win. &eEvery fighter gets 6&r Gaia Spirits, &ewhoever lands the last hit 8&r. With a 20 percent chance a music disc drops too."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/gaia_spirit.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.23CF74838C078848.quest_subtitle: "The first fight."
	quest.23CF74838C078848.title: "&d&lDefeat the Guardian of Gaia"
	quest.23D38E08ECC3516C.quest_desc: [
		"Inferium, the Infusion Altar and the first resource seeds. Stone seeds and fire seeds help the stone pillar and the andesite line."
	]
	quest.23D38E08ECC3516C.quest_subtitle: "Resources from the field."
	quest.23D38E08ECC3516C.title: "&aOpen Mystical Agriculture"
	quest.23D508FC25FC4941.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Raw Fish Fillet&r and &6kelp&r, see EMI."
		""
		"Made quickly and a snack for the road."
	]
	quest.23D508FC25FC4941.quest_subtitle: "Raw, but tasty."
	quest.23D508FC25FC4941.title: "&7Roll sushi"
	quest.23D891DFD0CBEA83.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rice&r into the pot, plus a bowl."
		""
		"With &6egg, carrot and onion&r, rice in the pot becomes &6Fried Rice&r, a full meal. Cooked rice also goes into Steak and Potatoes."
	]
	quest.23D891DFD0CBEA83.quest_subtitle: "The side dish for everything."
	quest.23D891DFD0CBEA83.title: "&6Cook rice"
	quest.23E724AA117F95D3.quest_desc: [
		"Steel Casing in the middle, Elite Control Circuits at the top and bottom, Bio Fuel left and right, Reinforced Alloy in the corners."
		""
		"A seed with &6nutrient solution&r gives a steady harvest, wheat five per run. The Dissolution Chamber makes nutrient solution from Bio Fuel and Nutritional Paste (Nutritional Liquifier, stage 3)."
	]
	quest.23E724AA117F95D3.quest_subtitle: "Harvest without a field."
	quest.23E724AA117F95D3.title: "&3Build a Planting Station"
	quest.23E8A5E844224DC2.quest_desc: [
		"Binder at the top and bottom, three ingots in the middle, gives eight. &ePower:&r three Conductive. &eItems:&r Conductive, Pulsating, Conductive. &eFluid:&r Conductive, Clear Glass, Conductive. &eRedstone:&r three Redstone Alloy."
		""
		"Different conduits share &eone block&r without mixing. Energetic or Vibrant Alloy gives faster tiers. The numbers are in the checklist &eTransport&r."
		""
		"&eGood to know:&r All kinds are the same item, the quest counts each of them."
	]
	quest.23E8A5E844224DC2.quest_subtitle: "Power, items, fluid in one block."
	quest.23E8A5E844224DC2.title: "&9&lLay Conduits"
	quest.23F8FBBFDCA3CDCC.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Iron Sheets&r above three &6Andesite Alloy&r make eight &6Metal Girders&r. Placed next to and on top of each other they join into supports and beams."
		""
		"Across ravines and rivers a bridge of Metal Girders carries the line. A handsome viaduct is worth more on stream than any stub track."
	]
	quest.23F8FBBFDCA3CDCC.quest_subtitle: "Bridges that look like a railway."
	quest.23F8FBBFDCA3CDCC.title: "&6Support the line with Metal Girders"
	quest.24004D97AB37098B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/exploration_e_arise_sky.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Reach a floating When Dungeons Arise structure and tick this off: a small airship or one of the three sky fortresses (Heavenly Rider, Challenger, Conqueror)."
		""
		"They hang high above plains, forests and deserts. Build yourself a pillar up and take Feather Falling or a water bucket along."
	]
	quest.24004D97AB37098B.quest_subtitle: "Airships and fortresses above the clouds."
	quest.24004D97AB37098B.title: "&bReach a sky structure"
	quest.2403924FE64E13C9.quest_desc: [
		"One Chimera is one fight, &e4 tributes&r are an evening with practice. Whoever can do the fights safely takes along someone who is still learning next time."
		""
		"Each tribute counts 50 points at the obelisk, 64 is the fixed goal."
	]
	quest.2403924FE64E13C9.quest_subtitle: "Four Chimeras, four tributes."
	quest.2403924FE64E13C9.title: "&dCollect Four Wilden Tributes"
	quest.24067129B28A80C5.quest_desc: [
		"&cScylla&r hat &e390 Lebenspunkte&r, Rüstung 12 und schlägt für 18. Ihr Speer macht 14, Blitzsturm 10 und 4 in der Fläche, ihre Schlangen und der Anker 16, der Wirbel 7 Prozent deiner Lebenspunkte. Sobald sie wach ist, zieht ein Gewitter auf."
		""
		"&eSo geht es:&r Nah dran bleiben, die Reichweitengrenze liegt bei nur 12 Blöcken. Wenn sie den Anker hebt, raus aus der Linie. Treffer über 21 werden gekappt, 13 pro Sekunde."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r &e8 bis 16 Lacrima&r und &e3 bis 4 Sturmessenzen&r. Zwei Essenzen und drei Lacrima ergeben &6Astrape&r (Rechtsklick schießt einen Blitzspeer, 10,5 Schaden) oder &6Ceraunus&r (ein Anker mit 16 Schaden, werfbar, schleichend Wellen in Fächerform)."
		""
		"Der Wiederbeleber nimmt ein &6Sturmauge&r."
	]
	quest.24067129B28A80C5.quest_subtitle: "Die Sturmkaiserin ruft Blitze und ändert das Wetter."
	quest.24067129B28A80C5.title: "&c&lBesiege Scylla"
	quest.240A7AC4D860B5AF.quest_desc: [
		"&dExplosion&r (Fire Essence, 3 TNT, fire charge): AOE makes it bigger, Amplify stronger."
		"&dFirework&r (Fire Essence, 2 rockets, firework star): a rocket at the target."
		"&dWind Shear&r (Air Essence, 3 iron swords): damage to targets in the air, more the higher they are, up to 10 blocks."
		"&dCold Snap&r (Water Essence, powder snow bucket, ice): a damage burst against slow, wet or frozen targets."
	]
	quest.240A7AC4D860B5AF.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2 checklist: bang and cold."
	quest.240A7AC4D860B5AF.title: "&dLearn the combat glyphs"
	quest.2415F481AB3173D5.quest_desc: [
		"Open your inventory and click the &eShow Attributes&r button top right. The list shows every attribute with its current value. &eHide Unchanged&r hides everything still at its base value. With &eShift&r over an entry you see base, minimum, maximum and every single modifier with its source."
		""
		"Apothic Attributes brings the values the affixes work on: &6Crit Chance&r and &6Crit Damage&r, &6Life Steal&r (part of the damage heals you) and &6Overheal&r (part of the damage becomes absorption, even at full health), &6Armor Pierce&r and &6Armor Shred&r against armor, &6Mining Speed&r, &6Dodge Chance&r, &6Draw Speed&r, &6Experience Gained&r, &6Cooldown Reduction&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A few pieces with Mining Speed make the difference when the obelisk wants 20,000 cobblestone."
	]
	quest.2415F481AB3173D5.quest_subtitle: "What your character can really do."
	quest.2415F481AB3173D5.title: "&e&lOpen the Attribute Display"
	quest.241A49BCFA3B8B74.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_depot.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Andesite Alloy&r and &6Andesite Casing&r make a &6Depot&r. Place it two blocks below the press, with one block of air in between."
		""
		"Put an item on it with a right-click. Instead of a depot a running belt works too: then it presses everything that passes underneath."
	]
	quest.241A49BCFA3B8B74.quest_subtitle: "The shelf the stamp comes down on."
	quest.241A49BCFA3B8B74.title: "&6Put a depot under the press"
	quest.241DC559B39F9318.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6zinc ore&r (in stone and as deepslate zinc ore) and smelt the &6raw zinc&r in a furnace. One ingot gives nine &6zinc nuggets&r."
		"{image:create:textures/item/raw_zinc.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Zinc nuggets go into Andesite Alloy instead of iron nuggets. That saves your iron for sheets and tools."
		""
		"In stage 2 zinc and twice as much copper make &6brass&r, and the obelisk then wants 2,000 ingots. A chest of raw zinc now is a head start later."
	]
	quest.241DC559B39F9318.quest_subtitle: "Create's second metal."
	quest.241DC559B39F9318.title: "&6Smelt zinc"
	quest.2424E646C622B4D2.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: &6Mage's Spell Book&r, &e3 ender pearls&r, &e2 emeralds&r, &6Totem of Undying&r, &fNether Star&r, &5Wilden Tribute&r."
		""
		"Only with it do you learn and use &dtier 3 glyphs&r, &e160 experience points&r each at the table. Another &e+50&r mana and &e+1&r per second."
		""
		"Linger, Wall and Glide need dragon's breath or elytra and come in stage 4."
	]
	quest.2424E646C622B4D2.quest_subtitle: "The third book: tier 3 glyphs."
	quest.2424E646C622B4D2.title: "&d&lBuild the Archmage Spell Book"
	quest.242814FBF1375799.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Packager&r put alone into the grid becomes the &6Re-Packager&r and back."
		""
		"A large order often arrives in several packages, and other packages can slip in between. Route the packages into a storage, put the Re-Packager on it and give it a redstone signal."
		""
		"Once all parts of an order are there, it packs them into one new package. That way an order arrives complete and in a fixed order, which matters for machines that need ingredients exactly like that."
	]
	quest.242814FBF1375799.quest_subtitle: "The Re-Packager."
	quest.242814FBF1375799.title: "&6Bundle orders together"
	quest.243FC08551254DCB.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Gem-Fused Slate&r on top and bottom, three &6Gem Dust&r in the middle give six &6Sigils of Rebirth&r."
		""
		"The Reforging Table uses them up: &aUncommon&r costs 1 sigil per reforge, &9Rare&r 2. Common works without."
	]
	quest.243FC08551254DCB.quest_subtitle: "The fuel for reforging."
	quest.243FC08551254DCB.title: "&dSigil of Rebirth"
	quest.24456541C4B62F76.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a &6Stoneborn&r to open trading. You pay with &6Regalium Crystals&r."
		""
		"&cDo not attack them:&r They hit hard, and killing one only gets you 3 to 6 Depthrock Pebbles."
	]
	quest.24456541C4B62F76.quest_subtitle: "Traders made of stone, paid in Regalium."
	quest.24456541C4B62F76.title: "&8Trade with a Stoneborn"
	quest.244A32B58BBE4EC7.quest_desc: [
		"Forge all four pieces from &6Glacite Shards&r, like iron. Worn, it freezes enemies that damage you."
		""
		"The &6Glacite Shield&r goes with it: planks with a Glacite Shard in the top middle. You need it later for the Flowglaze Shield."
	]
	quest.244A32B58BBE4EC7.quest_subtitle: "Whoever hits you freezes."
	quest.244A32B58BBE4EC7.title: "&fWear Full Glacite Armor"
	quest.244C1FDC7E222768.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Osmium in die Ecken, Legierung oben und unten, zwei Stahlgehäuse an den Seiten, ein &6Elektrolytischer Kern&r in der Mitte. Gas kommt per Druckrohr oder Tank hinein."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Gasgenerator:&r &bWasserstoff&r aus dem Elektrolyseur gibt &d80 FE/t&r je mB. &bEthen&r aus dem Druckreaktor (Biobrennstoff, Wasser, Wasserstoff) gibt &d11 280 FE je mB&r. Wie viel er pro Tick verbrennt, hängt davon ab, wie voll der Tank (18 000 mB) ist: randvoll bis &d72 000 FE/t&r bei 6,4 mB Ethen pro Tick. Offen ab Stufe 2. Die stärkste Quelle vor Stufe 3, aber eine ganze Produktionskette."
	]
	quest.244C1FDC7E222768.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, Gasgenerator, 80 FE/t bis 72 000 FE/t."
	quest.244C1FDC7E222768.title: "&6Verbrenne Wasserstoff oder Ethen"
	quest.244ED98B6DF2405F.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Blazegold Ingots&r in a plus around an &6ender pearl&r."
		""
		"Throw it at a living thing, and it catches it. Throw it again, and it comes back out. That way you bring cows, sheep or a villager safely into your base."
		""
		"A filled catcher also fits into the machines' filters: with it you filter very precisely, for example only blue sheep."
	]
	quest.244ED98B6DF2405F.quest_subtitle: "The Creature Catcher."
	quest.244ED98B6DF2405F.title: "&aCatch an Animal"
	quest.244FF387E68B8263.quest_desc: [
		"Rechtsklick mit einem &6Ambrosium Shard&r auf &6Aether Grass&r macht daraus &6Enchanted Aether Grass&r. Blue Berry Bushes darauf tragen mehr Beeren."
		""
		"Pflanz eine Blume auf verzaubertes Gras. In der Nähe wachsen dann keine &6Aechor Plants&r mehr, die dich mit Gift bespucken. So wird deine Insel zum sicheren Garten."
	]
	quest.244FF387E68B8263.quest_subtitle: "Mehr Beeren, keine Aechor Plants."
	quest.244FF387E68B8263.title: "&aVerzaubere das Gras"
	quest.245E930C71E273A6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Chemie-Upgrade&r (Chemical Upgrade): Glas oben und unten, Infundierte Legierung links und rechts, &6Eisenstaub&r in die Mitte."
		""
		"Es gehört in Klärkammer, Injektionskammer und Auflösungskammer. Bis zu 8 Stück senken den Gasverbrauch wieder, den die Geschwindigkeitsupgrades hochtreiben. Mit acht und acht liegt der Verbrauch pro Klumpen wieder beim alten Wert."
		""
		"In der Anreicherungskammer oder dem Schmelzer bringt es nichts, die brauchen kein Gas."
	]
	quest.245E930C71E273A6.quest_subtitle: "Weniger Gas pro Klumpen."
	quest.245E930C71E273A6.title: "&8Steck ein Chemie-Upgrade hinein"
	quest.2464C9BEE3566A41.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r Enriched iron left and right, a &61k Storage Part&r at the top, a &6Machine Casing&r in the middle, &6redstone&r at the bottom."
		""
		"The &61k Storage Block&r holds 1,024 items like the disk, but stands on the cable by itself, no drive needed. With the next bigger part at the crafting table it becomes a 4k or 16k block, and the contents stay. Empty, a right click in hand gives back part and casing."
		""
		"It only needs 2 FE/t. For a small side storage in another room that is cheaper than a drive."
	]
	quest.2464C9BEE3566A41.quest_subtitle: "Storage without a drive."
	quest.2464C9BEE3566A41.title: "&7Place a Storage Block"
	quest.246711927734B9C2.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6Blazegold Ingots&r in the corners, a &6blast furnace&r in the middle, two &6buckets&r left and right, &6redstone&r on top and bottom."
		""
		"&eHow to get fuel:&r &e1.&r A &6Blazegold Ingot&r and a &6nether wart&r give four &6Polymorphic Catalyst&r. Throw one into a water source: &6Polymorphic Fluid&r. &e2.&r A &6Blaze Ember&r after it: &6Unrefined Blaze Ember Fuel&r. &e3.&r Leave the fluid block next to &6Blazebloom Goo&r, after 2 minutes it is &6Blaze Ember Fuel&r."
		""
		"One bucket of it (1,000 mB) gives &e450,000 FE&r, the generator pushes out up to &e5,000 FE/t&r and stores 5 million. Fill it with a bucket, a &6Fluid Canister&r (four Ferricore around glass, holds 8 buckets) or the &6Simple Fluid Collector&r (like the breaker, with a bucket instead of the diamond and a dispenser instead of the observer)."
	]
	quest.246711927734B9C2.quest_subtitle: "Liquid fuel, 5,000 FE per tick."
	quest.246711927734B9C2.title: "&cBuild the Fuel Generator"
	quest.24760850DC76289D.quest_desc: [
		"Give a wild &dFlashjack&r (archwood forests, high peaks) a &6Flashpine&r. In the apparatus: token, &e2 Air Essences&r, &e2 gold ingots&r."
		""
		"The Flashjack scouts its territory, marks enemies and can take over spell turrets to fire at them. Flashpine grows on &6Flashing Archwood&r: any archwood sapling with Air Essence."
	]
	quest.24760850DC76289D.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: a scout for the base."
	quest.24760850DC76289D.title: "&6Summon a Flashjack"
	quest.24768CA3EEE4FD2D.quest_desc: [
		"Find an old mineshaft and tick this off. &6YUNG's Better Mineshafts&r builds them from different wood and stone depending on the biome, with ore veins, storage and minecarts."
		""
		"The minecarts with chests are Lootr minecarts. &6YUNG's Better Caves&r reshapes caves, so expect big halls and deep cracks."
	]
	quest.24768CA3EEE4FD2D.quest_subtitle: "YUNG's Better Mineshafts: every biome builds differently."
	quest.24768CA3EEE4FD2D.title: "&8Walk through a mineshaft"
	quest.2476CE04E449338C.quest_desc: [
		"Place a &6Primal Coal Block&r (nine Primal Coal) next to Blazebloom Goo. After 2 minutes the finished block drops &63 to 4 Blaze Ember&r."
		""
		"&6Blaze Ember&r burns &e14,400 ticks&r, nine times as long as coal, and counts four times in the generators. One piece delivers &e216,000 FE&r in the simple generator. It is also the raw material for the liquid fuel of the Fuel Generator."
	]
	quest.2476CE04E449338C.quest_subtitle: "The second coal tier."
	quest.2476CE04E449338C.title: "&cMake Blaze Ember"
	quest.2479D09B0644B277.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ihagan's Enthrallment."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6bed&r, a &6campfire&r, a &6pumpkin pie&r (other pies from cooking mods work too)."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book."
		""
		"Out comes a villager or a Wandering Trader. This way you build your trading hall without driving villagers across the world."
	]
	quest.2479D09B0644B277.quest_subtitle: "A village without searching."
	quest.2479D09B0644B277.title: "&5Summon a villager"
	quest.247F69D31871D1E3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_fragment_forge.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Five &6plastic&r, a &6Flux Gate&r in the middle, at the bottom Motor, plating, Motor. It needs &eseven cores&r and draws &e256 RF/t&r."
		""
		"An ore block becomes two raw ores and one raw ore of a side kind, for iron a Raw Nickel. Raw ore becomes &6clumps&r, that is the next step."
	]
	quest.247F69D31871D1E3.quest_subtitle: "Oritech's best grinder."
	quest.247F69D31871D1E3.title: "&6&lBuild the Fragment Forge"
	quest.248023F0CD98A515.quest_desc: [
		"Hold &eCtrl&r: all stats and traits. &eShift&r: what each trait does. &eAlt&r: which parts the tool is made of."
		""
		"If the same trait comes from several parts, its level rises. Some cancel each other out: Malleable against Brittle."
	]
	quest.248023F0CD98A515.quest_subtitle: "Ctrl, Shift, Alt."
	quest.248023F0CD98A515.title: "&7Read the tooltip"
	quest.2481EC1D811960D0.quest_desc: [
		"&bWater:&r water bucket, snow block, kelp."
		"&cFire:&r flint and steel, torch, gunpowder."
		"&5Abjuration:&r fermented spider eye, sugar, milk bucket."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Set up two or three chambers with fixed pedestal sets, then you only swap the gem."
	]
	quest.2481EC1D811960D0.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: three essences without monsters."
	quest.2481EC1D811960D0.title: "&dMake water, fire and abjuration"
	quest.248A865E9A0FD480.quest_desc: [
		"A cauldron with &e250 mB&r of Potion of Regeneration: the &6Crow Blank Amulet&r, dried &6Mugwort&r and &6Yellow Dock&r leaves and flowers, &e2 glow berries&r, a &6Totem of Undying&r."
		""
		"Put it around your crow's neck. If it were to die, the amulet saves it like a totem."
	]
	quest.248A865E9A0FD480.quest_subtitle: "A totem for your crow."
	quest.248A865E9A0FD480.title: "&6Consecrate a Crow Ankh Amulet"
	quest.248C590974DD4523.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r A &6Cable&r, a &6Construction Core&r and an &6Improved Processor&r, shapeless."
		""
		"The &6Exporter&r pushes whatever is in its filter slots out of the network into the block in front of it. Without a filter it does nothing. It needs 2 FE/t."
		""
		"&eThe classic:&r Exporter with raw iron on top of a furnace, Importer below it, and the furnace never runs empty. The same works with the Enrichment Chamber, the Melter or any Create machine with an input."
	]
	quest.248C590974DD4523.quest_subtitle: "Pushes out of the network."
	quest.248C590974DD4523.title: "&aPlace an Exporter"
	quest.24A2AAACA482D4A1.quest_desc: [
		"In the Alloy Forge: &6Crimson Steel&r, &6Azure Electrum&r, &6crushed shulker shell&r and &6netherite scrap&r: four ingots."
		""
		"&6Tyrian Steel&r: &e3,652&r durability, speed &e18&r, +8 damage, Sturdy III, Void Ward. The top of the ladder."
	]
	quest.24A2AAACA482D4A1.quest_subtitle: "3,652 durability, speed 18."
	quest.24A2AAACA482D4A1.title: "&5Alloy Tyrian Steel"
	quest.24AACD73C916E095.quest_desc: [
		"The &6SPS&r makes &e1 mB of antimatter&r from &e1,000 mB of polonium&r. The &6Chemical Crystallizer&r makes one &5pellet&r from 1,000 mB of antimatter."
		""
		"So one pellet needs a million mB of polonium. The obelisk wants a hundred of them, each counts 30 points. That means: several fission reactors and power from everything you have."
		""
		"Everything about it is in the chapter &5Mekanism: Antimatter&r."
	]
	quest.24AACD73C916E095.quest_subtitle: "1,000 mB of antimatter, one pellet."
	quest.24AACD73C916E095.title: "&6Crystallize an Antimatter Pellet"
	quest.24AC27A16E14145C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gravitit&r aus dem Aether am Altar verzaubern, dann Werkzeug und Rüstung. Rüstung: höher springen, kein Fallschaden. Werkzeug: Rechtsklick lässt Blöcke schweben."
		""
		"&6Valkyrienlanze&r aus dem Silberdungeon, &6Phönixrüstung&r aus dem Golddungeon (geh damit ins Wasser) und &6Neptunrüstung&r sind Beute, keine Rezepte."
	]
	quest.24AC27A16E14145C.quest_subtitle: "Aether: Dungeon-Beute und schwebende Blöcke."
	quest.24AC27A16E14145C.title: "&dSchmiede Gravitit"
	quest.24B30BCE6EA39A6C.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 grey&r, &e2 light grey&r petals, &eRune of Air&r, &6Redstone Root&r."
		""
		"Collects items nearby into an adjacent inventory. Mana is optional and increases the range. A frame with an item on a chest filters, labelled chests take priority."
	]
	quest.24B30BCE6EA39A6C.quest_subtitle: "Picks everything up from the ground."
	quest.24B30BCE6EA39A6C.title: "&6Plant a Hopperhock"
	quest.24B4387AD8CAA34B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/flux_networks_dust.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Bau dir die Staubstation zu Hause: ein &6Flux-Block&r unten, darüber ein Block Luft, darauf &6Obsidian&r. Wirf acht Stapel Redstone in die Lücke und schlag auf den Obsidian."
		""
		"Das sind &d512&r Flux-Staub, die Obergrenze für einen Schlag. Der Obsidian wird dabei fast sicher zu Bruchstein, leg also ein paar Obsidian bereit."
		""
		"Ein Vorrat von ein paar Stapeln reicht für alle Stecker, Punkte, Speicher und den Controller, die du in Stufe 3 brauchst."
	]
	quest.24B4387AD8CAA34B.quest_subtitle: "512 Staub mit einem Schlag."
	quest.24B4387AD8CAA34B.title: "&cZerquetsch acht Stapel auf einmal"
	quest.24B5CFA5737D7EF0.quest_desc: [
		"Find a village and tick this off. Villagers trade for &6emeralds&r, which you need for the Warp Stone, the Market and taverns."
		""
		"Many villages have a &6Waystone&r and a &6Bounty Board&r. Don't build right in the middle and keep the villagers alive; the rest of the server trades with them too."
	]
	quest.24B5CFA5737D7EF0.quest_subtitle: "Trade, beds and often a waystone."
	quest.24B5CFA5737D7EF0.title: "&6Find a village"
	quest.24BE0A6B973ADB1C.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6Sender Mk2&r top middle, below &6Sender Mk2&r, &6Blank Module&r, &6Sender Mk2&r. A &6Distributor Module&r."
		""
		"It is a Sender Mk2 with up to &eeight targets&r: sneak and right click each chest, once more to remove it. It distributes &eround robin&r, &erandom&r, &enearest&r or &efurthest&r first."
		""
		"One router, a puller from the ore chest, a distributor to three enrichment factories in round robin: no factory stands still, none overflows."
		""
		"The &6Energy Distributor Module&r (Energy Output Module and distributor) does the same with FE from an Energy Upgrade, wirelessly to eight machines."
	]
	quest.24BE0A6B973ADB1C.quest_subtitle: "The Distributor Module."
	quest.24BE0A6B973ADB1C.title: "&6Distribute to Eight Targets"
	quest.24C16F473F81E15A.quest_desc: [
		"&cThe Leviathan&r hat &e400 Lebenspunkte&r und Rüstung 10. Sein Biss macht 15 plus 10 Prozent deiner Lebenspunkte, der Abgrundstrahl 10 plus 10 Prozent, Risse und Kugeln 10 und 4. Er legt &eDunkelheit&r auf dich. Außerhalb des Wassers ist er unverwundbar, du musst zu ihm hinunter."
		""
		"&eSo geht es:&r Gesegnetes Krabbenfleisch gegen die Dunkelheit, Wasseratmung, Delphingunst oder Tiefenschnelle für Tempo. Bleib dicht an seinem Körper, nicht vor dem Maul. Treffer über 20 werden gekappt, 15 pro Sekunde maximal, Reichweite 38 Blöcke."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r &6Gezeitenklauen&r (Rechtsklick wirft einen Enterhaken, Linksklick einen Tentakel für Schaden, 8 Schaden) und ein &6Abgrundei&r. Aus dem Ei schlüpft ein kleiner Leviathan, der dir folgt und im Eimer mitkommt."
	]
	quest.24C16F473F81E15A.quest_subtitle: "400 Lebenspunkte, und nur im Wasser verwundbar."
	quest.24C16F473F81E15A.title: "&c&lBesiege den Leviathan"
	quest.24CA601583782EAC.quest_desc: [
		"&eLightning&r means concentrated damage. Common: &6Ball Lightning&r (slow lightning ball, bounces off blocks), &6Electrocute&r (hold: cone of electricity), &6Shockwave&r (shockwave around you), &6Volt Strike&r (leap forward with a lightning strike on impact)."
		""
		"Focus: Bottle o' Lightning from a charged creeper."
		""
		"&cStage 2:&r Chain Lightning, Lightning Lance, Thunderstep, Ascension, Charge, Thunderstorm. &cStage 3:&r Lightning Bolt."
	]
	quest.24CA601583782EAC.quest_subtitle: "Ball Lightning, Electrocute, Shockwave, Volt Strike."
	quest.24CA601583782EAC.title: "&eCast a Lightning Spell"
	quest.24DA5D11B4BFD78C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Nightfall Spider:&r string, Nightfall Spider Eye."
		"&6Lonestar Skeleton:&r bones, Deepsilver Nugget."
		"&6Seeker:&r Seeker Tentacle, Seeking Eye. &6Thirst Walker:&r Tooth of Hunger."
		"&6Creteor:&r Creteor Hide, gunpowder, Raw Aethersent. &6Gleech:&r Gleech Egg."
		"&6Stranghoul:&r Malarite, Pungency Fruit. &6Tangled:&r Soul Dew, vines."
		"&6Freeze:&r Frozen Tube, Oxidized Golem Steel Nugget."
	]
	quest.24DA5D11B4BFD78C.quest_subtitle: "Every enemy with its loot."
	quest.24DA5D11B4BFD78C.title: "&4Checklist: Enemies"
	quest.24E530778C8907C1.quest_desc: [
		"Uraninite ore comes in three kinds: poor below &eY 64&r, normal below &eY 20&r, dense below &eY 0&r. &6Raw Uraninite&r gives two &6Uraninite&r in the orb for 2,000 FE. An ore block mined with Silk Touch gives 3, 5 or 10 there, depending on the kind."
		""
		"A &6uranium ingot&r from Mekanism also becomes uraninite in the orb, for 30,000 FE."
	]
	quest.24E530778C8907C1.quest_subtitle: "The reactor's fuel."
	quest.24E530778C8907C1.title: "&aDig uraninite"
	quest.24E66C88730FE8F6.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6LV Wire Coils&r around an &6iron ingot&r make a &6Copper Coil Block&r."
		""
		"It is in the Kinetic Dynamo, in the Thermoelectric Generator and in the Charging Station."
	]
	quest.24E66C88730FE8F6.quest_subtitle: "The inside of the dynamo."
	quest.24E66C88730FE8F6.title: "&6Build a Copper Coil Block"
	quest.24EAC21DC0DA7BDB.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6diamond pickaxes&r left and right of a &6Blank Upgrade&r give the &6Hammer&r upgrade. It only fits from Blazegold on, so into the pickaxe from the last quest."
		""
		"With Hammer the Blazegold pickaxe mines &e3x3&r. A click on its icon in the Tool Settings turns it off when you only want one block after all. Celestigem later manages 5x5, Eclipse Alloy 7x7."
	]
	quest.24EAC21DC0DA7BDB.quest_subtitle: "3x3 with the Blazegold pickaxe."
	quest.24EAC21DC0DA7BDB.title: "&6Install the Hammer"
	quest.24EC81B106F356D9.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r top left a &dsource gem block&r from Ars Nouveau, reactor glass in the top, left, right and bottom middle, a redstone block in the middle. Gives &etwo&r."
		""
		"&6Reactor Glass:&r four Enriched Iron in the corners, four lead on the sides, glass in the middle, gives four. Every mage has a source gem block in storage."
	]
	quest.24EC81B106F356D9.quest_subtitle: "Fusion needs magic to start."
	quest.24EC81B106F356D9.title: "&dBuild Laser Focus Matrices"
	quest.24FFC1AEC52A81F8.quest_desc: [
		"Hover over an item and press &eA&r. It lands in the favorites on the &eleft&r of the inventory, the same key removes it. If you set it in the recipe window, EMI remembers the &erecipe&r with it, then you see the ingredients without looking them up."
		""
		"Before a big build: set all machines as favorites, then work through ingredient by ingredient. &eCtrl and O&r hides EMI completely when it is in the way."
	]
	quest.24FFC1AEC52A81F8.quest_subtitle: "Your shopping list on the left of the inventory."
	quest.24FFC1AEC52A81F8.title: "&eSet Favorites"
	quest.25073F81DD834B15.quest_desc: [
		"A &6feather&r, a &6Nebulous Heart&r, a &6Bat Wing&r and a &6Fertile Essence&r shapeless give the &6Angelic Feather&r. Fertile Essence is Rib Bone, Catalyzing Gland, &6Mandrake Root&r from Hexerei and Slime Pearl."
		""
		"In your inventory it catches fall damage and takes hunger instead. On top you jump a little higher."
	]
	quest.25073F81DD834B15.quest_subtitle: "Fall damage only costs hunger."
	quest.25073F81DD834B15.title: "&fBuild an Angelic Feather"
	quest.251007087FB0E302.quest_desc: [
		"Build a &6Flint Knife&r, a &6Stove&r and a &6Cooking Pot&r. With them you cook soups and meals that keep you full for a long time."
		""
		"&6Farmer's Delight&r is the kitchen, &6Farming for Blockheads&r helps with fields and animals, &6Aquaculture&r makes fishing a hobby."
		""
		"&eTip:&r AppleSkin shows hunger and saturation in the tooltip of every food. Kitchen furniture, botany pots and the best dishes are in the &6Cooking&r chapter."
	]
	quest.251007087FB0E302.quest_subtitle: "Whoever eats well digs longer."
	quest.251007087FB0E302.title: "&6&lEat better than bread"
	quest.2516E308DB75855D.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion, all with the Foliot book, no sacrifice."
		"&6Fragile Soul Gem:&r iron ingot, egg, glass. &6Vitality Compass:&r amethyst, &e2 Spirit Attuned Gems&r, compass."
		"&6Knowledge Tablet:&r Otherstone Tablet, Research Fragment Dust, Spirit Attuned Gem, ender pearl."
		""
		"The fragile soul gem carries a creature once, then it breaks. It goes into the real Soul Gem. The compass points to a creature you clicked with it. The tablet stores your experience (right click) and gives it back (sneaking right click)."
	]
	quest.2516E308DB75855D.quest_subtitle: "Soul gem, compass, experience tablet."
	quest.2516E308DB75855D.title: "&6Bind small artifacts"
	quest.251F81789251243F.quest_desc: [
		"Ein beliebiges &6Banner&r und ein &6Swet Cape&r aus dem Bronze-Dungeon ergeben das &6Swet Banner&r. Stell es auf."
		""
		"In seiner Nähe tauchen keine Swets mehr auf. Zusammen mit verzaubertem Gras und Blumen hast du dann eine Insel, auf der dich nichts mehr anspringt."
	]
	quest.251F81789251243F.quest_subtitle: "Ein Umhang, der Swets fernhält."
	quest.251F81789251243F.title: "&9Häng ein Swet Banner auf"
	quest.2521180F7F24E2A9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_heavy.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Steel Sheetmetal&r in the corners, a &6Precision Mechanism&r in the top middle, a &6Steel Mechanical Component&r each left, right and bottom, an &6Electrum Ingot&r in the middle. That makes four."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Create's Precision Mechanism replaces one steel component. The Metal Press needs one, the Diesel Generator &e13&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Every &6Steel Core&r, the milestone of stage 3, needs four. The obelisk wants eight Steel Cores."
	]
	quest.2521180F7F24E2A9.quest_subtitle: "Steel, Electrum and a Precision Mechanism."
	quest.2521180F7F24E2A9.title: "&8&lBuild Heavy Engineering Blocks"
	quest.252F7003CD7670AC.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r in zwei Reihen übereinander je &6Eisenklumpen&r, &6Eisenbarren&r, &6Eisenklumpen&r. Das ergibt zwei &6Eisentore&r."
		""
		"Ein Tor aus Eisen statt Holz, passend zu Eisengittern und Andesitgittern. Gut für Ställe, Kerker und die Einfahrt zur Fabrik."
	]
	quest.252F7003CD7670AC.quest_subtitle: "Ein Tor, das zu Eisengittern passt."
	quest.252F7003CD7670AC.title: "&7Setz ein Eisentor"
	quest.2530A228C1123622.quest_desc: [
		"&eSo geht es:&r Die &6Warp-Schriftrolle&r sind 4 Lapis, 4 Quelljuwelen und ein leeres Pergament, formlos. Schleich-Rechtsklick speichert den Ort, Rechtsklick bringt dich hin und verbraucht die Rolle. Die &6Stabilisierte&r Rolle aus dem Apparat hält ewig und kann die Dimension wechseln."
		""
		"&eDas Warp-Portal:&r Bau einen Rahmen aus &6Quellstein&r (1x1 bis 21x21, stehend oder liegend), stell ein volles &6Quellglas&r daneben und wirf eine beschriebene Rolle hinein. Das Portal bleibt stehen und kostet danach keine Quelle mehr, führt aber nur innerhalb derselben Dimension."
		""
		"In Stufe 3 kommt das &6Ritual der Verschiebung&r, das alle in der Nähe zum Ort auf der Rolle schickt. Alles im Kapitel &dArs Nouveau: Magier&r."
	]
	quest.2530A228C1123622.quest_subtitle: "Ars Nouveau: einmal nach Hause, oder ein Portal. Stufe 2."
	quest.2530A228C1123622.title: "&dSchreib eine Warp-Schriftrolle"
	quest.25331D09B9C67341.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r eight &6oak planks&r around a &6honeycomb&r give an &6Expansion Box&r. Place it directly next to or on top of the Advanced Beehive, one box per hive."
		""
		"The hive then holds &e5 bees&r instead of 3, and the box has the slots for &6upgrades&r. Hive and box exist in every wood type."
		""
		"&eTip:&r With a stick in hand you knock bees out of the hive that stay inside too long. The comb's progress is lost."
	]
	quest.25331D09B9C67341.quest_subtitle: "Five bees instead of three, and room for upgrades."
	quest.25331D09B9C67341.title: "&6Attach an Expansion Box"
	quest.2536CF7E953FEE9A.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6copper ingots&r at the top, &6Fluid Pipe&r, glass, Fluid Pipe in the middle, three copper ingots at the bottom make the &6Portable Tank&r."
		""
		"It holds &e256 buckets&r and keeps its contents when you mine it. Tanks stacked on top of each other let the fluid flow down, a comparator shows the fill level."
	]
	quest.2536CF7E953FEE9A.quest_subtitle: "256 buckets in one block."
	quest.2536CF7E953FEE9A.title: "&9Set Up a Portable Tank"
	quest.2558B50FF49D1626.quest_desc: [
		"&eStage 3:&r Osmium and Obsidian Bee (Lava Bee with Water Bee from the river) give the bee for &6Refined Obsidian&r. The Infused Iron Bee egg becomes the bee for the &6Ingot of the Skies&r at the Offering Table, the Manasteel egg becomes the egg of the &6Elementium Bee&r in the elven portal."
		"Nomad and Reed Bee give the &6Silicon Bee&r for AE2, Crystalline and Neon Cuckoo the &6Menril Bee&r, and Powah turns Iron and Gold Bees into the bee for &6Energized Steel&r."
		""
		"&eStage 4:&r In the End the &6Ender Bee&r lives in the end stone nest and the &6Draconic Bee&r in obsidian pillars. Diamond, emerald, experience and all gem bees descend from the Ender Bee, the Diamond Bee turns into the &6Arcane Bees&r of Ars Nouveau and the Netherite Bee. The Draconic Bee delivers the Draconic Dust for the Productivity Upgrade, and a dragon egg becomes the Heated Centrifuge."
		""
		"Everything you breed until then stays. A good Iron and Crystalline line is the start of each of these bees."
	]
	quest.2558B50FF49D1626.quest_subtitle: "Bees for stage 3 and 4."
	quest.2558B50FF49D1626.title: "&dWhat Comes Later"
	quest.255C5A8DD75756BF.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Matter Condenser&r (iron, glass, fluix dust) destroys everything that goes in. In &eMatter Ball&r mode every &e256 items&r become one &6Matter Ball&r. Put a storage component into its component slot, otherwise it has no buffer."
		""
		"What goes in does not matter. Cobblestone, dirt, netherrack all count the same. A quarry and an export bus feed it without a break."
	]
	quest.255C5A8DD75756BF.quest_subtitle: "The trash can that gives something back."
	quest.255C5A8DD75756BF.title: "&7Make Matter Balls"
	quest.255C6206ED9AD4A2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Otherstone&r in the furnace becomes &6Polished Otherstone&r, which is smelted once more into &6Burnt Otherstone&r."
		""
		"Put a whole stack into one furnace and the result straight into a second. You also need Otherstone for bowls, take plenty."
	]
	quest.255C6206ED9AD4A2.quest_subtitle: "The second half of every chalk."
	quest.255C6206ED9AD4A2.title: "&6Burn Otherstone twice"
	quest.2565F01F8794304F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Electron Tube&r, &6Andesite Casing&r and &6Brass Hand&r on top of each other make the &6Deployer&r. It does with its item what a player would do."
		""
		"Over a depot or belt it applies its item to everything below: sandpaper on rose quartz, planks on shafts for cogwheels. EMI lists everything under &eDeploying&r. It costs &d4 SU per RPM&r."
		""
		"For the precision line you need three: cogwheel, tube, nugget."
	]
	quest.2565F01F8794304F.quest_subtitle: "A hand that uses what it holds."
	quest.2565F01F8794304F.title: "&6Build three deployers"
	quest.25673FE4B07338A4.quest_desc: [
		"Zieh eine &6Sternfrucht&r und ernte &e8 Sternfrüchte&r. Der Baum ist die tiefste Kreuzung des Mods: Mango (Orange und Mangrove) und Sternanis (Nelke und Piment), hinter denen neun Generationen stehen, von Eiche und Birke bis zur Pomelo."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/fruit/star_fruit.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Der Markt hilft bis Generation 3 (Kakao, Ceylon-Ebenholz, Silberlinde und Sauerkirsche kannst du kaufen), die restlichen sechs Generationen züchtest du selbst, mit Bienen oder Pollen. Die Checkliste darunter führt alle 148 Kreuzungen nach Generationen auf, mit Eltern und Chance, ein Haken pro Art."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Ein Baumgarten mit Sägewerk, Pflanztöpfen und einer Create-Säge liefert Bretter für die Mühle und die Pressen des Steinwerks und Essen für alle. Und er sieht besser aus als jede Erzstraße."
	]
	quest.25673FE4B07338A4.quest_subtitle: "Neun Generationen Stammbaum enden hier."
	quest.25673FE4B07338A4.title: "&6&lErnte die Sternfrucht"
	quest.25688DAE48BD9558.quest_desc: [
		"An &6iron ingot&r with &e4 Prosperity Shards&r on the four sides gives a &6Prosperity Ingot&r."
		""
		"It is the first step of every essence ingot. Make a few in advance: two go into the first tool, four into the Inferium Watering Can."
	]
	quest.25688DAE48BD9558.quest_subtitle: "An ingot with four shards around it."
	quest.25688DAE48BD9558.title: "&fWrap Iron in Prosperity"
	quest.256FEE0738B8249E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_ores_tripling.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Füttere die Straße mit allem, was du findest: &6Eisen, Kupfer, Gold, Osmium, Zinn, Blei, Uran&r. Zum Beweis 32 Osmiumklumpen und 16 Zinnklumpen."
		""
		"Wenn die Klärkammer stehen bleibt, fehlt fast immer Sauerstoff oder Strom: 80 FE/t für die Kammer, dazu Elektrolyseur, Pumpe und drei Maschinen dahinter. Ein Einfacher Energie-Würfel als Puffer und ein zweiter Wärmegenerator helfen."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Für das Ziel von Stufe 3 (4 000 Stahlbarren) ist das die Eisenquelle. Stell die Stahlstraße direkt dahinter."
		""
		"&eNächste Stufe:&r 4x braucht die Chemische Injektionskammer mit Elite-Schaltkreisen aus Stufe 4. Bis dahin ist 3x das Beste, was Mekanism kann."
	]
	quest.256FEE0738B8249E.quest_subtitle: "Drei Barren aus einem Erz."
	quest.256FEE0738B8249E.title: "&d&lLass die Dreifach-Straße laufen"
	quest.257C717C0E99363E.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: one &6dirt&r, two &6straw&r, two &6bone meal&r, four &6tree bark&r. Or dirt, two straw, two rotten flesh and four bone meal."
		""
		"Placed as a block, it decomposes into Rich Soil over time."
	]
	quest.257C717C0E99363E.quest_subtitle: "Dirt, straw, bark, bone meal."
	quest.257C717C0E99363E.title: "&6Mix Organic Compost"
	quest.258381499B40FD89.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a placed &6ME P2P Tunnel&r with a &6chest&r, a &6hopper&r or a bus, and it turns into this type. Breaking it gives you the tunnel as an item of its own."
	]
	quest.258381499B40FD89.quest_subtitle: "Items from one block face to another."
	quest.258381499B40FD89.title: "Build an item tunnel"
	quest.2585FB9E1C72E61B.quest_desc: [
		"In the Crystal Assembler: an &6Extended Machine Frame&r, four certus quartz and two quartz fibers."
		""
		"Place it so that its front faces a &6Budding Certus Quartz&r, and give it power. A right click with a &6Charged Certus Quartz Crystal&r fills it up. It repairs the budding block and lifts it level by level."
		""
		"That way your certus farm grows without throwing more into the water."
	]
	quest.2585FB9E1C72E61B.quest_subtitle: "The Crystal Fixer makes certus flawless again."
	quest.2585FB9E1C72E61B.title: "&3Repair budding blocks"
	quest.258E3D497931ED1D.quest_desc: [
		"Fünfte Generation, zweiter Teil, mit dem Gummibaum."
		""
		"&6Wacholder&r: Holunder + Weißtanne, 10 %"
		"&6Key-Lime&r: Zitronatzitrone + Vogelkirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Mahagoni&r: Gelbes Meranti + Kapok, 10 %"
		"&6Pomelo&r: Zitronatzitrone + Vogelkirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Gummibaum&r: Amberbaum + Weihrauchkiefer, 10 %"
		"&6Salak&r: Pandanus + Kokospalme, 10 %"
		"&6Drachenblutbaum&r: Wenge + Cocobolo, 10 %"
		"&6Sumpf-Eukalyptus&r: Gelbes Meranti + Rosen-Eukalyptus, 10 %"
		"&6Acai-Palme&r: Dattelpalme + Schwarzkirsche, 5 %"
		"&6Kaki&r: Ceylon-Ebenholz + Purpur-Kreppmyrte, 5 %"
		"&6Pflaume&r: Zitronatzitrone + Vogelkirsche, 5 %"
	]
	quest.258E3D497931ED1D.quest_subtitle: "11 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.258E3D497931ED1D.title: "&aGeneration 5: Wacholder bis Pflaume"
	quest.258F3B682E550EF2.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6clay balls&r in the corners, one &6sugar&r each on top and bottom, one &6rotten flesh&r each left and right, &6Inferium Essence&r in the middle. That gives a block of &6Primogel Goo&r."
		""
		"&aJust Dire Things&r revolves around this goo. It eats blocks you place next to it and leaves something better behind: iron becomes &6Ferricore&r, gold &6Blazegold&r. From that you build tools with abilities, simple machines without power and a portal gun."
		""
		"Freshly placed, the goo is still dead and gray. &eRight clicking it with sugar or rotten flesh&r wakes it up, then it visibly wobbles."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A goo block and a book in the crafting table give the mod's handbook, with every recipe and every ability."
		""
		"&eWhat is open in stage 2:&r Primogel and Blazebloom Goo, Ferricore and Blazegold, all simple machines, the Pocket Generator and the Portal Gun. &cCelestigem comes in stage 3, Eclipse Alloy and the time crystals in stage 4.&r"
	]
	quest.258F3B682E550EF2.quest_subtitle: "A living block that turns iron into Ferricore."
	quest.258F3B682E550EF2.title: "&a&lMix the First Goo"
	quest.25914303BBB17B8E.quest_desc: [
		"Im Fluid Mixer bei &e2 Bar&r: &b25 mB Pflanzenöl&r und &b25 mB Ethanol&r ergeben &b50 mB Biodiesel&r und einen &6Glycerintropfen&r (Glycerol)."
		""
		"Biodiesel ist so gut wie Diesel: &e1 000 000 mL&r Luft pro Eimer im Flüssigkeitskompressor. In der Anlage wird er ab 100 Grad mit Redstone zu Schmiermittel und mit Holzkohle zu flüssigem Kunststoff. Damit läuft dein ganzes Kapitel ohne Ölquelle."
		""
		"&eGlycerin:&r In einem Geschwindigkeits-Upgrade statt Zucker gibt es zwei Upgrades. Vier Tropfen um einen Teppich ergeben einen &6Verband&r, der drei Herzen heilt."
	]
	quest.25914303BBB17B8E.quest_subtitle: "Brennstoff, der auf dem Feld wächst."
	quest.25914303BBB17B8E.title: "&a&lMisch Biodiesel"
	quest.2591E522C8570210.quest_desc: [
		"&6Annotated Codex&r: shapeless &6Blank Parchment&r and &6leather&r."
		""
		"Use the codex and it writes down every glyph you know. That costs &dexperience&r for each glyph. Used again, it brings the list up to date."
		""
		"Another player uses the codex and learns every glyph from it they are missing. The codex is used up in the process. Ideal for a team in which one person collects the glyphs."
	]
	quest.2591E522C8570210.quest_subtitle: "Glyphs for friends, without ingredients."
	quest.2591E522C8570210.title: "&6Share your knowledge with the codex"
	quest.259B423B20532EB5.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 cactus&r, &e1 beetroot&r, &e1 carrot&r, &e1 potato&r. Lay them in the field as a starting pattern."
		""
		"Cellular blocks are fragile, give nothing back when mined and cannot be pushed. Two Dandelifeons with overlapping fields kill the cells in between."
	]
	quest.259B423B20532EB5.quest_subtitle: "The game pieces of the Dandelifeon."
	quest.259B423B20532EB5.title: "&aCraft Cellular Blocks"
	quest.259E2E5E439C5298.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6quartz, iron, quartz&r, middle &6iron, advanced upgrade base, iron&r, bottom &6three Blaze Gold&r."
		""
		"Material plus catalyst in, and it comes out with a grade. The average is &eC&r."
		""
		"Catalyst I: &6Glowing Dust&r (stick, two glowstone, quartz, gives four). II: Blaze Gold dust and two glowstone."
	]
	quest.259E2E5E439C5298.quest_subtitle: "Grades from E to SSS."
	quest.259E2E5E439C5298.title: "&dRefine a material"
	quest.259E3C04FBD08D97.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Chemical Infuser from 1 mB each of sulfur trioxide and water vapour. Sulfur dust straight into the Chemical Dissolution Chamber gives 2 mB."
		"&eUsed by:&r the Chemical Dissolution Chamber, ore 5x in stage 4."
	]
	quest.259E3C04FBD08D97.quest_subtitle: "Trioxide plus water vapour."
	quest.259E3C04FBD08D97.title: "&fSulfuric acid"
	quest.25A0BEA42EF796C4.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Jetpack&r von Oritech fasst &d100.000 FE&r, verbraucht &d128 FE/t&r unter Schub und lädt mit höchstens &d1.024 FE/t&r. Zieh ihn an, hak im Reiter &eDrahtloses Laden&r die &6Rüstung&r an, und der Controller zu Hause hält ihn voll, auch am anderen Ende der Karte."
		""
		"Ohne Controller ist eine Füllung nach etwa 40 Sekunden Schub leer. Mit Controller kommen im Flug 1.024 FE/t herein und 128 heraus, er wird also unterwegs voller statt leerer."
		""
		"Der &6Exo-Jetpack&r fasst 5 Millionen FE und lädt mit 10.000 FE/t, braucht aber die Kybernetik aus dem Kapitel &6Oritech&r. Das Laden läuft bei ihm genauso."
	]
	quest.25A0BEA42EF796C4.quest_subtitle: "Oritech-Jetpack, voll, überall."
	quest.25A0BEA42EF796C4.title: "&bLade den Jetpack von unterwegs"
	quest.25B4DA49C85D1B2B.quest_desc: [
		"One &6uranium 235&r and eight &6uranium 238&r at the crafting table. Gives three &6LEU-235&r."
		""
		"One piece burns for &e4 minutes&r, makes &e50 heat&r and &e240 power per tick&r. &6HEU-235&r (three to six) makes much more heat, &6TBU&r from thorium very little. With oxygen in the Fluid Infuser it becomes oxide fuel, more power, more heat."
	]
	quest.25B4DA49C85D1B2B.quest_subtitle: "The first fuel."
	quest.25B4DA49C85D1B2B.title: "&a&lMix LEU-235"
	quest.25BA4E47836657E0.quest_desc: [
		"Neun &6Walnüsse&r in der Werkbank ergeben eine &6Kiste Walnüsse&r, die Kiste formlos wieder neun Nüsse. Das gibt es für jedes Obst, jede Nuss, jedes Gewürz und für Kaffeebohnen, insgesamt 90 Kistensorten."
		""
		"Eine Kiste Nüsse röstet im Ofen in 54 Sekunden zu einer &6Kiste geröstete Walnüsse&r, das ist pro Nuss genauso schnell wie einzeln, aber nur ein Ofenslot. Die Kisten sind Blöcke und lassen sich stapeln wie Fässer."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Die zwölf Nusssorten (Mandel, Buchecker, Paranuss, Butternuss, Kerzennuss, Cashew, Edelkastanie, Ginkgo, Hasel, Pekan, Pistazie, Walnuss) und Kaffeebohnen lassen sich rösten. Obst isst du roh."
	]
	quest.25BA4E47836657E0.quest_subtitle: "Neun Stück pro Kiste, geröstet wird im Ganzen."
	quest.25BA4E47836657E0.title: "&aPack Nüsse in eine Kiste"
	quest.25BD64271101CF3B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fuel Reprocessor:&r tin silver in the corners, &6glowstone dust&r at the top, &6ender pearls&r left and right, a &6chassis&r in the middle, a &6Coil Copper&r at the bottom."
		""
		"One spent LEU-235 gives four uranium 238, one each of &6plutonium 239&r, plutonium 242 and americium 243, plus strontium and caesium. The uranium 238 goes back into the next mix."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r All of it is strongly radioactive. Store it in chests far away, not in your inventory."
	]
	quest.25BD64271101CF3B.quest_subtitle: "Waste becomes plutonium."
	quest.25BD64271101CF3B.title: "&dReprocess Spent Fuel"
	quest.25C0F95C23BD4D27.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r iron ingot, &6dirt&r, iron ingot on top, iron ingot, &6dispenser&r, iron ingot in the middle, three iron ingots at the bottom."
		""
		"The &6Catcher&r puts bees around it into empty cages you give it. You control it with upgrades: Range for more area, Filter for certain kinds, &6BaBee&r only for baby bees, &6AdultBee&r only for adults."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Next to a breeding enclosure with a BaBee Upgrade it collects the offspring before they fly off."
	]
	quest.25C0F95C23BD4D27.quest_subtitle: "Bees catch themselves."
	quest.25C0F95C23BD4D27.title: "&aPlace a Catcher"
	quest.25CB1BB0DA8F1897.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus with a &6glass bottle&r in the middle:"
		"&6Charm of Void's Salvation&r (Stabilized Warp Scroll, end stone bricks): saves you from the void."
		"&6Charm of Ender Serenity&r (pumpkin, chorus fruit): endermen do not get angry when you look at them."
		"Empty, the Imbuement Chamber recharges them."
	]
	quest.25CB1BB0DA8F1897.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: two rescuers in your bag."
	quest.25CB1BB0DA8F1897.title: "&bFill the End Charms"
	quest.25CDDBCCDA94E967.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: &6baked potato&r, &6steak&r, &6bowl&r, &6onion&r and &6cooked rice&r."
		""
		"A big meal that gives the Nourishment effect."
	]
	quest.25CDDBCCDA94E967.quest_subtitle: "No pot, straight from the grid."
	quest.25CDDBCCDA94E967.title: "&6Serve Steak and Potatoes"
	quest.25D4794FA27CA577.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_advanced_evap.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Controller:&r circuit, glass pane, circuit at the top, block, bucket, block in the middle, three blocks at the bottom. Build a tower with a &e4 by 4&r base, hollow, &e3 to 18&r high, with the controller and valves in the wall."
		""
		"Water in through the valve: &e10 mB of water&r become &e1 mB of brine&r, and brine sent in a second time gives lithium, also 10 to 1. The higher the tower and the warmer it is, the faster."
	]
	quest.25D4794FA27CA577.quest_subtitle: "Water becomes brine, brine becomes lithium."
	quest.25D4794FA27CA577.title: "&6&lBuild the Thermal Evaporation Plant"
	quest.25FFC372B76B6F5A.quest_desc: [
		"Nine &6Demon's Dream Fruits&r or seeds (mixed freely) in the crafting grid make &6Demon's Dream Essence&r. Drink it: Third Eye guaranteed and longer."
		""
		"Only with the Third Eye from Demon's Dream can you mine &6Otherworld Logs&r and &6Otherstone&r. The essence has side effects, good and bad."
		""
		"Thrown into Spiritfire it becomes &6Otherworld Essence&r, without the bad side effects. You need that later for traders, repairs and Susje's Circle."
	]
	quest.25FFC372B76B6F5A.quest_subtitle: "Nine fruits, a clear view."
	quest.25FFC372B76B6F5A.title: "&5Open the Third Eye"
	quest.260123291734044D.quest_desc: [
		"Each shapeless from a Mana Lens and one rune:"
		"&eVelocity Lens&r (Air): the burst flies much faster, but carries less and starts losing earlier."
		"&ePotency Lens&r (Fire): twice as much mana per burst, but slower."
		"&eResistance Lens&r (Earth): the burst flies much longer before it loses mana."
		"&eEfficiency Lens&r (Water): loses later and much more slowly."
		""
		"A &6slimeball&r or a &6honey bottle&r at the crafting table joins two different lenses into one."
	]
	quest.260123291734044D.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: faster, stronger, more economical."
	quest.260123291734044D.title: "&6Grind lenses from the elemental runes"
	quest.2601A102B4B93A06.quest_desc: [
		"Öffne deinen Punkt, Reiter &eNetzwerkauswahl&r. Dort steht jedes Netzwerk des Servers mit seinem Besitzer. Öffentliche verbindest du direkt, verschlüsselte nach dem Passwort, private nur, wenn der Besitzer dich eingetragen hat."
		""
		"So teilt ihr euch ein Kraftwerk: Einer baut den Reaktor und den Stecker, alle anderen setzen nur Punkte. Wer Strom gibt, sollte im Reiter Statistik ab und zu nachsehen, ob der Eingang noch über dem Ausgang liegt."
	]
	quest.2601A102B4B93A06.quest_subtitle: "Passwort rein, Strom raus."
	quest.2601A102B4B93A06.title: "&eHäng dich an ein fremdes Netz"
	quest.260723F843366317.quest_desc: [
		"Eine Simulation dauert &e12 Sekunden&r und frisst die ganze Zeit den Stromwert des Modells: ein Zombie &d128 FE/t&r, also rund 31.000 FE pro Durchlauf, ein Witherskelett &d768 FE/t&r, also rund 184.000 FE."
		""
		"&eAusgang 1, immer:&r eine &6Generalisierte Vorhersage&r. Oberwelt-Mobs geben die &aOverworld Prediction&r, Nether-Mobs die &cNether Prediction&r, Enderman, Shulker, Wither und Mimic die &5Ender Prediction&r (Stufe 4)."
		""
		"&eAusgang 2, mit Glück:&r eine &6Vorhersage des Mobs&r, zum Beispiel &6Blaze Prediction&r. Die Chance ist die Genauigkeit des Modells. Diese Vorhersage ist das, was der Loot-Fabrikator in Stufe 4 zu Drops macht."
		""
		"&eRedstone:&r Mit dem Knopf im Fenster stellst du ein, ob ein Signal die Kammer anhält oder startet. So kann ein Komparator am Ausgangslager sie bremsen, wenn genug da ist."
	]
	quest.260723F843366317.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 3. Zwölf Sekunden, eine Matrix, zwei Ausgänge."
	quest.260723F843366317.title: "&b&lWas eine Simulation ist"
	quest.260A6E3C2ECAA6E8.quest_desc: [
		"Kochtopf: &6Roher Kabeljau&r, &6Kartoffel&r, ein &6Ei&r und eine &6Tomate&r, Schüssel."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/baked_cod_stew.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.260A6E3C2ECAA6E8.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.260A6E3C2ECAA6E8.title: "&6Koch Kabeljaueintopf"
	quest.260EC40B9EB29AA6.quest_desc: [
		"&aFlowering&r: Flourishing log, 3 poppies, 3 dandelions, Earth Essence. &aOvergrowth&r: Flourishing log, 3 Magebloom, 2 Earth Essences."
		""
		"Flowering fills the surroundings with flowers and grass, each Source Gem +1 radius. Overgrowth fertilises blocks nearby; with a bone block it instead makes baby animals grow faster."
	]
	quest.260EC40B9EB29AA6.quest_subtitle: "Flowers and bone meal without a hand."
	quest.260EC40B9EB29AA6.title: "&aMake Flowering and Overgrowth"
	quest.2616A302A715AEE3.quest_desc: [
		"Am Zaubertisch kann ein Schwert &eSculk-Bann&r bekommen: pro Stufe &d2,5&r Schaden mehr gegen alle Sculk-Wesen, bis Stufe &d5&r. Das schließt Schärfe und Bann aus."
		""
		"Es trifft Zerschmetterte, Beobachter, Shriek-Würmer und auch den &4Wärter&r. Den brauchst du: &eKronwerke Core&r gibt Mobs in Stufe 3 &d70 Prozent&r mehr Leben, aus 500 werden 850 Lebenspunkte."
	]
	quest.2616A302A715AEE3.quest_subtitle: "Eine Schwertverzauberung nur gegen Sculk."
	quest.2616A302A715AEE3.title: "&bLern den Sculk-Bann"
	quest.2617F7531D087224.quest_desc: [
		"Glass, alloy, a water and a lava bucket. It makes stone or cobblestone where a machine needs it, for example in the Combiner, which builds ore blocks from raw ore and cobblestone in stage 4."
	]
	quest.2617F7531D087224.quest_subtitle: "Stone out of nothing."
	quest.2617F7531D087224.title: "&7Build a Stone Generator Upgrade"
	quest.262F25304F0CF4B2.quest_desc: [
		"The list on the right of every inventory is &6JEI&r. Hover over an item, whether in the list or in your inventory, and press &eR&r: EMI shows you every way to make it. &eU&r shows you everything it is used for."
		""
		"At the top of the recipe window you flip through the types: crafting table, furnace, millstone, Mana Pool and so on. &eBackspace&r jumps back to the previous recipe, &eEsc&r closes the window."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A recipe whose ingredients keep cycling takes any of the ingredients shown. No reason to be confused."
	]
	quest.262F25304F0CF4B2.quest_subtitle: "R for the recipe, U for its uses."
	quest.262F25304F0CF4B2.title: "&6Look up a recipe"
	quest.263ED650110DB737.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/the_end_cg_kill.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Go to the &6Altar of Void&r deep in the citadel. As soon as you are close enough, the &cEnder Guardian&r appears: &e333 health&r, armor 20."
		""
		"Its blows deal a percentage of your health (uppercut and rocket punch 10 percent), plus void runes with 9 damage. It smashes blocks around itself. Damage cap: 22 per hit, 13 per second, almost no damage from beyond 12 blocks, so get close."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r the &6Gauntlet of Guard&r (right click pulls enemies in), with a 10 percent chance a music disc. For a second fight the Boss Respawner takes an Eye of Void."
	]
	quest.263ED650110DB737.quest_subtitle: "The warden of the citadel."
	quest.263ED650110DB737.title: "&c&lDefeat the Ender Guardian"
	quest.264FBA6B685A325F.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &63 Cloggrum Ingots&r and &62 sticks&r like an iron pickaxe. Plus a &6Cloggrum Chestplate&r from 8 ingots."
		""
		"&eWhy keep it:&r Later you upgrade the pickaxe at the smithing table into the &6Forgotten Pickaxe&r. Only that one mines Dreadrock."
		""
		"Cloggrum Boots have an advantage: Scintling Goo does not slow you down with them."
	]
	quest.264FBA6B685A325F.quest_subtitle: "Keep it, it gets upgraded later."
	quest.264FBA6B685A325F.title: "&7Build a Cloggrum Pickaxe"
	quest.26552006DCDB4A9C.quest_desc: [
		"A &6zinc sheet&r over two &6copper sheets&r and one &6andesite alloy&r makes the &6adapter&r. The press makes the zinc sheet from a zinc ingot."
		""
		"It gives devices without terminals of their own a connection and also feeds FE machines, such as Mekanism's, from your grid."
	]
	quest.26552006DCDB4A9C.quest_subtitle: "Terminals for devices without terminals."
	quest.26552006DCDB4A9C.title: "&3Place an adapter"
	quest.2659AA9A33765995.quest_desc: [
		"&5Sevira's Permanent Confinement&r, 17x17: &e60 purple&r, &e20 lime&r, &e16 orange&r, &e12 red&r, &e8 foundation&r and &e8 dark signs, &e8 Crystals&r, &e8 skulls&r, &e8 candles&r."
		"It is started with the Afrit book, 300 seconds per ritual."
		""
		"&eWhat it makes:&r Afrit Miner, Artisanal Satchel, tier 3 stabiliser, Witherite Dust, Iesnium ritual bowl, Iesnium butcher knife, Dimensional Battlefield. With &e3 Otherworld Essence&r and a gem it repairs tools, armour and miners."
	]
	quest.2659AA9A33765995.quest_subtitle: "The pentacle for Afrit items."
	quest.2659AA9A33765995.title: "&5Draw Sevira's Permanent Confinement"
	quest.266777516EC1EE91.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/silent_gear_stone_anvil.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eBlueprint:&r &6six Blueprint Paper&r in the top two rows, &6one stick&r at the bottom middle. The hammer head needs &esix&r material."
		""
		"Slower than the pickaxe, and every block costs durability. A sinew binding and a leather grip pay off the most here."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Hammer for tunnels, FTB Ultimine for ore veins."
	]
	quest.266777516EC1EE91.quest_subtitle: "Nine blocks per hit."
	quest.266777516EC1EE91.title: "&6&lDig 3x3 with the hammer"
	quest.2677F850814764D9.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Aviar's Circle."
		"&6Bowls:&r one &6stone&r, &6granite&r, &6diorite&r and &6andesite&r each."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book."
		""
		"Throw kinds of stone to it, and it trades them for &6Otherstone&r, faster than Spiritfire. It decays after about an hour."
	]
	quest.2677F850814764D9.quest_subtitle: "Building material in bulk."
	quest.2677F850814764D9.title: "&dSummon the Otherstone trader"
	quest.267DEDA17587E487.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 Gaia Spirits&r, a &6floating flower&r, &e2 prismarine shards&r, a &6Dragonstone&r, &6Rune of Air&r and &6Rune of Earth&r."
		""
		"Struck on the ground, the shard lifts a sphere of about &e14 blocks&r radius high into the air. With more Gaia Spirits the radius grows block by block, up to &e33&r."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r Large shards take ten minutes or more until everything is up. Choose a place where nobody builds."
	]
	quest.267DEDA17587E487.quest_subtitle: "A floating island from your land."
	quest.267DEDA17587E487.title: "&dSmash a Shard of Laputa"
	quest.268436539E5EED74.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_pollinated.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Stell &6Espe&r und &6Buche&r (beide im Markt) an deine Zuchtstation, mit 10 Prozent pro Versuch entsteht die &6Hasel&r, die erste Art, die es nicht zu kaufen gibt."
		""
		"Ein &6bestäubtes Blatt&r sieht aus wie vorher. Halt ein &6Fernrohr&r in die Hand (Haupt- oder Nebenhand reicht, nicht hindurchschauen), dann sprühen bestäubte Blätter grüne Funken. Schlag das Blatt ab, und der &6Setzling der neuen Art&r fällt heraus, egal mit welchem Werkzeug."
		""
		"{image:minecraft:textures/item/spyglass.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Bestäubte Blätter zerfallen nie, auch wenn du den Baum fällst. Du kannst also erst den Stamm nehmen und danach in Ruhe suchen. Ein bestäubtes Blatt wird nicht noch einmal bestäubt, und Fruchtblätter werden nie bestäubt, nur normale Blätter."
		""
		"Pflanz den neuen Setzling, fäll den Baum, und seine normalen Blätter geben mit 5 Prozent (Glück III: 10) weitere Setzlinge. Ab zwei Setzlingen bist du die Art nie wieder los."
	]
	quest.268436539E5EED74.quest_subtitle: "Fernrohr raus, Blatt abschlagen, Setzling einstecken."
	quest.268436539E5EED74.title: "&eZüchte die Hasel"
	quest.268E0DBB1CEA34A1.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Dark Gems&r on top, a &6Dark Block&r in the middle, three &6Dark Gems&r at the bottom give the &6Sanguinary Pedestal&r. It sucks up all Blood Stains within 2 blocks, holds 10 buckets and pushes 100 mB per tick into every tank next to it."
		""
		"Put a &6Spiked Plate&r on top: every monster the plate kills gives its blood directly into the pedestal, 40 mB per health point. That way a zombie brings 800 mB without you being there."
		""
		"The &6Powered Sanguinary Pedestal&r (five Dark Power Gems, a Power Gem block, the old pedestal) reaches 4 blocks and gets one and a half times as much from every stain."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The Promises further down ask for 10, 40 and 160 buckets of blood. Build this farm before you start there."
	]
	quest.268E0DBB1CEA34A1.quest_subtitle: "Collect blood without lifting a finger."
	quest.268E0DBB1CEA34A1.title: "&4Build a Sanguinary Pedestal"
	quest.269E1FA8A9769676.quest_desc: [
		"Sammle &e3 Seelenkristalle&r. Jeder &4Beobachter&r lässt einen fallen, ganz selten liegt einer in einer Tempeltruhe."
		""
		"In Stufe 4 brauchst du einen für die &6Seelenelytren&r und zwei für den &6Schallstab&r. Wer jetzt Beobachter jagt, steht dann nicht mit leeren Händen da."
	]
	quest.269E1FA8A9769676.quest_subtitle: "Jeder Beobachter gibt einen."
	quest.269E1FA8A9769676.title: "&bLeg Seelenkristalle zurück"
	quest.26A16BE5D767DC8F.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: a &6diamond pickaxe&r."
		""
		"Behind &dHarm&r more damage, behind &dBreak&r one more mining level, behind Mageblock the block stays. You can place it several times, each one costs extra mana."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Two mining spells: cheap for stone, amplified for ores."
	]
	quest.26A16BE5D767DC8F.quest_subtitle: "More power for the link to its left."
	quest.26A16BE5D767DC8F.title: "&dLearn Amplify"
	quest.26AB1A4423157CE6.quest_desc: [
		"Have &e16 candles&r and &e4 dried sage bundles&r ready. Then your hut is done: herbs on the rack, cauldron steaming, sage against monsters, crows tidying up."
		""
		"Hexerei has no place in the stage goal. But whoever flies fast is ahead in every transport, and candles with regeneration or speed help at every community farm."
	]
	quest.26AB1A4423157CE6.quest_subtitle: "Candles, herbs, a broom at the door."
	quest.26AB1A4423157CE6.title: "&2&lFurnish a witch's house"
	quest.26AB540A3B4BCAF6.quest_desc: [
		"Chipped hat sechs Werkbänke, jede für eine Blockfamilie. Alle brauchen eine &6Werkbank&r in der Mitte:"
		""
		"&6Glasbläser&r (Eisen, Glas, Ziegelsteine, ein &6Schmelzofen&r unten): 21 Glasvarianten und ihre Scheiben, auch gefärbt."
		"&6Webstuhltisch&r (drei Wolle, zwei Stöcke, drei Stämme): Wolle und Teppiche, 20 Muster pro Farbe."
		"&6Bastlertisch&r (zwei Redstone-Fackeln, Redstone, Eisen, zwei Stämme): Laternen, Seelenlaternen, Redstone-Lampen, Eisengitter."
		"&6Botanikertisch&r (drei Blumentöpfe, zwei Holzstufen, zwei Stöcke): Laub, Erde, Lehm, Pilze, Eis."
		"&6Alchemietisch&r (Braustand oben, Zaubertisch unten, Holzstufen): Erz- und Edelsteinblöcke, Glowstone, Amethyst."
	]
	quest.26AB540A3B4BCAF6.quest_subtitle: "Glas, Wolle, Lampen, Pflanzen."
	quest.26AB540A3B4BCAF6.title: "&6Stell die anderen Werkbänke auf"
	quest.26B8179E0B2761F8.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &e64 netherrack&r. In the furnace it becomes &6Nether bricks&r, every &6Empty Blaze Burner&r holds one block."
		""
		"You need Nether bricks for the blast bricks of the Immersive Engineering blast furnace. A Create millstone grinds netherrack into cinder flour."
		""
		"Lit, netherrack burns forever. A good fireplace."
	]
	quest.26B8179E0B2761F8.quest_subtitle: "There is more than enough of it."
	quest.26B8179E0B2761F8.title: "&4Mine netherrack"
	quest.26B862E38D2E66A5.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Ummantelter Lüfter&r von Create, der durch ein &6Lagerfeuer&r bläst, räuchert alles in seinem Luftstrom, so wie ein Räucherofen. Leg die Nüsse aus deinen Pflanztöpfen auf ein Band, das am Lüfter vorbeiläuft, und hinten kommen sie geröstet an."
		""
		"Kisten rösten genauso, neun Nüsse in einem Stück. Weder Ofen noch Brennstoff, und das Lagerfeuer brennt von allein weiter."
	]
	quest.26B862E38D2E66A5.quest_subtitle: "Ein Band, ein Feuer, ganze Kisten auf einmal."
	quest.26B862E38D2E66A5.title: "&6Röste Nüsse mit dem Lüfter"
	quest.26C4940747B7A7AC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/theurgy_liquefaction.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Liquefaction Cauldron&r: copper, cauldron, copper over three stone, on the brazier. Sal Ammoniac in, click it with &6Raw Iron&r, heat it."
		""
		"One Raw Iron gives &e3 Iron Sulfur&r, an ore block &e5&r, an ingot only one. Each operation costs 10 mB of Sal Ammoniac, a bucket lasts for a hundred."
	]
	quest.26C4940747B7A7AC.quest_subtitle: "This is where the multiplying happens."
	quest.26C4940747B7A7AC.title: "&6Dissolve Sulfur from Raw Iron"
	quest.26C5589E348B9115.quest_desc: [
		"&6Linear Chassis&r: three logs with alloy above and below, three at a time. &6Radial Chassis&r: logs in a cross with alloy left and right."
		""
		"Coat one side with a &6slime ball&r: it takes all blocks in front of it along, up to &e16 blocks&r far. That is how whole saw wheels hang on one bearing."
	]
	quest.26C5589E348B9115.quest_subtitle: "Big contraptions without glue at every corner."
	quest.26C5589E348B9115.title: "&6Build a chassis"
	quest.26CA0066722FDE24.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion."
		"&6Bowls:&r &e3 leaf blocks&r, &e3 saplings&r, &e3 seeds&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book."
		""
		"With impure white chalk it becomes &aGreen Chalk&r for Osorin's Unbound Calling (stage 3, also needs pink and light blue chalk). On the side, the paste turns cobblestone into mossy cobblestone."
	]
	quest.26CA0066722FDE24.quest_subtitle: "Green for the wild spirits."
	quest.26CA0066722FDE24.title: "&aMix Nature Paste"
	quest.26D99DD63F3E5821.quest_desc: [
		"Put a &6Display Link&r on the station and point it at a &6Display Board&r. Choose the train information in the link: the board shows which train comes when and where it goes."
		""
		"How link and board are built is in &6Create: Brass&r."
	]
	quest.26D99DD63F3E5821.quest_subtitle: "When does the next train come?"
	quest.26D99DD63F3E5821.title: "&6Hang up a departure board"
	quest.26D9A6BE5191D78F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/exploration_e_lootr.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Open a chest in a structure and &cdon't mine it&r. Thanks to &6Lootr&r it has its own contents for every player."
		""
		"You can see on the chest whether you have opened it already. Whoever mines it takes the loot away from everyone after them. Barrels, minecarts with chests and frames with elytra work the same way."
	]
	quest.26D9A6BE5191D78F.quest_subtitle: "Every chest, new for every player."
	quest.26D9A6BE5191D78F.title: "&6Leave the chests standing"
	quest.26E0CFED88D85727.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r eine &6Andesitlegierung&r über drei &6Rahmenblöcken&r ergibt die &6Rahmensäge&r (Framing Saw). Rechtsklick öffnet sie: links die Rahmenblöcke hinein, rechts die Form aussuchen, das Suchfeld hilft bei über 200 Einträgen."
		""
		"Die Säge rechnet in &eMaterialwert&r: Ein Rahmenblock ist 6 144 wert, eine Schräge 3 072, eine Stufe 3 072, eine Ecksäule 1 536. Aus einem Rahmenblock werden also zwei Schrägen oder vier Ecksäulen, ohne Rest."
		""
		"An der Werkbank bekommst du aus drei Rahmenblöcken drei Schrägen, in der Säge sechs. Treppen: sechs Blöcke für vier an der Werkbank, drei Blöcke für vier in der Säge. Eine Tür kostet an der Werkbank zwei Blöcke, in der Säge einen halben."
		""
		"Manche Formen brauchen eine Zutat dazu, die Säge zeigt sie an: Fackeln Kohle, Druckplatten Eisen oder Gold, die Laterne eine Fackel, der Rahmen-Trichter eine Truhe."
		""
		"&eAusblick:&r Die &6Angetriebene Rahmensäge&r (dazu zwei Redstone) arbeitet von selbst, braucht aber 50 FE/t. Strom gibt es ab &6Stufe 2&r."
	]
	quest.26E0CFED88D85727.quest_subtitle: "Doppelt so viele Formen aus demselben Holz."
	quest.26E0CFED88D85727.title: "&6&lBau eine Rahmensäge"
	quest.26ECA6444DDF8B64.quest_desc: [
		"In the water cauldron (1 500 mB): your &6Broom Brush&r, &6Belladonna Flowers&r and &6Berries&r, &e2 Mandrake Roots&r, &6Mandrake&r, &6Mugwort&r and &6Yellow Dock Flowers&r."
		"On the Drying Rack it dries in &e2 minutes&r."
		""
		"It lasts &e200&r instead of 100, so twice as long."
	]
	quest.26ECA6444DDF8B64.quest_subtitle: "Twice as long in the air."
	quest.26ECA6444DDF8B64.title: "&6Tie an Enhanced Brush"
	quest.26EE0B03130837E5.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6gold block&r in the middle, &e4 Air Essences&r, &6Wilden Wing&r, &e2 shulker shells&r."
		""
		"Creatures above it float upward, sneaking you sink slowly. Several on top of each other reach higher. As long as someone is in the updraft, it costs source."
	]
	quest.26EE0B03130837E5.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: float instead of stairs."
	quest.26EE0B03130837E5.title: "&bBuild a Current Elevator"
	quest.26F32AEB935BBD8D.quest_desc: [
		"&6HDPE Reinforced Elytra:&r top HDPE, Atomic Alloy, HDPE, middle HDPE, an &6elytra&r from the End City, HDPE, two HDPE in the bottom corners. Then the module: Reinforced Alloy around the HDPE elytra and the Module Base, bottom polonium, an &5antimatter pellet&r, polonium."
		""
		"The MekaSuit then glides as with an elytra, without giving up the chest slot. Per the config it costs 12,800 FE per second of flight."
	]
	quest.26F32AEB935BBD8D.quest_subtitle: "The Elytra Unit."
	quest.26F32AEB935BBD8D.title: "&5Build Wings into the MekaSuit"
	quest.26F467F182FEE1BF.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 stone&r (any kind) around &e1 Source Gem&r make &e8 sourcestone&r."
		""
		"The base for pedestals, Arcane Core and apparatus. The stonecutter has many variants for building, and with Ars Additions also doors, buttons and walls."
	]
	quest.26F467F182FEE1BF.quest_subtitle: "Stone with a gem inside."
	quest.26F467F182FEE1BF.title: "&6Make sourcestone"
	quest.26F5F69208721FCE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Comfort&r: magnets and other little helpers. &6Building&r: framed blocks, Chipped, Supplementaries and tips for a base that looks good on stream."
	]
	quest.26F5F69208721FCE.quest_subtitle: "The small mods that make the day easier."
	quest.26F5F69208721FCE.title: "&6Open Comfort and Building"
	quest.26F7198DDB281846.quest_desc: [
		"Eine Hülle aus &6Reaktorwänden&r (bis 64 Blöcke Kantenlänge), innen &6Brennstäbe&r, &6Wärmerohre&r, &6Absorber&r und &6Lüfter&r, ein &6Controller&r und Anschlüsse für Brennstoff und Strom in der Wand."
		""
		"&eOritech, Reaktor:&r Brennstoff Uranstäbe, &d64 FE je Reaktorpuls&r, Puffer 50 Millionen, Abgabe &d25 000 FE/t je Energieanschluss&r. Über 2 000 Hitze schmilzt er, der sichere Modus ist auf diesem Server &caus&r. &eSpeicher:&r der &6Kleine Energiespeicher&r fasst 1 Million FE (5 000 FE/t), der &6Große&r 20 Millionen (10 000 FE/t), Oritech-&6Energierohre&r verbinden alles. Offen ab Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.26F7198DDB281846.quest_subtitle: "Oritech, Kernreaktor, bis 25 000 FE/t je Energieanschluss."
	quest.26F7198DDB281846.title: "&cBau den Oritech-Reaktor"
	quest.26F99701DE6670F8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Tigerseye&r (yellow, brown, orange, lime, Rune of Autumn): creepers don't explode and flee from players."
		"&6Fallen Kanade&r (2 white, 2 yellow, 1 orange, Rune of Spring): regeneration for players and tame animals."
		"&6Medumone&r (2 brown, 2 grey, Rune of Earth, Redstone Root): holds every creature except players in place."
	]
	quest.26F99701DE6670F8.quest_subtitle: "Three guards, one line per flower."
	quest.26F99701DE6670F8.title: "&6Protect the base with flowers"
	quest.26FAD4527FC1D4FB.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6slime blocks&r at the top and sides, a &6milk bucket&r in the middle, at the bottom &6redstone&r, &6Advanced Frame&r, redstone."
		""
		"It needs both at the same time: &6slime balls&r in the slot and &6milk&r in the tank. The Animal Rancher gets milk from cows."
	]
	quest.26FAD4527FC1D4FB.quest_subtitle: "Slime balls and milk."
	quest.26FAD4527FC1D4FB.title: "&aSet Up a Slimey Mycelial Generator"
	quest.270AB5C03077AD8B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Spellcaster Bag&r: Trinkets Pouch with 2 Manipulation Essences, 2 blaze powder, 2 gold blocks. Bigger and dyeable."
		"&6Bubble Elevator&r: soul sand with Air and Water Essence, 4 prismarine shards. Lifts creatures in water like a bubble column."
		"&6Magma Elevator&r: soul sand with Air and Fire Essence, 4 magma blocks. Carries you up through lava, with fire resistance. Sneaking lets you sink."
	]
	quest.270AB5C03077AD8B.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: Spellcaster Bag and current lifts."
	quest.270AB5C03077AD8B.title: "&6Build a bag and lifts"
	quest.27113244210B8900.quest_desc: [
		"Forge &6helmet&r, &6chestplate&r, &6leggings&r and &6boots&r from Deepsilver Ingots, like iron. It makes you immune to certain harmful effects, the tooltip shows which and whether the full set is needed."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r In stage 4 hostile mobs have &d120 percent&r more health, &d75 percent&r more damage and &d7&r extra armor points, the inhabitants of this dimension too. Do not go without full armor."
	]
	quest.27113244210B8900.quest_subtitle: "The first armor of the star world."
	quest.27113244210B8900.title: "&7Wear Full Deepsilver Armor"
	quest.271428BF38732875.quest_desc: [
		"&e5 sticks&r around a &6leaf block&r make the &6Dowsing Rod&r."
		""
		"Sneaking right click switches between swamp and jungle, right click looks for a new target. Healthy leaves on the rod mean: right direction. Wilted ones mean: wrong."
	]
	quest.271428BF38732875.quest_subtitle: "The way to the swamp."
	quest.271428BF38732875.title: "&6Build a Dowsing Rod"
	quest.27150228414A47B6.quest_desc: [
		"Instead of water you can pump &6sodium&r into the coolant port. The reactor turns it into &6superheated sodium&r instead of steam. Sodium cools better than water."
		""
		"The hot sodium goes into the &6Thermoelectric Boiler&r from stage 3. It takes it as a heat source instead of resistive heaters, boils water into steam for the turbine and returns the cooled sodium. A loop without loss."
		""
		"Sodium comes with chlorine: brine in the Electrolytic Separator, see the chapter &5Mekanism&r. Whoever has collected it since stage 2 is glad now."
	]
	quest.27150228414A47B6.quest_subtitle: "The steam is made in the boiler."
	quest.27150228414A47B6.title: "&bCool with Sodium"
	quest.271A4FC16C7BED10.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.journeymap.map_toggle_alt\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" for \"},{\"text\":\"JourneyMap\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"'s big map, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.journeymap.create_waypoint\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" sets a waypoint where you stand, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.journeymap.fullscreen_waypoints\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" opens the waypoint list in the map. Waypoints glow in the world as a pillar, with name and distance.\"}]"
		""
		"On death JourneyMap creates a waypoint by itself. With the FTB Chunks map (&eM&r) you can also share waypoints with your team or the whole server."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Both mods bring a minimap, two is one too many. Turn one off in the settings, for example the FTB Chunks one via the &etoggle minimap&r key in the controls."
	]
	quest.271A4FC16C7BED10.quest_subtitle: "JourneyMap, waypoints and two minimaps."
	quest.271A4FC16C7BED10.title: "&aFind Your Way"
	quest.272177F2A37920CE.quest_desc: [
		"Throw an &6Iron Bee&r spawn egg into a &aMana Pool&r, &d10,000 mana&r. Flower: &6manasteel block&r. The comb gives 1 to 2 &6manasteel nuggets&r with 60 percent. These bees do not breed with each other. On the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate their egg becomes a Terrasteel Bee with mana diamond and mana pearl for 500,000 mana."
	]
	quest.272177F2A37920CE.quest_subtitle: "Manasteel nuggets from combs."
	quest.272177F2A37920CE.title: "&bTurn an Egg into a Manasteel Bee"
	quest.27226D742FCE5053.quest_desc: [
		"In der &6Treasure Chest&r des Bronze-Dungeons liegt mit Glück der &6Hammer of Kingbdogz&r. Lootr gibt jedem Spieler seine eigene Truhe, ihr könnt also alle euer Glück versuchen."
		""
		"Der Hammer schießt schwere Geschosse auf Gegner. Probier ihn an einem &6Zephyr&r aus, der dich vorher von der Insel geschubst hat."
	]
	quest.27226D742FCE5053.quest_subtitle: "Eine Waffe aus der Schatzkammer des Sliders."
	quest.27226D742FCE5053.title: "&6Hol den Hammer of Kingbdogz"
	quest.27255D3C2EA07E44.quest_desc: [
		"&6String&r, two &6glass&r and a &6Golden Sheet&r make the &6Engineer's Goggles&r. Look at a machine with them: speed, SU, usage and tank contents show up."
		"{image:create:textures/item/goggles.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Without goggles you build blind. Combined with a helmet in the grid they sit firmly on it, and the helmet still protects."
	]
	quest.27255D3C2EA07E44.quest_subtitle: "See why a setup stopped."
	quest.27255D3C2EA07E44.title: "&6Put on the Engineer's Goggles"
	quest.2729F2D79A654B65.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_bench.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"An &6iron ingot&r and two &6Treated Wood Slabs&r on top, below the &6Engineer's Crafting Table&r and a &6Treated Wood Fence&r make the &6Engineer's Workbench&r."
		""
		"&6Blueprint Components:&r copper, lead and iron on top, three blue dye, three paper. Blueprint into the window on the left, ingredients into the middle, on the right you see what you can make of them."
	]
	quest.2729F2D79A654B65.quest_subtitle: "The table for blueprints."
	quest.2729F2D79A654B65.title: "&6Build an Engineer's Workbench"
	quest.272FE9EFA8115D91.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/start_here_v_claim.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Pick a spot, build something solid and secure it: &eM&r opens the map, &eC&r the claim view. Hold the &eleft mouse button&r and drag across the chunks of your base."
		""
		"In your chunks nobody outside your team can break blocks or open chests. How many chunks you have and how to keep them loaded is in the chapter &6Tips and Tricks&r."
		""
		"At night the creatures of &6Born in Chaos&r roam alongside zombies and skeletons, and some of them are tough. Light and walls help as always."
	]
	quest.272FE9EFA8115D91.quest_subtitle: "M, then C, then drag across the chunks."
	quest.272FE9EFA8115D91.title: "&6Secure your base"
	quest.27376AC476255000.quest_desc: [
		"Steel at the top, in the middle Energy Tablet, &6Atomic Alloy&r, Energy Tablet, at the bottom Refined Obsidian, Personal Chest, Refined Obsidian."
		""
		"The Robit follows you, picks up items and charges itself on a Chargepad. Above all it is the heart of the Digital Miner."
	]
	quest.27376AC476255000.quest_subtitle: "A helper on wheels."
	quest.27376AC476255000.title: "&eBuild a Robit"
	quest.2738016492573B84.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_drawers_4.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Four wooden chests&r in the corners, &6five planks&r in between. Gives &efour&r drawers."
		""
		"Four compartments with &e8 stacks&r each, the best choice for many kinds: ores, ingots, dyes, mob drops. With the Deposit Upgrade in the backpack you stock the wall with one click per drawer."
	]
	quest.2738016492573B84.quest_subtitle: "2x2 drawers for the colourful mix."
	quest.2738016492573B84.title: "Build a drawer wall"
	quest.273B796CE12BB60B.quest_desc: [
		"Denizens drop a &6Mysterious Mask&r with a &d5 percent&r chance when you slay them. Looting raises the chance a little. Sometimes one lies in the camp chests."
		""
		"&cRemember:&r Whoever destroys their campfire has the whole camp against them."
	]
	quest.273B796CE12BB60B.quest_subtitle: "Rare, and only from the Denizens."
	quest.273B796CE12BB60B.title: "&6Get a Mysterious Mask"
	quest.273CFA8D7D1821CC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Draconium Ingots&r in the corners, an &6elytra&r at the top, a &6firework rocket&r at the bottom, a &6Draconium Core&r left and right, a &6Module Core&r in the middle."
		""
		"In the chestpiece it lets you fly. You find elytra on the End Ships."
	]
	quest.273CFA8D7D1821CC.quest_subtitle: "Flying without an elytra on your back."
	quest.273CFA8D7D1821CC.title: "&dBuild a Wyvern Flight Module"
	quest.273E77C05ED4D437.quest_desc: [
		"You get onto the server through the &9Discord&r: solve the captcha, then a streamer gives you a spot on the whitelist. &cWhoever leaves the Discord also leaves the whitelist.&r"
		""
		"If you played in &6Season 1&r, use &e/link&r with your Minecraft name in the Discord and get two spots of your own for friends."
		""
		"Dates for the stage finales and events are posted there first."
	]
	quest.273E77C05ED4D437.quest_subtitle: "This is where the season is organized."
	quest.273E77C05ED4D437.title: "&9Join the Discord"
	quest.274834A235E09223.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Source Jar&r in the middle, around it up to four &6Imbuement Chambers&r, each no more than &e2 blocks&r from the jar. Above each chamber a hopper with &6amethyst shards&r or &6lapis lazuli&r, below it a hopper into a shared chest."
		""
		"Each gem costs &d500 Source&r. The jar is fed by your Sourceberries, Sourcelinks and whatever other Source you have."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A hopper collects the gems in a chest that you carry to the obelisk. Each one counts &e4 points&r for the magic pillar."
	]
	quest.274834A235E09223.quest_subtitle: "Several chambers around one jar, hoppers in and out."
	quest.274834A235E09223.title: "&dBuild a gem plant"
	quest.274ED757289F3761.quest_desc: [
		"Press &eF3&r. Top left shows &eFPS&r, your frames per second. If they are low, the lag is on your side: render distance in the video settings to &e8 chunks&r, particles to &eDecreased&r, clouds off. That does more than any other setting."
		""
		"If the FPS are high but blocks come back after mining and doors react late, it is the &eserver&r. Nothing on your side helps then; say so in chat, and the team checks whose machine is slowing the world down."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Huge Create builds and lots of items on the ground cost the server the most. A hopper into a chest instead of a pile of cobblestone on the ground helps everyone."
	]
	quest.274ED757289F3761.quest_subtitle: "On your side or the server's, that is the difference."
	quest.274ED757289F3761.title: "&6Find out where the lag comes from"
	quest.276438D2CFD81BB2.quest_desc: [
		"Put &6iron ingots&r, &6copper ingots&r and &6gold ingots&r on the depot under the press. Every ingot becomes a sheet."
		"{image:create:textures/item/iron_sheet.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"&6Iron Sheet&r: propeller, whisk, chute, Super Glue. &6Copper Sheet&r: pipes and tanks. &6Golden Sheet&r: goggles, wrench, ejector."
	]
	quest.276438D2CFD81BB2.quest_subtitle: "Iron, copper and gold get flat."
	quest.276438D2CFD81BB2.title: "&6Press sheets"
	quest.2768BECF711443FC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Deny Item Scroll&r: shapeless Blank Parchment and cobblestone. &6Mimic Item Scroll&r: shapeless Allow Item Scroll and chest."
		""
		"You write items in by putting the scroll on the Scribe's Table and clicking items onto it while sneaking. With Allow the Starbuncle only takes these items, with Deny everything except these."
		""
		"The Mimic scroll goes into a frame on a chest: then only items that are already in the chest end up there. That way a Starbuncle sorts a whole storage room."
	]
	quest.2768BECF711443FC.quest_subtitle: "Allow, deny, mimic."
	quest.2768BECF711443FC.title: "&dFilter your helpers"
	quest.276A1B8B0C11DBC0.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ihagan's Enthrallment, all with the Djinni book."
		"&6Enderman:&r bone, string, end stone, rotten flesh, &cSacrifice:&r pig. &6Ghast:&r 2 soul sand, 2 magma blocks, netherrack, lava bucket, diamond, &cSacrifice:&r cow."
		"&6Blaze:&r fire charge, firework star, torch, candle, gold and copper ingot, &cSacrifice:&r chicken."
		""
		"The Enderman always drops an &6ender pearl&r, the Ghast always a &6ghast tear&r, the Blaze Nether plants and Nether blocks. The bee for Cursed Honey is in the Afrit chapter."
	]
	quest.276A1B8B0C11DBC0.quest_subtitle: "Pearls and tears without searching."
	quest.276A1B8B0C11DBC0.title: "&5Summon possessed Nether mobs"
	quest.276A40F6ED9B2FA8.quest_desc: [
		"Nine &5Draconium Ingots&r at the crafting table make one &5Draconium Block&r. Back works the same way."
		""
		"You need blocks for the Wyvern injector (one each) and as the shell of the Energy Core. Tier 3 of the core alone eats 26 blocks, so 234 ingots."
	]
	quest.276A40F6ED9B2FA8.quest_subtitle: "Nine ingots, one block."
	quest.276A40F6ED9B2FA8.title: "&5Press Draconium Blocks"
	quest.27714EB0A5C1477F.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6glass bottle&r in the middle, &6leather boots&r and a &6powder snow bucket&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"With the charm, powder snow carries you instead of you sinking into it. In snowy mountains and groves that saves a lot of trouble."
		""
		"Like the other charms, the Imbuement Chamber recharges it when it is empty."
	]
	quest.27714EB0A5C1477F.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: walk on powder snow."
	quest.27714EB0A5C1477F.title: "&6Fill the Charm of Snowstride"
	quest.27771EEE904D63E2.quest_desc: [
		"Tin, redstone, a Steel Casing and an Energy Tablet. It turns power into heat, by the server config at &e60 percent&r efficiency."
		""
		"&6Thermodynamic Conductors&r carry the heat to the boiler. The Fuelwood Heater does the same with fuel."
	]
	quest.27771EEE904D63E2.quest_subtitle: "Power becomes heat."
	quest.27771EEE904D63E2.title: "&cBuild a Resistive Heater"
	quest.277D6E4C6EE06DEA.quest_desc: [
		"&6AppleSkin&r shows in the tooltip of every food how much hunger and &esaturation&r it gives. When you hold food, the hunger bar flashes to show how far it will fill."
		""
		"The yellow outline of the drumsticks is your saturation. As long as it is there, hunger does not drop. Meals from &6Farmer's Delight&r give a lot of it, Ultimine and sprinting use it up quickly."
	]
	quest.277D6E4C6EE06DEA.quest_subtitle: "Saturation is what counts."
	quest.277D6E4C6EE06DEA.title: "&6Read the hunger bar more closely"
	quest.277F8A83983678C7.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_copper_tier.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Eight copper ingots&r around a &6lever&r: the &6Basic to Copper Tier Upgrade&r. Right click the placed barrel with it, done."
		""
		"27 slots become &e45&r, the contents stay. With Create ore processing you have copper in bulk."
	]
	quest.277F8A83983678C7.quest_subtitle: "Copper is made for exactly this."
	quest.277F8A83983678C7.title: "Upgrade to copper"
	quest.27809909862773DA.quest_desc: [
		"In the mortar: one each of &6wheat, pumpkin, melon&r and &6beetroot seeds&r and a &6Sage Seed&r."
		""
		"The &6Seed Mixture&r is the crows' favourite food and the way to tame them."
	]
	quest.27809909862773DA.quest_subtitle: "A treat for crows."
	quest.27809909862773DA.title: "&6Mix Seed Mixture"
	quest.278B3C9DD0AB3709.quest_desc: [
		"&6Goblet&r: four &6Arcane Gold&r. Place it on the altar, that gives +2 Capacity. Kill an animal right above it, then sing &5Wicked, Blood, Wicked&r."
		""
		"Sacrifices are worth a lot to the patron, but they also only work once a day."
	]
	quest.278B3C9DD0AB3709.quest_subtitle: "Blood for the Dark Lord."
	quest.278B3C9DD0AB3709.title: "&cSacrifice in the Goblet"
	quest.2791066338D23456.quest_desc: [
		"Stahlspitzhacke, Stahlaxt und Stahlschaufel mit zwei Stöcken ergeben die &6Stahlpaxel&r. Stahl kommt aus der Infusionsanlage, Kapitel &5Mekanism&r."
		""
		"1 000 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 8, 8 Schaden. &6Raffiniertes Glowstone&r gräbt mit Tempo 15, hält aber nur 768. Stahlrüstung: 20 Punkte, Zähigkeit 2."
	]
	quest.2791066338D23456.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism Tools: drei Werkzeuge, 1 000 Haltbarkeit."
	quest.2791066338D23456.title: "&7Bau die Stahlpaxel"
	quest.27974A7B886B935B.quest_desc: [
		"Setz einen &6Flux-Punkt&r im Nether oder im End und verbinde ihn mit deinem Netz. Er bekommt den Strom von deinem Stecker in der Oberwelt, ohne Verlust und ohne Kabel durchs Portal."
		""
		"So läuft eine Lavapumpe im Nether, eine Mob-Farm im End oder ein Außenposten in einer anderen Welt am selben Kraftwerk wie die Basis."
		""
		"Damit der Punkt arbeitet, muss sein Chunk geladen sein: Du bist dort, oder du schaltest an ihm &eChunk laden&r ein."
	]
	quest.27974A7B886B935B.quest_subtitle: "Ein Punkt im Nether, der Stecker zu Hause."
	quest.27974A7B886B935B.title: "&5Bring Strom in eine andere Dimension"
	quest.279B624240266ED9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_station.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Pflanz zwei verschiedene Bäume so, dass Blätter von beiden höchstens &e4 Blöcke&r von einem &6Bienennest&r oder &6Bienenstock&r entfernt sind, und setz Blumen daneben. Jedes Mal, wenn eine Biene mit Pollen von einer Blume heimkommt, versucht sie &eeinmal&r, ein Blatt in diesem Würfel zu bestäuben."
		""
		"So läuft ein Versuch: Die Biene sammelt alle Blattarten im 9x9x9-Würfel um den Stock, sucht alle Kreuzungen, die aus zwei davon möglich sind, würfelt eine aus und prüft deren Chance. Klappt es, wird ein Blatt eines der beiden Eltern zum &6bestäubten Blatt&r."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Mehrere Stöcke mit je drei Bienen vervielfachen die Versuche. Stell nur die zwei Bäume in Reichweite, die du kreuzen willst, sonst würfelt die Biene auch die unerwünschten Paare aus. Die erste Kreuzung, Eiche und Birke zur Buche, steht im Kapitel &6Kochen&r."
	]
	quest.279B624240266ED9.quest_subtitle: "Ein Bienenstock, zwei Bäume, Blumen, Geduld."
	quest.279B624240266ED9.title: "&e&lBau eine Zuchtstation"
	quest.279CDC4A076A8401.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Manaweave Cloth&r on top of each other, a &6sunflower&r below."
		""
		"Placed, it shortens rain and snowstorms. Give it a sunflower in bad weather (right click or throw) and the sun comes back. A comparator next to it reports bad weather."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r A &6blue orchid&r spoils its mood, and the weather along with it."
	]
	quest.279CDC4A076A8401.quest_subtitle: "Less rain over the base."
	quest.279CDC4A076A8401.title: "&6Hang up a Teru Teru Bozu"
	quest.279E94B5E730EEF2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Medium Satchel:&r Small Satchel, &e6 leather&r and a &6string&r in the water cauldron (500 mB). &6Large Satchel:&r Small and Medium Satchel, &e2 leather&r, &e4 strings&r, water as well."
		""
		"The large bag gives the broom &e27 slots&r. It goes into the satchel slot, so only one bag per broom."
	]
	quest.279E94B5E730EEF2.quest_subtitle: "27 slots on the broom."
	quest.279E94B5E730EEF2.title: "&6Sew a Large Satchel"
	quest.279FC42535D19652.quest_desc: [
		"Material: &e4 Air Agglomeratio&r (glass bottle, gravel, dirt, clay)."
		""
		"Plus &e4 Inferium Essence&r and a &6Prosperity Seed Base&r in the Infusion Altar."
	]
	quest.279FC42535D19652.quest_subtitle: "One seed, one checkmark."
	quest.279FC42535D19652.title: "Seed: Air"
	quest.27A61206FA93B3A0.quest_desc: [
		"Inferium-Werkzeug in die Mitte, 2 Prudentiumbarren und 2 Prudentium-Edelsteine drumherum. Verzauberungen bleiben."
		""
		"2 800 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 11, +6 Schaden. Mit dem &6Basteltisch&r (Soulium) setzt du jetzt Augmente ein. Dasselbe Muster noch zweimal: Tertium in Stufe 3 (4 000, Tempo 14, +9), Imperium in Stufe 4 (6 000, Tempo 19, +13)."
	]
	quest.27A61206FA93B3A0.quest_subtitle: "Mystical Agriculture: 2 800 Haltbarkeit."
	quest.27A61206FA93B3A0.title: "&aVeredle auf Prudentium"
	quest.27AFB6F580D161C9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Redstone Writer:&r a redstone block above redstone, Output Transformer, redstone. Put a card with true or false into the aspect &eBoolean&r, then it gives out redstone."
		""
		"With a comparison card from the programmer it only switches when a condition holds: chest full, tank empty, day or night."
	]
	quest.27AFB6F580D161C9.quest_subtitle: "The Redstone Writer."
	quest.27AFB6F580D161C9.title: "&9Switch a lamp with a card"
	quest.27B62C8AC9426847.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/logistics_xnet_connectors.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6Connector&r next to every machine or chest, &6Network Cables&r from there to the controller. Four colours, different colours do not connect, so two networks run close beside each other."
		""
		"Give every connector a name. In the controller you create a channel, click the channel's field at the connector and set &einsert&r or &eextract&r, priority and filter. &6Facades&r hide cables behind blocks."
	]
	quest.27B62C8AC9426847.quest_subtitle: "Thin, colourful, unobtrusive."
	quest.27B62C8AC9426847.title: "&ePlace connectors and cables"
	quest.27B6E481044EF248.quest_desc: [
		"&6Steel ingots&r and &6Treated Sticks&r make steel tools as with iron. Steel Plates and Treated Wood around a shield make the &6Heavy Plated Shield&r."
		""
		"Just right for the long digs for nickel and silver."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/tool_pickaxe_steel.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.27B6E481044EF248.quest_subtitle: "Lasts much longer than iron."
	quest.27B6E481044EF248.title: "&7Forge a steel pickaxe"
	quest.27BF63FFBC3E914D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_squeezer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e4 Wooden Barrels, 1 piston, 2 Light Engineering Blocks, 1 Redstone Engineering Block, 6 Steel Scaffolding, 3 Steel Fences, 2 fluid pipes&r. Hammer on the middle barrel on the side of the Redstone block."
		""
		"&eIn:&r through the two blue marked hatches at the back. &eOut:&r items at the orange hatch, fluid below it. &6Hemp seeds&r give 120 mB of Plant Oil, wheat seeds 80 mB. Wooden Barrel: three treated wood slabs over five treated planks."
	]
	quest.27BF63FFBC3E914D.quest_subtitle: "3x3x3, seeds in, Plant Oil out."
	quest.27BF63FFBC3E914D.title: "&eForm an Industrial Squeezer"
	quest.27C2CEB58930B967.quest_desc: [
		"First the &6Otherworldly Tablet&r: &6Otherstone&r in the middle, &e4 gold ingots&r on the sides, &e4 Otherworld Ashes&r in the corners."
		""
		"&5Pentacle:&r Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion."
		"&6Bowls:&r the tablet, &6Research Fragment Dust&r, a &6Spirit Attuned Gem&r, an &6ender pearl&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book, 60 seconds."
		""
		"Right click stores all your experience, sneaking right click gives it back. With very large amounts a small rest is lost to rounding. This way you can also pass experience on to other players."
	]
	quest.27C2CEB58930B967.quest_subtitle: "Experience in stock."
	quest.27C2CEB58930B967.title: "&6Bind a Knowledge Tablet"
	quest.27CB62653A416B09.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6cogwheels&r around a &6Rotation Speed Controller&r give a &6Brass Gearbox&r. Each of its four sides can be set to forward or reverse separately with the wrench."
		""
		"The &6Six-way Gearbox&r (Andesite Casing, three cogwheels and two large cogwheels, or a gearbox plus two large cogwheels) has shafts on all six sides, top and bottom at half speed. The &6Cross Connector&r (four shafts around a gearbox) runs two shafts independently through the same block."
		""
		"Plus the &6Dashboard&r (display board on Brass Casing), a small display with four lines whose content players on a seat in front of it see as an overlay, and the &6Brass Chute&r, which moves 64 items at once."
	]
	quest.27CB62653A416B09.quest_subtitle: "Create Connected: gearboxes that can do more."
	quest.27CB62653A416B09.title: "&6Build a Brass Gearbox"
	quest.27CF1C4B1B39A4D0.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6Arcane Essence&r around a block of &6wool&r (any color) give an &6Arcane Cloth&r."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/magic_cloth.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The wizard armor is made from the cloth: 5 for hat or hood, 8 for the robe, 7 for the leggings, 4 for the boots. A whole set is 24 cloth, so 192 essences. Start with the hat."
	]
	quest.27CF1C4B1B39A4D0.quest_subtitle: "Eight essences around a wool."
	quest.27CF1C4B1B39A4D0.title: "&dWeave Arcane Cloth"
	quest.27D6C68140ACD32B.quest_desc: [
		"A &6precision mechanism&r on a &6brass casing&r makes the &6Rotation Speed Controller&r. It sets a large cogwheel above it to up to 256 RPM through its value panel, in both directions."
		""
		"More speed means more consumption from the same capacity."
	]
	quest.27D6C68140ACD32B.quest_subtitle: "The Rotation Speed Controller."
	quest.27D6C68140ACD32B.title: "&6Set the speed exactly"
	quest.27DB12A43DAC9AA8.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eidolon_brazier.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Brazier&r: three &6Pewter&r at the top, a &6block of coal&r below, two sticks as legs. &6Stone Hand&r: stone slabs and stone, see EMI."
		""
		"Ritual: item on the brazier, further ingredients on Stone Hands around it, light it with &6flint and steel&r. An empty hand puts it out and ends the ritual."
	]
	quest.27DB12A43DAC9AA8.quest_subtitle: "The place for rituals."
	quest.27DB12A43DAC9AA8.title: "&6Build a Brazier and Stone Hands"
	quest.27DF6FBCD9173F7B.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &6Managlass&r into the portal. One &6Alfglass&r comes back per block."
		""
		"Alfglass is very clear and its pattern changes with its position. More important: the flasks for ender essence are made from it."
	]
	quest.27DF6FBCD9173F7B.quest_subtitle: "It becomes the Alfglass Flasks."
	quest.27DF6FBCD9173F7B.title: "&bTrade Managlass for Alfglass"
	quest.27E215BE394C3AA5.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding."
		"&6Bowls:&r an &6Otherstone Frame&r, an &6ender pearl&r, a &6crying obsidian&r, an &6Iesnium ingot&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book, 150 seconds."
		""
		"Right click to put a &6compass&r inside, sneak right click takes it out again. A plain compass leads to the world spawn, a compass bound to a &6lodestone&r to the lodestone. You may even mine the lodestone afterwards."
		""
		"A recovery compass takes you to the place of your last death. A compass named &eHOME&r takes you to your spawn point."
	]
	quest.27E215BE394C3AA5.quest_subtitle: "A small portal for quick trips."
	quest.27E215BE394C3AA5.title: "&6Build an Entity Wormhole"
	quest.27FA2E9748AF438F.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Gaia Spirits&r, &e3 Dragonstones&r and &e2 Dreamwood Twigs&r, as shown in EMI."
		""
		"Used, the rod summons countless magic projectiles from mana that seek random targets. Strongest against large groups."
		""
		"In the &6Livingwood Avatar&r it attacks monsters near it by itself, with the Avatar's mana. A good guard for the base entrance."
	]
	quest.27FA2E9748AF438F.quest_subtitle: "A swarm of homing projectiles."
	quest.27FA2E9748AF438F.title: "&dCarve the Rod of the Unstable Reservoir"
	quest.2801D673E14D450F.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Scryer's Crystal&r in the middle, &e4 blaze powder&r and &e4 ender pearls&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Use the eye on a placed Scryer's Crystal to bind it, or hold a bound &6Scryer's Scroll&r in your off hand. The inscribed spell then works at the crystal, like a spell turret, but with you as the caster."
		""
		"Good for teleporting or moving items from a distance."
	]
	quest.2801D673E14D450F.quest_subtitle: "Casting through a crystal."
	quest.2801D673E14D450F.title: "&6Build the Enchanter's Eye"
	quest.280777933A7972A3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Six stone&r, &6redstone&r on top, a &6drawer&r in the middle, a &6hopper&r at the bottom."
		""
		"It pushes into the block next to it as fast as the Puller pulls. A drawer full of coal supplies furnaces or a belt that way. Create funnels work without an upgrade too; drawers are normal inventories."
	]
	quest.280777933A7972A3.quest_subtitle: "The Pusher Upgrade."
	quest.280777933A7972A3.title: "Let the drawer push on its own"
	quest.280F4CCBBF5D04BE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/food_f_pot.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Top &6brick, wooden shovel, brick&r. Middle &6iron ingot, water bucket, iron ingot&r. Bottom three &6iron ingots&r. Place it on the stove."
		""
		"Up to six ingredients on the left, next to them the container, usually a &6bowl&r. Finished servings stay in the pot until you take them out."
		""
		"You can mine the pot with its contents and set it up again somewhere else."
	]
	quest.280F4CCBBF5D04BE.quest_subtitle: "Soups, stews and meals."
	quest.280F4CCBBF5D04BE.title: "&6&lSet up a Cooking Pot"
	quest.280F82D346F7CD79.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Rotary Condensentrator in decondensing mode from water, 1 to 1."
		"&eUsed by:&r the Infuser for sulfuric acid."
	]
	quest.280F82D346F7CD79.quest_subtitle: "Water in the Rotary Condensentrator."
	quest.280F82D346F7CD79.title: "&fWater vapour"
	quest.281D8DAABEF8ABDA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Kelp Handle&r: three dried kelp and an Andesite Alloy. The &6Chemical Sprayer&r is a recipe for the crafting units: two Kelp Handles, &6Precision Mechanism&r, &6copper block&r, dried kelp and a &6Fluid Pipe&r."
		""
		"A &6Spout&r fills it with any fluid, right click sprays it. Water puts out fire. If a deployer puts a &6Lighter&r (brass sheets, string, Andesite Alloy, flint and steel) on it, it ignites flammable fluids."
		""
		"The &6Chemical Turret&r is the fixed version: fluid in, cogwheel on, redstone signal, and it sprays. With an entity filter a mob inside aims by itself."
	]
	quest.281D8DAABEF8ABDA.quest_subtitle: "Fire extinguisher or flamethrower."
	quest.281D8DAABEF8ABDA.title: "&6Spray with the Chemical Sprayer"
	quest.2821C33E0BCF27F2.quest_desc: [
		"Kill monsters or open chests in structures until you hold a tool, a weapon or an armor piece with &6affixes&r. About every third piece of gear from a chest has some."
		""
		"Affixes are bonuses like enchantments: more damage, life steal, faster mining, more armor, luck. What a piece can do is in the tooltip. The terms in this chapter are the mod's own names."
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Careful:\",\"color\":\"red\"},{\"text\":\" Until you have activated a world tier once, the pieces are called \"},{\"text\":\"Unidentified\",\"color\":\"blue\"},{\"text\":\" and show nothing. Press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.apotheosis.open_world_tier_select\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" and activate \"},{\"text\":\"Haven\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\", then you can read everything.\"}]"
		""
		"A &6book&r and a &6gold ingot&r give the &6Chronicle of Shadows&r, the handbook for everything in this chapter."
	]
	quest.2821C33E0BCF27F2.quest_subtitle: "No sword is like another."
	quest.2821C33E0BCF27F2.title: "&6&lFind Loot with Affixes"
	quest.28261DC588E02FAE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_transport_create_tank.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Two &6Copper Sheets&r around a &6barrel&r make a &6Fluid Tank&r with &b8 buckets&r per block. Stacked tanks merge, up to 3 blocks wide and 32 high."
		""
		"In stage 2 a tank with Blaze Burners under it becomes a steam boiler."
		""
		"&6Tip:&r The &6Hose Pulley&r (Copper Casing, dried kelp block, Copper Sheet) sucks up to &e128 blocks&r deep. A body of water over &e10,000 blocks&r counts as infinite."
	]
	quest.28261DC588E02FAE.quest_subtitle: "Eight buckets per block."
	quest.28261DC588E02FAE.title: "&6Fill a Fluid Tank"
	quest.2844934EA6E411C3.quest_desc: [
		"Kronwerke has &efive stages&r, and no single player unlocks any of them. Each opens for the whole server at once as soon as the &ecommunity goal&r at the obelisk is fulfilled."
		""
		"Every goal has two pillars, &6Tech&r and &dMagic&r, plus &7Stone&r in stage 1. All of them have to fill up. A server that only builds machines gets nowhere, and neither does one that only casts spells."
		""
		"Nothing is removed from the pack, some things just come later. By the end of the season every mod is within reach. Vanilla is not locked, except the &cNether&r (stage 2) and the &dEnd&r (stage 4)."
	]
	quest.2844934EA6E411C3.quest_subtitle: "A stage opens for everyone at once, or not at all."
	quest.2844934EA6E411C3.title: "&6Understand rule number one"
	quest.2844A9541FB30F74.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Kanonenrohr&r oben in der Mitte, darunter ein &6Steinsockel&r (Stone Base: vier Stein und ein Rohr) mit einem &6Druckluftrohr&r rechts daneben, unten drei &6Verstärkte Steinstufen&r ergeben die &6Luftkanone&r (Air Cannon)."
		""
		"Dazu ein &6GPS-Werkzeug&r (GPS Tool): Redstone-Fackel oben, Glasscheibe zwischen zwei Kunststoffplatten, Diamant zwischen zwei Kunststoffplatten. Rechtsklick auf den Zielblock speichert ihn, dann kommt das Werkzeug in den GPS-Slot der Kanone. Ein Redstone-Impuls feuert alles, was im Inventar liegt, zum Ziel. Dort fängt eine Truhe mit Trichter oder ein Rundum-Trichter auf."
		""
		"Jedes &6Reichweiten-Upgrade&r bringt etwa 25 Blöcke mehr, bis 250. Mit einem &6Spender-Upgrade&r wirft sie TNT und Feuerkugeln wie ein Werfer. Mit einem &6Wesen-Tracker-Upgrade&r schießt sie statt Gegenständen das nächste Lebewesen los, dich eingeschlossen."
	]
	quest.2844A9541FB30F74.quest_subtitle: "Gegenstände fliegen zum GPS-Punkt."
	quest.2844A9541FB30F74.title: "&eSchieß mit der Luftkanone"
	quest.2849080267B6DDA8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Raw zinc&r between the wheels becomes &6Crushed Raw Zinc&r (75 percent chance of an experience nugget). Washed it gives &e9 zinc nuggets&r and gunpowder with 25 percent."
		"{image:create:textures/item/crushed_raw_zinc.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Raw copper gives clay on top when washed, raw iron redstone. Ore blocks mined with Silk Touch give 1.75 crushed ores."
	]
	quest.2849080267B6DDA8.quest_subtitle: "Nuggets plus extras."
	quest.2849080267B6DDA8.title: "&6Crush and wash ore"
	quest.284980C25D9713B1.quest_desc: [
		"A &6copper ingot&r and a &6drain&r give the &6Fluid Hatch&r. Put it on a tank: right click with a full bucket empties it into the tank, sneak and right click fills the bucket from the tank. Works with any container, bottles and canisters too."
		""
		"If you right click a placed hatch with an &6Experience Block&r (nine experience nuggets from the millstone), it becomes Enchantment Industry's &6Experience Hatch&r: right click pays your levels into the tank as liquid experience, sneak and right click takes them back. How much per click you set in the value box."
		""
		"The &6Experience Lantern&r (Experience Block, sponge, copper casing) sucks up experience orbs and experience from nearby players and stores 1,000 mB, on a contraption too."
	]
	quest.284980C25D9713B1.quest_subtitle: "Bucket in, bucket out, without a pipe."
	quest.284980C25D9713B1.title: "&dPlace a Fluid Hatch"
	quest.284EA2F9BC9C2D50.quest_desc: [
		"Im &6Chemischen Injektor&r: &e2 mB Schwefeldioxid + 1 mB Sauerstoff = 2 mB Schwefeltrioxid&r. Im zweiten Injektor: &e1 mB Schwefeltrioxid + 1 mB Wasserdampf = 1 mB Schwefelsäure&r."
		""
		"&eWasserdampf:&r ein &6Rotationskondensator&r im Modus Verdampfen macht aus Wasser Wasserdampf, 1 zu 1. &eRezept:&r Glas in die Ecken, Schaltkreise oben und unten, links ein Chemikalienbehälter, in der Mitte ein &6Energietablett&r, rechts ein Flüssigkeitsbehälter. Etwa &d20 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Der Sauerstoff kommt vom Elektrolyseur der Dreifach-Straße. Säure ist ein Gas, sie läuft in Druckschläuchen und Chemikalienbehältern."
		""
		"&eAbkürzung:&r Schwefelstaub direkt in den Slot der Auflösungskammer gibt &e2 mB Schwefelsäure&r pro Stück. Zum Testen reicht das."
	]
	quest.284EA2F9BC9C2D50.quest_subtitle: "Trioxid, Wasserdampf, Säure."
	quest.284EA2F9BC9C2D50.title: "&eBraue Schwefelsäure"
	quest.284EAE2B9FD035DB.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6comparators&r left and right of an &6Augment Core&r, one &6quartz&r each above and below, give the &6Regulator Augment&r. A number field then appears in the module."
		""
		"A sender only delivers while there is &eless&r than this number in the target. A puller only pulls while there is &emore&r in the target. Breaker and vacuum work until the buffer reaches the number. With the Fluid Module it is about percent or mB in the tank."
		""
		"That way every furnace holds exactly 16 coal and not one more."
	]
	quest.284EAE2B9FD035DB.quest_subtitle: "The Regulator Augment."
	quest.284EAE2B9FD035DB.title: "&6Keep a Fixed Stock"
	quest.285179CB6F3B3FE8.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nether_biomes.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Enter each of the five Nether biomes once. You already know the &6Nether wastes&r, the red land with ghasts, quartz and gold."
		""
		"Completes through the &eHot Tourist Destinations&r advancement. The Biomes O' Plenty biomes don't count for it."
	]
	quest.285179CB6F3B3FE8.quest_subtitle: "Nether wastes, crimson, warped, soul sand, basalt."
	quest.285179CB6F3B3FE8.title: "&c&lVisit all five biomes"
	quest.28524AFE78419B4C.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 lime&r, &e2 red&r, &e1 green&r petal, &5Rune of Gluttony&r."
		""
		"Eats leaves within 8 blocks, &d160 mana per block&r, without saplings or apples. When everything is gone, it pauses for 80 seconds."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Between trees that keep growing back, with Agricarnation or bone meal from the dispenser."
	]
	quest.28524AFE78419B4C.quest_subtitle: "Eats whole treetops."
	quest.28524AFE78419B4C.title: "&6Plant a Munchdew"
	quest.2856B1236FDC422C.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Stahlgehäuse&r in die Mitte, zwei &6Einfache Chemikalienbehälter&r links und rechts, Einfache Steuerschaltkreise oben und unten, Infundierte Legierung in die Ecken. Der Chemikalienbehälter: vier Osmiumbarren an den Seiten, Redstone in den Ecken, Mitte frei."
		""
		"Er nimmt zwei Gase, links und rechts, und macht ein drittes: &e1 mB Wasserstoff + 1 mB Chlor = 1 mB Chlorwasserstoff&r. Das ist das Gas der Injektionskammer. Er zieht etwa &d80 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Den Wasserstoff hast du: der Elektrolyseur der Dreifach-Straße macht ihn doppelt so schnell wie Sauerstoff. Jetzt nicht mehr ablassen, sondern per Druckschlauch hierher."
		""
		"Der Injektor ist Stufe 2. Später macht derselbe Maschinentyp auch Schwefeltrioxid und Schwefelsäure für die Fünffach-Straße."
	]
	quest.2856B1236FDC422C.quest_subtitle: "Zwei Gase werden eins."
	quest.2856B1236FDC422C.title: "&bBau einen Chemischen Injektor"
	quest.28580883A665A4CA.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Pulverizer&r von Oritech (Stufe 3, 32 RF/t) macht aus einem Erzblock &e2 Rohe Erze&r und aus einem Rohen Erz &e1 Staub plus 3 kleine Staubhäufchen&r, neun kleine sind ein ganzer. Macht 1,33 pro Rohes Erz."
		""
		"Die &6Fragment Forge&r weiter hinten im Kapitel Oritech holt mit Zentrifuge und Wasser etwa &e2,7 Barren&r aus einem Rohen Erz, dazu Nickel nebenbei."
		""
		"&eLohnt sich:&r Der Pulverizer vor einer Mekanism-Straße macht aus einem Erzblock zwei Rohe Erze, und die geben in der Klärkammer vier Klumpen statt drei. Die Fragment Forge ist in Stufe 3 fast so gut wie die Dreifach-Straße und braucht keinen Sauerstoff."
	]
	quest.28580883A665A4CA.quest_subtitle: "Stufe 3: Pulverizer und Fragment Forge."
	quest.28580883A665A4CA.title: "&cPulverisiere mit Oritech"
	quest.285933080676CF6D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_elevator.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Zwei &6Druckluftzylinder&r und zwei &6Kunststoffplatten&r schräg zueinander ergeben die &6Aufzugbasis&r (Elevator Base). Sechs &6Druckeisen&r in zwei Säulen ergeben vier &6Aufzugrahmen&r (Elevator Frame). Vier &6Steinknöpfe&r in die Ecken, vier Kunststoffplatten an die Seiten, ein Stein in die Mitte ergeben den &6Aufzugrufer&r (Elevator Caller)."
		""
		"Die Basis kommt unten hin, Rahmen stapelst du darüber, so hoch der Aufzug fahren soll. Jede Basis trägt &e6 Blöcke&r Höhe, zwei Basen übereinander also 12. Die Basis bekommt Luft über ein Rohr."
		""
		"&eSteuern:&r Ein Redstone-Signal an die Basis fährt sie hoch, Stärke 15 ganz, Stärke 7 halb. Oder du setzt an jede Etage einen Aufzugrufer neben einen Rahmen, dann zeigt er die Etagen als Knöpfe. Namen gibst du den Etagen im Fenster der Basis."
		""
		"Mehrere Basen nebeneinander ergeben eine größere Plattform. Mit &6Lade-Upgrades&r holt sich der Aufzug beim Herunterfahren bis zu 60 Prozent der Luft zurück."
	]
	quest.285933080676CF6D.quest_subtitle: "Sechs Blöcke Höhe pro Basis."
	quest.285933080676CF6D.title: "&a&lBau einen Aufzug"
	quest.28594F5FF3DC6436.quest_desc: [
		"&2Nature&r means weakening and poison. Common: &6Poison Arrow&r (poison arrow with poison cloud), &6Poison Spray&r (cone of poison), &6Acid Spit&r (acid ball, lowers armor), &6Oakskin&r (less damage for a while), &6Gluttony&r (food turns into mana)."
		""
		"Focus: poisonous potato. Oakskin and Gluttony are the two most useful spells for anyone, no matter which school."
		""
		"&cStage 2:&r Root, Stomp, Earthquake, Firefly Swarm, Poison Splash, Blight, Aspect of the Spider, Touch Dig."
	]
	quest.28594F5FF3DC6436.quest_subtitle: "Poison, acid and oakskin."
	quest.28594F5FF3DC6436.title: "&2Cast a Nature Spell"
	quest.285C15B0C586A75D.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Nether quartz ore&r until you have &e32 Nether quartz&r. Fortune on the pickaxe brings more per ore."
		""
		"{image:minecraft:textures/item/quartz.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Quartz is the start of Create's electronics, plus comparators, observers and quartz blocks."
	]
	quest.285C15B0C586A75D.quest_subtitle: "White in every wall."
	quest.285C15B0C586A75D.title: "&fMine Nether quartz"
	quest.286509E51E65F29D.quest_desc: [
		"A &6gold ingot&r in the middle, one &6Mundabitur Dust&r each left and right, one &6Arcane Crystal Dust&r each on top and bottom, &6charcoal&r in the four corners: a &6Deorum Ingot&r."
		""
		"{image:forbidden_arcanus:textures/item/deorum_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Deorum is the mod's precious metal. One ingot turns eight Polished Darkstone into eight &6Arcane Polished Darkstone&r, nine Deorum Nuggets gild nine decorated blocks, and the Magic Wand and the Spectral Eye Amulet need it too."
		""
		"&eThe math:&r For the forge with four pedestals and two obelisks you need about &e5 Deorum&r, so 10 Mundabitur Dust and 10 Arcane Crystal Dust."
	]
	quest.286509E51E65F29D.quest_subtitle: "Gold that conducts magic."
	quest.286509E51E65F29D.title: "&6Forge Deorum"
	quest.28660A2C7A28EFC6.quest_desc: [
		"Circuits top left and right, two &6Infused Alloys&r below them, two &6Energy Tablets&r at the bottom, the middle stays empty."
		""
		"The boots run on power: you step up a block without jumping, and they swallow fall damage completely as long as there is power in them. Each half heart costs &e50 J&r, full they hold &e64,000 J&r."
		""
		"&eArmored Free Runners:&r a block of steel on top, diamond dust left and right of the Free Runners, two bronze ingots at the bottom. Plus &d3&r armour."
	]
	quest.28660A2C7A28EFC6.quest_subtitle: "No fall damage, no step too high."
	quest.28660A2C7A28EFC6.title: "&bPut on Free Runners"
	quest.28763734C4D999AB.quest_desc: [
		"Eat a piece of &6Rogdorium&r or a &6Rogdorium Nugget&r when the infection rises. One Rogdorium makes 9 nuggets."
		""
		"The &6Purity&r effect lowers the infection a little every second. Carry a few nuggets on every trip."
	]
	quest.28763734C4D999AB.quest_subtitle: "Rogdorium is the antidote."
	quest.28763734C4D999AB.title: "&aPush Back the Infection"
	quest.2880174B6CFC2589.quest_desc: [
		"&6Plate Basic&r in the corners, &6motors&r at the top and bottom, &6redstone&r left and right, a &6chassis&r in the middle."
		""
		"Ten uranium dust make nine &6uranium 238&r and one &6uranium 235&r. Thorium dust becomes thorium 232 and thorium 230."
	]
	quest.2880174B6CFC2589.quest_subtitle: "Ten dust, one uranium 235."
	quest.2880174B6CFC2589.title: "&aSeparate Uranium in the Isotope Separator"
	quest.28868EFFD1C98F52.quest_desc: [
		"Ritual-Kohlenbecken mit der Tafel &6Ritual: Flug&r (Ärgerlicher Archwood-Stamm, 3 Wilden-Flügel, 2 Diamanten, Enderperle). Quellgläser daneben."
		""
		"Wer in der Nähe springt, bekommt den Effekt Flug und fliegt frei, solange das Ritual Quelle hat. Die beste Baustellen-Flughilfe des Packs."
	]
	quest.28868EFFD1C98F52.quest_subtitle: "Ars Nouveau: Flug wie im Kreativmodus."
	quest.28868EFFD1C98F52.title: "&dFlieg mit dem Ritual"
	quest.2887799657763FCE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ars Nouveau&r, &6Sternbunkel&r: ein Tier, das Gegenstände vom Boden aufsammelt und Stapel aus beliebig vielen Truhen in beliebig viele andere trägt. Filter über eine Gegenstandsrolle in seiner Hand oder einen Rahmen an der Truhe. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Ein Goldnugget an einen wilden Sternbunkel gibt Scherben, die Scherben mit vier Goldbarren im Bezaubernden Apparat den &6Sternbunkel-Charme&r. Einrichten mit dem Dominion-Zauberstab: erst Quelle, dann Tier, dann Ziel."
		""
		"Er braucht weder Strom noch Quelle und läuft durch Wände, wenn eine Tür offen ist. Mehr im Kapitel Ars Nouveau."
	]
	quest.2887799657763FCE.quest_subtitle: "Ars Nouveau, Sternbunkel: trägt Stapel von Truhe zu Truhe."
	quest.2887799657763FCE.title: "Zähm einen Sternbunkel"
	quest.288E0C1EE22A463A.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &62 Froststeel Ingots&r over &61 stick&r make the &6Froststeel Sword&r."
		""
		"Froststeel weapons slow every target they hit. That is worth a lot against fast enemies. There are also armor and tools made of Froststeel."
	]
	quest.288E0C1EE22A463A.quest_subtitle: "Every hit slows the target."
	quest.288E0C1EE22A463A.title: "&bForge a Froststeel Sword"
	quest.288E9B1CAF3697EA.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Rending Gale&r (Reliquary, Stufe 3) hält dich in der Luft, solange du Rechtsklick hältst, und fliegt dorthin, wo du hinschaust. Shift und Mausrad wechseln den Modus."
		""
		"Kein sanfter Fall: Richtung Boden gedrückt halten, sonst tut die Landung weh. Sie stößt und zieht auch Mobs und ruft bei Gewitter Blitze. Kapitel &5Reliquary&r."
	]
	quest.288E9B1CAF3697EA.quest_subtitle: "Reliquary: Fliegen in Blickrichtung."
	quest.288E9B1CAF3697EA.title: "&bFlieg mit der Rending Gale"
	quest.2893D9A947F62A14.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_plastic.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put a &6Fluid Addon&r on the centrifuge (five carbon fibre, one Fluid Pipe, two Electrum, one silicon) and pump water into the centrifuge itself."
		""
		"Four wheat make &6Packed Wheat&r. With &e250 mB&r of water it becomes &6Raw Biopolymer&r, which with &e500 mB&r of water becomes a &6Plastic Sheet&r."
		""
		"If the recipe does not start, open the centrifuge once after adding the addon."
	]
	quest.2893D9A947F62A14.quest_subtitle: "Fluid Addon, water, a wheat field."
	quest.2893D9A947F62A14.title: "&dMake Plastic from Wheat"
	quest.2896230628F1E72B.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 blue&r and &e2 cyan&r petals. Plant it in the middle and fill the eight spaces around it with water sources, at its height."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/block/hydroangeas.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Each block gives about &d13 mana&r, 20 in rain, and the water flows back right away. After &c72,000 ticks&r (one hour, three Minecraft days) it withers into a dead bush."
	]
	quest.2896230628F1E72B.quest_subtitle: "Drinks water and turns it into mana."
	quest.2896230628F1E72B.title: "&6Plant a Hydroangeas"
	quest.2896DC83DBFDFA42.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_apprentice_brazier.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Shapeless: &6Arcane Pedestal&r, &6Source Gem block&r, &e3 gold ingots&r."
		""
		"Every ritual is a &6ritual tablet&r made from a coloured archwood log and ingredients. Tablet on the brazier, throw additions onto it, start with an empty hand. Source comes from jars nearby, redstone stops it."
	]
	quest.2896DC83DBFDFA42.quest_subtitle: "Where the big spells burn."
	quest.2896DC83DBFDFA42.title: "&a&lBuild the Ritual Brazier"
	quest.289E1506658A9E6B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ender IO&r, &6Energy Conduit&r &e8 000 FE/t&r, &6Energetic&r 48 000, &6Vibrant&r &e192 000 FE/t&r. Jede Verbindung einzeln auf Eingang, Ausgang oder beides, mit Redstone-Steuerung. Liegt im selben Block wie Gegenstands- und Flüssigkeitsleitungen. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"Siehe Kapitel Ender IO."
	]
	quest.289E1506658A9E6B.quest_subtitle: "Ender IO, Energy Conduit: 8 000, 48 000 oder 192 000 FE pro Tick."
	quest.289E1506658A9E6B.title: "Lies: Ender-IO-Stromleitungen"
	quest.289E809B78ACB014.quest_desc: [
		"Iron goes into the parts for Create, the first magic devices, the cooking pot and Silent Gear tools. Iron nuggets and andesite make &6Andesite Alloy&r, the material of the tech pillar at the obelisk."
		""
		"Andesite Casing, Infused Iron and a Source Gem make the &6Mine Frame&r, the gate to the &6farm world&r. All about it in the chapter &6Exploration&r."
	]
	quest.289E809B78ACB014.quest_subtitle: "The metal in every mod."
	quest.289E809B78ACB014.title: "&6Smelt 16 iron"
	quest.28A0D7D640D88988.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_cobble_drill.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&bWater&r and &clava&r next to each other so that cobblestone forms between them, in front of it a &6Mechanical Drill&r on a shaft with a water wheel. An &6andesite funnel&r or a belt under the drill collects the stones."
		""
		"Every mined stone grows back instantly. Several drills on the same shaft multiply that; a drill costs 4 SU per RPM, a water wheel supplies 256 SU."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The generator fills chests while you sleep, and a backpack full of cobblestone is handed in at the obelisk with one sneak click. All the parts are in the chapter &6Create&r (cobblestone generator)."
	]
	quest.28A0D7D640D88988.quest_subtitle: "Endless stone, even while you talk."
	quest.28A0D7D640D88988.title: "&7Build a cobblestone generator"
	quest.28A140EFA693F97A.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r One &6Improved Processor&r each at the top left and bottom left, enriched iron in the left middle, a &6Construction Core&r in the top middle, a &6Destruction Core&r at the bottom, a Machine Casing in the center, three &6glass&r on the right."
		""
		"The &6Grid&r shows everything in the network. Left click takes a stack, right click one item, shift click from the inventory puts in. It needs 10 FE/t."
		""
		"&eSearch:&r &e@mekanism&r shows only things from one mod, &e#ingots&r only things with a tag, &e$text&r searches the tooltip. You can sort by amount, name or last changed."
	]
	quest.28A140EFA693F97A.quest_subtitle: "The window into storage."
	quest.28A140EFA693F97A.title: "&bBuild a Grid"
	quest.28A4B7CD4EC9A8B6.quest_desc: [
		"An &6egg&r in the Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer becomes a &5dragon egg&r with &e4 mB of antimatter&r."
		""
		"You need dragon eggs for &5Draconic Evolution&r recipes and for the &6Productive Bees&r heated centrifuge. Whoever does not want to wait for the next dragon hatches one here."
	]
	quest.28A4B7CD4EC9A8B6.quest_subtitle: "A chicken egg and 4 mB of antimatter."
	quest.28A4B7CD4EC9A8B6.title: "&5Hatch a Dragon Egg"
	quest.28A9AD8037DF9AE5.quest_desc: [
		"Top left and right &6diamond dust&r, middle bronze, &6block of steel&r, bronze, bottom middle your &6jetpack&r. The hydrogen in the tank is kept."
		""
		"The jetpack sits in the chest slot, so you wear no armour with it. The &6Armored Jetpack&r brings &d8&r armour and &d2&r toughness, as much as a diamond chestplate."
		""
		"The Crusher makes diamond dust from a diamond."
	]
	quest.28A9AD8037DF9AE5.quest_subtitle: "Flying without taking off the chestplate."
	quest.28A9AD8037DF9AE5.title: "&eArmour your jetpack"
	quest.28BC8AD98F603924.quest_desc: [
		"Five Dynamic Tanks around two Basic Chemical Tanks give the &6Basic Mid Chemical Tank&r. With five more Dynamic Tanks around it it becomes the &6Max&r tank."
		""
		"You upgrade both with alloys like normal tanks. The large MoreMachine machines in stage 4 need ultimate Max tanks."
	]
	quest.28BC8AD98F603924.quest_subtitle: "More gas on one block."
	quest.28BC8AD98F603924.title: "&3Build a mid chemical tank"
	quest.28CA7B6A7DBC85F5.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r at the top Advanced Control Circuit, &5draconium dust&r, Advanced Control Circuit. Below that one &6Reinforced Alloy&r each on the left and right, middle empty."
		""
		"{image:mekanism:textures/item/elite_control_circuit.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"On Kronwerke draconium ore only exists in the &5End&r, it drops 2 to 4 dust. With &6stage 4, the Star Works&r, Elite and Ultimate, the Induction Matrix, QIO, fusion and the MekaSuit open."
		""
		"&cStage 5:&r SPS, antimatter and the fission reactor, see the chapter &5Mekanism: Antimatter&r."
	]
	quest.28CA7B6A7DBC85F5.quest_subtitle: "A circuit with dragon dust."
	quest.28CA7B6A7DBC85F5.title: "&5&lBuild an Elite Control Circuit"
	quest.28D36AAE5A2A44F6.quest_desc: [
		"Glass, alloy and &6diamond dust&r in the middle. It keeps the machine's chunk loaded. Ideal for the Digital Miner in stage 3."
	]
	quest.28D36AAE5A2A44F6.quest_subtitle: "The machine runs even when you are away."
	quest.28D36AAE5A2A44F6.title: "&dBuild an Anchor Upgrade"
	quest.28D4E4DA10EAEBC7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Flux Networks&r, &6Flux Plug&r nimmt Strom ins Netz, &6Flux Point&r gibt ihn ab, überall und in jeder Dimension, bis &e800 000 FE/t&r je Anschluss. &6Basic Flux Storage&r speichert 2 Millionen FE bei 20 000 FE/t. Bis zu 5 Netze je Spieler, Chunks bleiben geladen. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Der &6Flux Core&r braucht ein Quelljuwel von Ars Nouveau statt des Enderauges, der &6Flux Controller&r einen Fortgeschrittenen Steuerschaltkreis. Herculean Storage öffnet in Stufe 4, Gargantuan in Stufe 5."
	]
	quest.28D4E4DA10EAEBC7.quest_subtitle: "Flux Networks, Plug und Point: Strom ohne Kabel, auch zwischen Dimensionen."
	quest.28D4E4DA10EAEBC7.title: "Lies: Flux Networks"
	quest.28DB0299AFB55DEF.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6gold ingots&r top and bottom in the two left columns, &6lapis lazuli&r top right, in the middle row your &6Basic Magnet&r, an &6eye of ender&r and a &6diamond&r, &6redstone&r bottom right."
		""
		"It pulls from &e8 blocks&r, in the window you set 3 to 11. Items and experience are switched separately, and the &6filter&r with whitelist or blacklist leaves cobblestone lying, for example."
		""
		"&cNote:&r The eye of ender needs blaze powder, and that only comes with the Nether in &estage 2&r."
	]
	quest.28DB0299AFB55DEF.quest_subtitle: "Farther, with a filter, and experience as you like."
	quest.28DB0299AFB55DEF.title: "&bBuild the Advanced Magnet"
	quest.28E9D43755E0221E.quest_desc: [
		"Hand in the staffs at the obelisk by hand. &e/kw goals&r shows the progress."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The magic goal of stage 4 is &e128 Gaia Spirits&r and &e30 Mystic Staffs&r, both fixed. Thirty staffs are &d60,000 mana&r. One full circuit is enough for the whole goal."
		""
		"&eThe fast way:&r Several mages fill a shared circuit, one calls the staffs with the Mystic Code of First Sorcery. Exchange circles and Kodoku next to it, the workshop on a ley point."
	]
	quest.28E9D43755E0221E.quest_subtitle: "Thirty staffs, 60,000 mana."
	quest.28E9D43755E0221E.title: "&c&lBring Staffs to the Obelisk"
	quest.28FB9C8CD9D63670.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6stick&r in the middle, &e2 Source Gems&r and &e1 gold ingot&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"{image:ars_nouveau:textures/item/dominion_wand.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Click the source first, then the target. Sneaking on a helper resets it."
	]
	quest.28FB9C8CD9D63670.quest_subtitle: "With it you tell helpers what to do."
	quest.28FB9C8CD9D63670.title: "&6Build the Dominion Wand"
	quest.2902E4F857948DD0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Drahtanschluss&r an beide Enden, mit der &6Drahtspule&r in der Hand erst den einen, dann den anderen anklicken. &6Kondensatoren&r speichern und geben je Seite ab, Seiten stellst du mit dem Hammer ein."
		""
		"&eIE, Leitungen:&r Kupferdraht &d2 048 FE/t&r, 16 Blöcke weit, Anschluss 256 FE/t je Seite. Elektrum 8 192 FE/t, Anschluss 1 024. HV-Draht 32 768 FE/t, 32 Blöcke, Anschluss 4 096. Je länger, desto mehr Verlust (1,25 Prozent je 16 Blöcke Kupfer)."
		""
		"&eIE, Kondensatoren:&r LV &d100 000 FE&r und 256 FE/t je Seite, MV 1 Million und 1 024, HV 4 Millionen und 4 096. Alles offen ab Stufe 2."
	]
	quest.2902E4F857948DD0.quest_subtitle: "Immersive Engineering: Kupfer 2 048, Elektrum 8 192, HV 32 768 FE/t."
	quest.2902E4F857948DD0.title: "&6Zieh Draht und stell Kondensatoren"
	quest.290477188DE42ABC.quest_desc: [
		"Two stations, a train with a conductor, a schedule with two entries and &eLoop Forever&r. As a condition for example &eWait 20 seconds&r, so passengers can board in peace."
		""
		"Agree among yourselves: a shared network with cleanly named stations helps everyone."
	]
	quest.290477188DE42ABC.quest_subtitle: "Two stations, one schedule, no driver."
	quest.290477188DE42ABC.title: "&6Let a line run by itself"
	quest.29052538655CDCA9.quest_desc: [
		"&eStage 2:&r The &6Sigil of Withdrawal&r (slate, a &6blaze rod&r, two ender pearls, a lava bucket, Gem Dust, gives four) takes all gems back out at the Smithing Table, item and gems stay intact. The &6Gem Case&r (glass, basalt, Gem Cutting Table, &6ender chest&r) stores 32,000 gems per kind and cuts them right in your inventory."
		""
		"&eStage 3:&r The big &6Reforging Table&r is the simple table with a &6netherite ingot&r, two &6Arcane Sands&r and three nether bricks. Only it forges &5Epic&r (30 levels, 2 Arcane Sands, 4 sigils) and &6Mythic&r (50 levels, 3 Godforged Pearls, 5 sigils)."
		""
		"&eStage 4:&r The &6Augmenting Table&r (Nether Star, two &6Godforged Pearls&r, enchanting table, polished blackstone) improves a single affix by 25 percent for 2 &6Sigils of Enhancement&r and 225 levels, or rerolls it for 1 sigil and 175 levels, without touching the others."
	]
	quest.29052538655CDCA9.quest_subtitle: "Withdrawal, Reforging Table, Augmenting."
	quest.29052538655CDCA9.title: "&5What Comes Later"
	quest.2907732BF4D0A15D.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Stahlgehäuse&r in die Mitte, zwei &6Eisenbarren&r links und rechts, zwei &6Einfache Steuerschaltkreise&r oben und unten, Redstone in die Ecken."
		""
		"&eWas hinein darf:&r Ein Erzblock wird zu &e2 Staub&r, drei Rohe Erze zu &e4 Staub&r, ein Block aus Rohem Erz zu &e12 Staub&r. Das gilt für Eisen, Kupfer, Gold, Osmium, Zinn, Blei und Uran."
		""
		"Sie zieht etwa &d20 FE/t&r, solange sie arbeitet. Ein brennender Wärmegenerator (80 FE/t) daneben reicht für sie und den Schmelzer."
		""
		"Den Einfachen Steuerschaltkreis gibt es auf Kronwerke nur aus Elektronenröhre und 20 mB Redstone in der Infusionsanlage, siehe Kapitel Mekanism."
	]
	quest.2907732BF4D0A15D.quest_subtitle: "Zwei Staub aus einem Erz."
	quest.2907732BF4D0A15D.title: "&d&lBuild an Enrichment Chamber"
	quest.29097D6A1803461D.quest_desc: [
		"Das &6Frosted Prison&r steht in der &eSchneeebene&r (Biom Snowy Plains). In derselben Gegend findest du verlassene Dörfer, Tempel und Türme mit &6Schwarzstahl&r und &6Stabilen Stiefeln&r (laufen über Pulverschnee) in den Kisten."
		""
		"Drinnen warten &cDraugr&r (28 Lebenspunkte, Rüstung 3), Elite-Draugr und Königliche Draugr. Sie lassen &6Schwarzstahl-Nuggets&r fallen, von deiner Hand getötet manchmal einen Barren. Neun Nuggets ergeben einen &6Schwarzstahlbarren&r."
		""
		"Aus Schwarzstahl craftest du Werkzeug wie aus Eisen: &6Schwarzstahlschwert&r (2 Barren, Stock) und die &6Schwarzstahl-Tartsche&r, ein Schild aus Barren, 4 Nuggets und 4 Brettern. Heb mindestens &e4 Barren&r auf, du brauchst sie für die Waffen aus Cursium."
		""
		"Ab Stufe 2 führt dich das &6Fluchauge&r hierher: Enderauge, Gold, Knochen, 2 Phantomhäute, verrottetes Fleisch."
	]
	quest.29097D6A1803461D.quest_subtitle: "Ein Gefängnis im Schnee voller Draugr."
	quest.29097D6A1803461D.title: "&bFinde das Frosted Prison"
	quest.2910CD1D7775A23C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pie crust&r: wheat, milk bottle, wheat, with one wheat below. On top apples, sugar and wheat: the &6apple pie&r."
		""
		"Place it and cut slices off with the knife. Four milk bottles come from one milk bucket and four glass bottles."
	]
	quest.2910CD1D7775A23C.quest_subtitle: "For the sweet tooth."
	quest.2910CD1D7775A23C.title: "&7Bake an apple pie"
	quest.292680ABCC01F192.quest_desc: [
		"&6Item Card:&r redstone, lapis, nether quartz, a Logic Chip and three gold nuggets. Open a node, choose a side and plug the card in."
		""
		"&eModes:&r &eExtract&r pulls out of the block, &eInsert&r puts into it, &eStock&r keeps a stock. Cards find each other through their &echannel&r: Extract on channel 0 delivers to Insert on channel 0. Priorities and round robin spread the load."
	]
	quest.292680ABCC01F192.quest_subtitle: "What, where to, on which channel."
	quest.292680ABCC01F192.title: "&cPlug in an Item Card"
	quest.292803D15DEC7A34.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/finale_tech.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &64 Draconium Blocks&r in the core. In seven Wyvern injectors: &64 Draconium Cores&r, &a2 Gaia Spirit Ingots&r, &c1 Dragon Heart&r. Makes &54 Awakened Draconium Blocks&r."
		""
		"The fusion draws &e50 million&r energy. Hook the injectors to your Energy Core, otherwise you wait a long time."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Every block in the obelisk counts 50 points. Still put a few aside, the next quests need some."
	]
	quest.292803D15DEC7A34.quest_subtitle: "Four blocks from one fusion."
	quest.292803D15DEC7A34.title: "&5&lFuse Awakened Draconium"
	quest.2928E7CCAC5479D8.quest_desc: [
		"Fences, a block of &6dirt&r and planks, see EMI. Fill it with plant leftovers."
		""
		"Over time &6worms&r come out. Put into the rod, they make the fish bite faster."
	]
	quest.2928E7CCAC5479D8.quest_subtitle: "Bait from kitchen scraps."
	quest.2928E7CCAC5479D8.title: "&7Build a Worm Farm"
	quest.2928F62C8F098F92.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 Powdered Diamond&r, cloth. Costs &d4,000 mana&r, which you pay from gems or a circuit."
		""
		"If you look at a creature while using it, it comes along. Then only one comes back: one has to die. Alone, taking damage is enough to return."
	]
	quest.2928F62C8F098F92.quest_subtitle: "A world of swords."
	quest.2928F62C8F098F92.title: "&bDraw the Reality Marble"
	quest.29290BF4968849AA.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Mob Charm&r needs five &6Mob Charm Fragments&r of the same type, plus leather on top and string in the middle: fragment, leather, fragment in the first row, fragment, string, fragment in the second, fragment, empty, fragment in the third."
		""
		"Fragments drop at 1 in 60 on a kill, or you craft them from the drops: six &6Zombie Hearts&r around rotten flesh, bone, rotten flesh give a zombie fragment, six &6Rib Bones&r around bone, flint, bone a skeleton fragment. Every type has such a recipe."
		""
		"With the charm in your inventory this mob type no longer attacks you. Every kill of that type costs 1 of &e80 durability&r. The &6Charm Belt&r (three leather, five fragments) carries all charms together in one slot."
	]
	quest.29290BF4968849AA.quest_subtitle: "A mob type that no longer sees you."
	quest.29290BF4968849AA.title: "&aBuild a Mob Charm"
	quest.292BD285F587721C.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r four Blueprint Paper and two sticks. The head needs &efour&r material."
		""
		"The &6mattock&r tills farmland, digs dirt and fells wood. A bit slower than shovel or axe, but more durable, and it counts wherever a hoe is asked for."
	]
	quest.292BD285F587721C.quest_subtitle: "Hoe, shovel and axe for the farm."
	quest.292BD285F587721C.title: "&7Build a mattock"
	quest.29374643DC18B3D2.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/the_end_elytra.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Next to some End Cities an &5End Ship&r floats. Inside, &5elytra&r hang in an item frame. &eOn Kronwerke&r Lootr makes that one frame per player: everyone takes their own pair from the same ship."
		""
		"Put them in the chest slot, jump and press jump again while falling. &6Firework rockets&r give thrust. Repair with &6phantom membrane&r or Mending."
		""
		"Draconic Evolution's Wyvern flight module needs an elytra."
	]
	quest.29374643DC18B3D2.quest_subtitle: "At the bow of an End Ship, a pair for everyone."
	quest.29374643DC18B3D2.title: "&5&lGet Elytra"
	quest.29391BFAD0ADC922.quest_desc: [
		"&6Farmwelt&r: ein Portal aus &e10 Grubenrahmen&r (vier breit, fünf hoch, Ecken frei), angezündet mit einem &6Quellstein&r. Drüben ist eine eigene Welt zum Graben, alle drei Tage neu. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"&eWas mitreist:&r Inventar, Enderkiste, Rucksäcke, und alles, was du durchs Portal wirfst. Siehe Kapitel Erkundung."
	]
	quest.29391BFAD0ADC922.quest_subtitle: "Grubenrahmen und ein Quellstein: Platz für Löcher, Erz ohne Ende."
	quest.29391BFAD0ADC922.title: "Reise in die Farmwelt"
	quest.294217BC9F51D52D.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Aviar's Circle."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6Demon's Dream Fruit&r, &6wheat&r, &6carrot&r, &6potato&r, a &6hoe&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Its Book of Calling appears with it."
		""
		"With the book you set the work area and the delivery chest. It harvests ripe plants and replants. If it pauses for a few minutes after an empty field, that is on purpose."
	]
	quest.294217BC9F51D52D.quest_subtitle: "Harvest and sow again."
	quest.294217BC9F51D52D.title: "&dSummon a Foliot Farmer"
	quest.2942F44C4E626DCD.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Quantum Rings&r in the corners, an &6Advanced Card&r in the middle, a &6Quantum Link Chamber&r in the bottom middle."
		""
		"The card from AE2 Wireless Terminals lets wireless terminals connect through a quantum bridge, with no range limit."
	]
	quest.2942F44C4E626DCD.quest_subtitle: "The wireless terminal without a range limit."
	quest.2942F44C4E626DCD.title: "&dBuild a Quantum Bridge Card"
	quest.2943E707A8F30D04.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r oben ein &6Advanced Pressure Tube&r, in der Mitte Gear, Compressed Iron, Gear, unten Compressed Iron, &6Einfacher Steuerschaltkreis&r, Compressed Iron."
		""
		"Der Dynamo ist der Flux Compressor rückwärts: aus 100 mL Luft werden &e40 FE&r, bei &e40 FE pro Tick&r im Grundzustand und einem Ausgang von 80 FE pro Tick. Speed Upgrades erhöhen beides. Auch er wird warm und braucht Heat Sinks."
		""
		"Wann lohnt das? Wenn du mit Elektrostatik oder Sonne mehr Luft hast als Maschinen. Ein Dynamo neben einem Energie-Würfel macht aus dem Überschuss Strom für alle anderen Mods."
	]
	quest.2943E707A8F30D04.quest_subtitle: "Luft wird zu Strom."
	quest.2943E707A8F30D04.title: "&dBau einen Pneumatic Dynamo"
	quest.2949F53EF3148917.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Dunkle Turm&r steht in Wäldern, Ebenen und Taigas. Drinnen: Spawner, Knochenrufer, Skelett-Drescher und ganz oben der &cOberste Knochenrufer&r (65 Lebenspunkte, dann eine zweite Form mit 60)."
		""
		"Er lässt immer den &6Orb des Beschwörers&r fallen, dazu meist Chaossamen, etwa jeder sechste Kampf ein &6Todestotem&r (in der Hand rettet es vor dem Tod und gibt Stärke, kostet Sättigung) und etwa jeder siebte den &6Stab der magischen Pfeile&r."
		""
		"Mit dem Orb baust du den &6Knochenruferstab&r: 2 Dunkelmetallnuggets, der Orb, 2 Knochen, ein &6Zerbrochener Schädel&r und ein Knochengriff. Er ruft kleine Skelette, die für dich kämpfen."
	]
	quest.2949F53EF3148917.quest_subtitle: "Der Oberste Knochenrufer und sein Orb."
	quest.2949F53EF3148917.title: "&8Räum den dunklen Turm"
	quest.294ED4DD432038E6.quest_desc: [
		"Eine Checkliste für lange Abende: von jeder der zwölf Nusssorten eine geröstete Nuss. Walnuss, Pekannuss, Buchecker, Paranuss, Cashew, Butternuss und Edelkastanie wachsen an Bäumen aus dem Markt."
		""
		"&6Hasel&r, &6Mandel&r, &6Pistazie&r, &6Kerzennuss&r und &6Ginkgo&r musst du züchten. EMI zeigt unter &eBaumbestäubung&r die Eltern."
	]
	quest.294ED4DD432038E6.quest_subtitle: "Zwölf Nüsse, vom Markt bis zur letzten Kreuzung."
	quest.294ED4DD432038E6.title: "&6Röste jede Nusssorte"
	quest.295EFC76A885DEF6.quest_desc: [
		"Tablet from stage 2: &5Vexing log&r, &6compass&r, &6source gem&r, &6wayfinder&r. As an addition throw a &5purpur block&r onto the brazier."
		""
		"Best started on an outer End island. The wayfinder then shows the way. End Cities mean elytra, shulker shells and purpur, everything this chapter needs."
	]
	quest.295EFC76A885DEF6.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: the Locate Structure tablet with purpur."
	quest.295EFC76A885DEF6.title: "&aFind an End City"
	quest.2976839E25DB7710.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Wizard&r armor piece, a &6rune&r and an &6Arcane Essence&r shapeless (or at the Smithing Table with the rune as the template) give the school's piece: Ice Rune for the &bCryomancer&r, Evocation Rune for the &aArchevoker&r, Ender Rune for the &5Shadowwalker&r, Holy Rune for the &ePriest&r."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/cryomancer_chestplate.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Every piece gives &e+125 mana&r, &e+10 percent spell power of its school&r and &e+5 percent in general&r, protection like diamond. Whoever plays a school wears four pieces of it."
		""
		"In stage 1 Ice, Evocation, Ender, Nature, Lightning, Blood and Holy work. The &cPyromancer&r needs the Fire Rune from blaze rods: stage 2. Every piece costs one rune, so eight foci and a runestone."
	]
	quest.2976839E25DB7710.quest_subtitle: "Wizard piece, rune, essence."
	quest.2976839E25DB7710.title: "&bForge School Armor"
	quest.297B5583009AF0A4.quest_desc: [
		"With &6stage 2 (Brass Works)&r open Manasteel, Mana Pearls, the Runic Altar with sixteen runes, sixteen new functional flowers, five new mana flowers and finally Terrasteel."
		""
		"On Kronwerke this depends on Create: Mana Pearls only with a brass casing under the pool, brass in the Runic Altar and in the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate. In return, Mekanism needs your Manasteel and Create your Runes of Fire."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The obelisk goal wants &e600 Mana Pearls&r, &e50 Terrasteel ingots&r and &e8 Rune Cores&r, together over &d30 million mana&r. The elven portal comes in stage 3."
	]
	quest.297B5583009AF0A4.quest_subtitle: "Stage 2 is open, now Botania shows what it can do."
	quest.297B5583009AF0A4.title: "&bOpen the Brass Works"
	quest.2983E934CA8AEC75.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sculkgestein&r bricht zu &6Bruchsculkgestein&r, &6Düsterschiefer&r zu &6Bruchdüsterschiefer&r. Im Ofen wird daraus wieder der ganze Block. Alle Varianten gibt es am &6Steinschneider&r."
		""
		"&eErze:&r In beiden Steinen stecken Kohle, Eisen, Kupfer, Gold, Redstone, Lapis, Smaragd und Diamant, genau wie zu Hause. Die &6Zerkleinerungsräder&r von Create und der Mekanism-Anreicherer kennen sie."
		""
		"&eMekanism:&r Der &6Anreicherer&r macht aus Bruchstein den Stein, aus Fliesen Ziegel, aus Ziegeln Poliert und aus Poliert Geschnitten. Praktisch für große Mengen Baustoff."
	]
	quest.2983E934CA8AEC75.quest_subtitle: "Bruchstein brennen, dann Ziegel, Fliesen, Poliert, Geschnitten, Glatt."
	quest.2983E934CA8AEC75.title: "&7Verarbeite Sculkgestein und Düsterschiefer"
	quest.299C84C4C154CDCB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nether_bastion.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Find a &6bastion remnant&r of blackstone and bring a &6gilded blackstone&r along."
		""
		"Inside live piglins, the &6piglin brutes&r (gold doesn't distract them) and hoglins in stables. Every chest makes the piglins angry, even with gold armour."
		""
		"In the chests: gold, diamond gear, ancient debris and the &6smithing template&r for netherite. Thanks to Lootr every player has their own loot."
	]
	quest.299C84C4C154CDCB.quest_subtitle: "The piglins' fortress."
	quest.299C84C4C154CDCB.title: "&8&lLoot a bastion"
	quest.29A2E8E667E65D2E.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.inventory\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" for your inventory. At the top left there is a small \"},{\"text\":\"book\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\"; clicking it opens the quest book. The chapters are on the left, the quests in the middle, and a clicked quest opens as text on the right.\"}]"
		""
		"Every quest has &etasks&r (bottom left in the quest window) and &erewards&r (bottom right). Item tasks complete themselves as soon as the item is in your inventory. It is not taken from you unless the quest says so explicitly."
		""
		"&eTip:&r If you prefer opening the book with a key, set one in the controls under &eFTB Quests&r. None is bound by default."
	]
	quest.29A2E8E667E65D2E.quest_subtitle: "The book at the top left of your inventory."
	quest.29A2E8E667E65D2E.title: "&6Open the quest book"
	quest.29A5104832EA5A19.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Redstoneblöcke in die Ecken, ein &6Token der Furcht&r oben, ein &6Token des Zorns&r unten, zwei &6Himmelsbarren&r an den Seiten, ein &6Umwandlungskatalysator&r in der Mitte."
		""
		"&eNature's Aura, RF-Umwandler:&r Brennstoff Aura aus der Umgebung, &d20 Aura = 1 FE&r. Er leert die Gegend spürbar, also nur neben starken Aura-Generatoren betreiben. Eher ein Notstrom für Magier als ein Kraftwerk. Offen ab Stufe 3 mit dem Himmelsbarren."
	]
	quest.29A5104832EA5A19.quest_subtitle: "Nature's Aura, RF-Umwandler, 20 Aura = 1 FE."
	quest.29A5104832EA5A19.title: "&aWandle Aura in Strom"
	quest.29AD23F9B1AB019A.quest_desc: [
		"Glass, &6Iron Plate&r, glass on top, three &6Vacuum Tubes&r in the middle, &6Treated Wood&r, &6Copper Coil Block&r, Treated Wood at the bottom make the &6Charging Station&r."
		""
		"It charges any item that stores power with up to &d256 FE/t&r. Power comes from below or from behind, the item you put in by right click or push in with a hopper."
		""
		"The tubes at the front glow according to the charge. A comparator next to it gives the charge as a redstone signal."
	]
	quest.29AD23F9B1AB019A.quest_subtitle: "Power in, full tools out."
	quest.29AD23F9B1AB019A.title: "&dBuild a Charging Station"
	quest.29B281C9D1703AE3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/food_f_rod.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Two &6iron sheets&r from the Create press, two &6string&r and a &6stick&r, see EMI."
		""
		"Aquaculture brings dozens of fish with their own habitats. Sneaking and right clicking with the rod opens its slots for hook, bait, line and bobber."
	]
	quest.29B281C9D1703AE3.quest_subtitle: "New fish, new rods."
	quest.29B281C9D1703AE3.title: "&6Build an Iron Fishing Rod"
	quest.29BB74D50C2B5086.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Mana Diamonds&r and &e1 Mana Quartz&r on the altar, plus the runes Summer and Fire as catalysts. &d12,000 mana&r."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r Orechid, Rafflowsia and Ring of Far Reach in stage 3, Charm of the Diva in stage 4."
	]
	quest.29BB74D50C2B5086.quest_subtitle: "Catalysts: Summer and Fire."
	quest.29BB74D50C2B5086.title: "&5Make the Rune of Pride"
	quest.29BE67174B38E35E.quest_desc: [
		"Redstone, gold and &6Infused Alloy&r make an &6Energy Tablet&r. It charges in any energy slot."
		""
		"Above all it is an ingredient: Energy Cube, Wind and Solar Generator, Rotary Condensentrator, laser and induction cells need it."
	]
	quest.29BE67174B38E35E.quest_subtitle: "A battery for your pocket."
	quest.29BE67174B38E35E.title: "&aBuild Energy Tablets"
	quest.29C1F344177EB2D4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/powah_reactor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Reactor (Starter):&r uraninite in the corners, Tiny on the sides, a casing in the middle, gives four. You need &e36&r."
		""
		"Take all 36 in your hand and place one. On a free area of &e3 by 3&r, &e4 blocks&r high, the reactor builds itself. If blocks are missing, the chat says how many."
	]
	quest.29C1F344177EB2D4.quest_subtitle: "36 blocks, and it builds itself."
	quest.29C1F344177EB2D4.title: "&a&lBuild a reactor"
	quest.29C589728E7570CC.quest_desc: [
		"Dig &664 andesite&r. It sits in large veins in the stone, often next to granite and diorite. Any pickaxe will do."
		""
		"You need it by the hundreds. Later a press over a basin compacts new andesite from flint, gravel and lava (quest &6Compact andesite&r)."
	]
	quest.29C589728E7570CC.quest_subtitle: "The grey stone almost everything here is made from."
	quest.29C589728E7570CC.title: "&6Mine andesite"
	quest.29C8E8BCADDFFA65.quest_desc: [
		"Torchmaster's &6Mega Torch&r stops monsters from spawning within &e32 blocks&r, in the dark and underground too. Spawners keep working. The &6Dread Lamp&r does the same for peaceful animals."
		""
		"The &6Feral Flare Lantern&r places invisible lights around itself and lights up a cave that way. Recipes in EMI."
	]
	quest.29C8E8BCADDFFA65.quest_subtitle: "One torch for the whole base."
	quest.29C8E8BCADDFFA65.title: "&eKeep Monsters Away"
	quest.29D33BAB626DA04B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r seven &6iron ingots&r around a &6Millstone&r from Create, the top middle stays empty. Throw combs in or put them in the window, after &e15 seconds&r out comes whatever the bee collected, plus &6wax&r."
		""
		"{image:productivebees:textures/item/centrifuge.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Normal &6honeycombs&r give 100 mB of &6honey&r and one wax. Honey collects in the tank (10 buckets), flows into any tank next to it and can be pumped out with pipes. Items you throw onto the centrifuge are sucked in by themselves."
		""
		"Two wax and a string give a candle, nine wax a wax block. Four identical resource combs can be pressed into a &6comb block&r, which also fits into the centrifuge."
	]
	quest.29D33BAB626DA04B.quest_subtitle: "Combs become resources, honey and wax."
	quest.29D33BAB626DA04B.title: "&7&lBuild a Centrifuge"
	quest.29D5C0BD8486862F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/enderio_enchanter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6book&r on top, &6diamond&r, &6lectern&r, diamond in the middle, three &6Dark Steel&r at the bottom."
		""
		"Put in a book, an ingredient and lapis and pay experience levels: out comes an enchanted book. Redstone gives Efficiency, slime Silk Touch, emerald Fortune, obsidian Unbreaking. More ingredient means a higher level, EMI shows the amounts."
	]
	quest.29D5C0BD8486862F.quest_subtitle: "Books by recipe instead of by luck."
	quest.29D5C0BD8486862F.title: "&dBuild the Enchanter"
	quest.29D7C20E5AE8FFAE.quest_desc: [
		"&64 Cold Aerclouds&r im Quadrat ergeben einen &6Cold Parachute&r. Er hält genau &eeinen&r Sturz, dann ist er weg. Mach also gleich mehrere."
		""
		"Der &6Golden Parachute&r hält 20 Stürze. Dafür brauchst du 4 &6Golden Aerclouds&r: Die hängen selten über &eY 96&r, oder du verzauberst eine Cold Aercloud im &6Altar&r (50 Sekunden, 4 Ambrosium Shards)."
	]
	quest.29D7C20E5AE8FFAE.quest_subtitle: "Vier Wolken, ein Sprung."
	quest.29D7C20E5AE8FFAE.title: "&fBau einen Cold Parachute"
	quest.29EADE5742D50649.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6plastic&r, one &6Magnetic Coil&r in the middle, at the bottom Energite, plating, Energite. The Foundry casts &6Energite&r from nickel and Fluxite."
		""
		"Each gives &e2,000,000 RF&r of storage and &e2,000 RF/t&r more input. For machines with many Speed Addons."
	]
	quest.29EADE5742D50649.quest_subtitle: "Capacitor Addon, 2 million RF more."
	quest.29EADE5742D50649.title: "&aEnlarge the Buffer"
	quest.29F241E959011E82.quest_desc: [
		"A &6copper sheet&r through the &6Mechanical Saw&r gives four &6copper wire&r. Click a terminal with wire, then the next one."
		""
		"Power Grid calculates with &dvolts&r, &damps&r and &dohms&r. Current only flows in a &eclosed circuit&r: every device has plus and minus, and it needs a way there and back."
		""
		"Long wires have more resistance, the lost power becomes heat, and too much of it burns the wire through. A &6connector&r (three copper nuggets, alloy) is a post to hang them on."
	]
	quest.29F241E959011E82.quest_subtitle: "Power Grid: power in a closed circuit."
	quest.29F241E959011E82.title: "&3Cut copper wire"
	quest.29FAFDD9D2F3F21A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Boron dust&r and &6steel dust&r in the Alloy Smelter make two &6ferroboron ingots&r. Mekanism's Crusher makes steel dust from steel."
		""
		"Ferroboron goes into the servo and actuator and is the step before the tough alloy."
	]
	quest.29FAFDD9D2F3F21A.quest_subtitle: "Boron and steel."
	quest.29FAFDD9D2F3F21A.title: "&6Smelt Ferroboron"
	quest.29FC33824A470023.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_belt.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Six &6dried kelp&r make a &6Belt Connector&r. Click two parallel shafts with it one after the other, up to &e20 blocks&r apart, level or at a 45 degree angle."
		"{image:create:textures/item/belt_connector.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"The belt carries items, mobs and players and passes the rotation on. Press and saw work on it as things pass by, a fan from the side."
	]
	quest.29FC33824A470023.quest_subtitle: "Items and rotation on one track."
	quest.29FC33824A470023.title: "&6Stretch a belt"
	quest.2A0778EF409BE97F.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Blazegold Ingot&r bottom left, a &6Polymorphic Catalyst&r in the middle, a &6Fluid Canister&r top right. It uses &6Polymorphic Fluid&r, the tooltip shows the fill level. How to make the fluid is under the Fuel Generator."
		""
		"Use it on a monster, and it turns into another random monster. It works the same with animals. You cannot choose which one comes out, and a monster never turns into an animal."
	]
	quest.2A0778EF409BE97F.quest_subtitle: "The Polymorphic Wand."
	quest.2A0778EF409BE97F.title: "&dTransform a Monster"
	quest.2A07DC5E99D9AFEA.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e1 orange&r, &e2 green&r petals, &e1 Redstone Root&r."
		""
		"All sounds near it are only half as loud, several Bergamutes add up. It needs no mana. For loud farms and Create halls; your viewers will thank you."
	]
	quest.2A07DC5E99D9AFEA.quest_subtitle: "Quiet in the factory."
	quest.2A07DC5E99D9AFEA.title: "&6Plant a Bergamute"
	quest.2A0C1E2EB1048AD7.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r The &6Storage Housing&r is glass, redstone, glass at the top, redstone left and right, three enriched iron at the bottom, the middle stays empty. The &61k Storage Part&r is silicon, enriched iron, silicon at the top, glass, redstone, glass in the middle, silicon, glass, silicon at the bottom. Housing and part, shapeless, make the &61k Storage Disk&r."
		""
		"A 1k disk holds &e1,024 items&r. And that is all you need to know: RS counts &eno types&r. 1,024 different things one each fit in just as well as 1,024 cobblestone. AE2's 63 type limit does not exist here."
		""
		"When a disk is empty, right clicking with it in hand gives the storage part back."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Disks take their contents along when you travel to another world, even inside a Disk Drive you carry with Carry On."
		""
		"{image:refinedstorage:textures/item/1k_storage_disk.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2A0C1E2EB1048AD7.quest_subtitle: "1,024 items, of any kind."
	quest.2A0C1E2EB1048AD7.title: "&7Make a 1k Storage Disk"
	quest.2A14A1FC2568E937.quest_desc: [
		"Zwei &6Mahlwerkräder&r nebeneinander, gegenläufig gedreht, &6Rohes Eisen&r von oben hinein. Heraus fällt &6Zerkleinertes Roheisen&r, dazu zu 75 Prozent ein Erfahrungsnugget."
		""
		"&eDie Zahlen:&r Rohes Erz gibt &e1 Zerkleinertes&r, mehr nicht. Ein Erzblock gibt 1 plus zu 75 Prozent ein zweites, ein Tiefenschiefer-Erzblock 2 plus zu 25 Prozent ein drittes. Zerkleinertes wird im Ofen ein Barren, oder beim Waschen 9 Nuggets plus zu 75 Prozent ein Redstone (bei Gold zu 50 Prozent ein Quarz)."
		""
		"&eLohnt sich:&r in Stufe 1 für Erzblöcke mit Behutsamkeit (bis 2,25 Barren) und für die Nebenprodukte, für Rohes Erz nicht. &eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r der Zerkleinerer von Mekanism braucht zwei dieser Räder, du brauchst sie also sowieso."
	]
	quest.2A14A1FC2568E937.quest_subtitle: "Stufe 1: Create zerkleinert, aber verdoppelt nicht."
	quest.2A14A1FC2568E937.title: "&6Mahl Erz mit Mahlwerkrädern"
	quest.2A237AEF4A42416D.quest_desc: [
		"Vier &6Flux-Kerne&r und fünf &6Flux-Staub&r im Schachbrett (Staub in die Ecken und die Mitte, Kerne an die Seiten) ergeben einen &6Flux-Block&r."
		""
		"{image:fluxnetworks:textures/block/flux_block.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Der Block ist das Gehäuse des Steckers, fünf stecken im Controller und sechs in jedem Speicher. Und er ersetzt das Grundgestein beim Staubmachen: Flux-Block unten, Luft mit Redstone, Obsidian oben, Linksklick."
	]
	quest.2A237AEF4A42416D.quest_subtitle: "Vier Kerne, fünf Staub."
	quest.2A237AEF4A42416D.title: "&9Presse Flux-Blöcke"
	quest.2A2B16B925BE643E.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 Livingwood logs&r around a &esticky piston&r. A spreader on top turns and distributes its bursts in turn."
		""
		"Redstone stops it. Right click with the wand changes the speed, a sneaking right click the direction."
	]
	quest.2A2B16B925BE643E.quest_subtitle: "A spreader that turns."
	quest.2A2B16B925BE643E.title: "&6Build a Spreader Turntable"
	quest.2A301EBCE4C292F9.quest_desc: [
		"Das &eÜbertragungslimit&r steht bei Stecker, Punkt und Controller auf &d800.000 FE/t&r, je Gerät und Tick. Du kannst es senken oder mit &eLimit umgehen&r ganz aufheben."
		""
		"Ein Limit ist nützlich, wenn ein Punkt einem Nachbarn nicht alles geben soll, etwa einem Energiewürfel neben der Fabrik, der sonst die ganze Reihe leer saugt. Gib ihm 2.000 FE/t, dann füllt er sich langsam im Hintergrund."
		""
		"Der &ePuffer&r eines Steckers oder Punkts ist höchstens ein Tick Limit groß. Strom liegt also nirgends im Netz herum, nur in Speichern."
	]
	quest.2A301EBCE4C292F9.quest_subtitle: "Wie viel pro Tick höchstens durch darf."
	quest.2A301EBCE4C292F9.title: "&eStell das Übertragungslimit"
	quest.2A35BDD1C79659C6.quest_desc: [
		"Bangle into the apparatus, plus:"
		"&cFire&r (3 Fire Essences, fire charge): hits set on fire. &bWater&r (3 Water Essences, powder snow bucket): hits freeze."
		"&aEarth&r (3 Earth Essences, cobweb): hits snare. &fAir&r (3 Air Essences, piston): faster, more knockback."
		"&dSummoning&r (2 Conjuration Essences, bone, Wilden Horn): summons attack your target. &5Anima&r (2 anima, ghast tear, wither rose)."
	]
	quest.2A35BDD1C79659C6.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: checklist of the bangles."
	quest.2A35BDD1C79659C6.title: "&6Attune Bangles to the Schools"
	quest.2A390CCD8D38E8C3.quest_desc: [
		"Harvest &6Ditchbulbs&r. One bulb makes one &6Ditchbulb Paste&r, paste over a stick makes &e2 torches&r."
		""
		"That way your coal stock stays for the furnace. Against rotspawn only the Shard Torch helps, though."
	]
	quest.2A390CCD8D38E8C3.quest_subtitle: "Light without coal."
	quest.2A390CCD8D38E8C3.title: "&eMake Torches from Ditchbulbs"
	quest.2A46BB015A61235B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Prosperity Ore&r lies deep, between &eY -60 and 24&r, up to 12 veins per chunk. It drops &e1 to 4 Prosperity Shards&r, more with Fortune."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/prosperity_shard.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Shards go into everything that is not essence: the seed base for the altar, the Infusion Crystal, ingots and gemstones for tools and Growth Accelerators. One stack is plenty for this chapter."
	]
	quest.2A46BB015A61235B.quest_subtitle: "The second base material."
	quest.2A46BB015A61235B.title: "&fMine Prosperity Shards"
	quest.2A4800512E32D0F1.quest_desc: [
		"Fuse the &6Draconic Bow&r from your Wyvern Bow and fit it with Draconic projectile modules. Recipe and modules are in the chapter &5Draconic: Awakened and Chaos&r."
		""
		"The Guardian's shield has 16,000 points and can be hit as fast as you shoot. The more bows fire at once, the shorter the fight."
	]
	quest.2A4800512E32D0F1.quest_subtitle: "The weapon against the shield."
	quest.2A4800512E32D0F1.title: "&dString the Draconic Bow"
	quest.2A5AE0F34A91D904.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Manasteel ingots&r from Botania. The first come from the &aRitual of the Forest&r (four Infused Iron, two Livingwood Twigs, a Mana Diamond, a Gold Leaf around an oak sapling, gives four), after that from the &aMana Pool&r: Infused Iron for 3,000 mana."
		""
		"How both work is in the &aBotania: Runes&r chapter. No pool of your own? Ask a magician, two ingots are quickly traded."
	]
	quest.2A5AE0F34A91D904.quest_subtitle: "The first machine needs mana."
	quest.2A5AE0F34A91D904.title: "&bGet two Manasteel ingots"
	quest.2A5C561BBC69017D.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a &6feather&r, &6black dye&r and a &6book&r into Spiritfire. Out come the &6Awakened Feather&r, &6Purified Ink&r and &6Taboo Book&r."
		""
		"Every ritual uses up a book of binding, make several sets right away. Black dye also comes from Hexerei belladonna berries. Shapeless together, the three make an empty book of binding."
	]
	quest.2A5C561BBC69017D.quest_subtitle: "Three ingredients from Spiritfire."
	quest.2A5C561BBC69017D.title: "&6Consecrate feather, ink and book"
	quest.2A66B27AF145480F.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Mana Diamonds&r and &e1 Mana Quartz&r on the altar, plus the runes Spring and Water as catalysts. &d12,000 mana&r."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r the Orechid in stage 3."
	]
	quest.2A66B27AF145480F.quest_subtitle: "Catalysts: Spring and Water."
	quest.2A66B27AF145480F.title: "&5Make the Rune of Greed"
	quest.2A68BAE49AD29E1C.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Hardened Blood Shards&r in the top corners, a &6Blood Infusion Core&r in the middle, a &6Dark Block&r below it, one &6Dark Gem&r each left and right of the core and in the bottom corners give the &6Purifier&r. The top middle stays empty. It holds 3 buckets of blood."
		""
		"&eThree uses:&r Cursed tool plus 1 bucket removes the curse. Enchanted item plus &6Blook&r with a full basin pulls a random enchantment into the book, for 3 buckets. An empty bottle with a full basin takes a potion effect off a creature standing in the purifier."
		""
		"It also reverts mob heads that the infuser has transformed further (skeleton skull to zombie head to creeper head to wither skeleton skull)."
	]
	quest.2A68BAE49AD29E1C.quest_subtitle: "Curses gone, enchantments into the book."
	quest.2A68BAE49AD29E1C.title: "&4Build a Purifier"
	quest.2A692A4F13D1A05C.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Ferricore Ingots&r and two sticks give the &6Ferricore Axe&r. The &6Tree Feller&r upgrade is two &6diamond axes&r left and right of a Blank Upgrade."
		""
		"Tree Feller is passive: mine one log, and all connected logs fall with it, up to 64 blocks. The hit takes a little longer than for a single block."
		""
		"&6Leaf Breaker&r goes well with it (two leaf blocks around a blank): right click leaves, and all connected leaves are gone."
	]
	quest.2A692A4F13D1A05C.quest_subtitle: "Ferricore axe with Tree Feller."
	quest.2A692A4F13D1A05C.title: "&2Fell Trees in One Hit"
	quest.2A6B3CDAF9360F83.quest_desc: [
		"Automate every ingredient: a press for brass sheets, a deployer puts planks on shafts for cogwheels, iron nuggets from ore washing, tubes from the tube line."
		""
		"Funnels refill the deployers, the scrap runs back, the mechanisms go into a chest."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r 150 for the obelisk, one per Brass Heart, and many machines from other mods want some: AE2 assembler, IE heavy engineering block, the PneumaticCraft drone."
	]
	quest.2A6B3CDAF9360F83.quest_subtitle: "Mechanisms off the production line."
	quest.2A6B3CDAF9360F83.title: "&6Let the precision line run"
	quest.2A7035218AA9DFF0.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e3 red&r, &e2 cyan&r petals, &e1 Redstone Root&r."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/block/bellethorne.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Constantly hurts all living things nearby with mana, except players. Under a spawner it kills without a weapon."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r It also hits animals and villagers. Switch it off with redstone when needed."
	]
	quest.2A7035218AA9DFF0.quest_subtitle: "Damage to everything except players."
	quest.2A7035218AA9DFF0.title: "&6Plant a Bellethorne"
	quest.2A72E38C0FC2E6EF.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r vier &6Turbine Rotors&r um ein &6Eisenschwert&r."
		""
		"Setz sie gegen eine Kiste mit einem Nahkampf-Schwert. Sie holt sich eins und greift jedes feindliche Monster an: &e16 Blöcke&r zur Seite, 8 nach oben, 5 nach unten. Weniger nach unten, damit sie nicht in jede Höhle teleportiert."
		""
		"Leg Ersatzschwerter in die Kiste. Bricht das letzte, kämpft sie mit bloßen Rotoren weiter, und das bringt wenig. In Stufe 4 bekommt sie ein Minigun Upgrade und Munition statt Schwert."
	]
	quest.2A72E38C0FC2E6EF.quest_subtitle: "Ein Schwert aus der Kiste, dann Wache."
	quest.2A72E38C0FC2E6EF.title: "&cSetz eine Guard Drone ein"
	quest.2A74FD2E1C36B09C.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Treated Sticks&r, three &6Steel Rods&r, two &6LV Wire Connectors&r, a &6leather&r and two &6Insulated LV Wire Coils&r make the frame. At the &6Engineer's Workbench&r you insert an &6accumulator&r."
		""
		"It charges the tools in your hands and the armor you wear. You wear it as a chest piece, or you combine it with a chestplate at the crafting table."
		""
		"With the &6Charging Antenna&r it charges itself when you walk under an uninsulated wire."
	]
	quest.2A74FD2E1C36B09C.quest_subtitle: "Power for everything in your hands."
	quest.2A74FD2E1C36B09C.title: "&eWear an Accumulator Backpack"
	quest.2A75A6F7DEC25645.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &e16 soulstone&r. It is a rock of its own from Mystical Agriculture and lies throughout the Nether."
		""
		"You also find &6Nether Inferium Ore&r and &6Nether Prosperity Ore&r here, the same shards and essences as in the overworld, just in netherrack. What you do with them is in the &6Mystical Agriculture&r chapter."
	]
	quest.2A75A6F7DEC25645.quest_subtitle: "Mystical Agriculture has filled the Nether with ore."
	quest.2A75A6F7DEC25645.title: "&8Dig soulstone"
	quest.2A7B30A610BA1BC7.quest_desc: [
		"Build a &6brush&r (feather, copper ingot, stick) and brush &6suspicious sand&r or gravel in a ruin."
		""
		"Besides pottery sherds, there is an artifact inside with &e6.25 percent&r. Dungeons and Taverns and the Cataclysm pyramid have their own archaeology."
	]
	quest.2A7B30A610BA1BC7.quest_subtitle: "Archaeology in ruins and temples."
	quest.2A7B30A610BA1BC7.title: "&6Brush suspicious sand"
	quest.2A7DACF11F66F62A.quest_desc: [
		"Eine Kammer zieht nur, solange sie simuliert, aber dann richtig: &d128 FE/t&r für einen Zombie sind sechs Wärmegeneratoren, &d768 FE/t&r für ein Witherskelett ein kleines Kraftwerk. Der Puffer von 2 Millionen FE fängt Spitzen ab, ersetzt aber keine Quelle."
		""
		"Leg die Kammern an &eeine Leitung&r. In Stufe 3 öffnet &6Flux Networks&r: ein Flux Plug am Generator, ein Flux Point an jeder Kammer, keine Kabel durch die Halle. Wie das geht, steht im Kapitel &6Flux Networks&r, Stromquellen im Kapitel &6Powah&r."
		""
		"&eRechenhilfe:&r Stromwert mal 240 ist der Verbrauch pro Simulation. Stromwert mal Kammern ist, was dein Netz liefern muss, wenn alle laufen."
	]
	quest.2A7DACF11F66F62A.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 3. Ein Netz, viele Kammern."
	quest.2A7DACF11F66F62A.title: "&dStrom für die Kammer"
	quest.2A808BAE9F0BDCF8.quest_desc: [
		"Material: &e4 dirt&r."
		""
		"Plus &e4 Inferium Essence&r and a &6Prosperity Seed Base&r in the Infusion Altar."
	]
	quest.2A808BAE9F0BDCF8.quest_subtitle: "One seed, one checkmark."
	quest.2A808BAE9F0BDCF8.title: "Seed: Dirt"
	quest.2A8331C8B4E4F190.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r &6two Blueprint Paper&r, &6one paper&r, &6one stone&r, shapeless. Then blueprint plus one material. Tool plus tip in the grid fits it."
		""
		"Iron: +128 durability, +1 speed, +1 damage, iron mining level. Gold: +6 speed. Redstone: +20 percent speed, +2 damage. Diamond: +256 durability, diamond mining level."
		""
		"&eTip:&r An iron tip on a stone head mines diamond ore for the price of one ingot."
	]
	quest.2A8331C8B4E4F190.quest_subtitle: "A hard core at the edge."
	quest.2A8331C8B4E4F190.title: "&6Put on a tip"
	quest.2A8DFA7B8DC8A51F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_master_wilden_ritual.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Shapeless: &5Vexing Archwood Log&r, &e3 Wilden parts&r (spike, horn, wing, mixed), &9lapis block&r."
		""
		"Without additions the ritual summons a group of Wilden. Throw one &espike&r, one &ehorn&r and one &ewing&r onto the brazier, then the &5Wilden Chimera&r comes. Only it gives the &5Wilden Tribute&r for the archmage book."
	]
	quest.2A8DFA7B8DC8A51F.quest_subtitle: "The way to archmage leads through a boss fight."
	quest.2A8DFA7B8DC8A51F.title: "&5&lMake the Summon Wilden Tablet"
	quest.2A93100F5F237FD4.quest_desc: [
		"Top and bottom &e3 sourcestone&r each, in the middle gold ingot, &6Source Gem&r, gold ingot."
		""
		"The core on its own does nothing. In the next step the apparatus goes on top of it."
	]
	quest.2A93100F5F237FD4.quest_subtitle: "The base for the apparatus."
	quest.2A93100F5F237FD4.title: "&aBuild an Arcane Core"
	quest.2A9833FC215DAA3D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Scuba Mask:&r top steel, middle glass, circuit, glass, bottom left and right steel. &6Scuba Tank:&r top a circuit, middle alloy, &6Basic Chemical Tank&r, alloy, bottom three steel."
		""
		"The tank holds &e24,000 mB of oxygen&r. Filling like the jetpack: put it into the item slot of a Chemical Tank full of oxygen. The Electrolytic Separator supplies the oxygen."
		""
		"Put both on and switch the tank on. As long as there is oxygen inside, you don't drown. Ideal for ocean monuments and salt under water."
	]
	quest.2A9833FC215DAA3D.quest_subtitle: "Scuba Mask and Scuba Tank."
	quest.2A9833FC215DAA3D.title: "&bDive with oxygen"
	quest.2AA11557F9128EF1.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6glass bottle&r in the middle, &e2 Abjuration Essences&r, a &6Source Gem block&r and a &6gold block&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"The &6Potion Flask&r holds &d8 charges&r of one potion. You fill it shapeless: flask and potion together at the crafting table. From stage 2 a Potion Jar fills it too."
		""
		"Two variants in the apparatus: with &e8 Abjuration Essences&r the flask turns into &dAmplify&r (one potion level more, half duration), with &e8 Manipulation Essences&r into &dExtend Time&r (&e50 percent&r longer)."
	]
	quest.2AA11557F9128EF1.quest_subtitle: "Eight sips in one flask."
	quest.2AA11557F9128EF1.title: "&6Fill a Potion Flask"
	quest.2AA1223E5333EA03.quest_desc: [
		"&6Raw osmium&r into the furnace or Energized Smelter, &e32 ingots&r out."
		""
		"Take a pickaxe with &6Fortune&r along. Later the ore ladder gets more out of every raw ore, see the &5Mekanism: Ore Step by Step&r chapter."
	]
	quest.2AA1223E5333EA03.quest_subtitle: "Enough for the infuser, generator and circuits."
	quest.2AA1223E5333EA03.title: "&7Smelt 32 osmium ingots"
	quest.2AA25AAEDABD9E60.quest_desc: [
		"&cBlazing log&r, &e3 gold swords&r, &e3 books&r."
		""
		"Monsters nearby disintegrate into &6experience gems&r with double experience, without loot. Each costs a little source. At the exit of a monster farm the fastest source for the 160 points of every tier 3 glyph."
	]
	quest.2AA25AAEDABD9E60.quest_subtitle: "Monsters become experience."
	quest.2AA25AAEDABD9E60.title: "&aMake the Disintegration Tablet"
	quest.2AA7F6D6A7535026.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_crusher.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Plastic, &6Nether wart&r, plastic at the top, &6magma cream&r left and right of the Advanced Frame, &6emeralds&r and redstone at the bottom."
		""
		"A Mob Imprisonment Tool with a mob inside, plus &aEssence&r and &d5,000 FE&r per operation. It spawns copies around itself and stops when there are too many nearby. With the Mob Crusher next to it, that is a mob farm without a spawner."
	]
	quest.2AA7F6D6A7535026.quest_subtitle: "One captured mob, as many copies as you like."
	quest.2AA7F6D6A7535026.title: "&cSet Up a Mob Duplicator"
	quest.2AB1B8F745B30491.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_chamber.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Bau einen &ehohlen Würfel&r aus Kammerwänden und Kammergläsern, 3x3x3, 4x4x4 oder 5x5x5. &6Ventil&r und &6Schnittstellen&r sitzen in einer &eFläche&r, nie an einer Kante oder Ecke. Sobald die Hülle geschlossen ist, bildet sich die Kammer von selbst."
		""
		"&eSo stellst du sie auf:&r Schnittstelle mit dem I nach außen an eine Seite, daneben eine mit dem O nach außen, einen Trichter oder ein Rohr an jede. Das Ventil bekommt das Rohr vom Kompressor. Rechtsklick auf das Ventil öffnet das Fenster mit Druck und Inhalt."
		""
		"Eine 3x3x3-Kammer hat &e16 000 mL&r Volumen. Für einen vollen Stapel durch die Schnittstelle braucht sie 64 000 mL, also 4 Bar. Größere Kammern fassen mehr Luft und sind ein guter Druckspeicher, brauchen aber länger, bis der Druck steht."
		""
		"&cAchtung:&r Auch die Kammer hält nur &e5 Bar&r. Das verstärkte Ventil für 20 Bar kommt in Stufe 3 aus der Montagestraße."
	]
	quest.2AB1B8F745B30491.quest_subtitle: "Ein hohler Würfel, 3x3x3 bis 5x5x5."
	quest.2AB1B8F745B30491.title: "&b&lSetz die Druckkammer zusammen"
	quest.2AB3983F2812DCDC.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Ignitium template&r: netherite smithing template in the middle, &64 blaze powder&r on the sides, &64 Nether brick blocks&r in the corners. At the smithing table, with an Ignitium ingot it turns netherite armour into Ignitium armour."
		""
		"&eThe pieces:&r helmet with an ember mark on a key press, chestplate (can later be combined with elytra), leggings with flame reflex, boots that let you walk on lava."
		""
		"&eWeapons:&r &6Bulwark of the Flame&r (shield, 2 Ignitium, 2 blaze rods, 4 Nether bricks), &6Incinerator&r (netherite sword, 2 Ignitium, 4 blaze rods), &6Blazing Grips&r (8 Nether bricks around one Ignitium)."
	]
	quest.2AB3983F2812DCDC.quest_subtitle: "Netherite becomes Ignitium."
	quest.2AB3983F2812DCDC.title: "&6Forge Ignitium gear"
	quest.2ABB97A55E126FDB.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &63 Elementium Ingots&r and &62 Dreamwood Twigs&r like an iron pickaxe."
		""
		"&ePickaxe:&r destroys cobblestone, dirt, netherrack and similar rubble while mining. &eShovel:&r mines a whole column of gravel or sand at once. &eAxe:&r sometimes chops off heads. &eHoe:&r makes farmland moist at once."
	]
	quest.2ABB97A55E126FDB.quest_subtitle: "A tool that destroys rubble."
	quest.2ABB97A55E126FDB.title: "&6Build an Elementium Pickaxe"
	quest.2ABC5EF31B47C4DC.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &e8 Raw Azure Silver&r from Silent Gear. Smelted, it is the material above Crimson Iron (chapter &6Silent Gear&r)."
		""
		"&eAlso in end stone:&r &6platinum ore&r from Oritech, End Inferium and End Prosperium ore from Mystical Agradditions, &6Dimensional Shards&r from RFTools and end stone nests from Productive Bees."
	]
	quest.2ABC5EF31B47C4DC.quest_subtitle: "Azure silver, platinum and essences in end stone."
	quest.2ABC5EF31B47C4DC.title: "&3Mine the Other End Ores"
	quest.2ACCF401A4BC26C4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_advanced_boiler.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Boiler Casing:&r four steel around iron, gives four. &6Boiler Valve:&r four casings around an Advanced Control Circuit, gives two. Inside, &6Superheating Elements&r at the bottom, and a layer of &6Pressure Dispersers&r above them separates water and steam."
		""
		"Water in through one valve, heat added, &bsteam&r out of another valve that you set to output with the Configurator. The steam drives the Industrial Turbine."
	]
	quest.2ACCF401A4BC26C4.quest_subtitle: "Water in, steam out."
	quest.2ACCF401A4BC26C4.title: "&6&lBuild a Thermoelectric Boiler"
	quest.2AD5CA9C51152B0C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Immersive Engineering&r, &6Förderband&r: bewegt Gegenstände und Tiere ganz ohne Antrieb und schiebt sie am Ende in ein Inventar. Varianten: &6Extrahierend&r (zieht wie ein Trichter), &6Senkrecht&r, &6Fallend&r, &6Teilend&r, &6Redstone-gesteuert&r und &6Abgedeckt&r. Kein Filter. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Rezepte in EMI, Richtung und Steigung mit dem Ingenieurshammer. Farbstoff färbt die Seitenwände. Siehe Kapitel Immersive Engineering."
	]
	quest.2AD5CA9C51152B0C.quest_subtitle: "Immersive Engineering, Förderband: läuft ohne Antrieb."
	quest.2AD5CA9C51152B0C.title: "Lies: IE-Förderbänder"
	quest.2AE4542C3AE5DBDB.quest_desc: [
		"&ePoison&r: Potion of Poison. &eSlowness&r: Potion of Slowness. &eInstant Damage&r: Potion of Harming."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r The candle works on everyone nearby, you too. Put it in a mob trap, not in the living room."
	]
	quest.2AE4542C3AE5DBDB.quest_subtitle: "Poison, slowness, harming."
	quest.2AE4542C3AE5DBDB.title: "&4Soak candles against enemies"
	quest.2AEF31B32E2CC63D.quest_desc: [
		"When you first join you choose an &6origin&r and a &6role&r. New to modpacks? &6Crown Citizen&r and &6Millchild&r are easy to play."
		""
		"Every origin has real strengths and a real weakness. The role (&6Engineer&r, &6Arcanist&r, &6Builder&r, &6Explorer&r, &6Keeper&r, &6Provider&r, &6Trader&r) gives small bonuses that fit a pillar. A group with different roles gets ahead faster."
		""
		"No origin can fly or skip a stage. &eO&r shows your powers, more in &6Tips and Tricks&r."
	]
	quest.2AEF31B32E2CC63D.quest_subtitle: "Who you are changes how you play."
	quest.2AEF31B32E2CC63D.title: "&6Choose your origin and role"
	quest.2AF19A157D9CAAE2.quest_desc: [
		"In the heated lava cauldron: &e5 stone&r, &e2 iron ingots&r, a &6nether quartz&r."
		""
		"Right click puts an item in, sneaking a stack. Once all ingredients of a recipe are in, it grinds them by itself and you can take nothing out any more. Five Belladonna Berries become four black dye that way."
	]
	quest.2AF19A157D9CAAE2.quest_subtitle: "Grind first, then cast."
	quest.2AF19A157D9CAAE2.title: "&6Build Pestle and Mortar"
	quest.2AF25EF517ED9037.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_belt.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Create&r, &6Mechanisches Förderband&r: Rechtsklick mit dem Band auf zwei Wellen, &e2 bis 20 Blöcke&r lang, waagerecht, schräg oder senkrecht. Trägt Gegenstände und Tiere mit der Drehzahl der Welle. Filter nur über Messing-Trichter und -Tunnel. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Sechs getrockneter Seetang ergeben ein Band. Rechtsklick mit leerer Hand nimmt Gegenstände vom Band. Andesit-Gehäuse verkleidet es."
		""
		"Das Band ist die Maschinenstraße von Stufe 1: Mühle, Presse, Sägewerk und Lüfter arbeiten direkt darauf. Mehr im Kapitel Create."
	]
	quest.2AF25EF517ED9037.quest_subtitle: "Create, Mechanisches Förderband: so schnell wie die Welle dreht."
	quest.2AF25EF517ED9037.title: "Spann ein Förderband"
	quest.2AF3D2BE896174C2.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r three &6Ferricore Ingots&r at the bottom, two &6hoppers&r left and right of an &6ender pearl&r, a &6diamond&r on top."
		""
		"The &6Item Collector&r is the only Ferricore machine with an area: everything lying on the ground in its area it sucks in and puts into the inventory it is attached to. &eRender Area&r shows the area, &eRAD&r enlarges it, &eOFF&r shifts it. Filter slots with an Allow or Deny List decide what it takes."
		""
		"It belongs at the end of every goo line, under the Lawn Mower, next to the Blazegold hoe that drops its harvest on the ground, or at a mob spawner."
	]
	quest.2AF3D2BE896174C2.quest_subtitle: "Sucks up everything lying around."
	quest.2AF3D2BE896174C2.title: "&aBuild the Item Collector"
	quest.2AF9D599B1A1865F.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Iron Sheets&r, an &6iron ingot&r and an &6Andesite Casing&r make the &6Mechanical Saw&r. Facing up it processes whatever lands on it or passes on the belt."
		""
		"Logs give more planks than in the crafting table, and it can do every stonecutter recipe. With several results you choose with a &6List Filter&r (iron nuggets and wool)."
	]
	quest.2AF9D599B1A1865F.quest_subtitle: "More planks, and everything from the stonecutter."
	quest.2AF9D599B1A1865F.title: "&6Cut wood with the saw"
	quest.2AFDDA6FB7F92C4F.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6books&r around an &6anvil&r give eight &6Tomes of Scrapping&r."
		""
		"Put a tome with an enchanted item into the anvil: the item is destroyed, and you get a book with &ehalf&r of its enchantments (rounded up, chosen at random). Good for loot with enchantments you do not want to wear."
		""
		"Through infusion it later becomes the &6Tome of Superior Scrapping&r (all enchantments, Eterna 45) and the &6Tome of Extraction&r (all enchantments, item stays intact, Eterna 60)."
	]
	quest.2AFDDA6FB7F92C4F.quest_subtitle: "Save enchantments before the tool breaks."
	quest.2AFDDA6FB7F92C4F.title: "&7Tome of Scrapping"
	quest.2B0AA104CC0C908D.quest_desc: [
		"Der &cFerrous Wroughtnaut&r aus &6Mowzie's Mobs&r steht in einer Kammer unter der Erde und wacht erst auf, wenn du nah kommst. Von vorn prallt alles ab. Weich seiner Axt aus und schlag in den &eRücken&r, am besten wenn die Axt im Boden steckt."
		""
		"Er hat nur &e40 Lebenspunkte&r, trifft aber für 30. Ein Fehler kostet dich mit Eisenrüstung fast alles, mit Diamant die Hälfte. Goldapfel vorher essen."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r &6Wrought Helm&r (unzerstörbar) und die &6Axt der tausend Metalle&r: unzerstörbar, Rechtsklick schlägt im Bogen, schleichend rammst du sie in den Boden für eine Stoßwelle."
	]
	quest.2B0AA104CC0C908D.quest_subtitle: "Eine Rüstung ohne Lücke, außer am Rücken."
	quest.2B0AA104CC0C908D.title: "&7Besiege den Ferrous Wroughtnaut"
	quest.2B140A50CBCAF2D0.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat the Guardian without a single armor piece. That gives the advancement &eMythologia's End&r."
		""
		"No advantage, only honor. Do it live, otherwise nobody will believe you."
	]
	quest.2B140A50CBCAF2D0.quest_subtitle: "Mythologia's End, only for the insane."
	quest.2B140A50CBCAF2D0.title: "&5Win Without Armor"
	quest.2B19FD9C9EE0F08B.quest_desc: [
		"On top gold, &6crafting table&r, gold. In the middle Crushed Dark Gem, &6ender chest&r, Crushed Dark Gem. At the bottom gold, iron, gold."
		""
		"Right click opens a crafting grid wherever you are, plus the contents of your &6ender chest&r. With a normal &6chest&r instead of the ender chest you get the &6Wooden Exalted Crafter&r with its own inventory. It can also be put on a key."
		""
		"&eTip:&r If lightning strikes the crafter, it becomes indestructible and no longer despawns when it lies on the ground."
	]
	quest.2B19FD9C9EE0F08B.quest_subtitle: "The crafting table for your pocket."
	quest.2B19FD9C9EE0F08B.title: "&5Build an Exalted Crafter"
	quest.2B1FF34C1DF3246D.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 petals&r, &e2 blaze powder&r, &e1 gold nugget&r. One spark on a pool, one on the plate, and the plate draws its mana directly."
		""
		"Several pools with sparks speed it up. A sneaking right click with the wand removes a spark, coloured sparks form separate networks."
	]
	quest.2B1FF34C1DF3246D.quest_subtitle: "Mana without a beam and without loss."
	quest.2B1FF34C1DF3246D.title: "&6Place Mana Sparks"
	quest.2B27204C1938F33D.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Ertrunkene&r mit dem Learner im Inventar. Sie zählen als eigenes Modell, nicht als Zombie."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet nur &d128 FE/t&r, und eine Vorhersage wird zu 64 Verrottetem Fleisch oder &68 Kupferbarren&r. Für Create und Mekanism ist Kupfer nie genug."
	]
	quest.2B27204C1938F33D.quest_subtitle: "Kupfer aus dem Wasser."
	quest.2B27204C1938F33D.title: "&3Lerne den Ertrunkenen"
	quest.2B440566D09838BA.quest_desc: [
		"Oritech's &6Destroyer Block&r travels on a frame up to 64 blocks per side and mines the layer below. With the Quarry Addon it becomes a quarry."
		""
		"Frame, Destroyer and addons: chapter &6Oritech&r."
	]
	quest.2B440566D09838BA.quest_subtitle: "Oritech digs under a frame."
	quest.2B440566D09838BA.title: "&7Do You Know the Destroyer?"
	quest.2B4960E206BB4BE9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_survey.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Mineral Survey Tools:&r book and quill, glass bottle, hammer at the top, three Tough Fabric at the bottom. &6Core Sample Drill:&r Steel Scaffolding and Steel Fences, two Light Engineering Blocks at the bottom."
		""
		"On natural stone the tools roughly show where a vein lies. The drill takes a &6Core Sample&r at &d40 FE/t&r: which ores are in it and how saturated. Placed while sneaking, the sample marks the vein on a map."
	]
	quest.2B4960E206BB4BE9.quest_subtitle: "Survey, drill, read the core sample."
	quest.2B4960E206BB4BE9.title: "&6Find a Mineral Vein"
	quest.2B59AABCCAFA469D.quest_desc: [
		"6 &6Spell Cloth&r and 3 &6Powdered Gold&r. It holds three stacks of scrolls."
		""
		"Sneaking and right clicking opens it, the key &eChange Mystic Code&r jumps between the scrolls, right click uses the chosen one."
	]
	quest.2B59AABCCAFA469D.quest_subtitle: "Three stacks of scrolls in one hand."
	quest.2B59AABCCAFA469D.title: "&6Sew a Mystic Code"
	quest.2B5B554394BB3E43.quest_desc: [
		"&6Stirling Generator:&r Zahnrad, Ofen, Zahnrad oben, Eisen, Gehäuse der Leere, Eisen in der Mitte, Obsidian, Tiefenschiefer, Obsidian unten. Ohne &6Kondensator&r im Slot läuft er nicht."
		""
		"&eEnder IO, Stirling Generator:&r Brennstoff alles Brennbare, &d40 µI/t&r mit dem einfachen Kondensator, bessere Kondensatoren holen mehr aus jedem Stück heraus, Puffer 64 000. µI ist FE. &ePhotovoltaik-Module:&r Energetisch &d4 µI/t&r, Pulsierend 16, Strahlend 64, nur bei Tag."
		""
		"&eKondensatorbänke:&r Einfach &d500 000 µI&r, Fortgeschritten 2 Millionen, Strahlend 4 Millionen, mehrere nebeneinander werden eine. &6Energieleitungen&r liegen mit Item- und Flüssigkeitsleitungen im selben Block. Offen ab Stufe 3, siehe Kapitel &6Ender IO&r."
	]
	quest.2B5B554394BB3E43.quest_subtitle: "Ender IO: 40 µI/t Stirling, 4 bis 64 µI/t Photovoltaik, Kondensatorbänke."
	quest.2B5B554394BB3E43.title: "&5Bau den Stirling Generator"
	quest.2B5CA14619486FF0.quest_desc: [
		"&e1.&r &6Upgrade Matrix&r: ein Lapislazuli mit 1 000 mB Wasser in der &6Thermopneumatic Processing Plant&r bei 2 bar ergibt vier Matrizen."
		"&e2.&r &6Solar Wafer&r: eine Matrix und eine &6Amethystscherbe&r in der Druckkammer bei &e2,5 bar&r."
		"&e3.&r &6Solar Cell&r: der Wafer mit dem Programm &eDrill&r durch die Montagestraße."
		""
		"Du brauchst drei Zellen für den Kompressor und weitere, um ihn zu reparieren, falls er überhitzt. Mach also gleich sechs."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Die Upgrade Matrix ersetzt in jedem Upgrade-Rezept den Lapislazuli, aus einem Lapis werden so vier Upgrades statt einem."
	]
	quest.2B5CA14619486FF0.quest_subtitle: "Lapis, Wasser, Amethyst und der Bohrer."
	quest.2B5CA14619486FF0.title: "&6Mach drei Solar Cells"
	quest.2B62F934479B6975.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r lever on top, &6Brass Casing&r in the middle, &6Precision Mechanism&r at the bottom give a &6Brass Switch&r. Placed like the Andesite Switch: click the track, put it down next to it."
		""
		"In the &eswitch mode&r value box you decide whether the switch applies only to manually driven trains or also to trains on a schedule. If you drive yourself, you can set a Brass Switch from inside the train while approaching."
		""
		"A &6Display Link&r on the switch writes its position (straight, left, right) onto a display board."
	]
	quest.2B62F934479B6975.quest_subtitle: "Switches that scheduled trains set too."
	quest.2B62F934479B6975.title: "&6Build a Brass Switch"
	quest.2B6FCE63DBDC9974.quest_desc: [
		"Never played a modpack? Then this chapter is for you. It explains what every other chapter assumes: the &6quest book&r, &6JEI&r, the &6map&r, &6claims&r and &6teams&r, the &6rules&r of Kronwerke and what to do when the game gets stuck."
		""
		"Every quest here is a short text and a checkmark. Read what interests you, check it off, take the reward. Five rows, top to bottom: &eQuest book&r, &eJEI and Jade&r, &eMap and team&r, &eRules&r, &eWhen something goes wrong&r."
		""
		"If you already know Kronwerke, skim the &eRules&r row and pick up the rest along the way."
	]
	quest.2B6FCE63DBDC9974.quest_subtitle: "Everything that sets a modpack apart from vanilla, at a glance."
	quest.2B6FCE63DBDC9974.title: "&6Tips and Tricks"
	quest.2B98A34EC942E3BF.quest_desc: [
		"The quest book guides you through the start of every mod. For anything deeper the mods have their own books: the &6Lexica Botania&r (a book and a sapling at the crafting table), Ars Nouveau's &6Worn Notebook&r, the &6Silent Gear guide&r and Occultism's &6Dictionary of Spirits&r."
		""
		"Create explains itself with &6Ponder&r: hover over a Create block in your inventory or in EMI and hold &eW&r. A small scene shows you how it works."
		""
		"You can find all books in EMI. Search for the mod with &e@&r; the book is usually right at the front."
	]
	quest.2B98A34EC942E3BF.quest_subtitle: "Almost every big mod comes with its own handbook."
	quest.2B98A34EC942E3BF.title: "&6Read the mods' books"
	quest.2B99AA887C15BA2B.quest_desc: [
		"Blow up a spawner you do not need with &6TNT&r. It starts to shake and detonates by itself a few seconds later, dropping the stored monster and &e48 to 64 Spawner Chains&r."
		""
		"Two &6Gem Dust&r around a &6Gem-Fused Slate&r on top, two chains around a slate in the middle, three chains at the bottom give two blank &6Spawner Runes&r. Every finished rune is built from a blank one."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r With Apotheosis the items of Apothic Spawners (sugar, clock, fermented spider eye) are disabled as spawner upgrades. On Kronwerke everything goes through runes."
	]
	quest.2B99AA887C15BA2B.quest_subtitle: "First blow up, then forge."
	quest.2B99AA887C15BA2B.title: "&8Forge Spawner Runes"
	quest.2B99F004F95F24A3.quest_desc: [
		"At the top &6boron ingot, boron block, boron ingot&r, in the middle &6Tough Alloy, tin silver, Tough Alloy&r, at the bottom &6boron ingot, actuator, boron ingot&r."
		""
		"The Alloy Smelter makes &6tin silver&r from three tin dust and one silver dust."
	]
	quest.2B99F004F95F24A3.quest_subtitle: "The heart of the controller."
	quest.2B99F004F95F24A3.title: "&bBuild a Decay Hastener"
	quest.2B9E8D01FC0EB971.quest_desc: [
		"&6Item Collectors&r, &6Basic Item Collector&r: sammelt alle Gegenstände im eingestellten Bereich bis &e5 Blöcke&r um sich herum in das Inventar, auf dem er sitzt. Kein Filter. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Rezept in EMI, Bereich im Fenster einstellen. Ein Collector auf einer Truhe unter dem Mob-Fall ersetzt alle Wasserströme."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r Der &6Advanced Item Collector&r reicht &e7 Blöcke&r und hat einen Filter mit Whitelist und Blacklist."
	]
	quest.2B9E8D01FC0EB971.quest_subtitle: "Item Collectors, Basic Collector: saugt im Umkreis von 5 Blöcken ein."
	quest.2B9E8D01FC0EB971.title: "Stell einen Item Collector auf"
	quest.2BA13083676DB1BC.quest_desc: [
		"Two small &6flowers&r, a &6coral&r and a &6bone meal&r make two &6Tree Fertilizer&r."
		""
		"On a sapling it grows a tree no matter how little room there is around it. That way the trees for the saw wheel stand close together in a row."
	]
	quest.2BA13083676DB1BC.quest_subtitle: "Tree Fertilizer for the saw wheel farm."
	quest.2BA13083676DB1BC.title: "&6Grow trees close together"
	quest.2BAE5A98D0EA2865.quest_desc: [
		"&6Shaft&r, &6Andesite Casing&r and &6Propeller&r (four Iron Sheets around an alloy) make the &6Encased Fan&r. It blows or sucks up to &e20 blocks&r far."
		""
		"One block right in front of the opening turns it into a machine: &bwater&r washes, &clava&r smelts, &6fire&r smokes food. Soul fire for haunting needs soul sand from the Nether, so stage 2."
	]
	quest.2BAE5A98D0EA2865.quest_subtitle: "Wind that processes items."
	quest.2BAE5A98D0EA2865.title: "&6Build a fan"
	quest.2BAF75FA7C49C846.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_gear_sg_end.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Azur-Silbererz&r liegt im Endstein, 8 Adern pro Chunk zwischen Y 16 und 92. Block Azur-Silber, 2 Gold, Enderperle in der Alloy Forge ergibt 3 &6Azur-Elektrum&r."
		""
		"Azur-Elektrum: 1 259 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 29, +7, Leicht IV, Beschleunigung. &6Tyrann-Stahl&r (Purpur-Stahl, Azur-Elektrum, zerstoßene Shulkerschale, Netheritschrott ergeben 4): 3 652 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 18, +8, Rüstung 25 mit Zähigkeit 12, Leerenwächter."
	]
	quest.2BAF75FA7C49C846.quest_subtitle: "Silent Gear: die Metalle aus dem End."
	quest.2BAF75FA7C49C846.title: "&bSchmiede Azur-Elektrum und Tyrann-Stahl"
	quest.2BB20719455725B0.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Treated Wood Fences&r on top of each other on a &6stone brick&r make a &6Wooden Post&r."
		""
		"A post is &e4 blocks&r high, so you need that much room above it. The hammer on one side of the topmost block adds an arm. On it you hang connectors, relays, transformers or lamps."
		""
		"That way your grid runs above heads and paths instead of straight through the base."
	]
	quest.2BB20719455725B0.quest_subtitle: "Four blocks high, with an arm for the wire."
	quest.2BB20719455725B0.title: "&6Set up Wooden Posts for your lines"
	quest.2BB79494F161FE24.quest_desc: [
		"&6Extraction:&r iron, plastic, iron at the top, iron, &6dispenser&r, iron in the middle, iron, &6Conveyor Belt&r, iron at the bottom. &6Insertion:&r the same, with a &6hopper&r instead of the dispenser."
		""
		"Right click a belt with the upgrade to install it. Extraction pulls items and fluids from the inventory next to it, even from player inventories. Insertion pushes them in. In the window you filter what may pass."
		""
		"The other upgrades: detection gives redstone, dropping drops, bouncing throws, blinking teleports, splitting distributes in the set ratio."
	]
	quest.2BB79494F161FE24.quest_subtitle: "Extraction and insertion."
	quest.2BB79494F161FE24.title: "&eUpgrade Conveyor Belts"
	quest.2BBB6FFF556F0121.quest_desc: [
		"The chain: cobblestone into the &6Millstone&r, the gravel in front of a &6fan&r with water. Gravel washing gives flint with &e25 percent&r and an iron nugget with &e12.5 percent&r."
		""
		"A &6Mechanical Press&r over a basin of lava compacts 2 &6flint&r, 1 &6gravel&r and &b100 mB lava&r into one &6andesite&r. A &6Mechanical Mixer&r over a second basin makes &etwo andesite alloys&r from 1 andesite and 1 iron nugget."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The alloy piles up in a chest as long as the generator runs, and you take it to the obelisk. Press and mixer are in the &6Create&r chapter."
	]
	quest.2BBB6FFF556F0121.quest_subtitle: "Cobblestone and lava become andesite alloy, without any mine."
	quest.2BBB6FFF556F0121.title: "&7Build an alloy line"
	quest.2BBC43A1735E2DFD.quest_desc: [
		"Build your own spells, Source Jars, Starbuncles and the &aImbuement Chamber&r, the only way to Source Gems for the magic pillar."
	]
	quest.2BBC43A1735E2DFD.quest_subtitle: "Spells from glyphs, source, Source Gems."
	quest.2BBC43A1735E2DFD.title: "&dOpen Ars Nouveau"
	quest.2BD2F0D498C91812.quest_desc: [
		"A &6string&r over a &6Tallow&r makes a &6Large Candle&r. Candles from Minecraft or other mods count in pentacles just the same."
		""
		"Candles slow down the essence decay of the summoned spirit. Large candles count like bookshelves at the enchanting table and can be dyed in 16 colours."
	]
	quest.2BD2F0D498C91812.quest_subtitle: "Candles keep the circle stable."
	quest.2BD2F0D498C91812.title: "&6Pour four Large Candles"
	quest.2BD41068DBFF46C1.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_manastar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Apothecary: &e1 light blue, green, red and cyan&r petal each. Plant it right next to a pool."
		""
		"&bBlue&r: more comes in than goes out. &cRed&r: the pool is losing. The wand's bar is too coarse for big pools, the star is not."
	]
	quest.2BD41068DBFF46C1.quest_subtitle: "Gain or loss at a glance."
	quest.2BD41068DBFF46C1.title: "&6Plant a Manastar"
	quest.2BD8A5A2029E3D0D.quest_desc: [
		"&eLaut Server-Config:&r"
		"&6Zinn:&r zwischen Y -32 und Y 94."
		"&6Blei:&r ganz unten bis Y 64, am meisten in der Tiefenschieferschicht."
		"&6Uran:&r nur tief, unter Y 8. Viele Adern liegen im Stein vergraben und berühren keine Höhle."
		"&6Fluorit:&r unter Y 23, ein Teil davon nur in festem Stein unter Y 4."
		"&6Osmium:&r große Adern im Gebirge über Y 72, dazu kleinere von ganz unten bis Y 64."
		""
		"Ein Strip-Mine-Gang auf Y -16 trifft fast alles auf einmal. Salz liegt in Tonablagerungen unter Wasser."
	]
	quest.2BD8A5A2029E3D0D.quest_subtitle: "Jedes Metall hat seine Höhe."
	quest.2BD8A5A2029E3D0D.title: "&7Merk dir, wo die Erze liegen"
	quest.2BDAE54068A44274.quest_desc: [
		"&6Four stone&r in the corners, &6two hoppers&r top and bottom, &6two redstone&r on the sides, a &6drawer&r in the middle."
		""
		"It sucks up items lying in front of the set side. Good under cacti, sugar cane or a mob trap."
	]
	quest.2BDAE54068A44274.quest_subtitle: "The Collector Upgrade."
	quest.2BDAE54068A44274.title: "Collect items from the ground"
	quest.2BDDD09FD2584160.quest_desc: [
		"&6Basic Amulet&r: &e3 string&r in an arc, an &6Arcane Gold&r below."
		"Worktable: Pewter at the top, &e2 Pewter Inlay&r on the sides, the Basic Amulet in the middle, &6obsidian&r at the bottom, &e2 Soul Shards&r in the extra slots."
		""
		"Worn, the amulet catches a projectile that would hit you. After that it recharges for about &d10 seconds&r. Skeletons and blazes lose much of their terror."
	]
	quest.2BDDD09FD2584160.quest_subtitle: "Arrows simply vanish."
	quest.2BDDD09FD2584160.title: "&5Forge a Void Amulet"
	quest.2BE98D793C03A54D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/draconic_dust.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Mine &6Draconium Ore&r in end stone until you have &e32 draconium dust&r, and smelt &e16 ingots&r. It lies between &eY 0 and 70&r, three veins per chunk."
		""
		"{image:draconicevolution:textures/item/components/draconium_dust.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Without Silk Touch one ore gives &e2 to 4 dust&r, Fortune brings more. With Silk Touch you only get the ore, and that smelts into one ingot. So go for the dust."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The ore veins in the Overworld and the Nether are switched off. The goal wants &e1,000 draconium ingots&r."
	]
	quest.2BE98D793C03A54D.quest_subtitle: "It only grows in the End now."
	quest.2BE98D793C03A54D.title: "&5&lMine Draconium"
	quest.2BEB4ABABEC4AA2A.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a &6Waystone&r to activate it. From any waystone you travel to all the ones you have already activated."
		""
		"&eCost on Kronwerke:&r 1 level per 100 blocks, at most 27, into another dimension always 27. Wild waystones stand about every 25 chunks and in villages. Activate the one at spawn too."
	]
	quest.2BEB4ABABEC4AA2A.quest_subtitle: "Click it once, travel there again and again."
	quest.2BEB4ABABEC4AA2A.title: "&6Activate a waystone"
	quest.2BEE4AFB22C4B99B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6rose bush&r on top, a &6BaBee Upgrade&r in the middle, seven &6iron ingots&r. The &6Breeding Chamber&r needs &d50 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Put both parents in cages inside, plus their food flowers and empty cages. After &e5 minutes&r the child is ready in a cage. Time Upgrades shorten the wait."
		""
		"That way breeding runs cleanly on the side, without bees flying off or getting lost in the enclosure."
	]
	quest.2BEE4AFB22C4B99B.quest_subtitle: "Breeding without an enclosure."
	quest.2BEE4AFB22C4B99B.title: "&aBuild a Breeding Chamber"
	quest.2BEEEDDBFE1633F8.quest_desc: [
		"&aAdjustable&r: shapeless from a Basic Spell Turret, aimed with the Dominion Wand. &aTimer&r: Basic Spell Turret with a &6clock&r in the apparatus."
		""
		"The timer fires by itself, every second by default. Right click longer, hit shorter, while sneaking in 10 second steps. Projectile, Touch, Sensitive and Redstone Signal cost it nothing."
	]
	quest.2BEEEDDBFE1633F8.quest_subtitle: "Turrets that fire by themselves and aim anywhere."
	quest.2BEEEDDBFE1633F8.title: "&aBuild Timer and Adjustable Spell Turrets"
	quest.2BEFC0DE050F0E96.quest_desc: [
		"Slay shulkers until you have &e4 shulker shells&r. Two shells and a chest make a &6shulker box&r, which keeps its contents when mined."
		""
		"Their projectiles make you levitate. Over the void that is dangerous, because when the effect ends you fall."
		""
		"Shulkers do not come back. With Occultism you make new ones: the Afrit ritual &ePossessed Shulker&r (dragon's breath, end stone, purple glazed terracotta)."
	]
	quest.2BEFC0DE050F0E96.quest_subtitle: "Two shells, one chest."
	quest.2BEFC0DE050F0E96.title: "&dMake a Shulker Box"
	quest.2BF65FDF7F25E0BE.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r stonecutter, 3 &6andesite alloys&r and planks make the &6Sawmill&r from Productive Trees. A hopper from the tree pot in, a hopper out at the bottom. Every log becomes &e6 planks&r and &e2 sawdust&r."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/sawdust.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"8 sawdust around a water bucket make 2 paper. Create's &6Mechanical Saw&r on a belt also cuts logs into more planks than the crafting table, if you have rotation anyway."
		""
		"A furnace next to it turns the remaining logs into &6charcoal&r, the fuel for the Endoflames below."
	]
	quest.2BF65FDF7F25E0BE.quest_subtitle: "Six planks and sawdust from every log, without power."
	quest.2BF65FDF7F25E0BE.title: "&6Saw in the sawmill"
	quest.2BF6AF79B91BDBE7.quest_desc: [
		"In the claim view drag with &eShift and left mouse button&r over claimed chunks to load them, with &eShift and right&r you unload them again. Loaded chunks are marked separately on the map. Up to &e25 chunks&r per team."
		""
		"Loaded means: machines, farms and pipes keep running there even when nobody is nearby. On Kronwerke they also run when &eyour whole team is offline&r. The farm keeps working overnight."
		""
		"With the &emouse wheel&r over a loaded chunk you set when the loading ends by itself. That is enough for a night run of the brass mixer."
	]
	quest.2BF6AF79B91BDBE7.quest_subtitle: "Chunk loading, as long as one of you is around."
	quest.2BF6AF79B91BDBE7.title: "&6Keep Your Farm Running"
	quest.2BFA588E704FB320.quest_desc: [
		"Crucible: &6coal&r. Then &6ghast tear&r and &6Death Essence&r, stir once. Then two &6Soul Shards&r and a Death Essence, stir once. Finally a &6diamond&r."
		""
		"The Shadow Gem is the core of the Soulfire Wand and of the Wicked Weave for the Warlock armor."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Eidolon is not part of the stage goal. But anyone fighting Afrits will be glad of a Soul Enchanter nearby."
	]
	quest.2BFA588E704FB320.quest_subtitle: "Favor, souls and a shadow stone."
	quest.2BFA588E704FB320.title: "&5&lBrew a Shadow Gem"
	quest.2BFDB1B2FB563040.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Diamond, 1 Powdered Eye&r, cloth."
		""
		"The scroll costs &d1,000 mana&r and gives you a &6Treasury Projection Gauntlet&r. It hurls weapons and tools from your inventory, some bags and your ender chest at the block you are looking at, &d120 mana&r per weapon."
	]
	quest.2BFDB1B2FB563040.quest_subtitle: "A rain of your weapons."
	quest.2BFDB1B2FB563040.title: "&6Draw Treasury Projection"
	quest.2C05DFCA19817882.quest_desc: [
		"&6Common Gems Niter&r as the source, a &6Common Metals Niter&r as the target. You reform the result into Iron Sulfur with an Iron Sulfur on the target."
		""
		"Two metals are worth one gem, two other minerals one metal. EMI shows how many sources are needed."
	]
	quest.2C05DFCA19817882.quest_subtitle: "With Niter you switch the kind."
	quest.2C05DFCA19817882.title: "&5Turn Gem into Metal"
	quest.2C0843DE3D831B45.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_inscriber.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Iron&r all around, a &6Mechanical Press&r from Create at the top centre and one at the bottom centre, a &6copper ingot&r at the middle left, the right side stays empty."
		""
		"&eHow to read the window:&r the presses at the top and bottom, the material in the middle. Without a press it grinds: certus to Certus Quartz Dust, ender pearls to Ender Dust, sky stone to Sky Stone Dust."
		""
		"Power (FE or AE) comes by cable. With &6Acceleration Cards&r it works faster."
	]
	quest.2C0843DE3D831B45.quest_subtitle: "It presses, prints and grinds."
	quest.2C0843DE3D831B45.title: "&7Build an Inscriber"
	quest.2C0FA41EB83CB8D9.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6diamonds&r in a plus around a &6Wyvern Energy Controller&r. Gives four &bBasic Energy Relay Crystals&r."
		""
		"Every Wyvern tool and the chestpiece need two. The crystals are really a wireless power network you link with the Crystal Binder. Here you only need them as an ingredient."
	]
	quest.2C0FA41EB83CB8D9.quest_subtitle: "An intermediate part for Wyvern recipes."
	quest.2C0FA41EB83CB8D9.title: "&bBuild Relay Crystals"
	quest.2C14D240A8474F7A.quest_desc: [
		"Alle Upgrades haben dieselbe Form: vier &6Lapislazuli&r in die Ecken, vier gleiche Dinge an die Seiten, eins in die Mitte. &6Volumen&r: Druckeisen außen, ein &6Luftkanister&r innen. &6Geschwindigkeit&r: Zucker außen, ein &6Eimer Schmiermittel&r innen. &6Sicherheit&r: Obsidian außen, ein &6Sicherheitsventil&r innen."
		""
		"Upgrades kommen in den Upgrade-Reiter am Fensterrand der Maschine, in Werkzeuge über die Ladestation. Das &6Volumen-Upgrade&r vergrößert den Luftspeicher, eins verdoppelt, vier vervierfachen, dafür sinkt der Druck beim Einsetzen. Das &6Geschwindigkeits-Upgrade&r macht Maschinen je Stück &e1,5-mal&r so schnell, der Verbrauch steigt auf das 1,65-fache. Das &6Sicherheits-Upgrade&r ist ein Sicherheitsventil in der Maschine selbst."
		""
		"Vier &6Upgrade-Matrizen&r aus der Anlage (ein Lapis und Wasser bei 2 Bar) ersetzen die vier Lapis, das spart drei Viertel des Lapis. Im Rundum-Trichter verdoppelt jedes Geschwindigkeits-Upgrade das Tempo, im Kompressor bringt es mehr Luft pro Tick für mehr Kohle."
	]
	quest.2C14D240A8474F7A.quest_subtitle: "Volumen, Geschwindigkeit, Sicherheit."
	quest.2C14D240A8474F7A.title: "&d&lBau Maschinen-Upgrades"
	quest.2C165D4BF70F18A9.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6copper ingots&r at the top and sides, a &6Motor&r in the middle, at the bottom &6Silicon&r, &6Copper Reinforced Plating&r, Silicon make the &6Pump&r."
		""
		"It pushes a pipe downward until it hits fluid, then drains the whole connected lake, up to &e100,000 blocks&r. It pulls &e4 buckets per second&r and needs &e512 RF&r per block."
		""
		"Above a lava lake in the Nether it is the best source for the Lava Generator."
	]
	quest.2C165D4BF70F18A9.quest_subtitle: "It drains whole lakes."
	quest.2C165D4BF70F18A9.title: "&9Set Up a Pump"
	quest.2C298C9024BE1893.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r steel casing in the middle, iron left and right, circuits top and bottom, redstone in the corners."
		""
		"What it does with ore is in the &5Mekanism: Ore Step by Step&r chapter. Here you need it for enriched carbon, redstone and diamond, which give eight times as much infusion type."
	]
	quest.2C298C9024BE1893.quest_subtitle: "For ore, but also for carbon."
	quest.2C298C9024BE1893.title: "&d&lBuild an Enrichment Chamber"
	quest.2C32415F25FD6F15.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r two Blueprint Paper and three sticks. The &6fishing reel and hook&r need &etwo&r material, plus a rod and a cord."
		""
		"It fishes like the vanilla rod but lasts as long as its material and can be repaired instead of rebuilt."
	]
	quest.2C32415F25FD6F15.quest_subtitle: "Reel, hook, rod, cord."
	quest.2C32415F25FD6F15.title: "&7Build a fishing rod"
	quest.2C3D12AEE8E4E4BD.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r on top redstone, &6lever&r, redstone, in the middle &6dispenser&r, &6Blank Module&r, dispenser, at the bottom redstone, &6quartz&r, redstone."
		""
		"It uses the item in the buffer like a player. Three modes: &eright click on blocks&r (doors, levers, seeds), &eright click on animals&r (milking cows, shearing sheep) and &eattack&r. Only the attack costs power, &d150 FE&r per hit from an Energy Upgrade."
		""
		"It reaches about &e4 blocks&r, like a player. In the module you set whether it looks straight ahead, up or down. Lots of Speed Upgrades do not help the attack, the weapon's cooldown still applies."
	]
	quest.2C3D12AEE8E4E4BD.quest_subtitle: "The Activator Module, a fake player."
	quest.2C3D12AEE8E4E4BD.title: "&7Let the Router Click"
	quest.2C44F2CB55F34D57.quest_desc: [
		"Öffne den Controller oder den Konfigurator, Reiter &eDrahtloses Laden&r. Hak &eDrahtlos aktivieren&r an und wähle die Plätze: &6Haupthand&r, &6Nebenhand&r, &6Schnellzugriff&r, &6Rüstung&r, &6Curios&r. Das Hauptinventar lässt sich nicht laden."
		""
		"Die Einstellung gilt für dich: Jedes Mitglied wählt selbst, ob und aus welchem Netz es geladen wird. Du musst online und am Leben sein, Entfernung und Dimension sind egal."
		""
		"Geladen wird alles, was FE annimmt, mit bis zu &d800.000 FE/t&r für alle zusammen. Schalte am Controller &eÜberspannung&r ein, dann kommt er immer vor den Maschinen dran."
	]
	quest.2C44F2CB55F34D57.quest_subtitle: "Hände, Schnellzugriff, Rüstung, Curios."
	quest.2C44F2CB55F34D57.title: "&dRichte drahtloses Laden ein"
	quest.2C5BEE521A7393D9.quest_desc: [
		"Leg einen &6Zinkbarren&r in den &6Steinschneider&r: vier &6Copycat-Platten&r oder vier &6Copycat-Stufen&r. Klick sie mit einem Block an, und sie nehmen sein Aussehen an, genau wie Rahmenblöcke, nur in Create-Form."
		""
		"{image:create:textures/item/zinc_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Copycats+&r erweitert das: ein Zinkbarren wird im Steinschneider zu einem &6Copycat-Block&r, zwei Stufen, vier Balken oder vier Wellen, dazu Treppen, Zäune, Mauern, Laufstege und Türen. Vier Zahnräder mit einem Zinkbarren ergeben vier Copycat-Zahnräder, die sich tarnen und trotzdem drehen."
		""
		"&eWann Rahmen, wann Copycat:&r FramedBlocks hat mehr Formen. Copycats sind dünn, brauchen kein Holz und bewegen sich auf Create-Kontraptionen mit."
	]
	quest.2C5BEE521A7393D9.quest_subtitle: "Platten und Stufen, die jeden Block nachmachen."
	quest.2C5BEE521A7393D9.title: "&6&lSchneide Copycats aus Zink"
	quest.2C67F6D3BCDC61E7.quest_desc: [
		"In Stufe 1 gibt es &ckeinen FE-Generator&r. Mekanism, Immersive Engineering, Powah und alle anderen Strommods sind zu, das Manaflussfeld von Botania braucht Manastahl aus Stufe 2. Was läuft, läuft mit &6Rotation&r von Create."
		""
		"&e1. Wasserräder:&r acht Bretter um eine Welle, 256 SU pro Rad, beliebig viele hintereinander an einem Bach. Billig, sofort, kein Brennstoff."
		"&e2. Windmühle:&r ein Windmühlenlager und Segel, bis 2 048 SU mit 32 Segeln. Braucht Platz, bringt dafür mehr als acht Räder."
		"&e3. Starbuncle-Rad:&r für Ars-Spieler, 256 SU ohne Wasser und ohne Wind, nur ein Starbuncle muss hinein."
		""
		"Was ihr braucht: Presse 8 SU pro RPM, Mahlstein und Mixer 4, Lüfter 2. Zwei Wasserräder tragen eine Presse bei 32 RPM, siehe Kapitel &6Create&r."
	]
	quest.2C67F6D3BCDC61E7.quest_subtitle: "Noch kein Strom, nur Drehung."
	quest.2C67F6D3BCDC61E7.title: "&e&lStufe 1: Welche Quelle wann"
	quest.2C6B1101FBC07225.quest_desc: [
		"&dSplit&r: &6Splitter&r (the relay), &6Wilden Spike&r, &6stonecutter&r. &dOrbit&r: &6compass&r, &6eye of ender&r, &6blaze rod&r."
		""
		"Split fires several projectiles with the whole spell. Orbit is a form: three orbs circle you and hit everything that gets too close, with Sensitive blocks too."
	]
	quest.2C6B1101FBC07225.quest_subtitle: "One spell, many orbs."
	quest.2C6B1101FBC07225.title: "&dLearn Split and Orbit"
	quest.2C6F665730B82E41.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r two fire bricks and one below give the &6Foundry Tap&r, which goes on the drain. Seven fire bricks as a table with legs give the &6Casting Table&r, as a tub the &6Casting Basin&r."
		""
		"{image:productivemetalworks:textures/item/ingot_cast.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eMold:&r Put any ingot on the Casting Table and pour &e360 mB of steel&r over it, out comes an &6Ingot Mold&r. Then &e90 mB&r of metal per ingot is enough. Without a mold the basin casts a whole block for 810 mB."
		""
		"Right clicking the tap pours, a redstone pulse pours automatically, and any fluid pipe does the job instead of the tap. You take the finished ingot with a right click, a hopper or a pipe."
	]
	quest.2C6F665730B82E41.quest_subtitle: "Tap, Casting Table, mold."
	quest.2C6F665730B82E41.title: "&6Cast Ingots"
	quest.2C6FBB98A84632D3.quest_desc: [
		"Draconium Ingots in the corners, a &6Totem of Undying&r at the top, Draconium Cores left and right, Module Core in the middle, a &6Wyvern Shield Module&r at the bottom."
		""
		"A deadly hit triggers it: &d6 health points&r back, &d2 seconds&r of invulnerability and a strong shield boost. After that it recharges for &d120 seconds&r with 5 million energy."
		""
		"It is also the ingredient for the Draconic Undying Module from stage 5."
	]
	quest.2C6FBB98A84632D3.quest_subtitle: "A second life in the chestpiece."
	quest.2C6FBB98A84632D3.title: "&dBuild a Wyvern Undying Module"
	quest.2C705B453292D7D5.quest_desc: [
		"Kreuz &6Silberlinde&r und &6Sauerkirsche&r (5 Prozent), und du hast die &6Zitronatzitrone&r, den Anfang aller Zitrusfrüchte. Keine davon steht im Markt. Zitrusfrüchte geben nur 2 Hunger (Zitrone, Limette, Key-Lime, Fingerlimette, Zitronatzitrone) oder 3 (Orange, Mandarine, Buddhas Hand) und keine Sättigung."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/fruit/lemon.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Von dort geht es weiter: Zitronatzitrone und Vogelkirsche ergeben Pomelo oder Key-Lime, Pomelo und Zitronatzitrone die &6Zitrone&r (3 pro Blatt), über Mandarine und Kumquat bis zu Grapefruit, Satsuma und Tangerine, die als Obst mit 4 Hunger zählen. Die ganze Familie steht in der Checkliste unten."
	]
	quest.2C705B453292D7D5.quest_subtitle: "Der Stammvater von dreizehn Zitrusarten."
	quest.2C705B453292D7D5.title: "&eZüchte die Zitronatzitrone"
	quest.2C75DFA0D85C6DDF.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_sawmill.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e6 Light and 2 Heavy Engineering Blocks, 4 Iron Sheetmetal, 8 Steel Scaffolding, 4 conveyor belts, 1 Redstone Engineering Block&r. Hammer on the middle sheetmetal block."
		""
		"Put the &6Sawblade&r (steel ingots in the corners, steel plates on the sides) in at the back with a right click. &eIn:&r log on the belt. &eOut:&r oak gives &e6 planks&r plus sawdust for 1,600 FE. Without a blade only stripped logs come out."
	]
	quest.2C75DFA0D85C6DDF.quest_subtitle: "5x3x3, logs in, six planks and sawdust out."
	quest.2C75DFA0D85C6DDF.title: "&9Form a Sawmill"
	quest.2C8D8C51B0FAD7AE.quest_desc: [
		"Last hit with an &dElementium Axe&r: about a &e7.7 percent&r chance for the head, 15.4 percent with Looting I, each further level 7.7 more."
		""
		"Useless, but on the wall everyone sees you were there."
	]
	quest.2C8D8C51B0FAD7AE.quest_subtitle: "A trophy, only with the Elementium Axe."
	quest.2C8D8C51B0FAD7AE.title: "&5Get Its Head"
	quest.2C94E2B54C5B66DB.quest_desc: [
		"&eEnhancer:&r &6Elementarium&r. &eMain item:&r an &6Arcane Crystal Block&r. &eOn the pedestals:&r &e2 coal&r, &e4 blaze powder&r. &eEssences:&r 200 Aureal, 1,250 Blood, 4 Souls."
		""
		"On the &6Smithing Table&r with the mod's Smithing Template and your tool, it gets the &eFiery&r modifier: everything it mines drops already smelted. Ore becomes ingots, sand becomes glass, cobblestone becomes stone."
	]
	quest.2C94E2B54C5B66DB.quest_subtitle: "A tool that smelts while mining."
	quest.2C94E2B54C5B66DB.title: "&6Ritual: Smelter Prism"
	quest.2C99E43E9EEE0329.quest_desc: [
		"&6HDPE Sheets&r in the corners, &6Polonium Pellets&r on the sides, a &6Plutonium Pellet&r in the middle."
		""
		"The SPS is a multiblock made of these casings. Build a stock right away."
	]
	quest.2C99E43E9EEE0329.quest_subtitle: "Four polonium and one plutonium per block."
	quest.2C99E43E9EEE0329.title: "&dBuild SPS Casing"
	quest.2CA230F450C992B9.quest_desc: [
		"Bring &e512 cobblestone&r along. Sneak and right click the obelisk, and everything from your inventory is in."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stone pillar of stage 1 wants &e20,000 cobblestone&r. Collect it in a chest at the portal and bring it to spawn in one go."
	]
	quest.2CA230F450C992B9.quest_subtitle: "Every trip counts for the whole server."
	quest.2CA230F450C992B9.title: "&7Dig stone for the obelisk"
	quest.2CA58CC28C140BE5.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 purple, 2 magenta, 1 light gray&r petal, &dGaia Spirit&r, runes of &5Envy&r and &5Wrath&r."
		""
		"If a shulker projectile hits a monster within its radius, both die and it gives &d75,000 mana&r. Its buffer has to be empty for that. Loot and experience are lost."
	]
	quest.2CA58CC28C140BE5.quest_subtitle: "75,000 mana per hit."
	quest.2CA58CC28C140BE5.title: "&aPlant a Shulk Me Not"
	quest.2CA6D45E9664839E.quest_desc: [
		"Werkbank, formlos: zwei &6Ofenkartoffeln&r, eine &6Milchflasche&r, drei &6gebratenes Hammelfleisch&r oder Koteletts, zwei &6Zwiebeln&r und eine &6Schüssel&r. Das ergibt den Festmahl-Block, mit einer Schüssel holst du dir Portionen."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/shepherds_pie.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2CA6D45E9664839E.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.2CA6D45E9664839E.title: "&6Tisch den Hirtenkuchen auf"
	quest.2CA75CE66411C531.quest_desc: [
		"&eWarp Lens&r: shapeless Mana Lens and Pixie Dust. If the burst hits a Force Relay, it jumps to its target. Combined behind a Bore Lens, it sends mined blocks back to the spreader."
		"&eTripwire Lens&r: shapeless Mana Lens, tripwire hook and Elementium. The spreader only fires when the burst would hit a creature or a player."
		""
		"Plus Redirective, Celebratory, Flare and Paintslinger, all in the Lexica."
	]
	quest.2CA75CE66411C531.quest_subtitle: "Lenses that teleport and aim."
	quest.2CA75CE66411C531.title: "&dGrind Elven Lenses"
	quest.2CAACEC5BA948074.quest_desc: [
		"Sieh dir alle vier Biome der Anderwelt an: &3Tiefenlande&r, &2Hallender Wald&r, &dBlühende Höhlen&r und &7Bewölkte Säulen&r."
		""
		"Die Biome liegen in großen Flächen nebeneinander, lauf eine Richtung lange genug, dann kommt das nächste."
	]
	quest.2CAACEC5BA948074.quest_subtitle: "Alle vier Biome gesehen."
	quest.2CAACEC5BA948074.title: "&bEchoortung"
	quest.2CB746E24B79A224.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pickaxe head&r and &6rod&r together in the grid. Or in one step: blueprint, three material and a rod."
		""
		"Silent Gear tools &edon't disappear&r when they break. They stay in your inventory as broken until you repair them."
	]
	quest.2CB746E24B79A224.quest_subtitle: "Head plus rod, done."
	quest.2CB746E24B79A224.title: "&6&lAssemble your pickaxe"
	quest.2CBF22171BB2128E.quest_desc: [
		"Extractors on the output of cauldron, oven and distiller, inserters on the three vessels, all connected with wire. A chest of Raw Iron at the start, one at the end."
		""
		"With a &6List Filter&r (eight paper around a shard, gives nine) you decide which inserter gets what."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r That way iron keeps flowing for the steelmakers even while you are offline."
	]
	quest.2CBF22171BB2128E.quest_subtitle: "The first setup that runs on its own."
	quest.2CBF22171BB2128E.title: "&d&lAutomate the Incubator"
	quest.2CBFBFFECBA609EA.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Böen&r in Prüfungskammern mit dem Learner im Inventar. Die Spawner dort werfen sie in Wellen, also ein guter Ort für viele Kills."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d256 FE/t&r. Eine Vorhersage wird zu &616 Böenruten&r. Daraus machst du Windladungen und den Streitkolben."
	]
	quest.2CBFBFFECBA609EA.quest_subtitle: "Böenruten aus der Prüfungskammer."
	quest.2CBFBFFECBA609EA.title: "&fLerne die Böe"
	quest.2CC312C9B78D7436.quest_desc: [
		"&6Flint&r: &e124&r durability, speed &e5&r, +2 damage, Jagged III."
		""
		"For blades: Jagged raises the damage the more worn the blade is."
	]
	quest.2CC312C9B78D7436.quest_subtitle: "124 durability, speed 5."
	quest.2CC312C9B78D7436.title: "&7Flint"
	quest.2CC3FAEFCE83AF0F.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Mana Diamonds&r and &e1 Mana Quartz&r on the altar, plus the runes Winter and Water as catalysts. &d12,000 mana&r."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r Spectranthemum and Loonium in stage 3, Shulk Me Not in stage 4."
	]
	quest.2CC3FAEFCE83AF0F.quest_subtitle: "Catalysts: Winter and Water."
	quest.2CC3FAEFCE83AF0F.title: "&5Make the Rune of Envy"
	quest.2CC62AD2062CC1D3.quest_desc: [
		"A &6golden carrot&r on top, a &6golden apple&r on the left, a &6glistering melon slice&r on the right, an &6ender pearl&r at the bottom, the upgrade base in the middle."
		""
		"It feeds you from the backpack as soon as you are hungry and picks food that won't be wasted. A few stacks from Farmer's Delight last a long time."
	]
	quest.2CC62AD2062CC1D3.quest_subtitle: "Eating without thinking about it."
	quest.2CC62AD2062CC1D3.title: "Build a Feeding Upgrade"
	quest.2CCB01D83B51655D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rahmenverstärkung&r: vier &6Obsidian&r in die Ecken, vier Stöcke an die Seiten, ein Rahmenblock in die Mitte ergibt 16 Stück. Klick damit einen Rahmen an, und er hält Explosionen aus wie Obsidian, sieht aber weiter aus wie Holz oder Stein."
		""
		"{image:framedblocks:textures/item/framed_reinforcement.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Weitere Formen mit Zutat in der Säge: das &6Einwegfenster&r (dazu getöntes Glas) ist von einer Seite durchsichtig, nur du als Setzer stellst die Seite ein. Die &6Rahmentruhe&r ist eine getarnte Truhe, der &6Rahmen-Trichter&r ein getarnter Trichter, die &6Rahmenlaterne&r eine getarnte Lichtquelle."
	]
	quest.2CCB01D83B51655D.quest_subtitle: "Rahmen, die mehr können als aussehen."
	quest.2CCB01D83B51655D.title: "&6Verstärke und verstecke"
	quest.2CCC5DE3D79554CF.quest_desc: [
		"The items of the &enext stage&r are already in the EMI list, veiled with the dark slot and question mark. With &eR&r you still see their recipe and can &eplan ahead&r: zinc for brass, for example, can already be mined and stored in stage 1."
		""
		"Stage 3 and everything after it stays invisible until its turn. That way you always see how much is coming, but the list is not flooded with things that are still weeks away."
		""
		"You cannot craft veiled items; the crafting table then says &7You can't craft that yet&r."
	]
	quest.2CCC5DE3D79554CF.quest_subtitle: "Veiled, but with its recipe."
	quest.2CCC5DE3D79554CF.title: "&6See what the next stage brings"
	quest.2CCF6BD423383093.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hostile_networks_sim_chamber.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r oben eine &6Glasscheibe&r. Mitte &6Enderperle&r, &6Quelljuwelblock&r aus Ars Nouveau, Enderperle. Unten &6Lapislazuli&r, &6Komparator&r, Lapislazuli. Der Juwelblock ersetzt den Obsidian des Originals."
		""
		"Die &6Simulation Chamber&r nimmt ein &6Datenmodell&r (mindestens Basic), eine &6Vorhersagematrix&r und &dStrom&r, und spielt den Kampf gegen den Mob nach. Sie speichert bis zu &d2 Millionen FE&r."
		""
		"&eIm Fenster:&r links der Modellslot, darunter die Matrix. Rechts zwei Ausgänge, einer für die Grundvorhersage, einer für die Mob-Vorhersage. Die Textzeilen in der Mitte zeigen, was die Kammer gerade tut, und warum sie stehen bleibt."
		""
		"&cStufe 3:&r Die Kammer öffnet mit dem Stahlwerk. Bis dahin: Modelle trainieren und Quelljuwelen sammeln."
	]
	quest.2CCF6BD423383093.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 3. Hier kämpft der Computer für dich."
	quest.2CCF6BD423383093.title: "&b&lDie Simulationskammer"
	quest.2CD2926C16F3697D.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Silicon&r at the top, iron, &6Void Chassis&r, iron in the middle, gear, &6crafting table&r, gear at the bottom make the &6Crafter&r."
		""
		"In the window you set a recipe. Ingredients come in by conduit or hopper, the result goes out, as long as there is power."
		""
		"Ideal for things you need all the time: Conduit Binder Composite, binder into conduits, nuggets into ingots."
	]
	quest.2CD2926C16F3697D.quest_subtitle: "A crafting table that builds on its own."
	quest.2CD2926C16F3697D.title: "&7Let the Crafter Work"
	quest.2CDBB0A78C3677BA.quest_desc: [
		"Look for an &darchwood forest&r with the Nature's Compass and tick this off when you stand in it."
		""
		"The trees grow in four colours, each belonging to a school of Ars Nouveau. No forest nearby? At the Farming for Blockheads &6Market&r every sapling costs one emerald."
	]
	quest.2CDBB0A78C3677BA.quest_subtitle: "Colourful trees full of magic."
	quest.2CDBB0A78C3677BA.title: "&dFind an archwood forest"
	quest.2CEE2D36FA860A6E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/alfheim_pure_essence.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Place &6end stone&r around a &6Pure Daisy&r. It turns it into &6cobbled deepslate&r and releases a cloud of &5Pure Ender Essence&r while doing it. Catch it with an Alfglass Flask."
		""
		"&eEnd stone without the End:&r The &5Possessed Endermite&r from Occultism drops end stone. A flask of Pure Essence thrown on stone makes end stone again, which closes the circle."
	]
	quest.2CEE2D36FA860A6E.quest_subtitle: "The daisy makes deepslate and pure essence."
	quest.2CEE2D36FA860A6E.title: "&5Purify End Stone"
	quest.2CEE7D65948B48DE.quest_desc: [
		"A &clava source block&r on top of a block, below it a hanging &6Pointed Dripstone&r, below that a &6cauldron&r. The lava drips through the stone and fills the cauldron bit by bit, the source block stays."
		""
		"You find pointed dripstone in dripstone caves. Several dripstones next to each other, each over its own cauldron, and an &6Item Drain&r or a bucket collects the lava."
		""
		"Slower than fire seeds, but without field and essence. For a cobblestone generator a single lava block is enough anyway, it is not used up."
	]
	quest.2CEE7D65948B48DE.quest_subtitle: "Lava out of nothing, slowly, but forever."
	quest.2CEE7D65948B48DE.title: "&cDrip lava into a cauldron"
	quest.2D05320EA8DB2E02.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r oben Goldklumpen, Tintenbeutel, Goldklumpen, in der Mitte Goldklumpen, &6Enderperle&r, Goldklumpen, unten drei Papier. Das ergibt &e3 Warp-Schriftrollen&r."
		""
		"&eSo geht es:&r Rechtsklick halten, im Menü einen bekannten Wegstein wählen, die Rolle ist danach verbraucht. Laut Serverconfig kostet eine Reise mit Schriftrolle &ekeine Erfahrung&r, auch in eine andere Dimension nicht."
		""
		"&eWofür:&r Für den Weg zu einem Wegstein, an dem du gerade nicht stehst. Die Rückkehr-Schriftrolle bringt dich nur nach Hause, die Warp-Schriftrolle überallhin."
	]
	quest.2D05320EA8DB2E02.quest_subtitle: "Zu jedem Wegstein, den du kennst, ohne Level."
	quest.2D05320EA8DB2E02.title: "&6Nimm Warp-Schriftrollen mit"
	quest.2D05B19418153534.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/undergarden_b_cold.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Mine &632 Shiverstone&r. It lies in the cold biomes: &6Frostfields&r, &6Frosty Smogstem Forest&r and &6Icy Sea&r."
		""
		"Only Shiverstone holds &6Froststeel&r. Remember the place."
	]
	quest.2D05B19418153534.quest_subtitle: "Shiverstone, and Froststeel inside it."
	quest.2D05B19418153534.title: "&bFind the Frostfields"
	quest.2D15A75BAEEEFEC4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/silent_gear_crude_mixer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Top &6stone, Flax String, stone&r. Middle &6stone, plank, stone&r. Bottom middle &6stone&r."
		""
		"The Crude Mixer mixes any materials into a &6crude alloy&r, even metal with a gem. It carries the &cCrude&r trait and has only &e80 percent&r of the mixed stats."
	]
	quest.2D15A75BAEEEFEC4.quest_subtitle: "The first alloy, from anything."
	quest.2D15A75BAEEEFEC4.title: "&6Build a Crude Mixer"
	quest.2D1A214E232E9ECD.quest_desc: [
		"The way goes tier by tier: a &6quartz block&r at the top, two capacitors of the new tier left and right of the casing, the rod below at the bottom. First Blazing, then Niotic, then &aSpirited&r."
		""
		"A &6Spirited Capacitor&r is four Spirited Crystals around a Large Capacitor, with paste in the corners. For the rod you need two, so eight emeralds and eight million FE."
		""
		"A Spirited rod pushes &e40,000 FE/t&r. Four of them charge a Spirited Crystal in a few seconds. The line to the rods has to carry that: Blazing cables manage 20,000 FE/t, Niotic 50,000."
	]
	quest.2D1A214E232E9ECD.quest_subtitle: "40,000 FE per tick at the orb."
	quest.2D1A214E232E9ECD.title: "&aBuild a Spirited rod"
	quest.2D1A3E7ED49CEAF9.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e3 black&r, &e2 cyan&r petals, &e1 Redstone Root&r."
		""
		"Only hurts &eadult animals&r, the young ones stay. In a pen with a hopper underneath it supplies meat and leather on its own. More animal farms in the &aFirst Farms&r chapter."
	]
	quest.2D1A3E7ED49CEAF9.quest_subtitle: "Only for adult animals."
	quest.2D1A3E7ED49CEAF9.title: "&6Plant a Dreadthorne"
	quest.2D1FC33927C70AF3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_kiln.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Set the &68 Kiln Bricks&r up as a &e2x2x2 cube&r and hit one of the blocks with the hammer."
		""
		"&eIn:&r two metals into the two inputs, fuel such as coal or coke below. &eOut:&r electrum, constantan, bronze and insulating glass. It does not make brass on Kronwerke."
	]
	quest.2D1FC33927C70AF3.quest_subtitle: "2x2x2, 8 Kiln Bricks, two metals in, alloy out."
	quest.2D1FC33927C70AF3.title: "&6&lForm an Alloy Kiln"
	quest.2D28DB17CFEEAC2E.quest_desc: [
		"Condenser in &eSingularity&r mode, a &664k component&r or larger in the component slot, then &e256,000 items&r in. With 16k the buffer is not enough, that is why singularities only come now."
		""
		"&eFaster:&r Advanced AE's &6Reaction Chamber&r makes a singularity from &e64 Matter Balls&r, 100 mB of lava and a million AE. That is only a good 16,000 items."
		""
		"You need singularities for the quantum bridge, the Accumulation Press, Quantum Alloy and the setup kit of the wireless connectors."
	]
	quest.2D28DB17CFEEAC2E.quest_subtitle: "256,000 items in a sphere."
	quest.2D28DB17CFEEAC2E.title: "&5&lPress a Singularity"
	quest.2D2F9072A71F8DDE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron&r at the top and sides, &6nickel&r in the middle, at the bottom &6Motor&r, &6copper block&r, Motor. It draws &e32 RF/t&r."
		""
		"One raw iron becomes one &6iron dust&r and three small ones, nine small ones make a whole: about &e1.33 ingots&r instead of one. An ore block becomes two raw ores."
		""
		"Coal becomes &6Coal Dust&r, quartz becomes &6Quartz Dust&r, an ender pearl becomes eight &6Enderic Compound&r. You need all three right away."
	]
	quest.2D2F9072A71F8DDE.quest_subtitle: "The first step of the ore line."
	quest.2D2F9072A71F8DDE.title: "&7&lBuild a Pulverizer"
	quest.2D4016CCB8520FDB.quest_desc: [
		"Uranium oxide and hydrofluoric acid into the &6Chemical Infuser&r. 1 mB of each gives &e2 mB of uranium hexafluoride&r."
		""
		"An infuser just for this mix saves you rewiring."
	]
	quest.2D4016CCB8520FDB.quest_subtitle: "Step 4: oxide and acid."
	quest.2D4016CCB8520FDB.title: "&aMix Uranium Hexafluoride"
	quest.2D42A558F2DED9B8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brass casing&r, &6dried kelp block&r and &6iron sheet&r make the &6Elevator Pulley&r. You mark floors with &6Redstone Contacts&r on the shaft."
		""
		"Contraption Controls in the cabin become the floor selector. The pulley costs &d4 SU per RPM&r."
	]
	quest.2D42A558F2DED9B8.quest_subtitle: "The Elevator Pulley stops at floors."
	quest.2D42A558F2DED9B8.title: "&6Build a lift"
	quest.2D488086C44D80D5.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 iron ingots&r in the corners, &e2 Prosperity Ingots&r top and bottom, &e2 furnaces&r left and right, the &6Machine Frame&r in the middle."
		""
		"It burns solid fuel like coal and has an internal storage for it. Its advantage is the &eupgrade slot&r: with a machine upgrade it smelts faster."
		""
		"&eTip:&r &6Inferium Coal&r from Agradditions burns longer than normal coal and comes from your own field."
	]
	quest.2D488086C44D80D5.quest_subtitle: "A furnace with room for an upgrade."
	quest.2D488086C44D80D5.title: "&6Build the Mystical Agriculture Furnace"
	quest.2D4A3C337ADAD2CC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_crops_essence.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Inferium Farmland&r (right click farmland with essence), under each block a column of &6Growth Accelerators&r, on top &6Inferium Seeds&r and resource seeds. Harvest with the &6Sickle&r: 7 by 7 crops, the seeds stay planted."
		""
		"On Inferium Farmland a second seed drops with 20 percent. Create's harvester harvests essence crops like wheat, then you don't even need the sickle."
		""
		"&cStage 2:&r Four Inferium become one Prudentium Essence, and the Mystical Agriculture Harvester takes over the field, see the right side. Everything else is in the &aMystical Agriculture&r chapter."
	]
	quest.2D4A3C337ADAD2CC.quest_subtitle: "Inferium, accelerators, sickle."
	quest.2D4A3C337ADAD2CC.title: "&aLay out an essence field"
	quest.2D5605B76502A25A.quest_desc: [
		"Stell eine &6Mechanische Säge&r von Create aufrecht und wirf ihr Stämme von Productive Trees vor. Sie schneidet jeden Stamm in &e6 Bretter&r, genau wie das Sägewerk, nur ohne Sägemehl und mit Rotation statt Wartezeit."
		""
		"Waagerecht fällt die Säge ganze Bäume, auch die Riesenbäume aus 2x2 oder 5x5 Setzlingen, und die Blätter mit. Mit einem Einsatzgerät, das den Setzling nachpflanzt, hast du eine Holzfarm für jede der 163 Arten."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Fruchtblätter geben beim Fällen nur dann eine Frucht, wenn sie gerade reif sind. Für Obst bleib beim Pflücken oder beim Pflanztopf, für Holz ist die Säge unschlagbar."
	]
	quest.2D5605B76502A25A.quest_subtitle: "Auch die Mechanische Säge kennt jedes Holz."
	quest.2D5605B76502A25A.title: "&6Lass die Create-Säge schneiden"
	quest.2D58F5B9C9604F89.quest_desc: [
		"Lithium Dust in the corners, Energy Tablets on the sides, a Basic Energy Cube in the middle. A &6Basic Induction Cell&r stores &d3.2 billion FE&r."
		""
		"Cells stand inside. The higher tiers are made from four cells of the tier below around a cube, the advanced one stores eight times as much."
	]
	quest.2D58F5B9C9604F89.quest_subtitle: "3.2 billion FE per block."
	quest.2D58F5B9C9604F89.title: "&9Build an Induction Cell"
	quest.2D746AF6714EE01D.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6uranium 235&r and six &6uranium 238&r at the crafting table make three &6HEU-235&r. Thorium fuel &6TBU&r: one thorium 230 and eight thorium 232 give three."
		""
		"HEU makes much more heat than LEU. Switching only pays off once your cooling runs with reserve. The controller shows at once whether the net heat stays at zero."
	]
	quest.2D746AF6714EE01D.quest_subtitle: "More uranium 235, more heat."
	quest.2D746AF6714EE01D.title: "&cMix HEU-235"
	quest.2D79122C70C6289E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Button&r, &6andesite casing&r and &6Electron Tube&r make the &6Contraption Controls&r. On a contraption they switch the tools, with a filter only one kind."
		""
		"The &6Linked Controller&r (six wooden buttons around a Redstone Link) transmits each key on its own frequency."
	]
	quest.2D79122C70C6289E.quest_subtitle: "Tools on and off, even while moving."
	quest.2D79122C70C6289E.title: "&6Control a contraption"
	quest.2D84F5A8DA2CE40A.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r on the left &6Basic Processor&r, enriched iron, Basic Processor on top of each other, a &6Construction Core&r in the top middle, a &6Destruction Core&r at the bottom, a &6Machine Casing&r in the center, three &6glass&r on the right."
		""
		"The &6Storage Monitor&r shows how much of one item is in the network. Shift and right click sets it. Left click takes a stack, shift and left click one item, right click puts in, several right clicks put in everything matching from the inventory."
		""
		"A row of monitors next to the door shows iron, coal and diamonds at a glance. It needs 4 FE/t."
	]
	quest.2D84F5A8DA2CE40A.quest_subtitle: "A number on the wall, a reach into storage."
	quest.2D84F5A8DA2CE40A.title: "&7Hang Up a Storage Monitor"
	quest.2D861CC9DB08F9E7.quest_desc: [
		"Salvage eight &7Common&r items into &6Mysterious Scrap Metal&r and a few &aUncommon&r items into &6Timeworn Fabric&r."
		""
		"&9Rare&r gives &6Luminous Crystal Shard&r. &5Epic&r gives &6Arcane Sands&r (stage 3), &6Mythic&r gives &6Godforged Pearl&r (stage 4)."
		""
		"You need the materials for cutting gems and for reforging. Keep everything you find, even the Common stuff: Scrap Metal goes in stacks when cutting."
	]
	quest.2D861CC9DB08F9E7.quest_subtitle: "Scrap Metal and Timeworn Fabric."
	quest.2D861CC9DB08F9E7.title: "&7Salvage Common and Uncommon"
	quest.2D87477B9A30909B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_slider.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Der &6Slider&r ist der riesige Würfel in der Bosshalle. Er schläft, bis du ihn mit einer &6Spitzhacke&r schlägst. Dann rast er in geraden Linien auf dich zu und kracht in die Wände. &cNur Spitzhacken machen ihm Schaden&r, Schwerter prallen ab."
		""
		"&eTaktik:&r Weich seitlich aus, wenn er anrollt, dann schlag mit der Zanite Pickaxe zu, solange er neu Anlauf nimmt. Essen auf Vorrat, die Halle schließt sich während des Kampfes."
		""
		"{image:aether:textures/item/miscellaneous/bronze_dungeon_key.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eBeute:&r Er lässt den &6Bronze Dungeon Key&r und 7 bis 9 Carved Stone fallen, und die Wände werden abbaubar. Mit dem Key öffnest du die &6Treasure Doorway&r zur &6Treasure Chest&r: Zanite-Rüstung, Zanite Ring und Pendant, &6Shield of Repulsion&r, &6Cloud Staff&r, &6Flaming Sword&r, &6Agility Cape&r, &6Sentry Boots&r, &6Hammer of Kingbdogz&r, Lightning Knives, ein Sattel. &eStufe 3:&r &6Neptune Armor&r, &6Phoenix Bow&r und &6Valkyrie Lance&r liegen auch hier, lassen sich aber erst dann tragen."
	]
	quest.2D87477B9A30909B.quest_subtitle: "Ein Steinwürfel, der nur Spitzhacken fürchtet."
	quest.2D87477B9A30909B.title: "&7&lBesiege den Slider"
	quest.2D943D441CEA3885.quest_desc: [
		"Säge 16 &6Rahmenschrägen&r (Framed Slopes) und tarne sie mit dem Block deines Dachs. Eine Schräge sitzt wie eine Treppe, nur ohne Absatz, und schließt mit den &6Eckschrägen&r (innen und außen) zu einem glatten Dach."
		""
		"&eSetzen:&r Die Richtung hängt davon ab, wo du auf den Block klickst, ob oben oder unten und von welcher Seite. Mit dem &6Schraubenschlüssel&r aus Rahmenblöcken (nächste Quest) drehst du eine falsch gesetzte Schräge, statt sie abzubauen."
		""
		"Lohnende Formen für den Anfang: &6Schrägplatte&r für flache Dächer, &6Säule&r und &6Ecksäule&r für Fachwerk, &6Halbtreppe&r für Fensterbänke, &6Rahmenzaun&r und &6Rahmenwand&r, die sich wie Vanilla verbinden."
	]
	quest.2D943D441CEA3885.quest_subtitle: "Dächer, die wie Dächer aussehen."
	quest.2D943D441CEA3885.title: "&6Bau mit Schrägen"
	quest.2D96716A23CE3BA0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/flux_networks_dust.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Such &6Grundgestein&r, lass darüber einen Block Luft und setz darauf einen &6Obsidian&r. Wirf &6Redstone&r in die Lücke, so dass es auf dem Grundgestein liegt, und schlag mit der Faust (Linksklick) auf den Obsidian."
		""
		"Jedes Redstone wird zu einem &6Flux-Staub&r, bis zu &d512&r (acht Stapel) auf einen Schlag. Der Obsidian rutscht dabei in die Lücke. Bei weniger als acht Redstone bleibt er immer heil, ab acht kann er zu Bruchstein zerfallen, und bei acht Stapeln tut er das fast sicher."
		""
		"{image:fluxnetworks:textures/item/flux_dust.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Wirf gleich acht Stapel hinein. Ein Obsidian für 512 Staub ist ein guter Preis, und Bruchstein ist schneller weggehackt als Obsidian. Grundgestein liegt ganz unten in der Oberwelt und im Nether. EMI zeigt das Ganze unter &eCreating Flux&r."
		""
		"&eSpäter:&r Statt Grundgestein tut es auch ein &6Flux-Block&r. Sobald du einen hast, machst du den Staub zu Hause."
		""
		"&eWas in Stufe 3 offen ist:&r alles von Flux Networks bis zum Einfachen Speicher. Der Herkulische Speicher kommt in Stufe 4, der Gigantische in Stufe 5."
	]
	quest.2D96716A23CE3BA0.quest_subtitle: "Redstone, auf Grundgestein zerquetscht."
	quest.2D96716A23CE3BA0.title: "&c&lMach Flux-Staub"
	quest.2D998758FB2F7CBE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sword blueprint&r plus &etwo&r material, plus a rod, a grip if you want."
		""
		"Iron and flint give +2 damage each. Gold and copper enchant better (enchantability 22 and 15 against 14 for iron)."
	]
	quest.2D998758FB2F7CBE.quest_subtitle: "Blade from two material."
	quest.2D998758FB2F7CBE.title: "&7Build a sword"
	quest.2D9E2531E7FB7986.quest_desc: [
		"Leg Blätter in den &6Pollensieber&r (Rezept im Kapitel &6Kochen&r, auf Kronwerke extra wieder eingebaut). Alle &e30 Sekunden&r verbraucht er ein Blatt und gibt mit &e11 Prozent&r einen &6Pollen&r dieser Baumart, im Schnitt also einen pro neun Blätter. Blätter erntest du mit der Schere."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/pollen.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Rechtsklick mit dem Pollen auf ein Blatt eines anderen Baums macht es &esofort&r zum bestäubten Blatt mit der passenden Kreuzung, ohne Chance-Wurf. Für die 5-Prozent-Kreuzungen ist das der Weg. Gibt es keine Kreuzung, fällt ein Setzling eines der beiden Eltern heraus."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r Das &6Pollensieb-Upgrade&r (Upgrade-Basis, zwei Papier, zwei Glasflaschen, vier Setzlinge) im Fortgeschrittenen Bienenstock liefert bei 2 Prozent der Heimflüge Pollen eines Baums in Reichweite, Reichweiten-Upgrades vergrößern den Würfel um 2 Blöcke pro Stück."
		"Die &6Allergie-Biene&r entsteht, wenn du einer Biene Pollen gibst (10 Prozent). Sie bringt fünfmal so oft Pollen, und ihre Kreuzungen gelingen fünfmal so oft, aus 10 werden 50 Prozent."
	]
	quest.2D9E2531E7FB7986.quest_subtitle: "Gezielt kreuzen, ohne Würfeln."
	quest.2D9E2531E7FB7986.title: "&eBestäube ein Blatt mit Pollen"
	quest.2D9E4C504163EE17.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_apprentice_relay.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e6 gold ingots&r on the sides, a &6Source Gem block&r in the middle, top and bottom middle empty."
		""
		"Dominion Wand: first the jar, then the relay, then the relay, then the target (jar or next relay). Range &e30 blocks&r. Clicking while sneaking clears, redstone switches it off."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Links at the tree farm, jars at the workplace, two relays in between."
	]
	quest.2D9E4C504163EE17.quest_subtitle: "Source over 30 blocks, without carrying jars."
	quest.2D9E4C504163EE17.title: "&a&lBuild a Source Relay"
	quest.2D9F76F418D77EE3.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 iron, 1 emerald&r. Within &e10 blocks&r monsters slowly lose health. Every point goes back to you: first as health, then as hunger, then as mana, depending on what you are missing."
		""
		"&eNote:&r This scroll cannot be put into the Mystic Code of First Sorcery."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Next to a mob farm it fills your bar while you sort."
	]
	quest.2D9F76F418D77EE3.quest_subtitle: "Monsters pay with their life."
	quest.2D9F76F418D77EE3.title: "&cLay a Boundary of Drain Life"
	quest.2DA3B68C411E69AE.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Diamond and 1 Powdered Iron&r on a cloth."
		""
		"It strengthens the first thing in your hotbar or the one in your offhand: unbreakable for a while, more damage, faster mining. Costs &d50 mana&r."
		""
		"&eMana grows with use&r like a muscle. It slowly comes back on its own, faster on a full stomach. Sleeping gives back half the bar at once."
	]
	quest.2DA3B68C411E69AE.quest_subtitle: "The first scroll."
	quest.2DA3B68C411E69AE.title: "&b&lDraw a Scroll of Strengthening"
	quest.2DA484CE6B671BAE.quest_desc: [
		"Like a campfire: &e3 logs&r at the bottom, &e3 sticks&r, a &6Demon's Dream Fruit&r in the middle instead of coal. It burns with Spiritfire permanently."
		""
		"Put a &6Sacrificial Bowl&r on it: every item that goes into the bowl transforms right away. With a hopper above it this becomes a small Otherstone or chalk factory."
	]
	quest.2DA484CE6B671BAE.quest_subtitle: "Spiritfire that doesn't go out."
	quest.2DA484CE6B671BAE.title: "&6Build a Spirit Campfire"
	quest.2DA4A08A2B00BA5E.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Dominion Wand&r, plus a &6block of amethyst&r and &e2 gold ingots&r."
		""
		"In the selection wheel you set the order and the multi mode. In multi mode, a sneaking right click connects all connected blocks, handy for ten chambers at once."
	]
	quest.2DA4A08A2B00BA5E.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: many connections at once."
	quest.2DA4A08A2B00BA5E.title: "&6Build the Advanced Dominion Wand"
	quest.2DA50B03201ABD15.quest_desc: [
		"&dFortune&r: a &6rabbit's foot&r. &dExtract&r: an &6emerald&r."
		""
		"Fortune works like Fortune on the pickaxe, also on loot from monsters, up to 4 times behind Break. Extract works like Silk Touch. &cBoth together don't work&r; make yourself two spells."
	]
	quest.2DA50B03201ABD15.quest_subtitle: "More ore, or the ore itself."
	quest.2DA50B03201ABD15.title: "&dLearn Fortune and Extract"
	quest.2DAA1142DE722C65.quest_desc: [
		"Shipwrecks and ocean ruins hold &6treasure maps&r. Follow one to the red cross and dig there for the buried chest. It always contains a &6Heart of the Sea&r."
		""
		"Eight &6nautilus shells&r around the heart make a &6Conduit&r. In a prismarine frame it gives you breath, sight and faster mining under water."
	]
	quest.2DAA1142DE722C65.quest_subtitle: "Follow the treasure map to the cross."
	quest.2DAA1142DE722C65.title: "&bDig up a Heart of the Sea"
	quest.2DADB45F8B139F87.quest_desc: [
		"Three Spatial Pylons at the top, glass cable left and right, a &6128³ Spatial Component&r in the middle, iron and an Engineering Processor at the bottom."
		""
		"The anchor loads every chunk that holds part of its network. A cable across the chunk border is enough. It works on through quantum bridges, but not across dimensions: the network in the Nether needs its own."
		""
		"It needs &d80 AE/t&r plus a little more for every chunk. It also gives random ticks, so certus keeps growing."
	]
	quest.2DADB45F8B139F87.quest_subtitle: "The network stays awake."
	quest.2DADB45F8B139F87.title: "&3&lPlace a Spatial Anchor"
	quest.2DAE231987B64DCF.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Runic Altar&r brings the flowers that hold farms together: the &6Hopperhock&r collects drops into a chest, the &6Agricarnation&r makes fields and trees grow faster, the &6Rannuncarpus&r replants. For mana, the &6Thermalily&r eats a lava block for 30 seconds, the &6Gourmaryllis&r eats food, preferably varied."
		""
		"A Thermalily at the lava tank of the fire seed farm and a Gourmaryllis at the kitchen replace a whole bed of Endoflames."
		""
		"See the &aBotania: Runes&r chapter. The &6Kekimurus&r, which eats cake, comes with Alfheim in stage 3."
	]
	quest.2DAE231987B64DCF.quest_subtitle: "Runes open up the helpers."
	quest.2DAE231987B64DCF.title: "&dStage 2: flowers that work"
	quest.2DB6AB930A7A7927.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &6Ancient Debris&r to your Crusher. The Foliot makes &e2&r of it, the Djinni &e3&r &6Netherite Scrap Dust&r."
		""
		"The dust smelts in a furnace or blast furnace into one &6netherite scrap&r each. One find thus gives two or three scraps instead of one."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Crushing finished netherite scrap isn't worth it, one scrap gives only one dust."
	]
	quest.2DB6AB930A7A7927.quest_subtitle: "More netherite from every find."
	quest.2DB6AB930A7A7927.title: "&dCrush Ancient Debris"
	quest.2DBFA830E320D2D7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Day one:&r head from three cobblestone, wooden rod. &6Climber:&r stone head plus iron tip, mines diamond ore."
		""
		"&6Everyday:&r iron head, iron rod, sinew binding, leather grip. Malleable III and Flexible twice last a long time."
		""
		"&6Weapon:&r sword blade from two flint. Jagged III raises the damage the more worn the blade is."
	]
	quest.2DBFA830E320D2D7.quest_subtitle: "Recipes that have proven themselves."
	quest.2DBFA830E320D2D7.title: "&7Remember four good builds"
	quest.2DC0338A43BDADBC.quest_desc: [
		"Katana-Blaupause (drei Blaues Papier, ein Stock), die Klinge aus &edrei&r Material statt zwei, dazu Stiel und Griff. Kapitel &6Silent Gear&r."
		""
		"Der &6Dolch&r (ein Material) schlägt sehr schnell, der &6Speer&r reicht weiter, die &6Machete&r mäht nebenbei Pflanzen."
	]
	quest.2DC0338A43BDADBC.quest_subtitle: "Silent Gear: schwerer und stärker als das Schwert."
	quest.2DC0338A43BDADBC.title: "&7Forge a katana"
	quest.2DD6F78555D4757D.quest_desc: [
		"&6MEGA Radioactive Storage Component:&r sky stone dust in the corners, an Accumulation Processor at the top, two &6Radioactive Waste Barrels&r left and right, polarized quartz glass in the middle, a 256k component at the bottom. For the cell add &6Reactor Glass&r, sky stone dust, &6HDPE Sheets&r and a &6Polonium Pellet&r."
		""
		"Normal chemical cells take no radioactive substances. This cell takes only those: nuclear waste, polonium, plutonium. It holds one type, which you set beforehand at the Cell Workbench, up to &d2,048 buckets&r."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r It needs &d250 AE/t&r in the drive. It does not take spent nuclear waste."
	]
	quest.2DD6F78555D4757D.quest_subtitle: "The cell that only takes radioactive things."
	quest.2DD6F78555D4757D.title: "&aStore Nuclear Waste in the Network"
	quest.2DD74D4CECC05026.quest_desc: [
		"EMI also shows you the recipes of all later stages. The &etooltip&r of a locked item says which stage it opens with. You can carry and store it, but not hold, equip, place or craft it."
		""
		"Use that to plan ahead: you can already collect zinc, osmium, livingwood and source stones in stage 1, so your Brass Works runs on the first evening of stage 2."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r What a stage opens and what the obelisk wants for it is in the &6Start here&r chapter, in the &eobelisk&r quests."
	]
	quest.2DD74D4CECC05026.quest_subtitle: "Locked means visible, not craftable."
	quest.2DD74D4CECC05026.title: "&eLook into the Next Stage"
	quest.2DDE69DD79E59127.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_blaze_burner.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Walk up to the spawner with an &6Empty Blaze Burner&r in hand and right click a live &6blaze&r. It lands in the cage, and you have a &6Blaze Burner&r."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The Empty Blaze Burner needs &62 Source Gems&r from Ars Nouveau on top with an iron sheet between them, netherrack between two iron sheets in the middle, an iron sheet at the bottom."
		""
		"Under a basin it heats the mixer for &6brass&r. How it continues is in the &6Create: Brass&r chapter."
	]
	quest.2DDE69DD79E59127.quest_subtitle: "A blaze in a cage, and Create gets hot."
	quest.2DDE69DD79E59127.title: "&6&lCatch a blaze"
	quest.2DE28351347147D7.quest_desc: [
		"Pump &bBiodiesel&r, &bDiesel&r oder &bEthanol&r in den &6Dieselmotor&r, ein Eimer wird auf Kronwerke nicht angenommen. Er trinkt &e1 mB pro Sekunde&r, ein Eimer hält 16 Minuten."
		""
		"&eCreate Diesel Generators, Dieselmotor:&r Biodiesel &d96 RPM, 4 096 SU&r, Diesel 6 144 SU, Ethanol 2 048 SU. Der &6Große Dieselmotor&r ist stapelbar, 6 144 SU mit Biodiesel und 8 192 mit Diesel je Block. Der &6Riesen-Dieselmotor&r (224 RPM, bis 16 384 SU) kommt in Stufe 3. Offen ab Stufe 2, siehe Kapitel &6Create: Erweiterungen&r."
	]
	quest.2DE28351347147D7.quest_subtitle: "Create Diesel Generators, 96 RPM, 4 096 bis 8 192 SU aus einem Block."
	quest.2DE28351347147D7.title: "&6Bau einen Dieselmotor"
	quest.2DE5C264C705BA2F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Advanced Pressure Tube&r oben, Compressed Iron, &6Air Canister&r, Compressed Iron in der Mitte, drei Compressed Iron unten."
		""
		"Er fasst &e6 000 mL&r statt 3 000, lädt bis &e20 bar&r und explodiert nie. In einer Kiste mit einem &6Charging Module&r am Rohr davor wird er zum Luftspeicher, den du überallhin tragen kannst."
		""
		"Vier davon im Quadrat ergeben ein &6Reinforced Air Canister Array&r. Das brauchst du im nächsten Schritt."
	]
	quest.2DE5C264C705BA2F.quest_subtitle: "Doppelt so viel Luft, bis 20 bar."
	quest.2DE5C264C705BA2F.title: "&3Bau Reinforced Air Canisters"
	quest.2DE72750DFE6D2F0.quest_desc: [
		"&64k Crafting Storage:&r a Crafting Unit and a 4k component, shapeless. Larger storages allow orders with more ingredients and steps in between."
		""
		"&6Crafting Monitor:&r a Crafting Unit and an &6ME Storage Monitor&r, shapeless. Built into the CPU, it shows the running order."
		""
		"The CPU stays a full cuboid. If you fill gaps with Crafting Units, it may have any shape."
	]
	quest.2DE72750DFE6D2F0.quest_subtitle: "More storage, and a look at what it does."
	quest.2DE72750DFE6D2F0.title: "&7Enlarge your CPU"
	quest.2DEBCBC68071A08E.quest_desc: [
		"Like the tools, with the &6Wyvern Chestpiece&r as catalyst."
		""
		"It is the whole armor. Its strength comes from the modules of the next quests."
	]
	quest.2DEBCBC68071A08E.quest_subtitle: "Shield, flight and a second life."
	quest.2DEBCBC68071A08E.title: "&dFuse the Draconic Chestpiece"
	quest.2DFC7ECAACFBDEFD.quest_desc: [
		"Put a brown or red mushroom on Rich Soil. It grows into a &6mushroom colony&r."
		""
		"You harvest a fully grown colony with &6shears&r, after that it keeps growing."
	]
	quest.2DFC7ECAACFBDEFD.quest_subtitle: "Endless mushrooms."
	quest.2DFC7ECAACFBDEFD.title: "&7Grow a mushroom colony"
	quest.2E067B80B7EA60F2.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 sand&r, &e1 slimeball&r, &e1 melon slice&r, catalysts Earth and Air. &d8,000 mana&r."
		""
		"For Gourmaryllis, Narslimmus, Exoflame, the Pyroclast Pendant and the Terrasteel Chestplate."
	]
	quest.2E067B80B7EA60F2.quest_subtitle: "Earth and air make warmth."
	quest.2E067B80B7EA60F2.title: "&eMake the Rune of Summer"
	quest.2E0A16603B2F9DE1.quest_desc: [
		"Find a desert temple, jungle temple or witch hut and tick this off. &6YUNG's Better Desert Temples&r, &6Jungle Temples&r and &6Witch Huts&r turn them into big complexes."
		""
		"Expect traps, puzzles and enemies. Go slowly and watch the floor."
	]
	quest.2E0A16603B2F9DE1.quest_subtitle: "Desert, jungle, swamp: YUNG's rebuilds them all."
	quest.2E0A16603B2F9DE1.title: "&eSolve a temple"
	quest.2E0B4480640C1778.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a &6Bounty Board&r, take a bounty, collect what is asked for and click the board again with it."
		""
		"Bounties have a deadline. A &6Decree&r sets which kind of bounties a board offers. No board in the village? Build one from oak planks, oak logs, paper and a diamond."
	]
	quest.2E0B4480640C1778.quest_subtitle: "The Bounty Board pays in emeralds."
	quest.2E0B4480640C1778.title: "&6Complete a bounty"
	quest.2E13FDF36B6CA0AE.quest_desc: [
		"Schmiede &6Helm&r, &6Harnisch&r, &6Beinschutz&r und &6Stiefel&r aus Zanite Gemstones, wie bei Eisen: zusammen &e24 Gemstones&r. Zanite schützt genau so gut wie Eisen."
		""
		"Abgenutzte Zanite-Teile reparierst du im &6Altar&r, Ambrosium ist der Brennstoff. Mit den &6Zanite Gloves&r aus dem Kapitel weiter rechts ist das Set komplett."
	]
	quest.2E13FDF36B6CA0AE.quest_subtitle: "Schutz wie Eisen, aus dem Himmel."
	quest.2E13FDF36B6CA0AE.title: "&5Trag die volle Zanite-Rüstung"
	quest.2E1FF667B667D650.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Tough Fabric&r on top, &6Aluminium Rod&r, &6leather tunic&r, Aluminium Rod in the middle, fabric, rod, fabric at the bottom make the &6Collapsible Glider&r. Aluminium comes from &6bauxite&r, two ingots on top of each other make four rods."
		""
		"It glides like an elytra, but takes less and accepts no enchantments. Dives and rockets harm it more. It is repaired with Tough Fabric."
	]
	quest.2E1FF667B667D650.quest_subtitle: "Wings of hemp and aluminium."
	quest.2E1FF667B667D650.title: "&bBuild a Collapsible Glider"
	quest.2E2324F215DB379A.quest_desc: [
		"Jeder Cataclysm-Boss hat drei Grenzen: Ein Treffer macht höchstens &e20 bis 22 Schaden&r, pro Sekunde kommen höchstens &e13 bis 15 Schaden&r durch, und wer weiter als &e12 bis 38 Blöcke&r weg steht, macht fast keinen Schaden mehr."
		""
		"Das heißt: Ein Schwert mit Schärfe V und Kritischen Treffern ist so gut wie ein verzaubertes Eisenschwert, solange du ständig triffst. Mehrere Spieler zählen aber jeder für sich. Zu fünft fällt ein Boss fünfmal so schnell."
		""
		"Lässt du den Boss allein, heilt er sich mit &e25 Lebenspunkten&r pro Heilung wieder hoch. Also nicht zum Nachladen nach Hause laufen, sondern Vorräte mitbringen."
	]
	quest.2E2324F215DB379A.quest_subtitle: "Große Schläge bringen nichts, Ausdauer schon."
	quest.2E2324F215DB379A.title: "&eLern die Regeln der Bosse"
	quest.2E24B9A6AA86BC24.quest_desc: [
		"Leg das &6Moa Egg&r in den &6Incubator&r und feuere mit Ambrosium Torches, bis das Küken schlüpft."
		""
		"Das Küken ist &ehungrig&r: Füttere es mit einem &6Aechor Petal&r, sobald es Hunger zeigt. Nach insgesamt &e4 Blütenblättern&r ist es erwachsen. Nur ein Moa, das du selbst ausgebrütet hast, lässt sich satteln und reiten."
		""
		"Ein &6Nature Staff&r (Zanite Gemstone auf Skyroot Stick) kommandiert deine Moas: Rechtsklick lässt sie sitzen oder wieder aufstehen, Schleichen plus Rechtsklick lässt sie dir folgen."
	]
	quest.2E24B9A6AA86BC24.quest_subtitle: "Vier Blütenblätter bis zum Reittier."
	quest.2E24B9A6AA86BC24.title: "&eBrüte ein Moa aus"
	quest.2E2CC411937BE96F.quest_desc: [
		"The Lexica recommends enchanted &dElementium armor&r and a &aTerra Blade&r, plus brews and baubles."
		""
		"Golden apples, healing potions, strength and resistance from the brewery help. The Guardian takes at most &e32 damage&r per hit, many fast hits beat one big one."
	]
	quest.2E2CC411937BE96F.quest_subtitle: "It is harder than the Wither."
	quest.2E2CC411937BE96F.title: "&aGear Up"
	quest.2E2F39B985AF12DF.quest_desc: [
		"Der &cFrostmaw&r schläft in offenen Schneegebieten, nicht in Wald oder Taiga. Er hat &e250 Lebenspunkte&r, schlägt für 10 und friert dich mit seinem Atem ein. Wach wird er, wenn du zu nah kommst, oder wenn du ihn angreifst."
		""
		"Du hast zwei Wege: Schleich dich im Schlaf heran und nimm den &6Eiskristall&r aus seiner Pranke, oder kämpf, mit Abstand zu seinem Eisatem und zu mehreren."
		""
		"Der &6Eiskristall&r schleudert mit gehaltenem Rechtsklick einen eisigen Wirbelsturm und lädt sich im Inventar wieder auf. Weitere Bosse von Mowzie: &cUmvuthi&r, der Sonnenvogel (150 Lebenspunkte) im Hain der Umvuthana in der Savanne, und &cTongbi&r, der Bildhauer (140), in seinem Kloster auf den Berggipfeln."
	]
	quest.2E2F39B985AF12DF.quest_subtitle: "Oder stiehl ihm den Kristall im Schlaf."
	quest.2E2F39B985AF12DF.title: "&bJag den Frostmaw"
	quest.2E32A3F2F1C3250B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_light.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Four &6Iron Sheetmetal&r in the corners, four &6Iron Mechanical Components&r on the sides, a &6brass sheet&r in the middle make four &6Light Engineering Blocks&r."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Create's brass sheet replaces the copper ingot. The blocks open with &6stage 3&r, and with them every large multiblock."
		""
		"The Crusher and Arc Furnace need &e10&r each, the Excavator 9. Build up a stock right away. The basics from stage 2 are in the &6Immersive Engineering&r chapter."
	]
	quest.2E32A3F2F1C3250B.quest_subtitle: "The building block of every large machine."
	quest.2E32A3F2F1C3250B.title: "&6&lBuild 16 Light Engineering Blocks"
	quest.2E38DEE7DEFA0E17.quest_desc: [
		"Uranium oxide, uranium hexafluoride, hydrofluoric acid, fissile fuel, nuclear waste, polonium, plutonium, antimatter and superheated sodium come with stage 5."
		""
		"Who makes them and what for: chapter &5Mekanism: Antimatter&r."
	]
	quest.2E38DEE7DEFA0E17.quest_subtitle: "What the fission reactor brings along."
	quest.2E38DEE7DEFA0E17.title: "&fThe Gases of Stage 5"
	quest.2E471E298FB1C45E.quest_desc: [
		"In the Crystal Assembler: four &6Molecular Assemblers&r, four Concurrent Processors, four fluix dust, three Engineering Processors and an Acceleration Card."
		""
		"It works on eight jobs at once (if the CPU has enough co-processors) and twice as fast as a normal one. You do not put patterns in directly, it only gets them from a provider."
	]
	quest.2E471E298FB1C45E.quest_subtitle: "Eight jobs, twice as fast."
	quest.2E471E298FB1C45E.title: "&3Build an Extended Molecular Assembler"
	quest.2E4A171676F0E64A.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Iron Sheetmetal&r on top, below a &6Fluid Pipe&r and an &6External Heater&r make the &6Blast Furnace Preheater&r."
		""
		"Up to &etwo&r preheaters on the sides of the Improved Blast Furnace, each draws &d32 FE/t&r. It works without power too, only slower."
	]
	quest.2E4A171676F0E64A.quest_subtitle: "Hot air makes it faster."
	quest.2E4A171676F0E64A.title: "&cHang preheaters on the blast furnace"
	quest.2E4A34334E3F28ED.quest_desc: [
		"Bring together &e8 Terrasteel Ingots&r, one for each fight."
		""
		"The Terrasteel line from the chapter &aBotania: Runes&r supplies them on the side. Put the ingots in a chest at the arena, then the next fight starts within a minute."
	]
	quest.2E4A34334E3F28ED.quest_subtitle: "A stock so no evening fails for lack of an ingot."
	quest.2E4A34334E3F28ED.title: "&aKeep Offerings Ready for Eight Fights"
	quest.2E5E27AED10196A4.quest_desc: [
		"At the top right of the quest window there is a &ePin&r button. A pinned quest is shown with its tasks at the edge of the screen, even with the book closed."
		""
		"That way you see how many ingots are still missing while you play, without opening the book. &eUnpin&r removes it again."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Ideal for streamers: viewers always see what you are working on."
	]
	quest.2E5E27AED10196A4.quest_subtitle: "Your goal stays at the edge of the screen."
	quest.2E5E27AED10196A4.title: "&6Pin a quest"
	quest.2E6C9B50A5233C93.quest_desc: [
		"&5EvilCraft&r is magic with &4blood&r: you tap it from monsters, store it in tanks and press it into gems, machines and tools. The whole mod opens with &6stage 2&r."
		""
		"The raw material is &6Dark Ore&r. It lies everywhere below &eY 66&r, most likely where redstone lies too, and needs at least an &6iron pickaxe&r. Each ore gives 4 to 5 &6Dark Gems&r."
		""
		"{image:evilcraft:textures/item/dark_gem.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eTip:&r Bring &6Fortune&r. Only with Fortune do &6Crushed Dark Gems&r drop as well, and you need them for rings, brooms and the Box of Eternal Closure. There is no other way to get the powder."
	]
	quest.2E6C9B50A5233C93.quest_subtitle: "The dark ore everything starts with."
	quest.2E6C9B50A5233C93.title: "&5Mine Dark Gems"
	quest.2E7256E1EF70D43C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_apprentice_potions.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&dDispel&r on a witch at half health or less gives &6Wixie Shards&r. In the apparatus with a sapling, emerald, crafting table and &6brewing stand&r it becomes the charm."
		""
		"Charm on a &6cauldron&r: the &6Wixie Cauldron&r. Click it with the item you want, and it crafts from chests nearby; each craft costs some Source. Pedestals at the cauldron give it several recipes in turn."
	]
	quest.2E7256E1EF70D43C.quest_subtitle: "A witch that crafts for you."
	quest.2E7256E1EF70D43C.title: "&dSummon a Wixie"
	quest.2E85B54CE853B2F6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Freezing:&r eight &6snowballs&r around a blank module. &6Light Placer:&r lanterns, glowstone, glowstone dust and two &6redstone lamps&r around a blank module."
		""
		"Freezing freezes lava and water in front of the laser, &d100 FE&r per block. Light Placer puts the &6Miner's Light&r into dark tunnels while mining, also &d100 FE&r per light."
	]
	quest.2E85B54CE853B2F6.quest_subtitle: "Freezing and Light Placer."
	quest.2E85B54CE853B2F6.title: "&bFreeze lava and make light"
	quest.2E8795546E23765B.quest_desc: [
		"A &6uranium ingot&r in the &6Enrichment Chamber&r gives &e2 Yellow Cake&r."
		""
		"Uranium comes from the ore ladder, see the chapter &5Mekanism: Ore Step by Step&r."
	]
	quest.2E8795546E23765B.quest_subtitle: "Step 1 of 5 toward fuel."
	quest.2E8795546E23765B.title: "&aEnrich Uranium into Yellow Cake"
	quest.2E8B8DD851CC4A55.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Worn Notebook&r is in your inventory on your first login. Lost it? &6Book&r and &6lapis lazuli&r, shapeless at the crafting table."
		""
		"&dArs Nouveau&r builds spells out of &dglyphs&r like sentences out of words. The energy is called &dSource&r, and from it come &6Source Gems&r. The server needs those: &e800 Source Gems&r and &e12 Source Keystones&r are the magic pillar of &6stage 1&r."
		""
		"This chapter has two paths you follow side by side: the &dspell book&r at the top, the &6first Source Gem&r below."
	]
	quest.2E8B8DD851CC4A55.quest_subtitle: "Your handbook for the whole mod."
	quest.2E8B8DD851CC4A55.title: "&d&lRead the notebook"
	quest.2E8CEA97A3CC10BC.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r Three &6iron ingots&r and a &6Nether quartz&r in the 2x2 grid (iron top left, top right, bottom left, quartz bottom right) make four &6Quartz Enriched Iron&r. Make two stacks right away, it goes into almost everything."
		""
		"&3Refined Storage&r (RS for short) does the same as AE2: items sit on storage disks, a cable network connects everything, and you search in a grid. The difference is the effort."
		""
		"&eWhere RS is different:&r There are &eno channels&r, you hang as many devices on the cable as you like. Processors come from the furnace instead of a machine. A disk counts &eno types&r, only items. Autocrafting only needs patterns and an Autocrafter, no multiblock."
		""
		"&eWhat RS does not have:&r P2P tunnels, spatial storage, the depth of addon mods. Anyone planning a big network with many subsystems is better off with AE2. Anyone who wants storage that stands within an hour is right here."
		""
		"&eWhat is open in stage 3:&r everything up to the &616k disk&r, autocrafting and the Elite and Ultra devices of &6Cable Tiers&r. &cWhat still waits:&r 64k disks and the Mega devices come in stage 4."
	]
	quest.2E8CEA97A3CC10BC.quest_subtitle: "The simpler storage network."
	quest.2E8CEA97A3CC10BC.title: "&3&lRefined Storage"
	quest.2E932C385529C7CC.quest_desc: [
		"&eSpeed&r: Potion of Swiftness. &eJump Boost&r: strengthened Potion of Leaping (level II). &eSlow Falling&r: Potion of Slow Falling."
		""
		"A slow falling candle at the edge of a high building site saves lives."
	]
	quest.2E932C385529C7CC.quest_subtitle: "Speed, jump boost, slow falling."
	quest.2E932C385529C7CC.title: "&bSoak candles for movement"
	quest.2E971AFB2F8AEA99.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eternal_starlight_golem.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Its shield is indestructible and it does not move. When it overheats and charges, switch off the &eEnergy Blocks&r nearby. Then the shield drops and you strike."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r &6Oxidized Golem Steel Ingots&r, the &6Energy Sword&r, an oxidized alloy furnace and an armor trim."
	]
	quest.2E971AFB2F8AEA99.quest_subtitle: "Boss 1 of 3."
	quest.2E971AFB2F8AEA99.title: "&6&lDefeat the Starlight Golem"
	quest.2E9CE08DE7F08C49.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_advanced_spatial.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Spatial Pylon:&r quartz glass, glass cable, fluix dust, fluix crystal. Use them to build a shell around the area you want to cut out. The space is the shell minus one block inward."
		""
		"Each row of pylons has to be at least two blocks long and needs a channel. The more of the shell you fill, the more efficient. A separate subnetwork is easiest."
	]
	quest.2E9CE08DE7F08C49.quest_subtitle: "The shell around a piece of world."
	quest.2E9CE08DE7F08C49.title: "&3Set Up Spatial Pylons"
	quest.2EA1FF9A52C75691.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_tank.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&634 Iron Sheetmetal&r (four Iron Plates give four) and &64 Treated Wood Fences&r as legs, shape as in the manual, then the hammer on it."
		""
		"&eIn:&r any fluid, top or bottom. &eOut:&r only at the bottom in the middle, with a redstone signal it pumps out by itself. A comparator there shows how full it is. Any sheetmetal works, not just iron."
	]
	quest.2EA1FF9A52C75691.quest_subtitle: "3x5x3, 34 sheetmetal blocks and 4 fences, 512 buckets."
	quest.2EA1FF9A52C75691.title: "&9Form a Fluid Tank"
	quest.2EA8CAAD238C4975.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table or stonecutter turn Livingrock into &6Livingrock Bricks&r, polished and mossy variants, slabs, stairs and walls."
		""
		"A garden of bright Livingrock with glowing flowers in between quickly becomes the most beautiful building on the server."
	]
	quest.2EA8CAAD238C4975.quest_subtitle: "Magic is allowed to look good too."
	quest.2EA8CAAD238C4975.title: "&7Build with Livingrock"
	quest.2EB6198ADB8AD286.quest_desc: [
		"Put the Builder with &6Dimensional Shards&r into RFTools Base's &6Machine Infuser&r. It gets infused bit by bit."
		""
		"It is full after &e256 shards&r. Then it needs less power and digs up to &e20&r more blocks per tick. The Infuser draws 600 RF/t."
	]
	quest.2EB6198ADB8AD286.quest_subtitle: "Shards for speed."
	quest.2EB6198ADB8AD286.title: "&dInfuse the Builder"
	quest.2ED7398A8BF9E75D.quest_desc: [
		"Into the Digestion Vat: &e4 Common Metals Niter&r, a &6Sal Ammoniac Bucket&r and a &6Purified Gold&r. Out comes &e1 Rare Metals Niter&r."
		""
		"Reform it with a Gold Sulfur on the target into &6Gold Sulfur&r, the Incubator makes gold from it. Going down works without gold, one becomes four."
	]
	quest.2ED7398A8BF9E75D.quest_subtitle: "The change of tier."
	quest.2ED7398A8BF9E75D.title: "&5Raise Iron to Gold"
	quest.2EE42153BDFA1EEB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crude Scythe&r on the altar, on the stands &e4 Soulstained Steel&r, &e2 Hex Ash&r and &e4 Refined Soulstone&r. Plus &e16 Earthen&r, &e8 Wicked&r and &e8 Arcane&r."
		""
		"Enchantments stay. It hits harder, lasts longer and still harvests arcana."
	]
	quest.2EE42153BDFA1EEB.quest_subtitle: "The old scythe, but stronger."
	quest.2EE42153BDFA1EEB.title: "&5Improve the Scythe"
	quest.2EE5D1D7DEAE4C53.quest_desc: [
		"The same &6Mechanical Pump&r, the open pipe end into a &clava lake&r, &6Fluid Tanks&r behind it. An &6Item Drain&r in the belt also empties lava buckets from the mine into the tank."
		""
		"You need lava more often than you think: at the cobblestone generator, in front of the fan for smelting, and the &6Mechanical Press&r over a basin compacts 2 flint, 1 gravel and some lava into new &6andesite&r, the raw material of the tech pillar."
		""
		"A lake in the overworld is finite, the pump empties it block by block. Lava only becomes infinite with the lava ocean in the Nether (stage 2) or with fire seeds, next quest."
	]
	quest.2EE5D1D7DEAE4C53.quest_subtitle: "Lava for drills, fans and andesite."
	quest.2EE5D1D7DEAE4C53.title: "&cTap a lava lake"
	quest.2EE8820FFE75B976.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 Powdered Quartz&r, cloth."
		""
		"A companion reports players, monsters and blocks and keeps the area around it loaded. Clicked with a block it reports only that one. Costs &d200 mana&r."
	]
	quest.2EE8820FFE75B976.quest_subtitle: "It reports and keeps chunks loaded."
	quest.2EE8820FFE75B976.title: "&fSummon a Familiar"
	quest.2EF578B2DFFAC333.quest_desc: [
		"Right click an &6andesite casing&r with a &6zinc ingot&r, or let a deployer do it. It becomes a &6conductive casing&r."
		""
		"It goes into adapter, electromagnet, motor, meters and generator casing."
	]
	quest.2EF578B2DFFAC333.quest_subtitle: "Zinc on andesite casing."
	quest.2EF578B2DFFAC333.title: "&3Make a conductive casing"
	quest.2EF9FAEA2AC47548.quest_desc: [
		"&6Frosted Helve&r (4 Frozen Bones, 3 Arcane Ingots) und der &6Permafrost Shard&r aus der Kapitänskajüte des &6Impaled Icebreaker&r (vereiste Ozeane, Eiszapfenebene, vereiste Gipfel), formlos."
		""
		"+15 Prozent Eiszauberkraft, +5 Prozent Zauberkraft, +25 Prozent Manaregeneration. Rechtsklick wirkt den aktiven Zauber, wie beim Graybeard Staff."
	]
	quest.2EF9FAEA2AC47548.quest_subtitle: "Iron's Spells: der Stab aus dem Eisschiff."
	quest.2EF9FAEA2AC47548.title: "&bHol dir den Ice Staff"
	quest.2EFB9894648EA1FC.quest_desc: [
		"An &6iron ingot&r and a &6copper ingot&r give two &6Conductive Alloy Ingots&r."
		""
		"The base of every conduit and of Energetic Alloy. A stack is gone fast."
	]
	quest.2EFB9894648EA1FC.quest_subtitle: "Iron and copper."
	quest.2EFB9894648EA1FC.title: "&cAlloy Conductive Alloy"
	quest.2F011EE8B29279EC.quest_desc: [
		"Two Energy Tablets, two iron, four redstone, a steel casing in the middle. It stores &d1.6 million FE&r and outputs &d1,600 FE/t&r."
		""
		"One side is output, the others input. Turn the output towards the machine line, the generators to an input side."
	]
	quest.2F011EE8B29279EC.quest_subtitle: "1.6 million FE of buffer."
	quest.2F011EE8B29279EC.title: "&aSet up an Energy Cube"
	quest.2F15623340FF9B3F.quest_desc: [
		"Lead, Teleportation Core, ender pearls, an Ultimate Control Circuit and a sticky piston. The &6Importer&r pulls from a block into the network, the &6Exporter&r pushes in by filter."
		""
		"An Exporter with a coal filter on the Enrichment Chamber, an Importer on the output, and the chamber runs from storage."
	]
	quest.2F15623340FF9B3F.quest_subtitle: "Machines on storage."
	quest.2F15623340FF9B3F.title: "&dAttach an Importer and Exporter"
	quest.2F271BA45D1FE663.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_portal.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &e4 deepslate&r, &e4 steel ingots&r and an &6echo shard&r make &e2&r Reinforced Deepslate."
		"&5Ritual:&r Osorin's Unbound Calling, bowls &e4 iron bars&r, &e4 obsidian&r, &e1 Iesnium ingot&r, start with &6deepslate&r, &cSacrifice:&r a &6Warden&r. One block per ritual."
		""
		"A possessed Warden from Posuc's Convocation counts as the sacrifice. The ritual is still only worth it if you have no steel. The block frames the portal to the Otherside, see the chapter &5Deeper and Darker&r."
	]
	quest.2F271BA45D1FE663.quest_subtitle: "Two ways to the frame of the Otherside."
	quest.2F271BA45D1FE663.title: "&8Make Reinforced Deepslate"
	quest.2F2B75676A4A2FB3.quest_desc: [
		"A &6copper ingot&r with &e10 mB redstone&r gives an &6Infused Alloy&r."
		""
		"It goes into the energy tablet, the upgrades, the electrolytic separator, the pump and almost every generator. You have enough copper, make a stack."
	]
	quest.2F2B75676A4A2FB3.quest_subtitle: "Copper that has swallowed redstone."
	quest.2F2B75676A4A2FB3.title: "&cMake infused alloy"
	quest.2F30F00339DAF75D.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6glass&r and three &6sticks&r diagonally, see EMI."
		""
		"Clicking a block while sneaking attunes it. Holding right click searches, a short right click shows the last find without using durability. Finds iron and coal."
	]
	quest.2F30F00339DAF75D.quest_subtitle: "Finds common ores."
	quest.2F30F00339DAF75D.title: "&7Build a Glass Divination Rod"
	quest.2F31930432A4AA6B.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r Blueprint Paper, iron ingot, Blueprint Paper on top, three sticks in the middle, one Blueprint Paper at the bottom. The shield plate needs &etwo&r material."
		""
		"The shield blocks like the vanilla one, its durability comes from the material. It is repaired with a Repair Kit like every Silent Gear part."
	]
	quest.2F31930432A4AA6B.quest_subtitle: "A shield that holds as much as its material."
	quest.2F31930432A4AA6B.title: "&7Build a shield"
	quest.2F319ACAAAD4952D.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &61 string&r over &61 Raw Amaramber&r makes an &6Amaramber Candle&r. Place it and light it."
		""
		"In this dimension burning Amaramber candles, Amaramber lanterns, Torreya campfires and Amaramber fire stop hostile monsters from spawning nearby. For a base here that is worth gold."
	]
	quest.2F319ACAAAD4952D.quest_subtitle: "Light where no monsters spawn."
	quest.2F319ACAAAD4952D.title: "&6Set Up Amaramber Candles"
	quest.2F32CA00AFD64FD1.quest_desc: [
		"All in the apparatus with a &6glass bottle&r in the middle:"
		"&6Charm of Emberward&r (magma cream, lava bucket, flint and steel): walk through fire, swim in lava."
		"&6Charm of Gilded Friendship&r (full gold armour, gilded blackstone): piglin brutes stay calm."
		"&6Charm of Decay's End&r (wither rose, wither skeleton skull, milk bucket): protects against Wither."
	]
	quest.2F32CA00AFD64FD1.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: checklist for the Nether."
	quest.2F32CA00AFD64FD1.title: "&6Fill the Nether charms"
	quest.2F3AB3A170C9C031.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/quarries_destroyer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Two &6Quarry Plus&r, &6diamond blocks&r, &6emerald blocks&r, &6eyes of ender&r, a &6Nether Star&r and a &6dragon head&r. You find the head on the End Ships."
		""
		"You stake out the area with a Chunk Marker or Flexible Marker, and start it in the window. It is expensive in power, plan a supply line of its own."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Draconium only exists in the End. A quarry on a remote End island brings ore in quantity for the &e1,000 draconium ingots&r of stage 4. The main island is left alone."
	]
	quest.2F3AB3A170C9C031.quest_subtitle: "Whole chunks down to the bottom."
	quest.2F3AB3A170C9C031.title: "&6&lBuild the Chunk Destroyer"
	quest.2F4026AC59803510.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Ferricore Ingots&r above a stick give the &6Ferricore Sword&r, half a point harder than iron. The &6Mob Scanner&r upgrade is two &6amethyst shards&r and two &6spider eyes&r around a blank."
		""
		"Mob Scanner is active: trigger it, and all monsters nearby glow through walls. Good before going down into a cave or when looking for the last mob in the basement."
		""
		"The &6Ferricore Bow&r (three strings, three ingots) has a slot in the Tool Settings for a &6Potion Canister&r (four ingots around a glass bottle). Fill the canister with potions, install the &6Potion Arrow&r upgrade (two glass bottles, four nether warts around a blank), and every arrow carries the potion effect."
	]
	quest.2F4026AC59803510.quest_subtitle: "Sword with Mob Scanner, bow with potion canister."
	quest.2F4026AC59803510.title: "&cTrack Down Monsters"
	quest.2F41A2CC82C7E211.quest_desc: [
		"&6Prussian Blue:&r one lapis lazuli and two iron nuggets. It takes &e1 Sv&r of dose at once and flushes caesium out of the body for two minutes."
		""
		"&6Rad-Protection Potion:&r glass bottle, iodine tablet and Prussian Blue. No reduction, but for five minutes up to &e95 percent&r less new dose. Drink it before you go to the reactor."
	]
	quest.2F41A2CC82C7E211.quest_subtitle: "Prevention instead of cure."
	quest.2F41A2CC82C7E211.title: "&eMix Prussian Blue and a Protection Potion"
	quest.2F56437A46E9AD0E.quest_desc: [
		"Chemical Infuser: &e1 mB Deuterium + 1 mB Tritium = 2 mB D-T Fuel&r. &6Hohlraum:&r four gold dust with 10 mB of carbon in the Metallurgic Infuser."
		""
		"Put the Hohlraum into a Chemical Tank with D-T Fuel, it holds &e10 mB&r. Filled, it goes into the reactor controller and ignites."
	]
	quest.2F56437A46E9AD0E.quest_subtitle: "Deuterium and Tritium together."
	quest.2F56437A46E9AD0E.title: "&bFill a Hohlraum with D-T Fuel"
	quest.2F59991ADFDD40F2.quest_desc: [
		"Put a &6saddle&r on a &6strider&r and steer it with a &6warped fungus on a stick&r (fishing rod plus warped fungus). That way you cross whole lava lakes."
		""
		"Striders wander around on lava, often in groups. You find saddles in fortresses and bastions."
	]
	quest.2F59991ADFDD40F2.quest_subtitle: "Across the lava lakes instead of around them."
	quest.2F59991ADFDD40F2.title: "&dRide a strider"
	quest.2F5ACB4CC676A3CF.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_portal.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eDas Portal:&r Ein Rahmen aus &6Leuchtstein&r, genau wie ein Netherportal, 4 breit und 5 hoch. Statt Feuer gießt du einen &6Wassereimer&r in den Rahmen, und das Portal leuchtet blau. Leuchtstein gibt es im Nether, deshalb öffnet der Aether mit ihm in &6Stufe 2&r."
		""
		"&eDrüben:&r schwebende Inseln, Skyroot und Holystone, Ambrosium, Zanite und Gravitit, Moas und fliegende Schweine. Drei Verliese mit drei Bossen: Bronze mit dem &6Slider&r, Silber mit der &6Walkürenkönigin&r, Gold mit dem &6Sonnengeist&r. Die Verliesausrüstung öffnet in Stufe 3."
		""
		"&eMitnehmen:&r Blöcke für Brücken, Essen, Pfeile. Werkzeuge aus der Oberwelt bauen Aether-Blöcke langsam ab, also gleich drüben &6Skyroot-&r und &6Holystone-Werkzeug&r machen. Beim ersten Besuch bekommst du das &6Buch der Überlieferung&r und goldene Fallschirme geschenkt. Alles Weitere im Kapitel &bDer Aether&r."
	]
	quest.2F5ACB4CC676A3CF.quest_subtitle: "Leuchtstein und ein Eimer Wasser. Stufe 2."
	quest.2F5ACB4CC676A3CF.title: "&bBau ein Aether-Portal"
	quest.2F5EEFB7045A6E96.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6Iron Sheets&r and two &6Andesite Alloys&r make a &6Whisk&r: alloy at the top, sheet, alloy, sheet in the middle, three sheets at the bottom."
	]
	quest.2F5EEFB7045A6E96.quest_subtitle: "The tool inside the mixer."
	quest.2F5EEFB7045A6E96.title: "&6Bend a whisk"
	quest.2F65CA23BBDCEF00.quest_desc: [
		"&6Extreme alloy&r (Tough Alloy and Hard Carbon) and &6boron arsenide&r in the Alloy Smelter, then into a plate in the Pressurizer."
		""
		"&6Boron arsenide:&r melt arsenic (Rock Crusher, from andesite) and boron in the &6Melter&r, mix them in the &6Chemical Reactor&r, let them set in the &6Ingot Former&r."
	]
	quest.2F65CA23BBDCEF00.quest_subtitle: "The long road to cooling."
	quest.2F65CA23BBDCEF00.title: "&bPress Thermoconducting Plates"
	quest.2F69AF6DB1641D62.quest_desc: [
		"&eScheduled Delay&r: the train waits a fixed time at the station, then it leaves."
	]
	quest.2F69AF6DB1641D62.quest_subtitle: "Wait, then on."
	quest.2F69AF6DB1641D62.title: "&7Scheduled Delay"
	quest.2F69ED37AAC71411.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 iron ingots&r and &e3 sticks&r diagonally make the &6Butcher Knife&r. Pigs, cows and sheep killed with it drop &6Tallow&r."
		""
		"Tallow becomes candles, and almost every pentacle needs candles."
	]
	quest.2F69ED37AAC71411.quest_subtitle: "Tallow for candles."
	quest.2F69ED37AAC71411.title: "&6Forge a Butcher Knife"
	quest.2F6D5B631C20527C.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &6coke&r into the Crusher, out comes &6Coke Dust&r, one to one, for 2,400 FE each."
		""
		"Eight Coke Dust become HOP graphite in the Industrial Squeezer. In the Arc Furnace Coke Dust is the additive that turns iron into steel."
	]
	quest.2F6D5B631C20527C.quest_subtitle: "Raw material for graphite and steel in the Arc Furnace."
	quest.2F6D5B631C20527C.title: "&8Grind Coke into Coke Dust"
	quest.2F71A3F7ABF3A098.quest_desc: [
		"Paste and &6iron bars&r: three bars in a column, paste left and right, gives eight vertical &6Dielectric Rods&r. As a row with paste above and below it gives eight horizontal ones."
		""
		"&6Casing:&r iron ingots in the corners, horizontal rods at the top and bottom, vertical ones left and right, the middle empty."
		""
		"Almost every Powah block has a casing in its recipe. Build four right away."
	]
	quest.2F71A3F7ABF3A098.quest_subtitle: "The frame of every Powah machine."
	quest.2F71A3F7ABF3A098.title: "&7Build a Dielectric Casing"
	quest.2F72A239B381F811.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Flüssigkeitsrohr&r und &6Mechanische Pumpe&r: Rohre verbinden Quellen und Ziele, die Pumpe treibt das Netz &e16 Blöcke&r weit an, schneller mit mehr Drehzahl, mehrere Pumpen addieren sich. Pfeil zeigt die Richtung, Schraubenschlüssel dreht sie. Kein Filter. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Zwei Kupferbleche um einen Kupferbarren ergeben vier Rohre, Zahnrad und Rohr eine Pumpe. Ein offenes Rohrende nimmt Quellblöcke auf und setzt sie wieder ab."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r Das &6Intelligente Flüssigkeitsrohr&r filtert eine Flüssigkeit. Mehr im Kapitel Create."
	]
	quest.2F72A239B381F811.quest_subtitle: "Create, Mechanische Pumpe: treibt 16 Blöcke Rohr an."
	quest.2F72A239B381F811.title: "Bau Rohr und Pumpe"
	quest.2F75D7990B5FFDC1.quest_desc: [
		"Jedes Modell hat einen festen &dStromverbrauch pro Tick&r in der Simulationskammer. Je gefährlicher der Mob, desto teurer:"
		""
		"&e64 FE/t:&r Kuh, Schaf, Huhn, Schwein. &e128 FE/t:&r Zombie, Skelett, Creeper, Spinne, Schleim, Ertrunkener, Phantom. &e256 FE/t:&r Lohe, Ghast, Magmawürfel, Zombifizierter Piglin, Hoglin, Hexe, Wächter, Breeze, Wilden."
		"&e512 FE/t:&r Enderman, Shulker, Diener (Vindicator). &e768 FE/t:&r Witherskelett. &e1.024 FE/t:&r Eisengolem, Magier (Evoker), Großer Wächter. &e2.560 FE/t:&r Wither, Warden, Mimic. &e4.096 FE/t:&r Enderdrache."
		""
		"&cKein Modell&r haben die Bosse von Cataclysm, Fledermaus und Tintenfisch zählen nur als Spielerei. Die Erzmodelle des Mods sind auf dem Server abgeschaltet."
	]
	quest.2F75D7990B5FFDC1.quest_subtitle: "Was es gibt, und was es kostet."
	quest.2F75D7990B5FFDC1.title: "&3Kenne die Modelle im Pack"
	quest.2F7FC4FE3DA36466.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_addons.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the Dissolution Chamber with &e1,000 mB of latex&r, two &6redstone&r, two &6glass panes&r, two &6Gold Gears&r each, plus: two &6sugar&r for speed, two &6blaze rods&r for efficiency, &6furnace&r and &6crafting table&r for processing."
		""
		"Speed: progress runs +1 per tick faster. Processing: +1 operation per run. Tier 2, with Diamond Gears instead of gold, gives +2. &6Range&r (glass, redstone and four cobblestone, lapis and so on up to tier 11) grows the work area by 1 per tier."
	]
	quest.2F7FC4FE3DA36466.quest_subtitle: "Faster, more efficient, more per operation."
	quest.2F7FC4FE3DA36466.title: "&9Put Addons in Your Machines"
	quest.2F80F0ADAE8ADB6D.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a &6diamond&r into Spiritfire. Out comes a &bSpirit Attuned Gem&r."
		""
		"The gem goes into the Divination Rod, the lenses, the Magic Lamp and, four in a square, into the &bSpirit Attuned Crystal&r for big pentacles."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The AE2 &6ME Controller&r needs a Spirit Attuned Gem on top instead of a fluix crystal. AE2 opens with stage 3, so put a few gems aside now. The shortcut through Ars Ocultas is removed, only Spiritfire remains."
	]
	quest.2F80F0ADAE8ADB6D.quest_subtitle: "A diamond that hears spirits."
	quest.2F80F0ADAE8ADB6D.title: "&bMake a Spirit Attuned Gem"
	quest.2F88027D3CD23E8B.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 red&r, &e1 grey&r, &e1 light grey&r petal, Runes of &eFire&r and &eSummer&r."
		""
		"All furnaces near it burn with mana, without coal and faster than normal. A row of furnaces around an Exoflame is a smeltery without a fuel store."
	]
	quest.2F88027D3CD23E8B.quest_subtitle: "Heats furnaces with mana."
	quest.2F88027D3CD23E8B.title: "&6Plant an Exoflame"
	quest.2F8D32F7B0484959.quest_desc: [
		"Throw an &6ender pearl&r into the &5gateway portal&r at the edge of the main island. A new one appears after every victory over the dragon."
		""
		"Over there lie the &eouter islands&r, about a thousand blocks from the center. A way back appears next to your landing spot. Put a waystone next to it, there are wild waystones here too."
	]
	quest.2F8D32F7B0484959.quest_subtitle: "An ender pearl through the hole."
	quest.2F8D32F7B0484959.title: "&5Travel Through a Gateway Portal"
	quest.2F8ECB8AFB57735C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_improved_form.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Set the &627 Reinforced Blast Bricks&r up as a 3x3x3 cube, put a &6hopper&r on top in the middle and hit the block the manual shows with the hammer."
		""
		"&eIn:&r iron and coke from above through the hopper. &eOut:&r steel at the front, slag at the back, straight into chests or onto conveyor belts. This is the first steel line that runs without you."
	]
	quest.2F8ECB8AFB57735C.quest_subtitle: "3x4x3, 27 Reinforced Blast Bricks and a hopper."
	quest.2F8ECB8AFB57735C.title: "&c&lForm an Improved Blast Furnace"
	quest.2F95F6FA4A2C168D.quest_desc: [
		"HDPE Sheets in the corners, a chest at the top, Ultimate Control Circuits left and right, Steel Casing in the middle, a Polonium Pellet at the bottom."
		""
		"Put armor or a tool in, then the module. In the station's window you turn each module on and off and adjust it."
	]
	quest.2F95F6FA4A2C168D.quest_subtitle: "This is where the modules go in."
	quest.2F95F6FA4A2C168D.title: "&bBuild a Modification Station"
	quest.2FAC967952DAFADF.quest_desc: [
		"Set the pipe end at your &6source chest&r to &eextract&r with sneak and wrench. Everything in it travels into the chests and machines on the same pipe line, the nearest first."
		""
		"A right click with an empty hand on an extracting end opens its window. There is a slot for an &6upgrade&r, and with it come redstone control, distribution and later filters."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A pipe line can have several extracting ends. Two chests with ore, one line, an Enrichment Chamber at the end: the feed line is done."
	]
	quest.2FAC967952DAFADF.quest_subtitle: "One side extracts, all others deliver."
	quest.2FAC967952DAFADF.title: "&bLet the Pipe Extract"
	quest.2FAD545FC27D4FD4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Lead&r in the corners, &6steel&r on the sides, &6Tough Alloy&r in the middle."
		""
		"You need plenty of steel here. Your steel line from stage 3 has work to do again."
	]
	quest.2FAD545FC27D4FD4.quest_subtitle: "The frame of every machine."
	quest.2FAD545FC27D4FD4.title: "&7Build a Chassis"
	quest.2FAE0B849425E8B2.quest_desc: [
		"Kill a &6pig&r with a kitchen knife. It drops &6ham&r."
		""
		"In the smoker it becomes smoked ham for the honey glazed ham. At the cutting board, ham gives pork and a bone."
	]
	quest.2FAE0B849425E8B2.quest_subtitle: "Off to the hunt with your knife."
	quest.2FAE0B849425E8B2.title: "&7Hunt ham with the knife"
	quest.2FB4FC214AB17177.quest_desc: [
		"Along the Ether Rivers grow &6Thioquartz&r geodes like amethyst. A &6Seeking Eye&r in the middle and &64 Thioquartz Shards&r on the sides make &e4 Etheric Eyes&r."
		""
		"Use one and it takes you to the surface. Ideal if you got lost in the caves below the Voidstone. The shards also become Thioquartz arrows."
	]
	quest.2FB4FC214AB17177.quest_subtitle: "The quick way up."
	quest.2FB4FC214AB17177.title: "&dBuild Etheric Eyes"
	quest.2FB7345AABF89207.quest_desc: [
		"An den Sculkglanz-Klumpen sitzt &6Poröser Sculkglanz&r. Mit der &6Schere&r kratzt du &6Glanzgel&r ab, und der Block füllt sich wieder."
		""
		"&eWofür:&r Mit Glanzgel &ezähmst&r du Sculk-Schnapper, siehe unten. Ein &6Seltsamer Trank&r plus Glanzgel wird zum &6Trank der Leuchtkraft&r. Neun Gel ergeben einen &6Glanzgelblock&r, der einen Sturz abfängt."
	]
	quest.2FB7345AABF89207.quest_subtitle: "Schere an den Porösen Sculkglanz."
	quest.2FB7345AABF89207.title: "&eKratz Glanzgel ab"
	quest.2FD44501D6EFF51C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/enderio_filter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Yeta Wrench:&r three copper ingots and a grain. &6Basic Item Filter:&r a hopper with paper, use it while sneaking to set it up."
		""
		"Right click a connection to a machine to open it: insert, extract, channel, priority, round robin and a filter slot for each direction."
	]
	quest.2FD44501D6EFF51C.quest_subtitle: "Yeta Wrench and filter."
	quest.2FD44501D6EFF51C.title: "&9Configure a Connection"
	quest.2FD9FD3668833236.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/flux_networks_first_link.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Flux-Staub:&r Redstone auf einen &6Obsidian&r fallen lassen, der auf Grundgestein steht. &eFlux-Kern (Kronwerke):&r Staub in die Ecken, Obsidian an die Seiten, ein &6Quellenedelstein&r in der Mitte. &eController (Kronwerke):&r Fluxblöcke, Staub, Kern oben und ein &6Fortschrittlicher Steuerschaltkreis&r in der Mitte."
		""
		"&eFlux Networks:&r Ein &6Flux Plug&r nimmt Strom aus Generatoren und Speichern, ein &6Flux Point&r gibt ihn an Maschinen ab, überall auf der Welt, auch in anderen Dimensionen, bis &d800 000 FE/t&r je Gerät. Der &6Controller&r lädt außerdem deine Werkzeuge drahtlos. Jeder Spieler hat bis zu 5 Netze, Chunks werden auf Wunsch geladen."
		""
		"&eSpeicher:&r &6Basic Flux Storage&r &d2 Millionen FE&r, 20 000 FE/t. Herculean 16 Millionen und 120 000 FE/t (Stufe 4), Gargantuan 128 Millionen und 720 000 FE/t (Stufe 5). Mekanism-Kabel tauschen mit Flux ohne Limit. Offen ab Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.2FD9FD3668833236.quest_subtitle: "Flux Networks, Strom ohne Kabel, 800 000 FE/t je Punkt."
	quest.2FD9FD3668833236.title: "&dBau ein Flux-Netzwerk"
	quest.2FDE77C019ED68C9.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Fertile Essence&r in the corners, four &6Nether Stars&r on the sides, a &6rose bush&r in the middle give the &6Witherless Rose&r. Fertile Essence is Rib Bone, Catalyzing Gland, a &6Mandrake Root&r from Hexerei and Slime Pearl in the crafting table."
		""
		"With the rose in your inventory the &5Wither&r effect no longer hits you, whether from wither skeletons, the Wither itself or arrows. Four Nether Stars are a price a group shares: whoever farms the Wither anyway has them."
		""
		"&eAlso good:&r Three Fertile Essence plus a lily pad give the &6Lilypad of Fertility&r, which makes crops within 4 blocks grow every 10 seconds."
	]
	quest.2FDE77C019ED68C9.quest_subtitle: "Never the Wither effect again."
	quest.2FDE77C019ED68C9.title: "&dPick a Witherless Rose"
	quest.2FE695089B5F6559.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_welcome.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6book&r and a &6lever&r at the crafting table make the &6Engineer's Manual&r. Right click opens it."
		""
		"&6Immersive Engineering&r builds its machines as &emultiblocks&r: set the blocks up in the right shape, hit them with the &6Engineer's Hammer&r, done. In the manual you can turn every structure and look at it layer by layer."
		""
		"&eStage 2:&r Coke Oven, Blast Furnace, Alloy Kiln, Windmill, wires, tank and silo. The engineering blocks and all the large machines come in &6stage 3&r, see the chapter &6Immersive Engineering: Heavy Industry&r."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/tool_manual.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2FE695089B5F6559.quest_subtitle: "A book that shows you every multiblock layer by layer."
	quest.2FE695089B5F6559.title: "&6&lGet the Engineer's Manual"
	quest.2FE76D89B8BB41ED.quest_desc: [
		"A &6wooden door&r and a &6Railway Casing&r make a &6Train Door&r, a trapdoor and a Railway Casing a &6Train Trapdoor&r. They slide aside and fit into narrow carriages."
		"{image:create:textures/item/train_door.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"A handsome train is your base's calling card on stream."
	]
	quest.2FE76D89B8BB41ED.quest_subtitle: "In and out without climbing."
	quest.2FE76D89B8BB41ED.title: "&6Fit train doors"
	quest.2FF700F613DF2D92.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_coke_oven.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put an &6empty bucket&r into the slot in the Coke Oven's window, below it you take out a &6Bucket of Creosote Oil&r."
		""
		"Creosote becomes Treated Wood and burns in the Diesel Generator if need be. Empty the tank regularly, or the oven stops when it is full."
	]
	quest.2FF700F613DF2D92.quest_subtitle: "Bucket into the window, full bucket back."
	quest.2FF700F613DF2D92.title: "&bTap Creosote Oil"
	quest.30026024D4CB34E4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_pots.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Steck einen &6Setzling&r von Productive Trees in einen &6Pflanztopf&r (Botany Pots, Kapitel &6Kochen&r) mit Erde. Alle &e2 Minuten&r kommen &e2 Stämme&r, ein Blatt und bei Obstbäumen die volle Ernte eines Blatts heraus, bei der Walnuss also 3 Nüsse, bei der Schwarzkirsche 5 Kirschen."
		""
		"Mit 5 Prozent fällt dabei ein weiterer Setzling ab. Ein &6Trichter-Pflanztopf&r wirft alles in die Kiste darunter. Das ist der schnellste Weg zu Obst, Gewürzen und Kaffee, viel schneller als das Reifen am Baum."
		""
		"Alle 163 Arten funktionieren so, auch die Fundstücke und die leuchtenden Hybriden. Kork, Zimt und Schleim aus dem Entrinder gibt es im Topf aber nicht, dafür brauchst du die Stämme."
	]
	quest.30026024D4CB34E4.quest_subtitle: "Alle zwei Minuten Holz, Blätter und die ganze Ernte."
	quest.30026024D4CB34E4.title: "&aZieh Bäume im Pflanztopf"
	quest.300502E45293D10D.quest_desc: [
		"Terrastahl von der Agglomerationsplatte. &6Terraklinge&r: 2 Barren, ein Lebeholzzweig. &6Terra-Zerschmetterer&r: Spitzhacke aus Terrastahl, die im Becken Mana schluckt."
		""
		"2 300 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 9, +4 Schaden, Netherit-Stufe. Rüstung 20 mit Zähigkeit 3. Die Klinge schießt Strahlen, der Zerschmetterer gräbt ab Rang B Flächen, der &6Terra-Fäller&r ganze Bäume."
	]
	quest.300502E45293D10D.quest_subtitle: "Botania: Terraklinge und Terra-Zerschmetterer."
	quest.300502E45293D10D.title: "&aSchmiede Terrastahl"
	quest.301358D2DA4DB758.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &6Nether quartz&r into the portal. One &6Elven Quartz&r comes back per piece."
		""
		"Elven Quartz is pure decoration: blocks, pillars, bricks and slabs in green. A good test with cheap goods."
	]
	quest.301358D2DA4DB758.quest_subtitle: "Green quartz for building."
	quest.301358D2DA4DB758.title: "&aTrade Quartz for Elven Quartz"
	quest.3013F277F6C47DD1.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_ores_line2.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Kiste, dann &6Einfache Logistiktransporter&r (zwei Stahl, ein Schaltkreis, gibt acht) zur Kammer, Auto-Auswurf, Transporter zum Schmelzer, Auto-Auswurf, Transporter in die Ausgangskiste. Strom an beide über Universalkabel."
		""
		"Mit dem &6Konfigurator&r stellst du die Transporterseite an der Eingangskiste auf &eZiehen&r, sonst holt der Transporter nichts heraus. Ein einfacher Transporter schafft einen Gegenstand pro halbe Sekunde, für eine einzelne Kammer reicht das lange."
		""
		"Zum Beweis: 32 Osmiumstaub, die durch diese Straße gelaufen sind. Osmium brauchst du für jede Maschine, die noch kommt."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Hinter dem Schmelzer ist der Platz für die Stahlstraße aus dem Kapitel Mekanism. Mehr Eisen heißt mehr Stahl für das Ziel von Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.3013F277F6C47DD1.quest_subtitle: "Kiste, Kammer, Schmelzer, Kiste."
	quest.3013F277F6C47DD1.title: "&d&lStell die Zweifach-Straße auf"
	quest.301C3EC70E22F8DA.quest_desc: [
		"Show eight 2x2 drawers, two iron barrels, a Storage Controller and an Item Vault."
		""
		"With that you have every pillar of good storage: a &6backpack&r with the upgrade for your day, a &6drawer wall&r for bulk goods, &6upgraded barrels&r at the &6Storage Controller&r for the rest and an &6Item Vault&r at the end of the Create line. The base is ready for whatever Create spits out."
	]
	quest.301C3EC70E22F8DA.quest_subtitle: "A base where you find things again."
	quest.301C3EC70E22F8DA.title: "&6&lBring order to the Kronwerk"
	quest.30267281CAAD1E17.quest_desc: [
		"&5Sevira's Permanent Confinement&r: &6netherite dust&r, &6wither skeleton skull&r, &6blackstone dust&r, &6wither rose&r make &e3 Witherite Dust&r (Afrit book)."
		"&6Impure White Chalk&r with &e3 Witherite Dust&r, then into Spiritfire."
		""
		"Your Crusher makes netherite and blackstone dust. Wither roses grow where the Wither killed something. Black counts as foundation everywhere."
	]
	quest.30267281CAAD1E17.quest_subtitle: "The hardest foundation."
	quest.30267281CAAD1E17.title: "&8Mix black chalk"
	quest.302B5E8A68ED44DD.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nether_nm_kill.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Wake the &cNetherite Monstrosity&r in the forge and defeat it: &e600 health&r, armour 12, lava bombs, flame beam and flare bombs."
		""
		"Cap: 25 per hit, 20 per second, barely any damage from 18 blocks away. Fire resistance is a must, netherite armour or Ignitium strongly recommended."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r the &6Infernal Forge&r, the &6Monstrous Horn&r and &e16 to 24 lava power cells&r. For a second fight the boss respawner takes a Monstrous Eye."
	]
	quest.302B5E8A68ED44DD.quest_subtitle: "The war machine of the Nether."
	quest.302B5E8A68ED44DD.title: "&c&lDefeat the Netherite Monstrosity"
	quest.3030AFB1FCEF8E0E.quest_desc: [
		"&cHunters&r and &cStalkers&r live around Wilden dens in forests at night, &cGuardians&r only in cold biomes. Bring armour."
		""
		"The Hunter drops &6Wilden Horns&r, the Stalker &6Wings&r, the Guardian &6Spikes&r. Wings go into Air Essence and Leap, horns into Conjuration Essence and the Drygmy."
	]
	quest.3030AFB1FCEF8E0E.quest_subtitle: "Horn, wing, spike."
	quest.3030AFB1FCEF8E0E.title: "&cHunt the Wilden"
	quest.3050E13EF78B8794.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6Pulse Mana Spreader&r, &6Rune of Mana&r, &bMana Diamond&r, middle &6Livingwood log&r and &6TNT&r, bottom right another Livingwood log."
		""
		"The blaster fires mana bursts from your hand, with mana from a tablet or ring in your inventory. The bursts are faster than a spreader's but only carry three quarters of the mana."
		""
		"A lens goes in at the crafting table; laid on the grid on its own, it comes out again. With the Bore Lens it becomes a long range drill."
	]
	quest.3050E13EF78B8794.quest_subtitle: "A spreader for your hand."
	quest.3050E13EF78B8794.title: "&6Build a Mana Blaster"
	quest.305E50EF85284644.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_arc.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e27 Reinforced Blast Bricks, 10 Light and 5 Heavy Engineering Blocks, 8 Steel Sheetmetal, 14 Steel Sheetmetal slabs, 6 steel blocks, 5 Steel Scaffolding, 1 Redstone Engineering Block, 1 cauldron&r. Hammer on the cauldron."
		""
		"&eIn:&r three electrodes at the top, up to 12 inputs through the hatch on the left, 4 additives on the right. &eOut:&r 6 outputs from the basin at the front, slag at the back. Power through the three connectors at the back."
		""
		"An ore block gives 2 ingots, raw ore 1 plus a half chance of a second. It melts Electrum, Constantan and bronze straight from dust. Not brass."
	]
	quest.305E50EF85284644.quest_subtitle: "5x5x5, ore and iron in, ingots and steel out."
	quest.305E50EF85284644.title: "&c&lForm an Arc Furnace"
	quest.30749FD4D35B31BC.quest_desc: [
		"Die großen Bosse von Cataclysm und Mowzie's Mobs, der Wither und der Enderdrache wachsen mit der Zahl der Spieler: Für jeden Spieler nach dem ersten bekommen sie &d60 Prozent&r mehr Leben und &d15 Prozent&r mehr Schaden, bis zu acht Spielern."
		""
		"Ab zwei Spielern setzen sie außerdem alle &d12 Sekunden&r einen &eBlitz&r (8 Schaden) und eine &eSchockwelle&r (6 Schaden) ein. Verteilt euch, statt alle auf einem Haufen zu stehen."
		""
		"&eUnd mit jeder Stufe:&r Alle feindlichen Mobs werden stärker, in Stufe 2 mit &d30 Prozent&r mehr Leben, in Stufe 3 mit &d70&r, in Stufe 4 mit &d120&r und in Stufe 5 mit &d180 Prozent&r. Was du jetzt schon schaffst, ist später härter."
	]
	quest.30749FD4D35B31BC.quest_subtitle: "Kronwerke Core macht Bosse für jede Gruppe passend."
	quest.30749FD4D35B31BC.title: "&eRechne mit der Gruppe"
	quest.309C39B820260A38.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Blast Brick&r and a &6Steel Plate&r, shapeless in the crafting table, make a &6Reinforced Blast Brick&r."
		""
		"You need &e27&r of them, so 27 Steel Plates. Your Crude Blast Furnace supplies the steel."
	]
	quest.309C39B820260A38.quest_subtitle: "The building material of the Improved Blast Furnace."
	quest.309C39B820260A38.title: "&cReinforce 27 Blast Bricks"
	quest.30A5612E83BC2AFF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Tough Alloy&r in the shape of iron armor makes the &6Tough Helmet&r, &6Tough Chestplate&r, &6Tough Leggings&r and &6Tough Boots&r, &e24 ingots&r in total."
		""
		"At the smithing table each piece takes a radiation shielding plate from Nuclear Radiation, see the radiation section."
	]
	quest.30A5612E83BC2AFF.quest_subtitle: "Four pieces of Tough Alloy."
	quest.30A5612E83BC2AFF.title: "&7Forge Tough Armor"
	quest.30B377D49F482D69.quest_desc: [
		"&6Turbine Rotor:&r three rows of steel, alloy, steel. &6Turbine Blade:&r four steel around alloy. &6Rotational Complex:&r steel, alloy and two Advanced Control Circuits."
		""
		"The rotors stand as a column in the middle, each carries up to two blades (right click), and the complex sits on top."
	]
	quest.30B377D49F482D69.quest_subtitle: "The inside of the turbine."
	quest.30B377D49F482D69.title: "&7Build rotors and blades"
	quest.30C8179E8FA66F5E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Emeralds&r at the top left and right, a &6Draconium Core&r in the top middle, two &6enchanted books&r left and right, an &6enchanting table&r in the middle, three &6bookshelves&r at the bottom."
		""
		"Put in an enchanted item and books and choose an enchantment. It moves onto a book, which costs &eexperience levels&r. That way you save enchantments from old gear before you fuse it into Wyvern gear."
	]
	quest.30C8179E8FA66F5E.quest_subtitle: "Enchantments back onto a book."
	quest.30C8179E8FA66F5E.title: "&dBuild a Disenchanter"
	quest.30E269DA1F484E35.quest_desc: [
		"With &6tin dust&r in the middle. In the Electric Pump it gets &e10 mB heavy water&r from every water block. In stage 4 that becomes deuterium for fusion."
	]
	quest.30E269DA1F484E35.quest_subtitle: "Heavy water from the pump."
	quest.30E269DA1F484E35.title: "&bBuild a Filter Upgrade"
	quest.30F5B626E01D3EC4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brass sheet&r, &6spout&r and &6block of iron&r make the &6Printer&r. It copies written books, enchanted books and banner patterns onto blanks running underneath it."
		""
		"Enchanted books cost a lot of experience, but then one good enchantment is enough for the whole server."
	]
	quest.30F5B626E01D3EC4.quest_subtitle: "Copies with liquid experience."
	quest.30F5B626E01D3EC4.title: "&5Print books"
	quest.30F93CDFA1068185.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Goldbarren&r und 2 &6Archwood-Planken&r ergeben die &6Wünschelrute&r. Benutz sie, und du siehst eine Weile Amethyst und magische Wesen durch Wände hindurch. Jede Nutzung kostet Haltbarkeit."
		""
		"&eWofür:&r Amethyst steckt im Warppulver, also in fast jedem Reise-Gegenstand von Waystones. Eine Tour durch die Minendimension mit der Rute findet die Geoden, ohne blind zu graben."
	]
	quest.30F93CDFA1068185.quest_subtitle: "Amethyst und magische Wesen durch Stein sehen."
	quest.30F93CDFA1068185.title: "&dNimm die Wünschelrute mit"
	quest.30F980E70ADDF20D.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6plastic&r, one &6Enderic Lens&r in the middle, at the bottom Electrum, plating, Electrum."
		""
		"On the Fragment Forge it doubles the byproducts (only one fits there). On Destroyers and lasers it works like Fortune, &ethree&r is the maximum."
	]
	quest.30F980E70ADDF20D.quest_subtitle: "Fortune for lasers and Destroyers."
	quest.30F980E70ADDF20D.title: "&aGet More Out with the Yield Addon"
	quest.30FC11AB7F872C1E.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Akropolis&r schwebt in &eY 200&r über dem &ewarmen Meer&r (Biom Warm Ocean). Von unten siehst du sie bei klarem Himmel. Hinauf kommst du mit Wassereimer und Blöcken, ab Stufe 2 mit dem &6Sturmauge&r (Enderauge, 2 Diamanten, 2 Prismarinscherben, 2 Prismarinkristalle, Blitzableiter, Wassereimer)."
		""
		"Oben leben &cUrchinkin&r (12 Lebenspunkte), &cCindaria&r (60), &cHippocamtus&r (85, Rüstung 15) und Oktopusse, die Ertrunkene steuern. Fast alle lassen &6Lacrima&r fallen. Die &cClawdian&r (225 Lebenspunkte, Rüstung 12, 16 Schaden, gekappt wie ein Boss) geben eine &6Chitinklaue&r und 5 bis 8 Lacrima."
		""
		"Aus 4 Lacrima, einem Goldbarren und 4 Goldnuggets wird der &6Azurblaue Seeschild&r. Für diese Gegner solltest du Ausrüstung aus Stufe 3 tragen, zum Beispiel Stahl von Silent Gear oder die Magierroben."
	]
	quest.30FC11AB7F872C1E.quest_subtitle: "Eine Stadt am Himmel, in Y 200 über dem warmen Meer."
	quest.30FC11AB7F872C1E.title: "&9Finde die Akropolis"
	quest.3103FCE0619584C1.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_list_mb.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Coke Oven:&r 3x3x3, 27 Coke Bricks. Coal in, coke and creosote out."
		"&6Crude Blast Furnace:&r 3x3x3, 27 Blast Bricks. Iron and coke in, steel and slag out."
		"&6Alloy Kiln:&r 2x2x2, 8 Kiln Bricks. Two metals in, alloy out."
		"&6Improved Blast Furnace:&r 3x4x3, 27 Reinforced Blast Bricks, one hopper."
		"&6Tank:&r 3x5x3, 34 sheetmetal blocks, 4 fences. &6Silo:&r 3x7x3, 50 sheetmetal blocks, 4 fences."
		"&6Crate Storage Shelf:&r 4x4x2, 24 Steel Catwalks, 4 steel fences."
		""
		"The large multiblocks made of engineering blocks follow in stage 3."
	]
	quest.3103FCE0619584C1.quest_subtitle: "Seven structures, one hammer."
	quest.3103FCE0619584C1.title: "&6&lTick off the multiblocks of stage 2"
	quest.31067034FD23177A.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Manipulation Essence&r in the middle, &6gold ingot&r, &6piston&r, &6slime block&r and &6diamond&r on the pedestals. It is worn as a curio."
		""
		"With the focus, the rest of the spell carries on at every block an effect creates, changes or moves. &eFreeze, Break&r freezes water and mines the ice right away."
		""
		"Moving blocks hurt whoever they hit. Try &eProjectile, Conjure Mageblock, Launch, Delay, Knockback&r: the block flies in the direction you look."
	]
	quest.31067034FD23177A.quest_subtitle: "Projectiles made of blocks."
	quest.31067034FD23177A.title: "&6Build the Focus of Block Shaping"
	quest.3107F38F6765E074.quest_desc: [
		"&616k component:&r like the 4k component, only with &6glowstone dust&r in the corners and three 4k components."
		""
		"A 16k cell holds &e130,048&r of one kind, &e66,560&r with 63 types. For many kinds in small amounts several small cells are better, the types per cell are always 63."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r On Kronwerke 64k needs an &6Ingot of the Skies&r from Nature's Aura, 256k a draconium ingot. Both come in stage 4."
	]
	quest.3107F38F6765E074.quest_subtitle: "The largest stage 3 has to offer."
	quest.3107F38F6765E074.title: "&b&lBuild a 16k cell"
	quest.310BD6B66D56BF2D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Tempad&r, &6Tempad&r: speichert Orte und öffnet eine &6Zeittür&r dorthin, &e1 000 Chronon&r für 10 Sekunden, 6 000 im Gerät. Chronon macht das Chronometer oder das Metronom. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"&6Mekanism&r, &6Teleporter&r: ein Rahmen aus Teleporterrahmen, Strom und eine Frequenz, der &6Tragbare Teleporter&r aus der Tasche. &eStufe 3.&r Der Quantenverschränker für Gegenstände, Flüssigkeiten, Gas und Strom ohne Rohr kommt in Stufe 4. Siehe Kapitel Rohre und Router und Mekanism: Fortgeschritten."
	]
	quest.310BD6B66D56BF2D.quest_subtitle: "Tempad, Zeittür: 1 000 Chronon je Tür, auch in andere Dimensionen."
	quest.310BD6B66D56BF2D.title: "Lies: Tempad und Teleporter"
	quest.31219E97B696428D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_pool.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e5 Livingrock&r in a U shape. Aim the spreader at it with the wand, and the flowers fill it up to &d1,000,000 mana&r."
		""
		"Throw suitable things in and the pool transforms them (&emana infusion&r). Functional flowers within 10 blocks draw from it, a spreader right next to it fills itself from it."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Right click with a petal dyes it, a clay ball washes the colour off. A comparator outputs the fill level."
	]
	quest.31219E97B696428D.quest_subtitle: "A million mana in one place."
	quest.31219E97B696428D.title: "&aBuild a Mana Pool"
	quest.3122C492C56B4F48.quest_desc: [
		"On a single track line two trains can only pass each other where there is a second track: a &epassing loop&r. In the middle of the line lay a short parallel track with two junctions."
		""
		"A &echain signal&r before every entrance and an &eentry signal&r at every exit. Then one train waits in the passing loop until the other is past."
		""
		"That way two trains run on a line that is only one track wide."
	]
	quest.3122C492C56B4F48.quest_subtitle: "Two trains, one track."
	quest.3122C492C56B4F48.title: "&6Build a passing loop"
	quest.312460174C45D501.quest_desc: [
		"4 &6SPS Casings&r around an &6Ultimate Control Circuit&r make one &6SPS Port&r."
		""
		"Ports sit in the shell. With the Configurator you switch them to input or output."
	]
	quest.312460174C45D501.quest_subtitle: "Polonium in, antimatter out."
	quest.312460174C45D501.title: "&dBuild SPS Ports"
	quest.3126B18D4588AAA3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_portal.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eDer Rahmen:&r Wie ein Netherportal, aber aus &6Verstärktem Tiefenschiefer&r. Innen mindestens &e2 breit und 3 hoch&r, die Ecken bleiben frei, das sind &e10 Blöcke&r."
		""
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r &e4 Tiefenschiefer&r in die Ecken, &e4 Stahlbarren&r an die Seiten, eine &6Echoscherbe&r in die Mitte, das ergibt &e2 Verstärkten Tiefenschiefer&r. Fünfmal craften, und der Rahmen steht. Der Rahmen in der Antiken Stadt lässt sich nicht abbauen."
		""
		"&eZünden:&r Klick mit dem &6Herz der Tiefen&r in der Hand auf den Rahmen. Das Herz wird dabei verbraucht, ein Herz pro Portal."
		""
		"&eDer andere Weg:&r Occultism macht den Block auch im Ritual (Pentakel Contact Wild Spirit) aus 4 Eisengittern, 4 Obsidian und einem Iesniumbarren, allerdings mit einem &cWärter als Opfer&r pro Block. Siehe Kapitel Occultism: Afrit und Marid."
	]
	quest.3126B18D4588AAA3.quest_subtitle: "Verstärkter Tiefenschiefer und ein Herz."
	quest.3126B18D4588AAA3.title: "&5&lBau das Portal zur Anderwelt"
	quest.3126CA2EFC0A22FD.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &6lantern&r and &6torch&r. The quest counts as soon as the glyph is in your inventory. Only learn it with right click after that."
		""
		"&eProjectile, Conjure Magelight&r places a permanent light on the wall. With &dAmplify&r it shines like glowstone. &eSelf, Magelight&r gives you night vision."
	]
	quest.3126CA2EFC0A22FD.quest_subtitle: "Never carry torches again."
	quest.3126CA2EFC0A22FD.title: "&dLearn Conjure Magelight"
	quest.312C367F7A5E874C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Magmatic Bee&r and &6Nomad Bee&r (from nests of the Ashy Mining Bee). Flower: magma block or fire. The comb gives &6blaze powder&r with 30 percent. Fireproof, fights back with fire. &eKronwerke:&r Blaze powder heats the brass mixer."
	]
	quest.312C367F7A5E874C.quest_subtitle: "Blaze powder without a fortress."
	quest.312C367F7A5E874C.title: "&cBreed the BlazBee"
	quest.312D389F4D1D3371.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_runes_rune_core.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Top &9Rune of Water&r, &bMana Pearl&r, &fRune of Air&r. Middle &6brass sheet&r, &aTerrasteel ingot&r, &6brass sheet&r. Bottom &cRune of Fire&r, &bMana Pearl&r, &6Rune of Earth&r."
		""
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/item/rune_core.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The runes are used up. Create's Mechanical Press presses brass sheets."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The obelisk wants &e8 Rune Cores&r, a fixed number, each counts as much as 150 pearls. Crafting only works in stage 2, handing in only while the stage goal is active."
	]
	quest.312D389F4D1D3371.quest_subtitle: "The magic milestone of stage 2."
	quest.312D389F4D1D3371.title: "&dCraft a Rune Core"
	quest.312F5B3F213A69D5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_washing.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A fan, a &bwater block&r in front of it, and &6gravel&r on a belt through the air stream. Each gravel gives flint with &e25 percent&r and an iron nugget with &e12.5 percent&r."
		""
		"With the millstone in front that grinds cobblestone into gravel, cobblestone becomes iron nuggets: exactly the nuggets for the alloy."
		""
		"Washing sand gives clay, red sand gold nuggets, flour turns into dough."
	]
	quest.312F5B3F213A69D5.quest_subtitle: "Iron nuggets from cobblestone."
	quest.312F5B3F213A69D5.title: "&6Wash gravel into iron"
	quest.3131731C3E3B6F7A.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &6Manipulation Essence&r, &e5 TNT&r, &6firework star&r."
		""
		"Applies the rest of the spell to everything in a sphere around the target. AOE enlarges it, Sensitive hits blocks, Dampen makes it hollow. &eProjectile, Burst, Lightning&r against groups."
	]
	quest.3131731C3E3B6F7A.quest_subtitle: "Everything in a sphere around the target."
	quest.3131731C3E3B6F7A.title: "&dLearn Burst"
	quest.31352A27F84A0B73.quest_desc: [
		"Niotic Crystals, two Niotic Capacitors, a casing and the &6Blazing Furnator&r at the bottom."
		""
		"A Niotic Furnator makes &e2,000 FE/t&r and buffers 2 million FE."
	]
	quest.31352A27F84A0B73.quest_subtitle: "2,000 FE per tick."
	quest.31352A27F84A0B73.title: "&bUpgrade to Niotic"
	quest.314160EF7039A875.quest_desc: [
		"Every quest in this chapter is &eone farm&r: what you need, how to set it up, what comes out at the end. Everything in the left half works in &6stage 1&r with andesite, flowers, pots and seeds. The right column tells you how to upgrade the same farm in &6stage 2&r."
		""
		"The rows from top to bottom: &estone&r, &ewood&r, &efields&r, &eanimals&r, &emonsters&r, &ewater and lava&r, &emagic&r. Each row stands on its own; start with the one you are missing right now."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r In stage 1 the obelisk wants &e20,000 cobblestone&r, &e1,500 andesite alloy&r and &e800 Source Gems&r. The farm fills the chest, you carry it to the obelisk: handing in is done by hand."
		""
		"The recipes are in the &6Create&r, &aBotania&r, &dArs Nouveau&r, &aMystical Agriculture&r, &6Food and Farming&r and &6Cooking&r chapters. This one only says how to put them together into a farm."
	]
	quest.314160EF7039A875.quest_subtitle: "One farm per quest, three lines of setup, and it runs while you talk."
	quest.314160EF7039A875.title: "&6&lLet the base do the work"
	quest.314242C058D73400.quest_desc: [
		"Hang up &6Mandrake Flowers&r. After &e100 seconds&r they are dried. That goes for all flowers and leaves of the four herbs and for sage."
		""
		"Dried herbs are in the Replacer Satchel and in the crow ankh."
	]
	quest.314242C058D73400.quest_subtitle: "Dried they keep forever."
	quest.314242C058D73400.title: "&6Dry herbs"
	quest.314331A7919C935F.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e12 Hexen&r mit dem Learner im Inventar. Sumpfhütten, Überfälle und Dörfer bei Nacht sind die Plätze dafür."
		""
		"Das Hexen-Modell kostet &d256 FE/t&r und ist das vielseitigste: eine Vorhersage wird zu &616 Redstone&r, 16 Glowstonestaub, 32 Zucker, 32 Stöcken, 16 Spinnenaugen oder 16 Glasflaschen, ganz wie du es im Fabrikator einstellst."
	]
	quest.314331A7919C935F.quest_subtitle: "Redstone und Glowstone aus dem Sumpf."
	quest.314331A7919C935F.title: "&5Lerne die Hexe"
	quest.314A751E13CBFAF9.quest_desc: [
		"If the game crashes, open the &einstance folder&r in the launcher. In it is &elogs/latest.log&r with everything the game did last, and in the &ecrash-reports&r folder a file with the date and time of the crash."
		""
		"Send the &efile&r to the Discord, not a screenshot of it. Add two sentences: what were you doing, and does it keep happening? Most crashes are sorted out within minutes that way."
		""
		"You don't need to worry about the world: &6FTB Backups&r backs up the server every &e2 hours&r while someone is online and keeps the last twelve backups."
	]
	quest.314A751E13CBFAF9.quest_subtitle: "Without a log, nobody can help you."
	quest.314A751E13CBFAF9.title: "&6Find the log file"
	quest.31579DF4D90775D1.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_hv.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Steel Plate&r and &6Aluminium Plate&r with the wire cutters make steel and aluminium wire. Two steel wires and two aluminium wires around a stick make four &6HV Wire Coils&r. &6HV Wire Connectors&r like LV, only with aluminium ingots."
		""
		"HV wire carries &d32,768 FE/t&r, an HV connector &d4,096 FE/t&r, exactly a Diesel Generator's output. The &6HV Transformer&r steps directly from HV down to LV or MV."
		""
		"&cHV wire cannot be insulated.&r Hang it high."
	]
	quest.31579DF4D90775D1.quest_subtitle: "32,768 FE/t over 32 blocks."
	quest.31579DF4D90775D1.title: "&cString HV Wire"
	quest.315BD29D3E7DF517.quest_desc: [
		"Right click on the ripe &6Belladonna&r gives &6Belladonna Berries&r and &6Belladonna Flowers&r."
		""
		"In the mortar &e5 berries&r become &e4 black dye&r. Berries and flowers make the Mindful Trance Blend. &cCareful:&r Eaten raw the berries are poisonous."
	]
	quest.315BD29D3E7DF517.quest_subtitle: "Poisonous berries, useful flowers."
	quest.315BD29D3E7DF517.title: "&5Harvest Belladonna"
	quest.315ED84F04A068ED.quest_desc: [
		"A &6snowball&r in the Energizing Orb becomes a &6Charged Snowball&r for &e500,000 FE&r."
		""
		"Thrown, it strikes &elightning&r where it lands. That way you make a charged creeper from a creeper, a Zombified Piglin from a pig and a witch from a villager, with no thunderstorm at all."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r The lightning sets fire to whatever can burn. Do not throw it in a wooden house."
	]
	quest.315ED84F04A068ED.quest_subtitle: "A lightning bolt to throw."
	quest.315ED84F04A068ED.title: "&bCharge a snowball"
	quest.3164AD9C468C7FB8.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r Enriched iron in the corners, a &6redstone torch&r at the top, two &6comparators&r left and right of a &6Machine Casing&r, an &6Improved Processor&r at the bottom."
		""
		"The &6Detector&r gives a redstone signal when the network has &eexactly&r, &emore&r or &eless&r of an item than a set amount. It needs 2 FE/t."
		""
		"That way a cobblestone machine only runs while there are fewer than 10,000 cobblestone in storage."
	]
	quest.3164AD9C468C7FB8.quest_subtitle: "The Detector."
	quest.3164AD9C468C7FB8.title: "&cReport Fill Levels by Redstone"
	quest.31683A07D8B15568.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Chemical Oxidizer from salt, 15 mB each. From stage 3 the Thermal Evaporation Plant from water, 10 to 1."
		"&eUsed by:&r the Electrolytic Separator for chlorine, the evaporation plant for lithium."
	]
	quest.31683A07D8B15568.quest_subtitle: "Salt in the oxidizer."
	quest.31683A07D8B15568.title: "&fBrine"
	quest.3168948D2B18FF4E.quest_desc: [
		"Bring together &e4 Wilden Tributes&r."
		""
		"Tributes are also wanted by the archmage book, the Marks of Mastery and Technomancy, the Focus of Summoning and the third level of Ars Additions' Spellweave enchantment. Build up a stock early."
	]
	quest.3168948D2B18FF4E.quest_subtitle: "Practice for stage 5."
	quest.3168948D2B18FF4E.title: "&5Collect Four Tributes"
	quest.316941217C394D47.quest_desc: [
		"Put the &6Vengeance Ring&r in the middle, four &6iron ingots&r on the sides and four &6Crushed Dark Gems&r in the corners. The &6Vengeance Focus&r shoots a beam with right click that freezes spirits in place."
		""
		"Frozen spirits can be caught, that comes in the next step."
	]
	quest.316941217C394D47.quest_subtitle: "A beam that freezes spirits."
	quest.316941217C394D47.title: "&dBuild a Vengeance Focus"
	quest.3171B896C15529B3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Copper&r at the top and sides, a &6Motor&r in the middle, at the bottom &6Electrum&r, &6cauldron&r, Electrum. Three cores, &e128 RF/t&r."
		""
		"One iron and one coal dust give &6steel&r, one gold and one redstone &6Electrum&r, one diamond and one nickel an &6Adamant Ingot&r (two each at the crafting table)."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The Foundry does not make &6netherite&r, that stays with the smithing table. No &6brass&r either, that only comes from Create's mixer."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Pulverizer for coal dust, Foundry behind it, chest at the end: the small steel line is done."
	]
	quest.3171B896C15529B3.quest_subtitle: "Two ingredients, one ingot, half the price."
	quest.3171B896C15529B3.title: "&c&lBuild a Foundry"
	quest.317418C9132581EC.quest_desc: [
		"In den Truhen der Antiken Städte liegen &6Plattenbruchstücke&r. Neun davon ergeben die &6Schallplatte 5&r."
		""
		"Lootr gibt dir jede Truhe einzeln, also lohnt es sich, eine Stadt ganz auszuräumen. Dabei findest du auch Bücher mit &eHuschen&r, Echoscherben und Verzauberte Goldene Äpfel."
	]
	quest.317418C9132581EC.quest_subtitle: "Neun Bruchstücke aus der Antiken Stadt."
	quest.317418C9132581EC.title: "&8Setz die Schallplatte 5 zusammen"
	quest.3193852CC8A4A34F.quest_desc: [
		"Zwei &6Druckmesser&r und ein &6Turbinenrotor&r oben, Druckluftrohr, Turbinenrotor, Druckluftrohr in der Mitte, drei &6Verstärkte Steinstufen&r unten ergeben die &6Vakuumpumpe&r (Vacuum Pump). Turbinenrotor: drei Turbinenblätter um einen Druckeisenbarren."
		""
		"Druckluft kommt an die &e+&r Seite, an der &e-&r Seite fällt der Druck bis auf &e-1 Bar&r, ein volles Vakuum."
		""
		"&eWofür:&r Ein verzauberter Gegenstand und ein Buch in der Druckkammer mit Unterdruck geben eine zufällige Verzauberung an das Buch ab. Ein Luftgitter-Modul mit Unterdruck zieht Gegenstände und Tiere an. In Stufe 3 brauchen Vakuumfalle und Spawner-Extraktor den Unterdruck."
	]
	quest.3193852CC8A4A34F.quest_subtitle: "Unterdruck bis minus 1 Bar."
	quest.3193852CC8A4A34F.title: "&7Bau eine Vakuumpumpe"
	quest.319B925B68AFD7DB.quest_desc: [
		"The Infusion Altar does not only start with the &6Wand&r: a &eredstone signal&r on the altar does the same once the recipe lies on the pedestals."
		""
		"A button next to the altar saves reaching for the wand. If you make many seeds in a row, put the ingredients on, press and take the seed out."
	]
	quest.319B925B68AFD7DB.quest_subtitle: "A button instead of the wand."
	quest.319B925B68AFD7DB.title: "&dStart the Altar with Redstone"
	quest.319BE3696F329A1E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_treated_wood.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Any eight &6wooden planks&r around a &6Bucket of Creosote Oil&r make eight &6Treated Wood Planks&r. The bucket comes back empty."
		""
		"Windmill, Water Wheel, crafting table, posts and barrels need it. Count on three or four buckets for a start."
	]
	quest.319BE3696F329A1E.quest_subtitle: "Treated Wood, the mod's building material."
	quest.319BE3696F329A1E.title: "&6Soak planks in creosote"
	quest.31A0D58569EEFD06.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Iron Plates&r in the corners, one &6copper ingot&r in the middle make an &6Iron Mechanical Component&r."
		""
		"It is in the dynamo, the pump, the Garden Cloche and in stage 3 in every Light Engineering Block. Make a few more right away."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_component_iron.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.31A0D58569EEFD06.quest_subtitle: "Gears and shafts in one part."
	quest.31A0D58569EEFD06.title: "&7Build Iron Mechanical Components"
	quest.31A23D07C61A0B70.quest_desc: [
		"All three are shapeless recipes with &6Andesite Casing&r and &6shaft&r. The &6Brake&r also needs redstone and obsidian, the &6Centrifugal Clutch&r an iron sheet and a speedometer, the &6Freewheel Clutch&r an iron sheet and a cogwheel."
		""
		"With a redstone signal the &6Brake&r creates so much stress that the network overstresses and stops. The &6Centrifugal Clutch&r only engages from an adjustable speed, the &6Freewheel Clutch&r only when the shaft turns in the set direction."
		""
		"That way a machine only starts when the diesel engine is up to speed, and a source turning the wrong way cannot break anything."
	]
	quest.31A23D07C61A0B70.quest_subtitle: "Brake, Centrifugal Clutch, Freewheel Clutch."
	quest.31A23D07C61A0B70.title: "&6Couple by Speed and Direction"
	quest.31AC70F287FD553E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_crops_harvester.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Glue &6Mechanical Harvesters&r and a chest to a &6Mechanical Bearing&r and let the bearing turn slowly over a round field. Ripe plants are harvested and grow back, unripe ones stay standing."
		""
		"A &6Portable Storage Interface&r at the edge takes the harvest as it passes, an andesite funnel pulls it into your chest. With a &6Gantry&r instead of a bearing, the same machine runs back and forth over a square field."
		""
		"You sow once by hand. After that the field runs as long as the bearing turns. Bearing, gantry and harvester are in the &6Create&r chapter (contraptions)."
	]
	quest.31AC70F287FD553E.quest_subtitle: "An arm that sweeps across the field."
	quest.31AC70F287FD553E.title: "&aBuild a harvester"
	quest.31B33A7C521EA105.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6stone bricks&r around a &6Dark Block&r give 4 &6Dark Bricks&r. Each brick with &e1 bucket of blood&r in the infuser (tier 2) becomes a &6Dark Blood Brick&r."
		""
		"The Spirit Furnace for a zombie is a hollow box with a 3 by 3 footprint and 4 blocks height, 1 by 1 by 2 free inside. That is 34 blocks, one of them the furnace itself, so &e33 Dark Blood Bricks&r and 33 buckets of blood."
	]
	quest.31B33A7C521EA105.quest_subtitle: "The walls no spirit escapes from."
	quest.31B33A7C521EA105.title: "&4Infuse Dark Blood Bricks"
	quest.31BBD097DF9D408D.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: robe piece in the middle, &e2 blaze rods&r on the pedestals, &d2,500 source&r."
		""
		"Each tier raises mana regeneration and gives more and larger thread slots. The third tier needs chorus fruit and comes with stage 4."
	]
	quest.31BBD097DF9D408D.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2 of the robe: 2 blaze rods, 2,500 source."
	quest.31BBD097DF9D408D.title: "&6Upgrade an Armor Piece"
	quest.31C761FBF2CC822B.quest_desc: [
		"Stand at a &6crafting table&r, find the recipe with &eR&r and click the small &e+&r at the bottom right of the recipe. EMI puts the ingredients from your inventory into the right slots. &eShift&r-click fills a whole stack."
		""
		"If the button is red, you are missing something. Hover over it and it tells you what."
		""
		"This also works in many machines with a recipe window, like the furnace or Mekanism's Metallurgic Infuser from stage 2."
	]
	quest.31C761FBF2CC822B.quest_subtitle: "The plus button puts the ingredients in."
	quest.31C761FBF2CC822B.title: "&6Let EMI fill the crafting table"
	quest.31DFCD789CB24B82.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &66 Livingwood Logs&r on the sides, &63 Terrasteel Nuggets&r in the middle column. One Terrasteel ingot gives 9 nuggets."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/block/elven_gateway_core.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Alfheim opens with &6Stage 3 (Steel Works)&r. You cannot go in, but the elves trade: you throw something through the portal, they throw something better back."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The magic goal of stage 3 is &e400 Elementium Ingots&r, &e150 Afrit Essence&r and &e8 Elven Stars&r. So the trade has to run automatically."
	]
	quest.31DFCD789CB24B82.quest_subtitle: "The heart of the gate to Alfheim."
	quest.31DFCD789CB24B82.title: "&a&lBuild the Elven Gateway Core"
	quest.31F7883E41F33971.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_silo.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&650 Iron Sheetmetal&r and &64 Treated Wood Fences&r, shape as in the manual, then the hammer on it."
		""
		"&eIn:&r one single kind of item, through the grate on top or at the bottom. &eOut:&r at the bottom, by itself with a redstone signal. It holds as much as &e24 chests&r, good for cobblestone, seeds or slag."
	]
	quest.31F7883E41F33971.quest_subtitle: "3x7x3, 50 sheetmetal blocks and 4 fences, 41 472 items."
	quest.31F7883E41F33971.title: "&9Form an Item Silo"
	quest.31FA3426A37E0250.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Golden Apple&r with &e4 Inferium Essence&r on the four sides gives an &6Inferium Apple&r."
		""
		"It fills &e6 hunger&r and gives &eAbsorption&r for &e3 minutes&r. The apples of the higher tiers add Speed, Resistance and more on top. A good snack before a dungeon when essence is left over."
	]
	quest.31FA3426A37E0250.quest_subtitle: "Mystical Agradditions: a golden apple with extras."
	quest.31FA3426A37E0250.title: "&cEat an Inferium Apple"
	quest.32009286594E8D03.quest_desc: [
		"Material: &e4 Water Agglomeratio&r (water bucket, gravel, dirt, clay)."
		""
		"Plus &e4 Inferium Essence&r and a &6Prosperity Seed Base&r in the Infusion Altar."
	]
	quest.32009286594E8D03.quest_subtitle: "One seed, one checkmark."
	quest.32009286594E8D03.title: "Seed: Water"
	quest.322A1CDF6B5C7140.quest_desc: [
		"Skeletons and strays drop a &6Rib Bone&r. You need it for the &6Fertile Essence&r and with it the Witherless Rose."
	]
	quest.322A1CDF6B5C7140.quest_subtitle: "From the skeleton."
	quest.322A1CDF6B5C7140.title: "&7Rib Bone"
	quest.322E1E0595ABED73.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Ferricore Ingots&r on top, two sticks below, like any pickaxe. Axe, shovel, hoe, sword and bow work the same way."
		""
		"Ferricore tools last &e500&r hits (iron 250), mine at speed 7 instead of 6 and handle the same blocks as iron, so no obsidian. They enchant a touch better than iron."
		""
		"The special part comes with the &6upgrades&r in the next step: ore veins in one hit, ore search, tree felling and more. Hold &eShift&r over the tool, then the tooltip shows which upgrades fit."
	]
	quest.322E1E0595ABED73.quest_subtitle: "Better than iron, and ready for upgrades."
	quest.322E1E0595ABED73.title: "&7Forge a Ferricore Pickaxe"
	quest.322ED1DE454A12EE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_frogport.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Four &6Andesite Casings&r around a &6Large Cogwheel&r make two &6Chain Conveyors&r. Put them on powered shafts and connect them with &6chains&r, up to &e32 blocks&r, up to four connections per conveyor."
		""
		"The &6Package Frogport&r (slime ball, vault, alloy) sits at most &e5 blocks&r next to the chain. It puts packages on and snaps up every one addressed to it."
	]
	quest.322ED1DE454A12EE.quest_subtitle: "Chain conveyor and frog."
	quest.322ED1DE454A12EE.title: "&6Send packages by chain"
	quest.3231356B06AD1A32.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept GPS Tool:&r eine Redstone-Fackel oben, Plastic Sheet, Glasscheibe, Plastic Sheet in der Mitte, Plastic Sheet, &6Diamant&r, Plastic Sheet unten. Zwei GPS Tools zusammen ergeben das &6GPS Area Tool&r."
		""
		"Das &6GPS Tool&r merkt sich mit Rechtsklick einen Block. Das &6Area Tool&r merkt sich zwei Ecken: Rechtsklick für die erste, Linksklick für die zweite, und zeigt den Bereich dazwischen an."
		""
		"Im Programmer klickst du mit dem Werkzeug auf ein &eArea&r-Teil, und die Koordinaten springen hinein. Linksklick mit dem Area Tool auf eine freie Stelle legt gleich ein neues Area-Teil an."
	]
	quest.3231356B06AD1A32.quest_subtitle: "So sagst du der Drohne, wo."
	quest.3231356B06AD1A32.title: "&5Bau GPS Tool und GPS Area Tool"
	quest.32352D5A1345019C.quest_desc: [
		"&eSunshine&r: Thick Potion (water bottle plus glowstone dust). &eLuck&r: Potion of Luck."
		""
		"The sun candle has a Hexerei effect of its own against rain. The Potion of Luck cannot be brewed, it only comes from chests or other mods."
	]
	quest.32352D5A1345019C.quest_subtitle: "Rain, rain, go away."
	quest.32352D5A1345019C.title: "&aSoak a sun candle"
	quest.3237EF8B25F399B0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Eight planks&r around a &6lever&r, or a vanilla chest and a lever."
		""
		"Two next to each other become a &edouble chest&r. Barrels stack more compactly, chests look nicer in living rooms."
	]
	quest.3237EF8B25F399B0.quest_subtitle: "Like the barrel, only as a chest."
	quest.3237EF8B25F399B0.title: "Build an upgradeable chest"
	quest.3256C9684CC2EC3A.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r oben roter Farbstoff, eine &6schwarze Glasscheibe&r, roter Farbstoff. Mitte: &6Turbine Rotor&r, &6PCB&r, Turbine Rotor. Unten zwei &6Plastic Sheets&r in die Ecken."
		""
		"Der Programmer braucht &ekeine Luft&r. Du setzt Programme aus &6Puzzleteilen&r zusammen, die ineinandergreifen wie ein Puzzle, und schreibst sie mit dem Pfeil auf eine Drohne im Slot oben rechts. Die Teile dafür liegen in deinem Inventar oder in einer Kiste direkt am Programmer."
		""
		"&eIm Fenster:&r Links die Fläche für dein Programm, rechts die Ablage mit allen Teilen (mit &eLeertaste&r aufklappen und suchen), unten die Schwierigkeit: Easy zeigt nur die wichtigsten Teile. Fang damit an."
	]
	quest.3256C9684CC2EC3A.quest_subtitle: "Hier werden Drohnen programmiert."
	quest.3256C9684CC2EC3A.title: "&5&lBau einen Programmer"
	quest.3256D8605808D07A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_cpu.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Crafting Unit:&r iron in the corners, Calculation Processors at the top and bottom, glass cables on the sides, a Logic Processor in the middle. A unit plus a 1k component gives a &61k Crafting Storage&r, a unit plus an Engineering Processor a &6Crafting Co-Processing Unit&r."
		""
		"The CPU is a full cuboid without gaps, with at least one storage. Co-processing units make it faster. One CPU, one order at a time."
		""
		"&eOrdering:&r in the terminal click something that has a pattern. If it is already in stock, use the mouse wheel button."
	]
	quest.3256D8605808D07A.quest_subtitle: "It plans the order."
	quest.3256D8605808D07A.title: "&7Build a crafting CPU"
	quest.325B7A495F752083.quest_desc: [
		"&6Taboo Book&r, &6Purified Ink&r, &6Awakened Feather&r and &e4 purple dye&r, then bind with the Dictionary."
		""
		"Djinni are the most summoned class: faster than Foliot, good for possessing stronger creatures and more valuable bindings."
	]
	quest.325B7A495F752083.quest_subtitle: "A stronger name."
	quest.325B7A495F752083.title: "&5Bind a Djinni name"
	quest.32639A972A8A41A9.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Bumble Bee&r lives in the &eplains&r and is big enough to ride. A Bumble Bee Nest attracts it there."
		""
		"Put a &6saddle&r on it and take the &6Treat on a Stick&r in your hand (fishing rod and Honey Treat shapeless). With it you steer it in gliding flight, right click gives a boost. When the treat is used up, you restore it with a new Honey Treat."
	]
	quest.32639A972A8A41A9.quest_subtitle: "A bee big enough for a saddle."
	quest.32639A972A8A41A9.title: "&eRide a Bumble Bee"
	quest.32640781356AF5A5.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &6Livingwood Logs&r into the portal. A &6Dreamwood Log&r comes back for each, a Dreamwood for each Livingwood."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/block/dreamwood_log.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Dreamwood conducts mana better than Livingwood. You need it for the Elven Mana Spreader and the Dreamwood Twigs."
	]
	quest.32640781356AF5A5.quest_subtitle: "The first and cheapest trade."
	quest.32640781356AF5A5.title: "&6Trade Livingwood for Dreamwood"
	quest.326910D90DB810B4.quest_desc: [
		"Top steel, circuit, steel, middle tin, Chemical Tank, tin, bottom tin. It holds &e24,000 mB of hydrogen&r."
		""
		"Filling: put it into the item slot of a Chemical Tank full of hydrogen. It has the modes normal and hover."
	]
	quest.326910D90DB810B4.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism's jetpack."
	quest.326910D90DB810B4.title: "&eFly with hydrogen"
	quest.326EB49B64046721.quest_desc: [
		"&6L_Ender's Cataclysm&r has two bosses in the Nether. Take them in this order: &cIgnis&r (450 health) in the &6Burning Arena&r, then the &cNetherite Monstrosity&r (600 health) in the &6Soul Black Smith&r."
		""
		"As with every Cataclysm boss, damage per hit and per second is capped, and whoever stands too far away barely hits. In a group they fall much faster. The rules are in the &cOverworld Bosses&r chapter."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A boss fight makes a good shared stream evening. Whoever finds an arena says so in chat."
	]
	quest.326EB49B64046721.quest_subtitle: "First Ignis, then the Monstrosity."
	quest.326EB49B64046721.title: "&4&lPlan the Nether bosses"
	quest.3270C4D43A5F9FF3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Basic Tier Installer:&r redstone in the corners, circuits top and bottom, iron left and right, a plank in the middle. Right click on a machine turns it into a &6Basic Factory&r."
		""
		"A factory works on &ethree&r items at the same time. The arrow button in the window spreads stacks across all slots. After that: Advanced 5 slots (stage 3), Elite 7 and Ultimate 9 (stage 4)."
	]
	quest.3270C4D43A5F9FF3.quest_subtitle: "Three slots instead of one."
	quest.3270C4D43A5F9FF3.title: "&a&lBuild your first factory"
	quest.3276D4835390192C.quest_desc: [
		"Like the tools, with a &6diamond chestplate&r as catalyst."
		""
		"It is the only armor piece of the Wyvern tier and carries a &eshield&r that absorbs damage with power. How strong depends on the modules in it."
	]
	quest.3276D4835390192C.quest_subtitle: "A shield made of energy."
	quest.3276D4835390192C.title: "&dFuse the Wyvern Chestpiece"
	quest.3293D8E1C9DCF430.quest_desc: [
		"Manasteel and &6Livingwood Twigs&r, pattern like iron. The armour from Manasteel alone."
		""
		"About as strong as iron, lasts longer, enchants better and &erepairs itself&r with mana from tablet or Band of Mana. Right click with the pickaxe places a torch, with the axe a sapling."
	]
	quest.3293D8E1C9DCF430.quest_subtitle: "Tools that repair themselves."
	quest.3293D8E1C9DCF430.title: "&6Forge Manasteel tools"
	quest.329CE64C2C1B9053.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Hedyrin's Lure."
		"&6Bowls:&r &e2 dirt&r, &e2 stone&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none, but when grey particles appear you throw an &6egg&r nearby."
		""
		"The endermite travels with the Foliot to the End and back. Defeated, it always drops &6end stone&r. The End only opens with stage 4; until then it is your source for purple chalk."
	]
	quest.329CE64C2C1B9053.quest_subtitle: "End stone without travelling to the End."
	quest.329CE64C2C1B9053.title: "&5Summon a Possessed Endermite"
	quest.32B5546E756BD485.quest_desc: [
		"Throw your &6Codex&r at a &5witch's&r feet. She writes the &5Wicked Sign&r into it and gives it back."
		""
		"You learn the light path by throwing the book to a &ecleric&r: the Sacred Sign. This chapter follows the dark path."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r Witches throw potions. Keep a healing potion ready."
	]
	quest.32B5546E756BD485.quest_subtitle: "A witch shows you the way."
	quest.32B5546E756BD485.title: "&5Learn the Wicked Sign"
	quest.32B661CCF37A5217.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sophisticated Storage&r, &6Fass&r und &6Truhe&r: &e27 Plätze&r, Kupfer 45, Eisen &e54&r mit zwei Upgrade-Plätzen, Gold 81 (Stufe 2), Diamant 108 (Stufe 3), Netherit (Stufe 4). Aufwerten per Rechtsklick am stehenden Block, der Inhalt bleibt. Filter in jedem Upgrade. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Sechs Bretter, zwei Stufen und ein Hebel. Das &6Stack-Upgrade&r aus acht Stämmen verdoppelt jeden Platz. Siehe Kapitel Lager."
	]
	quest.32B661CCF37A5217.quest_subtitle: "Sophisticated Storage, Fass: 27 Plätze, Eisen 54, wächst mit den Stufen."
	quest.32B661CCF37A5217.title: "Bau ein aufwertbares Fass"
	quest.32B8034D36B5E2CE.quest_desc: [
		"Vier &6Kupferbarren&r im Kreuz um einen &6Druckeisenbarren&r ergeben einen &6Druckmesser&r (Pressure Gauge). Allein kann er nichts, aber er steckt im Sicherheitsventil, im Manometer und in der Vakuumpumpe."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/item/pressure_gauge.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Mach gleich vier. Kupfer hast du genug."
	]
	quest.32B8034D36B5E2CE.quest_subtitle: "Vier Kupfer, ein Druckeisen."
	quest.32B8034D36B5E2CE.title: "&7Bau Druckmesser"
	quest.32CE822551186CC1.quest_desc: [
		"With the &6Molds blueprint&r at the workbench, three &6Steel Plates&r and the wire cutters make one mold each: &6Gear&r, &6Wire&r, &6Packing 2x2&r, &6Packing 3x3&r and &6Unpacking&r."
		""
		"The packing molds press 4 or 9 identical items into their block, Unpacking reverses it. That way ingots land in storage as space saving blocks, or sand becomes sandstone."
		""
		"The gear mold presses four ingots into a metal gear for other mods, the wire mold one ingot into two wires, no wire cutters needed."
	]
	quest.32CE822551186CC1.quest_subtitle: "Gears, wire and blocks from the press."
	quest.32CE822551186CC1.title: "&7Build More Press Molds"
	quest.32D06105B65DC280.quest_desc: [
		"Use the scroll. You land at a fixed spot in a dimension of your own, where swords appear everywhere. They only last a few hits."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A duel here pulls a dangerous enemy out of your base."
	]
	quest.32D06105B65DC280.quest_subtitle: "Your own dimension."
	quest.32D06105B65DC280.title: "&bEnter the Reality Marble"
	quest.32DB942428FAD3DA.quest_desc: [
		"At the &6smithing table&r: &6Blaze Burner&r, &6enchanting table&r and the smithing template for the blaze upgrade. The first template lies in chests in Nether fortresses and bastions."
		""
		"It enchants with &bliquid experience&r instead of levels, without lapis, up to level 30. More in &6Create: Addons&r."
	]
	quest.32DB942428FAD3DA.quest_subtitle: "The Blaze Enchanter."
	quest.32DB942428FAD3DA.title: "&5Let a blaze enchant"
	quest.32DECCB3B2B3BCAE.quest_desc: [
		"In den Handwerkseinheiten: &6Kupfer-Rückentank&r in der Mitte, &5Elytra&r darunter, 2 Präzisionsgetriebe, Welle, 4 Schächte, 6 Messingbleche. Kapitel &6Create: Erweiterungen&r."
		""
		"Eine Füllung: 450 Sekunden Flug oder 900 Sekunden Schweben, Laden an jeder Welle. Sprung steigt, Schleichen sinkt, G schaltet, H schwebt. Mit Netherit-Tank wird es das Netherit-Jetpack."
	]
	quest.32DECCB3B2B3BCAE.quest_subtitle: "Create Jetpack: 450 Sekunden Druckluft."
	quest.32DECCB3B2B3BCAE.title: "&6Bau das Create-Jetpack"
	quest.32E15096CEF4B827.quest_desc: [
		"Throw an &6oak sapling&r into Spiritfire, plant the &6Unstable Otherworld Sapling&r and fell the tree &ewith the Third Eye&r. Without it you only get oak wood."
		""
		"Otherworld saplings only drop from leaves you break by hand. Wild trees grow in &eOtherworld Groves&r, caves deep below the overworld."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Later a Foliot trader swaps unstable saplings for stable ones that anyone can fell without the Third Eye."
	]
	quest.32E15096CEF4B827.quest_subtitle: "Looks like an oak, isn't one."
	quest.32E15096CEF4B827.title: "&6Fell an Otherworld tree"
	quest.32ED2F26BE02AF93.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Mechanical Press&r presses an &6Experience Block&r into a blank &6Enchanting Template&r. The Experience Block is made from nine experience nuggets or from &b27 mB of liquid experience&r, compacted by a press over a basin."
		"{image:create_enchantment_industry:textures/item/enchanting_template.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"A template carries an enchantment like a book, but machines can read and write it: the &6Blaze Enchanter&r from &6Create: Brass&r fills it, the &6Blaze Forger&r in the next step transfers it onto tools and armor or pulls enchantments off items."
		""
		"You get liquid experience from experience nuggets at the Mechanical Grindstone, from the Experience Hatch or from bottles of enchanting (10 mB per bottle at the drain)."
	]
	quest.32ED2F26BE02AF93.quest_subtitle: "Enchantment Industry: enchantments as an item."
	quest.32ED2F26BE02AF93.title: "&5Press an Enchanting Template"
	quest.32EECADBCCD8ED35.quest_desc: [
		"&eChunk Unloaded&r: the train goes on as soon as the station is no longer loaded, so no player is near any more."
	]
	quest.32EECADBCCD8ED35.quest_subtitle: "On as soon as nobody is looking."
	quest.32EECADBCCD8ED35.title: "&7Chunk Unloaded"
	quest.330412D9E675F8DC.quest_desc: [
		"With the Runic Altar, &6stage 2&r opens: Agricarnation, Jaded Amaranthus, Hopperhock, Rannuncarpus, Clayconia, Exoflame, Tangleberrie, Jiyuulia, Daffomill, Fallen Kanade, Medumone, Tigerseye, Pollidisiac, Marimorphosis, Hyacidus and Vinculotus."
		""
		"Each with recipe and purpose as a checklist in the &aBotania: Runes&r chapter. Orechid, Bubbell and a few others need Pixie Dust from Alfheim, see &aBotania: Alfheim&r."
	]
	quest.330412D9E675F8DC.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen functional flowers wait for stage 2."
	quest.330412D9E675F8DC.title: "&7See what comes with runes"
	quest.331908F748343E9E.quest_desc: [
		"Everything that is still missing opens. This time the obelisk wants what makes the final fight possible."
		""
		"The finale is the fight against the &cChaos Guardian&r, live on every stream. See the chapter &5The Finale&r once stage 5 is open."
	]
	quest.331908F748343E9E.quest_subtitle: "The last machines and the last fight."
	quest.331908F748343E9E.title: "&cStage 5: Chaos Works"
	quest.331B7E71FF3B6821.quest_desc: [
		"&6Redstone blocks&r at the top left and right, a &6clock&r in the top middle, &6Draconium Ingots&r left and right, a &5dragon egg&r in the middle, &6iron, Wyvern Core, iron&r at the bottom."
		""
		"With power it jumps to sunrise, noon, sunset or midnight, or makes rain, thunder or clear sky. You get a new egg from every dragon."
	]
	quest.331B7E71FF3B6821.quest_subtitle: "Day, night and weather at the push of a button."
	quest.331B7E71FF3B6821.title: "&eBuild a Celestial Manipulator"
	quest.332328A18757F7BF.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_epic_el_armor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the apparatus: a &etier 3&r robe piece, &6Mark of Mastery&r, &6netherite ingot&r, &e2 essences&r of the element, &d7,000 source&r."
		""
		"Each piece strengthens and cheapens the glyphs of its school and lowers matching damage, such as lava and dragon's breath for fire. Full set: blocked damage turns into mana. Threads and enchantments are kept."
	]
	quest.332328A18757F7BF.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: armor of one school."
	quest.332328A18757F7BF.title: "&6Dedicate a Robe to an Element"
	quest.332463EBF3008F15.quest_desc: [
		"&6Copper Backtank&r (copper block, copper ingot, alloy, shaft), &6Copper Diving Helmet&r (copper and glass), &6Copper Diving Boots&r (copper and alloy)."
		"{image:create:textures/item/copper_diving_helmet.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Place the tank and power it (4 SU per RPM) until it holds &e900&r air. With helmet and boots you breathe under water and sink quickly to the bottom."
	]
	quest.332463EBF3008F15.quest_subtitle: "Backtank, helmet and boots."
	quest.332463EBF3008F15.title: "&6Dive with compressed air"
	quest.3326EEBF732242EE.quest_desc: [
		"One block each of &6Cloggrum&r, &6Froststeel&r, &6Utherium&r, &6Regalium&r and &6Rogdorium&r, each from 9 ingots or crystals."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The Undergarden has a lot of &6coal&r in its Depthrock. Coal becomes coke in the coke oven, and every blast furnace needs coke for steel. For the &e4,000 steel ingots&r of the stage goal \"The Furnace Never Sleeps\" this is a good second mining spot."
	]
	quest.3326EEBF732242EE.quest_subtitle: "One block of every ore."
	quest.3326EEBF732242EE.title: "&2&lCollect the Treasures of the Deep"
	quest.3345AFD00341532D.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Calx&r on the altar, on the stands &e4 Refined Soulstone&r and &e2 Hex Ash&r, plus &e4 Arcane&r and &e4 Earthen&r."
		""
		"In the Crucible with different arcana it turns into powders and reagents, EMI shows which."
	]
	quest.3345AFD00341532D.quest_subtitle: "The catalyst for the Crucible."
	quest.3345AFD00341532D.title: "&6Infuse an Alchemical Impetus"
	quest.3347183F57D71512.quest_desc: [
		"Let the crystallizer run into a chest and bring the pellets to the obelisk yourself. &e/kw goals&r shows the status."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stage 5 goal is called &5The Chaos Guardian&r: &e64 Awakened Draconium Blocks&r and &e100 antimatter pellets&r. Split up: one person the reactors, one the activators, one the power plant."
	]
	quest.3347183F57D71512.quest_subtitle: "The biggest factory of the season."
	quest.3347183F57D71512.title: "&5&lBring Antimatter to the Obelisk"
	quest.335AFF1EF49F4F5A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wild cabbages&r and &6wild beetroots&r grow on beaches. Breaking them gives cabbage and &6cabbage seeds&r."
		""
		"At the cutting board a cabbage becomes cabbage leaves. Cabbage counts as a leafy green for soups and salads."
	]
	quest.335AFF1EF49F4F5A.quest_subtitle: "On the coast."
	quest.335AFF1EF49F4F5A.title: "&aPick wild cabbage"
	quest.3363AB666B892877.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_configurator.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Two iron, osmium and steel. &eShift and mouse wheel&r switches the mode."
		""
		"&eModes:&r configure sides, empty contents, rotate blocks, wrench (dismantles machines with their contents)."
		""
		"&eSide configuration:&r tab at the top left of the window. Input red, output blue, and &eauto eject&r pushes finished items onward on its own."
	]
	quest.3363AB666B892877.quest_subtitle: "Every engineer's tool."
	quest.3363AB666B892877.title: "&3Build a Configurator"
	quest.3365667E01139DBD.quest_desc: [
		"Bring a &6golden helmet&r and a &6shield&r. With one piece of gold armour the piglins leave you alone, the shield catches the ghasts' fireballs."
		""
		"&eAlso:&r a stack of &6cobblestone&r. Netherrack breaks in ghast explosions, cobblestone holds. With a well timed hit you send a fireball back."
		""
		"&cNo bed:&r In the Nether it explodes. Piglins get angry despite gold if you mine gold in front of them or open their chests."
	]
	quest.3365667E01139DBD.quest_subtitle: "Gold on your head, shield in hand, cobblestone in the bag."
	quest.3365667E01139DBD.title: "&6Gear up for the Nether"
	quest.337C2FBA530088F3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brass sheet&r, &6chute&r and &6Electron Tube&r on top of each other make the &6Smart Chute&r. It only lets through what matches its filter, in the amount you set."
	]
	quest.337C2FBA530088F3.quest_subtitle: "A chute with a filter."
	quest.337C2FBA530088F3.title: "&6Build a Smart Chute"
	quest.3381A3C719E9B490.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r four &6Ferricore Ingots&r in the corners, a &6Basic Control Circuit&r from Mekanism in the middle, &6coal&r left and right, &6redstone&r on top and bottom."
		""
		"The &6Simple Coal Generator&r eats anything that burns in a furnace and makes &e15 FE per burn tick&r, four times as fast as a furnace. One coal gives &e24,000 FE&r in 20 seconds (60 FE/t), a &6Primal Coal&r 72,000 FE at 120 FE/t, a &6Blaze Ember&r 216,000 FE at 240 FE/t."
		""
		"It stores up to 1 million FE and gives up to &e1,000 FE/t&r to all neighbors. A Universal Cable from Mekanism or an Energy Pipe from Pipez takes the power away."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A basic Mekanism machine needs about 20 FE/t. So one generator with Primal Coal powers an Enrichment Chamber and a smelter together, with much less refueling than the Heat Generator."
	]
	quest.3381A3C719E9B490.quest_subtitle: "Power from coal, 1,000 FE per tick."
	quest.3381A3C719E9B490.title: "&6&lBuild the Simple Generator"
	quest.3392C714D31E0FA0.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r three enriched iron at the top and bottom, in the middle &6paper&r, an &6Improved Processor&r, paper."
		""
		"The &6Configuration Card&r stores a device's settings, with filters and modes, and transfers them to another device of the same kind. That way you set up twenty Exporters with the same filter in a minute."
	]
	quest.3392C714D31E0FA0.quest_subtitle: "The Configuration Card."
	quest.3392C714D31E0FA0.title: "&7Copy Settings"
	quest.339EDE49DABF8F99.quest_desc: [
		"Cobblestone all around, an iron ingot on top, a &6Blood Infusion Core&r in the middle, an &6iron block&r at the bottom."
		""
		"Put a full &6Box of Eternal Closure&r, an &6egg&r and blood inside. The reanimator puts the spirit into the egg, out comes a &6spawn egg&r of its mob. The spirit is used up afterwards, so only one egg per spirit."
		""
		"Some mobs refuse to go into the egg. Their spirits are lost."
	]
	quest.339EDE49DABF8F99.quest_subtitle: "Spirits become spawn eggs."
	quest.339EDE49DABF8F99.title: "&5Build a Spirit Reanimator"
	quest.33A292ED1B7739D0.quest_desc: [
		"6 &6Spell Cloth&r, 2 &6Fae Essence&r, 1 &6Powdered Diamond&r."
		""
		"Like the normal code, but &ethe scrolls inside are not used up&r. In return the code has &e50 durability&r. Put a Scroll of Explosive Mana Condensation inside, and every right click calls a new staff as long as the mana lasts."
	]
	quest.33A292ED1B7739D0.quest_subtitle: "Scrolls that are not used up."
	quest.33A292ED1B7739D0.title: "&6Sew the Mystic Code of First Sorcery"
	quest.33A526D00BEC788D.quest_desc: [
		"In the heated cauldron with &e500 mB of lava&r: a &6Medium Satchel&r, &e6 obsidian&r and an &6eye of ender&r."
		""
		"When you open the broom's inventory, your ender chest opens. What you find on the way is safe at home at once."
	]
	quest.33A526D00BEC788D.quest_subtitle: "The broom carries your ender chest."
	quest.33A526D00BEC788D.title: "&5Mix an Ender Satchel"
	quest.33A77C7A7B152D16.quest_desc: [
		"At the table, &e160 points&r: &6Manipulation Essence&r, &5dragon's breath&r, &bdiamond block&r, &e2 blaze rods&r."
		""
		"A form: at the target a field appears that casts the rest of the spell again and again on everything inside for a while. AOE makes it bigger, Accelerate faster, Extend Time longer, Sensitive hits blocks."
		""
		"&eProjectile, Linger, Wither&r right into a group of endermen."
	]
	quest.33A77C7A7B152D16.quest_subtitle: "A field that casts again and again."
	quest.33A77C7A7B152D16.title: "&dLearn Linger"
	quest.33C0F5D885E9ED2E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_elite_mekasuit.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eEach piece:&r top HDPE, Ultimate Control Circuit, HDPE, middle HDPE, the &6netherite piece&r, HDPE, bottom Polonium Pellet, Basic Induction Cell, Polonium Pellet."
		""
		"The armor runs on power instead of durability and grows with modules. Eight Polonium Pellets and four Induction Cells for the full set."
	]
	quest.33C0F5D885E9ED2E.quest_subtitle: "Netherite, upgraded."
	quest.33C0F5D885E9ED2E.title: "&b&lPut On the MekaSuit"
	quest.33CDDE77EFD8D1D5.quest_desc: [
		"&5Ihagan's Enthrallment&r, 13x13: &e12 lime&r, &e12 yellow&r, &e8 light grey&r and &e4 white&r signs, &e8 candles&r, &e4 skeleton skulls&r."
		"It is started with the Djinni book."
		""
		"&eWhat it summons:&r possessed Enderman, Ghast, Blaze, bee and weak Shulker, mounts and special animals, villagers, the Drikwing and ten familiars."
	]
	quest.33CDDE77EFD8D1D5.quest_subtitle: "The pentacle for Djinni possession."
	quest.33CDDE77EFD8D1D5.title: "&5Draw Ihagan's Enthrallment"
	quest.33D74A36E5681AD9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Impure White Chalk&r with &6silver&r, &6iron&r and &6calcite dust&r, all from the Crusher, then into Spiritfire."
		""
		"Djinni pentacles have spots where no white chalk may go. Light grey belongs there; grey or black work too. Light grey may also stand anywhere white is asked for."
	]
	quest.33D74A36E5681AD9.quest_subtitle: "A foundation without white."
	quest.33D74A36E5681AD9.title: "&7Mix light grey chalk"
	quest.33D817EB69C6BA7B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/exploration_e_campsite.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Find an Artifacts &6campsite&r and tick this off. It lies in caves between &eY -60 and 40&r, with light and a chest."
		""
		"The chest often holds artifacts. &cBut:&r About every third chest in a campsite is a Mimic (next quest)."
	]
	quest.33D817EB69C6BA7B.quest_subtitle: "Abandoned camps deep underground."
	quest.33D817EB69C6BA7B.title: "&6Find a cave campsite"
	quest.33E381BB2BF8C5E7.quest_desc: [
		"Squids drop a &6Squid Beak&r. Three of them and a &6Slime Pearl&r give a &6Kraken Shell Fragment&r, three fragments and a &6Nebulous Heart&r the &6Kraken Shell&r."
		""
		"In your inventory it takes the drowning damage off you and costs hunger for it. For dives to ocean monuments and underwater bases."
	]
	quest.33E381BB2BF8C5E7.quest_subtitle: "Never drown again."
	quest.33E381BB2BF8C5E7.title: "&3Build a Kraken Shell"
	quest.33E405C6E2376D48.quest_desc: [
		"13 Schwere Ingenieursbausteine, 9 Kühler, 4 Generatorblöcke, Stahlgerüste, Rohre und ein Redstone-Baustein, 3 x 3 x 5, geformt am mittleren Generatorblock. Brennstoff unten in die Ecken, Strom an bis zu drei Anschlüssen oben."
		""
		"&eIE, Dieselgenerator:&r Brennstoff Biodiesel, Hochcetan-Biodiesel oder zur Not Kreosotöl, &d4 096 FE/t&r, verteilt auf die Anschlüsse, läuft nur, wenn jemand Strom abnimmt. HV-Draht ist Pflicht. Der Generatorblock öffnet mit Stufe 3, siehe Kapitel &6Immersive Engineering: Schwerindustrie&r."
	]
	quest.33E405C6E2376D48.quest_subtitle: "Immersive Engineering, 4 096 FE/t aus Biodiesel."
	quest.33E405C6E2376D48.title: "&6Form den Dieselgenerator"
	quest.33E44C13922F04E9.quest_desc: [
		"A &6string&r in the pool becomes &6Mana Infused String&r for &d1,250 mana&r."
		""
		"From it come Manaweave Cloth, the Livingwood Bow and three amulets in stage 2. A spider farm keeps up the supply."
	]
	quest.33E44C13922F04E9.quest_subtitle: "String that carries magic."
	quest.33E44C13922F04E9.title: "&6Infuse string"
	quest.33E8181BC27158DC.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &6Monstrous Eye&r: &64 lava buckets&r in the corners, &6netherite scrap&r top and bottom, &6blackstone&r left and right, an &6eye of ender&r in the middle. Throw it and follow it."
		""
		"The forge stands in Nether wastes, crimson forest, warped forest or soul sand valley. You get the scraps from ancient debris."
	]
	quest.33E8181BC27158DC.quest_subtitle: "An abandoned forge where something sleeps."
	quest.33E8181BC27158DC.title: "&6Find the Soul Black Smith"
	quest.33EB694A7328B285.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Nether gold ore&r until you have &e64 gold nuggets&r. Fortune brings more per ore, 9 nuggets are one ingot."
		""
		"{image:minecraft:textures/item/gold_nugget.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Down here gold is currency: piglins trade all sorts of things for it (bastions section)."
	]
	quest.33EB694A7328B285.quest_subtitle: "Glittering in the netherrack."
	quest.33EB694A7328B285.title: "&6Mine Nether gold"
	quest.33F393874DB2429A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Four coal&r or charcoal on the altar, &e1 Arcane&r and &e2 Infernal&r: four Arcane Charcoal."
		""
		"A better fuel for furnaces and fire bowls, for example for Theurgy."
	]
	quest.33F393874DB2429A.quest_subtitle: "Burns longer than charcoal."
	quest.33F393874DB2429A.title: "&7Infuse Arcane Charcoal"
	quest.33F6A3D9A6956C7E.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Neptunium ingots&r and two &6sticks&r, shaped like any hoe."
		""
		"Farmland you till with it &estays moist&r, even without water nearby. That way you lay out fields wherever you like, on the roof or in a cave."
	]
	quest.33F6A3D9A6956C7E.quest_subtitle: "Farmland that never dries out."
	quest.33F6A3D9A6956C7E.title: "&bForge a Neptunium Hoe"
	quest.33F7F1791C5B1363.quest_desc: [
		"The Ender Dragon spits fireballs that leave a purple cloud. Click into the cloud with an empty &6glass bottle&r."
		""
		"{image:minecraft:textures/item/dragon_breath.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Once the dragon is dead, &e4 End Crystals&r on the rim of the exit portal summon it again. With &6stage 4&r the archmage book still lacks Linger, Wall and Glide, and the Sorcerer's robes, the third armor tier and a few things from the addons come along."
	]
	quest.33F7F1791C5B1363.quest_subtitle: "What the archmage book is still missing."
	quest.33F7F1791C5B1363.title: "&5&lBottle Dragon's Breath"
	quest.33FF9AAEDE1E43AD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Selective Incineration Module:&r Draconium Ingots in the corners, a &6lava bucket&r at the top, Draconium Cores left and right, Module Core in the middle, redstone at the bottom. What you set in the filter is burned when picked up: cobblestone, dirt, end stone."
		""
		"&6Ender Collection Module:&r eyes of ender in the corners, a Draconium Core at the top, Draconium Ingots left and right, Module Core in the middle, an &6ender chest&r at the bottom. Mined blocks land straight in your ender chest."
	]
	quest.33FF9AAEDE1E43AD.quest_subtitle: "Burn it or into the ender chest."
	quest.33FF9AAEDE1E43AD.title: "&dKeep Your Inventory Clean"
	quest.3401A84C8A05AB99.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/alfheim_elementium_line.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Collect &664 Elementium Ingots&r from an automatic line: Manasteel comes from the pool, gets pressed into blocks, blocks fly into the portal, a Hopperhock collects the Elementium."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The goal wants &e400 Elementium Ingots&r (the amount adapts to the player count), so &e800 Manasteel Ingots&r. The obelisk wants ingots, so break the blocks down again first."
		""
		"Keep the pools at the portal full with Elven Spreaders and strong flowers. Every trade costs 500 mana."
	]
	quest.3401A84C8A05AB99.quest_subtitle: "The trade has to run automatically."
	quest.3401A84C8A05AB99.title: "&dBuild an Elementium Line"
	quest.340C3FC1D50049D9.quest_desc: [
		"In the crafting grid &e3 Burnt Otherstone&r in one column, &e3 Otherworld Ashes&r in the column next to it. That makes an &6Impure White Chalk&r."
		""
		"Impure white chalk is the base of all 16 chalk colours. Each is mixed with additives and finally purified in Spiritfire."
	]
	quest.340C3FC1D50049D9.quest_subtitle: "Almost done."
	quest.340C3FC1D50049D9.title: "&6Mix impure chalk"
	quest.34187DCE2AB92E2B.quest_desc: [
		"Brüte ein &8Black Moa&r aus und reite es. Es ist das seltenste Moa und springt &e8-mal&r in der Luft, mehr als jedes andere."
		""
		"Black Moas laufen nur selten wild herum, und in keiner Dungeontruhe liegt ihr Ei. Findest du eines, bleib in der Nähe, bis es ein Ei legt, und gib es gleich in den Incubator."
	]
	quest.34187DCE2AB92E2B.quest_subtitle: "Acht Sprünge in der Luft."
	quest.34187DCE2AB92E2B.title: "&8Reite ein Black Moa"
	quest.34213EA5B410E502.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r a &6Certus Quartz Crystal&r and a &6redstone&r give two Charged Certus Quartz Crystals for &e20,000 FE&r. AE2's Charger and all other ways are removed."
		""
		"The second way is the Imbuement Chamber from Ars Nouveau: 2,000 source, redstone and glowstone on the pedestals, only one per run."
		""
		"Charged certus is the start of every ME network. Whoever has an orb takes a lot of work off the storage builders."
	]
	quest.34213EA5B410E502.quest_subtitle: "The way into AE2, two at a time."
	quest.34213EA5B410E502.title: "&bCharge certus quartz"
	quest.3422692534C7F491.quest_desc: [
		"&eStufe 1:&r &6Förderbänder mit Andesit-Trichtern&r für Maschinenstraßen, &6Schubladen mit Lagerkern und Trichter-Upgrade&r für das Lager. Ein zahmer Sternbunkel ersetzt dazwischen jede Menge Rohre."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r &6Pipez-Rohre&r, weil sie alles verbinden und nichts kosten, und &6Modular Routers&r, sobald du sortieren willst. Mekanism-Transporter nur innerhalb von Mekanism."
		""
		"&eStufe 3:&r &6AE2 oder Refined Storage&r als Lager mit Import- und Exportbussen, und &6XNet&r oder &6LaserIO&r für Maschinen, die nicht am Netz hängen sollen. Ender IO ist die schnellste Einzelleitung."
		""
		"&eStufe 4:&r Mekanism-Transporter der Elite- und Ultimativ-Stufe und das QIO-Netz, siehe Kapitel Mekanism."
	]
	quest.3422692534C7F491.quest_subtitle: "Zwei Wahlen pro Stufe."
	quest.3422692534C7F491.title: "&6&lWas wann: Gegenstände"
	quest.3425074AB5460589.quest_desc: [
		"&6Decoration Table:&r three &6logs&r on top, &6planks&r next to the chest upgrade base, two planks in the bottom corners. &6Paintbrush:&r two &6wool&r and two &6sticks&r diagonally."
		""
		"At the table you set material and colour for chests and barrels. You set up the paintbrush there, then you paint storage with it right in the world, without mining it."
	]
	quest.3425074AB5460589.quest_subtitle: "Decoration Table and Paintbrush."
	quest.3425074AB5460589.title: "Give your barrels colour"
	quest.34258E9C18DB5A9F.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Double-Layer Capacitors&r left and right, a &6glowstone block&r in the middle, a &6Vibrant Alloy Ingot&r at the top and bottom."
		""
		"The best capacitor you can craft. In chests you sometimes find &6Loot Capacitors&r with values of their own, the tooltip shows them."
	]
	quest.34258E9C18DB5A9F.quest_subtitle: "The highest tier you can build."
	quest.34258E9C18DB5A9F.title: "&6Build an Octadic Capacitor"
	quest.3425E371E27B730E.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r on top two &6flint and steel&r with a &6brass ingot&r between them, a &6shaft&r in the middle, at the bottom an &6Empty Blaze Burner&r between two &6Andesite Alloys&r. On Kronwerke the empty burner needs two source gems."
		""
		"The &6Burner&r heats a basin like a Blaze Burner, but with &bflammable fluid&r from a pipe, such as biodiesel. A valve in the line controls how fast it burns."
		""
		"No blaze, no coal refills: one biodiesel line heats a whole block of mixers this way."
	]
	quest.3425E371E27B730E.quest_subtitle: "Create Diesel Generators: the Burner."
	quest.3425E371E27B730E.title: "&6Heat with Liquid Fuel"
	quest.342A8C6B854B4A74.quest_desc: [
		"A QIO Dashboard surrounded by seven &6Polonium Pellets&r and a Teleportation Core at the bottom. With it you have the network in your pocket."
		""
		"The pellets come from NuclearCraft, see the fusion section."
	]
	quest.342A8C6B854B4A74.quest_subtitle: "The Portable QIO Dashboard."
	quest.342A8C6B854B4A74.title: "&dTake Your Storage Along"
	quest.34310FFCEB81B1EB.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6blast furnaces&r left and right, two &6blaze rods&r on top and bottom around a &6Blank Upgrade&r."
		""
		"In the Blazegold pickaxe, axe or shovel, mined blocks come out already smelted: ore as ingots, sand as glass, logs as charcoal. Every block costs some durability, the lava repairs it again."
		""
		"Together with the Ore Miner a whole iron vein lands in your inventory as ingots."
	]
	quest.34310FFCEB81B1EB.quest_subtitle: "The Auto Smelter upgrade."
	quest.34310FFCEB81B1EB.title: "&6Smelt While Mining"
	quest.3446C4E82E2EEF4A.quest_desc: [
		"A &6gold ingot&r on the altar, &e4 quartz&r on the stands, plus &e2 Sacred&r and &e1 Arcane&r."
		""
		"Arcana glide through Hallowed Gold like power through copper. It goes into Spirit Jars, obelisks and jewelry."
	]
	quest.3446C4E82E2EEF4A.quest_subtitle: "A conductor for arcana."
	quest.3446C4E82E2EEF4A.title: "&eConsecrate Hallowed Gold"
	quest.34491E4586B09655.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ophyx' Calling."
		"&6Bowls:&r one &6iron, gold, copper&r and &6silver dust&r each."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Bound Djinni book, 120 seconds."
		""
		"It makes &ethree dusts from one ore&r and is twice as fast as the Foliot. It also crushes ice, packed ice and blue ice into dust without it melting."
		""
		"Afrit (four dusts) and Marid (six) come with &6stage 3&r."
	]
	quest.34491E4586B09655.quest_subtitle: "One ore, three dusts."
	quest.34491E4586B09655.title: "&d&lSummon a Djinni Crusher"
	quest.345E080DC5C72914.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Ferricore oben und unten in den Ecken, Redstoneblock oben und unten in der Mitte, Kohle, Ofen, Kohle in der Mitte. Rechtsklick öffnet ihn, Brennstoff hinein."
		""
		"&eJust Dire Things, Pocket Generator:&r Brennstoff Kohle, Primal Coal und Blaze Ember mit denselben Werten wie der große Generator. Er fasst &d1 Million FE&r und lädt alles in deinem Inventar, was FE speichert, mit bis zu &d5 000 FE/t&r. Offen ab Stufe 2, siehe Kapitel &6Just Dire Things&r."
	]
	quest.345E080DC5C72914.quest_subtitle: "Just Dire Things: lädt dein Inventar mit bis zu 5 000 FE/t."
	quest.345E080DC5C72914.title: "&6Steck einen Taschengenerator ein"
	quest.346226A6919CF5ED.quest_desc: [
		"Place a &6stripped log&r and right-click it with &6Andesite Alloy&r. It becomes &6Andesite Casing&r. Stripped wood works the same way."
		""
		"Millstone, press, mixer, fan, gearbox, piston and depot all have a casing in their recipe. A stack of logs in stock saves walking."
		""
		"&6Tip:&r Click a shaft or a belt with a casing in hand and it gets encased."
	]
	quest.346226A6919CF5ED.quest_subtitle: "Andesite Casing, the frame of almost every machine."
	quest.346226A6919CF5ED.title: "&6Encase wood with alloy"
	quest.346C813E0DA61715.quest_desc: [
		"&69 Aethersent Ingots&r make a &6Block of Aethersent&r. Place it, carve a &6Lunaris cactus fruit&r and put it on top."
		""
		"The &6Aethersent Golem&r shoots meteors down before they strike your base. During a meteor shower Creteors fall too, and they explode like creepers."
	]
	quest.346C813E0DA61715.quest_subtitle: "A guard against meteors."
	quest.346C813E0DA61715.title: "&eBuild an Aethersent Golem"
	quest.3498BD79F8814B33.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6Blazegold Ingots&r in the corners, an &6observer&r in the middle, an &6eye of ender&r on top, &6redstone&r at the bottom, &6lapis&r left and right. Plus the &6Ferricore Wrench&r: four ingots in a hook shape."
		""
		"Place two &6Simple Swappers&r, right click the first one with the wrench, then the second one: linked, even between dimensions."
		""
		"From then on they swap the blocks in front of them, chests and machines with their contents, or living things by the same targets as the clicker. Set to players it is your first teleporter, set to adults an animal sorter that keeps the calves."
		""
		"The wrench also rotates blocks."
	]
	quest.3498BD79F8814B33.quest_subtitle: "Two places, one block swap."
	quest.3498BD79F8814B33.title: "&dBuild the Swapper"
	quest.349A54CD94529E4C.quest_desc: [
		"&e100 mB of random spawn fluid&r and one ingredient give &e250 mB&r of a fixed kind in the mixer: &6rotten flesh&r for zombies, &6bone&r for skeletons, &6gunpowder&r for creepers, &6leather and wheat&r for cows, &6emerald&r for villagers."
		""
		"Some need heat: &6blaze rod&r for blazes and &6ender pearl&r for endermen in the heated basin, &6emerald and book&r for mages in the superheated one. EMI lists all kinds under mixing."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A blaze farm from the spawner delivers the blaze rods for the blaze powder in brass, without any fortress."
	]
	quest.349A54CD94529E4C.quest_subtitle: "One ingredient turns random into a kind."
	quest.349A54CD94529E4C.title: "&cDecide the Mob"
	quest.349CCA6EA1ECEA3F.quest_desc: [
		"At the top &6ender pearl, potion, ender pearl&r, in the middle &6Marker, hay bale, potion&r, at the bottom &6gold block, hay bale, gold block&r."
		""
		"It collects the experience that mined ores drop."
	]
	quest.349CCA6EA1ECEA3F.quest_subtitle: "The experience from the ore."
	quest.349CCA6EA1ECEA3F.title: "&aBuild an Exp Collect Module"
	quest.34A7272DF92F42B0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fortgeschrittener Stufen Installateur:&r Infundierte Legierung in die Ecken, &6Fortschrittliche Steuerschaltkreise&r oben und unten, Osmium links und rechts, ein Brett in die Mitte. Rechtsklick auf die Einfache Fabrik, sie behält ihren Inhalt."
		""
		"Eine Fortschrittliche Fabrik hat &e5 Plätze&r. Werkbank-Weg: die Einfache Fabrik in die Mitte, sonst dasselbe Muster. Mit den Schaltkreisen öffnet das in &6Stufe 3&r, zusammen mit der Klärkammer."
		""
		"Dazu gehören die fortschrittlichen Leitungen: acht einfache um eine Infundierte Legierung ergeben acht fortschrittliche. Transporter 16 Gegenstände pro halbe Sekunde, Druckschlauch 2 000 mB/t, Rohrleitung 1 000 mB/t."
	]
	quest.34A7272DF92F42B0.quest_subtitle: "Fünf Plätze. Stufe 3."
	quest.34A7272DF92F42B0.title: "&aStuf auf Fortschrittlich hoch"
	quest.34A9196C1811C3A6.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6steel ingots&r with redstone between them give eight &6Basic Universal Cables&r. They carry &d3,200 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Cables connect to anything that takes or gives power. With the Configurator you set a side to &eNone&r if it shouldn't connect."
	]
	quest.34A9196C1811C3A6.quest_subtitle: "Power from here to there."
	quest.34A9196C1811C3A6.title: "&aLay Universal Cables"
	quest.34B32D8D8753EADE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cardboard&r makes a helmet, chestplate, leggings and boots in the shapes of normal armor, &d24 cardboard&r in total."
		"{image:create:textures/item/cardboard_chestplate.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Wearing all four pieces you disguise yourself as an inconspicuous package while sneaking. Ideal for hide and seek in the package depot."
		""
		"The &6Cardboard Sword&r (two cardboard and a stick) is almost harmless and still makes a nice sound."
	]
	quest.34B32D8D8753EADE.quest_subtitle: "Whoever sneaks is a package."
	quest.34B32D8D8753EADE.title: "&6Put on cardboard armor"
	quest.34B5F648108F682A.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Nether Star&r with four &6Obsidiansteel Ingots&r on the sides gives a &6Dark Nether Star&r. &eForge tier 5&r needs two of them, and that only comes with server stage 4."
		""
		"Another Nether Star with three strings, an eye of ender and two Deorum becomes the &6Spectral Eye Amulet&r, which turns on and off with right click."
		""
		"Whoever kills the Wither for beacons anyway builds the star now on the side. Everyone else waits."
	]
	quest.34B5F648108F682A.quest_subtitle: "For the late tiers of the forge."
	quest.34B5F648108F682A.title: "&5Dark Nether Star"
	quest.34BF264B56CE6E41.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ghast tear&r, &6Nebulous Heart&r, &6Slime Pearl&r and a &6lapis lazuli&r shapeless give the &6Void Tear&r. It holds practically unlimited amounts of one kind."
		""
		"Right clicking a chest with the empty tear sucks one kind out, right clicking with the full tear empties it into the chest. Matching items you pick up go straight into it. Shift mouse wheel switches the mode: &eEMPTY&r takes all stacks from your inventory, &eSTACK&r always keeps one stack ready, &eFILL&r fills your inventory."
		""
		"The tear is also an ingredient for the Sojourner's Staff, Ender Staff, Harvest Rod, Ice Magus Rod and the Infernal Tear, which burns items into experience."
	]
	quest.34BF264B56CE6E41.quest_subtitle: "One kind, almost without end."
	quest.34BF264B56CE6E41.title: "&5Make a Void Tear"
	quest.34E1C7B532DAD3E9.quest_desc: [
		"Vier &6Druckeisenbarren&r in die Ecken, &6oranger Farbstoff&r oben in der Mitte, ein &6Hebel&r unten in der Mitte, ein &6Luftkanister&r links in der Mitte ergeben den &6Druckluftschlüssel&r (Pneumatic Wrench). Lad ihn in der Station auf mindestens 3 Bar, ohne Luft tut er nichts."
		""
		"&eRechtsklick&r dreht Blöcke und schließt oder öffnet einzelne Seiten eines Druckluftrohrs. &eSchleichen und Rechtsklick&r baut eine Maschine samt Luft und Upgrades ab. Mit der Spitzhacke verlierst du beides. Module am Rohr nimmst du genauso wieder ab."
	]
	quest.34E1C7B532DAD3E9.quest_subtitle: "Dreht, schließt, baut ab."
	quest.34E1C7B532DAD3E9.title: "&6Bau den Druckluftschlüssel"
	quest.34E750AF19D363D7.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_gear_drilling.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Erzadern-Finder&r zeigt die Ader unter dem Chunk, die &6Bohrmaschine&r (Messing, Robuste Bleche, Präzisionsgetriebe, Mechanischer Bohrer) mit &6Eisenbohrer&r fördert Roherz, solange sie dreht."
		""
		"Adern sind auf Kronwerke unerschöpflich. Diamant- und Netheritbohrer kommen in Stufe 4. Kapitel &6Create: Erweiterungen&r. Der &6Digitale Miner&r von Mekanism gräbt daneben ganze Gebiete leer."
	]
	quest.34E750AF19D363D7.quest_subtitle: "Create Ore Excavation: Erz ohne Ende."
	quest.34E750AF19D363D7.title: "&7Stell eine Bohrmaschine auf"
	quest.34E78833D7F6A2B2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Turbine Casing:&r four steel around osmium, gives four. The shell is square with an &eodd edge length&r, start with 5 by 5. Structural Glass may go into the walls."
		""
		"By the config every block of volume adds &d6.4 million FE&r of buffer."
	]
	quest.34E78833D7F6A2B2.quest_subtitle: "A square tower."
	quest.34E78833D7F6A2B2.title: "&7Build the turbine shell"
	quest.34EF9BAD0CC68B94.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_config_tool.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Five paper&r, &6two gold ingots&r, a &6drawer&r and an &6emerald&r."
		""
		"A locked drawer remembers its kind even when empty, so nothing wrong ever ends up in the iron drawer. &eSneaking right click into the air&r switches the mode (lock, counts, items, upgrades, fill level), &eright click&r on the drawer applies it."
	]
	quest.34EF9BAD0CC68B94.quest_subtitle: "The Configuration Tool."
	quest.34EF9BAD0CC68B94.title: "Lock a drawer"
	quest.35027A3671CEFF2C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Vision Enhancement Unit:&r top Reinforced Alloy, an &6emerald&r, Reinforced Alloy, middle alloy, Module Base, alloy, bottom three Polonium Pellets. It brightens your surroundings, several work more strongly."
		""
		"&6Magnetic Attraction Unit:&r top Reinforced Alloy, iron bars, Reinforced Alloy, middle Elite Control Circuit, Module Base, Elite Control Circuit, bottom three Polonium Pellets. It pulls nearby items to you, several increase the range."
	]
	quest.35027A3671CEFF2C.quest_subtitle: "Night vision and magnet."
	quest.35027A3671CEFF2C.title: "&bSee in the Dark, Attract Loot"
	quest.350B190B1B98A9CF.quest_desc: [
		"One &6UU Matter&r, &6Atomic Alloy&r, 2 &6Ultimate Control Circuits&r and a &6Steel Casing&r. It exists for items, fluids and chemicals."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The item Replicator only copies &estone&r and &eores&r (1 mB each), &elogs&r (4 mB), &eplanks&r (1 mB) and &eiron, copper and gold ingots&r (5 mB each). The Chemical Replicator copies nothing."
		""
		"MoreMachine's &3Large Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer&r is open too, it needs two antimatter pellets and a Robit."
	]
	quest.350B190B1B98A9CF.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism MoreMachine copies things."
	quest.350B190B1B98A9CF.title: "&3Build a Replicator"
	quest.350C8F223355806F.quest_desc: [
		"Gaia Spirit at the top, Elementium, &5Pure Ender Essence&r, Elementium in the middle, Elementium at the bottom."
		""
		"Right click a block to set the kind, sneak right click into the air to turn it on. Then it sucks those blocks out of your inventory. Right click places them again."
	]
	quest.350C8F223355806F.quest_subtitle: "Almost unlimited blocks of one kind."
	quest.350C8F223355806F.title: "&5Craft a Black Hole Talisman"
	quest.350FD092E36A40EE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_press.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"At the bottom &6Steel Scaffolding, Redstone Engineering Block, Steel Scaffolding&r, in the middle &6conveyor belt, piston, conveyor belt&r in the same direction, on top of the piston a &6Heavy Engineering Block&r. Hammer on the piston."
		""
		"&eMolds:&r Molds blueprint (Iron Sheetmetal, three blue dye, three paper) at the workbench, then three Steel Plates and the wire cutters per mold. Right click to put it into the press. &eIn:&r ingots on the belt. &eOut:&r at the end of the belt, one Steel Plate for 2,400 FE."
	]
	quest.350FD092E36A40EE.quest_subtitle: "3x3x1, ingots in, plates, rods and gears out."
	quest.350FD092E36A40EE.title: "&7Form a Metal Press"
	quest.351037E72765B497.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6iron ingot&r, &6piston&r, iron ingot, middle piston, chest upgrade base, piston, bottom &6redstone&r, piston, redstone."
		""
		"Whatever comes in and has a 2x2 recipe, it presses into a block right away: quartz, clay, snow. 3x3 like ingots into blocks needs the &6Advanced Compacting Upgrade&r."
	]
	quest.351037E72765B497.quest_subtitle: "The Compacting Upgrade for chests."
	quest.351037E72765B497.title: "Press into blocks in the barrel"
	quest.351815CD1D7CBAA0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Nether bricks&r in the corners, &6iron&r on the sides, a &6furnace&r in the middle, a &6Draconium Core&r in the bottom middle."
		""
		"It burns anything that burns in a furnace. &eEco&r and &eEco Plus&r get more out of the fuel, &ePerformance&r and &eOverdrive&r give more output. Not enough for fusion and the Energy Core, but fine as backup power."
	]
	quest.351815CD1D7CBAA0.quest_subtitle: "A furnace that makes power."
	quest.351815CD1D7CBAA0.title: "&6Build a Generator"
	quest.351A7A64120D5AF2.quest_desc: [
		"Teleporters, miners and machines have a security switch in their window: &6Public&r, &6Private&r or &6Trusted&r (only players on your list)."
		""
		"Frequencies are public or private too. Everyone on the server sees a public teleporter frequency in their list, and anyone can jump into your base. Create a &eprivate&r frequency for home."
	]
	quest.351A7A64120D5AF2.quest_subtitle: "Your teleporter belongs to you."
	quest.351A7A64120D5AF2.title: "&8Make frequencies private"
	quest.351C5B3A9F9B05FA.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a placed stripped log with a &6brass ingot&r: it becomes a &6Brass Casing&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The botanists need it: the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate wants two, Mana Pearls only form over a brass casing, the Runic Altar wants a brass ingot. Both pillars have to be filled."
	]
	quest.351C5B3A9F9B05FA.quest_subtitle: "The brass casing, frame of every smart machine."
	quest.351C5B3A9F9B05FA.title: "&6Encase wood in brass"
	quest.351D96562E9FB7A4.quest_desc: [
		"Right clicking a &6Lost Soul&r with an &6Aureal Bottle&r turns it into an &6Enchanted Lost Soul&r. Defeated, it drops an &6Enchanted Soul&r."
		""
		"In the forge it counts &e10 souls&r instead of one. In the Clibano it makes &denchanted fire&r, 2.5 times as fast as normal."
	]
	quest.351D96562E9FB7A4.quest_subtitle: "A soul that counts ten."
	quest.351D96562E9FB7A4.title: "&bEnchant a Lost Soul"
	quest.3531E7CD4425B9E0.quest_desc: [
		"Farmer's Delight, Farming for Blockheads and Aquaculture: meals that keep you full for a long time, rich soil, animals and fishing."
	]
	quest.3531E7CD4425B9E0.quest_subtitle: "Knife, cooking pot, fields, fishing."
	quest.3531E7CD4425B9E0.title: "&6Open Food and Farming"
	quest.353F16A76929DD09.quest_desc: [
		"At the table, &e160 points&r: &fAir Essence&r, a pair of &5elytra&r, &e3 diamonds&r."
		""
		"&eSelf, Glide&r gives you the Glide effect as if wearing elytra, Extend Time makes it longer. Elytra hang in the End Ships, the pair for the glyph is gone, so get two."
	]
	quest.353F16A76929DD09.quest_subtitle: "Elytra from the spell book."
	quest.353F16A76929DD09.title: "&dLearn Glide"
	quest.353FA47F042F9B19.quest_desc: [
		"Spirited Crystals, two Spirited Capacitors, a casing and the &6Niotic Furnator&r at the bottom."
		""
		"A Spirited Furnator makes &e8,000 FE/t&r. Nitro with 40,000 FE/t comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.353FA47F042F9B19.quest_subtitle: "8,000 FE per tick."
	quest.353FA47F042F9B19.title: "&aUpgrade to Spirited"
	quest.3540D1BBDE1B2C4D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Diamantschwert&r in den Bezaubernden Apparat, auf die Podeste ein Diamant, 2 Goldblöcke und 2 Quelljuwelenblöcke. Für das &6Zauberschild&r: Schild, 2 Goldblöcke, 2 Quelljuwelenblöcke."
		""
		"Das Zauberschwert trägt einen Zauber, den du am Tisch des Schreibers einschreibst, und wirkt ihn bei jedem Treffer. Kapitel &dArs Nouveau&r."
	]
	quest.3540D1BBDE1B2C4D.quest_subtitle: "Ars Nouveau: ein Zauber auf jedem Treffer."
	quest.3540D1BBDE1B2C4D.title: "&dVerzaubere ein Schwert mit Quelle"
	quest.35475D311AA63A61.quest_desc: [
		"Sammle &e4 Wärterpanzer&r. Neben dem Wärter selbst liegen sie in den Truhen des Antiken Tempels und in &6Antiken Vasen&r."
		""
		"Aus Panzer und Phantomhaut werden &6Verstärkte Echoscherben&r. Jedes Teil der Wärterrüstung in Stufe 4 braucht eine, also leg schon jetzt einen Vorrat an."
	]
	quest.35475D311AA63A61.quest_subtitle: "Für Echoscherben und die Rüstung in Stufe 4."
	quest.35475D311AA63A61.title: "&8Sammle Wärterpanzer"
	quest.3554DFECC9BB20A5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/enderio_soul_binder.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r top Soulstained Steel, an &eempty&r Soul Vial, Soulstained Steel. Middle Energized Gear, Ensouled Chassis, Energized Gear. Bottom Soulstained Steel, Z-Logic Controller, Soulstained Steel."
		""
		"It binds the soul from a full vial to an item. For that it needs power and &aliquid experience&r in its tank: XP Juice from Ender IO or Essence from Industrial Foregoing."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The Soul Engine with a blaze's soul burns lava into power, &e800 µI&r per mB."
	]
	quest.3554DFECC9BB20A5.quest_subtitle: "One soul, one item, one result."
	quest.3554DFECC9BB20A5.title: "&5&lBuild the Soul Binder"
	quest.3555F064C11E3AED.quest_desc: [
		"Tick this and set out. The quests here show you how to find your way, travel fast, dig in the farm world and what waits in the structures."
		""
		"&6Terralith&r and &6Biomes O' Plenty&r bring dozens of new biomes, &6Tectonic&r higher mountains and deeper valleys. In between stand structures from a dozen mods."
		""
		"&eGood to know:&r Loot in structures exists for every player separately. Whoever comes second doesn't leave empty handed."
	]
	quest.3555F064C11E3AED.quest_subtitle: "The world is bigger and stranger than in vanilla."
	quest.3555F064C11E3AED.title: "&6&lSet out and explore"
	quest.356481D21AD0B761.quest_desc: [
		"&6Splitting Conveyor Belt:&r three Conveyor Belts and an iron ingot make three. It sends items left and right in turn."
		"&6Dropping Conveyor Belt:&r a Conveyor Belt above an Iron Plate. Everything falls down through the hatch, also into an inventory below. Redstone closes the hatch."
		"&6Extracting Conveyor Belt:&r a &6Strip Curtain&r, a Basic Engineering Block and a Conveyor Belt. It pulls from the inventory behind it like a hopper. Set the speed with the &6screwdriver&r (iron rod and stick)."
		""
		"A Conveyor Belt above a &6redstone torch&r stops on a redstone signal."
	]
	quest.356481D21AD0B761.quest_subtitle: "Split, drop, pull out."
	quest.356481D21AD0B761.title: "&7Build special conveyor belts"
	quest.357EBB1C0530E2D9.quest_desc: [
		"Bau zuerst ein &6Milchglas&r: Glas rundherum, ein Brett oben in der Mitte, ein &6Milcheimer&r in der Mitte. An der Küche liefert es Milch für Kuchen, Suppen und alles mit Milch im Rezept."
		""
		"Dann die &6Kuh im Glas&r: Stell das Milchglas auf, lock eine &6Kuh&r so, dass sie darauf steht, und lass einen &6Amboss&r auf sie fallen. Die Kuh verschwindet im Glas und gibt dort &e1 mB Milch pro Tick&r, ein Eimer voll alle 50 Sekunden, solange der Chunk geladen ist."
		""
		"Die Kuh muss genau auf dem Glas stehen, nicht daneben. Ein Zaun rundherum und Weizen in der Hand helfen beim Positionieren."
	]
	quest.357EBB1C0530E2D9.quest_subtitle: "Milch ohne Eimer, für immer."
	quest.357EBB1C0530E2D9.title: "&6Sperr eine Kuh ins Glas"
	quest.358F483542C93133.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_strigeor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Strigeor's Higher Binding&r, 13x13: &e32 purple&r, &e20 lime&r, &e8 white&r and &e8 light grey&r signs, &e8 candles&r, &e8 skeleton skulls&r."
		"It is started with the Djinni book, 150 seconds per ritual."
		""
		"&eWhat it makes:&r Soul Gem, Familiar Ring, Gray Paste, Infused Pickaxe, Ender Satchel, Spirit Grindstone. In stage 3 also: Dimensional Mineshaft, Djinni Miner, Dimensional Matrix, Storage Remote, wormholes."
	]
	quest.358F483542C93133.quest_subtitle: "The pentacle for Djinni items."
	quest.358F483542C93133.title: "&5Draw Strigeor's Higher Binding"
	quest.35A1D6A9E32CED33.quest_desc: [
		"&6Elektrische Pumpe:&r ein Eimer oben in der Mitte, Infundierte Legierung links und rechts von einem &6Stahlgehäuse&r, unten drei &6Osmiumbarren&r. &6Einfache Rohrleitung:&r zwei Stahlbarren mit einem Eimer dazwischen, gibt acht."
		""
		"Die Pumpe steht über dem Wasser und zieht etwa &d40 FE/t&r. Von ihr führt eine Rohrleitung zum Elektrolyseur; eine einfache schafft &e250 mB/t&r, mehr als genug. Ein Becken von zwei mal zwei Wasser füllt sich von selbst nach."
		""
		"Für den Anfang tut es auch ein Wassereimer im Slot des Elektrolyseurs."
	]
	quest.35A1D6A9E32CED33.quest_subtitle: "Elektrische Pumpe und Rohrleitungen."
	quest.35A1D6A9E32CED33.title: "&bPump Wasser hinein"
	quest.35B0FE43EBA9550B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_mixer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e4 Light Engineering Blocks, 4 Iron Sheetmetal, 5 Steel Scaffolding, 1 Steel Fence, 3 fluid pipes, 1 Redstone Engineering Block&r. Hammer on the middle Iron Sheetmetal."
		""
		"&eIn:&r fluid at the bottom by the power input, items at the back through two hatches. &eOut:&r at the front. 2 sand, 1 gravel, 1 clay in 500 mB of water give 500 mB of &6Liquid Concrete&r, 1 redstone in 250 mB of water the same amount of &6Redstone Acid&r. Potions in tanks too."
	]
	quest.35B0FE43EBA9550B.quest_subtitle: "3x3x3, solids and water in, concrete and acid out."
	quest.35B0FE43EBA9550B.title: "&9Form a Mixer"
	quest.35B53194DDE03C0E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluorite&r into the &6Chemical Dissolution Chamber&r, &6sulfuric acid&r with it. One fluorite gives &e1,000 mB of hydrofluoric acid&r, a fluorite block 9,000 mB."
		""
		"You know sulfuric acid and the chamber from the 5x line in the chapter &5Mekanism: Ore Step by Step&r. Fluorite comes as ore deep down."
	]
	quest.35B53194DDE03C0E.quest_subtitle: "Step 3: hydrofluoric acid."
	quest.35B53194DDE03C0E.title: "&aDissolve Fluorite in Sulfuric Acid"
	quest.35C4F06C94471306.quest_desc: [
		"The numbers are for &e30 active players&r. Active means more than an hour of play in the last 7 days. When a stage opens, the amount is multiplied by that share, at least 0.4 and at most 1.5, and then stays fixed."
		""
		"&eException:&r The 12 Stoneworks Gearboxes and 12 Source Keystones never change. &e/kw goals&r and the status page on the website show what applies right now."
	]
	quest.35C4F06C94471306.quest_subtitle: "More players, bigger goals."
	quest.35C4F06C94471306.title: "&6Check the real amounts"
	quest.35CE7D2ADB46E1E8.quest_desc: [
		"Ein Paar pro Endschiff, bewacht von Shulkern. Brustplatz, springen, im Fall noch einmal springen, Feuerwerksraketen geben Schub. Kapitel &5Das End&r."
		""
		"432 Haltbarkeit, Reparatur mit Phantomhaut. Jede Elytra ist eine Zutat: Create-Jetpack, HDPE-Elytra, Seelenelytra, Wyvern-Flugmodul, Gleiten-Glyphe. Hol lieber mehrere."
	]
	quest.35CE7D2ADB46E1E8.quest_subtitle: "Vanilla: an der Wand eines Endschiffs."
	quest.35CE7D2ADB46E1E8.title: "&5Hol dir Elytren"
	quest.35D1BC9B4DD69C2B.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Hügel der Hunde&r liegt in der Wüste. &cSchreckenshunde&r (17 Lebenspunkte, 5 Schaden) jagen im Rudel, und irgendwo dazwischen läuft der &cAnführer&r mit &e100 Lebenspunkten&r und 10 Schaden."
		""
		"Er lässt &e1 bis 3 Fangzähne&r fallen, dazu 3 bis 6 Monsterhaut und 4 bis 8 Monsterfleisch. Aus 4 Fangzähnen, einer schweren Druckplatte und einem Eisenbarren wird die &6Hundefalle&r, die hält Monster fest."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Hunde kommen von allen Seiten. Stell dich mit dem Rücken an eine Wand, oder lass sie durch eine Tür kommen."
	]
	quest.35D1BC9B4DD69C2B.quest_subtitle: "Der Hügel der Hunde in der Wüste."
	quest.35D1BC9B4DD69C2B.title: "&8Besiege den Anführer der Höllenhunde"
	quest.35DB78E529E71C2E.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6Spirit Attuned Pickaxe Head&r (3 gems in a row), &e2 sticks&r, &e2 silver ingots&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book, 150 seconds."
		""
		"The pickaxe is very fragile. It is only meant to fetch the first Iesnium, from which you build a durable Iesnium Pickaxe."
	]
	quest.35DB78E529E71C2E.quest_subtitle: "A Djinni in the gem breaks Iesnium."
	quest.35DB78E529E71C2E.title: "&6Bind an Infused Pickaxe"
	quest.35DED8695B795B84.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a placed &6ME P2P Tunnel&r with an &6Energy Cell&r or an &6Energy Acceptor&r, and it turns into this type. Breaking it gives you the tunnel as an item of its own."
	]
	quest.35DED8695B795B84.quest_subtitle: "Power without a cable, costs 2.5 percent."
	quest.35DED8695B795B84.title: "Build an FE tunnel"
	quest.35F2FF2D65AB0B16.quest_desc: [
		"&cFire&r means damage and burning. Common: &6Firebolt&r (small fire projectile), &6Fire Breath&r (hold: cone of fire), &6Blaze Storm&r (hold: volley of fireballs), &6Burning Dash&r (sprint forward in flames)."
		"&6Flaming Strike&r (melee slash, scales with the weapon), &6Heat Surge&r (burst of fire around you, lowers armor), &6Wall of Fire&r (wall of fire between anchor points, stops projectiles)."
		""
		"To forge them, stage 1 lacks the blaze rod. Fire scrolls from chests still work."
		""
		"&cStage 2:&r Magma Bomb, Scorch, Fire Arrow, Fireball, Flaming Barrage. &cStage 4:&r Raise Hell."
	]
	quest.35F2FF2D65AB0B16.quest_subtitle: "Firebolt, Fire Breath, Blaze Storm and more."
	quest.35F2FF2D65AB0B16.title: "&cCast a Fire Spell"
	quest.3610A161B85751BB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pins&r on top, below them two rows of &6iron sheet&r, &6resistor coil&r, iron sheet make the &6heating coil&r."
		""
		"Put it into a fan's air stream and give it enough power: the air stream gets hot. With higher voltage it smelts items like lava in front of the fan, and faster. The Ponder scene (&eW&r) shows the setup."
	]
	quest.3610A161B85751BB.quest_subtitle: "Power Grid: the heating coil."
	quest.3610A161B85751BB.title: "&3Smelt in an electric air stream"
	quest.361C2E303E9F730F.quest_desc: [
		"Many weapons and armour pieces from chests and monsters carry Apotheosis &6affixes&r. The colour of the name shows the rarity: &7Common&r, &aUncommon&r, &9Rare&r, &5Epic&r, &6Mythic&r."
		""
		"Gems, sockets, salvaging, reforging and world tiers are in the &6Apotheosis&r chapter."
	]
	quest.361C2E303E9F730F.quest_subtitle: "No sword is like another."
	quest.361C2E303E9F730F.title: "&6Get to know loot with affixes"
	quest.36286F9C00183F19.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r osmium in the corners, alloy top and bottom, steel casing left and right, an &6Electrolytic Core&r in the middle."
		""
		"It burns gas from its tank. &bHydrogen&r comes from the Electrolytic Separator (&5Mekanism: Ore Step by Step&r chapter), but splitting costs more power than the hydrogen gives back."
		""
		"It pays off with &bethene&r from the next quest, or with hydrogen that is left over anyway."
	]
	quest.36286F9C00183F19.quest_subtitle: "The Gas-Burning Generator."
	quest.36286F9C00183F19.title: "&bBurn hydrogen"
	quest.363BFCAE79B80548.quest_desc: [
		"&6Applied Energistics 2&r, &6Flüssigkeitszelle&r: 8 Eimer je Byte, eine 1k-Zelle fasst rund &e8 000 Eimer&r einer Sorte, Import- und Exportbus bewegen Flüssigkeiten wie Gegenstände. &6Refined Storage&r, &664B-Flüssigspeicherzelle&r: &e64 Eimer&r, bis 4 096B in Stufe 3. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"Siehe Kapitel Applied Energistics 2 und Refined Storage."
	]
	quest.363BFCAE79B80548.quest_subtitle: "AE2 und Refined Storage: Lava und Öl liegen im Laufwerk."
	quest.363BFCAE79B80548.title: "Lies: Flüssigkeiten im Lagernetz"
	quest.363F2F6549495CBA.quest_desc: [
		"A right click on the Robit opens its window. The tabs: &6Inventory&r, &6Crafting&r, &6Smelting&r (a furnace) and &6Repair&r (an anvil)."
		""
		"With the buttons you switch on &eFollow&r and &ePick up&r, give it a name and a different look. &eGo home&r sends it back to the Chargepad you put it on."
		""
		"A Robit that follows you into the mine collects the drops, smelts the ore and mends the pickaxe."
	]
	quest.363F2F6549495CBA.quest_subtitle: "Crafting table, furnace and anvil on wheels."
	quest.363F2F6549495CBA.title: "&eLet the Robit work for you"
	quest.364BE77E2B54D9C5.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Chemical Oxidizer, 100 mB per sulfur dust. The Pressurized Reaction Chamber gives sulfur from coal."
		"&eUsed by:&r the Infuser for sulfur trioxide."
	]
	quest.364BE77E2B54D9C5.quest_subtitle: "Sulfur dust in the oxidizer."
	quest.364BE77E2B54D9C5.title: "&fSulfur dioxide"
	quest.366C890332CCA08C.quest_desc: [
		"&bCascading log&r, &6feather&r, &6Source Gem block&r."
		""
		"Without an addition clear weather, with gunpowder rain, with a lapis block a thunderstorm. Coordinate with each other, the weather is the same for everyone."
	]
	quest.366C890332CCA08C.quest_subtitle: "Weather on request."
	quest.366C890332CCA08C.title: "&aMake the Cloudshaping tablet"
	quest.36744370CED5B6B4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_foliot_crusher.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Pentacle:&r Aviar's Circle."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6Chalk Brush&r (3 planks, 2 wool, string), a &6chest&r, a &6dispenser&r, a &6hopper&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Its Book of Calling appears with it."
		""
		"It collects items lying around and brings them into a target chest. Next to the Crusher it carries the dust away as soon as you enter it in the allowed list (it also starts on whitelist)."
		""
		"Transporter in, Janitor out: that is your first automatic ore line. The brush itself wipes chalk signs away quickly."
	]
	quest.36744370CED5B6B4.quest_subtitle: "It tidies up behind the others."
	quest.36744370CED5B6B4.title: "&dSummon a Foliot Janitor"
	quest.3681668078CC3487.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_advanced_teleporter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Teleporter:&r the core in the middle, Steel Casings on the sides, circuits in the corners. &6Frame:&r eight Refined Obsidian Ingots around a Refined Glowstone Ingot give nine."
		""
		"Build a frame &e3 wide and 4 high&r with an opening of 1 by 2: the Teleporter at the bottom in the middle, &e9 frame blocks&r left, right and on top. Give both the same &efrequency&r and power."
		""
		"Every jump costs power, the further the more, into another dimension a good deal more."
	]
	quest.3681668078CC3487.quest_subtitle: "From base to base in one step."
	quest.3681668078CC3487.title: "&d&lSet up two teleporters"
	quest.36874E34FB3D2997.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Mechanischer Arm&r: greift aus beliebig vielen Eingängen und legt in beliebig viele Ausgänge im Umkreis von &e5 Blöcken&r, Ziele vor dem Setzen anklicken. Filter nur über Messing-Trichter als Ziel. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Messingbleche, Andesitlegierung, Messinggehäuse und ein Präzisionsgetriebe. Verteilt nach Rundlauf, erzwungenem Rundlauf oder dem ersten gewählten Ziel."
		""
		"Ein Arm füttert ein Dutzend Mixer aus einem Depot. Siehe Kapitel Create: Messing."
	]
	quest.36874E34FB3D2997.quest_subtitle: "Create, Mechanischer Arm: beliebig viele Ziele in 5 Blöcken."
	quest.36874E34FB3D2997.title: "Lies: Mechanischer Arm"
	quest.368808DE4B76F8D7.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r like the item pipe, but with two &6redstone blocks&r instead of the dispensers. &616 Energy Pipes&r."
		""
		"An energy pipe carries &e256 FE per tick&r without an upgrade and understands every FE device in the pack: Mekanism, Create Crafts and Additions, Immersive Engineering, pylons. The extracting side goes on the generator or energy cube."
		""
		"The pipe distributes power &ein turn&r to all consumers, not just the nearest."
	]
	quest.368808DE4B76F8D7.quest_subtitle: "FE for all mods."
	quest.368808DE4B76F8D7.title: "&cBuild Energy Pipes"
	quest.368CFB9C4C3937D6.quest_desc: [
		"Put empty &6glass bottles&r into the &6Bottler&r, place a &6piston&r above it that pushes down, and put a bee in between. Pull the lever, and you hold &6Squashed Bee Material&r in your hand. The bee is gone afterwards."
		""
		"{image:productivebees:textures/item/gene.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Throw the bottle into a &6Centrifuge&r. Out come &6Gene Samples&r: one for the &etype&r of the bee (for example Iron Bee, 33 percent purity on average) and some for its traits."
		""
		"&eWithout loss:&r The &6Gene Sampler Upgrade&r (base, four comb blocks, two diamond swords, two honey bottles) in the Expansion Box takes a sample with a 5 percent chance on every visit, without harming the bee."
	]
	quest.368CFB9C4C3937D6.quest_subtitle: "Bottles in, bee on top, pull the lever."
	quest.368CFB9C4C3937D6.title: "&dSquash Genes out of a Bee"
	quest.368D4EFB777B3C58.quest_desc: [
		"A creeper struck by lightning is &echarged&r and glows blue. Right clicking it with an empty &6glass bottle&r gives a &6Bottle o' Lightning&r."
		""
		"Wait for a thunderstorm, or a trident with &6Channeling&r calls the lightning itself. Careful, a charged creeper blows up much harder."
		""
		"The bottle is the focus for lightning spells in the Scroll Forge, and eight of them around a Blank Runestone give the &6Lightning Rune&r for the &eElectromancer&r armor."
	]
	quest.368D4EFB777B3C58.quest_subtitle: "Bottle o' Lightning from a charged creeper."
	quest.368D4EFB777B3C58.title: "&eCatch Lightning in a Bottle"
	quest.369FEB1F391DF329.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron Bee&r and &6Sweat Bee&r (snow nest), the same pair also gives the nickel bee. Flower: &6zinc block&r. The comb gives &6raw zinc&r with 40 percent for the brass mixer."
	]
	quest.369FEB1F391DF329.quest_subtitle: "Raw zinc for brass."
	quest.369FEB1F391DF329.title: "&7Breed the Zinc Bee"
	quest.36C39E2085114030.quest_desc: [
		"Erleg &e5 Koboletons&r in der Pyramide. Sie lassen &6Koboleton-Knochen&r und Altmetall fallen."
		""
		"&6Helm:&r Kobolediator-Schädel, 2 Altmetallbarren und 2 Knochen. &6Brustplatte:&r 4 Altmetallbarren und 4 Knochen. Mit beiden Teilen gehst du deutlich sicherer in den Kampf gegen den Ancient Remnant."
	]
	quest.36C39E2085114030.quest_subtitle: "Koboletons haben genug Knochen für alle."
	quest.36C39E2085114030.title: "&6Bau die Knochenreptil-Rüstung"
	quest.36C4AC549D3F6361.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6iron ingots&r, two paste and a &6redstone block&r give four &6Basic Capacitors&r. One comes apart at the crafting table into two &6Tiny&r ones, two make a &6Large&r one."
		""
		"Starter blocks take Tiny, Basic the normal ones. From Hardened on you build one of each: a Large in the middle, paste in the corners, the tier's material on the sides. Hardened and Blazing give two, Niotic and Spirited one."
		""
		"A higher machine almost always comes from the machine below it. You lose nothing when you upgrade."
	]
	quest.36C4AC549D3F6361.quest_subtitle: "The tier sits in the capacitor."
	quest.36C4AC549D3F6361.title: "&7Build capacitors"
	quest.36CC726D0ECB54E7.quest_desc: [
		"Break a &6chorus flower&r off the top of a chorus plant and take end stone with you. Planted on end stone it grows into a whole plant in the Overworld too."
		""
		"Popped chorus fruit become &6purpur blocks&r (four make four) and, with a blaze rod, &e4 End Rods&r, bright lamps for any base."
	]
	quest.36CC726D0ECB54E7.quest_subtitle: "Chorus only grows on end stone."
	quest.36CC726D0ECB54E7.title: "&dPlant Chorus at Home"
	quest.36CCFE6F632CA63D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_satchel.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Pentacle:&r Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6hopper&r, &6dispenser&r, &e2 wool&r, &e2 leather&r, &6string&r, &6silver ingot&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book."
		""
		"Pack chalks, candles and skulls into it (sneaking right click). Pick a pentacle in the Dictionary through the eye, fix the preview with right click, and then every click with the satchel on a preview sign places the right part."
		""
		"The Artisanal Satchel from stage 3 draws the whole pentacle in one click."
	]
	quest.36CCFE6F632CA63D.quest_subtitle: "Drawing pentacles without a headache."
	quest.36CCFE6F632CA63D.title: "&6Bind an Apprentice Ritual Satchel"
	quest.36D26DCBF75AB56A.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Livingrock&r in the corners, &e4 redstone blocks&r on the sides, a &6Manasteel ingot&r in the middle."
		""
		"Every mana burst that hits the &6Mana Fluxfield&r becomes Forge Energy and goes to cables or machines right next to it. A spreader in front of a row of Endoflames becomes a small generator that way."
	]
	quest.36D26DCBF75AB56A.quest_subtitle: "The Mana Fluxfield for the engineers."
	quest.36D26DCBF75AB56A.title: "&bTurn mana into power"
	quest.36EDB6B17D96E31E.quest_desc: [
		"A &6diamond&r through the Enrichment Chamber becomes an &6Enriched Diamond&r, which gives &e80 mB&r of diamond in the Metallurgic Infuser. Diamond dust gives only 10 mB."
		""
		"That way one diamond is enough for four Reinforced Alloys or eight Refined Obsidian Dust."
	]
	quest.36EDB6B17D96E31E.quest_subtitle: "One diamond, 80 mB."
	quest.36EDB6B17D96E31E.title: "&bEnrich diamonds"
	quest.36F318EFA37546D5.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Ritual Brazier&r in the middle, &e3 Manipulation Essences&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Dominion Wand: first on the brazier, then on the &6Ritual Brazier Relay&r. The ritual then works at the relay, while the original brazier keeps paying the Source. Range &e15 blocks&r, several braziers may use the same relay."
		""
		"&eTip:&r That way all braziers stand in one place with their jars, and Harvest or Fertility still work in the middle of the field."
	]
	quest.36F318EFA37546D5.quest_subtitle: "The ritual works somewhere else."
	quest.36F318EFA37546D5.title: "&aBuild a Brazier Relay"
	quest.36FB2686CB33709E.quest_desc: [
		"Dig all the way down, just above bedrock, until you have &e8 diamonds&r. Ultimine takes the whole vein in one go."
		""
		"You need diamonds for the enchanting table, obsidian, Silent Gear and some magic devices."
	]
	quest.36FB2686CB33709E.quest_subtitle: "Deep down it will sparkle."
	quest.36FB2686CB33709E.title: "&bFind diamonds"
	quest.36FC70F511228615.quest_desc: [
		"A block of &6wool&r and a &6wooden slab&r make a &6seat&r. Glue a few of them into a carriage: whoever sits down rides along, sneaking gets off."
		""
		"With the departure condition &ePlayers Seated&r the train leaves as soon as enough people are seated. A taxi to the obelisk for everyone who wants to get to the stream."
	]
	quest.36FC70F511228615.quest_subtitle: "Seats for the passengers."
	quest.36FC70F511228615.title: "&6Build a passenger carriage"
	quest.3703449D8AFB77AE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_runes_terrasteel.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Throw one &6Manasteel ingot&r, one &6Mana Pearl&r and one &6Mana Diamond&r onto the finished plate. It draws &d500,000 mana&r, then a &aTerrasteel ingot&r lies there."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/terrasteel_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&cCareful:&r If you pick up an ingredient, it aborts and &call the mana is gone&r."
		""
		"You need Terrasteel for the Terra Blade and armour, one per Rune Core, 50 for the obelisk and in stage 3 as nuggets for the portal and Natura Pylons."
	]
	quest.3703449D8AFB77AE.quest_subtitle: "Half a pool for one ingot."
	quest.3703449D8AFB77AE.title: "&a&lForge Terrasteel"
	quest.370391FE38BBD442.quest_desc: [
		"One check per loot:"
		""
		"&6Dweller&r and &6Greater Dweller:&r Raw Dweller Meat, leather."
		"&6Gloomper:&r Raw Gloomper Leg, leather."
		"&6Gwibling:&r Raw Gwibling, bone meal."
		"&6Mog:&r Mogmoss, Depthrock Pebble. &6S'Mog:&r Blue Mogmoss."
		"&6Scintling:&r Scintling Goo Ball. &6Muncher:&r Cloggrum and Froststeel nuggets."
	]
	quest.370391FE38BBD442.quest_subtitle: "Every animal with its loot."
	quest.370391FE38BBD442.title: "&aChecklist: Animals"
	quest.370E2FC1062A001C.quest_desc: [
		"Catch a &6Yellow Carpenter Bee&r and a &6Green Carpenter Bee&r from wood nests, release them together and give both a &6flower&r. The child is a &6Lumber Bee&r, which nibbles logs nearby and drops wood in the hive."
		""
		"Every breeding works like this: two bees of different kinds, both fed, and the child is what EMI shows under &eBee Breeding&r for that pair. Children grow by themselves, faster with Honey Treats."
		""
		"&eMore jobs:&r &6Quarry Bee&r (Chocolate Mining and Digger Bee) collects stone chips, &6Rancher Bee&r (Lumber and Sweat Bee) milks and shears, &6Farmer Bee&r (Lumber and Rancher) harvests fields, &6CuBee&r (Farmer and Rancher) puts animals in the mood. A normal bee fed a &6hopper&r becomes a &6Collector Bee&r, which carries items from the ground into the hive."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The &6BaBee Upgrade&r (base, four comb blocks, four flowers) in the Expansion Box lets the bees in the hive breed by themselves with a 5 percent chance per visit."
	]
	quest.370E2FC1062A001C.quest_subtitle: "Two parents, flowers, a child with a new job."
	quest.370E2FC1062A001C.title: "&a&lBreed Your First Bee"
	quest.371C8FF4BE9AB694.quest_desc: [
		"&e5 Edelwood Planks&r in a bucket shape."
		""
		"The wooden bucket holds &e4 buckets&r of water, lava, milk or powder snow. Filled with lava it eventually chars in your pocket, so better use it for water and milk."
	]
	quest.371C8FF4BE9AB694.quest_subtitle: "Four buckets in one."
	quest.371C8FF4BE9AB694.title: "&2Carve an Edelwood Bucket"
	quest.3731E360C6DB4730.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r two &6Electron Tubes&r on the left, &6Control Chip&r top middle, &6brass sheet&r in the middle, &6redstone torch&r on the right, three stone at the bottom give the &6Sequenced Pulse Generator&r."
		""
		"Right click opens its program: a timed list of signals it plays as soon as a signal comes from behind. Then it waits for the next one. A signal from the side cancels, a comparator reads the progress. With it one button opens first the gate, then the barrier, then the lamp, in exactly that order."
		""
		"The &6Linked Transmitter&r is a converted Redstone Link: right click a lever, button or analog lever, and its signal is transmitted wirelessly up to 128 blocks to receivers on the same frequency. Honeycomb waxes it against misclicks, the axe removes the wax again."
	]
	quest.3731E360C6DB4730.quest_subtitle: "Sequenced Pulse Generator and Linked Transmitter."
	quest.3731E360C6DB4730.title: "&6Program Redstone"
	quest.3737D2A7DB049D7F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Draconium Ingots&r in the four corners, &6Deepsilver&r from Eternal Starlight on the four sides, a &6diamond&r in the middle."
		""
		"{image:draconicevolution:textures/item/components/draconium_core.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The Fusion Crafting Core, injectors, Generator, pylons, Particle Generator and all cores of the Wyvern tier need one or more of them. Make eight right away."
	]
	quest.3737D2A7DB049D7F.quest_subtitle: "The part for almost everything."
	quest.3737D2A7DB049D7F.title: "&5&lBuild a Draconium Core"
	quest.37449FDD50CEB9E3.quest_desc: [
		"All four have the same recipe as the Harvester Pylon, only the block in the middle is different. They open with &estage 2&r."
		""
		"&6Infusion Pylon&r (emerald block): charge a &6Potion Filter&r with a potion effect by right clicking it with the effect active, one hour of effect duration in total. After that the pylon gives you the effect everywhere, no matter how far away you are. Up to strength IV, no Absorption."
		""
		"&6Interdiction Pylon&r (netherite block): prevents mob spawns in a chunk area, filter via &6Mob Filter&r. &6Expulsion Pylon&r (diamond block): throws other players out of up to 2 chunks around the pylon, only in the Overworld. &6Protection Pylon&r (honeycomb block): stops you yourself from breaking blocks or animals from the filter."
	]
	quest.37449FDD50CEB9E3.quest_subtitle: "Four pylons for stage 2."
	quest.37449FDD50CEB9E3.title: "&dRead What the Other Pylons Do"
	quest.3746F93CEBAB57B1.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nether_ig_kill.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put the &6Burning Ashes&r on the &6Altar of Fire&r in the arena. &cIgnis&r appears: &e450 health&r, armour 10, heavy sword blows and fireballs."
		""
		"Hits over 20 are capped, no more than 14 per second get through, and from 15 blocks away you barely do damage. It heals from its hits. Fire resistance, golden apples and lots of people."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r &e3 Ignitium ingots&r, a music disc with 10 percent. After that, the Ignited Berserkers awaken in the Nether fortresses."
	]
	quest.3746F93CEBAB57B1.quest_subtitle: "Ashes on the altar, and the fire rises."
	quest.3746F93CEBAB57B1.title: "&c&lDefeat Ignis"
	quest.3757A743E3A31403.quest_desc: [
		"&6Inferium Axe&r, &6Inferium Pickaxe&r and &6Inferium Shovel&r side by side in the top row, &e2 sticks&r on top of each other below: the &6Inferium Paxel&r from &aMystical Agradditions&r."
		""
		"The paxel mines stone, wood and dirt with one tool and saves two hotbar slots. It costs three finished Inferium tools, so 6 ingots and 6 gemstones. With a paxel you no longer need the three single tools."
	]
	quest.3757A743E3A31403.quest_subtitle: "Mystical Agradditions: three tools in one."
	quest.3757A743E3A31403.title: "&aBuild an Inferium Paxel"
	quest.375C42F435FB21A6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Inverted Potentia&r: &e4 Dark Gems&r around a &6Potentia Sphere&r. Throw it at a Dark Temple's Environmental Accumulator during a &ethunderstorm&r, then it becomes the &6Empowered Inverted Potentia&r."
		"Mace: two Dark Power Gems, the Empowered Potentia top right, two Dark Sticks as the handle."
		""
		"Holding right click builds up a sphere, letting go pushes all creatures in it away and hurts them, as long as there is blood in the tank. Sneak right click chooses the strength, higher ones cost more blood."
	]
	quest.375C42F435FB21A6.quest_subtitle: "A shockwave of blood."
	quest.375C42F435FB21A6.title: "&cSwing the Mace of Distortion"
	quest.37719D3B37B6475B.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &62 Manasteel blocks&r into the portal, &61 Elementium block&r comes back, so 9 ingots in one trade."
		""
		"&eWhy:&r Every trade costs 500 mana, no matter how big. Blocks save mana. An ingot and a block together give 5 ingots."
	]
	quest.37719D3B37B6475B.quest_subtitle: "One trade, nine ingots."
	quest.37719D3B37B6475B.title: "&dTrade Whole Blocks"
	quest.3771E1B2BAFF5EC4.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Druckluftrohr&r formlos mit vier &6Kammerwänden&r ergibt vier &6Kammerventile&r (Pressure Chamber Valve). Ein &6Trichter&r mit zwei Kammerwänden ergibt zwei &6Kammerschnittstellen&r (Pressure Chamber Interface)."
		""
		"Das &eVentil&r ist der Anschluss für die Luft, dort kommt das Rohr vom Kompressor an. Die &eSchnittstelle&r schleust Gegenstände durch die Wand: eine mit dem &eI&r nach außen nimmt auf, eine mit dem &eO&r nach außen gibt fertige Sachen ab. Jeder Gegenstand kostet dabei &e1 000 mL&r Luft."
		""
		"Du brauchst mindestens ein Ventil. Zwei Schnittstellen sind die Empfehlung, sonst musst du alles von Hand hineinwerfen und wieder herausfischen."
	]
	quest.3771E1B2BAFF5EC4.quest_subtitle: "Luft rein, Gegenstände rein und raus."
	quest.3771E1B2BAFF5EC4.title: "&7Ventil und Schnittstellen"
	quest.377B2C0BF51B169B.quest_desc: [
		"Kreis ohne Tuch aus 2 Diamant- und 1 Smaragdpulver, er erschafft einen See. Ein &everzaubertes Schwert&r hinein, für 5 000 Mana kommt &6Caliburn&r zurück. Kapitel &cMahou Tsukai&r."
		""
		"Schaden des alten Schwerts plus ein Bonus für seine Verzauberungen, und Untote fliehen davor."
	]
	quest.377B2C0BF51B169B.quest_subtitle: "Mahou Tsukai: ein Schwert für 5 000 Mana."
	quest.377B2C0BF51B169B.title: "&6Zieh Caliburn aus dem See"
	quest.378D44026E7721E3.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: &6bread&r, &6beef patty&r, &6cabbage leaf&r, &6tomato&r and &6onion&r."
		""
		"You grill the patty in the furnace from &6minced beef&r, which the knife cuts from raw beef at the cutting board."
	]
	quest.378D44026E7721E3.quest_subtitle: "Minced beef, patty, bun."
	quest.378D44026E7721E3.title: "&6Build a hamburger"
	quest.3794F3541B11A4F9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_advanced_miner.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Atomic Alloy, circuit, Atomic Alloy at the top. &6Logistical Sorter&r, &6Robit&r, sorter in the middle. Teleportation Core, Steel Casing, Teleportation Core at the bottom."
		""
		"Set the radius up to &e32 blocks&r, the Y range and filters (an ore tag, for example), start. &e80 ticks&r per block without upgrades, &d400 FE/t&r. Silk Touch costs twelve times as much power."
		""
		"A chest or a transporter at the back, auto-eject on, an Anchor Upgrade in it, then it keeps running while you are away."
	]
	quest.3794F3541B11A4F9.quest_subtitle: "It mines what you tell it."
	quest.3794F3541B11A4F9.title: "&6&lSet up a Digital Miner"
	quest.379A5D8E0884E384.quest_desc: [
		"You make the &6Blazegold Sword&r like the pickaxe, with the template from the Ferricore sword. &6Cauterize Wounds:&r two &6golden apples&r on top and bottom, two &6magma cream&r left and right around a &6Blank Upgrade&r."
		""
		"Triggered, it heals you instantly and costs some durability. Then it needs a break before it works again. Put it on a key of its own, then you always have it ready in a fight."
	]
	quest.379A5D8E0884E384.quest_subtitle: "Blazegold sword with Cauterize Wounds."
	quest.379A5D8E0884E384.title: "&cHeal Yourself with the Sword"
	quest.37A293ABE1A8F205.quest_desc: [
		"If the game hangs for a long time while loading, stutters briefly every few seconds or crashes with &7OutOfMemory&r, Minecraft has too little &ememory&r. In &6Prism Launcher&r you set it under &eEdit Instance, Settings, Java&r, in the &6Modrinth App&r in the instance options under &eJava and memory&r."
		""
		"Rule of thumb for this pack: &e6 to 8 GB&r, and never more than half of what your computer has. More does not help, Minecraft does not use it any better."
		""
		"The pack needs &eJava 21&r. Both launchers bring it along, you don't have to install anything."
	]
	quest.37A293ABE1A8F205.quest_subtitle: "230 mods need more than vanilla."
	quest.37A293ABE1A8F205.title: "&6Give the game enough memory"
	quest.37CC24DE838AEDF0.quest_desc: [
		"Blood standing in the world dries over time into &6Hardened Blood&r. Smash it with &6flint and steel&r, then &6Hardened Blood Shards&r drop. With a pickaxe or fist it only turns liquid again."
		""
		"Faster: mine a Hardened Blood block with &6Silk Touch&r and smelt it in the furnace, that gives &e9 shards&r at once. For the first Infusion Core you need 8."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Dungeon, village and fortress chests often hold &6Condensed Blood&r. Each piece gives half a bucket in a blood machine."
	]
	quest.37CC24DE838AEDF0.quest_subtitle: "Dried blood, smashed."
	quest.37CC24DE838AEDF0.title: "&4Collect Hardened Blood Shards"
	quest.37CE25706208409B.quest_desc: [
		"Crafter recipe: five &6resistor coils&r on top, below them &6copper sheets&r and a &6conductive casing&r make the &6boiler heater&r. Put it under a basin, like a Blaze Burner."
		""
		"It heats with power from your grid. With enough power it reaches the highest heat level, &csuperheated&r, without any blaze cake."
		""
		"A wattmeter in the line shows how much power it is drawing right now."
	]
	quest.37CE25706208409B.quest_subtitle: "Power Grid: the boiler heater."
	quest.37CE25706208409B.title: "&3Heat a basin with power"
	quest.37D281EEB924371D.quest_desc: [
		"The CNC Stamper in the middle of the installer pattern (redstone, circuits, iron) gives the &6Basic Stamping Factory&r. With Advanced Control Circuits it becomes advanced."
		""
		"Every MoreMachine machine has factories of its own. Elite and ultimate come in stage 4."
	]
	quest.37D281EEB924371D.quest_subtitle: "Three presses in one block."
	quest.37D281EEB924371D.title: "&3Make a stamping factory"
	quest.37E1A7E54EDBC0F0.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Smelting Upgrade&r in the middle, top &6diamond&r, &6hopper&r, diamond, middle &6redstone&r on the left and a hopper on the right, bottom &6gold ingot&r, hopper, gold ingot."
		""
		"Unlike the simple Smelting Upgrade, it takes ore and fuel from the backpack itself and puts the ingots back in. In the filter you set what gets smelted."
	]
	quest.37E1A7E54EDBC0F0.quest_subtitle: "The Auto-Smelting Upgrade."
	quest.37E1A7E54EDBC0F0.title: "Let the backpack smelt on its own"
	quest.37E6700350A65082.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6Arcane Crystal Dust&r around a &6potion of Regeneration II&r give an &6Aureal Bottle&r. In the Aureal slot it gives &e35 Aureal&r, drunk it fills your own Aureal by 35 (you carry at most 100)."
		""
		"You need your own Aureal for the &6Magic Wand&r (Edelwood Stick, Deorum Ingot, Arcane Crystal diagonally): charge for 1.5 seconds, a projectile for 5 Aureal and 5 magic damage. And for the Quantum Catcher, see rituals."
		""
		"&eTip:&r For the forge, obelisks are cheaper. Bottles pay off when a ritual is just 100 Aureal short."
	]
	quest.37E6700350A65082.quest_subtitle: "The essence you carry yourself."
	quest.37E6700350A65082.title: "&dBrew Aureal Bottles"
	quest.37EA1D7DAAE26C90.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6dispenser&r in the middle, &e2 gold ingots&r, &e2 blaze rods&r and &e4 gunpowder&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"The cannon takes potions from bottles and potion flasks in your inventory and fires them as splash potions. Which one, you choose in the selection wheel."
	]
	quest.37EA1D7DAAE26C90.quest_subtitle: "Throw potions without brewing splash potions."
	quest.37EA1D7DAAE26C90.title: "&dBuild a Splash Flask Cannon"
	quest.37EB4DD214F449A0.quest_desc: [
		"&6ME Storage Bus:&r shapeless from an &6ME Interface&r and two &6pistons&r. Put it on a cable in front of a chest, a barrel or a drawer."
		""
		"What lies in that block shows in the terminal, and the network stores into it. Drawers count no types, so a drawer wall with a storage bus is often better than a cell. How to build the wall is in the chapter &6Storage&r."
	]
	quest.37EB4DD214F449A0.quest_subtitle: "The storage bus turns chests into cells."
	quest.37EB4DD214F449A0.title: "&6Hang a drawer wall on the network"
	quest.37EF820F3FAEADA8.quest_desc: [
		"Crafter recipe: four &6iron sheets&r, six &6copper coils&r, two &6magnets&r, one &6shaft&r and one &6conductive casing&r make the &6electric motor&r."
		""
		"Its speed depends on the voltage, it supplies &d64 SU per RPM&r. That way a power plant at the river drives a factory at the other end of the base through wires."
		""
		"With a &6precision mechanism&r it becomes the &6constant speed motor&r: fixed speed, the voltage decides load and direction."
	]
	quest.37EF820F3FAEADA8.quest_subtitle: "The electric motor, 64 SU per RPM."
	quest.37EF820F3FAEADA8.title: "&3Drive a shaft with power"
	quest.37F16548492AB61D.quest_desc: [
		"Like the Volcanic one, but a &6glistering melon slice&r in the middle."
		""
		"It makes Source when animals are bred or creatures die nearby, plus a little on its own for every baby animal. The babies grow faster. Next to an animal farm it works on the side."
	]
	quest.37F16548492AB61D.quest_subtitle: "Breeding and death bring Source."
	quest.37F16548492AB61D.title: "&aBuild a Vitalic Sourcelink"
	quest.37FA09E6BF325E63.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ihagan's Enthrallment."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6honeycomb&r, &6honey block&r, &6honey bottle&r, &6honeycomb block&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r a &6chicken&r. Start with the Djinni book."
		""
		"The bee always poisons, stings faster and calls for backup. Come in armour. Defeated, it drops &6Cursed Honey&r, the ingredient of orange chalk."
	]
	quest.37FA09E6BF325E63.quest_subtitle: "The only way to Cursed Honey."
	quest.37FA09E6BF325E63.title: "&5Summon a Possessed Bee"
	quest.37FA3A0C41F3F520.quest_desc: [
		"&6Quantum press:&r logic press at the top, engineering press at the bottom, a Shattered Singularity in the middle. Quantum Alloy under the press, then press it finished with redstone and printed silicon."
		""
		"&cStage 5:&r The &6Quantum Computer&r (CPU with no limit for simultaneous jobs) and the &6quantum armor&r need many of them. Whoever hoards now builds them right away then."
	]
	quest.37FA3A0C41F3F520.quest_subtitle: "The fourth press."
	quest.37FA3A0C41F3F520.title: "&dBuild Quantum Processors"
	quest.3811E59305462553.quest_desc: [
		"Zuerst den &6Kinetischen Dynamo&r setzen, dann die &6Windmühle&r (acht Blätter um Eisen) oder das &6Wasserrad&r an seine Wellenseite. Strom über einen LV-Anschluss am Dynamo."
		""
		"&eImmersive Engineering, Dynamo:&r Brennstoff Wind oder Wasser. Die Windmühle zählt die freien Blöcke in einem 9 x 9 x 7 Raum vor sich: völlig frei und ohne Segel etwa &d17 FE/t&r, mit acht &6Segeln&r rund &d50 FE/t&r, im Gewitter etwa das Doppelte. Bis drei Wasserräder treiben einen Dynamo, je mehr fließendes Wasser, desto mehr. Offen ab Stufe 2, siehe Kapitel &6Immersive Engineering&r."
	]
	quest.3811E59305462553.quest_subtitle: "Immersive Engineering, Dynamo mit Windmühle oder Wasserrad."
	quest.3811E59305462553.title: "&6Häng eine Windmühle an den Dynamo"
	quest.381652550AB417EB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_windmill.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Windmill Bearing&r: wooden slab, stone, shaft. Build the sails in front of it, connect everything with &6Super Glue&r and right-click the bearing."
		""
		"Every &e8 sails&r give &d1 RPM&r, and each RPM carries &d512 SU&r. 32 sails run at 4 RPM and carry 2,048 SU, as much as eight water wheels."
		""
		"Nothing may be in the way around the sails. You set the direction in the bearing's value box."
	]
	quest.381652550AB417EB.quest_subtitle: "Power without water, only with space."
	quest.381652550AB417EB.title: "&6Get the windmill running"
	quest.3821E89A4C376966.quest_desc: [
		"&6Vanilla&r, &6Trichter&r: zieht aus dem Block darüber und schiebt in den Block vor der Spitze, &e1 Gegenstand alle 8 Ticks&r, 5 Plätze, kein Filter. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Fünf Eisenbarren um eine Truhe. Ein Trichter in eine Kiste, aus der ein anderer Trichter zieht, ist der älteste Zwischenspeicher der Welt. Ein Redstone-Signal hält ihn an."
	]
	quest.3821E89A4C376966.quest_subtitle: "Vanilla, Trichter: 2,5 Stück pro Sekunde, kein Filter."
	quest.3821E89A4C376966.title: "Setz einen Trichter"
	quest.3828F18000825CC2.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 Sage&r around a &6string&r make a &6Sage Bundle&r. Hang it on the Drying Rack, after &e200 seconds&r it is a &6Dried Sage Bundle&r."
	]
	quest.3828F18000825CC2.quest_subtitle: "Fuel for the burning plate."
	quest.3828F18000825CC2.title: "&6Tie and dry a sage bundle"
	quest.382BCDE2BBBD5554.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Regalium Ore&r between &eY 0 and Y 12&r, only 3 small veins per chunk. It gives &6Regalium Crystals&r."
		""
		"Regalium is not a tool metal. It is the currency of the Stoneborn, 9 crystals make a block."
	]
	quest.382BCDE2BBBD5554.quest_subtitle: "Rare and all the way down."
	quest.382BCDE2BBBD5554.title: "&eFind Regalium"
	quest.382C07A0B20D63BA.quest_desc: [
		"Throw the &6Impure White Chalk&r into Spiritfire. Out comes &fWhite Chalk&r, usable from &6stage 2&r."
		""
		"Right click on a block draws a sign. For rituals only &ecolour&r and &eposition&r count, not the symbol. Every chalk wears out."
		""
		"The patterns of chalk, candles and skulls are called &5pentacles&r. On every ritual page in the Dictionary a blue link at the top leads to the matching pentacle, with a preview in the world."
	]
	quest.382C07A0B20D63BA.quest_subtitle: "Every summoner's tool."
	quest.382C07A0B20D63BA.title: "&f&lPurify white chalk"
	quest.382C1E9144D1B45D.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Glowstone dust in the corners, a Calculation Processor at the top, three 16k components left, right and bottom, a &6sky ingot&r from Nature's Aura in the middle instead of the quartz glass."
		""
		"This chapter continues &eApplied Energistics 2&r. With &6stage 4, the Star Works&r, 64k and 256k, the quantum bridge, spatial storage, &6MEGA Cells&r up to 4M, &6Advanced AE&r without the quantum computer and the Ex machines of &6Extended AE&r open."
		""
		"&cStage 5:&r MEGA 16M to 256M, the bulk cell, the Compression Card, the quantum computer and the quantum armor."
	]
	quest.382C1E9144D1B45D.quest_subtitle: "The first step beyond 16k."
	quest.382C1E9144D1B45D.title: "&b&lBuild a 64k Component"
	quest.382D4F037A92C5A3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_brass_mixing.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"From the bottom: &6Blaze Burner&r with coal, &6basin&r, one block of air, &6Mechanical Mixer&r. In: &6two copper ingots&r, &6one zinc ingot&r, &6one blaze powder&r."
		"{image:create:textures/item/brass_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r That gives &eone&r brass ingot. Other ways (alloy furnace, foundry, Oritech, brass bee) no longer make brass."
		""
		"&cMixer standing still?&r If the burner only smoulders, fuel is missing. If one of the three ingredients is missing, it doesn't stir."
	]
	quest.382D4F037A92C5A3.quest_subtitle: "Copper, zinc and a breath of blaze."
	quest.382D4F037A92C5A3.title: "&6Mix brass in the heated basin"
	quest.3833D03F6FCCC0EE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Melonshelf:&r three &6melons&r on top and bottom, in the middle glistering melon slice, bookshelf, glistering melon slice. It lowers &dQuanta&r by 10 percent and Eterna by 2."
		""
		"Other shelves shift the values in a targeted way: the &6Stoneshelf&r (six polished andesite, three books) lowers &5Arcana&r by 7.5 and Eterna by 3. The &6Beeshelf&r (beehives, honeycombs, honey blocks around a shelf) raises Quanta by 100 and lowers Eterna by 30."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r Some infusions ask for Quanta or Arcana in a narrow range. With these shelves you hit it without rebuilding the whole room."
	]
	quest.3833D03F6FCCC0EE.quest_subtitle: "Less randomness, more targeted books."
	quest.3833D03F6FCCC0EE.title: "&aTune the Table with Melonshelves"
	quest.3839EC013C49464F.quest_desc: [
		"In the heated cauldron with &e1 000 mB&r of Potion of Swiftness: a &6Coffer&r, an &6echo shard&r, &e2 eyes of ender&r, &e4 Moon Dust&r. Out come &e2&r Entangled Coffers."
		""
		"Both share one inventory, wherever they stand. One in the base, one at the farm or at the neighbour's: what you put into one also lies in the other."
	]
	quest.3839EC013C49464F.quest_subtitle: "Two chests, one content."
	quest.3839EC013C49464F.title: "&5Entangle two Coffers"
	quest.384464F097DB4B4B.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6diamond&r, one &6copper, silver&r and &6gold ingot&r each, a &6Fragile Soul Gem&r, &e3 soul sand&r or soul soil."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book."
		""
		"Right click on a creature catches it, another right click releases it. Bosses don't fit in. That way you bring animals, villagers or spirits to their destination without a lead."
	]
	quest.384464F097DB4B4B.quest_subtitle: "A creature in your pocket."
	quest.384464F097DB4B4B.title: "&6Bind a Soul Gem"
	quest.385A70A310BB363C.quest_desc: [
		"Stell einen &6Rahmenblock&r auf und klick ihn mit einem beliebigen &6Vollblock&r an. Der Block wird verbraucht, und der Rahmen sieht ab jetzt aus wie er. Mit dem &6Rahmenhammer&r (zwei Rahmenblöcke, zwei Stöcke) holst du die Tarnung wieder heraus."
		""
		"{image:framedblocks:textures/item/framed_hammer.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eLicht ab Stufe 2:&r Klick einen getarnten Rahmen mit &6Glowstone-Staub&r an, und er leuchtet mit Lichtstärke 15, ohne dass sich sein Aussehen ändert. Glowstone kommt aus dem Nether, der mit Stufe 2 öffnet. Bis dahin: eine Rahmenlaterne aus der Säge."
		""
		"Blöcke mit Inventar (Truhen, Öfen) gehen nicht als Tarnung. Doppelte Formen wie die Doppelstufe nehmen zwei Tarnungen, eine pro Hälfte."
	]
	quest.385A70A310BB363C.quest_subtitle: "Rechtsklick mit einem Block, fertig."
	quest.385A70A310BB363C.title: "&6Tarne einen Rahmen"
	quest.385B4DD277CDEC98.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/gaia_arena.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"One Gaia Pylon each &e4 blocks diagonally&r from the beacon and &e1 block higher&r, in all four directions. Around it a clear, flat area with a &e12 block radius&r, with no blocks in the way and no holes."
		""
		"&eStarting:&r Sneak right click the beacon with the Terrasteel Ingot, step back. A real player has to do this, not a Deployer."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Build a permanent arena for the whole server and leave it standing."
	]
	quest.385B4DD277CDEC98.quest_subtitle: "A clear space, otherwise the beacon accepts nothing."
	quest.385B4DD277CDEC98.title: "&dBuild the Arena"
	quest.385C6799DC742026.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r acht &6Plastic Sheets&r um ein &6Printed Circuit Board&r ergeben acht &6Programming Puzzles&r."
		""
		"Jedes Teil im Programm kostet beim Schreiben ein Puzzleteil. Überschreibst du die Drohne mit einem kürzeren Programm, bekommst du die Teile zurück. Ein einfaches Programm hat sechs bis zehn Teile, also mach gleich eine Kiste voll."
	]
	quest.385C6799DC742026.quest_subtitle: "Acht Plastik, ein PCB, acht Teile."
	quest.385C6799DC742026.title: "&5Mach Programming Puzzles"
	quest.38697538D116B810.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Iron Plate&r on top, glass pane, &6Incandescent Light Bulb&r, glass pane in the middle, a &6Copper Wire&r at the bottom make the &6Powered Lantern&r. Light bulbs are made at the workbench with the Components blueprint."
		""
		"It hangs straight on an LV wire and passes the power on, so you can connect several in a row. It draws only &d1 FE/t&r."
		""
		"&eThe best part:&r As long as it has power, no hostile monsters spawn within &e32 blocks&r. A few of them protect a whole base."
	]
	quest.38697538D116B810.quest_subtitle: "Light, and no monsters around."
	quest.38697538D116B810.title: "&eHang up Powered Lanterns"
	quest.38717A01E8CB085A.quest_desc: [
		"Acht &6Verstärkte Ziegel&r im Ring ergeben 16 &6Kammerwände&r (Pressure Chamber Wall). Mit einem &6Glas&r in der Mitte werden es 16 &6Kammergläser&r, die genauso tragen, aber durchsichtig sind."
		""
		"Eine 3x3x3-Kammer braucht 26 Blöcke in der Hülle. Rechne mit 20 Wänden oder Gläsern, der Rest sind Ventil und Schnittstellen aus dem nächsten Schritt."
	]
	quest.38717A01E8CB085A.quest_subtitle: "Acht Ziegel, sechzehn Wände."
	quest.38717A01E8CB085A.title: "&7Bau Kammerwände"
	quest.3876D429D5CE1277.quest_desc: [
		"In the water cauldron: a &6chain&r, &e4 candles&r, &e3 iron ingots&r. That is the &6Candelabra&r."
		""
		"Unlike single candles it never goes out. It stands on a block or hangs below one, on chains too."
	]
	quest.3876D429D5CE1277.quest_subtitle: "Candles that never go out."
	quest.3876D429D5CE1277.title: "&6Build a candelabra"
	quest.388E238B3070EB61.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: &e4 lapis lazuli&r, &e4 Source Gems&r, &6Blank Parchment&r."
		""
		"Using it while sneaking saves the location, using it normally takes you there and uses up the scroll. Not across dimensions."
	]
	quest.388E238B3070EB61.quest_subtitle: "Home once, please."
	quest.388E238B3070EB61.title: "&6Write a Warp Scroll"
	quest.38935DC4215FFC4E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/logistics_laser_node.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Logic Chip:&r redstone, gold nuggets, clay and a quartz block give four raw chips, fired in a furnace. A chip, glass, redstone and iron give a &6Laser Connector&r, a connector in iron and glass panes a &6Laser Node&r."
		""
		"With the &6Laser Wrench&r you click one node, then a second. At most &e8 blocks&r apart, for longer distances you put Laser Connectors in between. All linked nodes form one network."
	]
	quest.38935DC4215FFC4E.quest_subtitle: "Logistics without cables."
	quest.38935DC4215FFC4E.title: "&cLink two Laser Nodes"
	quest.389B283F7B0E73C7.quest_desc: [
		"&eSo geht es:&r Gib einem &6Banner&r am Amboss einen Namen und stell es auf. Klick mit einer Karte, die den Ort zeigt, auf das Banner: Auf der Karte erscheint ein Fähnchen in seiner Farbe, mit Namen."
		""
		"&eWofür:&r Eine große Karte am Spawn mit dem Banner jeder Basis, in einem Rahmen an der Wand, zeigt allen, wer wo wohnt. Am &6Kartentisch&r vergrößerst und kopierst du die Karte."
	]
	quest.389B283F7B0E73C7.quest_subtitle: "Deine Basis als Fähnchen auf jeder Karte."
	quest.389B283F7B0E73C7.title: "&6Markier die Karte mit Bannern"
	quest.38A89DD0539242D1.quest_desc: [
		"Power, tools and armor, transport and storage, dimensions and travel: one line per thing, one checkmark, sorted by stage. For looking things up, not for working through."
	]
	quest.38A89DD0539242D1.quest_subtitle: "Every generator, every tool, every path."
	quest.38A89DD0539242D1.title: "&6Open the Checklists"
	quest.38C6C1ABC1A9F762.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Andesit-Trichter&r: zieht einzelne Gegenstände aus Inventaren aufs Band oder vom Band hinein, je nachdem, ob du ihn normal oder schleichend setzt. &6Andesit-Tunnel&r teilen vom Band genau einen Gegenstand pro Stapel zur Seite ab. Kein Filter. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Andesitlegierung über getrocknetem Seetang ergibt zwei Trichter. Ein Redstone-Signal hält jeden Trichter an."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r &6Messing-Trichter&r ziehen ganze Stapel und haben einen Filter, &6Messing-Tunnel&r sortieren und verteilen (Aufteilen, Rundlauf, Nächster zuerst), siehe Kapitel Create: Messing."
	]
	quest.38C6C1ABC1A9F762.quest_subtitle: "Create, Andesit-Trichter: ein Gegenstand pro Vorgang auf und vom Band."
	quest.38C6C1ABC1A9F762.title: "Setz Trichter und Tunnel von Create"
	quest.38E89E8B696B9BD8.quest_desc: [
		"Hülle aus Casing und Glas, innen frei gesetzte &6Brennstoffzellen&r, Moderatoren und Kühlkörper, ein &6Controller&r und ein &6Port&r in der Wand. Netto-Hitze auf null, Redstone-Signal zündet. Im Energie-Modus kommt Strom aus dem Port, im Siede-Modus Dampf für die &6Dampfturbine&r."
		""
		"&eNuclearCraft, Spaltreaktor:&r Brennstoff LEU-235 und andere Brennstoffe, Ausstoß hängt von Zellen und Moderatoren ab. Kernschmelze etwa wie TNT. &eDampfturbine:&r ein Multiblock mit Rotorblättern und Spulen, 5 bis 17 Blöcke Kante, 2 000 mB Dampf je Blatt, Strom aus dem Dampf des Reaktors. &eZerfallsgenerator:&r Strom aus radioaktiven Blöcken daneben, die er langsam zu Blei zerfallen lässt. Offen ab Stufe 4, siehe Kapitel &6NuclearCraft&r."
	]
	quest.38E89E8B696B9BD8.quest_subtitle: "NuclearCraft: Spaltreaktor, Dampfturbine, Zerfallsgenerator."
	quest.38E89E8B696B9BD8.title: "&aFahr den NuclearCraft-Spaltreaktor an"
	quest.38ED8781794BA9B3.quest_desc: [
		"Each shapeless from &6Pixie Dust&r, &6Manasteel&r and a rune: &eDispersive&r (water) charges mana items of nearby players, &eDominant&r (fire) pulls mana from pools with normal sparks, &eRecessive&r (earth) spreads its mana to the others, &eIsolated&r (air) stays out of everything."
		""
		"Augments only go onto sparks above Mana Pools, one per spark."
		""
		"The &6Spark Tinkerer&r (2 Elementium, 3 Livingrock, redstone) next to a pool swaps its augment with a spark's on a redstone signal."
	]
	quest.38ED8781794BA9B3.quest_subtitle: "Steer mana between pools."
	quest.38ED8781794BA9B3.title: "&dAugment Your Sparks"
	quest.38F1B56EDE51ECA3.quest_desc: [
		"A &6dragon head&r over an &6Endshelf&r and &65 ender pearls&r below make a &6Draconic Endshelf&r."
		""
		"It gives &b20 Eterna&r and raises the limit to &b100&r, the enchanting table's maximum. A few of them replace a whole wall of ordinary shelves."
	]
	quest.38F1B56EDE51ECA3.quest_subtitle: "The last bookshelf."
	quest.38F1B56EDE51ECA3.title: "&5Crown It as a Draconic Endshelf"
	quest.390A6C9E9C22B98E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Impure White Chalk&r, &6glowstone dust&r and &e2 gold dust&r (from the Crusher) shapeless, then into Spiritfire. That is &eYellow Chalk&r (Golden Chalk in game)."
		""
		"Yellow lets spirits enter living creatures. Possessed creatures drop rare loot much more often. Glowstone comes from the Nether, which is open from stage 2."
	]
	quest.390A6C9E9C22B98E.quest_subtitle: "The colour of possession."
	quest.390A6C9E9C22B98E.title: "&eMix yellow chalk"
	quest.392D39A140DD0A3B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_welcome.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Four &6logs&r in the corners, four &6iron ingots&r on the sides, an &6Andesite Casing&r from Create in the middle make a &6Pity Machine Frame&r."
		""
		"&aIndustrial Foregoing&r builds machines that harvest fields, tend animals, process mobs and drill ore with a laser. The mod opens with &6stage 3&r. Every machine sits in one of four frames: Pity, Simple, Advanced, Supreme."
		""
		"A book, a redstone and a dirt block, shapeless, make &6Industrial Foregoing's Manual&r."
	]
	quest.392D39A140DD0A3B.quest_subtitle: "The frame of the first machines."
	quest.392D39A140DD0A3B.title: "&a&lBuild Two Pity Machine Frames"
	quest.3938FCAFCD22C593.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/enderio_smelter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Top gear, &6flint&r, gear. Middle iron, &6Void Chassis&r, iron. Bottom obsidian, a &6Crushing Wheel&r from Create, obsidian. It is the &6SAG Mill&r, and it grinds instead of sawing."
		""
		"One raw iron becomes one &6Powdered Iron&r and, at 80 percent, a second one. Coal becomes &6Powdered Coal&r, sand gives &6Silicon&r at 50 percent."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r More iron from every ore means more steel, and the coal goes straight into the smelter."
	]
	quest.3938FCAFCD22C593.quest_subtitle: "More dust from every ore."
	quest.3938FCAFCD22C593.title: "&7&lBuild a SAG Mill"
	quest.394162B243AC91E2.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Gem-Fused Slate&r, three &6flint&r, three slate in rows give six &6Sigils of Unnaming&r."
		""
		"At the Smithing Table a sigil removes the affix parts from an item's name. The affixes themselves stay, only the name becomes short again."
	]
	quest.394162B243AC91E2.quest_subtitle: "Away with the long name."
	quest.394162B243AC91E2.title: "&7Sigil of Unnaming"
	quest.39433CE0D184C9BD.quest_desc: [
		"Top and bottom &6steel, steel, gold nugget&r, in the middle &6Coil Copper, Coil Copper, iron&r."
	]
	quest.39433CE0D184C9BD.quest_subtitle: "Turns in the separator, assembler and crusher."
	quest.39433CE0D184C9BD.title: "&7Build a Motor"
	quest.39465359444BFF1F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_vault_big.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Iron sheet&r, a &6wooden barrel&r, &6iron sheet&r on top of each other."
		""
		"A Create &6Item Vault&r holds &e20 stacks per block&r. In and out only works with funnels, belts, arms or pipes, not by hand. A comparator on it reports the fill level."
	]
	quest.39465359444BFF1F.quest_subtitle: "The storage at the end of the Create line."
	quest.39465359444BFF1F.title: "&6Build an Item Vault"
	quest.39471A3D24B0C45D.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: &6Novice Spell Book&r, &e1 obsidian&r, &e3 diamonds&r, &e2 quartz blocks&r, &e2 blaze rods&r. Glyphs and saved spells move along."
		""
		"The &6Mage's Spell Book&r can use &etier 2&r glyphs and gives &e+50&r mana and &e+1&r per second. Quartz and blaze rods only come from the Nether."
		""
		"This chapter: new glyphs, Source over long distances, rituals, familiars, turrets and Create."
	]
	quest.39471A3D24B0C45D.quest_subtitle: "The second book: tier 2 glyphs, more mana."
	quest.39471A3D24B0C45D.title: "&d&lBuild the Mage's Spell Book"
	quest.3948F3EBDC55383B.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6anvil&r, &6diamond&r, anvil, middle &6iron ingot&r, upgrade base, iron ingot, bottom a &6wooden chest&r."
		""
		"An anvil in its own tab of the backpack: repair, rename and apply books wherever you are."
	]
	quest.3948F3EBDC55383B.quest_subtitle: "The Anvil Upgrade."
	quest.3948F3EBDC55383B.title: "Take an anvil along"
	quest.394A88F736179AE2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Obsidian&r, &6redstone lamp&r, &6Nebulous Heart&r and &6Catalyzing Gland&r shapeless give the &6Altar of Light&r. Place it under open sky and give it &e3 redstone&r with right click."
		""
		"It works at night, and after 15 to 25 minutes a &6glowstone block&r appears above it. Mine it, new redstone in, keep going. As long as it works, it glows itself with light level 16."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r The &6Tome of Alkahestry&r, which doubles items with redstone charge, needs a wither skeleton skull and many drops and only opens with &6stage 3&r. The altar is its entry point, and glowstone is valuable until then anyway."
	]
	quest.394A88F736179AE2.quest_subtitle: "Glowstone grows from redstone."
	quest.394A88F736179AE2.title: "&eBuild an Altar of Light"
	quest.394F060D274014B2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Lever&r, &6Railway Casing&r and &6precision mechanism&r below each other make the &6Train Controls&r. Put them on the train with the front in the direction of travel. Without them it cannot be assembled."
		""
		"For both directions each end gets its own. A &6seat&r right in front of them is the place for the conductor."
	]
	quest.394F060D274014B2.quest_subtitle: "The driver's cab."
	quest.394F060D274014B2.title: "&6Build Train Controls"
	quest.394FB23B3EFA2DA1.quest_desc: [
		"Collect one &6Indigo Mushroom&r and one &6Blood Mushroom&r each from the bogs."
		""
		"&eThe bogs:&r &6Indigo Mushroom Bog&r, &6Blood Mushroom Bog&r, &6Ink Mushroom Bog&r, &6Veil Mushroom Bog&r and the &6Puff Mushroom Forest&r. The mushrooms become dyes and stews."
	]
	quest.394FB23B3EFA2DA1.quest_subtitle: "Giant mushrooms in four colors."
	quest.394FB23B3EFA2DA1.title: "&5Walk Through the Mushroom Bogs"
	quest.39521344142AA0CA.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Enriched iron around, a &6chest&r in the top middle, a &6Machine Casing&r in the center, an &6Advanced Control Circuit&r from Mekanism in the bottom middle."
		""
		"The &6Disk Drive&r has &e8 slots&r for storage disks. It needs 10 FE/t plus 4 FE/t for each disk in it. Place it right next to the Controller or on a cable."
		""
		"&ePriority:&r In the drive you set the order in which the network stores. Higher number first. With filters in the drive a disk only gets certain things, for example only ores."
	]
	quest.39521344142AA0CA.quest_subtitle: "Eight disks in one block."
	quest.39521344142AA0CA.title: "&3&lBuild a Disk Drive"
	quest.3973859713AB8BEE.quest_desc: [
		"&4Blood&r is the dark school: damage that strengthens you. Only &6Ray of Siphoning&r is common (hold: beam that steals life and heals you for the full damage)."
		""
		"Focus: Blood Vial from a cauldron over a campfire with an animal inside. The Dead King drops this school's &6Blood Staff&r."
		""
		"&cStage 2:&r Blood Needles, Blood Step, Devour, Raise Dead, Wither Skull, Acupuncture, Blood Slash, Heartstop, Sacrifice."
	]
	quest.3973859713AB8BEE.quest_subtitle: "Ray of Siphoning, and everything else only in stage 2."
	quest.3973859713AB8BEE.title: "&4Cast a Blood Spell"
	quest.397D01043565E0D3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_afrit_unbound_afrit.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Pentacle:&r Kandar's Opened Conjure."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6netherrack&r, an &6Iesnium ingot&r, a &6flint and steel&r, &6gunpowder&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r a &6cow&r. Start with the Afrit book, 150 seconds."
		""
		"{image:occultism:textures/item/afrit_essence.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The Afrit is an angry fire spirit. &eFire resistance&r, good armour and friends help. Defeated, it drops an &cAfrit Essence&r, with Looting III up to three more."
	]
	quest.397D01043565E0D3.quest_subtitle: "Summon it, beat it, take its essence."
	quest.397D01043565E0D3.title: "&c&lDefeat an Unbound Afrit"
	quest.39949DD23D8542B2.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Generalisierten Vorhersagen&r aus Ausgang 1 kannst du schon in Stufe 3 an der Werkbank verwerten, ohne Loot-Fabrikator:"
		""
		"&e4 Overworld Prediction + 1 Verrottetes Fleisch = 8 Eisenbarren.&r &e1 Overworld Prediction + 1 Knochenmehl = 22 Knochen.&r &e2 Nether Prediction + 1 Knochen = 1 Lohenrute.&r &e1 Nether Prediction + Glowstonestaub + Eisenbarren = 6 Goldbarren.&r"
		""
		"Vier Overworld Predictions um ein Netherrack ergeben eine Nether Prediction, vier Nether Predictions um einen Endstein eine Ender Prediction."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Das Stahlziel von Stufe 3 heißt 4.000 Stahlbarren. Ein Zombie-Modell gibt alle 48 Sekunden acht Eisen, egal wie gut es trainiert ist. Mit Self Aware kommen die Zombie-Vorhersagen für den Fabrikator noch obendrauf."
	]
	quest.39949DD23D8542B2.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 3. Die Werkbank reicht für den Anfang."
	quest.39949DD23D8542B2.title: "&aVorhersagen ohne Fabrikator"
	quest.39A74282BA312818.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbchunks.map\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" for the \"},{\"text\":\"FTB Chunks\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" map or \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.journeymap.map_toggle_alt\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" for JourneyMap. Both record everything you have seen.\"}]"
		""
		"Set &ewaypoints&r at your base, ore finds, villages and portals. With &eF3&r you see your coordinates; write them down before you go down anywhere."
	]
	quest.39A74282BA312818.quest_subtitle: "Never get lost again."
	quest.39A74282BA312818.title: "&6Open the map"
	quest.39C563005BCBFAFA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_power_steam_engine.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Dampfmaschine&r an einen &6Flüssigkeitstank&r mit Wasser und &6Lohenbrennern&r darunter, eine Welle davor. Kesselstufe = das kleinste von Hitze, Wasser und Tankgröße."
		""
		"&eCreate, Dampfmaschine:&r Brennstoff alles, was ein Lohenbrenner frisst (Kohle, Holzkohle, Lohenkuchen, flüssiger Brennstoff mit dem Strohhalm aus Crafts & Additions). Voll versorgt &d64 RPM&r und &d16 384 SU&r pro Maschine, bis 18 Maschinen an einem Kessel. Ein Kessel ohne Brenner (passiv) gibt einer Maschine noch 16 RPM und 2 048 SU. Offen ab Stufe 2, siehe Kapitel &6Create: Messing&r."
	]
	quest.39C563005BCBFAFA.quest_subtitle: "Create, Dampfmaschine, 64 RPM und 16 384 SU je Maschine."
	quest.39C563005BCBFAFA.title: "&6Heiz einen Dampfkessel an"
	quest.39C86A5666F66BCC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_apprentice_source_motor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Corners and bottom middle &6brass ingots&r, top middle &6Electron Tube&r, left and right a &6cogwheel&r, the calibrated mechanism in the middle."
		""
		"Turns Source from a jar next to it into rotational force for Create. The sides set the speed, the front the ratio of stress to speed. More force costs more Source."
	]
	quest.39C86A5666F66BCC.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: Source becomes rotation."
	quest.39C86A5666F66BCC.title: "&6Build a Source Motor"
	quest.39CA473B386A001B.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Creeper&r mit dem Learner im Inventar. Am besten mit dem Bogen, ein explodierter Creeper zählt nicht als dein Kill."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d128 FE/t&r. Eine Vorhersage wird zu &632 Schwarzpulver&r, 4 Creeperköpfen oder 2 Katalysedrüsen von Reliquary. Schwarzpulver steckt in Raketen, TNT und vielen Mekanism-Rezepten."
	]
	quest.39CA473B386A001B.quest_subtitle: "Schwarzpulver in Stapeln."
	quest.39CA473B386A001B.title: "&aLerne den Creeper"
	quest.39E18630C8378B08.quest_desc: [
		"Ein Kasten aus &6Kernreaktorgehäuse&r, innen Säulen aus &6Brennstäben&r mit je einem &6Steuerstab&r obendrauf, &6Schnittstellen&r für Brennstoff, Kühlmittel, Dampf und Abfall in der Wand. Starten mit 0,1 mB pro Tick."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Spaltreaktor:&r Brennstoff Spaltbrennstoff, &d1 Million Joule Hitze je mB&r, also 400 000 FE, umgesetzt über Wasser und Dampf in der &6Industrieturbine&r. Brennrate und Turbinengröße bestimmen den Ausstoß. Kernschmelzen sind auf diesem Server &can&r, Radius 8 Blöcke, Strahlung mal fünfzig. Offen ab Stufe 5, siehe Kapitel &6Mekanism: Antimaterie&r."
	]
	quest.39E18630C8378B08.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, Spaltreaktor: Wasser zu Dampf, Dampf zu Strom in der Turbine."
	quest.39E18630C8378B08.title: "&5Fahr den Spaltreaktor an"
	quest.39E5871127D49C4D.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Ring of Lesser Discount&r in the middle, &e4 diamonds&r, &e2 blaze rods&r and &e2 source gems&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"The greater ring lowers the cost of every spell a bit more than the lesser one. With the long spells of the archmage book you notice it with every cast."
	]
	quest.39E5871127D49C4D.quest_subtitle: "Even cheaper spells for the big book."
	quest.39E5871127D49C4D.title: "&6Forge the Ring of Greater Discount"
	quest.39F56728AF000DCB.quest_desc: [
		"Stage 2 opens &6Productive Bees&r: an &6Advanced Beehive&r, bees in cages, a &6Centrifuge&r for the combs. Iron, copper, gold, zinc and osmium bees bring in metal while you do something else."
		""
		"Breeding starts with vanilla bees from the nest and a feeding slab. Everything step by step in the &eProductive Bees&r chapter."
	]
	quest.39F56728AF000DCB.quest_subtitle: "Productive Bees: combs of iron, copper and zinc."
	quest.39F56728AF000DCB.title: "&eStage 2: bees"
	quest.39F9C465FB0CFF5C.quest_desc: [
		"A &6gold ingot&r at the top, one &6archwood plank&r each bottom left and right."
		""
		"Used, it shows you &6budding amethyst&r through stone for a while and makes magical creatures within &e75 blocks&r glow. It only has a limited number of uses."
	]
	quest.39F9C465FB0CFF5C.quest_subtitle: "See budding amethyst through walls."
	quest.39F9C465FB0CFF5C.title: "&6Build a Dowsing Rod"
	quest.3A052AD8C4B22280.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pipez&r, &6Gasrohr&r: &e200 mB pro Tick&r ohne Modifikation, 400 mit der Normalen, 2 000 mit der Verbesserten, 8 000 mit der Fortgeschrittenen (Stufe 3), 40 000 mit der Ultimativen (Stufe 4). Gasfilter ab Stufe 3. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Wie das Item-Rohr, nur mit zwei Infundierten Legierungen statt der Werfer. Siehe Kapitel Rohre und Router."
	]
	quest.3A052AD8C4B22280.quest_subtitle: "Pipez, Gasrohr: 200 mB pro Tick, bis 2 000 mit Modifikation."
	quest.3A052AD8C4B22280.title: "Lies: Pipez Gasrohr"
	quest.3A127DF43B65D552.quest_desc: [
		"Glowstone, &6Menril Glass&r (glass in the Drying Basin with 1,000 mB of resin), both transformers and a Display Panel give the &6Storage Terminal&r."
		""
		"It shows everything behind the interfaces, with tabs for items, fluids and power. Search: text in the name, &e@&r by mod, &e#&r in the tooltip, &e$&r by tags. An eye of ender on it unlocks a tab for your ender chest."
	]
	quest.3A127DF43B65D552.quest_subtitle: "Everything at a glance."
	quest.3A127DF43B65D552.title: "&3Build a Storage Terminal"
	quest.3A180D47CB1D866B.quest_desc: [
		"Put a &6Honey Treat&r and one or more identical &6Gene Samples&r into the crafting table. Feed the treat to a bee, and it takes on the trait with the chance the treat shows as &epurity&r."
		""
		"Two identical genes together in the crafting table give a purer one. The &6Gene Indexer&r (iron, comparator, crafting table) does that with a redstone signal for a whole chest full of samples."
		""
		"&eTraits:&r Productivity (Normal, Medium, High, Very High: more combs per trip), Weather (None, Rain, Any), Behavior (Day, Night, Day and Night), Endurance and Temper. A bee you put on a lead in the rain or at night can learn the matching tolerance by itself, but sometimes takes damage doing so."
	]
	quest.3A180D47CB1D866B.quest_subtitle: "Treat plus gene, feed it, hope."
	quest.3A180D47CB1D866B.title: "&dTransfer a Gene"
	quest.3A1AA854F1841139.quest_desc: [
		"You craft Ferricore armor like iron armor from 5, 8, 7 and 4 &6Ferricore Ingots&r. It protects a little better than iron and takes upgrades at the Smithing Table, just like the tools."
		""
		"&eBoots:&r &6Step Assist&r (four ladders around a blank) steps up whole blocks without jumping, &6Jump Boost&r (two pistons) jumps higher. &eLeggings:&r &6Walk Speed&r (two sugar, two carrots) and &6Run Speed&r (two sugar, two potatoes)."
		""
		"&eChest:&r &6Invulnerability&r (two diamond chestplates, two shields) makes you invulnerable for a few seconds at the press of a key, then a long cooldown and some durability. &eHelmet:&r &6Mind Fog&r (two fermented spider eyes, two lapis), monsters notice you later."
		""
		"Higher armor tiers allow more speed and higher jumps, with a slider in the settings."
	]
	quest.3A1AA854F1841139.quest_subtitle: "Walk faster, jump higher, step up blocks."
	quest.3A1AA854F1841139.title: "&7Forge Ferricore Armor"
	quest.3A2903CA526F6364.quest_desc: [
		"In den oberen Stockwerken des Tempels warten &6Valkyries&r. Sie fliegen, teleportieren sich und stoßen mit dem Speer nach dir. Jede besiegte Valkyrie lässt eine &6Victory Medal&r fallen."
		""
		"{image:aether:textures/item/miscellaneous/victory_medal.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Die &6Valkyrie Queen&r redet erst mit dir, wenn du ihr &e10 Medaillen&r zeigst. Ohne Medaillen schickt sie dich weg. Sammle also, bevor du nach oben gehst."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Der Dart Shooter trifft fliegende Valkyries besser als jedes Schwert. Kämpfe mit dem Rücken zur Wand, Valkyries werfen dich gern über die Kante."
	]
	quest.3A2903CA526F6364.quest_subtitle: "Zehn Medaillen, sonst kämpft die Königin nicht."
	quest.3A2903CA526F6364.title: "&fSammle Victory Medals"
	quest.3A2B15368150CEF9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_runes_runic_altar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r top Livingrock, &6brass ingot&r, Livingrock, bottom Livingrock, &eMana Diamond&r or &eMana Pearl&r, Livingrock."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/block/runic_altar_top.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Put the ingredients on, aim a spreader with a full pool at the altar, when the mana is in put a &6Livingrock&r on top, then right click with the wand. Runes in a recipe are catalysts and come back."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Right click with an empty hand puts the same ingredients on again. Comparator: strength 1 while charging, 2 when done."
	]
	quest.3A2B15368150CEF9.quest_subtitle: "This is where the runes are made."
	quest.3A2B15368150CEF9.title: "&aBuild the Runic Altar"
	quest.3A463C4E8D2B6BB4.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Pewter Inlay&r at the top, three &6purple carpets&r, three &6Runewood planks&r from Malum. Pewter Inlay: four Pewter in a ring, gives two."
		""
		"It works like a crafting table but has four slots for magical ingredients. Many better recipes only work here."
	]
	quest.3A463C4E8D2B6BB4.quest_subtitle: "A crafting table with four extra slots."
	quest.3A463C4E8D2B6BB4.title: "&6Build a Worktable"
	quest.3A49B6EB93A7DFC9.quest_desc: [
		"Put &6Raw Iron&r into the Fragment Forge. Each becomes one &6Iron Clump&r, three &6Small Iron Clumps&r and three Small Nickel Clumps. Nine small ones make a whole one at the crafting table."
		""
		"With a &6Yield Addon&r on the forge the byproducts double, so the nickel does."
	]
	quest.3A49B6EB93A7DFC9.quest_subtitle: "One clump, three small ones, nickel on top."
	quest.3A49B6EB93A7DFC9.title: "&7Break Raw Iron into Clumps"
	quest.3A521EC622764C7E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Dropper Module:&r a Blank Module and a &6dropper&r, shapeless. It drops items from the buffer in front of the router. Adding &6gunpowder&r turns it into the &6Flinger Module&r."
		""
		"The flinger throws the items with adjustable speed, pitch and direction. At speed 1.0 and straight ahead they fly about &e7 blocks&r over the ground."
		""
		"That way seeds, feed or torches land where no pipe can reach, for example over a wall into an enclosure."
	]
	quest.3A521EC622764C7E.quest_subtitle: "Dropper and Flinger Module."
	quest.3A521EC622764C7E.title: "&eThrow Items through the Air"
	quest.3A662B938755D8CD.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r oben drei &6Stein&r, in der Mitte Terrakotta, &6Kochbuch II&r, Terrakotta, unten drei &6Terrakotta&r. Der &6Kochtisch&r (Cooking Table) ist das Buch als Block, und er benutzt alles, was an ihm hängt."
		""
		"&eSo funktioniert die Küche:&r Jeder Küchenblock, der den Kochtisch oder einen anderen Küchenblock berührt, gehört dazu. Der Tisch nimmt Zutaten aus Theken, Schränken und Kühlschränken, Wasser aus dem Spülbecken, Milch aus dem Milchglas, Werkzeug vom Werkzeugregal und brät im Backofen. Du klickst nur noch das Gericht an."
		""
		"Der &6Küchenverbinder&r (drei Stein, sechs Terrakotta) führt die Küche um Ecken, der &6Küchenboden&r (zwei Kohleblöcke, zwei Quarzblöcke im Schachbrett, ergibt zwölf) verbindet Blöcke, die auf ihm stehen, über Abstand."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Stell den &6Kochtopf&r von Farmer's Delight an die Küche. Dann kocht der Tisch auch Suppen und Eintöpfe aus dem Kapitel Essen, solange der Topf auf seiner Hitzequelle steht."
	]
	quest.3A662B938755D8CD.quest_subtitle: "Das Herz der Küche, die aus Blöcken besteht."
	quest.3A662B938755D8CD.title: "&6&lBau einen Kochtisch"
	quest.3A6736BDD169D06B.quest_desc: [
		"Erlege je eines von allem, was hier unten lebt: &6Anglerfisch&r, &6Phantom&r, &6Sculk-Hundertfüßer&r, &6Sculk-Egel&r, &6Sculk-Schnapper&r, &6Zerschmetterter&r, &6Shriek-Wurm&r, &6Beobachter&r und den &4Wärter&r."
		""
		"Den Wärter kannst du hier unten holen: Die Kreischer in den Antiken Tempeln dürfen ihn rufen. Oder du nimmst den aus der Oberwelt, der zählt genauso."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Das Stufenziel von Stufe 3 braucht &e150 Afrit-Essenz&r, jede Beschwörung ein Kampf. Wer hier unten Übung mit Beobachtern hat, lacht über Afrits."
	]
	quest.3A6736BDD169D06B.quest_subtitle: "Von jedem Sculk-Monster eines."
	quest.3A6736BDD169D06B.title: "&4&lSculk-Jäger"
	quest.3A6F605AA8A2AECB.quest_desc: [
		"The floor is a &e9 by 9 square&r, with the corner block and the two blocks next to it missing at each corner: &e48 Polished Darkstone&r, &e9 Gilded Chiseled Polished Darkstone&r and &e4 Chiseled Arcane Polished Darkstone&r."
		""
		"&6Chiseled Polished Darkstone&r: two Polished Darkstone Slabs on top of each other. Shapeless with a &6Deorum Nugget&r it becomes the gilded version. &6Chiseled Arcane Polished Darkstone&r: two Arcane Polished Darkstone Slabs on top of each other."
		""
		"&eHow they lie:&r A gilded block in the middle, the four arcane blocks directly next to it (north, south, east, west). The eight other gilded blocks form a ring: one on each of the four axes three blocks from the middle, one on each of the four diagonals two blocks diagonally from the middle. Everything in between Polished Darkstone."
		""
		"{image:forbidden_arcanus:textures/block/gilded_chiseled_polished_darkstone.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tip:\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" Ponder shows the build step by step: hover over the Hephaestus Forge in EMI and press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ponder.ponder\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
	]
	quest.3A6F605AA8A2AECB.quest_subtitle: "9 by 9 darkstone with gold and crystal."
	quest.3A6F605AA8A2AECB.title: "&7Lay the Forge Floor"
	quest.3A75BBCAD37EBA85.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Manipulation Essence&r in the middle, &6brass ingot&r, &6rabbit's foot&r, &6Calibrated Precision Mechanism&r and &6emerald&r on the pedestals. It is worn as a curio."
		""
		"Press, Polish and Whirl run &etwice as fast&r, Press and Polish process &etwice as many&r items. Random yields from Crush and Whirl are twice as likely. On top of that every glyph in the spell counts as an extra &dFortune&r augment."
	]
	quest.3A75BBCAD37EBA85.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: double yield for the Create glyphs."
	quest.3A75BBCAD37EBA85.title: "&6Build the Focus of Transmutation"
	quest.3A860A74987EDCB4.quest_desc: [
		"Burn &e32 charcoal&r. Charcoal from tree farm and furnace is the fuel that never runs out."
		""
		"&eMana per piece:&r coal or charcoal 1,200 (40 s). Block of coal 12,000. Dried kelp block 3,000. Log or planks 225. Stick 75. Blaze rod 1,800 (from stage 2)."
		""
		"&cNot:&r lava buckets and anything that leaves something behind in the furnace. Burn time beyond two blocks of coal at once is lost."
	]
	quest.3A860A74987EDCB4.quest_subtitle: "What each fuel brings."
	quest.3A860A74987EDCB4.title: "&6Feed the Endoflame"
	quest.3A8D4AD0CF5B3CD8.quest_desc: [
		"Top row string, leather, string. Middle string, a &6chest&r, string. Bottom three leather. Out comes a &6Backpack&r with &d27&r slots, as much as a chest."
		""
		"Wear it on your back or carry it in your hand; &eB&r opens it. How to make it bigger later is in the chapter &6Storage&r."
	]
	quest.3A8D4AD0CF5B3CD8.quest_subtitle: "More room for your first trip."
	quest.3A8D4AD0CF5B3CD8.title: "&6Sew yourself a backpack"
	quest.3A99D1120ADDCF38.quest_desc: [
		"Zuerst ein &6Kanonenrohr&r (Cannon Barrel): sechs &6Verstärkte Ziegelmauern&r in zwei Säulen, unten in der Mitte ein &6Druckluftrohr&r. Dann der &6Druckluftzylinder&r (Pneumatic Cylinder): sechs &6Kunststoffplatten&r in die äußeren Spalten, zwei &6Druckeisen&r oben und mittig, das Kanonenrohr unten in der Mitte, ergibt zwei Zylinder."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/item/pneumatic_cylinder.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Zylinder stecken in der Aufzugbasis und im Türantrieb. Das Kanonenrohr brauchst du außerdem einzeln für die Luftkanone."
	]
	quest.3A99D1120ADDCF38.quest_subtitle: "Das Bauteil für alles, was sich bewegt."
	quest.3A99D1120ADDCF38.title: "&7Bau Druckluftzylinder"
	quest.3ABD936E660718DA.quest_desc: [
		"Top Elementium, &6Alfglass&r, Elementium, middle Elementium, &6slime ball&r, Elementium, bottom middle Elementium."
		""
		"In an area where slimes spawn underground, the slime in the bottle wakes up and bounces around. That is how you find slime chunks for a slime farm or for the &6Narslimmus&r."
	]
	quest.3ABD936E660718DA.quest_subtitle: "A slime chunk finder."
	quest.3ABD936E660718DA.title: "&bPut Slime in a Bottle"
	quest.3AC5EB06EAA9E7C7.quest_desc: [
		"Du weißt jetzt, was auf dich zukommt. Der beste Zeitpunkt für die Kills ist &ejetzt&r, solange du ohnehin im Nether und in den Verliesen unterwegs bist."
		""
		"Bau &e4 Modellgerüste&r, richte sie auf Zombie, Lohe, Witherskelett und einen Mob deiner Wahl, und lass den Learner einfach im Inventar. Nach ein paar Abenden sind alle vier Self Aware, und in Stufe 3 stehst du mit vier fertigen Modellen vor der ersten Kammer."
	]
	quest.3AC5EB06EAA9E7C7.quest_subtitle: "Vier Modelle im Learner, bevor Stufe 3 kommt."
	quest.3AC5EB06EAA9E7C7.title: "&3Trainiere jetzt für später"
	quest.3AD9DFAD24F3E861.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluid Card:&r with a bucket in place of lapis. &6Chemical Card:&r with a Basic Control Circuit from Mekanism. The Redstone Card carries signals."
		""
		"The Chemical Card moves Mekanism gases such as hydrogen or chlorine between machines, with no pressurized tubes at all."
	]
	quest.3AD9DFAD24F3E861.quest_subtitle: "Fluid Card and Chemical Card."
	quest.3AD9DFAD24F3E861.title: "&cPump fluid and gas by laser"
	quest.3AE12336FF9ED04E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hexerei_blood.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the heated lava cauldron: &e4 redstone&r and &e4 polished blackstone&r make the &6Blood Sigil&r. Put it into the sigil slot at the top left of the cauldron menu."
		"Jump into the cauldron &ethree times&r, then there is enough in it for a &6Bottle of Blood&r. A glass bottle fills it."
		""
		"{image:hexerei:textures/item/blood_bottle.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Blood is the main ingredient of all brooms. &cCareful:&r Every jump costs health, do not jump in half dead."
	]
	quest.3AE12336FF9ED04E.quest_subtitle: "A sacrifice that hurts."
	quest.3AE12336FF9ED04E.title: "&4Draw blood"
	quest.3AEDADF7F021D005.quest_desc: [
		"Like the pickaxe, with the &6Wyvern Bow&r as catalyst."
		""
		"Equip it with Draconic projectile modules. The Draconic Projectile Damage Module: six Awakened Draconium nuggets, two Wyvern Projectile Damage Modules and a Wyvern Core in the middle."
		""
		"According to Draconic Evolution the Chaos Guardian's shield melts fastest under a strong bow that fires fast."
	]
	quest.3AEDADF7F021D005.quest_subtitle: "The weapon for the finale."
	quest.3AEDADF7F021D005.title: "&dFuse the Draconic Bow"
	quest.3AF7C5D41B08E881.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_advanced_first_program.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eDas Programm:&r Start, darunter &eImport from Inventory&r mit einem Area auf eine Kiste mit einer Schaufel und einem Item Filter auf die Schaufel (Haltbarkeit aus). Darunter &eDig Area&r mit einem Area auf ein Stück Erde oder Sand."
		""
		"Geladene Drohne in den Slot oben rechts, Pfeil drücken, Ton hören. Dann die Drohne irgendwo in der Nähe der Kiste in die Welt klicken und zusehen."
		""
		"&eWenn sie nichts tut:&r Hat sie Luft? Liegt die Schaufel wirklich in der Kiste im Area? Ist der Filter auf dieselbe Schaufel? Ein Rechtsklick mit einem GPS Tool auf die Drohne schickt sie zu dessen Koordinate, so testest du, ob sie überhaupt fliegt."
		""
		"Ab hier gilt: Wer eine Drohne programmieren kann, kann fast alles automatisieren. Rechtsklick mit Farbstoff färbt sie, damit du deine Flotte auseinanderhältst."
	]
	quest.3AF7C5D41B08E881.quest_subtitle: "Start, Import, Dig. Mehr braucht es nicht."
	quest.3AF7C5D41B08E881.title: "&d&lProgrammiere deine erste Drohne"
	quest.3AFEBCE0356C687A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/antimatter_wind.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Six &6steel blocks&r on the sides, a &6Wind Generator&r in the top middle, a &6Robit&r in the middle, an &6Ultimate Induction Cell&r at the bottom."
		""
		"It delivers &e2,250,000 to 3,750,000 J/t&r, so 900,000 to 1,500,000 FE/t, and stores 256.6 million J. One antimatter pellet costs a trillion J: a single Large Wind Generator needs about four and a half hours for that."
	]
	quest.3AFEBCE0356C687A.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism MoreMachine, stage 5."
	quest.3AFEBCE0356C687A.title: "&bSet Up a Large Wind Generator"
	quest.3AFF728DE116035B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_resonarium.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Eine &6Resonariumplatte&r entsteht formlos aus &e4 Resonarium&r und &e4 Hornschilden&r (Schildkröte oder Gürteltier). Am &6Schmiedetisch&r machst du mit der &6Resonarium-Schmiedevorlage&r aus einem &eDiamantwerkzeug oder einer Diamantrüstung&r das Resonarium-Gegenstück."
		""
		"&eDie Vorlage&r liegt in Antiken Städten, Festungsgängen und Prüfungskammern, und in den Tempeltruhen. Kopieren: 7 Diamanten, die Vorlage und ein Resonarium ergeben zwei."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r Jedes Teil &6Resonariumrüstung&r fängt ein Viertel von dem Schaden ab, der sonst durch Rüstung geht, etwa der &cSchallangriff des Wärters&r. Mit allen vier Teilen bleibt davon nichts übrig. Die Rüstung nutzt sich dabei ab."
		""
		"{image:deeperdarker:textures/item/resonarium.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3AFF728DE116035B.quest_subtitle: "Die Rüstung gegen den Schallangriff."
	quest.3AFF728DE116035B.title: "&6&lSchmiede Resonarium"
	quest.3B24B0423BFE31CC.quest_desc: [
		"50 ingots are a good &d25 million mana&r, 50 Manasteel, 50 pearls and 50 diamonds."
		""
		"&eWhat helps:&r many pools with Mana Sparks around the plate, several plates, Thermalilies at lava, Gourmaryllis with changing food, Rosa Arcana at the mob farm. Pick nothing up while the plate is working."
	]
	quest.3B24B0423BFE31CC.quest_subtitle: "Fifty ingots, each half a pool."
	quest.3B24B0423BFE31CC.title: "&aForge Terrasteel in series"
	quest.3B268BFFFDB0AD9A.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Source Gem Block&r is four &6Source Gems&r in a square. Or you put an &6Amethyst Block&r into the &aImbuement Chamber&r; that costs &d2,000 source&r and saves you the four gems."
		""
		"The &6Source Jar&r: three &6Archwood Slabs&r at the top and at the bottom, glass on the sides. With Mana Diamonds, Andesite Alloy and Gold Leaf you then have everything for the &6Source Keystone&r."
	]
	quest.3B268BFFFDB0AD9A.quest_subtitle: "Four gem blocks and a Source Jar."
	quest.3B268BFFFDB0AD9A.title: "&dCollect the parts for the keystone"
	quest.3B26E11DD76DD0D2.quest_desc: [
		"Stufe 5 öffnet den Spaltreaktor von Mekanism, den Drakonischen Reaktor und den Gargantuan-Speicher von Flux. Das Ziel am Obelisken, 100 Antimaterie-Pellets, braucht eine Billion Joule je Pellet, also 400 Milliarden FE."
		""
		"&e1. Spaltreaktor plus Industrieturbine:&r Spaltbrennstoff aus Uran, Wasser rein, Dampf raus, die Turbine aus Stufe 3 macht daraus Strom. Der Atommüll daraus ist zugleich der Rohstoff für Polonium und Plutonium."
		"&e2. Fusionsreaktor aus Stufe 4&r auf hoher Einspritzrate mit Dampf in eine zweite Turbine, wenn der Spaltreaktor dir zu heiß ist."
		"&e3. Drakonischer Reaktor:&r der größte Ausstoß im Pack, aber er explodiert, wenn das Feld fällt. Nur mit Energiekern als Rücklage für den Injektor."
	]
	quest.3B26E11DD76DD0D2.quest_subtitle: "Alles offen. Der Strom für hundert Pellets."
	quest.3B26E11DD76DD0D2.title: "&e&lStufe 5: Welche Quelle wann"
	quest.3B2FE6FB6C87C628.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Turbinenventile&r der Industrieturbine aus &5Mekanism: Fortgeschritten&r geben ihren Strom an jeden Block daneben ab. Setz einen &6Flux-Stecker&r direkt an ein Ventil, dann fließt alles, was die Turbine macht, ins Netz."
		""
		"Mekanism rechnet in Joule, das Netz in FE: 2,5 J sind 1 FE, die Umrechnung macht der Stecker von selbst. Eine Turbine mit Kessel und Wärmequelle ist das stärkste Kraftwerk, das Mekanism in Stufe 3 baut."
	]
	quest.3B2FE6FB6C87C628.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism-Strom ins Netz."
	quest.3B2FE6FB6C87C628.title: "&5Häng die Industrieturbine an"
	quest.3B304126E382EBE3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Dreckiger Staub&r in die &6Anreicherungskammer&r: eins zu eins wird daraus sauberer &6Staub&r. Dann in den Schmelzer, Barren heraus."
		""
		"Die Dreifach-Straße ist also die Zweifach-Straße mit zwei Maschinen davor: &eKlärkammer, Zerkleinerer, Anreicherungskammer, Schmelzer&r. Kammer und Schmelzer von vorhin bleiben, wo sie sind."
		""
		"&cAchtung:&r Rohes Erz gehört jetzt vor die Klärkammer, nicht mehr in die Anreicherungskammer. Sonst verschenkst du einen Barren pro Erz."
	]
	quest.3B304126E382EBE3.quest_subtitle: "Anreicherungskammer, dann Schmelzer, wie gehabt."
	quest.3B304126E382EBE3.title: "&7Reinige den Staub und schmilz ihn"
	quest.3B432216DF00AFF9.quest_desc: [
		"On top Hardened Blood Shard, &6diamond&r, Hardened Blood Shard. In the middle diamond, &6Dark Stick&r, diamond. At the bottom a Dark Stick."
		""
		"It comes ready with &eFortune V&r and &eVengeance III&r. In return it does not last long, and Vengeance Spirits can appear while mining. Keep it for diamonds, emeralds and other Fortune ores, and repair it in the Blood Chest."
	]
	quest.3B432216DF00AFF9.quest_subtitle: "Fortune V, fresh from the crafting table."
	quest.3B432216DF00AFF9.title: "&cForge a Vengeance Pickaxe"
	quest.3B451EE7CFDFF558.quest_desc: [
		"A &6chest&r, iron ingots, a &6block of iron&r and green dye, kelp or algae on top, see EMI."
		""
		"It keeps hooks, bait, lines and bobbers together, and you fit out the rod in it."
	]
	quest.3B451EE7CFDFF558.quest_subtitle: "Everything in one place."
	quest.3B451EE7CFDFF558.title: "&7Build a Tackle Box"
	quest.3B5313E3CE0CBCDE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hostile_networks_data_center.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r oben &6Echo-Scherbe&r, &6Netherstern&r, Echo-Scherbe. Mitte &6Simulationskammer&r, Obsidian, &6Loot-Fabrikator&r. Unten drei &6Obsidian&r."
		""
		"Das &6Data Center&r braucht eine Hülle von &e7 mal 7 mal 7&r Blöcken, innen hohl: der &6Boden aus Obsidian&r, &6Wände und Decke aus schwarzem Glas&r. Der Controller ersetzt einen Block der untersten Wandreihe und schaut nach außen."
		""
		"Innen liegt ein Raster von 5 mal 5 Plätzen für &e25 Self-Aware-Modelle&r und vier Eingänge für Matrizen. Jedes Modell macht alle &e15 Sekunden&r eine Simulation und wirft &edirekt den Drop&r aus, Simulation und Fabrikator in einem. Was, bestimmt seine Fabrikationsanweisung."
		""
		"Der Preis: jedes Modell kostet &e150 Prozent&r seines Stromwerts, 25 Zombies also 4.800 FE/t, 25 Lohen 9.600 FE/t. Der Puffer fasst 8 Millionen FE."
	]
	quest.3B5313E3CE0CBCDE.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 4. 25 Modelle, ein Block, tausende Drops."
	quest.3B5313E3CE0CBCDE.title: "&5&lDas Rechenzentrum"
	quest.3B554A689296B483.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_trains_first_train.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e1.&r Station into assembly mode. &e2.&r Bogeys onto the track. &e3.&r Build the train on them, do not forget the Train Controls. &e4.&r Glue everything. &e5.&r Assemble in the station menu."
		""
		"Carriages, seats, chests, decoration: whatever is glued to the bogeys rides along."
	]
	quest.3B554A689296B483.quest_subtitle: "All aboard."
	quest.3B554A689296B483.title: "&6&lBuild your first train"
	quest.3B669A2A6CC18D2E.quest_desc: [
		"Dritte Generation, zweiter Teil, im Markt für 4 Smaragde."
		""
		"&6Ulme&r: Esche + Silberlinde, 10 %"
		"&6Golden-Delicious-Apfel&r: Red-Delicious-Apfel + Granny-Smith-Apfel, 10 %"
		"&6Iroko&r: Balsa + Teak, 10 %"
		"&6Lawson-Zypresse&r: Gelbkiefer + Fichte, 10 %"
		"&6Weihrauchkiefer&r: Gelbkiefer + Fichte, 10 %"
		"&6Olive&r: Erle + Vogelkirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Rosen-Eukalyptus&r: Balsa + Blühende Azalee, 10 %"
		"&6Sauerkirsche&r: Silberweide + Kirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Zimtapfel&r: Pekannuss + Vogelkirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Edelkastanie&r: Walnuss + Vogelkirsche oder Silberlinde, 10 %"
		"&6Mehlbeere&r: Esche + Birke, 10 %"
	]
	quest.3B669A2A6CC18D2E.quest_subtitle: "11 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.3B669A2A6CC18D2E.title: "&aGeneration 3: Ulme bis Mehlbeere"
	quest.3B72F94064E45DB0.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r vier &6Flux-Staub&r in die Ecken, vier &6Obsidian&r an die Seiten, in die Mitte ein &6Quelljuwel&r aus Ars Nouveau statt des Enderauges. Ergibt vier &6Flux-Kerne&r."
		""
		"{image:fluxnetworks:textures/item/flux_core.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Der Kern steckt in jedem Gerät: vier pro Stecker oder Punkt, vier in jedem Flux-Block. Ein Quelljuwel kostet 500 Quelle in der Imbuement-Kammer, siehe Kapitel &aArs Nouveau&r. Ein Juwel macht vier Kerne, rechne für den Anfang mit zwanzig Kernen, also fünf Juwelen."
		""
		"Kein eigenes Quellglas? Die Magier haben Juwelen übrig, seit das Ziel von Stufe 1 voll ist. Flux-Staub ist eine gute Tauschware, den brauchen sie selbst nicht."
	]
	quest.3B72F94064E45DB0.quest_subtitle: "Auf Kronwerke mit einem Quelljuwel."
	quest.3B72F94064E45DB0.title: "&dBau Flux-Kerne"
	quest.3B7D945403B7A121.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Electrolytic Separator from &e10 mB brine&r: 1 mB chlorine and 1 mB sodium."
		"&eUsed by:&r the Chemical Infuser for hydrogen chloride."
	]
	quest.3B7D945403B7A121.quest_subtitle: "Brine in the separator."
	quest.3B7D945403B7A121.title: "&fChlorine"
	quest.3B7E57D017C67709.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Crimson Iron Ore&r until you have &e8 raw Crimson Iron&r. Smelted, it is the next material tier for Silent Gear (&6Silent Gear&r chapter)."
		""
		"&eWhat else lies in the Nether:&r Create's rock layers with &6scoria&r and &6scorchia&r, &6dimensional shards&r from RFTools (you need them from stage 3) and the ores from the next quest."
	]
	quest.3B7E57D017C67709.quest_subtitle: "Silent Gear's ore only grows in the Nether."
	quest.3B7E57D017C67709.title: "&5Find Crimson Iron"
	quest.3B83A37BE1681C9E.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r vier &6Bretter&r in die Ecken, vier &6Stöcke&r an die Seiten, die Mitte bleibt leer. Das ergibt vier &6Rahmenblöcke&r (Framed Cubes)."
		""
		"&6FramedBlocks&r ist der Baumod für alles, was Vanilla nicht hat: Schrägen, Ecken, Säulen, Türen und über 200 weitere Formen. Jede Form ist zuerst ein nackter Holzrahmen. Ihr Aussehen bekommt sie erst, wenn du einen Block darauf anwendest."
		""
		"Rahmenblöcke sind nicht gesperrt. Der ganze Mod steht dir von der ersten Minute an offen, egal welche Stufe der Server gerade hat."
	]
	quest.3B83A37BE1681C9E.quest_subtitle: "Ein Block, der aussieht wie jeder andere."
	quest.3B83A37BE1681C9E.title: "&6&lZimmere Rahmenblöcke"
	quest.3B882A8FE3DD2678.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6redstone&r at the top, three &6Markers&r below: a &6Chunk Marker&r. Three green dye over three Markers give a &6Flexible Marker&r."
		""
		"With both you set the area in the window. The Chunk Destroyer needs one of them."
	]
	quest.3B882A8FE3DD2678.quest_subtitle: "One block instead of four."
	quest.3B882A8FE3DD2678.title: "&9Build a Chunk Marker"
	quest.3B89F93F5E085B52.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &6Darkened Apple&r from an &6apple&r and a &6Dark Gem&r and feed it to an animal. The animal dies, and a purple anomaly remains at the spot. Throw a &6book&r into it, and out comes &6Origins of Darkness&r."
		""
		"The book explains every recipe and every machine of the mod and is linked with EMI. It sometimes lies in dungeon chests too."
	]
	quest.3B89F93F5E085B52.quest_subtitle: "Origins of Darkness, the mod's handbook."
	quest.3B89F93F5E085B52.title: "&5Get the Book"
	quest.3B8AAAF225F51A23.quest_desc: [
		"&6Hopping Botany Pot&r with dirt or &6Rich Soil&r, &6wheat&r, carrots, potatoes or sugar cane inside, a chest below. The pot harvests ripe plants on its own, the plant stays, you never have to add seeds again."
		""
		"Rich soil grows 10 percent faster than dirt, a tool with &6Efficiency&r in the tool slot another 5 percent per level. Tomatoes, cabbage, onions and rice from Farmer's Delight work the same way."
		""
		"A row of pots over a row of drawers feeds the cooking pot, feeding trough and the Mycelial Sourcelink."
	]
	quest.3B8AAAF225F51A23.quest_subtitle: "The smallest farm there is."
	quest.3B8AAAF225F51A23.title: "&aPlant wheat in pots"
	quest.3B8E811286D510AF.quest_desc: [
		"A &6book&r and any &6sapling&r, shapeless at the crafting table, make the &6Lexica Botania&r."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/lexica_botania.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&aBotania&r is technology made of plants: flowers make &dmana&r, &6Mana Spreaders&r shoot it through the air, &6Mana Pools&r store it and transform things you throw in."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Sneak and click a Botania block with the Lexica, and it jumps to the matching entry."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r This chapter goes up to the Mana Pool. Runic Altar, Manasteel and Terrasteel open with &6stage 2&r, continued in the &aBotania: Runes&r chapter."
	]
	quest.3B8E811286D510AF.quest_subtitle: "The handbook for everything that grows here."
	quest.3B8E811286D510AF.title: "&aCraft the Lexica Botania"
	quest.3B963BA9115EAA68.quest_desc: [
		"Eine &6Redstone-Fackel&r oben, ein &6Verstärker&r zwischen zwei &6Glas&r in der Mitte, ein &6Notenblock&r zwischen zwei Glas unten ergeben den &6Seismischen Sensor&r (Seismic Sensor). Er braucht keine Luft."
		""
		"Rechtsklick auf den Boden sagt dir, ob direkt darunter &8Rohöl&r liegt, wie tief und etwa wie viele Eimer. &eUnterirdische Ölseen&r gibt es in jedem sechsten Chunk, zwischen Y 0 und der Oberfläche und mindestens 5 Blöcke unter ihr. Seen an der Oberfläche sind seltener, einer in 25 Chunks."
		""
		"Lauf also mit dem Sensor im Raster von 16 Blöcken über die Gegend nahe deiner Basis und markiere Treffer. Der Ölscanner von Create Diesel Generators zeigt übrigens etwas anderes an, nämlich das Öl für die Pumpjacks aus Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.3B963BA9115EAA68.quest_subtitle: "Ölseen liegen meist tief unter der Erde."
	quest.3B963BA9115EAA68.title: "&8Such Öl mit dem Seismischen Sensor"
	quest.3B9DC1FA5D32439D.quest_desc: [
		"Leather at the top, three &6steel&r in the middle, at the bottom &6blaze powder&r, &6block of redstone&r, blaze powder. It holds &e100,000 RF&r and needs &e128 RF/t&r under thrust."
		""
		"You charge it in the &6Equipment Charger&r (steel, dispenser, block of redstone, Energy Pipes, chest). That is also where you fill in &6Turbofuel&r, which makes it fly faster. There is no hovering."
		""
		"With an elytra, two Processing Units and five gunpowder it becomes the &6Boosted Elytra&r, which pushes while gliding."
	]
	quest.3B9DC1FA5D32439D.quest_subtitle: "Hold jump and you rise."
	quest.3B9DC1FA5D32439D.title: "&eFly with the Jetpack"
	quest.3BA47BA4F53343F8.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: a &etier 3&r robe piece, &6Mark of Technomancy&r, &6netherite ingot&r, &e2 brass ingots&r (for the helmet brass and engineer's goggles), &d7,000 source&r."
		""
		"The Arcanist becomes the Technomancer, the Battlemage the Machinaguard, the Sorcerer the Artificer."
	]
	quest.3BA47BA4F53343F8.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: Technomancer, Machinaguard, Artificer."
	quest.3BA47BA4F53343F8.title: "&6Build a Tech Robe"
	quest.3BABD71E6BCD42F1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Red String&r: shapeless &6string&r, &6block of redstone&r, &6Pixie Dust&r and &5Pure Ender Essence&r. &6Red Stringed Container&r: &e7 Livingrock&r, a chest in the middle, the Red String to its right."
		""
		"Every Red String block binds to the next matching block it points at, up to about &e8 blocks&r away and through walls. The container passes everything that goes in on to the bound inventory, from the same side."
		""
		"There are also the Dispenser, Nutrifier (bone meal at a distance), Comparator, Spoofer (a flower works at another place) and Interceptor. With the Wand of the Forest in hand you see the strings."
	]
	quest.3BABD71E6BCD42F1.quest_subtitle: "Connect blocks over a distance."
	quest.3BABD71E6BCD42F1.title: "&5Span Red String"
	quest.3BB21E79FC7CE294.quest_desc: [
		"A mixer over a basin, below it a Blaze Burner kept &csuperheated&r with cake. &6Two copper&r and &6one zinc&r make &etwo brass ingots&r."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Heated, 2,000 copper and 1,000 zinc make only 1,000 ingots and eat 1,000 blaze powder. Superheated they become 2,000 ingots."
		""
		"Two or three mixers fed from a shared vault are a good start for the obelisk goal."
	]
	quest.3BB21E79FC7CE294.quest_subtitle: "Two ingots per recipe, no powder."
	quest.3BB21E79FC7CE294.title: "&6Mix brass superheated"
	quest.3BB4897802ABCC5A.quest_desc: [
		"Thanks to &6Controlling&r, the &econtrols settings&r have a &esearch bar&r at the top. Type part of the name, like &ebackpack&r or &eUltimine&r, and you immediately see the matching key."
		""
		"Next to it you can filter the list, for example to show only &edoubly bound&r keys. That way you find out in seconds why a key does not do what it should."
	]
	quest.3BB4897802ABCC5A.quest_subtitle: "Over 200 mods, one search bar."
	quest.3BB4897802ABCC5A.title: "&6Search the controls"
	quest.3BB494BCD3F4FEA9.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r four &6Andesite Alloy&r in the corners, four &6iron bars&r on the sides, a &6Blank Module&r in the middle. That gives &64 Routers&r."
		""
		"A router has a &ebuffer&r of one stack, &enine module slots&r and &efive upgrade slots&r. Every second it works through all modules from left to right. Hoppers and pipes may fill and empty the buffer."
		""
		"Top right you set the &eredstone control&r (always, only without signal, only with signal, never, once per pulse) and &eeco mode&r: after 5 seconds without work the router only runs every 5 seconds until something comes again."
		""
		"You configure modules in the router without taking them out: &emiddle click&r on the module."
	]
	quest.3BB494BCD3F4FEA9.quest_subtitle: "One block, nine modules, one buffer."
	quest.3BB494BCD3F4FEA9.title: "&e&lBuild a Router"
	quest.3BB6398A305E2EC6.quest_desc: [
		"Three parts, all with iron: &6Barrel Assembly&r (two Nebulous Hearts, magma cream), &6Hammer Assembly&r (stone button, blaze rod, Molten Core) and &6Grip Assembly&r (magma cream, empty magazine). With iron and a &6Slime Pearl&r it becomes the &6Hunter's Handgun&r."
		""
		"Ammo: flint, two gold nuggets and gunpowder give 8 &6Neutral Shots&r. Eight of them around an &6Empty Magazine&r (iron, glass, stone) give a full magazine."
		""
		"Right click shoots, holding right click reloads. Recoil, reloading and fire rate improve with your experience level, the maximum is reached from level &e20&r."
	]
	quest.3BB6398A305E2EC6.quest_subtitle: "A pistol made from monster parts."
	quest.3BB6398A305E2EC6.title: "&7Build the Hunter's Handgun"
	quest.3BC4D16CB68CEC1B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &6Awakened Draconium&r is a fusion of 4 Draconium Blocks, 4 Draconium Cores, a &5Dragon Heart&r and &a2 Gaia Spirit ingots&r. Save your Dragon Hearts."
		""
		"Plus Draconic gear, tier 8 of the core, the reactor and the Chaos Guardian. All in the chapter &5Draconic: Awakened and Chaos&r. The stage 5 goal wants &e64 Awakened Draconium Blocks&r."
	]
	quest.3BC4D16CB68CEC1B.quest_subtitle: "What comes in stage 5."
	quest.3BC4D16CB68CEC1B.title: "&8Look at Awakened and Chaos"
	quest.3BDA5DDAC90C245E.quest_desc: [
		"Deactivate the core, raise it one tier with &eTier Up&r in its window, turn on &eToggle Build Guide&r and place the blocks: &690 Draconium Blocks&r and &680 redstone blocks&r."
		""
		"&eStorage:&r &e59,300,000,000&r energy."
		""
		"From the large tiers on, the window asks for &e(Advanced stabilizers required)&r. What to build for that is then shown by the build guide."
	]
	quest.3BDA5DDAC90C245E.quest_subtitle: "90 and 80 blocks, 59.3 billion."
	quest.3BDA5DDAC90C245E.title: "&cCore Tier 5"
	quest.3BE2CE767844989E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Plate Advanced&r in the corners, &6terracotta&r at the top, &6actuators&r left and right, a &6chassis&r in the middle, an &6anvil&r at the bottom."
		""
		"It presses ingots into plates: lead for the casing, Tough Alloy for the port. Lead plates also work with Immersive Engineering's Engineer's Hammer."
	]
	quest.3BE2CE767844989E.quest_subtitle: "It presses plates."
	quest.3BE2CE767844989E.title: "&7Build a Pressurizer"
	quest.3BFB66351D27C53D.quest_desc: [
		"&dWatery Grave&r (kelp, prismarine shards, Water Essence): the target drowns on land."
		"&dGeyser&r (Fire and Water Essence, magma block, wind charge): flings creatures upward."
		"&dMist Cloud&r (Water and Air Essence, phantom membrane, blue ice): monsters lose their target."
		"&dMana Bubble&r (Heart of the Sea, prismarine shards, bastion fruit, Water Essence): a shield that absorbs damage with mana."
		"&dSlide&r (Water and Abjuration Essence, slimeball, ice). &dDischarge&r (lightning rod, Flashpine, Air Essence): damage to shocked targets."
	]
	quest.3BFB66351D27C53D.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2 checklist: Ars Elemental, part 1."
	quest.3BFB66351D27C53D.title: "&dLearn Ars Elemental water and air"
	quest.3C03302260C1AB9D.quest_desc: [
		"Endermen drop a &6Nebulous Heart&r, the most important part of the mod: Void Tear, Ender Staff, altar, Magicbane and Hero's Medallion need it. One in the crafting table gives 3 ender pearls."
	]
	quest.3C03302260C1AB9D.quest_subtitle: "From the enderman."
	quest.3C03302260C1AB9D.title: "&5Nebulous Heart"
	quest.3C0E066C9D7CE123.quest_desc: [
		"&6Nether quartz&r into the pool, &d250 mana&r each. Four make a &6Mana Quartz block&r."
		""
		"One block goes into the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate, one quartz into each of the seven sin runes. The rest is a nice building block next to Livingrock."
	]
	quest.3C0E066C9D7CE123.quest_subtitle: "Nether quartz, dyed blue."
	quest.3C0E066C9D7CE123.title: "&bInfuse Mana Quartz"
	quest.3C10E938B5BF24FD.quest_desc: [
		"Open the chapter &6First Farms&r. One farm per quest: cobblestone, wood, wheat, animals, monsters, lava and mana, all with stage 1 means."
		""
		"What they yield you carry to the obelisk."
	]
	quest.3C10E938B5BF24FD.quest_subtitle: "Your base works while you chat."
	quest.3C10E938B5BF24FD.title: "&6Read First Farms"
	quest.3C1AB9BF43A408CC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Golden Oaks&r erkennst du am goldenen Laub. Fäll die Stämme mit einer &6Zanite Axe&r, dann fallen &e1 bis 2 Golden Amber&r pro Stamm. Mit jeder anderen Axt bekommst du nur Skyroot Logs."
		""
		"{image:aether:textures/item/materials/golden_amber.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Aus dem Laub fällt mit etwas Glück ein &6Goldener Apfel&r. Pflanz die &6Golden Oak Saplings&r nach, mit Knochenmehl wachsen sie schnell."
		""
		"Golden Amber brauchst du für den &6Golden Dart Shooter&r und seine Pfeile, siehe Abschnitt Dungeons."
	]
	quest.3C1AB9BF43A408CC.quest_subtitle: "Harz aus den goldenen Eichen."
	quest.3C1AB9BF43A408CC.title: "&6Ernte Golden Amber"
	quest.3C2C0B2C5A644F3E.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Stock Link&r and a &6precision mechanism&r make two &6Factory Gauges&r. Tune them to your storage network and place them on the machine that makes an item."
		""
		"Set the item and the stock. If it drops below, the gauge orders the ingredients from the network and sends them by package. Several gauges connected make whole chains."
	]
	quest.3C2C0B2C5A644F3E.quest_subtitle: "The Factory Gauge."
	quest.3C2C0B2C5A644F3E.title: "&6Let the factory order on its own"
	quest.3C2CACC751E69389.quest_desc: [
		"Acht &6Druckeisenbarren&r um einen &6Ofen&r ergeben den &6Hitzerahmen&r (Heat Frame). Klick ihn an eine Truhe oder eine andere Kiste. Heizt du ihn, schmilzt er alles in der Kiste wie ein Ofen, bis zu einem Gegenstand pro Sekunde. Kühlst du ihn, friert er."
		""
		"Der Rahmen nimmt Hitze nicht direkt von Lava oder einem Lohenbrenner. Stell ein Wärmerohr oder einen Druckeisenblock dazwischen, oder häng ihn an die heiße Seite eines Wirbelrohrs."
		""
		"&eGefroren wird unter 0 Grad:&r Ein Wassereimer in der Kiste wird zu Eis, ein Lavaeimer zu Obsidian, und ein Eimer flüssiger Kunststoff zu einer &6Kunststoffplatte&r, je kälter, desto öfter mit einer zweiten obendrauf. Der Eimer bleibt dir erhalten."
	]
	quest.3C2CACC751E69389.quest_subtitle: "Ein Ofen ohne Ofen, oder ein Gefrierfach."
	quest.3C2CACC751E69389.title: "&6Schmilz mit einem Hitzerahmen"
	quest.3C30C1242203AFE6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/malum_crucible.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6furnace&r on the altar, on the stands &e8 Twisted Rock&r, &e8 Tainted Rock&r and &e2 Hex Ash&r, plus &e8 Infernal&r and &e8 Aqueous&r."
		""
		"The Crucible holds a catalyst around which arcana are focused. Each run costs it durability."
	]
	quest.3C30C1242203AFE6.quest_subtitle: "Focus arcana instead of pouring them in."
	quest.3C30C1242203AFE6.title: "&cBuild the Spirit Crucible"
	quest.3C3C91C6E28473E1.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Froststeel Ore&r in Shiverstone (&eY -64 to 64&r, only in cold biomes). It gives &6Raw Froststeel&r, a &6Froststeel Ingot&r in the furnace."
		""
		"{image:undergarden:textures/item/froststeel_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3C3C91C6E28473E1.quest_subtitle: "Only in the Shiverstone of the cold biomes."
	quest.3C3C91C6E28473E1.title: "&bSmelt Froststeel"
	quest.3C42B48297417F2D.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: Warp Scroll, &e4 blaze powder&r, &e2 ender pearls&r."
		""
		"Stays after use. The apparatus copies an inscribed scroll for &d1,000 Source&r; give friends one with your shared base."
	]
	quest.3C42B48297417F2D.quest_subtitle: "The way home without using it up."
	quest.3C42B48297417F2D.title: "&6Stabilize the scroll"
	quest.3C6D148714AB274A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nuclearcraft_reactor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A uranium line, cooling with reserve, a chest for spent fuel far away from you. Check every change at the controller first, then leave."
		""
		"Next: more cells, better heat sinks, HEU-235 or oxide fuel."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Stage 4 eats power: igniting fusion, filling Draconic cores, and in stage 5 the SPS runs for days for the obelisk's antimatter. A fission reactor is a good base load."
	]
	quest.3C6D148714AB274A.quest_subtitle: "A reactor that does not melt."
	quest.3C6D148714AB274A.title: "&a&lKeep the Reactor Running"
	quest.3C71D744C46C4E40.quest_desc: [
		"Take a &6brass ingot&r from the stage's starter pack or mix it yourself. The next quests show how."
		""
		"Everything with a brass casing can do more than the andesite machines: filter, count, craft recipes of any size. Trains are in &6Create: Trains&r, switches, diesel engines and more addons in &6Create: Addons&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The tech pillar wants &62,000 brass ingots&r and &6150 precision mechanisms&r (for 30 players), plus &68 Brass Hearts&r. &e/kw goals&r shows the progress."
	]
	quest.3C71D744C46C4E40.quest_subtitle: "Stage 2 is open, Create gets its second half."
	quest.3C71D744C46C4E40.title: "&6&lGet your first brass ingot"
	quest.3C76AA98D0A4190A.quest_desc: [
		"Top and bottom &e3 archwood slabs&r each, one &6glass&r on each side of the middle."
		""
		"A &6Source Jar&r holds &d10,000 Source&r. Sourcelinks fill jars up to &e5 blocks&r away, chamber and apparatus draw from jars nearby. Mined, it keeps its contents."
		""
		"A comparator next to it gives a signal by fill level."
	]
	quest.3C76AA98D0A4190A.quest_subtitle: "The storage for your Source."
	quest.3C76AA98D0A4190A.title: "&aBuild a Source Jar"
	quest.3C7B2F68E0B5998E.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Sender Mk1&r and an &6ender pearl&r give a &6Sender Module Mk2&r, four Mk1 and one pearl give four. The same way the Puller Mk1 becomes the &6Puller Mk2&r."
		""
		"Mk2 no longer needs a line of sight or an axis. Hold the module in your hand, &esneak and right click&r the target chest, and the router sends or pulls up to &e24 blocks&r (sender) or &e12 blocks&r (puller) away, through any wall."
		""
		"The target is marked as long as you hold the module. With &6Range Augments&r you get to 48 and 24 blocks."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r The &6Sender Module Mk3&r sends into any dimension, but needs end stone. That only comes with the End in stage 4."
	]
	quest.3C7B2F68E0B5998E.quest_subtitle: "Mk2 with an ender pearl: click the target, done."
	quest.3C7B2F68E0B5998E.title: "&6Send through Walls"
	quest.3C7CC15BA296ED09.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &e8 glass panes&r around a &6Spirit Attuned Gem&r make the &6Glass Lenses&r."
		""
		"&5Pentacle:&r Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion."
		"&6Bowls:&r the lenses, &e2 silver ingots&r, &e1 gold ingot&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book, 60 seconds."
		""
		"The &6Infused Lenses&r go into the &6Otherworld Goggles&r from the chapter &5Occultism: Afrit and Marid&r. Binding them now saves you a step in stage 3."
	]
	quest.3C7CC15BA296ED09.quest_subtitle: "Groundwork for the Otherworld Goggles."
	quest.3C7CC15BA296ED09.title: "&6Bind Infused Lenses"
	quest.3C8A87DA3B9919C6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Alter Speer&r: 4 Altmetallbarren vom Ancient Remnant, 9,5 Schaden, Linksklick schießt einen Sandsturm. &6Soul Render&r: 3 Cursium von Maledictus und 2 Schwarzstahl, 15 Schaden."
		""
		"&6Gezeitenklauen&r lässt der Leviathan fallen: Enterhaken und Tentakelschlag für 8. Wie die Kämpfe laufen, steht im Kapitel &cBosse der Oberwelt&r."
	]
	quest.3C8A87DA3B9919C6.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm: Alter Speer, Soul Render, Gezeitenklauen."
	quest.3C8A87DA3B9919C6.title: "&cHol dir eine Bosswaffe"
	quest.3C8ADEA240933DAF.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6Precision Mechanism&r on top, &6Brass Casing&r in the middle, at the bottom &6iron sheet&r, &6redstone&r, iron sheet give eight &6Kinetic Batteries&r."
		""
		"Without a signal it takes in capacity at the front and charges. With a &credstone signal&r it discharges and delivers a fixed capacity at a fixed speed. It only uses as much charge as the network needs right now, and nothing at all as long as other sources deliver enough."
		""
		"Placed in a row, batteries last longer, side by side they deliver more. Mined, they keep their charge, a deployer or arm swaps full ones for empty ones. A comparator reads the charge level."
	]
	quest.3C8ADEA240933DAF.quest_subtitle: "Create Connected: the Kinetic Battery."
	quest.3C8ADEA240933DAF.title: "&6Store Rotation in Batteries"
	quest.3C97D1996DC17C62.quest_desc: [
		"&eMitnehmen:&r einen Stapel &6Fackeln&r, Essen und Blöcke zum Abstützen. &eF3&r oder ein Wegpunkt am Ankunftsplatz, bevor du losgräbst."
		""
		"&cAlle drei Tage um 4:45 Uhr&r wird die Farmwelt neu erzeugt. Wer dann drüben ist, reist mit allem, was er trägt, nach Hause. Maschinen, Kisten und dein Körper nach einem Tod bleiben drüben und sind danach weg."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Wirf Beute einfach ins Portal, sie kommt vor deinem Portal zuhause heraus. Inventar, Enderkiste und Rucksäcke reisen mit."
	]
	quest.3C97D1996DC17C62.quest_subtitle: "Alle drei Tage neu, also bring deine Beute heim."
	quest.3C97D1996DC17C62.title: "&6Überleb in der Farmwelt"
	quest.3CA381ECFA0C98DD.quest_desc: [
		"Das &6Abgrundopfer&r (Abyssal Sacrifice) craftest du formlos aus &6Nautilusschale&r, &6Athame&r, &6Kristallkoralle&r oder Korallenbrocken, &6Herz des Meeres&r, Diamantblock, Smaragdblock, Eisenblock, Goldblock und Amethystblock."
		""
		"{image:cataclysm:textures/item/abyssal_sacrifice.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Leg es auf den &6Altar des Abgrunds&r in der untersten Halle der Stadt. Dann erscheint der Leviathan. Für jeden weiteren Kampf brauchst du ein neues Opfer, einen Wiederbeleber gibt es hier nicht."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Das Herz des Meeres liegt in Schatzkisten, die Karte dazu bekommst du von Kartografen oder aus Schiffswracks. Gesegnetes Krabbenfleisch essen, bevor du das Opfer ablegst."
	]
	quest.3CA381ECFA0C98DD.quest_subtitle: "Neun Dinge, formlos, und der Altar des Abgrunds."
	quest.3CA381ECFA0C98DD.title: "&3Crafte das Opfer der Tiefe"
	quest.3CAA00684E4307E5.quest_desc: [
		"Put &6brass ingots&r under the press. Each becomes a &6Brass Sheet&r."
		""
		"Every precision mechanism starts on a brass sheet. A press of its own just for brass pays off."
	]
	quest.3CAA00684E4307E5.quest_subtitle: "The base for hand and mechanism."
	quest.3CAA00684E4307E5.title: "&6Press brass sheets"
	quest.3CADA5FC7DA5BF7A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_addons.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Five &6plastic&r, one &6steel&r in the middle, at the bottom coil, plating, coil. Place the addon on one of the machine's &eaddon slots&r, the tooltip names the slots."
		""
		"A Speed Addon gives &e+50 percent speed&r and &e20 percent more usage&r. On this server addons add up: two give +100 percent."
		""
		"On the right are all kinds of addons, one per quest. Each is a checkmark of its own."
	]
	quest.3CADA5FC7DA5BF7A.quest_subtitle: "Work faster, draw more power."
	quest.3CADA5FC7DA5BF7A.title: "&a&lAttach a Speed Addon"
	quest.3CB130AE8CB3BDAB.quest_desc: [
		"Knock &6glowstone&r from the ceiling until you have &e32 glowstone dust&r. Without Silk Touch each block gives 2 to 4 dust."
		""
		"&cBuild a platform underneath first.&r The clusters like to hang over lava lakes."
		""
		"Glowstone is light, a potion booster, fuel for the &6Respawn Anchor&r and the frame of the &bAether portal&r (&bThe Aether&r chapter)."
	]
	quest.3CB130AE8CB3BDAB.quest_subtitle: "It hangs from the ceiling, often over lava."
	quest.3CB130AE8CB3BDAB.title: "&eCollect glowstone"
	quest.3CB342F10C2D0DFF.quest_desc: [
		"Dirt, carrot, potato, poisonous potato, rotten flesh and nether wart give a &2Kodoku&r."
		""
		"Monsters that kill others collect Kodoku value. Put the hungry worm on a strong monster and kill it. If you burn the worm afterwards, circuits nearby get mana, more near a leyline."
	]
	quest.3CB342F10C2D0DFF.quest_subtitle: "A worm full of mana."
	quest.3CB342F10C2D0DFF.title: "&2Breed a Kodoku"
	quest.3CB7E833DCA668D3.quest_desc: [
		"Put &6coal&r into the left slot of the infuser. &eCarbon:&r coal 10 mB, charcoal 20 mB, block of coal 90 mB, block of charcoal 180 mB, enriched carbon 80 mB."
		""
		"&eRedstone:&r dust 10 mB, block 90 mB, enriched redstone 80 mB. Most recipes need 10 mB per piece, the circuit 20 mB."
	]
	quest.3CB7E833DCA668D3.quest_subtitle: "Coal in on the left, the bar rises."
	quest.3CB7E833DCA668D3.title: "&8Fill in carbon"
	quest.3CBACA26528A2779.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Solar Generators&r, two alloys, three iron. It delivers &d120 FE/t&r by day, six times as much as a single one."
		""
		"It needs room around it and open sky. A cube in between catches the night."
	]
	quest.3CBACA26528A2779.quest_subtitle: "Four small ones become a large one."
	quest.3CBACA26528A2779.title: "&eBuild an Advanced Solar Generator"
	quest.3CBBB520D1216F34.quest_desc: [
		"Top ender pearl, redstone torch, ender pearl, middle Ultimate Control Circuit, redstone, Ultimate Control Circuit, bottom ender pearl, &6Teleportation Core&r, ender pearl."
		""
		"It hangs on your QIO frequency and watches one kind: give it an item and an amount, then its signal lights up as soon as that much is in storage."
		""
		"That way the steel line switches off when 10,000 ingots are there, and on again when storage shrinks."
	]
	quest.3CBBB520D1216F34.quest_subtitle: "The QIO Redstone Adapter."
	quest.3CBBB520D1216F34.title: "&dLet Storage Give Redstone"
	quest.3CC37F8088B07FDB.quest_desc: [
		"Material: &e4 logs&r, any wood type."
		""
		"Plus &e4 Inferium Essence&r and a &6Prosperity Seed Base&r in the Infusion Altar."
	]
	quest.3CC37F8088B07FDB.quest_subtitle: "One seed, one checkmark."
	quest.3CC37F8088B07FDB.title: "Seed: Wood"
	quest.3CC653727697EE2C.quest_desc: [
		"Collect &e64 steel ingots&r. Crude Blast Furnace, Improved Blast Furnace or Mekanism, everything counts."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The obelisk goal of &6stage 3&r wants &e4 000 steel ingots&r. Two or three blast furnaces that run now already make that relaxed later. Handing in is done by hand at the obelisk later."
		""
		"That settles the basics: multiblocks, coke, creosote, alloys and steel."
	]
	quest.3CC653727697EE2C.quest_subtitle: "A stack of steel for stage 3."
	quest.3CC653727697EE2C.title: "&6&lPut 64 steel ingots in stock"
	quest.3CCCC4EE41E4536E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_elite_mekasuit.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Pro Teil: Netheritteil in der Mitte, HDPE-Platten, ein Ultimativer Schaltkreis, 2 Polonium Pellets und eine Induktionszelle. Module in der &6Modifikationsstation&r. Kapitel &5Mekanism: Elite&r."
		""
		"Module: Jetpack, Nachtsicht, Servomotor, Magnet, Strahlenschutz, Energie. Die starken brauchen Polonium. Die Rüstung läuft mit Strom und schützt, solange sie geladen ist."
	]
	quest.3CCCC4EE41E4536E.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism: Netherit mit Strom und Modulen."
	quest.3CCCC4EE41E4536E.title: "&bZieh die MekaSuit an"
	quest.3CCE4F6E158FA081.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r Heavy Engineering Block, &6Advanced Control Circuit&r, Heavy Engineering Block at the top. Engineering Processor, &6Steel Casing&r, Engineering Processor in the middle. Heavy Engineering Block, &aElementium Ingot&r, Heavy Engineering Block at the bottom."
		""
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/item/steel_core.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Engineering blocks from Immersive Engineering (with a Precision Mechanism), processors from AE2 or the CNC Stamper, elementium from a botanist. The obelisk wants &e8 Steel Cores&r."
	]
	quest.3CCE4F6E158FA081.quest_subtitle: "The milestone of the Steel Works."
	quest.3CCE4F6E158FA081.title: "&6Build a Steel Core"
	quest.3CD016B0B821A4FD.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Material Book&r is in your starting inventory. Otherwise: a &6book&r and a &6Blueprint Paper&r, shapeless."
		""
		"It lists every material with durability, speed, damage and traits and sorts by them. In the inventory, &eCtrl&r over a material shows the same stats."
	]
	quest.3CD016B0B821A4FD.quest_subtitle: "Every material with all its stats."
	quest.3CD016B0B821A4FD.title: "&7Look up a material"
	quest.3CD8FF8245CE3372.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: an &6iron armor piece&r in the middle, &e4 Magebloom Fiber&r on the pedestals. From &6diamond&r come the pieces of the &6Battlemage&r."
		""
		"All robes give mana regeneration. The Battlemage protects more, the Arcanist has better thread slots. The Sourceborn may wear both."
	]
	quest.3CD8FF8245CE3372.quest_subtitle: "Armor that gives mana."
	quest.3CD8FF8245CE3372.title: "&6Sew the Arcanist's Robes"
	quest.3CDF0C46E508B917.quest_desc: [
		"&6Arcane Crystal Ore&r lies in the Overworld between &eY -40 and Y 14&r, densest around Y -13. The veins are small (up to 5 blocks), three per chunk. Each block gives an &6Arcane Crystal&r, more with Fortune."
		""
		"{image:forbidden_arcanus:textures/item/arcane_crystal.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&5Forbidden and Arcanus&r opens completely with &6stage 2&r: the Hephaestus Forge up to tier 2, the Clibano, Edelwood, Obsidian Skulls. Only &eforge tier 3&r waits until stage 3, tiers 4 and 5 and the Draco Arcanus armor until stage 4."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Nothing here counts directly for the obelisk goal. This chapter is a side path for everyone who likes rituals and strange tools."
	]
	quest.3CDF0C46E508B917.quest_subtitle: "The crystal everything here is made of."
	quest.3CDF0C46E508B917.title: "&d&lMine Arcane Crystals"
	quest.3CDF143412D7A502.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6steel ingots&r on top of each other make four &6Steel Rods&r. Three steel ingots on top and three rods below make six &6Steel Scaffolding&r, four ingots and two rods three &6Steel Fences&r."
		""
		"The Excavator alone needs &e26&r scaffolding, the Crusher 10 scaffolding and 8 fences."
	]
	quest.3CDF143412D7A502.quest_subtitle: "The supports of the machines."
	quest.3CDF143412D7A502.title: "&7Build Steel Scaffolding and Steel Fences"
	quest.3CE6BDD1A3B018D6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Functional Storage&r, &6Fluid Drawer&r: lagert eine Flüssigkeit pro Fach, als 1x1, 1x2 oder 2x2. Eimer in der Hand füllt und leert sie, Rohre jeder Mod ebenso. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Ein Eimer in acht Holzbrettern. Mit dem &6Water Generator Upgrade&r füllt sie sich selbst mit Wasser, siehe Kapitel Lager."
	]
	quest.3CE6BDD1A3B018D6.quest_subtitle: "Functional Storage, Fluid Drawer: eine Flüssigkeit, von Hand und per Rohr."
	quest.3CE6BDD1A3B018D6.title: "Build a fluid drawer"
	quest.3CF613F8A8E72CC7.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 Inferium Essence&r around &6wheat seeds&r give &6Inferium Seeds&r. Plant them on farmland like wheat, each harvest gives &e1 essence&r and the seed back."
		""
		"Start with four seeds and plant every essence again until the field is full. 8 essence make one seed, so it pays to start early and harvest later."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r &6Bone meal does not work&r on Inferium or on any other essence crop. That is a rule of the mod, and on Kronwerke it holds without exception. What helps instead is under Mystical Fertilizer."
	]
	quest.3CF613F8A8E72CC7.quest_subtitle: "Essence that grows back."
	quest.3CF613F8A8E72CC7.title: "&aPlant Inferium Seeds"
	quest.3D0467FF96E935BF.quest_desc: [
		"Drei &6Eisengitter&r oben, darunter &6Druckeisen&r, &6Kupfer&r, &6Druckeisen&r ergeben einen &6Kühlkörper&r (Heat Sink). Er gibt Hitze oder Kälte des Blocks, an dem er &esitzt&r, an die Luft ab. Nur an den Block, auf dem er klebt, nicht an Nachbarn."
		""
		"Setz ihn auf die kalte Seite des Wirbelrohrs. Mehrere Kühlkörper brauchen mehrere Flächen, dafür hängst du einen Druckeisenblock oder ein Wärmerohr dazwischen. Ein &6Luftgitter-Modul&r an einem Rohr vor den Kühlkörpern bläst sie an und kühlt sie deutlich stärker."
		""
		"&cVorsicht:&r Ein Kühlkörper über 60 Grad oder unter minus 60 Grad verletzt dich beim Anfassen."
	]
	quest.3D0467FF96E935BF.quest_subtitle: "Hitze oder Kälte an die Luft abgeben."
	quest.3D0467FF96E935BF.title: "&bKühl mit Kühlkörpern"
	quest.3D0C2C9B2F0E878A.quest_desc: [
		"A &6string&r on top, &e2 sticks&r and a &6wooden slab&r below. That is the &6Drying Rack&r."
		""
		"Three places with up to three items each. Right click hangs up, right click takes down what is done. Hoppers fill and empty it too. Rotten flesh dries to &6leather&r here, wet sponges become dry."
	]
	quest.3D0C2C9B2F0E878A.quest_subtitle: "Herbs need time."
	quest.3D0C2C9B2F0E878A.title: "&6Build a Drying Rack"
	quest.3D12132AF9574661.quest_desc: [
		"The Energized Smelter with an installer, or at the crafting table: the smelter in the middle of the installer pattern."
	]
	quest.3D12132AF9574661.quest_subtitle: "Three furnaces in one."
	quest.3D12132AF9574661.title: "&aBasic Smelting Factory"
	quest.3D2084057D22EDCE.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r eine &6Anreicherungskammer&r in die Mitte, Osmiumbarren links und rechts, &6Fortschrittliche Steuerschaltkreise&r oben und unten, Infundierte Legierung in die Ecken. Die Schaltkreise öffnen mit &6Stufe 3&r (Gedrucktes Silizium aus AE2), vorher geht hier nichts."
		""
		"&eWas herauskommt:&r Ein Erzblock gibt &e3 Klumpen&r, ein Rohes Erz &e2 Klumpen&r, ein Block aus Rohem Erz &e18&r. Dabei frisst sie rund &e1 mB Sauerstoff pro Tick&r und etwa &d80 FE/t&r, viermal so viel wie die Anreicherungskammer."
		""
		"Den Sauerstoff bringst du mit Druckschläuchen vom Elektrolyseur. Zum Testen tut es auch &6Feuerstein&r im Chemikalien-Slot: 10 mB pro Stück."
		""
		"{image:mekanism:textures/item/clump_iron.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Die Aufgabe sind 16 Eisenklumpen. Die gibt es erst in Stufe 3, die Quest wartet so lange."
	]
	quest.3D2084057D22EDCE.quest_subtitle: "Drei Klumpen aus einem Erz. Stufe 3."
	quest.3D2084057D22EDCE.title: "&d&lBau eine Klärkammer"
	quest.3D30A98E855FD4DF.quest_desc: [
		"Whoever joins later gets the &6starter kits&r of every stage that is already open. With stage 2 that is 16 brass ingots, a Blaze Burner, a Source Jar and 8 Mana Pearls."
		""
		"That way you are right there with the others. If you need help, ask in chat or in voice chat."
	]
	quest.3D30A98E855FD4DF.quest_subtitle: "Whoever comes later does not start from zero."
	quest.3D30A98E855FD4DF.title: "&aGet your starter kit"
	quest.3D3132A8699F69CD.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6iron ingots&r in the corners, four &6grains&r on the sides, the middle stays empty."
		""
		"Two chassis are enough for the smelter and the generator."
	]
	quest.3D3132A8699F69CD.quest_subtitle: "The body of the basic machines."
	quest.3D3132A8699F69CD.title: "&7Build a Void Chassis"
	quest.3D325AEE94664080.quest_desc: [
		"Elite- und Ultimativ-Kabel, Würfel und Induktionszellen entstehen aus den fortgeschrittenen mit Verstärkter und Atomlegierung und den Elite- und Ultimativ-Schaltkreisen."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Elite:&r Kabel &d409 600 FE/t&r, Würfel 25,6 Millionen FE mit 25 600 FE/t, Induktionszelle 204,8 Milliarden FE, Anschluss 6,5 Millionen FE/t. &eUltimativ:&r Kabel &d3 276 800 FE/t&r, Würfel &d102,4 Millionen FE&r mit 102 400 FE/t, Induktionszelle &d1,6 Billionen FE&r, Anschluss 52,4 Millionen FE/t. Offen ab Stufe 4, siehe Kapitel &6Mekanism: Elite&r."
	]
	quest.3D325AEE94664080.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism: bis 3 276 800 FE/t im Kabel, 102,4 Millionen FE im Würfel."
	quest.3D325AEE94664080.title: "&5Rüste Mekanism auf Elite und Ultimativ"
	quest.3D346F0F81C0F4C4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mahou_tsukai_staff.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Use the scroll with &d2,000 mana&r in your bar, gems or a circuit within 10 blocks. &eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The server raised the cost from 100 to 2,000."
		""
		"Sneaking and right clicking changes the fire mode: one big explosion (&d5,000 mana&r, thunderstorm afterwards), many small ones (&d600&r per volley), beam (&d500 per tick&r, destroys blocks)."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Explosions and the beam destroy the landscape. Never near bases. For the obelisk you do not have to fire it."
	]
	quest.3D346F0F81C0F4C4.quest_subtitle: "2,000 mana for one staff."
	quest.3D346F0F81C0F4C4.title: "&6&lCall a Mystic Staff"
	quest.3D3A8DCEA26335EF.quest_desc: [
		"With stage 4 &bEternal Starlight&r opens too, a dimension of its own with three bosses (chapter &bEternal Starlight&r). Every portal at a glance is in the &6Checklist: Dimensions and Travel&r."
		""
		"Far out in the End lies Draconic Evolution's &5Chaos Island&r. For the finale in &estage 5&r the obelisk takes everyone there (chapter &5The Finale&r)."
	]
	quest.3D3A8DCEA26335EF.quest_subtitle: "A new world now, the Chaos Island later."
	quest.3D3A8DCEA26335EF.title: "&dSee What Is Still to Come"
	quest.3D3FDB0DB9F082C9.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Teslaspule&r entsteht in der Mechanischen Werkbank aus Kupferspulen, Andesitlegierung, Kondensatoren, Messinggehäuse, Messingblechen und einer Elektronenröhre. Stell sie über ein Depot oder ein Band."
		""
		"&eCrafts & Additions, Teslaspule:&r lädt FE-Gegenstände unter sich mit &d5 000 FE/t&r, Rezepte zum Aufladen mit 2 000 FE/t, Puffer &d40 000 FE&r. Sie kann auch Mobs in 3 Blöcken einen Schlag versetzen, jeder kostet 1 000 FE. Offen ab Stufe 2, siehe Kapitel &6Create: Erweiterungen&r."
	]
	quest.3D3FDB0DB9F082C9.quest_subtitle: "Crafts & Additions: lädt mit 5 000 FE/t, was unter ihr liegt."
	quest.3D3FDB0DB9F082C9.title: "&6Lad Gegenstände an der Teslaspule"
	quest.3D4C6F4E8F84D8E6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Annihilation Plane:&r three fluix at the top, iron, Annihilation Core, iron below. &6Formation Plane:&r the same with a Formation Core."
		""
		"The Annihilation Plane breaks the block in front of it and picks up items that touch it. It takes pickaxe enchantments: Fortune, Silk Touch and Efficiency work. It only breaks what the network can also store, so you filter with a partitioned cell in a subnetwork."
		""
		"The Formation Plane places blocks or throws out items the network pushes into it. Together with an Import Bus that makes a stone farm with no hands."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Both work as fake players. Allow that in your claim."
	]
	quest.3D4C6F4E8F84D8E6.quest_subtitle: "The network breaks and places blocks."
	quest.3D4C6F4E8F84D8E6.title: "&6Place a formation and an annihilation plane"
	quest.3D61ECD7368F450F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_frame_simple.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the Dissolution Chamber: two &6Plastic&r, one &6Advanced Frame&r, two &6netherite ingots&r, two &6diamonds&r, one &6Diamond Gear&r and &e135 mB of Ether Gas&r."
		""
		"The &6Wither Builder&r sits in it and builds a wither on its own from three wither skeleton skulls and four soul sand, for &d20,000 FE&r per operation. That keeps the Ether Gas running without you."
	]
	quest.3D61ECD7368F450F.quest_subtitle: "Frame tier 4, with Ether Gas."
	quest.3D61ECD7368F450F.title: "&5&lBuild a Supreme Machine Frame"
	quest.3D68AEC5831F6D62.quest_desc: [
		"In the chamber: an &6amethyst shard&r inside, &e3 essences&r of one element and &e3 gold ingots&r on the pedestals, &d5,000 Source&r."
		""
		"As a curio, the focus strengthens the glyphs of its school and makes them cheaper, but weakens the other elements. The greater focus comes with the Wilden Tribute in stage 3."
	]
	quest.3D68AEC5831F6D62.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: one school gets stronger."
	quest.3D68AEC5831F6D62.title: "&6Grind a Lesser Focus"
	quest.3D7B3B704740B2A8.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Enderauge&r oben rechts, zwei &6Flux-Staub&r und zwei &6Obsidian&r in einer Diagonale von unten links nach oben rechts ergeben den &6Flux-Konfigurator&r."
		""
		"Rechtsklick in die Luft öffnet dein Netzwerk-Fenster von überall, ohne an einem Gerät zu stehen. &eSchleichen und Rechtsklick&r auf ein Flux-Gerät kopiert dessen Einstellungen (Netz, Priorität, Limit), &eRechtsklick&r auf das nächste Gerät fügt sie ein."
		""
		"Du brauchst ihn nicht zwingend, aber sobald du mehr als fünf Punkte setzt, sparst du dir mit ihm jedes einzelne Verbinden."
	]
	quest.3D7B3B704740B2A8.quest_subtitle: "Das Netz in der Tasche."
	quest.3D7B3B704740B2A8.title: "&bBau den Flux-Konfigurator"
	quest.3D89A434297F0683.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_drawers_4.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Functional Storage&r, &6Schublade 1x1&r: &e32 Stapel&r einer Sorte, 1x2 zweimal 16, 2x2 viermal 8. Upgrades vervielfachen: Kupfer x8 und Gold x16 (Stufe 2), Diamant x24 (Stufe 3), Netherit x32 (Stufe 4). Sperren mit dem Configuration Tool hält die Sorte fest. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Eine Truhe in acht Brettern. Der &6Drawer Controller&r braucht Quarz und damit den Nether (Stufe 2), die &6Kompaktier-Schublade&r für Nugget, Barren und Block öffnet ebenfalls in Stufe 2. Siehe Kapitel Lager."
	]
	quest.3D89A434297F0683.quest_subtitle: "Functional Storage, Schublade: 32 Stapel einer Sorte in einem Block."
	quest.3D89A434297F0683.title: "Bau Schubladen"
	quest.3D97518706CB1359.quest_desc: [
		"Besides the &6Infused Iron&r, a &6Stoneworks Gearbox&r needs four &6Andesite Casings&r, a &6Large Cogwheel&r, a &6Mechanical Press&r, a &6Millstone&r and a &6Water Wheel&r."
		""
		"All of it is available with Create in stage 1. The chapter &6Create&r shows you every part, and you can use the press and the millstone for your andesite line before they go into the gearbox."
	]
	quest.3D97518706CB1359.quest_subtitle: "Everything from Create, except the Infused Iron."
	quest.3D97518706CB1359.title: "&6Collect the parts for the gearbox"
	quest.3D9BEB06B00E3EA8.quest_desc: [
		"&aEvocation&r is the illagers' bag of tricks. Common: &6Fang Strike&r (line of fangs), &6Fang Ward&r (rings of fangs around you), &6Firecracker&r (fireworks explode where you look), &6Shield&r (shield wall, stops projectiles and enemies), &6Summon Horse&r (spirit horse, only for you), &6Throw&r (throws your tool as a weapon)."
		""
		"Focus: emerald. The Archevoker drops the matching rune."
		""
		"&cStage 2:&r Arrow Volley, Chain Creeper, Lob Creeper, Gust, Spectral Hammer, Invisibility, Scapegoat, Summon Vex. &cStage 3:&r Fang Swirl, Slow. &cStage 4:&r Wololo."
	]
	quest.3D9BEB06B00E3EA8.quest_subtitle: "Fangs, shield, horse and fireworks."
	quest.3D9BEB06B00E3EA8.title: "&aCast an Evocation Spell"
	quest.3DAE52B7AADD884C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/logistics_programmer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Logic Programmer:&r shapeless from a Crystalized Menril Block and a crafting table. &6Variable Store:&r chunks, two menril blocks and a chest."
		""
		"In the programmer you build cards of your own: fixed numbers, items, lists and operators such as addition or comparison. Cards that other cards refer to have to lie in the network, best in the Variable Store."
		""
		"The book &6On the Dynamics of Integration&r explains everything step by step, with exercises."
	]
	quest.3DAE52B7AADD884C.quest_subtitle: "Numbers, lists, comparisons."
	quest.3DAE52B7AADD884C.title: "&9&lWrite cards in the Logic Programmer"
	quest.3DB212CA2A66BF80.quest_desc: [
		"&6Tough Alloy plates&r in the corners, &6Plate Advanced&r at the top and bottom, &6servos&r left and right, a &6casing&r in the middle."
		""
		"Fuel goes in through the port and spent fuel comes out. In energy mode it gives off power, in boiling mode the reactor makes steam for turbines."
	]
	quest.3DB212CA2A66BF80.quest_subtitle: "Fuel in, power out."
	quest.3DB212CA2A66BF80.title: "&7Build a Reactor Port"
	quest.3DB94A49EAC2AF88.quest_desc: [
		"A room without any light, at least &e24 blocks&r from where you stand, platforms with open &6trapdoors&r at the edges, between them a shaft &e22 blocks&r deep. Monsters take open trapdoors for floor, step on them and fall."
		""
		"After 22 blocks, zombies and skeletons land with half a heart: one hit is enough, and the experience is yours. From 23 blocks they die on their own, then you get loot but no experience."
		""
		"Hoppers on the floor collect bones, arrows, flesh and gunpowder. An &6Encased Fan&r pushes hesitant monsters to the hole."
	]
	quest.3DB94A49EAC2AF88.quest_subtitle: "Monsters that walk into the shaft on their own."
	quest.3DB94A49EAC2AF88.title: "&cBuild a dark room"
	quest.3DBC8EF3BCC7BE54.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Energetic Alloy Ingot&r, an &6ender pearl&r and a &6glowstone dust&r give two ingots."
		""
		"Eight nuggets around an &6emerald&r make the &6Vibrant Crystal&r. The alloy carries the fastest conduits and the Octadic Capacitor."
	]
	quest.3DBC8EF3BCC7BE54.quest_subtitle: "Energetic, ender pearl, glowstone."
	quest.3DBC8EF3BCC7BE54.title: "&aAlloy Vibrant Alloy"
	quest.3DC4ED509279D8F2.quest_desc: [
		"Both from three &6Enderic Compound&r, one &6Adamant Ingot&r, one &6Motor&r and two &6steel&r, just laid out differently. EMI shows the shape."
		""
		"The &6Hand Drill&r is pickaxe and shovel in one, the &6Chainsaw&r axe and sword. With &eShift&r the saw fells a whole tree at once. Both hold &e10,000 RF&r and never break, without power they only work very slowly."
		""
		"You charge them in the Equipment Charger or with the Exo Chestplate worn. They accept enchantments such as Efficiency and Fortune."
	]
	quest.3DC4ED509279D8F2.quest_subtitle: "Unbreakable as long as there is power."
	quest.3DC4ED509279D8F2.title: "&eBuild a Hand Drill and Chainsaw"
	quest.3DC64A36E9EA0760.quest_desc: [
		"Four Niotic Crystals in the corners, two &6Niotic Capacitors&r at the top and bottom, two &6Blazing Energy Cells&r left and right, the casing in the middle."
		""
		"It stores &e100 million FE&r, more than both Blazing cells together (80 million). Put it behind the reactor, then nothing goes to waste in auto mode."
	]
	quest.3DC64A36E9EA0760.quest_subtitle: "100 million FE in one block."
	quest.3DC64A36E9EA0760.title: "&bBuild a Niotic Energy Cell"
	quest.3DD33CCB4A8513D4.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ophyx' Calling, all with the Djinni book."
		"&6Gambler:&r emerald, block of diamond, gold ingot, block of silver. &6Wandering Trader:&r &e2 Otherworld Essence&r, &e2 emeralds&r."
		"&6Partner:&r gold ingot, emerald (male) or diamond (female), gunpowder, pork, sword, glass bottle, &cSacrifice:&r a chicken."
		""
		"The gambler trades gems for random gems or nuggets, rarely Iesnium, and leaves after 30 minutes. The partner cooks food and extends potions; the bond is permanent."
		""
		"The &6machine operator&r (block of coal, gold, iron, furnace) operates machines from the magical storage that comes with stage 3."
	]
	quest.3DD33CCB4A8513D4.quest_subtitle: "Gambler, trader, partner, operator."
	quest.3DD33CCB4A8513D4.title: "&dSummon the other Djinni"
	quest.3DD498AA75B86A98.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_mixer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"One &6andesite&r and one &6iron&r or &6zinc nugget&r into the basin: the mixer makes &etwo Andesite Alloys&r from them."
		""
		"This is how you build it: one chest each of andesite and nuggets with an Andesite Funnel that puts them on the belt to the basin. A funnel on the side of the basin loads the alloy into an output chest."
		""
		"&cStuck?&r Usually an ingredient is missing, or the output funnel faces the wrong way and the basin is full."
	]
	quest.3DD498AA75B86A98.quest_subtitle: "Double the alloy, a quarter of the material."
	quest.3DD498AA75B86A98.title: "&6Mix alloy on the belt"
	quest.3DDA09607F9DF746.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_portal.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Bau einen Rahmen aus &6Glowstone&r wie ein Netherportal: mindestens vier breit und fünf hoch, ohne Ecken reichen &610 Glowstone&r. Dann gieß einen &6Wassereimer&r in den Rahmen. Das Wasser wird zum Portal."
		""
		"Glowstone hängt an der Decke des Nethers (siehe Kapitel &cDer Nether&r). Vier Glowstonestaub ergeben einen Block. Pass beim Bauen auf, wohin du klickst: Ein Rechtsklick mit dem Eimer neben den Rahmen verschüttet das Wasser nur."
		""
		"Das Portal geht nur von der Oberwelt aus. Im Aether entsteht ein passendes Gegenstück, durch das du zurückkommst."
	]
	quest.3DDA09607F9DF746.quest_subtitle: "Ein Rahmen aus Glowstone, gezündet mit Wasser."
	quest.3DDA09607F9DF746.title: "&bBau das Glowstone-Portal"
	quest.3DDA8494CDCBD683.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_plastic.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"One &6Dry Rubber&r in a furnace gives one &6Plastic&r."
		""
		"Almost every machine needs two to four, a conveyor recipe six. A stack is a good first goal, let the extractors run day and night."
		""
		"&eGood to know:&r The &6Plastic Sheet&r from Oritech also counts as plastic in every recipe of this mod."
		""
		"{image:industrialforegoing:textures/item/plastic.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3DDA8494CDCBD683.quest_subtitle: "The material this mod is built from."
	quest.3DDA8494CDCBD683.title: "&f&lSmelt Rubber into Plastic"
	quest.3DE4DC5484068C06.quest_desc: [
		"Into the Fermentation Vat: &6Sal Ammoniac Bucket&r, &6sugar&r and a crop. Out comes a big stack of &6Fermentation Starter&r."
		""
		"One starter replaces the sugar or the crop per fermentation."
	]
	quest.3DE4DC5484068C06.quest_subtitle: "Less sugar per Niter."
	quest.3DE4DC5484068C06.title: "&7Make a Fermentation Starter"
	quest.3DE5BAC7CDD4991E.quest_desc: [
		"Erleg &e3 Sculk-Hundertfüßer&r. Sie krabbeln durch die &6Tiefenlande&r und lassen &6Fäden&r fallen."
		""
		"Fäden sind hier unten knapp. Für Bögen, Wolle und die Seelenelytren später brauchst du sie trotzdem."
	]
	quest.3DE5BAC7CDD4991E.quest_subtitle: "Lang, flink und voller Fäden."
	quest.3DE5BAC7CDD4991E.title: "&3Erleg Sculk-Hundertfüßer"
	quest.3DF00E2C1755CB3F.quest_desc: [
		"&cBlood:&r Every living thing that takes damage within &e5 blocks&r of the forge gives it &e20 blood per health point&r. A zombie with 20 health points is 400 blood. A small mob trap next to the forge fills the bar by itself."
		""
		"On the go: hold a &6Test Tube&r (glass bottle and rune) in your &eoffhand&r and hit with the main hand. It becomes a Blood Test Tube and collects 20 blood per damage point, up to 3,000. Put into the blood slot, it flows into the forge at 10 per tick."
		""
		"&aExperience:&r A &6bottle of enchanting&r in the experience slot gives 15. Enchanted items or books give up their enchantments (curses stay) and deliver between half and the full value of their minimum cost as essence."
	]
	quest.3DF00E2C1755CB3F.quest_subtitle: "Two essences you have to fight for."
	quest.3DF00E2C1755CB3F.title: "&cTap Blood and Experience"
	quest.3DF2DC332927A30F.quest_desc: [
		"Mach auch &6Helm&r, &6Beinschutz&r und &6Stiefel&r aus Resonarium: jedes Teil eine Diamantrüstung, eine Resonariumplatte und eine Vorlage am Schmiedetisch."
		""
		"Mit allen vier Teilen fängt die Rüstung den Schaden ab, der sonst durch jede Rüstung geht, auch den &cSchallangriff des Wärters&r. Sie nutzt sich dabei ab, nimm Reparatur oder Ersatzplatten mit."
	]
	quest.3DF2DC332927A30F.quest_subtitle: "Vier Teile, kein Schallangriff kommt mehr durch."
	quest.3DF2DC332927A30F.title: "&6&lTrag die volle Resonariumrüstung"
	quest.3DFBD8D19758869F.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Clibano Core&r is eight &6darkstone&r around a &6Blaze Burner&r from Create. Then the build: a &e3 by 3 by 3 cube&r of &6Polished Darkstone Bricks&r, &6Polished Darkstone&r at the eight corners, hollow inside, and the core sits in the middle of a side wall. Right click the core with &6Mundabitur Dust&r."
		""
		"The Clibano smelts ores and raw ores like a blast furnace in 5 seconds. A &6Soul&r in the soul slot makes &bsoul fire&r, 1.5 times as fast, an &6Enchanted Soul&r &denchanted fire&r, 2.5 times as fast."
		""
		"&eResidue:&r With every third ore a residue of that kind stays in the Clibano. Nine residues give a whole block, iron block, copper block or Arcane Crystal Block. That is the mod's ore multiplication."
	]
	quest.3DFBD8D19758869F.quest_subtitle: "A blast furnace that heats with souls."
	quest.3DFBD8D19758869F.title: "&6Build the Clibano"
	quest.3E0C519367EC7FF6.quest_desc: [
		"Like the pickaxe, with the &6Wyvern Sword&r as catalyst: 4 netherite ingots, a Wyvern Core, 2 Awakened ingots, a Draconic Energy Controller. Costs 32 million energy."
		""
		"&6Draconic Damage Module:&r Awakened nuggets in the corners, &6dragon's breath&r at the top and bottom, in the middle Wyvern Damage Module, Wyvern Core, Wyvern Damage Module. The sword is for everything that gets too close on the island."
	]
	quest.3E0C519367EC7FF6.quest_subtitle: "With dragon's breath in the damage module."
	quest.3E0C519367EC7FF6.title: "&dFuse a Draconic Sword"
	quest.3E24BBEAB88789C9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_etching.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eÄtzsäure&r (Etching Acid): ein &6Eimer flüssiger Kunststoff&r, zwei &6Verrottetes Fleisch&r, zwei &6Spinnenaugen&r und zwei &6Schwarzpulver&r in der Druckkammer bei 1 Bar ergeben einen Eimer. &eÄtzbecken&r (Etching Tank): zwei &6Obsidian&r um eine &6Glasscheibe&r oben, ein &6Kleiner Tank&r zwischen zwei &6Verstärkten Ziegelmauern&r, unten drei &6Verstärkte Ziegelstufen&r."
		""
		"Füll die Säure ins Becken und leg bis zu 25 belichtete Platinen hinein. Ohne Hitze dauert eine Platine &e150 Sekunden&r, geheizt über 50 Grad bis zu 30 Sekunden, dann wird aber langsam Säure verbraucht. Gelungene &6Unbestückte Platinen&r (Unassembled PCB) landen rechts oben, &6Fehlplatinen&r rechts unten."
		""
		"Fehlplatinen werden im &6Schmelzofen&r wieder zu leeren Platinen. Zum Automatisieren: Unbestückte von der Seite abziehen, Fehlplatinen oben oder unten."
	]
	quest.3E24BBEAB88789C9.quest_subtitle: "Ätzsäure aus der Kammer, ein Becken aus Obsidian."
	quest.3E24BBEAB88789C9.title: "&9Ätze die Platine"
	quest.3E4314AD3C1A3B99.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r Enriched iron in the corners, &6Storage Housing&r in the top and bottom middle, a &6Construction Core&r on the left, a &6Destruction Core&r on the right, a Machine Casing in the center."
		""
		"It moves contents between the network and the disks you put in: empty a full disk into the network, or fill an empty disk with certain things, for moving house or as a package for a fellow player. It needs 6 FE/t plus 4 per disk."
	]
	quest.3E4314AD3C1A3B99.quest_subtitle: "The Disk Interface."
	quest.3E4314AD3C1A3B99.title: "&bEmpty and Fill Disks"
	quest.3E43817C36C9EA11.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Sevira's Permanent Confinement."
		"&6Bowls:&r your &6Butcher Knife&r, &e2 Iesnium ingots&r, an &cAfrit Essence&r, &6netherite dust&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Afrit book, 300 seconds."
		""
		"The knife does more damage, still gives tallow and makes some mobs drop their heads. Against spirits it hits &d3 times&r as hard. Just right for the Unbound Afrit, which you defeat hundreds of times for the obelisk."
	]
	quest.3E43817C36C9EA11.quest_subtitle: "Triple damage against spirits."
	quest.3E43817C36C9EA11.title: "&6Bind an Iesnium Butcher Knife"
	quest.3E476F6BD11012E2.quest_desc: [
		"Bring together &e16 blaze rods&r, &e64 Nether quartz&r and &e32 glowstone dust&r. That lasts a while."
		""
		"Rods for more Blaze Burners and brewing stands, quartz for electron tubes, glowstone for light and the Aether portal."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The goal of the stage wants &e2,000 brass ingots&r, and every mixer with brass needs a Blaze Burner. Whoever catches more blazes than they need passes them on."
	]
	quest.3E476F6BD11012E2.quest_subtitle: "Enough for a whole stage."
	quest.3E476F6BD11012E2.title: "&c&lBuild up a Nether supply"
	quest.3E49A7C3393DBF2E.quest_desc: [
		"Rauten aus &6Reaktorrahmen&r (Polonium-Pellets im Rezept), Reaktorglas, Anschlüsse, die &6Laser-Fokusmatrix&r (Kronwerke: Quellenedelsteinblock) und der Controller oben. Hohlraum mit D-T-Treibstoff in den Controller, Laserverstärker auf die Matrix, zünden."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Fusionsreaktor:&r Brennstoff Deuterium und Tritium aus Wasser (Elektrolyseur, Solar-Neutronenaktivator). Strom direkt über die Anschlüsse, oder mit Wasser Dampf für die Industrieturbine, damit noch mehr. Puffer 400 Millionen FE. Je höher die Einspritzrate, desto mehr Strom, die Zahl hängt von Rate und Kühlung ab. &eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r die Fokusmatrix braucht einen Quellenedelsteinblock. Offen ab Stufe 4, siehe Kapitel &6Mekanism: Elite&r."
	]
	quest.3E49A7C3393DBF2E.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, Fusion: D-T-Treibstoff, Laser, Strom oder Dampf."
	quest.3E49A7C3393DBF2E.title: "&5Zünde den Fusionsreaktor"
	quest.3E4E61C75AEC6B2D.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Halt \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbultimine\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" gedrückt, schau auf einen Block, bau ab. Mit Shift und Mausrad wechselst du die Form: Ader, Tunnel 3x3, Stollen.\"}]"
		""
		"Kostet 20-mal so viel Hunger wie ein Block, also iss vorher. Jede Herkunft darf das. Kapitel &6Komfort&r."
	]
	quest.3E4E61C75AEC6B2D.quest_subtitle: "FTB Ultimine: bis zu 128 Blöcke pro Schlag."
	quest.3E4E61C75AEC6B2D.title: "&6Räum eine Ader mit Ultimine"
	quest.3E50797AB2FE6514.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_mega.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Setz &64 Pekannuss-Setzlinge&r als 2x2-Quadrat und dünge einen davon. Die &6Pekannuss&r wächst nur so, als einzelner Setzling passiert gar nichts. Genauso Ulme, Iroko, Padauk, Pandanus und Eibe."
		""
		"Andere brauchen &e3x3&r (Brown Amber, Cave Dweller, Grandidier-Baobab, Regenbogeneukalyptus, Rosen-Eukalyptus) oder &e5x5&r (Paranuss, Kapok, Purpleheart, Mammutbaum, Westliche Hemlocktanne, Gelbes Meranti). Der Mammutbaum wird mit &e9x9&r Setzlingen noch einmal größer."
		""
		"Viele normale Bäume haben zusätzlich eine große Form: Buche, Walnuss, Hasel, Zeder, Mango und rund vierzig weitere wachsen aus 2x2 oder 3x3 Setzlingen zu einem Riesenbaum mit viel mehr Blättern, also mehr Früchten pro Baum."
	]
	quest.3E50797AB2FE6514.quest_subtitle: "Manche Bäume wachsen nur als Riesen."
	quest.3E50797AB2FE6514.title: "&aPflanz vier Setzlinge im Quadrat"
	quest.3E57B5C07A82A6AB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Two wool&r on the altar, &6two string&r on the stands, plus &e3 Aerial&r and &e3 Earthen&r."
		""
		"It goes into the Soulhunter armor and the Soulwoven Pouch."
	]
	quest.3E57B5C07A82A6AB.quest_subtitle: "Cloth for soul hunters."
	quest.3E57B5C07A82A6AB.title: "&7Weave Soulwoven Silk"
	quest.3E6072EF5F93C964.quest_desc: [
		"&6Experience Block&r, &6sponge&r and &6copper casing&r on top of each other give the &6Experience Lantern&r."
		""
		"It sucks up experience orbs and experience from nearby players and glows brighter the more it has stored. That works on a contraption too."
		""
		"At a mob farm it collects the experience for enchanter, forger and Enchanting Cake."
	]
	quest.3E6072EF5F93C964.quest_subtitle: "It collects what falls off in fights."
	quest.3E6072EF5F93C964.title: "&5Hang Up an Experience Lantern"
	quest.3E621E87FA4075B1.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_transport_packages.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Create&r, &6Verpacker&r: packt den Inhalt eines Inventars in &6Pakete&r, die auf Bändern, in Rutschen und an &6Kettenförderern&r reisen. &6Froschports&r an der Kette nehmen Pakete mit ihrer Adresse an. Filter über die Adresse. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Verpacker: ein Pappblock in der Mitte, Eisenbarren oben und an den Seiten, Redstone unten. Kettenförderer: ein Großes Zahnrad in vier Andesit-Gehäusen ergibt zwei, verbunden mit Ketten."
		""
		"Mit &6Lagerverbindung&r und &6Lagerticker&r bestellst du aus allen angeschlossenen Lagern, und der Verpacker schickt es los. Das Postsystem von Create 6, siehe Kapitel Create."
	]
	quest.3E621E87FA4075B1.quest_subtitle: "Create, Verpacker und Kettenförderer: Gegenstände als Paket mit Adresse."
	quest.3E621E87FA4075B1.title: "Verschick ein Paket"
	quest.3E6A3398CEDD686B.quest_desc: [
		"&7Common&r: one attribute bonus, a 25 percent chance of a second one."
		"&aUncommon&r: two attribute bonuses, half the time an effect on top, up to one socket."
		"&9Rare&r: two attribute bonuses, one effect (35 percent for a second), up to two sockets, and it wears 10 to 25 percent slower."
		""
		"&5Epic&r has three attributes, one effect and always an &6ability&r with a cooldown. &6Mythic&r has four attributes, two effects and an ability, rarely even unbreakability."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Common, Uncommon and a little Rare exist in stage 1. &5Epic&r comes in stage 3, &6Mythic&r in stage 4, with the world tiers Summit and Pinnacle."
	]
	quest.3E6A3398CEDD686B.quest_subtitle: "The color of the name says what is inside."
	quest.3E6A3398CEDD686B.title: "&7Learn the Rarities"
	quest.3E855AB0F15CBD8B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluid Extractor&r: blue dye, copper, Mercury Shard on top of each other. &6Fluid Inserter&r: blue dye, Mercury Shard, copper."
		""
		"Attach the extractor to the &6Sal Ammoniac Tank&r and an inserter to every Liquefaction Cauldron, connect them with copper wire. Then the solvent flows to the cauldrons on its own, as long as the accumulator has water."
	]
	quest.3E855AB0F15CBD8B.quest_subtitle: "No more carrying buckets."
	quest.3E855AB0F15CBD8B.title: "&bMove Sal Ammoniac by Mercury"
	quest.3E8A1A1D0ADC31D8.quest_desc: [
		"Fusion, Wyvern tier: &6Dislocator&r in the core, in eight injectors &63 ender pearls&r, &64 Draconium Ingots&r and &61 Wyvern Core&r. Costs 1 million energy."
		""
		"It remembers a whole list of places and refuels with ender pearls. It can also &eblink&r: up to 32 blocks, one pearl lasts 4 jumps."
	]
	quest.3E8A1A1D0ADC31D8.quest_subtitle: "Many places and short jumps."
	quest.3E8A1A1D0ADC31D8.title: "&bFuse an Advanced Dislocator"
	quest.3E8E13AF9A5B34EA.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Empty Heat Sink&r with four &6redstone dust&r in a cross makes a &6Redstone Heat Sink&r."
		""
		"Each kind of heat sink has its own cooling rate and its own rules where it may sit. The tooltip shows the rate in H/t, EMI shows the rule under &eHeat Sink Placement&r. With several kinds you cool denser reactors."
	]
	quest.3E8E13AF9A5B34EA.quest_subtitle: "The next heat sink after water."
	quest.3E8E13AF9A5B34EA.title: "&bBuild a Redstone Heat Sink"
	quest.3EB525DB212CC3D6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_laser.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the Dissolution Chamber: four &6glass panes&r, one &6dye&r and &e250 mB of latex&r make a &6Laser Lens&r in the dye's color."
		""
		"In the base it raises the weight of its ore a lot and is not used up. &6Brown&r iron, &6Orange&r copper, &6Yellow&r gold, &6Light Gray&r osmium, &6Black&r coal, &6Lime&r uranium. EMI shows the rest."
	]
	quest.3EB525DB212CC3D6.quest_subtitle: "Tell the laser what you want."
	quest.3EB525DB212CC3D6.title: "&6Insert a Laser Lens"
	quest.3EB7E04048C1259C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_dimensions_r_enderio.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eSo geht es:&r Ein &6Reiseanker&r sind 4 Eisen, 4 Leitungsbinder und ein &6Pulsierender Kristall&r. Stell Anker in deiner Basis auf, schleich und schau einen anderen Anker an, und du springst hin. Der &6Stab des Reisens&r (Dunkelstahl, Enderkristall) springt mit 1 000 FE auch ins Freie, 24 Blöcke weit, 100 000 FE Speicher."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r Für eine große Fabrik mit mehreren Etagen und Hallen gibt es nichts Bequemeres. Anker zu Anker reicht 96 Blöcke, Stab zu Anker 192."
		""
		"Alles im Kapitel &6Ender IO&r."
	]
	quest.3EB7E04048C1259C.quest_subtitle: "Ender IO: von Anker zu Anker springen. Stufe 3."
	quest.3EB7E04048C1259C.title: "&bSetz Reiseanker"
	quest.3EC125BD6B2AF002.quest_desc: [
		"Worktable: at the top &6obsidian&r, &6crying obsidian&r, obsidian. Below that Pewter, then a Pewter Inlay as the handle."
		"Extra: &6ender pearl&r, &6Lesser Soul Gem&r and &e2 Soul Shards&r."
		""
		"This pickaxe flips hardness around: hard blocks like &6obsidian&r break fast, soft ones like dirt or sand slow it down. Use it for obsidian and deepslate, not for dirt."
	]
	quest.3EC125BD6B2AF002.quest_subtitle: "The harder the block, the faster."
	quest.3EC125BD6B2AF002.title: "&5Forge the Pickaxe of Inversion"
	quest.3ED9F8C49E3CEF37.quest_desc: [
		"Bring together &e8 Wilden Tributes&r and use Linger or Wall in a fight."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r In stage 4 the obelisk wants &e128 Gaia Spirits&r and &e30 Mystic Staffs&r on the magic side. Against the Gaia Guardian's minions a Linger field or a Wall helps."
		""
		"In &6stage 5&r the obelisk wants &e64 Wilden Tributes&r, a fixed number, each one a Chimera fight. Whoever practices now manages that later in a few evenings."
	]
	quest.3ED9F8C49E3CEF37.quest_subtitle: "Everything ready for the Chaos Guardian."
	quest.3ED9F8C49E3CEF37.title: "&d&lGet Ready for Stage 5"
	quest.3EE3670FBEA66FE6.quest_desc: [
		"&eTon:&r Create wäscht &6Sand&r unter einem Ventilator mit Wasser zu Tonklumpen (25 Prozent). Die Anreicherungskammer von Mekanism macht aus &6Schlamm&r Tonblöcke und aus einem Tonblock vier Klumpen. Ein Bohrer von Create auf einer Tonader im Fluss geht auch."
		""
		"&eGlas:&r Sand im Schmelzer, sechs Glas werden an der Werkbank zu 16 Scheiben. Ein Mechanischer Handwerker oder eine AE2-Autocraft-Vorlage baut dir dann Matrizen auf Vorrat."
		""
		"Für ein Rechenzentrum in Stufe 4 brauchst du etwa &e100 Matrizen pro Minute&r. Plan die Linie jetzt, dann steht sie, wenn es so weit ist."
	]
	quest.3EE3670FBEA66FE6.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 3. Matrizen nie wieder von Hand."
	quest.3EE3670FBEA66FE6.title: "&bTon und Glas am Band"
	quest.3EF0490971BDDD89.quest_desc: [
		"Acht &6Weizenmehl&r um einen &6Eimer Hefekultur&r ergeben acht &6Sauerteig&r (Sourdough). Im Ofen wird daraus &6Sauerteigbrot&r, das besser sättigt als normales Brot."
		""
		"Mehl presst die Druckkammer bei 1,5 Bar aus Weizen, drei Mehl pro Weizen."
	]
	quest.3EF0490971BDDD89.quest_subtitle: "Hefe hat auch was für den Magen."
	quest.3EF0490971BDDD89.title: "&6Back Sauerteigbrot"
	quest.3F05BE6E2C01A787.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_advanced_electrostatic.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r vier &6Eisengitter&r in die Ecken, drei &6Plastic Sheets&r oben und an den Seiten, ein &6Turbine Rotor&r in die Mitte, der &6Advanced Air Compressor&r unten."
		""
		"Jeder Blitzeinschlag bringt &e200 000 mL&r Luft auf einmal. Der Kompressor erzeugt die Blitze selbst, bei klarem Himmel fast nie, bei Regen öfter, im &eGewitter&r sehr oft. Echte Blitze zählen nicht."
		""
		"&eAufbau:&r Ein Gitter aus &6Eisengittern&r oder Blitzableitern, mit dem Kompressor verbunden, bis 5 Blöcke zur Seite und 5 nach oben und unten, erhöht die Chance. Bis zu 10 Gitter direkt darüber bilden einen Blitzableiter. Eisengitter &edirekt darunter&r leiten je 10 000 mL Überdruck ab, damit er nach dem Einschlag nicht platzt. Zwei bis drei reichen bei einem Kompressor."
	]
	quest.3F05BE6E2C01A787.quest_subtitle: "Ein Blitz, 200 000 mL Luft."
	quest.3F05BE6E2C01A787.title: "&eBau einen Electrostatic Compressor"
	quest.3F108701026EFF92.quest_desc: [
		"In the water cauldron: &e6 leather&r, a &6string&r, a &6gold nugget&r. The &6Small Satchel&r gives a broom &e9 slots&r."
		""
		"&6Medium&r (Small Satchel, 6 leather, string) gives 18, &6Large&r (Small and Medium Satchel, 2 leather, 4 strings) gives 27. Pack spare brushes into it, without a brush no broom flies."
	]
	quest.3F108701026EFF92.quest_subtitle: "Luggage for the broom."
	quest.3F108701026EFF92.title: "&6Sew a Small Satchel"
	quest.3F10F6D7017454EA.quest_desc: [
		"Aus dem &6Steinschneider&r kommen mit einem Zinkbarren auch die Formen von &6Copycats+&r. Zwei &6Copycat-Stufen&r übereinander ergeben einen &6Copycat-Block&r."
		""
		"Tarn ihn wie jede Copycat mit einem Rechtsklick. Copycat-Blöcke auf einer Kontraption bewegen sich mit und behalten ihr Aussehen, ideal für Tore und Zugbrücken mit Create."
	]
	quest.3F10F6D7017454EA.quest_subtitle: "Copycats+: ganze Blöcke, Treppen und Balken."
	quest.3F10F6D7017454EA.title: "&6Bau mit Copycat-Blöcken"
	quest.3F11195E4227182C.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6Soul Gem&r, &e2 gold&r and &e2 silver ingots&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book."
		""
		"Catch your familiar with the ring and wear it as a curio. It keeps working without walking next to you. Whoever gets the ring and releases the familiar becomes its new master."
	]
	quest.3F11195E4227182C.quest_subtitle: "A familiar as jewellery."
	quest.3F11195E4227182C.title: "&6Bind a Familiar Ring"
	quest.3F11CFEBD1C69149.quest_desc: [
		"Book in hand, press &eC&r. Click &dProjectile&r, then &dBreak&r, enter a name, save. Right click casts the spell."
		""
		"The book has ten slots. &eV&r opens the selection wheel. Build a second one right away: &eProjectile, Harm&r for combat."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Break without amplification only handles blocks of medium hardness. For ores, &dAmplify&r goes behind it soon."
	]
	quest.3F11CFEBD1C69149.quest_subtitle: "Projectile, Break. Click, and the block is gone."
	quest.3F11CFEBD1C69149.title: "&dCast your first spell"
	quest.3F162EF082914490.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Steel Plates&r in a cross make four &6Steel Sheetmetal&r. Three of them side by side make six slabs."
		""
		"The Arc Furnace needs 8 blocks and 14 slabs, the Excavator 16 blocks. From the Metal Press on, the plates come by themselves."
	]
	quest.3F162EF082914490.quest_subtitle: "Four steel plates, four blocks."
	quest.3F162EF082914490.title: "&7Build Steel Sheetmetal"
	quest.3F19701DFAC9B458.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wool&r, two &6sticks&r and one &6Andesite Alloy&r make two &6Windmill Sails&r. A mill needs at least &e8&r."
		""
		"Dye colors them. Without wool there is the &6Sail Frame&r, which counts the same."
	]
	quest.3F19701DFAC9B458.quest_subtitle: "Eight sails are the minimum."
	quest.3F19701DFAC9B458.title: "&6Sew windmill sails"
	quest.3F1B1C788F85F428.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &62 red&r, &62 green&r, &62 blue&r, &62 white&r petals, &6Rune of Winter&r, &6Rune of Air&r, &6Pixie Dust&r."
		""
		"It eats &ewool&r in the color it wants right now, then the next color around the wheel. The Dandelifeon needs a Gaia Spirit and comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.3F1B1C788F85F428.quest_subtitle: "Eats wool in the right color."
	quest.3F1B1C788F85F428.title: "&6Plant a Spectrolus"
	quest.3F1CFD46ED53D831.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r shapeless from a &6Machine Casing&r, &6Cable&r, &6Advanced Processor&r and &6redstone torch&r."
		""
		"The &6Relay&r connects an input network to an output network and switches the output off by redstone. Without pass-through you pass things on selectively: power, storage, security, patterns, or by filter only certain items."
		""
		"That way a fellow player's workshop only gets to see ores and coal from your network. It needs 8 FE/t on each side."
	]
	quest.3F1CFD46ED53D831.quest_subtitle: "The Relay."
	quest.3F1CFD46ED53D831.title: "&6Switch Off Parts of the Network"
	quest.3F1EF055276CDA53.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_master_tribute.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"With every lost quarter of its &c1,000 health&r it stops, is briefly invulnerable and gets wings, spikes or horns, until it has everything."
		""
		"&eWings:&r a dive that destroys blocks here. &eSpikes:&r spike volleys and curling up, &cwhile curled up it takes no damage&r and stings in melee. &eHorns:&r run up and ram."
		""
		"Lava makes it stronger, drowning and suffocation do not hurt it, cold works more weakly."
	]
	quest.3F1EF055276CDA53.quest_subtitle: "What the Chimera does in the fight."
	quest.3F1EF055276CDA53.title: "&5Learn the Four Phases"
	quest.3F2240D98B16A9AF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Plate Advanced&r in the corners, a &6cauldron&r at the top, &6Coil Copper&r left and right, a &6chassis&r in the middle, a &6furnace&r at the bottom make the &6Steam Turbine&r."
		""
		"If you set the reactor port to boiling mode, the reactor makes steam instead of power. The turbine turns that steam into power. For large plants there is also a multiblock turbine."
	]
	quest.3F2240D98B16A9AF.quest_subtitle: "Steam from the reactor becomes power."
	quest.3F2240D98B16A9AF.title: "&bBuild a Steam Turbine"
	quest.3F4529F332462362.quest_desc: [
		"Find a dungeon from &6When Dungeons Arise&r on land and tick this off: Foundry, Plague Asylum, Mechanical Nest, Keep Kayra in the swamp, Shiraz Palace in the desert, Thornborn Towers, Illager Fort or Windmill, Bandit Village, Monastery."
		""
		"Several floors, many enemies, good chests. An evening for a group."
	]
	quest.3F4529F332462362.quest_subtitle: "When Dungeons Arise builds huge."
	quest.3F4529F332462362.title: "&4Conquer a big dungeon"
	quest.3F490F80873FF59F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_advanced_matrix.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A cuboid of 3 to 7 blocks per edge: edges of &6Assembler Matrix Frame&r, sides of Wall or Glass, the cores inside. At least one &6Pattern Core&r (36 crafting patterns) and one &6Craft Core&r (eight jobs)."
		""
		"&6Speed Cores&r make it faster, full speed is reached from five. When the lines on the frame glow blue, it is finished. Saves many channels."
	]
	quest.3F490F80873FF59F.quest_subtitle: "One multiblock instead of a hundred assemblers."
	quest.3F490F80873FF59F.title: "&3Build an Assembler Matrix"
	quest.3F4FD44BE74577C3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Netherite ingots&r in the corners, &6Awakened ingots&r at the top and bottom, in the middle &6Wyvern AOE Module, Draconic Core, Wyvern AOE Module&r."
		""
		"In the Draconic Pickaxe it mines up to &e7 x 7&r. Safe Mode protects your machines here too."
	]
	quest.3F4FD44BE74577C3.quest_subtitle: "7 x 7 at once."
	quest.3F4FD44BE74577C3.title: "&dBuild a Draconic AOE Module"
	quest.3F580EF5D09F4B98.quest_desc: [
		"Kill a &6ghast&r with its own fireball. Hit the fireball at the right moment with your hand, the sword or an arrow, and it flies back."
		""
		"One hit is enough for a ghast. At this distance it works better than any bow."
	]
	quest.3F580EF5D09F4B98.quest_subtitle: "Beaten with its own weapons."
	quest.3F580EF5D09F4B98.title: "&fSend the fireball back"
	quest.3F5A551957DA7504.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Ausguss&r: füllt über einem Depot oder Band Eimer, Flaschen und alle Befüllen-Rezepte aus seinem Tank. Der &6Abfluss&r leert Gegenstände, die darauf landen, ins Rohr. Kein Filter, andere Gegenstände rollen durch. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Ausguss: Kupferrahmen über getrocknetem Seetang. Abfluss: Eisengitter über Kupferrahmen. Siehe Kapitel Create."
	]
	quest.3F5A551957DA7504.quest_subtitle: "Create, Ausguss und Abfluss: Flüssigkeit in Eimer und Flaschen, und zurück."
	quest.3F5A551957DA7504.title: "Füll und leer Gegenstände"
	quest.3F74FE18841B810E.quest_desc: [
		"Hoard &6copper&r and &6zinc&r at a ratio of two to one, and press &6Iron Sheets&r ahead of time."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Brass only comes from the heated mixer: two copper, one zinc and one &6Blaze Powder&r make one ingot. Superheated with Blaze Cake it becomes two ingots without powder."
		""
		"The &6Blaze Burner&r's casing needs &dtwo Source Gems&r from Ars Nouveau. Stage 2 also wants 150 &6Precision Mechanisms&r, built on Brass Sheets. The chapters &6Create: Brass&r and &6Create: Trains&r are waiting."
	]
	quest.3F74FE18841B810E.quest_subtitle: "What stage 2 brings and what you can already do now."
	quest.3F74FE18841B810E.title: "&6Get ready for the Brass Works"
	quest.3F762C5C8BE9ED70.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron ingot&r or &6iron dust&r in the middle, &e10 mB carbon&r: one &6Enriched Iron&r."
		""
		"It is an intermediate for steel dust. Make a stack right away; the fusion's reactor glass needs it later too."
	]
	quest.3F762C5C8BE9ED70.quest_subtitle: "The first step towards steel."
	quest.3F762C5C8BE9ED70.title: "&7Enrich iron"
	quest.3F77E31B21F76A9B.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Augment Core&r and a &6soul sand&r, shapeless, give the &6XP Vacuum Augment&r. It only fits into a Vacuum Module."
		""
		"Then the module sucks up &eexperience orbs&r instead of items and fills them into &6bottles of enchanting&r, one per &e7 XP&r. If a matching tank lies in the buffer or stands next to the router, it can also fill the experience as a fluid."
		""
		"Under a mob farm a router collects loot and experience in one go this way."
	]
	quest.3F77E31B21F76A9B.quest_subtitle: "The XP Vacuum Augment."
	quest.3F77E31B21F76A9B.title: "&aVacuum Experience"
	quest.3F8004ECF578813E.quest_desc: [
		"At the &6smithing table&r put in a &6smithing template&r, a &6diamond pickaxe&r and a &6netherite ingot&r. Enchantments are kept."
		""
		"Netherite tools last longer, mine faster and don't burn when they fall into lava. Copy the template before you use up the last one."
	]
	quest.3F8004ECF578813E.quest_subtitle: "The best pickaxe in vanilla."
	quest.3F8004ECF578813E.title: "&8Upgrade a pickaxe to netherite"
	quest.3F83E83146927BEA.quest_desc: [
		"Mit &6Stufe 3&r öffnet PneumaticCraft seine zweite Hälfte. Die &6Montagestraße&r (Controller, Plattform, Bohrer, Laser, zwei Ein- und Ausgabearme) baut fortgeschrittene Rohre für 20 Bar, das verstärkte Kammerventil und bestückt Platinen ohne Lichtkasten. Ihre Programme kaufst du bei Amadron."
		""
		"Der &6Fortgeschrittene Luftkompressor&r macht 50 mL pro Tick statt 10, wird dabei heiß und braucht Kühlkörper. Dazu kommen &6Drohnen&r, der &6Programmierer&r mit seinen Puzzleteilen, der Programmierbare Controller, die Sicherheitsstation und der Universalsensor."
		""
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Der &6Flux-Kompressor&r und der &6Druckluft-Dynamo&r, die Brücken zu Strom, brauchen statt der Platine einen &6Einfachen Steuerschaltkreis&r von Mekanism, dazu ein fortgeschrittenes Rohr und einen Turbinenrotor. Die &6Drohne&r bekommt unter ihre Platine ein &6Präzisionsgetriebe&r von Create, drei Turbinenrotoren drum herum."
		""
		"Die &6Druckluftrüstung&r mit Düsenstiefeln und die Minigun warten bis Stufe 4. Alles andere aus diesem Kapitel bleibt die Grundlage: Druck, Hitze, Kunststoff und Platinen brauchst du dort nur in größeren Mengen."
	]
	quest.3F83E83146927BEA.quest_subtitle: "Montagestraße, Drohnen, Strom."
	quest.3F83E83146927BEA.title: "&dOutlook on Stage 3"
	quest.3F8A2F4BD44A2313.quest_desc: [
		"When a quest is done you get the message &eQuest completed!&r at the top right. The reward does not come to you by itself though: open the quest and &eclick the reward&r at the bottom right."
		""
		"If you have several open, use the &eClaim all rewards&r button at the bottom edge of the book. If your inventory is full, the reward drops to the ground in front of you."
		""
		"Many quests give &6crates&r: &7Stone Crate&r, &fIron Crate&r and &6Gold Crate&r, better in that order. Right-click opens them. A Gold Crate waits at the end of this chapter."
	]
	quest.3F8A2F4BD44A2313.quest_subtitle: "Finished quests glow until you click them."
	quest.3F8A2F4BD44A2313.title: "&6Claim a reward"
	quest.3F93D83DDB6A9C84.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r at the top enriched iron, &6comparator&r, enriched iron, in the middle &6redstone&r, &6Upgrade&r, redstone, three enriched iron at the bottom. Right click with the upgrade in hand to set the amount."
		""
		"In an &6Exporter&r it only delivers while the target holds less than set. In an &6Importer&r it only pulls while the target holds more. Exactly 16 coal in the furnace, never more."
	]
	quest.3F93D83DDB6A9C84.quest_subtitle: "The Regulator Upgrade."
	quest.3F93D83DDB6A9C84.title: "&eKeep a Fixed Amount in the Target"
	quest.3F9AD9EA5C86450D.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &e32 basalt&r in the &6basalt deltas&r. Blackstone lies right next to it."
		""
		"The ground is a tangle of spikes and lava holes. Walk slowly, place blocks, and take care of the magma cubes from a distance."
	]
	quest.3F9AD9EA5C86450D.quest_subtitle: "Basalt deltas: jagged, full of magma cubes."
	quest.3F9AD9EA5C86450D.title: "&7Mine basalt"
	quest.3FA56141B71851D7.quest_desc: [
		"A &6stick&r in the top middle, &e3 Pewter&r in the row below."
		""
		"The stand brews potions like a brewing stand but needs no &6blaze powder&r as fuel. Handy as long as you have no blaze farm yet. You make the healing potion for the Ritual of Purifying and the harming potion for the Sanguine rituals right here."
	]
	quest.3FA56141B71851D7.quest_subtitle: "Brewing without blaze powder."
	quest.3FA56141B71851D7.title: "&6Build an Apothecary Stand"
	quest.3FB073F38AAB3E6B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Enchanter's Gauntlet&r (leather, diamond, 2 gold blocks, 2 Source Gem blocks): mines up to diamond hardness, casts at a discount."
		"&6Enchanter's Fishing Rod&r (fishing rod, 2 gold blocks, 2 Source Gem blocks): casts the spell on whatever is on the hook."
		"&6Enchanter's Mirror&r (Source Gem block, 2 glass, 2 Manipulation Essences, 2 archwood logs, 2 gold): casts a Self spell cheaper and longer."
	]
	quest.3FB073F38AAB3E6B.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: three tools with a built-in spell."
	quest.3FB073F38AAB3E6B.title: "&6Build a gauntlet, fishing rod and mirror"
	quest.3FB4EAF3E033CB38.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Stahlgehäuse in die Mitte, Ultimative Schaltkreise links und rechts, oben ein &6Einfacher Flüssigkeitsbehälter&r, unten ein Einfacher Chemikalienbehälter, Raffiniertes Obsidian in die Ecken."
		""
		"Sie wäscht &e1 mB Schmutzigen Schlamm&r mit &e5 mB Wasser&r zu &e1 mB Sauberem Schlamm&r. Für die 1 000 mB eines Erzblocks sind das fünf Eimer Wasser. Gib ihr eine eigene Pumpe mit Rohrleitung."
		""
		"Etwa &d80 FE/t&r. Ohne Wasser steht die ganze Fünffach-Straße, also zuerst das Wasser."
	]
	quest.3FB4EAF3E033CB38.quest_subtitle: "Schmutziger Schlamm wird sauber."
	quest.3FB4EAF3E033CB38.title: "&bBau eine Chemische Waschanlage"
	quest.3FB85D1B934FD6D2.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/malum_altar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"At the top a &6Refined Soulstone&r, middle &6Arcane Gold&r from Eidolon, &6Runewood plank, Arcane Gold&r, at the bottom three &6Runewood planks&r. Plus &6Runewood Item Stands&r: three slabs over three planks, gives two."
		""
		"Main item and arcana on the altar, side ingredients on stands within &e4 blocks&r. Then you wait."
	]
	quest.3FB85D1B934FD6D2.quest_subtitle: "Arcana flow into an item."
	quest.3FB85D1B934FD6D2.title: "&6&lBuild a Spirit Altar"
	quest.3FB874C07A9A0C98.quest_desc: [
		"A Steel Casing in the middle, &6Atomic Alloy&r in the corners, &6Polonium Pellets&r at the top, bottom, left and right. Gives four frames."
		""
		"Four frames around an Ultimate Control Circuit give two &6Fusion Reactor Ports&r. Plan on a few dozen frames."
	]
	quest.3FB874C07A9A0C98.quest_subtitle: "Four pellets, four frames."
	quest.3FB874C07A9A0C98.title: "&6Build Fusion Reactor Frames"
	quest.3FBD2E86F3809056.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/enderio_vacuum_chest.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Seven &6iron ingots&r around a &6chest&r, a &6Pulsating Crystal&r in the bottom middle."
		""
		"It pulls in items near it. You set the range in the window and can have it shown. Good under a mob farm or at the end of a harvester."
	]
	quest.3FBD2E86F3809056.quest_subtitle: "Loose items land in it on their own."
	quest.3FBD2E86F3809056.title: "&9Set Up a Vacuum Chest"
	quest.3FC6B71CB35F1EC8.quest_desc: [
		"Hold the cobblestone and &eright-click&r the obelisk. The whole stack goes in and is credited to you."
		""
		"&eSneak and right-click&r delivers everything in your inventory that the goal needs right now. What it does not need stays with you. Deliveries of 64 or more show up in chat."
	]
	quest.3FC6B71CB35F1EC8.quest_subtitle: "Stack in hand, right-click the obelisk."
	quest.3FC6B71CB35F1EC8.title: "&eDeliver your cobblestone"
	quest.3FCA85F6064E30AB.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Stein in die Ecken, Redstone oben und unten in der Mitte, Papier, Verstärker, Papier in der mittleren Reihe: das &6Generator-Augment&r. Rechtsklick damit auf einen Ofen von Iron Furnaces."
		""
		"&eIron Furnaces, Generator-Augment:&r Statt zu schmelzen verbrennt der Ofen Brennstoff zu Strom, was er nimmt, zeigt EMI unter &eAugment: Generator&r. Eisen- und Kupferofen &d40 FE/t&r, Silber 100, Gold 160, Diamant 240, Smaragd 320, Kristall 360, Obsidian 500, Netherit &d1 000 FE/t&r. Offen ab Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.3FCA85F6064E30AB.quest_subtitle: "Iron Furnaces: 40 bis 1 000 FE/t, je nach Ofen."
	quest.3FCA85F6064E30AB.title: "&6Mach einen Eisenofen zum Generator"
	quest.3FD4F0B8CBCD3214.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &cFire Essence&r, &e2 flint and steel&r, &e2 fire charges&r, &6blaze rod&r."
		""
		"If it hits something burning, sparks explode and hit everything nearby. &eProjectile, Ignite, Flare&r is the classic combat spell."
	]
	quest.3FD4F0B8CBCD3214.quest_subtitle: "Fire on burning targets."
	quest.3FD4F0B8CBCD3214.title: "&dLearn Flare"
	quest.3FFE8D768FF434F2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Plate Basic&r in the corners, &6iron ingots&r on the sides, a &6furnace&r in the middle make the &6Nuclear Furnace&r."
		""
		"It smelts fast and burns &6uranium ingots&r as fuel instead of coal. According to NuclearCraft surprisingly safe for a furnace."
	]
	quest.3FFE8D768FF434F2.quest_subtitle: "A furnace that burns uranium."
	quest.3FFE8D768FF434F2.title: "&cBuild a Nuclear Furnace"
	quest.4004879497A32E3B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r drei &6Flachs&r oben, darunter links und rechts ein &6Stock&r. Das ergibt zwei &6Markisen&r, mit Farbstoff färbst du sie ein."
		""
		"Über Tür und Fenster, als Dach über einem Marktstand oder als Sonnensegel auf der Terrasse. Den Flachs kennst du schon von den Seilen."
	]
	quest.4004879497A32E3B.quest_subtitle: "Ein Stoffdach über Marktstand und Tür."
	quest.4004879497A32E3B.title: "&aSpann eine Markise"
	quest.400BE4CC7BBC12F8.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"keybind\":\"key.voice_chat\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" opens the \"},{\"text\":\"Simple Voice Chat\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" menu. There you pick your microphone, set the volume and choose between \"},{\"text\":\"voice activation\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"push to talk\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\". You set the push to talk key in the controls settings; by default none is bound.\"}]"
		""
		"Anyone closer than &e48 blocks&r hears you, quieter with distance. Whispering reaches 24 blocks. In the menu you create &egroups&r, then your team hears you over any distance."
		""
		"The icons at the bottom show whether your microphone is muted. Muting is not on any key so it does not happen by accident; in the menu it takes one click."
	]
	quest.400BE4CC7BBC12F8.quest_subtitle: "You can be heard 48 blocks away."
	quest.400BE4CC7BBC12F8.title: "&6Set up voice chat"
	quest.402282C84DFC4F3C.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Take damage and press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.drawMahoujin\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" (Draw Mahoujin) \"},{\"text\":\"right after\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\", looking at a solid block.\"}]"
		""
		"With the first circle you are a &cMahou Tsukai&r. Your mana bar appears, starting at &d100 mana&r."
	]
	quest.402282C84DFC4F3C.quest_subtitle: "A circle on the ground, and you are a mage."
	quest.402282C84DFC4F3C.title: "&cDraw a Blood Circle"
	quest.40254D5CAFD84167.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Hedyrin's Lure."
		"&6Bowls:&r &e4 logs&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r a &6pig&r."
		""
		"The beaver lets you mine wood faster and fells small trees that grow from saplings next to it."
	]
	quest.40254D5CAFD84167.quest_subtitle: "Faster wood chopping."
	quest.40254D5CAFD84167.title: "&dSummon a Beaver"
	quest.402BB31F7C41F6E7.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Mana Infused String&r in a square make &6Manaweave Cloth&r."
		""
		"The cloth is what the magician's robe is made of. For the full robe you need a good two dozen, so a good hundred strings."
	]
	quest.402BB31F7C41F6E7.quest_subtitle: "Four strings, one cloth."
	quest.402BB31F7C41F6E7.title: "&6Weave Manaweave Cloth"
	quest.40306B10C2AEC952.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Solar Panels&r (glass panes, redstone, alloy, osmium) over alloy, iron, osmium and an Energy Tablet. &d20 FE/t&r by day under open sky."
		""
		"In stage 3, four of them become the Advanced Solar Generator with 120 FE/t."
	]
	quest.40306B10C2AEC952.quest_subtitle: "Small, quiet, only by day."
	quest.40306B10C2AEC952.title: "&eLay Solar Generators on the roof"
	quest.403CCD48355C0D86.quest_desc: [
		"The bosses of the Overworld in the order you can beat them. Best with two or three people."
	]
	quest.403CCD48355C0D86.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm, Born in Chaos, Mowzie's Mobs."
	quest.403CCD48355C0D86.title: "&cOpen Overworld Bosses"
	quest.403CF2A90894462C.quest_desc: [
		"Kill ghasts until you have &e2 ghast tears&r. Easiest with the bow, or hit their fireballs back."
		""
		"The tear likes to fall into lava. Fight over solid ground. You need it for potions of regeneration and in stage 4 for the &5End crystals&r that make the dragon appear again."
	]
	quest.403CF2A90894462C.quest_subtitle: "The ghast cries when it falls."
	quest.403CF2A90894462C.title: "&fGet a ghast tear"
	quest.403D94AC159D99FF.quest_desc: [
		"Hand in &e600 Mana Pearls&r, &e50 Terrasteel ingots&r and &e8 Rune Cores&r at the obelisk. Right click puts the stack in, a sneaking right click everything."
		""
		"When tech and magic are full, &6stage 3 (Steel Works)&r opens with a stream event, and with it the elven portal, see &aBotania: Alfheim&r."
		""
		"&ePrepare:&r Glimmering Livingwood (log and glowstone dust), two Mana Pylons (2 gold, 2 Manasteel, 1 Mana Diamond), two Natura Pylons and full pools. The portal wants 200,000 mana to open."
	]
	quest.403D94AC159D99FF.quest_subtitle: "The Brass Works is waiting for its flowers."
	quest.403D94AC159D99FF.title: "&d&lBring the magic to the obelisk"
	quest.4049757F890F8E58.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r Eight &6Quartz Enriched Iron&r around, a &6stone&r in the middle make a &6Machine Casing&r."
		""
		"Every RS block that is not a cable has a casing in the middle: Controller, Grid, Disk Drive, Interface, Wireless Transmitter, Autocrafter. Four are enough for the first network."
	]
	quest.4049757F890F8E58.quest_subtitle: "Eight enriched iron around a stone."
	quest.4049757F890F8E58.title: "&7Build a Machine Frame"
	quest.404B1115E012B030.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Catacombs&r lie under hills, forests, plains, swamps, deserts, savannas, taigas, jungles and dripstone caves, so almost everywhere, between &eY -40 and Y 20&r. While caving you run into their corridors sooner or later."
		""
		"Inside: &6Catacombs Zombies&r, skeletons and &5Necromancers&r, who call undead. The Necromancer drops 0 to 4 essence and sometimes a scroll, the scroll only if you kill it yourself."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r Sarcophagi with 1 to 2 scrolls, 5 to 16 essence and a 15 percent chance of a Rotten Spell Book. Wall chests with scrolls, runestones and rings. The &6Wayward Compass&r (essence, iron, soul lantern) points to the nearest catacombs, but the soul lantern only comes with the Nether in stage 2."
	]
	quest.404B1115E012B030.quest_subtitle: "Underground, between Y -40 and Y 20."
	quest.404B1115E012B030.title: "&8Descend into the Catacombs"
	quest.40577D2C2058AA4A.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ihagan's Enthrallment."
		"&6Bowls:&r &e2 wool&r, a &6mushroom block&r, a &6moss block&r, an &6iron block&r, a &6packed ice&r, a &6pottery&r, a &6block of bamboo&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book."
		""
		"Out comes one of these at random: armadillo, mooshroom, panda, polar bear, goat, &6iron golem&r or &6sniffer&r. For an iron farm or rare seeds you don't have to travel across half the world."
		""
		"You summon the mounts (horse, donkey, llama, camel, strider and more) in the same pentacle with &e2 hay bales&r, apple, golden apple, carrot, golden carrot, cactus and warped fungus."
	]
	quest.40577D2C2058AA4A.quest_subtitle: "Pandas, sniffers and iron golems on order."
	quest.40577D2C2058AA4A.title: "&5Summon a rare animal"
	quest.40625177532CB7E4.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6Brass Casing&r on top, &6chute&r in the middle, &6Electron Tube&r at the bottom give two &6Inventory Access Ports&r. Two access ports together are an &6Inventory Bridge&r."
		""
		"An &6Inventory Access Port&r on a chest or vault extends the inventory by one block: funnels, arms and chutes on the port work as if they were attached directly to the chest. Several ports per inventory work, chained ones do not. A redstone signal turns it off."
		""
		"The &6Inventory Bridge&r between two chests makes one access point out of both. Its two filter slots decide which item goes to which side. Whatever matches no filter, it does not accept. A blessing for tight factories."
	]
	quest.40625177532CB7E4.quest_subtitle: "Inventory Access Port and Inventory Bridge."
	quest.40625177532CB7E4.title: "&6Connect Two Inventories"
	quest.4070CC81A393954E.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Gummibaum&r, der &6Zuckerahorn&r, das &6Sandelholz&r, die &6Dattelpalme&r und der &6Drachenblutbaum&r sollen angezapft werden: &6Gummi&r, &6Ahornsaft&r, &6Sandelholzöl&r, &6Dattelsaft&r und &cDrachenblut&r. Dafür braucht der Mod den Mod &6Tree Tap&r."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/rubber.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&cTree Tap ist auf Kronwerke nicht installiert.&r Diese fünf Produkte gibt es hier nicht, der Gummibaum lässt sich nicht anzapfen. Vulkanisierter Gummi, Ahornsirup und der Zucker daraus bleiben Einträge in EMI ohne Weg."
		""
		"Die Bäume selbst wachsen trotzdem, geben Holz und zählen für die Checkliste. Der Gummibaum (Generation 5) ist Elternteil von nichts, züchte ihn also nur für die Liste. Der Zuckerahorn steht im Markt und ist Vater von Amberbaum, Sykomore, Süßem Holzapfel und Brotfrucht."
	]
	quest.4070CC81A393954E.quest_subtitle: "Fünf Bäume brauchen einen Zapfhahn, den es hier nicht gibt."
	quest.4070CC81A393954E.title: "&cGummi, Ahornsirup und Sandelöl"
	quest.407A58F922CC3B6F.quest_desc: [
		"A &6dead bush&r for &d2,500 mana&r gives &6Boreal Seeds&r (podzol), a &6mushroom&r for &d6,500 mana&r gives &6Mycelium Seeds&r (mycelium)."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r A flower on podzol grabs items on the ground a bit later, on mycelium later still. That way you decide which flower grabs first."
	]
	quest.407A58F922CC3B6F.quest_subtitle: "Podzol and mycelium to order."
	quest.407A58F922CC3B6F.title: "&6Infuse Boreal Seeds"
	quest.407D5FB188E210EB.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6emerald dust&r (from the Crusher), &e2 bottles o' enchanting&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book, 60 seconds."
		""
		"The dust is the main ingredient of lime chalk, and that goes into every Djinni pentacle."
	]
	quest.407D5FB188E210EB.quest_subtitle: "Knowledge, ground to dust."
	quest.407D5FB188E210EB.title: "&6Grind Research Fragment Dust"
	quest.4092E655810B14AB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/exploration_e_veins.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Dig into a large &6ore vein&r and bring a &6block of raw copper&r along. The veins run through the stone as long bands, in the farm world too."
		""
		"&eCopper veins&r lie between Y 0 and 50 in granite, &eiron veins&r between Y -60 and -8 in tuff. They contain ore and whole raw blocks."
	]
	quest.4092E655810B14AB.quest_subtitle: "Copper with granite, iron with tuff."
	quest.4092E655810B14AB.title: "&6Find a large ore vein"
	quest.409349A012B39C21.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pipez&r, &6Stromrohr&r: &e256 FE pro Tick&r ohne Modifikation, 1 024 mit der Normalen, 8 192 mit der Verbesserten, 32 768 mit der Fortgeschrittenen (Stufe 3), 131 072 mit der Ultimativen (Stufe 4). Verteilt reihum auf alle Verbraucher. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Wie das Item-Rohr, nur mit zwei Redstone-Blöcken statt der Werfer. Siehe Kapitel Rohre und Router."
	]
	quest.409349A012B39C21.quest_subtitle: "Pipez, Stromrohr: 256 FE pro Tick, bis 8 192 mit Modifikation."
	quest.409349A012B39C21.title: "Lies: Pipez Stromrohr"
	quest.40995844B154C20D.quest_desc: [
		"&e5 Elementium&r, &e2 Gaia Spirits&r, &e1 Dreamwood Log&r."
		""
		"Sneak right click a block to choose it, sneak right click into the air for the amount. Right click builds the preview with mana and blocks from your inventory, also from the Black Hole Talisman."
	]
	quest.40995844B154C20D.quest_subtitle: "Place many blocks at once."
	quest.40995844B154C20D.title: "&6Build a Worldshaper's Astrolabe"
	quest.40A70B21ED71996E.quest_desc: [
		"&eImport from Inventory&r schickt die Drohne zur nächsten Kiste im angegebenen &eArea&r und lässt sie Gegenstände herausnehmen. Das Area-Teil kommt &erechts&r dran, ein &eItem Filter&r ebenfalls rechts."
		""
		"Filter rechts heißt: nur das. Filter links heißt: alles außer dem. Ohne Filter nimmt sie, was sie findet. Rechtsklick auf das Teil: Seite der Kiste und Höchstmenge. Ohne Inventory Upgrades trägt eine Drohne &eeinen Stapel&r."
	]
	quest.40A70B21ED71996E.quest_subtitle: "Die Drohne holt etwas aus einer Kiste."
	quest.40A70B21ED71996E.title: "&7Puzzleteil: Import from Inventory"
	quest.40C0C0197F80B5B4.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6Ferricore Ingots&r in the corners, an &6observer&r in the middle, an &6eye of ender&r on top, &6redstone&r at the bottom, &6lapis&r left and right."
		""
		"The &6Simple Sensor&r checks the block in front of it and gives a redstone signal when its condition matches. The target button switches between blocks, air, monsters, animals, adults, children, players, all living things and items. A filter slot narrows it down, set it to &eAllow List&r when you are looking for a specific block."
		""
		"&eFor the goo line:&r Put a &6Raw Ferricore Block&r into the filter, set it to Allow List and point the sensor at the block next to the goo. As soon as it is finished, the sensor turns on the breaker. Right clicking the filter slot even filters by block state, such as door open or closed."
	]
	quest.40C0C0197F80B5B4.quest_subtitle: "Redstone as soon as something is there."
	quest.40C0C0197F80B5B4.title: "&cBuild the Sensor"
	quest.40DDF42B7B5187B3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Reliquary&r builds its tools from rare parts that monsters drop on death: a &6Zombie Heart&r, a &6Rib Bone&r from the skeleton, a &6Nebulous Heart&r from the enderman. The whole mod opens with &6stage 2&r."
		""
		"The chance is small: &e2 percent&r without enchantment, 11 percent with &6Looting III&r. Even better is the mod's own enchantment &6Severing&r from the enchanting table: Severing III gives 32 percent, Severing V 52. Only what you kill yourself counts."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The &6Magicbane&r (two Nebulous Hearts, one gold, one iron) is a small sword that gets stronger with every enchantment and has a higher chance for these parts itself."
		""
		"To start: get yourself a &6Zombie Heart&r."
	]
	quest.40DDF42B7B5187B3.quest_subtitle: "Every monster carries a rare part."
	quest.40DDF42B7B5187B3.title: "&6Slay Monsters with Looting"
	quest.40E0334D644B4B2E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wild flax&r grows in the overworld. Breaking it gives seeds for farmland. Ripe plants give &6Flax Fiber&r and &6flax flowers&r."
		""
		"Two fibers make one &6Flax String&r. Flax flowers become blue dye for Blueprint Paper."
	]
	quest.40E0334D644B4B2E.quest_subtitle: "Fibers, seeds and blue dye."
	quest.40E0334D644B4B2E.title: "&7Grow flax"
	quest.4103ABC9164E225E.quest_desc: [
		"&eStation Powered&r: the train leaves as soon as the station gets a redstone signal. A button on the platform is enough."
	]
	quest.4103ABC9164E225E.quest_subtitle: "Depart at the push of a button."
	quest.4103ABC9164E225E.title: "&7Redstone signal"
	quest.410E7D8D1C690956.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Blank Thread&r, &e2 Air Essences&r, a pair of &5elytra&r."
		""
		"You glide as with elytra, the chest slot stays free for the robe. Needs a thread slot of &esize 3&r."
	]
	quest.410E7D8D1C690956.quest_subtitle: "Elytra, sewn in."
	quest.410E7D8D1C690956.title: "&6Sew the Thread of Gliding"
	quest.411976AA6DA1D525.quest_desc: [
		"Der Wärter lässt immer einen &6Sculk-Katalysator&r fallen, manchmal liegt einer in den Truhen der Antiken Stadt."
		""
		"Stirbt ein Mob in seiner Nähe, breitet sich Sculk aus, um so mehr, je mehr Erfahrung der Mob gegeben hätte. Sculk baust du mit einer Hacke schnell ab, und ohne Behutsamkeit gibt jeder Block Erfahrung. Stell ihn an deine Mobfarm."
	]
	quest.411976AA6DA1D525.quest_subtitle: "Wo etwas stirbt, wächst Sculk."
	quest.411976AA6DA1D525.title: "&3Stell einen Sculk-Katalysator auf"
	quest.411AA013329F1B8F.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Ancient Factory&r liegt um &eY minus 30&r unter jedem Biom. Große Höhlen und Schluchten legen ihre Wände frei, sonst hilft ab Stufe 2 das &6Mechanische Auge&r (Enderauge, 4 Eisenbarren, 4 Redstoneblöcke)."
		""
		"Drinnen patrouillieren &cWatcher&r (25 Lebenspunkte, 5 Schaden, lassen Eisen und Redstone fallen) und &cProwler&r (160 Lebenspunkte, Rüstung 10, 14 Schaden, Zielsuchraketen für 5 und ein Todeslaser für 5 plus 5 Prozent). Ein Prowler gibt &e5 bis 7 Eisen&r und &e5 bis 9 Redstone&r."
		""
		"&cAchtung:&r Die &6EMP-Blöcke&r in den Hallen schalten Redstone in der Nähe ab. Türen mit Druckplatten funktionieren dort nicht, nimm Zauntore."
	]
	quest.411AA013329F1B8F.quest_subtitle: "Eine Fabrik tief unter der Erde, um Y minus 30."
	quest.411AA013329F1B8F.title: "&7Finde die alte Fabrik"
	quest.412424E78EB64F22.quest_desc: [
		"Fusion, Draconium tier: a &6chest&r in the core. In ten injectors: &65 furnaces&r, &62 Draconium Cores&r, &62 crafting tables&r and &61 Draconium Block&r. Costs 2 million energy."
		""
		"It holds far more than a double chest and has a built in furnace on power. &eAuto-Smelt&r sends everything smeltable into it, or only what is already being smelted. You set the color in the window."
	]
	quest.412424E78EB64F22.quest_subtitle: "A huge chest with its own furnace."
	quest.412424E78EB64F22.title: "&6Fuse a Draconium Chest"
	quest.412AB5C73A97212A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron Bee&r and &6Neon Cuckoo Bee&r (from nests of the Blue Banded Bee). Flower: &6osmium block&r. The comb gives &6raw osmium&r with 40 percent. Paired with a Glowing Bee it becomes the bee for Refined Glowstone."
	]
	quest.412AB5C73A97212A.quest_subtitle: "Raw osmium for Mekanism."
	quest.412AB5C73A97212A.title: "&bBreed the Osmium Bee"
	quest.412C454633A81FA4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_dimensions_d_mining.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Stay in the portal briefly until the light takes you. You arrive at the arrival square of the farm world; the portal there takes you back to yours."
		""
		"Your inventory, your ender chest and your backpacks travel with you. Whatever you throw through the portal comes out on the other side."
	]
	quest.412C454633A81FA4.quest_subtitle: "Stand in the portal for a moment."
	quest.412C454633A81FA4.title: "&6&lTravel to the farm world"
	quest.4140321514F4846E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_ores_quintupling.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Die &6Kristalle&r gehen in die &6Injektionskammer&r: ein Kristall und 1 mB Chlorwasserstoff geben einen &6Splitter&r. Ab da läuft alles wie bei der Vierfach-Straße."
		""
		"&eDie ganze Leiter:&r Auflösungskammer, Waschanlage, Kristallisator, Injektionskammer, Klärkammer, Zerkleinerer, Anreicherungskammer, Schmelzer. Acht Maschinen, drei Gase (Schwefelsäure, Chlorwasserstoff, Sauerstoff) und viel Wasser, dazu zwei Elektrolyseure, zwei Injektoren, Oxidierer, Kondensator und Pumpen."
		""
		"&eStrom:&r Allein die acht Maschinen der Leiter ziehen zusammen rund &d700 FE/t&r, die Hilfsmaschinen kommen dazu. Das ist etwas für die Industrieturbine, nicht mehr für Wärmegeneratoren."
		""
		"&eLohnt sich das?&r Fünf statt vier pro Block, mit Glück III rund 7,3 Barren pro abgebautem Erz. Für Eisen, Kupfer und Gold in den Mengen von Stufe 4 und 5 ja. Für Osmium reicht meist die Dreifach-Straße."
	]
	quest.4140321514F4846E.quest_subtitle: "Fünf Barren aus einem Erz."
	quest.4140321514F4846E.title: "&d&lLass die Fünffach-Straße laufen"
	quest.4140EEBB772BD4AC.quest_desc: [
		"In assembly mode you right click the track in front of the station with a &6Railway Casing&r: a &6bogey&r appears there. The wrench switches between small and large."
		""
		"Short carriages need one, longer ones two, &e20&r per train at most. What you build on them you fix with &6Super Glue&r."
	]
	quest.4140EEBB772BD4AC.quest_subtitle: "The wheels under the train."
	quest.4140EEBB772BD4AC.title: "&6Place bogeys"
	quest.4158C1933288D1D2.quest_desc: [
		"Stufe 3 öffnet Powah, Oritech, Ender IO, Industrial Foregoing, Flux Networks, die großen IE-Maschinen und PneumaticCraft mit Strom. Die Erzverdreifachung und die Fabriken fressen tausende FE pro Tick."
		""
		"&e1. Powah-Reaktor:&r 36 Reaktorblöcke, Uraninit als Brennstoff, Wasser und Eis als Kühlung. Schon der Starter macht 250 FE/t, der Blazing-Reaktor &d10 000 FE/t&r, Spirited 100 000. Das beste Verhältnis von Aufwand zu Strom in dieser Stufe."
		"&e2. Blazing Furnator:&r 800 FE/t aus Kohle, 48 000 FE je Stück, ohne Kühlung und ohne Erz. Eine Baumfarm mit Holzkohle hängt dran, fertig."
		"&e3. IE-Dieselgenerator:&r 4 096 FE/t aus Biodiesel, wenn die Raffinerie ohnehin läuft. Ein großer Multiblock, aber nur einer."
		""
		"Dazu &6Flux Networks&r als Verteilung: ein Controller, Plugs an den Generatoren, Points an den Maschinen, kein Kabel mehr quer durch die Basis."
	]
	quest.4158C1933288D1D2.quest_subtitle: "Das Stahlwerk braucht Kraftwerke."
	quest.4158C1933288D1D2.title: "&e&lStufe 3: Welche Quelle wann"
	quest.415C88030B6FDB7C.quest_desc: [
		"&ePowdered Gold, Emerald and Diamond&r, cloth."
		""
		"Costs a share of your bar, the damage grows with your mana. Your negative effects jump over to the enemy."
	]
	quest.415C88030B6FDB7C.quest_subtitle: "A curse that grows with you."
	quest.415C88030B6FDB7C.title: "&6Draw Gandr"
	quest.415E8B453D8F082E.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &64 andesite casings&r, &64 Infused Iron&r and a &6sourcestone&r in the middle make &e2 Mine Frames&r. For a portal you need &e10&r."
		""
		"The &6farm world&r is a world of its own for digging. There you may make as many holes as you want, and the overworld stays beautiful."
	]
	quest.415E8B453D8F082E.quest_subtitle: "The frame for the gate to the farm world."
	quest.415E8B453D8F082E.title: "&6Build ten Mine Frames"
	quest.416366C37FD4E2B3.quest_desc: [
		"In the water cauldron: a &6diamond&r, &e2 Witch Hazel Logs&r, &e2 Bottles of Blood&r, &e2 wheat&r, a &6Mandrake Root&r."
		""
		"Faster than willow, slower than mahogany, and without netherite."
	]
	quest.416366C37FD4E2B3.quest_subtitle: "The golden middle way."
	quest.416366C37FD4E2B3.title: "&2Build a witch hazel broom"
	quest.416DBD57A4EDBCD1.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_trains_first_train.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Right click the Train Controls. &eW&r and &eS&r drive, at junctions &eA&r and &eD&r choose the direction, the mouse wheel limits the speed."
		""
		"With the &espace bar&r held the train stops at the next station, sneaking ends the driving. By hand it runs at &e75 percent&r of the schedule speed."
	]
	quest.416DBD57A4EDBCD1.quest_subtitle: "W, S, and A and D at junctions."
	quest.416DBD57A4EDBCD1.title: "&6Drive by hand"
	quest.416E9A199B0DF656.quest_desc: [
		"&6QIO Drive Array:&r Teleportation Cores in the corners, glass pane at the top, Ultimate Control Circuits left and right, Personal Chest in the middle, ender pearl at the bottom. &6QIO Drive:&r lead in the corners, four Ultimate Control Circuits, an ender pearl."
		""
		"One drive holds &e16,000 items&r in &e128 types&r. All QIO blocks on the same frequency are one network. The large drives need plutonium and antimatter from stage 5."
	]
	quest.416E9A199B0DF656.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism's storage network without cables."
	quest.416E9A199B0DF656.title: "&d&lBuild a QIO Storage"
	quest.4177D5A3CAF6502E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_crafter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &6Precision mechanism&r, &6brass casing&r and &6crafting table&r on top of each other make three &6Mechanical Crafters&r."
		""
		"Set them up as a grid, one per recipe slot, and point their arrows at an output crafter with the wrench. Ingredients in, rotation on, and when every slot is filled they start."
		""
		"You cover empty slots with a &6Crafter Slot Cover&r. They cost &d2 SU per RPM&r."
	]
	quest.4177D5A3CAF6502E.quest_subtitle: "Recipes up to 9 by 9 slots."
	quest.4177D5A3CAF6502E.title: "&6Set up Mechanical Crafters"
	quest.417B81A5AA87447D.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Tainted Rock Item Pedestal&r (stonecutter) on the altar, on the stands &e8 Tainted&r and &e8 Twisted Rock&r each. Plus &e16 Sacred, Aerial, Aqueous&r and &e16 Infernal&r each."
		""
		"Give the pylon arcana and the matching repair material. It looks for damaged items on pedestals, stands and in the Crucible nearby and repairs them without experience: normal tools to half, Malum gear to three quarters."
		""
		"That way your Impetus lasts longer too."
	]
	quest.417B81A5AA87447D.quest_subtitle: "Repair with arcana instead of experience."
	quest.417B81A5AA87447D.title: "&6Infuse a Repair Pylon"
	quest.41943EB3EF1ED2C3.quest_desc: [
		"One sapling of each colour: red, blue, green, purple."
		""
		"&cBlazing&r (red) burns best in the Volcanic Sourcelink. The ritual tablets from stage 2 need logs in the matching colour: &aFlourishing&r (green) for nature, &bCascading&r (blue) for water and weather, &5Vexing&r (purple) for binding and searching."
		""
		"A small garden with all four saves you many trips later."
	]
	quest.41943EB3EF1ED2C3.quest_subtitle: "Every colour has its job."
	quest.41943EB3EF1ED2C3.title: "&6Collect all four saplings"
	quest.41989F8CB685EA37.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_cores.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Primitive Core:&r eight planks around a crafting table. &6Basic Core:&r copper or iron around lapis. &6Improved Core:&r carbon fibre or nickel around redstone."
		""
		"Large machines want cores right around them: furnace, centrifuge and laser one, Foundry and Assembler three, Fragment Forge seven, Atomic Forge eight. If one is missing, the machine says so."
		""
		"The quality of the cores decides how many &6Addon Extenders&r a machine can take. The machine's tooltip names cores and addon slots."
	]
	quest.41989F8CB685EA37.quest_subtitle: "No cores, no multiblock."
	quest.41989F8CB685EA37.title: "&7Build Machine Cores"
	quest.41990A0D6BE75734.quest_desc: [
		"This is where you are. Open: the Overworld and the mining dimension, Create up to andesite (water wheel, millstone, press, mixer without heat, belts, fans), Ars Nouveau for beginners, Botania up to the Mana Pool, Nature's Aura, Mystical Agriculture inferium."
		""
		"Plus Farmer's Delight, Aquaculture, Silent Gear up to iron, leather backpacks, wooden drawers, waystones and Apotheosis. The goal wants cobblestone, Andesite Alloy and Source Gems."
	]
	quest.41990A0D6BE75734.quest_subtitle: "Wood, stone, water wheels, the first spells."
	quest.41990A0D6BE75734.title: "&7Stage 1: Stone Works"
	quest.419B17C2D5A36ED1.quest_desc: [
		"Find a &6pillager outpost&r and tick this off. Towns and Towers builds it differently in every biome, from badlands to snowy slopes."
		""
		"Crossbowmen hit from far away. Go with a shield, and leave the captain's banner alone if you don't want a raid on your village."
	]
	quest.419B17C2D5A36ED1.quest_subtitle: "Outposts in every biome."
	quest.419B17C2D5A36ED1.title: "&cClear a pillager outpost"
	quest.419C322999E86D94.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Electric Pump&r over a water block, power connected: it draws water up to &e80 blocks&r away without the lake getting emptier. The &6Basic Fluid Tank&r holds 32 buckets, &6Basic Mechanical Pipes&r pump 250 mB per tick."
		""
		"Infinite lava: a &6Hose Pulley&r over the lava ocean in the Nether, over 10,000 blocks count as infinite. Next to a &6Heat Generator&r every adjacent lava brings 12 FE/t without being used up."
		""
		"See the &5Mekanism&r (pipes and tanks) and &cThe Nether&r chapters."
	]
	quest.419C322999E86D94.quest_subtitle: "Power instead of rotation, 80 blocks far."
	quest.419C322999E86D94.title: "&bStage 2: Mekanism pump and tank"
	quest.419C965074DD94BD.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Certus Quartz Crystal&r under the Calculation Press, then finish it like the Logic Processor with &6redstone&r and &6Printed Silicon&r."
		""
		"You need Calculation Processors for 4k and 16k cells, cards, crafting units and the access point."
	]
	quest.419C965074DD94BD.quest_subtitle: "Certus under the Calculation Press."
	quest.419C965074DD94BD.title: "&bBuild a Calculation Processor"
	quest.419F003B27288373.quest_desc: [
		"Grind certus quartz to &6Certus Quartz Dust&r in the Inscriber, smelt it to &6Silicon&r in a furnace, press it to &6Printed Silicon&r under the &6Silicon Press&r."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Mekanism's &6Advanced Control Circuit&r is a Basic Control Circuit, two Infused Alloys and one &6Printed Silicon&r at the crafting table. There is no other way."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stage 3 goal, &e\"The Furnace Never Sleeps\"&r, wants &e250 Advanced Control Circuits&r."
	]
	quest.419F003B27288373.quest_subtitle: "The part Mekanism is waiting for."
	quest.419F003B27288373.title: "&8Print silicon"
	quest.41AA998DC5B64780.quest_desc: [
		"Sechs &6Verstärkte Steinstufen&r oben und unten, ein &6Druckluftrohr&r zwischen zwei &6Kleinen Tanks&r in der Mitte ergeben die &6Thermopneumatische Anlage&r (Thermopneumatic Processing Plant, kurz TPP)."
		""
		"Links kommt eine Flüssigkeit und ein Gegenstand hinein, rechts eine Flüssigkeit oder ein Gegenstand heraus. Manche Rezepte wollen Hitze, manche Druck, manche beides. Die Anlage heizt du wie die Raffinerie, und sie bekommt ein Rohr für die Luft."
		""
		"&eDie wichtigsten Rezepte:&r 100 mB LPG und eine Kohle ergeben bei 100 Grad &b1 000 mB Kunststoff&r. 1 000 mB Diesel und ein Redstone ergeben bei 100 Grad &b1 000 mB Schmiermittel&r. Ein Lapislazuli und 1 000 mB Wasser ergeben bei 2 Bar vier &6Upgrade-Matrizen&r, die in Upgrades den Lapis ersetzen. Ein Rohr mit 50 mB Kunststoff wird bei 1,5 Bar zum &6Verstärkten Rohr&r."
		""
		"Mit einem &6Spender-Upgrade&r schiebt sie ihre Flüssigkeit von selbst in einen Tank daneben."
	]
	quest.41AA998DC5B64780.quest_subtitle: "Hitze und Druck für Flüssigkeiten."
	quest.41AA998DC5B64780.title: "&6&lBau die Thermopneumatische Anlage"
	quest.41AEAC6A0D40F6B3.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Encased Chain Drive&r and an &6Electron Tube&r make the &6Adjustable Chain Gearshift&r. Without a signal it behaves like a normal chain drive."
		""
		"With a redstone signal it passes on &edouble the speed&r to the chain drives next to it, half if it doesn't sit at the source. A weak signal sets values between 1 and 2."
		""
		"It costs no capacity. With it a lever switches a press from gentle mode to full power."
	]
	quest.41AEAC6A0D40F6B3.quest_subtitle: "The Adjustable Chain Gearshift."
	quest.41AEAC6A0D40F6B3.title: "&6Switch the speed with redstone"
	quest.41AEB7D0E5FB1298.quest_desc: [
		"With &6stage 2 (Brass Works)&r the &aBotania: Runes&r chapter continues: Manasteel, Mana Pearls (only with a brass casing under the pool), Mana Tablet, Runic Altar (with brass ingots) and Terrasteel."
		""
		"The obelisk goal of stage 2 wants &e600 Mana Pearls&r, &e50 Terrasteel ingots&r and &e8 rune cores&r. That is over &d30 million mana&r. Start filling pools now."
		""
		"The elven portal follows with stage 3, the Gaia Guardian with stage 4."
	]
	quest.41AEB7D0E5FB1298.quest_subtitle: "What waits behind the obelisk."
	quest.41AEB7D0E5FB1298.title: "&7Look ahead to stage 2"
	quest.41B043A9F3AEB57D.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Electrolytic Separator, 1 mB per 2 mB of water. A flint in the chemical slot gives 10 mB."
		"&eUsed by:&r Purification Chamber (3x ore), Scuba Mask, sulfur trioxide."
	]
	quest.41B043A9F3AEB57D.quest_subtitle: "Comes along when splitting water."
	quest.41B043A9F3AEB57D.title: "&fOxygen"
	quest.41B4CE956EA13CE4.quest_desc: [
		"&eOberwelt:&r Ein &6Leitstein&r (Netheritbarren in gemeißeltem Steinziegel, Stufe 2) macht einen Kompass zum festen Zeiger auf einen Ort. Der &6Bergungskompass&r (8 Echoscherben aus antiken Städten um einen Kompass) zeigt auf deinen letzten Tod."
		"&eOtherside:&r Der &6Antike Kompass&r (Kompass, 4 Warden-Panzer) zeigt die nächste antike Stadt. Der Panzer kommt vom Warden, Stufe 3."
		"&eEternal Starlight:&r Das &6Seeking Eye&r (8 Starlight Flowers, Enderperle) schwebt zu Bauwerken und Biomen der Sternenwelt, Stufe 4."
		""
		"Einen Explorer's Compass für Bauwerke gibt es im Pack nicht. Für Bauwerke der Oberwelt nimm die Augen von Cataclysm oder frag im Chat nach Koordinaten."
	]
	quest.41B4CE956EA13CE4.quest_subtitle: "Jede Welt hat ihr eigenes Suchgerät."
	quest.41B4CE956EA13CE4.title: "&6Kenn die Kompasse der Dimensionen"
	quest.41B5F2D941A3D0F6.quest_desc: [
		"Kochtopf: &6Karotte&r, ein &6Pilz&r, &6Rohe Nudeln&r, ein Blattgemüse (Kohl oder Kohlblatt) und ein weiteres Gemüse, Schüssel."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/vegetable_noodles.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.41B5F2D941A3D0F6.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.41B5F2D941A3D0F6.title: "&6Koch Gemüsenudeln"
	quest.41CD7D49F64CE2C5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Draconium Ingots&r in the corners, &64 Draconium Cores&r on the sides, a &6Nether Star&r in the middle."
		""
		"{image:draconicevolution:textures/item/components/wyvern_core.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Every core costs a &5Wither&r. To start you need two: one for the Wyvern injector, one for the Energy Core."
	]
	quest.41CD7D49F64CE2C5.quest_subtitle: "A Nether Star in draconium."
	quest.41CD7D49F64CE2C5.title: "&dBuild a Wyvern Core"
	quest.41CFF95BFBBF4EA7.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Crushing Wheels&r from the crafting units, one block apart, turning towards each other: gravel becomes &6sand&r, with 10 percent flint and 5 percent clay on top. The Mekanism &6Crusher&r turns cobblestone into gravel and gravel into sand with power."
		""
		"The chain: drill, millstone, crushing wheels. Cobblestone in, sand out. Diorite between the wheels gives Nether quartz with 25 percent."
		""
		"See the &6Create: Brass&r (crushing wheels) and &5Mekanism&r (Crusher) chapters."
	]
	quest.41CFF95BFBBF4EA7.quest_subtitle: "Crushing wheels and the Crusher."
	quest.41CFF95BFBBF4EA7.title: "&6Stage 2: gravel to sand"
	quest.41F339404C023EAA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_crusher.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Plastic, &6iron sword&r, plastic at the top, &6books&r left and right of the &6Advanced Frame&r, Gold Gears and redstone at the bottom."
		""
		"It kills mobs as if a player had struck: loot plus &aEssence&r, &d50 FE&r per operation. In the second mode you get loot with random Looting instead of Essence. Essence fills the enchanting machines, and the Dissolution Chamber makes a bottle o' enchanting from 250 mB."
	]
	quest.41F339404C023EAA.quest_subtitle: "Loot and Essence without a sword."
	quest.41F339404C023EAA.title: "&cSet Up a Mob Crusher"
	quest.41FD0D218C6DDD62.quest_desc: [
		"&eGo to Location&r schickt die Drohne zum nächsten erreichbaren Block im &eArea&r. Ist sie da, oder kommt sie nicht hin, geht es mit dem nächsten Teil weiter."
		""
		"Nützlich, um die Drohne nach der Arbeit an einen Warteplatz zu schicken statt über der Kiste zu schweben, oder um sie an einer Stelle vorbeizuführen, die sie sonst umfliegt."
	]
	quest.41FD0D218C6DDD62.quest_subtitle: "Flieg dorthin, dann weiter."
	quest.41FD0D218C6DDD62.title: "&7Puzzleteil: Go to Location"
	quest.421EAB45386F53B8.quest_desc: [
		"Four wool around an ingot or brick. It makes machines quieter, nothing more. Worth gold for streamers with many machines next to the microphone."
	]
	quest.421EAB45386F53B8.quest_subtitle: "Quiet in the factory hall."
	quest.421EAB45386F53B8.title: "&7Build a Muffling Upgrade"
	quest.422BDE42CD38A916.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Erweiterte Solargenerator&r: vier Solargeneratoren, Legierung, Schaltkreise und ein Eisenblock, drei Blöcke hoch. Fortgeschrittene Kabel und Würfel entstehen aus den einfachen mit Infundierter Legierung und Fortschrittlichen Schaltkreisen."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Erweiterter Solargenerator:&r &d120 FE/t&r bei Tag, sechsmal der kleine. &eFortgeschrittenes Universalkabel:&r &d51 200 FE/t&r. &eFortgeschrittener Energie-Würfel:&r &d6,4 Millionen FE&r, 6 400 FE/t. Fortgeschrittene Induktionszellen speichern 25,6 Milliarden FE je Zelle, der Anschluss schafft 819 200 FE/t. Wie die ganze Matrix erst ab Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.422BDE42CD38A916.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism: 120 FE/t Solar, 51 200 FE/t Kabel, 6,4 Millionen FE Würfel."
	quest.422BDE42CD38A916.title: "&5Rüste Mekanism auf Fortgeschritten"
	quest.422C7E65F845450E.quest_desc: [
		"The Metallurgic Infuser with an installer. All three slots share one tank of infusion type, so one factory per type."
	]
	quest.422C7E65F845450E.quest_subtitle: "Three steel slots."
	quest.422C7E65F845450E.title: "&aBasic Infusing Factory"
	quest.422DB3D0363335B8.quest_desc: [
		"Find a &6trial chamber&r of copper and tuff and defeat the waves of a &6Trial Spawner&r. It ejects a &6Trial Key&r as it does."
		""
		"With the key you open a &6Vault&r of the chamber. Every vault gives every player loot once, so the chamber is worth it in a group too."
	]
	quest.422DB3D0363335B8.quest_subtitle: "Trial chambers lie deep in the stone."
	quest.422DB3D0363335B8.title: "&6Get a Trial Key"
	quest.4242765F4ECAD454.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cloggrum&r reicht für alle Erze, &6Froststahl&r-Waffen verlangsamen. Am Schmiedetisch: Vorlage, Cloggrumwerkzeug, Vergessener Barren vom Vergessenen Wächter."
		""
		"Vergessenes Werkzeug baut alle Undergarden-Blöcke anderthalbmal so schnell ab und ist der einzige Schlüssel zum Furchtfels über den Tiefen. Kapitel &2Der Undergarden&r."
	]
	quest.4242765F4ECAD454.quest_subtitle: "Undergarden: Cloggrum, Froststahl, Vergessen."
	quest.4242765F4ECAD454.title: "&2Hol die Vergessene Spitzhacke"
	quest.42460412094B7533.quest_desc: [
		"First &6Ether&r: &e4 glowstone dust&r on the altar, a &6Blazing Quartz&r (Nether ore) on a stand, plus &e2 Infernal&r and &e1 Arcane&r. Gives two."
		"Then a &6Twisted Rock Item Pedestal&r on the altar, &e4 Twisted&r, &e4 Tainted Rock&r and one Ether on the stands, plus &e8 Infernal&r and &e8 Aerial&r."
		""
		"Place the Catalyzer next to the Crucible: it heats the catalyst and speeds up focusing. In return the Impetus wears out a little faster, so combine it with a Repair Pylon right away."
	]
	quest.42460412094B7533.quest_subtitle: "The Crucible gets faster."
	quest.42460412094B7533.title: "&cInfuse a Spirit Catalyzer"
	quest.42555C6BA23D894D.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Encased Fan&r blowing through &clava&r smelts everything lying on the belt in front of it or falling through the air stream. Logs from the tree pots become &6charcoal&r that way, without a furnace and without fuel."
		""
		"A belt from the pot chest past the fan into a second chest, done. The lava is not used up."
		""
		"You need charcoal for Endoflames, torches and the furnace. With fire instead of lava, the fan smokes food instead."
	]
	quest.42555C6BA23D894D.quest_subtitle: "Logs through hot air, coal for the Endoflames."
	quest.42555C6BA23D894D.title: "&6Burn charcoal with the fan"
	quest.4256647EF926EB9F.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Zerschmetterten&r sind die Fußsoldaten der Anderwelt: &e50 Lebenspunkte, 6 Schaden&r, etwas Rüstung, langsam. Sie reagieren auf &eSchwingungen&r wie ein Sculk-Sensor, Schleichen hilft."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r &e1 bis 3 Sculkknochen&r. Die brauchst du für die Seelenelytren und den Schallstab aus Stufe 4, sammle sie also schon."
		""
		"&eVerzauberung:&r &6Sculk-Bann&r auf dem Schwert macht mehr Schaden gegen alle Sculk-Monster, auch gegen den Wärter."
	]
	quest.4256647EF926EB9F.quest_subtitle: "Sie hören dich, bevor sie dich sehen."
	quest.4256647EF926EB9F.title: "&8Zerschlag die Zerschmetterten"
	quest.425B0AAB92520850.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r four &6brass ingots&r in the corners, four &6redstone&r on the sides, the &6Basic Upgrade&r in the middle."
		""
		"Now the end extracts &e16 items every 10 ticks&r, &e500 mB&r of fluid, &e8,192 FE&r or &e2,000 mB&r of gas per tick."
		""
		"New is &edistribution&r: &6Nearest first&r, &6Furthest first&r, &6Round robin&r or &6Random&r. For a row of factories use round robin, then each gets the same amount. For overflow into a trash can use nearest first and put the can at the end."
	]
	quest.425B0AAB92520850.quest_subtitle: "Faster, and you decide where to."
	quest.425B0AAB92520850.title: "&6Build the Improved Upgrade"
	quest.425CD718A1DA8E47.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Top Source Gem, iron sheet, Source Gem. Middle iron sheet, &6netherrack&r, iron sheet. Bottom just one iron sheet."
		""
		"So four &6iron sheets&r, one netherrack and two &dSource Gems&r. EMI shows the changed recipe."
	]
	quest.425CD718A1DA8E47.quest_subtitle: "A cage for a blaze, sealed with magic."
	quest.425CD718A1DA8E47.title: "&6Build an Empty Blaze Burner"
	quest.426B4445204B3689.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6andesite alloys&r, &6redstone&r and two &6logs&r make the &6Cart Assembler&r. When a minecart with a redstone signal runs over it, it takes the glued blocks along."
		""
		"The &6Controller Rail&r (gold, stick, Electron Tube, six pieces) sets its speed by signal strength. For short routes in the mine it is cheaper than a train."
	]
	quest.426B4445204B3689.quest_subtitle: "The Cart Assembler."
	quest.426B4445204B3689.title: "&6Put a contraption on rails"
	quest.426C4D1C09A4C077.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_master_ritual_awakening.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&aFlourishing log&r, one sapling of each of the &e4 Archwood colors&r, &e4 source gems&r."
		""
		"Archwood trees nearby become &dWeald Walkers&r that guard a place (Dominion Wand: first the walker, then the block). Their color decides the spell: torch, freeze, damage with snare, or hex with wither."
	]
	quest.426C4D1C09A4C077.quest_subtitle: "Guardians from trees, golems from amethyst."
	quest.426C4D1C09A4C077.title: "&aMake the Awakening Tablet"
	quest.426DAFC0C10CD0AA.quest_desc: [
		"Break &dchorus plants&r at the bottom and collect &e16 chorus fruit&r. In a furnace &e8&r of them become popped chorus fruit."
		""
		"Four popped ones make four &6purpur blocks&r, one with a blaze rod an &6End Rod&r. Eaten, a fruit teleports you randomly, a gamble over the void."
		""
		"A &6chorus flower&r only grows on end stone. A few blocks at your base are enough for a farm."
	]
	quest.426DAFC0C10CD0AA.quest_subtitle: "The plant that teleports."
	quest.426DAFC0C10CD0AA.title: "&dHarvest Chorus Fruit"
	quest.426E75EA528A4918.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6smooth stone slab&r over a &6chest&r. The &6Feeding Slab&r holds three blocks that count as a flower for the bees, for example an iron block, a quartz block and a flower."
		""
		"Lumber and Quarry bees that feed from the slab produce from a random block in it. In front of a hive with a Simulator Upgrade, the slab is the only way to supply three different bees."
	]
	quest.426E75EA528A4918.quest_subtitle: "Three flowers on one block."
	quest.426E75EA528A4918.title: "&aPlace a Feeding Slab"
	quest.42710174B8567723.quest_desc: [
		"At the table, tier 2: &6Manipulation Essence&r and &6Mechanical Press&r."
		""
		"Presses items on the ground like a press, ingots into sheets. With AOE more at once, with Extract compacting instead of pressing, with Smelt heated."
	]
	quest.42710174B8567723.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: the press as a glyph."
	quest.42710174B8567723.title: "&dLearn Press"
	quest.427B30EC8AC36F66.quest_desc: [
		"A &6crafting table&r on top, &6two iron ingots&r next to the upgrade base, a &6chest&r at the bottom."
		""
		"A 3x3 grid in its own tab that works directly on the backpack contents. You put EMI recipes in with the plus."
	]
	quest.427B30EC8AC36F66.quest_subtitle: "A crafting table you always have with you."
	quest.427B30EC8AC36F66.title: "Build a Crafting Upgrade"
	quest.42848B904B06B075.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Bulk component from a &61M component&r, a &616³ Spatial Component&r, 2 &6Accumulation Processors&r, &6sky stone dust&r and an &5Awakened nugget&r. The cell: vibrant quartz glass, sky stone dust, 3 netherite ingots."
		""
		"It stores a single kind, of that almost any amount. The &6Compression Card&r converts between ingots, blocks and nuggets."
	]
	quest.42848B904B06B075.quest_subtitle: "One kind, as much as you like."
	quest.42848B904B06B075.title: "&bBuild a Bulk Cell"
	quest.428F8FE120E20C54.quest_desc: [
		"&e6 Livingrock&r, &e1 brewing stand&r, &e1 Rune of Mana&r, &e1 block of Manasteel&r."
		""
		"Put in a &6Managlass Vial&r (3 Managlass in a V shape give 3), then the ingredients, and aim a spreader at it. Brews have fixed recipes and several sips per vial; the Lexica lists them all."
	]
	quest.428F8FE120E20C54.quest_subtitle: "Potions with mana instead of a brewing stand."
	quest.428F8FE120E20C54.title: "&6Build the Botanical Brewery"
	quest.429F0D4C3D0BF1C4.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6tomatoes&r into the pot, a bowl with them."
		""
		"It goes into pasta with meatballs, pasta with mutton chop and fish stew."
	]
	quest.429F0D4C3D0BF1C4.quest_subtitle: "The base for pasta and stew."
	quest.429F0D4C3D0BF1C4.title: "&6Cook tomato sauce"
	quest.42AEE5D46F3B2881.quest_desc: [
		"Functional flowers draw mana from the nearest &6Mana Pool&r within &e10 blocks&r. A spreader can't supply them directly."
		""
		"Open without runes are &6Bellethorne&r, &6Dreadthorne&r, &6Bergamute&r and &6Solegnolia&r. All the others are listed as a checklist in the &aBotania: Runes&r chapter."
	]
	quest.42AEE5D46F3B2881.quest_subtitle: "Flowers that use mana and do work."
	quest.42AEE5D46F3B2881.title: "&aUnderstand functional flowers"
	quest.42BFA972276FD357.quest_desc: [
		"&6Storage Link:&r ender pearl and plank on top, repeater and stone at the bottom. Or shapeless: Storage Controller and ender pearl give three."
		""
		"With the &6Storage Tool&r (ender pearl, iron ingot, redstone torch, two sticks) click the Storage Controller first, then the link. That way a block of chests in another room hangs on the same controller."
	]
	quest.42BFA972276FD357.quest_subtitle: "The Storage Link."
	quest.42BFA972276FD357.title: "Connect a distant barrel"
	quest.42C8E7A307A40CFB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Elven Mana Spreader&r, &dDragonstone&r and &dGaia Spirit&r, shapeless."
		""
		"Bigger bursts, farther, with less loss, but less often. At the strongest flower or over long distances."
	]
	quest.42C8E7A307A40CFB.quest_subtitle: "The mod's best spreader."
	quest.42C8E7A307A40CFB.title: "&dBuild a Gaia Mana Spreader"
	quest.42D9D903A0AC27DD.quest_desc: [
		"A &6gold ingot&r and a &6silver ingot&r make &e2 electrum ingots&r in the Alloy Kiln."
		""
		"Electrum becomes MV wire and MV connectors, and in stage 3 it is in every Heavy Engineering Block."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/metal_ingot_electrum.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.42D9D903A0AC27DD.quest_subtitle: "Gold and silver, the metal of medium voltage."
	quest.42D9D903A0AC27DD.title: "&eAlloy electrum"
	quest.42DD8B765575CB93.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 planks&r around a &6Blood Infusion Core&r."
		""
		"Put damaged tools inside and fill the tank with blood. They slowly repair themselves, &e5 mB&r per durability point. Very rarely they catch a &cCurse of Breaking&r doing so, which the purifier removes again."
		""
		"Good for the Vein Sword with its 32 hits."
	]
	quest.42DD8B765575CB93.quest_subtitle: "Tools bathe in blood."
	quest.42DD8B765575CB93.title: "&4Build a Blood Chest"
	quest.42EC59B690C1CE41.quest_desc: [
		"The Crystal Assembler makes two &6ME Wireless Connectors&r from machine frames, smart dense cables, wireless receivers and boosters. With the &6ME Wireless Setup Kit&r (needs a singularity) you click both one after the other."
		""
		"Only within the same dimension. The farther, the more power, Energy Cards lower it by 10 percent each. The &6ME Wireless Hub&r connects up to eight connectors and needs a Quantum Link Chamber."
	]
	quest.42EC59B690C1CE41.quest_subtitle: "Cables through the air."
	quest.42EC59B690C1CE41.title: "&3Connect Networks Wirelessly"
	quest.42F0A01AF14B922E.quest_desc: [
		"While fishing you now and then pull a &6box&r, a &6locker&r or a &6treasure chest&r out of the water. &eRight click&r opens it, there is loot inside."
		""
		"On top of that come driftwood, algae, fish bones and tin cans. Driftwood gives planks, fish bones give bone meal."
	]
	quest.42F0A01AF14B922E.quest_subtitle: "Not everything on the hook is a fish."
	quest.42F0A01AF14B922E.title: "&7Open a catch from the deep"
	quest.42FD6FF97D969429.quest_desc: [
		"Ein Elternteil ist eine Kreuzung der ersten Generation. Alle zwölf stehen für 2 Smaragde im Markt."
		""
		"&6Erle&r: Buche + Birke, 10 %"
		"&6Esche&r: Silberlinde + Fichte, 10 %"
		"&6Balsa&r: Teak + Akazie, 10 %"
		"&6Paranuss&r: Buche + Kakao, 10 %"
		"&6Gelbkiefer&r: Europäische Lärche + Fichte, 10 %"
		"&6Cashew&r: Teak + Mangrove, 10 %"
		"&6Granny-Smith-Apfel&r: Red-Delicious-Apfel + Kirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Ipe&r: Teak + Schwarzeiche, 10 %"
		"&6Kapok&r: Teak + Tropenbaum, 10 %"
		"&6Pekannuss&r: Buche + Birke, 10 %"
		"&6Prärie-Holzapfel&r: Red-Delicious-Apfel + Birke, 10 %"
		"&6Rotahorn&r: Silberlinde + Europäische Lärche, 10 %"
	]
	quest.42FD6FF97D969429.quest_subtitle: "12 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.42FD6FF97D969429.title: "&aGeneration 2: Erle bis Rotahorn"
	quest.4301C49EBE02D2C7.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Copper Plate&r and the &6wire cutters&r in the crafting table make a &6Copper Wire&r."
		""
		"Copper Wire is the raw material for LV Wire Coils and for Vacuum Tubes."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_wire_copper.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4301C49EBE02D2C7.quest_subtitle: "One plate, one wire."
	quest.4301C49EBE02D2C7.title: "&6Cut Copper Wire"
	quest.4302C8F783572309.quest_desc: [
		"Der &cNightmare Stalker&r (70 Lebenspunkte, 7 Schaden, schnell und schwer wegzustoßen) sucht sich einen Spieler aus und verfolgt ihn. Kämpf bei Licht und mit dem Rücken zur Wand, er greift von hinten an."
		""
		"Er lässt eine &6Albtraumklaue&r fallen, dazu Monsterhaut oder Dunkelmetall, und etwa jeder elfte seinen &6Schädel&r. Zwei Klauen, ein Dunkelmetallbarren und ein Knochengriff ergeben die &6Albtraumsense&r: Angriffe heilen dich, verdorren das Ziel und sperren seine Magie."
		""
		"Aus Monsterhaut und Dunkelmetall wird die &6Albtraumrüstung&r (Robe: 2 Barren und 6 Haut), die Maske braucht den Schädel. Im Dunkeln läufst du damit schneller, und dunkle Waffen werden stärker."
	]
	quest.4302C8F783572309.quest_subtitle: "Er jagt dich. Also dreh dich um."
	quest.4302C8F783572309.title: "&8Stell dich dem Nightmare Stalker"
	quest.4313E9F0A0D5A27F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r sechs Eisenbarren oben und unten, zwei Redstoneblöcke links und rechts, ein Redstone in der Mitte. Die ziehende Seite kommt an den Generator oder Speicher, Rechtsklick mit dem Schraubenschlüssel öffnet das Menü."
		""
		"&ePipez, Energierohr:&r &d256 FE/t&r ohne Upgrade, Basis-Upgrade 1 024, Verbessert 8 192 (beide Stufe 2), Fortgeschritten 32 768 (Stufe 3), Ultimativ 131 072 FE/t (Stufe 4). Ein Rohr für jede Mod, siehe Kapitel &6Rohre und Router&r."
	]
	quest.4313E9F0A0D5A27F.quest_subtitle: "Pipez, Energierohr, 256 FE/t ohne Upgrade, bis 131 072 mit."
	quest.4313E9F0A0D5A27F.title: "&6Leg ein Stromrohr von Pipez"
	quest.4313FC57036C08F2.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nether_fortress.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Look for a &6Nether fortress&r and bring &e16 Nether bricks&r out. Keep a lookout from above for dark walls over the lava lakes."
		""
		"On Kronwerke &eYUNG's Better Nether Fortresses&r builds them bigger and more winding, with rooms of their own for the spawners. Share the coordinates in chat."
		""
		"&cDangers:&r blazes, wither skeletons (who poison you with Wither) and ghasts in the big halls."
	]
	quest.4313FC57036C08F2.quest_subtitle: "Dark bricks, long bridges, blazes."
	quest.4313FC57036C08F2.title: "&4&lFind a Nether fortress"
	quest.43171CD5E9DB4D2B.quest_desc: [
		"&fHoly&r means healing and support. Common: &6Wisp&r (light projectile, seeks targets), &6Guiding Bolt&r (hits attract projectiles), &6Blessing of Life&r (heals one target), &6Healing Circle&r (healing circle on the ground)."
		"&6Cloud of Regeneration&r (hold: heals allies around you), &6Fortify&r (bonus health for everyone around you), &6Divine Smite&r (melee slash, scales with the weapon)."
		""
		"Focus: Divine Pearl from gold and amethyst. The school for everyone who plays in a group."
		""
		"&cStage 2:&r Heal, Sunbeam, Greater Heal. &cStage 3:&r Cleanse, Haste. &cStage 4:&r Angel Wings."
	]
	quest.43171CD5E9DB4D2B.quest_subtitle: "Heal, protect, buff."
	quest.43171CD5E9DB4D2B.title: "&fCast a Holy Spell"
	quest.43353D99842FDE3E.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &e8 Otherstone&r in a ring make the &6Otherstone Frame&r."
		""
		"&5Pentacle:&r Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion."
		"&6Bowls:&r the frame, an &6ender pearl&r, &e2 nether quartz&r, &e2 gold ingots&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book, 60 seconds."
		""
		"Click the Storage Actuator while sneaking to link the wormhole, then place it anywhere in the base. It opens the same storage as the Actuator. With Otherrock instead of Otherstone you get the dark variant."
	]
	quest.43353D99842FDE3E.quest_subtitle: "A second access to the storage."
	quest.43353D99842FDE3E.title: "&6Build a Stable Wormhole"
	quest.4342DA54864C265F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Entro Seed&r: sand, three Ender Dust, two redstone, two glowstone, one Sky Stone Dust. A right click with it on a &6fluix block&r makes a &6Budding Fully Entroized Fluix&r, on which entro buds grow."
		""
		"The block uses itself up and ends as a Certus Quartz Block, on average after about ten crystals. Broken it gives one &6Entro Dust&r. Entro Dust and fluix in water give an Entro Crystal, Entro Dust with gold and lapis an &6Entro Infused Ingot&r."
	]
	quest.4342DA54864C265F.quest_subtitle: "Fluix with ender dust."
	quest.4342DA54864C265F.title: "&3Grow entro"
	quest.4348580594C97569.quest_desc: [
		"&dEnder Inventory&r (Manipulation Essence, ender chest): opens your ender chest anywhere."
		"&dName&r (Manipulation Essence, name tag): names the target after the spell."
		"&dSense Magic&r (Abjuration Essence, Dowsing Rod, Starbuncle Shards): magical creatures within 75 blocks glow."
		"&dInvisibility&r (Abjuration Essence, fermented spider eye, blaze rod). &dInfuse&r (Abjuration Essence, glass bottle, blaze rod): gives the target the potion from your flask."
		"&dAnimate Block&r (Conjuration Essence, 3 obsidian): a block fights for you."
	]
	quest.4348580594C97569.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2 checklist: everything for the road."
	quest.4348580594C97569.title: "&dLearn the utility glyphs"
	quest.434D8079824BE4A7.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_lightning_rod.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e8 Copper Coil Blocks, 4 Light Engineering Blocks, 4 Steel Scaffolding, 4 treated wood fences, 4 HV Accumulators, 3 High-Voltage Coil Blocks&r, shape as in the manual, then the hammer on it."
		""
		"&6HV Accumulator:&r aluminium, Redstone Acid bucket, aluminium at the top, Aluminium Plate, Basic Engineering Block, &6HOP graphite plate&r at the bottom, stores 4 million FE. Steel Fences on top of the Lightning Rod raise the chance of a strike during a thunderstorm."
	]
	quest.434D8079824BE4A7.quest_subtitle: "3x3x3, one lightning strike gives 16 million FE."
	quest.434D8079824BE4A7.title: "&eForm a Lightning Rod"
	quest.435A1C79B4753DF4.quest_desc: [
		"&664k ME Energy Storage Component:&r fluix dust in the corners, an &6Energy Processor&r at the top, three 16k energy components, polarized quartz glass in the middle. Housing: quartz glass, redstone, Insulating Resin."
		""
		"FE cells now go up to &64M&r. At 1,048,576 FE per byte a 64k cell holds a good 68 billion FE."
	]
	quest.435A1C79B4753DF4.quest_subtitle: "Applied Flux up to 4M."
	quest.435A1C79B4753DF4.title: "&cStore Power in 64k"
	quest.437C80EC5335B717.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Aviar's Circle."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6coal&r, a &6furnace&r, a &6campfire&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book."
		""
		"It smelts everything a furnace, blast furnace, smoker or campfire can, without fuel and as fast as a furnace."
	]
	quest.437C80EC5335B717.quest_subtitle: "A furnace without fuel."
	quest.437C80EC5335B717.title: "&dSummon a Foliot Smelter"
	quest.4380F85A59F5736D.quest_desc: [
		"Smithing table: &6Flowglaze Upgrade Smithing Template&r, &6Glacite Shield&r and &6Flowglaze&r make the &6Flowglaze Shield&r."
		""
		"When you block with it, arrows and other projectiles fly back. Very pleasant against Lonestar Skeletons and ranged fighters in the boss arenas."
	]
	quest.4380F85A59F5736D.quest_subtitle: "A shield that throws projectiles back."
	quest.4380F85A59F5736D.title: "&bUpgrade to the Flowglaze Shield"
	quest.438698BAE4D28E96.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wraith Heart&r: &5Wraiths&r rarely drop it, only when you defeat them yourself. Looting helps."
		"Worktable: Wraith Heart at the top right, &e2 Pewter&r and a &6stick&r diagonally, Pewter Inlay at the bottom left. Extra: &6Lesser Soul Gem&r and &e3 bone meal&r."
		""
		"The wand curses the target with an icy grip: as with a Wraith's claws, it no longer regenerates health. You recharge empty wands with a Soul Gem on the brazier."
	]
	quest.438698BAE4D28E96.quest_subtitle: "Whoever is hit stops healing."
	quest.438698BAE4D28E96.title: "&bBuild a Bonechill Wand"
	quest.438C52F72ED64035.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6redstone&r at the top, two &6Draconium Ingots&r left and right in the middle, &6iron&r, &6Dislocator&r, &6iron&r at the bottom."
		""
		"The &bItem Dislocator&r pulls items near you to you. A key turns it on and off, handy at the monster farm or when mining in the End."
	]
	quest.438C52F72ED64035.quest_subtitle: "What lies on the ground comes to you."
	quest.438C52F72ED64035.title: "&bBuild an Item Magnet"
	quest.438E930A257A8803.quest_desc: [
		"&6Shape Card&r, &6obsidian&r, &6black dye&r. It deletes every block in the area and only costs &ehalf&r the power."
		""
		"Good for leveling a mountain. For ore, use the Quarry Card instead."
	]
	quest.438E930A257A8803.quest_subtitle: "Get rid of it."
	quest.438E930A257A8803.title: "&8Build a Void Card"
	quest.43A52E158139267F.quest_desc: [
		"&cIgnis&r lässt &6Ignitium&r fallen. Vorlage: Netherit-Schmiedevorlage, 4 Lohenstaub, 4 Netherziegel. Damit wird Netheritrüstung am Schmiedetisch zu Ignitiumrüstung."
		""
		"&6The Incinerator&r: Netheritschwert, 2 Ignitium, 4 Lohenruten. &6Bulwark of the Flame&r: Schild, 2 Ignitium, 2 Lohenruten, 4 Netherziegel. Die &cNetherit-Monstrosität&r lässt die &6Infernal Forge&r fallen."
	]
	quest.43A52E158139267F.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm im Nether: Ignis und die Monstrosität."
	quest.43A52E158139267F.title: "&cTrag Ignitium"
	quest.43A6A31DB3A4D41E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mortar:&r two bricks above a diamond. &6Pestle:&r three diamonds and two sticks. Both together, shapeless, give &6Mortar and Pestle&r."
		""
		"Instead of the hammer, each piece gives two powders with it. For thirty staffs that pays off quickly."
	]
	quest.43A6A31DB3A4D41E.quest_subtitle: "Twice as much powder."
	quest.43A6A31DB3A4D41E.title: "&eBuild a Mortar and Pestle"
	quest.43ADA68DB1B12342.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Lebestein in die Ecken, Redstoneblöcke an die Seiten, ein &6Manastahlbarren&r in die Mitte. Schieß Manastöße aus einem Verbreiter hinein, der Strom geht an alle Nachbarn."
		""
		"&eBotania, Manaflussfeld:&r Brennstoff Mana, &d1 Mana = 10 FE&r. Puffer 1 280 Mana, also 12 800 FE, Abgabe bis &d1 600 FE/t&r. Ein Becken mit 1 Million Mana sind 10 Millionen FE. Der Block selbst ist frei, der Manastahl im Rezept kommt mit Stufe 2. Einen Rückweg von FE zu Mana gibt es nicht."
	]
	quest.43ADA68DB1B12342.quest_subtitle: "Botania, Manaflussfeld, 1 Mana = 10 FE, bis 1 600 FE/t."
	quest.43ADA68DB1B12342.title: "&dMach aus Mana Strom"
	quest.43ADBB5C52E44FA0.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Sevira's Permanent Confinement."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6Djinni Miner&r, &6Iesnium Pickaxe&r, &bSpirit Attuned Crystal&r, &cAfrit Essence&r, &6echo shard&r, &6crying obsidian&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Afrit book."
		""
		"It digs faster, also finds deepslate ores and wears the lamp out more slowly. Echo shards come from the possessed Warden of Posuc's Convocation, or from the chests of the Ancient Cities."
	]
	quest.43ADBB5C52E44FA0.quest_subtitle: "Dig deeper, with less wear."
	quest.43ADBB5C52E44FA0.title: "&6Bind an Afrit Miner"
	quest.43CDFCAC9A211246.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_loot_saplings.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Sechs Setzlinge wachsen aus keiner Kreuzung: &6Blue Yonder&r liegt in &eSchiffswrack-Schatztruhen&r (30 Prozent), &6Flickering Sun&r in &eWüstentempeln&r (15), &6Firecracker&r in &eAntiken Städten&r (15), &6Brown Amber&r kommt beim Ausgraben verdächtigen Kieses in &ekalten Ozeanruinen&r (10)."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/fruit/planet_peach.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Black Ember&r liegt in Bastionstruhen (30 Prozent) und kommt mit dem Nether in Stufe 2, der &6Soul Tree&r in Endsiedlungen (5 Prozent) mit dem End in Stufe 4. Keines der Fundstücke steht im Markt."
		""
		"Alle sechs sind &efeuerfest&r wie Netherholz, und bis auf Brown Amber leuchten sie (Lichtlevel 11, Flickering Sun 14). Blue Yonder trägt den &6Planetenpfirsich&r, der satt macht wie eine Goldene Karotte, wächst aber am Baum extrem langsam (Tempo 0,1), nimm den Pflanztopf. Firecracker trägt &6Feuerwerksraketen&r, eine pro Blatt."
	]
	quest.43CDFCAC9A211246.quest_subtitle: "Sechs Bäume gibt es nur als Fundstück."
	quest.43CDFCAC9A211246.title: "&bFinde einen Setzling in einer Truhe"
	quest.43CEFC2210C2A552.quest_desc: [
		"Into the pot: a &6wheat dough&r, &6cabbage&r, an &6onion&r and raw chicken, pork, beef or a &6brown mushroom&r. Out come &etwo&r dumplings."
		""
		"The mushroom version needs no animals at all. Dumplings need no bowl, you eat them directly."
	]
	quest.43CEFC2210C2A552.quest_subtitle: "Two servings from one pot."
	quest.43CEFC2210C2A552.title: "&6Fill dumplings"
	quest.43D847CCF4429AF2.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &5Wilden Tribute&r in the middle, &6Precision Mechanism&r, &6Calibrated Precision Mechanism&r, &6Manipulation Essence&r, iron, copper, zinc, brass and gold sheets on the pedestals, &d10,000 source&r. Makes &e5 Marks&r."
		""
		"With a mark, netherite and brass, third tier robes become Technomancer, Machinaguard or Artificer. The third tier only exists with stage 4, collect the marks now."
	]
	quest.43D847CCF4429AF2.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: one tribute, five marks for tech robes."
	quest.43D847CCF4429AF2.title: "&6Stamp Marks of Technomancy"
	quest.43E40E1AA1D5CD02.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ranged Pumps&r, &6Pumpe&r: pumpt von ihrem Standort aus Ring um Ring bis Reichweite &e64&r alles unter sich weg, &e100 FE pro Block&r, einer alle 8 Ticks, Tank 32 Eimer. Was weg ist, wird zu Stein. Kein Filter, Redstone hält sie an. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Obsidian, zwei Eisenspitzhacken, Lava- und Wassereimer, in der Mitte eine Mechanische Pumpe von Create. Siehe Kapitel Rohre und Router."
	]
	quest.43E40E1AA1D5CD02.quest_subtitle: "Ranged Pumps, Pumpe: saugt 64 Blöcke im Umkreis leer."
	quest.43E40E1AA1D5CD02.title: "Lies: Ranged Pump"
	quest.43E562D043305A20.quest_desc: [
		"Tick this off when you find biomes, travel between waystones, dig in the farm world and know which structures belong where."
		""
		"The &cNether&r opens with stage 2, live on stream, through the portal at spawn. Until then, build up a supply of food, torches and iron."
	]
	quest.43E562D043305A20.quest_subtitle: "There and back again."
	quest.43E562D043305A20.title: "&6&lBecome an explorer"
	quest.43E59A00996FC943.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gilded Belt&r: &e3 leather&r at the top, below them Hallowed Gold, Refined Soulstone, Hallowed Gold, one Hallowed Gold at the bottom."
		"The belt on the altar, on the stands &6Cthonic Gold&r and &e4&r raw gold, iron and copper each. Plus &e32 Earthen&r, &e32 Infernal&r and &e16 Arcane&r."
		""
		"Every explosion you set off works like Fortune III. Valuable finds also give you &eAvarice&r: each level brings a &d10 percent&r chance of one extra Fortune level when mining."
	]
	quest.43E59A00996FC943.quest_subtitle: "Explosions with Fortune III."
	quest.43E59A00996FC943.title: "&6Infuse the Belt of the Prospector"
	quest.43ECD9AEB4E153A7.quest_desc: [
		"The recipe holds &6amethyst&r, &6prismarine shards&r, a &6Marker&r and &6dragon's breath&r."
		""
		"You catch dragon's breath with an empty bottle from the Ender Dragon's purple cloud. More speed means more power per second, check your supply line."
	]
	quest.43ECD9AEB4E153A7.quest_subtitle: "Dragon's breath for the motor."
	quest.43ECD9AEB4E153A7.title: "&5Build a Faster Work Module"
	quest.43EF8F41A15FD63B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Induction Casing:&r four steel around an Energy Tablet, gives four. &6Induction Port:&r four casings around an &6Elite Control Circuit&r, gives two."
		""
		"The shell is a hollow cuboid of casing and structural glass, at least 3 by 3 by 3. One port takes power in, set a second one to output with the Configurator."
	]
	quest.43EF8F41A15FD63B.quest_subtitle: "The shell of the largest battery."
	quest.43EF8F41A15FD63B.title: "&9Build Induction Casing and Port"
	quest.43FC78E4F0295D41.quest_desc: [
		"Raw &6beef&r, a &6carrot&r and a &6potato&r into the pot, plus a bowl."
		""
		"Soups and stews usually give the &dComfort&r effect, see the quest after this one."
	]
	quest.43FC78E4F0295D41.quest_subtitle: "Hearty and warming."
	quest.43FC78E4F0295D41.title: "&6Cook a beef stew"
	quest.43FD84871F042818.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fission Fuel Assembly:&r lead, steel and a &6Basic Chemical Tank&r. They stand as columns in the reactor and can be stacked."
		""
		"Each assembly raises the burn rate and the room for fuel and waste. Leave air between the columns, the coolant needs surface."
	]
	quest.43FD84871F042818.quest_subtitle: "The columns in the reactor."
	quest.43FD84871F042818.title: "&7Build Fuel Assemblies"
	quest.4410E9C1FE5C3D7B.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Heavy Core&r over a &6Breeze Rod&r makes the &6Mace&r. Its damage grows with the fall height, and a hit from a jump breaks your fall."
		""
		"The core only exists in &5Ominous Vaults&r. Drink an &6Ominous Bottle&r, which captains of pillager patrols drop, and then enter a trial chamber. The spawners get harder and eject &5Ominous Trial Keys&r."
		""
		"Together with wind charges it becomes the most dangerous melee weapon of the overworld."
	]
	quest.4410E9C1FE5C3D7B.quest_subtitle: "The deeper the fall, the harder the blow."
	quest.4410E9C1FE5C3D7B.title: "&5Forge a Mace"
	quest.44174E12BFA633C4.quest_desc: [
		"Eine Hülle aus &6Turbinengehäuse&r (mindestens 5 x 5), innen Rotor mit Blättern, Rotationskomplex, Druckventile, darüber &6Elektromagnetische Spulen&r (eine je vier Blätter), Ventile in der Hülle für Dampf und Strom."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Industrieturbine:&r Brennstoff Dampf. Dampf kommt vom Thermoelektrischen Dampfkessel, aus Oritech über den Rotationskondensator, und ab Stufe 5 vom Spaltreaktor. Jeder Turbinenblock gibt 6,4 Millionen FE Puffer dazu, der Ausstoß hängt von Blättern, Spulen und Dampfmenge ab. Offen ab Stufe 3, siehe Kapitel &6Mekanism: Fortgeschritten&r."
	]
	quest.44174E12BFA633C4.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, Strom aus Dampf, wächst mit dem Reaktor."
	quest.44174E12BFA633C4.title: "&5Bau die Industrieturbine"
	quest.4421F6507C3F8FC4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/undergarden_forgotten.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Smithing table: &6Smithing Template&r, &6Cloggrum Pickaxe&r, &6Forgotten Ingot&r. Out comes the &6Forgotten Pickaxe&r."
		""
		"Only Forgotten tools mine the &6Dreadrock&r at the bottom, and the Depths lie below it. Forgotten tools mine Undergarden blocks &e1.5 times&r as fast."
		""
		"&eCopy the template:&r template, 7 diamonds and 1 Depthrock make 2 templates."
	]
	quest.4421F6507C3F8FC4.quest_subtitle: "The key to the Depths."
	quest.4421F6507C3F8FC4.title: "&dUpgrade the Pickaxe"
	quest.442AB303E889EDA0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_elite_fusion.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Controller:&r Ultimate Control Circuits top left and right, a glass pane between them, Chemical Tank in the middle, frames all around. It sits in the middle of the top side."
		""
		"&eShape:&r 5 by 5 by 5, each side a diamond (1, 3, 5, 3, 1 blocks). Frames on the outside, in the plus of each side frames, reactor glass, ports, logic adapters or the focus matrix."
		""
		"&eIgnition:&r Hohlraum into the controller, fire the amplifier at the matrix. After that it needs D-T Fuel continuously through the ports. With water it makes steam for the turbine."
	]
	quest.442AB303E889EDA0.quest_subtitle: "A small sun in the basement."
	quest.442AB303E889EDA0.title: "&6&lIgnite the Fusion Reactor"
	quest.443BF49FB69032A0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Daffomill&r (2 white, brown, yellow, Rune of Air, Redstone Root): pushes items in front of it. A sneaking right click with the wand turns it."
		"&6Pollidisiac&r (2 red, 2 pink, 1 orange, Runes of Lust and Fire): feeds animals with food from the ground. With the wand in function mode you choose adults, young or all."
	]
	quest.443BF49FB69032A0.quest_subtitle: "Two helpers for farms."
	quest.443BF49FB69032A0.title: "&6Move items and feed animals"
	quest.443EA6D204C4BCEC.quest_desc: [
		"&eFluid Cargo Condition&r: like the Item Cargo Condition, only for the train's tanks. A tank train only leaves when it is full or empty."
	]
	quest.443EA6D204C4BCEC.quest_subtitle: "Fill the tank first."
	quest.443EA6D204C4BCEC.title: "&7Fluid Cargo Condition"
	quest.44477DCB55DFF3B0.quest_desc: [
		"&ePlace&r setzt Blöcke aus dem Inventar der Drohne in den &eArea&r, zuerst die nächstgelegenen Stellen. Rechtsklick: Schicht für Schicht, von oben oder unten, zufällige Blöcke aus dem Inventar, und eine Höchstzahl."
		""
		"Import aus einer Kiste voller Bruchstein, Place in einen Bereich, zurück zu Start: eine Mauer, die sich von selbst baut. Mit einem Filter rechts setzt sie nur bestimmte Blöcke."
	]
	quest.44477DCB55DFF3B0.quest_subtitle: "Die Drohne baut aus ihrem Inventar."
	quest.44477DCB55DFF3B0.title: "&7Puzzleteil: Place"
	quest.444B9286FB5F51E1.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/quarries_quarry.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Deepsilver&r from Eternal Starlight, &6obsidian&r, two &6diamond pickaxes&r, a &6dispenser&r, a &6redstone block&r and a &6Marker&r."
		""
		"Place it next to a connected Marker, then it takes over the area. Power through FE cables, the loot goes to a chest or a pipe next to it."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r If a chunk of another team lies in the area, it stops."
	]
	quest.444B9286FB5F51E1.quest_subtitle: "Frame, head, hole."
	quest.444B9286FB5F51E1.title: "&9&lBuild a Quarry Plus"
	quest.4459C39EF219EF00.quest_desc: [
		"&e1 bone meal&r and &e4 dyes of any colour&r, shapeless, make &6Floral Fertilizer&r. Right click grass with it, and Mystical Flowers in random colours sprout all around."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Lay out a bed next to your base and fertilise it regularly, then you no longer have to search."
	]
	quest.4459C39EF219EF00.quest_subtitle: "New flowers wherever you want."
	quest.4459C39EF219EF00.title: "&6Mix Floral Fertilizer"
	quest.4461F299F1CB41DA.quest_desc: [
		"Steel in bulk, ore tripling, storage networks with Applied Energistics and Refined Storage, Alfheim, Afrit and Marid, machines that run around the clock."
		""
		"A pure magic base multiplies ore here just as well as a pure tech base."
	]
	quest.4461F299F1CB41DA.quest_subtitle: "Steel, ore multiplication, rituals."
	quest.4461F299F1CB41DA.title: "&fStage 3: Steel Works"
	quest.44681E91BB9B17DD.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r three &6stone&r on top, &6cobblestone&r on the sides and bottom, a &6chest&r in the middle. A &6Trash Can for items&r."
		""
		"Everything you put in is gone. Almost: the &eshow deleted&r button shows the last items, and you get them back. A &6filter&r with nine slots and whitelist or blacklist makes it the overflow at the end of a pipe: only cobblestone may go in."
		""
		"The same shape with a &6bucket&r in the middle destroys fluids and gases, with a &6redstone&r power, with an adjustable maximum rate as a load test for generators. All three together give the &6Ultimate Trash Can&r."
	]
	quest.44681E91BB9B17DD.quest_subtitle: "Three trash cans, with filter and undo."
	quest.44681E91BB9B17DD.title: "&7Throw Away What Bothers You"
	quest.446DEBB1C869A0A6.quest_desc: [
		"The upgrade base in the middle, &6eight logs&r around it."
		""
		"Every slot holds &etwice&r as much. An iron barrel with this upgrade holds as much as four chests. At most &etwo stack upgrades&r per chest or barrel."
	]
	quest.446DEBB1C869A0A6.quest_subtitle: "Stack Upgrade Tier 1 for chests."
	quest.446DEBB1C869A0A6.title: "Double a barrel with wood"
	quest.448228BD326C7E34.quest_desc: [
		"A &6book&r in the middle, &e2 leather&r above and below, on the left something that melts (&6Animal Fat&r, a candle or honeycomb), on the right a &6Sage Seed&r. That is the &6Book of Shadows&r."
		"You find Sage Seeds like wheat seeds when breaking grass."
		""
		"&2Hexerei&r is witchcraft you can touch: gather herbs, dry them, grind them, mix them in the cauldron, dip candles and fly off on a broom. The whole mod opens with &6stage 2&r."
		""
		"In the book a key above every item shows the recipe in EMI. Bookmarks you set at the top left."
	]
	quest.448228BD326C7E34.quest_subtitle: "Witchcraft the old way."
	quest.448228BD326C7E34.title: "&2&lOpen the Book of Shadows"
	quest.4486F05415B07D3B.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 light grey&r, &e1 grey&r, &e1 cyan&r petal, &eRune of Earth&r."
		""
		"Turns sand nearby into clay balls for a little mana. With a Hopperhock next to it, the clay lands straight in the chest."
	]
	quest.4486F05415B07D3B.quest_subtitle: "Sand becomes clay."
	quest.4486F05415B07D3B.title: "&6Plant a Clayconia"
	quest.448990C81099D36B.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 iron ingots&r, a &6bowl&r in the middle and a &6bone meal&r at the top middle give the &6Watering Can&r. Fill it by right clicking water."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/watering_can.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Hold the right mouse button over the field: the can waters &e3 by 3&r tiles and gives every crop in it a &e25 percent&r chance per tick for a growth boost. That works on essence crops too, unlike bone meal."
		""
		"The water never runs out, only your patience. The Inferium Watering Can in the Prosperity section waters a larger area and can run on its own."
	]
	quest.448990C81099D36B.quest_subtitle: "Growth by hand, three by three tiles."
	quest.448990C81099D36B.title: "&bBuild a Watering Can"
	quest.448DC6FC2DC42A52.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/exploration_e_tnt_village.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Find a village in a biome that has none in vanilla and tick this off: beach, birch forest, flower forest, jungle, meadow, mushroom island, swamp, badlands and more."
		""
		"&6Towns and Towers&r gives each of them its own houses. There is even one on the ocean."
	]
	quest.448DC6FC2DC42A52.quest_subtitle: "Every biome has its own village style."
	quest.448DC6FC2DC42A52.title: "&6Visit a Towns and Towers village"
	quest.44939877E7552F5D.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6steel ingots&r, an &6Iron Mechanical Component&r and two &6Wooden Grips&r make the &6Engineer's Skyhook&r. Wooden Grip: five Treated Sticks and a copper nugget."
		""
		"Hold right click near a wire and you hang on it. Downhill you roll by yourself, uphill with the movement keys. At junctions it goes where you look. Sneaking lets you go."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Uninsulated wires under power hurt you on the Skyhook too. For pure cable cars use &6hemp rope&r: four hemp fibres around a stick make four Hemp Rope Coils, one stretch may be &e32 blocks&r long."
	]
	quest.44939877E7552F5D.quest_subtitle: "Your lines become a cable car."
	quest.44939877E7552F5D.title: "&bRide the wire with the Skyhook"
	quest.44A1DF76092DDEDE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blank Runestones&r only exist as loot: 4 percent in normal chests, 30 percent in fort libraries, 60 percent in the basement of the Ice Spider Den. Mages do not drop any, but the Archevoker drops a finished Evocation Rune half the time."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/blank_rune.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Eight foci around a runestone give the school's &6rune&r: eight Frozen Bones the Ice Rune, eight emeralds the Evocation Rune, eight ender pearls the Ender Rune. Eight &6Arcane Essence&r give the Arcane Rune, eight pufferfish the Protective Rune, eight phantom membranes the Recovery Rune."
		""
		"A &6Shriving Stone&r (raw iron and amethyst shard, shapeless) turns any rune back into a blank stone. You need runes for the school armor below and from stage 2 for upgrade orbs."
	]
	quest.44A1DF76092DDEDE.quest_subtitle: "Eight foci around it, a rune of the school."
	quest.44A1DF76092DDEDE.title: "&5Find a Blank Runestone"
	quest.44A3402F3F3A6857.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mekanism&r, &6Einfaches Universalkabel&r: &e3 200 FE pro Tick&r, Fortgeschritten 51 200 (Stufe 3), Elite 409 600 und Ultimativ 3 276 800 (Stufe 4). Verbindet sich mit allem, was FE kennt. Seiten mit dem Konfigurator auf Ziehen, Schieben oder Keine. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Zwei Stahlbarren und ein Redstone ergeben acht. Der &6Energie-Würfel&r speichert daneben 1,6 Millionen FE. Siehe Kapitel Mekanism."
	]
	quest.44A3402F3F3A6857.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, Universalkabel: 3 200 FE pro Tick, versteht jede Mod."
	quest.44A3402F3F3A6857.title: "Lies: Universalkabel"
	quest.44A3719685353C0E.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: any &6seeds&r in the middle, &e4 Source Gems&r on the pedestals. Out comes &6Magebloom seeds&r for farmland."
		""
		"One bloom gives &e4 Magebloom Fiber&r, shapeless. You need it for parchment, rune chalk, threads, robes and the Trinkets Pouch."
	]
	quest.44A3719685353C0E.quest_subtitle: "The stuff magicians are made of."
	quest.44A3719685353C0E.title: "&6Grow Magebloom"
	quest.44C03ED12C342702.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r A &6glass bottle&r, an &6ink sac&r and a &6Source Gem&r from Ars Nouveau shapeless give a &6Common Ink&r."
		""
		"It also lies in the same chests as the scrolls (10 percent per chest, two tries), almost always in fort libraries, and every &6mage&r drops 1 to 3 vials. The Wandering Trader sells it for emeralds."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/common_ink.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Every spell has levels, usually 5 to 10. The lowest 30 percent of them are &fcommon&r, then come 25 percent &auncommon&r, 20 percent &9rare&r, 15 percent &5epic&r and 10 percent &6legendary&r. The ink decides which rarity you may forge in the Scroll Forge."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r You already find Uncommon and Rare Ink (stage 2), Epic Ink (stage 3) and Legendary Ink (stage 4) now. Collect them in a chest, they are useful right away later."
	]
	quest.44C03ED12C342702.quest_subtitle: "From chests, from mages or from the crafting table."
	quest.44C03ED12C342702.title: "&fCollect Common Ink"
	quest.44CCE94BB30D1B82.quest_desc: [
		"&6Hopping Botany Pot&r (botany pot and hopper), dirt inside, a &6sapling&r on top, a chest or drawer below. Every &e2 minutes&r &e1 to 4 logs&r drop into the chest, the tree stays."
		""
		"Every sapling in the pack works, including &darchwood&r for Ars Nouveau. One pot gives about 75 logs per hour; four pots next to the kitchen supply furnace, casings and Endoflames."
		""
		"Pots, soils and the tool slot are in the &6Cooking&r chapter (botany pots)."
	]
	quest.44CCE94BB30D1B82.quest_subtitle: "A tree in one block, logs every two minutes."
	quest.44CCE94BB30D1B82.title: "&6Set up tree pots"
	quest.44D26EEA1D282F83.quest_desc: [
		"&5Ender&r is the arcane school, from damage to movement. Common: &6Magic Missile&r (bolt of arcane magic, the classic), &6Shadow Slash&r (leap with a slash, deflects projectiles), &6Dragon's Breath&r (hold: cone of dragon's breath with puddles)."
		""
		"Focus: ender pearl. The good movement spells sit one stage higher."
		""
		"&cStage 2:&r Teleport, Portal, Recall, Starfall, Counterspell, Magic Arrow, Summon Swords, Summon Ender Chest, Arcane Shackle, Echoing Strikes. &cStage 3:&r Evasion, Gravity Fissure. &cStage 4:&r Black Hole."
	]
	quest.44D26EEA1D282F83.quest_subtitle: "Magic Missile, Shadow Slash, Dragon's Breath."
	quest.44D26EEA1D282F83.title: "&5Cast an Ender Spell"
	quest.44D89338D2D66A58.quest_desc: [
		"&6Silver ore&r lies in the overworld, also as deepslate ore. Raw silver smelts into &6Silver Ingots&r in the furnace."
		""
		"The first ritual wants a silver ingot. Later silver goes into lamps, satchels, lenses and soul gems."
	]
	quest.44D89338D2D66A58.quest_subtitle: "The metal spirits respect."
	quest.44D89338D2D66A58.title: "&7Smelt silver"
	quest.44E38347917EF53B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_incomplete.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Run the belt in a loop, then incomplete parts do their three rounds on their own. A funnel with a filter pulls off finished mechanisms."
		"{image:create:textures/item/precision_mechanism.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &e80 percent&r become a mechanism. Otherwise scrap: &6brass nugget&r (12 percent) or a &6cogwheel&r (8 percent)."
		""
		"On average a mechanism costs &e1.25 brass sheets&r and just under &efour&r each of cogwheels, tubes and iron nuggets. The tubes are the bottleneck."
	]
	quest.44E38347917EF53B.quest_subtitle: "Three rounds, then it drops off the belt."
	quest.44E38347917EF53B.title: "&6&lBuild a precision mechanism"
	quest.44E3D7B177AD28B8.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Stack Upgrade Tier 1&r in the middle, copper ingots on top and on the sides, at the bottom copper block, copper ingot, copper block."
		""
		"Double becomes &etriple&r: an iron barrel then holds 54 times three stacks. Tier 2 (fourfold) opens with the Brass Works."
	]
	quest.44E3D7B177AD28B8.quest_subtitle: "Stack Upgrade Tier 1 Plus."
	quest.44E3D7B177AD28B8.title: "Triple a barrel with copper"
	quest.44F6726A010EADF9.quest_desc: [
		"Cobblestone, Andesite Alloy and Source Gems can be made automatically. Handing in is yours to do: put the yield into a backpack, walk to the obelisk, and sneak with a right click hands in everything that fits at once."
		""
		"How to build a cobblestone generator, an alloy line or a gem setup is shown in the chapter &6First Farms&r."
	]
	quest.44F6726A010EADF9.quest_subtitle: "The farm fills the chest, you carry it over."
	quest.44F6726A010EADF9.title: "&6Build a farm for the goal"
	quest.4520027E5F654845.quest_desc: [
		"Nachts kommen die Monster aus &6Born in Chaos&r: &cZombie-Schläger&r (60 Lebenspunkte, schleudern dich weg), &cSkelett-Drescher&r (50, Rüstung 10, Hammerschlag für 8 mit viel Rückstoß), &cTürritter&r (30, Rüstung 7), &cKnochenrufer&r, die kleine Skelette rufen, und &cGefallene Chaosritter&r (40 Lebenspunkte, Rüstung 20)."
		""
		"Viele von ihnen lassen &6Dunkelmetallstücke&r fallen, der Chaosritter 4 bis 7 auf einmal. Sammle &e9 Stück&r, mehr dazu im nächsten Quest."
		""
		"&cAchtung:&r Ein &cGeist des Chaos&r kann in einen normalen Mob fahren und ihn besessen machen. Siehst du im Chat &c\"Something is chasing you\"&r, jagt dich ein &cNightmare Stalker&r. Zu Hause bleiben hilft nicht, er kommt."
	]
	quest.4520027E5F654845.quest_subtitle: "Die Nacht gehört Born in Chaos."
	quest.4520027E5F654845.title: "&8Sammle Dunkelmetall"
	quest.452344199990D8C6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Glowstone Nest&r in the Nether, attracted with glowstone dust. Flower: glowstone, shroomlight or redstone lamp. The comb surely gives one &6glowstone dust&r. The bee glows and blinds."
	]
	quest.452344199990D8C6.quest_subtitle: "Glowstone dust, every comb."
	quest.452344199990D8C6.title: "&eKeep a Glowing Bee"
	quest.452656E4A1C7A85C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Excavation Escalation Unit:&r top Infused Alloy, &6iron pickaxe&r, Infused Alloy, middle alloy, Module Base, alloy, bottom three HDPE Sheets. Several in a row make the tool faster and faster."
		""
		"&6Vein Mining Unit:&r top Reinforced Alloy, &6diamond pickaxe&r, Reinforced Alloy, middle diamond axe, Module Base, diamond shovel, bottom three Polonium Pellets. It mines whole ore veins and trees in one hit. &eKronwerke:&r The extended mode that takes every block of the vein is on."
		""
		"There are also the Ore Refinement Unit (Fortune) and the Silk Touch Unit as modules of their own."
	]
	quest.452656E4A1C7A85C.quest_subtitle: "Dig faster, whole veins at once."
	quest.452656E4A1C7A85C.title: "&bUpgrade the Meka-Tool"
	quest.45318D85DBDBF88B.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Golden Sheets&r, a &6Cogwheel&r and a &6stick&r make the &6Wrench&r. Right-click turns a Create block, sneak and right-click picks it up at once."
		"{image:create:textures/item/wrench.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"With it you flip funnels and adjust contraptions. Belongs in every hotbar."
	]
	quest.45318D85DBDBF88B.quest_subtitle: "Turn, rebuild, pick up."
	quest.45318D85DBDBF88B.title: "&6Grab the wrench"
	quest.453D647301198DB3.quest_desc: [
		"&eUpgrade Base recipe:&r four sticks in the corners, three &6emeralds&r, a &6diamond&r at the bottom, a &6Honey Treat&r in the middle. Every upgrade is this base plus four &6honeycomb blocks&r and whatever makes it special."
		""
		"&eTime Upgrade:&r four clocks. Every bee stays in the hive &e15 percent&r shorter, in the centrifuge and the incubator everything goes faster. Several stack."
		"&eFilter Upgrade:&r comparator, redstone, book and quill. Right clicking a bee registers it, then only that one may enter the hive."
		"&eRange:&r four iron blocks, one block more work area for Farmer, Collector and Hoarder bees, the default is 4."
		"&eSimulator:&r first an Anti Teleport Upgrade (four ender pearls), then three blaze rods and an ender pearl. The bees no longer fly out, the trip is only calculated. The flower then has to stand directly below the hive entrance. Good for the server."
		""
		"&cThe Productivity Upgrade&r needs Draconic Dust from a Draconic Bee and comes with the End in stage 4."
	]
	quest.453D647301198DB3.quest_subtitle: "Faster, filtering, without air traffic."
	quest.453D647301198DB3.title: "&bBuild an Upgrade"
	quest.454AE6E49F31C54E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Redstone Reader:&r a redstone block above redstone, Input Transformer, redstone. Put it on a cable, aim it at a redstone torch, open it and put an empty Variable Card into the aspect &eRedstone Value&r."
		""
		"A &6Display Panel&r on the same network shows the value as soon as the card lies in it. All readers work like this: Block, Fluid, Inventory, Entity, Machine."
	]
	quest.454AE6E49F31C54E.quest_subtitle: "Redstone Reader and Display Panel."
	quest.454AE6E49F31C54E.title: "&9Read a value and show it"
	quest.454D94E0C6614703.quest_desc: [
		"In the Bottling Machine: &6Metal Press Mold: Rod&r and &e4 HOP Graphite Dust&r on the belt, &e1,000 mB of Creosote Oil&r in the tank. Out comes a &6Graphite Electrode&r, the mold comes back."
		""
		"Each electrode lasts &e80 minutes&r of continuous running, then it breaks. Refilling is by hand only. Always keep three in reserve."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/graphite_electrode.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.454D94E0C6614703.quest_subtitle: "The furnace needs three, and they wear out."
	quest.454D94E0C6614703.title: "&8Cast Three Graphite Electrodes"
	quest.4554D855273D3F41.quest_desc: [
		"&6Vanilla&r, &6Trichterlore&r: fährt auf Schienen und zieht unterwegs Gegenstände aus Inventaren über der Schiene und vom Boden, 5 Plätze, kein Filter. Ein Trichter unter einer Schiene leert sie im Vorbeifahren. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Trichter auf eine Lore. Die &6Truhenlore&r trägt 27 Plätze. Aktivierungsschienen stoppen das Aufsammeln."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r Create-Züge mit Gleisen, Bahnhöfen und Portable Storage Interfaces, siehe Kapitel Create: Züge."
	]
	quest.4554D855273D3F41.quest_subtitle: "Vanilla, Trichterlore: holt von Schienen, was darüber liegt."
	quest.4554D855273D3F41.title: "Lass eine Lore fahren"
	quest.456132EC3D9247D3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Redstone Relay&r: &e6 gold ingots&r, &6redstone&r top and bottom middle, a &6Source Gem block&r in the middle. Connected with the Dominion Wand, relays send a signal up to &e30 blocks&r. Input is one side, output goes to all the others."
		""
		"&6Display Case&r: top &e3 glass&r, middle glass, &6observer&r, glass, bottom &e3 archwood planks&r. Bind a chest to it with the wand, click the item to be counted onto it. Right click raises the threshold, hitting lowers it. Above the threshold it gives a signal."
		""
		"Bound with the wand while sneaking, it reverses: then it gives a signal as long as there is less in the chest."
	]
	quest.456132EC3D9247D3.quest_subtitle: "Redstone without wires."
	quest.456132EC3D9247D3.title: "&aSwitch with magic"
	quest.456D9240BB25B222.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Template Boards&r on top, two &6sticks&r vertically below. Same shape as the blueprint."
		""
		"The template disappears after one part. Good for parts you only need once, or when you are out of blue dye."
	]
	quest.456D9240BB25B222.quest_subtitle: "Like a blueprint, but only once."
	quest.456D9240BB25B222.title: "&7Build a pickaxe template"
	quest.457B6225C03AECEE.quest_desc: [
		"Rose quartz on the belt, a &6deployer&r with sandpaper polishes it, two &6crafters&r on top of each other put it on an iron sheet."
		""
		"Per precision mechanism you need over eight tubes on average. Without this line the precision line soon stands still."
	]
	quest.457B6225C03AECEE.quest_subtitle: "The bottleneck, automated."
	quest.457B6225C03AECEE.title: "&6Build a tube line"
	quest.458296701997D5CB.quest_desc: [
		"&e5 Livingwood logs&r around a &6Pasture Seed&r: top middle, left and right of the middle, and bottom left and middle."
		""
		"Hold right click, and all plant growth around you is torn out and drops what it would drop by hand: tall grass, flowers, ripe crops."
		""
		"Shapeless with &6leaves&r it becomes the &6Horn of the Canopy&r, which clears leaves, with a &6snowball&r the &6Horn of the Covering&r for snow."
	]
	quest.458296701997D5CB.quest_subtitle: "A whole field in one breath."
	quest.458296701997D5CB.title: "&6Blow the Horn of the Wild"
	quest.458A986922E61DEC.quest_desc: [
		"Die Eltern sind Vanilla-Bäume oder die sechs Fundstücke. Die sechs Vanilla-Kreuzungen stehen für 1 Smaragd im Markt, Black Ember kommt in Stufe 2, Soul Tree in Stufe 4."
		""
		"&6Silberlinde&r: Eiche + Birke, 55 %"
		"&6Buche&r: Eiche + Birke, 50 %"
		"&6Teak&r: Schwarzeiche + Tropenbaum, 40 %"
		"&6Kakao&r: Tropenbaum + Kirsche, 35 %"
		"&6Europäische Lärche&r: Fichte + Birke, 10 %"
		"&6Red-Delicious-Apfel&r: Kirsche + Eiche oder Schwarzeiche, 10 %"
		"&6Cave Dweller&r: Black Ember + Soul Tree, 5 %"
		"&6Purple Spiral&r: Blue Yonder + Firecracker, 5 %"
		"&6Rippling Willow&r: Blue Yonder + Flickering Sun, 5 %"
		"&6Sparkle Cherry&r: Firecracker + Soul Tree, 5 %"
		"&6Thunder Bolt&r: Firecracker + Flickering Sun, 5 %"
		"&6Water Wonder&r: Blue Yonder + Soul Tree, 5 %"
	]
	quest.458A986922E61DEC.quest_subtitle: "12 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.458A986922E61DEC.title: "&aGeneration 1: aus Vanilla und Fundstücken"
	quest.45AA055EE166E261.quest_desc: [
		"A &6hopper&r on top, &6two iron ingots&r next to the upgrade base, &6three redstone&r at the bottom."
		""
		"It pulls from the block &eabove&r the storage and pushes into the block &ebelow&r, each direction with its own filter. Under a farm it collects the harvest, and only the seeds go on down."
	]
	quest.45AA055EE166E261.quest_subtitle: "The Hopper Upgrade."
	quest.45AA055EE166E261.title: "Build a hopper into the barrel"
	quest.45C139102FB99314.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Andesite Alloy&r above a &6dried kelp&r makes two &6Andesite Funnels&r. On a chest, depot or basin it pulls items out or pushes them in."
		""
		"The direction depends on which way you place it; the wrench flips it. It takes one item at a time, a redstone signal stops it."
		""
		"Filters and stack sizes only come with the Brass Funnel in stage 2."
	]
	quest.45C139102FB99314.quest_subtitle: "Onto the belt, out of the chest."
	quest.45C139102FB99314.title: "&6Attach an Andesite Funnel"
	quest.45CECFA8ADF7988F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_conveyor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Six &6Plastic&r, two &6iron&r and one &6redstone&r make six &6Conveyor Belts&r."
		""
		"They carry items and animals uphill and downhill. Upgrades by right click: extraction, insertion, detection, dropping, bouncing, splitting, blinking. Almost all of them can be filtered."
	]
	quest.45CECFA8ADF7988F.quest_subtitle: "Items, mobs and fluids on the move."
	quest.45CECFA8ADF7988F.title: "&eLay Conveyor Belts"
	quest.45DC4C7499B73924.quest_desc: [
		"&eStufe 1:&r &6Schubladen&r für alles in Mengen, &6Eisenfässer am Lagerkern&r für den Rest. Der Rucksack ist das Lager unterwegs, die Minendimension der Platz für Löcher."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r &6Goldfässer&r und &6Kompaktier-Schubladen&r, dazu die &6Tonne&r von Mekanism als Puffer vor der Erzstraße und die &6Endertruhe&r für den Weg zwischen Basis und Nether."
		""
		"&eStufe 3:&r &6AE2&r, wenn du Autocrafting willst, &6Refined Storage&r, wenn es einfach sein soll. Beide liegen am besten über einer Schubladenwand per Speicherbus. Tempad und Teleporter bringen dich selbst dorthin."
		""
		"&eStufe 4:&r 64k-Zellen, QIO von Mekanism und Netherit für Fässer und Rucksäcke."
	]
	quest.45DC4C7499B73924.quest_subtitle: "Zwei Wahlen pro Stufe."
	quest.45DC4C7499B73924.title: "&7&lWas wann: Lager"
	quest.45E40FFB3B7CF3A4.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Warper Relay&r in the middle, &e2 Air Essences&r and &e2 diamonds&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Like the Warper Relay, but it no longer loses source even over long distances and holds more of it. Two of them connect the link farm at home with the base at the other end of the world."
	]
	quest.45E40FFB3B7CF3A4.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: source without loss."
	quest.45E40FFB3B7CF3A4.title: "&bBuild a Wind Warper Relay"
	quest.45E7FB9BFAB4A8C0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_mixer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Cogwheel&r, &6Andesite Casing&r and &6Whisk&r stacked make the &6Mechanical Mixer&r. Place it two blocks above the basin, with one block of air in between."
		""
		"Without heat it can make: two alloys from andesite and nuggets, &6Dough&r from flour and water, &6Pulp&r for cardboard, &6Mud&r and many shapeless recipes."
		""
		"Recipes marked &cHeated&r or &cSuperheated&r in EMI need a &6Blaze Burner&r under the basin. It comes in stage 2, and brass with it."
	]
	quest.45E7FB9BFAB4A8C0.quest_subtitle: "Stirring instead of kneading."
	quest.45E7FB9BFAB4A8C0.title: "&6Build the Mechanical Mixer"
	quest.4601992F7BE5B929.quest_desc: [
		"Nine &6tomatoes&r in the grid make a &6tomato crate&r. Onions, cabbage, carrots, potatoes and beetroot work the same way."
		""
		"You get the nine back from the crate at any time. Saves space and looks good."
	]
	quest.4601992F7BE5B929.quest_subtitle: "Order in the pantry."
	quest.4601992F7BE5B929.title: "&7Pack vegetables into crates"
	quest.4604704DCAB30B6B.quest_desc: [
		"Erleg &e10 Draugr&r im Frosted Prison und sammle ihren &6Schwarzstahl&r."
		""
		"Ein &6Schwarzstahlbarren&r in der Mitte, &64 Schwarzstahl-Nuggets&r in den Ecken und &64 Bretter&r dazwischen ergeben die &6Schwarzstahl-Tartsche&r, einen Schild aus Stahl. Gegen die Schläge von Maledictus willst du etwas in der Hand haben."
	]
	quest.4604704DCAB30B6B.quest_subtitle: "Draugr liefern den Stahl."
	quest.4604704DCAB30B6B.title: "&bSchmiede eine Schwarzstahl-Tartsche"
	quest.460DEF000E273CDC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Compass&r, &6copper coil&r and &6conductive casing&r make the &6voltmeter&r. Put into the grid on its own it becomes the &6ammeter&r, both together the &6wattmeter&r."
		""
		"The ammeter sits in series in the circuit. That way you see whether the generator sags under load or a wire carries too much."
	]
	quest.460DEF000E273CDC.quest_subtitle: "Whoever measures understands their grid."
	quest.460DEF000E273CDC.title: "&3Measure voltage and current"
	quest.4619DA1F4243B667.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Enriched iron in the corners, a &6Precision Mechanism&r from Create in the top middle, two &6Advanced Processors&r left and right, a Machine Casing in the center, a &6Destruction Core&r at the bottom."
		""
		"The &6Autocrafter&r holds &e9 patterns&r. It crafts crafting patterns by itself, right in the block. No crafting CPU, no molecular assembler, no accumulation processors as in AE2. It needs 4 FE/t plus 2 per pattern."
		""
		"&eProcessing patterns:&r The Autocrafter faces the machine and pushes the ingredients in. The result has to get back into the network, so put an Importer on the machine. More than nine patterns for one machine? Place a second Autocrafter facing the first, then they form a chain."
		""
		"&eOrdering:&r Click something in the Grid that has a pattern (Ctrl click if you already have it in stock). The preview shows what is missing, then &eStart&r."
	]
	quest.4619DA1F4243B667.quest_subtitle: "Nine patterns, no multiblock."
	quest.4619DA1F4243B667.title: "&a&lBuild an Autocrafter"
	quest.46211537A6B0B9DE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_ores_line2.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Mekanism&r, &6Einfacher Logistiktransporter&r: &e2 Gegenstände pro Sekunde&r mit 1 Meter pro Sekunde. Fortgeschritten (Stufe 3) 32 pro Sekunde, Elite 64, Ultimativ 128 pro Sekunde (Stufe 4). Farben trennen Stränge, der &6Logistische Sortierer&r filtert. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Zwei Stahlbarren und ein Schaltkreis ergeben acht. Zieht nur, wenn eine Seite mit dem Konfigurator auf Ziehen steht oder die Maschine Auto-Auswurf hat. Siehe Kapitel Mekanism."
	]
	quest.46211537A6B0B9DE.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, Logistiktransporter: 2 Stück pro Sekunde, Sortierer als Filter."
	quest.46211537A6B0B9DE.title: "Lies: Logistiktransporter"
	quest.462A34FB49DF9AFF.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r A blank &6Pattern&r is glass, redstone, glass at the top, redstone, glass, redstone in the middle, three enriched iron at the bottom. The &6Pattern Grid&r is a Grid, an Advanced Processor and a Pattern, shapeless."
		""
		"In the Pattern Grid you put the ingredients into the grid and press &eCreate Pattern&r. A &ecrafting pattern&r is a crafting table recipe. A &eprocessing pattern&r only says: these ingredients go into a machine, this comes back. The stonecutter and smithing table have their own pattern kinds too."
		""
		"&eFuzzy mode:&r Turned on, the pattern also takes alternatives (any wood type, any iron with the same tag). For processing patterns you can click allowed alternatives one by one."
	]
	quest.462A34FB49DF9AFF.quest_subtitle: "Pattern Grid and blank patterns."
	quest.462A34FB49DF9AFF.title: "&aWrite a Pattern"
	quest.462B27F826F1C5C1.quest_desc: [
		"&6One book&r, &6one wool&r, &6one gold ingot&r and &6three Template Boards&r, shapeless."
		""
		"In the grid the book counts as the currently selected blueprint. With &eZ&r and &eC&r you flip through it."
	]
	quest.462B27F826F1C5C1.quest_subtitle: "All blueprints in one slot."
	quest.462B27F826F1C5C1.title: "&7Collect blueprints in a book"
	quest.462C0F7A23F3F88F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Botania&r, &6Corporea-Funken&r über Truhen bilden ein Netz. Der &6Corporea-Trichter&r holt bei Redstone-Signal einen Gegenstand heraus, der &6Corporea-Index&r liefert, was du in den Chat schreibst, zum Beispiel &e64 cobblestone&r. Filter über den Namen. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"Braucht Ender-Essenz und Feenstaub aus Alfheim. Siehe Kapitel Alfheim."
	]
	quest.462C0F7A23F3F88F.quest_subtitle: "Botania, Corporea-Funken: ein Lager, das auf den Chat hört."
	quest.462C0F7A23F3F88F.title: "Lies: Corporea"
	quest.462C595130F254F7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Drill&r: &d4 SU per RPM&r. Four drills at 32 RPM: 512 SU, two water wheels."
	]
	quest.462C595130F254F7.quest_subtitle: "Drilling faster means more SU."
	quest.462C595130F254F7.title: "&7Drill: 4 SU per RPM"
	quest.463E3F017FF4B811.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6nautilus shells&r on top, a &6Heart of the Sea&r in the middle, an &6iron ingot&r at the bottom give the &6Inert Trident&r."
		""
		"Infused in the enchanting table at &bEterna 40&r, &dQuanta 20 to 50&r and &5Arcana 35&r, it becomes a real &6trident&r. The Heart of the Sea lies in buried treasure, nautilus shells you fish or get from drowned."
		""
		"With &6Channeling&r the trident calls lightning during thunderstorms, handy for charged creepers."
	]
	quest.463E3F017FF4B811.quest_subtitle: "A trident without drowned."
	quest.463E3F017FF4B811.title: "&3Awaken a Trident"
	quest.4643921A15D7ABC6.quest_desc: [
		"Put the &6spawn egg of an Iron Bee&r on the &6Casting Table&r and pour &e810 mB of molten steel&r over it. The egg becomes the spawn egg of the &6Steel Bee&r. On this server that is the only way to alloy bees, they cannot be bred."
		""
		"&eEvery alloy works like this:&r egg of a base metal plus 810 mB (nine ingots) of the alloy. Copper or Tin Bee with &6bronze&r, Iron or Nickel Bee with &6invar&r, Copper or Nickel Bee with &6constantan&r, Gold or Silver Bee with &6electrum&r, Copper or Zinc Bee with molten &6brass&r."
		""
		"Alloy bees need a block of their alloy as a flower and surely give &e4 to 6 nuggets&r per comb, the Steel Bee even 7 to 12."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A hive full of Steel Bees at a Powered Centrifuge delivers steel for the stage 3 goal, without ore and without a Metallurgic Infuser. You carry the ingots to the obelisk."
	]
	quest.4643921A15D7ABC6.quest_subtitle: "A spawn egg on the Casting Table, metal over it."
	quest.4643921A15D7ABC6.title: "&8&lCast an Alloy Bee"
	quest.46449D6485143667.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_mana_endoflame.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"4 to 8 &6Endoflames&r around a &6Mana Spreader&r, at the edge of the bed an &6Open Crate&r with a hopper and chest above it, the spreader aimed at a &6Mana Pool&r. Charcoal from the tree pots and a furnace into the chest. One &6charcoal&r gives about &d2,400 mana&r."
		""
		"Each Endoflame supplies about 60 mana per second. Eight of them fill a pool (1,000,000 mana) in a little over half an hour and eat about 420 charcoal for it, roughly 100 logs."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Items on the ground disappear after 5 minutes. A pressure plate under the crate that locks the hopper while coal is lying there solves that. &cStage 2:&r Thermalily and Gourmaryllis, see the right side. See the &aBotania&r chapter."
	]
	quest.46449D6485143667.quest_subtitle: "Mana that comes out of your tree pots."
	quest.46449D6485143667.title: "&dFeed Endoflames with charcoal"
	quest.4647FC22948329C2.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_p2p.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Iron at the top and on the sides, an &6Engineering Processor&r in the middle, three fluix at the bottom. Link them with the &6Memory Card&r: sneak and right click the input, right click every output."
		""
		"The classic: an ME tunnel needs a channel itself, but carries all 32 channels of the dense cable at its input. That way you bring many channels through a thin cable. ME tunnels cannot be nested in each other."
		""
		"You make other types with a right click on a placed tunnel, see the list next to this."
	]
	quest.4647FC22948329C2.quest_subtitle: "A portal between two block faces."
	quest.4647FC22948329C2.title: "&d&lBuild an ME P2P Tunnel"
	quest.4651C104B13CC0B6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_thermoelectric.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Three &6steel ingots&r on top, &6Constantan Plate&r, &6Copper Coil Block&r, Constantan Plate in the middle, three Constantan Plates at the bottom make the generator."
		""
		"Hot on one side, cold on the opposite one. The difference counts: &6magma block&r at 1 300 Kelvin against &6blue ice&r at 200 Kelvin is a good pair. Lava and water work too."
	]
	quest.4651C104B13CC0B6.quest_subtitle: "Power from hot and cold, without moving parts."
	quest.4651C104B13CC0B6.title: "&cBuild a Thermoelectric Generator"
	quest.4654581A43834892.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6Ferricore Ingots&r in the corners, an &6observer&r in the middle, a &6diamond&r on top, &6redstone&r at the bottom, &6lapis&r left and right."
		""
		"The &6Simple Block Breaker&r mines the block directly in front of it, but only with a &etool in its slot&r. The tool loses durability as in your hand. A Ferricore pickaxe with Ore Miner breaks whole veins this way."
		""
		"&eHow to read every simple machine:&r The &6Redstone&r button is set to Ignored (always runs), Low (runs without a signal), High (runs with a signal) or Pulse (one action per pulse). &6Speed (ticks)&r says how often it works: 20 is once per second, 1 is every tick and causes lag."
		""
		"Simple machines need no power and only hit the block in front of them. The &cadvanced&r versions with area and filter need Celestigem and come in &6stage 3&r."
	]
	quest.4654581A43834892.quest_subtitle: "Your first machine, without any power."
	quest.4654581A43834892.title: "&7Build the Block Breaker"
	quest.46593BEEF4B139F1.quest_desc: [
		"Both on a &6Runewood&r totem base, three runes:"
		"&eStone Ward:&r one &dArcane&r, two &6Earthen&r. You take &d20 percent&r less damage, twice that without armor."
		"&eBurning Fervor:&r one &dArcane&r, two &cInfernal&r. Attack and mining speed rise by &d40 percent&r."
		""
		"A Fervor totem next to the building site or at the quarry saves a lot of time."
	]
	quest.46593BEEF4B139F1.quest_subtitle: "Rite of the Stone Ward and Burning Fervor."
	quest.46593BEEF4B139F1.title: "&2Light Combat Auras"
	quest.4672D39A10188888.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6Centrifuge&r in the middle, one &6Basic Control Circuit&r from Mekanism each on top and bottom, iron ingots left and right, redstone in the corners."
		""
		"The &6Powered Centrifuge&r needs &d10 FE/t&r and does a comb in &e5 seconds&r instead of 15. A Heat Generator next to it is enough."
		""
		"&eStability Upgrade:&r Upgrade Base, four ender pearls and four honeycombs. In the centrifuge it raises the chance of all uncertain outputs by &e15 percent&r, 40 percent raw iron becomes 55."
		""
		"&cThe Heated Centrifuge&r, which makes whole blaze rods from blaze combs, needs a dragon egg and comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.4672D39A10188888.quest_subtitle: "Three times as fast, with Mekanism circuits."
	quest.4672D39A10188888.title: "&dBuild a Powered Centrifuge"
	quest.4672F3A84CF77370.quest_desc: [
		"Leg &6Rohes Eisen&r und &6Rohes Kupfer&r in den linken Slot der Kammer. Je drei werden zu vier &6Staub&r. Der Rest bleibt liegen, bis wieder drei zusammen sind."
		""
		"Staub ist noch kein Barren. Er geht in den Ofen, in den Schmelzofen oder in den Energiegeladenen Schmelzer der nächsten Quest."
		""
		"&eNebenbei:&r Dieselbe Kammer macht aus Kohle &6Angereicherten Kohlenstoff&r (80 mB statt 10 mB in der Infusionsanlage) und aus einem Salzblock vier &6Salz&r. Das Salz brauchst du in Stufe 4 wieder."
	]
	quest.4672F3A84CF77370.quest_subtitle: "Drei hinein, vier heraus."
	quest.4672F3A84CF77370.title: "&7Mach Staub aus Rohem Erz"
	quest.46761BAE90808C2B.quest_desc: [
		"&dSummon Wolves&r (Conjuration Essence, 3 bones, 4 Wilden Wings): two wolves fight at your side for a while."
		"&dPrestidigitation&r (Conjuration Essence): an invisible block that sprays particles in your spell colour."
		""
		"Summons give you &eSummoning Sickness&r. Until it wears off, you can't summon again."
	]
	quest.46761BAE90808C2B.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1 checklist: conjuration."
	quest.46761BAE90808C2B.title: "&dLearn wolves and prestidigitation"
	quest.467BFAD9554B014C.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e6 Wilden&r von Ars Nouveau mit dem Learner im Inventar. Jäger, Pirscher und Wächter füllen zusammen ein Modell."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d256 FE/t&r. Eine Vorhersage wird zu &616 Wilden-Hörnern&r, 16 Stacheln oder 16 Flügeln. Wer Ars spielt, weiß, wie viele Flügel ein Zauberbuch frisst."
	]
	quest.467BFAD9554B014C.quest_subtitle: "Für die Magier: Horn, Stachel und Flügel."
	quest.467BFAD9554B014C.title: "&aLerne die Wilden"
	quest.468286D85AD797D5.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Mana Diamonds&r and &e1 Mana Quartz&r on the altar, plus the runes Winter and Earth as catalysts. &d12,000 mana&r."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r Entropinnyum and Heisei Dream in stage 3, Shulk Me Not in stage 4."
	]
	quest.468286D85AD797D5.quest_subtitle: "Catalysts: Winter and Earth."
	quest.468286D85AD797D5.title: "&5Make the Rune of Wrath"
	quest.4699EA2A9F63B8AD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cows&r, &6sheep&r and &6zombies&r give one each, an &6iron golem&r five."
		""
		"For Soulstained Steel, Calx, Impetus and the armor."
	]
	quest.4699EA2A9F63B8AD.quest_subtitle: "Earthy arcana."
	quest.4699EA2A9F63B8AD.title: "&6Earthen"
	quest.469CD8475322E3E0.quest_desc: [
		"&e16 stone&r on the altar. With &e1 Wicked&r and &e1 Arcane&r: &6Twisted Rock&r. With &e1 Sacred&r and &e1 Arcane&r: &6Tainted Rock&r. 16 pieces each."
		""
		"Together they form the Spirit Crucible."
	]
	quest.469CD8475322E3E0.quest_subtitle: "Two stones with opposite charges."
	quest.469CD8475322E3E0.title: "&7Infuse Twisted and Tainted Rock"
	quest.46A79D780C28D080.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_farm.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"At least &e4 Endoflames&r, &e2 Mana Spreaders&r and a &6Mana Pool&r, fed by Open Crate or belt."
		""
		"&eFor planning:&r An Endoflame on coal brings just under 29 mana per second on average. A full pool takes almost ten hours that way, with ten Endoflames one hour and a good 800 coal."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A tree farm with a Create saw plus a furnace gives charcoal without a mine. The Manastar at the pool shows whether the farm keeps up."
	]
	quest.46A79D780C28D080.quest_subtitle: "Mana that flows while you do something else."
	quest.46A79D780C28D080.title: "&a&lBuild a real mana farm"
	quest.46ADBE97B9F0BBE6.quest_desc: [
		"A &6dye&r and &b250 mB of water&r in the &6mixer&r give &d250 mB of liquid dye&r in that color. Mixed back heated, 250 mB become a dye item again."
		""
		"Whatever falls into the dye gets dyed: items as well as animals and players. When liquid dye meets &clava&r, &6concrete&r of the same color forms. A bucket of it is an ingredient for the fan catalysts from Create Connected."
		""
		"The bottle of &ddragon's breath&r also becomes a fluid with Dragons Plus, 250 mB per bottle, but dragon's breath only comes with the End in stage 4."
	]
	quest.46ADBE97B9F0BBE6.quest_subtitle: "Create: Dragons Plus. One dye, 250 mB of water."
	quest.46ADBE97B9F0BBE6.title: "&dMix Liquid Dye"
	quest.46D89965516574CE.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 sand&r in the heated lava cauldron make a &6Herb Jar&r. It holds up to &e1 024&r pieces of one kind."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The jars only take herbs (config). You open the menu with a right click on any side but the front, at the front sneaking with an empty hand. With the crow button crows sort matching items into it."
	]
	quest.46D89965516574CE.quest_subtitle: "1 024 herbs in one jar."
	quest.46D89965516574CE.title: "&6Fire a Herb Jar"
	quest.46F5ED9F25781EE4.quest_desc: [
		"You get onto the server through the &9Discord&r, and whoever leaves the Discord is also removed from the whitelist. The rules posted there apply in the game."
		""
		"A few things go without saying: leave other people's bodies alone (anyone can open them, see below). Thanks to &6Lootr&r, chests in structures have their own contents for every player, so there is no reason to empty them. Respect claims, even if there is a gap somewhere."
		""
		"Questions or trouble: don't argue it out in chat, talk to the team on Discord."
	]
	quest.46F5ED9F25781EE4.quest_subtitle: "Thirty people, one world, seven weeks."
	quest.46F5ED9F25781EE4.title: "&6Play fair"
	quest.46FD5D2A6517A395.quest_desc: [
		"&6Helmet blueprint&r: five Blueprint Paper in helmet shape. The helmet plates need &efive&r material. Chest, legs, boots need eight, seven and four."
		""
		"A full iron set gives 15 armour points. A leather &6lining&r brings Flexible IV."
	]
	quest.46FD5D2A6517A395.quest_subtitle: "Armour from parts."
	quest.46FD5D2A6517A395.title: "&7Build a helmet"
	quest.470663EA49DDC090.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_drawers_4.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6wooden chest&r in the middle, &6eight planks&r around it. Every kind of wood works, it only changes the look."
		""
		"The 1x1 drawer stores exactly &eone kind&r, &e32 stacks&r of it, so 2,048 cobblestone. &eRight click&r puts in, &edouble click&r everything matching from the inventory, &eleft click&r takes one, &esneaking left click&r a stack."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Every hit on the front takes items out. To mine it, hit the side with an axe; the contents stay inside."
	]
	quest.470663EA49DDC090.quest_subtitle: "Thousands of one kind in one block."
	quest.470663EA49DDC090.title: "&6&lBuild a drawer"
	quest.470856D04625D004.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_altar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"8 &6Holystone&r um eine &6Ambrosium Torch&r ergeben den &6Incubator&r. Er brennt &6Ambrosium Torches&r, jede hält 25 Sekunden."
		""
		"Ein &6Moa Egg&r in den oberen Slot, Fackeln in den unteren, dann warten. Das Brüten dauert eine ganze Weile, leg also einen Stapel Fackeln hinein und bau in der Zeit weiter. Alles zu den Moas im Abschnitt Moas."
	]
	quest.470856D04625D004.quest_subtitle: "Der Brutkasten für Moa-Eier."
	quest.470856D04625D004.title: "&6Build an Incubator"
	quest.470994827F2ECC74.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Thermal Evaporation Plant from brine, 10 to 1, as a fluid. The Rotary Condensentrator turns it into gas."
		""
		"&eNeeded by:&r in stage 4 the Solar Neutron Activator for tritium, and the Chemical Crystallizer makes lithium dust for the induction cells."
	]
	quest.470994827F2ECC74.quest_subtitle: "Brine, evaporated once more."
	quest.470994827F2ECC74.title: "&fLithium"
	quest.4709C8192189C4E0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Impure White Chalk&r, &6Research Fragment Dust&r, &6emerald dust&r and a &6slimeball&r shapeless, then into Spiritfire: &aLime Chalk&r."
		""
		"Lime gives a pentacle the calling power for Djinni. Ophyx' Calling needs &e36 signs&r of it, so several pieces of chalk."
	]
	quest.4709C8192189C4E0.quest_subtitle: "The colour of the Djinni."
	quest.4709C8192189C4E0.title: "&aMix lime chalk"
	quest.4712B9DC80714F1F.quest_desc: [
		"Smithing table: &6Starfire Upgrade Smithing Template&r, &6Thermal Springstone Scythe&r, &6Starfire&r. Out comes the &6Starfire Scythe&r."
		""
		"The template lies in the chests of the Golem Forge and the Cursed Garden. Copying: template, 7 Springstone ingots and 1 Starcore block make 2."
	]
	quest.4712B9DC80714F1F.quest_subtitle: "Springstone plus Starfire."
	quest.4712B9DC80714F1F.title: "&6Upgrade to the Starfire Scythe"
	quest.4714EB4269C95D6C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Painting Machine:&r red, green and blue dye at the top, Conductive Alloy, &6Void Chassis&r, Conductive Alloy in the middle, gear, Redstone Alloy, gear at the bottom. &6Conduit Facade:&r eight binders in a ring."
		""
		"Put the facade and any block into the Painting Machine: the facade takes on that block's look, for &d2,400 µI&r. Right click a conduit with it to cover it."
		""
		"That way your conduits disappear into walls and floors and keep running. The Yeta Wrench still reaches them."
	]
	quest.4714EB4269C95D6C.quest_subtitle: "Painting Machine and Conduit Facade."
	quest.4714EB4269C95D6C.title: "&9Hide Your Conduits"
	quest.47351BF318E79A9D.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &62 red&r, &62 gray&r, &62 white&r petals, &6Rune of Wrath&r, &6Rune of Fire&r."
		""
		"If you light TNT on solid ground next to it, it swallows the whole explosion and turns it into mana, without damage. That only works while its storage is empty. Otherwise it blows up as usual."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r It does not like duplicated TNT, the yield then drops sharply. A TNT line with real sand and gunpowder is the Lexica's challenge for it."
	]
	quest.47351BF318E79A9D.quest_subtitle: "TNT becomes mana."
	quest.47351BF318E79A9D.title: "&6Plant an Entropinnyum"
	quest.4735B7BB1918C1E6.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Control Chip&r is made by sequenced assembly like the Precision Mechanism: a &6gold sheet&r onto the belt, a deployer adds an &6Electron Tube&r, one &6redstone&r, a press presses. &eThree rounds&r, then it is done."
		"{image:create_connected:textures/item/control_chip.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"80 percent of the time a chip comes out, otherwise redstone, a tube or a gold sheet comes back, rarely something else. As forgiving as the Precision Mechanism."
		""
		"The chip goes into the Sequenced Pulse Generator. You can quickly convert an existing precision line to it with a filter change."
	]
	quest.4735B7BB1918C1E6.quest_subtitle: "Three rounds on a gold sheet."
	quest.4735B7BB1918C1E6.title: "&6Make a Control Chip"
	quest.474868EB59887384.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a &6Certus Quartz Block&r into water with a charged crystal, that gives a damaged &6Budding Certus Quartz&r. Put two &6Growth Accelerators&r next to it (iron, glass cable, quartz glass, a fluix block in the middle)."
		""
		"Every further charged crystal in the water lifts the budding block one level, up to flawed. Every grown bud can throw it back one level. A finished cluster gives four crystals, Fortune helps."
		""
		"The accelerator takes FE or AE at the top and bottom, a Wooden Crank will do in a pinch."
	]
	quest.474868EB59887384.quest_subtitle: "Like amethyst, only faster with power."
	quest.474868EB59887384.title: "&aGrow certus"
	quest.47495DBD8F5EC437.quest_desc: [
		"Erleg einen &cSkelett-Drescher&r. Er hat 50 Lebenspunkte, Rüstung 10 und schlägt mit seinem Hammer für 8, mit viel Rückstoß."
		""
		"Er lässt Knochen, Dunkelmetall und manchmal einen ganzen &6Haufen Dunkelmetall&r fallen, dazu selten seinen Schild und mit Glück den &6Skullbreaker Hammer&r. Kämpf mit dem Rücken zur Wand, nicht am Abgrund."
	]
	quest.47495DBD8F5EC437.quest_subtitle: "Ein Hammer, der dich vom Feld schlägt."
	quest.47495DBD8F5EC437.title: "&8Erleg einen Skelett-Drescher"
	quest.47533AF4EE6C4786.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Chemical Infuser from 2 mB sulfur dioxide and 1 mB oxygen, gives 2 mB."
		"&eUsed by:&r the Infuser for sulfuric acid."
	]
	quest.47533AF4EE6C4786.quest_subtitle: "Dioxide plus oxygen."
	quest.47533AF4EE6C4786.title: "&fSulfur trioxide"
	quest.47566F80FFE3045F.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: tier 2 robe piece in the middle, &e2 ender pearls&r and &e1 chorus fruit&r on the pedestals, &d5,000 source&r."
		""
		"Tier 3 gives the most mana regeneration and the largest thread slots. A whole set costs &d30,000 source&r from tier 1 on."
	]
	quest.47566F80FFE3045F.quest_subtitle: "Chorus fruit and 5,000 source per piece."
	quest.47566F80FFE3045F.title: "&6Bring a Robe to Tier 3"
	quest.476948D055D00873.quest_desc: [
		"First &6Silicon&r: two quartz dust and two sand make three &6Raw Silicon&r, which the furnace turns into silicon. Furnace: copper at the top, silicon left and right, Electrum in the middle, at the bottom coil, furnace, coil."
		""
		"With &e32 RF/t&r it smelts anything a furnace smelts and needs one machine core."
	]
	quest.476948D055D00873.quest_subtitle: "A furnace on power instead of coal."
	quest.476948D055D00873.title: "&6Build a Powered Furnace"
	quest.47700BF8F6EE2234.quest_desc: [
		"Collect &68 Golem Steel Ingots&r and &632 Deepsilver Ingots&r. Golem, Permafrost and Monstrosity are defeated."
		""
		"All three bosses can be fought again. The loot is a good way to strong gear before the Gaia Guardian."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Nothing here counts directly toward the stage goal. Whoever gets their gear here fights better in the End and in the Gaia fights on stream."
	]
	quest.47700BF8F6EE2234.quest_subtitle: "All three bosses are down."
	quest.47700BF8F6EE2234.title: "&b&lRule Under a Million Stars"
	quest.4779F1E7E612B991.quest_desc: [
		"Place a &6dispenser&r in front of the cutting board and put a &6knife&r in it. Every redstone signal uses the knife on whatever is lying on the board."
		""
		"With an axe in the dispenser it strips logs on the board and drops the bark."
	]
	quest.4779F1E7E612B991.quest_subtitle: "The cutting board without your hand."
	quest.4779F1E7E612B991.title: "&7Let the dispenser cut"
	quest.478A601FB093DB34.quest_desc: [
		"In the cauldron with &e1 000 mB&r of Thick Potion (water bottle plus glowstone dust): a &6Medium Satchel&r, dried &6Mandrake, Belladonna, Mugwort&r and &6Yellow Dock flowers&r, a &6Broom Brush&r and &e2 ender pearls&r."
		""
		"As big as the Medium Satchel. If the active brush breaks, the broom puts in the brush from the top left of the bag. On long flights you never fall from the sky again."
	]
	quest.478A601FB093DB34.quest_subtitle: "The brush changes itself."
	quest.478A601FB093DB34.title: "&6Mix a Replacer Satchel"
	quest.479BDFDA8EB2572E.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r oben Bretter, &6Klebriger Kolben&r, Bretter, in der Mitte Eisenbarren, &6Pinsel&r, Eisenbarren, unten drei Bretter. Die Mod lässt das Rezept weg, sobald Productive Bees dabei ist, Kronwerke gibt es zurück. Der &6Pollensieber&r holt aus Blättern &6Pollen&r der jeweiligen Baumart heraus."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/pollen.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Klick mit dem Pollen auf ein Blatt eines anderen Baums, und es ist bestäubt, als wäre eine Biene da gewesen. EMI zeigt unter &eBaumbestäubung&r, welcher Pollen auf welches Blatt gehört. So kreuzt du gezielt, auch unter Tage und ohne Blumenwiese."
	]
	quest.479BDFDA8EB2572E.quest_subtitle: "Kreuzen ohne Bienen."
	quest.479BDFDA8EB2572E.title: "&eSieb Pollen aus Blättern"
	quest.47A0BA899F7092C0.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Open the map with \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbchunks.map\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" and press \"},{\"text\":\"C\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" for the claim view. Dragging with the \"},{\"text\":\"left mouse button\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" claims chunks, dragging with the \"},{\"text\":\"right mouse button\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" releases them. In your chunks nobody outside your team can break blocks, open chests or hit animals, and creepers blow up nothing.\"}]"
		""
		"You have &e500 chunks&r. That is a lot, but not the whole valley: a chunk is 16 by 16 blocks, and 500 are enough for a big base with fields and a factory."
		""
		"&eShift&r and dragging with the left mouse button keeps chunks &eloaded&r: up to &e9&r per player, at most &e25&r for the whole team. Machines in them keep running even when you are offline. After &e7 days&r without logging in the server releases them, after &e30 days&r the claims too."
	]
	quest.47A0BA899F7092C0.quest_subtitle: "500 chunks for you, 25 of them kept loaded."
	quest.47A0BA899F7092C0.title: "&6Secure your base"
	quest.47A1DCD27F6800D2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blue Swets&r und &6Golden Swets&r sind hüpfende Schleimwürfel. Treffen sie dich, nehmen sie dich mit und hüpfen weiter. Töte sie schnell oder spring heraus."
		""
		"{image:aether:textures/item/materials/swet_ball.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eBeute:&r Blue Swets lassen einen &6Swet Ball&r fallen (gilt als Schleimball für Leinen und Co.) und manchmal eine &6Blue Aercloud&r. Mit einem Swet Ball in der Hand wird aus Erde Gras, aus Gras Podsol und aus Netherrack Nezel. Golden Swets lassen &6Glowstone&r fallen."
		""
		"Ein &6Swet Cape&r aus dem Bronze-Dungeon macht Swets friedlich, dann kannst du auf ihnen reiten. Ein &6Swet Banner&r vor dem Haus hält sie fern."
	]
	quest.47A1DCD27F6800D2.quest_subtitle: "Klebrige Würfel, die dich mitnehmen."
	quest.47A1DCD27F6800D2.title: "&9Besiege Swets"
	quest.47A37769886DAFD7.quest_desc: [
		"A Crusher in the middle, osmium left and right, Advanced Control Circuits at the top and bottom, alloy in the corners."
		""
		"Stone and dirt become &6scrap&r at &e17 percent&r, substrate at 43 percent. Scrap is the raw material for the replicators, which open only in stage 5. Until then it is a trash can with a bonus."
	]
	quest.47A37769886DAFD7.quest_subtitle: "Stone becomes scrap."
	quest.47A37769886DAFD7.title: "&3Build a Recycler"
	quest.47A5BA50FA1FA49E.quest_desc: [
		"All in the apparatus with a &6glass bottle&r in the middle:"
		"&6Charm of Ocean's Breath&r (pufferfish, ink sac, kelp): air under water."
		"&6Charm of Featherlight&r (feather, phantom membrane): a gentle fall from 3 blocks of falling height."
		"&6Charm of Darkvision&r (lantern, torch): night vision in the dark."
		"The Imbuement Chamber recharges empty charms with Source."
	]
	quest.47A5BA50FA1FA49E.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: protection to wear."
	quest.47A5BA50FA1FA49E.title: "&6Fill the first charms"
	quest.47A794FF8E96B7BA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Belt of Levitation&r (Mundane Belt, 4 gold, 3 feathers, Air Essence): sneaking in the air makes you rise."
		"&6Ring of Jumping&r (Ring of Potential, 3 Wilden Wings, Air Essence): jumps in mid air, each costs &e30 mana&r."
		"&6Alchemist's Crown&r (gold helmet, 3 glass bottles): drink potions from your inventory instantly."
		"You make the Mundane Belt from 3 leather and a Source Gem."
	]
	quest.47A794FF8E96B7BA.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: jewellery for the journey."
	quest.47A794FF8E96B7BA.title: "&6Forge a belt, crown and ring"
	quest.47A87E4E89EC365D.quest_desc: [
		"Tools, weapons and armor from parts whose material decides the stats. Even the iron tier beats every vanilla iron tool."
	]
	quest.47A87E4E89EC365D.quest_subtitle: "Tools from parts."
	quest.47A87E4E89EC365D.title: "&6Open Silent Gear"
	quest.47BF234EC21224C7.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Blank Module&r and a &6comparator&r, shapeless, give the &6Detector Module&r. It moves nothing."
		""
		"If the buffer's contents match its filter, the router gives a redstone signal in the module's direction. Strength (default 15) and type (weak or strong) you set in the module."
		""
		"That way a router switches a lamp or clutch as soon as, for example, diamonds come through."
	]
	quest.47BF234EC21224C7.quest_subtitle: "The Detector Module."
	quest.47BF234EC21224C7.title: "&cReport by Redstone What Is in the Buffer"
	quest.47C51A9763F1E7C6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/start_here_m_keystone.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Top: &6Source Gem Block&r, &6Source Jar&r, &6Source Gem Block&r. Middle: &bMana Diamond&r, &6Andesite Alloy&r, &bMana Diamond&r. Bottom: &6Source Gem Block&r, &6Gold Leaf&r, &6Source Gem Block&r."
		""
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/item/source_keystone.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"You infuse the &bMana Diamonds&r in Botania's Mana Pool, &d10,000 mana&r each. The Gold Leaf comes from your golden tree."
		""
		"The obelisk wants &e12&r, fixed. One counts &e250 points&r, as much as a good 60 Source Gems. The twelve make up almost half of the magic pillar."
	]
	quest.47C51A9763F1E7C6.quest_subtitle: "The milestone of the magic pillar."
	quest.47C51A9763F1E7C6.title: "&dBuild a Source Keystone"
	quest.47CB4805DB64C079.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Infernal Tear&r is Void Tear, Witch Hat, Molten Core and Infernal Claw. With &6flint and steel&r, &6Molten Core&r and &6Catalyzing Gland&r shapeless it becomes the &6Destruction Catalyst&r."
		""
		"It charges with gunpowder from your inventory, up to &e250&r, and every right click costs &e3&r. Then it blasts a cube of ordinary blocks like dirt, gravel, cobblestone and stone away, without drops. Ores and everything else stay standing."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Ideal for exposing ore veins without filling your inventory with cobblestone."
	]
	quest.47CB4805DB64C079.quest_subtitle: "Dirt and stone gone, ores stay."
	quest.47CB4805DB64C079.title: "&cBuild a Destruction Catalyst"
	quest.47CED511AFFC09E4.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6redstone&r top middle, three &6paper&r in the middle row, three &6gold nuggets&r at the bottom. That gives &66 Blank Modules&r."
		""
		"&6Modular Routers&r is the counterpart to the pipes: a single block that learns through modules what it should do. Pull, send, vacuum, place, break, void. Almost every module is a blank module plus an item from vanilla."
		""
		"Make twelve right away, you need them for the router itself and for every module."
	]
	quest.47CED511AFFC09E4.quest_subtitle: "Paper, gold and redstone, six at once."
	quest.47CED511AFFC09E4.title: "&e&lMake Blank Modules"
	quest.47D5B411CBF8DA0E.quest_desc: [
		"&6ME Quantum Ring:&r iron, Logic Processors, an Engineering Processor, an Energy Cell and a Smart Dense Cable. &6ME Quantum Link Chamber:&r quartz glass with four fluix pearls."
		""
		"A bridge side is a flat 3 x 3: the chamber in the middle, eight rings around it. So you need &e16 rings&r and &etwo chambers&r."
	]
	quest.47D5B411CBF8DA0E.quest_subtitle: "Eight per bridge side."
	quest.47D5B411CBF8DA0E.title: "&bBuild Quantum Rings"
	quest.47D6837AFF83BFB1.quest_desc: [
		"Diagonally: an &6Edelwood Stick&r top right, a &6Deorum Ingot&r in the middle, an &6Arcane Crystal&r bottom left."
		""
		"Holding right click charges the wand in &e1.5 seconds&r. Letting go shoots a projectile for &e5 Aureal&r from your own supply, which deals &e5 magic damage&r. An Aureal Bottle fills you up again."
	]
	quest.47D6837AFF83BFB1.quest_subtitle: "Casting with your own Aureal."
	quest.47D6837AFF83BFB1.title: "&dBuild a Magic Wand"
	quest.47DA0BBE952265D3.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Spawner Rune&r with four &6wool&r around it gives the &6Rune of Silence&r. Applied to the spawner, its monsters no longer make a sound."
		""
		"For farms next to the base, in the basement or under the community square. The &6Rune of Perpetual Twilight&r, which lets a spawner work in the light too, needs soul lanterns from the Nether."
	]
	quest.47DA0BBE952265D3.quest_subtitle: "A farm nobody hears."
	quest.47DA0BBE952265D3.title: "&2Make the Spawner Quiet"
	quest.47DCFAE50AC52582.quest_desc: [
		"In EMI you may see the &6Farming Station&r. In this version Ender IO only ships it as an &cexperimental data pack&r marked as unfinished. It is not active on Kronwerke, so the station can neither be crafted nor placed."
		""
		"Automate your fields with &6Industrial Foregoing&r or with Oritech's &6Destroyer&r and a harvest filter."
	]
	quest.47DCFAE50AC52582.quest_subtitle: "Why there is none here."
	quest.47DCFAE50AC52582.title: "&2Read: The Farming Station"
	quest.47E11756526EFA9D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_advanced_mega_4m.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Ender dust in the corners, an Accumulation Processor at the top, three 1M components, a &6draconium ingot&r in the middle. Plus 16 Elite Control Circuits from your CPU."
		""
		"A 4M cell holds dozens of processors, several singularities and four draconium ingots. &cStage 5:&r 16M to 256M and the bulk cell need Awakened Draconium."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r &e\"Light of the Dragon\"&r wants &e150 Elite Control Circuits&r and &e1,000 draconium ingots&r. Write patterns for the Elite Control Circuits and let the CPU work."
	]
	quest.47E11756526EFA9D.quest_subtitle: "4M, the biggest before the Chaos Works."
	quest.47E11756526EFA9D.title: "&6&lFill the Storage of the Star Works"
	quest.47EBEEB009090C19.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wild fluffy puffs&r grow everywhere in the overworld, like flax. Breaking them gives &6Fluffy Seeds&r for farmland, ripe plants give &6Fluffy Puffs&r, more with luck."
		""
		"Three Fluffy Puffs in a row make a &6Fluffy String&r. As a binding it brings Flexible III, as a cord +5 percent ranged damage at a slightly slower draw. Four in a square make &6Fluffy Fabric&r, five diagonally a &6Fluffy Feather&r."
	]
	quest.47EBEEB009090C19.quest_subtitle: "Soft fibers for cord and binding."
	quest.47EBEEB009090C19.title: "&7Harvest fluffy puffs"
	quest.47F2DFF65613425E.quest_desc: [
		"Defeat the &dGuardian of Gaia&r more times until it is five."
		""
		"After a few fights you know the phases, the teleports and the minions. Keep the arena clean, put Terrasteel and pylons in a chest next to it, and the fights become routine."
		""
		"For the obelisk every spirit counts: whoever lands the last hit gets two more."
	]
	quest.47F2DFF65613425E.quest_subtitle: "Practice for sixteen fights."
	quest.47F2DFF65613425E.title: "&dDefeat the Guardian Five Times"
	quest.47F63CED073E9891.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_diesel.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e13 Heavy Engineering Blocks, 9 Radiator Blocks, 4 Generator Blocks, 6 Steel Scaffolding, 5 fluid pipes, 1 Redstone Engineering Block&r. Hammer on the middle Generator Block."
		""
		"&eIn:&r fuel at the bottom corners. &eOut:&r &d4,096 FE/t&r to up to three connectors above the generator. It only runs when something draws power."
		""
		"A bucket of Biodiesel lasts 250 ticks, so a good million FE. Creosote only 20 ticks, high cetane Biodiesel (95 to 5 with a starch potion from the Refinery) 275 ticks."
	]
	quest.47F63CED073E9891.quest_subtitle: "3x3x5, Biodiesel in, 4,096 FE/t out."
	quest.47F63CED073E9891.title: "&c&lForm a Diesel Generator"
	quest.47FE078672EBF5E2.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The &6256k component&r has a &5draconium ingot&r in the middle instead of glass, plus a calculation processor, 3 64k components and sky stone dust. The MEGA components for &61M&r and &64M&r as well."
		""
		"The 64k component wants a sky ingot from Nature's Aura. From 16M on it needs awakened draconium, which comes in stage 5."
	]
	quest.47FE078672EBF5E2.quest_subtitle: "Draconium at the heart of the large cells."
	quest.47FE078672EBF5E2.title: "&bBuild a 256k Component"
	quest.4800A394D425DA77.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ophyx' Calling."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6fire charge&r, a &6blast furnace&r, a &6smoker&r, a &6flint and steel&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book."
		""
		"It smelts without fuel in half the time. Placed next to the Djinni Crusher, with Transporter and Janitor in between, ore becomes ingots without your help."
	]
	quest.4800A394D425DA77.quest_subtitle: "Twice as fast as a furnace."
	quest.4800A394D425DA77.title: "&dSummon a Djinni Smelter"
	quest.48137713AF962996.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Machine Frame&r from RFTools Base in the middle, &6brick blocks&r in the corners, an &6ender pearl&r at the top, &6redstone&r on the sides and at the bottom."
		""
		"With &6stage 4&r two mods open that mine whole areas: the RFTools &6Builder&r and &6Quarry Plus&r. The Builder is a toolbox: with a shape card it mines, pumps, clears or places blocks."
		""
		"&ePower:&r It stores 1,000,000 RF and accepts up to &d20,000 RF/t&r. A mined block costs 300 RF or more, depending on hardness."
	]
	quest.48137713AF962996.quest_subtitle: "Digging without digging yourself."
	quest.48137713AF962996.title: "&6&lBuild a Builder"
	quest.48156A74AC2685B4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crystalline Bee&r and &6Ashy Mining Bee&r, the same pair as for iron, which also gives the tin and aluminum bees. Flower: copper block or copper ore. The comb gives &6raw copper&r with 40 percent."
	]
	quest.48156A74AC2685B4.quest_subtitle: "Raw copper from combs."
	quest.48156A74AC2685B4.title: "&6Breed the Copper Bee"
	quest.481976FE5C9A22EC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_ores_shards.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Die &6Splitter&r gehen in die &6Klärkammer&r: ein Splitter und 1 mB Sauerstoff geben einen &6Klumpen&r. Dann Zerkleinerer, Anreicherungskammer, Schmelzer wie bisher."
		""
		"&eDie Vierfach-Straße:&r Injektionskammer, Klärkammer, Zerkleinerer, Anreicherungskammer, Schmelzer. Fünf Maschinen, zwei Gase (Chlorwasserstoff, Sauerstoff), ein Elektrolyseur für Wasser und einer für Sole."
		""
		"&eNebenbei:&r &6Schießpulver&r in der Injektionskammer wird zu &6Schwefelstaub&r, 1 mB Chlorwasserstoff pro Stück. Heb ihn auf, die Fünffach-Straße läuft auf Schwefel."
		""
		"Mit Glück III sind das rund 5,9 Barren pro abgebautem Erz."
	]
	quest.481976FE5C9A22EC.quest_subtitle: "Splitter, Klumpen, Staub, Barren."
	quest.481976FE5C9A22EC.title: "&d&lLass Splitter durch die Straße laufen"
	quest.481D143950165232.quest_desc: [
		"Processing patterns for Printed Silicon (Inscriber), Infused Alloy and Basic Control Circuits (two Metallurgic Infusers), and a crafting pattern in the assembler for the &6Advanced Control Circuit&r. Order 64."
		""
		"An Export Bus with a Crafting Card on a chest keeps the stock until you carry it to the obelisk. If you need a lot of silicon, build the &6Circuit Slicer&r from Extended AE further down."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r &e\"The Furnace Never Sleeps\"&r wants &e250 Advanced Control Circuits&r, &e4,000 steel ingots&r and &e8 Steel Cores&r. You hand in by hand at the obelisk, and it counts for whoever hands in."
	]
	quest.481D143950165232.quest_subtitle: "The furnace never sleeps, and neither does the Inscriber."
	quest.481D143950165232.title: "&6&lBuild the circuit factory"
	quest.4824275E4DA2D186.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r iron ingot, &6Honey Bucket&r, iron ingot on top, iron ingot, &6furnace&r, iron ingot in the middle, three iron ingots at the bottom. You make the Honey Bucket from four honey bottles and a bucket or from a honey block and a bucket."
		""
		"The &6Honey Generator&r burns &e2 mB of honey per tick&r and gives &d60 FE/t&r for it. Place it at the centrifuge's tank or fill it by pipe, bottle, bucket or honey block."
		""
		"A Time Upgrade raises the output at higher consumption, a Productivity Upgrade lowers consumption. That way the Powered Centrifuge and incubator run off your own bee house."
	]
	quest.4824275E4DA2D186.quest_subtitle: "60 FE/t from what the bees deliver anyway."
	quest.4824275E4DA2D186.title: "&6Make Power from Honey"
	quest.48399F469D493447.quest_desc: [
		"&5Vexing log&r, &e3 Wilden Wings&r, &e2 diamonds&r, &6ender pearl&r. Ars Elemental knows a second tablet: Flashing log, Wilden Wing, 2 diamonds, feather."
		""
		"Players nearby get the &eFlight&r effect when jumping, and the ritual refreshes it as long as they stay nearby. Each time it costs source from the jars."
	]
	quest.48399F469D493447.quest_subtitle: "Fly as in creative mode, as long as the source lasts."
	quest.48399F469D493447.title: "&aMake the Flight Tablet"
	quest.484E378E6FC7D9F5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/start_here_v_claim.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eSo geht es:&r &eM&r öffnet die Karte von FTB Chunks, &eC&r die Claim-Ansicht. Linke Maustaste ziehen beansprucht, &eShift&r und ziehen lädt dauerhaft. Dein Team hat &e500 Claims&r und &e25 geladene Chunks&r, zusammen, nicht pro Kopf."
		""
		"&eWas das heißt:&r Geladene Chunks laufen weiter, während du anderswo bist, auch wenn dein ganzes Team offline ist. Maschinen an einem Portal, eine Pumpe im Nether, ein Bahnhof: alles, was ohne dich arbeiten soll, braucht einen geladenen Chunk."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Lad nicht die Strecke, lad die Enden. Ein Zug fährt auch durch ungeladene Chunks, der Bahnhof am Ziel muss aber geladen sein, damit die Fracht ankommt."
	]
	quest.484E378E6FC7D9F5.quest_subtitle: "25 Chunks bleiben geladen, auch über Nacht."
	quest.484E378E6FC7D9F5.title: "&6Lade Chunks auf dem Weg"
	quest.48591788BD0ABF5E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Plate Basic&r in the corners, &6Hard Carbon&r at the top, &6actuators&r left and right, a &6chassis&r in the middle, a &6motor&r at the bottom."
		""
		"The Alloy Smelter smelts &6Hard Carbon&r from graphite and diamond dust."
	]
	quest.48591788BD0ABF5E.quest_subtitle: "It builds the circuits."
	quest.48591788BD0ABF5E.title: "&bBuild an Assembler"
	quest.4865FD84899DDCDA.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hold \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbultimine\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\", look at a block and mine it. All matching neighboring blocks go with it, up to \"},{\"text\":\"128\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" at once. That costs hunger, \"},{\"text\":\"20 times\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" as much as a normal block, so eat first.\"}]"
		""
		"With the key held and &eShift and mouse wheel&r (or arrow keys) you switch the shape: &eShapeless&r for veins and trees, &eSmall Tunnel&r, &eLarge Tunnel 3x3&r, &eSmall Square 3x3&r, &eMining Tunnel&r and &eEscape Tunnel&r upward."
		""
		"Ultimine can do more: with the key and &eright click&r the axe strips several logs, the hoe tills a whole area, the shovel makes paths, and you harvest ripe crops row by row. You harvest a single crop simply with right click."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r On this server &eevery origin&r may ultimine. Neo Origins could tie it to a power, but no origin in the pack has such a power, so it stays open for everyone."
	]
	quest.4865FD84899DDCDA.quest_subtitle: "Hold the key, take the whole vein."
	quest.4865FD84899DDCDA.title: "&6Mine with Ultimine"
	quest.4879A02A4A12D9EC.quest_desc: [
		"Place &e5 buckets of blood&r with the extractor so that five source blocks stand side by side. Throw a &6Dark Gem&r into the middle of the pool, and it becomes a &6Dark Power Gem&r."
		""
		"{image:evilcraft:textures/item/dark_power_gem.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"You only have to do this by hand once. As soon as the Blood Infuser stands, a Power Gem only costs 250 mB there. Power Gems go into the Infusion Core, the Promises, the Vein Sword and the Blood Pearl of Teleportation."
	]
	quest.4879A02A4A12D9EC.quest_subtitle: "A gem that has swallowed blood."
	quest.4879A02A4A12D9EC.title: "&4Make a Dark Power Gem"
	quest.487D59D9430175DA.quest_desc: [
		"Der Boden entscheidet, was wächst und wie schnell. &6Reichhaltige Erde&r aus Farmer's Delight wächst 10 Prozent schneller als Erde, Sand ist für Kaktus und Zuckerrohr, Seelensand für Netherwarze, Wasser (ein Wassereimer) für Seegras und Seetang."
		""
		"&eWerkzeugplatz:&r Leg ein Werkzeug in den Topf. &6Effizienz&r darauf macht die Pflanze pro Stufe 5 Prozent schneller, eine &6Schere&r bringt Blätter von Bäumen, Behutsamkeit zählt wie beim Abbauen. Das Werkzeug nutzt sich dabei ab."
		""
		"&6Knochenmehl&r auf den Topf bringt 400 bis 600 Ticks Wachstum, also 20 bis 30 Sekunden auf einen Schlag."
		""
		"Auch die Pflanzen aus Farmer's Delight gehen: Tomatensamen, Weißkohlsamen, Zwiebeln, Reis und die Pilzkolonien."
	]
	quest.487D59D9430175DA.quest_subtitle: "Schneller wachsen, mehr ernten."
	quest.487D59D9430175DA.title: "&aWähl Boden und Werkzeug"
	quest.4888962F267720FF.quest_desc: [
		"Collect &664 zinc ingots&r and &6128 copper ingots&r. Every brass ingot costs two copper and one zinc."
		"{image:create:textures/item/zinc_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"The farm world is ideal for this; there the landscape around the bases stays intact. Whoever only hoards zinc stands at the mixer with an empty copper chest."
	]
	quest.4888962F267720FF.quest_subtitle: "Two parts copper, one part zinc."
	quest.4888962F267720FF.title: "&6Hoard copper and zinc"
	quest.48B0D1BFA29C5682.quest_desc: [
		"Craft a &6Flame Eye&r and throw it like an eye of ender: top &63 blaze powder&r, middle &6netherite scrap, eye of ender, netherite scrap&r, bottom &63 soul sand&r."
		""
		"It flies to the nearest &6Burning Arena&r. That only stands in the &eNether wastes&r. Follow it until you are inside."
	]
	quest.48B0D1BFA29C5682.quest_subtitle: "A burning colosseum in the Nether wastes."
	quest.48B0D1BFA29C5682.title: "&6Find the Burning Arena"
	quest.48D05FC96BE8C371.quest_desc: [
		"Manastahl und Lebeholzzweige in den Eisenmustern. Manastahl kommt aus dem Ritual des Waldes oder dem Becken, Kapitel &aBotania: Runen&r."
		""
		"300 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 6,2, Diamant-Abbaustufe. Rüstung 15 wie Eisen, Verzauberbarkeit 18. Alles heilt sich aus einer Manatafel im Inventar."
	]
	quest.48D05FC96BE8C371.quest_subtitle: "Botania: repariert sich mit Mana."
	quest.48D05FC96BE8C371.title: "&bBau Manastahl-Ausrüstung"
	quest.48D21689C278C370.quest_desc: [
		"An &6ingot&r and the &6Engineer's Hammer&r together in the crafting table make a &6plate&r. The hammer loses one point of durability."
		""
		"You need &6Iron Plates&r for components and pipes, &6Copper Plates&r for Copper Wire, &6Lead Plates&r for the accumulator. In stage 3 the Metal Press takes over."
	]
	quest.48D21689C278C370.quest_subtitle: "An ingot and the hammer give a plate."
	quest.48D21689C278C370.title: "&7Hammer ingots into plates"
	quest.48D6249248F1319A.quest_desc: [
		"You already find &6zinc ore&r while digging. Brass from copper and zinc only opens in stage 2, but you may mine and store the zinc now."
		""
		"A few stacks of &6raw zinc&r in a chest, and on opening day you are right in."
	]
	quest.48D6249248F1319A.quest_subtitle: "Plan ahead and you build brass on day one."
	quest.48D6249248F1319A.title: "&6Stock up on zinc for stage 2"
	quest.48DFABD388ACA260.quest_desc: [
		"Dritte Generation mit 5 Prozent, darunter Mammutbaum und Zuckerahorn, im Markt für 4 Smaragde. Danach verkauft der Markt nichts mehr."
		""
		"&6Blue Mahoe&r: Teak + Balsa, 5 %"
		"&6Padauk&r: Rotahorn + Tropenbaum, 5 %"
		"&6Papaya&r: Vogelkirsche + Kakao, 5 %"
		"&6Mammutbaum&r: Europäische Lärche + Gelbkiefer, 5 %"
		"&6Zuckerahorn&r: Europäische Lärche + Rotahorn, 5 %"
		"&6Silberpappel&r: Silberweide + Eiche oder Birke oder Silberlinde, 5 %"
	]
	quest.48DFABD388ACA260.quest_subtitle: "6 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.48DFABD388ACA260.title: "&aGeneration 3: Blue Mahoe bis Silberpappel"
	quest.48E12C44C7750F0F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Steel&r at the top right, &6ferroboron&r and a &6piston&r in the middle, &6copper&r and &6ferroboron&r at the bottom. EMI shows the exact layout."
	]
	quest.48E12C44C7750F0F.quest_subtitle: "For the pressurizer, assembler and hastener."
	quest.48E12C44C7750F0F.title: "&7Build an Actuator"
	quest.48F1253019E91931.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &6netherrack&r between the crushing wheels. Each block gives one &6cinder flour&r, a second with 50 percent."
		""
		"The millstone doesn't grind netherrack; you need the wheels for that."
	]
	quest.48F1253019E91931.quest_subtitle: "The first step towards the blaze cake."
	quest.48F1253019E91931.title: "&6Grind netherrack into cinder flour"
	quest.48F8A5EEC6ED4BDF.quest_desc: [
		"A Steel Casing in the middle, two &6Robits&r left and right, circuits at the top and bottom, redstone in the corners."
		""
		"It turns rods: steel and aluminum for Immersive Engineering, copper, gold, brass and electrum for Create Crafts & Additions, &etwo&r per ingot."
	]
	quest.48F8A5EEC6ED4BDF.quest_subtitle: "The CNC Lathe."
	quest.48F8A5EEC6ED4BDF.title: "&3Turn rods"
	quest.490915287F39E323.quest_desc: [
		"&6Six stone&r, &6two water buckets&r top and bottom, an empty &6bucket&r in the middle. Put into a fluid drawer, it fills with &bwater&r."
		""
		"A pipe on it supplies water for washing, mixer or concrete, without any source in the ground."
	]
	quest.490915287F39E323.quest_subtitle: "The Water Generator Upgrade."
	quest.490915287F39E323.title: "Make water out of nothing"
	quest.492213BF837C450A.quest_desc: [
		"&eRight click&r the &6Blueprint Package&r from your starting inventory. You get blueprints for rod, pickaxe, shovel, axe, hoe and sword."
		""
		"Blueprints are &enot used up&r when crafting. Over a blueprint, &eAlt&r shows which parts the tool needs, &eU&r shows the recipes in EMI."
	]
	quest.492213BF837C450A.quest_subtitle: "Six blueprints for free."
	quest.492213BF837C450A.title: "&7Unpack the Blueprint Package"
	quest.4927710F8D0F2B33.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Aviar's Circle."
		"&6Bowls:&r one &6deepslate&r, &6dripstone block&r, &6calcite&r and &6magma block&r each."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book."
		""
		"It trades like the Otherstone trader, only for &6Otherrock&r. Otherrock is good for bowls and building, but not for chalk."
	]
	quest.4927710F8D0F2B33.quest_subtitle: "Dark stone for builders."
	quest.4927710F8D0F2B33.title: "&dSummon the Otherrock trader"
	quest.492A386EFBFFB11E.quest_desc: [
		"&fAir:&r feather, &6Wilden Wing&r, arrow."
		"&dConjuration:&r &6Wilden Horn&r, &6Starbuncle Shards&r, book."
		""
		"That gives you all seven Ars Nouveau essences. The eighth, &6Anima&r from Ars Elemental, needs a wither skeleton skull and comes with stage 2."
	]
	quest.492A386EFBFFB11E.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: the two essences with Wilden parts."
	quest.492A386EFBFFB11E.title: "&dMake Air and Conjuration Essence"
	quest.492D71E452CD19B1.quest_desc: [
		"Let the chamber run at the jar until you have &e16 Source Gems&r. A &6block of amethyst&r turns straight into a &6Source Gem Block&r for &d2,000 Source&r."
		""
		"Gems go into sourcestone, pedestals, apparatus, every link and every piece of jewellery. Whatever is left belongs in the &eobelisk&r at spawn."
	]
	quest.492D71E452CD19B1.quest_subtitle: "The currency of magic."
	quest.492D71E452CD19B1.title: "&d&lMake 16 Source Gems"
	quest.49309AAE0825F254.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Emerald, 1 Powdered Iron&r, cloth."
		""
		"For a few hits, damage taken turns into mana. Costs &d40 mana&r."
	]
	quest.49309AAE0825F254.quest_subtitle: "Hits become mana."
	quest.49309AAE0825F254.title: "&aDraw Damage Exchange"
	quest.493BA659596BA22E.quest_desc: [
		"Obsidianstaub aus dem Zerkleinerer, mit Diamant infundiert, geschmolzen. Werkzeug und Rüstung wie Eisen. Kapitel &5Mekanism: Fortgeschritten&r."
		""
		"Werkzeug 4 096, Paxel 8 192 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 12, 8 Schaden. Rüstung 31 Punkte (6, 12, 8, 5), Zähigkeit 5. Das stärkste Rüstungsmetall vor der MekaSuit."
	]
	quest.493BA659596BA22E.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism Tools: 8 192 Haltbarkeit."
	quest.493BA659596BA22E.title: "&5Bau Raffiniertes Obsidian"
	quest.494A21B1D6812CA7.quest_desc: [
		"Hold a rune in your hand and &eright click&r the spawner. Every rune is a blank Spawner Rune with four identical items around it:"
		""
		"&6Pistons&r: Spawn Range +2 (up to 32). &6Comparators&r: only runs with a redstone signal. &6Wool&r: the monsters are silent. &6Campfires&r: the monsters burn. &6Turtle eggs&r: only babies. &6Dripstone&r: the monsters start with 16 percent less health (up to 20 percent). &6Soul lanterns&r: ignores light, stage 2."
		""
		"With &6nether quartz&r in your offhand (from stage 2) you reverse a rune, the quartz stays. &eInfused runes&r (Eterna 70) bring No AI, Ignores Players, Ignores Conditions and Echoing, more loot per monster. EMI shows every rune under the spawner."
	]
	quest.494A21B1D6812CA7.quest_subtitle: "One rune per value."
	quest.494A21B1D6812CA7.title: "&2Modify a Spawner"
	quest.49530F1CA9326122.quest_desc: [
		"There is a &6waystone&r at spawn. A &eright-click&r activates it for you. From then on every waystone you know brings you back here with one click."
		""
		"The trip costs some experience, the farther the more. More in the chapter &6Tips and Tricks&r."
	]
	quest.49530F1CA9326122.quest_subtitle: "So you can always find your way back."
	quest.49530F1CA9326122.title: "&6Activate the waystone at spawn"
	quest.49563BD37CD5D9C3.quest_desc: [
		"&eÖl:&r In der Anlage bei &e2 Bar&r gibt jeder &6Samen&r &b50 mB Pflanzenöl&r (Vegetable Oil), eine Feldfrucht nur 20 mB. Samen sind also die bessere Quelle."
		""
		"&6Fluid Mixer:&r ein &6Kleiner Tank&r oben, &6Verstärkte Ziegelmauer&r, &6Turbinenrotor&r, Verstärkte Ziegelmauer in der Mitte, Kleiner Tank, Druckluftrohr, Kleiner Tank unten. Er mischt zwei Flüssigkeiten mit Druck, mehr Druck heißt schneller und mehr Luftverbrauch."
	]
	quest.49563BD37CD5D9C3.quest_subtitle: "Samen werden Öl."
	quest.49563BD37CD5D9C3.title: "&2Press Pflanzenöl, bau den Fluid Mixer"
	quest.4958C72546BFF3B8.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ophyx' Calling, all with the Djinni book, no sacrifice, 60 seconds."
		"&eDay:&r torch, sapling, wheat, yellow dye. &eNight:&r gunpowder, rotten flesh, bone, black dye."
		"&eClear weather:&r beetroot, carrot, potato, wheat."
		""
		"The spirit changes the world once and disappears. Time and weather apply to everyone; coordinate on the server. Rain and thunderstorms are only summoned by Afrit (stage 3)."
	]
	quest.4958C72546BFF3B8.quest_subtitle: "Djinni that act once and leave."
	quest.4958C72546BFF3B8.title: "&dSet time and weather"
	quest.496842F2E1B785BA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crimson Iron Ore&r lies in the Nether, also in blackstone. Raw ore in the furnace gives the ingot."
		""
		"&6Crimson Iron&r: &e420&r durability, speed &e10&r, Malleable III, Hard II, Heat-Resistant IV. As a tip +224 durability and Fiery."
	]
	quest.496842F2E1B785BA.quest_subtitle: "420 durability, speed 10."
	quest.496842F2E1B785BA.title: "&cFind Crimson Iron in the Nether"
	quest.49746F33B4B3EC52.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_time_traveller.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r oben und unten je drei &6Time-Traveller-Bretter&r, in der Mitte &6Faden&r, &6Glas&r, &6Faden&r. Das &6Time-Traveller-Display&r ist ein Block mit einem Slot, der den Gegenstand darin sichtbar ausstellt, wie ein Rahmen mit Glas davor."
		""
		"Das Holz dafür gibt es nur vom &6Time Traveller&r, der Kreuzung aus Blue Yonder und Rippling Willow, mit 5 Prozent. Ein Baum liefert Stämme genug, im Pflanztopf alle zwei Minuten zwei weitere."
		""
		"Das ist das einzige Funktionsrezept, das an ein bestimmtes Holz gebunden ist. Wer es baut, hat die halbe leuchtende Reihe hinter sich."
	]
	quest.49746F33B4B3EC52.quest_subtitle: "Ein Schaukasten aus dem seltensten Holz."
	quest.49746F33B4B3EC52.title: "&dBau das Time-Traveller-Display"
	quest.4975B82B0B560B4B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gantry Shaft&r: alloy, redstone, alloy, eight at a time. &6Gantry Carriage&r: wooden slab, Andesite Casing, cogwheel. Turn the shaft and the carriage moves with everything glued to it."
		""
		"Shafts across the carriage give a second direction. Ideal for drills that clear an area."
	]
	quest.4975B82B0B560B4B.quest_subtitle: "Straight along a rail."
	quest.4975B82B0B560B4B.title: "&6Ride a gantry shaft"
	quest.4989628BEC9FD746.quest_desc: [
		"Place a &6gold block&r next to active &6Blazebloom Goo&r. After 2 minutes it is a &6Raw Blazegold Block&r, which drops &63 to 4 Raw Blazegold&r. Smelt it into &6Blazegold Ingots&r."
		""
		"{image:justdirethings:textures/item/blazegold_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Blazegold is the second tool tier: blocks like diamond, &e1,440&r durability, mining speed 12. And it has &eLava Repair&r: throw a damaged Blazegold tool into a lava source, and it comes back out fully repaired."
		""
		"From Blazegold you build the Fuel Generator, the Swapper, the Portal Gun and a few helpers like the Blazejet Wand and the Totem of Death Recall."
	]
	quest.4989628BEC9FD746.quest_subtitle: "A metal that repairs itself in lava."
	quest.4989628BEC9FD746.title: "&6&lMake Blazegold"
	quest.498BFF9BF8A70355.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gunpowder&r on the altar plus &e1 Arcane&r: Hex Ash."
		""
		"It goes into totem bases, the Spirit Crucible, the Impetus and the better scythe. Make a stack."
	]
	quest.498BFF9BF8A70355.quest_subtitle: "The base ingredient for almost everything."
	quest.498BFF9BF8A70355.title: "&7Infuse Hex Ash"
	quest.49971F63EA100B4A.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r iron ingot, &6comparator&r, iron ingot on top, iron ingot, &6crafting table&r, iron ingot in the middle, three iron ingots at the bottom."
		""
		"The &6Gene Indexer&r takes in Gene Samples and, with a redstone signal, merges identical genes until they become purer ones. That way you do not have to combine every sample in the crafting table by hand."
	]
	quest.49971F63EA100B4A.quest_subtitle: "A chest full of samples, one signal."
	quest.49971F63EA100B4A.title: "&dSort Genes with the Indexer"
	quest.499EDB78A6E55E5B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_advanced_pressurized_spawner.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r vier &6Compressed Iron&r in die Ecken, vier &6Advanced Pressure Tubes&r an die Seiten, der &6Empty Spawner&r in die Mitte."
		""
		"Leg einen gefüllten &6Spawner Core&r hinein und gib ihm mindestens &e10 bar&r. Dann spawnt er, egal wie hell es ist und egal, ob ein Spieler in der Nähe steht, und ein Redstone-Signal schaltet ihn ab. Jeder Versuch kostet Luft, auch wenn der Core an der Stelle leer ist."
		""
		"Ein Core zu 50 Prozent Zombie und 25 Prozent Creeper spawnt in der Hälfte der Fälle einen Zombie, in einem Viertel einen Creeper, sonst nichts. Volle Cores aus dem Extractor sind darum die besten."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Monsterfarmen mit Guard Drone und Collector Drone daneben sind ein Weg zu den Seelen und Essenzen, die die Magier für die Rituale dieser Stufe brauchen. Und wer Hostile Neural Networks spielt, füttert so die Simulation mit Modellen."
	]
	quest.499EDB78A6E55E5B.quest_subtitle: "Ein Spawner, der auf dich hört."
	quest.499EDB78A6E55E5B.title: "&2&lBau einen Pressurized Spawner"
	quest.49B9D5E5F252DBB0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Battery (Starter):&r paste in the corners, four Basic Capacitors on the sides, a &6redstone block&r in the middle. It holds &e1,000,000 FE&r, higher tiers up to 400 million."
		""
		"&eSneak and right click&r switches on charging: then it gives its power to the other powered items in your inventory. A full Battery in your pocket keeps tools and jetpack alive on long trips."
		""
		"In an Ender Cell's window a Battery makes the storage larger with a shift click."
	]
	quest.49B9D5E5F252DBB0.quest_subtitle: "A million FE for your pocket."
	quest.49B9D5E5F252DBB0.title: "&aBuild a Battery"
	quest.49BF5BB0EE711260.quest_desc: [
		"A &6copper ingot&r and a &6nickel ingot&r make &e2 constantan ingots&r in the Alloy Kiln."
		""
		"Constantan plates go into the Thermoelectric Generator and in stage 3 into the Radiator Blocks of the Diesel Generator."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/metal_ingot_constantan.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.49BF5BB0EE711260.quest_subtitle: "Copper and nickel for thermocouples."
	quest.49BF5BB0EE711260.title: "&6Alloy constantan"
	quest.49C4AEBBED144162.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6slime balls&r, an &6Iron Sheet&r and an &6iron nugget&r make &6Super Glue&r. Click one corner, then the opposite one: everything in the frame is glued."
		"{image:create:textures/item/super_glue.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"The block right in front of a bearing or piston always belongs to it; everything else needs glue or a chassis."
	]
	quest.49C4AEBBED144162.quest_subtitle: "What is glued moves along."
	quest.49C4AEBBED144162.title: "&6Glue blocks together"
	quest.49D0F7E926FFDB41.quest_desc: [
		"A &cPlutonium Pellet&r into the &6Chemical Injection Chamber&r with hydrogen chloride gives &e4 Reprocessed Fissile Fragments&r. Each becomes &e2,000 mB of fissile fuel&r in the Oxidizer."
		""
		"That way the reactor partly runs on its own waste."
	]
	quest.49D0F7E926FFDB41.quest_subtitle: "One pellet, 8,000 mB of fuel."
	quest.49D0F7E926FFDB41.title: "&cMake New Fuel from Plutonium"
	quest.49D2C35E7815A9C3.quest_desc: [
		"A &6book&r and a &6Refined Soulstone&r, shapeless."
		""
		"&5Malum&r works with souls. What dies by the right blade drops &dSpirit Arcana&r. With them you infuse items, forge metals and build totems. The mod opens with &6stage 3&r."
		""
		"&6Soulstone&r is a common ore. The raw piece gives Refined Soulstone in a furnace."
	]
	quest.49D2C35E7815A9C3.quest_subtitle: "Magic from shattered souls."
	quest.49D2C35E7815A9C3.title: "&5&lOpen the Encyclopedia Arcana"
	quest.49D349DC5DA9B7AD.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eidolon_crucible.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Seven &6Pewter&r in a cauldron shape. Place it over a campfire, fill it with water, wait until it boils."
		""
		"Throw in the ingredients of the first step. When the color changes, the next one follows. If it says \"stir\", you stir with an empty hand as often as given."
		""
		"For practice: &6coal&r and &6Enchanted Ash&r (bone in a furnace) make two Sulfur."
	]
	quest.49D349DC5DA9B7AD.quest_subtitle: "Alchemy in several steps."
	quest.49D349DC5DA9B7AD.title: "&6Set Up a Crucible"
	quest.49D43A816290C3A1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Advanced Induction Cell:&r four Basic Cells and four Energy Tablets alternating around an &6Advanced Energy Cube&r. It holds &d25.6 billion FE&r."
		""
		"&6Advanced Induction Provider:&r four Basic Providers and four Advanced Control Circuits around an Advanced Cube. It manages &d819,200 FE/t&r."
		""
		"The Elite tier does that eight times again: 204.8 billion FE per cell, a good 6.5 million FE/t per provider. Just swap old cells, the shell stays standing."
	]
	quest.49D43A816290C3A1.quest_subtitle: "Eight times the storage, eight times the throughput."
	quest.49D43A816290C3A1.title: "&9Upgrade the Matrix"
	quest.49D9760C4025EA05.quest_desc: [
		"A &bbeacon&r on a finished pyramid, at least 3x3 of iron, gold, emerald, diamond or netherite. It has to shine."
		""
		"The &5Wither&r gives the Nether Star, see the chapter &aBosses&r. The Guardian switches the effect off during the fight."
	]
	quest.49D9760C4025EA05.quest_subtitle: "The beacon becomes the altar."
	quest.49D9760C4025EA05.title: "&bSet Up an Active Beacon"
	quest.49DDDBA13B3BC629.quest_desc: [
		"&6Six stone&r, a &6hopper&r on top, a &6drawer&r in the middle, &6redstone&r at the bottom. The drawer is used up."
		""
		"Right clicking the drawer with the upgrade installs it. It pulls &e4 items every 4 ticks&r from the block on one side. You choose the side in the menu (right click the frame) by right clicking the upgrade."
	]
	quest.49DDDBA13B3BC629.quest_subtitle: "The Puller Upgrade."
	quest.49DDDBA13B3BC629.title: "Let the drawer pull on its own"
	quest.49E117DEE84FA0D4.quest_desc: [
		"&5Vexing log&r, &6Blank Parchment&r, &6ender pearl&r, &e3 Source Gems&r."
		""
		"Start next to a Starbuncle, Drygmy, Whirlisprig or Wixie. The creature becomes a &6Bound Script&r; right click with it makes it your familiar. You summon it in the spell book, only one at a time."
	]
	quest.49E117DEE84FA0D4.quest_subtitle: "A helper becomes a familiar."
	quest.49E117DEE84FA0D4.title: "&aMake the Binding tablet"
	quest.49E952C251A80C20.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/gaia_dandelifeon.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Apothecary: &e2 purple, 1 lime, 1 green&r petal, runes of &eWater, Fire, Earth, Air&r, &6Redstone Root&r, &dGaia Spirit&r."
		""
		"Around it lies a &e25x25&r field. With a redstone signal it calculates one step twice per second: cells with 2 or 3 neighbors survive, empty ones with exactly 3 come alive."
		""
		"Cells that grow into the 3x3 around the flower become &d60 mana times age&r, age at most 100."
	]
	quest.49E952C251A80C20.quest_subtitle: "Conway's Game of Life, in mana."
	quest.49E952C251A80C20.title: "&aPlant a Dandelifeon"
	quest.49F297EB5E1F759F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Starbuncle-Amulett&r und ein &6Wasserrad&r, formlos. Das Starbuncle aus dem Amulett steckt danach im Rad, setz es einfach an eine Welle."
		""
		"&eArs Creo, Starbuncle-Rad:&r Brennstoff keiner, &d16 RPM&r, &d16 SU pro RPM&r, also &d256 SU&r. Ein &6Goldblock&r direkt vor dem Rad treibt es auf 24 RPM und 384 SU. Es läuft im Keller, in der Wüste, überall."
	]
	quest.49F297EB5E1F759F.quest_subtitle: "Ars Creo, 16 RPM, 256 SU, ein Starbuncle läuft im Rad."
	quest.49F297EB5E1F759F.title: "&dSetz ein Starbuncle-Rad"
	quest.4A055E359602E3DD.quest_desc: [
		"Put two different materials into the &6Crude Mixer&r, like copper and iron. Out comes a &6crude alloy&r that goes into heads like a material of its own."
		""
		"Worth it when two traits should go together. For pure stats a single material head is better. The real alloy forge comes in stage 2."
	]
	quest.4A055E359602E3DD.quest_subtitle: "A new material from two old ones."
	quest.4A055E359602E3DD.title: "&7Mix a crude alloy"
	quest.4A06A5B131ED9889.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r Blueprint Paper, stick and feather on top of each other. The &6arrowheads&r need &eone&r material, plus a rod and &6fletching&r. EMI shows exactly which parts."
		""
		"The arrows fit bow and crossbow. The material of the head decides the damage."
	]
	quest.4A06A5B131ED9889.quest_subtitle: "Arrowheads from any material."
	quest.4A06A5B131ED9889.title: "&7Build your own arrows"
	quest.4A08EA7A64BF48A5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Modification Table:&r iron at the top and bottom, redstone and a Blank Upgrade Module in the middle. &63x3 upgrade:&r redstone blocks, a diamond block, ender pearls and a diamond pickaxe around a blank module."
		""
		"Gadget into the table, drag the upgrade onto the free slot. Every upgrade raises the power draw per block, look at the tooltip. &65x5&r follows from the 3x3."
	]
	quest.4A08EA7A64BF48A5.quest_subtitle: "Fit upgrades, and the first one right away."
	quest.4A08EA7A64BF48A5.title: "&bBuild a Modification Table"
	quest.4A0E42528E807FF4.quest_desc: [
		"Infuse &6dragon's breath&r at the enchanting table into &e3 Infused Dragon's Breath&r. The recipe wants at least &b80&r Eterna, Quanta between &d15 and 30 percent&r and at least &560 percent&r Arcana. Eterna above 75 only becomes possible with the world tier Pinnacle, and the dragon brings that."
		""
		"&66 end stone bricks&r, an &6Infused Dragon's Breath&r, a &6bookshelf&r and an &6ender pearl&r make an &6Endshelf&r: &b5 Eterna&r up to a maximum of 90, plus &d5 Quanta&r and &55 Arcana&r each."
		""
		"More on this in the &6Apotheosis&r chapter."
	]
	quest.4A0E42528E807FF4.quest_subtitle: "Dragon's breath for the enchanting table."
	quest.4A0E42528E807FF4.title: "&5Build an Endshelf"
	quest.4A16044EE4AB1568.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Reinforced Alloy&r with &e40 mB of Refined Obsidian&r gives an &6Atomic Alloy&r."
		""
		"The dust gives only 10 mB. Send it through the Enrichment Chamber first, &6Enriched Obsidian&r gives 80 mB, enough for two alloys."
		""
		"Atomic Alloy goes into the Teleportation Core, the Robit and everything called ultimate in stage 4."
	]
	quest.4A16044EE4AB1568.quest_subtitle: "Reinforced Alloy, soaked in obsidian."
	quest.4A16044EE4AB1568.title: "&5&lMake Atomic Alloy"
	quest.4A19A4F9352DEC24.quest_desc: [
		"An &6iron ingot&r on top, below plank, &6andesite&r, plank. The planks decide the kind: willow, mahogany or witch hazel."
		""
		"It cuts wood and planks like a stonecutter: connected plank patterns that only exist here, and stairs, slabs and more with less waste than at the crafting table."
	]
	quest.4A19A4F9352DEC24.quest_subtitle: "The stonecutter for wood."
	quest.4A19A4F9352DEC24.title: "&6Build a Woodcutter"
	quest.4A1D5466A4002F11.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 Powdered Gold&r, cloth."
		""
		"For &d900 mana&r you become much faster and stronger for a short time. Monsters you hit fly through walls. Holding jump jumps farther, held in the air you stick to the surface you land on."
	]
	quest.4A1D5466A4002F11.quest_subtitle: "Strong as a god, for a short time."
	quest.4A1D5466A4002F11.title: "&6Draw Borrowed Authority"
	quest.4A401167020FBDB9.quest_desc: [
		"A &6redstone block&r, a Fluix Crystal and glowstone dust in water give two &6Redstone Crystals&r, and the Charger charges them. An iron block in the Charger becomes the &6Inscriber Energy Press&r."
		""
		"A charged Redstone Crystal under the Energy Press, then finish it like every processor with redstone and Printed Silicon."
	]
	quest.4A401167020FBDB9.quest_subtitle: "Power needs a processor of its own."
	quest.4A401167020FBDB9.title: "&cMake Energy Processors"
	quest.4A455F3B85F81A50.quest_desc: [
		"&6Taboo Book&r, &6Purified Ink&r, &6Awakened Feather&r and &e4 blue dye&r make the &6Book of Binding: Foliot&r."
		"Then craft it shapeless with the &6Dictionary of Spirits&r. The Dictionary stays, the book is now bound."
		""
		"{image:occultism:textures/item/book_of_binding_bound_foliot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Colour per rank: &9blue&r Foliot, &5purple&r Djinni, &eyellow&r Afrit, &agreen&r Marid. The name in the book doesn't matter, only the rank counts."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Up to six books at once: put them into a chiseled bookshelf and click it with the Dictionary while sneaking."
	]
	quest.4A455F3B85F81A50.quest_subtitle: "A name on paper is a leash."
	quest.4A455F3B85F81A50.title: "&9Bind a Foliot name"
	quest.4A49423CB7F03840.quest_desc: [
		"Kochtopf: ein &6roher Fisch&r (Kabeljau oder Lachs), &6Rohe Nudeln&r, &6Tomate&r und ein &6Tintenbeutel&r, Schüssel."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/squid_ink_pasta.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4A49423CB7F03840.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.4A49423CB7F03840.title: "&6Koch Pasta mit Tintenfischtinte"
	quest.4A4F4A2424EF0F38.quest_desc: [
		"&6Two iron ingots&r on top of each other make &efour iron rods&r. Two of them with the rod blueprint: four iron rods for tools."
		""
		"Stats like the wooden rod, Flexible II. The difference is the look."
	]
	quest.4A4F4A2424EF0F38.quest_subtitle: "For a rod made entirely of iron."
	quest.4A4F4A2424EF0F38.title: "&7Forge iron rods"
	quest.4A5680E2772D9840.quest_desc: [
		"Eisenbarren auf dem Geisteraltar mit 4 Refined Soulstone, 3 Wicked, 1 Earthen, 1 Arcane ergibt &6Soul Stained Steel&r. Kapitel &5Malum&r."
		""
		"Werkzeug und die &6Seelenstahl-Sense&r treffen Körper und Seele zugleich und ernten Spirit Arcana. Die Rüstung hat eigene Rezepte, weil reiner Seelenstahl auch deine Seele berührt."
	]
	quest.4A5680E2772D9840.quest_subtitle: "Malum: Waffen, die die Seele treffen."
	quest.4A5680E2772D9840.title: "&5Schmiede Seelenstahl"
	quest.4A63D4D567B48BB9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_runes_thermalily.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Apothecary: &e1 red&r, &e2 orange&r petals, Runes of &eEarth&r and &eFire&r. It drinks lava next to it at its height."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/block/thermalily.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"A lava block gives 45 mana per tick for &e30 seconds&r, so &d27,000 mana&r. After that it cools down for &e5 minutes&r. Lava it touches during the pause it swallows without mana and restarts the pause."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A Create Hose Pulley over a lava lake in the Nether supplies endless lava, an open pipe end places it as a block next to the flower. Only give one block every 5 minutes."
	]
	quest.4A63D4D567B48BB9.quest_subtitle: "Lava in, a lot of mana out."
	quest.4A63D4D567B48BB9.title: "&6Plant a Thermalily"
	quest.4A6B5FD3C4EFCC2F.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: a &6Dislocator&r, a &6Draconium Core&r and a &6ghast tear&r. With two Dislocators instead of one it becomes the point to point version that links two Dislocators with each other."
		""
		"Right click binds it to you. Give it to a fellow player: with a right click they land next to you, as long as you are online. The number of jumps is limited."
		""
		"Handy when someone gets lost in the End or the group gathers before a fight."
	]
	quest.4A6B5FD3C4EFCC2F.quest_subtitle: "A jump to your fellow player."
	quest.4A6B5FD3C4EFCC2F.title: "&bBuild a Player Dislocator"
	quest.4A72ED683B865E82.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_advanced_bridge.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Build both 3 x 3 and put one half of the entangled pair into each chamber. The bridge then carries &e32 channels&r over any distance, even from the Nether or the End."
		""
		"Only the four rings on the sides take cables, not the corners. &cBoth sides have to be loaded.&r At the far end a &6Spatial Anchor&r helps, see spatial storage."
	]
	quest.4A72ED683B865E82.quest_subtitle: "A dense cable through every dimension."
	quest.4A72ED683B865E82.title: "&b&lConnect Two Places with a Quantum Bridge"
	quest.4A7CA79582CE03AD.quest_desc: [
		"Top steel, glass, steel, middle chest, circuit, chest, bottom three steel."
		""
		"It has &e54&r slots like a large chest. Who may open it you set in the security tab. Mined, it keeps its contents, and as an item you open it with right click right from the inventory: a backpack."
		""
		"The Chemical Oxidizer and later the Robit and QIO need it as an ingredient."
	]
	quest.4A7CA79582CE03AD.quest_subtitle: "54 slots that belong only to you."
	quest.4A7CA79582CE03AD.title: "&3Set up a Personal Chest"
	quest.4A8C437262AA3434.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_silver.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Silver Dungeons&r sind große Tempel aus &6Angelic Stone&r mit Säulen und Treppen, die frei im Himmel schweben. Sie sind selten, oft hunderte Blöcke voneinander entfernt. Ein Moa oder viel Holystone für Brücken bringt dich hin."
		""
		"Der Stein ist gesperrt, bis die Königin besiegt ist, und einige Blöcke sind Fallen. Chest Mimics gibt es auch hier."
		""
		"&eDie Truhen:&r Zanite Swords, Golden, Enchanted und Poison Dart Shooter, &6Moa Eggs&r (weiß und blau), Zanite Ring und Pendant, Healing Stones, Enchanted Berries, Golden Gummy Swets. Nimm einen Block Angelic Stone als Beleg mit, nach dem Sieg geht das."
	]
	quest.4A8C437262AA3434.quest_subtitle: "Ein weißer Tempel in den Wolken."
	quest.4A8C437262AA3434.title: "&f&lSilber-Dungeon"
	quest.4AA332C66BC04F8C.quest_desc: [
		"Kill a &cpiglin brute&r. They guard the bastions with golden axes, attack you despite gold armour and don't come back once dead."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r From stage 2, hostile mobs have &d30 percent&r more health, &d20 percent&r more damage and &d2&r extra armour points. A brute hits correspondingly hard; go with a shield and good armour."
	]
	quest.4AA332C66BC04F8C.quest_subtitle: "Gold doesn't impress him."
	quest.4AA332C66BC04F8C.title: "&cDefeat a piglin brute"
	quest.4AAAA9F78B6C3881.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Arcane Crystal&r in the furnace becomes &6Arcane Crystal Dust&r in 7.5 seconds, in the blast furnace in half the time."
		""
		"The dust is in almost every recipe of this chapter: Mundabitur Dust, Deorum, Aureal Bottle, Arcane Bone Meal (one dust and four bone meal give four). Smelt a stack right away."
	]
	quest.4AAAA9F78B6C3881.quest_subtitle: "Crystal into the furnace, dust out."
	quest.4AAAA9F78B6C3881.title: "&dSmelt Arcane Crystal Dust"
	quest.4AC74DFF7F405AB6.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Gold Dungeon&r ist eine große Insel aus rotem &6Hellfire Stone&r, bewacht von &6Fire Minions&r. Drinnen sitzt der &cSun Spirit&r, der Grund, warum im Aether nie die Sonne untergeht. Er schießt Feuerkugeln und &6Fire Crystals&r, dazwischen &6Ice Crystals&r, die durch den Raum springen. Prallt einer seiner eigenen Eiskristalle gegen ihn, ist er kurz eingefroren, und &enur dann&r kannst du ihn verletzen."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r der &6Gold Dungeon Key&r, der &6Sun Altar&r, mit dem du die Tageszeit im Aether stellst, und die Schatzkammer mit &6Phoenix Armor&r (Feuerresistenz, schwimmen in Lava; in Wasser wird sie zur &6Obsidian Armor&r), &6Gravitite&r-Rüstung und -Waffen, &6Enchanted Gravitite&r, &6Life Shards&r (ein Herz mehr, bis zu zehn), &6Vampire Blade&r, &6Pig Slayer&r und &6Iron Bubble&r."
		""
		"Sun Altar, Phoenix-, Obsidian- und Gravitite-Ausrüstung öffnen mit &6Stufe 3 (Stahlwerk)&r. Der Kampf lohnt sich darum erst dann. Nach seinem Tod wird es im Aether zum ersten Mal Nacht."
	]
	quest.4AC74DFF7F405AB6.quest_subtitle: "Der Sun Spirit und das Ende des ewigen Tages."
	quest.4AC74DFF7F405AB6.title: "&c&lGold-Dungeon: kommt in Stufe 3"
	quest.4AD3365B683EE324.quest_desc: [
		"&6Simple Magnets&r, &6Magnet&r: zieht Gegenstände und Erfahrung bis &e5 Blöcke&r weit zu dir, solange er an ist. Der &6Fortgeschrittene Magnet&r reicht &e3 bis 11 Blöcke&r, einstellbar, mit Filter. Beide &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Rezepte in EMI. Mit der Taste im Tastenmenü schaltest du ihn an und aus. Eine &6Entmagnetisierungsspule&r hält einen Bereich frei, zum Beispiel über dem Werfer deines Handelsplatzes."
		""
		"Dasselbe steckt im &6Magnet-Upgrade&r des Rucksacks, siehe Kapitel Lager."
	]
	quest.4AD3365B683EE324.quest_subtitle: "Simple Magnets, Magnet: zieht Gegenstände und XP zu dir."
	quest.4AD3365B683EE324.title: "Trag einen Magneten"
	quest.4AEDDD3FE376D864.quest_desc: [
		"An &6HV Accumulator&r, a &6Wooden Grip&r, two &6steel ingots&r, two &6Electrum Coil Blocks&r and an &6Advanced Electronic Component&r make the &6Railgun&r."
		""
		"Hold right click until the charge reaches &e99&r, then let go. It fires iron, aluminium and steel rods or Graphite Electrodes from your inventory, blaze rods set targets on fire."
		""
		"Its own storage is small. Wear the Accumulator Backpack with it."
	]
	quest.4AEDDD3FE376D864.quest_subtitle: "Rods with power at top speed."
	quest.4AEDDD3FE376D864.title: "&d&lBuild a Railgun"
	quest.4AFD8617B07FB3C7.quest_desc: [
		"Kill a &bBreeze&r. It jumps around and shoots &6wind charges&r that knock you back. It deflects arrows, so get close."
		""
		"It drops &6Breeze Rods&r. You can throw the four &6wind charges&r from one rod yourself: thrown at the ground, they fling you up."
	]
	quest.4AFD8617B07FB3C7.quest_subtitle: "The guardian of the trial chambers."
	quest.4AFD8617B07FB3C7.title: "&bDefeat a Breeze"
	quest.4AFF62A58F9013D4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/productive_trees_sawmill_run.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r oben Bretter, ein &6Stamm&r, Bretter, in der Mitte drei &6Eisenbarren&r, unten drei Bretter. Leg eine &6Axt&r in den Werkzeugslot des &6Entrinders&r und Stämme oder Holz in den Eingang, alle halbe Sekunde kommt ein entrindeter Block heraus."
		""
		"Die Axt verliert pro Block einen Punkt Haltbarkeit, eine Steinaxt schafft also 131 Stämme. Mit Reparatur hält sie entsprechend länger, Haltbarkeit ist alles, was zählt."
		""
		"Der vierte Slot ist der &eRindenslot&r: Bei Zimt-, Korkeichen- und Slimy-Delight-Stämmen fällt dort &6Zimt&r, &6Kork&r oder ein &6Schleimball&r an, pro Stamm einer. Von Hand mit der Axt klappt das auch, dann liegt es am Boden."
	]
	quest.4AFF62A58F9013D4.quest_subtitle: "Eine Axt im Block entrindet stapelweise."
	quest.4AFF62A58F9013D4.title: "&6Bau den Entrinder"
	quest.4B0355F97624DC9C.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Sky stone dust in the corners, an Accumulation Processor at the top, three 256k components, a &6draconium ingot&r in the middle. Housing: polarized quartz glass at the top, sky stone dust on the sides, three Sky Steel Ingots at the bottom."
		""
		"The 63 types stay. Large cells pay off for a few kinds in huge amounts: cobblestone, ores, everything from the quarry."
	]
	quest.4B0355F97624DC9C.quest_subtitle: "A thousand k in one cell."
	quest.4B0355F97624DC9C.title: "&6&lBuild the First 1M Cell"
	quest.4B049DD65F08B03B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/silent_gear_alloy_forge.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Top &6quartz block, glass, quartz block&r. Middle &6polished blackstone, glass, polished blackstone&r. Bottom polished blackstone, &6block of Blaze Gold&r, polished blackstone."
		""
		"The &6Starlight Charger&r collects charge at night when it can see the sky. Catalyst I is Blaze Gold dust, II Azure Silver dust, III starmetal dust."
	]
	quest.4B049DD65F08B03B.quest_subtitle: "Only at night, only under open sky."
	quest.4B049DD65F08B03B.title: "&dCharge material in starlight"
	quest.4B1FFEBB49E3BCCA.quest_desc: [
		"In the Crystal Assembler: an &6ME Drive&r, two glass cables, a Capacity Card and a &6Concurrent Processor&r give the &6ME Extended Drive&r. The &6ME Extended Pattern Provider&r has many more slots than a normal one."
		""
		"Extended AE's upgrade items swap a placed device for its Ex version with a sneak right click, settings and contents stay."
	]
	quest.4B1FFEBB49E3BCCA.quest_subtitle: "Twenty cells instead of ten."
	quest.4B1FFEBB49E3BCCA.title: "&3&lBuild an Extended Drive"
	quest.4B2A67A0EE7062A7.quest_desc: [
		"An &6iron ingot&r and a &6Powdered Coal&r give one &6Steel Ingot&r from Oritech."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Every steel ingot counts at the obelisk for &6The Furnace Never Sleeps&r. A SAG Mill for powdered coal in front, a chest behind: a small steel line."
	]
	quest.4B2A67A0EE7062A7.quest_subtitle: "Iron and powdered coal, one ingot."
	quest.4B2A67A0EE7062A7.title: "&7Alloy Steel"
	quest.4B32735919C952AE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eternal_starlight_garden.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Find the &5Cursed Garden&r, a hedge maze full of &6Tangled&r. Slay &610 Tangled&r on the way to the middle."
		""
		"After death a Tangled releases a &6Tangled Skull&r that flies through walls and explodes. Area weapons like scythes and &6Sonar Bombs&r work best here."
		""
		"&cA must:&r flint and steel or a weapon with Fire Aspect. Without fire you will not get through the boss's skin."
	]
	quest.4B32735919C952AE.quest_subtitle: "Preparing for the third boss."
	quest.4B32735919C952AE.title: "&5Enter the Cursed Garden"
	quest.4B3C9198184A1E8D.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Ender, 1 Powdered Iron&r, cloth."
		""
		"When an arrow would hit you, you jump to a random spot nearby instead, like an enderman. Costs &d50 mana&r and gives a fixed number of jumps, not a fixed time."
	]
	quest.4B3C9198184A1E8D.quest_subtitle: "Arrows hit nothing."
	quest.4B3C9198184A1E8D.title: "&5Draw Protective Displacement"
	quest.4B423869A8D5E500.quest_desc: [
		"Worktable: &6iron chestplate&r in the middle, a &6Soul Shard&r above it, &e3 Enchanted Ash&r left, right and below, &e4 Pewter Inlay&r in the extra slots."
		""
		"You wear the mail under your armor as a curio. Then your armor also blocks magic damage that would otherwise go straight through it. Good against witches, evokers and magical bosses."
	]
	quest.4B423869A8D5E500.quest_subtitle: "Protection against magic."
	quest.4B423869A8D5E500.title: "&5Consecrate a Warded Mail"
	quest.4B49BF825D8BF19A.quest_desc: [
		"Eine &6Energiekarte&r in einem &6Laserknoten&r zieht Strom aus dem Block an dieser Seite oder gibt ihn ab. Die Knoten verbindest du mit dem Laserschlüssel, der Strom springt als Laser von Knoten zu Knoten."
		""
		"&eLaserIO, Energiekarte:&r bis &d1 000 000 FE/t&r je Karte. Dieselben Knoten tragen auch Items und Flüssigkeiten, eine Leitung für alles. Offen ab Stufe 3, siehe Kapitel &6Logistik&r."
	]
	quest.4B49BF825D8BF19A.quest_subtitle: "LaserIO: Energiekarten in Laserknoten, bis 1 Million FE/t."
	quest.4B49BF825D8BF19A.title: "&dSchick Strom per Laser"
	quest.4B4E9B5A5A019147.quest_desc: [
		"The upgrade base in the middle, &6eight iron blocks&r around it."
		""
		"Every slot holds &etwice&r as much, 128 stone instead of 64. Expensive in stage 1, but it makes the leather backpack as big as two chests. Tier 2 (fourfold) comes with the Brass Works."
	]
	quest.4B4E9B5A5A019147.quest_subtitle: "Stack Upgrade Tier 1 from iron."
	quest.4B4E9B5A5A019147.title: "Double every slot"
	quest.4B55AB4C0358AE0B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wooden slab&r, &6Andesite Casing&r and &6Piston Extension Pole&r make the &6Mechanical Piston&r. More poles sit behind it (planks and alloy, eight at a time), one per block of stroke."
		""
		"It retracts when the rotation changes direction, easiest with a gearshift. With a slime ball it becomes a &6Sticky Mechanical Piston&r."
	]
	quest.4B55AB4C0358AE0B.quest_subtitle: "Up to 64 blocks of stroke."
	quest.4B55AB4C0358AE0B.title: "&6Push with the piston"
	quest.4B7814CD22951FE2.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Kristallresonanzgenerator&r kommt an ein ME-Kabel und versorgt das Netz von selbst. Kein Brennstoff, kein Kabel von einem Kraftwerk."
		""
		"&eApplied Energistics 2, Kristallresonanzgenerator:&r &d20 AE pro Tick&r, Tag und Nacht. Für ein kleines Lagernetz reichen ein paar Stück, und der Strom der Basis bleibt für die Maschinen. Offen ab Stufe 3, siehe Kapitel &6Applied Energistics 2&r."
	]
	quest.4B7814CD22951FE2.quest_subtitle: "Applied Energistics 2: 20 AE pro Tick ins ME-Netz, ohne Brennstoff."
	quest.4B7814CD22951FE2.title: "&bStell einen Kristallresonanzgenerator"
	quest.4B7D1B3027AEA796.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fluid Extractor:&r Pity, 500 FE per operation, optional."
		"&6Latex Processing Unit:&r Pity, 20 FE/t. &6Dissolution Chamber:&r Pity, 90 FE/t."
		"&6Pitiful Generator:&r Pity, gives 30 FE/t."
		"&6Bioreactor:&r Pity, 400 FE per operation. &6Biofuel Generator:&r Pity, gives 160 FE/t."
		"&6Sludge Refiner:&r Pity, 40 FE/t, processes the Plant Gatherer's sludge."
		"&6Dye Mixer:&r Pity, 30 FE/t. &6Material StoneWork Factory:&r Advanced, 60 FE/t, cobblestone from water and lava."
	]
	quest.4B7D1B3027AEA796.quest_subtitle: "Latex, power and workshop, with power use."
	quest.4B7D1B3027AEA796.title: "&6&lCheck Off the Basic Machines"
	quest.4B82B0A09009404B.quest_desc: [
		"&eFlight:&r elytra or the flight module in a Draconic chestpiece."
		"&eShield:&r a chestpiece with many shield modules and shield recovery."
		"&eSecond life:&r an Undying Module or Totems of Undying."
		"&eRanged:&r a strong bow with damage and speed modules."
		""
		"The fight takes place in the air and over the abyss. The Guardian's shield has &e16,000&r points, and Draconic Evolution itself says that a fast, strong bow melts it best."
	]
	quest.4B82B0A09009404B.quest_subtitle: "Four things you do not fly there without."
	quest.4B82B0A09009404B.title: "&dCheck Off Your Gear"
	quest.4B8F89673DFEBCA1.quest_desc: [
		"Pflanz eine &6Eiche&r und eine &6Birke&r so, dass Blätter von beiden höchstens &e4 Blöcke&r von einem &6Bienennest&r oder &6Bienenstock&r entfernt sind, und setz Blumen daneben. Jedes Mal, wenn eine Biene von einer Blume heimkommt, versucht sie, ein Blatt in der Nähe zu bestäuben."
		""
		"Eiche und Birke ergeben mit 50 Prozent eine &6Buche&r oder mit 55 Prozent eine &6Silberlinde&r. Weitere Paare aus Vanilla-Bäumen: Fichte und Birke die &6Europäische Lärche&r (10 Prozent), Schwarzeiche und Tropenbaum &6Teak&r (40), Tropenbaum und Kirsche &6Kakao&r (35), Kirsche und Eiche den &6Red-Delicious-Apfelbaum&r (10)."
		""
		"Bestäubte Blätter erkennst du mit dem &6Fernrohr&r. Aus ihnen kommt der Setzling der neuen Art. Pflanz ihn, und du hast einen Baum, den es in dieser Welt sonst nirgends gibt."
	]
	quest.4B8F89673DFEBCA1.quest_subtitle: "Eiche und Birke ergeben Buche oder Linde."
	quest.4B8F89673DFEBCA1.title: "&eLass Bienen Bäume kreuzen"
	quest.4B9042DBF504BABB.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r like the breaker, only with a &6dispenser&r instead of the observer in the middle."
		""
		"The &6Simple Block Placer&r places the block from its inventory in front of it. With the direction button you set which way round it places it, for example torches on a wall."
		""
		"&eThis is how a goo line starts:&r The placer puts iron blocks next to the goo, a hopper refills it, and a breaker set to Redstone High waits for the finished Raw Ferricore Block. What gives it the signal is under the sensor."
	]
	quest.4B9042DBF504BABB.quest_subtitle: "Breaker and placer, the pair for every line."
	quest.4B9042DBF504BABB.title: "&7Build the Block Placer"
	quest.4B906184EDD78418.quest_desc: [
		"&6Refined Storage&r, &6Laufwerk&r mit acht Zellen: 1k &e1 024&r Stück, 4k 4 096, 16k &e16 384&r, egal wie viele Sorten. Konsole, Importeur und Exporteur, Externer Speicher, Autocrafting mit Mustern und Autoherstellern, drahtlose Konsole. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"Keine Kanäle, keine Typen, dafür weniger Zellplatz als AE2. 64k öffnet in Stufe 4. Siehe Kapitel Refined Storage."
	]
	quest.4B906184EDD78418.quest_subtitle: "Refined Storage, Laufwerk: Zellen ohne Typenzahl."
	quest.4B906184EDD78418.title: "Lies: Refined Storage"
	quest.4B93ECF961BA2049.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Sevira's Permanent Confinement."
		"&6Bowls:&r your &6Golden Ritual Bowl&r, &6Research Fragment Dust&r, a &bSpirit Attuned Crystal&r, an &6Iesnium block&r, an &cAfrit Essence&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Afrit book, 300 seconds."
		""
		"Place it in the middle instead of the golden bowl. It works like the golden one, only every ritual runs &d4 times&r as fast. The Unbound Afrit for the essence then comes after less than 40 seconds instead of two and a half minutes."
	]
	quest.4B93ECF961BA2049.quest_subtitle: "Every ritual in a quarter of the time."
	quest.4B93ECF961BA2049.title: "&6Bind the Iesnium Ritual Bowl"
	quest.4B98DC0BAB7B907B.quest_desc: [
		"Der &cAncient Remnant&r hat &e450 Lebenspunkte&r, Rüstung 12 und schlägt für 25. Sein Ansturm nimmt dir &e10 Prozent&r deiner maximalen Lebenspunkte, Erdbeben und Steinsäulen machen je 11. Treffer über 21 werden gekappt, mehr als 14 Schaden pro Sekunde kommen nicht durch, und ab 14 Blöcken Abstand bist du zu weit weg."
		""
		"&eSo geht es:&r Bleib nah dran und seitlich. Beim Ansturm zur Seite springen, gegen den Wüstensturm hinter eine Säule. Wenn er in die Wand rennt, ist er kurz benommen, dann draufhauen."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r &6Sandsturm in einer Flasche&r (Rechtsklick ruft zwei kreisende Sandstürme), &6Remnant-Schädel&r (ruft einen Modern Remnant, zähmbar mit einem Schnüffler-Ei) und ein &6Altmetallblock&r, also 9 Barren. Daraus wird der &6Alte Speer&r (4 Barren, Linksklick schießt einen Sandsturm, 9,5 Schaden)."
		""
		"An seinem Platz erscheint ein &6Boss-Wiederbeleber&r. Rechtsklick mit einem &6Wüstenauge&r (ab Stufe 2) darauf, und der Kampf geht von vorn los."
	]
	quest.4B98DC0BAB7B907B.quest_subtitle: "450 Lebenspunkte, Panzer aus Altmetall."
	quest.4B98DC0BAB7B907B.title: "&c&lBesiege den Ancient Remnant"
	quest.4BC868DB964448DD.quest_desc: [
		"Every machine has a cost per RPM. &eUsage = value times speed.&r The press costs 8 SU per RPM, so 256 SU at 32 RPM: exactly one water wheel."
		""
		"If the usage is higher than the sources give, the network is &coverstressed&r and everything stops. Then more source, less speed or a second network helps."
		""
		"From &d30 RPM&r a speed counts as medium, from &d100&r as fast, the maximum is &d256&r. Shafts, cogwheels, gearboxes and belts cost nothing. What each machine costs is in the section below."
	]
	quest.4BC868DB964448DD.quest_subtitle: "Sources give SU, machines use them."
	quest.4BC868DB964448DD.title: "&dUnderstand RPM and SU"
	quest.4BCD51D154767897.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cobblestone&r: &e131&r durability, speed &e4&r, stone mining level, Ancient I (more experience)."
		""
		"The head for the first day. Costs nothing."
	]
	quest.4BCD51D154767897.quest_subtitle: "131 durability, speed 4."
	quest.4BCD51D154767897.title: "&7Stone"
	quest.4BCEFE5EDA745EF0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Hammer:&r string and cobblestone on top, cobblestone and stick in the middle, a stick at the bottom. &6Knowledge Compendium:&r leather, paper, red dye."
		""
		"Mahou Tsukai opens in &6stage 4&r. No machines, no altars: a circle of your own blood, three powders in, and the scroll is done. The compendium shows every spell with this server's costs."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The magic pillar of stage 4 wants &e30 Mystic Staffs&r from this chapter, a fixed number, plus 128 Gaia Spirits from Botania."
	]
	quest.4BCEFE5EDA745EF0.quest_subtitle: "Magic from blood, powder and cloth."
	quest.4BCEFE5EDA745EF0.title: "&c&lBuild the Hammer and the Compendium"
	quest.4BD416540A4C1CDD.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/undergarden_infuser.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Crafting table: &65 Dreadrock&r, &61 Rogdorium&r and &61 Utheric Cluster&r make the &6Infuser&r. It runs on Rogdorium."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r A Utheric Cluster becomes a &6Utherium Crystal&r in it in 10 seconds. You can infuse armor in it with Rogdorium."
	]
	quest.4BD416540A4C1CDD.quest_subtitle: "Clusters become crystals."
	quest.4BD416540A4C1CDD.title: "&dBuild the Infuser"
	quest.4BE024A205775B96.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_water_wheel.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Eight &6planks&r around a &6Shaft&r make a &6Water Wheel&r. Place it so that &bflowing water&r runs over its paddles, ideally from above onto one side."
		""
		"One wheel gives &d8 RPM&r and &d256 SU&r (32 SU per RPM). Several wheels on one shaft add up their SU, not their speed. Four wheels on a stream are a solid start."
		""
		"&cCommon mistake:&r The water flows underneath the wheel. Still water turns nothing. The type of wood is only looks."
	]
	quest.4BE024A205775B96.quest_subtitle: "Your first real power source."
	quest.4BE024A205775B96.title: "&6Put a water wheel into the stream"
	quest.4BE1ED568848DAC9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_pg_generator.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Crafter recipe: &6pins&r (two copper nuggets), two &6coal&r, &6copper sheet&r, two &6andesite alloys&r, &6shaft&r and &6andesite casing&r make the &6generator collector&r. It goes at the end of the rotor, 8 SU per RPM."
		""
		"The load goes on its terminals. For power to be made, the stator needs an &dexcitation current&r, for example through an adapter from another source."
		""
		"The Ponder scenes (&eW&r) show the setup. Hands off the spinning rotor."
	]
	quest.4BE1ED568848DAC9.quest_subtitle: "The generator supplies voltage."
	quest.4BE1ED568848DAC9.title: "&3&lConnect the collector"
	quest.4BE4170AF0226CEE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_pg_magnet.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Conductive casing&r, five &6copper coils&r and an &6iron sheet&r make the &6electromagnet&r. With power it magnetises &6andesite alloy&r on a depot or belt below."
		"{image:powergrid:textures/item/magnet.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"That is why the motor only comes after the generator."
	]
	quest.4BE4170AF0226CEE.quest_subtitle: "The electromagnet makes magnets."
	quest.4BE4170AF0226CEE.title: "&3Magnetise andesite alloy"
	quest.4BE4EE2D7DB86A2B.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: a &6gold armor piece&r in the middle, &e4 Magebloom Fiber&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"The Sorcerer protects least but has the best thread slots: chest and leggings already have a size 2 slot without an upgrade. Battlemage is the opposite, Arcanist in between."
	]
	quest.4BE4EE2D7DB86A2B.quest_subtitle: "Little protection, the strongest threads."
	quest.4BE4EE2D7DB86A2B.title: "&6Sew the Sorcerer's Robes"
	quest.4BF437761846EE2C.quest_desc: [
		"Read the &cOverworld Bosses&r chapter before you enter a pyramid in the desert, a prison in the snow, a sunken city, an old factory or an acropolis above the sea."
		""
		"That is where the five L_Ender's Cataclysm bosses stand in the right order, plus the dark towers of Born in Chaos and the creatures of Mowzie's Mobs."
	]
	quest.4BF437761846EE2C.quest_subtitle: "Arenas for real bosses. Not alone."
	quest.4BF437761846EE2C.title: "&cKnow the dangerous places"
	quest.4BF4498213060C57.quest_desc: [
		"&6Botania&r, &6Hopperhock&r: eine Funktionsblume, die herumliegende Gegenstände in ihrer Nähe aufhebt und in angrenzende Inventare legt. Mana ist freiwillig und vergrößert die Reichweite. Filter über Rahmen an den Truhen. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Aus der Blütenapotheke, siehe Kapitel Botania. Mit dem Zauberstab des Waldes im Funktionsmodus wechselst du die Sortierregel."
		""
		"Unter einer Mobfalle oder hinter einer Kakteenfarm ersetzt eine Blume den ganzen Trichterboden."
	]
	quest.4BF4498213060C57.quest_subtitle: "Botania, Hopperhock: sammelt vom Boden in die Truhe daneben."
	quest.4BF4498213060C57.title: "Pflanz eine Trichterblume"
	quest.4BF5047D4A9055F9.quest_desc: [
		"Vier &6Flux-Kerne&r in Kreuzform um einen &6Redstoneblock&r ergeben den &6Flux-Punkt&r (Flux Point). Er ist das billigere Gerät, denn davon brauchst du viele."
		""
		"Ein Punkt drückt Strom aus dem Netz aktiv in alle Blöcke, die an ihm anliegen: Maschinen, Speicher, Kabel. Er holt sich pro Tick so viel aus dem Netz, wie seine Nachbarn annehmen, bis zu &d800.000 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Ein Punkt hat sechs Seiten, ein Punkt zwischen zwei Maschinen versorgt also beide. Kosten pro Punkt: 4 Staub, 4 Obsidian, ein Quelljuwel, ein Redstoneblock."
	]
	quest.4BF5047D4A9055F9.quest_subtitle: "Hier kommt der Strom wieder heraus."
	quest.4BF5047D4A9055F9.title: "&c&lBau einen Flux-Punkt"
	quest.4BFFFD5215CE391C.quest_desc: [
		"Place &eexactly 10 bookshelves&r at the table (Eterna 20, no more), put a &6carrot&r into the enchanting table. The third slot lights up: click it, it costs 3 lapis and experience, and out comes a &6Golden Carrot&r."
		""
		"This is how &6infusion&r works: a recipe asks for certain values of Eterna, Quanta and Arcana, sometimes with an upper limit. If they match, the item in the third slot is transformed. The carrot wants Eterna exactly 20 and Quanta between 10 and 30, the 15 percent of the empty table is enough."
		""
		"All infusion recipes are in EMI under the enchanting table. Honey bottles become bottles of enchanting from Eterna 20, at Eterna 60 eight of them."
	]
	quest.4BFFFD5215CE391C.quest_subtitle: "A carrot turns golden."
	quest.4BFFFD5215CE391C.title: "&eYour First Infusion"
	quest.4C00C2E9E0EB9370.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Hedyrin's Lure."
		"&6Bowls:&r &e4 bones&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r a &6chicken&r nearby when the grey particles come."
		""
		"The skeleton doesn't burn in the sun and always drops a &6skeleton skull&r. Ophyx' Calling needs 4 skulls, Strigeor's Higher Binding 8."
	]
	quest.4C00C2E9E0EB9370.quest_subtitle: "Skulls for stronger pentacles."
	quest.4C00C2E9E0EB9370.title: "&5Summon a Possessed Skeleton"
	quest.4C0F41780FE33540.quest_desc: [
		"&6Electron Tube&r, &6brass ingot&r and &6dried kelp&r on top of each other make two &6Brass Funnels&r."
		""
		"It has a &efilter slot&r for an item or a filter and an adjustable &ecount&r. An &6Attribute Filter&r (brass nugget and wool) filters by properties, such as everything enchanted."
	]
	quest.4C0F41780FE33540.quest_subtitle: "One item, one count."
	quest.4C0F41780FE33540.title: "&6Filter with the brass funnel"
	quest.4C1E38CDD2758689.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_channels.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Almost every device needs a &echannel&r. A normal cable carries &e8&r, a &6dense cable&r (four covered cables) carries &e32&r. Build like a tree: dense cables as branches from the controller, normal cables as twigs, at most eight devices per twig."
		""
		"Channels run the shortest way from the controller, first through dense, then through normal cables. If that way is full, devices stay dark, even when an empty cable lies next to it."
		""
		"&6Smart Cables&r show with stripes how many channels run through them. &eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r four covered cables in the corners, redstone at the top and bottom, glowstone left and right, an &6Electron Tube&r from Create in the middle, gives four."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Cable colours have nothing to do with channels. Two cables of different colours just do not connect."
	]
	quest.4C1E38CDD2758689.quest_subtitle: "8 per cable, 32 per dense cable."
	quest.4C1E38CDD2758689.title: "&e&lUnderstand channels"
	quest.4C251A5FBF288288.quest_desc: [
		"In the pattern encoding terminal, mode &eProcessing&r: &6Silicon&r at the top, &6Printed Silicon&r below as the result. Put the pattern into a provider that sits directly against an Inscriber with a Silicon Press."
		""
		"The result has to get back into the network. The easiest way is for the machine to push it back into the provider (auto output or a pipe), otherwise use an Import Bus."
		""
		"It works the same with every furnace, every Mekanism machine and every mixer."
	]
	quest.4C251A5FBF288288.quest_subtitle: "A processing pattern at the Inscriber."
	quest.4C251A5FBF288288.title: "&aLet a machine work for you"
	quest.4C39C948ACC593B6.quest_desc: [
		"Deliver &6256 brass ingots&r and &632 precision mechanisms&r. They are handed in by hand at the obelisk; sneak and right-click hands in everything that fits."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The tech pillar wants 2,000 ingots, 150 mechanisms and 8 hearts. For that you need several superheated mixers, copper and zinc from crushing and washing, a tube line and at least one precision line."
		""
		"The magicians need your brass casings, you need their Source Gems and Runes of Fire. At 98 percent the obelisk stops; the last load goes in together on the streams."
	]
	quest.4C39C948ACC593B6.quest_subtitle: "The stage 2 goal: the brass machine."
	quest.4C39C948ACC593B6.title: "&6&lFeed the obelisk with brass"
	quest.4C409EA09C0F18B8.quest_desc: [
		"Left and right &e3 Livingwood logs&r each, top and bottom middle &6leather&r, the &6Horn of the Wild&r in the middle."
		""
		"When a mana burst hits the drum, it tears out all plant growth around it, just like the horn. It stores no mana, so it needs a &6Pulse Mana Spreader&r on a redstone clock."
		""
		"With hoppers or a Hopperhock from stage 2 this becomes a harvest that runs on its own."
	]
	quest.4C409EA09C0F18B8.quest_subtitle: "The horn as a block, for the farm."
	quest.4C409EA09C0F18B8.title: "&6Build a Drum of the Wild"
	quest.4C4808B2A74297E8.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eternal_starlight_monstrosity.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Set it on fire, then it becomes vulnerable. Without fire most weapons barely do damage. It mostly stays in place, but sometimes digs in and pops up next to you."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r &6Crescent Spear&r, &6Moonring Bow&r, &6Wand of Teleportation&r, Crescent Pendant, &6Tenacious Petals&r and &6Tenacious Vines&r."
	]
	quest.4C4808B2A74297E8.quest_subtitle: "Boss 3 of 3."
	quest.4C4808B2A74297E8.title: "&5&lDefeat the Lunar Monstrosity"
	quest.4C5101A01AB75191.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &e64 raw iron&r. With &6Ultimine&r you clear whole veins at once."
		""
		"You need iron all the time: Create parts, buckets, cooking pot, Silent Gear, iron nuggets for andesite alloy. Take copper along right away."
	]
	quest.4C5101A01AB75191.quest_subtitle: "The mine is there to be cleared out."
	quest.4C5101A01AB75191.title: "&6Mine iron in bulk"
	quest.4C6403D8C1E5AABA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/undergarden_arrival.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eDer Schlüssel:&r der &6Katalysator&r. &eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r &e4 Stahlbarren&r in den Ecken, &e4 Stein&r an den Seiten und eine &6Enderperle&r in der Mitte."
		"&eDas Portal:&r Ein Rahmen aus &6Steinziegeln&r (auch rissig, bemoost, gemeißelt, oder Tiefschieferziegel) wie ein Netherportal, dann Rechtsklick mit dem Katalysator."
		""
		"&eDrüben:&r ewige Nacht, Pilze, Moderwesen, die dich anstecken, und vier Erze: &6Cloggrum&r, &6Froststahl&r, &6Utherium&r und &6Regalium&r. Betten funktionieren. Ein Block dort sind &evier&r in der Oberwelt."
		""
		"&eMitnehmen:&r 64 Fackeln, ein Bett, Essen, Pfeile, Rüstung. Alles Weitere im Kapitel &2Der Undergarden&r."
	]
	quest.4C6403D8C1E5AABA.quest_subtitle: "Steinziegel und ein Katalysator. Stufe 3."
	quest.4C6403D8C1E5AABA.title: "&2Öffne den Undergarden"
	quest.4C6B8A361409ED3A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Steel&r from Mekanism or Immersive Engineering counts as a material."
		""
		"&e500&r durability, speed &e6&r, +4 damage, Malleable V. As a rod +25 percent durability. The workhorse of stage 2."
	]
	quest.4C6B8A361409ED3A.quest_subtitle: "500 durability, speed 6."
	quest.4C6B8A361409ED3A.title: "&7Put steel in the head"
	quest.4C6EC1A3A1353E98.quest_desc: [
		"&6Befallener Sculk&r sieht aus wie normaler Sculk und steckt in Adern im Sculkgestein. Brichst du ihn ohne Behutsamkeit, wirst du zurückgestoßen und heraus kommen &6Sculk-Egel&r oder ein &4Shriek-Wurm&r."
		""
		"&eSculk-Egel:&r Winzig, &e4 Lebenspunkte&r, in Gruppen. Sie lassen &6Seelenstaub&r fallen. Mit &eBehutsamkeit&r bekommst du statt dessen einfach Sculk."
	]
	quest.4C6EC1A3A1353E98.quest_subtitle: "Egel oder ein Wurm, beides unangenehm."
	quest.4C6EC1A3A1353E98.title: "&cBrich Befallenen Sculk auf"
	quest.4C76F7AEDA486664.quest_desc: [
		"Wyvern-Stück als Katalysator, 8 Injektoren mit 4 Netherit, Wyvernkern, 2 Erwachten Barren, Drakonischem Energiekern, 32 Millionen OP. Kapitel &5Draconic: Erwacht und Chaos&r."
		""
		"Die &6Drakonische Brustplatte&r mit Schildkapazität, Flug und Untod-Modul ist die Rüstung für den Chaoswächter. Der &6Drakonische Bogen&r schmilzt seinen Schild von 16 000 am schnellsten."
	]
	quest.4C76F7AEDA486664.quest_subtitle: "Draconic Evolution: Schild, Flug, Untod."
	quest.4C76F7AEDA486664.title: "&dFusioniere Drakonisch"
	quest.4C83C592231CEA3B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_transport_hose_pulley.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Create&r, &6Schlauchaufzug&r: lässt einen Schlauch bis &e128 Blöcke&r tief herab und pumpt den See darunter leer oder füllt ihn, so schnell wie das angeschlossene Rohrnetz. Ein Gewässer ab &e10 000 Blöcken&r bleibt dabei unverändert: unendlich Wasser oder Lava. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Kupfergehäuse, Trockener-Seetang-Block, Kupferblech. Drehrichtung umkehren zieht den Schlauch ein."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Ein Ozean oder ein großer Lavasee im Nether (Stufe 2) am Schlauchaufzug versorgt Waschanlagen und Wärmegeneratoren für immer."
	]
	quest.4C83C592231CEA3B.quest_subtitle: "Create, Schlauchaufzug: ab 10 000 Blöcken unendlich."
	quest.4C83C592231CEA3B.title: "Häng einen Schlauchaufzug über den See"
	quest.4C8F23728456A495.quest_desc: [
		"&6Jade&r shows at the top middle which block or creature you are looking at and which mod it comes from. For furnaces and machines you see contents and progress, for plants their growth, for animals and monsters their hearts."
		""
		"Hold &eShift&r and Jade shows more details. &eNumpad 1&r hides and shows the window, &eNumpad 0&r opens the settings."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The mod name in the window tells you which chapter of the quest book to read."
	]
	quest.4C8F23728456A495.quest_subtitle: "What you look at is shown at the top of the screen."
	quest.4C8F23728456A495.title: "&6Read the Jade window"
	quest.4C911CA3C95AB42A.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &64 Tenacious Petals&r and &62 Tenacious Vines&r make the &6Petal Scythe&r. With Soul Dew, Petals and Vines become the Moonring Greatsword."
	]
	quest.4C911CA3C95AB42A.quest_subtitle: "The scythe from the Monstrosity's loot."
	quest.4C911CA3C95AB42A.title: "&dBuild the Petal Scythe"
	quest.4C91F9F44885805A.quest_desc: [
		"Jede Zeile hier ist ein Weg, &6Gegenstände&r, &bFlüssigkeiten&r, &aGase&r oder &dStrom&r zu bewegen oder zu lagern: Mod, Block, Durchsatz oder Fassung, ob es einen Filter gibt und ab welcher Stufe es geht."
		""
		"Hak ab, was du gebaut hast. Stufe-1-Zeilen wollen den Block sehen, spätere Zeilen sind ein Haken, sobald du sie kennst. Die Rezepte und Details stehen in den Modkapiteln, auf die jede Zeile zeigt."
		""
		"Vor jedem Abschnitt steht ein &eWas wann&r mit den zwei besten Wahlen pro Stufe. Wer nur das liest, baut nichts Falsches."
	]
	quest.4C91F9F44885805A.quest_subtitle: "Was Dinge bewegt und wo sie liegen bleiben."
	quest.4C91F9F44885805A.title: "&6&lTransport und Lager"
	quest.4C9474600262A331.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Containment Jar&r in the middle, &6Conjuration Essence&r, &6Manipulation Essence&r and an &6ender pearl&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Hold the Reliquary in the off hand and cast a spell with &dMark&r: it remembers the creature or the place. A spell with &dRecall&r then works exactly there, no matter where you stand."
	]
	quest.4C9474600262A331.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: the target for Mark and Recall."
	quest.4C9474600262A331.title: "&6Fill an Unstable Reliquary"
	quest.4C9C97509CF300BC.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r fünf &6Flux-Blöcke&r (oben links, oben rechts, unten alle drei), oben in der Mitte ein &6Flux-Kern&r, links und rechts je ein &6Flux-Staub&r und in die Mitte ein &6Fortschrittlicher Steuerschaltkreis&r von Mekanism."
		""
		"{image:fluxnetworks:textures/block/flux_controller.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Der Controller ist das Gerät für &edrahtloses Laden&r: Er zieht Strom aus dem Netz und füllt die Gegenstände, die Mitglieder am Körper tragen, überall auf der Welt. Pro Netzwerk ist nur &dein&r Controller erlaubt."
		""
		"Der Schaltkreis braucht Gedrucktes Silizium aus dem AE2-Inscriber, siehe Kapitel &5Mekanism: Fortgeschritten&r. Mit Blöcken, Kern und Staub stecken 21 Kerne im Controller, also 48 Staub, 21 Obsidian und sechs Quelljuwelen."
	]
	quest.4C9C97509CF300BC.quest_subtitle: "Lädt alles, was du am Körper trägst."
	quest.4C9C97509CF300BC.title: "&5&lBau den Flux-Controller"
	quest.4CA057DCFC11E077.quest_desc: [
		"Every ritual costs one &aTerrasteel Ingot&r, the beacon uses it up."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/terrasteel_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Keep the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate from stage 2 running. Sixteen fights for the obelisk are sixteen ingots."
	]
	quest.4CA057DCFC11E077.quest_subtitle: "One ingot per fight."
	quest.4CA057DCFC11E077.title: "&aKeep Terrasteel Ready as an Offering"
	quest.4CA75793302EBECF.quest_desc: [
		"Rose bush and &6Fertile Essence&r on top, &6vines&r, &6Void Tear&r, rose bush in the middle, stick and vines at the bottom give the &6Harvest Rod&r."
		""
		"It takes up to &e250 bone meal&r and 250 of each seed from your inventory. Shift mouse wheel switches the mode: bone meal, planting, hoe. Right click works on one block, holding right click on the whole area around you. When breaking, it harvests the crops around it too."
		""
		"&eTip:&r In a &6Pedestal&r it harvests, fertilizes and plants a field within &e4 blocks&r by itself."
	]
	quest.4CA75793302EBECF.quest_subtitle: "Bone meal, seeds and hoe in one rod."
	quest.4CA75793302EBECF.title: "&aBuild a Harvest Rod"
	quest.4CB2B54E2B6F8BE8.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e6 Zombies&r mit dem Learner im Inventar. Das Zombie-Modell ist das beste Übungsmodell: Zombies gibt es überall, und später liefert jede Zombie-Vorhersage &6acht Eisenbarren&r."
		""
		"Ein &8Faulty&r-Modell gibt &e1 Datenpunkt pro Kill&r und wird bei &e6 Datenpunkten&r zu &aBasic&r. Die Zahlen gelten für jede Mobart gleich, nur der Enderdrache und der Mimic haben eigene."
		""
		"Erst ab &aBasic&r nimmt die Simulationskammer das Modell überhaupt an. Faulty heißt: zu wenig Daten, die Kammer verweigert den Start."
	]
	quest.4CB2B54E2B6F8BE8.quest_subtitle: "Sechs Kills, und der Chip fängt an zu denken."
	quest.4CB2B54E2B6F8BE8.title: "&aBring ein Modell auf Basic"
	quest.4CB305BB245A9884.quest_desc: [
		"Every essence crop except Inferium has a &e10 percent&r chance to drop a &6Fertilized Essence&r when harvested. Stone Seeds are the easiest source."
		""
		"It works like bone meal, but on essence crops too. Four of them instead of bone meal in the Mystical Fertilizer recipe give 8 fertilizer instead of 4."
	]
	quest.4CB305BB245A9884.quest_subtitle: "Bone meal that works on essence crops."
	quest.4CB305BB245A9884.title: "&eHarvest Fertilized Essence"
	quest.4CC27A8782DF499A.quest_desc: [
		"Once the crystals are gone, the Guardian still has a shield of &e16,000&r and below it &e1,000 health&r. The shield can be hit as fast as you like: Draconic bows with damage and speed modules, all at once."
		""
		"Full shield modules, an Undying Module and flight belong on everyone who fights along."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The fight runs live on every stream. Whoever defeats it ends the season."
	]
	quest.4CC27A8782DF499A.quest_subtitle: "The finale of the season."
	quest.4CC27A8782DF499A.title: "&4&lDefeat the Chaos Guardian"
	quest.4CD234577732416F.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r four Blueprint Paper and three sticks. The crossbow limbs need &ethree&r material, plus a rod and a cord like the bow."
		""
		"It shoots like a vanilla crossbow. With Sinew Fiber or Fluffy String as the cord it hits harder."
	]
	quest.4CD234577732416F.quest_subtitle: "Like the pillagers' one, only made of your material."
	quest.4CD234577732416F.title: "&7String a crossbow"
	quest.4CD76CF6A51A5ABE.quest_desc: [
		"In the &6Isotopic Centrifuge&r &e10 mB of nuclear waste&r give &e1 mB of plutonium&r. In the Pressurized Reaction Chamber 1,000 mB become a &cPlutonium Pellet&r with water and fluorite dust."
		""
		"Every SPS casing needs one in the middle."
	]
	quest.4CD76CF6A51A5ABE.quest_subtitle: "Then pellets from it."
	quest.4CD76CF6A51A5ABE.title: "&cSpin Nuclear Waste into Plutonium"
	quest.4CE3E78D9929AB65.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6sugar cane&r, bamboo or saplings with &b250 mB water&r in the mixer make &6Pulp&r, the press turns it into &6Cardboard&r. Four cardboard are a &6Cardboard Block&r."
		"{image:create:textures/item/cardboard.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"The &6Packager&r (Cardboard Block, four iron ingots, two redstone) sits on a storage. With a redstone signal it packs the contents into a &6package&r, and it unpacks a package again."
		""
		"A &6sign&r with a name on the packager gives its packages an &eaddress&r."
	]
	quest.4CE3E78D9929AB65.quest_subtitle: "Cardboard, packager, address."
	quest.4CE3E78D9929AB65.title: "&6Pack a package"
	quest.4CEB661A02C734F7.quest_desc: [
		"The &6elytra&r fit into their own &ecurio slot&r on the back. Your chestplate stays on, and you still fly."
		""
		"The &6Create goggles&r also have their own slot. In the inventory the small button above your figure opens the curio slots."
	]
	quest.4CEB661A02C734F7.quest_subtitle: "The wings have their own slot."
	quest.4CEB661A02C734F7.title: "&bWear Elytra and Chestplate"
	quest.4CEC503F60C10794.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_controller.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Four stone&r in the corners, &6two comparators&r top and bottom, &6two planks&r on the sides, a Sophisticated barrel or chest of the wood tier in the middle."
		""
		"All chests and barrels that touch it or each other become one storage. Right click with an item stores it in the right place, hoppers and pipes on the controller distribute across the network. &6Storage Connectors&r (sticks and planks, gives four) bridge gaps."
		""
		"A real network with search only comes with &bApplied Energistics 2&r in stage 3."
	]
	quest.4CEC503F60C10794.quest_subtitle: "Many chests, one access."
	quest.4CEC503F60C10794.title: "&6Build a Storage Controller"
	quest.4D0475CCF887E8EF.quest_desc: [
		"Chaotic tier. Catalyst: the Draconic item. In eight injectors: &66 Awakened ingots&r, a &6Chaotic Core&r, a &6Chaotic Energy Controller&r. Costs 128 million energy."
		""
		"&6Chaotic Energy Controller:&r small Chaos Fragments in the corners, 4 Draconic Energy Controllers on the sides, a Draconic Core in the middle. With Chaotic weapons more Guardians become much easier."
	]
	quest.4D0475CCF887E8EF.quest_subtitle: "The end of the ladder."
	quest.4D0475CCF887E8EF.title: "&8Fuse Chaotic Gear"
	quest.4D09AA1B102B1CA6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/antimatter_waste.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Pump the &2nuclear waste&r from the waste port into a &6Solar Neutron Activator&r. &e10 mB of nuclear waste&r give &e1 mB of polonium&r. It needs open sky and works by day."
		""
		"Every mB of fuel becomes one mB of nuclear waste. For antimatter you mostly want polonium, so set up many activators."
	]
	quest.4D09AA1B102B1CA6.quest_subtitle: "What the reactor leaves behind is the raw material."
	quest.4D09AA1B102B1CA6.title: "&2Activate Nuclear Waste into Polonium"
	quest.4D0D2B41CE5E29E8.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &616 Raw Nickel&r. Nickel ore lies between &eY 40&r and the bottom of the world, densest around &eY -12&r. Smelt it into &6Nickel Ingots&r in a furnace."
		""
		"&6Oritech&r opens with stage 3: machines of steel and nickel, lasers, frame machines, a reactor and in the end upgrades to your own body."
		""
		"&eGood to know:&r Nickel from Immersive Engineering counts the same in every Oritech recipe."
	]
	quest.4D0D2B41CE5E29E8.quest_subtitle: "The metal Oritech is built from."
	quest.4D0D2B41CE5E29E8.title: "&6&lMine Nickel"
	quest.4D185A026BB61908.quest_desc: [
		"The &bPermafrost&r is a cooling plant made of several Freezes. It spits icy saliva that freezes the ground and throws Frozen Tubes in all directions. Keep moving."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r &6Coldsnap&r, Frozen Tubes and Oxidized Golem Steel Nuggets."
	]
	quest.4D185A026BB61908.quest_subtitle: "Boss 2 of 3."
	quest.4D185A026BB61908.title: "&b&lDefeat the Permafrost"
	quest.4D257506F1525346.quest_desc: [
		"&6Basic Belt&r: &e4 leather&r as a diamond. &6Calx of End&r: ender pearl and Enchanted Ash into the boiling Crucible, gives two."
		"Worktable: ender pearl at the top, &e2 feathers&r next to the belt, &6Lesser Soul Gem&r at the bottom. Extra: &e2 Calx of End&r and &e2 Pewter Inlay&r."
		""
		"The belt slows every fall a lot, and fall damage drops to a &dquarter&r. Anyone who builds a lot in caves and on towers takes it first."
	]
	quest.4D257506F1525346.quest_subtitle: "Fall like a feather."
	quest.4D257506F1525346.title: "&5Buckle On the Gravity Belt"
	quest.4D2B46C883E7C574.quest_desc: [
		"&6Quartz Nest&r in the Nether, attracted with nether quartz. Flower: quartz block or quartz ore. The comb gives 1 to 3 &6nether quartz&r with 50 percent."
	]
	quest.4D2B46C883E7C574.quest_subtitle: "Nether quartz from combs."
	quest.4D2B46C883E7C574.title: "&fKeep a Crystalline Bee"
	quest.4D37F7EA25BFE552.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &62 Advanced Control Circuits&r, &62 Reinforced Alloys&r and &61 draconium dust&r at the crafting table make one &6Elite Control Circuit&r. There are no other recipes."
		""
		"Without it no Elite machines and no way to the Ultimate Control Circuits (chapter &bMekanism: Elite&r)."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The goal wants &e150 Elite Control Circuits&r. Build yourself a line: dust from the End, alloy from the Metallurgic Infuser."
	]
	quest.4D37F7EA25BFE552.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism needs the End."
	quest.4D37F7EA25BFE552.title: "&bBuild Elite Control Circuits"
	quest.4D3D19F269DC0874.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Vitalic Sourcelink&r makes Source when animals are bred or creatures die nearby. Next to the pen with feeding trough and Dreadthorne, both happen all the time."
		""
		"Place a &6Source Jar&r within &e5 blocks&r and the animal farm supplies Source for your Imbuement Chamber on the side. You find the link in the &dArs Nouveau&r chapter."
	]
	quest.4D3D19F269DC0874.quest_subtitle: "Dreadthorne and Vitalic Sourcelink work together."
	quest.4D3D19F269DC0874.title: "&dLet the pen give Source"
	quest.4D52E98FA8A66E0E.quest_desc: [
		"Starts with an event: the &cNether portal at spawn&r is lit live on stream."
		""
		"Then brass and Blaze Burners, trains and contraptions, Mekanism and Immersive Engineering for a start, the Runic Altar and Terrasteel, apprentice glyphs, the first spirits in Occultism, Hexerei and Productive Bees."
	]
	quest.4D52E98FA8A66E0E.quest_subtitle: "Brass, the Nether, the first machines."
	quest.4D52E98FA8A66E0E.title: "&6Stage 2: Brass Works"
	quest.4D6231E91D67D708.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: a &6firework star&r."
		""
		"Enlarges the area around the target. &eProjectile, Break, AOE&r mines 3x3, AOE twice 5x5. Each AOE costs more mana; don't try it under your own feet."
	]
	quest.4D6231E91D67D708.quest_subtitle: "One block becomes nine."
	quest.4D6231E91D67D708.title: "&dLearn AOE"
	quest.4D7B04EAD8E9BF79.quest_desc: [
		"&6Awakened ingots&r in the corners, a &6potion&r at the top, a &6firework rocket&r at the bottom, a &6Wyvern Core&r left and right, the &6Wyvern Flight Module&r in the middle."
		""
		"The Chaos Island is big, and the Guardian flies."
	]
	quest.4D7B04EAD8E9BF79.quest_subtitle: "Better flying."
	quest.4D7B04EAD8E9BF79.title: "&dBuild a Draconic Flight Module"
	quest.4D90BB12850AE739.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Mountain Tower&r stands in mountains, snowy plains, snowy taigas, groves and ice spikes biomes. The &bCryomancer&r lives at the top. His ice spells freeze you, so keep moving and bring healing."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r 0 to 8 &6Arcane Essence&r, a scroll, 1 to 3 inks. The tower chests have essence, paper, amethyst shards and many &6Frozen Bones&r, 1 to 2 scrolls and a 30 percent chance of a &6Furled Map&r that leads you to a structure. The ice barrel holds two scrolls and often a ring."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Here you get Frozen Bones for the Ice Rune without hunting strays."
	]
	quest.4D90BB12850AE739.quest_subtitle: "Ice, amethyst and a map."
	quest.4D90BB12850AE739.title: "&bClimb the Mountain Tower"
	quest.4D95335BF6ECD1AE.quest_desc: [
		"Werkbank, formlos: ein &6Räucherschinken&r, eine &6Honigflasche&r, vier &6Süßbeeren&r, zwei &6Gekochter Reis&r und eine &6Schüssel&r. Den Schinken jagst du mit dem Messer und räucherst ihn im Räucherofen oder auf dem Lagerfeuer."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/honey_glazed_ham.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4D95335BF6ECD1AE.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.4D95335BF6ECD1AE.title: "&6Tisch den Honigglasierten Schinken auf"
	quest.4D9AC8CB35883A98.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_trash.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Three stone&r on top, a &6wooden chest&r in the middle, &6five cobblestone&r around it: the &6Item Trash Can&r."
		""
		"It deletes everything that comes in, by hand, hopper or belt. Its filter has &e9 slots&r as whitelist or blacklist."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Hand in cobblestone first, the obelisk needs it. Sneak and right click the obelisk to hand in everything the goal can use."
	]
	quest.4D9AC8CB35883A98.quest_subtitle: "Whatever falls in is gone."
	quest.4D9AC8CB35883A98.title: "Build a trash can"
	quest.4D9B0790A54A7014.quest_desc: [
		"Check off each ore once. The world goes from &eY -64&r to &eY 319&r."
		""
		"&6Deepsilver, Starlit Diamond, Starcore, Redstone, Saltpeter:&r everywhere, Y -64 to the surface. Denser below Y 0, only Saltpeter is denser higher up."
		"&6Malarite:&r only Dark Swamp, Y -64 to the surface."
		"&6Glacite:&r only permafrost biomes, Y -64 to 45."
		"&6Thermal Springstone:&r at hot springs. &6Aethersent:&r from meteors."
	]
	quest.4D9B0790A54A7014.quest_subtitle: "Every ore with location and height."
	quest.4D9B0790A54A7014.title: "&7&lChecklist: Ores"
	quest.4DAF599694CC68E1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sewer:&r plastic, bucket, plastic at the top, bricks around the Pity Frame, Iron Gear at the bottom. It collects &6Sewage&r from animals and turns experience orbs into &aEssence&r."
		""
		"The &6Sewage Composter&r (&d40 FE/t&r) turns sewage into &6Fertilizer&r. That goes into the Plant Fertilizer or the Hydroponic Bed."
	]
	quest.4DAF599694CC68E1.quest_subtitle: "What animals leave behind."
	quest.4DAF599694CC68E1.title: "&6Collect Sewage and Make Fertilizer"
	quest.4DB245054E2AEB6A.quest_desc: [
		"Leg in den &6Kochtopf&r: &6Reis&r, &6Zwiebel&r, &6Brauner Pilz&r, &6Kartoffel&r, eine &6Beere&r und ein weiteres Gemüse, als Behälter einen ganzen &6Kürbis&r. Nach 20 Sekunden kommt der &6Gefüllte Kürbis&r heraus, ein Festmahl-Block, aus dem jeder mit einer Schüssel Portionen holt."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/stuffed_pumpkin.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eDie Spitze:&r 14 Hunger und 21 Sättigung bringen alle Festmahl-Portionen (Gefüllter Kürbis, Backhähnchen, Hirtenkuchen, Honigglasierter Schinken, Gleaming Salad), dazu Gemüsenudeln, Pasta mit Tintenfischtinte, Kürbissuppe, Nudelsuppe, Gebackener Kabeljaueintopf, Gebratene Hammelkoteletts, Gegrillter Lachs und der Kanincheneintopf, den Farmer's Delight aufwertet."
		""
		"&eZum Vergleich:&r Gemüsesuppe, Rindfleischeintopf und Gebratener Reis bringen 12 Hunger und 19,2 Sättigung, der Hamburger 11 und 17,6, Steak 8 und 12,8, die Goldene Karotte 6 und 14,4. Der Quellbeerenkuchen von Ars Nouveau liegt bei 9 und 16,2, der Honigapfel von Create bei 8 und 12,8."
		""
		"Die Quests daneben sind eine Checkliste: je vier Portionen der elf Spitzengerichte, die nicht schon im Kapitel Essen stehen. Der Kochtisch mit vollen Schränken macht das zu einem Klick pro Gericht."
	]
	quest.4DB245054E2AEB6A.quest_subtitle: "Das stärkste Essen im Pack, und ein Überblick, was sonst noch satt macht."
	quest.4DB245054E2AEB6A.title: "&6&lTisch den gefüllten Kürbis auf"
	quest.4DB3471C9EEDBF11.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Infusion Crystal&r makes 1 &6Prudentium Essence&r from 4 Inferium Essence. With it come Prudentium farmland, Prudentium accelerators and the seeds for coal, nature, dye and animals. The &6Harvester&r (iron, 2 Soulium ingots, 2 diamond sickles, machine frame) harvests ripe crops and replants them."
		""
		"The harvester runs on coal or charcoal, puts the harvest into its own inventory and can be switched off with redstone. Machine upgrades make it faster."
		""
		"See the &aMystical Agriculture&r chapter (outlook)."
	]
	quest.4DB3471C9EEDBF11.quest_subtitle: "More essence, and a machine that harvests and sows."
	quest.4DB3471C9EEDBF11.title: "&aStage 2: Prudentium and the Harvester"
	quest.4DBA08F6961CD3FE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blaze powder&r in the corners, &6draconium dust&r on the sides, a &6reinforced echo shard&r from Deeper and Darker in the middle."
		""
		"Sneak and right click stores place, view direction and dimension. After that a right click takes you back there. It only has a limited number of charges."
	]
	quest.4DBA08F6961CD3FE.quest_subtitle: "A jump back to a fixed place."
	quest.4DBA08F6961CD3FE.title: "&bBuild a Dislocator"
	quest.4DC3FDAF3B2629AB.quest_desc: [
		"A right click with a &6Photoelectric Pane&r on an &5enderman&r or an endermite turns it into the &6Lens Of Ender&r. A right click with a &6Binding Card&r makes the &6Binding Card (Dimensional)&r."
		""
		"&eThe lens:&r a right click with it on a Solar Panel, and it sees the sky even through blocks above it. That way solar fields can be built under a roof or underground."
		""
		"&eThe card:&r In the Player Transmitter it charges you even when you are in another dimension."
	]
	quest.4DC3FDAF3B2629AB.quest_subtitle: "Two parts come only from the enderman."
	quest.4DC3FDAF3B2629AB.title: "&5Go hunting endermen"
	quest.4DCA21F71EA86B2A.quest_desc: [
		"&eDie Regel:&r Der Nether ist bis &6Stufe 2 (Messingwerk)&r gesperrt, für alle gleichzeitig. Vorher kannst du Obsidian setzen und anzünden, so viel du willst, durchgehen geht nicht."
		""
		"&eDas Event:&r Sobald das Ziel der Stufe 1 bei 98 Prozent steht, setzt das Team einen Termin. Alle gehen live, die letzten Barren wandern in den Obelisken, und das &cNetherportal am Spawn&r wird vor laufender Kamera entzündet. Ab dann ist der Nether für alle offen."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Hilf mit, dass es schnell geht: &eBruchstein&r, &eAndesitlegierung&r und &eQuelljuwelen&r am Obelisken bringen das Event näher. Welche Events es noch gibt, steht im Kapitel &6Tipps und Tricks&r."
	]
	quest.4DCA21F71EA86B2A.quest_subtitle: "Die Stufe öffnet das Portal, nicht das Feuerzeug."
	quest.4DCA21F71EA86B2A.title: "&cWarte auf das Nether-Event"
	quest.4DCFF9AE485F7706.quest_desc: [
		"&6Right click&r normal farmland with an &6Inferium Essence&r to turn it into &6Inferium Farmland&r. Or: essence and farmland shapeless in the crafting table, or hoe, essence and dirt."
		""
		"On ordinary farmland an essence crop never drops a second seed. On essence farmland there is a &e10 percent&r chance, on the matching farmland of its own tier another &e10 percent&r on top. For everything in this chapter that means &e20 percent&r on Inferium Farmland."
		""
		"More essence per harvest only comes with higher farmland, and that comes with &cstage 2&r."
	]
	quest.4DCFF9AE485F7706.quest_subtitle: "The soil decides the second seed."
	quest.4DCFF9AE485F7706.title: "&aMake Inferium Farmland"
	quest.4DD82BD2E67B049E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/theurgy_vessels.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Each vessel: four &6copper ingots&r over three &6stone&r, a Salt, a Sulfur or a Mercury in the top middle. All three right next to the Incubator."
		""
		"Right click fills each vessel with its principle, a hopper works too."
	]
	quest.4DD82BD2E67B049E.quest_subtitle: "Salt, Sulfur, Mercury."
	quest.4DD82BD2E67B049E.title: "&6Set Up the Three Vessels"
	quest.4DD9D739F3D66B95.quest_desc: [
		"Create a channel of the type &6Logic&r. A connector as a &esensor&r measures items, fluid, energy or redstone in the block next to it and sets a colour. A connector as an &eoutput&r gives out redstone at that colour."
		""
		"Other channels listen to these colours. That way an item channel only runs as long as the target tank is not full. For plain redstone signals there is the &6Redstone Proxy&r (a Machine Frame in redstone)."
	]
	quest.4DD9D739F3D66B95.quest_subtitle: "Sensors and redstone in the controller."
	quest.4DD9D739F3D66B95.title: "&eSwitch with a logic channel"
	quest.4DDB29BABEFA3AD6.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r three &6prismarine bricks&r on top and bottom, in the middle a &6water bottle&r, a &6bookshelf&r and a &6pufferfish&r."
		""
		"A &6Seashelf&r gives &b3 Eterna&r (up to 45) and &53 percent Arcana&r. Five of them plus your fifteen bookshelves give Eterna 45 and Arcana 15. You get prismarine from an ocean monument, pufferfish you fish in the ocean."
		""
		"The alternative from the Nether, the &6Hellshelf&r (nether bricks, blaze rod, potion of regeneration, bookshelf), comes in stage 2."
	]
	quest.4DDB29BABEFA3AD6.quest_subtitle: "The sea raises the table to 45."
	quest.4DDB29BABEFA3AD6.title: "&3Build Five Seashelves"
	quest.4DDB9EE8673EB902.quest_desc: [
		"Keep praying and sacrificing. With enough favor you get the &dSoul Sign&r."
		""
		"With it you know &5Touch of Darkness&r (Wicked, Soul, Wicked, Soul). The chants with Flame, Winter or Death are in the Codex as soon as you have the signs."
	]
	quest.4DDB9EE8673EB902.quest_subtitle: "The sign that binds souls."
	quest.4DDB9EE8673EB902.title: "&dReceive the Soul Sign"
	quest.4DF5D057568DD120.quest_desc: [
		"Die Zweifach-Straße nimmt jedes Metall von Mekanism. Wirf &6Rohes Zinn&r und &6Rohes Blei&r in die Eingangskiste, heraus kommen Barren, zwei pro Erzblock."
		""
		"&eZinn&r brauchst du für Bronze, Seismischen Vibrator, Taucherflasche und Widerstandsheizer. &eBlei&r für Reaktorglas, QIO und den Spaltreaktor in Stufe 5. Beides liegt nicht im Weg, also sammle es jetzt mit."
	]
	quest.4DF5D057568DD120.quest_subtitle: "Dieselbe Straße, andere Metalle."
	quest.4DF5D057568DD120.title: "&7Schick Zinn und Blei hinterher"
	quest.4DFFFCD38E78B9EE.quest_desc: [
		"Slay an &5Ender Golem&r. It has &e150 health&r, armor 12, and summons void runes from the ground that deal 7 damage."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r a &6Void Core&r. Right click summons void runes yourself. On the Mechanical Fusion Anvil it becomes part of the &6Void Forge&r and the &6Void Assault Shoulder Weapon&r (see Ender Guardian)."
	]
	quest.4DFFFCD38E78B9EE.quest_subtitle: "It guards the citadel and drops a Void Core."
	quest.4DFFFCD38E78B9EE.title: "&5Defeat an Ender Golem"
	quest.4E12BB7D1E0FD62B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/flux_networks_setup_mek.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Stell die Fabriken mit einem Block Abstand in eine Reihe und setz in jede Lücke einen &6Flux-Punkt&r: Fabrik, Punkt, Fabrik, Punkt, Fabrik. Jeder Punkt versorgt beide Nachbarn. Oder ein Punkt auf jede Fabrik, wenn die Transporter die Lücken brauchen."
		""
		"Mekanism nimmt Strom auf jeder Seite, die in der Seitenkonfiguration für Energie auf Eingang steht, und rechnet in Joule: 1 FE sind 2,5 J. Eine Anreicherungskammer braucht 20 FE/t, eine Klärkammer 80, Fabriken mit fünf Plätzen entsprechend mehr. Ein Punkt mit 800.000 FE/t langweilt sich."
		""
		"Gib den Fabriken Priorität 10, dann bleiben sie an, wenn der Energiewürfel am Lager den Rest schluckt. Wie die Straße selbst gebaut wird, steht im Kapitel &5Mekanism: Fortgeschritten&r."
	]
	quest.4E12BB7D1E0FD62B.quest_subtitle: "Fünf Fabriken, kein Kabel."
	quest.4E12BB7D1E0FD62B.title: "&5Fabrikreihe von Mekanism"
	quest.4E13629347C7CA13.quest_desc: [
		"&e5 ender pearls&r in the corners and the middle, &e4 Dark Power Gems&r on the sides."
		""
		"The pearl has its own blood tank, which you fill in the left slot of the Blood Infuser. Then you throw it like an ender pearl, except it is not used up. Every throw costs some blood."
	]
	quest.4E13629347C7CA13.quest_subtitle: "An ender pearl that comes back."
	quest.4E13629347C7CA13.title: "&4Build a Blood Pearl of Teleportation"
	quest.4E13CE882E876E3A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Harvester&r: alloy and Iron Sheets over an Andesite Casing. It harvests ripe plants and replants. The &6Mechanical Plough&r turns dirt into farmland."
		""
		"Glue both to a gantry or piston that moves slowly over the field. The harvest lands in chests on the contraption."
	]
	quest.4E13CE882E876E3A.quest_subtitle: "Harvester and plough."
	quest.4E13CE882E876E3A.title: "&6Harvest while driving by"
	quest.4E1BA47934236848.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_crops_essence.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Now everything together. &eThis is what a farm looks like:&r a field of &6Inferium Farmland&r, a column of &6Growth Accelerators&r under every block, on it Inferium Seeds and your resource seeds. The &6Inferium Watering Can&r runs, and every few minutes you click through once with the &6Scythe&r."
		""
		"&eThe math:&r 9 by 9 tiles of Inferium with four accelerators below give 81 essence per round. That is ten new seeds or twenty Prudentium Essence, once stage 2 is open. The sooner the farm stands, the more you have by then."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Farmland still needs water, at most 4 blocks away. A water channel through the middle of the field is enough. With Create from the tech chapter a harvesting machine can replace the scythe later."
	]
	quest.4E1BA47934236848.quest_subtitle: "Accelerators below, essence farmland, scythe in hand."
	quest.4E1BA47934236848.title: "&a&lSet Up an Essence Farm"
	quest.4E1EFA9809C91E7C.quest_desc: [
		"Du kennst jetzt jeden Weg, auf dem in Kronwerke etwas von A nach B kommt oder liegen bleibt. Zum Abschluss zeig die Stufe-1-Grundausstattung einer Fabrik: Bänder, Trichter, Rohre, Pumpe und ein Fass dafür."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Everything in this chapter moves goods as far as your chests. The last stretch to the obelisk you walk yourself: handing in is done by hand."
	]
	quest.4E1EFA9809C91E7C.quest_subtitle: "Fünfmal gelesen, einmal gebaut."
	quest.4E1EFA9809C91E7C.title: "&6&lAlles verbunden"
	quest.4E257FC7D1897C14.quest_desc: [
		"Zeit für ein richtiges Gebäude. Sammle &664 Rahmenblöcke&r, &616 Copycat-Platten&r und &616 Wandfackeln&r, dann hast du Dach, Fassade und Licht für ein Haus, das im Stream etwas hermacht."
		""
		"&eEin Plan, der funktioniert:&r Fachwerk oder Metallträger als Gerüst, Chipped-Varianten für Wände und Boden, Rahmenschrägen als Dach, Copycat-Platten als dünne Verkleidung, Wandfackeln alle zwölf Blöcke. Alles in geclaimten Chunks, alles innerhalb einer Chunkgrenze, wo Maschinen stehen sollen."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Was beim Bauen an &6Bruchstein&r anfällt, gehört in den Obelisken. 20 000 Stück sind das Ziel von Stufe 1, und ein Bauabend bringt leicht ein paar Tausend."
	]
	quest.4E257FC7D1897C14.quest_subtitle: "Rahmen, Copycats und Licht für ein Haus, das man zeigen kann."
	quest.4E257FC7D1897C14.title: "&6&lBau die Stream-Basis"
	quest.4E2D89EFDAD9E138.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_nouveau_starbuncle_work.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&ePick up:&r with the Dominion Wand first the chamber, then the Starbuncle. &eDeliver:&r first the Starbuncle, then the chest."
		""
		"It takes any number of sources and targets. An &6item scroll&r in its hand or in a frame on the chest filters what it touches."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Let it carry the gems from every chamber into one chest, then bring them to the obelisk in one go."
	]
	quest.4E2D89EFDAD9E138.quest_subtitle: "From the chamber into the chest."
	quest.4E2D89EFDAD9E138.title: "&dSet up the Starbuncle"
	quest.4E2DECA925E893E7.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Ring&r ist ein Rahmen aus 4 Barren oder Gemstones mit leerer Mitte, ein &6Pendant&r hängt an 5 Fäden über einem Barren oder Gemstone."
		""
		"&eEisen und Gold&r sind reiner Schmuck. &5Zanite Ring&r und &5Zanite Pendant&r lassen dich &eschneller abbauen&r, nutzen sich dabei aber ab. &bIce Ring&r und &bIce Pendant&r (Eisen oder Gold 40 Sekunden im Freezer) frieren Wasser und Lava unter deinen Füßen ein, du läufst also über Lavaseen."
		""
		"Zwei Ringe gleichzeitig sind erlaubt, der Anhänger-Slot ist einer."
	]
	quest.4E2DECA925E893E7.quest_subtitle: "Schmuck mit und ohne Wirkung."
	quest.4E2DECA925E893E7.title: "&5Ring und Anhänger"
	quest.4E33D39D0F87D9B5.quest_desc: [
		"A &6leather armor piece&r and an &6Arcane Essence&r shapeless give the matching piece of the &6Wandering Magician&r armor. Four essences for the whole set."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/wandering_magician_chestplate.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Every piece gives &e+25 mana&r, so the set +100, with protection like iron armor (2, 6, 5, 2). The cheapest doubling of your mana there is."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Sourceborn may wear it. Their ban only covers iron, gold, diamond and netherite armor."
	]
	quest.4E33D39D0F87D9B5.quest_subtitle: "Leather and one essence, 25 mana per piece."
	quest.4E33D39D0F87D9B5.title: "&6Sew the Wanderer's Robe"
	quest.4E35AFFE0B374CFD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Travel Anchor:&r iron in the corners, binder on the sides, a &6Pulsating Crystal&r in the middle. &6Staff of Travelling:&r two Dark Steel Ingots diagonally and an &6Ender Crystal&r at the tip. The Soul Binder binds the Ender Crystal from an enderman and a Vibrant Crystal."
		""
		"With the staff you teleport to an anchor you are looking at, up to &e192 blocks&r away. From anchor to anchor it is &e96 blocks&r. With no anchor in sight the staff jumps up to &e24 blocks&r."
		""
		"Each jump costs &d1,000 µI&r from the staff, which stores 100,000. You charge it in the Wired Charger."
	]
	quest.4E35AFFE0B374CFD.quest_subtitle: "Teleport from anchor to anchor."
	quest.4E35AFFE0B374CFD.title: "&dTravel with Anchors and Staff"
	quest.4E38985D02BBEDB4.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Magmawürfel&r im Nether mit dem Learner im Inventar. In Basaltdeltas und Festungen gibt es viele."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d256 FE/t&r und gibt die &cNether Prediction&r. Eine Vorhersage wird zu &632 Magmacreme&r oder 2 Geschmolzenen Kernen von Reliquary."
	]
	quest.4E38985D02BBEDB4.quest_subtitle: "Magmacreme für Tränke und Ars."
	quest.4E38985D02BBEDB4.title: "&6Lerne den Magmawürfel"
	quest.4E3BC45CEF1125D2.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Transmitter&r on an &6Andesite Casing&r makes two &6Redstone Links&r. Give both the same two items in their frequency slots."
		""
		"Sneak and right-click with an empty hand switches between sending and receiving. That way you switch a clutch at the other end of the base."
	]
	quest.4E3BC45CEF1125D2.quest_subtitle: "Redstone without wires, 256 blocks far."
	quest.4E3BC45CEF1125D2.title: "&6Switch by radio"
	quest.4E45E68481EC6D3E.quest_desc: [
		"Take &e8 Nether wart&r from the fortress stairwells and gardens."
		""
		"At home it grows on &6soul sand&r, without light and without water, in the overworld too. A small field is enough for every potion."
	]
	quest.4E45E68481EC6D3E.quest_subtitle: "The base of every potion."
	quest.4E45E68481EC6D3E.title: "&4Harvest Nether wart"
	quest.4E5A0651DEED220F.quest_desc: [
		"&6ME Chemical Cell Housing:&r quartz glass, redstone, quartz glass at the top, redstone left and right in the middle, three &6Osmium Ingots&r at the bottom. With a &61k ME Storage Component&r it becomes the &6chemical cell&r."
		""
		"Put into the ME Drive, it stores Mekanism's gases and other chemicals. AE2's import and export buses, storage buses and interfaces then work with chemicals too, and the terminal shows them next to items and fluids."
		""
		"That way oxygen or hydrogen comes from the network straight into your machines. How ME networks are built is in the chapter &bApplied Energistics 2&r."
	]
	quest.4E5A0651DEED220F.quest_subtitle: "Applied Mekanistics joins the two."
	quest.4E5A0651DEED220F.title: "&3Store gases in the ME network"
	quest.4E5F1DAD153ED58B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ancient Debris&r into the Liquefaction Cauldron: one &6Netherite Sulfur&r for &e100 mB&r of Sal Ammoniac."
		""
		"In the Incubator it becomes a &6netherite ingot&r directly with Mineral Salt and a Mercury Shard. You save four netherite scrap and four gold ingots."
	]
	quest.4E5F1DAD153ED58B.quest_subtitle: "One find, a whole ingot."
	quest.4E5F1DAD153ED58B.title: "&5Make Netherite from Ancient Debris"
	quest.4E660E87434B97A1.quest_desc: [
		"Per Chimera: &e3 parts&r for the &5Summon Wilden&r tablet (plus Vexing log, lapis block) and one &espike&r, &ehorn&r, &ewing&r each as additions."
		""
		"&eHorns&r from hunters, &ewings&r from stalkers, both at night around Wilden dens in the forest. &eSpikes&r only from defenders in cold biomes. A waystone in the snow saves trips. The Locate Structure tablet with a source gem shows the nearest Wilden den."
	]
	quest.4E660E87434B97A1.quest_subtitle: "Every fight eats six Wilden parts."
	quest.4E660E87434B97A1.title: "&5Collect Parts for Six Fights"
	quest.4E6CFFE083CDDAAE.quest_desc: [
		"Tin, a Chemical Tank, a flint and steel, bronze and an Advanced Control Circuit. It shoots burning &bhydrogen&r."
		""
		"Fill it like the jetpack in a Chemical Tank. One of its modes smelts what it hits."
	]
	quest.4E6CFFE083CDDAAE.quest_subtitle: "Hydrogen as a weapon."
	quest.4E6CFFE083CDDAAE.title: "&cBuild a Flamethrower"
	quest.4E737EF964309F75.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_spirit_fire.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Throw a &6Demon's Dream Fruit&r on the ground and light it with &6flint and steel&r. Then throw &6andesite&r in: out comes &6Otherstone&r."
		""
		"Spiritfire doesn't hurt living things. More recipes: diorite becomes Otherrock, an oak sapling becomes an Otherworld sapling, feather, black dye and book become book of binding ingredients, flowers become Otherflowers (a dye tripler)."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r The fire goes out after a while. Keep a few fruits ready."
	]
	quest.4E737EF964309F75.quest_subtitle: "A fire that transforms instead of burning."
	quest.4E737EF964309F75.title: "&dLight Spiritfire"
	quest.4E7B584F2A7D37C9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_transformer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"LV and MV connector on top, &6Electronic Component&r and &6Electrum Coil Block&r in the middle, two iron ingots at the bottom. The component: Components blueprint, Treated Wood Slab, quartz, redstone, Electrum Wire."
		""
		"Connectors and relays only take wire of their voltage. The Transformer connects an LV and an MV wire and also fits on a Wooden Post."
	]
	quest.4E7B584F2A7D37C9.quest_subtitle: "LV and MV in one grid."
	quest.4E7B584F2A7D37C9.title: "&eBuild a Transformer"
	quest.4E7DD988C3B81C0C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/food_f_market.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Planks and a &6red wool&r on top, &6logs&r as the frame, see EMI."
		""
		"The market sells seeds, saplings, flowers and fertilizer for emeralds, including the wild plants from Farmer's Delight."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r It also sells the Productive Trees hybrids of generations 1 to 3 for 1, 2 and 4 emeralds, see the Cooking chapter."
	]
	quest.4E7DD988C3B81C0C.quest_subtitle: "Seeds and saplings for emeralds."
	quest.4E7DD988C3B81C0C.title: "&6Set up a Market"
	quest.4E8B779EE711879F.quest_desc: [
		"Quarry Card, &6Dimensional Shards&r, &6diamonds&r and a &6Nether Star&r. Every block comes back as it was."
		""
		"&eThree times&r as much power. Worth it if you quadruple ore blocks in Mekanism. Both cards also exist in a clearing version."
	]
	quest.4E8B779EE711879F.quest_subtitle: "Ores as blocks."
	quest.4E8B779EE711879F.title: "&bBuild a Silk Touch Card"
	quest.4E9375CD7886E0FA.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r four &6obsidian&r in the corners, two &6iron pickaxes&r on top and bottom, a &6lava bucket&r on the left, a &6water bucket&r on the right, a &6Mechanical Pump&r from Create in the middle. A &6Pump&r from Ranged Pumps."
		""
		"Place it above the water or lava and give it power. It works outward from where it stands ring by ring, up to range &e64&r, and sucks everything below it empty. Every block costs &e100 FE&r and takes 8 ticks, the buffer holds 32,000 FE."
		""
		"Its own tank holds &e32 buckets&r. Drain it with a &6Fluid Pipe&r, or the pump stops. A redstone signal stops it. What it pumps away turns into stone so nothing flows back."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A lava lake in the Nether, a pump, a pipe to three Heat Generators: power for the whole Brass stage."
	]
	quest.4E9375CD7886E0FA.quest_subtitle: "A lake disappears, block by block."
	quest.4E9375CD7886E0FA.title: "&9Build the Pump"
	quest.4E9928EE0CC2B85D.quest_desc: [
		"In the inventory there is a &eMy Team&r button on the left, or you use the command &e/ftbteams party create <name>&r. You invite others with &e/ftbteams party invite <player>&r. Team size is not limited."
		""
		"A team shares its &eclaims&r (500 chunks for the whole team, not per head) and its &equest progress&r: what one does is done for everyone. Each still claims the reward themselves."
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tip:\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" With \"},{\"text\":\"Ping Wheel\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" you show your team where to go: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.pingwheel.ping_location\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" sets a ping where you are looking, visible to everyone nearby.\"}]"
	]
	quest.4E9928EE0CC2B85D.quest_subtitle: "Shared claims, shared progress."
	quest.4E9928EE0CC2B85D.title: "&6Start a team"
	quest.4E9BF84C18A1F424.quest_desc: [
		"Build up a supply of &e8 Source Gem blocks&r."
		""
		"Sourcelinks fill jars, chambers make gems, a Starbuncle collects them. &6Stage 2&r opens the &6Mage's Spell Book&r, the relays, the ritual brazier and the spell turrets. Continue in the &dArs Nouveau: Mage&r chapter."
	]
	quest.4E9BF84C18A1F424.quest_subtitle: "Source flows, the apparatus stands, the server waits."
	quest.4E9BF84C18A1F424.title: "&d&lBecome a real magician"
	quest.4E9C4F613B6B9900.quest_desc: [
		"&5Susje's Simple Circle&r, 11x11: only &e16 white&r signs around the golden bowl."
		"&6Bowls:&r &e4 Otherworld Essence&r. &cStart:&r your familiar's &6Soul Shard&r instead of a book, 15 seconds."
		""
		"The familiar returns with a new body. In the same circle a Vex becomes an Allay with redstone, glowstone, silver and gold dust and sugar as the start."
	]
	quest.4E9C4F613B6B9900.quest_subtitle: "Bring fallen familiars back."
	quest.4E9C4F613B6B9900.title: "&5Draw Susje's Simple Circle"
	quest.4E9E5114F9F06BCF.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Riesen-Dieselmotor&r ist ein großer Multiblock aus Motorteilen, der wie der kleine mit Diesel oder Biodiesel per Rohr gefüllt wird. Ein &6Turbolader&r verdoppelt seine Drehzahl."
		""
		"&eCreate Diesel Generators, Riesen-Dieselmotor:&r &d224 RPM&r und bis &d16 384 SU&r, so viel wie eine voll versorgte Dampfmaschine, aber bei dreieinhalbfacher Drehzahl. Dazu kommen in Stufe 3 die &6Pumpjacks&r für Rohöl und der &6Destillationsturm&r für Diesel. Offen ab Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.4E9E5114F9F06BCF.quest_subtitle: "Create Diesel Generators, 224 RPM, bis 16 384 SU."
	quest.4E9E5114F9F06BCF.title: "&6Bau den Riesen-Dieselmotor"
	quest.4E9F87181606AF4A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Four redstone&r in the corners, &6two redstone blocks&r top and bottom, &6two comparators&r on the sides, a &6drawer&r in the middle."
		""
		"The drawer outputs a signal that rises with its fill level. With it you switch off a Create setup through a clutch as soon as the storage is full."
	]
	quest.4E9F87181606AF4A.quest_subtitle: "The Redstone Upgrade."
	quest.4E9F87181606AF4A.title: "Let the drawer report"
	quest.4EA52E5BB217772E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_trains_postbox.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Dye, &6barrel&r and &6Andesite Alloy&r below each other make a &6Postbox&r. Right click a station with it and set it down nearby, then give it an address."
		""
		"Packages with a foreign address are taken along by the next train that stops, matching ones it unloads there. In the schedule there are &eDeliver Package&r and &eRetrieve Package&r for that."
	]
	quest.4EA52E5BB217772E.quest_subtitle: "Postboxes at the stations."
	quest.4EA52E5BB217772E.title: "&6Send packages by train"
	quest.4ED4AD4CEFE09764.quest_desc: [
		"&6Generator Block:&r Steel Sheetmetal in the corners, &6Electrum Coil Blocks&r on the sides, an &6Iron Mechanical Component&r in the middle, gives four. &6Radiator Block:&r Steel Sheetmetal, &6Constantan plates&r, a water bucket in the middle, gives four."
		""
		"Both open with stage 3. The Diesel Generator needs &e4 Generator Blocks&r and &e9 Radiator Blocks&r, the Excavator 3 radiators."
	]
	quest.4ED4AD4CEFE09764.quest_subtitle: "The inside of the Diesel Generator."
	quest.4ED4AD4CEFE09764.title: "&7Build Generator and Radiator Blocks"
	quest.4EE32856F3E9D1B0.quest_desc: [
		"&efive Strata Salt&r into the Calcination Oven once more: &eone Mineral Salt&r."
		""
		"That way the salt per ingot costs you five cobblestone instead of a third of an ore."
	]
	quest.4EE32856F3E9D1B0.quest_subtitle: "Five cobblestone for one ingot."
	quest.4EE32856F3E9D1B0.title: "&6Burn Strata into Mineral Salt"
	quest.4EEACBE873E2B758.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_trains_cargo.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"One &6Portable Storage Interface&r on the carriage, one at the platform, facing each other when the train stops. Chests or &6Item Vaults&r on the train are the cargo storage."
		""
		"A funnel on the fixed interface unloads into the storage or fills the train, depending on which way round it sits."
	]
	quest.4EEACBE873E2B758.quest_subtitle: "Portable Storage Interfaces."
	quest.4EEACBE873E2B758.title: "&6Load cargo at the platform"
	quest.4EF1A088955F811B.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Heart of the Sea&r on top, below prismarine shard, &6Infused Seashelf&r, prismarine shard and three prismarine shards at the bottom."
		""
		"It gives &b15 Eterna&r (up to 60) and &520 percent Arcana&r, as much as four Infused Seashelves. The &6Crystalline Seashelf&r (Infused Seashelf and three prismarine crystals) on the other hand gives 5 Eterna, 3 Quanta and 5 Arcana."
		""
		"More Arcana means rare enchantments and more enchantments per book."
	]
	quest.4EF1A088955F811B.quest_subtitle: "A lot of Arcana in one go."
	quest.4EF1A088955F811B.title: "&3Forge a Heart-Forged Seashelf"
	quest.4EF20F3F4BEAF5AF.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Your origin is on \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.neoorigins.skill_1\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.neoorigins.skill_2\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.neoorigins.skill_3\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.neoorigins.skill_4\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" (ability 1 to 4), your role on \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.neoorigins.class_skill\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\", the overview on \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.neoorigins.view_info\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\". Plus \"},{\"text\":\"R\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"U\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" in EMI, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbchunks.map\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" map and claims, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sophisticatedbackpacks.open_backpack\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" backpack, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.curios.open.desc\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" accessory slots, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbultimine\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" Ultimine, hold \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ponder.ponder\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" for Ponder, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.corpse.death_history\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" outside of menus the death history.\"}]"
		""
		"Kronwerke sets no keys of its own, every mod brings its own. Some are therefore bound twice, they show red in the &econtrols settings&r. Rebind what you need: this book always shows the key that is set on your side. With &6KeyBind Bundles&r you put several actions on one key as a radial menu."
		""
		"In the controls settings &6KeybindsPurger&r clears all keys of one mod or of all mods at the push of a button, if you would rather start from zero."
	]
	quest.4EF20F3F4BEAF5AF.quest_subtitle: "Every mod brings its keys, the book shows yours."
	quest.4EF20F3F4BEAF5AF.title: "&6Check your keys"
	quest.4EF70CDED4C9B534.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Mixer&r: &d4 SU per RPM&r. 256 SU at 64 RPM, one water wheel per mixer."
	]
	quest.4EF70CDED4C9B534.quest_subtitle: "The alloy maker."
	quest.4EF70CDED4C9B534.title: "&7Mixer: 4 SU per RPM"
	quest.4EF79888559766DA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Reinforced Undead Planks&r: Undead Planks with &e1 bucket&r of blood in the infuser (tier 2). The chest itself: &e4&r of them around a &6Blood Infusion Core&r."
		""
		"Build a hollow cube of 3 by 3 by 3 from Reinforced Undead Planks and put the Colossal Blood Chest at one spot in the wall. That is &e25 planks&r plus the chest."
		""
		"It holds much more, is faster, accepts &6Promises&r and catches no curses. The more items lie in it at the same time, the more economical it is with blood."
	]
	quest.4EF79888559766DA.quest_subtitle: "Repairing on a grand scale."
	quest.4EF79888559766DA.title: "&4Build the Colossal Blood Chest"
	quest.4F03184C5C2F0A52.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Impaled Icebreaker&r is a ship frozen into the ice. You find it in &eFrozen Oceans&r, the &eIce Spikes&r and on &eFrozen Peaks&r."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r The captain's cabin always holds a &6Permafrost Shard&r, a bundle with 42 to 56 emeralds, a spyglass, an &6Epic Ink&r (stage 3, keep it) and a lot of paper, with a 25 percent chance also a ring or amulet."
		""
		"The Permafrost Shard is the tip of the Ice Staff."
	]
	quest.4F03184C5C2F0A52.quest_subtitle: "A ship, impaled in the ice."
	quest.4F03184C5C2F0A52.title: "&bBoard the Impaled Icebreaker"
	quest.4F06DE55387ECBCE.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r zwei &6Pneumatic Cylinders&r in die oberen Ecken, drei &6Plastic Sheets&r in die Mitte, unten Compressed Iron, &6PCB&r, Compressed Iron."
		""
		"Die Plattform hält das Werkstück fest, während Bohrer und Laser arbeiten. Alle anderen Maschinen müssen sie erreichen, also kommt sie in die Mitte."
		""
		"Einen &6Pneumatic Cylinder&r baust du aus sechs Plastic Sheets, zwei Compressed Iron und einem Cannon Barrel, und bekommst gleich zwei. Die ganze Straße braucht 14 Zylinder, also sieben Rezepte."
	]
	quest.4F06DE55387ECBCE.quest_subtitle: "Der Werktisch in der Mitte."
	quest.4F06DE55387ECBCE.title: "&bBau eine Assembly Platform"
	quest.4F0F188EA19FFC81.quest_desc: [
		"Blazegold in the corners, &6diamonds&r on top and bottom, &6lapis&r left and right, an &6ender pearl&r in the middle."
		""
		"Carry it in your inventory. If you die, it remembers the spot. Afterwards hold the right mouse button with the totem, and you land there again, with your things. The totem is used up."
	]
	quest.4F0F188EA19FFC81.quest_subtitle: "Back to the place where you died."
	quest.4F0F188EA19FFC81.title: "&eBuild a Totem of Death Recall"
	quest.4F0F207349D0E998.quest_desc: [
		"A &6compass&r on top, below stick, &6copper ingot&r, stick make the &6Engineer's Multimeter&r."
		""
		"Right click on a storage shows how full it is. Clicked on two connectors while sneaking, it shows the loss on the stretch between them."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/tool_voltmeter.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4F0F207349D0E998.quest_subtitle: "How much power is left in there?"
	quest.4F0F207349D0E998.title: "&7Build an Engineer's Multimeter"
	quest.4F162550F48675B5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_afrit_iesnium.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Set the &6Divination Rod&r to &6netherrack&r while sneaking, hold right click in the Nether and follow the glow. With the goggles you see the ore, with the Infused Pickaxe you mine it."
		""
		"The ore gives &6Raw Iesnium&r, Fortune works. In the furnace it becomes ingots. With Silk Touch a stabilised ore drops that any pickaxe can mine once it is placed again."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A Crusher turns Raw Iesnium into dust: the Djinni three, the Afrit four per piece."
	]
	quest.4F162550F48675B5.quest_subtitle: "An ore that looks like netherrack."
	quest.4F162550F48675B5.title: "&6&lMine Iesnium"
	quest.4F4C15E347F67B71.quest_desc: [
		"&ePneumatischer Dynamo (Kronwerke):&r ein Fortgeschrittenes Druckrohr oben, Zahnräder aus Druckeisen um einen Druckeisenbarren, unten Druckeisen, &6Einfacher Steuerschaltkreis&r, Druckeisen. &eFlux-Kompressor (Kronwerke):&r Redstone, Zahnrad, Schaltkreis, Redstoneblock, Turbinenrotor, Druckrohr, Redstone, Schmelzofen, Schaltkreis."
		""
		"&ePneumaticCraft, Pneumatischer Dynamo:&r Brennstoff Druckluft, &d100 mL Luft = 40 FE&r, &d40 FE/t&r ohne Upgrades, Abgabe 80 FE/t. &eFlux-Kompressor:&r &d100 FE = 40 mL Luft&r, verbraucht 40 FE/t, Puffer 100 000. Beide müssen gekühlt werden, sonst sinkt der Wirkungsgrad. &eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r beide brauchen den Mekanism-Schaltkreis statt der gedruckten Platine. Offen ab Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.4F4C15E347F67B71.quest_subtitle: "PneumaticCraft: Dynamo 40 FE/t aus Luft, Flux-Kompressor 40 FE/t zu Luft."
	quest.4F4C15E347F67B71.title: "&bÜbersetze Druckluft und FE"
	quest.4F512F0BF2B89FF9.quest_desc: [
		"&6One cobblestone&r, &6one dirt&r and &6one stick&r, shapeless, make &efour Crude Tool Parts&r."
		""
		"From them you build the crude knife, which carves Template Boards from logs. Templates are the cheap way without a blueprint."
	]
	quest.4F512F0BF2B89FF9.quest_subtitle: "Cobblestone, dirt, stick."
	quest.4F512F0BF2B89FF9.title: "&7Build crude tool parts"
	quest.4F5873DF949D30FD.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Druckluftrohr&r rechts oben, drei &6Ziegelsteine&r (die aus dem Ofen) in der Mitte, drei &6Verstärkte Steinstufen&r unten ergeben die &6Ladestation&r (Charging Station)."
		""
		"Leg ein Druckluftwerkzeug hinein, schließ ein Rohr an, und der Druck gleicht sich aus. Werkzeuge laden bis &e10 Bar&r, also mehr, als ein Rohr aushält: Die Station bekommt, was das Netz hergibt, und ein voller Kanister braucht Geduld."
		""
		"Der &ePfeil über dem Slot&r öffnet das Upgrade-Fenster des Werkzeugs. Mit einem &6Spender-Upgrade&r in der Station wird sie zum &eLadefeld&r: Alles, was auf ihr liegt oder in deiner Tasche steckt, wenn du draufstehst, wird geladen."
		""
		"&eNebenbei:&r Die Ladestation ist der Arbeitsblock des &6Druckmechanikers&r. Ein Dorfbewohner ohne Beruf nimmt ihn an, und dieser Händler wird später für die Platinen-Vorlage wichtig."
	]
	quest.4F5873DF949D30FD.quest_subtitle: "Werkzeug auftanken, Upgrades einsetzen."
	quest.4F5873DF949D30FD.title: "&a&lBau eine Ladestation"
	quest.4F5D0481442B5919.quest_desc: [
		"&e32 Gaia Spirit Ingots&r are 128 Gaia Spirits, so many fights against the Guardian of Gaia. That is exactly how many the techs need for all 16 fusions of Awakened Draconium."
		""
		"Whoever has them decides together what goes first: into the Fusion Crafting Core or into the obelisk. Both count for the same goal."
	]
	quest.4F5D0481442B5919.quest_subtitle: "Enough for 16 fusions."
	quest.4F5D0481442B5919.title: "&d&lForge 32 Gaia Spirit Ingots"
	quest.4F662C7C02A95473.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wax&r: honey bottle and slimeball shapeless, gives two."
		"&eMain item:&r a &6lodestone&r. &eOn the pedestals:&r &e2 clay balls&r, &e2 Wax&r, &e2 slimeballs&r, &e1 iron ingot&r. &eEssences:&r 100 Aureal, 1,250 Blood, 2 Souls. No enhancer needed."
		""
		"Right clicking a &6Darkstone Pedestal&r with the mixture makes it magnetic: it collects items nearby by itself. On the Smithing Table it gives a tool the &eMagnetized&r modifier."
	]
	quest.4F662C7C02A95473.quest_subtitle: "A pedestal that collects by itself."
	quest.4F662C7C02A95473.title: "&5Ritual: Ferrognetic Mixture"
	quest.4F6F1FAF8BB5B7E1.quest_desc: [
		"&dExtend Time&r: &6clock&r and &6block of redstone&r. &dDuration Down&r: &6clock&r and &6glowstone dust&r."
		""
		"Extend stretches potions, summons and buffs. Duration Down makes Delay and Redstone Signal shorter and expensive buffs cheaper."
	]
	quest.4F6F1FAF8BB5B7E1.quest_subtitle: "Glow longer, wait shorter."
	quest.4F6F1FAF8BB5B7E1.title: "&dLearn Extend Time and Duration Down"
	quest.4F6FFA3DD9E965B4.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Potion Jar&r in the middle, &e2 Abjuration Essences&r, &e2 gold blocks&r and &e4 blaze rods&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Dominion Wand from two Potion Jars to the melder, those are the inputs. Then from the melder to a third jar, that is the output. The melder takes doses from both jars and fills a potion with both effects. Each mix costs Source."
	]
	quest.4F6FFA3DD9E965B4.quest_subtitle: "Two potions become one."
	quest.4F6FFA3DD9E965B4.title: "&dMix potions in the Potion Melder"
	quest.4F737437D2FC07A9.quest_desc: [
		"Attuner and an &6emerald&r, shapeless. Holds &d5,000 mana&r."
		""
		"Two of them carry one Mystic Staff with some left over."
	]
	quest.4F737437D2FC07A9.quest_subtitle: "5,000 mana, cheaper."
	quest.4F737437D2FC07A9.title: "&dAttune an Emerald"
	quest.4F86631B97461E25.quest_desc: [
		"Give a &6Stranghoul&r a bowl of &6Pungency Stew&r. Then it fights for you for a day."
		""
		"Stranghouls live in their own caves in the swamp and also trade for Malarite. But: anyone standing near them badly hurt looks like food to them. They fear silver weapons."
	]
	quest.4F86631B97461E25.quest_subtitle: "A bowl of stew, a day of escort."
	quest.4F86631B97461E25.title: "&2Hire a Stranghoul"
	quest.4F88EEBC3221D925.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Nitro-Kristall&r entsteht in der Kugel aus Netherstern, zwei Redstoneblöcken und einem Block Blazing-Kristalle für 20 Millionen FE. Daraus Kondensatoren, dann wie gewohnt aufrüsten."
		""
		"&ePowah, Nitro:&r Furnator und Magmator &d40 000 FE/t&r, Solar und Thermo 2 000 FE/t, Reaktor &d500 000 FE/t&r (Puffer 500 Millionen). Nitro-Kabel 1 Million FE/t, Nitro Energy Cell &d2 Milliarden FE&r mit 2 Millionen FE/t. Offen ab Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.4F88EEBC3221D925.quest_subtitle: "Powah Nitro: 40 000 FE/t Furnator, 500 000 FE/t Reaktor, 2 Milliarden FE Zelle."
	quest.4F88EEBC3221D925.title: "&bRüste Powah auf Nitro"
	quest.4F9187126774C459.quest_desc: [
		"You now know the book, EMI, the map, the rules and the keys. Everything else you learn while playing, and nobody expects you to know 230 mods."
		""
		"If you get stuck: first &eR&r and &eU&r in EMI, then the matching &echapter&r in the book, then &echat&r or &evoice chat&r. Thirty people on the server, one of them has surely built that machine already. For anything technical (crash, installation, whitelist) there is the &9Discord&r, and &ekronwerke.com&r has the most common questions and the state of the obelisk."
		""
		"And the other way round: if someone asks you in chat how a water wheel works, answer. That is how Kronwerke works."
	]
	quest.4F9187126774C459.quest_subtitle: "People help each other here. Really."
	quest.4F9187126774C459.title: "&6Ask for help"
	quest.4F923076C81A87E4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_water_wheel.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r acht &6Bretter&r um eine &6Welle&r. Stell das Rad so, dass Wasser an seinen Schaufeln vorbeifließt, die Welle zeigt zur Seite."
		""
		"&eCreate, Wasserrad:&r Brennstoff keiner, &d8 RPM&r, &d256 SU&r, kein Puffer. Mehrere Räder auf einer Welle addieren die SU, nicht die Drehzahl. Offen ab Stufe 1."
	]
	quest.4F923076C81A87E4.quest_subtitle: "Create, 8 RPM, 256 SU, braucht fließendes Wasser."
	quest.4F923076C81A87E4.title: "&6Bau ein Wasserrad"
	quest.4F989279349B6783.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ultimate Tier Installer:&r Atomic Alloy in the corners, Ultimate Control Circuits at the top and bottom, diamonds left and right, a plank."
		""
		"An Ultimate Factory has &enine&r slots. Upgrade the slowest machine of your line first, that is where things jam."
	]
	quest.4F989279349B6783.quest_subtitle: "Nine slots, the last tier."
	quest.4F989279349B6783.title: "&dUpgrade a Factory to Ultimate"
	quest.4F9CF49C5EA5B8BD.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6coal blocks&r at the top and sides, a &6furnace&r in the middle, at the bottom &6redstone&r, &6Simple Frame&r, redstone make the &6Furnace Mycelial Generator&r."
		""
		"It burns any fuel a furnace takes too. The longer something burns, the more power you get."
		""
		"The &aMycelial Generators&r are a family: each kind eats a different fuel, and all of them together drive the Mycelial Reactor in the end."
	]
	quest.4F9CF49C5EA5B8BD.quest_subtitle: "Power from anything that burns in a furnace."
	quest.4F9CF49C5EA5B8BD.title: "&6Set Up a Furnace Mycelial Generator"
	quest.4FB0B8DEE6BF0527.quest_desc: [
		"Zwei &6Redstone-Fackeln&r, drei &6Gold- oder Kupferklumpen&r und eine &6Kunststoffplatte&r in der Druckkammer bei &e1,5 Bar&r ergeben drei &6Leere Platinen&r (Empty PCB)."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/item/empty_pcb.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Kupferklumpen sind das billigere Kabel, du bekommst sie aus Kupferbarren an der Werkbank. Mach gleich ein Dutzend Platinen, denn beim Ätzen geht noch etwas schief."
	]
	quest.4FB0B8DEE6BF0527.quest_subtitle: "Drei auf einmal, bei 1,5 Bar."
	quest.4FB0B8DEE6BF0527.title: "&9Presse leere Platinen"
	quest.4FB0BD3991D5D212.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6iron ingots&r in the corners and four &6Treated Wood Planks&r on the sides, middle empty, make four &6Basic Engineering Blocks&r."
		""
		"They are in every accumulator, in the Garden Cloche and in the routers. The Light and Heavy blocks are something else, they only open in stage 3."
	]
	quest.4FB0BD3991D5D212.quest_subtitle: "The frame for accumulators and the Garden Cloche."
	quest.4FB0BD3991D5D212.title: "&6Build Basic Engineering Blocks"
	quest.4FB954B40373F3CA.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r three Blueprint Paper and a stick. The blade needs &ethree&r material instead of two."
		""
		"The &6katana&r is heavier and stronger than the sword. If you prefer it fast: the &6dagger&r (one material) strikes very fast and shortens the target's invulnerability time. The &6spear&r (one material) is weaker but reaches further."
	]
	quest.4FB954B40373F3CA.quest_subtitle: "Heavier and stronger than a sword."
	quest.4FB954B40373F3CA.title: "&7Forge a katana"
	quest.4FD512219DFB41BA.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Pressurized Air Tank&r, two &6Wooden Grips&r, a &6Heavy Engineering Block&r, a &6fluid pipe&r and a &6bucket&r make the &6Chemical Thrower&r."
		""
		"Fill it with a fluid or a gas, right click sprays it. Sneak and right click toggles the pilot flame: with creosote or Biodiesel it becomes a flamethrower. With Liquid Concrete you build quick platforms."
		""
		"At the workbench: &6Large Tank&r for more contents, &6Focused Nozzle&r for more range, &6Multitank&r for three fluids."
	]
	quest.4FD512219DFB41BA.quest_subtitle: "It sprays any fluid, burning if you like."
	quest.4FD512219DFB41BA.title: "&cBuild a Chemical Thrower"
	quest.4FDB5B94CAF85475.quest_desc: [
		"Like vanilla tools: three &6Soulstained Steel&r and two sticks for the pickaxe, two and one for the sword."
		""
		"Soulstained Steel weapons drop arcana even without a scythe."
	]
	quest.4FDB5B94CAF85475.quest_subtitle: "Harvest with any blade."
	quest.4FDB5B94CAF85475.title: "&7Forge Soulstained Steel Tools"
	quest.50025CC2C67A07B2.quest_desc: [
		"Catalyst: a &6Draconium Fusion Crafting Injector&r. In eight injectors: &61 Wyvern Core&r, &62 Draconium Cores&r, &64 diamonds&r, &61 Draconium Block&r. Costs 32,000 energy."
		""
		"Wyvern tools and the chestpiece need &esix&r Wyvern injectors, the capacitor eight. If some are missing, the core reports &e\"Not enough wyvern tier injectors\"&r."
		""
		"A Wyvern injector also handles every Draconium recipe and charges faster (11 instead of 15 seconds). With eight you can replace the old ones completely."
	]
	quest.50025CC2C67A07B2.quest_subtitle: "Your first fusion."
	quest.50025CC2C67A07B2.title: "&d&lFuse a Wyvern Injector"
	quest.50096F03B27818A8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Ummantelter Kettenriemen&r: Liegen mehrere in einer Reihe, gibt jeder die Drehung an den nächsten weiter, ganz ohne Zahnräder. So führst du eine Welle neben Maschinen vorbei, die im Weg stehen. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Ein Andesitgehäuse und drei Eisenklumpen, formlos."
	]
	quest.50096F03B27818A8.quest_subtitle: "Create, Ummantelter Kettenriemen: Drehung seitlich weitergeben."
	quest.50096F03B27818A8.title: "Leg einen Kettenriemen"
	quest.501774DAD692CFF7.quest_desc: [
		"Ein Stecker oder Punkt verbindet sich automatisch mit jedem Nachbarn, der Strom nimmt oder gibt. Am Block siehst du an jeder verbundenen Seite einen kleinen Anschluss, im Reiter &eHome&r stehen alle sechs Seiten mit dem Nachbarblock und seinem Durchfluss."
		""
		"Eine einzelne Seite abschalten gibt es nicht. Soll ein Nachbar nichts bekommen, stell seine eigene Seite ab (bei Mekanism mit dem Konfigurator auf &eKeine&r) oder lass einen Block Abstand."
	]
	quest.501774DAD692CFF7.quest_subtitle: "Alle sechs Seiten verbinden sich von selbst."
	quest.501774DAD692CFF7.title: "&7Lies die Seiten ab"
	quest.50244CFF4ED6480C.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Osorin's Unbound Calling."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6copper,&r &6silver&r and &6gold block&r, a &6diamond&r, &6netherrack&r, &6soul sand&r."
		"&cStart:&r a &6skeleton skull&r. &cSacrifice:&r a &6villager&r, 90 seconds."
		""
		"Wither skeletons come with their skeleton minions. The big spirits are nearly invulnerable until their minions are defeated, so clear the small ones first."
		""
		"The Wild Hunt has a high chance to drop &6wither skeleton skulls&r. You need them for Witherite Dust and Tibira's Attraction."
	]
	quest.50244CFF4ED6480C.quest_subtitle: "Wither skeleton skulls without a Nether fortress."
	quest.50244CFF4ED6480C.title: "&5Summon the Wild Hunt"
	quest.50271DF9FC3AED46.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/logistics_counter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"An &6Inventory Reader&r (an Input Transformer under three chests) aimed at a buffer chest at the end of the steel line reads with &eInventory Count&r what lies in it. Put the card into the Display Panel and you see the count from afar."
		""
		"Compare it in the programmer with a fixed number, and a Redstone Writer switches a lamp as soon as enough steel is ready. Then the walk to the obelisk is worth it."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r &e\"The Furnace Never Sleeps\"&r wants &e4,000 steel ingots&r, &e250 Advanced Control Circuits&r and &e8 Steel Cores&r. You hand in by hand at the obelisk, and it counts for whoever hands in."
	]
	quest.50271DF9FC3AED46.quest_subtitle: "How much is still missing for the obelisk?"
	quest.50271DF9FC3AED46.title: "&6&lBuild the steel counter"
	quest.502D175E91C0B4F7.quest_desc: [
		"Material: &e4 Fire Agglomeratio&r (lava bucket, gravel, dirt, clay)."
		""
		"Plus &e4 Inferium Essence&r and a &6Prosperity Seed Base&r in the Infusion Altar."
	]
	quest.502D175E91C0B4F7.quest_subtitle: "One seed, one checkmark."
	quest.502D175E91C0B4F7.title: "Seed: Fire"
	quest.502F7E8E5BA8DF0E.quest_desc: [
		"Pick up the &e8 dragon scales&r that every dragon drops with Mystical Agradditions."
		""
		"They go into the &6Dragon Egg Chunk&r, the base of the dragon egg seeds. That only comes in &estage 5&r, so put the scales aside."
	]
	quest.502F7E8E5BA8DF0E.quest_subtitle: "Eight scales per dragon."
	quest.502F7E8E5BA8DF0E.title: "&dCollect Dragon Scales"
	quest.5030F9D7D837F573.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_deeplands.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Die &3Tiefenlande&r sind das Hauptbiom: Säulen aus &6Sculkgestein&r, Sculkranken, Sensoren, und an den Wänden der leuchtende &6Sculkglanz&r."
		""
		"&eWer hier wohnt:&r Sculk-Schnapper, Zerschmetterte, &6Sculk-Hundertfüßer&r (20 Lebenspunkte, lassen Fäden fallen) und &cPhantome&r, auch wenn du geschlafen hast. Hier stehen auch die Antiken Tempel."
	]
	quest.5030F9D7D837F573.quest_subtitle: "Säulen aus Sculkgestein, und Phantome ohne Schlafmangel."
	quest.5030F9D7D837F573.title: "&3Durchquere die Tiefenlande"
	quest.5036E615F5774276.quest_desc: [
		"In the &cheated&r mixer &b500 mB of liquid experience&r and &b500 mB of water&r give a bucket of &6Random Spawn Fluid&r. It works without experience too: a &6blaze rod&r, an &6ender pearl&r and 250 mB of water give 250 mB heated."
		"{image:create_mechanical_spawner:textures/item/spawn_fluid_random_bucket.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"The &6Mechanical Spawner&r (a recipe for the crafting units, see &6Create: Brass&r) uses &e100 mB per mob&r and needs at least &e100 RPM&r from below. Fluid goes in from any horizontal side, its tank holds 1,000 mB. With the random kind it spawns any animal or monster."
		""
		"It costs 16 SU per RPM, so 1,600 SU at 100 RPM. A job for steam or diesel."
	]
	quest.5036E615F5774276.quest_subtitle: "Create Mechanical Spawner: experience and water, heated."
	quest.5036E615F5774276.title: "&cMix Spawn Fluid"
	quest.503AA435EACFDF64.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Frosted Helve&r is four &6Frozen Bones&r and three &6Arcane Ingots&r in a diagonal (EMI shows the pattern). Plus the &6Permafrost Shard&r from the ice ship, both shapeless give the &6Ice Staff&r."
		""
		"It gives &e+15 percent ice spell power&r, &e+5 percent spell power&r and &e+25 percent mana regeneration&r. Right click casts your active spell like any staff."
	]
	quest.503AA435EACFDF64.quest_subtitle: "Handle of bone, tip from the ice ship."
	quest.503AA435EACFDF64.title: "&bAssemble the Ice Staff"
	quest.503AABEE9CC92494.quest_desc: [
		"In the water cauldron: &e5 mahogany planks&r and &e3 gold ingots&r. That is the &6Coffer&r."
		""
		"Hitting it picks it up with its contents. If the crow button in the menu is on, gathering crows bring everything to it that already lies in the Coffer. Dyeing and renaming work as with leather armour."
	]
	quest.503AABEE9CC92494.quest_subtitle: "A chest for witches and crows."
	quest.503AABEE9CC92494.title: "&6Build a Coffer"
	quest.503C6BA0D59469CB.quest_desc: [
		"Kill wither skeletons until one drops its &6skull&r. Looting helps."
		""
		"Three skulls on soul sand summon the &cWither&r. Keep them until the server is ready together (next quest)."
	]
	quest.503C6BA0D59469CB.quest_subtitle: "Rare, and better kept in the cupboard."
	quest.503C6BA0D59469CB.title: "&8Collect wither skeleton skulls"
	quest.5043046E0185E5AA.quest_desc: [
		"Give a wild &dSiren&r in warm oceans a &6sea pickle&r and it drops tokens. In the apparatus with prismarine shards, 3 fish and &e3 Source Gems&r it becomes the charm."
		""
		"Charm on &6prismarine&r: it becomes a &6Siren Shrine&r. It slowly produces fishing loot for Source, more with lots of water creatures and plants around it."
	]
	quest.5043046E0185E5AA.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: a fishing spot that fishes itself."
	quest.5043046E0185E5AA.title: "&6Summon a Siren"
	quest.504F5EF7FA6CCED1.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6glass bottle&r in the middle, &6Allow Item Scroll&r, &6furnace&r, &6cobblestone&r, &6coal&r and &6lapis lazuli&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Works like the Void Jar: in the hotbar it destroys the items on its list as you pick them up. Instead of mana it gives a little &dexperience&r for them."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Put cobblestone and tuff on the list, and every mining spell fills the experience bar for the Scribe's Table on the side."
	]
	quest.504F5EF7FA6CCED1.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: waste becomes experience."
	quest.504F5EF7FA6CCED1.title: "&6Build a Jar of Miner's Wisdom"
	quest.505367F09EC096FA.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r &6two Blueprint Paper&r and &eone leather&r or &eone wool&r, shapeless. Then blueprint plus one material."
		""
		"Leather: +15 percent mining speed, +0.15 attack speed, Flexible III. Wool: +10 percent mining speed, +0.2 attack speed, Flexible II."
	]
	quest.505367F09EC096FA.quest_subtitle: "More speed when digging and striking."
	quest.505367F09EC096FA.title: "&6Wrap a grip"
	quest.5060E85183881862.quest_desc: [
		"A &6diamond&r top left and four &6Arcane Ingots&r in a ring around it give the &6Ring of Mana&r. EMI shows the layout."
		""
		"It goes into a &ering slot&r (Curios) and gives &e+100 mana&r, as much as the whole Wanderer's Robe. More maximum also means faster regeneration."
		""
		"Other rings like the &6Silver Ring&r (+25 mana) lie in chests of the towers, catacombs and ships. Most crafted rings need mithril, which can only be mined with netherite tools."
	]
	quest.5060E85183881862.quest_subtitle: "+100 mana on your finger."
	quest.5060E85183881862.title: "&bForge a Ring of Mana"
	quest.50625DB768C232D9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron&r: &e250&r durability, speed &e6&r, +2 damage, iron mining level, Malleable III."
		""
		"The standard for stage 1. Mines diamond ore."
	]
	quest.50625DB768C232D9.quest_subtitle: "250 durability, speed 6."
	quest.50625DB768C232D9.title: "&fIron"
	quest.50627F9C20C520E4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_dimensions_d_mining.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Build a frame of &6Mine Frames&r, 4 wide and 5 high, 2 by 3 open inside. Without corners, &e10&r are enough. Bigger works too, up to 21 by 21."
		""
		"Then right click the inside with a &6sourcestone&r, and the portal glows blue. Build it in or next to your base: whoever comes back stands in front of exactly this portal."
	]
	quest.50627F9C20C520E4.quest_subtitle: "Like a Nether portal, only made of Mine Frames."
	quest.50627F9C20C520E4.title: "&6Light the Mine Portal"
	quest.5068D3CB12541380.quest_desc: [
		"&6Tin dust&r gives 10 mB tin, &6Enriched Tin&r 80 mB. Three &6copper ingots&r with &e10 mB tin&r become four &6bronze ingots&r."
		""
		"Bronze and tin are needed for the MekaSuit base modules, jetpack, canteen and Solar Neutron Activator. Tin ore lies throughout the overworld."
	]
	quest.5068D3CB12541380.quest_subtitle: "Three copper, a touch of tin."
	quest.5068D3CB12541380.title: "&6Alloy bronze"
	quest.506FEA0AE13804CF.quest_desc: [
		"&eMana Powder&r, &eManasteel ingot&r, &ebone meal&r, &esugar cane&r, &efishing rod&r. &d5,200 mana&r, gives &e2 runes&r."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/rune_of_water.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Goes into the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate, Rune Core, Narslimmus, Jiyuulia and is the catalyst for Spring and Winter."
	]
	quest.506FEA0AE13804CF.quest_subtitle: "The first element."
	quest.506FEA0AE13804CF.title: "&9Make the Rune of Water"
	quest.508D12A34A8D1EF5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wicked Weave&r: &e8 white wool&r around a &6Shadow Gem&r, extra an &6Unholy Symbol&r and &6blue dye&r. That gives &e8&r pieces."
		"&6Warlock's Cloak&r: &e7 Wicked Weave&r in a chestplate shape, extra &e2 Soul Shards&r."
		""
		"The cloak halves magic and wither damage. The hat gives &d50 percent&r more magic and wither damage, the boots make you immune to slowness."
	]
	quest.508D12A34A8D1EF5.quest_subtitle: "Half damage from magic and wither."
	quest.508D12A34A8D1EF5.title: "&5Sew a Warlock's Cloak"
	quest.509FF7E6C4A446D3.quest_desc: [
		"Put an &6iron ingot&r on the &aNatural Altar&r from Nature's Aura. For &d15,000 aura&r it becomes &6Infused Iron&r, a block of iron becomes a Block of Infused Iron for 135,000 aura."
		""
		"An iron ingot in the Mana Pool simply stays there on Kronwerke. From stage 2, Manasteel only comes from Infused Iron."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The iron bee from the &aBees&r chapter gives Infused Iron as a comb."
	]
	quest.509FF7E6C4A446D3.quest_subtitle: "Infused Iron, the raw material for Manasteel."
	quest.509FF7E6C4A446D3.title: "&6Refine iron at the Natural Altar"
	quest.50AB5CA48E1320D3.quest_desc: [
		"Programm &eLaser&r in den Controller, &620 Pressure Chamber Valves&r in die Eingangskiste, heraus kommen &68 Advanced Pressure Tubes&r. Mit dem Programm &eDrill & Laser&r geht es direkt vom &6Compressed Iron Block&r zu den acht Rohren."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/item/advanced_pressure_tube.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Ein normales Rohr hält 5 bar, ein Reinforced Tube 10. Das Advanced Tube hält &e20 bar&r und fasst 4 000 mL statt 1 000. Jede Maschine dieser Stufe braucht es als Zutat: die großen Kompressoren, der Dynamo, der Pressurized Spawner, das Aerial Interface."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Ein Block wird zu acht Rohren. Mach gleich vier Blöcke durch, 32 Rohre brauchst du schnell."
	]
	quest.50AB5CA48E1320D3.quest_subtitle: "Rohre für 20 bar."
	quest.50AB5CA48E1320D3.title: "&3&lMach Advanced Pressure Tubes"
	quest.50B1264EBE14692D.quest_desc: [
		"Look for the three End biomes of Biomes O' Plenty on the outer islands and check off once you have entered one."
		""
		"&6End Wilds:&r trees and End plants of their own. &6End Corruption:&r anomalies and lakes of liquid null. &6End Reef:&r barnacles, dead coral and tide pools."
	]
	quest.50B1264EBE14692D.quest_subtitle: "Three new biomes between the islands."
	quest.50B1264EBE14692D.title: "&dVisit the Biomes O' Plenty Biomes"
	quest.50BB336485F2AB6B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r a &6Basic Control Circuit&r from Mekanism on top, two &6Engine Pistons&r left and right of a &6brass block&r, at the bottom two &6polished blackstone slabs&r with a &6Fluid Tank&r between them. An Engine Piston is made from Andesite Alloy, shaft and zinc nugget diagonally, two per recipe."
		"{image:createdieselgenerators:textures/item/engine_piston.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Pump fuel in, on Kronwerke it does not take buckets. With &bbiodiesel&r it runs at &e96 RPM&r and &e4,096 SU&r, with &bdiesel&r 6,144 SU, with ethanol 2,048 SU, and it drinks &e1 mB per second&r. So one bucket lasts 16 minutes. A redstone signal stops it, an analog lever regulates it."
		""
		"&eUpgrades:&r The &6Turbocharger&r (propeller, pipe, zinc, iron sheets, andesite) doubles the speed at the same consumption, the &6Muffler&r (wool, pipe, iron sheets) makes it quiet. Right clicking the engine attaches them."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r For comparison, a water wheel carries 256 SU. One diesel engine alone drives a brass mixer plus press and deployers of a precision line, and on a single block."
	]
	quest.50BB336485F2AB6B.quest_subtitle: "96 RPM and 4,096 SU from one block."
	quest.50BB336485F2AB6B.title: "&6&lBuild a Diesel Engine"
	quest.5101AD18AC8C7D6D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mekanism&r, &6Einfaches Druckrohr&r: zieht &e750 mB Gas pro Tick&r, Fortgeschritten 2 000 (Stufe 3), Elite 64 000 und Ultimativ 256 000 (Stufe 4). &6Chemikalientank&r: &e64 000 mB&r, dann 256 000, 1 024 000 und 8 192 000 mB. Kein Filter, Seiten mit dem Konfigurator. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Zwei Stahlbarren und ein Glas ergeben acht Rohre. Sauerstoff, Wasserstoff, Chlor und alles andere aus dem Kapitel Mekanism: Fortgeschritten."
	]
	quest.5101AD18AC8C7D6D.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, Druckrohr: 750 mB pro Tick, Tank 64 000 mB."
	quest.5101AD18AC8C7D6D.title: "Lies: Druckrohre und Chemikalientanks"
	quest.5101B4DD22875170.quest_desc: [
		"&6Diamantwerkzeug&r in die Mitte, 2 Inferiumbarren links und rechts, 2 Inferium-Edelsteine oben und unten, an der Werkbank."
		""
		"2 000 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 9, +4 Schaden statt +3. Die Rüstung gibt 21 statt 20. Kapitel &aMystical Agriculture&r."
	]
	quest.5101B4DD22875170.quest_subtitle: "Mystical Agriculture: 2 000 Haltbarkeit."
	quest.5101B4DD22875170.title: "&aVeredle Diamant mit Inferium"
	quest.5101E57E0AE8D9E1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron ingots&r as input, &6Coke Dust&r as additive make a &6steel ingot&r and slag. Per ingot 204,800 FE in 20 seconds, that is &d512 FE/t&r per slot, with all twelve about &d6,000 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Hoppers or pipes refill iron and Coke Dust from above, a chest at the front takes the steel. The Crusher supplies the Coke Dust."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stage goal wants &e4,000 steel ingots&r. Collect the output in chests and bring it to the obelisk."
	]
	quest.5101E57E0AE8D9E1.quest_subtitle: "Twelve slots at once."
	quest.5101E57E0AE8D9E1.title: "&8&lSmelt 256 Steel in the Arc Furnace"
	quest.510403A293E4A17C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_advanced_adv_air.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r sechs &6Compressed Iron&r, ein &6Advanced Pressure Tube&r rechts in der Mitte und dein alter &6Air Compressor&r unten in der Mitte. Der Kompressor wird aufgewertet, du brauchst keinen neuen."
		""
		"Er macht &e50 mL Luft pro Tick&r statt 10 und hält &e20 bar&r. Speed Upgrades machen ihn schneller, aber er &cmuss gekühlt&r werden: Je heißer er wird, desto weniger Luft kommt heraus, bis gar nichts mehr."
		""
		"&eKühlen:&r Ein &6Heat Sink&r (drei Eisengitter, zwei Compressed Iron, ein Kupfer) an jede freie Seite leitet die Wärme in die Luft. Heat Pipes bringen weitere Kühlkörper heran, ein Air Grate Module an einem Rohr daneben macht sie wirksamer. Offene Seiten zur Luft kühlen von selbst ein bisschen."
	]
	quest.510403A293E4A17C.quest_subtitle: "Fünfmal so viel Luft, und er wird heiß."
	quest.510403A293E4A17C.title: "&3Bau einen Advanced Air Compressor"
	quest.51141FEBADB3F7D1.quest_desc: [
		"Antiker Schrott aus dem Nether um Y 15, im Ofen zu Netheritplatten, vier davon plus vier Gold. Am Schmiedetisch mit der Vorlage aus Bastionen auf Diamantausrüstung. Kapitel &cDer Nether&r."
		""
		"2 031 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 9, +1 Schaden, verbrennt nicht in Lava. Rüstung: Zähigkeit 3 und Rückstoßwiderstand pro Teil. Silent Gear nimmt Netherit als &6Beschichtung&r am Schmiedetisch."
	]
	quest.51141FEBADB3F7D1.quest_subtitle: "Four scraps, four gold, one ingot."
	quest.51141FEBADB3F7D1.title: "&8Schmiede Netherit"
	quest.5117E9E50A8546C5.quest_desc: [
		"You plant &6Sage Seeds&r on farmland like wheat. Ripe, the plant gives &6Sage&r and new seeds."
		""
		"{image:hexerei:textures/item/sage.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Bundled, dried and lit, sage keeps monsters away. It is also in the Mindful Trance Blend."
	]
	quest.5117E9E50A8546C5.quest_subtitle: "The herb against monsters."
	quest.5117E9E50A8546C5.title: "&2Grow sage"
	quest.512BBB0DC4DF0398.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_frame_simple.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the Dissolution Chamber: two &6Plastic&r, one &6Pity Frame&r, two &6Nether bricks&r, two &6iron ingots&r, one &6Gold Gear&r and &e250 mB of latex&r."
		""
		"The Laser Drill, Plant Fertilizer, Hydroponic Bed, Fermentation Station and Marine Fisher sit in this frame. Make two right away."
	]
	quest.512BBB0DC4DF0398.quest_subtitle: "Frame tier 2, with latex."
	quest.512BBB0DC4DF0398.title: "&7Build a Simple Machine Frame"
	quest.512C74E760831B20.quest_desc: [
		"Put a &6Seashelf&r into the enchanting table when the table has &bEterna 45&r, &dQuanta 15&r and &5Arcana 10&r. Fifteen bookshelves, five Seashelves and the table's base value are exactly enough. Out comes an &6Infused Seashelf&r."
		""
		"That only works when your world tier &aFrontier&r is active. In Haven the world tier caps you at 30, and the recipe stays dark."
		""
		"An Infused Seashelf gives &b5 Eterna&r (up to 60) and 5 percent Arcana. Six of them plus the bookshelves raise the table to Eterna 60, usable from world tier &aAscent&r (Uncommon set and a defeated invader)."
	]
	quest.512C74E760831B20.quest_subtitle: "Eterna 45 needs Frontier."
	quest.512C74E760831B20.title: "&3&lInfuse a Seashelf"
	quest.5132E72CB573902F.quest_desc: [
		"First the &6ME Import Export Bus&r: import bus, Logic Processor, export bus in a row. Then Acceleration Cards in the corners, Quantum Processors at the top, middle and bottom, the Import Export Bus on the left, an &6ME Stock Export Bus&r on the right."
		""
		"The &6ME Advanced IO Bus&r moves eight times as much as an export bus."
	]
	quest.5132E72CB573902F.quest_subtitle: "Import and export in one part."
	quest.5132E72CB573902F.title: "&dBuild an Advanced IO Bus"
	quest.5153FFFDB9965D39.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r wie die Anreicherungskammer, nur mit &6Glas&r statt der Eisenbarren links und rechts: Stahlgehäuse in die Mitte, zwei Schaltkreise, Redstone in die Ecken."
		""
		"Er schmilzt alles, was ein Ofen schmilzt, für etwa &d20 FE/t&r und ohne Brennstoff. Stell ihn direkt neben die Kammer und schalte an der Kammer den &eAuto-Auswurf&r ein (Reiter oben links im Fenster), dann wandert der Staub von selbst hinüber."
		""
		"Ein normaler Ofen tut es auch. Aber der Schmelzer kann später eine Fabrik werden, der Ofen nicht."
	]
	quest.5153FFFDB9965D39.quest_subtitle: "Staub wird Barren, ohne Kohle."
	quest.5153FFFDB9965D39.title: "&6Bau einen Energiegeladenen Schmelzer"
	quest.515CC271AAE15835.quest_desc: [
		"First exactly one &aform&r (how), then &aeffects&r (what), behind each link &aaugments&r (how strong). It reads from left to right."
		""
		"&dProjectile&r fires a ball, &dTouch&r acts right in front of you, &dSelf&r on you. An augment always changes the link directly to its left."
		""
		"Several effects act one after another on the same target. &eProjectile, Break, Pickup&r mines and puts the loot into your inventory."
	]
	quest.515CC271AAE15835.quest_subtitle: "Form, effect, augment."
	quest.515CC271AAE15835.title: "&dLearn how a spell is built"
	quest.516DDF5BF852E4FE.quest_desc: [
		"Mine a &6monster spawner&r with a pickaxe with &6Silk Touch&r (costs 100 durability) and place it at home over a shaft. It spawns up to &e4 monsters&r every 10 to 40 seconds as long as you are within &e16 blocks&r."
		""
		"Water on the spawner floor washes the monsters to the shaft. With &6spawner runes&r you change rate, count and range; the &6Frontiersman's Rune&r makes 7 monsters per spawn at 24 blocks activation."
		""
		"Spawners stand in dungeons, mines and as rogue spawners freely in caves. Runes and spawn eggs are in the &6Apotheosis&r chapter."
	]
	quest.516DDF5BF852E4FE.quest_subtitle: "A monster source you set up wherever you want."
	quest.516DDF5BF852E4FE.title: "&cGet yourself a spawner"
	quest.516DEFBAEAFDECA8.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Verfluchte Pyramide&r steht in der &eWüste&r (nur im Biom Wüste). Such von einem hohen Punkt aus oder nimm den &6Naturkompass&r, der das nächste Wüstenbiom zeigt."
		""
		"Rundherum leben &cKoboleton&r (25 Lebenspunkte, schnell). Sie klauen dir Gegenstände aus der Hand und rennen weg. &6Klebrige Handschuhe&r (Faden, Leder, Schleimball, Hasenfell, formlos) verhindern das. Sie lassen Koboleton-Knochen und selten Altmetall fallen."
		""
		"In der Pyramide gibt es Fallen aus Sandstein: fallende Blöcke, Feuer und Giftpfeile. Geh langsam und nicht als Gruppe durch enge Gänge. Die Kisten unten enthalten &6Altmetall&r, manchmal einen &6Unzerbrechlichen Schädel&r oder ein &6Lebens-Ankh&r."
		""
		"Ab Stufe 2 craftest du das &6Wüstenauge&r (Enderauge in der Mitte, Gold, gemeißelter Sandstein, Smaragd, toter Busch, Kaktus, verrottetes Fleisch, Knochen). Es fliegt wie ein Enderauge zur nächsten Pyramide."
	]
	quest.516DEFBAEAFDECA8.quest_subtitle: "Eine große Pyramide in der Wüste, bewacht von Koboleton."
	quest.516DEFBAEAFDECA8.title: "&6Finde die verfluchte Pyramide"
	quest.517A40650C548517.quest_desc: [
		"Enter each of the &d22&r biomes of Eternal Starlight, including the seas, the &6Ether Rivers&r, the &6Solaris Isles&r and at the very bottom &6The Abyss&r."
		""
		"A &6Nature's Compass&r finds the missing ones. For the seas take a boat and water breathing potions."
	]
	quest.517A40650C548517.quest_subtitle: "From crystal desert sand down into the abyss."
	quest.517A40650C548517.title: "&b&lExplore All 22 Biomes"
	quest.518A03BA5EFDE940.quest_desc: [
		"A &6sticky piston&r on top, &6string&r left and right of the upgrade base, &6three redstone&r at the bottom."
		""
		"The filter has &e9 slots&r. Whitelist means only these items, blacklist everything except these. An empty filter on blacklist takes everything."
		""
		"&6Tip:&r Put ores, coal and raw metals on the whitelist, then cobblestone stays in your inventory, for the obelisk."
	]
	quest.518A03BA5EFDE940.quest_subtitle: "What you pick up lands in the backpack."
	quest.518A03BA5EFDE940.title: "Build a Pickup Upgrade"
	quest.518EC580C41117AF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Depths&r (3 fish, pufferfish, 2 Water Essences): underwater you run out of air much more slowly. In a tier 3 slot not at all anymore, and you swim faster."
		"&6Heights&r (spider eye, 3 rabbit hides, 2 Air Essences): jump higher, fall farther without damage."
		"&6The Amethyst Golem&r (3 obsidian): &e15 percent&r knockback resistance per level."
		"&6Reach&r from Ars Additions (3 Alakarkinos Tokens, 3 Manipulation Essences): &e+1&r reach for blocks and creatures per level."
	]
	quest.518EC580C41117AF.quest_subtitle: "Checklist: diving, jumping, standing firm."
	quest.518EC580C41117AF.title: "&6Sew Threads for Travel"
	quest.519768CE5D208790.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Infusion Pedestal&r is the altar without a base: &e2 gold sheets&r from the Create press, &e1 red wool&r between them, below &e2 stone&r on top of each other. You need &e8&r, so 16 gold sheets, 8 wool and 16 stone in total."
		""
		"A pedestal takes exactly one item, right click puts it in and takes it out again. For a clear overview: essence on the four straight pedestals, material on the four diagonal ones, or the other way round."
		""
		"&eTip:&r You dye red wool from white wool with red dye from poppies or red petals from Botania."
	]
	quest.519768CE5D208790.quest_subtitle: "Two gold sheets and a piece of wool per pedestal."
	quest.519768CE5D208790.title: "&dPlace Eight Pedestals"
	quest.519885EF47C0DFA7.quest_desc: [
		"Put a &6log&r on the cutting board and click it with an &6axe&r. You get the stripped log and &6tree bark&r."
		""
		"Bark is the main ingredient of Organic Compost."
	]
	quest.519885EF47C0DFA7.quest_subtitle: "Log, axe, cutting board."
	quest.519885EF47C0DFA7.title: "&6Peel tree bark"
	quest.51A0ABB1FCF08BB4.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a &6Demon's Dream Essence&r into Spiritfire. Out comes &6Otherworld Essence&r."
		""
		"{image:occultism:textures/item/otherworld_essence.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"You need it more often than you think: &e2&r for the Djinni Wandering Trader, &e4&r for every revival in Susje's Simple Circle, &e3&r for every chalk repair."
		""
		"In stage 3, Afrit also repair tools, armour and miners with it. Keep a small stock."
	]
	quest.51A0ABB1FCF08BB4.quest_subtitle: "The essence without side effects."
	quest.51A0ABB1FCF08BB4.title: "&dPurify Otherworld Essence"
	quest.51A8FB77C4AAFE9B.quest_desc: [
		"Glass top and bottom, Infused Alloy left and right, &6osmium dust&r in the middle. Up to 8 per machine; eight make it &eten times&r as fast."
		""
		"The maths and the mix with Energy Upgrades: &5Mekanism: Ore Step by Step&r chapter."
	]
	quest.51A8FB77C4AAFE9B.quest_subtitle: "Faster, but hungrier."
	quest.51A8FB77C4AAFE9B.title: "&bBuild a Speed Upgrade"
	quest.51D7B0370F10EEFA.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &6Source gem blocks&r from Ars Nouveau in the corners, &6diamonds&r on the sides, a &6Draconium Core&r in the middle."
		""
		"The &ecatalyst&r goes into the core, the part that gets transformed. Around it stand &einjectors&r with one ingredient each. The injectors get the power, not the core. In the core's window you press &eCraft&r."
	]
	quest.51D7B0370F10EEFA.quest_subtitle: "Draconic Evolution's crafting table."
	quest.51D7B0370F10EEFA.title: "&dBuild a Fusion Crafting Core"
	quest.51E5531618D4B793.quest_desc: [
		"&6Component:&r a Logic Processor in the middle, certus on the sides, redstone in the corners. &6Housing:&r quartz glass, redstone, iron and copper. Both together at the crafting table give the cell."
		""
		"&eHow a cell counts:&r every type costs bytes up front, after that eight items need one byte. A 1k cell holds &e8,128&r of one kind, or &e4,160&r when all 63 types are taken."
		""
		"Broken tools from the mob farm do not belong in it: every durability is a type of its own. Empty cells come apart with sneak and right click."
	]
	quest.51E5531618D4B793.quest_subtitle: "1,024 bytes, 63 types."
	quest.51E5531618D4B793.title: "&7Build a 1k cell"
	quest.51E593A88A66EDF2.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless in the crafting table: &6Arcane Crystal Dust&r, &6redstone&r, &6blaze powder&r, &6bone meal&r, a &6phantom membrane&r and &6gunpowder&r give &e4 Mundabitur Dust&r."
		""
		"With Mundabitur Dust you awaken the mod's three structures: right click on the Smithing Table of the Hephaestus Forge, on the Arcane Crystal Obelisk and on the Clibano Core. It also goes into every Deorum ingot."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Right clicking a creeper charges it like lightning. Do not do it by accident."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Phantom membranes are the bottleneck. Whoever does not sleep for three nights gets visitors, and phantoms are easy to shoot from the roof."
	]
	quest.51E593A88A66EDF2.quest_subtitle: "The dust that brings structures to life."
	quest.51E593A88A66EDF2.title: "&cMix Mundabitur Dust"
	quest.51E6E80E2A3ADDEB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_pipes.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Energy Pipe:&r three Electrum in a row, gives six. &6Item Pipe:&r planks at the top and bottom, nickel in the middle, gives six. &6Fluid Pipe:&r copper at the top and bottom, silicon in the middle."
		""
		"Right click the connection to a chest to turn on extraction: &e8 items every 5 ticks&r from the first filled slot. A &6Motor&r, set into the pipe with a right click, pulls from all slots."
		""
		"Energy Pipes carry &e10,000 RF/t&r. The &6Pipe Wrench&r (steel and nickel) cuts single sides."
	]
	quest.51E6E80E2A3ADDEB.quest_subtitle: "Power, items, fluids."
	quest.51E6E80E2A3ADDEB.title: "&9Lay Pipes"
	quest.51FCD63D2E9D22C7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Charcoal&r on the brazier. On the hands: &6Soul Shard&r and &6rotten flesh&r. One rotten flesh into a &6Necrotic Focus&r."
		""
		"A zombie appears on the brazier. With bones a skeleton, with phantom membrane a phantom, with soul sand in the focus a wither skeleton."
	]
	quest.51FCD63D2E9D22C7.quest_subtitle: "Lesser Summoning."
	quest.51FCD63D2E9D22C7.title: "&8Summon a Zombie"
	quest.5218331719A6B0B1.quest_desc: [
		"Steel, a crafter, circuits, a steel casing and a chest. A &6Crafting Formula&r (paper and circuit) stores a recipe."
		""
		"Put the recipe into the grid, the formula into its slot, and it crafts with power from its stock as long as ingredients keep coming. Ideal for steel casings off the line."
	]
	quest.5218331719A6B0B1.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism's first autocrafting machine."
	quest.5218331719A6B0B1.title: "&3Let the Formulaic Assemblicator craft"
	quest.521891764C51A6E3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Quarry Y Setter:&r three glass at the top, below that &6lapis, Marker, lapis&r. With it you set how deep it digs. &6StatusChecker:&r the same with iron instead of lapis, it shows what the machine is doing right now."
		""
		"For diamonds it is enough to dig to just above the bedrock."
	]
	quest.521891764C51A6E3.quest_subtitle: "Y Setter and StatusChecker."
	quest.521891764C51A6E3.title: "&7Set the Depth"
	quest.52265AF68B03EAFC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/start_here_m_altar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Ritual of the Forest with an &6oak sapling&r: 3 &6Livingrock&r (from Botania's Pure Daisy), a Gold Leaf, a gold ingot and a Token of Joy. Out comes the &6Natural Altar&r."
		""
		"The altar only works inside its structure of stone bricks, planks, chiseled stone bricks and &6Golden Stone Bricks&r (stone bricks and Brilliant Fiber). The book shows the build layer by layer."
	]
	quest.52265AF68B03EAFC.quest_subtitle: "A ritual for the altar, a structure around it."
	quest.52265AF68B03EAFC.title: "&aBuild the Natural Altar"
	quest.522EB6B27239EEFA.quest_desc: [
		"In the &cheated&r mixer &b100 mB of random spawn fluid&r and a &6blaze rod&r give &b250 mB of blaze spawn fluid&r."
		""
		"The spawner takes twice as long for a blaze as for a zombie, but blazes drop blaze rods. With a Loot Collector the rods land directly in the chest."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Blaze powder for brass, blaze rods for Blaze Burner feed and templates: a blaze farm keeps the Brass Works running. You still have to get the first rod for mixing yourself."
	]
	quest.522EB6B27239EEFA.quest_subtitle: "Blaze spawn fluid."
	quest.522EB6B27239EEFA.title: "&cBreed Blazes without a Fortress"
	quest.52329B282B1E5A1E.quest_desc: [
		"Jede Vorhersage ergibt &eeinen&r der Drops ihres Modells, und zwar in Mengen, die sich lohnen:"
		""
		"&eZombie:&r 64 Verrottetes Fleisch, &68 Eisen&r, 16 Karotten oder 16 Kartoffeln. &eSkelett:&r 32 Pfeile, 24 Knochen oder 4 Schädel. &eCreeper:&r 32 Schwarzpulver oder 4 Köpfe. &eSpinne:&r 32 Fäden, 16 Augen oder 4 Spinnweben."
		"&eLohe:&r &616 Lohenruten&r. &eWitherskelett:&r &63 Schädel&r, 24 Knochen oder 32 Kohle. &eEnderman:&r 16 Enderperlen oder ein Endkristall. &eEisengolem:&r 32 Eisen. &eMagier:&r 2 Totems der Unsterblichkeit oder 16 Smaragde."
		""
		"Mit Reliquary, EvilCraft und Deeper and Darker im Pack kommen deren Mobteile dazu: Verwitterte Rippe, Geschmolzener Kern, Enderträne, Herz der Tiefe. Der Tooltip des Modells listet alles auf, halt Shift."
	]
	quest.52329B282B1E5A1E.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 4. Immer ein ganzer Stapel."
	quest.52329B282B1E5A1E.title: "&6Was aus einer Vorhersage wird"
	quest.52365814DA71B494.quest_desc: [
		"&6Seltsamer Trank&r plus &6Seelenkristall&r, oder &6Trank der Unsichtbarkeit&r plus &6Seelenstaub&r, ergibt den &6Trank der Sculk-Affinität&r. Redstone verlängert ihn."
		""
		"&eWirkung:&r Solange er läuft, nehmen Sculk-Sensoren, Kreischer und der Wärter deine Schwingungen nicht wahr. Für Antike Städte und Tempel ist das der wichtigste Trank im Pack."
		""
		"&eAußerdem:&r Vier &6Seelenstaub&r um ein Glas ergeben zwei &6Schalldichtes Glas&r."
	]
	quest.52365814DA71B494.quest_subtitle: "Die Sculk-Welt hört dich nicht mehr."
	quest.52365814DA71B494.title: "&bBraue Sculk-Affinität"
	quest.52393952DFA0BCC3.quest_desc: [
		"&eMain item:&r a &6Quantum Core&r (rune, flint and Mundabitur Dust shapeless) in the middle of the forge. &eOn the pedestals:&r &e4 Spawner Scrap&r. &eEssences:&r 200 Aureal, 1,200 Blood, 155 Experience, 5 Souls. Then right click with the gavel."
		""
		"&6Spawner Scrap&r drops when you mine a &6spawner&r without Silk Touch, one per spawner. So four spawners, search dungeons and mines."
		""
		"A ritual takes &e25 seconds&r. If a sign appears above the forge, everything fits. The pedestals empty, the result lies in the main slot."
		""
		"The &6Quantum Catcher&r catches an animal or monster with right click and releases it again with right click on the ground. That costs &eyour own Aureal&r: as much as the creature's maximum health, half for animals. Players and villagers do not work."
	]
	quest.52393952DFA0BCC3.quest_subtitle: "A mob in your pocket."
	quest.52393952DFA0BCC3.title: "&5&lThe First Ritual: Quantum Catcher"
	quest.523E88118DC60B60.quest_desc: [
		"Build up a stock of &e16 Source Gem blocks&r."
		""
		"Relays carry Source, rituals harvest and protect, turrets fire, a motor drives Create. &6Stage 3&r brings the Archmage's Spell Book, flight, Awakening and the robes. Continue in the &dArs Nouveau: Master&r chapter."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The magic pillar of stage 2 is Mana Pearls and Terrasteel from Botania. Bring your Source Gems to the engineers; they need them for every Blaze Burner."
	]
	quest.523E88118DC60B60.quest_subtitle: "Source for the whole town."
	quest.523E88118DC60B60.title: "&d&lBecome a master of Source"
	quest.52599A8537E3F5A2.quest_desc: [
		"&e8 Livingrock&r around a &eMana Diamond&r or a &eMana Pearl&r. Stores &d500,000 mana&r."
		""
		"Throwing it into the pool charges it, a sneaking right click on the pool with the wand switches the direction. In your inventory it supplies Manasteel tools, bow and robe."
	]
	quest.52599A8537E3F5A2.quest_subtitle: "Half a pool in your pocket."
	quest.52599A8537E3F5A2.title: "&bCraft a Mana Tablet"
	quest.527289BB5DBD0AFC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Battery I:&r eight &6nether quartz&r around a Blank Upgrade Module. &6Efficiency I:&r eight &6redstone&r around a blank module."
		""
		"Battery I gives the gadget &d2,000,000 FE&r more storage, II even more. Efficiency lets it mine faster, but costs &d10 FE&r extra per block, 10 more for every higher level."
	]
	quest.527289BB5DBD0AFC.quest_subtitle: "Battery and Efficiency."
	quest.527289BB5DBD0AFC.title: "&bGive the gadget more stamina"
	quest.52759E7E9C236B7C.quest_desc: [
		"The antimatter from the SPS is a gas. The &6Chemical Crystallizer&r makes an &5antimatter pellet&r from &e1,000 mB&r."
		""
		"In reverse the Oxidizer turns a pellet back into 1,000 mB of gas. That is how you store antimatter."
	]
	quest.52759E7E9C236B7C.quest_subtitle: "1,000 mB into the crystallizer."
	quest.52759E7E9C236B7C.title: "&5Crystallize the First Pellet"
	quest.5281639F6C158E03.quest_desc: [
		"In the Imbuement Chamber: &6Enchanted Spell Turret&r in, &e3 essences&r of one element and the matching &6greater focus&r on the pedestals, &d5,000 source&r."
		""
		"The turret triggers the combos of its focus, and spells with a glyph of its school cost it &e65 percent&r less source. A &dFlashjack&r can hijack it and aim it at enemies itself."
	]
	quest.5281639F6C158E03.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: the greater focus in a turret."
	quest.5281639F6C158E03.title: "&aBuild an Elemental Turret"
	quest.52930B06D06C5604.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_welcome.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Wooden chest&r in the middle, &6four leather&r (one on top, three at the bottom), &6four string&r on the sides and in the top corners."
		""
		"The leather backpack has &e27 slots&r and &eone upgrade slot&r. Open it with right click in hand or with &eB&r while it is in your inventory. A sneaking right click on the ground sets it down, the contents stay inside. Dyes in the crafting grid colour it."
		""
		"This chapter is your first week: backpack, drawer wall, upgradeable barrels, a vault for Create. &cKronwerke:&r Copper and iron backpacks open in stage 2, gold and diamond in stage 3, netherite in stage 4. The tooltip says which stage is missing."
	]
	quest.52930B06D06C5604.quest_subtitle: "Your storage to take along."
	quest.52930B06D06C5604.title: "&6&lSew a backpack"
	quest.52A695A19BD76174.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r an &6Electron Tube&r with &e20 mB redstone&r in the infuser gives a &6Basic Control Circuit&r. There are no other ways."
		""
		"Every machine after the infuser needs some. A dozen in stock saves many switches of the infusion type."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r The Advanced Control Circuit comes in stage 3 with printed silicon from AE2, the Elite Control Circuit in stage 4 with draconium dust."
	]
	quest.52A695A19BD76174.quest_subtitle: "A tube soaked in redstone."
	quest.52A695A19BD76174.title: "&aInfuse a control circuit"
	quest.52B40541879BF099.quest_desc: [
		"Blazegold Upgrade Template (5 Blazegold um ein Blank Upgrade) am Schmiedetisch auf das Ferricore-Stück, die Upgrades bleiben drin."
		""
		"1 440 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 12, +3 Schaden, Diamant-Abbaustufe. Neu: Hammer 3x3, Auto Smelter, Cauterize Wounds für die Rüstung. Dazu die &6Portal Gun&r (5 Blazegold, Enderauge)."
	]
	quest.52B40541879BF099.quest_subtitle: "Just Dire Things: 3x3 und Auto-Schmelzen."
	quest.52B40541879BF099.title: "&6Steig auf Blazegold um"
	quest.52B519D3FC982D6C.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Spinnen&r mit dem Learner im Inventar. Höhlenspinnen aus den Minenschächten zählen mit."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d128 FE/t&r. Eine Vorhersage wird zu &632 Fäden&r, 16 Spinnenaugen, 4 Spinnweben, 3 &6Feiner Seide&r für Silent Gear oder 2 Cheliceren von Reliquary."
	]
	quest.52B519D3FC982D6C.quest_subtitle: "Faden für alles."
	quest.52B519D3FC982D6C.title: "&8Lerne die Spinne"
	quest.52B9F48B7C9C8BD9.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6sticks&r and an &6iron ingot&r make the &6Engineer's Wire Cutters&r. They last for &e250&r cuts."
		""
		"With a plate in the crafting table they cut it into a wire. Right click on a connector takes down all the wires that hang on it."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/tool_wirecutter.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.52B9F48B7C9C8BD9.quest_subtitle: "They cut plates into wire and take wires down."
	quest.52B9F48B7C9C8BD9.title: "&7Build wire cutters"
	quest.52CDB5AFF4147675.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.apotheosis.open_world_tier_select\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" (key \"},{\"text\":\"Open World Tier Select\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" in the controls settings), choose \"},{\"text\":\"Haven\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" and click \"},{\"text\":\"Activate\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\". Only then do your affix items show what they can do.\"}]"
		""
		"A &6world tier&r only applies to you. It decides how strong monsters near you are and how good the loot is. In Haven &7Common&r drops 60 percent of the time, &aUncommon&r 36 and &9Rare&r 4 percent."
		""
		"There are five tiers: Haven, Frontier, Ascent, Summit and Pinnacle. Each has to be unlocked first and then activated here. The &eDetailed Info&r button shows the chances and bonuses for every tier."
	]
	quest.52CDB5AFF4147675.quest_subtitle: "[\"\",{\"keybind\":\"key.apotheosis.open_world_tier_select\"},{\"text\":\" opens the menu.\"}]"
	quest.52CDB5AFF4147675.title: "&eActivate the Haven World Tier"
	quest.52D1CFF3595407C9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Controller&r: the heart of the network, 32 channels per side. &6Energy Acceptor&r: 2 FE to 1 AE. &6Energy Cell&r and &6Dense Energy Cell&r: 200,000 and 1.6 million AE of buffer. &6Vibration Chamber&r: fuel to 40 AE/t."
		"&6ME Drive&r: 10 cells. &6ME Chest&r: one cell with a terminal of its own. &6ME IO Port&r: fills or empties cells. &6Cell Workbench&r: filter cells and fit them with cards."
		"&6Terminal&r, &6Crafting Terminal&r, &6Pattern Encoding Terminal&r, &6Pattern Access Terminal&r: look, craft, write recipes, manage providers. &6Storage Monitor&r and &6Conversion Monitor&r: show an amount, the second one also swaps."
		"&6Import&r, &6Export&r and &6Storage Bus&r: in, out, foreign chests. &6Formation&r and &6Annihilation Plane&r: place and break blocks. &6Level Emitter&r: redstone by stock, without a channel. &6Toggle Bus&r: cut a cable by redstone."
		"&6Interface&r: a chest with a stock. &6Pattern Provider&r and &6Molecular Assembler&r: autocrafting. &6Inscriber&r, &6Charger&r, &6Growth Accelerator&r, &6Matter Condenser&r: machines. &6P2P Tunnel&r and &6Access Point&r: connections."
	]
	quest.52D1CFF3595407C9.quest_subtitle: "One line per device."
	quest.52D1CFF3595407C9.title: "&7Know every AE2 device"
	quest.52E9875B96B119C7.quest_desc: [
		"Gold nuggets, an ink sac, an &6ender pearl&r and paper make three &6Warp Scrolls&r. Each opens the list of all your waystones once."
		""
		"{image:waystones:textures/item/warp_scroll.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Handy while the Warp Stone is missing or cooling down."
	]
	quest.52E9875B96B119C7.quest_subtitle: "Travel once, free choice of destination."
	quest.52E9875B96B119C7.title: "&6Write a Warp Scroll"
	quest.52FA15A0664F4074.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r sechs &6Verstärkte Ziegel&r außen herum, ein &6Ofen&r unten in der Mitte, ein &6Druckluftrohr&r rechts in der Mitte ergeben den &6Luftkompressor&r (Air Compressor)."
		""
		"Er verbrennt alles, was ein Ofen verbrennt, und macht daraus &b10 mL Luft pro Tick&r. Ein Stück Kohle brennt 1 600 Ticks, das sind 16 000 mL. Eimer mit Lava nimmt er nicht, dafür gibt es den Flüssigkeitskompressor."
		""
		"Der Kompressor ist eine Maschine der ersten Stufe und hält selbst nur &e5 Bar&r aus. Läuft er ohne Verbraucher weiter, explodiert er irgendwann. Häng also immer ein Rohr mit Ventil dran, oder nimm die Kohle heraus."
		""
		"&eOhne Kohle:&r Der &6Handkompressor&r (Manual Compressor: zwei Druckeisenzahnräder, ein Steinsockel, Rohr, Barren, zwei rote Farbstoffe) pumpt, solange du Rechtsklick hältst, und kostet Hunger statt Brennstoff. Jeder Pumpstoß gibt 1 000 mL."
	]
	quest.52FA15A0664F4074.quest_subtitle: "Kohle rein, Druck raus."
	quest.52FA15A0664F4074.title: "&6&lBau einen Luftkompressor"
	quest.5305899DAF8A4495.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/food_f_rich_soil.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Place compost and wait. Mushrooms, podzol, mycelium or more compost nearby speed it up."
		""
		"Plants on Rich Soil grow faster. With a hoe it becomes Rich Soil Farmland."
	]
	quest.5305899DAF8A4495.quest_subtitle: "Everything grows faster here."
	quest.5305899DAF8A4495.title: "&6&lMake Rich Soil"
	quest.532147EA99A0CA1A.quest_desc: [
		"&eTunnel:&r Projectile, Break, Amplify, AOE, Pierce, Pierce, Pickup. &eOre:&r Projectile, Break, Fortune, Smelt, Pickup."
		"&eGarden:&r Touch, Grow, AOE, AOE. &eHarvest:&r Touch, Harvest, AOE, AOE, Pickup. &eMedic:&r Projectile, Heal, Amplify."
		""
		"A spell has at most ten glyphs. When it gets tight, split it up or take a wand."
	]
	quest.532147EA99A0CA1A.quest_subtitle: "Tunnels, fields and ingots."
	quest.532147EA99A0CA1A.title: "&d&lUpgrade your spell book"
	quest.53236C05A667D990.quest_desc: [
		"&e5 Otherstone&r in a U shape make a &6Sacrificial Bowl&r. You put ingredients in with right click and take them out the same way."
		""
		"The bowls have to stand somewhere within &e8 blocks&r of the middle; the exact spot doesn't matter. Crafted with copper or silver ingots you get prettier variants."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Build eight right away. Later rituals have up to eight ingredients."
	]
	quest.53236C05A667D990.quest_subtitle: "This is where the ingredients go."
	quest.53236C05A667D990.title: "&6Set up four sacrificial bowls"
	quest.532B7709766C0367.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Sevira's Permanent Confinement."
		"&6Bowls:&r &e4 Otherstone&r or Otherrock, a &6netherite ingot&r, an &6Iesnium block&r, a &bSpirit Attuned Crystal&r, an &cAfrit Essence&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Afrit book, 300 seconds."
		""
		"Put in a &6Soul Gem&r with a captured mob, a &6weapon&r and spirit fuel: Demon's Dream Seeds, Fruit, Essence or Otherworld Essence. The Afrit clones the mob and defeats it again and again, the loot lands in the block."
		""
		"Looting brings more loot, Sharpness makes it faster. A redstone signal stops it. Empty it with a hopper, full slots throw loot away."
	]
	quest.532B7709766C0367.quest_subtitle: "An Afrit fights for you in an arena."
	quest.532B7709766C0367.title: "&6Build the Dimensional Battlefield"
	quest.533523A58B9514E6.quest_desc: [
		"A 64k component in the &6ME Fluid Cell Housing&r gives the &664k fluid cell&r. With the chemical housing from Applied Mekanistics it becomes a chemical cell."
		""
		"Fluids count &e8 buckets per byte&r. So a 64k fluid cell holds over half a million buckets of one kind."
	]
	quest.533523A58B9514E6.quest_subtitle: "The same component, a different housing."
	quest.533523A58B9514E6.title: "&9Store Fluids in 64k"
	quest.533A9512C7763E2A.quest_desc: [
		"Put &5draconium dust&r into a furnace or an Energized Smelter. One dust becomes one &5Draconium Ingot&r."
		""
		"{image:draconicevolution:textures/item/components/draconium_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r AE2's 256k component and the MEGA components for 1M and 4M each have a draconium ingot in the middle. So bring some to the storage people."
	]
	quest.533A9512C7763E2A.quest_subtitle: "One dust, one ingot."
	quest.533A9512C7763E2A.title: "&5Smelt Draconium Ingots"
	quest.533B48A119AC94B6.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Hedyrin's Lure."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6chest&r, a &6block of iron&r, a &6dispenser&r, a &6hopper&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r a &6zombie&r nearby."
		""
		"Familiars follow you and give bonuses. The Greedy picks up items within 32 blocks for you. In the &6Familiar Ring&r (Strigeor's Higher Binding) it increases your pickup radius."
	]
	quest.533B48A119AC94B6.quest_subtitle: "Your first familiar collects for you."
	quest.533B48A119AC94B6.title: "&dSummon a Greedy Familiar"
	quest.533DFF66309DB39F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_vault_big.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Create&r, &6Tresor&r: &e20 Stapel pro Block&r, Grundfläche bis 3 x 3, bis dreimal so lang wie breit, also bis 81 Blöcke und 1 620 Stapel in einem Inventar. Nur Trichter, Bänder, Arme und Rohre kommen hinein, von Hand geht nichts. Kein Filter. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Zwei Eisenbleche um ein Holzfass. Ein Tresor am Ende der Maschinenstraße fängt alles auf, und ein Komparator meldet den Stand."
	]
	quest.533DFF66309DB39F.quest_subtitle: "Create, Tresor: 20 Stapel pro Block, bis 81 Blöcke am Stück."
	quest.533DFF66309DB39F.title: "Bau einen Tresor"
	quest.534A7C35D49D8DEF.quest_desc: [
		"Fish, fish, fish. With luck you pull out &bNeptunium&r as a nugget, or &6Neptune's Bounty&r in the treasure chest."
		""
		"Neptunium ingots make tools, armour and Aquaculture's best fishing rod."
	]
	quest.534A7C35D49D8DEF.quest_subtitle: "A rare catch from the deep."
	quest.534A7C35D49D8DEF.title: "&bFish up Neptunium"
	quest.53514A25A75A41BB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Five planks&r and &6four iron ingots&r in a checkerboard pattern."
		""
		"Chests and barrels take almost the same upgrades as the backpack. A finished upgrade can be converted between backpack and storage; EMI shows the recipes."
	]
	quest.53514A25A75A41BB.quest_subtitle: "Not the same one as for the backpack."
	quest.53514A25A75A41BB.title: "Build an upgrade base for chests"
	quest.53514EDE2640B797.quest_desc: [
		"&6Double doors&r open together. An empty stack in your hand refills from your inventory. The tooltip of a &6shulker box&r shows its contents, that of a tool its durability as a number."
		""
		"You place blocks on the edge in front of you without sneaking: look down at an angle over the edge. Through grass and flowers you hit whatever stands behind them."
		""
		"You carry the &6Crafting on a Stick&r crafting table in your hand. And in the enchanting table, at traders and in chests you find &dTireless&r: with this enchantment Ultimine costs no hunger on the tool."
	]
	quest.53514EDE2640B797.quest_subtitle: "What is just there in everyday life."
	quest.53514EDE2640B797.title: "&7Know the Little Things"
	quest.53598BFDD376FB7D.quest_desc: [
		"Build a &6brewing stand&r (blaze rod, 3 cobblestone). Water bottle plus &6Nether wart&r, then &6magma cream&r, makes the &6Potion of Fire Resistance&r."
		""
		"It lasts 3 minutes, with redstone 8. The brewing stand runs on blaze powder. A stack of them belongs in your bag for every longer trip."
	]
	quest.53598BFDD376FB7D.quest_subtitle: "Lava becomes bath water."
	quest.53598BFDD376FB7D.title: "&cBrew fire resistance"
	quest.536581E1DD51BB52.quest_desc: [
		"Mehrere Speicher im selben Netz addieren sich: drei &6Einfache Flux-Speicher&r halten &d6 Millionen FE&r und nehmen oder geben zusammen &d60 000 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Das reicht, um eine Nacht ohne Solarstrom oder eine Pause im Reaktor zu überbrücken. Und sechs davon werden in Stufe 4 zum Herkulischen Speicher mit 16 Millionen FE, der Strom wandert mit."
	]
	quest.536581E1DD51BB52.quest_subtitle: "Sechs Millionen FE Puffer."
	quest.536581E1DD51BB52.title: "&9Stell drei Speicher auf"
	quest.53804725BDD596BD.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6iron ingots&r in a cross, middle empty, make an &6Iron Gear&r. The same with four &6gold ingots&r and four &6diamonds&r."
		""
		"Iron goes into the Plant Sower and the sewage machines, gold into the Plant Gatherer and the Laser Drill, diamond into the Dissolution Chamber, the Bioreactor and every laser base."
	]
	quest.53804725BDD596BD.quest_subtitle: "Four pieces in a cross, one gear."
	quest.53804725BDD596BD.title: "&7Build Iron, Gold and Diamond Gears"
	quest.5387317D537DB360.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_shelf.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Five &6Steel Rods&r and three &6Steel Scaffolding Slabs&r make six &6Steel Catwalks&r. &e24&r of them and &64 steel fences&r in the shape from the manual, then the hammer on it."
		""
		"&eIn:&r Wooden Storage Crates (eight Treated Wood Planks in a ring), Reinforced Storage Crates or shulker boxes by right click. Every level has its own window. A hopper at the front fills two crates, at the side a row of four, from above a column of three."
	]
	quest.5387317D537DB360.quest_subtitle: "4x4x2, 24 Steel Catwalks and 4 steel fences, twelve crates in one place."
	quest.5387317D537DB360.title: "&9Form a Crate Storage Shelf"
	quest.538B0C7E814E36A3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/flux_networks_setup_mek.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Zieh die Kabel aus der Basis. &e1.&r Ein &6Stecker&r an jeden Generator oder an den Ausgang der Energiezelle. &e2.&r Ein &6Punkt&r an jede Maschine oder zwischen zwei. &e3.&r Alle ins selbe Netz, die Punkte mit dem Konfigurator kopieren."
		""
		"Für eine Basis mit zwanzig Maschinen rechne mit zehn bis zwanzig Punkten, also 10 bis 20 Quelljuwelen und ein Stapel Obsidian. Das ist eine Stunde an der Imbuement-Kammer, und danach verlegst du nie wieder ein Kabel."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Stahlstraßen, Infusionsanlagen, der AE2-Controller und die Elfen-Automatik laufen alle am selben Netz. Wenn der Nachbar Strom übrig hat, hängt er einen Stecker an sein Kraftwerk und gibt dir das Passwort."
	]
	quest.538B0C7E814E36A3.quest_subtitle: "Ein Stecker am Kraftwerk, ein Punkt an jeder Maschine."
	quest.538B0C7E814E36A3.title: "&6&lVersorge die ganze Basis"
	quest.53A2D8B1C75626E4.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless from an &6Illuminated Panel&r, an &6Engineering Processor&r and a &6Pattern Provider&r."
		""
		"When a wall of providers and assemblers stands packed together, you cannot reach the middle ones any more. The terminal shows every provider in the network, and you put patterns straight into them."
	]
	quest.53A2D8B1C75626E4.quest_subtitle: "All providers in one window."
	quest.53A2D8B1C75626E4.title: "&aBuild a pattern access terminal"
	quest.53A3C71A0B5C3715.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/alfheim_corporea_index.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Crafting table: &62 Pure Ender Essence&r, &64 obsidian&r, &61 Corporea Block&r, &62 Dragonstones&r."
		""
		"Stand in front of it and write in the chat, for example &e\"64 cobblestone\"&r. The items drop out in front of you. In the inventory it also works with the mouse on an item and the Corporea key."
	]
	quest.53A3C71A0B5C3715.quest_subtitle: "Items on request in the chat."
	quest.53A3C71A0B5C3715.title: "&dBuild a Corporea Index"
	quest.53A9A68307C9EEF0.quest_desc: [
		"Two steel and a bucket give eight &6Basic Mechanical Pipes&r (250 mB per pull). The &6Basic Fluid Tank&r (redstone and iron) holds &e32,000 mB&r."
		""
		"The tank keeps its contents when mined. A tank of lava next to the Heat Generator is a good reserve."
	]
	quest.53A9A68307C9EEF0.quest_subtitle: "If it flows, it belongs in a pipe."
	quest.53A9A68307C9EEF0.title: "&bLay pipes and set up a tank"
	quest.53B6AD1FCF591472.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wayfinder&r: amethyst shard in the middle, 4 gold ingots in a cross. Tablet: &5Vexing log&r, &6compass&r, &6Source Gem&r, Wayfinder."
		""
		"The addition picks the destination: Nether bricks fortress, polished blackstone bricks bastion, emerald outpost, mossy cobblestone jungle temple, sandstone desert temple, deepslate bricks ancient city, Source Gem Wilden den. The Wayfinder then shows the way."
	]
	quest.53B6AD1FCF591472.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: the way to the nearest structure."
	quest.53B6AD1FCF591472.title: "&aMake the Locate Structure tablet"
	quest.53BD549EFE7986A2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Foliaathe&r sind große Fangpflanzen im Dschungel. Sie stehen still im Laub und schnappen zu, wenn du vorbeigehst. Erlegte lassen manchmal einen &6Foliaath-Samen&r fallen."
		""
		"Pflanz ihn auf Gras. Der kleine Foliaath bekommt jeden halben Tag Hunger, wirf ihm dann Fleisch hin. Nach zwei Tagen ist er ausgewachsen und schnappt nach allem, was deiner Basis zu nahe kommt."
	]
	quest.53BD549EFE7986A2.quest_subtitle: "Eine fleischfressende Pflanze als Wache."
	quest.53BD549EFE7986A2.title: "&2Zieh dir einen Foliaath"
	quest.53C53080300CB27D.quest_desc: [
		"Der &cEnder-Wächter&r lässt den &6Gauntlet of Guard&r fallen, der &cEnder-Golem&r einen &6Void Core&r für die &6Void Forge&r."
		""
		"Im Nether vorher: der &cHarbinger&r braucht einen Netherstern und gibt Witherit für den &6Mechanischen Fusionsamboss&r, der Bosswaffen verschmilzt. Kapitel &cBosse der Oberwelt&r."
	]
	quest.53C53080300CB27D.quest_subtitle: "Cataclysm im End: Wächter und Golem."
	quest.53C53080300CB27D.title: "&5Erbeute den Panzerhandschuh"
	quest.53CA7504B50F835A.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Küchentheke&r (Counter) ist das Kochtisch-Rezept mit einer &6Truhe&r statt des Buchs: drei Stein, Terrakotta, Truhe, Terrakotta, drei Terrakotta. Der &6Küchenschrank&r (Cabinet) sind fünf Terrakotta um eine Truhe, er hängt an die Wand über die Küchenzeile."
		""
		"Beide lagern Zutaten, und der Kochtisch greift direkt hinein. Eine Reihe Theken mit Weizen, Zucker, Eiern, Gemüse und Fleisch, und du kochst, ohne je eine Truhe zu öffnen."
		""
		"Alle Küchenblöcke lassen sich mit &6Farbstoff&r einfärben, 16 Farben, formlos an der Werkbank. Mit &6Knochenmehl&r wird ein gefärbter Block wieder weiß."
	]
	quest.53CA7504B50F835A.quest_subtitle: "Vorräte, die der Kochtisch sieht."
	quest.53CA7504B50F835A.title: "&6Stell Theken und Schränke auf"
	quest.53CC16710B5323D4.quest_desc: [
		"A &6redstone&r and a &6copper ingot&r give one &6Redstone Alloy Ingot&r."
		""
		"It turns into &6Redstone Conduits&r, the Painting Machine and the Impulse Hopper."
	]
	quest.53CC16710B5323D4.quest_subtitle: "Redstone and copper."
	quest.53CC16710B5323D4.title: "&4Alloy Redstone Alloy"
	quest.53D16DF1D7F409BF.quest_desc: [
		"Fluoriterz liegt tief, unter Y 23. Abgebaut lässt es &e2 bis 4 Fluorit&r fallen, mit Glück III im Schnitt gut 6. Mit &6Behutsamkeit&r bleibt der Erzblock ganz, und die Anreicherungskammer macht daraus genau &e6&r. Das lohnt sich, wenn du keine Glück-Spitzhacke hast."
		""
		"Fluorit brauchst du später an vielen Stellen: im Chemischen Kristallisator der Fünffach-Straße, als Flusssäure im Spaltbrennstoff, als Staub für Polonium- und Plutonium-Pellets. Neun ergeben einen Block, so lagert es sich gut."
	]
	quest.53D16DF1D7F409BF.quest_subtitle: "Sechs Stück pro Erz."
	quest.53D16DF1D7F409BF.title: "&bSammle Fluorit"
	quest.53F2A17B30390747.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e6 Phantome&r mit dem Learner im Inventar, das macht das Modell Basic. Sie kommen nur, wenn du drei Nächte nicht geschlafen hast."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d128 FE/t&r. Eine Vorhersage wird zu &68 Phantomhäuten&r. Die brauchst du für Elytren-Reparatur und das Mining-Stabilisator-Modul von Draconic Evolution."
	]
	quest.53F2A17B30390747.quest_subtitle: "Membranen ohne schlaflose Nächte."
	quest.53F2A17B30390747.title: "&8Lerne das Phantom"
	quest.53F3BBECFB68ACC4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Zanite Ore&r liegt im Holystone &eunter Y 75&r, am besten gräbst du in die Inseln hinein oder suchst die Unterseiten ab. Du brauchst mindestens eine &6Holystone Pickaxe&r. Jedes Erz gibt einen &6Zanite Gemstone&r, mit Glück mehr."
		""
		"{image:aether:textures/item/materials/zanite_gemstone.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Zanite ist Werkzeug- und Rüstungsmaterial auf Eisenniveau, dazu der Kern des Altars und die Spitze des Nature Staff. Neun Gemstones ergeben einen &6Zanite Block&r."
	]
	quest.53F3BBECFB68ACC4.quest_subtitle: "Das Eisen des Aethers, lila und glänzend."
	quest.53F3BBECFB68ACC4.title: "&5Finde Zanite"
	quest.540C81F69CC129F8.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r eine &6Fackel&r zwischen zwei &6Eisenklumpen&r, ein dritter Klumpen darunter ergibt eine &6Wandfackel&r (Sconce). Sie hängt an der Wand oder steht auf dem Boden und leuchtet wie eine Fackel, nur ohne den Stiel im Weg."
		""
		"{image:supplementaries:textures/item/sconce.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Supplementaries&r ist der Mod für den Kleinkram, der eine Basis bewohnt aussehen lässt. Für Licht gibt es dazu den &6Kerzenständer&r (Kerze auf Eisenbarren), der sich stapeln lässt, und die &6Seelen-Wandfackel&r mit Seelenfackel."
	]
	quest.540C81F69CC129F8.quest_subtitle: "Licht, das nicht aus dem Boden ragt."
	quest.540C81F69CC129F8.title: "&e&lHäng Wandfackeln auf"
	quest.541CB68331DA2C04.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Mysterious Scrap Metal&r on top, below it twice &6stone&r, Gem-Fused Slate, stone give two upgrade templates. At the &6Smithing Table&r they turn stone tools or chainmail armor into the iron version with &e4 iron ingots&r."
		""
		"That way you keep a piece with good affixes, even if it dropped in the wrong material. The next tier turns iron into gold: the same template with &6Timeworn Fabric&r instead of Scrap Metal, plus 4 gold ingots."
	]
	quest.541CB68331DA2C04.quest_subtitle: "Good affixes on bad material."
	quest.541CB68331DA2C04.title: "&7Upgrade Affix Loot to Iron"
	quest.5422E4D6D824DD27.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6honeycomb&r and &6honey bottle&r shapeless give a &6Honey Treat&r. A honey block with four combs gives four at once."
		""
		"{image:productivebees:textures/item/honey_treat.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Right clicking an angry bee with the treat calms it, on a baby bee it makes it grow faster, on an empty nest it attracts a new bee. Later the treat also carries &egenes&r from one bee to another."
		""
		"With a fishing rod it becomes the &6Treat on a Stick&r, which lets you steer a saddled &6Bumble Bee&r from the plains."
	]
	quest.5422E4D6D824DD27.quest_subtitle: "The treat for everything that buzzes."
	quest.5422E4D6D824DD27.title: "&6Make Honey Treats"
	quest.54296EC5F7545D24.quest_desc: [
		"Component and &6ME Storage Housing&r at the crafting table. A Crafting Unit and the component make a &664k Crafting Storage&r for your CPU."
		""
		"A 64k cell holds &e520,192&r items of one kind, &e266,240&r with 63 types. You upgrade full 16k cells at the crafting table, the contents stay."
	]
	quest.54296EC5F7545D24.quest_subtitle: "520,192 items of one kind."
	quest.54296EC5F7545D24.title: "&bBuild a 64k Cell"
	quest.542DFEB3A370F944.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6Fluid Pipes&r, one &6copper ingot&r in the middle, at the bottom Adamant, plating, Adamant."
		""
		"On the generator it burns fuel with water into steam. The &6Steam Engine&r (generator, coil, Electrum, copper) turns that back into power, one to one."
	]
	quest.542DFEB3A370F944.quest_subtitle: "Steam Boiler Addon."
	quest.542DFEB3A370F944.title: "&aBoil Steam Instead of Power"
	quest.5435FA9F8A2B0B11.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_manasteel_prep.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Collect the ingredients for the &aRitual of the Forest&r: &e4 Infused Iron&r, &e2 Livingwood Twigs&r, &e1 Mana Diamond&r, &e1 Gold Leaf&r."
		""
		"From stage 2 you put them on Wooden Stands (Gold Leaf on a log) around an &6oak sapling&r in a pattern of Gold Powder. When the tree grows, &e4 Manasteel ingots&r lie in the middle. The details are in the &aBotania: Runes&r chapter."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r From stage 2, Infused Iron becomes Manasteel in the pool for 3,000 mana."
	]
	quest.5435FA9F8A2B0B11.quest_subtitle: "Manasteel on the first evening of stage 2."
	quest.5435FA9F8A2B0B11.title: "&bPrepare the Ritual of the Forest"
	quest.5440DEEC6D2A6496.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6amethyst shards&r left and right, &6redstone&r on top and bottom around a &6Blank Upgrade&r give the &6Ore Scanner&r."
		""
		"This is an active ability: trigger it, and all ores nearby glow through the stone as particles for a few seconds. You do not see which ore it is, but where you have to dig."
		""
		"What triggers it, right click, left click or a key of its own, you set in the next step."
	]
	quest.5440DEEC6D2A6496.quest_subtitle: "See ores through the wall."
	quest.5440DEEC6D2A6496.title: "&bInstall the Ore Scanner"
	quest.5456AEE1F1ED202A.quest_desc: [
		"Wyvern tier. Catalyst: a &6Nether Star&r. In eight injectors: &64 Wyvern Cores&r and &64 Awakened ingots&r. Costs 1 million energy."
		""
		"You need it for the staff, for modules, for the Chaotic Core (four) and the Chaotic Energy Controller. Collect the stars while you farm Withers."
	]
	quest.5456AEE1F1ED202A.quest_subtitle: "A Nether Star and four Wyvern Cores."
	quest.5456AEE1F1ED202A.title: "&dFuse a Draconic Core"
	quest.5463E9D915FF277A.quest_desc: [
		"3 &6copper ingots&r at the top, a &6Laser&r between 2 &6Ultimate Control Circuits&r in the middle, 3 &6Polonium Pellets&r at the bottom."
		""
		"The coil sits directly on an SPS port, otherwise the SPS does not form. The power flows in through it."
	]
	quest.5463E9D915FF277A.quest_subtitle: "This is where the power goes in."
	quest.5463E9D915FF277A.title: "&dBuild a Supercharged Coil"
	quest.546620819774F109.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Edelwood Log&r in the furnace becomes &6Dark Matter&r in 20 seconds. Alone it is only a lump, but throw it on the ground together with a &6Corrupti Dust&r, on an open field: a &6Black Hole&r appears."
		""
		"The black hole attracts items, arrows and experience orbs within &e5 blocks&r. Whatever gets into the middle takes 4 damage per tick. For every &e60 experience points&r it spits out an &6Xpetrified Orb&r: right click gives 91 experience points, or it delivers 91 experience in the forge."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A black hole next to a mob trap is an experience storage. The Eternal Stella later needs three orbs."
	]
	quest.546620819774F109.quest_subtitle: "A log of Edelwood turns into darkness."
	quest.546620819774F109.title: "&5Smelt Dark Matter"
	quest.5469845449F0E0AB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_assembler.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e9 Iron Sheetmetal, 6 Iron Sheetmetal slabs, 6 Steel Scaffolding, 2 Light and 2 Redstone Engineering Blocks, 2 conveyor belts&r. Hammer on the conveyor belt pointing inward."
		""
		"&eIn:&r ingredients and fluids on the input side, 18 storage slots. &eOut:&r the finished parts. Three recipes in a row, the result of the first may be an ingredient of the second. &d80 FE&r per part."
	]
	quest.5469845449F0E0AB.quest_subtitle: "3x3x3, a crafting table with three recipes."
	quest.5469845449F0E0AB.title: "&9Form an Assembler"
	quest.54963D0F4E454E78.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Infused Alloy, Basic Control Circuit, Infused Alloy at the top, and below in the middle a &6Printed Silicon&r from the AE2 Inscriber with the Silicon Press. There is no other way."
		""
		"{image:mekanism:textures/item/advanced_control_circuit.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"With &6stage 3, the Steel Works&r, Mekanism opens its second level: teleporter, Digital Miner, turbine, thermal evaporation, the advanced tier. Ore tripling is in the chapter &5Mekanism: Ore Step by Step&r."
		""
		"&cLater:&r elite, ultimate, QIO, Induction Matrix and fusion in stage 4, antimatter in stage 5."
	]
	quest.54963D0F4E454E78.quest_subtitle: "A circuit that needs silicon."
	quest.54963D0F4E454E78.title: "&5&lBuild an Advanced Control Circuit"
	quest.549C15E46826BC84.quest_desc: [
		"Kochtopf: &6Kürbisscheibe&r, ein Blattgemüse, &6rohes Schweinefleisch&r und &6Milch&r, Schüssel. Die Kürbisscheibe schneidest du am Schneidebrett."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/pumpkin_soup.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.549C15E46826BC84.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.549C15E46826BC84.title: "&6Koch Kürbissuppe"
	quest.54A58A31D8DE7224.quest_desc: [
		"Steel, circuit, steel at the top, furnace, &6Steel Casing&r, furnace in the middle, three steel at the bottom. It is open in stage 2 already."
		""
		"It burns everything that burns in a furnace and makes &eheat&r of it in place of power: by the config 400 units per burn tick. Thermodynamic Conductors carry it to the boiler, as with the Resistive Heater."
		""
		"The advantage: it needs no power. With coal blocks from a tree farm it heats up the boiler before the turbine even runs."
	]
	quest.54A58A31D8DE7224.quest_subtitle: "The Fuelwood Heater."
	quest.54A58A31D8DE7224.title: "&6Heat with wood"
	quest.54A8F4160E0A0FD1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Six planks&r, &6two wooden slabs&r top and bottom middle, a &6lever&r in the middle. It takes on the look of the wood type."
		""
		"&e27 slots&r and &eone upgrade slot&r. The big advantage: you upgrade it &eright in the world&r, block and contents stay put. Barrels can be turned in any direction and built against each other."
	]
	quest.54A8F4160E0A0FD1.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade instead of replace."
	quest.54A8F4160E0A0FD1.title: "&6&lBuild an upgradeable barrel"
	quest.54AC361B52B8E398.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Press&r: &d8 SU per RPM&r. 128 SU at 16 RPM, 256 SU at 32 RPM."
	]
	quest.54AC361B52B8E398.quest_subtitle: "The most expensive machine of this stage."
	quest.54AC361B52B8E398.title: "&7Press: 8 SU per RPM"
	quest.54AC82A8BC800ADE.quest_desc: [
		"All three stand on three &6stone&r with a &6brass sheet&r and a &6redstone torch&r above. The &6Pulse Timer&r has an &6amethyst shard&r instead of redstone."
		""
		"The &6Pulse Timer&r gives short pulses again and again; you set the interval at the value panel. A signal at the input side stops and resets it. The &6Pulse Repeater&r gives a short pulse after a delay, the &6Pulse Extender&r makes a signal longer. Both go up to an hour."
		""
		"That way a mixer only runs every few minutes, or a dispenser fires on a fixed beat."
	]
	quest.54AC82A8BC800ADE.quest_subtitle: "Pulse Timer, Pulse Repeater, Pulse Extender."
	quest.54AC82A8BC800ADE.title: "&6Clock your setup"
	quest.54AF6ABEE259F331.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_controller.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &6Sky Stone Blocks&r in the four corners, a &6Spirit Attuned Gem&r from Occultism at the top centre, &6Fluix Crystals&r left, right and bottom centre, an &6Engineering Processor&r in the centre."
		""
		"You make the gem from lapis in Spiritfire, see the chapter &5Occultism&r. Every side of the controller gives out &e32 channels&r."
		""
		"&eRules:&r one controller per network, it may be made of several blocks, all within 7 x 7 x 7. It needs &d6 AE/t&r per block. If a block turns red, the shape is wrong."
	]
	quest.54AF6ABEE259F331.quest_subtitle: "Networks need a ritual."
	quest.54AF6ABEE259F331.title: "&5&lBuild an ME Controller"
	quest.54B3D1FDD28C9434.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_power_mekmm_large.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Der &6Große Wärmegenerator&r und der &6Große Windgenerator&r sind die Riesenversionen der Mekanism-Generatoren, der &6Große Gasgenerator&r hat einen Tank von 180 000 mB. Alle drei große Blöcke, der Windgenerator darf keinen zweiten direkt neben sich haben."
		""
		"&eMekanism More Machine, Großer Wärmegenerator:&r &d400 FE/t&r aus Brennstoff, &d140 FE/t je Lavaseite&r, bis 81 Seiten, im Nether 300 FE/t extra, Tank 240 000 mB. &eGroßer Windgenerator:&r &d900 000 FE/t&r unten, &d1 500 000 FE/t&r ganz oben, ohne Brennstoff. Der stärkste Dauerläufer ohne Brennstoff im Pack. Offen ab Stufe 4. Der &6Solar-Wärmegenerator&r (Reflektoren heizen Kühlmittel) ist schon ab Stufe 3 offen."
	]
	quest.54B3D1FDD28C9434.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism More Machine: 400 FE/t plus Lava, bis 1,5 Millionen FE/t Wind."
	quest.54B3D1FDD28C9434.title: "&5Stell die großen Generatoren"
	quest.54C48D8C04913A6E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_advanced_cnc_stamper.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Mekanism MoreMachine:&r a Steel Casing in the middle, pistons left and right, circuits at the top and bottom, redstone in the corners."
		""
		"It presses with a mould in the mould slot. With the &6Silicon Press&r from AE2 it turns silicon into &6Printed Silicon&r, with the other presses the processor parts, with moulds from Immersive Engineering plates, rods and wires."
	]
	quest.54C48D8C04913A6E.quest_subtitle: "Print silicon without an Inscriber."
	quest.54C48D8C04913A6E.title: "&3&lBuild a CNC Stamper"
	quest.54CBF0CE4350507E.quest_desc: [
		"Place a &6Smithing Table&r on the gilded block in the middle. The eight spaces above the outer gilded blocks must be free. Right click the Smithing Table with &6Mundabitur Dust&r, a red lightning bolt strikes, and the &6Hephaestus Forge&r stands."
		""
		"&eHow to read the window:&r In the middle lies the ritual's &6main item&r. Below are four slots for the essences: &dAureal&r, &bSouls&r, &cBlood&r and &aExperience&r, with bars next to them. Plus four slots for enhancer relics, on tier 1 only the first is open, every further tier unlocks one. Tier 1 holds &e1,000 Aureal, 10 Souls, 10,000 Blood and 900 Experience&r."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r The forge checks its floor every four seconds. If a block is missing, it goes out and accepts nothing more. It can be mined with a pickaxe and placed again on a new floor."
	]
	quest.54CBF0CE4350507E.quest_subtitle: "A Smithing Table, a dust, a lightning bolt."
	quest.54CBF0CE4350507E.title: "&c&lAwaken the Hephaestus Forge"
	quest.54D2CA7891095547.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Elektromotor&r macht aus Strom Drehung. Er entsteht in der Mechanischen Handwerkseinheit aus Andesitlegierung, Messingblechen, Kupferspulen, einem Eisenstab und einem Kondensator."
		""
		"Laut Config dreht er bis &d256 RPM&r und trägt bis &d16 384 SU&r. Das Tempo stellst du am Motor ein. Ein Flux-Punkt daneben, und deine Create-Maschinen laufen ohne Wasserrad und ohne Wellen quer durch die Basis."
	]
	quest.54D2CA7891095547.quest_subtitle: "Der Elektromotor von Create Crafts & Additions."
	quest.54D2CA7891095547.title: "&6Treib Create mit Flux an"
	quest.54D8B864DFB7142B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pyromantic Brazier&r: five &6copper ingots&r and four &6stone&r, see EMI. You feed it with normal furnace fuel."
		""
		"&dTheurgy&r splits things into three principles: &6Salt&r (body), &6Sulfur&r (soul) and &6Mercury&r (energy). Then you put them back together, and one Raw Iron becomes three ingots."
		""
		"The handbook &6The Hermetica&r: a &6book&r and two &6sand&r, shapeless. The whole mod opens with &6stage 3&r."
	]
	quest.54D8B864DFB7142B.quest_subtitle: "Every device stands on one."
	quest.54D8B864DFB7142B.title: "&d&lBuild Four Braziers"
	quest.54DA45AD611870C9.quest_desc: [
		"At &e98 percent&r the obelisk takes nothing more. Then the team sets a date, all streamers go live together, and the last items go in together. At that moment the next stage opens for everyone."
		""
		"Nobody is ahead, nobody misses anything because they happened to be offline. You find out the date on &9Discord&r."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Keep a small stack for the finale, then you can throw something in yourself at the event."
	]
	quest.54DA45AD611870C9.quest_subtitle: "At 98 percent it stops until everyone is there."
	quest.54DA45AD611870C9.title: "&cWait for the finale"
	quest.54DFDC3FDB8A5994.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r top brass casing, lapis block, brass casing. Middle Rune of Water, Mana Quartz block, Rune of Fire. Bottom Rune of Earth, Rune of Mana, Rune of Air."
		""
		"The runes are &cused up&r here. Plan one of each elemental rune and one Rune of Mana just for the plate."
	]
	quest.54DFDC3FDB8A5994.quest_subtitle: "The forge for Terrasteel."
	quest.54DFDC3FDB8A5994.title: "&aBuild the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate"
	quest.54FCED683D66843E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Brilliant Stone&r is a rare ore in small nests underground, also as a deepslate variant. Mined, it gives &6Raw Brilliance&r, Fortune works."
		""
		"With it you build the &6Brilliant Obelisk&r: &e2 Runewood planks&r on the altar, &e2 Raw Brilliance&r on the stands, plus &e16 Aerial&r and &e8 Aqueous&r."
		""
		"Next to an enchanting table a Brilliant Obelisk counts as &dfive bookshelves&r. Two or three of them replace a whole library."
	]
	quest.54FCED683D66843E.quest_subtitle: "Experience turned to stone."
	quest.54FCED683D66843E.title: "&bMine Brilliance"
	quest.550CA1FE94FDEAAB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sunflower&r on the brazier. On the hands: &6charcoal&r, &6wheat seeds&r, two &6Soul Shards&r."
		""
		"Lit at night, it fast forwards time until the sun rises."
	]
	quest.550CA1FE94FDEAAB.quest_subtitle: "Ritual of Daylight."
	quest.550CA1FE94FDEAAB.title: "&eCall the Day"
	quest.55173FA1D9E683F8.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6iron pickaxes&r left and right of a &6Blank Upgrade&r give the &6Ore Miner&r upgrade. At the Smithing Table into the Ferricore pickaxe."
		""
		"&eOre Miner&r is passive: when you mine an ore, the pickaxe breaks all connected ores of the vein along with it, up to &e64 blocks&r with Ferricore, 128 with Blazegold. Each block costs durability as usual."
		""
		"An osmium vein in the mountains is in your inventory after one hit. You can switch it off any time with a click on its icon in the Tool Settings."
	]
	quest.55173FA1D9E683F8.quest_subtitle: "A whole vein in one hit."
	quest.55173FA1D9E683F8.title: "&bInstall the Ore Miner"
	quest.551A07D8E07E72B9.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r sechs &6Compressed Iron&r, zwei &6Advanced Pressure Tubes&r in der Mitte rechts und dein &6Liquid Compressor&r unten in der Mitte."
		""
		"Er verbrennt flüssigen Brennstoff aus der Raffinerie (Kapitel &bPneumaticCraft&r) und macht &e50 mL pro Tick&r. Wie der Luftkompressor muss er gekühlt werden, Heat Sinks an die freien Seiten."
		""
		"Wer eine Raffinerie hat, fährt mit diesem Kompressor am besten: Er läuft, solange der Tank voll ist, Tag und Nacht."
	]
	quest.551A07D8E07E72B9.quest_subtitle: "Diesel, Kerosin oder LPG zu 20 bar."
	quest.551A07D8E07E72B9.title: "&3Bau einen Advanced Liquid Compressor"
	quest.551D0813201F3D2E.quest_desc: [
		"First build the &6Flimsy Journal&r: one &6copper ingot&r each top and bottom left, a &6string&r in the middle left, two columns of &6paper&r on the right (6 pieces). It has &e5 spell slots&r."
		""
		"&5Iron's Spells&r is Kronwerke's second magic mod. Unlike Ars Nouveau you do not put anything together here: you find finished spells as &6scrolls&r in chests and on mages and write them into your book. For that there are towers, forts and catacombs with their own enemies."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/copper_spell_book.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The &6ink&r decides the tier. With &fCommon Ink&r (now) you forge common spells. &aUncommon&r and &9Rare Ink&r come in stage 2, &5Epic Ink&r in stage 3, &6Legendary Ink&r in stage 4. You can keep locked ink, but not use it."
	]
	quest.551D0813201F3D2E.quest_subtitle: "Spells you find instead of build."
	quest.551D0813201F3D2E.title: "&5&lIron's Spells 'n Spellbooks"
	quest.5520632EB582CC63.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mob Slaughter Factory:&r Pity, 400 FE per operation. &6Mob Crusher:&r Advanced, 50 FE."
		"&6Mob Duplicator:&r Advanced, 5,000 FE. &6Mob Detector:&r Simple, 400 FE."
		"&6Stasis Chamber:&r Advanced, 1,000 FE, freezes mobs and heals them."
		"&6Enchantment Extractor, Applicator, Factory and Sorter:&r Advanced, 40 FE/t each."
		"&6Wither Builder:&r Supreme, 20,000 FE."
	]
	quest.5520632EB582CC63.quest_subtitle: "Mobs, Essence and books, with power use."
	quest.5520632EB582CC63.title: "&6&lCheck Off the Mob and Enchanting Machines"
	quest.552FB9DF946A584E.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6crops&r at the top and sides, a &6cooked beef&r in the middle, at the bottom &6redstone&r, &6Simple Frame&r, redstone."
		""
		"It eats anything a player can eat. Nutrition and saturation decide how much power and for how long. A potato or carrot farm with a Plant Gatherer keeps it fed."
	]
	quest.552FB9DF946A584E.quest_subtitle: "Power from food."
	quest.552FB9DF946A584E.title: "&6Feed a Culinary Mycelial Generator"
	quest.5538FC75A11EA5BA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_trains_station.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6Railway Casing&r and a &6compass&r make two &6Train Stations&r. Right click a straight track with it and set it down next to it."
		""
		"In the menu you give it a name for the schedules. In &eassembly mode&r the track in front of it becomes the building site for a train, up to &e128 blocks&r long."
	]
	quest.5538FC75A11EA5BA.quest_subtitle: "This is where trains are built and stop."
	quest.5538FC75A11EA5BA.title: "&6Build a Train Station"
	quest.553F4DAFECEB2F43.quest_desc: [
		"&6Vanilla&r, &6Endertruhe&r: &e27 Plätze&r, die dir allein gehören und in jeder Endertruhe der Welt gleich sind, auch im Nether. Acht Obsidian um ein Enderauge, und das Auge braucht Lohenstaub. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Trichter kommen nicht hinein. Shulkerkisten als tragbare Truhen gibt es erst mit dem End in Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.553F4DAFECEB2F43.quest_subtitle: "Vanilla, Endertruhe: 27 Plätze, überall dieselben."
	quest.553F4DAFECEB2F43.title: "Lies: Endertruhe"
	quest.5541B240F8B684F1.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eidolon_brazier.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Bone meal&r on the brazier, one &6redstone&r each on two Stone Hands, light it."
		""
		"When the ritual uses up the last ingredient, it destroys all undead nearby and leaves &dSoul Shards&r behind. Set it up at night or trap zombies in a pit next to it."
	]
	quest.5541B240F8B684F1.quest_subtitle: "The Ritual of Crystallization."
	quest.5541B240F8B684F1.title: "&dCrystallize Souls"
	quest.554BB902855E5DC6.quest_desc: [
		"&ePlayers Seated&r: the train waits until a number of players have taken a seat on it."
	]
	quest.554BB902855E5DC6.quest_subtitle: "Leaves when everyone is seated."
	quest.554BB902855E5DC6.title: "&7Players Seated"
	quest.55501AD98352DE31.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Warp Stone&r in the middle, &63 stone bricks&r above and beside it, &63 obsidian&r as the base make a &6Waystone&r."
		""
		"Give it a name others will recognise. It also comes mossy, in sandstone, deepslate and more; EMI shows every variant."
	]
	quest.55501AD98352DE31.quest_subtitle: "Your home, one click away."
	quest.55501AD98352DE31.title: "&6Put a waystone at your base"
	quest.5551DF3525B3507A.quest_desc: [
		"Mine a &6monster spawner&r with a pickaxe with &6Silk Touch&r. That costs the pickaxe &e100 durability&r, but you get the spawner with its monster as an item."
		""
		"Hold &eShift&r over the spawner item, then you see its values: Min and Max Spawn Delay (200 and 800 ticks), Spawn Count (4), Max Entities (6), Activation Range (16) and Spawn Range (4). Exactly these values are what you change with runes."
		""
		"You find spawners in dungeons, mines and in the &6Rogue Spawners&r of Apotheosis, which stand freely in caves and often have a chest with them."
	]
	quest.5551DF3525B3507A.quest_subtitle: "Silk Touch takes it along."
	quest.5551DF3525B3507A.title: "&2&lGet Yourself a Spawner"
	quest.555D9BA5A85FCD28.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r iron in the corners, &6Engineering Processors&r at the top and bottom, two &6Advanced Control Circuits&r from Mekanism left and right, the middle stays empty."
		""
		"The circuits replace the fluix glass cables of the original: storage networks need Mekanism. The drive holds up to &e10 cells&r and needs one channel."
	]
	quest.555D9BA5A85FCD28.quest_subtitle: "Ten slots for storage cells."
	quest.555D9BA5A85FCD28.title: "&3Build an ME Drive"
	quest.555DD9CA6B18F83F.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 leaf blocks&r, &e1 spider eye&r, catalysts Fire and Air. &d8,000 mana&r."
		""
		"For Tigerseye, Hyacidus, the Cirrus Amulet, the Rune of Sloth and the Terrasteel Leggings."
	]
	quest.555DD9CA6B18F83F.quest_subtitle: "Fire and air make falling leaves."
	quest.555DD9CA6B18F83F.title: "&6Make the Rune of Autumn"
	quest.55615F7EBE215146.quest_desc: [
		"Once the Guardian is dead, the &5Chaos Crystal&r in the middle of the island can be mined. It gives &e5 Chaos Shards&r, the Guardian itself a Dragon Heart."
		""
		"What you build from the shards is in the chapter &5Draconic: Awakened and Chaos&r. Whoever builds something from them writes the last chapter of this world."
	]
	quest.55615F7EBE215146.quest_subtitle: "Five Chaos Shards, only after the victory."
	quest.55615F7EBE215146.title: "&8Mine the Chaos Crystal"
	quest.55644370C550EA15.quest_desc: [
		"&6Scryer's Crystal&r: shapeless &6eye of ender&r and &6Source Gem&r. Right click the placed crystal and you look through it."
		""
		"A &6Blank Parchment&r on the crystal gives a &6Scryer's Scroll&r with its location. Rename it at the anvil so you find it again more easily."
		""
		"The &6Scryer's Oculus&r (apparatus: eye of ender in the middle, observer, spyglass, Source Gem block, diamond) opens any crystal whose scroll lies on a pedestal next to it. The crystal has to be loaded for that."
	]
	quest.55644370C550EA15.quest_subtitle: "A camera for the base."
	quest.55644370C550EA15.title: "&6Scout with the Scryer's Crystal"
	quest.55695389CA849C35.quest_desc: [
		"&6Electron Tube&r, &6brass casing&r and &6observer&r make the &6Smart Observer&r. With a &6comparator&r instead of the observer it becomes the &6Threshold Switch&r."
		""
		"The observer reports a certain item, the switch turns on when a storage rises above a fill level and off when it drops below. With a clutch the setup stops when the storage is full."
	]
	quest.55695389CA849C35.quest_subtitle: "Smart Observer and Threshold Switch."
	quest.55695389CA849C35.title: "&6Let redstone recognise items"
	quest.556CE436EDE2179A.quest_desc: [
		"A &6transmitter&r on a &6brass casing&r makes the &6Display Link&r. &6Alloy, tube, alloy&r make two &6Display Boards&r."
		""
		"Click the target with the link first, then place it at the source, up to &e64 blocks&r away. Fill levels, SU or departure times appear on the board."
	]
	quest.556CE436EDE2179A.quest_subtitle: "Display Link and Display Board."
	quest.556CE436EDE2179A.title: "&6Write numbers on the wall"
	quest.55790DAB27CCC75B.quest_desc: [
		"Show that it runs: a stack of cobblestone from the generator, charcoal from the pots, wheat from the field and leather from the pen, all from farms that work without you."
		""
		"Now you have time for the chat. The farms fill chests, one trip to the obelisk counts them for the goal, and whatever is left you trade with the others: Create players need logs and coal, magicians need Source Gems and mana."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Keep the chunks of your farms loaded (Shift and left mouse button on the map, up to 25 chunks), otherwise they stand still as soon as you are far away."
	]
	quest.55790DAB27CCC75B.quest_subtitle: "Stone, wood, wheat and leather, without you standing next to it."
	quest.55790DAB27CCC75B.title: "&6&lThe base is running"
	quest.5579846F04096A5E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wooden Barrel:&r three Treated Wood Slabs above five Treated Wood Planks, the middle empty. It holds &e12 buckets&r, but no hot fluids and no gases."
		"&6Metal Barrel:&r three Iron Sheetmetal Slabs above five Iron Sheetmetal. Same size, but it also takes hot fluids and gases, and a redstone signal switches its output off."
		""
		"With the hammer you set the sides to input or output. Good as a buffer next to Coke Oven, pump and machines when a whole tank is too big."
	]
	quest.5579846F04096A5E.quest_subtitle: "12 buckets in one block."
	quest.5579846F04096A5E.title: "&9Set up barrels for fluids"
	quest.5581893B22CBA4C0.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Kupferbarren&r im &6Steinschneider&r ergibt zwei &6Kupferschindeln&r oder zwei &6Kupferfliesen&r, jeweils mit Treppen und Stufen. Ein &6Eisenbarren&r wird zu zwei &6Industrieeisen&r, dem dunklen Block für Maschinenhallen."
		""
		"Kupferschindeln oxidieren wie Kupferblöcke: erst orange, dann braun, dann grün. Mit einer &6Honigwabe&r wachst du sie in der Farbe, die dir gefällt, mit der Axt kratzt du eine Stufe wieder ab."
	]
	quest.5581893B22CBA4C0.quest_subtitle: "Schindeln, die grün werden."
	quest.5581893B22CBA4C0.title: "&6Deck mit Kupfer"
	quest.5592A2F0D9F96A95.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &6Earth Essence&r, &6grindstone&r, &6piston&r."
		""
		"Turns stone into gravel, gravel into sand, flowers into double dye, with Sensitive items too. Especially strong against swimming creatures."
	]
	quest.5592A2F0D9F96A95.quest_subtitle: "Stone to gravel, gravel to sand."
	quest.5592A2F0D9F96A95.title: "&dLearn Crush"
	quest.559D75E71F26822B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Paper&r in the corners, &6bricks&r at the top and bottom, &6redstone&r left and right, &6iron&r in the middle."
		""
		"In the card's window you set shape, size and offset. Faster: card in hand, sneak right click the Builder, then right click two opposite corners. Up to &e512&r blocks per side, up to &e260&r blocks away from the Builder."
		""
		"The empty card does not mine anything. It is the base of all the others."
	]
	quest.559D75E71F26822B.quest_subtitle: "Tell the Builder where."
	quest.559D75E71F26822B.title: "&7Build a Shape Card"
	quest.55A8F6E3D3A4098A.quest_desc: [
		"&6One gold ingot&r and &6four blaze powder&r, shapeless. In the Alloy Forge two blaze powder are enough."
		""
		"&6Blaze Gold&r: &e69&r durability, speed &e15&r, Greedy III (faster at ore). You need it for the Refabricator and the Starlight Charger."
	]
	quest.55A8F6E3D3A4098A.quest_subtitle: "69 durability, speed 15."
	quest.55A8F6E3D3A4098A.title: "&6Smelt Blaze Gold"
	quest.55AEB4AA6B7BC5D6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Magmatic Bee&r and &6Leafcutter Bee&r (dirt nest). Flower: &6coal block&r. The comb gives &6coal&r with 60 percent. Paired with the Magmatic Bee it becomes the Sulfur Bee, with a CreeBee the Saltpeter Bee."
	]
	quest.55AEB4AA6B7BC5D6.quest_subtitle: "Coal from combs."
	quest.55AEB4AA6B7BC5D6.title: "&8Breed the Coal Bee"
	quest.55B97CB2CA0E9B27.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/powah_reactor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Uraninite&r into the fuel slot. &6Coal&r and &6redstone&r in the side slots raise the output. Cool it with water and solid coolants: ice, packed ice, Blue Ice or Dry Ice."
		""
		"In &eauto mode&r it stops when it is full and starts again below 70 percent. That way it burns no uraninite for nothing."
		""
		"A Starter reactor makes up to &e250 FE/t&r."
	]
	quest.55B97CB2CA0E9B27.quest_subtitle: "Uraninite, coal, redstone, ice."
	quest.55B97CB2CA0E9B27.title: "&aFire up and cool the reactor"
	quest.55BB51D7B3FF7947.quest_desc: [
		"Gold, dispenser, gold at the top, &6mossy cobblestone&r, redstone, mossy cobblestone in the middle, mossy cobblestone, iron and a &6Marker&r at the bottom."
		""
		"It places blocks from its inventory in front of it, controlled by redstone. Right click with a &6redstone torch&r changes how it reacts to the signal. Together with a quarry or Builder you automate construction work this way."
	]
	quest.55BB51D7B3FF7947.quest_subtitle: "Places blocks on redstone."
	quest.55BB51D7B3FF7947.title: "&7Build a Placer Plus"
	quest.55C7983DEA86CE05.quest_desc: [
		"&64 netherite scrap&r and &64 gold ingots&r make a &6netherite ingot&r. At the smithing table, diamond gear becomes netherite with an ingot and a &6smithing template&r."
		""
		"The template lies in bastions. &e7 diamonds&r, a netherrack and a template make two templates."
		""
		"You need netherite armour for the boss armours further down."
	]
	quest.55C7983DEA86CE05.quest_subtitle: "Four scraps, four gold, one ingot."
	quest.55C7983DEA86CE05.title: "&8Forge a netherite ingot"
	quest.55DAFBA4EDCEC57F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_advanced_thermal.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r vier &6Compressed Iron&r in die Ecken, &6Pressure Tubes&r oben und unten, zwei &6schwere Druckplatten&r (Eisen) links und rechts, ein &6Air Compressor&r in die Mitte."
		""
		"Er macht Luft aus einem &eTemperaturunterschied&r zwischen zwei gegenüberliegenden Seiten: &cLava&r auf der einen, &bPacked Ice&r auf der anderen. Nord-Süd und Ost-West sind getrennt, du kannst also zwei Paare anlegen. Je größer der Unterschied, desto mehr Luft."
		""
		"Die Wärme gleicht sich mit der Zeit aus, Eis schmilzt nicht, verliert aber seine Kälte. Nutz ihn für die &eAbwärme&r eines Advanced Compressors oder der heißen Seite eines Vortex Tube, dann holst du etwas zurück, was sonst in Heat Sinks verpufft. Ein Redstone-Signal schaltet ihn ab und hält den Unterschied fest."
	]
	quest.55DAFBA4EDCEC57F.quest_subtitle: "Heiß auf der einen Seite, kalt auf der anderen."
	quest.55DAFBA4EDCEC57F.title: "&cBau einen Thermal Compressor"
	quest.55E7999B4727CDA4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/theurgy_sal_tank.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Tank&r: iron, copper, iron in two rows, stick, copper, stick at the bottom. &6Accumulator&r: three stone, three iron, two sticks. Accumulator on top of the tank."
		""
		"Fill water into the accumulator with a bucket. Blue bubbles mean it is working, yellow ones mean with a crystal."
	]
	quest.55E7999B4727CDA4.quest_subtitle: "The accumulator sits on top."
	quest.55E7999B4727CDA4.title: "&7Set Up the Tank and Accumulator"
	quest.55F30A273E86C937.quest_desc: [
		"Throw your &aLexica Botania&r through the portal. The elves write their knowledge into it and send it back."
		""
		"After that the book has elven metals, new flowers, Corporea and elven tools, with recipes."
	]
	quest.55F30A273E86C937.quest_subtitle: "The book comes back thicker."
	quest.55F30A273E86C937.title: "&aSend the Lexica to the Elves"
	quest.5606FD87948917A9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Charm of Second Wind&r (totem, crying obsidian, glowstone): saves you from death as long as it is charged."
		"&6Charm of Resonant Shield&r (sculk, shield, white wool): protects against the Warden's sonic boom."
		"&6Charm of Unyielding Magic&r (milk bucket, shield, spider eye, wither rose): Dispel does not take your buffs."
	]
	quest.5606FD87948917A9.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: checklist for boss fights."
	quest.5606FD87948917A9.title: "&bFill the Heavy Charms"
	quest.56155C1029AC1BDD.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: a &6Nether brick&r."
		""
		"Weakens the link to its left. Dampened Magelight is weaker, dampened Smelt cooks food instead of ore, with Burst the sphere becomes hollow."
	]
	quest.56155C1029AC1BDD.quest_subtitle: "Sometimes less is more."
	quest.56155C1029AC1BDD.title: "&dLearn Dampen"
	quest.562CC8F6129C299C.quest_desc: [
		"A &6grain&r in the middle, four &6iron ingots&r on the sides, four &6iron nuggets&r in the corners make an &6Infinity Bimetal Gear&r."
		""
		"The Alloy Smelter, Stirling Generator and SAG Mill each want two."
	]
	quest.562CC8F6129C299C.quest_subtitle: "Two per machine."
	quest.562CC8F6129C299C.title: "&7Build Infinity Gears"
	quest.563142AC0650306F.quest_desc: [
		"Some skeletons carry a &6quiver&r on their back. Kill one of them and take it along. The harder the area, the more often you see them."
		""
		"The quiver holds &d6&r stacks of arrows, tipped arrows too. Picked up arrows go into it on their own; you choose the kind to shoot with the quiver key."
	]
	quest.563142AC0650306F.quest_subtitle: "Six stacks of arrows in one slot."
	quest.563142AC0650306F.title: "&6Loot a quiver"
	quest.5637C906BBC2025D.quest_desc: [
		"Im Ofen gibt ein &6Antiker Schrott&r eine &6Netheritplatte&r. Im &6Zerkleinerer&r wird er zu &e3 Dreckigen Netheritplatten&r, und die Anreicherungskammer macht aus jeder eine saubere Netheritplatte."
		""
		"Dreimal so viel Netherit aus jedem Fund im Nether. Vier Platten und vier Gold sind ein Netheritbarren, die MekaSuit in Stufe 4 braucht vier davon."
	]
	quest.5637C906BBC2025D.quest_subtitle: "Zerkleinerer und Kammer statt Ofen."
	quest.5637C906BBC2025D.title: "&8Verdreifache Antiken Schrott"
	quest.563F9F92764D14F3.quest_desc: [
		"Das Ende der Leiter. Draconic Evolution macht aus Wyvern Drakonisch und Chaotisch, Mystical Agriculture wird unzerstörbar."
		""
		"Alles hier ist für den Chaoswächter gedacht. Wer Erwachte Blöcke für den Obelisken spart, lässt den Stab weg."
	]
	quest.563F9F92764D14F3.quest_subtitle: "Drakonisch, Chaotisch, Supremium."
	quest.563F9F92764D14F3.title: "&c&lRüste dich für Stufe 5"
	quest.564E9C3B7C911095.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Diamond, 1 Powdered Quartz&r, cloth."
		""
		"The first use remembers the tool you are looking at. Each further use gives you a copy with little durability. Costs &d1,000 mana&r per use."
	]
	quest.564E9C3B7C911095.quest_subtitle: "A copy of your tool."
	quest.564E9C3B7C911095.title: "&bDraw Projection"
	quest.56632AC4CA9C6932.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: &6Starbuncle Charm&r and a &6water wheel&r from Create."
		""
		"A Starbuncle runs in the wheel and drives your Create machines, without any water. Good for the first andesite line in the middle of your base."
	]
	quest.56632AC4CA9C6932.quest_subtitle: "Ars Creo: rotational force from a hamster wheel."
	quest.56632AC4CA9C6932.title: "&6Build a Starbuncle Wheel"
	quest.566733F207C341CB.quest_desc: [
		"Werkbank, formlos: &6Gebratener Lachs&r, &6Süßbeeren&r, &6Weißkohl&r, &6Zwiebel&r und eine Schüssel."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/grilled_salmon.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.566733F207C341CB.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.566733F207C341CB.title: "&6Richte gegrillten Lachs an"
	quest.566794FB42380678.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_ethene.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Pressurized Reaction Chamber:&r top steel, alloy, steel, middle circuit, Enrichment Chamber, circuit, bottom Chemical Tank, Dynamic Tank, Chemical Tank."
		""
		"&e2 bio fuel + 10 mB water + 100 mB hydrogen&r give &e100 mB ethene&r and a &6substrate&r. Ethene in the gas generator is the strongest power source of stage 2."
		""
		"The same chamber makes hydrogen and sulfur dust from coal, water and oxygen, and later HDPE for the MekaSuit."
	]
	quest.566794FB42380678.quest_subtitle: "Bio fuel, water, hydrogen."
	quest.566794FB42380678.title: "&e&lMake ethene in the Pressurized Reaction Chamber"
	quest.567903D05C3469B6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wheat seeds&r with &e4 Prosperity Shards&r on the sides give a &6Prosperity Seed Base&r. It is the core of every seed from the altar."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/prosperity_seed_base.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Every seed eats one base, so 4 shards. Make a small stock, then you do not have to keep going back to the crafting table for the checklist at the end of the chapter."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r The &6Soulium Seed Base&r for animal and monster seeds needs Soulium, and that only opens with &cstage 2&r."
	]
	quest.567903D05C3469B6.quest_subtitle: "Wheat seeds in Prosperity."
	quest.567903D05C3469B6.title: "&fCraft a Seed Base"
	quest.567CBB9392556456.quest_desc: [
		"Now you know how Kronwerke works: the server works together toward the obelisk, every stage opens for everyone, and this book shows you the way through every chapter."
		""
		"Sooner or later you will look into the three big chapters anyway: &6Create&r, &dArs Nouveau&r and &aBotania&r. Have fun in the Kronwerke."
	]
	quest.567CBB9392556456.quest_subtitle: "Tech, magic or both. The server needs both."
	quest.567CBB9392556456.title: "&6Get started"
	quest.5684A0F706CC1C22.quest_desc: [
		"Vier &6Flux-Kerne&r in Kreuzform um einen &6Flux-Block&r ergeben den &6Flux-Stecker&r (Flux Plug)."
		""
		"Ein Stecker nimmt Strom von allen Blöcken an, die an ihm anliegen, und schiebt ihn ins Netzwerk. Er zieht nichts von selbst: Der Generator, die Energiezelle oder das Kabel daneben muss den Strom hineindrücken, so wie in eine Maschine. Setz ihn also direkt an den Generator oder ans Ende des Kabels."
		""
		"Ein Stecker schafft bis zu &d800.000 FE/t&r. Das reicht für jedes Kraftwerk dieser Stufe. Mit Blöcken und Kernen kostet er 13 Staub, 8 Obsidian und 2 Quelljuwelen, und du brauchst nur einen pro Kraftwerk."
	]
	quest.5684A0F706CC1C22.quest_subtitle: "Hier geht der Strom ins Netz."
	quest.5684A0F706CC1C22.title: "&a&lBau einen Flux-Stecker"
	quest.5691C24AC6851B3A.quest_desc: [
		"Top Soularium, a &6mob head&r, Soularium. Middle Soularium, &6Ensouled Chassis&r, Soularium. Bottom &6Energized Gear&r, iron bars, Energized Gear. An &6axe&r and &6shears&r go into the tool slots."
		""
		"&6Z-Logic Controller:&r Soularium, &6zombie head&r, Soularium, below that silicon, redstone, silicon. Zombie heads come from a charged creeper or from the sword The Ender."
	]
	quest.5691C24AC6851B3A.quest_subtitle: "Heads, silicon and Soularium."
	quest.5691C24AC6851B3A.title: "&cBuild the Slice'N'Splice"
	quest.56974D2C235B8A69.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6iron ingots&r in the corners, four &6iron nuggets&r on the sides, a &6redstone&r in the middle. Put it into the slot of an extracting pipe end."
		""
		"With it the end extracts &e8 items every 15 ticks&r, &e100 mB&r of fluid, &e1,024 FE&r or &e400 mB&r of gas per tick."
		""
		"On top comes the &eredstone mode&r: ignore, off with signal, on with signal or always off. A lever on the pipe shuts down a whole line with it."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Put a configured upgrade together with a new one in the crafting table, then the new one takes over all settings. An upgrade alone in the crafting table gets reset."
	]
	quest.56974D2C235B8A69.quest_subtitle: "Twice as much, and redstone listens."
	quest.56974D2C235B8A69.title: "&fBuild the Basic Upgrade"
	quest.56B13DC9109A3913.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sophisticated Storage&r, &6Trichter-Upgrade&r: zieht aus dem Block über der Truhe und schiebt in den darunter, jede Richtung mit eigenem Filter. Der &6Lagerkern&r verteilt alles, was Trichter oder Rohre an ihn liefern, auf den ganzen Truhenverbund. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Trichter, zwei Eisenbarren, Upgrade-Basis, drei Redstone. Rezepte und Verbund im Kapitel Lager."
		""
		"Dazu von &6Functional Storage&r: &6Puller-&r und &6Pusher-Upgrade&r an einer Schublade bewegen &e4 Gegenstände alle 4 Ticks&r in die Schublade hinein oder aus ihr heraus."
	]
	quest.56B13DC9109A3913.quest_subtitle: "Sophisticated Storage, Trichter-Upgrade und Lagerkern: das Lager zieht selbst."
	quest.56B13DC9109A3913.title: "Steck ein Trichter-Upgrade ins Fass"
	quest.56B6AFF9013FDCC8.quest_desc: [
		"Electrum, &6Bucket of Redstone Acid&r, electrum on top, &6Nickel Plate&r, &6Basic Engineering Block&r, &6Iron Plate&r at the bottom make the &6MV Accumulator&r."
		""
		"It stores &e1 000 000 FE&r, &d1 024 FE/t&r per side. Set the sides with the hammer as with the LV Accumulator."
	]
	quest.56B6AFF9013FDCC8.quest_subtitle: "One million FE."
	quest.56B6AFF9013FDCC8.title: "&e&lBuild an MV Accumulator"
	quest.56B7D8A29D5AB2C9.quest_desc: [
		"Alone it has &e320 health&r, each additional player adds a quarter: 480 with two, 640 with four."
		""
		"It &eteleports&r through the arena, fires &dpurple projectiles&r, lays &dpurple traps&r on the ground and summons &ewaves of monsters&r. Whoever leaves the arena gets pulled back."
	]
	quest.56B7D8A29D5AB2C9.quest_subtitle: "Stay away from the purple."
	quest.56B7D8A29D5AB2C9.title: "&5Learn What It Does"
	quest.56BA74D32B562B28.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_pg_winding.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Lay &6shafts&r next to the rotor and click two of them with a &6copper coil&r: they become a &6winding&r. Windings next to each other connect in series."
		""
		"A &6generator casing&r (iron sheets, copper sheet, conductive casing) connects windings around a corner."
	]
	quest.56BA74D32B562B28.quest_subtitle: "The stator makes the magnetic field."
	quest.56BA74D32B562B28.title: "&3Lay windings around the rotor"
	quest.56C632080F52C99B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_wood_saw.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6Mechanical Bearing&r, a &6Radial Chassis&r with slime in front, &6Mechanical Saws&r all around facing out. When the wheel turns through a row of trees, it fells whole trunks."
		""
		"The logs fall to the ground; a belt with a funnel below collects them. Every saw costs 4 SU per RPM more."
	]
	quest.56C632080F52C99B.quest_subtitle: "Bearing, chassis and saws in a circle."
	quest.56C632080F52C99B.title: "&6Fell trees with a saw wheel"
	quest.56CA0C4464702899.quest_desc: [
		"Bau Erz ab jetzt mit &6Glück III&r ab, nicht mit Behutsamkeit. Rohes Erz bringt auf jeder Stufe der Leiter mehr als der Erzblock."
		""
		"&eBarren pro Erzblock, Block mit Behutsamkeit gegen Rohes Erz mit Glück III:&r"
		"Ofen: 1 gegen etwa 2,2."
		"Anreicherungskammer: 2 gegen rund 2,9 (drei Rohe Erze geben vier Staub)."
		"Klärkammer: 3 gegen rund 4,4 (ein Rohes Erz gibt zwei Klumpen)."
		"Injektionskammer: 4 gegen rund 5,9 (drei Rohe Erze geben acht Splitter)."
		"Auflösungskammer: 5 gegen rund 7,3 (drei Rohe Erze geben 2 000 mB Schlamm, also zehn Kristalle)."
		""
		"Der &6Digitale Miner&r aus Stufe 3 kennt kein Glück, er lässt pro Block ein Rohes Erz fallen. Behutsamkeit kostet ihn das Zwölffache an Strom und lohnt sich hier nicht."
	]
	quest.56CA0C4464702899.quest_subtitle: "Rohes Erz ist auf jeder Stufe besser als der Block."
	quest.56CA0C4464702899.title: "&eNimm Glück III mit"
	quest.56CC2D4FFE2A3A14.quest_desc: [
		"Vier &6Stahlbarren&r in die Ecken, vier &6Andesitlegierungen&r an die Seiten, ein &6Osmiumbarren&r in die Mitte. &eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r die Legierung ersetzt das Glas."
		""
		"Dieses Kapitel ist die Erzleiter von Mekanism: eine Maschine pro Quest, in der Reihenfolge, in der du sie baust. Ofen, dann Anreicherungskammer (2x), Klärkammer (3x), Injektionskammer (4x), Auflösungskammer (5x)."
		""
		"&eStufen:&r 2x geht sofort. 3x öffnet mit &6Stufe 3&r, 4x und 5x mit &6Stufe 4&r. Die Quests dieser Stufen stehen schon hier, damit du weißt, worauf du hinbaust, abhaken kannst du sie erst dann."
		""
		"Osmium, Infusionsanlage, Schaltkreise und Stahl: siehe Kapitel &5Mekanism&r. Hier geht es nur um die Straße."
	]
	quest.56CC2D4FFE2A3A14.quest_subtitle: "Das Fundament jeder Maschine auf der Erzleiter."
	quest.56CC2D4FFE2A3A14.title: "&5&lBau zwei Stahlgehäuse"
	quest.56D80350295E3FE0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Logic Cable:&r menril chunks, two sticks and one redstone, gives three. &6Variable Card:&r eight chunks around a paper, gives 24."
		""
		"Cables form the network you plug all parts into. A Variable Card stores a reference to a value: a number, an item, a list or a rule for a calculation. From cards, chunks and pistons you build the &6Variable Transformers&r that go into every reader and writer."
	]
	quest.56D80350295E3FE0.quest_subtitle: "The network and its sticky notes."
	quest.56D80350295E3FE0.title: "&9Build Logic Cables and Variable Cards"
	quest.56DB6430BA7D5ACF.quest_desc: [
		"The Precision Sawmill with an installer. For wood farms that need planks in bulk."
	]
	quest.56DB6430BA7D5ACF.quest_subtitle: "Three saws."
	quest.56DB6430BA7D5ACF.title: "&aBasic Sawing Factory"
	quest.56DF3EA395E2A223.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Condensed Potion Vial&r (five glass panes), a &6water bucket&r, &6glowstone dust&r, &6gunpowder&r and &6nether wart&r shapeless give &6Glowing Water&r."
		""
		"Thrown, it hits all undead around like a splash potion. Zombies, skeletons and zombified piglins fall quickly."
		""
		"&eAlso good:&r Three bread plus Glowing Water give three &6Glowing Bread&r, which fills your hunger completely in one bite. With gold nuggets, TNT and Catalyzing Gland they become four &6Holy Hand Grenades&r."
	]
	quest.56DF3EA395E2A223.quest_subtitle: "Throwing water against undead."
	quest.56DF3EA395E2A223.title: "&eBottle Glowing Water"
	quest.56E10362DBD2A68B.quest_desc: [
		"An der Werkbank: 4 &6Purpur-Eisen&r, 2 Lohenruten, 1 Magmacreme ergeben 1 Barren. In der &6Alloy Forge&r (&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Purpur-Stahl, Schwarzstein, Messinggehäuse): ein Block Purpur-Eisen, 2 Lohenruten, Magmacreme ergeben 3."
		""
		"2 400 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 15, +6 Schaden, Rüstung 22 mit Zähigkeit 10, Flammenwächter (Feuerschutz im ganzen Satz). &6Lohengold&r (Gold und 4 Lohenstaub) hält nur 69, gräbt aber mit Tempo 15 und taugt als Spitze."
	]
	quest.56E10362DBD2A68B.quest_subtitle: "Silent Gear: das Endgame-Metall des Nethers."
	quest.56E10362DBD2A68B.title: "&cLegiere Purpur-Stahl"
	quest.56ED1C8245FC7FA8.quest_desc: [
		"Put an &6Artisan Relic&r into the Clibano's enhancer slot. Then it takes two ingredients at once: &6raw iron&r and &6obsidian&r become an &6Obsidiansteel Ingot&r."
		""
		"{image:forbidden_arcanus:textures/item/obsidiansteel_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Obsidiansteel goes into the Obsidian Skulls, Corrupti Dust, the Dark Nether Star and the Draco Arcanus armor. Without the relic there is no Obsidiansteel. &eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Four &6Deorum Ingots&r around a &6Precision Mechanism&r give one, otherwise loot village smiths or catch the Wandering Trader."
	]
	quest.56ED1C8245FC7FA8.quest_subtitle: "Raw iron and obsidian in one fire."
	quest.56ED1C8245FC7FA8.title: "&8Smelt Obsidiansteel"
	quest.56EF2EFA989FDA9F.quest_desc: [
		"A station before spawn, a goods train that stops there, and a funnel that loads from the Portable Storage Interface into a chest. From there you carry the load the last steps to the obelisk and hand it in by hand."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Brass ingots and precision mechanisms in this stage, steel in the next: the goals want large amounts, and a train brings them without walking."
		""
		"A shared main station with several tracks and chain signals is nicer for thirty players than thirty stub tracks."
	]
	quest.56EF2EFA989FDA9F.quest_subtitle: "All roads lead to spawn."
	quest.56EF2EFA989FDA9F.title: "&6&lRun a line to the obelisk"
	quest.56F4EE9836D3B386.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r three oak planks on top, in the middle &6honeycomb&r, &6beehive&r (or bee nest), honeycomb, at the bottom &6campfire&r, oak plank, &6shears&r. Get honeycomb and honey bottles first with shears and bottles at a wild bee nest."
		""
		"{image:productivebees:textures/block/advanced_beehive/oak_beehive_front.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The &6Advanced Beehive&r has a window: right click shows you which three bees live inside and what they have produced. It needs no campfire for harvesting, and you can break it with the bees inside and take it along, without Silk Touch."
		""
		"Only in this hive do the special bees of this chapter make their &6resource combs&r. After every trip a bee stays in the hive for about &e4 minutes&r, then there is a comb in the window."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Productive Bees is open from stage 2. Bees for ores, redstone, steel and manasteel are already available, the gem and ender bees come in stage 4 with the End."
	]
	quest.56F4EE9836D3B386.quest_subtitle: "A hive with a window you can look into."
	quest.56F4EE9836D3B386.title: "&e&lBuild an Advanced Beehive"
	quest.56FAEA713F70DAB3.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding."
		"&6Bowls:&r an &6Otherstone Pedestal&r, a &6hopper&r, an &6Iesnium block&r, a &bSpirit Attuned Crystal&r, &e2 gold ingots&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book, 150 seconds."
		""
		"Place a Mineshaft, Battlefield or a working spirit on the Extractor and a storage below it. The Djinni picks up the results quickly and puts them in below."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r If the storage is full, it throws the rest away."
	]
	quest.56FAEA713F70DAB3.quest_subtitle: "Finds straight into the chest."
	quest.56FAEA713F70DAB3.title: "&6Build a Dimensional Extractor"
	quest.57002C5A6625DA69.quest_desc: [
		"Hold a &6Train Casing&r in your hand and press &eAlt&r: the &6bogey menu&r opens. There you choose the style placed when you click the track: simple axles, double and triple axles, large locomotive running gear with up to six axles, plus favorites."
		""
		"There are three gauges. Normal tracks carry the standard bogeys, &enarrow&r and &ewide&r tracks are made like normal ones by sequenced assembly and have their own running gear. Phantom tracks fit all of them."
		""
		"&eFor looks:&r An &6iron block&r in the stonecutter gives eight &6Locometal&r, from which locomotive boilers, smokeboxes, doors and ladders are built. &6Smokestacks&r (iron sheets around a campfire) smoke while driving, colorful with dye, blue with soul sand. With &eAlt&r you switch the variant of many of these blocks."
	]
	quest.57002C5A6625DA69.quest_subtitle: "Bogeys in all sizes, boilers and smokestacks."
	quest.57002C5A6625DA69.title: "&6Build a Real Locomotive"
	quest.5702AA4D1BD32504.quest_desc: [
		"Six horizontal &6Dielectric Rods&r at the top and bottom, iron nugget, Tiny, iron nugget in the middle: twelve &6Starter cables&r. Basic: iron in place of nuggets and a Basic capacitor."
		""
		"&eFE/t:&r Starter 500, Basic 2,000, Hardened 5,000, Blazing 20,000, Niotic 50,000, Spirited 200,000."
	]
	quest.5702AA4D1BD32504.quest_subtitle: "Twelve cables from rods and nuggets."
	quest.5702AA4D1BD32504.title: "&eLay energy cables"
	quest.570C009149EFE96F.quest_desc: [
		"Throw an &6eye of ender&r into the air, follow it, and dig down when it points downward. Below lies a &6stronghold&r from &eYUNG's Better Strongholds&r. Fill the 12 frame blocks with &e12 eyes of ender&r."
		""
		"Now and then an eye breaks. The portal at spawn is enough for everyone, your own is only worth it if your base is far away."
	]
	quest.570C009149EFE96F.quest_subtitle: "Twelve eyes of ender and a stronghold."
	quest.570C009149EFE96F.title: "&5Find an End Portal of Your Own"
	quest.57156B805C93A1E7.quest_desc: [
		"At the table, tier 2: &6Manipulation Essence&r, &6golden apple&r, &6bucket&r, &6glass bottle&r, &6ender pearl&r."
		""
		"Cast on a chest or a tank, you eat or drink the first food or the first potion in it, with tanks part of the fluid. With &dSensitive&r it also uses items that aren't food, like experience gems."
	]
	quest.57156B805C93A1E7.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: eating from the chest."
	quest.57156B805C93A1E7.title: "&dLearn Telefeast"
	quest.572B2ECDCDEB5B72.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Diamant&r oben links, drei &6Pneumatic Cylinders&r, unten Compressed Iron, &6PCB&r, Compressed Iron."
		""
		"Der Bohrer greift &cnicht&r diagonal, er muss direkt neben der Plattform stehen. Mit dem Programm &eDrill&r macht er aus einem &6Compressed Iron Block&r 20 Pressure Chamber Valves, aus einem Solar Wafer eine Solar Cell und aus Redstone zwei roten Farbstoff."
	]
	quest.572B2ECDCDEB5B72.quest_subtitle: "Ein Diamantbohrer für die härtesten Blöcke."
	quest.572B2ECDCDEB5B72.title: "&bBau einen Assembly Drill"
	quest.5732DEFEF730A6F0.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Prosperity Seed Base&r into the altar. On the pedestals alternating &e4 Inferium Essence&r and &e4 stone&r (smelted stone, not cobblestone). Wand on the altar, and the &6Stone Seeds&r are done."
		""
		"Stone Seeds grow like wheat and give &6Stone Essence&r. &e8 Stone Essence&r in a ring give &e24 cobblestone&r, 8 Stone Essence with a Coal Essence in the middle 20 stone, but that only comes in stage 2."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stone goal at the obelisk asks for &e20,000 cobblestone&r. A field of Stone Seeds with accelerators below helps without a pickaxe, and every cobblestone counts."
		""
		"All seeds you can already build are in the &echecklist&r on the right."
	]
	quest.5732DEFEF730A6F0.quest_subtitle: "Your first resource from the field."
	quest.5732DEFEF730A6F0.title: "&6&lInfuse Stone Seeds"
	quest.57432AC486C4BE0B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_farm.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Apothecary: &e2 brown&r, &e1 red&r, &e1 light grey&r petal. Throw fuel on the ground within &e3 blocks&r, it sucks it up."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/block/endoflame.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"A piece burns half as long as in the furnace and gives &d3 mana every 2 ticks&r, so 30 mana per second. Then a 2 second pause. Its buffer holds 300 mana; when it is full, it eats nothing new."
	]
	quest.57432AC486C4BE0B.quest_subtitle: "Coal in, mana out."
	quest.57432AC486C4BE0B.title: "&6Plant an Endoflame"
	quest.57451DBD7AFA514C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/gaia_goal.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Collect &e64 Gaia Spirits&r for the obelisk. The goal wants &e128&r (a fixed number) and &e30 Mystic Staffs&r from Mahou Tsukai."
		""
		"At eight spirits per fight that is &esixteen fights&r, all live. A permanent arena, one Terrasteel per fight, spirits into the obelisk by hand afterwards."
		""
		"Once the techs' draconium and Elite Control Circuits are in too, &6Stage 5 (Chaos Works)&r opens."
	]
	quest.57451DBD7AFA514C.quest_subtitle: "128 Gaia Spirits for the obelisk."
	quest.57451DBD7AFA514C.title: "&d&lDeliver Spirits for the Light of the Dragon"
	quest.5746D276745D966B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eidolon_altar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Wooden Altar&r: wooden slabs over planks, gives three. &6Straw Effigy&r: five wheat in a cross. Effigy on top."
		""
		"Candles, skulls of the undead and rare herbs in a pot on the altar raise &ePower&r and &eCapacity&r. Only the best piece of each kind counts."
	]
	quest.5746D276745D966B.quest_subtitle: "A place where you are heard."
	quest.5746D276745D966B.title: "&6Build an Altar with an Effigy"
	quest.5748C3D01E57ADBA.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e6 Magier&r mit dem Learner im Inventar. Sie leben in Waldanwesen und kommen bei Überfällen. Sechs Kills machen das Modell Basic."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d1.024 FE/t&r, viel für den Anfang. Dafür wird eine Vorhersage zu &62 Totems der Unsterblichkeit&r oder 16 Smaragden. Totems brauchen die Untod-Module von Draconic Evolution."
	]
	quest.5748C3D01E57ADBA.quest_subtitle: "Totems und Smaragde."
	quest.5748C3D01E57ADBA.title: "&2Lerne den Magier"
	quest.574BCA422130FCBB.quest_desc: [
		"&eDig Area&r baut jeden Block im &eArea&r ab. Was fällt, lässt sie liegen, dafür hängst du ein &ePick up Items&r-Teil dahinter oder stellst eine Sammeldrohne daneben."
		""
		"Lass sie vorher eine &6Spitzhacke&r importieren, sonst gräbt sie mit bloßen Händen, und das dauert. Mit Haken bei &eRequires digging tool&r gräbt sie nur mit Werkzeug. Rechtsklick auf das Teil: Schicht für Schicht, von oben oder von unten, und eine Höchstzahl an Blöcken pro Durchlauf."
		""
		"Ein Item Filter rechts sagt ihr, welche Blöcke sie abbauen darf. Bei Pflanzen filterst du nach dem Samen, den sie fallen lassen."
	]
	quest.574BCA422130FCBB.quest_subtitle: "Die Drohne gräbt einen Bereich aus."
	quest.574BCA422130FCBB.title: "&7Puzzleteil: Dig Area"
	quest.5759AFCC802B70A9.quest_desc: [
		"Top Atomic Alloy, &6Nether Star&r, Atomic Alloy, middle &6Ultimate Induction Provider&r, Module Base, Ultimate Induction Provider, bottom three &5antimatter pellets&r."
		""
		"In the MekaSuit it lets you fly as in creative mode. Per the config it costs &d400 FE/t&r while you fly. The Jetpack Unit is retired with it."
	]
	quest.5759AFCC802B70A9.quest_subtitle: "Free flight in the MekaSuit."
	quest.5759AFCC802B70A9.title: "&5Fly with Gravitational Modulation"
	quest.57625193D4DF5F70.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_crushing_wheel.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A 5 by 5 recipe for the crafters: &616 andesite alloys&r, &64 planks&r, &61 stone&r make two &6Crushing Wheels&r."
		""
		"Two wheels one block apart, turning &etowards each other&r. Whatever falls in from above is crushed. Each wheel costs &d8 SU per RPM&r, so two at 64 RPM cost 1,024 SU."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r They hurt you too. On Kronwerke, the Mekanism Crusher also needs a crushing wheel."
	]
	quest.57625193D4DF5F70.quest_subtitle: "Crushing with a bonus."
	quest.57625193D4DF5F70.title: "&6Build crushing wheels"
	quest.5774E97440BA7A66.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Infused Alloys&r in a cross around a &6Basic Control Circuit&r."
		""
		"&eSneaking and right clicking&r a finished machine reads in side configuration and auto eject. &eRight click&r on the next machine of the same kind writes everything into it. Sneaking and right clicking into the air clears the card."
		""
		"For a row of five factories that saves five windows full of coloured blocks every time."
	]
	quest.5774E97440BA7A66.quest_subtitle: "Set up once, paste ten times."
	quest.5774E97440BA7A66.title: "&3Copy settings with the Configuration Card"
	quest.5782EFB8EC701E98.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_queen.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Sprich die &6Valkyrie Queen&r mit 10 Victory Medals im Gepäck an und fordere sie heraus. Sie teleportiert sich durch den Saal, stößt mit der Lanze nach dir und schickt &6Thunder Crystals&r, die auf dich zufliegen. Gummy Swets und ein Healing Stone gehören in die Leiste."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r Sie lässt den &6Silver Dungeon Key&r und ein Goldschwert fallen. Der Key öffnet die Schatzkammer: &6Lightning Sword&r, &6Holy Sword&r, &6Invisibility Cloak&r, &6Regeneration Stone&r, Enchanted und Poison Dart Shooter, Moa-Eier, Enchanted Berries."
		""
		"&eStufe 3:&r Das Beste aus der Kammer ist gesperrt, bis das Stahlwerk öffnet: die &6Valkyrie Armor&r (zeitweise fliegen, wenn alle Teile samt Valkyrie Gloves getragen werden), &6Valkyrie Pickaxe, Axe, Shovel und Hoe&r, das &6Valkyrie Cape&r und &6Gravitite&r-Rüstung und -Werkzeug. Heb alles auf, tragen kannst du es jetzt schon."
	]
	quest.5782EFB8EC701E98.quest_subtitle: "Der große Kampf dieser Stufe im Aether."
	quest.5782EFB8EC701E98.title: "&f&lBesiege die Valkyrie Queen"
	quest.578757F7D00B0EFC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/flux_networks_first_link.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Setz den &6Stecker&r neben deinen Generator und den &6Punkt&r neben eine Maschine, egal wo. Öffne beide (Rechtsklick), Reiter &eNetzwerkauswahl&r, dein Netz anklicken, &eVerbinden&r. Die Lämpchen am Gerät gehen an, die Maschine läuft."
		""
		"Im Reiter &eHome&r jedes Geräts siehst du den Namen, den Puffer und wie viel gerade fließt. Mit &eThe One Probe&r siehst du Netz und Durchfluss auch beim Hinsehen, Limit und Priorität beim Schleichen."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Ab hier brauchen deine Stahlstraßen für das Ziel von Stufe 3 keinen Kabelkanal mehr. Jede neue Fabrik bekommt einen Punkt, fertig."
	]
	quest.578757F7D00B0EFC.quest_subtitle: "Stecker am Generator, Punkt an der Maschine, kein Kabel."
	quest.578757F7D00B0EFC.title: "&6&lSchließe die erste Maschine an"
	quest.579E9B53C7DCC979.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/draconic_chaos_reactor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Reactor core&r: fusion, chaotic, Chaos Shard in the core. &6Stabilizer&r: fusion around the frame with rotor assembly, focus ring, Draconic Energy Controller, 3 Awakened ingots, Chaotic Core and a Large Fragment, four times. Plus a &6Reactor Energy Injector&r."
		""
		"Awakened Draconium is the fuel. The injector charges the core to start and then holds the &econtainment field&r. The stabilizers give off the power."
		""
		"&c&lHonestly:&r If the field drops to zero, it explodes. The big explosion is &cnot switched off&r on this server. Build it far away, and feed the injector from an Energy Core. Use SAS and comparator outputs."
	]
	quest.579E9B53C7DCC979.quest_subtitle: "A lot of power, and it can explode."
	quest.579E9B53C7DCC979.title: "&c&lBuild the Draconic Reactor"
	quest.57BAA1EE97F2F59F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/gaia_tiara.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Three &dGaia Spirits&r at the top, middle Elementium, Gaia Spirit, Elementium, bottom feather, &5Pure Ender Essence&r, feather."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/flugel_tiara.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"In the head slot you fly on mana, about &e30 seconds&r at a time. The sprint key without sprinting gives a dash (every 2 s), sneaking while falling lets you glide, without fall damage."
		""
		"&ePure Ender Essence:&r In the End the Soulscribe gives the pure form on endermen, see &aBotania: Alfheim&r."
	]
	quest.57BAA1EE97F2F59F.quest_subtitle: "Flying with mana."
	quest.57BAA1EE97F2F59F.title: "&b&lCraft the Flügel Tiara"
	quest.57BDA4588B381C5C.quest_desc: [
		"One Quantum Infused Dust and 4,000 mB of water make 1,000 mB of &6Quantum Infusion&r in the chamber. From that, with four copper ingots, four Shattered Singularities and &efour singularities&r, one &6Quantum Alloy&r ingot."
		""
		"Let the condenser run day and night."
	]
	quest.57BDA4588B381C5C.quest_subtitle: "More than six singularities per ingot."
	quest.57BDA4588B381C5C.title: "&dCast Quantum Alloy"
	quest.57D0E496FCC33454.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mahou_tsukai_fay_sight.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e3 Powdered Eye&r, cloth. Costs &d100 mana&r and shows you &2leylines&r and the &2Fae&r for a while."
		""
		"Leylines connect points about 300 blocks apart. Near a line mana comes back much faster. With elytra along a line you get a boost. Build the workshop on a ley point."
	]
	quest.57D0E496FCC33454.quest_subtitle: "Leylines and the Fae."
	quest.57D0E496FCC33454.title: "&2Open Fay Sight"
	quest.57E0E464E8552E7D.quest_desc: [
		"A &6potato&r in the pool becomes a &6Tiny Potato&r for &d1,337 mana&r."
		""
		"It does nothing. Right click pets it, at the anvil it gets a name. Every botanist needs one."
	]
	quest.57E0E464E8552E7D.quest_subtitle: "It believes in you."
	quest.57E0E464E8552E7D.title: "&6Infuse a potato"
	quest.57E22FDA80DAE530.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_endo_auto.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Chest, hopper, Open Crate above the Endoflames. A &6pressure plate&r under the drop spot locks the hopper while coal is still lying there, so never too much falls."
		""
		"Items on the ground disappear after five minutes. A Create belt ending over the bed works just as well."
	]
	quest.57E22FDA80DAE530.quest_subtitle: "The Endoflame feeds itself."
	quest.57E22FDA80DAE530.title: "&6Automate the coal"
	quest.57E62B9C747445FE.quest_desc: [
		"In the Dissolution Chamber: two &6Plastic&r, one &6Supreme Frame&r, two &6netherite ingots&r, two &6Diamond Gears&r, one &6Nether Star&r and &e500 mB of Ether Gas&r."
		""
		"The reactor finds your other Mycelial Generators through the mycelial network. It produces huge amounts of power, but only while one of &eevery kind&r is running at the same time."
		""
		"This is a long term project: EMI shows under each generator what it burns, from snowball to Nether Star."
	]
	quest.57E62B9C747445FE.quest_subtitle: "All Mycelial Generators at once."
	quest.57E62B9C747445FE.title: "&5&lBuild a Mycelial Reactor"
	quest.57EED854FEA4E23E.quest_desc: [
		"Dritte Generation, erster Teil, im Markt für 4 Smaragde."
		""
		"&6Adlerholz&r: Teak + Ipe, 10 %"
		"&6Espe&r: Buche + Erle, 10 %"
		"&6Balsamtanne&r: Erle + Europäische Lärche, 10 %"
		"&6Banane&r: Balsa + Kakao, 10 %"
		"&6Robinie&r: Balsa + Silberlinde, 10 %"
		"&6Butternuss&r: Walnuss + Vogelkirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Ceylon-Ebenholz&r: Kapok + Schwarzeiche, 10 %"
		"&6Cocobolo&r: Balsa + Schwarzeiche, 10 %"
		"&6Kokospalme&r: Paranuss + Balsa, 10 %"
		"&6Kulturbirne&r: Red-Delicious-Apfel + Nashi-Birne, 10 %"
	]
	quest.57EED854FEA4E23E.quest_subtitle: "10 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.57EED854FEA4E23E.title: "&aGeneration 3: Adlerholz bis Kulturbirne"
	quest.57FF5F324DC7988B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Calcination Oven&r: a copper block with four iron ingots in a cross, on the brazier. Click it with ore, raw metal or ingots, heat it."
		""
		"Out comes &6Mineral Salt&r. One raw piece only gives one salt, you need three per raw piece. It gets cheaper with Strata Salt further down."
	]
	quest.57FF5F324DC7988B.quest_subtitle: "The body of a mineral."
	quest.57FF5F324DC7988B.title: "&6Burn Mineral Salt"
	quest.5804CBE7C2BE0961.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_echoing_forest.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Im &2Hallenden Wald&r wachsen &6Echobäume&r auf &6Echoboden&r. Fäll ein paar Stämme, aus einem Stamm werden vier Bretter."
		""
		"Hier sind die &6Zerschmetterten&r am dichtesten. Halt dich an die Baumkronen, wenn es eng wird."
	]
	quest.5804CBE7C2BE0961.quest_subtitle: "Echobäume auf Echoboden."
	quest.5804CBE7C2BE0961.title: "&2Finde den Hallenden Wald"
	quest.580C06F1C4F7DB06.quest_desc: [
		"Gieß einen Eimer &6Lava&r im Aether aus. In der Kälte dort oben wird sie sofort zu &6Aerogel&r."
		""
		"Aerogel ist durchsichtig und hält Explosionen aus. Gut für Fenster, die ein Creeper nicht wegsprengt, und als Treppen, Stufen und Mauern."
	]
	quest.580C06F1C4F7DB06.quest_subtitle: "Was oben aus Lava wird."
	quest.580C06F1C4F7DB06.title: "&bGieß Lava in den Aether"
	quest.581C3F4B706ED10E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/the_end_arrival.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eDer Weg:&r Wirf ein &6Enderauge&r (Enderperle und Lohenstaub) in die Luft, lauf hinterher, wirf das nächste. Zeigt es nach unten, grab. Auf Kronwerke sind das die großen Festungen von YUNG's Better Strongholds."
		"&eDas Portal:&r 12 Rahmenblöcke, in jeden ein Enderauge, dann öffnet es sich. Das Portal vom Event reicht für alle, ein eigenes lohnt sich nur bei weit entfernter Basis."
		""
		"&eDrüben:&r Leere unter den Inseln, Endermen überall, Endsiedlungen mit Shulkern und Elytren, Chorus, Draconium. &eMitnehmen:&r geschnitzten Kürbis, Bogen und viele Pfeile, Blöcke, Wassereimer, goldene Karotten. Alles Weitere im Kapitel &5Das End&r."
	]
	quest.581C3F4B706ED10E.quest_subtitle: "Zwölf Enderaugen und eine Festung. Stufe 4."
	quest.581C3F4B706ED10E.title: "&5Find an End Portal of Your Own"
	quest.581D178F3B38DF08.quest_desc: [
		"A &6book&r in the middle, &e2 leather&r above and below, &e4 dyes&r in the corners, on the left &6Belladonna Berries&r, on the right something that melts like Animal Fat or a candle."
		""
		"In the book you paint on the pages, on the Altar or in your hand. A &6Canvas&r (a &6painting&r, &e4 Dried Sage&r around it) transfers a section: right click on a picture in the book, drag the area, close the window. Then you hang it up like a painting."
		""
		"Signs for shops, a coat of arms for the base, a portrait of the crow: all painted by yourself."
	]
	quest.581D178F3B38DF08.quest_subtitle: "Your own pictures on the wall."
	quest.581D178F3B38DF08.title: "&dPaint in the Book of Colors"
	quest.581F00E6AA61DA37.quest_desc: [
		"Find one of the small structures from &6Formations Nether&r and tick this off."
		""
		"&eAmong them:&r basalt huts, a blackstone castle, quartz spires, obsidian pillars, small lava arenas and lava shrines, a Nether wart field, an altar with a respawn anchor and a parkour course. Some have loot."
	]
	quest.581F00E6AA61DA37.quest_subtitle: "Small finds all over the Nether."
	quest.581F00E6AA61DA37.title: "&6Find a Formations Nether structure"
	quest.5836D48F1334F4B0.quest_desc: [
		"Infundierte Legierung, Energietablett, Infundierte Legierung oben, Legierung, &6Atomlegierung&r, Legierung in der Mitte, Raffiniertes Obsidian unten."
		""
		"Spitzhacke, Schaufel, Axt und Schwert in einem, läuft mit Strom statt Haltbarkeit. Modus-Taste: Normal, Langsam, Schnell, Aderabbau. In Stufe 4 wird daraus das Meka-Werkzeug."
	]
	quest.5836D48F1334F4B0.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism: ein Werkzeug mit Strom."
	quest.5836D48F1334F4B0.title: "&bBau den Atomic Disassembler"
	quest.5837F176723AB096.quest_desc: [
		"Mit dem Nether öffnen Mekanism, Immersive Engineering, Create-Messing, Just Dire Things und Productive Bees. Ab jetzt gibt es FE."
		""
		"&e1. Wärmegenerator von Mekanism in Lava:&r Eisen, Osmium, Kupfer, Bretter. 80 FE/t mit Kohle, dazu 12 FE/t je Lavaseite, ohne dass die Lava weniger wird. Billig und sofort, genug für drei bis vier Grundmaschinen."
		"&e2. Generator von Just Dire Things mit Primal Coal:&r 120 FE/t aus einem Stück, 1 Million FE Puffer, gibt 1 000 FE/t ab. Weniger Nachlegen als alles andere in dieser Stufe."
		"&e3. Dampfkessel mit Alternator:&r Eine Dampfmaschine liefert 16 384 SU, ein Alternator macht daraus bei 256 RPM 360 FE/t. Wer schon einen Kessel für Messing hat, bekommt den Strom fast geschenkt."
		""
		"Für richtig viel: der &6Gasgenerator&r mit Ethen aus dem Druckreaktor, bis 72 000 FE/t. Das ist ein Projekt für das Ende der Stufe."
	]
	quest.5837F176723AB096.quest_subtitle: "Der erste Strom. Drei Wege, die sich lohnen."
	quest.5837F176723AB096.title: "&e&lStufe 2: Welche Quelle wann"
	quest.583982681E14CDD1.quest_desc: [
		"A &6hay bale&r between two &6planks&r."
		""
		"Chickens nearby lay their eggs into it instead of into the grass. You need eggs for dough, fried rice and roast chicken."
	]
	quest.583982681E14CDD1.quest_subtitle: "Let the eggs be collected."
	quest.583982681E14CDD1.title: "&7Build a Chicken Nest"
	quest.5839D543483B6704.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &6Nickel&r at the top and sides, a &6copper ingot&r in the middle, at the bottom &6Magnetic Coil&r, an &6Andesite Casing&r from Create, Magnetic Coil."
		""
		"It burns anything that burns in a furnace, makes &e32 RF/t&r and buffers 50,000 RF. It needs no cores and takes no addons. Two or three of them carry the Pulverizer, furnace and Foundry."
	]
	quest.5839D543483B6704.quest_subtitle: "Coal in, 32 RF per tick out."
	quest.5839D543483B6704.title: "&c&lSet Up a Basic Generator"
	quest.584B3705D44CD470.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Pickup Upgrade&r in the middle, &6two ender pearls&r in the top corners, &6three iron ingots&r on top and on the sides, at the bottom &6redstone&r on the left and &6lapis lazuli&r on the right."
		""
		"Does everything the Pickup Upgrade does and pulls items in from a &e3 block&r radius. Perfect with FTB Ultimine."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r It also pulls in what a teammate drops. Switch it off in the upgrade tab when trading."
	]
	quest.584B3705D44CD470.quest_subtitle: "Pulls nearby items to you."
	quest.584B3705D44CD470.title: "Build a Magnet Upgrade"
	quest.584B70BE33FE2864.quest_desc: [
		"Plant &6Demon's Dream Seeds&r on farmland like wheat. Ripe, the plant gives &6Demon's Dream Fruit&r and new seeds."
		""
		"{image:occultism:textures/item/datura.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The fruit lights &dSpiritfire&r, heals spirits (right click the spirit) and, eaten, gives the &5Third Eye&r with some luck. Lay out a small field right away, you need many."
	]
	quest.584B70BE33FE2864.quest_subtitle: "The fruit everything revolves around."
	quest.584B70BE33FE2864.title: "&6Grow Demon's Dream"
	quest.585B83C32EBBE8C7.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6Crystalized Menril Chunks&r and a &6book and quill&r, diagonally like a pen."
		""
		"In the Labeller you give a Variable Card a name. With twenty cards in the Variable Store you know which one counts the coal and which one the tank."
	]
	quest.585B83C32EBBE8C7.quest_subtitle: "The Labeller."
	quest.585B83C32EBBE8C7.title: "&9Label your cards"
	quest.585EC3D75E9B9AB9.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6lead ingots&r and two &6graphite dust&r crosswise. Gives two &6Plate Basic&r."
	]
	quest.585EC3D75E9B9AB9.quest_subtitle: "The base plate of almost every machine."
	quest.585EC3D75E9B9AB9.title: "&8Lay Plate Basic"
	quest.5867F04FD180EAE5.quest_desc: [
		"Crafter recipe: brass ingots, brass sheets, iron bars, an &6emerald&r and a shaft. Pump &bspawn fluid&r into it and give it rotation."
		""
		"How the fluids are mixed is in &6Create: Addons&r."
	]
	quest.5867F04FD180EAE5.quest_subtitle: "Mobs from fluid."
	quest.5867F04FD180EAE5.title: "&6Build the Mechanical Spawner"
	quest.586C995B8D2FB38F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Incense Stick&r: Livingwood Twig diagonally, &6blaze powder&r in the middle, a &6ghast tear&r top right. &6Incense Plate&r: two Livingwood slabs and a Livingwood log in a row."
		""
		"In the brewery the stick takes up a brew like a vial, but costs about ten times as much mana. Put it on the plate and light it with flint and steel."
		""
		"It burns sixty times as long as a sip and gives the effect to all players within &e30 blocks&r. Not every brew works: no instant healing, nothing with several effects."
	]
	quest.586C995B8D2FB38F.quest_subtitle: "A brew for a 30 block radius."
	quest.586C995B8D2FB38F.title: "&6Light incense"
	quest.5871EDE821760ECC.quest_desc: [
		"&dHoming Projectile&r (Nether Star, Manipulation Essence, Dowsing Rod, eye of ender): seeks out the nearest creature. &dPropagate Homing&r (Manipulation Essence, the glyph): fires the rest of the spell anew as homing."
		"&dLife Link&r (lead, anima, sculk sensor): your damage and its healing are shared."
		"&dNullify Defense&r (Nether Star, 2 Marks of Mastery, netherite block): the target loses its invulnerability after hits."
	]
	quest.5871EDE821760ECC.quest_subtitle: "Tier 3 checklist: Ars Elemental, form and anima."
	quest.5871EDE821760ECC.title: "&dLearn Homing and Life Link"
	quest.5871F2C7F6FC9743.quest_desc: [
		"&6Spellbow&r: bow with a Source Gem block, gold block, Manipulation Essence. The Spell Crossbow works the same way."
		""
		"If your mana suffices, every arrow becomes a spell arrow with the inscribed spell. In the chamber you make &6augment arrows&r (Amplify, Pierce, Split) for more effect."
	]
	quest.5871F2C7F6FC9743.quest_subtitle: "Arrows that cast spells."
	quest.5871F2C7F6FC9743.title: "&6Enchant a bow"
	quest.58753FE55EDBEE1B.quest_desc: [
		"In the water cauldron: a &6netherite ingot&r, &e2 Mahogany Logs&r, &e2 Bottles of Blood&r, &e2 wheat&r, a &6Mandrake Root&r."
		""
		"The fastest of the three. As an item it is fireproof like netherite. That does not protect you when flying through lava, the netherite tip is for that."
	]
	quest.58753FE55EDBEE1B.quest_subtitle: "The fastest broom in the sky."
	quest.58753FE55EDBEE1B.title: "&2&lBuild a mahogany broom"
	quest.587961BD31DD6602.quest_desc: [
		"Dull Trinket into the apparatus. &e3 diamonds, 5 Source Gems&r make the &6Amulet of Mana Boost&r, &e2 diamonds, 2 gold ingots, 4 Source Gems&r the &6Amulet of Mana Regeneration&r."
		""
		"Only one amulet fits the curio slot. For long mining spells, more mana is usually better."
	]
	quest.587961BD31DD6602.quest_subtitle: "More mana or faster regen."
	quest.587961BD31DD6602.title: "&6Forge a mana amulet"
	quest.588B026AF2499D41.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_advanced_reaction.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Matter Condenser, Vibration Chamber, fluix dust, glowstone and a bucket make Advanced AE's &6Reaction Chamber&r."
		""
		"It makes 64 fluix, 64 sky steel, 64 entro or a singularity from 64 Matter Balls, each with a fluid and &d100,000 to 1 million AE&r per recipe."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r It does not make charged certus here. Attach it as a block to a provider, then it pulls straight from the network, and put dense energy cells next to it."
	]
	quest.588B026AF2499D41.quest_subtitle: "Water and lava, with power only."
	quest.588B026AF2499D41.title: "&5&lBuild a Reaction Chamber"
	quest.588E33EC80D80589.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Agglomeratio&r is a two by two recipe: the element top left, &6gravel&r top right, &6dirt&r bottom left, a &6clay ball&r bottom right. As the element you use a &eglass bottle&r (air), &egrass&r (earth), a &ewater bucket&r or a &elava bucket&r (fire)."
		""
		"Four Agglomeratio of one kind are the material for the matching &eelement seed&r in the altar, together with 4 Inferium Essence. Water and Fire Essence already have recipes, Air and Earth you collect for the &6Awakening Altar&r in &cstage 4&r."
	]
	quest.588E33EC80D80589.quest_subtitle: "Air, earth, water and fire pressed into clay."
	quest.588E33EC80D80589.title: "&bMix the Agglomeratio"
	quest.588FE4A385F1949A.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6plastic&r, one &6Electrum&r in the middle, at the bottom carbon fibre, plating, carbon fibre."
		""
		"Each lowers usage by &e20 percent&r without making the machine slower. Goes well with Speed Addons."
	]
	quest.588FE4A385F1949A.quest_subtitle: "20 percent less usage."
	quest.588FE4A385F1949A.title: "&aSave Power with the Efficiency Addon"
	quest.5891582657C05B8A.quest_desc: [
		"Kill &e5 blazes&r at their spawner and bring &e8 blaze rods&r along. Each blaze drops up to one rod, Looting more."
		""
		"{image:minecraft:textures/item/blaze_rod.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"A shield blocks the fireballs, snowballs damage blazes. Position yourself so they come to you. The Mekanism Crusher makes 4 blaze powder from one rod instead of 2."
		""
		"&cLeave the spawner standing.&r You need it for supply and for the live blaze of the next quest."
	]
	quest.5891582657C05B8A.quest_subtitle: "The raw material this stage revolves around."
	quest.5891582657C05B8A.title: "&6&lKill blazes"
	quest.58989C64FE93145C.quest_desc: [
		"Bring &e8 Diamanten&r aus der Anderwelt mit. Im &6Sculkgestein&r und im &6Düsterschiefer&r stecken dieselben Erze wie oben: Kohle, Eisen, Kupfer, Gold, Redstone, Lapis, Smaragd und Diamant."
		""
		"Die Höhlen sind riesig und offen, die Erze liegen oft frei an den Wänden. Leise gehen: Wo Sensoren stehen, sind auch Kreischer nicht weit."
	]
	quest.58989C64FE93145C.quest_subtitle: "Alle Erze, nur in anderem Gestein."
	quest.58989C64FE93145C.title: "&bGrab Diamanten in der Anderwelt"
	quest.58B2673DC628CD56.quest_desc: [
		"Boundaries are circles on the ground that work in a radius and keep drawing a little mana from whoever drew them. All need &e2 Powdered Iron&r and a third powder, no cloth needed. With cloth it becomes a scroll, which lets you lay the boundary somewhere else."
		""
		"&6Alarm Boundary:&r &e2 iron, 1 quartz&r. It reports every monster and every player that shows up within &e10 blocks&r and then gives comparator signal 15."
		""
		"Right click turns a boundary on and off, a redstone signal flips the state."
	]
	quest.58B2673DC628CD56.quest_subtitle: "Powdered Iron guards your base."
	quest.58B2673DC628CD56.title: "&7&lLay an Alarm Boundary"
	quest.58BB62824B5AD7BD.quest_desc: [
		"Draconic tier. Catalyst: the &6Wyvern Capacitor&r. In eight injectors: &64 Awakened ingots&r, &63 Draconic Energy Controllers&r and a &6Draconic Core&r. Costs 32 million energy."
		""
		"It charges tools and armor in your inventory and holds much more than the Wyvern Capacitor. In the fight against the Guardian the shield eats power, a full capacitor keeps it up."
	]
	quest.58BB62824B5AD7BD.quest_subtitle: "The battery for the Draconic gear."
	quest.58BB62824B5AD7BD.title: "&dFuse a Draconic Capacitor"
	quest.58C003978D129BBB.quest_desc: [
		"Pack a &6carved pumpkin&r, a &6bow&r and &e64 arrows&r. With the pumpkin on your head, endermen do not attack when you look at them."
		""
		"&eAlso:&r a stack of cobblestone for pillars and gaps, a &6water bucket&r against endermen, golden carrots and healing potions."
		""
		"The pumpkin limits your view. For the dragon fight you swap it for a helmet."
	]
	quest.58C003978D129BBB.quest_subtitle: "Pumpkin, bow, blocks."
	quest.58C003978D129BBB.title: "&dGear Up for the End"
	quest.58C4E94FD0DA9735.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6iron&r at the top, two Basic capacitors left and right of the casing, iron, the &6Starter Furnator&r, iron at the bottom."
		""
		"A Basic Furnator makes &e80 FE/t&r."
	]
	quest.58C4E94FD0DA9735.quest_subtitle: "Four times the power from iron."
	quest.58C4E94FD0DA9735.title: "&fUpgrade to Basic"
	quest.58C780BF42DC78FC.quest_desc: [
		"Four &cPlutonium Pellets&r in the corners, four normal &6QIO Drives&r on the sides, a Teleportation Core in the middle."
		""
		"It holds &e128,000 items&r in &e256 types&r, the normal drive 16,000 in 128. Put it into your Drive Array from stage 4, the network stays the same."
	]
	quest.58C780BF42DC78FC.quest_subtitle: "Eight times the room."
	quest.58C780BF42DC78FC.title: "&dBuild a Hyper-Dense QIO Drive"
	quest.58DE9117C21BCE2E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cirrus Amulet&r (Runes Autumn and Air, 4 Mana Infused String, Manasteel): double jump without fall damage."
		"&6Snowflake Pendant&r (Runes Winter and Water, 4 Mana Infused String, Manasteel): freezes water under you."
		"&6Pyroclast Pendant&r (Runes Summer and Fire, 4 Mana Infused String, Manasteel): puts you out as soon as there is no more fire."
		"&6Tainted Blood Pendant&r (4 prismarine, ghast tear, Mana Diamond): stores a brew and applies it permanently."
	]
	quest.58DE9117C21BCE2E.quest_subtitle: "Four pendants for the neck slot."
	quest.58DE9117C21BCE2E.title: "&6Wear amulets"
	quest.58EC0554EFA95D75.quest_desc: [
		"Each piece is made from &6Neptunium ingots&r like iron armour and has its own effect under water: the &6helmet&r improves sight, the &6chestplate&r lets you breathe, the &6leggings&r make you weightless, the &6boots&r faster at swimming."
		""
		"The Neptunium pickaxe and shovel dig under water without slowdown, sword and axe hit harder there. Just right for ocean monuments and sunken ships."
	]
	quest.58EC0554EFA95D75.quest_subtitle: "Breathe, see and swim under water."
	quest.58EC0554EFA95D75.title: "&bDive in Neptunium armour"
	quest.58F1958DA0645286.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_afrit_storage.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Dimensional Matrix:&r &e3 quartz blocks&r, ender pearl in Strigeor's Higher Binding (Djinni book)."
		"&6Storage Actuator Base:&r Otherstone Pedestal, &e2 copper&r, gold in Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion (Foliot book)."
		"The matrix over the base at the crafting table, done."
		""
		"It holds &e128 item types&r and &e256,000 items&r in total. Pipes and hoppers work with it like with a shulker box. When broken it keeps everything."
		""
		"&eTip:&r To take things out, use a Foliot Transporter instead of a filter pipe, that spares the server."
	]
	quest.58F1958DA0645286.quest_subtitle: "A storage in its own dimension."
	quest.58F1958DA0645286.title: "&6Build the Storage Actuator"
	quest.58F1DE6031C7BF7E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Energy Upgrade:&r on top quartz, &6redstone block&r, quartz, in the middle a &6Blank Upgrade&r, at the bottom quartz, &6gold ingot&r, quartz. Each gives the router &d50,000 FE&r of storage and &d1,000 FE&r throughput per router cycle."
		""
		"The &6Energy Output Module&r (redstone block over a Blank Module between two gold ingots, quartz below) pushes the power into the block next to it. If a chargeable item lies in the buffer, the router charges or drains it."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Without Speed Upgrades a router cycle is a whole second, so 20 ticks. The value per cycle is not FE per tick."
	]
	quest.58F1DE6031C7BF7E.quest_subtitle: "Energy Upgrade and Energy Output Module."
	quest.58F1DE6031C7BF7E.title: "&cTurn the Router into a Battery"
	quest.58FD8C4C0463E126.quest_desc: [
		"Ein Netz mit &6Stecker&r am Kraftwerk, einem &6Controller&r, einem &6Speicher&r und mindestens sechzehn &6Punkten&r: Das ist der Stand, mit dem der Rest von Kronwerke läuft. Alles, was ab Stufe 4 kommt, der Fusionsreaktor, Draconic, die großen AE2-Netze, hängt einfach an einem weiteren Punkt."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Die Technikseite des Ziels von Stufe 3 will 4.000 Stahl und 250 Fortschrittliche Steuerschaltkreise. Jede Stahlstraße, die du jetzt ohne Kabelsalat irgendwo hinstellst, zahlt darauf ein."
	]
	quest.58FD8C4C0463E126.quest_subtitle: "Das Netz, das die Basis trägt."
	quest.58FD8C4C0463E126.title: "&6&lMach Kabel überflüssig"
	quest.5906947CFD9F0C43.quest_desc: [
		"Here: &6Enchantment Industry&r (experience as a fluid), &6Power Grid&r (circuits with volts and amps), &6Crafts & Additions&r (FE from rotation) and the first parts of &6Create Connected&r."
		""
		"Switches, couplings, diesel engines, spawn fluids and the rest are in &6Create: Addons&r."
	]
	quest.5906947CFD9F0C43.quest_subtitle: "What else there is for Create."
	quest.5906947CFD9F0C43.title: "&dLook at the Create addons"
	quest.590AEE3D4B76B666.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cows&r, &6pigs&r and &6sheep&r drop &6Animal Fat&r, Looting raises the amount."
		""
		"In the heated cauldron it becomes tallow, from tallow you dip candles. Honeycomb and old candles melt just the same. Whoever has an animal farm collects the fat on the side."
	]
	quest.590AEE3D4B76B666.quest_subtitle: "Raw material for tallow and candles."
	quest.590AEE3D4B76B666.title: "&6Collect Animal Fat"
	quest.590E875B092F1121.quest_desc: [
		"Tief unten, unter &eY 16&r im Stein, krabbelt manchmal ein &6Grottol&r herum, ein kleines Wesen mit Diamanten auf dem Rücken. Er ist scheu und flieht, sobald er dich bemerkt."
		""
		"Erleg ihn, und er lässt einen &6Diamanten&r fallen. Schleich dich an und schneid ihm den Weg ab, bevor er in einem Gang verschwindet."
	]
	quest.590E875B092F1121.quest_subtitle: "Ein Steinwesen mit Diamanten auf dem Rücken."
	quest.590E875B092F1121.title: "&bFang einen Grottol"
	quest.591E4839C97A3B2A.quest_desc: [
		"Stell den &6Markt&r von Farming for Blockheads auf (Rezept im Kapitel &6Essen und Landwirtschaft&r) und kauf unter &eSetzlinge&r einen &6Walnuss-Setzling&r für &62 Smaragde&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Die Bäume von &6Productive Trees&r wachsen nirgends in der Welt. Der Markt verkauft die Kreuzungen der ersten drei Generationen: &eGeneration 1&r (Buche, Silberlinde, Teak, Kakao, Lärche, Red-Delicious-Apfel) für &61 Smaragd&r, &eGeneration 2&r und die fünf Mutationen für &62&r, &eGeneration 3&r für &64&r."
		""
		"Alles ab Generation 4, die leuchtenden Bäume und die Fundstücke gibt es nur durch &eZüchten&r mit Bienen oder Pollen und aus Truhen. 57 Setzlinge zum Kaufen, gut 100 zum Erarbeiten."
		""
		"Smaragde bekommst du bei Dorfbewohnern, aus Smaragderz im Gebirge und aus den Kisten dieses Kapitels. 163 Baumarten warten, mit Obst, Nüssen, Gewürzen, Farben und 163 Holzsorten. EMI zeigt unter &eBaumbestäubung&r zu jedem Baum die Eltern."
	]
	quest.591E4839C97A3B2A.quest_subtitle: "Jede Baumart für einen Smaragd."
	quest.591E4839C97A3B2A.title: "&a&lKauf einen Setzling am Markt"
	quest.591FF346477C851E.quest_desc: [
		"Zwei Stahlbarren mit Redstone dazwischen geben acht &6Einfache Universalkabel&r. Der &6Einfache Energie-Würfel&r: zwei Energietabletts, zwei Eisen, vier Redstone um ein Stahlgehäuse."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Einfaches Universalkabel:&r &d3 200 FE/t&r. Fortgeschritten 51 200 FE/t (Stufe 3), Elite 409 600 und Ultimativ 3 276 800 FE/t (Stufe 4). Kabel verbinden sich mit jedem FE-Gerät im Pack."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Einfacher Energie-Würfel:&r &d1,6 Millionen FE&r, Abgabe 1 600 FE/t. Fortgeschritten 6,4 Millionen und 6 400 FE/t (Stufe 3), Elite 25,6 Millionen und 25 600, Ultimativ 102,4 Millionen und 102 400 FE/t (Stufe 4). Die &6Induktionsmatrix&r (Gehäuse, Zellen, Anschlüsse) speichert schon mit einfachen Zellen &d3,2 Milliarden FE&r je Zelle, der einfache Anschluss schafft 102 400 FE/t. Kommt erst in Stufe 4: der Anschluss braucht Elite-Schaltkreise, die Zellen Lithiumstaub aus dem Kristallisator, siehe Kapitel &6Mekanism: Elite&r."
	]
	quest.591FF346477C851E.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism: 3 200 FE/t im Kabel, 1,6 Millionen FE im Würfel."
	quest.591FF346477C851E.title: "&6Leg Universalkabel und Energie-Würfel"
	quest.592E1500C47B722A.quest_desc: [
		"&eDer Weg:&r Die Rolle &bPerle der Realität&r (Reality Marble) von Mahou Tsukai teleportiert dich an einen festen Ort in einer eigenen kleinen Welt voller Schwerter. Sie kostet &d4 000 Mana&r pro Benutzung."
		""
		"&eDrüben:&r ein Duellplatz. Schaust du beim Benutzen ein Ziel an, nimmst du es mit, und einer von euch muss sterben, damit der andere wieder herauskommt. Allein genügt es, Schaden zu nehmen, dann bist du zurück."
		""
		"&eMitnehmen:&r nur, was du im Kampf brauchst. Alles Weitere im Kapitel &dMahou Tsukai&r."
	]
	quest.592E1500C47B722A.quest_subtitle: "Eine Dimension aus einer Schriftrolle. Stufe 4."
	quest.592E1500C47B722A.title: "&bBetritt das Reality Marble"
	quest.5952DC83553966F6.quest_desc: [
		"Bring &5Awakened Draconium Blocks&r to the obelisk and hand them in by hand. &e/kw goals&r shows the status."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stage 5 goal is called &5The Chaos Guardian&r: &e64 Awakened Draconium Blocks&r (fixed) and the antimatter pellets from Mekanism. That is 16 fusions, 16 Dragon Hearts, 32 Gaia Spirit Ingots."
		""
		"At 98 percent the date for the finale is set."
	]
	quest.5952DC83553966F6.quest_subtitle: "The tech pillar of the Chaos Works."
	quest.5952DC83553966F6.title: "&5&lBring 64 Blocks to the Obelisk"
	quest.59570321B36C9666.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6chains&r in the left column, two &6leather&r each top and bottom right, two &6paper&r in the middle. The &6Ironbound Tome&r has &e6 slots&r. A chain is iron nugget, iron ingot, iron nugget on top of each other."
		""
		"To move over, take the scrolls out of the old book at the Inscription Table and write them into the new one."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r The golden &6Apprentice's Spell Book&r (8 slots, +50 mana, 15 percent shorter cast time) needs hogskin from the Nether and comes in stage 2. The &6Enchanted Spell Book&r (10 slots, +100 mana) and the &6Ancient Codex&r (12 slots, +200 mana) come in stage 3, the Dragonskin book in stage 4."
	]
	quest.59570321B36C9666.quest_subtitle: "Chains and leather, one more slot."
	quest.59570321B36C9666.title: "&7Bind the Ironbound Tome"
	quest.5958C46A8187CB16.quest_desc: [
		"&6Encased Fan&r: &d2 SU per RPM&r. 256 SU at 128 RPM."
	]
	quest.5958C46A8187CB16.quest_subtitle: "The cheapest processor."
	quest.5958C46A8187CB16.title: "&7Fan: 2 SU per RPM"
	quest.596ADDFDC00D322E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hexerei_crow.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Crows live in forests. Throw &6Seed Mixture&r on the ground, then they fly over, and the chance is higher than when feeding by hand. Build the &6Crow Flute&r for it: &e3 mahogany planks&r and &e2 dyes&r."
		""
		"{image:hexerei:textures/item/crow_flute.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Right click changes the command: follow, sit, wander, help. When helping, the crow gathers items into a Coffer or Herb Jar, harvests fields or steals something from villagers (every 90 seconds)."
		""
		"The flute commands all crows nearby or up to 9 chosen ones and sets perches."
	]
	quest.596ADDFDC00D322E.quest_subtitle: "Small, black and helpful."
	quest.596ADDFDC00D322E.title: "&8Tame a crow"
	quest.596F1F2F3A46E581.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/powah_power_plant.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Blazing Furnator:&r Blazing Crystals, Blazing Capacitors, a casing and the Hardened Furnator. Plus a &6Blazing Energy Cell&r as a buffer."
		""
		"The Blazing Furnator makes &e800 FE/t&r, forty times as much as the Starter. Feed it coal blocks from a tree farm, or build reactors right away."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r &6The Furnace Never Sleeps&r wants thousands of steel ingots and Advanced Control Circuits. Behind every steel line stands a power plant. Spare power goes to your neighbour by cable."
	]
	quest.596F1F2F3A46E581.quest_subtitle: "800 FE per tick from charcoal."
	quest.596F1F2F3A46E581.title: "&6&lBuild a Blazing power plant"
	quest.5976A15C80404CE2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Skyroot Trees&r stehen überall mit grünem oder blauem Laub. Ein &6Skyroot Log&r ergibt 4 &6Skyroot Planks&r, zwei Bretter übereinander 4 &6Skyroot Sticks&r."
		""
		"&cWichtig:&r Werkzeuge aus der Oberwelt bauen Aether-Blöcke auf Kronwerke &elangsamer&r ab. Mach dir gleich hier Skyroot-Werkzeug, sonst kratzt du an jedem Block."
		""
		"Bäume mit goldenem Laub sind &6Golden Oaks&r. Lass sie stehen, bis du eine Zanite-Axt hast, siehe Quest Golden Amber."
	]
	quest.5976A15C80404CE2.quest_subtitle: "Das Holz des Aethers."
	quest.5976A15C80404CE2.title: "&2Fäll einen Skyroot-Baum"
	quest.5978B86F57E43FCE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cogwheel&r, &6Andesite Casing&r and &6stone&r make the &6Millstone&r. Drive it from the side or from above and throw items in on top."
		""
		"&6Wheat&r becomes &6Wheat Flour&r, &6cobblestone&r becomes &6gravel&r, gravel &6flint&r, andesite cobblestone, flowers twice as much dye. EMI shows everything else."
		""
		"Right-click takes the result out; an Andesite Funnel on the side pulls it off. Ores are only crushed by the Crushing Wheels from stage 2."
	]
	quest.5978B86F57E43FCE.quest_subtitle: "Your first machine."
	quest.5978B86F57E43FCE.title: "&6Mill in the millstone"
	quest.5988FAF7D17F3CC9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_controller.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Sophisticated Storage&r, &6Lagerkern&r: Alle Sophisticated-Truhen und -Fässer, die ihn oder einander berühren, werden ein Lager. Rechtsklick mit einem Gegenstand legt ihn passend ab, Trichter und Rohre am Kern verteilen auf den ganzen Verbund. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Vier Stein, zwei Komparatoren, zwei Bretter um ein Holzfass oder eine Holztruhe. Lücken überbrücken Lagerverbindungen. Siehe Kapitel Lager."
	]
	quest.5988FAF7D17F3CC9.quest_subtitle: "Sophisticated Storage, Lagerkern: viele Truhen, ein Zugang."
	quest.5988FAF7D17F3CC9.title: "Verbinde Fässer mit dem Lagerkern"
	quest.599FDC8D45DCD789.quest_desc: [
		"&6Diamond&r: &e1,561&r durability, speed &e8&r, +3 damage, diamond mining level, Brittle II."
		""
		"The best in stage 1. You make up for Brittle with an iron rod and a sinew binding."
	]
	quest.599FDC8D45DCD789.quest_subtitle: "1,561 durability, speed 8."
	quest.599FDC8D45DCD789.title: "&bDiamond"
	quest.59C22455BC8004C6.quest_desc: [
		"Chaotic tier. Catalyst: the &6Draconic Capacitor&r. In eight injectors: &64 Awakened ingots&r, &63 Chaotic Energy Controllers&r and a &6Chaotic Core&r. Costs 128 million energy."
		""
		"It keeps Chaotic gear full in the field without you having to go back to the Energy Core."
	]
	quest.59C22455BC8004C6.quest_subtitle: "The last battery."
	quest.59C22455BC8004C6.title: "&8Fuse a Chaotic Capacitor"
	quest.59C434572D86FC9A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/the_end_cg_find.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Craft an &6Eye of Void&r and throw it: top &6purpur pillar, shulker shell, purpur pillar&r, middle &6end stone bricks, eye of ender, end stone bricks&r, bottom &6purpur block, shulker shell, purpur block&r."
		""
		"Cataclysm's &6Ruined Citadel&r only stands in the End Highlands and Midlands. Inside wait Ender Golems, Endermapteras and at the end the &cEnder Guardian&r."
	]
	quest.59C434572D86FC9A.quest_subtitle: "The Eye of Void shows the way."
	quest.59C434572D86FC9A.title: "&6Find the Ruined Citadel"
	quest.59CBA4C5D0E1A0A0.quest_desc: [
		"Zurück in die Druckkammer, je bei &e1 Bar&r: drei &6Klumpen&r, ein &6Redstone&r und eine &6Kunststoffplatte&r ergeben einen &6Transistor&r, zwei Klumpen, ein &6Schleimball&r und eine Kunststoffplatte einen &6Kondensator&r. An der Werkbank: eine &6Unbestückte Platine&r in der Mitte, zwei Transistoren oben und unten, zwei Kondensatoren links und rechts ergeben die &6Platine&r (Printed Circuit Board)."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/item/printed_circuit_board.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Die Platine ist das Bauteil, mit dem die höheren Maschinen beginnen. In Stufe 2 steckt sie in der &6Modul-Erweiterungskarte&r (Platine, vier Kunststoffplatten, vier Redstone, ergibt vier), die dem Sicherheitsventil, dem Regler und der Druckanzeige ein Fenster mit genauer Schwelle gibt. In Stufe 3 braucht sie jede Drohne, der Programmierer, die Montagestraße und die fortgeschrittenen Kompressoren."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Wer jetzt eine Platinenlinie aufbaut (Kammer, Lichtkasten, Becken, Schmelzofen für die Fehlplatinen), hat am ersten Tag von Stufe 3 die Teile für die Montagestraße fertig."
	]
	quest.59CBA4C5D0E1A0A0.quest_subtitle: "Transistoren, Kondensatoren, fertig."
	quest.59CBA4C5D0E1A0A0.title: "&9&lSetz die Platine zusammen"
	quest.59D51D26FC492787.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6clay&r in the corners, four &6bricks&r on the sides, one &6sandstone&r in the middle make three &6Coke Bricks&r."
		""
		"For one oven that is nine recipes: &e36 clay, 36 bricks, 9 sandstone&r. Clay is found in rivers and swamps, bricks you fire in the furnace from clay balls."
	]
	quest.59D51D26FC492787.quest_subtitle: "Enough for one Coke Oven."
	quest.59D51D26FC492787.title: "&6Fire 27 Coke Bricks"
	quest.59D727E21E41F5C9.quest_desc: [
		"Unter &eSicherheit&r wählst du: &6Öffentlich&r (jeder kann Geräte anschließen), &6Verschlüsselt&r (nur mit &ePasswort&r) oder &6Privat&r (nur eingetragene Mitglieder)."
		""
		"Auf einem Server mit vielen Spielern ist verschlüsselt der gute Mittelweg: Freunde bekommen das Passwort und hängen ihre Punkte an deinen Strom, Fremde nicht. Wer nicht ans Netz darf, bekommt am Gerät &cZugriff verweigert&r."
		""
		"Server-Admins können sich zum Super-Admin machen und in jedes Netz schauen. Das ist für Streit um Strom gedacht, nicht für Alltag."
	]
	quest.59D727E21E41F5C9.quest_subtitle: "Öffentlich, verschlüsselt oder privat."
	quest.59D727E21E41F5C9.title: "&eSichere dein Netzwerk"
	quest.59DB7135CD26CAD3.quest_desc: [
		"A &6string&r above a &6Soulwoven Silk&r."
		""
		"The pouch works like a bundle, but grabs every arcana you pick up. Magical items take up less space in it. After a few hours of harvesting with the scythe your inventory will thank you."
	]
	quest.59DB7135CD26CAD3.quest_subtitle: "Arcana no longer land in your inventory."
	quest.59DB7135CD26CAD3.title: "&7Sew a Soulwoven Pouch"
	quest.59DEA4114D1D5E3B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cell Workbench:&r wool, Calculation Processor, wool at the top, iron, chest, iron in the middle, three iron at the bottom."
		""
		"Put a cell into it and drag the items it should take from EMI into the filter slots. After that only those land in it. A button takes the current contents as the filter."
		""
		"Cards go into the cell here too: the &6Equal Distribution Card&r splits the room across all types, the &6Overflow Destruction Card&r deletes what no longer fits. Use that one only with a filter."
	]
	quest.59DEA4114D1D5E3B.quest_subtitle: "A cell just for ores."
	quest.59DEA4114D1D5E3B.title: "&dPartition a cell"
	quest.59EE5DF5D7393061.quest_desc: [
		"An &6ME FE Cell Housing&r with &6Harden Insulating Resin&r (a water bucket, two cacti, bone meal, silicon, a slime ball, glowstone, hardened in a furnace). Component: a Logic Processor with Redstone Crystals and Certus Quartz Dust."
		""
		"&d1,048,576 FE&r fit into one byte, so the 1k cell swallows about a billion FE. The &6Flux Accessor&r is the socket: power in through a cable, power out to machines next to it. The &6Induction Card&r does the same from an interface or a provider."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stored power does not feed the ME network itself, the Energy Acceptor stays for that. Cells up to 16k in stage 3."
	]
	quest.59EE5DF5D7393061.quest_subtitle: "A battery that fits into the drive."
	quest.59EE5DF5D7393061.title: "&c&lStore power in cells"
	quest.59F84C7BFF6888A2.quest_desc: [
		"Iron all around, a piston on top, a circuit in the middle. It pulls by filter from the chest behind it and pushes into the transporter in front of it."
		""
		"Two of them go into the Digital Miner from stage 3."
	]
	quest.59F84C7BFF6888A2.quest_subtitle: "Filters from chests into transporters."
	quest.59F84C7BFF6888A2.title: "&eSet up a Logistical Sorter"
	quest.5A04E062C833F78E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_aviar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Aviar's Circle&r, 9x9: &e24 white&r signs as a circle with a cross, &e4 candles&r diagonally next to the middle, the golden bowl in the centre."
		"Put at least &e4 sacrificial bowls&r within 8 blocks with it. The preview in the Dictionary shows every sign."
		""
		"&eWhat it summons:&r Foliot with a job. Crusher, smelter, crystallizer, lumberjack, farmer, transporter, janitor and three traders. The checklist on the right has a quest for each."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Grey particles at the golden bowl mean: the ritual is waiting for a sacrifice or a used item."
	]
	quest.5A04E062C833F78E.quest_subtitle: "The pentacle for the Foliot."
	quest.5A04E062C833F78E.title: "&5Draw Aviar's Circle"
	quest.5A072D8F78E05A22.quest_desc: [
		"Die Programme kann niemand craften. Du kaufst sie beim &6Pressure Mechanic&r, einem Dorfbewohner mit eigenem Haus in Dörfern, oder über das &6Amadron Tablet&r: &eAssembly Program: Drill&r und &eAssembly Program: Laser&r kosten je &68 Smaragde&r, &eDrill & Laser&r kostet 14."
		""
		"Das &6Amadron Tablet&r (7 Plastic Sheets, ein GPS Tool, ein Air Canister, danach aufladen) bindest du per Rechtsklick an eine Kiste. In der Kiste liegen die Smaragde, eine Drohne holt sie ab, eine zweite bringt die Ware. Gleich dort gibt es auch den &6PCB Blueprint&r."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Ein arbeitsloser Dorfbewohner neben einer &6Charging Station&r wird von selbst zum Pressure Mechanic. Dann sparst du dir die Lieferdrohnen."
		""
		"Das Programm &eDrill & Laser&r macht nicht beides, sondern nur Rezepte mit zwei Schritten, zum Beispiel vom Compressed Iron Block direkt zum Advanced Pressure Tube."
	]
	quest.5A072D8F78E05A22.quest_subtitle: "Drill und Laser, für Smaragde."
	quest.5A072D8F78E05A22.title: "&eKauf die Assembly Programs"
	quest.5A0F97042370EA0C.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Andesite Alloys&r on top of each other make eight &6Shafts&r. A shaft passes rotation on in a straight line, without loss."
		""
		"You only get around a corner with cogwheels or a gearbox. The wrench turns a placed shaft."
		""
		"&6Tip:&r The &6Mechanical Saw&r makes six shafts from one alloy, the crafting table only four."
	]
	quest.5A0F97042370EA0C.quest_subtitle: "The simplest line for rotation."
	quest.5A0F97042370EA0C.title: "&6Lay a shaft"
	quest.5A0F9713892A89DA.quest_desc: [
		"Don't throw any cobblestone away. In stage 1 the obelisk wants &e20,000&r from the whole server, and every kind counts: normal, mossy and cobbled deepslate."
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tip:\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" Hold \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbultimine\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" while mining and \"},{\"text\":\"Ultimine\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" takes a whole row at once.\"}]"
	]
	quest.5A0F9713892A89DA.quest_subtitle: "Your first stack for the obelisk."
	quest.5A0F9713892A89DA.title: "&7Collect 64 cobblestone"
	quest.5A1363EB8E5F78C9.quest_desc: [
		"In der &6Thermopneumatischen Anlage&r: &b1 000 mB Wasser&r und ein &6Pilz&r ergeben &b250 mB Hefekultur&r (Yeast Culture). Die Anlage muss zwischen &e30 und 60 Grad&r warm sein, nicht heißer. In warmen Biomen geht das von selbst, sonst hilft ein wenig Hitze oder ein Platz tief unter der Erde."
		""
		"&eSchneller:&r Gieß einen Eimer Hefekultur als Teich aus und wirf &6Zucker&r hinein. Gießt du dann Wasser direkt daneben, wird es zu neuer Hefekultur."
		""
		"Hefe ist der Anfang einer ganz eigenen Brennstofflinie: &aBiodiesel&r aus Feldfrüchten, ohne Öl aus dem Boden."
	]
	quest.5A1363EB8E5F78C9.quest_subtitle: "Pilze und Wasser bei Körpertemperatur."
	quest.5A1363EB8E5F78C9.title: "&2Züchte Hefekultur"
	quest.5A14AA4A7BC2D925.quest_desc: [
		"&6Breaker Module:&r a &6Blank Module&r and a &6pickaxe&r, shapeless. &6Placer Module:&r Blank Module, &6dispenser&r and &6dirt&r."
		""
		"The breaker mines the block in front of the router and puts it into the buffer. The pickaxe decides what it can handle: with iron no obsidian, with &eSilk Touch&r or &eFortune&r on it, it takes over the enchantment. The placer places blocks from the buffer, seeds on farmland too."
		""
		"The &6Activator Module&r (dispenser, lever, quartz, redstone around a module) clicks like a player: right on blocks, right on animals (milking, shearing), or it attacks, then every hit costs 150 FE from an Energy Upgrade."
		""
		"Breaker in front of a cobblestone generator, placer in a tree farm: the router replaces the player standing next to it."
	]
	quest.5A14AA4A7BC2D925.quest_subtitle: "Breaker, Placer and Activator."
	quest.5A14AA4A7BC2D925.title: "&7Let the Router Dig and Build"
	quest.5A290F2836513354.quest_desc: [
		"In swamps and mangrove swamps stands the &6Mangrove Hut&r, the hut of the &2Apothecarist&r. He is a mage like the others: 0 to 8 &6Arcane Essence&r, a scroll, 1 to 3 inks."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r His stash has 15 rolls of 2 emeralds or 2 essence each, 3 to 5 potions or &6elixirs&r (Oakskin, Evasion, Invisibility, Greater Healing) and 2 to 5 &6Netherward Tinctures&r. Those protect hoglins and piglins you bring along from zombification, important from stage 2."
		""
		"The &6Alchemist Cauldron&r, in which you brew elixirs and recycle scrolls into ink, needs Cinder Essence from the Nether: stage 2."
	]
	quest.5A290F2836513354.quest_subtitle: "Potions, elixirs and a mage in the swamp."
	quest.5A290F2836513354.title: "&2Visit the Mangrove Hut"
	quest.5A2D3B62DB679D2B.quest_desc: [
		"Fünfte Generation, erster Teil. Die Hemlocktanne gelingt immer."
		""
		"&6Westliche Hemlocktanne&r: Gelbkiefer + Weißtanne, jeder Versuch"
		"&6Avocado&r: Wenge + Eiche, 10 %"
		"&6Brotfrucht&r: Sykomore + Zuckerahorn, 10 %"
		"&6Zeder&r: Weißtanne + Europäische Lärche, 10 %"
		"&6Kaffee&r: Schwarzkirsche + Kakao, 10 %"
		"&6Douglasie&r: Weißtanne + Fichte, 10 %"
		"&6Zierapfel&r: Süßer Holzapfel + Blühende Azalee, 10 %"
		"&6Ginkgo&r: Wenge + Silberlinde, 10 %"
		"&6Grandidier-Baobab&r: Balsa + Wenge, 10 %"
		"&6Weißdorn&r: Eberesche + Buche, 10 %"
		"&6Stechpalme&r: Erle + Eberesche, 10 %"
	]
	quest.5A2D3B62DB679D2B.quest_subtitle: "11 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.5A2D3B62DB679D2B.title: "&aGeneration 5: Hemlocktanne bis Stechpalme"
	quest.5A2FE6F6337F2177.quest_desc: [
		"Top gear, &6furnace&r, gear. Middle iron, &6Void Chassis&r, iron. Bottom obsidian, &6deepslate&r, obsidian. Capacitor in."
		""
		"With the Basic Capacitor it makes &e40 µI/t&r and buffers 64,000. Better capacitors get more out of every piece of fuel. Place it right next to the smelter and the power flows without a conduit."
	]
	quest.5A2FE6F6337F2177.quest_subtitle: "Power from anything that burns."
	quest.5A2FE6F6337F2177.title: "&cSet Up a Stirling Generator"
	quest.5A3223E15B5896B7.quest_desc: [
		"Material: &e4 Earth Agglomeratio&r (grass, gravel, dirt, clay)."
		""
		"Plus &e4 Inferium Essence&r and a &6Prosperity Seed Base&r in the Infusion Altar."
	]
	quest.5A3223E15B5896B7.quest_subtitle: "One seed, one checkmark."
	quest.5A3223E15B5896B7.title: "Seed: Earth (element)"
	quest.5A351A0F00D7D554.quest_desc: [
		"&6Solar Panel Basic:&r lapis, glass pane, lapis at the top, &6heavy weighted pressure plate&r, lapis, heavy weighted pressure plate in the middle, &6Coil Copper&r, &6daylight detector&r, Coil Copper at the bottom."
		""
		"It makes &e28 FE/t&r as long as it is day and the sky is clear. Three of them with four &6Plate Advanced&r, quartz dust and a Coil Copper make a &6Solar Panel Advanced&r with &e112 FE/t&r."
		""
		"The tiers above, DU and Elite, manage 448 and 1,792 FE/t."
	]
	quest.5A351A0F00D7D554.quest_subtitle: "28 FE per tick, just like that."
	quest.5A351A0F00D7D554.title: "&eSet Up Solar Panels"
	quest.5A3CC3DE11EAC4A4.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Wächter&r an einem Ozeanmonument mit dem Learner im Inventar. Ein Trank der Wasseratmung hilft."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d256 FE/t&r. Eine Vorhersage wird zu &616 Prismarinkristallen&r, 24 Kabeljau oder 2 Wächterstacheln von Reliquary. Der Große Wächter hat ein eigenes, teureres Modell."
	]
	quest.5A3CC3DE11EAC4A4.quest_subtitle: "Prismarin aus dem Ozeanmonument."
	quest.5A3CC3DE11EAC4A4.title: "&bLerne den Wächter"
	quest.5A3D0D49D3F4C874.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/the_end_crystals.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Shoot every &dEnd Crystal&r on the obsidian pillars with the bow. As long as one stands, the dragon heals from it."
		""
		"Two crystals sit in cages of iron bars. Build your way up, break open a bar and shoot through the hole. A crystal explodes, so do not stand next to it."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Split up the pillars. With ten people it takes a few minutes."
	]
	quest.5A3D0D49D3F4C874.quest_subtitle: "First the crystals, then the dragon."
	quest.5A3D0D49D3F4C874.title: "&dDestroy the End Crystals"
	quest.5A3E18466617101E.quest_desc: [
		"Blazes (3 percent) and magma cubes drop a &6Molten Core&r. It goes into the Sojourner's Staff, Lantern of Paranoia and Infernal Claw. Two Molten Cores in the crafting table give 4 blaze rods."
	]
	quest.5A3E18466617101E.quest_subtitle: "From the blaze or magma cube."
	quest.5A3E18466617101E.title: "&cMolten Core"
	quest.5A45271B024E68C8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Energy Discharger (Starter):&r paste in the corners and on the sides, Tiny at the top and bottom centre, the casing in the middle."
		""
		"It draws the power out of the items in its slots and gives it to cables and machines next to it. The counterpart of the Energy Hopper."
		""
		"That is how you carry power without cables: charge Batteries at the power plant with the hopper, carry them to the building site, empty them in the discharger."
	]
	quest.5A45271B024E68C8.quest_subtitle: "The Energy Discharger."
	quest.5A45271B024E68C8.title: "&eDischarge Batteries"
	quest.5A45E093DB57D9C5.quest_desc: [
		"Helm, Brust, Hose und Stiefel aus Komprimiertem Eisen und Druckluftteilen, geladen mit Luft. Jedes Teil nimmt Upgrade-Karten. Die einfache Rüstung aus Komprimiertem Eisen und der Presslufthammer gehen schon ab Stufe 2."
		""
		"Jet-Boots-Upgrade in den Stiefeln zum Fliegen, Nachtsicht und Mob-Tracker im Helm, Magnet und Ladegerät in der Brust. Die &6Minigun&r öffnet ebenfalls in Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.5A45E093DB57D9C5.quest_subtitle: "PneumaticCraft: Upgrades in jedem Teil."
	quest.5A45E093DB57D9C5.title: "&7Trag die Pneumatikrüstung"
	quest.5A470A14F364FB8F.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6archwood log&r in the middle, &e4 Source Gems&r, &e2 gold ingots&r, &fAir Essence&r, &6Manipulation Essence&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"The &6Wand&r always casts &eProjectile, Accelerate&r and then the spell you inscribe at the table without its own form. That way you get around the ten glyph limit."
	]
	quest.5A470A14F364FB8F.quest_subtitle: "One spell, instant and far."
	quest.5A470A14F364FB8F.title: "&6Build a Wand"
	quest.5A4B62CD2B7C049D.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &6arrow&r and &6Wilden Spike&r."
		""
		"Behind Projectile the ball flies one target further, behind Break it also hits the block behind. &eProjectile, Break, AOE, Pierce, Pierce&r digs a 3x3 tunnel, three blocks deep."
	]
	quest.5A4B62CD2B7C049D.quest_subtitle: "Through the wall and beyond."
	quest.5A4B62CD2B7C049D.title: "&dLearn Pierce"
	quest.5A4B9B4007E35800.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_nouveau_earth_essence.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Three &6pedestals&r no more than &e1 block&r next to the chamber: &6iron ingot&r, &6seeds&r, &6dirt&r. One Source Gem inside, &d2,000 Source&r, done."
		""
		"{image:ars_nouveau:textures/item/earth_essence.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The pedestal items stay put. Each essence only uses up the gem."
	]
	quest.5A4B9B4007E35800.quest_subtitle: "The chamber can do more than gems."
	quest.5A4B9B4007E35800.title: "&dMake Earth Essence"
	quest.5A59B88D79813940.quest_desc: [
		"A &6diamond&r with &e4 Prosperity Shards&r gives a &6Prosperity Gemstone&r. With &e2 Inferium Essence&r, shapeless, it becomes an &6Inferium Gemstone&r."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/inferium_gemstone.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Gemstones sit at the top and bottom of every Inferium tool and in the middle of every Growth Accelerator recipe. Three diamonds are enough to start: two for the first tool, one for three accelerators."
	]
	quest.5A59B88D79813940.quest_subtitle: "A diamond, four shards, two essence."
	quest.5A59B88D79813940.title: "&bCut Inferium Gemstones"
	quest.5A5BE12CDFF717E6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron ingots&r at the top, &6coal&r or charcoal at the bottom, two each: that gives one &6Steel Ingot&r."
		""
		"That is expensive. Later the &6Foundry&r makes one ingot from one iron and one coal dust. Every Oritech recipe takes any steel, including Mekanism's."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Every steel ingot counts at the obelisk for &6The Furnace Never Sleeps&r."
	]
	quest.5A5BE12CDFF717E6.quest_subtitle: "Two iron, two coal, one ingot."
	quest.5A5BE12CDFF717E6.title: "&8Make Steel at the Crafting Table"
	quest.5A7068DE34B7B447.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mahou_tsukai_cloth.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6White wool&r and the &6dagger&r give 4 Spell Cloth. The dagger stays."
		""
		"&eHow to cast:&r cloth on the ground, blood circle on top, click three powders in one after another. Without cloth the circle becomes a &6magic circle&r that works on the ground. An empty hand on a fresh circle puts the last recipe back in."
	]
	quest.5A7068DE34B7B447.quest_subtitle: "No cloth, no scroll."
	quest.5A7068DE34B7B447.title: "&eCut Spell Cloth"
	quest.5A75B4AB0897E764.quest_desc: [
		"Put a &6sapling&r with &6shears&r into the crafting table, that gives a &6dead bush&r. Infuse it with 800 mB into an &6Undead Sapling&r and plant it. The tree grows like any other."
		""
		"An &6Undead Log&r becomes 4 &6Undead Planks&r. A &6Dark Gem&r above two planks gives 4 &6Dark Sticks&r, the handle for the Vein Sword, Kineticator, brooms and Gemstone Torch."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Small blood stains gather under the leaves of an Undead Tree over time. A Sanguinary Pedestal next to it drinks them by itself."
	]
	quest.5A75B4AB0897E764.quest_subtitle: "Dark Sticks for tools and brooms."
	quest.5A75B4AB0897E764.title: "&4Grow an Undead Tree"
	quest.5A8027BE844B0D12.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Abras' Conjure, 17x17: Kandar's circle plus &e16 red&r signs and &e4 Spirit Attuned Crystals&r."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6Iesnium&r, &6emerald&r, &6lapis&r, &6amethyst&r and &6obsidian dust&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Afrit book, 180 seconds."
		""
		"It makes &efour dusts from one ore&r and needs only half as long as the Djinni. Iesnium ore now gives four ingots instead of one."
	]
	quest.5A8027BE844B0D12.quest_subtitle: "Abras' Conjure: one ore, four dusts."
	quest.5A8027BE844B0D12.title: "&5Summon an Afrit Crusher"
	quest.5A8894E4E8E5B9F9.quest_desc: [
		"Put an &6Iron Bee&r spawn egg on the &aNatural Altar&r from Nature's Aura, &d15,000 Aura&r. Flower: &6Infused Iron block&r. The comb gives &6Infused Iron&r with 80 percent. A Gold Bee egg becomes a Tainted Gold Bee there for 3,000 Aura."
	]
	quest.5A8894E4E8E5B9F9.quest_subtitle: "Infused Iron, almost every comb."
	quest.5A8894E4E8E5B9F9.title: "&aTurn an Egg into an Infused Iron Bee"
	quest.5A911226C416703F.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Iron Sheets&r and an &6iron ingot&r make four &6Chutes&r. A chute pulls items from chests, millstones or basins above it and lets them fall."
		""
		"With a fan below or above it you can even push items upward."
		""
		"&6Tip:&r The &6Weighted Ejector&r (Golden Sheet, depot, cogwheel) throws items up to 32 blocks onto a target you click before placing it."
	]
	quest.5A911226C416703F.quest_subtitle: "Vertical, faster than a hopper."
	quest.5A911226C416703F.title: "&6Drop items through a chute"
	quest.5A9715FED6E51E1E.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Diamond, 1 Powdered Gold&r, cloth."
		""
		"For &d100 mana&r you get the &6Bow of Weapon Projectiles&r. It shoots tools and weapons from your inventory instead of arrows. Sneaking and right clicking switches modes, then it only takes projected weapons and Scrolls of Projection."
	]
	quest.5A9715FED6E51E1E.quest_subtitle: "A bow that shoots swords."
	quest.5A9715FED6E51E1E.title: "&bDraw Weapon Projectiles"
	quest.5A9AAE5DD2619FB7.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6Blank Module&r and a &6sticky piston&r, shapeless. A &6Puller Module Mk1&r."
		""
		"Each run it pulls one item from the chest directly next to the router into the buffer. You set the &edirection&r in the module, it counts relative to the router's front."
		""
		"Every module has &enine filter slots&r for ghost copies of items, plus buttons for whitelist or blacklist, durability, NBT and tags. Empty means: everything."
	]
	quest.5A9AAE5DD2619FB7.quest_subtitle: "The Puller Module Mk1."
	quest.5A9AAE5DD2619FB7.title: "&ePull from a Chest"
	quest.5A9DEFF20142F889.quest_desc: [
		"Iron in the top corners, &6four pistons&r around the upgrade base, redstone in the bottom corners."
		""
		"It presses items with a 2x2 recipe into a block right away, for example clay balls or quartz. 3x3 recipes like nuggets into ingots need the advanced version from stage 2."
	]
	quest.5A9DEFF20142F889.quest_subtitle: "The Compacting Upgrade."
	quest.5A9DEFF20142F889.title: "Pack small stuff together"
	quest.5AB8BCA25458279B.quest_desc: [
		"Öffne ein Flux-Gerät oder den Konfigurator, Reiter &eEin neues Netzwerk erstellen&r: Namen eingeben, Farbe wählen, &eErstellen&r. Jeder Spieler kann bis zu &d5&r Netzwerke besitzen."
		""
		"Ein Netzwerk ist kein Block und kein Ort. Es ist eine Liste: Alle Stecker, Punkte, Controller und Speicher, die du ihm zuweist, teilen sich den Strom, egal wie weit sie auseinanderstehen und in welcher Dimension. Es gibt keine Reichweite und keine Verluste."
		""
		"Die Farbe siehst du an den Geräten in der Welt, so erkennst du im Keller des Nachbarn, wessen Punkt das ist. In den &eNetzwerkeinstellungen&r änderst du Name und Farbe später, stellst die Anzeige auf FE oder EU um und löschst das Netz (doppelt Shift halten)."
	]
	quest.5AB8BCA25458279B.quest_subtitle: "Name, Farbe, und wem es gehört."
	quest.5AB8BCA25458279B.title: "&a&lLeg ein Netzwerk an"
	quest.5AC28303E139FB44.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r The &6Security Card&r is enriched iron at the top and bottom, two &6Network Cards&r and an Advanced Processor in the middle. Shapeless with paper it becomes the &6Fallback Security Card&r. The &6Security Manager&r: enriched iron, a &6chest&r at the top, two Security Cards left and right of the casing, the fallback card at the bottom."
		""
		"Once the manager is active, &ceverything is forbidden&r in the network at first. With Security Cards you allow individual players what they may do: insert, extract, build devices. The fallback card applies to everyone without a card of their own."
		""
		"On a server with thirty people the best protection for your diamonds. It needs 16 FE/t."
	]
	quest.5AC28303E139FB44.quest_subtitle: "Security Manager and Security Cards."
	quest.5AC28303E139FB44.title: "&cProtect Your Network"
	quest.5AC6A55469482592.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Buche&r trägt &6Bucheckern&r, drei pro reifem Blatt, und der Red-Delicious-Apfelbaum zwei &6Äpfel&r. Früchte reifen an den Blättern, du siehst es an der Farbe, und mit Rechtsklick pflückst du sie, der Baum bleibt stehen."
		""
		"Nüsse schmeckst du im Ofen oder Räucherofen zu &6Gerösteten Bucheckern&r, Hasel-, Wal-, Pekannüssen und mehr, je nach Baum. Neun Nüsse werden zu einer Kiste, die sich als ganze rösten lässt."
		""
		"Insgesamt tragen 83 der Baumarten Obst oder Nüsse: Zitronen, Bananen, Kirschen, Pflaumen, Mandeln, Kaffee. Jede davon ist ein Setzling, den du erst kreuzen musst."
	]
	quest.5AC6A55469482592.quest_subtitle: "Bäume, die mehr geben als Holz."
	quest.5AC6A55469482592.title: "&6Ernte Nüsse und Obst"
	quest.5AD1EB7E90E841A2.quest_desc: [
		"Shadowpulse Goo (Sculk) macht aus Netheritblöcken &6Eclipse Alloy&r. Template am Schmiedetisch wie immer."
		""
		"2 561 Haltbarkeit, Tempo 16, +5 Schaden, Netherit-Stufe. Hammer 7x7, die Rüstung fliegt und schützt vor Lava. Dazu Zeitkristalle, Time Wand und die &6Portal Gun V2&r."
	]
	quest.5AD1EB7E90E841A2.quest_subtitle: "Just Dire Things: 7x7 und Flug."
	quest.5AD1EB7E90E841A2.title: "&8Schmiede Eclipse Alloy"
	quest.5AD7F3AA6B280385.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Schlossblock&r besteht aus vier &6Eisenbarren&r in den Ecken, vier Brettern und einem Redstone in der Mitte. Der &6Schlüssel&r aus einem &6Goldbarren&r über zwei Goldklumpen wird mit einem Namen am Amboss zum passenden Schlüssel: Schlossblock und Schlüssel müssen gleich heißen."
		""
		"{image:supplementaries:textures/item/key.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Rechtsklick mit dem richtigen Schlüssel gibt ein Redstone-Signal, zum Beispiel an eine Eisentür. Türen, Falltüren und Zauntore lassen sich mit einem benannten Schlüssel ebenfalls sperren. Innerhalb deines Claims ist das Deko, am Serverrand ist es nützlich."
	]
	quest.5AD7F3AA6B280385.quest_subtitle: "Ein Schloss, zu dem nur dein Schlüssel passt."
	quest.5AD7F3AA6B280385.title: "&6Schließ ab"
	quest.5AE1619DF20D779C.quest_desc: [
		"3 &dGaia-Seelen&r oben, Elementium, Gaia-Seele, Elementium in der Mitte, Feder, Reine Ender-Essenz, Feder unten. Kapitel &aBotania: Gaia&r."
		""
		"Fliegt mit Mana aus dem Inventar, nach etwa 30 Sekunden am Stück ist die Leiste leer. Sprint-Stoß alle 2 Sekunden, Gleiten beim Schleichen ohne Fallschaden. Quarz tauscht die Flügel."
	]
	quest.5AE1619DF20D779C.quest_subtitle: "Botania: 30 Sekunden Flug mit Mana."
	quest.5AE1619DF20D779C.title: "&bSetz die Flügel-Tiara auf"
	quest.5AE9E5E081CB6BE2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Urn of Endless Waters&r comes from the &dArs Nouveau&r Enchanting Apparatus: &6flower pot&r in the middle, &6Source Gem&r, &e2 Water Essences&r and &e2 prismarine shards&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Connect it to your Petal Apothecary (or a cauldron) with the &6Dominion Wand&r. When the apothecary is empty, the urn refills it for a little Source."
		""
		"&eTip:&r That is exactly the Lexica task &eApothecary refiller&r."
	]
	quest.5AE9E5E081CB6BE2.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: never carry water buckets again."
	quest.5AE9E5E081CB6BE2.title: "&bFill the apothecary with the urn"
	quest.5AF4637E8D5BABCB.quest_desc: [
		"&dSpark&r (Air Essence, wool, iron bars): damage with shock, more against wet targets."
		"&dConjure Terrain&r (Earth Essence, dirt): places dirt, with Amplify cobblestone."
		"&dFilters&r (item scroll plus one item): Undead (rotten flesh), Summoned (bone), Aerial (phantom membrane), Aquatic (fish), Insect (spider eye). With the Deny scroll you get each one the other way round too."
	]
	quest.5AF4637E8D5BABCB.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: the stage 1 glyphs."
	quest.5AF4637E8D5BABCB.title: "&dLearn Spark, Terrain and the filters"
	quest.5AF6780F712BF3C4.quest_desc: [
		"The Quarry Card surrounded by eight &6glass blocks&r. It leaves air behind. Good for a basement, a hall or a pool."
		""
		"With eight dirt blocks around it, it becomes the normal card again."
	]
	quest.5AF6780F712BF3C4.quest_subtitle: "Air instead of dirt."
	quest.5AF6780F712BF3C4.title: "&7Build a Clearing Card"
	quest.5AF877D13DE617C3.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a &6diamond&r into a &6Mana Pool&r with at least &d10,000 mana&r. It turns into a &bMana Diamond&r."
		""
		"The &6Source Keystone&r needs two. How to make mana and get it into the pool is in the chapter &aBotania&r."
	]
	quest.5AF877D13DE617C3.quest_subtitle: "A diamond into the full Mana Pool."
	quest.5AF877D13DE617C3.title: "&bInfuse two Mana Diamonds"
	quest.5B1BF1525F54306D.quest_desc: [
		"&eMana Powder&r, &eManasteel ingot&r, &eNether brick&r, &egunpowder&r, &ecoal&r or charcoal. &d5,200 mana&r, gives &e2 runes&r."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/rune_of_fire.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"For the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate, Rune Core, Thermalily, Gourmaryllis, Exoflame. The engineers need one per &6Brass Heart&r: a good trade for casings."
	]
	quest.5B1BF1525F54306D.quest_subtitle: "A breath of the Nether."
	quest.5B1BF1525F54306D.title: "&cMake the Rune of Fire"
	quest.5B25DD50942C713A.quest_desc: [
		"Let the Crude Blast Furnace run on &6iron&r and &6coke&r until &e16 steel ingots&r are done."
		""
		"A full stack of iron and coke is through in a good hour. Steel from Immersive Engineering and from Mekanism is the same ingot, you can use it in both mods."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/metal_ingot_steel.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.5B25DD50942C713A.quest_subtitle: "Steel, one ingot per minute."
	quest.5B25DD50942C713A.title: "&8&lSmelt your first 16 steel ingots"
	quest.5B2F65D98288796A.quest_desc: [
		"Trees from the market, fruit and nuts, the sawmill and crossbreeding. You buy the hybrids here at the Farming for Blockheads market."
	]
	quest.5B2F65D98288796A.quest_subtitle: "163 kinds of trees, fruit, nuts, wood."
	quest.5B2F65D98288796A.title: "&aOpen Productive Trees"
	quest.5B32FB094B66B231.quest_desc: [
		"An &6ender pearl&r, a &6lead&r and a &6gold ingot&r shapeless give the &6Flimsy Ender Lead&r. Hit an animal with it, and it is stuck in the lead. Right clicking the ground releases it again."
		""
		"With it cows, sheep and bees move to the new base without fences and without a boat. The weak lead only takes animals."
		""
		"&eInfusion:&r At &bEterna 45&r, &dQuanta 25&r and &5Arcana 40&r it becomes the &6Ender Lead&r, which catches almost any creature. Eterna 45 needs the world tier &aFrontier&r."
	]
	quest.5B32FB094B66B231.quest_subtitle: "Cow into the pocket, cow back out."
	quest.5B32FB094B66B231.title: "&5Catch Animals with the Ender Lead"
	quest.5B4A45220537CBE1.quest_desc: [
		"Vier &6Stöcke&r in Rautenform ergeben einen &6Fachwerkrahmen&r (Timber Frame). Stell ihn auf und klick ihn mit einem &6Vollblock&r an, der Block füllt den Rahmen und die Balken bleiben sichtbar. Vier Stöcke diagonal ergeben die &6Strebe&r, vier Stöcke in den Ecken das &6Kreuz&r."
		""
		"Die passende Füllung ist &6Lehmputz&r (Daub): ein &6Lehmklumpen&r und ein &6Stroh&r im 2x2-Schachbrett ergeben zwei Stück. Stroh kommt von Farmer's Delight, Weizen oder Flachs gehen auch. Lehmputz mit vier Stöcken drumherum ist gleich der fertige Fachwerkblock."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Rahmen aus FramedBlocks und Fachwerk aus Supplementaries vertragen sich. Ein Fachwerkhaus mit Rahmenschrägen als Dach ist in einer Stunde gebaut."
	]
	quest.5B4A45220537CBE1.quest_subtitle: "Balken und Lehm, wie im Dorf."
	quest.5B4A45220537CBE1.title: "&6Bau Fachwerk"
	quest.5B5277928B3141A4.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &68 Malarite&r. The ore only exists in the &6Dark Swamp&r, from &eY -64&r up to the surface."
		""
		"Malarite becomes weapons, tools, arrows and a spear. &6Pungency Fruit&r grows all over the swamp, smells like garlic and works as a weapon too."
	]
	quest.5B5277928B3141A4.quest_subtitle: "Only in the Dark Swamp."
	quest.5B5277928B3141A4.title: "&2Dig Malarite in the Swamp"
	quest.5B60791811808507.quest_desc: [
		"Erleg einen &cProwler&r in der alten Fabrik. Er hat &e160 Lebenspunkte&r und Rüstung 10, feuert Zielsuchraketen und einen Todeslaser."
		""
		"Bleib in Bewegung und geh hinter Säulen in Deckung, wenn er auflädt. Zur Belohnung gibt er &e5 bis 7 Eisen&r und &e5 bis 9 Redstone&r, eine gute Übung für den Harbinger."
	]
	quest.5B60791811808507.quest_subtitle: "Die Wachmaschine der alten Fabrik."
	quest.5B60791811808507.title: "&7Leg einen Prowler still"
	quest.5B709BC504B96D05.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Öffne mit \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ftbchunks.map\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" die Karte von \"},{\"text\":\"FTB Chunks\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" und zieh mit gedrückter linker Maustaste über die Chunks deiner Basis. Ein Team kann bis zu \"},{\"text\":\"500 Chunks\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" beanspruchen, mehr als genug. Wie Teams gehen, steht im Startkapitel unter Claims.\"}]"
		""
		"&eChunkgrenzen:&r &eF3 und G&r blendet sie ein. Bau Maschinenreihen so, dass sie nicht über eine Grenze laufen. Wenn der Nachbarchunk gerade nicht geladen ist, steht die halbe Anlage still, und Förderbänder oder Rohre über der Grenze stauen."
		""
		"&eLaden:&r Mit Schleichen und Linksklick auf der Karte lädst du bis zu &e25 Chunks&r dauerhaft. Auf Kronwerke bleiben sie auch geladen, wenn dein ganzes Team offline ist. Farmen laufen also über Nacht weiter."
	]
	quest.5B709BC504B96D05.quest_subtitle: "Claims, Chunkgrenzen und was geladen bleibt."
	quest.5B709BC504B96D05.title: "&aSichere deine Basis"
	quest.5B72439E13FA934F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRedstone Link&r: the train waits until a frequency of the redstone links is on or off. That way a switch in your base sends the train off from the other end of the line."
	]
	quest.5B72439E13FA934F.quest_subtitle: "Depart by radio."
	quest.5B72439E13FA934F.title: "&7Redstone Link"
	quest.5B7733539BCEAB3D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ender IO&r, &6Item Conduit&r: &e32 Gegenstände pro Netztakt&r, &6Energetic&r 64, &6Vibrant&r 64 doppelt so oft. Jede Verbindung hat einen Ein- und einen Ausgangsfilter mit Farbkanälen, Prioritäten und Rundlauf. Mehrere Leitungssorten liegen in einem Block. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"Leitungen aus Conduit Binder und dem Metall der Stufe. Fassaden verstecken sie hinter jedem Block. Siehe Kapitel Ender IO."
	]
	quest.5B7733539BCEAB3D.quest_subtitle: "Ender IO, Item Conduit: 32 Stück pro Netztakt, Filter in jeder Verbindung."
	quest.5B7733539BCEAB3D.title: "Lies: Ender-IO-Leitungen"
	quest.5B7C517C27E44A58.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blank Parchment&r: &e1 paper&r surrounded by &e8 Magebloom Fiber&r. Put it on the Scribe's Table, pick the spell in the book and click the table while sneaking."
		""
		"From stage 2, parchments feed the spell turrets. Shapeless with a chest, a blank one becomes an &6Allow Item Scroll&r, with cobblestone a &6Deny Item Scroll&r. Both are filters for Starbuncles."
	]
	quest.5B7C517C27E44A58.quest_subtitle: "A spell to take along."
	quest.5B7C517C27E44A58.title: "&6Write a parchment"
	quest.5B8A5E7E3A66B7C8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Moas&r sind die großen Laufvögel des Aethers. Jedes erwachsene Moa legt nach einer Weile ein &6Moa Egg&r, auch die wilden, solange niemand darauf sitzt. Folge einer Herde oder sperr ein paar in einen Zaun."
		""
		"&eDie Farben:&r &9Blue Moa&r, häufig, &e3 Sprünge&r in der Luft. &fWhite Moa&r, seltener, &e4 Sprünge&r. &8Black Moa&r, das seltenste, &e8 Sprünge&r."
		""
		"Weiße und blaue Eier liegen auch in den Truhen der Silber-Dungeons. Ein Moa-Ei ist zudem Zutat für Kürbiskuchen und Kuchen."
	]
	quest.5B8A5E7E3A66B7C8.quest_subtitle: "Blau, weiß oder schwarz, und jedes fliegt anders."
	quest.5B8A5E7E3A66B7C8.title: "&eFinde ein Moa-Ei"
	quest.5B8E1A16ABE701CC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/undergarden_depths.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Dig through the &6Dreadrock&r at the bottom of the world with the Forgotten Pickaxe. Below lie the &5Depths&r and the &5Infected Depths&r. Mine &68 Rogdorium&r."
		""
		"&cThe air is bad:&r Just being there drives up the Utheric Infection, faster in the Infected Depths. Do not stay longer than needed."
		""
		"&6Rogdorium Ore&r lies in Dreadrock from &eY -64 to 0&r."
	]
	quest.5B8E1A16ABE701CC.quest_subtitle: "Below the Dreadrock."
	quest.5B8E1A16ABE701CC.title: "&5&lBreak Through into the Depths"
	quest.5B929F6F7049FCFA.quest_desc: [
		"Feed a &6Black Hole&r with experience, for example next to a mob trap. For every &e60 experience points&r it spits out an &6Xpetrified Orb&r."
		""
		"Right click gives &e91 experience points&r, more than went in. In the forge an orb delivers 91 experience as essence. The &6Eternal Stella&r needs three orbs when forge tier 3 opens with stage 3."
	]
	quest.5B929F6F7049FCFA.quest_subtitle: "Experience to take along."
	quest.5B929F6F7049FCFA.title: "&aCollect Xpetrified Orbs"
	quest.5B96C535381949C2.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Fusion Reactor Frame&r with four redstone in a cross. It sits in the plus of a side, like glass and ports."
		""
		"In the window you choose when it gives a signal: &eReady for Ignition&r as soon as the core is hot enough, or &eInsufficient Fuel&r when the D-T Fuel runs out. A signal to a lamp or to the Laser Amplifier, and you do not have to stand next to it."
	]
	quest.5B96C535381949C2.quest_subtitle: "The reactor reports by redstone."
	quest.5B96C535381949C2.title: "&cBuild a Fusion Reactor Logic Adapter"
	quest.5BBDB9E4B8166E3A.quest_desc: [
		"In the Crystal Assembler: a machine frame, eight Engineering Processors, all four presses, an &6Inscriber Concurrent Press&r (three eyes of ender, four Entro Crystals, a Silicon Press) and a stonecutter."
		""
		"A &6silicon block&r gives nine Printed Silicon, a gold block nine logic circuits, a diamond block nine engineering circuits, a Certus Quartz Block four calculation circuits. The fastest source of silicon in stage 3."
	]
	quest.5BBDB9E4B8166E3A.quest_subtitle: "Nine plates from one block."
	quest.5BBDB9E4B8166E3A.title: "&3Build a Circuit Slicer"
	quest.5BCBAB91759BF922.quest_desc: [
		"&6Basic Battery:&r one steel at the top, below it plastic, Electrum, plastic twice. Storage: three &6nickel&r at the top, silicon, &6Magnetic Coil&r, silicon in the middle, three batteries at the bottom."
		""
		"It holds &e1,000,000 RF&r and takes and gives &e5,000 RF/t&r each. Power goes in on all &agreen&r sides and only out at the &cred&r port. Mined, it keeps its charge."
		""
		"A comparator reads the fill level, a redstone signal stops the output. With the slider in the window you limit how much it gives."
	]
	quest.5BCBAB91759BF922.quest_subtitle: "A million RF to take along."
	quest.5BCBAB91759BF922.title: "&eBuild a Portable Energy Storage"
	quest.5BE023B3A7A0D8B5.quest_desc: [
		"Place a &6Pewter Inlay&r on the ground, look at it and sing &5Wicked, Soul, Wicked, Soul&r. It becomes the &5Unholy Symbol&r."
		""
		"Sung onto a weapon, it deals wither damage for a while. The symbol goes into the scythe, the Elder Statue and the Wicked Weave."
	]
	quest.5BE023B3A7A0D8B5.quest_subtitle: "Touch of Darkness."
	quest.5BE023B3A7A0D8B5.title: "&5Consecrate an Unholy Symbol"
	quest.5BE06264E07BD930.quest_desc: [
		"&e1 redstone&r and &e1 fern&r or &e1 short grass&r, shapeless."
		""
		"It goes into almost every functional flower. A flower with a root in its recipe rests as long as it gets a redstone signal. You harvest grass and ferns with shears."
	]
	quest.5BE06264E07BD930.quest_subtitle: "The switch for your flowers."
	quest.5BE06264E07BD930.title: "&6Craft Redstone Roots"
	quest.5BE61543A538C710.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_s2_xp.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Use a &6Mechanical Grindstone&r (8 andesite alloy around a shaft) on an &6Item Drain&r: a grindstone drain. A second grindstone on top grinds &6experience nuggets&r into &b3 mB of liquid experience&r each, the drain empties bottles o' enchanting at &b10 mB&r each."
		""
		"Experience nuggets drop from raw ore between the crushing wheels. The &6Experience Hatch&r (fluid hatch and block of experience) on the tank is your bank: right click pays in levels, sneaking takes them out again."
		""
		"See the &6Create: Add-ons&r chapter (Enchantment Industry)."
	]
	quest.5BE61543A538C710.quest_subtitle: "Enchantment Industry: grindstone, drain, hatch."
	quest.5BE61543A538C710.title: "&5Stage 2: experience in bottles"
	quest.5BE6B9DEDB998338.quest_desc: [
		"With the &6Components blueprint&r at the &6Engineer's Workbench&r: two &6Steel Plates&r and a &6copper ingot&r make a &6Steel Mechanical Component&r."
		""
		"Three of them go into every set of Heavy Engineering Blocks. You build the workbench and blueprint as described in the stage 2 chapter."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_component_steel.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.5BE6B9DEDB998338.quest_subtitle: "At the Engineer's Workbench."
	quest.5BE6B9DEDB998338.title: "&7Build Steel Mechanical Components"
	quest.5BF566997804F15F.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6redstone blocks&r at the top and sides, a &6lava bucket&r in the middle, at the bottom &6redstone&r, &6Advanced Frame&r, redstone."
		""
		"It uses &6lava&r from the tank together with &6redstone&r in the slot. The Fluid Laser Base with an Orange Lens drills lava for you in the Nether."
	]
	quest.5BF566997804F15F.quest_subtitle: "Lava and redstone."
	quest.5BF566997804F15F.title: "&cSet Up a Magma Mycelial Generator"
	quest.5BF86ABF0D0B011B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6gold ingot&r top middle, two &6redstone&r left and right below it, four &6iron ingots&r in the middle and bottom row. A &6Basic Demagnetization Coil&r."
		""
		"Within &e2 blocks&r of the coil (adjustable 1 to 3) no magnet pulls anymore. Put it at your farm's collection point, then the output stays in the hopper even when someone walks by with a magnet. Its area is shown when you look at it."
		""
		"The &6Advanced Coil&r (glowstone, redstone, gold around the basic one) reaches 3 blocks, adjustable up to 5, and has a filter. Glowstone comes with the Nether in stage 2."
	]
	quest.5BF86ABF0D0B011B.quest_subtitle: "The Demagnetization Coil."
	quest.5BF86ABF0D0B011B.title: "&7Protect Your Farm from Magnets"
	quest.5BF96ACCE4732BD0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_hedyrin.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Hedyrin's Lure&r, 9x9: &e12 white&r signs, &e4 yellow&r signs, &e4 candles&r, golden bowl in the middle."
		"It is started with the bound Foliot book, like Aviar's Circle."
		""
		"&eWhat it summons:&r possessed endermites, skeletons, witches and phantoms, a wild parrot, random animals (common, small, water) and the first familiars: Greedy, Beaver, Deer, Blacksmith and Parrot."
	]
	quest.5BF96ACCE4732BD0.quest_subtitle: "The pentacle for Foliot possession."
	quest.5BF96ACCE4732BD0.title: "&5Draw Hedyrin's Lure"
	quest.5C15963A121D43D5.quest_desc: [
		"&6ME Tag Storage Bus:&r a Logic Processor at the top, redstone, storage bus, redstone in the middle, a book at the bottom."
		""
		"In place of single items you enter a tag, asterisks are allowed. &ec:raw_materials/*&r sends all raw ores into the chest behind it, &ec:ingots/* | c:gems/*&r all ingots and gems: &e|&r means or."
	]
	quest.5C15963A121D43D5.quest_subtitle: "A storage bus that can read tags."
	quest.5C15963A121D43D5.title: "&3Filter by tags"
	quest.5C1BE0D2A1DC8D0B.quest_desc: [
		"&64k component:&r redstone in the corners, a Calculation Processor at the top, three 1k components left, right and bottom, quartz glass in the middle."
		""
		"A 4k cell holds &e32,512&r of one kind, &e16,640&r with 63 types. A full cell and a larger component at the crafting table swap the component, the contents stay."
	]
	quest.5C1BE0D2A1DC8D0B.quest_subtitle: "Four times the room, the same types."
	quest.5C1BE0D2A1DC8D0B.title: "&9Upgrade to 4k"
	quest.5C3395CA4CBB0A61.quest_desc: [
		"First the &6Shears of Winter&r: Frozen Core, shears and two diamonds shapeless. Holding right click shears sheep and rips off leaves around you."
		""
		"Ice Magus Rod, Void Tear, Frozen Core and Shears of Winter shapeless give the &6Glacial Staff&r. It shoots stronger snowballs (&d3&r damage, &d+3&r against fireproof mobs, &d+6&r against blazes) and turns water under you into packed ice and lava into obsidian."
		""
		"The blocks thaw again as soon as you are far enough away. With it you walk dry over lava lakes in the Nether."
	]
	quest.5C3395CA4CBB0A61.quest_subtitle: "Water and lava freeze under you."
	quest.5C3395CA4CBB0A61.title: "&bMove Up to the Glacial Staff"
	quest.5C3B984CE25BA9B7.quest_desc: [
		"Wyvern tier. Catalyst: a &6Wyvern injector&r. In seven injectors: &64 diamonds&r, &62 Wyvern Cores&r, &61 Awakened Draconium Block&r. Costs 256,000 energy."
		""
		"Draconic tools have eight ingredients, so you need eight. A Draconic injector charges in 7 seconds instead of 11."
	]
	quest.5C3B984CE25BA9B7.quest_subtitle: "The next tier of fusion."
	quest.5C3B984CE25BA9B7.title: "&dFuse Draconic Injectors"
	quest.5C4E0AB60F5F5436.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r A &6Grid&r, an &6Advanced Processor&r and a &6crafting table&r, shapeless."
		""
		"The &6Crafting Grid&r has a crafting area that pulls straight from the network. Shift clicking the result crafts a whole stack. It needs 14 FE/t."
		""
		"&eTip:&r With Shift and Ctrl held together the grid only shows the things that fit the recipe currently laid out."
	]
	quest.5C4E0AB60F5F5436.quest_subtitle: "A crafting table with storage behind it."
	quest.5C4E0AB60F5F5436.title: "&bBuild a Crafting Grid"
	quest.5C65CFED73840F41.quest_desc: [
		"&6Andesite Casing&r, &6wool&r and &6Iron Sheet&r stacked make the &6Rope Pulley&r. It raises and lowers whatever is glued to the end of its rope."
		""
		"A freight lift, a mining platform or a drilling rig that eats its way down layer by layer. The elevator with floors comes in stage 2."
	]
	quest.5C65CFED73840F41.quest_subtitle: "Up and down, 384 blocks deep."
	quest.5C65CFED73840F41.title: "&6Lower a rope pulley"
	quest.5C7605B8D9AE7222.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sculk&r baust du mit einer &6Hacke&r ab, er gibt Erfahrung. &6Sensoren&r, &6Kreischer&r und &6Katalysatoren&r bekommst du nur mit &eBehutsamkeit&r heil heraus."
		""
		"&eKatalysatoren&r lassen Sculk wachsen: Stirbt ein Monster in ihrer Nähe, breitet er sich aus und setzt neue Sensoren und Kreischer. Kreischer, die so entstehen, können einen Wärter rufen."
		""
		"Sculk brauchst du später, um Schmiedevorlagen aus der Anderwelt zu kopieren."
	]
	quest.5C7605B8D9AE7222.quest_subtitle: "Mit der Hacke, nicht mit der Spitzhacke."
	quest.5C7605B8D9AE7222.title: "&3Ernte Sculk"
	quest.5C7D2202DE97FCA6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Nautilus shell&r on the brazier. On the hands: &6iron ingot&r, &6leather&r, &6quartz&r, two &6Soul Shards&r."
		""
		"Monsters within a large radius are driven away."
	]
	quest.5C7D2202DE97FCA6.quest_subtitle: "Ritual of Repelling."
	quest.5C7D2202DE97FCA6.title: "&cDrive Off Monsters"
	quest.5C7EBE075FC52CE4.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r two Blueprint Paper on top, a stick, an iron ingot at the bottom. The head needs &etwo&r material."
		""
		"Click a block with it. It reports ores up to &e16 blocks&r away."
	]
	quest.5C7EBE075FC52CE4.quest_subtitle: "Finds ore behind the wall."
	quest.5C7EBE075FC52CE4.title: "&7Build a prospector hammer"
	quest.5C7F097F734DF56F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Monstrous Helm:&r netherite helmet, Monstrous Horn and netherite template at the smithing table. Below half health it knocks everything nearby away and gives defence and regeneration."
		""
		"&6Infernal Forge:&r a pickaxe that blasts the ground with right click. With a void core from the End it later becomes the Void Forge."
		""
		"&6Netherite Effigy:&r netherite ingot, block of redstone, totem, 2 gold and 4 Nether bricks. It summons a small Monstrosity, which you tame with lava power cells."
	]
	quest.5C7F097F734DF56F.quest_subtitle: "A helmet, a pickaxe and a pet."
	quest.5C7F097F734DF56F.title: "&6Use the Monstrosity's loot"
	quest.5C8083CB09513A92.quest_desc: [
		"Diese Liste zeigt, welches Werkzeug, welche Waffe, welche Rüstung und welche Flughilfe sich in jeder Stufe lohnt: ein Haken pro Stück, dazu Zahlen und das Kapitel, in dem das Rezept steht."
		""
		"In Stufe 1 ist Diamant das Ziel, und Silent Gear macht aus wenig Eisen schon ein gutes Werkzeug. Alles in diesem Abschnitt ist eine echte Aufgabe, ab Stufe 2 sind es Haken."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Gesperrte Ausrüstung kannst du tragen, aber nicht anlegen. Der Tooltip nennt die Stufe."
	]
	quest.5C8083CB09513A92.quest_subtitle: "Eisen, Diamant, Teile und ein Rucksack."
	quest.5C8083CB09513A92.title: "&7&lRüste dich für Stufe 1"
	quest.5C815934C0FF07BE.quest_desc: [
		"Components blueprint at the workbench: a &6Duroplast Sheet&r, two &6Vacuum Tubes&r and an &6Aluminium Wire&r make an &6Advanced Electronic Component&r."
		""
		"It opens with stage 3 and goes into the Tesla coil, the Railgun, the turret and the Resonanz Engineering Blocks."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_component_electronic_adv.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.5C815934C0FF07BE.quest_subtitle: "The best part of the mod."
	quest.5C815934C0FF07BE.title: "&d&lBuild Advanced Electronics"
	quest.5C86604A476E54F6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/farms_animals_thorn.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Dreadthorne&r (3 black, 2 cyan petals, redstone root) in the Petal Apothecary, planted in the pen, a &6Mana Pool&r within 10 blocks. It only hurts &eadult animals&r and leaves the young ones alone."
		""
		"A floor of hoppers under the pen collects meat, leather, wool and feathers. With the feeding trough next to it, the animal farm runs completely without you."
		""
		"A redstone signal switches it off when the herd gets too small. Flower and pool are in the &aBotania&r chapter."
	]
	quest.5C86604A476E54F6.quest_subtitle: "Meat and leather without a sword, the calves stay."
	quest.5C86604A476E54F6.title: "&6Plant a Dreadthorne"
	quest.5C8FB7B228CE9B39.quest_desc: [
		"Break &6grass&r, &6wheat&r or &6rice&r with the knife in your hand. You also get &6straw&r."
		""
		"Two straw on top of each other: four rope. Four straw in a square: one canvas. Nine straw: a straw bale. And straw goes into compost."
	]
	quest.5C8FB7B228CE9B39.quest_subtitle: "Through the tall grass with the knife."
	quest.5C8FB7B228CE9B39.title: "&6Harvest straw with the knife"
	quest.5C9FC3E47AEA9B2E.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r The &664B Fluid Storage Part&r is the 1k part with an empty &6bucket&r instead of the redstone in the middle. Part and Storage Housing make the &664B Fluid Storage Disk&r, it holds 64 buckets."
		""
		"Fluid disks sit in the same drive as item disks. Lava, water, oil, Mekanism fluids: everything that fits in a pipe comes into the network with Importer and Exporter. At the top of the Grid you switch between seeing items or fluids."
		""
		"256B, 1024B and 4096B work like the item parts, only always with a bucket in the middle."
	]
	quest.5C9FC3E47AEA9B2E.quest_subtitle: "Bucket instead of redstone."
	quest.5C9FC3E47AEA9B2E.title: "&9Store Fluids"
	quest.5CC040E073942ECB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_foliot_crusher.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Pentacle:&r Aviar's Circle."
		"&6Bowls:&r one &6iron, gold, copper&r and &6silver ingot&r each."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Bound Foliot book onto the golden bowl, after &e60 seconds&r it stands there."
		""
		"Throw ore or raw ore to it: &eone ore becomes two dusts&r. Dust in the furnace gives ingots, which doubles your yield. It works half as fast as the Djinni."
		""
		"Foliot with a job don't age. If they are hurt, you heal them with a Demon's Dream Fruit."
	]
	quest.5CC040E073942ECB.quest_subtitle: "One ore, two dusts."
	quest.5CC040E073942ECB.title: "&d&lSummon a Foliot Crusher"
	quest.5CD0A072FD54E586.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r five &6clay balls&r and four &6sand&r in a checkerboard give four &6Fire Clay&r, fired in the furnace into &6Fire Bricks&r. Eight fire bricks around a &6blast furnace&r give the &6Foundry Controller&r, around glass the &6Tank&r, as an empty ring the &6Drain&r. Three copper ingots, copper, bucket, copper, three fire bricks give a &6Liquid Heating Coil&r."
		""
		"{image:productivemetalworks:textures/item/fire_brick.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eBuilding:&r The floor is made entirely of &6heating coils&r, the walls of fire brick blocks (four bricks give four) or windows, with controller, tank and at least one drain in them. At least 3 by 3 and two high, an air block inside, the corners may be missing. &6Lava&r into the tank, then it heats at 1,500 degrees."
		""
		"&eSmelting:&r Throw items in via the controller or from above. An ingot gives 90 mB, a raw ore 180 mB, an &6ore block 270 mB&r, so three ingots. Coal becomes 100 mB of carbon, a honeycomb honey and wax. Two fluids together alloy by themselves, 90 mB of iron and 100 mB of carbon become 90 mB of &6steel&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The Foundry does not alloy brass, only the mixer does that. Steel from the Foundry counts later for the stage 3 goal."
	]
	quest.5CD0A072FD54E586.quest_subtitle: "A smeltery made of fire clay, fired with lava."
	quest.5CD0A072FD54E586.title: "&6&lBuild the Foundry"
	quest.5CDDC03DD1834D02.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ore Vein Atlas:&r a chest and an amethyst at the top, a map and a book and quill at the bottom. &6Sample drill:&r in mechanical crafting from brass sheets, an electron tube, a precision mechanism, a brass casing, sturdy sheets and a mechanical drill."
		""
		"Place the sample drill over a vein, put a &6copper backtank&r with air on top and click it. When it is done, click it with the atlas. Clicking a running drilling machine with the atlas works too."
		""
		"The atlas remembers place, kind and size of every vein. With it you filter the ore vein finder to exactly the vein you are looking for."
	]
	quest.5CDDC03DD1834D02.quest_subtitle: "Sample drill and Ore Vein Atlas."
	quest.5CDDC03DD1834D02.title: "&7Map Your Ore Veins"
	quest.5CE05A7727557306.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Enriched iron in the four corners, an &6Advanced Control Circuit&r from Mekanism in the top middle, &6Silicon&r left, right and bottom, a &6Machine Casing&r in the center."
		""
		"The &6Controller&r accepts &dFE&r from every side, a universal cable from Mekanism or Powah is enough. It stores &d1,000 FE&r and passes it on to every device in the network. Click it to see what the network needs."
		""
		"&eNo ritual, no channels:&r Unlike the ME Controller it needs no rare parts, and it hands out no channels. You may even put several Controllers into one network if the power is not enough."
		""
		"For comparison: Grid 10 FE/t, Disk Drive 10 FE/t plus 4 per disk, Importer and Exporter 2 FE/t each, Wireless Transmitter 16 FE/t. A small network runs on less than &d50 FE/t&r."
	]
	quest.5CE05A7727557306.quest_subtitle: "The power for the whole network."
	quest.5CE05A7727557306.title: "&3&lBuild the Controller"
	quest.5CE2422F8345AA82.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &62 Dreamwood Logs&r on top of each other make &61 Dreamwood Twig&r."
		""
		"Twigs go into the Elementium tools and the &6Wand of the Elven Forest&r (3 twigs, 2 petals), the elven version of the Wand of the Forest."
	]
	quest.5CE2422F8345AA82.quest_subtitle: "Handles for everything elven."
	quest.5CE2422F8345AA82.title: "&6Carve Dreamwood Twigs"
	quest.5CF76C7A691F9E0A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Copper&r at the top, two &6crafters&r left and right, an &6Adamant Ingot&r in the middle, at the bottom Motor, blast furnace, Motor. Three cores, &e128 RF/t&r."
		""
		"Its most important product is the &6Processing Unit&r: plastic, carbon fibre, Electrum and redstone. The order in the slots does not matter, AE2 pattern providers work directly."
		""
		"Coils, motors and plating are much cheaper here than at the crafting table."
	]
	quest.5CF76C7A691F9E0A.quest_subtitle: "Four ingredients, one part."
	quest.5CF76C7A691F9E0A.title: "&9&lBuild an Assembler"
	quest.5CFCC0BC7EA018F2.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Rahmentür&r kommt aus der Rahmensäge, die &6Rahmenfalltür&r aus sechs &6Rahmenstufen&r in zwei Reihen an der Werkbank. Tarn sie mit demselben Block wie die Wand daneben, und der Eingang verschwindet fast."
		""
		"Es gibt beides auch in Eisen, das sich nur mit Redstone öffnet. Für einen versteckten Lagerraum hinter der Bücherwand genau das Richtige."
	]
	quest.5CFCC0BC7EA018F2.quest_subtitle: "Rahmentür und Rahmenfalltür, getarnt wie die Wand."
	quest.5CFCC0BC7EA018F2.title: "&6Bau Türen, die nicht auffallen"
	quest.5D0BE98FE94CBC51.quest_desc: [
		"Glue &6Mechanical Drills&r to the front of your train and chests or a vault behind them. When the train moves they drill what is in the way, and what they mine lands in the chests."
		""
		"The tracks you lay piece by piece in front of it. The &6Mechanical Roller&r from &6Create: Brass&r paves the bed as well."
		""
		"&cImportant:&r Drills and other tools on the train only work near a player. In unloaded chunks the train keeps going, but does not drill."
	]
	quest.5D0BE98FE94CBC51.quest_subtitle: "Drills on the engine, chests in the carriage."
	quest.5D0BE98FE94CBC51.title: "&6Bore a tunnel with the train"
	quest.5D17215C745178DC.quest_desc: [
		"Enter each of the &d20&r biomes of the Undergarden, including the &6Barren Abyss&r, the three seas and, below, the &6Depths&r, the &6Infected Depths&r and the &6Rogdorium Grove&r."
		""
		"A &6Nature's Compass&r finds the missing ones for you, it knows the Undergarden's biomes too."
	]
	quest.5D17215C745178DC.quest_subtitle: "From the Smogstem Forest to the Infected Depths."
	quest.5D17215C745178DC.title: "&2&lVisit All Twenty Biomes"
	quest.5D1BAF41EFDB096B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Immersive Engineering&r, &6Flüssigkeitsrohr&r: verteilt gleichmäßig auf alle Ausgänge, langsam ohne Druck, schnell hinter einer &6Flüssigkeitspumpe&r (&e250 RF/t&r für Hochdruck). &6Holz-&r und &6Metallfass&r 12 Eimer, der &6Tank&r aus Blechmetall &e512 Eimer&r. Kein Filter, ein &6Rohrventil&r sperrt per Redstone. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Hammer trennt und verbindet Rohre, Farbstoff färbt sie, gefärbte Rohre verbinden sich nicht mit neuen. Siehe Kapitel Immersive Engineering."
	]
	quest.5D1BAF41EFDB096B.quest_subtitle: "Immersive Engineering: langsam ohne Druck, 512 Eimer im Tank."
	quest.5D1BAF41EFDB096B.title: "Lies: IE-Rohre, Pumpe und Tanks"
	quest.5D277AE3F3547F8E.quest_desc: [
		"A train with cargo storage and interfaces, a schedule with two stations, condition &eCargo Idle&r: the train leaves as soon as loading or unloading has been done for a while."
		""
		"That way a mine at the edge of the map feeds your factory, or your zinc and copper mine the brass mixers."
	]
	quest.5D277AE3F3547F8E.quest_subtitle: "Raw materials travel by themselves."
	quest.5D277AE3F3547F8E.title: "&6Let a goods train shuttle"
	quest.5D2F7A3290E4A328.quest_desc: [
		"Crusher: one obsidian gives &efour obsidian dust&r. Metallurgic Infuser: dust with &e10 mB of diamond&r gives &6Refined Obsidian Dust&r. Compressor: dust with osmium gives the &6ingot&r."
		""
		"Refined Obsidian is the strongest material of Mekanism Tools and goes into the Teleporter Frame and the Robit."
	]
	quest.5D2F7A3290E4A328.quest_subtitle: "Obsidian, diamond, osmium."
	quest.5D2F7A3290E4A328.title: "&5Make Refined Obsidian"
	quest.5D39D58490ECDCDF.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r steel casing in the middle, a &6crushing wheel&r left and right instead of the lava buckets, circuits top and bottom, redstone in the corners."
		""
		"It turns ingots into dust, cobblestone into gravel, obsidian into four obsidian dust (stage 3 needs that). Plants and food become &6bio fuel&r, an apple two."
		""
		"&eNether tip:&r A blaze rod gives four blaze powder here instead of two."
	]
	quest.5D39D58490ECDCDF.quest_subtitle: "Grinds with Create's wheels."
	quest.5D39D58490ECDCDF.title: "&4Build a Crusher"
	quest.5D7AC0894293B916.quest_desc: [
		"Siebte Generation, erster Teil, die Gewürze."
		""
		"&6Piment&r: Teak + Gewürznelke, 10 %"
		"&6Aprikose&r: Pflaume + Pfirsich, 10 %"
		"&6Buddhas Hand&r: Mandarine + Zitronatzitrone, 10 %"
		"&6Zimt&r: Palisander + Teak, 10 %"
		"&6Copoazu&r: Kakao + Kerzennuss, 10 %"
		"&6Jackfrucht&r: Cempedak + Brotfrucht, 10 %"
		"&6Kumquat&r: Mandarine + Vogelkirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Blauholz&r: Kapok + Palisander, 10 %"
	]
	quest.5D7AC0894293B916.quest_subtitle: "8 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.5D7AC0894293B916.title: "&aGeneration 7: Piment bis Blauholz"
	quest.5D8EFD1DEB9BCA03.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Containment Jar&r in the middle, &6Stabilized Warp Scroll&r, &6Conjuration Essence&r and &6diamond&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Name the Planarium at the anvil or with &dName&r, then a small dimension of its own belongs to it. Used while sneaking you enter it. What you build inside, you see shrunk in the jar outside."
		""
		"You set the start point with the Dominion Wand: first on a wall of the dimension, then on the place you want. You get out by breaking a wall."
	]
	quest.5D8EFD1DEB9BCA03.quest_subtitle: "A world of your own in a jar."
	quest.5D8EFD1DEB9BCA03.title: "&5Build a Planarium"
	quest.5D9581A486A0D250.quest_desc: [
		"With the Steel Works these open even without a new book: the rituals &aFlight&r, &aAwakening&r, &aDisintegration&r, &aWarping&r and the two &aIslands&r, the &aAdjustable&r and the &aTimer Spell Turret&r, the robes of the &6Arcanist&r and the &6Battlemage&r."
		""
		"Plus Ars Additions' &aArcane Permanence&r (Cascading log, Nether Star, source gem, Earth Essence): loads the chunks around the brazier as long as source flows."
	]
	quest.5D9581A486A0D250.quest_subtitle: "Rituals, turrets and robes without the archmage book."
	quest.5D9581A486A0D250.title: "&aSee What Stage 3 Opens in Ars"
	quest.5DA365C7D37A7AB5.quest_desc: [
		"First centrifuge without a Processing Unit: three &6glass bottles&r at the top, &6copper&r left and right, a &6Motor&r in the middle, at the bottom iron block, Motor, iron block."
		""
		"One &6Coal Dust&r becomes &6Carbon Fibre Strands&r. You need carbon fibre for the Processing Unit, the laser and the better cores."
	]
	quest.5DA365C7D37A7AB5.quest_subtitle: "Coal dust becomes carbon fibre."
	quest.5DA365C7D37A7AB5.title: "&dBuild a Centrifuge"
	quest.5DA5F6B45F83998C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Andesite Casing&r and &6Chute&r make a &6Portable Storage Interface&r. One sits on the contraption, one fixed in the world."
		""
		"When they face each other one or two blocks apart, the contraption stops and swaps items. A funnel on the fixed one pulls them off. In stage 2 freight trains load this way too."
	]
	quest.5DA5F6B45F83998C.quest_subtitle: "Portable Storage Interface."
	quest.5DA5F6B45F83998C.title: "&6Transfer while driving by"
	quest.5DBCF8A7C80F0249.quest_desc: [
		"&6Berry Bushes&r wachsen überall auf den Inseln. Abbauen gibt &e1 bis 3 Blue Berries&r, mit Glück mehr. Der Busch wird zum kahlen Stiel und wächst nach."
		""
		"{image:aether:textures/item/food/blue_berry.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Eine Beere füllt nur &eeine Keule&r, sättigt aber schnell. Auf &6Enchanted Aether Grass&r (Rechtsklick mit einem Ambrosium Shard auf Aether-Gras) fallen doppelt so viele Beeren."
	]
	quest.5DBCF8A7C80F0249.quest_subtitle: "Das Brot des Aethers, nur dünner."
	quest.5DBCF8A7C80F0249.title: "&9Pflück Blue Berries"
	quest.5DBF690D83BCA083.quest_desc: [
		"Find one of these structures and check off: the &6End Castle&r, the &6End Lighthouse&r or the &6End Ship&r from Dungeons and Taverns, or the &6End Shipwreck&r from Explorify."
		""
		"All chests in them are Lootr chests. Cataclysm's citadel has its own section further down."
	]
	quest.5DBF690D83BCA083.quest_subtitle: "More than purpur on the outer islands."
	quest.5DBF690D83BCA083.title: "&6Find a Structure from the Other Mods"
	quest.5DCDB707D5EEA3CA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_afrit_mineshaft.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding, both with the Djinni book, no sacrifice."
		"&6Mineshaft:&r &e4 Otherstone&r, gold ingot, &6Iesnium block&r, &bSpirit Attuned Crystal&r."
		"&6Djinni Miner:&r Foliot Miner, Iesnium Pickaxe, gold ingot, lapis, Spirit Attuned Crystal."
		""
		"The lamp goes into the Mineshaft, the finds come out at the bottom. The Djinni searches for ores on purpose and wears the lamp out faster than the Foliot. Empty the Mineshaft with a hopper, otherwise it throws finds away."
	]
	quest.5DCDB707D5EEA3CA.quest_subtitle: "Spirits dig for you, without lag."
	quest.5DCDB707D5EEA3CA.title: "&6&lBuild the Dimensional Mineshaft"
	quest.5DDA9A7C23487CEA.quest_desc: [
		"Stone, redstone and a circuit. The &6Basic Bin&r holds &e4,096&r of one kind; left click takes, right click puts in."
		""
		"Ideal as a buffer at the start of a line. The better bins hold 8,192, 32,768 and 262,144."
	]
	quest.5DDA9A7C23487CEA.quest_subtitle: "4,096 of one kind."
	quest.5DDA9A7C23487CEA.title: "&eSet down a bin"
	quest.5DE1E6545FBC512D.quest_desc: [
		"Hammer and the material into the crafting table, the hammer stays. &7Iron&r for boundaries, &5ender pearl&r for displacement, &bdiamond&r for projection, &aemerald&r for exchange, &6gold&r for mysticism, &fquartz&r for familiars, &2eye of ender&r for Mystic Eyes."
	]
	quest.5DE1E6545FBC512D.quest_subtitle: "Every school of magic has its powder."
	quest.5DE1E6545FBC512D.title: "&eCrush the Seven Powders"
	quest.5DF59C92B3D28C4C.quest_desc: [
		"8 &6Fae Essence&r around a &6Powdered Emerald&r. Like the Magitech circuit it holds &d100,000 mana&r."
		""
		"A circuit clicked with Fae Essence may be used by everyone. That way several mages fill one shared storage."
	]
	quest.5DF59C92B3D28C4C.quest_subtitle: "The same storage, made from essence."
	quest.5DF59C92B3D28C4C.title: "&2Build a Fae Mana Circuit"
	quest.5DF702AB09013EB4.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Honigeimer&r oben, ein &6Ofen&r in der Mitte, sieben Eisenbarren. Honig kommt per Rohr, Flasche, Eimer oder Honigblock hinein."
		""
		"&eProductive Bees, Honiggenerator:&r Brennstoff Honig, &d2 mB pro Tick&r für &d60 FE/t&r, ein Eimer ist 30 000 FE. Ein paar Bienenstöcke mit Zentrifuge davor, und die Zuchtkammer (50 FE/t) versorgt sich selbst. Offen ab Stufe 2, siehe Kapitel &6Productive Bees&r."
	]
	quest.5DF702AB09013EB4.quest_subtitle: "Productive Bees, Honiggenerator, 60 FE/t aus 2 mB Honig pro Tick."
	quest.5DF702AB09013EB4.title: "&6Verbrenne Honig"
	quest.5DFC4452A45FBEC6.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Steel Casing&r in the middle, 2 &6antimatter pellets&r left and right, 2 &6Ultimate Control Circuits&r at the top and bottom, 4 &6Atomic Alloys&r in the corners."
		""
		"It transforms things with a few mB of antimatter: coal into diamond (4 mB), egg into dragon egg, plus iron, lapis, redstone, quartz, glowstone, emerald, echo shards, heart of the sea. The two pellets are missing from the obelisk."
	]
	quest.5DFC4452A45FBEC6.quest_subtitle: "Coal into diamond, egg into dragon egg."
	quest.5DFC4452A45FBEC6.title: "&dBuild an Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer"
	quest.5E17FDE633086052.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nether_welcome.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Go through the &6portal at spawn&r. It was lit on stream with the event for &estage 2&r, and since then the Nether is open to everyone."
		""
		"Almost every machine of this stage needs something from here: &6blaze rods&r for the Blaze Burner, &6Nether quartz&r for electron tubes, &6glowstone&r for the Aether portal, &6magma&r and Nether bricks for the blast furnace."
		""
		"&cRead the next quest before you go through.&r Whoever falls into a lava lake loses everything they carry."
	]
	quest.5E17FDE633086052.quest_subtitle: "Since the event, the portal at spawn is open to everyone."
	quest.5E17FDE633086052.title: "&c&lEnter the Nether"
	quest.5E29B2C89BF426FE.quest_desc: [
		"Let the extractors run until &e1,000 mB of latex&r has come together and fill it into a bucket. Each extractor has a tank for 1,000 mB."
		""
		"You need latex for rubber, for the Simple Frame, for laser lenses and for all addons. A ring of four to eight extractors around a column of logs is a good start."
	]
	quest.5E29B2C89BF426FE.quest_subtitle: "The raw material for rubber."
	quest.5E29B2C89BF426FE.title: "&6Fill a Bucket of Latex"
	quest.5E337253E9C1DBD3.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Blue Ice&r give one &6Dry Ice&r for &e10,000 FE&r. It also lies as a vein in stone below &eY 64&r, mine it with Silk Touch."
		""
		"In the reactor Dry Ice cools with -32 degrees and 712 units. For comparison: Blue Ice -17 degrees and 568, normal ice -5 degrees and 48."
	]
	quest.5E337253E9C1DBD3.quest_subtitle: "The best coolant for the reactor."
	quest.5E337253E9C1DBD3.title: "&bMake Dry Ice"
	quest.5E46EC82DABC88F4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rohes Uran&r aus der Tiefe durch die Straße, wie jedes Metall. Für den Haken acht &6Uranbarren&r."
		""
		"&eWozu:&r In der Energizing Orb von &bPowah&r wird ein Uranbarren für 30 000 FE zu Uraninit, dem Brennstoff des Powah-Reaktors (Stufe 3). In Stufe 5 macht die Anreicherungskammer aus einem Barren zwei Gelbkuchen, der Anfang des Spaltbrennstoffs."
		""
		"Barren strahlen nicht. Lager sie in einer Kiste, bis du sie brauchst."
	]
	quest.5E46EC82DABC88F4.quest_subtitle: "Heute nutzlos, in Stufe 3 und 5 gesucht."
	quest.5E46EC82DABC88F4.title: "&aLeg Uran auf Vorrat"
	quest.5E480223E2B11D6B.quest_desc: [
		"Zwei &6Rahmenblöcke&r übereinander ergeben vier &6Ecksäulen&r. Eine Ecksäule allein in die Werkbank wird zur &6Rahmensäule&r, die in der Mitte des Blocks steht. Sockel und halbe Säulen kommen aus der Säge."
		""
		"Getarnt mit Quarz, Steinziegeln oder poliertem Andesit werden daraus Säulengänge, Zaunpfosten oder schlanke Stützen unter einem Vordach."
	]
	quest.5E480223E2B11D6B.quest_subtitle: "Eckpfeiler, Säulen und Sockel."
	quest.5E480223E2B11D6B.title: "&6Stell Säulen auf"
	quest.5E4C8AF28C5D23DA.quest_desc: [
		"Helmet, chestplate, leggings and boots of &6Refined Obsidian Ingots&r, laid out like any armour. For the set you need &e24 ingots&r."
		""
		"&eValues from the config:&r &d31&r armour in total, &d5&r toughness per piece and 20 percent knockback resistance per piece. Netherite has 20 armour and 3 toughness."
		""
		"Until the MekaSuit in stage 4 this is Mekanism's strongest armour."
	]
	quest.5E4C8AF28C5D23DA.quest_subtitle: "More armour than netherite."
	quest.5E4C8AF28C5D23DA.title: "&5Put on Refined Obsidian"
	quest.5E515F5CD5128504.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hexerei_candles.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Tallow in the cauldron, dipper on it, &e3 strings&r on the dipper. Each string becomes a &6candle&r with &e50 mB&r of tallow. With an empty hand you take it off."
		""
		"Up to &e4 candles&r fit in one block, lit they burn for about &e35 minutes&r. With planks, selenite or a redstone block in the crafting grid they get a base."
	]
	quest.5E515F5CD5128504.quest_subtitle: "Light and magic in one."
	quest.5E515F5CD5128504.title: "&6Dip eight candles"
	quest.5E51D73471E48A4A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iodine tablets&r (dried kelp, glowstone, sugar) take 0.5 Sv off your dose. &6RadAway&r (glass bottle, ghast tear, redstone, glowstone) takes 1 Sv and protects for five minutes."
	]
	quest.5E51D73471E48A4A.quest_subtitle: "Against the dose you already have."
	quest.5E51D73471E48A4A.title: "&eKeep Medicine Ready"
	quest.5E5FC305B736FA54.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wild onions&r, &6wild carrots&r and &6wild potatoes&r grow in temperate biomes. You plant onions straight back in."
		""
		"Onions go into fried rice, burgers, stews and almost every big meal."
	]
	quest.5E5FC305B736FA54.quest_subtitle: "In temperate areas."
	quest.5E5FC305B736FA54.title: "&aDig up wild onions"
	quest.5E6450139C0A40F4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/start_here_s_locked.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"An item of a later stage is called &7???&r in its tooltip, with &cOpens in stage 2 (Brass Works).&r and &8You can carry it, not use it yet.&r below. You may pick it up and store it, but not hold, wear, place or craft it."
		""
		"In EMI you only see the &enext&r stage, veiled but with its recipe. Later stages stay completely hidden. So you can already stock up on zinc for brass."
		""
		"More in the chapter &6Tips and Tricks&r."
	]
	quest.5E6450139C0A40F4.quest_subtitle: "You can carry them, not use them yet."
	quest.5E6450139C0A40F4.title: "&cRecognize locked items"
	quest.5E64C941274D471A.quest_desc: [
		"Top Atomic Alloy, &6Teleportation Core&r, Atomic Alloy, middle Atomic Alloy, Module Base, Atomic Alloy, bottom three &5antimatter pellets&r."
		""
		"In the Meka-Tool a right click takes you to the block you are looking at, per the config up to &e100 blocks&r away. Across the factory hall, over ravines, onto roofs."
	]
	quest.5E64C941274D471A.quest_subtitle: "The Teleportation Unit."
	quest.5E64C941274D471A.title: "&5Jump with the Meka-Tool"
	quest.5E66A70264E14A40.quest_desc: [
		"&6Speed Upgrade:&r four lapis dust and four redstone dust around a &6heavy weighted pressure plate&r. &6Energy Upgrade:&r four obsidian dust and four quartz dust around a &6light weighted pressure plate&r. The Manufactory grinds the dusts."
		""
		"Most machines have two upgrade slots on the side: the first takes Energy Upgrades, the second Speed Upgrades, up to 64 per slot. Each Speed Upgrade makes the machine faster, but power use grows with the square."
		""
		"Energy Upgrades take that extra use off again and enlarge the buffer. Mix both instead of going only for speed."
	]
	quest.5E66A70264E14A40.quest_subtitle: "Faster, or more efficient, or both."
	quest.5E66A70264E14A40.title: "&9Upgrade Machines"
	quest.5E68E2BEB095CBFA.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Transmitter&r (three Copper Sheets, a lightning rod, redstone) on a &6vault&r makes a &6Stock Link&r. Put it on a packager: the storage behind it belongs to the &estock network&r."
		""
		"You tune further links by clicking an old one with them before placing. All of this already works in stage 1, without any power."
	]
	quest.5E68E2BEB095CBFA.quest_subtitle: "A Stock Link on the packager."
	quest.5E68E2BEB095CBFA.title: "&6Connect a stock network"
	quest.5E6FF7DF9793C34E.quest_desc: [
		"&eÜberspannungsmodus&r (Power Surge) setzt die Priorität des Geräts auf &d100.000&r, über alles, was du von Hand einstellen kannst. Gedacht für den einen Verbraucher, der nie ausgehen darf: der Controller fürs Laden, die Pumpe am Reaktor."
		""
		"Mehrere Geräte mit Überspannung teilen sich dann gleichberechtigt. Mehr als ein oder zwei solltest du nicht haben, sonst ist der Modus wertlos."
	]
	quest.5E6FF7DF9793C34E.quest_subtitle: "Dieser Punkt kommt vor allen anderen."
	quest.5E6FF7DF9793C34E.title: "&cSchalte Überspannung ein"
	quest.5E7928B88E31DFCB.quest_desc: [
		"Prismarine bricks, &6Infused Seashelf&r, prismarine bricks on top, three prismarine brick slabs in the middle, the same as the top at the bottom: the &6Seashelf of Aquatic Filtration&r."
		""
		"Put enchanted books into it. What is in them no longer shows up at the table. The more books are inside, the more Eterna and Arcana the shelf itself gives."
	]
	quest.5E7928B88E31DFCB.quest_subtitle: "What you do not want stays out."
	quest.5E7928B88E31DFCB.title: "&3Filter Out Enchantments"
	quest.5E7A3C423AC985EB.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a pair of &6shears&r between two &6smooth stone&r, below planks with a &6Gem Dust&r in the middle, one more plank each bottom left and right."
		""
		"To cut, put the gem in the middle, a &esecond gem of the same purity&r with it, Gem Dust on the left and material on the right. &7Cracked&r to Chipped costs 1 Gem Dust and 3 Scrap Metal or 1 Timeworn Fabric. Chipped to Flawed costs 3 Gem Dust and 9 Scrap Metal, 3 Fabric or 1 Crystal Shard."
		""
		"Flawed to Normal already costs 5 Gem Dust and 27 Scrap Metal, 9 Fabric, 3 Shards or 1 Arcane Sands. Above that you need materials from stage 3 and 4. EMI shows every step."
	]
	quest.5E7A3C423AC985EB.quest_subtitle: "Two gems become one, but a better one."
	quest.5E7A3C423AC985EB.title: "&dBuild a Gem Cutting Table"
	quest.5E7AD20C9249F102.quest_desc: [
		"Find a &9Rare&r item you do not need and salvage it in the &6Salvaging Table&r into a &6Luminous Crystal Shard&r. Or forge yourself one: 15 levels, two shards, two sigils, but then you already have the shards."
		""
		"With that you have seen everything Apotheosis has to offer in stage 1: Frontier active, a set with affixes, gems in the sockets, an enchanting table at 45 and a spawner to your taste."
		""
		"&eOutlook:&r With the Nether in stage 2 come Hellshelves, the Sigil of Withdrawal, the Gem Case and with the Wither the Summit world tier. &5Epic&r is meant for stage 3, &6Mythic&r and Pinnacle for stage 4, after the dragon."
	]
	quest.5E7AD20C9249F102.quest_subtitle: "The end of stage 1 for Apotheosis."
	quest.5E7AD20C9249F102.title: "&9&lSalvage a Rare Item"
	quest.5E835E59CCD257CB.quest_desc: [
		"Every spell belongs to a &dschool&r. The school decides the focus in the Scroll Forge, the rune for the armor and which spell power makes it stronger."
		""
		"&cFire&r: damage and burning. &bIce&r: damage and control. &eLightning&r: concentrated damage. &fHoly&r: healing and buffing. &5Ender&r: the arcane, from damage to movement. &4Blood&r: damage that heals you. &aEvocation&r: illager tricks and summoning. &2Nature&r: poison and weakening. &8Eldritch&r: forgotten magic, only in stage 4."
		""
		"The eight quests on the right are a checklist: one per school, with all spells you can forge with Common Ink, and what comes in later stages. Tick off what you have cast."
	]
	quest.5E835E59CCD257CB.quest_subtitle: "Nine schools, eight of them now."
	quest.5E835E59CCD257CB.title: "&d&lGet to Know the Schools"
	quest.5E9DE4DC5D916B35.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_destroyer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Machine Frame:&r four iron bars around two nickel, gives sixteen. Use it to lay out an &eempty rectangle&r up to &e64 blocks&r per side. &6Destroyer Block&r: Motor, laser, Motor at the top, Motor, Pulverizer, Motor, three plating at the bottom."
		""
		"Place the Destroyer against the frame, a corner works too. Its arm mines the layer &ebelow&r the frame. The &6Placer Block&r and &6Fertilizer Block&r work on the same frame too."
		""
		"With a Crop Filter it becomes a farm, with a Quarry Addon a quarry. Both are further down with the addons."
	]
	quest.5E9DE4DC5D916B35.quest_subtitle: "An arm travels across the area."
	quest.5E9DE4DC5D916B35.title: "&7Span a Frame with a Destroyer"
	quest.5EABB3E140D80052.quest_desc: [
		"&6Endermen&r give three, endermites one, a &6ravager&r four."
		""
		"The rarest kind. For totem bases and the Rite of Quickening."
	]
	quest.5EABB3E140D80052.quest_subtitle: "Eerie arcana."
	quest.5EABB3E140D80052.title: "&5Eldritch"
	quest.5EAF208AFFB20737.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_latex_unit.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Plastic, &6wooden chest&r, plastic at the top, &6Fluid Tank&r from Create, Pity Frame, tank in the middle, &6gold ingot&r, &6Diamond Gear&r, gold ingot at the bottom."
		""
		"The mod's assembly table: up to &eeight items&r and &eone fluid&r, shapeless. Frames, lenses, addons and Pink Slime Ingots are made here. It draws &d90 FE/t&r."
	]
	quest.5EAF208AFFB20737.quest_subtitle: "Up to eight ingredients and a fluid."
	quest.5EAF208AFFB20737.title: "&9Build a Dissolution Chamber"
	quest.5EB482ABC77C8101.quest_desc: [
		"Coal, a stick and &6soul sand&r make &6soul torches&r. Eight iron nuggets around a torch make a &6soul lantern&r."
		""
		"Piglins avoid soul fire, soul torches, soul lanterns and soul campfires. Hoglins avoid warped fungi. Put both at your Nether portal and around your outpost, and it stays quieter."
	]
	quest.5EB482ABC77C8101.quest_subtitle: "They avoid whatever burns blue."
	quest.5EB482ABC77C8101.title: "&3Keep piglins away with soul fire"
	quest.5EBFD92A76955173.quest_desc: [
		"Like the Speed Upgrade, with &6gold dust&r in the middle. Eight lower the consumption to a tenth and enlarge the buffer."
	]
	quest.5EBFD92A76955173.quest_subtitle: "Less power per tick."
	quest.5EBFD92A76955173.title: "&aBuild an Energy Upgrade"
	quest.5EC64D932C53D550.quest_desc: [
		"At &e98 percent&r the obelisk accepts nothing more. Then the team sets the date for the finale, it is posted first on &9Discord&r."
		""
		"On the evening of the finale all streamers go live together, the last items go into the obelisk together, and then it is off to the Chaos Island."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Until then you have time to gear up. The next quests tell you with what."
	]
	quest.5EC64D932C53D550.quest_subtitle: "At 98 percent it stops until everyone is there."
	quest.5EC64D932C53D550.title: "&cWait for the Date"
	quest.5ED5C6D65955A672.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6Blank Module&r, a &6Breaker Module&r and a &6Placer Module&r, shapeless. The breaker's pickaxe carries over to the extruder, so build it with diamond for obsidian."
		""
		"With a redstone signal the &6Extruder Module Mk1&r pushes a row of blocks from the buffer out in the module's direction, without a signal it pulls them back. Up to &e16 blocks&r, with Range Augments up to 32. Bridges, gates and secret doors."
		""
		"The &6Extruder Module Mk2&r (Blank Module and chest) places blocks from a template in the module instead of from the buffer. These blocks are only scenery and drop nothing when mined. It reaches 32 blocks, with augments 64. The &6Sync Upgrade&r keeps several routers for a wide gate in step."
	]
	quest.5ED5C6D65955A672.quest_subtitle: "The Extruder Module."
	quest.5ED5C6D65955A672.title: "&7Build a Drawbridge"
	quest.5EF139C16005FBBE.quest_desc: [
		"Remnant, Maledictus, Leviathan, Harbinger und Scylla liegen hinter dir. Der Rest von Cataclysm wartet in anderen Welten: &cIgnis&r in der Burning Arena und die &cNetherite Monstrosity&r in der Soul Black Smith im Nether (Stufe 2), der &cEnder Guardian&r in der Ruined Citadel im End (Stufe 4)."
		""
		"Ignis lässt &6Ignitium&r fallen, drei Barren pro Kampf, für die Ignitium-Rüstung und den Incinerator. Die Monstrosity gibt die &6Höllenschmiede&r, eine Spitzhacke, die mit Rechtsklick den Boden sprengt. Wer alle acht besiegt, ist der Cataclysmfarer."
		""
		"Jeder Wiederbeleber ruft seinen Boss beliebig oft zurück, mit dem passenden Auge. So kommt ihr zu mehr Witherit und Sturmessenz für die ganze Gruppe."
	]
	quest.5EF139C16005FBBE.quest_subtitle: "Alle Bosse der Oberwelt sind gefallen."
	quest.5EF139C16005FBBE.title: "&c&lFünf Bosse, fünf Siege"
	quest.5EFF84C54AFE6D05.quest_desc: [
		"An &6iron ingot&r on the altar, &e4 Refined Soulstone&r on the stands, plus &e3 Wicked&r, &e1 Earthen&r and &e1 Arcane&r."
		""
		"Everything made of Soulstained Steel hits the soul as well: tools, weapons, the better scythe."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Here Ender IO's &6Soul Binder&r needs &e4 Soulstained Steel&r instead of Soularium. Ender IO's soul side comes from Malum."
	]
	quest.5EFF84C54AFE6D05.quest_subtitle: "A metal in two worlds."
	quest.5EFF84C54AFE6D05.title: "&5&lForge Soulstained Steel"
	quest.5F10428E7D8BBB53.quest_desc: [
		"Ein abgebautes Flux-Gerät behält Netz, Namen, Priorität und Limit, ein Speicher auch seinen Strom. Setz es woanders hin, und es ist sofort wieder verbunden."
		""
		"Willst du ein Gerät verschenken oder neu einrichten, leg es allein in die Werkbank: Das Rezept setzt die Einstellungen zurück. Oder kopier mit dem Konfigurator die Einstellungen eines fertigen Punkts (Schleichen und Rechtsklick) und füg sie auf jeden neuen Punkt (Rechtsklick), dann sparst du dir das Verbinden."
	]
	quest.5F10428E7D8BBB53.quest_subtitle: "Einstellungen bleiben am Gerät."
	quest.5F10428E7D8BBB53.title: "&7Setz Geräte um"
	quest.5F2B9B0085B033A8.quest_desc: [
		"Kupplung, &6Induktionsrotor&r und &6Kollektor&r auf eine Welle, Wicklungen aus Kupferspulen daneben, einen kleinen Erregerstrom hinein. Die Ponder-Szenen (W) zeigen jeden Schritt."
		""
		"&ePower Grid, Generator:&r Brennstoff Rotation. Er rechnet nicht in FE, sondern in &dVolt und Ampere&r, Leistung = Spannung mal Strom, lange Drähte verlieren. Über den &6Adapter&r (Zinkblech, Kupferbleche, Legierung) versorgt er FE-Maschinen, und das &6Solarmodul&r von Power Grid liefert tagsüber Spannung ohne Welle. Offen ab Stufe 2, siehe Kapitel &6Create: Messing&r."
	]
	quest.5F2B9B0085B033A8.quest_subtitle: "Power Grid, Volt und Ampere, per Adapter auch FE."
	quest.5F2B9B0085B033A8.title: "&6Wickle einen Power-Grid-Generator"
	quest.5F349A5EDC7882FF.quest_desc: [
		"&aFlourishing log&r, &6golden apple&r, &5Abjuration Essence&r."
		""
		"Heals creatures nearby bit by bit and harms undead. &6Zombie villagers&r are cured right away and give you a discount if you were there."
	]
	quest.5F349A5EDC7882FF.quest_subtitle: "Healing for everyone nearby."
	quest.5F349A5EDC7882FF.title: "&aMake the Restoration tablet"
	quest.5F3895B47878B595.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nether_debris.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Dig long tunnels at &eY 15&r and mine &e4 ancient debris&r. It doesn't glow, is blast proof and floats on lava as an item."
		""
		"It goes faster with TNT: netherrack flies away, the debris stays. Keep your distance and secure against lava."
		""
		"In the furnace each block becomes a &6netherite scrap&r."
	]
	quest.5F3895B47878B595.quest_subtitle: "Deep down, fireproof, worth every effort."
	quest.5F3895B47878B595.title: "&4&lDig up ancient debris"
	quest.5F3FA1E5797417C2.quest_desc: [
		"Für jeden Bosskampf: ein &6Schild&r, mindestens &62 Goldäpfel&r, ein Stapel Essen, Pfeile und eine &6Rückkehr-Schriftrolle&r von Waystones. Ein Wegpunkt am Eingang des Bauwerks spart den langen Rückweg."
		""
		"&eRüstung:&r Diamant mit Schutz IV ist für Pyramide und Gefängnis genug. Apotheosis gibt dir bis Stufe 1 seltene Affixe auf Waffen und Rüstung, die Zahlen im Tooltip lohnen einen Blick."
		""
		"&eZu mehreren:&r Einer hält mit dem Schild den Blick des Bosses, die anderen schlagen von der Seite. Wer heilt, steht hinten. Ein Ars-Zauber &eProjektil, Heilen&r heilt aus der Ferne."
	]
	quest.5F3FA1E5797417C2.quest_subtitle: "Schild, Goldäpfel und ein Weg zurück."
	quest.5F3FA1E5797417C2.title: "&ePack die Bosskiste"
	quest.5F44F4D8DEF195D0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/draconic_stabilizer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Deactivate the core, raise it one tier with &eTier Up&r in its window, turn on &eToggle Build Guide&r and place the blocks: &626 Draconium Blocks&r as a full cube around the core."
		""
		"&eStorage:&r &e1,640,000,000&r energy."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Blocks in the core do not count for the obelisk. Plan together how much draconium goes into cores."
	]
	quest.5F44F4D8DEF195D0.quest_subtitle: "26 blocks, 1.64 billion."
	quest.5F44F4D8DEF195D0.title: "&cCore Tier 3"
	quest.5F452D140A574530.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Andesite Alloys&r around an &6iron ingot&r with an &6Andesite Casing&r below make the &6Mechanical Drill&r. It breaks the block in front of its tip as long as it turns."
		""
		"Placed in one spot it is the heart of a cobblestone generator. On a piston, bearing or gantry it becomes a tunnel borer."
	]
	quest.5F452D140A574530.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Drill."
	quest.5F452D140A574530.title: "&6Drill through stone"
	quest.5F58611AAEBAD0CD.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_manasteel_prep.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &e4 Infused Iron&r, &e2 Livingwood Twigs&r, &e1 Mana Diamond&r, &e1 Gold Leaf&r on Wooden Stands around an &6oak sapling&r. Let it grow, then &e4 Manasteel ingots&r lie in the middle."
		""
		"The Nature's Aura book shows the pattern of &6Gold Powder&r (one Gold Leaf gives two) as a preview. A &6Wooden Stand&r is a Gold Leaf on a log."
		""
		"&cCommon mistakes:&r a sapling other than oak, a missing ingredient, a gap in the pattern. Then only a tree grows."
	]
	quest.5F58611AAEBAD0CD.quest_subtitle: "The first Manasteel grows on a tree."
	quest.5F58611AAEBAD0CD.title: "&aPerform the Ritual of the Forest"
	quest.5F7DAA47C968585F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_trains_conductor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put a mob on the seat in front of the Train Controls, or place a &6Blaze Burner&r in the same spot. Right click it with the schedule: it takes over."
		""
		"The blaze is the most popular conductor, it needs nothing and does not run away. A mob on a lead you put on the seat with a click."
	]
	quest.5F7DAA47C968585F.quest_subtitle: "Somebody has to drive."
	quest.5F7DAA47C968585F.title: "&6Put a conductor in"
	quest.5F8BEA7E17FDA34F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_bottling.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e3 conveyor belts, 2 fluid pumps, 2 Iron Sheetmetal, 2 Light Engineering Blocks, 1 Redstone Engineering Block, 3 Steel Scaffolding&r. Hammer on the middle belt, the direction matters. Mirroring works."
		""
		"&eIn:&r item on the belt, fluid into the tank (8 buckets). &eOut:&r filled at the end of the belt. It fills buckets, bottles and jerrycans and casts resin and graphite into press molds."
	]
	quest.5F8BEA7E17FDA34F.quest_subtitle: "3x3x2, mold and fluid in, part out."
	quest.5F8BEA7E17FDA34F.title: "&bForm a Bottling Machine"
	quest.5F968E63BD4F3887.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Enchantment Mover&r (anvils, obsidian, iron, gold, diamond, a Marker) transfers enchantments from a &6diamond pickaxe&r onto the machine."
		""
		"&6Efficiency&r makes it faster, &6Unbreaking&r saves power, &6Fortune&r and &6Silk Touch&r work as on the pickaxe. Enchant a pickaxe as high as you can and move them over one after another."
	]
	quest.5F968E63BD4F3887.quest_subtitle: "Hence the name."
	quest.5F968E63BD4F3887.title: "&dEnchant the Quarry"
	quest.5F9D6DC01EEFF26F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Marker Plus:&r glowstone and lapis around a redstone torch. Put one at each corner of the area and click them until they connect. The chat says whether it worked."
		""
		"&6Quarry Plus&r works like the old BuildCraft quarries: a frame around the area, then layer by layer downward."
	]
	quest.5F9D6DC01EEFF26F.quest_subtitle: "A rectangle on the ground."
	quest.5F9D6DC01EEFF26F.title: "&9Stake Out an Area with Markers"
	quest.5FA01AB2967C4DB5.quest_desc: [
		"With over 200 mods it happens that two recipes have exactly the same ingredients. Then &6Polymorph&r shows small buttons with every possible result above the result slot."
		""
		"Click the one you want. If the crafting table gives you something other than expected, look there first."
	]
	quest.5FA01AB2967C4DB5.quest_subtitle: "Two recipes, same ingredients."
	quest.5FA01AB2967C4DB5.title: "&6Pick the right result"
	quest.5FA55EFFFE67255C.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6Obsidiansteel Ingots&r around a &6skeleton skull&r give the &6Obsidian Skull&r. Worn as a helmet, it gives permanent &eFire Resistance&r."
		""
		"But: as long as you are &cburning&r, it gets a crack every 8 to 13 seconds: Obsidian Skull, Cracked, Fragmented, Fading, and then a bare skeleton skull remains. Two Obsidiansteel in the crafting table repair each stage by one."
		""
		"For lava lakes in the Nether it is a life ring, nothing more. Whoever wants permanent fire resistance needs the Eternal Obsidian Skull from the higher tiers."
	]
	quest.5FA55EFFFE67255C.quest_subtitle: "Fire resistance that cracks."
	quest.5FA55EFFFE67255C.title: "&8Put On the Obsidian Skull"
	quest.5FA7EB092C1DCFB2.quest_desc: [
		"One &6Source Gem&r top and bottom, one &6gold ingot&r left and right, a &6lava bucket&r in the middle."
		""
		"The link burns anything that burns and fills the nearest jar with it. &6Archwood logs&r give a bonus, &cBlazing archwood&r the biggest."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r It gets hot. Stone next to it turns into magma over time and then into lava."
	]
	quest.5FA7EB092C1DCFB2.quest_subtitle: "Wood in, Source out."
	quest.5FA7EB092C1DCFB2.title: "&aBuild a Volcanic Sourcelink"
	quest.5FB546D07CC0F1E0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_transport_create_tank.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Create&r, &6Flüssigkeitstank&r: &e8 Eimer pro Block&r, Grundfläche bis 3 x 3, bis &e32 Blöcke hoch&r, zusammen 2 304 Eimer. Rohre füllen und leeren ihn von jeder Seite, ein Komparator misst den Stand. Von Hand geht in Survival nichts hinein. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Zwei Kupferbleche um ein Holzfass. Schraubenschlüssel schaltet das Fenster."
		""
		"Becken, Flaschenabfüller und Ausguss füllen und leeren Eimer und Flaschen am Tank."
	]
	quest.5FB546D07CC0F1E0.quest_subtitle: "Create, Flüssigkeitstank: 8 Eimer pro Block, bis 2 304 Eimer am Stück."
	quest.5FB546D07CC0F1E0.title: "Bau einen Flüssigkeitstank"
	quest.5FB9B5C993CE8435.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pylons&r, &6Harvester Pylon&r: erntet und pflanzt im eingestellten Bereich alle &e3 Sekunden&r eine Pflanze neu und legt die Ernte in das Inventar direkt über sich. Braucht eine &6Hacke&r im Pylon, keinen Strom, keinen Filter. &eStufe 2&r, Quarz und Schwarzstein kommen aus dem Nether."
		""
		"Rezept in EMI. Den Arbeitsbereich stellst du im Fenster in Blöcken ein. Ohne Inventar darüber steht er still. In Stufe 1 übernimmt das der Trichter-Pflanztopf oder die Create-Erntemaschine."
		""
		"Die anderen drei Pylonen (Infusion, Interdiktion, Expulsion) haben mit Gegenständen nichts zu tun."
	]
	quest.5FB9B5C993CE8435.quest_subtitle: "Pylons, Harvester Pylon: erntet alle drei Sekunden in die Kiste über ihm. Stufe 2."
	quest.5FB9B5C993CE8435.title: "Merk dir den Ernte-Pylon"
	quest.5FB9FCCC02BA9AD6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hostile_networks_deep_learner.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r oben &6Obsidian&r, &6Redstone-Verstärker&r, Obsidian. Mitte Verstärker, &6Elektronenröhre&r von Create, Verstärker. Unten Obsidian, &6Redstone&r, Obsidian."
		""
		"&3Hostile Neural Networks&r baut Monsterdrops am Computer nach. Du tötest einen Mob ein paar Dutzend Mal, der &6Deep Learner&r lernt dabei, wie der Mob funktioniert, und später simuliert eine Maschine den Kampf und wirft die Drops aus. Ohne Spawner, ohne Dunkelheit, ohne Lag."
		""
		"&eDer Weg in drei Stufen:&r In &6Stufe 2&r sammelst du Daten, das ist langsam und Handarbeit. In &6Stufe 3&r simuliert die &6Simulationskammer&r mit Strom. In &6Stufe 4&r macht der &6Loot-Fabrikator&r aus den Simulationen echte Gegenstände, und das &6Rechenzentrum&r schafft tausende pro Minute."
		""
		"Der Deep Learner ist dein Lehrbuch. Er fasst &e4 Datenmodelle&r und muss beim Töten nur irgendwo im Inventar liegen, in der Zweithand oder im eigenen Curio-Slot."
	]
	quest.5FB9FCCC02BA9AD6.quest_subtitle: "Eine Mobfarm, die keine Mobs braucht."
	quest.5FB9FCCC02BA9AD6.title: "&3&lBau einen Deep Learner"
	quest.5FBC7EF7E8BCBEFA.quest_desc: [
		"On top Dark Power Gem, any &6head&r or skull, Dark Power Gem. Middle Spike, &6Empowered Inverted Potentia&r, Spike. At the bottom a Dark Stick."
		""
		"The staff calls a group of zombies that attack the creature you target for a while. Handy against groups and as a distraction in a boss fight."
	]
	quest.5FBC7EF7E8BCBEFA.quest_subtitle: "Zombies that fight for you."
	quest.5FBC7EF7E8BCBEFA.title: "&cBuild a Necromancer Staff"
	quest.5FC1B9DD27A90D2F.quest_desc: [
		"Shapeless: &6Pixie Dust&r, &6vines&r and &5Pure Ender Essence&r."
		""
		"Put the ivy together with an item into the crafting table. If you die, that item stays in your inventory, and the ivy is used up."
		""
		"Not for things that leave something behind when crafted, such as a water bucket. Worth it for the Terra Blade and Elementium armor."
	]
	quest.5FC1B9DD27A90D2F.quest_subtitle: "An item you keep when you die."
	quest.5FC1B9DD27A90D2F.title: "&5Attach Resolute Ivy"
	quest.5FC2F0F24AD1FA89.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 bone meal&r, &e4 Inferium Essence&r and &e1 diamond&r in the middle give &e4 Mystical Fertilizer&r. It makes any crop grow fully &einstantly&r, essence crops and saplings too."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/mystical_fertilizer.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Every essence crop except Inferium has a &e10 percent&r chance to drop a &6Fertilized Essence&r when harvested. It works like bone meal, but on essence crops too, and with 4 Fertilized Essence instead of bone meal the recipe gives &e8 fertilizer&r instead of 4."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Fertilizer is meant for starting a new kind, not for running the farm. For the field you use Growth Accelerators and the Watering Can."
	]
	quest.5FC2F0F24AD1FA89.quest_subtitle: "The replacement for bone meal."
	quest.5FC2F0F24AD1FA89.title: "&eMake Mystical Fertilizer"
	quest.5FC39F15F47658CE.quest_desc: [
		"The Unprocessed Obsidian Sheet has to go under the &6press&r twice. Two presses in a row above the belt are the easiest. After that you have a &6Sturdy Sheet&r."
		"{image:create:textures/item/sturdy_sheet.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Sturdy Sheets are in every Railway Casing and in the schedules."
	]
	quest.5FC39F15F47658CE.quest_subtitle: "The Sturdy Sheet."
	quest.5FC39F15F47658CE.title: "&6Press it twice"
	quest.5FC5916989C6F7C3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gloomgourds&r lie purple in the grass. One gourd at the crafting table gives &64 Gloomgourd Seeds&r. Plant them like pumpkin seeds."
		""
		"The gourd also becomes pies and the &6Carved Gloomgourd&r. You need that later for the Forgotten Minion."
	]
	quest.5FC5916989C6F7C3.quest_subtitle: "A field that keeps you fed."
	quest.5FC5916989C6F7C3.title: "&5Plant Gloomgourds"
	quest.5FC8136D1033C0E8.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6Magic Lamp&r (5 silver around a Spirit Attuned Gem), an &6Iesnium Pickaxe&r, an &6iron ingot&r, &6gravel&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book."
		""
		"The Foliot digs aimlessly and brings everything it finds. It is slow but spares the lamp. Without a Mineshaft it does nothing, so carry straight on."
	]
	quest.5FC8136D1033C0E8.quest_subtitle: "A spirit in the magic lamp."
	quest.5FC8136D1033C0E8.title: "&6Bind a Foliot Miner"
	quest.5FD444BBA48FD630.quest_desc: [
		"Creepers and ghasts drop a &6Catalyzing Gland&r. It goes into the Altar of Light, the Fertile Essence and the Holy Hand Grenade."
	]
	quest.5FD444BBA48FD630.quest_subtitle: "From the creeper or ghast."
	quest.5FD444BBA48FD630.title: "&aCatalyzing Gland"
	quest.5FD9A1897C1CA6E1.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Spikes&r on top, a &6glass&r in the middle, a &6Dark Gem&r at the bottom give the &6Blood Extractor&r. Spikes are a Dark Gem above an iron ingot, which gives 16 at once."
		""
		"The extractor holds &e5,000 mB&r and fills by itself as long as it is in your inventory and you kill monsters: 5 to 40 mB per health point (half a heart), so a zombie with 20 health points brings 100 to 800 mB. If something dies from a fall, a &4Blood Stain&r remains on the ground, which you suck up with shift right click."
		""
		"Right click places a bucket of blood in the world. Several extractors, or extractor and Dark Tank, together in the crafting table give a bigger extractor."
	]
	quest.5FD9A1897C1CA6E1.quest_subtitle: "Collect blood, place blood."
	quest.5FD9A1897C1CA6E1.title: "&4Build a Blood Extractor"
	quest.5FE4DCEFCB5A479E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron sword&r on the brazier. On the Stone Hands: &6Shadow Gem&r, &e2 Soul Shards&r, &e2 Nether wart&r, &6ghast tear&r. Into a &6Necrotic Focus&r: a &6potion of harming&r."
		""
		"The ritual also demands &d10 hearts&r of life nearby: place a few animals next to it, they are used up."
		""
		"The sword deals extra wither damage, and that damage heals you. The iron sword's enchantments are kept."
	]
	quest.5FE4DCEFCB5A479E.quest_subtitle: "A sword that steals life."
	quest.5FE4DCEFCB5A479E.title: "&cConsecrate a Sword of Sapping"
	quest.5FF6E9B7E297083E.quest_desc: [
		"Stone at the daisy becomes &6Livingrock&r. You need &e5&r for every Mana Pool, &e4&r for the Runic Altar in stage 2, &e8&r for every Mana Tablet."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Several daisies next to each other, each with its own ring of eight stones, multiply the yield."
	]
	quest.5FF6E9B7E297083E.quest_subtitle: "The stone for pools and altars."
	quest.5FF6E9B7E297083E.title: "&6Collect Livingrock"
	quest.5FFE1D2FC9FFF4EE.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6books&r, an &6ender pearl&r and a &6Marker&r, shapeless. Right click opens its list. Whatever is on it, the quarry throws away at once."
		""
		"Cobblestone, dirt, gravel and deepslate belong on it, otherwise every chest is full in minutes."
	]
	quest.5FFE1D2FC9FFF4EE.quest_subtitle: "What it throws away at once."
	quest.5FFE1D2FC9FFF4EE.title: "&7Build a Void Module"
	quest.6019E024D0CFA393.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_echo_shard.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Eine &6Echoscherbe&r in die Mitte, &e4 Wärterpanzer&r an die Seiten, &e4 Phantomhäute&r in die Ecken: eine &6Verstärkte Echoscherbe&r. Ein Wärter gibt also höchstens für eine Scherbe her."
		""
		"&eWofür:&r In Stufe 4 ist sie der Zusatz, der am Schmiedetisch aus Netherit die Wärterrüstung macht. Jetzt schon nützlich: Ein &6Kompass&r mit 4 Wärterpanzern wird zum &6Antiken Kompass&r, der zur nächsten Antiken Stadt zeigt."
	]
	quest.6019E024D0CFA393.quest_subtitle: "Panzer und Phantomhaut um eine Scherbe."
	quest.6019E024D0CFA393.title: "&bVerstärke eine Echoscherbe"
	quest.601ADF29871509C8.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r Three copper ingots and a Nether quartz in the 2x2 grid make four &6Quartz Enriched Copper&r. Three of those at the top and three at the bottom, glass, &6redstone&r, glass in the middle: twelve &6Cables&r."
		""
		"Cables connect all RS blocks and need no power. There are &eno channels&r: a single cable carries a hundred disk drives if the Controller has enough power."
		""
		"&eColors:&r With dye at the crafting table you color cables and devices. Colored cables only connect to the same color or to gray ones. That way two networks run right next to each other."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Full blocks like the Disk Drive or Grid also connect directly to each other, with no cable in between."
	]
	quest.601ADF29871509C8.quest_subtitle: "Twelve at once, no channels."
	quest.601ADF29871509C8.title: "&bRun Cables"
	quest.602DBF2732E13CC9.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6sawdust&r from the Precision Sawmill in a square make a &6Cardboard Box&r."
		""
		"&eSneaking and right clicking&r a block packs it up with its contents: a full chest, a machine in the middle of its work. Set the box down somewhere else, and the block stands there again with everything that was inside."
		""
		"Beds, doors, trial spawners and vaults can't be packed."
	]
	quest.602DBF2732E13CC9.quest_subtitle: "Move without emptying."
	quest.602DBF2732E13CC9.title: "&eFold a Cardboard Box"
	quest.6040DCEC91532345.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Kompass&r in der Mitte, 4 Holzstämme an den Seiten, 4 Setzlinge in den Ecken. Rechtsklick öffnet die Liste aller Biome, wähl eines, und der Kompass zeigt Richtung und Entfernung."
		""
		"&eWofür:&r den &dArchwood-Wald&r für Ars Nouveau, Wüsten und warme Meere für die Bosse von Cataclysm, kalte Biome für die Portalruinen von Eternal Starlight."
	]
	quest.6040DCEC91532345.quest_subtitle: "Der Kompass der Natur zeigt den Weg."
	quest.6040DCEC91532345.title: "&aFinde ein Biom"
	quest.6042060596DA4E6A.quest_desc: [
		"Let a tree grow next to a wild &dWhirlisprig&r and it gives shards. In the apparatus with a Source Gem, Magebloom seeds, Magebloom, diamond, oak, spruce and birch saplings and wheat seeds it becomes the charm."
		""
		"Charm on a flower, chest right next to it, Source nearby. It produces wood, crops, seeds and flowers from everything growing within &e10 blocks&r. Variety makes it happy."
	]
	quest.6042060596DA4E6A.quest_subtitle: "A nature spirit as gardener."
	quest.6042060596DA4E6A.title: "&6Summon a Whirlisprig"
	quest.60511EA1602C8C5C.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6wheat&r and an &6egg&r, shapeless: &ethree wheat dough&r. Wheat and a water bucket work too."
		""
		"At the cutting board the knife cuts it into &6raw pasta&r. Pasta dishes are in the &6Cooking&r chapter."
	]
	quest.60511EA1602C8C5C.quest_subtitle: "The start of every noodle."
	quest.60511EA1602C8C5C.title: "&7Knead wheat dough"
	quest.60564CC10A27AA74.quest_desc: [
		"Mit &eStufe 4&r kommt die Rüstung aus dem Wärter: Mit der &6Wärter-Schmiedevorlage&r aus der Antiken Stadt oder der Tempel-Geheimtruhe wird am Schmiedetisch aus &eNetherit&r plus einer &6Verstärkten Echoscherbe&r die &6Wärterrüstung&r und das Wärterwerkzeug. Die Vorlage kopierst du mit 7 Diamanten und einem Sculk."
		""
		"&6Wärterstiefel&r dämpfen deine Schritte, Sensoren hören sie nicht. Die &6Seelenelytren&r (Elytren, Seelenkristall, 2 Seelenstaub, 4 Sculkknochen) haben einen Schub mit 30 Sekunden Abklingzeit. Der &6Schallstab&r (Herz der Tiefen, 2 Seelenkristalle, 2 Sculkknochen) feuert aufgeladen den Schallangriff des Wärters."
		""
		"Sammle also schon jetzt Verstärkte Echoscherben, Sculkknochen, Seelenstaub, Seelenkristalle und ein zweites Herz. Die Rezepte brauchen nichts, was du nicht schon aus diesem Kapitel kennst."
	]
	quest.60564CC10A27AA74.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 4."
	quest.60564CC10A27AA74.title: "&5Ausblick: Die Wärterrüstung"
	quest.605DFC279042734B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_temple.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Der &6Antike Tempel&r steht in den Tiefenlanden: Hallen aus Sculkgesteinfliesen, ein Keller mit Thronsaal, ein Oberbau mit Brunnen. Überall &6Sensoren&r, &6Antike Vasen&r und &cKreischer, die einen Wärter rufen können&r. Schleichen."
		""
		"&eIn den Truhen:&r Echoscherben, Seelenstaub, Sculkknochen, Kristallisierter Bernstein, Diamanten, Namensschilder, Resonarium-Vorlagen, mit Glück ein Seelenkristall. Irgendwo gibt es einen &6Geheimgang&r mit einer Truhe, in der immer ein &6Sculksender&r liegt."
		""
		"&eVasen:&r Darin sind Sand, Fäden, Gold, manchmal ein Goldapfel oder Diamanten. Jede sechste Vase ist &cunecht&r, und aus jeder dritten unechten steigt ein &4Beobachter&r. Zerschlag Vasen also nur mit freiem Rücken."
	]
	quest.605DFC279042734B.quest_subtitle: "Fliesen, Vasen und Kreischer, die rufen können."
	quest.605DFC279042734B.title: "&5&lFinde einen Antiken Tempel"
	quest.605F56D49F6FF418.quest_desc: [
		"Mit dem End kommen die Elytren und damit das Create-Jetpack, die Seelenelytra und das Wyvern-Flugmodul. Mekanism baut die MekaSuit, Just Dire Things die Eclipse-Rüstung, die fliegt."
		""
		"Auch die End-Metalle von Silent Gear liegen erst jetzt im Boden."
	]
	quest.605F56D49F6FF418.quest_subtitle: "Elytren, MekaSuit, Wyvern und Eclipse."
	quest.605F56D49F6FF418.title: "&d&lRüste dich für Stufe 4"
	quest.60697FF98DA3A3AE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/theurgy_array.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Source Pedestal&r: the Sulfur that gets used up lies here. &6Target Pedestal&r: the Sulfur you want more of, it stays. &6Result Pedestal&r: the result lands here."
		""
		"No fixed layout, everything just a few blocks apart. Recipes in EMI."
	]
	quest.60697FF98DA3A3AE.quest_subtitle: "Source, target, result."
	quest.60697FF98DA3A3AE.title: "&6Set Up Three Pedestals"
	quest.606EE253AF4C1C9A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_portal.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eDas Portal:&r Ein Rahmen aus &6Verstärktem Tiefenschiefer&r wie ein Netherportal, 10 Blöcke ohne Ecken. Entzündet wird er mit dem &6Herz der Tiefe&r (Heart of the Deep), das der &cWarden&r fallen lässt. Ein Warden, ein Herz, ein Portal."
		""
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r &e4 Tiefenschiefer&r in den Ecken, &e4 Stahlbarren&r an den Seiten und eine &6Echoscherbe&r in der Mitte ergeben &e2 Verstärkten Tiefenschiefer&r. Vanilla lässt den Block in den Antiken Städten nichts droppen. Der andere Weg ist ein Occultism-Ritual, das pro Block einen Warden opfert."
		""
		"&eDrüben:&r Sculk, so weit das Auge reicht: Deeplands, Blooming Caverns, Echoing Forest, Overcast Columns. Erze in Sculkstein und Gloomslate, Sculk-Kriecher, Shattered, Stalker. &eMitnehmen:&r Wolle für leise Schritte, Fackeln, Rüstung. Alles Weitere im Kapitel &3Deeper and Darker&r."
	]
	quest.606EE253AF4C1C9A.quest_subtitle: "Verstärkter Tiefenschiefer und das Herz der Tiefe. Stufe 3."
	quest.606EE253AF4C1C9A.title: "&3Öffne die Otherside"
	quest.6076914C41D62B34.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Der &6Generator&r ist Ferricore in den Ecken, Redstone oben und unten, Kohle links und rechts, ein &6Einfacher Steuerschaltkreis&r in der Mitte. Der &6Brennstoffgenerator&r hat dort Blazegold, Redstone, Eimer und einen Schmelzofen. &6Taschengenerator&r: Rechtsklick, Kohle rein, lädt alles in deinem Inventar."
		""
		"&eJust Dire Things, Generator:&r 15 FE je Brenntick, vierfache Brenngeschwindigkeit. Kohle &d60 FE/t&r (24 000 FE), Primal Coal &d120 FE/t&r (72 000), Blaze Ember &d240 FE/t&r (216 000). Puffer &d1 Million FE&r, Abgabe 1 000 FE/t an alle Nachbarn."
		""
		"&eBrennstoffgenerator:&r flüssiger Brennstoff aus Blaze Ember, &d450 FE je mB&r, also 450 000 FE pro Eimer, Abgabe &d5 000 FE/t&r, Puffer 5 Millionen. Der &6Energiesender&r schickt 1 000 FE/t drahtlos, mit 1 Prozent Verlust je Block. Offen ab Stufe 2, siehe Kapitel &6Just Dire Things&r."
	]
	quest.6076914C41D62B34.quest_subtitle: "Just Dire Things: 60 bis 240 FE/t fest, 5 000 FE/t flüssig."
	quest.6076914C41D62B34.title: "&6Heiz mit Primal Coal"
	quest.60786E7399FA932A.quest_desc: [
		"Der &cAptrgangr&r (160 Lebenspunkte, Rüstung 10, 18 Schaden, wirft Axtklingen für 8) lässt den &6Seltsamen Schlüssel&r fallen. Damit öffnest du das &6Tor des Siegels&r unten im Gefängnis."
		""
		"{image:cataclysm:textures/item/strange_key.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Er schlägt langsam, aber hart. Weich nach hinten aus, wenn er die Axt hebt, und schlag zu, während er sie wieder hochzieht. Dazu gibt es 1 bis 2 Schwarzstahlbarren und 2 bis 4 Nuggets."
	]
	quest.60786E7399FA932A.quest_subtitle: "Ein großer Draugr, ein seltsamer Schlüssel, ein Siegeltor."
	quest.60786E7399FA932A.title: "&bHol den Schlüssel vom Aptrgangr"
	quest.607C4773D367465D.quest_desc: [
		"Time to put everything together. A &egoo line&r: the &6Block Placer&r puts iron blocks next to the goo, the &6Sensor&r (Raw Ferricore Block in the filter, Allow List) turns on the &6Block Breaker&r set to Redstone High, the &6Item Collector&r collects the Raw Ferricore into a chest, and a &6Clicker&r with sugar wakes the goo again."
		""
		"Every goo has six sides, such a set fits on each one. With Blazebloom Goo and gold blocks the same line runs for Blazegold, with coal blocks for Primal Coal."
		""
		"At the back a furnace with a Fuel Canister smelts the Raw Ferricore. If you have Pipez or Mekanism transporters, connect everything without hoppers."
	]
	quest.607C4773D367465D.quest_subtitle: "Ferricore and Blazegold, hands free."
	quest.607C4773D367465D.title: "&a&lBuild the Goo Line"
	quest.608264B8DBE7B828.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6planks&r at the top and sides, a &6Processing Unit&r in the middle, at the bottom plank, &6plating&r, plank make the &6Item Filter&r."
		""
		"Place it in front of the target inventory with the differently colored side pointing at it. On five sides it only accepts what matches the filter in its window, and passes it on to the target. It pulls nothing out by itself."
	]
	quest.608264B8DBE7B828.quest_subtitle: "Only what fits gets in."
	quest.608264B8DBE7B828.title: "&9Sort with the Item Filter"
	quest.60934AC64E99612A.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6cauldron&r on top, below &6glass&r, &6Blank Module&r, &6glass&r. A &6Fluid Module Mk1&r."
		""
		"A router has no tank. Put a &6bucket&r or a tank item into the buffer, then the module fills or empties it from the block in the module's direction, even from water or lava in the world. &e1 bucket per second&r, no matter how many Speed Upgrades."
		""
		"Only &6Fluid Upgrades&r give more throughput (bucket over glass, Blank Upgrade, glass, three pieces): &e10 mB/t&r more each, up to 400 mB/t."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r If the direction is wrong, the router pours lava over you. Test with water first."
	]
	quest.60934AC64E99612A.quest_subtitle: "Fluids through a bucket in the buffer."
	quest.60934AC64E99612A.title: "&9Pump with the Router"
	quest.60A151267BD2B876.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_ores_full.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Steck &e8 Geschwindigkeitsupgrades&r und &e8 Energie-Upgrades&r in eine Maschine. Für den Satz brauchst du 16 Glas, 16 Infundierte Legierungen, 8 Osmiumstaub und 8 Goldstaub."
		""
		"Die Maschine arbeitet jetzt zehnmal so schnell wie vorher und braucht pro Gegenstand genauso viel Strom wie ohne Upgrades. Eine so bestückte Anreicherungskammer zieht statt 20 nun &d200 FE/t&r, der Schmelzer ebenso."
		""
		"Die Aufgabe prüft 8 und 8 im Inventar. Mach den Satz zuerst für die langsamste Maschine der Straße, dann für die nächste. Auch Fabriken nehmen die Upgrades."
	]
	quest.60A151267BD2B876.quest_subtitle: "Acht Geschwindigkeit, acht Energie."
	quest.60A151267BD2B876.title: "&6&lBestück eine Maschine voll"
	quest.60A6208CE0ADDB45.quest_desc: [
		"Owls live in the dark oak forest. Tame them with raw &6cod&r or &6salmon&r, best thrown on the ground."
		"&6Courier Package:&r 4 paper and a wooden slab, holds &e5 items&r. &6Courier Letter:&r paper and ink sac. Seal it, click on the owl, choose the recipient."
		""
		"The recipient is a player or a &6Courier Depot&r, the postbox made of Hexerei planks. On a server with many bases the nicest way to send friends something."
	]
	quest.60A6208CE0ADDB45.quest_subtitle: "Letters and packages for friends."
	quest.60A6208CE0ADDB45.title: "&6Send owl post"
	quest.60B73277F0D1A7FC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_altar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"8 &6Holystone&r um einen &6Zanite Gemstone&r ergeben den &6Altar&r. Er läuft mit &6Ambrosium Shards&r (12,5 Sekunden pro Shard) oder Ambrosium Blocks."
		""
		"&eVerzaubern:&r Blue Berry zu Enchanted Berry (12,5 s), Holystone zu &6Healing Stone&r (25 s), Cold Aercloud zu &6Golden Aercloud&r (50 s), Quicksoil zu &6Quicksoil Glass&r (12,5 s), Golden Dart zu &6Enchanted Dart&r (2,5 s), Skyroot Poison Bucket zu &6Remedy Bucket&r (25 s), Golden Dart Shooter zu &6Enchanted Dart Shooter&r."
		""
		"&eReparieren:&r Leg ein beschädigtes Werkzeug oder Rüstungsteil hinein, der Altar flickt es für ein paar Shards. Eine Zanite Pickaxe braucht 37,5 Sekunden."
		""
		"&eStufe 3:&r Dann verzaubert der Altar auch &6Gravitite Ore&r zu &6Enchanted Gravitite&r, dem besten Material des Aethers."
	]
	quest.60B73277F0D1A7FC.quest_subtitle: "Verzaubern und reparieren mit Ambrosium."
	quest.60B73277F0D1A7FC.title: "&d&lBau einen Altar"
	quest.60C4426ACBBC9B57.quest_desc: [
		"&eTier 2, with Elementarium in the enhancer slot.&r Main item a &6diamond block&r, on the pedestals &e2 flint, 2 dripstone blocks, 2 pointed dripstone&r. Essences: 300 Aureal, 1,500 Blood, 9 Souls."
		""
		"The prism goes onto the &6Smithing Table&r: the template is the mod's &6Smithing Template&r (eight darkstone around a netherite template), plus your tool and the prism. The tool gets &6Demolishing&r and mines 3 by 3 blocks at once."
		""
		"Smelter Prism (Fiery, smelts ore while mining, also needs Elementarium) and Ferrognetic Mixture (Magnetized) work the same way. The mixture also makes a pedestal magnetic with a right click, then it collects items by itself."
	]
	quest.60C4426ACBBC9B57.quest_subtitle: "A tool that mines whole areas."
	quest.60C4426ACBBC9B57.title: "&2Terrastomp Prism"
	quest.60D275D1E33B82BB.quest_desc: [
		"On top &6Gem Dust&r, &6gunpowder&r, Gem Dust, in the middle three &6Gem-Fused Slate&r, at the bottom Gem Dust, &6amethyst shard&r, Gem Dust. That gives three &6Sigils of Socketing&r."
		""
		"A sigil with an item at the &6Smithing Table&r gives the item one more socket, at most two per item this way. So even a piece without sockets gets room for a gem."
		""
		"&eSigil of Unnaming:&r three slate, three &6flint&r, three slate give six. At the Smithing Table it removes the affix name and an invader's name from the item again."
	]
	quest.60D275D1E33B82BB.quest_subtitle: "One more socket, up to two."
	quest.60D275D1E33B82BB.title: "&dSigil of Socketing"
	quest.60D9C334A54D24D6.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"keybind\":\"key.voice_chat\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" opens the Simple Voice Chat menu. Join the \"},{\"text\":\"group\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" the team creates for the finale. In a group you hear the others over any distance.\"}]"
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Without a group your voice only reaches 48 blocks, and the island is much bigger. Check beforehand in the voice chat menu (\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.voice_chat\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\") that your microphone is on.\"}]"
	]
	quest.60D9C334A54D24D6.quest_subtitle: "Hear who calls what across the whole island."
	quest.60D9C334A54D24D6.title: "&eJoin the Voice Group"
	quest.60DCDA43CC63EA05.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.curios.open.desc\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" for your \"},{\"text\":\"curio slots\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\". The magnet fits into the \"},{\"text\":\"charm\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" slot and pulls from there just as from the inventory.\"}]"
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"That way Ultimine cannot bury it in cobblestone by accident, and a full backpack does not push it out. Turning it on and off still works with \"},{\"keybind\":\"simplemagnets.keys.toggle\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
	]
	quest.60DCDA43CC63EA05.quest_subtitle: "It works there too, and the inventory stays free."
	quest.60DCDA43CC63EA05.title: "&bPut the Magnet in the Curio Slot"
	quest.60E3DED33ED9EAEA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_refinery.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept Steuerblock:&r sechs &6Verstärkte Steinstufen&r oben und unten, ein &6Kleiner Tank&r zwischen zwei &6Redstone&r in der Mitte ergeben die &6Raffinerie&r (Refinery). &eRezept Ausgang:&r dieselben Stufen, in der Mitte ein &6Diamant&r zwischen zwei &6Glas&r ergeben einen &6Raffinerie-Ausgang&r (Refinery Output)."
		""
		"Stell den Steuerblock hin und &ezwei bis vier Ausgänge&r direkt darauf oder daneben übereinander. Öl kommt in den Steuerblock, die Brennstoffe sammeln sich in den Ausgängen: der leichteste oben, der schwerste unten. Aus 10 mB Öl werden mit zwei Ausgängen 4 Diesel und 2 LPG, mit drei 2 Diesel, 3 Kerosin, 2 LPG, mit vier 2 Diesel, 3 Kerosin, 3 Benzin, 2 LPG."
		""
		"Die Raffinerie läuft &eab 100 Grad&r und braucht weder Luft noch Strom, nur &cHitze&r. Je heißer, desto schneller. Wie du heizt, steht im Abschnitt Hitze: ein Wirbelrohr, Lava oder Magma daneben, oder ein &6Lohenbrenner&r von Create."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Sie hat viele offene Seiten und verliert Hitze an die Luft. Verkleide alles, was frei ist, mit beliebigen Blöcken, Platten oder Falltüren, am besten mit &6Wärmedämmung&r (Thermal Lagging: Wolle und Glas im Schachbrett)."
	]
	quest.60E3DED33ED9EAEA.quest_subtitle: "Ein Steuerblock, zwei bis vier Ausgänge, Hitze."
	quest.60E3DED33ED9EAEA.title: "&6&lBau die Raffinerie"
	quest.60EDDBB2054A9775.quest_desc: [
		"Lithium Dust in the corners, circuits on the sides, a Basic Energy Cube in the middle. A &6Basic Induction Provider&r manages &d102,400 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Providers add up. If the matrix is full but your machines are starving, you are missing providers, not cells."
	]
	quest.60EDDBB2054A9775.quest_subtitle: "Decides how fast power flows."
	quest.60EDDBB2054A9775.title: "&9Build an Induction Provider"
	quest.60F0EBDABFEC3826.quest_desc: [
		"Collect &e24 Gaia Spirits&r. Almost everything here costs one or more."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Every &cstabilizer&r for Draconic Evolution's Energy Core needs a Gaia Spirit, a core four. See the chapter &5Draconic Evolution&r."
	]
	quest.60F0EBDABFEC3826.quest_subtitle: "The currency of this stage."
	quest.60F0EBDABFEC3826.title: "&dCollect Gaia Spirits"
	quest.60F46F2CBB76B74C.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a &6Singularity&r and an &6ender pearl&r (or ender dust) on the ground together and blow them up. A creeper is enough."
		""
		"Out always come &etwo Quantum Entangled Singularities&r that belong together. Only this pair links two bridges. Name each pair at the anvil right away, for example &7\"Base Nether\"&r."
	]
	quest.60F46F2CBB76B74C.quest_subtitle: "One bang, two halves."
	quest.60F46F2CBB76B74C.title: "&dBlow Them into a Pair"
	quest.610266553BAD1EE0.quest_desc: [
		"&e9 vines&r in the full grid make a &6Vine Ball&r."
		""
		"Thrown, it leaves a track of solid vines on the wall where it hits, which you can climb up. Handy on cliffs and in caves."
		""
		"In stage 2 the &6Livingwood Slingshot&r (with a Rune of Air) shoots the balls straight ahead without gravity."
	]
	quest.610266553BAD1EE0.quest_subtitle: "A ladder to throw."
	quest.610266553BAD1EE0.title: "&6Roll a Vine Ball"
	quest.61048DE670A4910E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Nebulous Heart&r, &6Coin of Fortune&r, &6Witch Hat&r and &6Infernal Tear&r shapeless give the &6Hero's Medallion&r. Witches drop the Witch Hat, the Infernal Tear is Void Tear, Witch Hat, Molten Core and Infernal Claw."
		""
		"The medallion stores your experience levels and gives them back with right click. Shift mouse wheel sets how many levels it leaves you. If you die, the experience in the medallion is still there."
	]
	quest.61048DE670A4910E.quest_subtitle: "Save experience for later."
	quest.61048DE670A4910E.title: "&eBuild a Hero's Medallion"
	quest.611B31DAC9106109.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 redstone&r, &e4 Livingrock&r and a &etarget block&r. Bursts fly through the detector like through air, and it gives a redstone signal as they do."
		""
		"That way you notice whether a line carries any mana at all, or count bursts with a counter."
	]
	quest.611B31DAC9106109.quest_subtitle: "Redstone when a burst flies past."
	quest.611B31DAC9106109.title: "&6Build a Mana Detector"
	quest.6122D0CE9C0E01BC.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 lime&r, &e1 green&r, &e1 yellow&r petal, &eRune of Spring&r, &6Redstone Root&r."
		""
		"Plants near it grow much faster with mana: fields, sugar cane, trees, flowers. Under a Create harvester it saves every bone meal."
	]
	quest.6122D0CE9C0E01BC.quest_subtitle: "Fertilizer that never runs out."
	quest.6122D0CE9C0E01BC.title: "&6Plant an Agricarnation"
	quest.6130845001A9AB9D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Industrial Hemp Seeds&r drop when you break tall grass. Plant them on farmland, the upper block gives &6Industrial Hemp Fiber&r at harvest."
		""
		"Eight fibres around a stick make &6Tough Fabric&r. It becomes Windmill Sails, Jump Cushions and Balloons. In stage 3 the seeds are the best source of plant oil."
	]
	quest.6130845001A9AB9D.quest_subtitle: "Fibre for sails, fabric and plant oil."
	quest.6130845001A9AB9D.title: "&2Grow Industrial Hemp"
	quest.614A73700EB8ED76.quest_desc: [
		"Andesite (dug or compacted) and nuggets (from gravel washing or from zinc) run on belts to the mixer, water wheels drive everything, a funnel unloads the &6Andesite Alloy&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The tech pillar wants &61,500 alloys&r (for 30 players) and &e12 Stoneworks Gearboxes&r: four Andesite Casings, Large Cogwheel, press, millstone, water wheel and an Infused Iron. Each counts as much as 125 alloys."
		""
		"&eHow to deliver:&r Sneak and right-click at the obelisk hands in everything that fits. There is no machine that hands in for you. &e/kw goals&r shows the progress."
	]
	quest.614A73700EB8ED76.quest_subtitle: "The Stone Works run by themselves."
	quest.614A73700EB8ED76.title: "&6&lBuild the andesite factory"
	quest.6152796C85ECCA39.quest_desc: [
		"Mit dem Nether kommen Netherit, die Nether-Metalle von Silent Gear und Just Dire Things, Stahl von Mekanism und Terrastahl. Und der erste Flug: der Jetpack von Mekanism."
		""
		"Ab hier sind die Einträge Haken. Hak ab, was du hast, die Belohnung ist klein, die Übersicht das Ziel."
	]
	quest.6152796C85ECCA39.quest_subtitle: "Netherit, Nether-Metalle, der erste Jetpack."
	quest.6152796C85ECCA39.title: "&6&lRüste dich für Stufe 2"
	quest.6152D70576E31328.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r oben drei &6Schwarzes Glas&r, in der Mitte Eisenbarren, &6Ofen&r, Eisenbarren, unten drei Eisenbarren. Der &6Backofen&r nimmt nur Essen, kein Erz, und gart bis zu neun Stücke gleichzeitig: drei Eingänge, neun Garplätze, drei Ausgänge."
		""
		"Er brennt mit allem, was auch der Ofen frisst, aber Brennstoff hält im Backofen nur ein &eDrittel&r so lange. Kohleblöcke statt Kohle, dann musst du seltener nachlegen."
		""
		"Steht er an der Küche, brät der Kochtisch damit: Fleisch, Kartoffeln, Fisch und alles, was im Kochbuch einen Ofen verlangt."
		""
		"&eAusblick:&r Die &6Heizeinheit&r (drei Eisenklumpen, zwei Eisen, Komparator) heizt den Backofen mit Strom statt Kohle. Strom gibt es ab &6Stufe 2&r."
	]
	quest.6152D70576E31328.quest_subtitle: "Brät nur Essen, dafür neun Stücke auf einmal."
	quest.6152D70576E31328.title: "&6Bau einen Backofen"
	quest.616773D49EAC39AD.quest_desc: [
		"Every kind of &6cobblestone&r counts, one point each. The pillar for everyone: anybody can help from the first minute, without machines or magic."
		""
		"The fastest way is Ultimine in the farm world or a cobblestone generator that fills chests."
	]
	quest.616773D49EAC39AD.quest_subtitle: "20,000 cobblestone."
	quest.616773D49EAC39AD.title: "&7Fill the stone pillar"
	quest.6177AB9F8D678B41.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Basic Machine Cores&r in the corners, &6plating&r on the sides, one &6Duratium&r in the middle."
		""
		"The extender sits on the machine or on another extender and gives new slots. How many work depends on the quality of the cores, shown at the top left of the window."
	]
	quest.6177AB9F8D678B41.quest_subtitle: "Machine Addon Extender."
	quest.6177AB9F8D678B41.title: "&aExtend the Addon Slots"
	quest.617C3AFAEF929D13.quest_desc: [
		"Right click on the ripe &6Mugwort&r gives &6Mugwort Leaves&r and &6Mugwort Flowers&r."
		""
		"The leaves are in the normal broom brush, the flowers in the Enhanced Brush. Dried, both belong in the crow ankh."
	]
	quest.617C3AFAEF929D13.quest_subtitle: "Leaves and flowers."
	quest.617C3AFAEF929D13.title: "&aHarvest Mugwort"
	quest.618368E50612B008.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6wooden sword&r and &6oak log&r shapeless give an &6Oak Nest&r. Dirt, sand, gravel, snow or sugar cane work the same with the wooden sword, stone needs an iron sword. Or just pick up a nest in the world, the bee stays inside."
		""
		"Wild nests hang on tree trunks and lie in coarse dirt, sand, gravel and sugar cane. In each lives a &esolitary bee&r: &6Carpenter Bees&r in wood nests, &6Ashy Mining&r, &6Chocolate Mining&r and &6Leafcutter Bee&r in dirt nests, &6Mason&r and &6Digger Bee&r in the stone nest."
		"Plus the &6Reed Bee&r in sugar cane, the &6Resin Bee&r in spruces, the &6Blue Banded Bee&r in acacia, cherry and black oak, the &6Sweat Bee&r in snow and the &6Slimy Bee&r in swamps."
		""
		"An empty nest attracts new bees: right click with a &6Honey Treat&r, and after about &e20 minutes&r a new one moves in. Crafting a nest with itself empties it. Two cuckoo bees lay in other bees' nests: the &6Nomad Bee&r in nests of the Ashy Mining Bee, the &6Neon Cuckoo Bee&r in those of the Blue Banded Bee, at most twice per nest."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The &6Nest Locator&r (gold nugget, iron bars and note block), after a shift right click on a nest block, shows all nests of that kind within 100 blocks."
	]
	quest.618368E50612B008.quest_subtitle: "A single wild bee lives in every nest."
	quest.618368E50612B008.title: "&2Find or Build a Wild Nest"
	quest.61897AFF1AC84E9D.quest_desc: [
		"Draconic tier. Catalyst: a &6Large Chaos Fragment&r. In twelve injectors: &64 Awakened ingots&r, &64 Draconic Cores&r, &64 Large Chaos Fragments&r. Costs 100 million energy."
	]
	quest.61897AFF1AC84E9D.quest_subtitle: "The tier above Draconic."
	quest.61897AFF1AC84E9D.title: "&8Fuse a Chaotic Core"
	quest.618E9D2E071570EF.quest_desc: [
		"&eStrength&r: Potion of Strength. &eRegeneration&r: Potion of Regeneration. &eInstant Health&r: Potion of Healing."
		""
		"Set them up where you fight or gather: at the Afrit arena, at the boss spawn, in the farm."
	]
	quest.618E9D2E071570EF.quest_subtitle: "Strength, regeneration, healing."
	quest.618E9D2E071570EF.title: "&cSoak candles for the fight"
	quest.61908B1DD17D4CB6.quest_desc: [
		"Be at the &emeeting point&r the team announces on Discord at the start time, with your gear in your inventory. The team leads you to the &5Chaos Island&r itself, there is no teleport at the obelisk."
		""
		"The island has a radius of about 160 blocks, the Chaos Crystal stands in the middle at height 80. Save it in the Dislocator right away."
		""
		"&cPlease:&r Do not fly there alone beforehand. The fight starts as soon as someone arrives, and it belongs to everyone."
	]
	quest.61908B1DD17D4CB6.quest_subtitle: "Everyone together, on a signal."
	quest.61908B1DD17D4CB6.title: "&5Come Along to the Island"
	quest.619872B74EBD9A2C.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r An &6Importer&r in the top middle, an &6Exporter&r at the bottom, redstone left and right, a &6Machine Casing&r in the center, enriched iron in the corners."
		""
		"The &6Interface&r is a full block with slots of its own: a row where everything goes that should go into the network, and slots where it keeps configured items ready from the network. Hoppers, Create belts or Mekanism transporters use it like a chest. It needs 4 FE/t."
		""
		"With an &6Autocrafting Upgrade&r (enriched iron, Construction Core, two crafting tables, an Upgrade) it orders missing items from autocrafting."
	]
	quest.619872B74EBD9A2C.quest_subtitle: "Importer and Exporter in one block."
	quest.619872B74EBD9A2C.title: "&6Build an Interface"
	quest.619975337A99582F.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Teleportation Core&r in the middle, Atomic Alloy left and right, Ultimate Control Circuits at the top and bottom, Refined Obsidian in the corners."
		""
		"Two porters on the same &efrequency&r share a buffer: power, items, fluids, gases and heat, even between dimensions. You set every side with the Configurator."
	]
	quest.619975337A99582F.quest_subtitle: "To the other end of the world without cables."
	quest.619975337A99582F.title: "&5Build Two Quantum Entangloporters"
	quest.61A0C23A207FEE35.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r glowstone dust, &6Menril Glass&r, glowstone dust at the top, a &6Display Panel&r in the middle, glowstone dust, a &6crafting table&r, glowstone dust at the bottom."
		""
		"It shows the crafting jobs your network is working through. That way you see at a glance whether an order runs or hangs."
	]
	quest.61A0C23A207FEE35.quest_subtitle: "The Crafting Job Terminal."
	quest.61A0C23A207FEE35.title: "&3Keep an eye on the orders"
	quest.61A0E26321BD2D76.quest_desc: [
		"&6Skyroot Planks&r und &6Skyroot Sticks&r ergeben Werkzeug wie aus Holz: 3 Bretter und 2 Stöcke für die &6Skyroot Pickaxe&r, 3 Bretter und 2 Stöcke für die Axt."
		""
		"Skyroot-Werkzeug hat einen Trick: Alles aus dem Aether (Holystone, Ambrosium-Erz, Aerclouds, Beerenbüsche, Skyroot-Stämme) fällt &edoppelt&r. Mit Glück auf einer Skyroot Pickaxe wird Ambrosium zur Massenware."
		""
		"Zwei Bretter oben und eines darunter ergeben den &6Skyroot Bucket&r, einen Holzeimer für Wasser, Milch und das Gift der Aechor-Pflanzen."
	]
	quest.61A0E26321BD2D76.quest_subtitle: "Holzwerkzeug, das doppelt erntet."
	quest.61A0E26321BD2D76.title: "&2Bau Skyroot-Werkzeug"
	quest.61A1F3538FB158C0.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Deployer&r with saplings in hand replants at the saw carousel what the saw felled, then the tree farm runs without you. The Mekanism &6Precision Sawmill&r makes 6 planks per log and drops sawdust with a little luck."
		""
		"The deployer works 2 blocks in front of it and gets its saplings by funnel from the harvest chest. A brass funnel with a filter only lets saplings through."
		""
		"See the &6Create: Brass&r (Deployer) and &5Mekanism&r (Precision Sawmill) chapters."
	]
	quest.61A1F3538FB158C0.quest_subtitle: "Deployer and Precision Sawmill."
	quest.61A1F3538FB158C0.title: "&6Stage 2: replanting without you"
	quest.61B89DC3CE373DEA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Shaft&r, &6Andesite Casing&r and an &6iron block&r stacked make the &6Mechanical Press&r. It gets rotation from above or from the side."
		""
		"It costs &d8 SU per RPM&r. For one press at 32 RPM plan a whole water wheel, better two."
	]
	quest.61B89DC3CE373DEA.quest_subtitle: "A stamp for sheets."
	quest.61B89DC3CE373DEA.title: "&6Build the Mechanical Press"
	quest.61BDE2340B6537C7.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_advanced_security_station.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r grauer Farbstoff, &6Glasscheibe&r, grauer Farbstoff oben, &6Turbine Rotor&r, &6PCB&r, Turbine Rotor in der Mitte, zwei &6Plastic Sheets&r unten in die Ecken."
		""
		"In ihrem Bereich kann kein fremder Spieler Blöcke setzen, abbauen oder Kisten öffnen. Jedes &6Range Upgrade&r vergrößert den Bereich um einen Block, bis 16 in jede Richtung. Freunde trägst du im Reiter &eShared Users&r ein."
		""
		"&eEinrichten:&r Im Netzraster müssen ein &6Diagnostic Subroutine&r, ein &6Network IO Port&r und eine &6Network Registry&r liegen, verbunden durch &6Network Nodes&r (Truhe mit Transistoren und lila Farbstoff, 16 Stück). Die Komponenten sind Plastik oder Transistoren um eine Truhe mit Farbstoff."
		""
		"&cHacken ist auf diesem Server erlaubt:&r Mit einem Pneumatic Helmet und Security Upgrades (Stufe 4) kann jemand deine Station knacken. Größere Stapel Network Nodes und Entity Tracker Upgrades machen das schwerer, Security Upgrades in der Station verlangen vom Hacker mehr Upgrades. Versteck sie gut."
	]
	quest.61BDE2340B6537C7.quest_subtitle: "Niemand außer dir fasst deine Kisten an."
	quest.61BDE2340B6537C7.title: "&cBau eine Security Station"
	quest.61C8DBA871625226.quest_desc: [
		"&6Digestion Vat&r: a decorated pot with two gold ingots, a Sal Ammoniac Crystal and sandstone. Inside: &6gold ingot&r, an &6Alchemical Salt&r, a &6water bucket&r, close it by sneaking."
		""
		"Out comes &6Purified Gold&r."
	]
	quest.61C8DBA871625226.quest_subtitle: "The catalyst for digestion."
	quest.61C8DBA871625226.title: "&6Purify Gold"
	quest.61CEAEC262E568C2.quest_desc: [
		"&eStufe 1:&r &6Create-Rohre mit Mechanischer Pumpe&r für alles Kurze und der &6Schlauchaufzug&r über einem See oder Lavasee für Unendliches. Lagern im &6Create-Flüssigkeitstank&r."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r &6Pipez-Flüssigkeitsrohre&r (500 mB/t mit der Verbesserten Modifikation) als Allzweckleitung und die &6Ranged Pump&r im Nether für Lava. Mekanism-Rohre und -Tanks innerhalb der Mekanism-Fabrik."
		""
		"&eStufe 3:&r &6Ender-IO-Flüssigkeitsleitungen&r (bis 8 000 mB) für die großen Mengen und &6Flüssigkeitszellen&r in AE2 oder RS, damit Lava, Öl und Chemie im Lager liegen statt in Tanks."
	]
	quest.61CEAEC262E568C2.quest_subtitle: "Zwei Wahlen pro Stufe."
	quest.61CEAEC262E568C2.title: "&b&lWas wann: Flüssigkeiten"
	quest.61D6442CC6B1747B.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6redstone&r and a &6water bucket&r, shapeless in the crafting table, make a &6Bucket of Redstone Acid&r."
		""
		"Every accumulator needs one. In stage 3 the Mixer mixes the acid from one redstone per 250 mB of water, so much cheaper."
	]
	quest.61D6442CC6B1747B.quest_subtitle: "The electrolyte for every accumulator."
	quest.61D6442CC6B1747B.title: "&cMix Redstone Acid"
	quest.61E13FD902B5954C.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r vier &6Terrakotta&r um einen &6Blumentopf&r (oben links und rechts, in der Mitte links und rechts, eine unten). Das ist der &6Pflanztopf&r (Botany Pot)."
		""
		"Rechtsklick mit &6Erde&r setzt den Boden, Rechtsklick mit &6Samen&r die Pflanze. Sie wächst ohne Wasser, Licht oder Platz, und mit Rechtsklick erntest du, die Pflanze bleibt stehen. Weizen, Karotten, Kartoffeln, Zuckerrohr, Kaktus, Pilze, Blumen, Seegras, Netherwarze, alles geht."
		""
		"Töpfe gibt es aus jeder Terrakotta-Farbe, aus Beton und aus Ziegelarten, immer nach demselben Rezept. Jade und der Tooltip zeigen dir, welche Pflanze welchen Boden will und wie lange sie braucht."
	]
	quest.61E13FD902B5954C.quest_subtitle: "Ein Feld in einem Block."
	quest.61E13FD902B5954C.title: "&a&lTöpfere einen Pflanztopf"
	quest.61EBAF73D8AE43B0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/malum_quickening.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Four runes: &5Eldritch&r, &dArcane&r and two &cInfernal&r, but on a totem of &6Soulwood&r. On Runewood the same runes give the &eRite of Smelting&r, which smelts blocks below the spark."
		""
		"The rite weaves a &eRite Locus&r, a wandering spark. Furnaces, blast furnaces and smokers it passes over smelt faster. The fuel lasts just as far as usual."
		""
		"You get Soulwood with the &eUnchained Rite&r, it transforms Runewood. You make the totem base from Soulwood in spirit infusion."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Put a Quickening totem in your furnace hall. It fits the stage goal \"The Furnace Never Sleeps\"."
	]
	quest.61EBAF73D8AE43B0.quest_subtitle: "The furnace never sleeps."
	quest.61EBAF73D8AE43B0.title: "&cLight the Rite of Quickening"
	quest.61EEF6A526AC137D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Spiders&r, &6chickens&r, &6bats&r and &6rabbits&r. Phantoms give three."
		""
		"For obelisks, Soulwoven Silk and totem bases."
	]
	quest.61EEF6A526AC137D.quest_subtitle: "Airy arcana."
	quest.61EEF6A526AC137D.title: "&fAerial"
	quest.61FE2E780F3FEA60.quest_desc: [
		"&6Light Radiation Shielding:&r copper, leather, copper at the top, iron nugget, clay ball, iron nugget in the middle, copper, leather, copper at the bottom, gives four. &6Medium:&r iron, lapis, iron around a gold block, gives two."
		""
		"At the &6smithing table&r: armor piece in the base slot, plate with it. That works with any armor. Light gives &e2 percent&r protection, Medium 4, Heavy 7, Dense 12. Each piece takes one plate."
	]
	quest.61FE2E780F3FEA60.quest_subtitle: "One plate per piece, at the smithing table."
	quest.61FE2E780F3FEA60.title: "&eReinforce Your Armor Against Radiation"
	quest.6201E5BDB258C810.quest_desc: [
		"&6Andesite Alloy&r: 2 &6andesite&r and 2 &6iron nuggets&r (or zinc nuggets) diagonally in the crafting table make one."
		""
		"{image:create:textures/item/andesite_alloy.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The &6Mechanical Mixer&r makes &etwo&r alloys from 1 andesite and 1 nugget, so it needs a quarter of the material. Each alloy counts 2 points. See the chapter &6Create&r."
	]
	quest.6201E5BDB258C810.quest_subtitle: "1,500 Andesite Alloy and 12 Stoneworks Gearboxes."
	quest.6201E5BDB258C810.title: "&6Fill the tech pillar"
	quest.620E5F31B282373E.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Schild&r formlos ergibt zwei &6Wegweiser&r (Way Signs). Häng sie an einen Zaunpfosten, beschrifte sie und dreh den Pfeil mit Rechtsklick in die Richtung, in die er zeigen soll. Zwei Wegweiser passen an denselben Pfosten, einer oben, einer unten."
		""
		"Sechs &6Wolle&r über einem Stock ergeben eine &6Fahne&r. Sie hängt an der Wand, nimmt Bannermuster an und weht im Wind. Auf einem Fahnenmast über der Basis sieht jeder Besucher, wessen Claim er betritt."
	]
	quest.620E5F31B282373E.quest_subtitle: "Wegweiser und Fahnen für den Server."
	quest.620E5F31B282373E.title: "&6Weise den Weg"
	quest.621FDA4F4D181954.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Gewichteter Werfer&r: wirft, was auf ihm landet, &ebis 32 Blöcke&r weit zu einem Ziel, das du vorher mit Schleichen und Rechtsklick festlegst. Auf eine Kiste gezielt wartet er, bis Platz ist. Mit Stückzahl am Wertefeld wirft er erst ab dieser Menge. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Goldblech, Depot und Zahnrad untereinander, &d2 SU pro RPM&r. Siehe Kapitel Create."
	]
	quest.621FDA4F4D181954.quest_subtitle: "Create, Gewichteter Werfer: bis 32 Blöcke weit, ohne Band."
	quest.621FDA4F4D181954.title: "Wirf mit dem Gewichteten Werfer"
	quest.623717357CBDF5EB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_crusher.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e10 Light Engineering Blocks, 10 Steel Scaffolding, 8 Steel Fences, 9 hoppers, 1 Redstone Engineering Block&r. Hammer on the middle fence of the long side with the Redstone block."
		""
		"&eIn:&r at the top into the rollers. &eOut:&r at the bottom front. An ore block gives 2 dust (plus 10 percent nickel dust), raw ore 1 dust plus a one in three chance of a second, cobblestone gravel, sandstone sand and Nitrate Dust. Power at the top on the shoulder."
		""
		"&cWhoever falls in comes out as loot.&r"
	]
	quest.623717357CBDF5EB.quest_subtitle: "5x3x3, ore in, two dust out."
	quest.623717357CBDF5EB.title: "&7&lForm a Crusher"
	quest.6238590FD0D265ED.quest_desc: [
		"Bürste den &6Verdächtigen Sand&r in der Pyramide mit einem &6Pinsel&r (Feder, Kupferbarren, Stock). Darin liegt die &6Halskette der Wüste&r. Unten in der großen Halle schläft der &cAncient Remnant&r. Rechtsklick mit der Kette auf ihn, und er wacht auf."
		""
		"{image:cataclysm:textures/item/necklace_of_the_desert.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Die Kette wird dabei verbraucht. Solange er schläft, kannst du in Ruhe die Halle ausleuchten, Wegpunkt setzen und alle versammeln. Erst wecken, wenn alle bereit sind."
	]
	quest.6238590FD0D265ED.quest_subtitle: "Eine Kette aus dem Sand, dann ein Rechtsklick."
	quest.6238590FD0D265ED.title: "&6Weck den Ancient Remnant"
	quest.623A922EF7C378AA.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &5Abjuration Essence&r, &e4 glistering melon slices&r, &6golden apple&r."
		""
		"Heals a bit and costs you hunger. Undead take the same amount as damage. &eSelf, Heal, Amplify&r for you, &eProjectile, Heal&r for friends."
	]
	quest.623A922EF7C378AA.quest_subtitle: "Finally a healing spell."
	quest.623A922EF7C378AA.title: "&dLearn Heal"
	quest.623F6294DD8F0F79.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Conductor Cap&r is made by &esequenced assembly&r: a block of &6wool&r onto the belt, a &6Mechanical Saw&r cuts it, a deployer adds a &6Precision Mechanism&r, a second one a &6string&r. Every wool color gives its own cap."
		""
		"Right click a placed &6Andesite Casing&r with the cap: it becomes a &6Conductor&r. Put it on the seat in front of the train controls and give it the schedule, then it drives like a blaze or villager, except it does not walk away."
		""
		"Conductors press buttons and flip levers as soon as you look at them, up to 16 blocks away. If you wear a cap of a different color yourself, they do not. A &6Toolbox&r from Create works on them as on you."
	]
	quest.623F6294DD8F0F79.quest_subtitle: "A cap, an Andesite Casing, an employee."
	quest.623F6294DD8F0F79.title: "&6Hire a Conductor"
	quest.62418F9E28D23C0D.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6osmium ingots&r on the sides, redstone in the corners: a &6Basic Chemical Tank&r for &e64,000 mB&r of gas. Two steel and glass give eight &6Pressurized Tubes&r."
		""
		"Gases only run in Pressurized Tubes, fluids only in Mechanical Pipes. A tank can vent its gas with the button in the window if you don't need it."
	]
	quest.62418F9E28D23C0D.quest_subtitle: "Gases don't belong in pipes."
	quest.62418F9E28D23C0D.title: "&bBuild a Chemical Tank"
	quest.6241A27B59F5BDF0.quest_desc: [
		"&e7 paper&r, a &6feather&r in the top middle, a &6Mercury Shard&r in the middle: nine filters."
		""
		"Unlike the List Filter it checks properties: tags, damage or enchantments. Right click into the air opens it, put a sample item inside, scroll to the property you want and click &eAdd&r. Then right click an inserter or extractor."
		""
		"A filter on raw materials sends every raw ore into the Liquefaction Cauldron, no matter which metal."
	]
	quest.6241A27B59F5BDF0.quest_subtitle: "Filter by tags instead of items."
	quest.6241A27B59F5BDF0.title: "&bSort with the Attribute Filter"
	quest.6244B68F3856AF43.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r three &6iron ingots&r on top, two &6iron bars&r on the sides, three &6wooden slabs&r at the bottom. A &6Cage&r."
		""
		"With the cage in hand you click an animal, and it sits inside. A right click on the ground releases it there again. With &eShift&r you place the cage with the animal as a block."
		""
		"Tameable animals like wolves and cats have to be tamed first. If a creature does not fit, the cage tells you."
	]
	quest.6244B68F3856AF43.quest_subtitle: "Move cows without lead and wheat."
	quest.6244B68F3856AF43.title: "&7Carry an Animal in a Cage"
	quest.62500DD1F12B651A.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Shape Card&r in the middle, a &6water bucket&r at the top, a &6lava bucket&r at the bottom, &6iron&r left and right, &6redstone&r in the corners."
		""
		"With it the Builder puts fluid into the shape instead of sucking it out. The fluid comes from a tank on the Builder. That way you fill a pool or a moat in one go."
	]
	quest.62500DD1F12B651A.quest_subtitle: "The Builder fills too."
	quest.62500DD1F12B651A.title: "&9Build a Fluid Card"
	quest.627965BF9675D7D0.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Livingwood Logs&r in the corners, &e4 TNT&r on the sides, a &aGaia Spirit&r in the middle."
		""
		"A mana burst ignites the charge. It becomes a &cManastorm Epicenter&r that hurls explosive mana bursts in all directions for a while."
		""
		"&cNever&r ignite it near bases, spawn or other people's builds. Far out it is good for removing terrain."
	]
	quest.627965BF9675D7D0.quest_subtitle: "Only for the insane."
	quest.627965BF9675D7D0.title: "&5Build a Manastorm Charge"
	quest.627DFF4E5C474F59.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eternal_starlight_forge.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Follow a Seeking Eye to a &6Golem Forge&r and go inside. Collect &64 Frozen Tubes&r from the &6Freezes&r on the way."
		""
		"&eWhy the tubes:&r A Frozen Tube thrown at the Starlight Golem sends it into its charging state faster. The Freezes cause frostbite, armor against cold helps."
	]
	quest.627DFF4E5C474F59.quest_subtitle: "Preparing for the first boss."
	quest.627DFF4E5C474F59.title: "&6Find a Golem Forge"
	quest.627E863E0CB6197C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/exploration_e_compass.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6compass&r in the middle, &64 logs&r on the sides, &64 saplings&r in the corners make the &6Nature's Compass&r."
		""
		"Right click opens the list of all biomes. Pick one, and it shows direction, distance and coordinates of the nearest. It doesn't wear out."
	]
	quest.627E863E0CB6197C.quest_subtitle: "It shows you the way to any biome."
	quest.627E863E0CB6197C.title: "&6Build the Nature's Compass"
	quest.628049EA9161CA53.quest_desc: [
		"An &6ender pearl&r on top, &6two iron ingots&r next to the upgrade base, one &6lead&r each bottom left and right."
		""
		"With the upgrade in the backpack you catch &epassive animals&r with a sneaking right click, they end up in a slot of the backpack. That way cows, sheep and chickens move with you to the new base, without lead or fence."
	]
	quest.628049EA9161CA53.quest_subtitle: "The Mob Catcher Upgrade."
	quest.628049EA9161CA53.title: "Put a sheep in the backpack"
	quest.62868D7A8B29245D.quest_desc: [
		"&6ME Infinity Cobblestone Cell:&r quartz glass, lava bucket, quartz glass at the top, water bucket, 16k component, water bucket in the middle, three diamonds at the bottom. The &6ME Infinity Water Cell&r takes a water bucket instead of the lava."
		""
		"In a drive it gives out unlimited cobblestone or water and swallows both without end. No more stone farm or water source for machines that need them."
	]
	quest.62868D7A8B29245D.quest_subtitle: "Cobblestone and water without end."
	quest.62868D7A8B29245D.title: "&3Build Infinite Cells"
	quest.628BB49DC2AAA41F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crafting Card:&r shapeless from a Basic Card and a crafting table. Put it into an Export Bus, set the item, and when it is missing in the network the bus orders it by itself."
		""
		"The &6ME Level Emitter&r (shapeless: redstone torch and Calculation Processor) gives redstone as soon as a stock falls below a number. With a Crafting Card it can even switch on a farm that works without ingredients."
	]
	quest.628BB49DC2AAA41F.quest_subtitle: "The Crafting Card reorders."
	quest.628BB49DC2AAA41F.title: "&aKeep a stock"
	quest.628D4F8468034B1E.quest_desc: [
		"Find one of these structures and tick this off: &6Creeping Crypt&r, &6Undead Crypt&r, &6Stray Fort&r, &6Illager Manor&r, illager hideout, &6Toxic Lair&r, jungle or desert ruins."
		""
		"These are real dungeons full of enemies. Go in pairs and take Return Scrolls along."
	]
	quest.628D4F8468034B1E.quest_subtitle: "The dungeons of Dungeons and Taverns."
	quest.628D4F8468034B1E.title: "&8Venture into a crypt"
	quest.628DE4AA5CA8B93C.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus the relay goes in the middle, plus &e2 essences&r of its element and &e2 diamonds&r on the pedestals:"
		"&cFiery Collector Relay&r: collector with Fire Essence."
		"&bFlow Splitter Relay&r: splitter with Water Essence."
		"&2Deep Depositor Relay&r: depositor with Earth Essence."
		""
		"The strengthened relays hold more Source and pass it on faster. Worth it anywhere many links or chambers hang on one relay."
	]
	quest.628DE4AA5CA8B93C.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: more storage, more throughput."
	quest.628DE4AA5CA8B93C.title: "&aStrengthen your relays"
	quest.628FF160699A8243.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_djinni_familiars.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Pentacle:&r Ihagan's Enthrallment. &eBat&r (night vision): golden carrot, spider eye, glowstone, lava, torch, sacrifice bat. &eBeholder&r (marks enemies): 4 spider eyes, 4 glowstone, sacrifice spider."
		"&eDevil&r (fire resistance): 2 magma, 2 bones, lava, sacrifice horse. &eFairy&r (protects other familiars): 2 golden apples, ghast tear, 3 gunpowder, milk, sacrifice horse."
		"&eChimera&r (mount), &eDragon&r (more XP), &eMummy&r (fights), &eCthulhu&r (water breathing), &eHeadless&r (damage against one mob type), &eDrikwing&r (multi jump). Ingredients in the Dictionary."
		""
		"When a familiar dies, a Soul Shard remains. With it you bring it back in Susje's Simple Circle."
	]
	quest.628FF160699A8243.quest_subtitle: "Ten familiars for Ihagan's Enthrallment."
	quest.628FF160699A8243.title: "&dSummon a Djinni familiar"
	quest.62905749AE2851D2.quest_desc: [
		"Like the pickaxe, only with a &6bow&r as catalyst."
		""
		"The bow is the step before the Draconic Bow from stage 5, the weapon against the Chaos Guardian. Projectile modules for damage, speed and accuracy already exist in the Wyvern tier."
	]
	quest.62905749AE2851D2.quest_subtitle: "With a normal bow in the core."
	quest.62905749AE2851D2.title: "&dFuse a Wyvern Bow"
	quest.6294F9AFC6525E6C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/alfheim_elementium_armor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Crafting table: Elementium Ingots in armor shape, &624 ingots&r for all four pieces."
		""
		"It protects like Manasteel and repairs itself with mana from your inventory. When you are hit, a &dfairy&r sometimes appears and attacks the attacker. The more pieces, the more often."
	]
	quest.6294F9AFC6525E6C.quest_subtitle: "Fairies fight for you."
	quest.6294F9AFC6525E6C.title: "&6Wear Elementium Armor"
	quest.62950DC046B44BE9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Arcane Essence&r on top, &6wooden shovel&r in the middle, &6iron ingot&r at the bottom give the &6Graybeard Staff&r."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/graybeard_staff.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"A staff is a casting tool: right click casts your active spell. On top it gives &e+10 percent spell power&r and &e+25 percent mana regeneration&r, in the main hand as in the offhand."
		""
		"The &6Artificer Cane&r (crimson planks, gold, amethyst) needs wood from the Nether: stage 2. The &6Ice Staff&r is assembled from parts scattered across the world; the Cryomancer knows more."
	]
	quest.62950DC046B44BE9.quest_subtitle: "A stick that casts spells."
	quest.62950DC046B44BE9.title: "&7Carve the Graybeard Staff"
	quest.62A8610585C22677.quest_desc: [
		"Like the pickaxe, only with a &6diamond sword&r as catalyst. Axe, shovel and hoe work the same with the matching diamond tool."
		""
		"With damage modules it is your weapon for the rest of stage 4."
	]
	quest.62A8610585C22677.quest_subtitle: "Same recipe, diamond sword in the core."
	quest.62A8610585C22677.title: "&dFuse a Wyvern Sword"
	quest.62A9CAE9B07D4D7E.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding."
		"&6Bowls:&r &e3 Otherworld Essence&r, a &6Spirit Attuned Gem&r."
		"&cStart:&r the worn chalk itself instead of a book. After a few seconds it is full again."
		""
		"Worth it above all for lime and purple chalk, whose ingredients are costly. White chalk is cheaper to make new."
	]
	quest.62A9CAE9B07D4D7E.quest_subtitle: "A Djinni fills it up again."
	quest.62A9CAE9B07D4D7E.title: "&6Repair your chalk"
	quest.62AB82D6E5AA08DF.quest_desc: [
		"In the cauldron with lava: &e5 iron ingots&r and &e3 iron nuggets&r. Out comes the &6Candle Dipper&r."
		""
		"Sneaking right click puts it on top of the cauldron. It has three places for one item each and dips it into the fluid below until the recipe is done."
	]
	quest.62AB82D6E5AA08DF.quest_subtitle: "Candle dipping like in the old days."
	quest.62AB82D6E5AA08DF.title: "&6Build a Candle Dipper"
	quest.62E55426A50447DF.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/food_f_cutting_board.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Two &6sticks&r on the left, four &6planks&r next to them on the right."
		""
		"Put an ingredient on it with right click and click it with the tool. Knife: cabbage becomes cabbage leaves, beef becomes minced beef, rice panicles become rice and straw. Axe: logs are stripped and give tree bark."
	]
	quest.62E55426A50447DF.quest_subtitle: "Get more out of every ingredient."
	quest.62E55426A50447DF.title: "&6Build a Cutting Board"
	quest.62F8F5885AD1E40B.quest_desc: [
		"On the pedestals: &6stone button&r, &6redstone&r, &6clock&r. Source Gem into the chamber, &d2,000 Source&r."
		""
		"The most versatile essence: Place Block, Interact, Rotate, Delay, the rune chalk and later many relays and rituals."
	]
	quest.62F8F5885AD1E40B.quest_subtitle: "Button, redstone, clock."
	quest.62F8F5885AD1E40B.title: "&dMake Manipulation Essence"
	quest.6302968036571E8A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sculkglanz&r leuchtet von allein, du findest ihn an den Wänden der Tiefenlande und im Hallenden Wald. Vier &6Düsterschiefer&r darum ergeben eine &6Düsterschieferlampe&r, die zur Welt hier unten passt."
		""
		"Im Steinschneider gibt es für Sculkgestein und Düsterschiefer je zwei Dutzend Formen. Wer in der Anderwelt baut, baut aus dem, was da ist."
	]
	quest.6302968036571E8A.quest_subtitle: "Vier Düsterschiefer um einen Sculkglanz."
	quest.6302968036571E8A.title: "&eBau eine Düsterschieferlampe"
	quest.630880A06D01CC32.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron Impetus&r: Impetus on the altar, &e6 iron ingots&r, &e4 gunpowder&r and &e1 Cthonic Gold&r on the stands, &e8 Earthen, Infernal, Aqueous&r each. Into the Crucible with &e2 Earthen&r and &e2 Infernal&r."
		""
		"Each run gives &ethree Iron Nodes&r, the Impetus loses 2 durability. You smelt nodes into nuggets. Copper, gold, lead, osmium and more have their own Impetus."
		""
		"&6Cthonic Gold&r is a rare ore deep in the deepslate, close to gold veins."
	]
	quest.630880A06D01CC32.quest_subtitle: "Ore without a pickaxe."
	quest.630880A06D01CC32.title: "&6Focus Iron Nodes"
	quest.630E48223DAFD0CA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Knife blueprint&r: one Blueprint Paper, one stick. Blade from &eone&r material, plus a rod."
		""
		"Fast, light, and it carves Template Boards on the stone anvil. Unlike the crude knife, it can be repaired."
	]
	quest.630E48223DAFD0CA.quest_subtitle: "Blade from one material."
	quest.630E48223DAFD0CA.title: "&7Build a knife"
	quest.6311295C04882C49.quest_desc: [
		"Four Gaia Spirits around a Terrasteel Ingot make the &dGaia Spirit Ingot&r. Offered to the beacon, it starts the &dRitual of Gaia II&r with a stronger Guardian."
		""
		"That one gives 10 spirits each, 16 for the last hit, plus runes, Manasteel, Mana Pearls, lotus blossoms and a &6Dice of Fate&r for one of the relics of the Aesir."
		""
		"&cComing in stage 5:&r Then the obelisk wants &e128 Gaia Spirit Ingots&r, and the techs need them for Awakened Draconium."
	]
	quest.6311295C04882C49.quest_subtitle: "What comes in stage 5."
	quest.6311295C04882C49.title: "&8Look at Gaia II"
	quest.631378BA5B40D647.quest_desc: [
		"&6Energy Battery:&r menril chunks, two menril blocks and a redstone block. &6Mechanical Squeezer:&r a Squeezer between two batteries, a diamond at the top, obsidian at the bottom. &6Mechanical Drying Basin:&r a basin between two batteries, obsidian at the top and bottom."
		""
		"No more jumping. The mechanical basin dries Menril Glass in 20 ticks in place of 200."
	]
	quest.631378BA5B40D647.quest_subtitle: "Squeezer and basin with power."
	quest.631378BA5B40D647.title: "&9Let machines do the pressing"
	quest.6313C6F87318E0DB.quest_desc: [
		"Bring &6Draconium Ingots&r and &6Elite Control Circuits&r to the obelisk and hand them in by hand. &e/kw goals&r shows the status."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The tech goal of stage 4 is &e1,000 Draconium Ingots&r and &e150 Elite Control Circuits&r. The magic pillar wants 128 Gaia Spirits and 30 Mystic Staffs."
		""
		"&eLine:&r mine with Fortune III, dust by hopper into furnaces or a smelter, ingots straight into the chest. Keep the end stone, the mages need it. Quarries in the End: chapter &6Quarries&r."
	]
	quest.6313C6F87318E0DB.quest_subtitle: "A thousand ingots for the tech pillar."
	quest.6313C6F87318E0DB.title: "&5&lBring Light of the Dragon to the Obelisk"
	quest.6324699F9751BF51.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Terrasteel Ingot&r in the middle, &64 Gaia Spirits&r at the top, bottom, left and right. Makes one &aGaia Spirit Ingot&r."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Every fusion for Awakened Draconium needs two of them, so eight Gaia Spirits. They come from the Gaia fights, ask the mages early."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stage 5 tech goal wants &e64 Awakened Draconium Blocks&r and antimatter pellets. The magic pillar itself wants 128 Gaia Spirit Ingots, so share fairly."
	]
	quest.6324699F9751BF51.quest_subtitle: "The botanists supply the dragon's metal."
	quest.6324699F9751BF51.title: "&5&lForge Two Gaia Spirit Ingots"
	quest.6328CD94686BFEBA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Copper Casing&r over &6dried kelp&r makes the &6Spout&r. Over a depot or belt it fills buckets, bottles and every &eFilling&r recipe from EMI."
		""
		"The &6Item Drain&r (iron bars over Copper Casing) empties items that land on it into the pipe. Other items pass through like a piece of belt."
	]
	quest.6328CD94686BFEBA.quest_subtitle: "Fluid into items and out again."
	quest.6328CD94686BFEBA.title: "&6Fill with the spout"
	quest.6330CD0C305AC1D5.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Apothecary Mortar&r is Catalyzing Gland, quartz block, Catalyzing Gland on top, quartz block, Catalyzing Gland, quartz block in the middle and three quartz blocks at the bottom. In it you grind two or three ingredients into a &6Potion Essence&r."
		""
		"Every ingredient carries passive effects. If two ingredients share an effect, it ends up in the essence: &6sugar&r (Speed, Haste) and &6gold nugget&r (Strength, Haste) give Haste."
		""
		"Brewing is done in the &6Apothecary Cauldron&r (Hexerei mixing cauldron with Reliquary parts): fire below, water in, essence and nether wart on top, bottle it with &6Condensed Potion Vials&r made from glass panes. Up to 3 redstone extend it, up to 2 glowstone strengthen it."
	]
	quest.6330CD0C305AC1D5.quest_subtitle: "Reliquary's own potions."
	quest.6330CD0C305AC1D5.title: "&dGrind a Potion Essence"
	quest.6339F26E1BC04DA9.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Compressed Iron, &6Eisenfalltür&r, Compressed Iron oben, &6Reinforced Brick Wall&r, &6Enderauge&r, &6Pressure Tube&r in der Mitte, drei &6Reinforced Stone Slabs&r unten."
		""
		"Der zweite Weg zum Spawner Core: Die Falle braucht &c-0,5 bar&r, Volume Upgrades helfen. Leg einen leeren oder halbvollen &6Spawner Core&r hinein und öffne die Klappe mit Shift-Rechtsklick oder Redstone. Jedes Monster, das hineingezogen wird, füllt den Core um 1 Prozent."
		""
		"&eSpawner Core selbst machen:&r Eine &6Spawner Core Shell&r (vier Compressed Iron, vier Pressure Chamber Glass, ein Smaragd) mit 4 000 mB flüssiger Erfahrung (Memory Essence) in der Thermopneumatic Processing Plant bei 3 bar."
		""
		"Mit 100 mB &6Memory Essence&r im Tank der Falle zählt jedes Monster 2 bis 4 Prozent, also 25 bis 50 statt 100. Spieler, Drohnen, Bosse, gezähmte Tiere und Monster aus Spawnern fängt sie nie. Gemischte Cores spawnen gemischt, also eine Falle pro Monsterart."
	]
	quest.6339F26E1BC04DA9.quest_subtitle: "Monster einsaugen, Essenz sammeln."
	quest.6339F26E1BC04DA9.title: "&2Bau eine Vacuum Trap"
	quest.634227EE9AA2F8EC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Monorail Track&r is made by sequenced assembly: a &6Metal Girder&r onto the belt, a deployer adds a &6Metal Bracket&r, one an &6iron sheet&r, a press presses, six tracks per girder. A monorail bogey of its own runs on it, which you click onto the track with the Train Casing as usual. The rail can also hang above the train."
		""
		"&6Phantom Tracks&r (phantom membrane, iron, 32 per membrane) are invisible as long as you do not hold one, and fit any gauge. &6Ender Tracks&r from end stone brick slabs come with the End in stage 4. &6Tracks without sleepers&r exist for bridges made of metal girders."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Right clicking a track with a slab puts it underneath as cladding. Snow and moss work too."
	]
	quest.634227EE9AA2F8EC.quest_subtitle: "Monorail, Ender Track, Phantom Track."
	quest.634227EE9AA2F8EC.title: "&6Lay a Monorail"
	quest.63461E2902C31DC7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Medium Fluid Tank:&r Plastic Sheet, &6Small Tank&r, Plastic Sheet oben, Gold, Pressure Tube, Gold in der Mitte, Plastic Sheet, Small Tank, Plastic Sheet unten, &e64 000 mB&r. &6Large Fluid Tank:&r dasselbe mit zwei Medium Tanks, zwei Diamanten und einem &6Advanced Pressure Tube&r, &e128 000 mB&r."
		""
		"Der &6Huge Fluid Tank&r aus Large Tanks, Netherit und einem Reinforced Air Canister fasst 512 000 mB."
		""
		"Rechtsklick mit dem Wrench verbindet Tanks übereinander. Flüssigkeit fließt dann nach unten: oben hinein pumpen, unten heraus."
	]
	quest.63461E2902C31DC7.quest_subtitle: "128 Eimer, stapelbar."
	quest.63461E2902C31DC7.title: "&9Bau einen Large Fluid Tank"
	quest.63464378907BF306.quest_desc: [
		"&6Primitiver Heizgenerator:&r Bruchstein in die Ecken, Gold oben, Eisengitter an den Seiten, Ofen unten, das Pity-Maschinengehäuse in die Mitte. Der &6Biokraftstoffgenerator&r braucht Biokraftstoff aus dem Bioreaktor."
		""
		"&eIndustrial Foregoing, Primitiver Heizgenerator:&r Brennstoff alles Brennbare, &d30 FE/t&r, Puffer 100 000, Abgabe 1 000 FE/t. &eBiokraftstoffgenerator:&r &d160 FE/t&r aus Biokraftstoff (Tank 4 000 mB), Puffer 1 Million, hört auf, wenn er voll ist. Offen ab Stufe 3, siehe Kapitel &6Industrial Foregoing&r."
	]
	quest.63464378907BF306.quest_subtitle: "Industrial Foregoing: 30 FE/t aus Kohle, 160 FE/t aus Biokraftstoff."
	quest.63464378907BF306.title: "&aHeiz den Primitiven Heizgenerator"
	quest.6349AFD22B005B3E.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r ein &6Network IO Port&r oben, Transistor, &6GPS Tool&r, Transistor in der Mitte, Transistor, &6Network Data Storage&r, Transistor unten."
		""
		"Schleichend Rechtsklick öffnet den Editor: Knöpfe, Häkchen und Auswahllisten ziehst du wie Puzzleteile hinein, jedes setzt eine &eglobale Variable&r. Drohnen lesen diese Variablen in ihren Programmen."
		""
		"&eKabelloses Redstone:&r Ein Universal Sensor mit Dispenser Upgrade und der Einstellung World, Global Variable gibt ein Signal, sobald dein Häkchen auf der Fernbedienung gesetzt ist. Egal, wo du gerade stehst."
	]
	quest.6349AFD22B005B3E.quest_subtitle: "Eigene Knöpfe, kabelloses Redstone."
	quest.6349AFD22B005B3E.title: "&3Bau dir eine Fernbedienung"
	quest.634B43CE28194F31.quest_desc: [
		"&dObliterate&r: &6Manipulation Essence&r, &6anvil&r, &6diamond block&r. &dSuperheat&r: &e3 Fire Essences&r, &6blaze rod&r, &6blaze cake&r."
		""
		"Obliterate strikes with an arcane hammer, with Sensitive it processes items like crushing wheels. Superheat turns Fuse into superheated mixing. A spell turret above a Create depot is a small factory."
	]
	quest.634B43CE28194F31.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: the master glyphs for Create."
	quest.634B43CE28194F31.title: "&dLearn Obliterate and Superheat"
	quest.63512703AA48FD9F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r plank, &6honey bottle&r, plank in a row give &e4 Bee Cages&r. Right clicking a bee catches it, right clicking the ground releases it again."
		""
		"If you place the bee on a hive or nest while sneaking, that becomes its home. If you place it on a matching flower block, it remembers that as its flower."
		""
		"Always take a few empty cages along. Every bee in this chapter starts with you catching it somewhere in the world."
	]
	quest.63512703AA48FD9F.quest_subtitle: "Right click the bee, right click the ground."
	quest.63512703AA48FD9F.title: "&6Catch Bees in Cages"
	quest.6380FEA350AEE3A4.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6Hardened Blood Shards&r around a &6Dark Power Gem&r give the &6Blood Infusion Core&r. Every machine of this chapter has one in the middle: infuser, purifier, Spirit Furnace, pedestal accessories and pendants."
		""
		"{image:evilcraft:textures/item/blood_infusion_core.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The simplest machine with a core is the &6Blood Chest&r: eight planks around it. Tools inside bathe in blood and repair themselves, 5 mB per durability point. Very rarely they catch a &cCurse of Breaking&r doing so, which the purifier removes again later."
	]
	quest.6380FEA350AEE3A4.quest_subtitle: "The heart of every blood machine."
	quest.6380FEA350AEE3A4.title: "&4Build a Blood Infusion Core"
	quest.6381268075777268.quest_desc: [
		"Same table, new book in hand. Every tier 2 glyph costs &e55 experience points&r, about &e5 levels&r, plus its ingredients."
		""
		"The big new things are the augments: AOE, Pierce, Extend Time, Dampen, Fortune, Extract. They turn your old spells into tools. Many recipes want Nether ingredients; plan a trip together."
	]
	quest.6381268075777268.quest_subtitle: "55 experience points per glyph."
	quest.6381268075777268.title: "&dLearn what tier 2 costs"
	quest.6388E371270BCADB.quest_desc: [
		"A &6lead ingot&r and an &6iron ingot&r, shapeless: &etwo Pewter Blend&r. In a furnace they become ingots."
		""
		"Any lead counts: from Eidolon, Mekanism or the mining dimension. Almost every device of the mod is made of Pewter."
	]
	quest.6388E371270BCADB.quest_subtitle: "A metal that does not disturb magic."
	quest.6388E371270BCADB.title: "&7Smelt Pewter"
	quest.6388EBBAA83F340C.quest_desc: [
		"Stage 3 opens the &5Mekanism: Advanced&r chapter: Advanced Control Circuit (with printed silicon from AE2), teleporter, Digital Miner, Industrial Turbine, thermal evaporation and the advanced tier."
		""
		"The stage 3 goal wants steel, Advanced Control Circuits and Steel Cores. Every steel line running now gets the server there."
	]
	quest.6388EBBAA83F340C.quest_subtitle: "What waits behind the steel goal."
	quest.6388EBBAA83F340C.title: "&dLook ahead to stage 3"
	quest.639BCA7E03871F3A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Laser Drill:&r Simple, 1,000 FE per operation. Ore and Fluid Laser Base: Advanced, no power of their own."
		"&6Washing Factory:&r Advanced, 60 FE/t. &6Fermentation Station:&r Simple, 40 FE/t. &6Fluid Sieving Machine:&r Advanced, 40 FE/t."
		"&6Block Breaker, Block Placer, Fluid Collector, Fluid Placer, Water Condensator:&r Pity, 1,000 FE per operation each."
		"&6Resourceful Furnace:&r Pity, 40 FE/t, three furnaces in one, 2 mB of Essence per item. &6Spores Recreator:&r Pity, 40 FE/t."
	]
	quest.639BCA7E03871F3A.quest_subtitle: "Ore, fluids and blocks, with power use."
	quest.639BCA7E03871F3A.title: "&6&lCheck Off the Resource Machines"
	quest.639D8F237FAFF578.quest_desc: [
		"At the top &6iron, Mercury, iron&r. Middle &6gold, quartz block, gold&r. At the bottom &6iron, gold, iron&r."
		""
		"Click it with shards. It slowly turns them into &bMercury Flux&r, the sides get bluer the fuller it is. A redstone signal stops the output."
	]
	quest.639D8F237FAFF578.quest_subtitle: "Shards become flux."
	quest.639D8F237FAFF578.title: "&bBuild a Mercury Catalyst"
	quest.639F097D0FD8C0CE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_connectors.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Immersive Engineering&r, &6Kupferdraht&r (NS): &e2 048 RF/t&r, 16 Blöcke je Spanne, &6Elektrumdraht&r (MS): 8 192 RF/t, 16 Blöcke, &6Stahldraht&r (HS): &e32 768 RF/t&r, 32 Blöcke. Ein &6Verbinder&r nimmt nur 256, 1 024 oder 4 096 RF/t an, &6Relais&r reichen weiter. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Drahtspule in der Hand, ersten Verbinder anklicken, zweiten anklicken. Drähte zerreißen, wenn ein Block in ihrem Weg steht, und Berühren tut weh. Siehe Kapitel Immersive Engineering."
	]
	quest.639F097D0FD8C0CE.quest_subtitle: "Immersive Engineering, Drähte: 2 048, 8 192 oder 32 768 RF pro Tick über Land."
	quest.639F097D0FD8C0CE.title: "Lies: IE-Drähte"
	quest.63A10BD536201FFA.quest_desc: [
		"Crafter recipe with copper spools, capacitors, brass casing, brass sheets and an Electron Tube. It charges items on a depot or belt below with FE."
		""
		"A &6gold ingot&r becomes an &6electrum ingot&r with 36,000 FE. A Blaze Burner with a &6straw&r (paper or bamboo in the rolling mill) burns liquid fuels."
	]
	quest.63A10BD536201FFA.quest_subtitle: "Power for items on the belt."
	quest.63A10BD536201FFA.title: "&6Charge items with the Tesla Coil"
	quest.63AA05EB7525A6BD.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6quartz&r on top, &6gold nugget&r, &6Blank Upgrade&r, gold nugget in the middle, a &6redstone&r at the bottom."
		""
		"A router with this upgrade can only be opened by you and the players you add: right clicking a fellow player with the upgrade adds them, sneak and right click removes them, up to six per upgrade."
		""
		"&eImportant for claims:&r Breaker, placer and activator otherwise work as a fake player called &e[Modular Routers]&r. With the upgrade they work as you and may do everything in your claim that you may. An activator in attack mode spares added players."
		""
		"The &6Camouflage Upgrade&r (Blank Upgrade, red, green and blue dye) makes the router look like another block: sneak and right click the block to store it."
	]
	quest.63AA05EB7525A6BD.quest_subtitle: "The Security Upgrade, important on the server."
	quest.63AA05EB7525A6BD.title: "&6Secure Your Router"
	quest.63B10CA4D84A81C8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cobblestone&r in the corners, a &6gold ingot&r at the top, &6iron bars&r left and right, a &6furnace&r at the bottom, the Pity Frame in the middle."
		""
		"It burns anything that burns in a furnace for &d30 FE/t&r, buffer 100,000 FE. It keeps burning even when the buffer is full. It is enough to start with, later the Biofuel Generator replaces it."
	]
	quest.63B10CA4D84A81C8.quest_subtitle: "30 FE/t from coal, nothing more."
	quest.63B10CA4D84A81C8.title: "&cSet Up a Pitiful Generator"
	quest.63B98263B476A026.quest_desc: [
		"Under swamps lie &6selenite geodes&r. Break the clusters off, then you get &6Selenite Shards&r."
		""
		"Selenite becomes a base for candles and is in the netherite tip for brooms."
	]
	quest.63B98263B476A026.quest_subtitle: "Crystals under the swamp."
	quest.63B98263B476A026.title: "&6Break off selenite"
	quest.63BA9FC9153E9BD5.quest_desc: [
		"A tool without durability stays in your inventory as &ebroken&r. Parts, enchantments and materials stay."
		""
		"Repairs are done with a &6Repair Kit&r. The anvil with the head material works too, but costs levels and is only half as effective."
	]
	quest.63BA9FC9153E9BD5.quest_subtitle: "Broken here means: repair."
	quest.63BA9FC9153E9BD5.title: "&7Repair instead of throwing away"
	quest.63BE3A31ADD1CC1F.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 saplings&r, &e1 wheat&r, catalysts Water and Fire. &d8,000 mana&r."
		""
		"For Jaded Amaranthus, Agricarnation, Fallen Kanade, the Benevolent Goddess' Charm and the Terrasteel Helmet."
	]
	quest.63BE3A31ADD1CC1F.quest_subtitle: "Water and fire make growth."
	quest.63BE3A31ADD1CC1F.title: "&aMake the Rune of Spring"
	quest.63BFED27B04021F4.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Livingwood logs&r on top of each other make a &6Livingwood Twig&r."
		""
		"Twigs go into the Wand of the Forest (3), the Livingwood Bow (3), every Manasteel tool and two of them into every Manasteel ritual."
	]
	quest.63BFED27B04021F4.quest_subtitle: "Two logs, one twig."
	quest.63BFED27B04021F4.title: "&6Carve Livingwood Twigs"
	quest.63E6076D33EED03F.quest_desc: [
		"A &6magnet&r in your pocket, a &6collector&r at the first farm, a &6trash can&r at the storage, the base claimed and a waypoint set. With that you are faster than most who start here."
		""
		"What comes now is in the big chapters: Create, Ars Nouveau, Botania, storage. And if you forget how something works: &eR&r in EMI."
	]
	quest.63E6076D33EED03F.quest_subtitle: "Magnet, collector, trash can, claim."
	quest.63E6076D33EED03F.title: "&6&lAll Set Up"
	quest.63E9606ACC59DBDA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eternal_starlight_desert.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Mine crystal clusters in the &6Crystallized Desert&r and collect &616 Blue Starlight Crystal Shards&r. They become new Orbs of Prophecy."
		""
		"&eBelow the desert&r &6Crystallized Moths&r hunt with sound waves that no shield stops. With enough meat you can tame them."
	]
	quest.63E9606ACC59DBDA.quest_subtitle: "Blue and red Starlight crystals."
	quest.63E9606ACC59DBDA.title: "&bLoot the Crystal Desert"
	quest.63F2A47571A71948.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r an &6ender pearl&r top middle, an &6obsidian&r below it, three &6obsidian&r at the bottom. A &6Basic Collector&r from Item Collectors."
		""
		"Place it directly on a chest, barrel or machine. It picks up everything lying in its area and puts it into the block it is attached to. In the window you set the range, up to &e5 blocks&r in every direction, separately for each axis."
		""
		"Under a chicken farm, next to the sugar cane with an observer or behind a Create drill it saves you a whole floor of hoppers."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r The &6Advanced Collector&r (eye of ender, collector, three obsidian) reaches 7 blocks and has a filter. It opens with &estage 2&r."
	]
	quest.63F2A47571A71948.quest_subtitle: "What drops lands in the chest."
	quest.63F2A47571A71948.title: "&aPut a Collector at the Farm"
	quest.63FDA154B0A4BBDF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Corrupti Dust&r (Obsidiansteel Ingot, blaze powder, nether wart, Arcane Crystal Dust and an Ender Pearl Fragment shapeless, gives four) on a &6Lost Soul&r makes a &6Corrupt Lost Soul&r, which drops a &6Corrupt Soul&r. Right click an &6oak sapling&r or &6dead bush&r with it: &6Growing Edelwood&r."
		""
		"At light level 9 it grows into a gnarled trunk of 2 to 4 &6Edelwood Logs&r with a carved face on top, bone meal helps with 45 percent. The branches give &6Edelwood Sticks&r. One log gives only &e2 Edelwood Planks&r. The Wandering Trader also sells Growing Edelwood for 6 emeralds."
		""
		"&eQuirks:&r A log in the rain fills with water. Now and then a log becomes oily, then a glass bottle gives &6Edelwood Oil&r (two black dyes). The &6Edelwood Bucket&r from five planks holds &e4 buckets&r, but with lava it eventually chars in your pocket."
	]
	quest.63FDA154B0A4BBDF.quest_subtitle: "A tree from a corrupted soul."
	quest.63FDA154B0A4BBDF.title: "&2Grow Edelwood"
	quest.63FFA1520C119810.quest_desc: [
		"&6Aurora Deer:&r steak, leather. Steered against stone, it loses its antlers."
		"&6Yeti:&r White Yeti Fur (with shears too), string."
		"&6Ratlin:&r Ratlin Meat, leather, Cave Moss. &6Shadow Snail:&r meat, shell."
		"&6Ent:&r Lunar Berries. &6Crystallized Moth:&r crystal shards, Shivering Gel."
		"&6Rookfish:&r Rookfish, Air Sac. &6Luminofish&r and &6Luminaris:&r themselves."
		"&6Twilight Gaze:&r Seeking Eye, bone meal."
	]
	quest.63FFA1520C119810.quest_subtitle: "Every animal with its loot."
	quest.63FFA1520C119810.title: "&aChecklist: Animals"
	quest.6406994A9FBB1145.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_power_mek_heat.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r drei Eisen oben, Bretter links und rechts vom Osmiumbarren, unten Kupfer, Ofen, Kupfer. Leg Kohle hinein oder stell ihn in ein Lavabecken, am besten beides."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Wärmegenerator:&r Brennstoff alles Brennbare, &d80 FE/t&r aktiv. Jede angrenzende Lavaseite &d12 FE/t&r dazu, bis sieben Seiten, im Nether noch einmal 40 FE/t obendrauf. Ein Lavaeimer im Tank (24 000 mB) wird dagegen verbraucht. Puffer klein, Abgabe an alle Nachbarn. Offen ab Stufe 2, siehe Kapitel &6Mekanism&r."
	]
	quest.6406994A9FBB1145.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, 80 FE/t aus Brennstoff plus 12 FE/t je Lavaseite."
	quest.6406994A9FBB1145.title: "&6Stell einen Wärmegenerator in Lava"
	quest.6416C10E6A9873E6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_power_nc_passive.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Die &6Solarzellen&r brauchen Himmel über sich, die &6RTGs&r nur einen Platz und ein Kabel. Beide laufen, bis du sie abbaust. RTGs strahlen, also Geigerzähler und Abstand."
		""
		"&eNuclearCraft, Solarzellen:&r Basic &d28 FE/t&r, Advanced 112, DU 448, Elite &d1 792 FE/t&r, nur bei Tag. &eRTGs:&r Uran &d112 FE/t&r, Americium 448, Plutonium 1 792, Californium &d4 096 FE/t&r, Tag und Nacht, ohne Brennstoff und ohne Kühlung. Americium, Plutonium und Californium kommen aus abgebranntem Brennstoff. &eBatterien:&r Lithium-Ionen-Batterien in vier Stufen als Puffer. Offen ab Stufe 4, siehe Kapitel &6NuclearCraft&r."
	]
	quest.6416C10E6A9873E6.quest_subtitle: "NuclearCraft: 28 bis 1 792 FE/t Sonne, 112 bis 4 096 FE/t RTG, für immer."
	quest.6416C10E6A9873E6.title: "&aLeg Solarzellen und RTGs"
	quest.641773C1B4BF6436.quest_desc: [
		"A crafting CPU as a multiblock, at most &e7 by 7 by 7&r on this server. Outside &6Quantum Computer Structural Glass&r, inside the &6core&r, units, storage, accelerators."
		""
		"Each accelerator brings 8 threads. A Multi-Threader quadruples them, a Data Entangler the storage, one each per computer. The parts need singularities from Advanced AE's Reaction Chamber."
	]
	quest.641773C1B4BF6436.quest_subtitle: "Advanced AE for huge orders."
	quest.641773C1B4BF6436.title: "&dBuild the Quantum Computer"
	quest.6419F71C4889F09D.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6Primogel Goo&r in the middle, four &6blaze powder&r in the corners, &6redstone&r on top and bottom, &6nether wart&r left and right."
		""
		"&6Blazebloom Goo&r can do everything Primogel can, only faster, and on top of that convert gold blocks and Primal Coal blocks. It is woken with &6nether wart&r or &6blaze powder&r, sugar is no longer enough here."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Build several goo blocks. Each works on six sides, and a dozen in a row is already a small factory."
	]
	quest.6419F71C4889F09D.quest_subtitle: "The goo learns the Nether."
	quest.6419F71C4889F09D.title: "&6Make Blazebloom Goo"
	quest.6435C45B65BED305.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &6Manipulation Essence&r, &6crafting table&r, &6chest&r, &6block of iron&r."
		""
		"Packs identical items on the ground into their 2x2 recipe, like snowballs into snow. The only Ars Technica glyph already open in stage 1. The rest comes with brass in stage 2."
	]
	quest.6435C45B65BED305.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: pack items by spell."
	quest.6435C45B65BED305.title: "&dLearn Pack"
	quest.643B11C0E766D30A.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Dead King&r sits in the throne room of the catacombs. A right click or a hit on the corpse wakes him, and then there is no way back. Come with friends, a full robe, healing spells and food."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r &e28 to 45 Arcane Essence&r (more with Looting), a &6Bone Key&r for every player in the fight, and with luck the &6Blood Staff&r or the &6Necronomicon&r, a unique book full of dark spells."
		""
		"The Bone Key opens the &6Bone Vaults&r of the catacombs: rings, Arcane Cloth, Arcane Ingots, high level scrolls, runestones, three vials of rare ink (Rare to Legendary, keep them for later), Blood Vials and shards of his phylactery, with which the king can be woken again later."
	]
	quest.643B11C0E766D30A.quest_subtitle: "The boss of the catacombs."
	quest.643B11C0E766D30A.title: "&4&lWake the Dead King"
	quest.643C0E6DCEB9CE59.quest_desc: [
		"A &6piston&r on top, &6two iron ingots&r next to the upgrade base, at the bottom &6redstone&r, a &6wooden chest&r and &6redstone&r."
		""
		"Backpack in hand, &esneaking right click&r on a chest, barrel or drawer, and the matching items move in. In the filter you set that only items already there are deposited."
	]
	quest.643C0E6DCEB9CE59.quest_subtitle: "One click, and the backpack is empty."
	quest.643C0E6DCEB9CE59.title: "Build a Deposit Upgrade"
	quest.644F132204954F2F.quest_desc: [
		"Affix-Beute fällt von Monstern und liegt in Truhen. Trag vier Affix-Rüstungsteile und eine Affix-Waffe, dann öffnet die Weltstufe &6Frontier&r mit mehr Uncommon und Rare."
		""
		"Rare: zwei Attributboni, ein Effekt, bis zu zwei Sockel für Edelsteine, 10 bis 25 Prozent weniger Verschleiß. Kapitel &6Apotheosis&r."
	]
	quest.644F132204954F2F.quest_subtitle: "Apotheosis: Affixe auf Waffe und Rüstung."
	quest.644F132204954F2F.title: "&9Trag ein Rare-Item"
	quest.64547D1594DE8445.quest_desc: [
		"First the Wyvern module: Draconium Ingots in the corners, &6netherite scrap&r at the top and bottom, redstone left and right, a Module Core in the middle. Then: netherite ingots in the corners, Draconium Core at the top, Wyvern Core at the bottom, Awakened ingots left and right, the Wyvern module in the middle."
		""
		"It recharges the shield &e2.5 times&r as fast as the Wyvern module. In the fight it is not only how big the shield is that counts, but how fast it comes back."
	]
	quest.64547D1594DE8445.quest_subtitle: "The shield comes back faster."
	quest.64547D1594DE8445.title: "&dBuild a Draconic Shield Recovery Module"
	quest.6457126D31A12BB2.quest_desc: [
		"Light a &cfire&r on &8bedrock&r in the Overworld and let it burn out. Afterwards &6Grains of Infinity&r lie there: an 80 percent chance of one to three, and sometimes a &6Suspicious Seed&r too."
		""
		"On &8deepslate&r there is a 40 percent chance of one grain, then the block turns into cobblestone. Bedrock stays, so you can light it again and again."
		""
		"&5Ender IO&r opens with stage 3: alloys, conduits in one block and machines with a soul. Almost every part needs these grains."
	]
	quest.6457126D31A12BB2.quest_subtitle: "Grains of Infinity from a fire."
	quest.6457126D31A12BB2.title: "&5&lSet Bedrock on Fire"
	quest.6465AA2E36E8285F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eternal_starlight_starfire.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put &6seeds&r into a nest of the &6Starfire Birds&r. The nests sit in the crowns of Lunar trees. The birds reward you, among other things with &6Starfire&r."
		""
		"You throw Starfire as a weapon, use it to upgrade Thermal Springstone gear, and thrown on Twilight Sand it creates &6Raw Flowglaze&r."
	]
	quest.6465AA2E36E8285F.quest_subtitle: "A gift from the Starfire Birds."
	quest.6465AA2E36E8285F.title: "&6Get Starfire"
	quest.64678BB9594470CA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Impure White Chalk&r, &e1 end stone dust&r and &e2 obsidian dust&r shapeless, then into Spiritfire. Your Crusher makes both dusts."
		""
		"Purple binds spirits into items. The first pentacle for that is Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion."
	]
	quest.64678BB9594470CA.quest_subtitle: "The chalk of binding."
	quest.64678BB9594470CA.title: "&5Mix purple chalk"
	quest.646839758B334A0F.quest_desc: [
		"An &6emerald&r on top, &6book, ender pearl, book&r in the middle, three &6Blazegold Ingots&r at the bottom."
		""
		"With &e+&r and &e-&r you push levels into the block and back, with Shift ten at once, with Ctrl all. Mined, it keeps the experience."
		""
		"It can also hold you at a fixed level within its area, for example always at &e30&r at the enchanting table, and collect experience orbs nearby. As a tank it gives out experience as &6XP Fluid&r, 20 mB per point."
	]
	quest.646839758B334A0F.quest_subtitle: "The Experience Holder."
	quest.646839758B334A0F.title: "&aStore Your Experience"
	quest.648CAB31EAF1E136.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Machine Frame&r from RFTools Base (steel, blue dye, gold nuggets), plus a &6Logic Processor&r from AE2, repeater, redstone, iron and gold: the &6Controller&r."
		""
		"It has &e8 channels&r, each of the type &6Item&r, &6Fluid&r, &6Energy&r or &6Logic&r. In the channel you set which blocks give and which receive. Power: 1 RF/t per active channel, one cable from the grid is enough."
	]
	quest.648CAB31EAF1E136.quest_subtitle: "One block that controls everything."
	quest.648CAB31EAF1E136.title: "&eBuild an XNet Controller"
	quest.648CD1C6DC37B626.quest_desc: [
		"Check off each ore once. The world goes from &eY -64&r to &eY 127&r."
		""
		"&6Coal:&r Y 0 to 127, very common."
		"&6Iron:&r Y 63 to 127, most at the top below the ceiling."
		"&6Gold:&r Y 95 to 127. &6Diamond:&r Y 111 to 127, at the very top."
		"&6Cloggrum:&r Y -64 to 64, most at the bottom. &6Froststeel:&r the same, only in Shiverstone."
		"&6Utherium:&r Y -64 to 32. &6Regalium:&r Y 0 to 12."
		"&6Rogdorium:&r Y -64 to 0, only in the Dreadrock of the Depths."
	]
	quest.648CD1C6DC37B626.quest_subtitle: "Every ore of the Undergarden with its height."
	quest.648CD1C6DC37B626.title: "&7&lChecklist: Ores"
	quest.64A9D9DF0207F477.quest_desc: [
		"&6PneumaticCraft&r, &6Logistikmodul&r auf einem Druckrohr: holt und liefert zwischen Inventaren mit &6Logistikrahmen&r (Anbieter, Anforderer, Lager) und braucht dafür Luftdruck aus dem Rohr. Filter in jedem Rahmen. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"&eStufe 3:&r Die &6Logistikdrohne&r macht dasselbe fliegend in einem Bereich von &e31 x 31 x 31&r Blöcken, die programmierbare &6Drohne&r alles, was du ihr beibringst. &eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Jede Drohne braucht ein Präzisionsgetriebe von Create."
	]
	quest.64A9D9DF0207F477.quest_subtitle: "PneumaticCraft, Logistikmodul: bewegt mit Druckluft, Drohnen fliegen."
	quest.64A9D9DF0207F477.title: "Lies: Logistikmodule und Drohnen"
	quest.64BF437F7D5CB56E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/start_here_m_ritual.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"One Gold Leaf gives 2 &6Gold Powder&r. Lay &e16&r of it as a ring around an empty spot, as the book shows. Around the outside up to 8 &6Wooden Stands&r (Gold Leaf on a log)."
		""
		"The ingredients go on the stands, a &6sapling&r in the middle. When it grows (bone meal helps), the ritual eats the tree and the ingredients and leaves the result behind. Every recipe needs the right kind of sapling."
	]
	quest.64BF437F7D5CB56E.quest_subtitle: "Gold powder in a circle, stands around it."
	quest.64BF437F7D5CB56E.title: "&aPrepare the Ritual of the Forest"
	quest.64C1BBBCE0E6C548.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Golden Parachute&r aus dem Begrüßungsgeschenk hält &e20 Stürze&r. Lass ihn im Inventar: Sobald du von einer Insel fällst, öffnet er sich allein und trägt dich sanft zur Oberwelt hinunter."
		""
		"Verloren? Einen neuen gibt es aus &6Golden Aerclouds&r, oder du baust den einfachen &6Cold Parachute&r, siehe Abschnitt Aerwolken."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Bau Brücken aus Holystone zwischen den Inseln, statt zu springen. Quicksoil am Inselrand ist rutschig und schiebt dich über die Kante."
	]
	quest.64C1BBBCE0E6C548.quest_subtitle: "Er rettet dich, wenn du über den Rand gehst."
	quest.64C1BBBCE0E6C548.title: "&fBehalte den Fallschirm"
	quest.64CF6ED701DD6F34.quest_desc: [
		"Search &6dungeons, mineshafts, desert temples, outposts, mansions and ruined portals&r. In each of those chests there is a 1 percent chance of a &6Rotten Spell Book&r, in the sarcophagi of the catacombs 15 percent."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/rotten_spell_book.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"It has &e8 slots&r and &e+100 mana&r, more than any book you can build in stage 1. In return you take 15 percent more damage from spells."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A Rotten Spell Book, a honey bottle, a spore blossom, an amethyst cluster, a glow ink sac and two Arcane Cloth give the &6Druidic Tome&r with 10 slots and 10 percent more nature spell power."
	]
	quest.64CF6ED701DD6F34.quest_subtitle: "Old, moldy, and better than anything from stage 1."
	quest.64CF6ED701DD6F34.title: "&2Find a Rotten Spell Book"
	quest.64D80DC38DB41433.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &62 Dragonstones&r, &63 Mana Infused String&r, &61 Livingwood Twig&r. That makes the &6Crystal Bow&r."
		""
		"It conjures arrows from mana as if with Infinity and repairs itself with mana."
	]
	quest.64D80DC38DB41433.quest_subtitle: "Arrows made of mana."
	quest.64D80DC38DB41433.title: "&dString the Crystal Bow"
	quest.64E5F1C5F5143A66.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crystalline Bee&r and &6Ashy Mining Bee&r. Flower: iron block, iron ore, iron bars or hopper. The comb gives &6raw iron&r with 40 percent. The Iron Bee is the parent of zinc, osmium, lead, nickel, silver and steel."
	]
	quest.64E5F1C5F5143A66.quest_subtitle: "Raw iron from combs."
	quest.64E5F1C5F5143A66.title: "&7Breed the Iron Bee"
	quest.64E7C69711777B4B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Plate Advanced&r in the corners, a &6motor&r at the top, &6actuators&r left and right, a &6chassis&r in the middle, &6Tough Alloy&r at the bottom."
		""
		"Four &6diorite&r become two zirconium dust, plus fluorite and carobbiite. &6Andesite&r gives beryllium and arsenic."
	]
	quest.64E7C69711777B4B.quest_subtitle: "Zirconium, beryllium and arsenic from rock."
	quest.64E7C69711777B4B.title: "&7Build a Rock Crusher"
	quest.64F9FC809CBDD296.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6copper ingots&r: two at the top corners, two below each other in the middle underneath. The &6Wrench&r from Supplementaries."
		""
		"&eRight click&r on a block turns it. Stairs, logs, chests, hoppers: everything that has a direction. Especially when building and on hopper chains that saves a lot of mining and placing again."
		""
		"You still need Create's &6Wrench&r for Create blocks. Both next to each other in the hotbar do no harm."
	]
	quest.64F9FC809CBDD296.quest_subtitle: "Stairs the wrong way round? Do not mine them."
	quest.64F9FC809CBDD296.title: "&7Turn Blocks with the Wrench"
	quest.64FC687CF1937154.quest_desc: [
		"Water wheel, shafts and cogwheels drive millstone, press and mixer. In stage 1 it goes up to andesite, and that is exactly what fills the tech pillar."
	]
	quest.64FC687CF1937154.quest_subtitle: "Rotation, belts, Andesite Alloy."
	quest.64FC687CF1937154.title: "&6Open Create"
	quest.650E8BE4CF695A97.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r oben drei &6Eisenbarren&r, in der Mitte Terrakotta, &6Wassereimer&r, Terrakotta, unten drei Terrakotta. Das &6Spülbecken&r liefert unendlich Wasser: Rechtsklick mit einem Eimer oder einer Glasflasche füllt sie, und der Kochtisch nimmt Wasser für alle Rezepte, die welches brauchen."
		""
		"Ohne Spülbecken müsstest du für jeden Kuchen und jede Suppe einen Eimer schleppen. Mit ihr ist Wasser in der Küche einfach da."
	]
	quest.650E8BE4CF695A97.quest_subtitle: "Wasser ohne Ende."
	quest.650E8BE4CF695A97.title: "&6Bau ein Spülbecken"
	quest.65112CE2572657C6.quest_desc: [
		"Die &8Tiefe Dunkelheit&r liegt tief unter Bergen, meist unter &eY 0&r. Du erkennst sie am dunkelblauen &6Sculk&r auf dem Boden, an den zuckenden &6Sculk-Sensoren&r und daran, dass hier nichts spawnt."
		""
		"&eSo bewegst du dich:&r Sensoren hören jeden Schritt, jeden Block, jede Truhe. Geh &6schleichend&r, lauf auf &6Wolle&r und bau keine Blöcke ab, die du nicht brauchst. Ein Wollblock vor einem Sensor schluckt die Schwingung."
		""
		"Das ist der Einstieg in dieses Kapitel: Aus der Tiefen Dunkelheit kommt alles, was du für den Weg in die &5Anderwelt&r brauchst."
	]
	quest.65112CE2572657C6.quest_subtitle: "Wo kein Monster spawnt und trotzdem alles still ist."
	quest.65112CE2572657C6.title: "&8&lFinde die Tiefe Dunkelheit"
	quest.65140A8B6C58771A.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the crafting table window hover over a stack of \"},{\"text\":\"ingots\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" and press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.craftingtweaks.compress_stack\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Tweaks\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" compresses it into blocks. \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.craftingtweaks.compress_one\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" compresses only one block, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.craftingtweaks.compress_all\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" everything of that kind.\"}]"
		""
		"[\"\",{\"keybind\":\"key.craftingtweaks.refill_last_stack\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" fills the grid again with the last recipe, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.craftingtweaks.refill_last\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" only once. Handy when you make the same thing thirty times.\"}]"
	]
	quest.65140A8B6C58771A.quest_subtitle: "Crafting Tweaks: compress and refill."
	quest.65140A8B6C58771A.title: "&7Compress Ingots with One Key"
	quest.6531D5799455DC28.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Soul Chains&r in the corners, four &6Soularium Ingots&r on the sides, a &6Nether quartz&r in the middle. Soul Chain: one Soularium, two Soularium nuggets, two quartz dust, gives two."
		""
		"Slice'N'Splice, Soul Binder, Soul Engine and XP Obelisk need one each."
	]
	quest.6531D5799455DC28.quest_subtitle: "The casing for machines with a soul."
	quest.6531D5799455DC28.title: "&5Build an Ensouled Chassis"
	quest.6532F17C88B857EB.quest_desc: [
		"Auf den Berggipfeln wartet &cTongbi, der Bildhauer&r. Sprich ihn an und starte die Prüfung: Klettere den Felsenparcours bis ganz oben, etwa &e60 Blöcke&r, und klick ihn dort an, bevor die Zeit abläuft. Blöcke setzen, abbauen, teleportieren und fliegen sind verboten."
		""
		"Wer besteht, bekommt den &6Earthrend Gauntlet&r: Er hebt Felsbrocken aus dem Boden und schleudert sie, gräbt dich durch die Erde und hebt dich auf einer Erdsäule nach oben. Er lädt sich im Inventar wieder auf."
		""
		"Wer ihn lieber bekämpft (&e140 Lebenspunkte&r), bekommt die Geomanten-Kleidung und den Geomanten-Stab."
	]
	quest.6532F17C88B857EB.quest_subtitle: "Klettern statt kämpfen."
	quest.6532F17C88B857EB.title: "&7Besteh die Prüfung des Bildhauers"
	quest.65398B8ADE85B09A.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r A &6string&r, a &6slime ball&r and another string in a row make eight &6Processor Binding&r."
		""
		"That is the base of every processor. Eight per slime ball, so a small slime stock lasts a long time."
	]
	quest.65398B8ADE85B09A.quest_subtitle: "String, slime, string."
	quest.65398B8ADE85B09A.title: "&aMake Processor Binding"
	quest.655126D028749A52.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r The &6Autocrafting Monitor&r is two Improved Processors on the left, two &6Patterns&r in the top and bottom middle, enriched iron in the left middle, a casing in the center, three glass on the right."
		""
		"It shows all running jobs and cancels them when a machine gets stuck. The wireless version (monitor, ender pearl, Advanced Processor) does that from your pocket."
		""
		"The &6Autocrafter Manager&r (two Advanced Processors, two Autocrafters, casing, enriched iron, three glass) shows the patterns of all Autocrafters in one window. And an &6Autocrafting Upgrade&r in an Exporter keeps a stock: if the level drops below the filter, it orders more."
	]
	quest.655126D028749A52.quest_subtitle: "Monitor, manager, restocking."
	quest.655126D028749A52.title: "&7Keep an Eye on the Jobs"
	quest.65586A7003E369B7.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/undergarden_catacombs.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Find a &6catacomb&r: long corridors of Depthrock bricks with burial chambers and altars. Go inside."
		""
		"&eIn the chests:&r Cloggrum and Froststeel nuggets, Regalium, shards, Forgotten Nuggets and the &6Smithing Template&r for the Forgotten upgrade. Take every template."
		""
		"The &6Forgotten&r roam here. Go in with full armor and mark your way back."
	]
	quest.65586A7003E369B7.quest_subtitle: "Forgotten halls below the Forgotten Field."
	quest.65586A7003E369B7.title: "&8&lEnter the Catacombs"
	quest.65593E372EC8FD9B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/quarries_first_dig.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put the Quarry Card into the Builder, place a chest or an AE2 import bus right next to it and give it power."
		""
		"Base rate: &e8 blocks per tick&r, as long as the power lasts. It loads the chunk it is digging in by itself. Its own chunk has to be loaded."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r It also mines chests, machines and spawners. Check the area, never dig in other people's bases."
	]
	quest.65593E372EC8FD9B.quest_subtitle: "Card in, chest on, power on."
	quest.65593E372EC8FD9B.title: "&6Let the Builder Dig"
	quest.656C9871CA44A8BE.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r top two Blueprint Paper with a gap, middle three, bottom a stick in the middle. The head needs &efive&r material, plus a rod."
		""
		"Digs like the shovel, but 3x3. Ideal for building sites and sand deserts."
	]
	quest.656C9871CA44A8BE.quest_subtitle: "The hammer for dirt and sand."
	quest.656C9871CA44A8BE.title: "&7Build an excavator"
	quest.656D85B162A33182.quest_desc: [
		"25 Modelle, alle 15 Sekunden ein Stapel: das sind &e100 Stapel pro Minute&r. Mit 25 Lohen-Modellen &61.600 Lohenruten&r pro Minute, mit Witherskeletten 3.200 Kohle oder 300 Schädel, mit Zombies 800 Eisen."
		""
		"Dafür braucht das Zentrum &e100 Matrizen pro Minute&r, also sechs Tonklumpen, sechs Eisen, sechs Gold und 25 Glasscheiben, und zwischen 4.800 und 28.800 FE/t. Beides plant man, bevor man den Netherstern verbaut."
		""
		"Und das war der Weg: 98 Kills pro Modell in Stufe 2, Kammern an einem Stromnetz in Stufe 3, und in Stufe 4 ersetzt ein Glaswürfel jede Mobfarm des Servers."
	]
	quest.656D85B162A33182.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 4. Die Rechnung am Ende."
	quest.656D85B162A33182.title: "&5Tausende pro Minute"
	quest.6580F31A803F9769.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Pflanztopf&r und ein &6Trichter&r formlos ergeben den &6Trichter-Pflanztopf&r. Oder gleich beim Töpfern: der Trichter oben in die Mitte statt der leeren Stelle."
		""
		"Er erntet reife Pflanzen von selbst und wirft die Ernte in das Inventar unter sich: eine Truhe, ein Fass, eine Schublade oder ein Create-Förderband. Samen pflanzt er nicht nach, das muss er auch nicht, die Pflanze bleibt ja stehen."
		""
		"Eine Reihe Trichter-Töpfe über einer Reihe Schubladen ist die kleinste Farm, die es gibt, und sie passt in jede Küche."
	]
	quest.6580F31A803F9769.quest_subtitle: "Erntet von selbst in die Kiste darunter."
	quest.6580F31A803F9769.title: "&aMach den Topf zum Trichter"
	quest.658523ED3531FD1D.quest_desc: [
		"&eSo geht es:&r &eJ&r öffnet JourneyMap. Rechtsklick auf die Karte oder &eB&r in der Welt setzt einen &6Wegpunkt&r mit Namen und Farbe, er wird dir am Horizont und auf der Minimap gezeigt. Jeder aktivierte Wegstein wird automatisch zum Wegpunkt."
		""
		"&eWofür:&r jedes Portal, jedes Bauwerk, jede Erzader, jeden Leichnam. Wegpunkte gelten pro Dimension, im Nether siehst du also deine Nether-Punkte."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Wegpunkte lassen sich mit FTB Chunks an dein Team oder den ganzen Server teilen. So findet jeder den Hauptbahnhof."
	]
	quest.658523ED3531FD1D.quest_subtitle: "JourneyMap merkt sich den Ort, du nicht."
	quest.658523ED3531FD1D.title: "&6Setz Wegpunkte"
	quest.6585D16B20EBC66B.quest_desc: [
		"The ritual &6Summon Wilden&r at the brazier on an open field, defeat the &5Wilden Chimera&r, pick up the &5Wilden Tribute&r."
		""
		"The obelisk wants &e64 tributes&r, a fixed number, each counts 50 points. Team up in twos or threes, that is faster and safer."
		""
		"How the Chimera fights is in the chapter &dArs Nouveau: Epic&r."
	]
	quest.6585D16B20EBC66B.quest_subtitle: "One fight, one tribute."
	quest.6585D16B20EBC66B.title: "&dDefeat a Wilden Chimera"
	quest.659044911D6B77C7.quest_desc: [
		"Every monster you kill yourself has a &e4 percent&r chance to drop a &dgem&r (kills by machines only 0.5 percent). Gems also lie in chests, and invaders carry them more often."
		""
		"You put a gem in at the &6Smithing Table&r: item on the left, gem on the right. Or pick it up in your inventory and right click it onto the item. The tooltip says under &eFits In&r where it fits and what it does in each item type."
		""
		"&ePurity:&r &7Cracked&r, Chipped, Flawed, Normal, Flawless, &6Perfect&r. In Haven 55 percent drop Cracked, 41 Chipped and 4 Flawed. Higher purities come with the higher world tiers, or you cut them yourself."
	]
	quest.659044911D6B77C7.quest_subtitle: "Four percent from every monster."
	quest.659044911D6B77C7.title: "&d&lFind a Gem"
	quest.659476FBDC55EFDF.quest_desc: [
		"Slay &e10 shulkers&r. With a bit of luck each drops a shell."
		""
		"&eTrick:&r If a shulker's projectile hits another shulker, that one may split, and a new one appears next to it. Position yourself so they hit each other, and leave a few. That way the End City stays a source of shells."
	]
	quest.659476FBDC55EFDF.quest_subtitle: "Shulkers do not come back, but they split."
	quest.659476FBDC55EFDF.title: "&dMultiply the Shulkers"
	quest.6595D6F845056CC3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_pump.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Six &6Iron Plates&r make eight &6Fluid Pipes&r. An Iron Plate on top, plate, &6Iron Mechanical Component&r, plate in the middle and three pipes at the bottom make the &6Fluid Pump&r."
		""
		"The oven does not give its creosote away by itself, the pump pulls it out. With power it pumps much faster. Set the sides to input, output or closed with the hammer."
	]
	quest.6595D6F845056CC3.quest_subtitle: "Fluid Pump and pipes instead of buckets."
	quest.6595D6F845056CC3.title: "&bPump the creosote out"
	quest.65991B28EA0CB93E.quest_desc: [
		"Tool plus new part in the grid: the part is fitted, the old one comes back."
		""
		"That way the day one pickaxe gets better piece by piece. Only the head can't be swapped like this."
	]
	quest.65991B28EA0CB93E.quest_subtitle: "A tool that grows with you."
	quest.65991B28EA0CB93E.title: "&7Swap a part"
	quest.65A1592CA61E4C74.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r The blank &6Upgrade&r is six enriched iron, glass in the top and bottom middle, an Improved Processor in the center. With three &6sugar&r and five enriched iron around it, it becomes a &6Speed Upgrade&r. Four Speed Upgrades and five sugar in a checkerboard make a &6Stack Upgrade&r."
		""
		"You put upgrades into the four slots on the right of the window of the Importer, Exporter and so on. Speed: faster, 4 FE/t more. Stack: a whole stack per operation instead of one item, 16 FE/t more."
		""
		"There is also the &6Regulator Upgrade&r (keeps a fixed amount in the target) and, for the Constructor and Destructor, &6Fortune&r and &6Silk Touch&r from the matching enchanted book."
	]
	quest.65A1592CA61E4C74.quest_subtitle: "Sugar makes things fast."
	quest.65A1592CA61E4C74.title: "&eBuild Upgrades"
	quest.65AB8C6A77115271.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/food_f_feast.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Shapeless: &6cooked chicken&r, two &6baked potatoes&r, two &6carrots&r, &6onion&r, &6egg&r, &6bread&r and &6bowl&r."
		""
		"You set a feast down on the table as a block, and everyone takes a serving with a bowl. Shepherd's pie and honey glazed ham work the same way."
	]
	quest.65AB8C6A77115271.quest_subtitle: "A feast for everyone."
	quest.65AB8C6A77115271.title: "&6Serve a roast chicken"
	quest.65B86E057621E272.quest_desc: [
		"Enchanter's Bangle into the apparatus, plus:"
		"&dSummoning&r: &e2 Conjuration Essences&r, &6bone&r, &6Wilden Horn&r. Your summons attack whatever you hit and deal more damage."
		"&5Anima&r: &e2 Anima Essences&r, &6ghast tear&r, &6wither rose&r. More damage with anima spells, hits randomly heal or wither, plus a little more health for you."
	]
	quest.65B86E057621E272.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: the last two bangles."
	quest.65B86E057621E272.title: "&6Attune Summoning and Anima"
	quest.65C80547497F870A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Electrolytic Breathing Unit:&r top Infused Alloy, &6Electrolytic Core&r, Infused Alloy, middle alloy, Module Base, alloy, bottom three HDPE Sheets. Underwater it turns the water into oxygen to breathe and fills the Jetpack Unit with hydrogen on the side."
		""
		"&6Nutritional Injection Unit:&r Reinforced Alloy, a &6Canteen&r, Module Base and polonium. It feeds you Nutritional Paste as soon as you are hungry. The paste comes from the Nutritional Liquifier from stage 3."
	]
	quest.65C80547497F870A.quest_subtitle: "Oxygen from water, food from paste."
	quest.65C80547497F870A.title: "&bBreathe and Eat from the Suit"
	quest.65CF736881DA0C97.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Witherskelette&r in einer Netherfestung mit dem Learner im Inventar. Das bringt ein frisches Modell bis &9Advanced&r."
		""
		"Das Modell ist mit &d768 FE/t&r teuer, aber jede Vorhersage wird im Fabrikator wahlweise zu &63 Witherskelettschädeln&r, 24 Knochen oder 32 Kohle. Drei Schädel pro Simulation statt 2,5 Prozent pro Kill: so wird der Wither planbar."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Wie du sicher in die Festung kommst, steht im Kapitel &cDer Nether&r."
	]
	quest.65CF736881DA0C97.quest_subtitle: "Schädel ohne Plünderung III."
	quest.65CF736881DA0C97.title: "&8Lerne das Witherskelett"
	quest.65DA7D61E3D6D682.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Warp Index&r in the middle, &6netherite ingot&r, &6Nether Star&r and &6ender chest&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"The &6Stabilized Warp Index&r opens your Storage Lectern not only in the same dimension, but from every dimension."
	]
	quest.65DA7D61E3D6D682.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: your storage from every dimension."
	quest.65DA7D61E3D6D682.title: "&bStabilize the Warp Index"
	quest.65E8DBA0194668D1.quest_desc: [
		"Sechste Generation, zweiter Teil, die Zitrusfrüchte."
		""
		"&6Zitrone&r: Pomelo + Zitronatzitrone, 10 %"
		"&6Limette&r: Pomelo + Key-Lime, 10 %"
		"&6Mandarine&r: Pomelo + Vogelkirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Araukarie&r: Westliche Hemlocktanne + Tropenbaum, 10 %"
		"&6Gelbholz&r: Rotahorn + Mahagoni, 10 %"
		"&6Pfirsich&r: Pflaume + Edelkastanie, 10 %"
		"&6Palisander&r: Mahagoni + Teak, 10 %"
		"&6Myrten-Ebenholz&r: Ceylon-Ebenholz + Kaki, 5 %"
		"&6Granatapfel&r: Stechpalme + Purpur-Kreppmyrte, 5 %"
	]
	quest.65E8DBA0194668D1.quest_subtitle: "9 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.65E8DBA0194668D1.title: "&aGeneration 6: Zitrone bis Granatapfel"
	quest.65ECCBAF60F06897.quest_desc: [
		"&eSo geht es:&r Die Glyphe &dBlinzeln&r (Manipulationsessenz, 4 Enderperlen) kommt mit dem Erzmagier-Buch. &eSelbst, Blinzeln&r springt dich ein Stück nach vorn, &eProjektil, Blinzeln&r an den Einschlag."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r Über Schluchten, aus Fallen heraus, auf Dächer. Mit einer Warp-Schriftrolle in der Zweithand schickst du getroffene Wesen an deren Ort. Alles im Kapitel &dArs Nouveau: Meister&r."
	]
	quest.65ECCBAF60F06897.quest_subtitle: "Ars Nouveau: ein Zauber statt eines Portals. Stufe 3."
	quest.65ECCBAF60F06897.title: "&dSpring mit Blinzeln"
	quest.65F1F4E06047F7EB.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Osorin's Unbound Calling."
		"&6Bowls:&r &e6 amethyst dust&r (from the Crusher)."
		"&cStart:&r an &6amethyst block&r. &cSacrifice:&r a &6pig&r, 180 seconds."
		""
		"Wild spirits forge a &6budding amethyst&r for you. You cannot mine it otherwise, not even with Silk Touch. Place it in your base and amethyst grows at your door."
	]
	quest.65F1F4E06047F7EB.quest_subtitle: "The block no pickaxe can take."
	quest.65F1F4E06047F7EB.title: "&5Have a Budding Amethyst Forged"
	quest.65FDD089F1FF5A18.quest_desc: [
		"&5Odus' Open Convocation&r, 17x17: &e24 yellow&r, &e12 lime&r, &e8 orange&r, &e8 dark&r and &e4 white&r signs, &e8 skulls&r, &e8 candles&r, &e4 Spirit Attuned Crystals&r."
		"&6Zombified Piglin:&r gilded blackstone, warped fungus, crimson fungus, nether quartz, &cSacrifice:&r pig. Afrit book."
		"&6Guardian:&r tropical fish, seagrass, lapis block, turtle scute, water bucket, &cSacrifice:&r a fish."
		""
		"The Piglin drops &6Demonic Meat&r. Eaten, it gives fire resistance; three of them make pink chalk for Osorin's Unbound Calling."
	]
	quest.65FDD089F1FF5A18.quest_subtitle: "Afrit possession without red chalk."
	quest.65FDD089F1FF5A18.title: "&5Draw Odus' Open Convocation"
	quest.661593931F9FC5C9.quest_desc: [
		"The &6obelisk&r stands at spawn. Hold a stack and &eright-click&r it. &eSneak&r and right-click delivers everything in your inventory that the goal needs right now."
		""
		"In stage 1 the goal wants &6cobblestone&r, &6Andesite Alloy&r and &6Source Gems&r. Everyone has cobblestone, so don't throw it away. You see how far along it is on the &eboss bar&r at the top and with &e/kw goals&r."
		""
		"Everything else, the pillars and the milestones, is explained in the chapter &6Start here&r."
	]
	quest.661593931F9FC5C9.quest_subtitle: "Every stack counts, even a small one."
	quest.661593931F9FC5C9.title: "&6Deliver something at the obelisk"
	quest.661D0642B6785157.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r acht &6Bretter&r um ein fertiges &6Wasserrad&r. Es ist 3 x 3 Blöcke groß und will Wasser an seinem ganzen Rand."
		""
		"&eCreate, Großes Wasserrad:&r Brennstoff keiner, &d4 RPM&r, &d512 SU&r. Langsam, aber doppelt so stark wie das kleine, und ein Zahnradpaar macht aus 4 RPM wieder 8."
	]
	quest.661D0642B6785157.quest_subtitle: "Create, 4 RPM, 512 SU, drei Blöcke groß."
	quest.661D0642B6785157.title: "&6Bau ein großes Wasserrad"
	quest.661D89EE5F6C7FD9.quest_desc: [
		"&68 chiseled stone bricks&r around a &6netherite ingot&r make a &6lodestone&r. Right click it with a &6compass&r and it becomes a lodestone compass."
		""
		"A normal compass only spins in circles in the Nether. The lodestone compass always points to its lodestone as long as you are in the same dimension. Put one next to your Nether portal, and you always find your way back."
	]
	quest.661D89EE5F6C7FD9.quest_subtitle: "A compass that points in the Nether too."
	quest.661D89EE5F6C7FD9.title: "&8Put a lodestone at your portal"
	quest.6638841DC971D9F3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_stalker.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Der &4Beobachter&r (Stalker) ist drei Blöcke hoch, hat &e200 Lebenspunkte&r, Rüstung und schlägt mit &c22 Schaden&r zu. Wenn er dich trifft, lässt er &6Sculk-Egel&r auf dich los. Er kommt aus unechten Vasen im Tempel."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r Ein &6Seelenkristall&r, mit Plünderung bis zu drei. Den Kristall brauchst du für den Trank der Sculk-Affinität und für die Seelenelytren aus Stufe 4."
		""
		"&eTipps:&r Volle Diamantrüstung, Goldäpfel, und zerschlag die Vasen eine nach der anderen. Zu zweit ist er machbar, zu dritt bequem."
	]
	quest.6638841DC971D9F3.quest_subtitle: "Der größte Gegner der Anderwelt."
	quest.6638841DC971D9F3.title: "&4&lBesiege den Beobachter"
	quest.664757CBBE5B7CB6.quest_desc: [
		"Like the Flower Pouch, only with &e1 Mana Powder&r in the middle: 5 wool, 1 petal, 1 powder."
		""
		"It breaks collected Mystical Flowers down into petals right away and also holds Shimmering Mushrooms. A sneaking right click switches collecting on and off."
	]
	quest.664757CBBE5B7CB6.quest_subtitle: "Flowers in, petals out."
	quest.664757CBBE5B7CB6.title: "&6Sew a Petal Pouch"
	quest.665A8E14EE9DBEC2.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Sunken City&r liegt auf dem Grund der &eTiefsee&r (Deep Ocean, auch kalt, lauwarm und gefroren). Nimm Wasseratmung, einen &6Schnorchel&r aus den Artefakten oder einen Schildkrötenpanzer mit, und Türen zum Luftholen."
		""
		"Darin leben &cDeeplings&r (26 Lebenspunkte), Brutes (60), Angler, Priester und Hexer. &cPriester und Hexer&r lassen ein &6Athame&r fallen, das brauchst du für das Opfer. Der &cCoralssus&r (160 Lebenspunkte) gibt einen &6Korallenbrocken&r, der &cKorallengolem&r Korallensplitter, vier davon sind eine &6Kristallkoralle&r."
		""
		"Im Tempel steht der &6Altar des Amethysts&r. Lege &6Amethystkrabbenfleisch&r darauf, nach sechs Sekunden ist es gesegnet und macht dich immun gegen Dunkelheit und die Angst der Tiefe. Die &cAmethystkrabbe&r (200 Lebenspunkte) lebt im Amethystnest in den üppigen Höhlen um Y 0 und lässt 4 bis 10 Fleisch fallen."
		""
		"Ab Stufe 2 zeigt das &6Abgrundauge&r (Enderauge, 4 Obsidian, 4 weinender Obsidian) den Weg."
	]
	quest.665A8E14EE9DBEC2.quest_subtitle: "Ab hier wird Ausrüstung aus Stufe 2 empfohlen."
	quest.665A8E14EE9DBEC2.title: "&3Finde die versunkene Stadt"
	quest.6661B45C5ACB608A.quest_desc: [
		"Kill an &cEvoker&r. It lives in woodland mansions and comes in the later waves of a raid on a village."
		""
		"Dodge its fangs from the ground and kill the Vexes first. It always drops a &6Totem of Undying&r. Hold it in your off hand and it saves you from death once."
	]
	quest.6661B45C5ACB608A.quest_subtitle: "It carries a Totem of Undying."
	quest.6661B45C5ACB608A.title: "&cDefeat an Evoker"
	quest.666832A8259D915F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/powah_furnator.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Three paste at the top, two Tiny left and right of the casing, paste, &6furnace&r, paste at the bottom."
		""
		"Every fuel gives &e30 FE&r per burn time tick, so one coal gives 48,000 FE in every tier. Higher tiers only burn faster. The Starter makes &e20 FE/t&r."
	]
	quest.666832A8259D915F.quest_subtitle: "Coal in, power out."
	quest.666832A8259D915F.title: "&6Build a Furnator"
	quest.66753E505DED38F6.quest_desc: [
		"A &6blaze rod&r at the crafting table gives two &6blaze powder&r. Blazes in Nether fortresses drop rods."
		""
		"Between &6crushing wheels&r a rod gives three powder, with a 25 percent chance of three more. The millstone doesn't grind rods."
	]
	quest.66753E505DED38F6.quest_subtitle: "The price of the first brass."
	quest.66753E505DED38F6.title: "&6Make blaze powder"
	quest.6677E555381A9836.quest_desc: [
		"&6Experience Rod:&r two Soularium, two &6Suspicious Seeds&r and one Vibrant Alloy Ingot. The rod on top, a Soularium below it, Soularium, &6Ensouled Chassis&r, Soularium at the bottom make the &6XP Obelisk&r."
		""
		"In the window you deposit 1, 10 or all levels and take them back the same way. It stores them as liquid experience, which the Soul Binder drinks too."
		""
		"Suspicious Seeds sometimes drop when you set bedrock on fire for Grains of Infinity."
	]
	quest.6677E555381A9836.quest_subtitle: "Your levels in reserve, without loss."
	quest.6677E555381A9836.title: "&aStore Experience in the XP Obelisk"
	quest.667B8F1B1F4833EA.quest_desc: [
		"Copper at the top and on the sides, a &6fluix block&r at the top centre, a &6Charged Certus Quartz Crystal&r in the middle, three iron at the bottom."
		""
		"It gives the network &d20 AE/t&r without you ever refilling anything. More than one per network does not work, the vibrations disturb each other, even through quartz fiber."
		""
		"For a small network that is enough when idle. If you need more, stay with the Energy Acceptor."
	]
	quest.667B8F1B1F4833EA.quest_subtitle: "Power without fuel."
	quest.667B8F1B1F4833EA.title: "&eBuild a Crystal Resonance Generator"
	quest.669763008F19B86D.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r one &6Blueprint Paper&r and &6two string&r, shapeless. Then blueprint plus &eone&r material: the binding."
		""
		"String gives Flexible I, Flax String Flexible III and +5 percent speed, Sinew Fiber Flexible IV. Vines only give looks."
	]
	quest.669763008F19B86D.quest_subtitle: "Flexible: the tool often takes no damage."
	quest.669763008F19B86D.title: "&6Build a binding"
	quest.66A68AD992FAC9FD.quest_desc: [
		"First the &5Guardian Crystals&r, then its shield with &e16,000&r points, then &e1,000&r health. The bar at the top shows how many crystals still stand and how much shield it has."
		""
		"&eThe crystals:&r Their shield withstands normal weapons. It only becomes unstable when the Guardian itself hits the crystal, then it stays open for about &e10 seconds&r."
		""
		"&eIts attacks:&r dive, laser beam, bombs from the air, shockwaves, charged attacks. On top of that &5Guardian Withers&r can appear. Keep moving and do not bunch up with others."
	]
	quest.66A68AD992FAC9FD.quest_subtitle: "The fight as Draconic Evolution builds it."
	quest.66A68AD992FAC9FD.title: "&cRead What Awaits You"
	quest.66C788F17E38778F.quest_desc: [
		"Put the &6Oxidized Golem Steel Ingots&r into a blast furnace. Out come clean &6Golem Steel Ingots&r."
		""
		"&eAlloy furnace:&r 3 Deepsilver Ingots and 2 Golem Steel Nuggets make another Golem Steel Ingot. Deepsilver, Golem Steel, Malarite and Soul Dew make &6Unrealium&r."
		""
		"Golem Steel becomes the Greatsword, the Energy Boomerang and, with crystals, the Crystal Greatsword."
	]
	quest.66C788F17E38778F.quest_subtitle: "Rust becomes steel."
	quest.66C788F17E38778F.title: "&6Smelt Golem Steel"
	quest.66D6605BE9DEE23A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pickup Upgrade for chests:&r a &6sticky piston&r on top, &6planks&r next to the chest upgrade base, three &6redstone&r at the bottom. With &6ender pearls&r, &6iron&r, &6redstone&r and &6lapis lazuli&r around it, it becomes the &6Magnet Upgrade&r."
		""
		"A barrel with a magnet pulls items from a &e3 block&r radius to itself, the Advanced Magnet Upgrade from &e5&r. Under a cactus or sugar cane farm or next to the cobblestone drill it replaces hoppers and belts."
	]
	quest.66D6605BE9DEE23A.quest_subtitle: "Pickup and Magnet Upgrade for chests."
	quest.66D6605BE9DEE23A.title: "Let the barrel collect"
	quest.66D79B61D760D2D0.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Echostamm&r ergibt vier &6Echoholzbretter&r. Daraus gibt es den ganzen Satz: Treppen, Zaun, Tür, Falltür, Schilder und ein &6Echoholzboot&r für die Tümpel."
		""
		"&eSetzlinge:&r &6Echolaub&r lässt beim Abbauen einen &6Echosetzling&r fallen, etwa jedes zwanzigste Mal, mit Glück öfter. Der Baum wächst auch in der Oberwelt. Mit der Schere nimmst du das Laub selbst mit."
	]
	quest.66D79B61D760D2D0.quest_subtitle: "Bretter, Boote, Türen, und ein Setzling aus dem Laub."
	quest.66D79B61D760D2D0.title: "&2Pflanze Echoholz"
	quest.66E6A917F19C6D28.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wireless Access Point:&r Wireless Receiver, Calculation Processor, glass cable on top of each other. &6Wireless Crafting Terminal:&r receiver, crafting terminal, Dense Energy Cell on top of each other. Put the terminal into the slot at the top right of the access point, then it is linked."
		""
		"&6Wireless Boosters&r in the access point raise range and power draw. It recharges in the Charger."
		""
		"&6AE2 Wireless Terminals&r joins several wireless terminals into the &6Wireless Universal Terminal&r, and the &6Magnet Card&r in it pulls nearby items into the network."
	]
	quest.66E6A917F19C6D28.quest_subtitle: "The storage in your pocket."
	quest.66E6A917F19C6D28.title: "&bGo wireless"
	quest.66E90CB505CEE239.quest_desc: [
		"Cowl from &e5&r, Robe Top from &e8&r Manaweave Cloth, Robe Bottom and Boots the same as with leather."
		""
		"Protects little, but with all four pieces Botania's tools and rods cost much less mana and the rods get stronger. It repairs itself with mana from your inventory as soon as you carry a Mana Tablet from stage 2."
	]
	quest.66E90CB505CEE239.quest_subtitle: "Little protection, big discount."
	quest.66E90CB505CEE239.title: "&6Tailor the Manaweave robe"
	quest.66FA0EC7EA7C543E.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Prosperity Shards&r on the sides, &e4 Inferium Essence&r in the corners and a &6diamond&r in the middle give the &6Infusion Crystal&r. It has &e1,000 uses&r."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/infusion_crystal.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The crystal condenses essence: &e4 Inferium Essence&r around the crystal give &e1 Prudentium Essence&r, and so on tier by tier. But &cPrudentium&r is locked until &cstage 2&r, so you can build the crystal now and get started right away once the Brass Works opens."
		""
		"The &6Master Infusion Crystal&r without wear needs Supremium and comes at the very end in stage 5."
	]
	quest.66FA0EC7EA7C543E.quest_subtitle: "The tool for the next essence tier."
	quest.66FA0EC7EA7C543E.title: "&dCut an Infusion Crystal"
	quest.66FF6DCC865DE35A.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Thermoelectric Boiler from water and heat. The Rotary Condensentrator turns steam from other mods into Mekanism steam. In stage 5 the fission reactor."
		""
		"&eNeeded by:&r the Industrial Turbine. The exhaust steam turns back into water in the Saturating Condenser."
	]
	quest.66FF6DCC865DE35A.quest_subtitle: "The turbine's fuel."
	quest.66FF6DCC865DE35A.title: "&fSteam"
	quest.6701C0B3ED36C748.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crusher:&r 5x3x3, 38 blocks. Ore in, dust out."
		"&6Metal Press:&r 3x3x1, 7 blocks. Ingots in, plates out."
		"&6Industrial Squeezer:&r 3x3x3, 19 blocks. Seeds in, Plant Oil out."
		"&6Industrial Fermenter:&r 3x3x3, 19 blocks. Fruit in, Ethanol out."
		"&6Bottling Machine:&r 3x3x2, 13 blocks. Mold and fluid in, part out."
		"&6Mixer:&r 3x3x3, 18 blocks. Solids and water in, concrete out."
		"&6Sawmill:&r 5x3x3, 25 blocks. Log in, planks out."
		"&6Assembler:&r 3x3x3, 27 blocks. Ingredients in, parts out."
	]
	quest.6701C0B3ED36C748.quest_subtitle: "Eight multiblocks made of engineering blocks."
	quest.6701C0B3ED36C748.title: "&6&lCheck Off the Processing Machines"
	quest.6703E9B19D9BFE2E.quest_desc: [
		"Nine &6Coal Coke&r make a &6Block of Coal Coke&r, and it turns back into nine."
		""
		"The Coke Oven turns two blocks of coal straight into one block of coke, with ten times the creosote of a load of loose coal."
	]
	quest.6703E9B19D9BFE2E.quest_subtitle: "Nine coke, one block."
	quest.6703E9B19D9BFE2E.title: "&8Pack coke into blocks"
	quest.670C72A66EDB786D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_coke_oven.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Set the &627 Coke Bricks&r up as a &e3x3x3 cube&r and hit the middle of one side with the hammer."
		""
		"&eIn:&r up to &e16 coal&r or &e8 logs&r per load. &eOut:&r coke or charcoal, plus &bCreosote Oil&r in the tank: 500 mB per load of coal (5 minutes), 250 mB per load of logs."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Two &6blocks of coal&r give one block of coke and &e5 000 mB&r of creosote at once. For creosote, blocks of coal are much better than loose coal."
	]
	quest.670C72A66EDB786D.quest_subtitle: "3x3x3, 27 Coke Bricks, coal in, coke and creosote out."
	quest.670C72A66EDB786D.title: "&8&lForm a Coke Oven"
	quest.67200176F22FC2FE.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Druckluftrohr&r oben, darunter zwei Reihen aus &6Druckeisen&r, &6Redstone&r, &6Druckeisen&r ergeben einen &6Luftkanister&r (Air Canister). Er fasst 3 000 mL, lädt bis 10 Bar und explodiert nie."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/item/air_canister.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Ein &6Druckmesser&r über einem Kanister ergibt das &6Manometer&r. Rechtsklick auf ein Rohr oder eine Maschine zeigt dir den Druck im Chat, beim Sicherheitsventil auch dessen Schwelle. Mit Jade im Pack siehst du den Druck meist schon beim Hinsehen, trotzdem ist es für die ersten Fehlersuchen Gold wert."
		""
		"Jedes Druckluftwerkzeug wird aus einem Kanister gebaut und übernimmt dessen Luft."
	]
	quest.67200176F22FC2FE.quest_subtitle: "Luft zum Mitnehmen."
	quest.67200176F22FC2FE.title: "&7Bau Luftkanister und Manometer"
	quest.67250A4081A3B621.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r oben links eine &6Eisenaxt&r, oben rechts ein Eisenbarren, in der Mitte Bretter, &6Werkbank&r, Bretter, unten drei Bretter. Der &6Zimmermannstisch&r (Carpenters Table) macht aus Brettern, Stämmen, Türen, Falltüren, Leitern, Fässern und Bücherregalen neue Varianten."
		""
		"Eichenbretter allein haben 38 Muster, jeder Stamm elf. Besonders praktisch: Türen und Falltüren mit Fenstern, die zu deinem Holz passen."
	]
	quest.67250A4081A3B621.quest_subtitle: "Holz in 38 Mustern."
	quest.67250A4081A3B621.title: "&6Bau einen Zimmermannstisch"
	quest.673406096246C326.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a &6Sal Ammoniac Crystal&r into the accumulator and wait. Then take &6Sal Ammoniac&r out of the tank with an empty bucket."
		""
		"Without a crystal 1,000 mB of water gives only &e100 mB&r. With a crystal &e1,000 mB&r."
	]
	quest.673406096246C326.quest_subtitle: "The alchemists' solvent."
	quest.673406096246C326.title: "&bTap a Bucket of Sal Ammoniac"
	quest.67350EBAE878C500.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_blaze_cake.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Press over basin: &6cinder flour&r, &6sugar&r and an &6egg&r make the &6Blaze Cake Base&r. A &6spout&r fills &b250 mB lava&r into it: the &6Blaze Cake&r is done."
		"{image:create:textures/item/blaze_cake.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Give it to the burner, and it is &csuperheated&r for a while. An arm or a funnel tops it up."
	]
	quest.67350EBAE878C500.quest_subtitle: "Superheated means double brass."
	quest.67350EBAE878C500.title: "&6Bake a blaze cake"
	quest.674206390ACA1F92.quest_desc: [
		"&6Reaktorkern&r, vier &6Stabilisatoren&r und ein &6Energieinjektor&r, alles erst nach dem Chaoswächter. Erwachtes Draconium als Brennstoff, mit dem Injektor aufladen, aktivieren, dann das Eindämmungsfeld dauerhaft füttern."
		""
		"&eDraconic Evolution, Reaktor:&r Brennstoff Erwachtes Draconium, aus dem nach und nach Chaos wird. Der Ausstoß steigt mit Temperatur und Sättigung in die Millionen FE/t, der Injektor braucht dafür ständig einen Teil zurück. Fällt das Feld auf null, reißt die Explosion einen Krater, die große Explosion ist hier &cnicht abgeschaltet&r. Offen ab Stufe 5, siehe Kapitel &6Draconic: Erwacht und Chaos&r."
	]
	quest.674206390ACA1F92.quest_subtitle: "Draconic Evolution, Reaktor: riesiger Ausstoß, riesige Explosion."
	quest.674206390ACA1F92.title: "&cStarte den Drakonischen Reaktor"
	quest.674BFEB3C5381E6C.quest_desc: [
		"&eMining:&r Projectile, Break, Amplify, Pickup. &eLight:&r Projectile, Magelight. &eBridge:&r Projectile, Mageblock."
		"&eMelee:&r Touch, Harm, Amplify, Amplify. &eRanged:&r Projectile, Harm, Amplify. &eField:&r Touch, Harvest."
		""
		"If a spell doesn't do what it should, check the order of the augments first."
	]
	quest.674BFEB3C5381E6C.quest_subtitle: "Ten slots, six good ideas."
	quest.674BFEB3C5381E6C.title: "&d&lFill your spell book"
	quest.674C304FB40CDEAC.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r oben ein &6Printed Circuit Board&r, in der Mitte ein &6Pressure Tube&r und zwei weitere PCBs, unten drei &6Compressed Iron Ingots&r."
		""
		"Mit &6Stufe 3 (Stahlwerk)&r öffnet PneumaticCraft seine zweite Ebene: die &eMontagestraße&r (Assembly System), Rohre und Kompressoren für &e20 bar&r, und die &eDrohnen&r. Alles davon beginnt hier, denn Advanced Pressure Tubes gibt es nur aus der Montagestraße."
		""
		"Was du mitbringen solltest, steht im Kapitel &bPneumaticCraft&r: Compressed Iron, einen laufenden Air Compressor, die Druckkammer, Plastik und drei fertige PCBs. Der Controller ist die einzige Maschine der Straße, die Luft braucht. Ein Rohr an ihn, und die ganze Straße läuft."
		""
		"&cNoch gesperrt:&r Die &6Pneumatic Armor&r, die &6Minigun&r und die &6Micromissiles&r kommen in Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.674C304FB40CDEAC.quest_subtitle: "Das Gehirn der Montagestraße."
	quest.674C304FB40CDEAC.title: "&b&lBau einen Assembly Controller"
	quest.674EE2E2316CDDAD.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_apprentice_collector.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the apparatus: relay with &e4 chests&r becomes the &6Collector&r, with &e4 hoppers&r the &6Depositor&r."
		""
		"The collector draws from every jar within &e5 blocks&r, the depositor fills every jar within &e5 blocks&r. Collector at the link farm, depositor in the workshop, done."
		""
		"The &6Warping Relay&r for endless distances needs chorus fruit and comes with stage 4."
	]
	quest.674EE2E2316CDDAD.quest_subtitle: "Never connect every jar one by one again."
	quest.674EE2E2316CDDAD.title: "&aBuild Collector and Depositor"
	quest.674FA4D9163B17A3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_advanced_turbine.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Turbine Valves&r (casing and Advanced Control Circuit) in the shell for steam in and power out. &6Turbine Vents&r (casing and iron bars) at the height of the complex or above. &6Saturating Condensers&r above the dispersers turn exhaust steam into water."
		""
		"Steam comes from the boiler. The output depends on blades, coils and the amount of steam, and the turbine grows with your power plant all the way to fusion and the fission reactor."
	]
	quest.674FA4D9163B17A3.quest_subtitle: "Steam in, power out."
	quest.674FA4D9163B17A3.title: "&6&lAssemble the Industrial Turbine"
	quest.6754881034BDBFA8.quest_desc: [
		"You upgrade Energy Cubes, tanks and bins with Reinforced, then Atomic Alloy. &6Ultimate Cube&r &d102.4 million FE&r, &6tank&r 256,000 mB, &6Chemical Tank&r 8,192,000 mB, &6bin&r 262,144 items."
	]
	quest.6754881034BDBFA8.quest_subtitle: "The largest storage per block."
	quest.6754881034BDBFA8.title: "&bUpgrade Cubes and Tanks to Ultimate"
	quest.6754C984173455B1.quest_desc: [
		"&6AOE Module:&r pistons in the corners, Draconium Ingots at the top and bottom, Draconium Cores left and right, a Module Core in the middle. Two of them with a &6Wyvern Core&r, four Draconium Ingots and two &6netherite scrap&r make the Wyvern module."
		""
		"The simple module mines &e3 x 3&r, the Wyvern module &e5 x 5&r. You set the size in the tool. &eAOE Safe Mode&r stops as soon as a machine stands in the area."
	]
	quest.6754C984173455B1.quest_subtitle: "5 x 5 at once."
	quest.6754C984173455B1.title: "&dBuild a Wyvern AOE Module"
	quest.676D6D69D407DB40.quest_desc: [
		"Pulsating Alloy, &6Enlightened Fused Quartz&r, Pulsating Alloy at the top, Photovoltaic Plate, &6Powdered Coal&r, Photovoltaic Plate in the middle, &6Double-Layer Capacitor&r, an &6Energetic Photovoltaic Module&r, Double-Layer Capacitor at the bottom."
		""
		"In daylight it gives up to &d16 µI/t&r. The &6Vibrant Photovoltaic Module&r as the next tier manages &d64 µI/t&r."
		""
		"You smelt Enlightened Fused Quartz in the Alloy Smelter from Fused Quartz and a glowstone block or four glowstone dust."
	]
	quest.676D6D69D407DB40.quest_subtitle: "Four times the sun."
	quest.676D6D69D407DB40.title: "&bUpgrade to Pulsating Photovoltaics"
	quest.67767F8673273C00.quest_desc: [
		"Set up &64 soul sand&r as a T and put &63 wither skeleton skulls&r on top. The &cWither&r appears, explodes and flies off. It drops a &6Nether star&r."
		""
		"&cFar away from any base&r, best deep underground where it can't move freely. From half health it deflects arrows, then only the sword helps."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r the beacon and the wake-up call for &cThe Harbinger&r (&cOverworld Bosses&r chapter). With Mystical Agradditions it drops a &6Withering Soul&r with 35 percent; three of them make three new skulls."
	]
	quest.67767F8673273C00.quest_subtitle: "Three skulls, four soul sand, one Nether star."
	quest.67767F8673273C00.title: "&8&lDefeat the Wither"
	quest.677B8B1F5C5139D6.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Loot Collector&r is a 5 x 5 recipe for the crafting units: &6brass ingots&r in the corners and on the sides, &6brass sheets&r top and bottom, &6iron bars&r inside and a &6barrel&r in the middle."
		""
		"Put it at the spawner's spawn point (in the value box you set how high above the spawner that is). Then no mob appears anymore, but its loot lands directly in the collector, 8 stacks of room. An Item Vault from Create also works as a collector. No fight, no noise, no creeper holes."
		""
		"The &6Reinforced Brass Casing&r (apply an iron block to a Brass Casing) and the &6Dark Framed Glass&r (framed glass and coal) are the matching blocks for a secured spawn room."
	]
	quest.677B8B1F5C5139D6.quest_subtitle: "The loot without the mob."
	quest.677B8B1F5C5139D6.title: "&cBuild a Loot Collector"
	quest.6790BE9A0C937979.quest_desc: [
		"&6Applied Flux&r bringt Speicherzellen für Strom: Sie stecken wie Item-Zellen im ME-Laufwerk. Der &6Flux Accessor&r am Netz nimmt FE auf und gibt es wieder ab, wie ein großer Akku."
		""
		"&eApplied Flux:&r &d1 048 576 FE pro Byte&r Zellenspeicher, der Flux Accessor hat keine Durchsatzgrenze. Das ME-Netz selbst lädt er nicht, dafür bleibt der Kristallresonanzgenerator. Offen ab Stufe 3, größere Zellen ab Stufe 4 und 5."
	]
	quest.6790BE9A0C937979.quest_subtitle: "Applied Flux: FE-Zellen im ME-Laufwerk, über eine Million FE je Byte."
	quest.6790BE9A0C937979.title: "&bLager Strom im ME-Netz"
	quest.67A177EC4C84D738.quest_desc: [
		"Generating flowers consume something and turn it into &dmana&r. They pass it on to the nearest &6Mana Spreader&r, which they bind to on their own when planted."
		""
		"In stage 1 two are open, all others need runes:"
		"&6Endoflame&r: burns fuel, 1,200 mana per coal."
		"&6Hydroangeas&r: drinks water, about 13 mana per block, withers after an hour."
		""
		"The other twelve flowers with their numbers are in the &aBotania: Runes&r chapter."
	]
	quest.67A177EC4C84D738.quest_subtitle: "Mana comes from flowers, not from cables."
	quest.67A177EC4C84D738.title: "&aUnderstand generating flowers"
	quest.67C0BF34A5A77F00.quest_desc: [
		"Eisenrüstung oder Diamantrüstung mit 4 Magieblütenfasern im Bezaubernden Apparat. Eisen wird Arkanist, Diamant Kampfmagier. Kapitel &dArs Nouveau: Meister&r."
		""
		"Alle Roben erhöhen die Manaregeneration und nehmen Fäden am Änderungstisch. Erste Aufwertung: 2 Lohenruten und 2 500 Quelle pro Teil."
	]
	quest.67C0BF34A5A77F00.quest_subtitle: "Ars Nouveau: Arkanist und Kampfmagier."
	quest.67C0BF34A5A77F00.title: "&dNäh Magierroben"
	quest.67C159C66551679E.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 bone meal&r in a cross around an &6Arcane Crystal Dust&r give &e4 Arcane Bone Meal&r."
		""
		"It works on plants like bone meal. But right clicking &6farmland&r turns it into &6Magical Farmland&r: ripe crops on it drop their harvest &etwice&r."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r If you mine the magical farmland, only dirt remains. Lay it where it is meant to stay."
	]
	quest.67C159C66551679E.quest_subtitle: "Double harvest on every field."
	quest.67C159C66551679E.title: "&aMake Magical Farmland"
	quest.67C8E566485640AD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Vanilla&r, &6Hilfsgeist&r: Gib ihm einen Gegenstand, und er sammelt alles dieser Sorte vom Boden auf und bringt es dir. Spielst du einen &6Notenblock&r, liefert er stattdessen dort ab. Filter ist die eine Sorte in seiner Hand. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Hilfsgeister sitzen in Käfigen bei Plünderer-Außenposten und in Waldanwesen. Ein Notenblock über einem Trichter ist eine Sammelstelle, die ohne Strom und Rohr auskommt."
	]
	quest.67C8E566485640AD.quest_subtitle: "Vanilla, Hilfsgeist: sucht die Sorte, die du ihm gibst."
	quest.67C8E566485640AD.title: "Lass einen Hilfsgeist sammeln"
	quest.67CAB45A545ACFE9.quest_desc: [
		"Binding next to a Starbuncle, then use the script."
		""
		"As a familiar it gives you &eSpeed II&r. A gold nugget fed to it briefly shows you gold ore through the walls."
	]
	quest.67CAB45A545ACFE9.quest_subtitle: "Speed II from a little friend."
	quest.67CAB45A545ACFE9.title: "&dBind a Starbuncle"
	quest.67D51A511C7AB0E3.quest_desc: [
		"Stufe 3 bringt die Mitte der Leiter: Raffiniertes Obsidian von Mekanism, Celestigem, Elementium, Seelenstahl, Gravitit aus den Aether-Dungeons und drei neue Wege zu fliegen."
		""
		"Dazu die Abbaumaschinen: Mining Gadget, Bohrmaschine, Digitaler Miner."
	]
	quest.67D51A511C7AB0E3.quest_subtitle: "Raffiniertes Obsidian, Elementium, Flugrituale."
	quest.67D51A511C7AB0E3.title: "&f&lRüste dich für Stufe 3"
	quest.67E126AFA6E34334.quest_desc: [
		"Two steel and a circuit give eight &6Basic Logistical Transporters&r."
		""
		"They don't pull anything out of a chest on their own: either auto eject on the machine, or set the transporter side to &epull&r with the Configurator. Coloured transporters only connect to the same colour."
	]
	quest.67E126AFA6E34334.quest_subtitle: "Items on the move."
	quest.67E126AFA6E34334.title: "&eLay Logistical Transporters"
	quest.67F8F3589E6ED400.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6stick&r top and bottom middle, in between &6string&r, &6wool&r, &6string&r: the &6hammock cloth&r. Plus two &6Rope and Nails&r (an iron ingot and a rope from Supplementaries give two)."
		""
		"The two nails go on two opposite walls, the cloth between them. The hammock only works &eduring the day&r and sleeps until evening, the counterpart to the sleeping bag."
		""
		"Handy when your farm needs monsters or you prefer to dig at night."
	]
	quest.67F8F3589E6ED400.quest_subtitle: "Sleep through the day until it is dark."
	quest.67F8F3589E6ED400.title: "&6Hang Up a Hammock"
	quest.67FA11CA596E1630.quest_desc: [
		"Slay &e5 Endermapteras&r. They only have 16 health, but come in groups."
		""
		"The ones with jaws drop a &6Void Jaw&r. A jaw over a spectral arrow makes &e2 Void Scatter Arrows&r."
	]
	quest.67FA11CA596E1630.quest_subtitle: "Bugs of the citadel, some with jaws."
	quest.67FA11CA596E1630.title: "&5Hunt Endermapteras"
	quest.6804CE1BE6F8F515.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6nether bricks&r in the corners, four &6bricks&r on the sides, one &6magma block&r in the middle make three &6Blast Bricks&r."
		""
		"For one blast furnace: &e36 nether bricks, 36 bricks, 9 magma blocks&r. Magma blocks lie at lava lakes in the Nether, or you craft them from four magma cream. The Nether chapter shows the way there."
	]
	quest.6804CE1BE6F8F515.quest_subtitle: "Ingredients from the Nether."
	quest.6804CE1BE6F8F515.title: "&cFire 27 Blast Bricks"
	quest.6805824C4E127F95.quest_desc: [
		"Energietablett oben und unten, Schaltkreis, &6Teleportationskern&r, Schaltkreis in der Mitte. Der Kern braucht Atomlegierung."
		""
		"Teleportiert dich zu jedem Teleporter deiner Frequenz, überall auf dem Server. Kapitel &5Mekanism: Fortgeschritten&r. Ohne Strom geht das &6Tempad&r (Stufe 3): Orte speichern, Rechtsklick öffnet ein Portal dorthin."
	]
	quest.6805824C4E127F95.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism: Portable Teleporter."
	quest.6805824C4E127F95.title: "&dTrag einen Teleporter in der Tasche"
	quest.68131C46039879E9.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_pg_generator.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Rheostat&r: coal, shaft, five &6resistor coils&r (four iron wire and a stick) and a conductive casing. Wire collector and windings plus to plus, minus to minus, with the rheostat in between."
		""
		"That only works in one direction of rotation, with the right resistance and at enough speed. The rheostat sets the resistance by rotation."
	]
	quest.68131C46039879E9.quest_subtitle: "Without an outside power source, with a rheostat."
	quest.68131C46039879E9.title: "&3Let the generator excite itself"
	quest.681BA31B899D5F2B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The &aMetallurgic Infuser&r has Manasteel, furnace, Manasteel at the bottom instead of iron. Top iron, furnace, iron, middle redstone, osmium, redstone."
		""
		"No infuser, no steel and no circuits. Trade Manasteel for brass, see the &5Mekanism&r chapter."
	]
	quest.681BA31B899D5F2B.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism needs your flowers."
	quest.681BA31B899D5F2B.title: "&7Deliver Manasteel to the engineers"
	quest.681CB92F88800613.quest_desc: [
		"Rechtsklick mit dem &6Deep Learner&r in der Hand öffnet ihn. Links liegen die vier Modellplätze, in der Mitte dreht sich der Mob, rechts steht alles Wichtige: &eModel Tier&r, &eModel Accuracy&r und &eUpgrades to ... in N kills&r."
		""
		"Liegt ein Modell im Learner, zeigt dir ein kleines &6HUD&r oben links im Spiel, wie viele Kills bis zur nächsten Stufe fehlen. Du musst den Learner dafür nicht offen haben."
		""
		"&cWichtig:&r Es zählt nur, was &edu&r tötest. Schwert, Bogen, Zauber, alles mit deinem Namen dran. Eine Mobfarm, die ohne dich tötet, bringt dem Modell nichts."
	]
	quest.681CB92F88800613.quest_subtitle: "Was die Anzeige dir sagt."
	quest.681CB92F88800613.title: "&7Lies den Deep Learner"
	quest.682BE2CA0AF0354A.quest_desc: [
		"Pickaxe, axe, sword and hammer, all from Silent Gear. You decide the material."
		""
		"Put them in the backpack with the Tool Swapper Upgrade, then you always have the right one in hand."
	]
	quest.682BE2CA0AF0354A.quest_subtitle: "Four tools, all made of parts."
	quest.682BE2CA0AF0354A.title: "&6&lGear up completely"
	quest.68359FDAD745E4AE.quest_desc: [
		"&7Stone Works&r, &6Brass Works&r, &fSteel Works&r, &dStar Works&r, &cChaos Works&r. Each opens through a goal at the obelisk and can do about twice as much as the one before."
		""
		"Nothing is removed from the pack, some things just come later. Vanilla is open, except the &cNether&r (stage 2) and the &dEnd&r (stage 4). Both open with an event."
	]
	quest.68359FDAD745E4AE.quest_subtitle: "One after another, for everyone at once."
	quest.68359FDAD745E4AE.title: "&6Learn the five stages"
	quest.6857EF089C45D3F2.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Schleime&r mit dem Learner im Inventar. Schleimchunks unter Tage oder Sümpfe bei Vollmond sind die Plätze dafür. Die kleinen zählen genauso."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d128 FE/t&r. Eine Vorhersage wird zu &632 Schleimbällen&r, 3 Schleimblöcken oder 2 Schleimperlen von Reliquary. Schleim brauchen Klebekolben, Create-Kleber und viele Maschinen."
	]
	quest.6857EF089C45D3F2.quest_subtitle: "Schleimbälle ohne Sumpf."
	quest.6857EF089C45D3F2.title: "&aLerne den Schleim"
	quest.685F9E2E8863D069.quest_desc: [
		"&6Geschwindigkeitsupgrade:&r Glas oben und unten, Infundierte Legierung links und rechts, &6Osmiumstaub&r in die Mitte. Es kommt in den Upgrade-Reiter rechts im Maschinenfenster."
		""
		"Bis zu &e8 Stück&r pro Maschine. Acht machen die Maschine &ezehnmal so schnell&r (Faktor 10 in der Server-Config), jedes einzelne ein Achtel des Weges dorthin. Der Strom pro Tick steigt dabei stärker als das Tempo: mit acht zieht sie das Hundertfache pro Tick, also zehnmal so viel pro Gegenstand."
		""
		"Bei Klärkammer und Injektionskammer steigt auch der Gasverbrauch pro Tick. Ohne mehr Sauerstoff bringt das Upgrade dort nichts."
	]
	quest.685F9E2E8863D069.quest_subtitle: "Faster, but hungrier."
	quest.685F9E2E8863D069.title: "&bSteck Geschwindigkeitsupgrades hinein"
	quest.686214DB6E62E69A.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6sticks&r diagonally, plus &6copper&r in the middle and a &6Mercury Shard&r at the top right."
		""
		"The wand turns logistics blocks on and off and picks the side they push into or pull from."
	]
	quest.686214DB6E62E69A.quest_subtitle: "The tool for logistics."
	quest.686214DB6E62E69A.title: "&bBuild a Mercurial Wand"
	quest.68623CAB44AB2D5B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Gilded Ring&r (Hallowed Gold and leather) on the altar. On the stands &e4 Living Flesh&r, &e4 Calx&r, &e1 Ghast Tear&r. Plus &e16 Sacred&r and &e16 Arcane&r."
		""
		"Every time you pick up arcana it heals you a little. Living Flesh: four rotten flesh, 2 Sacred, 2 Wicked."
	]
	quest.68623CAB44AB2D5B.quest_subtitle: "Ring of Curative Talent."
	quest.68623CAB44AB2D5B.title: "&dForge a Healing Ring"
	quest.6862EBE6C610E4BB.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6three diamond shards&r, middle &6blue dye, upgrade base, blue dye&r, bottom &6three gold nuggets&r."
		""
		"You break a diamond down into &enine shards&r in the grid."
		""
		"From it: &6Road Maker&r (plus iron shovel and orange dye, dirt paths in 3x3 with the excavator) and &6Spoon Upgrade&r (plus diamond shovel, the pickaxe digs dirt too)."
	]
	quest.6862EBE6C610E4BB.quest_subtitle: "Diamond shards, gold, colour."
	quest.6862EBE6C610E4BB.title: "&7Build an advanced upgrade base"
	quest.6868D3E932E58562.quest_desc: [
		"Mystical Flowers grow in almost every grass biome; you recognise them by their sparkles. A flower gives &e2 petals&r at the crafting table, a tall one &e4&r."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/white_mystical_petal.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Almost every recipe in Botania is a list of petals. You need white right away, brown, red and light grey shortly after."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A petal right clicked onto grass, then bone meal on it, grows a tall flower of exactly that colour."
	]
	quest.6868D3E932E58562.quest_subtitle: "Sixteen colours, two petals per flower."
	quest.6868D3E932E58562.title: "&6Pick Mystical Flowers"
	quest.68708E42C6635F0D.quest_desc: [
		"In the Reaction Chamber: a &6Singularity&r, two ender dust, two sky stone dust and some lava make two &6Shattered Singularities&r."
		""
		"The Inscriber (or Mekanism's Crusher) grinds them into &6Quantum Infused Dust&r."
	]
	quest.68708E42C6635F0D.quest_subtitle: "The first step toward Quantum Alloy."
	quest.68708E42C6635F0D.title: "&dShatter a Singularity"
	quest.68722186C6F083CB.quest_desc: [
		"Empty &6milk buckets&r into an &6Item Drain&r; a pipe brings the milk to the &6Spout&r. A &6bread&r below it becomes a &6Sweet Roll&r with &b250 mB milk&r."
		"{image:create:textures/item/sweet_roll.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"With wheat from the harvester and flour from the millstone the whole bakery runs on belts."
	]
	quest.68722186C6F083CB.quest_subtitle: "Sweet rolls from the spout."
	quest.68722186C6F083CB.title: "&6Fill bread with milk"
	quest.68751490DDDE0237.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a placed &6ME P2P Tunnel&r with a &6Chemical Tank&r from Mekanism, and it turns into this type. Breaking it gives you the tunnel as an item of its own."
	]
	quest.68751490DDDE0237.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism gases without a pressurized tube (Applied Mekanistics)."
	quest.68751490DDDE0237.title: "Build a chemical tunnel"
	quest.687BFE692FDDE430.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Plate Basic&r at the top and bottom, &6Tough Alloy, redstone, Tough Alloy&r in the middle. Gives two."
	]
	quest.687BFE692FDDE430.quest_subtitle: "The better plate."
	quest.687BFE692FDDE430.title: "&7Build Plate Advanced"
	quest.6880C52DD0366C72.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/malum_obelisk.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Two Runewood planks&r on the altar, &6two Hallowed Gold&r on the stands, plus &e16 Aerial&r and &e8 Sacred&r."
		""
		"Up to &efour&r obelisks nearby speed up every infusion. Otherwise a stack of Hex Ash takes minutes."
	]
	quest.6880C52DD0366C72.quest_subtitle: "The altar gets faster."
	quest.6880C52DD0366C72.title: "&eSet Up Runewood Obelisks"
	quest.68955C43FCF9E50A.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Easy Villagers:\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" Look at a villager and press \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.easy_villagers.pick_up\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\", and you have them as an item in your inventory. A right click puts them down again. In the mod's blocks they work without walking around: \"},{\"text\":\"Trader\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" for trading, \"},{\"text\":\"Breeder\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" for offspring, \"},{\"text\":\"Farmer\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Farm\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Converter\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Incubator\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\". Recipes in EMI.\"}]"
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"If you do not like an offer, switch it in the trading window with the button or with \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.easy_villagers.cycle_trades\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\". That works as long as you have not traded with them yet.\"}]"
		""
		"Villagers in blocks do not walk, do not pathfind and cost the server almost nothing. A trading hall is best built this way."
	]
	quest.68955C43FCF9E50A.quest_subtitle: "As an item, and with new offers."
	quest.68955C43FCF9E50A.title: "&aTake a Villager Along"
	quest.689CD3C6861A5DC5.quest_desc: [
		"Three glass at the top, ME Drive, glass cable, ME Drive in the middle, iron, Logic Processor, iron at the bottom."
		""
		"The arrow in the middle sets the direction: out of the cell into the network or out of the network into the cell. Finished cells move to the output slots. That is how you move a full 1k cell over to a 16k cell."
		""
		"&6Acceleration Cards&r move more per step, the &6Redstone Card&r switches it by signal."
	]
	quest.689CD3C6861A5DC5.quest_subtitle: "Fill or empty cells in seconds."
	quest.689CD3C6861A5DC5.title: "&6Build an ME IO Port"
	quest.68B0BEF2F3D4B62B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r Compressed Iron, &6Remote&r, Compressed Iron oben, &6PCB&r, &6Drone&r, &6Advanced Pressure Tube&r in der Mitte, Compressed Iron, &6Network Registry&r, Compressed Iron unten. Das Remote: Network IO Port, zwei Transistoren, GPS Tool, zwei Transistoren, Network Data Storage."
		""
		"Leg eine programmierte Drohne oder eine &6Network API&r hinein. Der Block führt das Programm mit einer &eMinidrohne&r aus, die keine echte Einheit ist: kein Pfadfinden, sie geht durch Wände, der Server dankt. Dafür 10 mL Luft pro Tick statt 1."
		""
		"Was sie sammelt, nimmst du an den Seiten des Blocks ab, Flüssigkeiten an jeder Seite. Ein Slot und 16 Eimer Tank, jedes Inventory Upgrade (bis 35) gibt einen Slot und 1 000 mB mehr. Teile wie Entity Attack, Teleport und Standby kann sie nicht. Für große Gruben und große Bauten ist sie das richtige Werkzeug."
	]
	quest.68B0BEF2F3D4B62B.quest_subtitle: "Eine Drohne im Block, die durch Wände geht."
	quest.68B0BEF2F3D4B62B.title: "&5Bau einen Programmable Controller"
	quest.68C1AE0C047671EE.quest_desc: [
		"Put, for example, &6two iron&r and &6one gold&r with the blueprint. The head averages the stats and takes along the traits of both."
		""
		"The &6synergy&r in the tooltip drops the more different the materials are. &6Rustic&r (paper, terracotta) lifts a low synergy, &6Synergistic&r (emerald) rewards a high one."
	]
	quest.68C1AE0C047671EE.quest_subtitle: "Stats are averaged."
	quest.68C1AE0C047671EE.title: "&7Mix two materials in a head"
	quest.68C246034187E5F6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_washing.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Pink Slime Ingots&r top left and right, a &6Meat Feeder&r top middle, plastic around the &6Advanced Frame&r, Diamond Gears and a furnace at the bottom. Pink Slime Ingot: two iron, two gold and 1,000 mB of Pink Slime in the Dissolution Chamber."
		""
		"&eIn:&r an ore and &6Liquid Meat&r from the slaughter factory. &eOut:&r &6Raw Ore Meat&r of that ore. It draws &d60 FE/t&r."
	]
	quest.68C246034187E5F6.quest_subtitle: "Ore and Liquid Meat become Raw Ore Meat."
	quest.68C246034187E5F6.title: "&4Build a Washing Factory"
	quest.68DB324F17A467F3.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_network.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Build an &6Energy Acceptor&r (iron in the corners, quartz glass on the sides, copper in the middle) and an &6ME Terminal&r (shapeless: Formation Core, Annihilation Core, Illuminated Panel, Logic Processor). Connect everything with &6Fluix ME Glass Cables&r (a quartz fiber and two fluix give four)."
		""
		"The acceptor turns &d2 FE into 1 AE&r. An &6Energy Cell&r (200,000 AE) next to it catches power spikes when you store things, otherwise the network restarts for a moment."
		""
		"Without a controller the network is &ead hoc&r and carries at most &e8 devices&r with a channel. With the ninth everything goes dark."
	]
	quest.68DB324F17A467F3.quest_subtitle: "Drive, power, terminal, cable."
	quest.68DB324F17A467F3.title: "&b&lConnect your first network"
	quest.68E11E26D9DEED7A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_boiler.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Place &64 Steam Engines&r on a big boiler and &64 Blaze Burners&r below. The Engineer's Goggles show the &eboiler level&r and what is missing: heat, water or size."
		""
		"Every heated burner counts one level of heat, a superheated one two. The smallest of the three values sets the level, and every level lets one more engine run at full power."
		""
		"&cCommon mistake:&r too little water. A slow pump is only enough for small levels."
	]
	quest.68E11E26D9DEED7A.quest_subtitle: "Every boiler level carries one more engine."
	quest.68E11E26D9DEED7A.title: "&6Build a boiler plant"
	quest.68E4F8A151C4D3FA.quest_desc: [
		"&63 stone bricks&r, &62 dyes&r, a &6Warp Stone&r and &63 obsidian&r make a &6Sharestone&r."
		""
		"All sharestones of the same colour are connected, and every player can use them. Good for a team or the route between your bases and spawn."
	]
	quest.68E4F8A151C4D3FA.quest_subtitle: "One network for everyone in one colour."
	quest.68E4F8A151C4D3FA.title: "&6Connect with sharestones"
	quest.6901DD2F58427A21.quest_desc: [
		"&6Building Gadgets 2&r öffnet mit &6Stufe 2&r. Der &6Baugadget&r (Eisen, Redstone, zwei Diamanten, Lapislazuli) setzt ganze Wände, Böden und Säulen aus deinem Inventar mit einem Klick, bis zu 32 Blöcke weit. Der &6Tauschgadget&r ersetzt eine Fläche durch einen anderen Block, der &6Abrissgadget&r (mit Enderperlen) räumt einen Bereich leer."
		""
		"{image:buildinggadgets2:textures/item/gadget_building.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Alle Gadgets laufen mit Strom, den es ebenfalls erst ab Stufe 2 gibt. Der &6Kopiergadget&r (mit Smaragden) und der &6Vorlagenverwalter&r für gespeicherte Bauten kommen in &6Stufe 3&r. Bis dahin: Hand, Rahmensäge und Meißel."
		""
		"&6Mining Gadgets&r (Stufe 3) gehören dazu: ein Laser, der Tunnel in jeder Größe gräbt. Mehr dazu im Kapitel &6Logistik&r."
	]
	quest.6901DD2F58427A21.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 2."
	quest.6901DD2F58427A21.title: "&dAusblick: Building Gadgets"
	quest.6911E81D6D6096F4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_nouveau_mana.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"The blue bar at the bottom left is your mana. A spell costs the sum of its glyphs, and mana refills on its own."
		""
		"&eThe numbers on the server:&r base &e100 mana&r, &e5 per second&r back. Every glyph you learn gives &e+15&r maximum and &e+0.33&r per second. Every book tier gives &e+50&r and &e+1&r per second."
		""
		"The enchantment &dMana Boost&r adds &e+25&r per level, &dMana Regen&r &e+2&r per second and level. So learning glyphs pays off twice."
	]
	quest.6911E81D6D6096F4.quest_subtitle: "Every spell costs mana, every glyph gives some."
	quest.6911E81D6D6096F4.title: "&dKeep an eye on the mana bar"
	quest.69161FEA6C5C569B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Stella Arcanum&r is a rare ore between &eY -44 and Y 42&r, two tiny veins per chunk. If you mine it without &6Silk Touch&r, it &cexplodes&r with radius 3 and deals block damage, but drops a &6Stellarite Piece&r."
		""
		"{image:forbidden_arcanus:textures/item/stellarite_piece.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"With Silk Touch you take the block along and mine it at home, where the explosion breaks nothing. Nine pieces give a &6Stellarite Block&r."
		""
		"&eOutlook:&r You need Stellarite for &eforge tier 4&r (four pieces), the Eternal Stella and the Boss Catcher. All of that comes in stage 3 and 4, but collect it now anyway."
	]
	quest.69161FEA6C5C569B.quest_subtitle: "A star in the stone, and it explodes."
	quest.69161FEA6C5C569B.title: "&eFind Stella Arcanum"
	quest.692BB8E34F1C80AA.quest_desc: [
		"Now everything together: let the network build &6Advanced Control Circuits&r for the obelisk."
		""
		"&eHow it works:&r A processing pattern for Printed Silicon at an AE2 inscriber (Autocrafter in front, Importer behind). A second one for Infused Alloy at a Metallurgic Infuser, a third for Basic Control Circuits from vacuum tubes. A crafting pattern puts it all together. An Exporter with an Autocrafting Upgrade on a chest keeps the stock until you carry it to the obelisk."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r &e\"The Furnace Never Sleeps\"&r wants &e250 Advanced Control Circuits&r and &e4,000 steel ingots&r. With RS the factory is cheaper than with AE2, because it needs no accumulation processors and no CPU. Hand-in is by hand at the obelisk."
		""
		"Plus two 16k disks so storage does not fill up first."
	]
	quest.692BB8E34F1C80AA.quest_subtitle: "The furnace never sleeps, and neither does the Autocrafter."
	quest.692BB8E34F1C80AA.title: "&3&lThe Circuit Factory with RS"
	quest.6939B2E743839A21.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_fermenter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e4 cauldrons, 4 Iron Sheetmetal, 6 Steel Scaffolding, 2 Light Engineering Blocks, 2 fluid pipes, 1 Redstone Engineering Block&r. Hammer on the middle cauldron on the side of the Redstone block."
		""
		"&eIn:&r at the back through the blue hatches: potatoes, sugar cane, apples, melons, berries, beetroot, honey. &eOut:&r Ethanol below the orange hatch. One potato gives 80 mB for 6,400 FE."
	]
	quest.6939B2E743839A21.quest_subtitle: "3x3x3, potatoes in, Ethanol out."
	quest.6939B2E743839A21.title: "&eForm an Industrial Fermenter"
	quest.693A5D6E1304403E.quest_desc: [
		"&e6 Livingwood logs&r, &e1 copper sheet&r from the Create press and &e1 petal&r. Place it no more than 6 blocks from your flowers and bind it to its target with the wand (bind mode)."
		""
		"It fires as long as the target takes mana, a new burst only when the last one has arrived. Long distances cost mana; the sparks in the aiming beam show where the loss begins."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Redstone stops it. Right click with wool muffles the sound, with scaffolding it gets a frame that levers stick to."
	]
	quest.693A5D6E1304403E.quest_subtitle: "Shoots mana from A to B."
	quest.693A5D6E1304403E.title: "&aSet up a Mana Spreader"
	quest.6945CB7F11D4A119.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_transporters.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Redstone in the corners, an &6ender pearl&r at the top, &6gold&r left and right (&6lapis&r for fluids, hoppers instead of gold and dispensers instead of pistons for the World Transporter), a &6piston&r at the bottom, the Pity Frame in the middle. That gives two."
		""
		"One transporter on the side it pulls from, one on the side it inserts into. Right click the middle to switch direction, filter in the window."
	]
	quest.6945CB7F11D4A119.quest_subtitle: "From block to block."
	quest.6945CB7F11D4A119.title: "&bConnect Two Inventories with Transporters"
	quest.6963096E96DF4F85.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_atomic_forge.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Flux Gate&r, &6Duratium&r, Flux Gate at the top, &6plastic&r, &6Enderic Compound&r, plastic in the middle, three plating at the bottom. Eight cores around it, power &eonly by laser&r."
		""
		"The Foundry casts &6Duratium&r from platinum and a netherite ingot. The forge makes &6Silicon Wafers&r, uranium gems for the reactor, Duratium and reinforced deepslate."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r It does not make Mekanism's control circuits. Those only come along the path of the Mekanism chapter."
	]
	quest.6963096E96DF4F85.quest_subtitle: "Only a laser can charge it."
	quest.6963096E96DF4F85.title: "&5Feed an Atomic Forge"
	quest.696E8BE753E8080E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Axe blueprint&r plus &ethree&r material makes the axe head, plus a rod."
		""
		"Iron gives the axe -0.1 attack speed. Flint makes it dangerous in combat with Jagged."
	]
	quest.696E8BE753E8080E.quest_subtitle: "Axe head from three material."
	quest.696E8BE753E8080E.title: "&6Build an axe"
	quest.696F84A6E32481C2.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Capturing&r enchantment (up to level III, for swords) makes monsters drop their spawn egg with &e0.5 percent per level&r. Bosses and some monsters are excluded."
		""
		"With a spawn egg you switch a spawner to another monster: right click the spawner with the egg, done. Zombie spawner from the dungeon, skeletons inside."
	]
	quest.696F84A6E32481C2.quest_subtitle: "Spawn eggs from monsters."
	quest.696F84A6E32481C2.title: "&aCapturing"
	quest.69720528BCB75EF8.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_stock_ticker.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Glass&r, &6Stock Link&r and &6gold ingot&r stacked make the &6Stock Ticker&r. Put it into the same network with a mob on a &6Seat&r (wool and a wooden slab) next to it."
		""
		"Click the mob: you see everything in the network and order. The packagers send the goods to the address you give."
		""
		"A &6Redstone Requester&r (redstone, Stock Link, iron ingot) places a fixed order on every pulse."
	]
	quest.69720528BCB75EF8.quest_subtitle: "A seller delivers whatever is in the network."
	quest.69720528BCB75EF8.title: "&6Order at the Stock Ticker"
	quest.69790E9D943B0BE4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crafting Interface:&r iron, crafting tables, both transformers and a menril block. &6Crafting Writer:&r crafting table, Output Transformer, crafting table."
		""
		"The interface faces a crafting table or a machine and gets recipes as cards that you build &eyourself&r in the programmer. A green tick shows a valid recipe. The writer starts orders."
		""
		"More work than with AE2, but you tie every order to conditions of your own."
	]
	quest.69790E9D943B0BE4.quest_subtitle: "Autocrafting, written by yourself."
	quest.69790E9D943B0BE4.title: "&3Let the network craft"
	quest.698B1FF1187D7466.quest_desc: [
		"Sechs &6Flux-Blöcke&r oben und unten, zwei &6Glasscheiben&r links und rechts ergeben den &6Einfachen Flux-Speicher&r (Basic Flux Storage): &d2.000.000 FE&r, und er nimmt oder gibt bis zu &d20.000 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Ein Speicher hängt direkt im Netz, ohne Stecker oder Punkt. Er füllt sich, wenn mehr hereinkommt als die Punkte verlangen, und gibt ab, wenn die Stecker nicht reichen. Die Anzeige am Block zeigt den Füllstand."
		""
		"Abgebaut behält er seinen Strom. 24 Kerne (54 Staub, 24 Obsidian, 6 Quelljuwelen) sind nicht wenig; eine Powah-Energiezelle neben einem Punkt ist billiger, aber ein Flux-Speicher puffert für das ganze Netz, auch über Dimensionen hinweg."
	]
	quest.698B1FF1187D7466.quest_subtitle: "Zwei Millionen FE im Netz."
	quest.698B1FF1187D7466.title: "&9&lBau einen Flux-Speicher"
	quest.698F03C1F29CA1B2.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Platinen-Vorlage&r (PCB Blueprint) lässt sich nicht craften. Bau ein &6Amadron-Tablet&r (sieben &6Kunststoffplatten&r um ein &6GPS-Werkzeug&r, unten in der Mitte ein &6Luftkanister&r), klick damit auf eine Truhe mit &e8 Smaragden&r und bestell die Vorlage. Eine Drohne von Amadron holt die Smaragde ab, eine zweite liefert."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/item/pcb_blueprint.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Oder du findest einen &6Druckmechaniker&r: Dieser Dorfbewohner hat sein eigenes Haus in manchen Dörfern, und jeder arbeitslose Dorfbewohner nimmt den Beruf an einer Ladestation an. Er handelt unter anderem mit der Vorlage."
		""
		"Amadron braucht Luft im Tablet und verkauft noch mehr: einen Eimer Öl für einen Smaragd, und es kauft deine Brennstoffe, zum Beispiel 1 000 mB LPG oder 4 000 mB Diesel für je einen Smaragd. Die Montageprogramme aus Stufe 3 kommen ebenfalls von dort."
	]
	quest.698F03C1F29CA1B2.quest_subtitle: "Die gibt es nur im Handel."
	quest.698F03C1F29CA1B2.title: "&9Besorg die Platinen-Vorlage"
	quest.698F46D26E3952FD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Solargenerator:&r drei Solarmodule auf Infundierter Legierung, Eisen, Osmium und einem Energietablett. &6Windgenerator:&r Osmium, Legierung, zwei Energietabletts und ein Schaltkreis, braucht freien Himmel über sich."
		""
		"&eMekanism, Solargenerator:&r &d20 FE/t&r bei Tag und freiem Himmel, nachts und im Regen nichts. &eWindgenerator:&r &d24 FE/t&r unten ab Y 24, &d192 FE/t&r ganz oben, steigt mit der Höhe. Beide ohne Brennstoff. Offen ab Stufe 2. Der &6Erweiterte Solargenerator&r mit 120 FE/t kommt in Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.698F46D26E3952FD.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, 20 FE/t Sonne, 24 bis 192 FE/t Wind."
	quest.698F46D26E3952FD.title: "&6Bau Solar- und Windgenerator"
	quest.69929D91298A3292.quest_desc: [
		"In der Anlage, wieder bei &e30 bis 60 Grad&r: &b100 mB Hefekultur&r und ein &6Zucker&r ergeben &b50 mB Ethanol&r. Ein Apfel gibt ebenso viel, eine Kartoffel die Hälfte. Die Gärung wärmt die Anlage selbst, behalt die Temperatur im Auge."
		""
		"Ethanol brennt im Flüssigkeitskompressor mit &e400 000 mL&r Luft pro Eimer. Viel wertvoller ist es als Zutat für Biodiesel."
	]
	quest.69929D91298A3292.quest_subtitle: "Hefe und Zucker."
	quest.69929D91298A3292.title: "&2Brau Ethanol"
	quest.69A08D86B0B6473F.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Blue Yonder&r aus der Schiffswrack-Schatztruhe trägt den &6Planetenpfirsich&r. Er macht satt wie eine &6Goldene Karotte&r und ist damit das stärkste Obst von Productive Trees."
		""
		"Am Baum reift er extrem langsam. Steck den Setzling in einen &6Trichter-Pflanztopf&r, dort fällt die Frucht bei jeder Ernte mit ab."
	]
	quest.69A08D86B0B6473F.quest_subtitle: "Das beste Obst des Mods, aus einem Schiffswrack."
	quest.69A08D86B0B6473F.title: "&bErnte Planetenpfirsiche"
	quest.69A7367B6C584860.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Chaos Islands&r lie in the End on a grid of &e10,000 blocks&r, each with about a 160 block radius, with the &5Chaos Crystal&r at height 80. For the finale the obelisk takes everyone there."
		""
		"The crystal cannot be mined as long as the Guardian lives."
	]
	quest.69A7367B6C584860.quest_subtitle: "The place of the finale."
	quest.69A7367B6C584860.title: "&8Find the Chaos Island"
	quest.69AAD91CE2D28D63.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/undergarden_guardian.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Deep in the catacombs stands the &4Forgotten Guardian&r, a colossus of old metal. Slay it, ideally with two or three people."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r Only when a player kills it do &e4 to 16&r &6Forgotten Nuggets&r drop."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A good reason for a joint trip on stream. Whoever finds a catacomb shares the coordinates in chat."
	]
	quest.69AAD91CE2D28D63.quest_subtitle: "The boss of the catacombs."
	quest.69AAD91CE2D28D63.title: "&4&lDefeat the Forgotten Guardian"
	quest.69B3257A1E5B98E5.quest_desc: [
		"A Steel Casing in the middle, steel left and right, circuits at the top and bottom, redstone in the corners."
		""
		"It rolls ingots into Immersive Engineering wires: copper, steel, lead, aluminum, &etwo&r per ingot."
	]
	quest.69B3257A1E5B98E5.quest_subtitle: "The CNC Rolling Mill."
	quest.69B3257A1E5B98E5.title: "&3Roll wires"
	quest.69BF2A95F5E4E623.quest_desc: [
		"&6Laser:&r three Reinforced Alloys on the left, middle Energy Tablet, Steel Casing, Energy Tablet, a diamond on the right. &6Amplifier:&r steel all around, Basic Energy Cube in the middle, a diamond on the right."
		""
		"The laser draws &d4,000 FE/t&r and burns everything away, you too. Lasers fire into the amplifier, which collects and fires at the Laser Focus Matrix, controlled by redstone and a threshold in its window."
	]
	quest.69BF2A95F5E4E623.quest_subtitle: "The match of the reactor."
	quest.69BF2A95F5E4E623.title: "&cBuild a Laser and Laser Amplifier"
	quest.69C7E3C6C2F50FFF.quest_desc: [
		"Worktable: book, two &6Arcane Gold&r, four &6obsidian&r, extra two &6diamonds&r and two &6Gold Inlays&r."
		""
		"It gives exactly one enchantment at level I or raises an existing one by one, on enchanted items too. Every step costs levels and Soul Shards."
	]
	quest.69C7E3C6C2F50FFF.quest_subtitle: "Enchanting without gambling."
	quest.69C7E3C6C2F50FFF.title: "&dBuild a Soul Enchanter"
	quest.69CD1C187DA5DB28.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/silent_gear_repair_kit.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Top a &6stick&r, middle &6Template Board, iron ingot, Template Board&r, bottom &6three Template Boards&r. Kit plus material fills it, kit plus tool repairs."
		""
		"The material has to be one from the head. The kit holds &e16&r units at &e35 percent&r effectiveness. With stone instead of iron: 8 units, 30 percent."
	]
	quest.69CD1C187DA5DB28.quest_subtitle: "Material in, tool whole."
	quest.69CD1C187DA5DB28.title: "&6Fill a Repair Kit"
	quest.69D4965D9560FA59.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron&r in the corners, &6redstone&r at the top and bottom, &6gold&r left and right, a &6Draconium Ingot&r in the middle."
		""
		"The modules are made from it: AOE, Speed, Damage, Junk Filter, Night Vision, Undying and more. EMI shows the recipes. Wyvern modules fit into Wyvern gear."
	]
	quest.69D4965D9560FA59.quest_subtitle: "The base of every module."
	quest.69D4965D9560FA59.title: "&dBuild Module Cores"
	quest.69D4ECB6512A62EA.quest_desc: [
		"Eine &6Truhe&r und eine &6Eisentür&r formlos ergeben den &6Kühlschrank&r. Er lagert Zutaten wie eine Küchentheke, nur mit Tür, und zwei Kühlschränke übereinander werden zu einem großen."
		""
		"Zwei Upgrades stecken in den Kühlschrank: Die &6Konservierungskammer&r (drei Redstone, zwei Eisen, Komparator) sorgt dafür, dass der letzte Gegenstand eines Platzes nie verbraucht wird. Ein Ei, ein Zucker, eine Milch bleiben also immer liegen, und das Kochbuch zeigt die Rezepte weiter an. Die &6Eiseinheit&r (drei Schneebälle, zwei Eisen, Komparator) liefert Schnee und Eis für Rezepte."
	]
	quest.69D4ECB6512A62EA.quest_subtitle: "Zutaten mit Tür, und ein Upgrade, das nie leer wird."
	quest.69D4ECB6512A62EA.title: "&6Stell einen Kühlschrank auf"
	quest.69DDB1C6A3578614.quest_desc: [
		"Four Plutonium Pellets in the corners, four &6Hyper-Dense Drives&r on the sides, a &bPolonium Pellet&r in the middle. It holds &e1,048,000 items&r in &e1,024 types&r."
		""
		"&eThe last one:&r Four Polonium Pellets, four Time-Dilating Drives and an &5antimatter pellet&r make the &6Supermassive QIO Drive&r with &e16 billion&r items in 8,192 types."
	]
	quest.69DDB1C6A3578614.quest_subtitle: "A million items."
	quest.69DDB1C6A3578614.title: "&dBuild a Time-Dilating QIO Drive"
	quest.69DF02F52FB7DE1F.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Enchanted Spell Turret&r in the middle, &e3 Manipulation Essences&r and the &6Focus of Transmutation&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"The &6Transmutation Infused Turret&r casts every spell as if it were wearing the focus. In return each shot costs more Source."
	]
	quest.69DF02F52FB7DE1F.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: the focus as a spell turret."
	quest.69DF02F52FB7DE1F.title: "&6Build a Transmutation turret"
	quest.69E0EC05B3CAA42C.quest_desc: [
		"&eTime of Day&r: the train leaves at a set time, for example every morning to the mine."
	]
	quest.69E0EC05B3CAA42C.quest_subtitle: "Departure by the clock."
	quest.69E0EC05B3CAA42C.title: "&7Time of Day"
	quest.69FD9D23919448A7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mana Pylon&r: &6gold&r top and bottom, middle Manasteel, &bMana Diamond&r, Manasteel. Two pylons next to an enchanting table already bring it to level 30."
		""
		"The Mana Enchanter is a structure of about 11x7 blocks from &e17 obsidian&r, &e10 Mystical Flowers&r, &e6 Mana Pylons&r and a &6lapis block&r in the middle. The Lexica shows the exact plan. A right click with the Wand of the Forest on the lapis block awakens it."
		""
		"Put the tool into the enchanter, throw &6enchanted books&r into the obsidian circle and click with the wand. It transfers the first enchantment of each book, the books are kept. It is paid with mana, fastest through a spark."
	]
	quest.69FD9D23919448A7.quest_subtitle: "Enchanting without losing the book."
	quest.69FD9D23919448A7.title: "&bBuild a Mana Enchanter"
	quest.69FE80CC6AEEE44F.quest_desc: [
		"Hinter dem Tor steht der &6Verfluchte Grabstein&r. Rechtsklick ruft &cMaledictus&r: &e420 Lebenspunkte&r, Rüstung 10, 13 Schaden im Nahkampf, Phantomhellebarden für 11, Phantompfeile für 5. Sein Sturzflug kostet dich 10 Prozent deiner Lebenspunkte, der Flächenschlag 15."
		""
		"&eSo geht es:&r Er greift in festen Mustern an, jedes Muster hat eine Pause am Ende. Schild hoch, Pfeile und Hellebarden abwarten, dann drei bis vier Schläge. Treffer über 20 werden gekappt, mehr als 13 pro Sekunde zählen nicht."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r &e3 bis 4 Cursium-Barren&r. Mit Schwarzstahl werden daraus sofort Waffen: &6Fluchbogen&r (2 Cursium, 1 Schwarzstahl, 3 Faden, schießt drei Phantompfeile), &6Soul Render&r (3 Cursium, 2 Schwarzstahl, 15 Schaden, Ansturm und Hellebardenspirale) und &6The Annihilator&r (2 Cursium, 1 Schwarzstahl, hohe kritische Treffer, aufladbar)."
		""
		"Die &6Cursium-Rüstung&r braucht Netheritrüstung und eine Cursium-Vorlage, die kommt in Stufe 2. Der Grabstein ruft Maledictus nach einer Minute wieder."
	]
	quest.69FE80CC6AEEE44F.quest_subtitle: "Der verfluchte Ritter hinter dem Siegeltor."
	quest.69FE80CC6AEEE44F.title: "&c&lBesiege Maledictus"
	quest.6A03B7F54126F192.quest_desc: [
		"One row: &6Atomic Alloy&r, Elite Control Circuit, Atomic Alloy. The path through the Metallurgic Infuser is removed on Kronwerke."
		""
		"{image:mekanism:textures/item/ultimate_control_circuit.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Ultimate Control Circuits go into QIO, the Quantum Entangloporter, fusion, the MekaSuit and the machines of ore quintupling. Make more right away."
	]
	quest.6A03B7F54126F192.quest_subtitle: "Elite in the middle, atomic on the outside."
	quest.6A03B7F54126F192.title: "&d&lBuild an Ultimate Control Circuit"
	quest.6A077EA3DE80B239.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_radio_tower.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e90 concrete, 76 Aluminium Sheetmetal, 16 Aluminium Sheetmetal slabs, 11 Redstone Engineering Blocks, 6 Aluminium Fences, 4 Steel Sheetmetal, 2 Radiator Blocks, 2 Light Engineering Blocks&r. Shape as in the manual, then the hammer on it."
		""
		"&eIn:&r &d128 FE/t&r at the left connector, a redstone signal at the middle one. &eOut:&r the same signal at every tower on the same frequency (128 to 384 kHz) in range. Higher and more open means farther."
	]
	quest.6A077EA3DE80B239.quest_subtitle: "5x19x6, redstone signals over long distances."
	quest.6A077EA3DE80B239.title: "&bForm a Radio Tower"
	quest.6A0980ECDAC0B03B.quest_desc: [
		"Material: &e4 ice&r, with Silk Touch from a cold biome."
		""
		"Plus &e4 Inferium Essence&r and a &6Prosperity Seed Base&r in the Infusion Altar."
	]
	quest.6A0980ECDAC0B03B.quest_subtitle: "One seed, one checkmark."
	quest.6A0980ECDAC0B03B.title: "Seed: Ice"
	quest.6A1A68A159905715.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Millstone&r behind the cobblestone generator turns cobblestone into &6gravel&r and gravel into &6flint&r, 250 ticks per piece. For &6sand&r put 2 &6Fire Essence&r and 2 &6Earth Essence&r diagonally into the grid: 16 sand. 2 Stone and 2 Earth Essence make 16 gravel."
		""
		"Gravel in front of a &6fan&r with water (gravel washing): flint and iron nuggets, the nuggets for your andesite alloy. Sandstone in the millstone turns back into sand."
		""
		"&cStage 2:&r Crushing wheels and the Mekanism Crusher turn gravel straight into sand, see the right side."
	]
	quest.6A1A68A159905715.quest_subtitle: "Cobblestone becomes gravel, essence becomes sand."
	quest.6A1A68A159905715.title: "&7Grind gravel and sand"
	quest.6A1B163535AD591B.quest_desc: [
		"Like the Furnator, only with a &6bucket&r in place of the furnace. A bucket of lava gives &e10,000 FE&r."
		""
		"Output in every tier as with the Furnator: Starter 20 up to Spirited 8,000 FE/t. Next to a lava pump from the Nether it runs without a break."
	]
	quest.6A1B163535AD591B.quest_subtitle: "Lava in place of coal."
	quest.6A1B163535AD591B.title: "&cBuild a Magmator"
	quest.6A241CE5D0BECCDA.quest_desc: [
		"Shoot the shield down, then the last &e1,000&r health. Whoever dies comes back by Dislocator. Stay together until it falls."
		""
		"All streamers are live, everyone sees the fight from their own view. Only one lands the last hit, so you check off this quest yourself once the Guardian is dead and you were there."
	]
	quest.6A241CE5D0BECCDA.quest_subtitle: "Live on every stream."
	quest.6A241CE5D0BECCDA.title: "&4&lDefeat the Chaos Guardian"
	quest.6A2BE40D95C51185.quest_desc: [
		"Leder, Faden und eine Truhe an der Werkbank. Die &6Upgrade-Basis&r (Leder, Eisen, Faden) wird zu Pickup, Magnet und Werkzeugtausch. Kapitel &6Lager&r."
		""
		"Lederrucksack: 27 Plätze, 1 Upgrade. Kupfer (45) und Eisen (54, 2 Upgrades) kommen in Stufe 2, Gold und Diamant in Stufe 3, Netherit in Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.6A2BE40D95C51185.quest_subtitle: "Sophisticated Backpacks: 27 Plätze auf dem Rücken."
	quest.6A2BE40D95C51185.title: "&6Näh einen Rucksack"
	quest.6A30DE88BFFE3BB6.quest_desc: [
		"Every higher rod: a &6quartz block&r at the top, the new tier's capacitors left and right of the casing, the old rod at the bottom."
		""
		"&eFE/t per rod:&r Starter 100, Basic 400, Hardened 1,000, Blazing 4,000, Niotic 10,000, Spirited 40,000. With crystals from 120,000 FE on, that turns minutes into seconds. The line to the rods has to carry that."
	]
	quest.6A30DE88BFFE3BB6.quest_subtitle: "More FE per tick at the orb."
	quest.6A30DE88BFFE3BB6.title: "&8Upgrade the rods"
	quest.6A354EC0C917FB13.quest_desc: [
		"Place a track, right click it with tracks in hand and click on the end point. The preview shows green for possible, red for too steep or too tight."
		""
		"One section is up to &e32 blocks&r long. With the sprint key held the curve gets as wide as possible. Blocks in the off hand are paved in as a bed."
		""
		"If you start in the middle of a line, a junction is made. Moving trains hurt whatever stands on the track."
	]
	quest.6A354EC0C917FB13.quest_subtitle: "Click, click, curve."
	quest.6A354EC0C917FB13.title: "&6Lay a line"
	quest.6A45B2FDBE5FB744.quest_desc: [
		"In the Refinery, without a catalyst: &e12 mB of Acetaldehyde&r and &e8 mB of Creosote Oil&r make &e8 mB of Phenolic Resin&r."
		""
		"The creosote comes from the coke ovens. A full coke oven with coal blocks keeps a resin line running nicely."
	]
	quest.6A45B2FDBE5FB744.quest_subtitle: "Acetaldehyde and creosote."
	quest.6A45B2FDBE5FB744.title: "&dMix Phenolic Resin"
	quest.6A4E742097FC22FD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Bio-Generator:&r redstone, alloy, bio fuel, a circuit and iron. It burns &6bio fuel&r from the Crusher and supplies &d140 FE/t&r."
		""
		"A wheat or potato farm in front of the Crusher, and it runs without coal."
	]
	quest.6A4E742097FC22FD.quest_subtitle: "140 FE/t from crop leftovers."
	quest.6A4E742097FC22FD.title: "&aBurn bio fuel"
	quest.6A59403B53DB721C.quest_desc: [
		"Casing and an &6Elite Control Circuit&r give two &6Fission Reactor Ports&r. You need four: fuel, coolant, steam and waste."
		""
		"With the &6Configurator&r you switch each port's mode."
	]
	quest.6A59403B53DB721C.quest_subtitle: "In with fuel and water, out with steam and waste."
	quest.6A59403B53DB721C.title: "&7Build Reactor Ports"
	quest.6A632222EBEDA82E.quest_desc: [
		"In the Crystal Assembler: an Inscriber, three Capacity Cards and a Concurrent Processor."
		""
		"The &6Extended Inscriber&r works four inscriptions at the same time. There are also the &6Extended Molecular Assembler&r (eight jobs at once) and the &6ME Extended IO Port&r (eight times as fast)."
	]
	quest.6A632222EBEDA82E.quest_subtitle: "Four inscriptions at once."
	quest.6A632222EBEDA82E.title: "&3Build an Extended Inscriber"
	quest.6A657D4C208E284E.quest_desc: [
		"You recognize Runewood by its orange and yellow leaves, mostly on large plains. Plant saplings at home."
		""
		"From it: Spirit Altar, stands, obelisks and totems. &eTip:&r Sticky spots on the log give &6Runic Sap&r into a bottle once stripped."
	]
	quest.6A657D4C208E284E.quest_subtitle: "Oak, soaked with magic."
	quest.6A657D4C208E284E.title: "&6Fell Runewood"
	quest.6A6D0B961561C4E4.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Strigeor's Higher Binding."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6gunpowder&r, &6clay ball&r, &6phantom membrane&r, &6gray dye&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Djinni book."
		""
		"Paste plus dust in the crafting grid gives back the block: amethyst, obsidian, calcite, ice, emerald, lapis and more. With impure chalk it becomes &7Gray Chalk&r, the dark foundation for the Afrit pentacles."
	]
	quest.6A6D0B961561C4E4.quest_subtitle: "Dust becomes stone again."
	quest.6A6D0B961561C4E4.title: "&6Mix Gray Paste"
	quest.6A70633074FE9942.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6obsidian&r at the top, below that &6diamond block, Marker, diamond block&r twice."
		""
		"With it it digs through the bedrock too. Think of everyone building below you in the Nether or the mining dimension: the hole stays."
	]
	quest.6A70633074FE9942.quest_subtitle: "Through the bottom of the world."
	quest.6A70633074FE9942.title: "&8Build a Remove Bedrock Module"
	quest.6A7E9877C164CA29.quest_desc: [
		"&6Logistischer Sortierer:&r Eisen rundherum, oben in der Mitte ein Kolben, in der Mitte ein Schaltkreis. Er zieht aus der Kiste hinter ihm und schiebt in den Transporter vor ihm."
		""
		"Gib ihm einen Filter pro Barrensorte, zum Beispiel einen Tag wie &ec:ingots/osmium&r, und jedem Filter eine &eFarbe&r. Gefärbte Gegenstände laufen nur durch Transporter dieser Farbe. So landen Osmium, Kupfer und Eisen jedes in seiner eigenen Kiste, und der Rest nimmt den ungefärbten Weg."
		""
		"Die Transporter färbst du mit dem Konfigurator im Modus Färben."
	]
	quest.6A7E9877C164CA29.quest_subtitle: "Ein Sortierer am Ausgang."
	quest.6A7E9877C164CA29.title: "&eSortier die Barren"
	quest.6A8C83E6372A07F8.quest_desc: [
		"Crucible: &6Zombie Heart&r and &6rotten flesh&r. Then &6bone meal&r twice and stir twice. Finally &6charcoal&r: four Death Essence."
		""
		"The stronger &6Zombie Brutes&r drop the heart."
	]
	quest.6A8C83E6372A07F8.quest_subtitle: "From the heart of a Zombie Brute."
	quest.6A8C83E6372A07F8.title: "&8Brew Death Essence"
	quest.6A93D87D730FE408.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6Blazegold Ingots&r around a &6Blank Upgrade&r (both top corners, left and right of it, bottom middle) give the &6Blazegold Upgrade Template&r. One template and two Blazegold ingots give two templates."
		""
		"{image:justdirethings:textures/item/template_blazegold.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"At the &6Smithing Table&r: template on the left, Ferricore tool or armor in the middle, a &6Blazegold Ingot&r on the right. Out comes the Blazegold piece &ewith all installed upgrades&r."
		""
		"Blazegold opens new upgrades: &6Hammer&r (two diamond pickaxes) mines 3x3, &6Auto Smelter&r (two blast furnaces, two blaze rods) smelts ores while mining, &6Auto Smoker&r (two smokers, two blaze rods) cooks mob drops. Both cost some durability."
		""
		"For armor: &6Cauterize Wounds&r heals with a right click, &6Extinguish&r puts you out, &6Ground Stomp&r pushes enemies away, &6Stupefy&r makes them forget you, &6Swim Speed&r swims faster. The bow gets &6Splash&r for potion clouds on impact."
	]
	quest.6A93D87D730FE408.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade the tool, keep the upgrades."
	quest.6A93D87D730FE408.title: "&6&lMove Up to Blazegold"
	quest.6A9B352D1311E946.quest_desc: [
		"Ring plus &e1 Terrasteel ingot&r at the crafting table:"
		"&6Greater Band of Mana&r: about four times as much mana. &6Greater Band of Aura&r: generates much faster. &6Greater Ring of Magnetization&r: bigger range."
		""
		"Every ingot here is missing from the obelisk. Only after the goal."
	]
	quest.6A9B352D1311E946.quest_subtitle: "One ingot makes every ring bigger."
	quest.6A9B352D1311E946.title: "&aRefine three rings with Terrasteel"
	quest.6AA8FAEAF3F7E15A.quest_desc: [
		"Töte &e18 Endermen&r mit dem Learner im Inventar. Nachts in der Oberwelt, oder gleich dutzendweise im Warzenwald des Nethers."
		""
		"Das Modell kostet &d512 FE/t&r. Jede Vorhersage wird zu &616 Enderperlen&r oder einem Enderkristall. Die Grundvorhersage dieses Modells ist allerdings eine &5Ender-Vorhersage&r, und die ist bis &6Stufe 4&r gesperrt. Lohnt sich also erst mit dem End."
	]
	quest.6AA8FAEAF3F7E15A.quest_subtitle: "Perlen, ohne ins End zu müssen."
	quest.6AA8FAEAF3F7E15A.title: "&5Lerne den Enderman"
	quest.6AB0827A573C5867.quest_desc: [
		"Plastic, &6Diamond Gear&r, plastic at the top, &6pistons&r left and right of the &6Simple Frame&r, &6Gold Gears&r and redstone at the bottom."
		""
		"A drill with power, &d1,000 FE&r per operation, charges the first ore or fluid laser base in its work area. Several drills around one base make it faster."
	]
	quest.6AB0827A573C5867.quest_subtitle: "They charge every laser base in range."
	quest.6AB0827A573C5867.title: "&cBuild Two Laser Drills"
	quest.6AB3A70FA2E18096.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r The &64k Storage Part&r: four &6Basic Processors&r in the corners, enriched iron in the top middle, three &61k Storage Parts&r left, right and bottom, redstone in the center. The &616k Storage Part&r the same, only with four &6Improved Processors&r and three 4k parts."
		""
		"4k holds &e4,096&r items, 16k &e16,384&r. You upgrade a full disk by putting it into the crafting table with the bigger part: the contents stay, the small part comes back."
		""
		"A Disk Drive with eight 16k disks holds over 130,000 items. That is enough for a whole stage."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r The 64k part (four Advanced Processors, three 16k parts) opens in stage 4."
	]
	quest.6AB3A70FA2E18096.quest_subtitle: "The largest stage 3 has to offer."
	quest.6AB3A70FA2E18096.title: "&bUpgrade to 16k"
	quest.6ABC6EFAB9C1B498.quest_desc: [
		"An &6iron ingot&r over a &6stick&r. Gold or diamond work the same way."
		""
		"A worn iron or gold knife smelts into a nugget in the furnace."
	]
	quest.6ABC6EFAB9C1B498.quest_subtitle: "Lasts longer, cuts faster."
	quest.6ABC6EFAB9C1B498.title: "&7Forge an Iron Knife"
	quest.6ABEC2189EAC7037.quest_desc: [
		"A broom consists of three parts. &6Bare Rod&r: a Dark Stick on top and bottom, in the middle Crushed Dark Gem, Dark Stick, Crushed Dark Gem. &6Bare Brush&r: three Crushed Dark Gems over two Dark Sticks. &6Bare Cap&r: Crushed Dark Gem, Dark Gem, Crushed Dark Gem in a row."
		""
		"Refine each part with a material, for example rod with two planks, brush with three feathers, cap with two Dark Gems. The tooltip shows what the part gives the broom. Rod, brush and cap together in the crafting table give the &6Broom&r."
		""
		"Fill it with blood in the Blood Infuser, sit on it with right click and fly. Without blood it becomes very slow. Old brooms also lie in dungeon chests."
	]
	quest.6ABEC2189EAC7037.quest_subtitle: "Flying with blood in the tank."
	quest.6ABEC2189EAC7037.title: "&cBuild a Broom"
	quest.6ACA3F652BC2C991.quest_desc: [
		"&aMystical Agriculture&r lets you grow resources: stone, dirt, wood, later ores and even monsters. Everything starts with &6Inferium Essence&r. You get it in three ways: from &6Inferium Ore&r, from mobs and from the field."
		""
		"{image:mysticalagriculture:textures/item/inferium_essence.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eOre:&r Inferium Ore lies between &eY -32 and 64&r, up to 16 veins per chunk, and drops &e2 to 4 essence&r directly. Fortune counts. &eMobs:&r Every animal and every monster has a &e20 percent&r chance to drop an essence."
		""
		"&eWhat is open in stage 1:&r everything with Inferium: seeds, farmland, Growth Accelerator, Infusion Altar, Watering Can, tools and the first tier seeds. &cPrudentium&r and everything above comes with the later stages."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A book and an essence give the mod's &6Guide&r, with every recipe to look up."
	]
	quest.6ACA3F652BC2C991.quest_subtitle: "The essence this mod is made of."
	quest.6ACA3F652BC2C991.title: "&a&lCollect Inferium Essence"
	quest.6ADDBD81DEBE7D34.quest_desc: [
		"Chaotic tier. Catalyst: the &6Draconic Chestpiece&r. In eight injectors: &66 Awakened ingots&r, a &6Chaotic Core&r, a &6Chaotic Energy Controller&r. Costs 128 million energy. The Chaotic Bow works the same from the Draconic one."
		""
		"Modules stay in, and the Chaotic modules fit now too. With it, more Guardians on other islands are no longer a group task."
	]
	quest.6ADDBD81DEBE7D34.quest_subtitle: "The strongest shield of the season."
	quest.6ADDBD81DEBE7D34.title: "&8Fuse the Chaotic Chestpiece"
	quest.6AF0D65FDBDA3025.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pipez&r, &6Item-Rohr&r: &e4 Gegenstände pro Sekunde&r ohne Modifikation, 8 alle 15 Ticks mit der Normalen, 16 alle 10 Ticks mit der Verbesserten. Ein Ende zieht, alle anderen liefern. Filter erst mit der Fortgeschrittenen Modifikation in Stufe 3. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Sechs Eisen, zwei Werfer, ein Redstone ergeben 16 Rohre. Schleichen und Schraubenschlüssel stellt ein Ende auf Ziehen."
		""
		"Alle vier Pipez-Sorten im Kapitel Rohre und Router. Stufe 3 bringt das Universalrohr, Stufe 4 die Ultimative Modifikation mit 64 Stück pro Tick."
	]
	quest.6AF0D65FDBDA3025.quest_subtitle: "Pipez, Item-Rohr: 4 Stück pro Sekunde, mit Modifikation mehr."
	quest.6AF0D65FDBDA3025.title: "Lies: Pipez Item-Rohr"
	quest.6B059580EA028A54.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/finale_tech.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e4 Draconium Blocks&r into the Fusion Crafting Core, &e4 Draconium Cores&r, &a2 Gaia Spirit Ingots&r and &c1 Dragon Heart&r into the seven Wyvern injectors. Result: &54 Awakened Draconium Blocks&r for 50 million OP."
		""
		"For 64 blocks that is &e16 fusions&r, so 16 Dragon Hearts and 32 Gaia Spirit Ingots. Each block counts 50 points at the obelisk."
		""
		"Everything about the fusion is in the chapter &5Draconic: Awakened and Chaos&r."
	]
	quest.6B059580EA028A54.quest_subtitle: "Four blocks from one fusion."
	quest.6B059580EA028A54.title: "&6Fuse Awakened Draconium"
	quest.6B14156D0736CD7F.quest_desc: [
		"&dBlink&r: &6Manipulation Essence&r, &e4 ender pearls&r. &dIntangible&r: Manipulation Essence, &e3 phantom membranes&r, &e2 ender pearls&r."
		""
		"&eSelf, Blink&r jumps forward, &eProjectile, Blink&r to the impact. With a Warp Scroll in the off hand you send hit creatures there. Intangible briefly turns blocks into air, they come back afterwards."
	]
	quest.6B14156D0736CD7F.quest_subtitle: "Teleport and walk through walls."
	quest.6B14156D0736CD7F.title: "&dLearn Blink and Intangible"
	quest.6B193E39DE2E5226.quest_desc: [
		"Nexus towers stand where ruined warp portals appear, and in the biomes of the End Cities. An Explorer's Warp Scroll from a ruined warp portal can take you to one too."
		""
		"At the top stands a &6Warp Nexus&r. Used while sneaking it opens a compartment for &e9 Warp Scrolls&r, used normally you choose a target, in other dimensions too. In the tower that costs nothing. If you break it and rebuild it elsewhere, each jump costs &d1,000 source&r."
		""
		"The chest holds codex pages with random glyphs and Archwood fruit."
	]
	quest.6B193E39DE2E5226.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: a travel node on a ley line."
	quest.6B193E39DE2E5226.title: "&aFind a Nexus Tower"
	quest.6B20F917AD176832.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_sower.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Plastic, &6iron hoe&r, plastic at the top, &6iron axes&r left and right of the Pity Frame, &6Gold Gears&r and redstone at the bottom."
		""
		"It harvests ripe plants and fells trees with everything hanging on them, &d400 FE&r per operation. It produces &6Sludge&r while doing it. With a little Ether Gas it replants right away."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A tree field of Plant Sower and Plant Gatherer supplies logs for the extractors and charcoal for steel."
	]
	quest.6B20F917AD176832.quest_subtitle: "Harvests fields and fells whole trees."
	quest.6B20F917AD176832.title: "&2Set Up a Plant Gatherer"
	quest.6B350BA417B7DDA4.quest_desc: [
		"Place a &6Waystone&r in a safe spot, for example next to your portal or at a fortress."
		""
		"&eCost on Kronwerke:&r within one dimension 1 level per 100 blocks, a jump into another dimension &e27 levels&r. Between overworld and Nether the portal is the cheaper way."
		""
		"Wild waystones exist in the Nether too, about one every 25 chunks."
	]
	quest.6B350BA417B7DDA4.quest_subtitle: "Cheap within the Nether, expensive between worlds."
	quest.6B350BA417B7DDA4.title: "&bPut a waystone in the Nether"
	quest.6B361DC54D4A617C.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Eye, 1 Powdered Gold&r on a cloth. Costs &d320 mana&r."
		""
		"After that, eye contact holds every monster and every player you look at. Players get free as soon as they look away, monsters do not."
		""
		"&eAlso from Powdered Eye:&r Eyes of Insight (&e2 eye, 1 ender&r) show a target's inventory and effects, Eyes of the Black Flame (&e2 eye, 1 diamond&r) set black fire, which deals wither damage and eats no blocks."
	]
	quest.6B361DC54D4A617C.quest_subtitle: "One look, and it stands still."
	quest.6B361DC54D4A617C.title: "&2Draw Mystic Eyes of Binding"
	quest.6B36359B70DEBACF.quest_desc: [
		"Put an &6artifact&r into one of the extra slots next to your armour. You open the menu for it with the button in the inventory."
		""
		"&6Running Shoes&r make you faster, the &6Cloud in a Bottle&r gives a double jump, the &6Snorkel&r air under water, the &6Night Vision Goggles&r light at night. Rarely a zombie, skeleton or piglin wears one."
	]
	quest.6B36359B70DEBACF.quest_subtitle: "Small treasures with a big effect."
	quest.6B36359B70DEBACF.title: "&6Wear an artifact"
	quest.6B439F3677CCED34.quest_desc: [
		"&5Vexing log&r, &6Manipulation Essence&r, &e3 glass bottles&r. The &6Containment Jar&r: 3 archwood slabs on top, then glass in a frame."
		""
		"Catches a creature within &e3 blocks&r and puts it into a jar next to it. Creatures in jars count as neighbours for the Drygmy."
	]
	quest.6B439F3677CCED34.quest_subtitle: "A creature in a jar."
	quest.6B439F3677CCED34.title: "&aMake the Containment tablet"
	quest.6B4A2DC2AAAA5278.quest_desc: [
		"Deactivate the core, raise it one tier with &eTier Up&r in its window, turn on &eToggle Build Guide&r and place the blocks: &654 Draconium Blocks&r outside, &626 redstone blocks&r inside."
		""
		"&eStorage:&r &e9,880,000,000&r energy."
	]
	quest.6B4A2DC2AAAA5278.quest_subtitle: "54 and 26 blocks, 9.88 billion."
	quest.6B4A2DC2AAAA5278.title: "&cCore Tier 4"
	quest.6B4DAE9A47DF655D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_nouveau_imbuement.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put an &6amethyst shard&r or &6lapis lazuli&r into the chamber and wait. At &d500 Source&r the &6Source Gem&r is done, right click takes it out."
		""
		"{image:ars_nouveau:textures/item/source_gem.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Without a jar the first gem takes a few minutes. Use the time for the next parts: a Source Jar and a Sourcelink."
	]
	quest.6B4DAE9A47DF655D.quest_subtitle: "One amethyst shard, 500 Source, one gem."
	quest.6B4DAE9A47DF655D.title: "&d&lMake your first Source Gem"
	quest.6B680DC809E4DF01.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 totems&r if you have no Undying Module. Golden carrots. A stack of blocks for bridging. An &6Advanced Dislocator&r with &e16 ender pearls&r."
		""
		"The Chaos Island lies thousands of blocks from the center of the End. Whoever dies wakes up at their spawn point. Save the island in the Dislocator right on arrival, then you are back quickly."
	]
	quest.6B680DC809E4DF01.quest_subtitle: "Totems, food, a Dislocator, blocks."
	quest.6B680DC809E4DF01.title: "&ePack Your Bags"
	quest.6B7068DB0C72C3E9.quest_desc: [
		"Make &e16 Advanced Control Circuits&r. The bottleneck is Printed Silicon: trade with an AE2 player or build the CNC Stamper further down."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r In stage 3 the obelisk wants &e250 Advanced Control Circuits&r, each counts eight points. A stock pays off twice."
	]
	quest.6B7068DB0C72C3E9.quest_subtitle: "Every new machine wants two."
	quest.6B7068DB0C72C3E9.title: "&aStock up on 16 circuits"
	quest.6B783037E0EC6722.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Mundane Belt&r, plus &6Scryer's Oculus&r, &6Scry Crystal&r, &6Starbuncle Charm&r, &6Bookwyrm Charm&r. The oculus: Scry Crystal (eye of ender, source gem) with 4 blaze powder and 4 ender pearls."
		""
		"It accesses your Storage Lectern from afar, in the same dimension. With a netherite ingot, Nether Star and ender chest it becomes the &6Stabilized Warp Index&r for every dimension."
	]
	quest.6B783037E0EC6722.quest_subtitle: "Ars Additions: your storage in your pocket."
	quest.6B783037E0EC6722.title: "&bBuild a Warp Index"
	quest.6B793CB096A2A159.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/powah_ender_cell.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Ender Cell (Starter):&r obsidian in the corners, iron nuggets on the sides, an &6Ender Core&r in the middle. Basic with iron ingots."
		""
		"All Ender Cells on the same channel share one storage, wherever they stand. A shift click with an energy cell or battery in the window makes it larger. Starter has one channel, Spirited nine."
		""
		"&6Ender Gates&r (cables in place of nuggets, gives four) do the same in a smaller way, like a cable end."
	]
	quest.6B793CB096A2A159.quest_subtitle: "Ender Cells on one channel."
	quest.6B793CB096A2A159.title: "&5Share power without cables"
	quest.6B7AB17A8FB04252.quest_desc: [
		"Mine &6Thermal Springstone&r at the &chot springs&r and smelt it into &68 Thermal Springstone Ingots&r."
		""
		"It becomes armor (sets attackers on fire), tools, a scythe and a hammer. &eTip:&r Only fire destroys the giant plants at the springs."
	]
	quest.6B7AB17A8FB04252.quest_subtitle: "From the hot springs."
	quest.6B7AB17A8FB04252.title: "&cSmelt Thermal Springstone"
	quest.6B7DF4FA29B44FBB.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Plastic&r in a cross around a &6ghast tear&r make the &6Mob Imprisonment Tool&r."
		""
		"Right click an animal to put it inside, right click the ground to let it out. That is how you get cows into the barn, and the Mob Duplicator needs a captured mob as a template."
	]
	quest.6B7DF4FA29B44FBB.quest_subtitle: "A mob to go."
	quest.6B7DF4FA29B44FBB.title: "&5Build a Mob Imprisonment Tool"
	quest.6B8386805748948E.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6Crushing Wheels&r under the drop shaft hurt everything that falls in, without sword and without mana. The &6Mechanical Spawner&r spawns mobs from &6spawn fluid&r (heated mixer: liquid experience and water), &e100 mB per mob&r at 100 RPM or more. The &6Loot Collector&r at its spawn point catches the loot without a mob ever appearing."
		""
		"With rotten flesh, bones or gunpowder in the mixer, the random kind becomes zombie, skeleton or creeper. Spawner runes with a soul lantern ignore light."
		""
		"See the &6Create: Brass&r (crushing wheels, Mechanical Spawner), &6Create: Add-ons&r (spawn fluid) and &6Apotheosis&r (runes) chapters."
	]
	quest.6B8386805748948E.quest_subtitle: "Killing without mana, spawning without a spawner."
	quest.6B8386805748948E.title: "&cStage 2: crushing and spawn fluid"
	quest.6B8E68820566C2D0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_auto_workbench.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e4 Light and 2 Heavy Engineering Blocks, 5 Steel Scaffolding, 4 conveyor belts, 2 treated wood slabs, 1 Redstone Engineering Block&r. Hammer on the block the manual shows."
		""
		"Put a blueprint on the drawing table and choose the part. &eIn:&r ingredients through the two blue hatches, power above them. &eOut:&r at the end of the belt. That way steel components and Vacuum Tubes run without you."
	]
	quest.6B8E68820566C2D0.quest_subtitle: "3x2x3, blueprint in, finished parts out."
	quest.6B8E68820566C2D0.title: "&9Form an Automated Engineer's Workbench"
	quest.6B97BC3580748EFF.quest_desc: [
		"&6Ambrosium Ore&r ist das häufigste Erz des Aethers und steckt auf jeder Höhe im Holystone. Es lässt &6Ambrosium Shards&r fallen, mit Skyroot Pickaxe doppelt, mit Glück noch mehr."
		""
		"{image:aether:textures/item/materials/ambrosium_shard.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eWofür:&r Ein Shard über einem Skyroot Stick ergibt 4 &6Ambrosium Torches&r, das Licht des Aethers. Ein Shard im &6Altar&r brennt 12,5 Sekunden. Gegessen heilt er ein halbes Herz. Rechtsklick auf Aether-Gras macht &6Enchanted Grass&r für doppelte Beeren."
		""
		"Neun Shards ergeben einen &6Ambrosium Block&r, der im Altar 125 Sekunden brennt."
	]
	quest.6B97BC3580748EFF.quest_subtitle: "Kohle, Fackel, Medizin und Brennstoff des Altars."
	quest.6B97BC3580748EFF.title: "&eFinde Ambrosium"
	quest.6BC02B6A0A4DA017.quest_desc: [
		"Six &6Crushed Dark Gems&r on top and bottom, two &6potions of weakness&r left and right and an &6ender chest&r in the middle give the &6Box of Eternal Closure&r. Finished boxes with old spirits also lie in dungeon chests, mineshafts and fortress libraries."
		""
		"&eHow to catch:&r Place the empty box, freeze a spirit with the focus that is at most 10 blocks away. The box pulls it in and closes the lid. The spirit's name is then in the tooltip."
		""
		"You decide yourself which spirits exist: kill zombies, then zombie spirits appear, kill blazes in the Nether, then blaze spirits. Every spirit has the traits and drops of its old body, and that is exactly what the Spirit Furnace uses."
	]
	quest.6BC02B6A0A4DA017.quest_subtitle: "A prison for a spirit."
	quest.6BC02B6A0A4DA017.title: "&dBuild a Box of Eternal Closure"
	quest.6BDF7D92D3733C02.quest_desc: [
		"Put an &6iron ingot&r on the finished altar. Once it has gathered enough aura (&e15,000&r per ingot), it turns into &6Infused Iron&r. An iron block works the same way."
		""
		"The altar slowly draws aura from the area around it until there is none left. If it gets slow, the area is drained. You also need Infused Iron later for Manasteel in Botania."
	]
	quest.6BDF7D92D3733C02.quest_subtitle: "Put an iron ingot on the altar and wait."
	quest.6BDF7D92D3733C02.title: "&aRefine iron into Infused Iron"
	quest.6BEC1B344E31ADB5.quest_desc: [
		"Strip &6Torreya Logs&r with an axe. Sometimes &6Raw Amaramber&r drops. A broken Torreya campfire gives some too. Collect 9."
		""
		"The Torreya trees only grow in the &6Torreya Forest&r."
	]
	quest.6BEC1B344E31ADB5.quest_subtitle: "Resin from the Torreya trees."
	quest.6BEC1B344E31ADB5.title: "&6Tap Amaramber"
	quest.6BEF9F3B83B02EDA.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Sculk-Schnapper&r ist klein, schnell und beißt (&e12 Lebenspunkte, 3 Schaden&r). Er lässt &6Seelenstaub&r fallen. Mit &6Glanzgel&r in der Hand &ezähmst&r du ihn wie einen Wolf."
		""
		"&eWarum sich das lohnt:&r Ein gezähmter Schnapper schnüffelt im Boden und gräbt &6verzauberte Bücher&r aus, bis zu &e8 Stück&r pro Tier. Er folgt dir und kämpft mit."
	]
	quest.6BEF9F3B83B02EDA.quest_subtitle: "Ein Hund aus Sculk, der Bücher ausgräbt."
	quest.6BEF9F3B83B02EDA.title: "&3Zähme einen Sculk-Schnapper"
	quest.6C0470E74CFDA0DC.quest_desc: [
		"Drive the train to a station and switch &eassembly mode&r on there. The train falls back into blocks on its bogeys."
		""
		"Now you add carriages, swap chests for vaults or build a second set of Train Controls at the end. Then assemble again."
	]
	quest.6C0470E74CFDA0DC.quest_subtitle: "Take apart, lengthen, assemble again."
	quest.6C0470E74CFDA0DC.title: "&6Rebuild the train"
	quest.6C0F2CADB6D54B7F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Black dye&r on the brazier. On the hands: &6snowball&r, &6spider eye&r, two &6Soul Shards&r."
		""
		"Lit during the day, it fast forwards time until sunset."
	]
	quest.6C0F2CADB6D54B7F.quest_subtitle: "Ritual of Moonlight."
	quest.6C0F2CADB6D54B7F.title: "&9Call the Night"
	quest.6C16F7A979EACAB8.quest_desc: [
		"With &6stage 3&r &6Create Ore Excavation&r opens. The &6Vein Finder&r (eye of ender, amethyst, redstone ore, sticks) shows which vein lies under a chunk: coal, copper, iron, gold, zinc, redstone, lapis, diamond, emerald, plus quartz, glowstone and netherite in the Nether as well as water."
		""
		"The &6Drilling Machine&r (5 x 5 recipe from brass, Sturdy Sheets, Precision Mechanisms and a Mechanical Drill) stands on solid ground above the vein, gets an &6iron drill&r and rotation and then produces raw ore, for example one raw iron every 30 seconds at 256 SU. On Kronwerke the veins are inexhaustible. Diamond and netherite drills come in stage 4."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The stage 3 goal wants 4,000 steel ingots. A Drilling Machine on an iron vein running day and night is the quietest way there."
	]
	quest.6C16F7A979EACAB8.quest_subtitle: "Create Ore Excavation comes in stage 3."
	quest.6C16F7A979EACAB8.title: "&7Drill into Ore Veins"
	quest.6C24E92C8704048C.quest_desc: [
		"Mystical Agriculture grows with the server. &cStage 2:&r &6Prudentium&r with coal, nature, dye and animal seeds, &6Soulium&r with the Soulium Dagger and Soul Jars, the &6Harvester&r, the Seed Reprocessor and the enchanter."
		""
		"&cStage 3:&r &6Tertium&r, and with it iron, copper, redstone, obsidian and the monster seeds. &cStage 4:&r &6Imperium&r with gold, lapis and experience, plus the &6Awakening Altar&r, which needs your Air, Earth, Water and Fire Essence. &cStage 5:&r &6Supremium&r, diamond, emerald, netherite and the Insanium seeds from Agradditions."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The essence recipe for &6Manasteel&r is removed. Here Manasteel only comes from Botania and Nature's Aura, not from the field."
		""
		"Locked essence can be stored but not processed, the tooltip tells you the stage. Everything you grow in stage 1 stays and keeps counting."
	]
	quest.6C24E92C8704048C.quest_subtitle: "Five essences, five stages."
	quest.6C24E92C8704048C.title: "&dRead What Comes in the Next Stages"
	quest.6C2B1BD2D8AEBFBA.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &62 Advanced Control Circuits&r, &62 Reinforced Alloy&r and &61 draconium dust&r. There is no other way."
		""
		"So the whole Elite tier of Mekanism depends on the End. What you build with it is in the chapter &dMekanism: Elite&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r In stage 4 the obelisk wants &e150 Elite Control Circuits&r in the tech pillar."
	]
	quest.6C2B1BD2D8AEBFBA.quest_subtitle: "Draconium for Mekanism."
	quest.6C2B1BD2D8AEBFBA.title: "&dBuild an Elite Control Circuit"
	quest.6C3DE80B81BB4577.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_nouveau_imbuement.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e6 archwood planks&r in a ring, &e2 gold ingots&r at the top and bottom middle, the centre stays empty."
		""
		"Right click with amethyst puts it inside. The chamber gathers Source very slowly on its own, or quickly from a &6Source Jar&r no more than &e2 blocks&r away."
	]
	quest.6C3DE80B81BB4577.quest_subtitle: "The only way to Source Gems."
	quest.6C3DE80B81BB4577.title: "&a&lBuild an Imbuement Chamber"
	quest.6C5BB64AA39F5970.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6brass sheet&r on top, &6Spout&r in the middle, three &6Nixie Tubes&r at the bottom give the &6Infuser&r. Put it over a &6basin&r and give it &bliquid experience&r."
		""
		"It does the infusion recipes of &dApotheosis&r automatically, which otherwise run at the enchanting table. Like the enchanting table it needs bookshelves around it for the Eterna, Quanta and Arcana values, it may ignore the recipes' upper limits."
		""
		"The &6Gem Cutter&r (amethyst, brass, gem dust) upgrades Apotheosis gems on a belt or depot and needs a tank of crystal essence two blocks below it. The &6Brass Bookshelf&r, which sets the values freely, needs a pearl shelf from the End and comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.6C5BB64AA39F5970.quest_subtitle: "Apotheosis infusion on the assembly line."
	quest.6C5BB64AA39F5970.title: "&5Build the Infuser"
	quest.6C61EF3CB071650A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Elektrolytischer Kern:&r fünf &6Infundierte Legierungen&r in die Ecken und die Mitte, &6Osmiumstaub&r oben und unten, links ein &6Eisenstaub&r, rechts ein &6Goldstaub&r. &6Elektrolyseur:&r der Kern in die Mitte, Infundierte Legierung links und rechts, Redstone oben und unten, Eisen in die Ecken."
		""
		"Aus &e2 mB Wasser&r macht er &e2 mB Wasserstoff&r und &e1 mB Sauerstoff&r. Die Klärkammer der Dreifach-Straße braucht den Sauerstoff. Der Wasserstoff fällt doppelt an: stell seinen Tank im Fenster auf &eAblassen&r, bis du ihn in Stufe 4 für Chlorwasserstoff brauchst."
		""
		"Der Elektrolyseur ist in Stufe 2 offen. Bau ihn ruhig jetzt, dann steht er, wenn Stufe 3 die Klärkammer öffnet."
	]
	quest.6C61EF3CB071650A.quest_subtitle: "Wasser wird Wasserstoff und Sauerstoff."
	quest.6C61EF3CB071650A.title: "&bBau einen Elektrolyseur"
	quest.6C80C675E18AF462.quest_desc: [
		"Kill &e3 hoglins&r in the crimson forest. They drop pork and leather and are the only real food source down here."
		""
		"Hoglins knock you far away, even over cliffs. &6Warped fungi&r scare them off: a few of them at your camp keep them away."
	]
	quest.6C80C675E18AF462.quest_subtitle: "Pork and leather in the Nether."
	quest.6C80C675E18AF462.title: "&cHunt a hoglin"
	quest.6C85F16F076CFE8B.quest_desc: [
		"Drei &6Redstone-Lampen&r oben, in der Mitte &6Druckeisen&r, die &6Platinen-Vorlage&r und ein &6Druckluftrohr&r, unten drei Druckeisen ergeben den &6UV-Lichtkasten&r (UV Light Box). Er braucht Luft."
		""
		"Leg eine leere Platine hinein. Nach &e10 Minuten&r ist sie zu 100 Prozent belichtet und das Ätzen klappt sicher. Du kannst früher abbrechen, der Schieberegler setzt die Schwelle, dann steigt die Fehlerquote. Am Anfang geht es schnell, zum Ende hin zäh."
		""
		"&6Geschwindigkeits-Upgrades&r lassen die Lampen heller leuchten und belichten schneller. Mit einem &6Spender-Upgrade&r wirft er fertige Platinen in Richtung des Upgrades aus, zum Beispiel direkt ins Ätzbecken."
	]
	quest.6C85F16F076CFE8B.quest_subtitle: "Zehn Minuten für hundert Prozent."
	quest.6C85F16F076CFE8B.title: "&9Belichte im UV-Lichtkasten"
	quest.6C9262B6276CA085.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Personal Chest&r or Personal Barrel over a &6Laser Amplifier&r makes the &6Laser Tractor Beam&r."
		""
		"Lasers destroy blocks in their path. Fire them into the tractor beam: it focuses and directs them like an amplifier, and everything its beam mines lands in its inventory instead of on the ground."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r The beam hits you too. Never stand in front of it."
	]
	quest.6C9262B6276CA085.quest_subtitle: "The Laser Tractor Beam collects."
	quest.6C9262B6276CA085.title: "&cDrill with the Laser"
	quest.6C9398D392459A07.quest_desc: [
		"&e5 Manasteel ingots&r and &e1 Mana Pearl&r. &d8,000 mana&r."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/rune_of_mana.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"For the Terrestrial Agglomeration Plate, Rosa Arcana, Botanical Brewery and the Band of Aura. Keep at least two."
	]
	quest.6C9398D392459A07.quest_subtitle: "Pure mana, set in stone."
	quest.6C9398D392459A07.title: "&dMake the Rune of Mana"
	quest.6CAD20CEB435895A.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &62 Tooth of Hunger&r on top of each other on &61 stick&r make the &6Dagger of Hunger&r."
		""
		"&eGetting the tooth:&r &6Thirst Walkers&r sneak up in the desert, bite and run off. If you block the bite with a shield, they lose a tooth. Killed, they drop one too."
		""
		"The dagger gets fed by hits and grows stronger."
	]
	quest.6CAD20CEB435895A.quest_subtitle: "A tooth from the Thirst Walker."
	quest.6CAD20CEB435895A.title: "&cBuild the Dagger of Hunger"
	quest.6CB96BE277CE5B5E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Moon dust:&r &e4 redstone&r and &e4 glowstone dust&r in the water cauldron make &e4 Moon Dust&r."
		"&6Brush:&r Enhanced Brush, &e4 Moon Dust&r, &e2 Mandrake Roots&r, &6Mandrake Flowers&r in the water cauldron, then dry for 60 seconds."
		""
		"Like the Enhanced Brush it lasts &e200&r, but it makes the broom faster, most of all at full moon."
	]
	quest.6CB96BE277CE5B5E.quest_subtitle: "Faster, above all at full moon."
	quest.6CB96BE277CE5B5E.title: "&9Tie a Moon Dust Brush"
	quest.6CC239453158173D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_gear_mek_jetpack.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Oben Stahl, Einfacher Schaltkreis, Stahl, in der Mitte Zinn, &6Einfacher Chemietank&r, Zinn, unten Zinn. Füllen mit &bWasserstoff&r aus dem Elektrolyseur (Wasser und Strom)."
		""
		"Fasst 24 000 mB. Taste für den Modus: Normal, Schweben, Aus. Die &6Free Runners&r (2 Schaltkreise, 2 Infundierte Legierungen, 2 Energietabletts) fangen Fallschaden ab und steigen Blöcke hoch."
	]
	quest.6CC239453158173D.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism: der erste Flug des Packs."
	quest.6CC239453158173D.title: "&bFlieg mit dem Jetpack"
	quest.6CC5E60D27AA22FA.quest_desc: [
		"Bow limbs from &ethree&r material, a rod and a &6cord&r into the grid. The cord blueprint is three Blueprint Paper next to three string."
		""
		"String draws 10 percent faster, Sinew Fiber gives +20 percent ranged damage."
	]
	quest.6CC5E60D27AA22FA.quest_subtitle: "Bow limbs, rod and cord."
	quest.6CC5E60D27AA22FA.title: "&7String a bow"
	quest.6CD62F70FB9C1EFD.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Advanced Upgrade&r (diamonds and redstone blocks around the improved one) opens with &estage 3&r. Only it brings &efilters&r: items, tags with # in front, fluids, as whitelist or blacklist."
		""
		"The filters come with the &6Filter Destination Tool&r, which you can already build now: click a chest with it, and a filter sends its items only to exactly that place. That turns a pipe line into a sorting system."
		""
		"The &6Universal Pipe&r (item, energy and fluid pipe with iron around a redstone block, six pieces) carries all four kinds in one block. Stage 4 brings the Ultimate Upgrade made of netherite."
	]
	quest.6CD62F70FB9C1EFD.quest_subtitle: "Filters, destinations and the Universal Pipe."
	quest.6CD62F70FB9C1EFD.title: "&dRead What Comes in Stage 3"
	quest.6CDE49941E4635C0.quest_desc: [
		"Take the &cDragon Heart&r that every dragon drops with &6Draconic Evolution&r. There is one per fight, so agree beforehand who gets it."
		""
		"In stage 4 it goes into the Wyvern shield module, in &estage 5&r into every awakened draconium."
		""
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r For awakened draconium two of the six draconium cores are replaced by &dGaia Spirit ingots&r. The heart stays in."
	]
	quest.6CDE49941E4635C0.quest_subtitle: "One per fight, for whoever grabs it first."
	quest.6CDE49941E4635C0.title: "&cPick Up the Dragon Heart"
	quest.6CE0AEDE300FD308.quest_desc: [
		"&6MEGA Fluid Cell Housing:&r polarized quartz glass, sky stone dust, polarized quartz glass at the top, sky stone dust on the sides, three &6Sky Bronze ingots&r at the bottom. With a &61M component&r it becomes the &61M MEGA Fluid Storage Cell&r."
		""
		"You make sky bronze like sky steel, only with copper instead of iron in the lava. Like every fluid cell it holds &e5 types&r."
	]
	quest.6CE0AEDE300FD308.quest_subtitle: "Sky bronze instead of sky steel."
	quest.6CE0AEDE300FD308.title: "&9Build a MEGA Fluid Cell"
	quest.6CED9FD808309030.quest_desc: [
		"An &6ender pearl&r on top, &6three obsidian&r around the upgrade base, &6two redstone&r in the bottom corners."
		""
		"Whatever is in the filter is destroyed on arrival. Good for dirt, gravel, diorite."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Cobblestone does not belong in it. For stage 1 the obelisk needs &e20,000 cobblestone&r from the whole server. Hand it in at the obelisk."
	]
	quest.6CED9FD808309030.quest_subtitle: "Deletes what you don't want."
	quest.6CED9FD808309030.title: "Build a Void Upgrade"
	quest.6CF12EE37E15668A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Magitech Mana Circuit:&r 6 iron ingots and 3 Powdered Emerald, iron left and right, powder in the middle column."
		""
		"It stores &d100,000 mana&r. Spells within at most &e10 blocks&r draw from it. Whoever clicks it first owns it. Right click puts mana in, sneaking you switch it on and off."
	]
	quest.6CF12EE37E15668A.quest_subtitle: "100,000 mana next to the crafting table."
	quest.6CF12EE37E15668A.title: "&d&lBuild a Mana Circuit"
	quest.6CF62E1D4BB29AC8.quest_desc: [
		"&6Golden String&r: string and gold nugget, shapeless. Then &e3 Golden Strings&r as an arc on top, below Crushed Dark Gem, &6Blood Infusion Core&r, Crushed Dark Gem."
		""
		"In your inventory the pendant removes every bad potion effect and costs blood from its tank for it, worse effects more. It even puts out fire on you, but still do not swim in lava."
	]
	quest.6CF62E1D4BB29AC8.quest_subtitle: "Bad effects gone, for blood."
	quest.6CF62E1D4BB29AC8.title: "&4Tie an Invigorating Pendant"
	quest.6CF971351F3417E4.quest_desc: [
		"16 &6Soulstained Steel&r and 8 &6Hallowed Gold&r in your inventory."
		""
		"You harvest souls, infuse at the altar, focus in the Crucible and let totems work."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Soulstained Steel is the link to Ender IO. Build up a stock, the tech people will surely ask."
	]
	quest.6CF971351F3417E4.quest_subtitle: "Harvest, infuse, forge."
	quest.6CF971351F3417E4.title: "&5&lBecome a Soulsmith"
	quest.6D00C3D5725F225F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r a &6Source Gem&r from Ars Nouveau on top, in the middle an &6enchanting table&r between two &6Gem Dust&r, three &6smooth stone&r at the bottom."
		""
		"&eHow it works:&r Item in the middle, top left rarity material of the tier the item should get, bottom right Sigils of Rebirth. As at the enchanting table you see three offers, none is better than the other. Items without affixes can be reforged too, as often as you like."
		""
		"&eCost:&r &7Common&r 2 levels and 1 Scrap Metal. &aUncommon&r 5 levels, 2 Fabric, 1 sigil. &9Rare&r 15 levels, 2 Crystal Shards, 2 sigils. The second and third offers ask for double and triple the level requirement and material, but only take one, two or three levels."
		""
		"The simple table handles items up to &9Rare&r. For Epic and Mythic you need the big Reforging Table, see the next quest."
	]
	quest.6D00C3D5725F225F.quest_subtitle: "Reroll until it fits."
	quest.6D00C3D5725F225F.title: "&6&lBuild a Simple Reforging Table"
	quest.6D0868F4EE94F91E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Livingwood Avatar&r: &e5 Livingwood logs&r around a &bMana Diamond&r as its heart. &6Rod of the Plentiful Mantle&r: &e4 Livingwood Twigs&r and a Mana Diamond."
		""
		"The rod briefly makes ores within a small radius glow through the walls, the same ores in the same colour. Give it to the avatar, supply it with a spreader, and it shows the ores near it permanently. Redstone stops it."
		""
		"With the runes from stage 2 the avatar gets more rods, such as the Rod of the Skies or of the Hells."
	]
	quest.6D0868F4EE94F91E.quest_subtitle: "A statue that uses rods."
	quest.6D0868F4EE94F91E.title: "&bSet up a Livingwood Avatar"
	quest.6D1CBFD513C6C408.quest_desc: [
		"Place a &6cauldron&r on a burning &6campfire&r and bring an animal inside, for example with a lead. It gets boiled into blood, and a &6glass bottle&r scoops a &6Blood Vial&r out of it."
		""
		"The vial is the focus of the blood school, and eight of them around a Blank Runestone give the &6Blood Rune&r. With Create a Spout also fills glass bottles from blood in a tank."
	]
	quest.6D1CBFD513C6C408.quest_subtitle: "Cauldron, campfire, an animal."
	quest.6D1CBFD513C6C408.title: "&4Boil a Blood Vial"
	quest.6D1DCCF8FBC15F5C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_trains_junction.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"The wrench switches a signal. The &eentry signal&r lets a train into the next free section. The &echain signal&r waits until the way is free up to the signal after next."
		""
		"Rule of thumb: chain signal before the junction, entry signal behind it. Otherwise a train stops in the middle of the junction. The goggles show whether a section is occupied."
	]
	quest.6D1DCCF8FBC15F5C.quest_subtitle: "Entry signal and chain signal."
	quest.6D1DCCF8FBC15F5C.title: "&6Secure a junction"
	quest.6D3749D5AA5C85C9.quest_desc: [
		"At the &6Mechanical Fusion Anvil&r (6 Witherite from the Harbinger, 2 redstone blocks, anvil) you fuse boss weapons:"
		""
		"&6Void Forge:&r the Netherite Monstrosity's Infernal Forge plus a Void Core. &6Gauntlet of Bulwark:&r Gauntlet of Guard plus Ignis's Bulwark of the Flame. &6Void Assault Shoulder Weapon:&r Wither Assault Shoulder Weapon plus a Void Core."
		""
		"Ignis and the Monstrosity are in the chapter &cThe Nether&r, the Harbinger in the chapter &cBosses of the Overworld&r."
	]
	quest.6D3749D5AA5C85C9.quest_subtitle: "Void Core and gauntlet on the Fusion Anvil."
	quest.6D3749D5AA5C85C9.title: "&6Fuse the Boss Weapons"
	quest.6D3B2AA57876A325.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_blast_furnace.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Set the &627 Blast Bricks&r up as a &e3x3x3 cube&r and hit the middle of one side with the hammer."
		""
		"&eIn:&r &6iron&r on top, &6coke&r below. &eOut:&r one &6steel ingot&r per minute, plus &6slag&r. One coke burns for exactly one minute, charcoal for a quarter of that."
		""
		"&cThe Crude Blast Furnace cannot be automated.&r Hoppers do not reach it, everything goes through the window. Take the slag out, or it stops."
	]
	quest.6D3B2AA57876A325.quest_subtitle: "3x3x3, 27 Blast Bricks, iron in, steel out."
	quest.6D3B2AA57876A325.title: "&c&lForm a Crude Blast Furnace"
	quest.6D5FB00B76C782D4.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6iron sword&r and &6nether quartz ore&r give a &6Quartz Nest&r. Place it in the &cNether&r and click it with &6nether quartz&r, then a &6Crystalline Bee&r moves in. Or pick up a quartz nest you find in the Nether."
		""
		"You need three Nether nests for almost everything else. &6Quartz Nest&r: Crystalline Bee, attracted with nether quartz. &6Glowstone Nest&r (wooden sword and glowstone): Glowing Bee, attracted with glowstone dust. &6Nether Brick Nest&r (iron sword and nether bricks): Magmatic Bee, attracted with magma cream, found in fortresses. The &6Soul Sand Nest&r gives a Ghostly Bee with a ghast tear."
		""
		"The Crystalline Bee is the &eparent of all ore bees&r. Catch two or three, you need them all the time."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Magmatic Bees turn cobblestone near them into lava. Build their enclosure from something else."
	]
	quest.6D5FB00B76C782D4.quest_subtitle: "Quartz, glowstone and magma have their own bees."
	quest.6D5FB00B76C782D4.title: "&cGet Bees from the Nether"
	quest.6D6081D5BBBB4B85.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6Draconium Ingots&r each at the top and bottom, in the middle &6Wyvern Energy Controller, Wyvern Core, Wyvern Energy Controller&r."
		""
		"The block alone is &etier 1&r and stores &e45,500,000&r energy. It only runs with four stabilizers, those come next."
	]
	quest.6D6081D5BBBB4B85.quest_subtitle: "Tier 1 stores 45.5 million."
	quest.6D6081D5BBBB4B85.title: "&c&lBuild the Energy Core"
	quest.6D8713C88B54A04A.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &e2 lime&r, &e2 green&r, &e1 black&r petal, Runes of &eSummer&r and &eWater&r."
		""
		"Catches slimes that spawn naturally in a &eslime chunk&r. Small &d2,400&r, medium &d4,800&r, large &d19,200 mana&r."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A flat hall below height 40 in a slime chunk, the flower in the middle. Runs as long as the chunk is loaded."
	]
	quest.6D8713C88B54A04A.quest_subtitle: "Slime from slime chunks."
	quest.6D8713C88B54A04A.title: "&6Plant a Narslimmus"
	quest.6D87610761B17DE3.quest_desc: [
		"Eine &6Energiebatterie&r und ein &6Ofen&r formlos ergeben den &6Kohlegenerator&r. Kohle hinein, Strom an die Nachbarn oder ins Integrated-Netz."
		""
		"&eIntegrated Dynamics, Kohlegenerator:&r Brennstoff alles Brennbare, &d20 FE/t&r. Die &6Energiebatterie&r speichert &d1 Million FE&r und gibt mindestens 2 000 FE/t ab. Beides ist eher für das eigene Kabelnetz von Integrated Dynamics gedacht als für ein Kraftwerk. Offen ab Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.6D87610761B17DE3.quest_subtitle: "Integrated Dynamics, 20 FE/t, dazu die Energiebatterie."
	quest.6D87610761B17DE3.title: "&aStell den Kohlegenerator"
	quest.6D9190ECBF886CFE.quest_desc: [
		"&eSchärpe des Reisenden&r (Stufe 2): Manastahl, Leder und die Runen der Erde und der Luft. Schneller laufen, höher springen, Stufen hochgehen wie Treppen, weniger Fallschaden, für ein Rinnsal Mana."
		"&eSchärpe des Weltenwanderers&r (Stufe 2): Schärpe, Karte, Weidesamen, Zucker. Je länger du läufst, desto schneller wirst du."
		"&eStab der Lüfte&r (Stufe 2): Lebeholzzweig, Feder, Rune der Luft. Schleudert dich in die Höhe."
		""
		"&eFlügel-Tiara&r (Stufe 4): Gaia-Seelen, Elementium, Federn und reine Ender-Essenz. Dann fliegst du mit Mana wie im Kreativmodus. Die &eGlobetrotter-Schärpe&r (Stufe 4) braucht ebenfalls eine Gaia-Seele."
		""
		"Alles im Kapitel &aBotania: Runen&r und &aBotania: Alfheim&r."
	]
	quest.6D9190ECBF886CFE.quest_subtitle: "Schärpen und Stäbe statt Portale."
	quest.6D9190ECBF886CFE.title: "&aLauf und flieg mit Botania"
	quest.6D97A30950F298D7.quest_desc: [
		"&62 gold nuggets&r, a &6feather&r and &63 paper&r make three &6Blank Scrolls&r. Right click a waystone with one of them, and it becomes a &6Bound Scroll&r."
		""
		"{image:waystones:textures/item/bound_scroll.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"It takes you once to exactly this waystone, without choosing and, like all scrolls, without level cost. Bind a few to your base and give them to friends."
	]
	quest.6D97A30950F298D7.quest_subtitle: "Always to the same destination, without levels."
	quest.6D97A30950F298D7.title: "&6Bind a scroll to a waystone"
	quest.6D99B10F1027142E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Draconium Ingots&r in the corners, an &6eye of ender&r at the top, &6emeralds&r on the sides, a &6Draconium Core&r in the middle, a &6diamond&r at the bottom. Gives two."
		""
		"Place the pylon near the core and put a &eglass block&r directly above or below it. A pylon takes power in or gives it out, you switch the direction at the pylon. A comparator on it shows how full the core is."
	]
	quest.6D99B10F1027142E.quest_subtitle: "Into the core, out of the core."
	quest.6D99B10F1027142E.title: "&cPlace Two Energy Pylons"
	quest.6DA829C325374BF3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Casing:&r lead plates in the corners, Plate Advanced on the sides, middle empty. Gives four. &6Glass:&r one casing, glass at the top, bottom, left and right."
		""
		"The reactor is a cuboid. All edges casing, the faces casing or glass. The smallest is 3 by 3 by 3. For 5 by 5 by 5 you need 98 shell blocks."
	]
	quest.6DA829C325374BF3.quest_subtitle: "The shell of the reactor."
	quest.6DA829C325374BF3.title: "&7Build Casing and Glass"
	quest.6DAEB35DF5496BD6.quest_desc: [
		"Acht &6Arcane Essence&r um einen Eisen-, Kupfer- oder Goldbarren ergeben einen &6Arcane Ingot&r. Vier davon und ein Diamant ergeben den Ring. Kapitel &5Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r."
		""
		"+100 Mana, so viel wie die ganze Wanderer-Robe. Der &6Silver Ring&r aus Kisten gibt +25."
	]
	quest.6DAEB35DF5496BD6.quest_subtitle: "Iron's Spells: +100 Mana im Ring-Slot."
	quest.6DAEB35DF5496BD6.title: "&bSteck einen Ring of Mana an"
	quest.6DAFDB6BCF3980F1.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r like the item pipe, but with two &6Infused Alloys&r from Mekanism instead of the dispensers. &616 Gas Pipes&r."
		""
		"Gas pipes move &e200 mB of gas per tick&r: oxygen, hydrogen, chlorine and everything Mekanism fills into tanks. In stage 2 you hardly need them, from stage 3 the oxygen carries ore tripling."
		""
		"{image:mekanism:textures/item/alloy_infused.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.6DAFDB6BCF3980F1.quest_subtitle: "For Mekanism's chemistry."
	quest.6DAFDB6BCF3980F1.title: "&aBuild Gas Pipes"
	quest.6DC3383E64C3E46E.quest_desc: [
		"&64 copper ingots&r around a &6redstone&r make the Supplementaries &6Altimeter&r. One click shows your height as a Y value."
		""
		"Handy when looking for ore: diamonds lie all the way down, copper veins between Y 0 and 50, iron veins between Y -60 and -8."
	]
	quest.6DC3383E64C3E46E.quest_subtitle: "How deep are you right now?"
	quest.6DC3383E64C3E46E.title: "&6Build an Altimeter"
	quest.6DD1B12B8DC43E84.quest_desc: [
		"&6Energy Cell (Basic):&r iron in the corners, Basic capacitors on the sides, a casing in the middle. Higher cells: the tier's material, two new capacitors, a casing and the cell below."
		""
		"&eStorage:&r Starter 1, Basic 4, Hardened 10, Blazing 40, Niotic 100, Spirited 400 million FE."
	]
	quest.6DD1B12B8DC43E84.quest_subtitle: "A buffer for the whole base."
	quest.6DD1B12B8DC43E84.title: "&aBuild energy cells"
	quest.6DD32E5E899C84F2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Caloric Flux Emitter&r: a &6campfire&r (or lava bucket), two gold ingots, one Mercury, three stone, see EMI."
		""
		"Click the device with the emitter until it glows, and place it on a Mercury Catalyst. It heats up to &e8 blocks&r away as long as there is flux."
	]
	quest.6DD32E5E899C84F2.quest_subtitle: "Caloric Flux Emitter."
	quest.6DD32E5E899C84F2.title: "&cHeat Without Coal"
	quest.6DD6D591AAD00C06.quest_desc: [
		"Das &6Blauholz&r (Kapok und Palisander, Generation 7) gibt im &6Sägewerk&r neben Brettern und Sägemehl ein &5Hämatoxylin&r. Zwei davon nebeneinander ergeben &e2 Blauen Farbstoff&r, zwei übereinander &e2 Lila Farbstoff&r."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/haematoxylin.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Brasilholz&r (Teak und Mahagoni, Generation 6) gibt im Sägewerk ebenfalls Hämatoxylin, der kürzere Weg. &6Gelbholz&r (Rotahorn und Mahagoni) gibt &eFustik&r, das als gelber Farbstoff zählt, überall wo ein Rezept gelben Farbstoff per Tag verlangt."
		""
		"Das Blut des &6Drachenblutbaums&r wäre roter Farbstoff, braucht aber den Baumzapfen, siehe unten. Blauholz und Gelbholz sind die einzigen Farben, die hier wirklich fließen."
	]
	quest.6DD6D591AAD00C06.quest_subtitle: "Blauholz und Gelbholz färben."
	quest.6DD6D591AAD00C06.title: "&5Züchte Farbbäume"
	quest.6DD91D3A69E46F9A.quest_desc: [
		"Let shulker projectiles hit you until you have floated &e50 blocks&r up."
		""
		"Do this over solid ground, ideally at an End City, not over the void. A water bucket or a potion of slow falling breaks the landing."
	]
	quest.6DD91D3A69E46F9A.quest_subtitle: "A shulker as an elevator."
	quest.6DD91D3A69E46F9A.title: "&dLevitate Fifty Blocks Up"
	quest.6DE2F5CB16022985.quest_desc: [
		"&6Zephyre&r sind die fliegenden Wolkenwesen. Sie schießen &6Schneebälle&r mit so viel Wucht, dass du über die Kante fliegst. Ein &6Schild&r fängt den Stoß ab, ein Bogen oder der Dart Shooter holt sie herunter. Sie lassen 0 bis 2 &6Cold Aerclouds&r fallen."
		""
		"&eUngefährlich:&r &6Aerwhales&r, die riesigen Wale am Himmel, schwimmen nur vorbei und lassen nichts fallen. &6Whirlwinds&r heben alles hoch, was ihnen zu nahe kommt, die dunklen &cEvil Whirlwinds&r tun dabei weh."
		""
		"Steh nie mit dem Rücken zum Abgrund, wenn ein Zephyr in der Nähe ist."
	]
	quest.6DE2F5CB16022985.quest_subtitle: "Der Wind, der dich von der Insel pustet."
	quest.6DE2F5CB16022985.title: "&fSchieß einen Zephyr ab"
	quest.6DE4761F2FBA1D9B.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6redstone, wooden sword, redstone&r, middle &6wooden pickaxe, upgrade base, wooden axe&r, bottom &6iron, wooden shovel, iron&r."
		""
		"When you hit a block, it takes the matching tool from the backpack into your hand: pickaxe, axe, shovel, sword. Works with Silent Gear too."
	]
	quest.6DE4761F2FBA1D9B.quest_subtitle: "Always the right tool in hand."
	quest.6DE4761F2FBA1D9B.title: "Build a Tool Swapper Upgrade"
	quest.6DEEC20BEA0BEE49.quest_desc: [
		"&6Endoflame&r: fuel, 1,200 per coal. &6Hydroangeas&r: water, 13 per block."
		"&6Thermalily&r: lava, 27,000 per block, then a 5 minute pause."
		"&6Gourmaryllis&r: food, nutrition times nutrition times 70, steak 4,480, with variety up to 1.8 times."
		"&6Munchdew&r: leaves, 160 per block, 80 second pause when everything is eaten."
		"&6Narslimmus&r: slimes from slime chunks, 2,400, 4,800 or 19,200 by size."
		"&6Rosa Arcana&r: experience, 50 per point."
		"&6Entropinnyum&r (stage 3): TNT, 6,500 per explosion. &6Kekimurus&r (stage 3): cake, 1,800 per piece."
		"&6Spectrolus&r (stage 3): wool in the wanted colour, 1,200. &6Rafflowsia&r (stage 3): flowers, 2,000 to over 600,000 depending on variety."
		"&6Dandelifeon&r (stage 4): cell blocks, up to 6,000 per cell. &6Shulk Me Not&r (stage 4): 75,000 per shulker hit."
	]
	quest.6DEEC20BEA0BEE49.quest_subtitle: "What each generating flower brings per piece."
	quest.6DEEC20BEA0BEE49.title: "&aCompare all mana flowers"
	quest.6DF888D56AB321F0.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_runes_mana_pearl.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &6ender pearl&r into the pool, &d6,000 mana&r, but only with a &6brass casing&r directly &eunder the pool&r. Without the casing the pearl just stays there."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/mana_pearl.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Other infusions carry on normally in the same pool. Ender pearls come from the warped forest in the Nether, from endermen at night on plains and from piglins in trade for gold."
	]
	quest.6DF888D56AB321F0.quest_subtitle: "An ender pearl bedded on brass."
	quest.6DF888D56AB321F0.title: "&bInfuse Mana Pearls"
	quest.6DFB61F79C3F3102.quest_desc: [
		"A &6stone button&r at the top in the middle, &e3 mahogany planks&r to the right of it and below, &6bamboo&r at the bottom left. That is the &6Broom Whistle&r."
		""
		"Put whistle and broom together into the crafting grid, then it is bound. Right click calls the broom over when it is in range. Put into the crafting grid alone once more, it undoes the binding."
	]
	quest.6DFB61F79C3F3102.quest_subtitle: "The broom comes when you call."
	quest.6DFB61F79C3F3102.title: "&6Carve a broom whistle"
	quest.6DFD0126FEC2B19A.quest_desc: [
		"Five ingots of one alloy laid out as a plus make &e24&r grinding balls. A ball goes into the SAG Mill's own slot."
		""
		"Each kind changes main output, bonus and usage differently and wears down while doing it. The ball's tooltip shows its values."
	]
	quest.6DFD0126FEC2B19A.quest_subtitle: "More output, less power, or both."
	quest.6DFD0126FEC2B19A.title: "&7Insert a Grinding Ball"
	quest.6DFD9CF214DC782B.quest_desc: [
		"A pickaxe, an axe and a shovel of &6Refined Obsidian&r, then all three in a row at the top, two sticks below in the middle."
		""
		"&eValues from the config:&r mining speed &d12&r (netherite has 9), &d8,192&r durability, enchantability 18. One tool for stone, wood and dirt that lasts long and takes enchantments well."
		""
		"If you would rather dig with power, take the Atomic Disassembler further down."
	]
	quest.6DFD9CF214DC782B.quest_subtitle: "The hardest tool without power."
	quest.6DFD9CF214DC782B.title: "&5Forge an obsidian paxel"
	quest.6E071135D3D34FFA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Energy Module:&r six &6redstone blocks&r at the top and bottom, iron, Module Core, iron in the middle. &6Wyvern Energy Module:&r six Draconium Ingots at the top and bottom, Energy Module, Draconium Core, Energy Module in the middle."
		""
		"The simple module stores &d1 million&r, the Wyvern module &d4 million&r energy. Every module needs power, so this one goes into every grid first."
	]
	quest.6E071135D3D34FFA.quest_subtitle: "More battery for tools and armor."
	quest.6E071135D3D34FFA.title: "&dBuild a Wyvern Energy Module"
	quest.6E0F9169C15D1706.quest_desc: [
		"&eExport to Inventory&r ist das Gegenstück: Die Drohne fliegt zur nächsten Kiste im &eArea&r und legt ab, was sie trägt. Item Filter rechts für nur das, links für alles außer dem."
		""
		"Import und Export zusammen sind schon ein Programm: Start, Import aus Kiste A, Export in Kiste B. Die Drohne pendelt, bis A leer oder B voll ist, und wartet dann."
	]
	quest.6E0F9169C15D1706.quest_subtitle: "Die Drohne legt etwas in eine Kiste."
	quest.6E0F9169C15D1706.title: "&7Puzzleteil: Export to Inventory"
	quest.6E1285396527392A.quest_desc: [
		"&eBore Lens&r: top &6piston&r, middle &6lapis block&r, lens, lapis block, bottom &6redstone&r. The burst mines every block it hits with its mana."
		"&eMagnetizing Lens&r: shapeless lens, iron ingot, gold ingot. The burst seeks out the nearest block that accepts mana on its own."
		"&eKindle Lens&r: shapeless lens and fire charge. The burst sets blocks on fire."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Tool lenses belong on a &6Pulse Mana Spreader&r; a normal one only fires at targets that accept mana."
	]
	quest.6E1285396527392A.quest_subtitle: "Lenses that mine, attract and ignite."
	quest.6E1285396527392A.title: "&6Turn the burst into a tool"
	quest.6E140B2737105793.quest_desc: [
		"Amethyst grows in &egeodes&r underground: a sphere of smooth basalt and calcite, purple inside. Mine the fully grown clusters."
		""
		"&6Budding amethyst&r can't be taken along. Remember the geode, the buds keep growing back."
		""
		"Lapis lazuli works too: the chamber turns one piece of it into a Source Gem as well."
	]
	quest.6E140B2737105793.quest_subtitle: "The raw material for every Source Gem."
	quest.6E140B2737105793.title: "&6Collect amethyst"
	quest.6E1640D4F0A6D771.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Railway Casing&r and a &6pressure plate&r make two &6Train Observers&r. Placed on the track like a signal, it gives redstone as long as a train is above it."
		""
		"With a filter it only reacts to trains with a certain item. With that you close barriers or start a loading station."
	]
	quest.6E1640D4F0A6D771.quest_subtitle: "The Train Observer."
	quest.6E1640D4F0A6D771.title: "&6Report passing trains"
	quest.6E22E2343E1BC516.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &69 Forgotten Nuggets&r make &61 Forgotten Ingot&r."
		""
		"{image:undergarden:textures/item/forgotten_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Every ingot is one upgrade. The pickaxe is a must, everything else comes after."
	]
	quest.6E22E2343E1BC516.quest_subtitle: "Nine nuggets, one ingot."
	quest.6E22E2343E1BC516.title: "&dForge a Forgotten Ingot"
	quest.6E25C12926B19AE5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_dynamo.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Three &6Treated Wood Planks&r and four &6Treated Sticks&r make a &6Windmill Blade&r. Eight blades around an &6iron ingot&r make the &6Windmill&r."
		""
		"It needs a lot of free space in front of it, every block in the way slows it down. Completely free and without sails it makes about &d17 FE/t&r. Above the ocean it turns 15 percent faster, in rain and thunderstorms too."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/material_windmill_blade.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.6E25C12926B19AE5.quest_subtitle: "Power from the air."
	quest.6E25C12926B19AE5.title: "&b&lPut a Windmill on the dynamo"
	quest.6E3194D31188967A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Arcane Cloth&r aus Arcane Essence und Wolle, dann Hut, Robe, Hose und Schuhe im Lederrüstungsmuster. Kapitel &5Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r."
		""
		"Jedes Teil +125 Mana und +5 Prozent Zauberkraft, Schutz wie Diamant (3, 8, 6, 3). Mit einer Rune wird daraus Schulrüstung mit +10 Prozent für ihre Schule."
	]
	quest.6E3194D31188967A.quest_subtitle: "Iron's Spells: 125 Mana pro Teil."
	quest.6E3194D31188967A.title: "&5Zieh die Zaubererrobe an"
	quest.6E319C40AA564E5E.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Sky stone dust in the corners, Calculation Processor at the top, three 64k components left, right and bottom, a &6draconium ingot&r in the middle. Draconium only exists in the End."
		""
		"A 256k cell holds &e2,080,768&r items of one kind. With a Crafting Unit the component becomes 256k Crafting Storage."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r In stage 4 the obelisk wants &e1,000 draconium ingots&r. Every ingot in a cell is missing there. Build only as big as you really need."
	]
	quest.6E319C40AA564E5E.quest_subtitle: "Draconium in storage."
	quest.6E319C40AA564E5E.title: "&b&lBuild a 256k Cell"
	quest.6E33B0F26592EC33.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r four Blueprint Paper and two metal ingots. The ring blueprint and &etwo&r metal ingots make a &6ring&r."
		""
		"It goes into a &ering slot&r (Curios) and carries the traits of its metal. What a metal brings is in the &6Material Book&r. Bracelet and necklace follow the same principle."
	]
	quest.6E33B0F26592EC33.quest_subtitle: "Jewellery with the traits of the metal."
	quest.6E33B0F26592EC33.title: "&eForge a ring"
	quest.6E39D753FBF2952B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Grass block&r, below it &6wheat seeds&r, below that &6Dragonstone&r. That makes &e4 World Seeds&r."
		""
		"Right click takes you straight to the world's spawn point if you are at least &e24 blocks&r away from it. The seed is used up."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The obelisk stands at spawn. With a few seeds in your pocket the way to hand things in is short."
	]
	quest.6E39D753FBF2952B.quest_subtitle: "A jump back to spawn."
	quest.6E39D753FBF2952B.title: "&dPlant a World Seed"
	quest.6E3A1E12838FE053.quest_desc: [
		"A Teleportation Core, two Energy Tablets, two circuits. It jumps to every teleporter on your frequencies."
		""
		"Charge it first. A jump home from the mine saves the way back."
	]
	quest.6E3A1E12838FE053.quest_subtitle: "The Portable Teleporter."
	quest.6E3A1E12838FE053.title: "&dPocket a teleporter"
	quest.6E3F4844B0942666.quest_desc: [
		"Bats drop a &6Bat Wing&r. You need it for the Coin of Fortune, the Ender Staff and the Angelic Feather. Bats hang in dark caves, Looting helps here too."
	]
	quest.6E3F4844B0942666.quest_subtitle: "From the bat."
	quest.6E3F4844B0942666.title: "&8Bat Wing"
	quest.6E5766817EEA260D.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Open your inventory and put the spell book into the \"},{\"text\":\"spell book slot\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" next to the armor (Curios). Casting: \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.irons_spellbooks.spellbook_cast\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" casts the selected spell, holding \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.irons_spellbooks.spell_wheel\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" opens the spell wheel, \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.irons_spellbooks.spell_bar_modifier\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" + mouse wheel\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" switches the spell.\"}]"
		""
		"You see your &bmana&r as a blue bar by the hotbar. You start with &e100 mana&r. Every half second &e1 percent&r of your maximum comes back, so with 100 mana 2 per second, a full bar in 50 seconds."
		""
		"So more maximum also means faster regeneration. Armor and better books bring mana, see below. &eKronwerke:&r The &6Sourceborn&r origin (Neo Origins) gives you &e+50 mana&r in Iron's Spells from the start, and in Ars Nouveau as well."
	]
	quest.6E5766817EEA260D.quest_subtitle: "Book into the slot, R to cast, V for the wheel."
	quest.6E5766817EEA260D.title: "&dEquip the Book"
	quest.6E702C3E467A77B5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Pump&r: &d4 SU per RPM&r. 256 SU at 64 RPM."
	]
	quest.6E702C3E467A77B5.quest_subtitle: "More speed, more flow."
	quest.6E702C3E467A77B5.title: "&7Pump: 4 SU per RPM"
	quest.6E86618148BB3FB8.quest_desc: [
		"Bring the power over &6Elite Universal Cables&r from Mekanism, an AE2 energy P2P tunnel (costs 2.5 percent) or a generator on site. An Energy Cube right at the machine buffers peaks."
		""
		"A Builder with a Fortune Card or a Quarry Plus with Efficiency V eats more than most machines of your base."
	]
	quest.6E86618148BB3FB8.quest_subtitle: "Quarries are hungry."
	quest.6E86618148BB3FB8.title: "&cLay Power to the Quarry"
	quest.6E88EA9560076981.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6Ferricore Ingots&r in the corners, a &6furnace&r in the middle, &6coal&r left and right, &6redstone blocks&r on top and bottom."
		""
		"{image:justdirethings:textures/item/pocket_generator.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Right click opens the &6Pocket Generator&r. Put coal, Primal Coal or Blaze Ember inside (same values as the big generator), and it charges everything in your inventory that stores FE with up to &e5,000 FE/t&r. It holds 1 million FE itself."
		""
		"This is the power source for the Portal Gun, but just as well for an Energy Tablet from Mekanism or any other item that stores FE."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The &6Fuel Canister&r (four ingots around a coal) swallows up to 10 million burn ticks, anything except lava buckets, and fits into furnaces, the generator and the Pocket Generator. A furnace only draws what it needs from it, instead of burning a whole coal for one ore. You do not get the fuel back."
	]
	quest.6E88EA9560076981.quest_subtitle: "A power plant in your inventory."
	quest.6E88EA9560076981.title: "&eBuild the Pocket Generator"
	quest.6EA8AB6A9B26ADD0.quest_desc: [
		"Kauf eine &6Lawson-Zypresse&r (Gelbkiefer und Fichte, 4 Smaragde), sie wächst einzeln oder als 3x3-Riese. Aus Fichte und Birke kommt die &6Europäische Lärche&r, aus ihr Gelbkiefer und Eibe, dann Balsamtanne, Weißtanne, Zeder, Douglasie, Weihrauchkiefer, Westliche Hemlocktanne, Wacholder und Araukarie."
		""
		"Die &6Westliche Hemlocktanne&r (Gelbkiefer und Weißtanne) ist die einzige Kreuzung, die bei jedem Versuch gelingt. Der &6Mammutbaum&r braucht 5x5 Setzlinge, mit 9x9 wird er zum größten Baum des Mods."
		""
		"Nadelbäume tragen nichts außer Wacholderbeeren (3 pro Blatt). Sie sind Holzlieferanten und Eltern: Amberbaum plus Weihrauchkiefer ergibt den &6Gummibaum&r."
	]
	quest.6EA8AB6A9B26ADD0.quest_subtitle: "Nadelbäume: Lärche, Tannen, Kiefern, Mammutbaum."
	quest.6EA8AB6A9B26ADD0.title: "&2Pflanz eine Lawson-Zypresse"
	quest.6EA9E0ED86983F1F.quest_desc: [
		"Paper in the corners, &6Plastic&r at the top and sides, &6redstone&r in the middle and bottom middle make the &6Machine Settings Copier&r."
		""
		"It saves a machine's settings, such as side configuration and filters, and transfers them to a second machine of the same kind. Saves a lot of clicking when you want to set up ten Plant Sowers or Plant Gatherers the same way."
	]
	quest.6EA9E0ED86983F1F.quest_subtitle: "Set it once, apply it everywhere."
	quest.6EA9E0ED86983F1F.title: "&7Copy Machine Settings"
	quest.6EB56E4B2AED9F8B.quest_desc: [
		"Slimes drop a &6Slime Pearl&r. It goes into the Void Tear, the Lantern of Paranoia, the Coin of Fortune and the Fertile Essence."
	]
	quest.6EB56E4B2AED9F8B.quest_subtitle: "From the slime."
	quest.6EB56E4B2AED9F8B.title: "&aSlime Pearl"
	quest.6EB6BEEA844AAABE.quest_desc: [
		"A &6string&r at the top middle, &6seven flax&r around it. Flax grows wild, you can farm the seeds."
		""
		"The Supplementaries &6Sack&r has &e9 slots&r and can be set down as a block. Anyone carrying more than two gets slower."
	]
	quest.6EB6BEEA844AAABE.quest_subtitle: "Nine slots, and heavy."
	quest.6EB6BEEA844AAABE.title: "Sew a sack"
	quest.6EBEA82F8E132468.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_hammer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Two &6iron ingots&r, a &6string&r and two &6sticks&r make the &6Engineer's Hammer&r."
		""
		"&eHow to form a multiblock:&r build the structure exactly as in the manual, then right click with the hammer on the block the manual names. If a block is wrong, simply nothing happens."
		""
		"The hammer lasts for &e100&r uses. It also makes plates and sets the sides of accumulators, so build a second one right away."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/tool_hammer.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.6EBEA82F8E132468.quest_subtitle: "The key to every multiblock."
	quest.6EBEA82F8E132468.title: "&7Build an Engineer's Hammer"
	quest.6EC19C284A47EA2D.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r The Soul Binder needs four &6Soulstained Steel&r from &5Malum&r instead of Soularium. The soul side of Ender IO runs through Malum."
		""
		"Spirit Altar: one iron ingot, four Refined Soulstone, three &cWicked&r, one &2Earthen&r, one &dArcane Spirit&r. See the &5Malum&r chapter."
		""
		"No Malum player nearby? Ask in chat. Four ingots for a stack of conduits is a fair trade."
	]
	quest.6EC19C284A47EA2D.quest_subtitle: "The Soul Binder wants Malum."
	quest.6EC19C284A47EA2D.title: "&5Get Soulstained Steel"
	quest.6EC2F75D909C67D5.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Chemical Infuser from 1 mB hydrogen and 1 mB chlorine. Salt straight into the Chemical Injection Chamber gives 2 mB."
		"&eUsed by:&r the Chemical Injection Chamber, ore 4x in stage 4."
	]
	quest.6EC2F75D909C67D5.quest_subtitle: "Hydrogen plus chlorine."
	quest.6EC2F75D909C67D5.title: "&fHydrogen chloride"
	quest.6ED69134FFF1E0FB.quest_desc: [
		"&eDye&r (400 mana) or &egunpowder&r, &eredstone&r, &esugar&r (500 mana each) in the pool become &6Mana Powder&r."
		""
		"In stage 2 there is a powder in each of the four elemental runes. Spare petals become dye, dye becomes powder."
	]
	quest.6ED69134FFF1E0FB.quest_subtitle: "Dust that smells of magic."
	quest.6ED69134FFF1E0FB.title: "&6Make Mana Powder"
	quest.6EE7E899D25E0E86.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_plastic.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Gib &b100 mB LPG&r und eine &6Kohle&r in die heiße Thermopneumatische Anlage (ab 100 Grad, kein Druck nötig). Heraus kommen &b1 000 mB flüssiger Kunststoff&r. Schöpf ihn in einen Eimer und &egieß ihn aus&r: Nach einer halben Sekunde liegt eine &6Kunststoffplatte&r (Plastic Sheet) da."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/item/plastic.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eAutomatisch:&r Ein Flüssigkeitstrichter mit Spender-Upgrade gießt den Kunststoff aus, ein Rundum-Trichter sammelt die Platte ein. Oder du stellst einen Eimer Kunststoff in eine Kiste mit kaltem Hitzerahmen, das gibt bei tiefen Minusgraden bis zu 75 Prozent öfter eine zweite Platte."
		""
		"Kunststoff steckt im Druckluftzylinder, im GPS-Werkzeug, in den Aufzugrufern, im Amadron-Tablet und in jeder Platine. Ein Eimer LPG macht zehn Platten, ein Eimer Öl aus der Raffinerie also zwei. Plane eine Linie, keine Einzelrezepte."
	]
	quest.6EE7E899D25E0E86.quest_subtitle: "LPG und Kohle, ausgegossen."
	quest.6EE7E899D25E0E86.title: "&f&lKoch Kunststoff"
	quest.6F07852A716D3465.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pipez&r, &6Flüssigkeitsrohr&r: &e50 mB pro Tick&r ohne Modifikation, 100 mit der Normalen, 500 mit der Verbesserten, 2 000 mit der Fortgeschrittenen (Stufe 3), 10 000 mit der Ultimativen (Stufe 4). Flüssigkeitsfilter ab Stufe 3. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Wie das Item-Rohr, nur mit zwei Eimern statt der Werfer. Siehe Kapitel Rohre und Router."
	]
	quest.6F07852A716D3465.quest_subtitle: "Pipez, Flüssigkeitsrohr: 50 mB pro Tick, bis 500 mit Modifikation."
	quest.6F07852A716D3465.title: "Lies: Pipez Flüssigkeitsrohr"
	quest.6F0E2ECEDFEB12C0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Terra Shatterer&r: top Terrasteel, &6Mana Tablet&r, Terrasteel, middle Terrasteel, twig, Terrasteel, bottom twig. &6Terra Truncator&r: 4 Terrasteel, glowstone, 2 twigs."
		""
		"The Shatterer soaks up mana like a tablet in a pool and rises in rank from D to SS as it does. A sneaking right click switches on its ability: from rank C it mines a narrow column, from B a square, after that ever larger areas."
		""
		"The Truncator fells whole trees with leaves in one hit. While sneaking it works like a normal axe."
	]
	quest.6F0E2ECEDFEB12C0.quest_subtitle: "A pickaxe that grows with mana, and an axe for whole trees."
	quest.6F0E2ECEDFEB12C0.title: "&aForge Shatterer and Truncator"
	quest.6F301E6815986CAB.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Shape Card&r in the middle, a &6diamond pickaxe&r at the top, a &6diamond shovel&r at the bottom, &6iron&r left and right, &6redstone&r in the corners."
		""
		"With it the Builder mines everything in the area and puts dirt in every spot, so no giant hole remains."
	]
	quest.6F301E6815986CAB.quest_subtitle: "The Builder becomes an excavator."
	quest.6F301E6815986CAB.title: "&6&lBuild a Quarry Card"
	quest.6F410BC1C10DBAAF.quest_desc: [
		"In the &dArs Nouveau&r Enchanting Apparatus: &6Golden Ritual Bowl&r in the middle, &e4 silver ingots&r, &e2 sourcestone&r, a &6Drygmy Shard&r and a &6Containment Jar&r, plus 5,000 Source."
		""
		"The altar goes under the golden bowl. If a ritual wants an animal sacrifice and a Containment Jar with the right animal stands nearby, the altar pays with Source from a Source Jar. The animal lives on."
		""
		"Spirits like your Crusher also keep working inside a Containment Jar, fed by hopper."
	]
	quest.6F410BC1C10DBAAF.quest_subtitle: "Ars Ocultas: pay sacrifices with Source."
	quest.6F410BC1C10DBAAF.title: "&bBuild the Sacrificial Altar"
	quest.6F47E5B16CB6D71F.quest_desc: [
		"Pray every day. As favor grows, the patron grants you the &cBlood Sign&r, the sign of life force."
		""
		"Try every new rite at least once. Sometimes only that opens the next step."
	]
	quest.6F47E5B16CB6D71F.quest_subtitle: "A gift for faithful prayers."
	quest.6F47E5B16CB6D71F.title: "&cReceive the Blood Sign"
	quest.6F4AE0A76A262AB5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Elite-Installateur:&r Verstärkte Legierung in die Ecken, &6Elite-Schaltkreise&r oben und unten, Gold links und rechts, ein Brett. &6Ultimativ-Installateur:&r Atomlegierung, &6Ultimative Schaltkreise&r, Diamanten, ein Brett. Beides &6Stufe 4&r."
		""
		"Elite-Fabrik &e7 Plätze&r, Ultimative Fabrik &e9 Plätze&r. Die Leitungen wachsen mit: acht fortschrittliche um eine Verstärkte Legierung ergeben Elite, acht Elite um eine Atomlegierung ergeben Ultimativ. Elite-Transporter 32 pro halbe Sekunde, Ultimativ 64, Elite-Druckschlauch 64 000 mB/t."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Rechtsklick mit der nächsten Legierung auf eine liegende Leitung stuft sie an Ort und Stelle hoch, ohne Abbauen."
	]
	quest.6F4AE0A76A262AB5.quest_subtitle: "Sieben, dann neun Plätze. Stufe 4."
	quest.6F4AE0A76A262AB5.title: "&aStuf auf Elite und Ultimativ hoch"
	quest.6F4DB33C72E95B9B.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6iron ingots&r and three paste, laid diagonally."
		""
		"&eConfig&r sets on a cable side whether it pulls, pushes or does nothing. &eLink&r links rods with the orb. &eRotate&r turns blocks. The current mode is in the tooltip."
	]
	quest.6F4DB33C72E95B9B.quest_subtitle: "Three modes for cables, orb and blocks."
	quest.6F4DB33C72E95B9B.title: "&7Build the Wrench"
	quest.6F557A28BC936207.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r in der mittleren Reihe &6Holzstufe&r, &6Erde&r, &6Holzstufe&r, darunter drei Holzstufen. Das ergibt zwei &6Blumenkästen&r."
		""
		"Stell sie unter ein Fenster oder auf eine Mauer und setz kleine Blumen hinein. Ein paar Kästen bringen mehr Farbe an ein Haus als jede Fassade."
	]
	quest.6F557A28BC936207.quest_subtitle: "Blumen am Fenster, nicht nur auf der Wiese."
	quest.6F557A28BC936207.title: "&aPflanz einen Blumenkasten"
	quest.6F6546647C0552B4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Redstone Bee&r and &6Blue Banded Bee&r. Flower: &6lapis lazuli block&r. The comb gives &6lapis lazuli&r with 50 percent. Paired with a Skeletal Bee it becomes the Dye Bee, which collects dye from flowers."
	]
	quest.6F6546647C0552B4.quest_subtitle: "Lapis lazuli from combs."
	quest.6F6546647C0552B4.title: "&9Breed the Lapis Bee"
	quest.6F65AC2BCB516AE5.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r A &6book&r into the &6Imbuement Chamber&r from &dArs Nouveau&r, a &6lapis lazuli&r and a &6glowstone dust&r on the pedestals next to it. For &d300 source&r it turns into &e3 Arcane Essence&r."
		""
		"Lapis and glowstone dust stay on the pedestals, only the book is used up. With source from Source Links this runs by itself next to the base while you go round the towers."
		""
		"&eTip:&r For the whole wizard robe you need 192 essences. A stack of books and a full source storage save you many mage fights."
	]
	quest.6F65AC2BCB516AE5.quest_subtitle: "Books instead of mages."
	quest.6F65AC2BCB516AE5.title: "&dImbue Arcane Essence with Source"
	quest.6F6F095C201A9182.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/the_end_egg.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put a &6torch&r below the block the &5dragon egg&r sits on, and break the block. The egg falls onto the torch and becomes an item."
		""
		"Clicking it does nothing, it just teleports away. &eOn Kronwerke&r a new egg appears after every victory, not only after the first."
	]
	quest.6F6F095C201A9182.quest_subtitle: "It does not want to be touched."
	quest.6F6F095C201A9182.title: "&5Get the Dragon Egg"
	quest.6F8E1F1C96414E76.quest_desc: [
		"&6XNet&r: ein Controller, 8 Kanäle, dünne Kabel zu Connectors an jeder Maschine, Advanced Connector bis &e100 000 RF/t&r und 5 000 mB je Vorgang. &6LaserIO&r: Laser zwischen Nodes bis 8 Blöcke, Karten je Seite, Energy Card bis &e1 000 000 FE/t&r. &6Integrated Tunnels&r: Importer und Exporter am Logiknetz, programmierbar. Alle mit Filtern. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"Alle drei im Kapitel Logistik."
	]
	quest.6F8E1F1C96414E76.quest_subtitle: "Drei Netze, in denen du alles an einer Stelle einstellst."
	quest.6F8E1F1C96414E76.title: "Lies: XNet, LaserIO, Integrated Tunnels"
	quest.6F9A91933C4AAD8D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cogwheel&r: a shaft and a plank. &6Large Cogwheel&r: a shaft and two planks, or a cogwheel and a plank."
		""
		"Two small ones side by side pass the rotation sideways and the direction flips. A large one drives a small one offset diagonally and &edoubles&r the speed; the other way round it halves."
	]
	quest.6F9A91933C4AAD8D.quest_subtitle: "Small and large, and the speed in between."
	quest.6F9A91933C4AAD8D.title: "&6Fit cogwheels together"
	quest.6FAA15595AE66000.quest_desc: [
		"&6Electron Tube&r, &6andesite casing&r and &6crushing wheel&r on top of each other make the &6Mechanical Roller&r. At the front of a contraption it clears the way and paves with the block from its filter."
		""
		"It fills holes up to 12 blocks deep. A train with two rollers levels its own track bed."
	]
	quest.6FAA15595AE66000.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Roller."
	quest.6FAA15595AE66000.title: "&6Pave a track bed"
	quest.6FB03CF421652A7D.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_apprentice_turret.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Top &e3 Source Gems&r, middle Source Gem, &6block of redstone&r, gold ingot, bottom &e3 gold ingots&r."
		""
		"On every pulse it casts the spell from an inscribed &6parchment&r, with Touch or Projectile, paid with Source from jars. With a chest next to it, Pickup and Place Block work too."
		""
		"Example: &eTouch, Break&r in front of a cobblestone generator on a redstone clock."
	]
	quest.6FB03CF421652A7D.quest_subtitle: "A spell on a redstone pulse."
	quest.6FB03CF421652A7D.title: "&a&lBuild a Basic Spell Turret"
	quest.6FB0CE50046D4F85.quest_desc: [
		"A &6gold ingot&r under the Logic Press gives a Printed Logic Circuit. Put that in the top slot, &6redstone&r in the middle, &6Printed Silicon&r at the bottom: the &6Logic Processor&r is done."
		""
		"Logic Processors go into cells, terminals and the formation and annihilation cores."
	]
	quest.6FB0CE50046D4F85.quest_subtitle: "Gold, then redstone and silicon."
	quest.6FB0CE50046D4F85.title: "&eBuild a Logic Processor"
	quest.6FB294DD0D637FC4.quest_desc: [
		"Setz einen &6Eichensetzling&r auf Erde in einen Pflanztopf. Nach &e2 Minuten&r ist der Baum reif und gibt &e1 bis 4 Eichenstämme&r, dazu mit je 5 Prozent einen Setzling oder einen Apfel. Mit einer Schere im Werkzeugplatz kommen Blätter dazu."
		""
		"Das geht mit jedem Setzling im Pack: alle Vanilla-Bäume, die &dArchwood-Bäume&r von Ars Nouveau, die Bäume aus Biomes O' Plenty, Hexerei und Malum. Ein Trichter-Topf mit Setzling über einer Schublade ist eine Holzfarm ohne Sägen und ohne Kontraption."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Holzkohle für die Create-Spieler, Bretter für Andesitgehäuse, Stämme für Mekanism-Stahl später: Holz braucht jeder, und vier Töpfe laufen leise neben der Küche."
	]
	quest.6FB294DD0D637FC4.quest_subtitle: "Botany Trees: Holz alle zwei Minuten."
	quest.6FB294DD0D637FC4.title: "&aPflanz einen Baum in den Topf"
	quest.6FD098CC9C455991.quest_desc: [
		"&6Dwellers&r are the big, calm animals of the Undergarden. They drop &6Raw Dweller Meat&r and leather. In a furnace it becomes a &6Dweller Steak&r."
		""
		"You can ride a saddled Dweller and steer it with an &6Underbean on a Stick&r. The hopping &6Gloompers&r give Gloomper legs and leather."
	]
	quest.6FD098CC9C455991.quest_subtitle: "Meat and leather from the Dweller."
	quest.6FD098CC9C455991.title: "&6Cook a Dweller Steak"
	quest.6FD207C48096D020.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Infused Alloy&r with &e20 mB of diamond&r gives a &6Reinforced Alloy&r."
		""
		"The mages' milestone, the &6Elven Star&r, needs one. The mages cannot make it themselves, bring them some. In stage 4 it goes into the Elite Control Circuit."
	]
	quest.6FD207C48096D020.quest_subtitle: "Infused Alloy, soaked in diamond."
	quest.6FD207C48096D020.title: "&bMake Reinforced Alloy"
	quest.6FD37C0D735F7B6C.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Copper Wire&r around a &6stick&r make four &6LV Wire Coils&r."
		""
		"Coil in hand, click one connector first, then the next. One stretch may be &e16 blocks&r long at most, and no block may stand in the way."
		""
		"{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/wirecoil_copper.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.6FD37C0D735F7B6C.quest_subtitle: "Low voltage to hang up."
	quest.6FD37C0D735F7B6C.title: "&6Wind LV Wire Coils"
	quest.6FD77EC7EFA9027B.quest_desc: [
		"Sechste Generation, erster Teil."
		""
		"&6Mandel&r: Pflaume + Walnuss, 10 %"
		"&6Schlehe&r: Pflaume + Red-Delicious-Apfel, 10 %"
		"&6Buchsbaum&r: Stechpalme + Erle, 10 %"
		"&6Brasilholz&r: Teak + Mahagoni, 10 %"
		"&6Kerzennuss&r: Ginkgo + Hasel, 10 %"
		"&6Cempedak&r: Sykomore + Brotfrucht, 10 %"
		"&6Kirschpflaume&r: Pflaume + Kirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Gewürznelke&r: Kaffee + Teak, 10 %"
		"&6Fingerlimette&r: Zitronatzitrone + Key-Lime, 10 %"
		"&6Greenheart&r: Mahagoni + Kapok, 10 %"
	]
	quest.6FD77EC7EFA9027B.quest_subtitle: "10 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.6FD77EC7EFA9027B.title: "&aGeneration 6: Mandel bis Greenheart"
	quest.6FD7F624EEA82EBD.quest_desc: [
		"&dCut&r (essence, shears, iron sword): works like shears, costs nothing."
		"&dEvaporate&r (essence, 3 sponges): removes fluids in an area."
		"&dRedstone Signal&r (essence, 3 redstone blocks): a short signal at the target."
		"&dRune&r (essence, rune chalk, tripwire hook): sets a trap that casts its spell on anything walking over it. Rune chalk: Manipulation Essence, bone meal, Magebloom Fiber."
	]
	quest.6FD7F624EEA82EBD.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1 checklist: manipulation, part two."
	quest.6FD7F624EEA82EBD.title: "&dLearn Cut, Evaporate, Signal and Rune"
	quest.6FDF1F18F22B7A61.quest_desc: [
		"Druckeisen, &6Goldklumpen&r, Druckeisen oben, &6Verstärkte Ziegelmauer&r, &6Truhe&r, Verstärkte Ziegelmauer in der Mitte, Druckeisen, &6Obsidian&r, Druckeisen unten ergeben die &6Verstärkte Truhe&r (Reinforced Chest)."
		""
		"Sie hat &e36 Plätze&r, hält Explosionen wie Obsidian und behält ihren Inhalt, wenn du sie abbaust. Ideal für Kohle und Druckeisen neben dem Kompressor."
		""
		"&eMit Platine:&r Zwei Verstärkte Truhen, ein Rundum-Trichter, zwei Diamanten und eine Platine ergeben die &6Intelligente Truhe&r (Smart Chest) mit 72 Plätzen. Jede Seite kann schieben oder ziehen, einzelne Plätze lassen sich auf einen Gegenstand festlegen."
	]
	quest.6FDF1F18F22B7A61.quest_subtitle: "Explosionsfest, und sie behält alles."
	quest.6FDF1F18F22B7A61.title: "&eBau eine Verstärkte Truhe"
	quest.6FE18D935573B6E9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Four paper&r and &6one blue dye&r, shapeless, make &efour Blueprint Paper&r."
		""
		"Blue dye comes from cornflowers, lapis or Silent Gear's &6flax flowers&r. A pickaxe blueprint is three Blueprint Paper on top, two sticks vertically below."
	]
	quest.6FE18D935573B6E9.quest_subtitle: "The paper for every further blueprint."
	quest.6FE18D935573B6E9.title: "&7Make Blueprint Paper"
	quest.7000C2108F60B823.quest_desc: [
		"Into the pot: a &6milk bottle&r, &6sugar&r and two &6cocoa beans&r."
		""
		"&6Hot cocoa&r removes one negative status effect, such as poison or slowness. A &6milk bottle&r removes any one effect, &6melon juice&r heals a little instantly. Good for the cave and after a boss fight."
	]
	quest.7000C2108F60B823.quest_subtitle: "A drink against bad effects."
	quest.7000C2108F60B823.title: "&6Cook hot cocoa"
	quest.700566FCFCCB3B7D.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6copper wire&r, two &6cardboard&r and one &6stick&r make a &6copper coil&r."
		"{image:powergrid:textures/item/copper_coil.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"You need many: the rotor wants four, the electromagnet five, the motor six."
	]
	quest.700566FCFCCB3B7D.quest_subtitle: "Goes into generator, motor and magnet."
	quest.700566FCFCCB3B7D.title: "&3Wind a copper coil"
	quest.700F030FDF18CD64.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_advanced_teleporter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eSo geht es:&r Ein &6Teleportationskern&r (&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r 4 Manaperlen, 2 Atomlegierungen, 2 Gold, Diamant) wird mit 4 Stahlgehäusen und 4 einfachen Schaltkreisen zum &6Teleporter&r. Dazu &e9 Teleporter-Rahmen&r aus raffiniertem Obsidian und Glowstone, als Rahmen 3 breit und 4 hoch, der Teleporter unten in der Mitte."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r Zwei Teleporter mit derselben &eFrequenz&r verbinden zwei Basen oder zwei Dimensionen, ohne Level und ohne Wartezeit. Nur Strom, mehr je weiter. Der &6Tragbare Teleportierer&r springt von überall zu jedem Teleporter deiner Frequenz."
		""
		"Alles im Kapitel &6Mekanism: Fortgeschritten&r."
	]
	quest.700F030FDF18CD64.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism: Rahmen, Frequenz, Strom. Stufe 3."
	quest.700F030FDF18CD64.title: "&dBau einen Teleporter"
	quest.702A0AE6AA12A45C.quest_desc: [
		"Top a &6piston&r, middle &6Crimson Iron, block of iron, Crimson Iron&r, bottom &6Crimson Iron, obsidian, Crimson Iron&r."
		""
		"Breaks Silent Gear tools and vanilla tools down into material. &e0 to 50 percent&r is lost per part."
	]
	quest.702A0AE6AA12A45C.quest_subtitle: "Old tools back into material."
	quest.702A0AE6AA12A45C.title: "&7Build a Salvager"
	quest.702B5491F8F27A8D.quest_desc: [
		"Sieben &6Flachs&r (oder Weizen, oder Leinwand aus Farmer's Delight) um einen &6Faden&r oben in der Mitte ergeben einen &6Sack&r. Er hat neun Plätze, lässt sich als Block aufstellen und behält seinen Inhalt, wenn du ihn abbaust."
		""
		"&cAchtung:&r Säcke sind schwer. Mit mehr als zwei Säcken im Inventar wirst du langsamer, mit mehr als vier noch langsamer. Ein Sack für die Ernte, einer für Baumaterial, mehr nicht."
	]
	quest.702B5491F8F27A8D.quest_subtitle: "Neun Plätze, die du mitnehmen kannst."
	quest.702B5491F8F27A8D.title: "&6Näh einen Sack"
	quest.7040879D670270F0.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &fAir Essence&r and &e3 Wilden Wings&r."
		""
		"&eSelf, Leap&r flings you forward, Amplify further. &cNo protection from fall damage.&r"
	]
	quest.7040879D670270F0.quest_subtitle: "Further than any horse."
	quest.7040879D670270F0.title: "&dLearn Leap"
	quest.704CBA0CA99C2603.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6iron ingots&r in a square at the top right, a &6brick&r at the bottom left as the handle."
		""
		"On the heat source it fries like a small furnace. In your hand over a heat source works too. On the side, a decent melee weapon."
	]
	quest.704CBA0CA99C2603.quest_subtitle: "Frying on the stove or in your hand."
	quest.704CBA0CA99C2603.title: "&7Forge a Skillet"
	quest.7054E30ADE9AE64C.quest_desc: [
		"A &6hand crank&r and a &6cogwheel&r make the &6crank wheel&r, a crank that meshes with cogwheels next to it."
		""
		"On top of that there are the &6brake&r, &6centrifugal clutch&r, &6kinetic battery&r, &6item silo&r and &6fluid vessel&r. EMI shows every recipe."
	]
	quest.7054E30ADE9AE64C.quest_subtitle: "Create Connected: small parts."
	quest.7054E30ADE9AE64C.title: "&6Build a crank wheel"
	quest.7056FC6DBFCD7835.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Sculk-Kreischer&r, der dreimal ausgelöst wird, holt den &4Wärter&r aus dem Boden. Er ist blind, hört und riecht dich aber, hat &e500 Lebenspunkte&r und sein &cSchallangriff&r geht durch jede Rüstung."
		""
		"&eBeute:&r Ein &6Sculk-Katalysator&r, &e1 bis 3 Wärterpanzer&r und ein &6Herz der Tiefen&r. Das Herz zündet das Portal in die Anderwelt, aus dem Panzer werden Verstärkte Echoscherben und der Antike Kompass."
		""
		"&eTipps:&r Kämpf aus der Distanz und mit Höhe, er klettert nicht. Wer ihn nicht bekämpfen will, lockt ihn mit einem geworfenen Schneeball weg. Geht zu zweit oder zu dritt, Zuschauer sind hier gern gesehen."
	]
	quest.7056FC6DBFCD7835.quest_subtitle: "Dreimal kreischen, dann kommt er."
	quest.7056FC6DBFCD7835.title: "&4&lErlege den Wärter"
	quest.705A1D339FC496C6.quest_desc: [
		"Sal Ammoniac Crystal, gold, a Sulfur and stone, see EMI. Click every pedestal with it and then place it on a Mercury Catalyst."
		""
		"A right click on the placed emitter shows whether everything is connected."
	]
	quest.705A1D339FC496C6.quest_subtitle: "It controls the reformation."
	quest.705A1D339FC496C6.title: "&6Connect the Sulfuric Flux Emitter"
	quest.70624AB6F4B0554A.quest_desc: [
		"Kill an &6Ignited Revenant&r in the arena. It drops &6Burning Ashes&r, the key for Ignis."
		""
		"It has &e80 health&r and armour 12, shoots burning bones and spits ash. Shield up and stay on it."
		""
		"&eSecond way:&r 4 &6Dying Embers&r make one ash. Ignited Berserkers drop the embers, and they only appear once Ignis is defeated."
	]
	quest.70624AB6F4B0554A.quest_subtitle: "The Ignited Revenant carries the key."
	quest.70624AB6F4B0554A.title: "&6Get Burning Ashes"
	quest.706D7598F3CB0BAC.quest_desc: [
		"Right-click a placed stripped log with a &6copper ingot&r: it becomes &6Copper Casing&r. It goes into the spout, the drain and the hose pulley."
		""
		"In stage 2 every brass ingot has two copper in it. Hoarding copper pays off."
	]
	quest.706D7598F3CB0BAC.quest_subtitle: "The Copper Casing for everything fluid."
	quest.706D7598F3CB0BAC.title: "&6Encase wood with copper"
	quest.708941A82D1AB8D8.quest_desc: [
		"Lay the track right into a &cNether portal&r. Create continues the line on the other side."
		""
		"A short Nether line connects bases far apart. Secure it, ghasts think nothing of schedules."
	]
	quest.708941A82D1AB8D8.quest_subtitle: "One block of Nether, eight blocks of overworld."
	quest.708941A82D1AB8D8.title: "&cRide through the Nether"
	quest.709426BD7E90A173.quest_desc: [
		"A &6redstone&r, a &6Conductive Alloy Ingot&r and a &6gold ingot&r give two ingots."
		""
		"It goes into the &6Energized Bimetal Gear&r (alloy around an Infinity Gear), the Double-Layer Capacitor and the fast conduits."
	]
	quest.709426BD7E90A173.quest_subtitle: "Redstone, conductive, gold."
	quest.709426BD7E90A173.title: "&6Alloy Energetic Alloy"
	quest.709D024E47EC8723.quest_desc: [
		"Slay &e10 endermen&r and bring back &e16 ender pearls&r. Stand under a roof two blocks high: there they cannot reach you."
		""
		"You need pearls for eyes of ender, warp dust and warp stones, for Draconic Evolution and for the gateway portals of the next sections."
	]
	quest.709D024E47EC8723.quest_subtitle: "More endermen walk here than anywhere else."
	quest.709D024E47EC8723.title: "&5Collect Ender Pearls"
	quest.709FC144CB431019.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke, way 1:&r the &6Imbuement Chamber&r from Ars Nouveau, a &6Certus Quartz Crystal&r inside, two pedestals next to it with &6redstone dust&r and &6glowstone dust&r. &d2,000 source&r per crystal."
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke, way 2:&r the &6Energizing Orb&r from Powah, one crystal and one redstone give &etwo&r charged crystals for &d20,000 FE&r."
		""
		"On Kronwerke the Charger charges no certus, and the shortcuts of other mods are gone too. The orb needs a mana diamond from Botania here, see the chapter &cPowah&r."
		""
		"The starter kit of stage 3 holds eight charged crystals. Save them for fluix."
	]
	quest.709FC144CB431019.quest_subtitle: "First a mage, later a power plant."
	quest.709FC144CB431019.title: "&e&lCharge certus quartz"
	quest.70A9D4BB89E0A4CD.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/the_end_st_aviary.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Find the &6Aviary&r from When Dungeons Arise. It only stands in the End Highlands and Midlands."
		""
		"A large complex with many floors, enemies and chests. Go in a group and take blocks for the way back."
	]
	quest.70A9D4BB89E0A4CD.quest_subtitle: "When Dungeons Arise builds high above the islands."
	quest.70A9D4BB89E0A4CD.title: "&6Find the Aviary"
	quest.70BE991E61C1B7C7.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Andesite Alloy&r and an &6iron trapdoor&r make the &6Item Hatch&r. Put it on a vault, a chest or another storage."
		""
		"Right-click puts the item in your hand into it. Sneak and right-click puts in everything that is not in your hotbar."
		""
		"That way you can reach the vault by hand after all, at least for storing."
	]
	quest.70BE991E61C1B7C7.quest_subtitle: "The Item Hatch."
	quest.70BE991E61C1B7C7.title: "&6Empty your inventory into the vault"
	quest.70C2E8DBDC3922EF.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Mercury Shards&r, shapeless, make one &6Mercury Crystal&r."
		""
		"In the Mercury Catalyst a shard gives &e800&r flux, a crystal &e3,200&r, both at &e20&r flux per tick. The same energy, but a quarter of the space in chests and hoppers."
		""
		"For the math: one reformation costs &e100 to 200&r flux. So one crystal lasts for 16 to 32 conversions."
	]
	quest.70C2E8DBDC3922EF.quest_subtitle: "Flux in reserve."
	quest.70C2E8DBDC3922EF.title: "&bPress Mercury Crystals"
	quest.70D99C6145C42CE9.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r three Blueprint Paper and a stick. The blade needs &ethree&r material."
		""
		"Harvests plants, grass and flowers around the block you hit. Handy for the Farmer's Delight fields."
	]
	quest.70D99C6145C42CE9.quest_subtitle: "Mows a whole field."
	quest.70D99C6145C42CE9.title: "&7Build a sickle"
	quest.70E2BCE28DA35DE3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Underbean Bushes&r grow on the ground. Breaking them gives &6Underbeans&r. In a furnace they become &6Roasted Underbeans&r, which fill you up more."
		""
		"&eMore food:&r &6Droopfruit&r hangs from the glowing Droopvines on the ceiling, &6Blisterberries&r grow on bushes. Do not eat Rotten Blisterberries, they are for throwing."
	]
	quest.70E2BCE28DA35DE3.quest_subtitle: "The first food down here."
	quest.70E2BCE28DA35DE3.title: "&aPick Underbeans"
	quest.70E57BF06C45A964.quest_desc: [
		"&aTerra Blade&r, &e2 Pure Ender Essence&r, &dDragonstone&r, &dElementium Ingot&r. The blade's enchantments are lost."
		""
		"With every swing a star falls on the spot you are looking at."
	]
	quest.70E57BF06C45A964.quest_subtitle: "A sword that makes stars fall."
	quest.70E57BF06C45A964.title: "&eForge the Starcaller"
	quest.70F34E96B1AFA4DD.quest_desc: [
		"Throw a &6Charged Certus Quartz Crystal&r, an &6iron ingot&r and a &6sky stone&r into &clava&r together. Out come two &6Sky Steel Ingots&r."
		""
		"With copper instead of iron it becomes &6Sky Bronze&r for MEGA fluid cells, with osmium &6Sky Osmium&r for chemical cells. The bottleneck stays the charged certus from the Imbuement Chamber or the Energizing Orb."
	]
	quest.70F34E96B1AFA4DD.quest_subtitle: "Iron, certus and sky stone."
	quest.70F34E96B1AFA4DD.title: "&8Make Sky Steel in Lava"
	quest.70F64B61EF46DCDC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/malum_spirits.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"With the scythe: &6pigs&r and &6chickens&r for &eSacred&r, &6zombies&r for &5Wicked&r, &6skeletons&r and &6witches&r for &dArcane&r."
		""
		"You need these three first: Hex Ash, Hallowed Gold, Soulstained Steel. The other five are on the right as a checklist."
	]
	quest.70F64B61EF46DCDC.quest_subtitle: "Sacred, Wicked, Arcane."
	quest.70F64B61EF46DCDC.title: "&dHarvest Your First Arcana"
	quest.70FACC2FA8C71BAD.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &62 Manasteel Ingots&r into the portal, &61 Elementium Ingot&r comes back."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/elementium_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"You need Elementium for Elven Spreaders, the Conjuration Catalyst, elven tools, and the engineers need one ingot each for their &6Steel Core&r, the tech milestone of this stage."
	]
	quest.70FACC2FA8C71BAD.quest_subtitle: "Two Manasteel in, one Elementium out."
	quest.70FACC2FA8C71BAD.title: "&d&lTrade Manasteel for Elementium"
	quest.71081EF09BA538FD.quest_desc: [
		"&eStufe 1:&r nichts. Es gibt noch kein Gas zu bewegen."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r &6Mekanism-Druckrohre&r (750 mB/t) für die kurzen Wege in der Fabrik, &6Pipez-Gasrohre&r, wenn Gas über eine Strecke oder zwischen Mods soll. PneumaticCraft bewegt mit seinen Druckrohren nur seine eigene Druckluft."
		""
		"&eStufe 3:&r &6Fortgeschrittene Druckrohre&r (2 000 mB/t) und &6Chemikalienzellen&r von Applied Mekanistics im AE2-Netz. Stufe 4 bringt die Elite- und Ultimativ-Rohre und den Quantenverschränker, der Gas ohne Rohr verschickt."
	]
	quest.71081EF09BA538FD.quest_subtitle: "Alles Gas ist Mekanism, bis auf die Luft."
	quest.71081EF09BA538FD.title: "&a&lWas wann: Gase"
	quest.711AF6780B31B937.quest_desc: [
		"Kauf eine &6Banane&r (Generation 3, 4 Smaragde): &e3 Bananen&r pro Blatt mit je 4 Hunger, aber die Blätter reifen langsam (Tempo 0,2). Die Rote Banane (3) ist eine Verwandte mit 4 Hunger. Kochbanane (2), Kokosnuss, Mango, Papaya, Brotfrucht, Jackfrucht, Cempedak, Copoazu, Stachelannone, Hala-Frucht und Baobabfrucht geben &e5 Hunger&r."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/fruit/banana.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&eKokospalme:&r Reife Kokosnüsse fallen von selbst herunter und schlagen hart auf, stell dich nicht darunter. Der Kokosspross am Boden ist die Frucht, abbauen und aufheben."
		"&eKakao:&r Der Baum wächst mit Vanilla-&6Kakaoschoten&r am Stamm, die Bohnen kommen also wie im Dschungel."
		""
		"Dattelpalme, Acai-Palme, Salak und Pandanus (Hala-Frucht) runden die Tropen ab. Alle Palmen und Bananen haben zusammenhängende Kronen, abgetrennte Blätter zerfallen."
	]
	quest.711AF6780B31B937.quest_subtitle: "Bananen, Mango, Kokos und Kakao, die großen Früchte."
	quest.711AF6780B31B937.title: "&aPflanz eine Banane"
	quest.71234B86620B9460.quest_desc: [
		"Im Reiter &eHome&r stellst du die &ePriorität&r von &d-9999&r bis &d9999&r. Punkte mit hoher Zahl werden zuerst versorgt, Stecker mit hoher Zahl zuerst abgeschöpft. Reicht der Strom nicht, bleiben die niedrigen leer."
		""
		"Beispiel: Erzstraße auf 10, Beleuchtung und Deko auf 0, der Punkt am Energiewürfel auf -10. Dann wird gespeichert, was übrig ist, und die Straße stottert nie."
	]
	quest.71234B86620B9460.quest_subtitle: "Wer zuerst Strom bekommt."
	quest.71234B86620B9460.title: "&ePrioritäten setzen"
	quest.71272D050AFF0EA7.quest_desc: [
		"&aArchwood Overgrowth&r (archwood log, Overgrowth tablet, 4 essences Earth, Water, Fire, Air): places archwood trees and fertilises."
		"&aConjure Island: Archwood Forest&r (archwood log, Abjuration and Conjuration Essence): a round island with radius 7."
		"&aPollination&r (Flourishing log, 2 honeycombs, 2 flowers, Earth Essence): bees collect nectar faster."
	]
	quest.71272D050AFF0EA7.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: forest, island and bees."
	quest.71272D050AFF0EA7.title: "&aMake the archwood rituals"
	quest.713D079E79D84314.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6iron plates&r and four &6buckets&r make the &6Jerrycan&r. It holds &e10 buckets&r."
		""
		"Fill it at a barrel or tank, it does not scoop from the world. Jerrycan and drill put into the crafting table together refill the drill without a trip to the Refinery."
	]
	quest.713D079E79D84314.quest_subtitle: "Ten buckets of fuel to take along."
	quest.713D079E79D84314.title: "&9Pack a Jerrycan"
	quest.7143E694F34F4B20.quest_desc: [
		"&6Elite Tier Installer:&r Reinforced Alloy in the corners, Elite Control Circuits at the top and bottom, gold left and right, a plank. Right click an Advanced Factory."
		""
		"An Elite Factory works on &eseven&r items. That also works for MoreMachine's factories."
	]
	quest.7143E694F34F4B20.quest_subtitle: "Seven slots."
	quest.7143E694F34F4B20.title: "&aUpgrade a Factory to Elite"
	quest.7145901D24453A3E.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Dark Blood Bricks&r around a &6Blood Infusion Core&r give the &6Spirit Furnace&r. Place it anywhere in the wall of the brick box. If the build is right, the box glows red."
		""
		"Put a full &6Box of Eternal Closure&r into the box slot and fill the tank with blood (10 buckets). The furnace revives the spirit inside and cooks it right away: &e25 mB per tick&r, 10 ticks per health point. A zombie takes 10 seconds and costs 5 buckets, the drops land in the furnace's inventory. The box stays full and never empties."
		""
		"Big mobs need a bigger box, up to 9 by 9. A villager gives an emerald with 20 percent. Hoppers or pipes take the drops out of any side."
	]
	quest.7145901D24453A3E.quest_subtitle: "Revive spirits and cook them right away."
	quest.7145901D24453A3E.title: "&4&lBuild the Spirit Furnace"
	quest.7145CCA78C92AFDA.quest_desc: [
		"A &6jukebox&r on top, &6two iron ingots&r next to the upgrade base, a &6redstone&r at the bottom."
		""
		"Put a record into the tab and your backpack plays it wherever you go."
	]
	quest.7145CCA78C92AFDA.quest_subtitle: "The Jukebox Upgrade."
	quest.7145CCA78C92AFDA.title: "Listen to music on the road"
	quest.714DDB6D632143C6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wood&r: 27 slots, 1 upgrade. &6Copper&r: 45, 1. &6Iron&r: 54, 2. All three in stage 1."
		"&6Gold&r: 81, 3, stage 2. &6Diamond&r: 108, 4, stage 3. &6Netherite&r: 132, 5, stage 4."
		"&6Stack upgrades for chests&r: I twofold and I Plus threefold from stage 1, II fourfold from stage 2, III eightfold from stage 3, IV sixteenfold from stage 4, V thirty-twofold from stage 5."
		"Backpacks: leather 27 and 1, copper 45 and 1, iron 54 and 2 (stage 2), gold 81 and 3, diamond 108 and 5 (stage 3), netherite 120 and 7 (stage 4)."
	]
	quest.714DDB6D632143C6.quest_subtitle: "Slots and upgrade slots at a glance."
	quest.714DDB6D632143C6.title: "Know every chest tier"
	quest.715475249E441A96.quest_desc: [
		"&6Draconium Ingots&r in the corners, &6netherite scrap&r at the top and bottom, &6glowstone dust&r left and right, a &6Module Core&r in the middle."
		""
		"Put it into the chestpiece. Five small ones make a large one through a recipe with Draconium Cores, and a large one can be split back into five."
	]
	quest.715475249E441A96.quest_subtitle: "A bigger shield."
	quest.715475249E441A96.title: "&dBuild a Wyvern Shield Module"
	quest.716E660668E868DB.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &61 Pixie Dust&r and &64 Elementium Ingots&r make the &6Great Fairy Ring&r. Put it in an accessory slot."
		""
		"It raises the chance that a fairy appears when you are hit, even without Elementium armor. Strongest together with the armor."
	]
	quest.716E660668E868DB.quest_subtitle: "More fairies with every hit."
	quest.716E660668E868DB.title: "&dPut On the Great Fairy Ring"
	quest.7180B9E2F0DEBA48.quest_desc: [
		"&6Storage I/O:&r stone in the corners, planks top and bottom, a repeater on the left, a gold ingot on the right, a barrel of the wood tier in the middle. &6Input&r and &6Output&r are the same with repeater and gold at the top and bottom."
		""
		"Placed into the network at the Storage Controller, the I/O takes items from pipes and hands them out. Input only in, Output only out; both are easy on the server."
	]
	quest.7180B9E2F0DEBA48.quest_subtitle: "Storage Input, Output and I/O."
	quest.7180B9E2F0DEBA48.title: "Hook pipes up to the network"
	quest.719DC7EB567A6482.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wooden slab&r, &6Andesite Casing&r and &6Shaft&r stacked make the &6Mechanical Bearing&r. Right-click turns the blocks in front of it into a &econtraption&r that rotates."
		""
		"Drills, saws and harvesters on it work while it moves. A contraption takes up to &e2,048 blocks&r along. Another right-click sets it down."
	]
	quest.719DC7EB567A6482.quest_subtitle: "The Mechanical Bearing makes blocks move."
	quest.719DC7EB567A6482.title: "&6Turn a structure"
	quest.71A03A654E31E03F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r das &6Kochbuch I&r in die Mitte, eine &6Werkbank&r links und rechts, ein &6Diamant&r oben und unten. Das ist &6Cooking for Blockheads II&r."
		""
		"{image:cookingforblockheads:textures/item/crafting_book.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Band II zeigt nicht nur, er craftet: Klick ein Gericht an, und es wird aus deinem Inventar gemacht, Shift-Klick macht einen ganzen Stapel. Für alles, was an der Werkbank entsteht, brauchst du damit keine Werkbank mehr."
	]
	quest.71A03A654E31E03F.quest_subtitle: "Band II craftet aus deinem Inventar."
	quest.71A03A654E31E03F.title: "&6Mach das Kochbuch zum Werkzeug"
	quest.71A8C46488896708.quest_desc: [
		"The upgrade base in the middle, &6eight glass&r around it."
		""
		"A tank in the backpack that you fill and empty with buckets. Together with the &6Pump Upgrade&r (glass, bucket, piston, sticky piston) it sucks up fluid or places it."
	]
	quest.71A8C46488896708.quest_subtitle: "The Tank Upgrade."
	quest.71A8C46488896708.title: "Carry fluid in the backpack"
	quest.71B1B80464BB336C.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r Processor Binding, a &6Silicon&r, a &6redstone&r and a metal, shapeless, make a raw processor. &6Iron ingot&r for the Basic Processor, &6gold ingot&r for the Improved, &6diamond&r for the Advanced. Then bake the raw processor in a furnace."
		""
		"Unlike AE2 there is no inscriber and no presses. A furnace is enough, and the blast furnace is twice as fast."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r Basic Processors for cores and 4k Storage Parts. Improved for the Grid, Importer, Exporter and 16k parts. Advanced for the Autocrafter and everything wireless, the Controller and Disk Drive take an Advanced Control Circuit on Kronwerke. A dozen of each kind is a good stock."
	]
	quest.71B1B80464BB336C.quest_subtitle: "Binding, metal, silicon, redstone, then into the furnace."
	quest.71B1B80464BB336C.title: "&b&lBake the Processors"
	quest.71B5C3CA4158995A.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r eine &6Generalisierte Vorhersage&r oben, &6Papier&r, &6Vorhersagematrix&r, Papier in der Mitte, Papier unten."
		""
		"Die &6Fabrication Directive&r speichert, welcher Drop für welches Modell gewählt ist. &eRechtsklick&r auf einen Fabrikator kopiert seine Auswahl, &eShift-Rechtsklick&r auf einen anderen überträgt sie. Für zehn Fabrikatoren oder das Rechenzentrum sparst du dir damit das Durchklicken."
	]
	quest.71B5C3CA4158995A.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 4. Einstellungen zum Mitnehmen."
	quest.71B5C3CA4158995A.title: "&6Die Fabrikationsanweisung"
	quest.71B708DC9C836285.quest_desc: [
		"Like the Volcanic one, but &6mushroom stew&r in the middle."
		""
		"It eats food nearby or on pedestals next to it; nourishing food gives more, Sourceberry food much more. It turns the ground in the 3x3 below it into mycelium and grows mushrooms."
	]
	quest.71B708DC9C836285.quest_subtitle: "Food becomes Source."
	quest.71B708DC9C836285.title: "&aBuild a Mycelial Sourcelink"
	quest.71BA402B36393E94.quest_desc: [
		"Break a wild &6tomato bush&r. You get tomatoes and &6tomato seeds&r."
		""
		"Tomatoes climb up rope and bear fruit along their whole height. You need them for sauce, salad and burgers."
	]
	quest.71BA402B36393E94.quest_subtitle: "Where it is warm."
	quest.71BA402B36393E94.title: "&aPick wild tomatoes"
	quest.71D96A8373AEA635.quest_desc: [
		"Scrolls, common ink and the first spellcaster. A second magic next to Ars Nouveau that already gets going in stage 1."
	]
	quest.71D96A8373AEA635.quest_subtitle: "Scrolls, ink, the first spells."
	quest.71D96A8373AEA635.title: "&dOpen Iron's Spells"
	quest.71DAFB58443656B6.quest_desc: [
		"At the top &6plank, stone, plank&r, middle three &6gold ingots&r, at the bottom &6stone, copper, stone&r. On a brazier."
		""
		"On its own it does nothing. It needs the three vessels right next to it, next quest."
	]
	quest.71DAFB58443656B6.quest_subtitle: "Where the three principles become one again."
	quest.71DAFB58443656B6.title: "&6Build an Incubator"
	quest.71E39CB411FE5E3A.quest_desc: [
		"An &6iron ingot&r and a &6gold ingot&r become two &6Energized Steel&r for &e10,000 FE&r."
		""
		"{image:powah:textures/item/steel_energized.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The material of the &8Hardened&r tier: capacitors, cables, cells, generators. Make yourself a stack."
	]
	quest.71E39CB411FE5E3A.quest_subtitle: "Iron and gold, charged."
	quest.71E39CB411FE5E3A.title: "&7Charge Energized Steel"
	quest.71E84A6ECC039752.quest_desc: [
		"&eSo geht es:&r Leg im Nether-Tunnel eine Bahn aus &6Blaueis&r, links und rechts eine Kante, und fahr mit einem &6Boot&r darauf. Neun &6Packeis&r ergeben ein Blaueis, neun Eis ein Packeis. Eis findest du in gefrorenen Ozeanen und Eisbergen."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r Auf Blaueis fährt ein Boot über 70 Blöcke pro Sekunde, und im Nether zählt jeder Block acht. Zusammen mit dem Nether-Tunnel bist du in Sekunden am anderen Ende der Welt."
	]
	quest.71E84A6ECC039752.quest_subtitle: "Ein Boot auf Blaueis ist das schnellste ohne Portal. Stufe 2."
	quest.71E84A6ECC039752.title: "&bBau eine Eisbahn im Nether"
	quest.71F54037FD20BAE2.quest_desc: [
		"&eItem Cargo Condition&r: the train waits until its cargo reaches or falls below an amount of an item."
	]
	quest.71F54037FD20BAE2.quest_subtitle: "Full first, then off."
	quest.71F54037FD20BAE2.title: "&7Item Cargo Condition"
	quest.71FBBD10C8CECAFA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Nether quartz&r and &68 redstone&r make &6Rose Quartz&r. You polish it with &6Sandpaper&r, and polished on an &6iron sheet&r it becomes an &6Electron Tube&r."
		""
		"Electron tubes go into everything that processes signals in Create: Mechanical Arm, Smart Chute, Display Link. On Kronwerke also into the first Mekanism circuit and AE2's smart cables."
	]
	quest.71FBBD10C8CECAFA.quest_subtitle: "Quartz with redstone, polished, on an iron sheet."
	quest.71FBBD10C8CECAFA.title: "&dMake electron tubes"
	quest.7201DEE5406460F3.quest_desc: [
		"Right click a placed &6ME P2P Tunnel&r with a &6torch&r or &6glowstone&r, and it turns into this type. Breaking it gives you the tunnel as an item of its own."
	]
	quest.7201DEE5406460F3.quest_subtitle: "Light from here to there."
	quest.7201DEE5406460F3.title: "Build a light tunnel"
	quest.72173DD90F34093A.quest_desc: [
		"Bronze nuggets in the corners, tin on the sides, an HDPE Sheet in the middle, gives two."
		""
		"Every module is a Module Base plus alloys and the part it imitates: a jetpack, a Geiger counter, a pickaxe."
	]
	quest.72173DD90F34093A.quest_subtitle: "The blank of every module."
	quest.72173DD90F34093A.title: "&bBuild Module Bases"
	quest.722120E86A09BE76.quest_desc: [
		"In the Crystal Assembler: an import bus (or export bus), three Acceleration Cards, two pistons and an Annihilation Core (a Formation Core for export)."
		""
		"The &6ME Extended Import Bus&r and &6Export Bus&r move &d8 times&r as much as the normal ones and have more card slots. Just right for the quarry that dumps into your network."
	]
	quest.722120E86A09BE76.quest_subtitle: "Eight times as fast."
	quest.722120E86A09BE76.title: "&3Build Extended Buses"
	quest.7226ED25CB0B4B4C.quest_desc: [
		"The &dEnd&r opens with an event; the Ender Dragon is the first boss the server fights together."
		""
		"After that fusion, Draconic Evolution, the Gaia Guardian and Mahou Tsukai."
	]
	quest.7226ED25CB0B4B4C.quest_subtitle: "The End, the stars, the dragon."
	quest.7226ED25CB0B4B4C.title: "&dStage 4: Star Works"
	quest.7228D87AF0D862F2.quest_desc: [
		"A &6diamond&r in the pool becomes a &bMana Diamond&r for &d10,000 mana&r. A block of diamond becomes a Block of Mana Diamond for 90,000 mana."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Two go into every &6Source Keystone&r, the magic milestone of stage 1. In stage 2 the Manasteel ritual needs it, every Terrasteel craft, and every sin rune needs two."
		""
		"&cThink ahead:&r Stage 2 wants 50 Terrasteel and 8 rune cores, that is about 60 Mana Diamonds. Save your diamonds."
	]
	quest.7228D87AF0D862F2.quest_subtitle: "10,000 mana in one stone."
	quest.7228D87AF0D862F2.title: "&bInfuse a Mana Diamond"
	quest.7229F11F3730A0E7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Dripping Upgrade:&r stone all around, a &6pointed dripstone&r on top, a &6cauldron&r in the middle, a &6lava bucket&r at the bottom. Four Dripping Upgrades and one Water Generator Upgrade make the &6Obsidian Generator Upgrade&r, shapeless."
		""
		"As with water, the drawer fills on its own. You need obsidian for the backpack Void Upgrade and the drawer Void Upgrade."
	]
	quest.7229F11F3730A0E7.quest_subtitle: "Dripping and Obsidian Generator Upgrade."
	quest.7229F11F3730A0E7.title: "Let lava drip"
	quest.72396E79EA7EAE1E.quest_desc: [
		"&6Steel Plates&r in the shape of iron armour make the &6Steel Helmet&r, &6Steel Chestplate&r, &6Steel Leggings&r and &6Steel Boots&r. For all four you need &e24 plates&r."
		""
		"It takes more than iron and only costs you steel from the blast furnace. Good for the time before you get to diamonds or better armour."
	]
	quest.72396E79EA7EAE1E.quest_subtitle: "Four pieces from 24 Steel Plates."
	quest.72396E79EA7EAE1E.title: "&7Forge steel armour"
	quest.723B99B6B09C28EE.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 Livingwood Twigs&r and &e3 Mana Infused String&r."
		""
		"Lasts longer than a normal bow and repairs itself with mana as soon as you carry a Mana Tablet from stage 2."
	]
	quest.723B99B6B09C28EE.quest_subtitle: "A bow made of living wood."
	quest.723B99B6B09C28EE.title: "&6String a Livingwood Bow"
	quest.723F3B7A023BACD9.quest_desc: [
		"You have a secured base, iron, and you have already delivered something to the obelisk. That is more than most people have after their first evening."
		""
		"From here on there is no fixed path. Further down, this chapter explains the obelisk and the stages in detail; on the right under &eYour Paths&r you find every chapter of stage 1."
	]
	quest.723F3B7A023BACD9.quest_subtitle: "Base, iron and your first delivery."
	quest.723F3B7A023BACD9.title: "&6Get through the first day"
	quest.7242970D694B0A03.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Ferricore Ingot&r bottom left, a &6paper&r in the middle, a &6Primal Coal&r top right."
		""
		"Sneak right clicking a machine copies its settings: redstone mode, speed, filter, direction. Right clicking the next one pastes them. A click into the air chooses which settings come along. With a goo line on six sides that saves you a lot of clicking."
	]
	quest.7242970D694B0A03.quest_subtitle: "Set it once, paste it everywhere."
	quest.7242970D694B0A03.title: "&7Copy Machine Settings"
	quest.724DE8D2EAF33DAA.quest_desc: [
		"Stufe 4 bringt Powah Nitro, Mekanism Elite und Ultimativ mit der Fusion, NuclearCraft, Draconic Evolution und die großen Generatoren von Mekanism More Machine."
		""
		"&e1. Nitro-Reaktor von Powah:&r &d500 000 FE/t&r aus Uraninit. Nitro-Kristalle brauchen einen Netherstern und 20 Millionen FE je Kristall in der Kugel, danach läuft er wie der kleine."
		"&e2. RTGs von NuclearCraft:&r kein Brennstoff, keine Kühlung, nie aus. Uran 112, Plutonium 1 792, Californium &d4 096 FE/t&r, Block für Block."
		"&e3. Fusionsreaktor von Mekanism:&r D-T-Treibstoff aus Wasser, gezündet mit dem Laser, läuft dann für Tage. Das Kraftwerk für die Antimaterie in Stufe 5."
		""
		"Speicher: der &6Draconic-Energiekern&r fasst ab 45,5 Millionen FE und wächst in sieben Stufen bis 2,14 Billionen."
	]
	quest.724DE8D2EAF33DAA.quest_subtitle: "Das End ist offen, die Maschinen fressen Strom."
	quest.724DE8D2EAF33DAA.title: "&e&lStufe 4: Welche Quelle wann"
	quest.7251BA17B7A78C2E.quest_desc: [
		"The way home always leads through the &6portal at the arrival square&r, or through any Mine Portal you build over there yourself. You come out in front of the portal you went through."
		""
		"A &6Waystone&r in the farm world only connects places in the farm world and is gone at the next reset. Your waystones at home stay yours."
	]
	quest.7251BA17B7A78C2E.quest_subtitle: "The portal at the arrival square takes you to yours."
	quest.7251BA17B7A78C2E.title: "&6Find the way home"
	quest.72552248B9D40CAB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/draconic_dust.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Dig for &5Ender Draconium Ore&r in the End, in end stone between height 0 and 70, in veins of up to eight blocks. Bring a pickaxe with &6Fortune III&r."
		""
		"{image:draconicevolution:textures/item/components/draconium_dust.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"One ore gives 2 to 4 &5draconium dust&r, about 4.5 on average with Fortune III. With Silk Touch you only get the ore, and that gives a single ingot in the furnace."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The ores in the Overworld and the Nether are switched off. Awakened and Chaos are in the chapter &5Draconic: Awakened and Chaos&r and come in stage 5."
	]
	quest.72552248B9D40CAB.quest_subtitle: "The purple ore only exists in the End."
	quest.72552248B9D40CAB.title: "&5&lMine Draconium in the End"
	quest.7263779BF31C5F58.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6sand&r, two &6clay balls&r, two &6gravel&r and a &6water bucket&r make &e8 concrete&r. The Mixer makes &6Liquid Concrete&r: poured out it flows like water and sets after a while. Whoever stands in it then is stuck."
		""
		"A concrete and a &6lead plate&r, shapeless, make &6Leaded Concrete&r. Neither endermen nor ender pearls nor chorus fruit teleport through it."
		""
		"The Radio Tower needs &e90 concrete&r, the Resonanz Observer 9. The stonecutter turns concrete into bricks, tiles and slabs."
	]
	quest.7263779BF31C5F58.quest_subtitle: "Hard, cheap and blast resistant."
	quest.7263779BF31C5F58.title: "&9Pour Concrete"
	quest.726485A25C208EA9.quest_desc: [
		"&e4 Manasteel ingots&r around a block of &eglass&r. Right click fits it into a spreader. On its own it only colours the burst; it is the base of all special lenses."
		""
		"&eVelocity&r, &ePotency&r (double mana per burst), &eResistance&r and &eEfficiency&r (less loss), &eMessenger&r and many more. A slimeball joins two lenses. All recipes in EMI."
	]
	quest.726485A25C208EA9.quest_subtitle: "Turn a mana burst into a tool."
	quest.726485A25C208EA9.title: "&6Grind a Mana Lens"
	quest.726B86F8F6415630.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Gargantuan Flux Storage&r ist die größte Flux-Zelle, gebaut aus dem Herculean-Speicher und Fluxblöcken. Er hängt direkt im Netz, ohne Plug und Point."
		""
		"&eFlux Networks, Gargantuan:&r &d128 Millionen FE&r, &d720 000 FE/t&r rein und raus, drahtlos über das Netz. Für den Draconic-Energiekern zu klein, als Puffer zwischen Reaktor und Fabrik genau richtig. Offen ab Stufe 5."
	]
	quest.726B86F8F6415630.quest_subtitle: "Flux Networks, 128 Millionen FE, 720 000 FE/t."
	quest.726B86F8F6415630.title: "&dStell den Gargantuan Flux Storage"
	quest.7274747BA1993556.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hexerei_herbs.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the &2swamp&r &6Mandrake&r, &6Belladonna&r, &6Mugwort&r and &6Yellow Dock&r grow wild. Break one plant of each and take it along."
		""
		"{image:hexerei:textures/item/mandrake_root.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Plant them in a herb garden in front of your hut. Fully grown you harvest them with a right click like sweet berries, then they grow back. The four quests on the right are the checklist: what each plant gives and what for."
	]
	quest.7274747BA1993556.quest_subtitle: "Mandrake, belladonna, mugwort, yellow dock."
	quest.7274747BA1993556.title: "&2Dig up the four witch herbs"
	quest.727B589420F29226.quest_desc: [
		"Worktable: three &6Pewter&r and two sticks, extra &5Unholy Symbol&r, two &6Tattered Cloth&r and a &6Soul Shard&r."
		""
		"&5Wraiths&r drop Tattered Cloth. Their claws give Chilled, then you do not heal. Whatever undead the scythe kills leaves Soul Shards behind."
	]
	quest.727B589420F29226.quest_subtitle: "Harvest souls without a ritual."
	quest.727B589420F29226.title: "&5Forge the Reaper Scythe"
	quest.727B7DEB1A173563.quest_desc: [
		"&eSo geht es:&r Ein wildes &6Pferd&r so oft besteigen, bis es Herzen zeigt, dann einen &6Sattel&r auflegen. Sättel gibt es nicht an der Werkbank, sie liegen in Truhen von Verliesen, Tempeln und Dörfern."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r Ein gutes Pferd ist schneller als du zu Fuß, springt über Zäune und kostet weder Level noch Strom. &6Pferdefutter&r aus Farmer's Delight hilft ihm, siehe Kapitel &6Essen und Landwirtschaft&r."
	]
	quest.727B7DEB1A173563.quest_subtitle: "Der älteste Weg, schnell über Land zu kommen."
	quest.727B7DEB1A173563.title: "&6Sattel ein Pferd"
	quest.7284AF029EEF7817.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/immersive_heavy_refinery.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e16 Iron Sheetmetal, 2 Light and 2 Heavy Engineering Blocks, 1 Redstone Engineering Block, 8 Steel Scaffolding, 5 fluid pipes&r. Hammer on the Heavy block in the middle layer."
		""
		"&eIn:&r one fluid on each side, &6Nitrate Dust&r as a catalyst by hand (not used up). &eOut:&r at the orange port at the front. 8 mB of oil and 8 mB of Ethanol give &e16 mB of Biodiesel&r."
		""
		"Nitrate Dust drops at 50 percent when the Crusher grinds sandstone."
	]
	quest.7284AF029EEF7817.quest_subtitle: "5x3x3, Plant Oil and Ethanol in, Biodiesel out."
	quest.7284AF029EEF7817.title: "&6&lForm a Refinery"
	quest.7287772E5712B0C0.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r A &6Basic Processor&r and a &6glowstone dust&r, shapeless, make a &6Construction Core&r. A Basic Processor and a &6Nether quartz&r make a &6Destruction Core&r."
		""
		"The Construction Core goes into everything that gives out of the network (Exporter, Constructor), the Destruction Core into everything that pulls in (Importer, Destructor). The Grid wants both, the Autocrafter on Kronwerke only the Destruction Core."
	]
	quest.7287772E5712B0C0.quest_subtitle: "Glowstone builds, quartz destroys."
	quest.7287772E5712B0C0.title: "&eMake the Two Cores"
	quest.7290070AC6443383.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wireless Router:&r &6ender pearls&r in the four corners, a &6comparator&r at the top, &6redstone&r left, right and bottom centre, a &6Machine Frame&r in the centre. Plus an &6Antenna Base&r (iron ingots and an iron block) and an &6Antenna&r (iron bars and iron ingots)."
		""
		"The Wireless Router passes published channels on to other Wireless Routers without a cable. With the antenna it reaches &e100 blocks&r, with the &6Antenna Dish&r (iron trapdoors, ender pearl, iron) &e500&r. Every channel costs 20 or 50 RF per tick."
		""
		"That is how you link a team mate's base without a single cable across the landscape."
	]
	quest.7290070AC6443383.quest_subtitle: "Wireless Router and antenna."
	quest.7290070AC6443383.title: "&eRadio between controllers"
	quest.72912139724F013E.quest_desc: [
		"A &6painting&r and a &6crafting table&r make the &6Crafting Blueprint&r. Hang it on a wall like a painting; every field on it is its own recipe."
		""
		"Right-click an empty field to open a grid where you set the recipe. Right-click a filled field to craft it from the ingredients in your inventory, sneaking for up to a whole stack."
		""
		"&6Tip:&r Next to the crafting table for shafts, cogwheels and casings it saves a lot of clicking."
	]
	quest.72912139724F013E.quest_subtitle: "Recipes on the wall, one click per stack."
	quest.72912139724F013E.title: "&6Hang up a Crafting Blueprint"
	quest.729F1279CD6A9918.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/silent_gear_alloy_forge.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Top &6Crimson Steel, blackstone, Crimson Steel&r. Middle two &6Crimson Steel&r. Bottom &6blackstone&r, a Create &6brass casing&r, &6blackstone&r."
		""
		"It makes Crimson Steel, Blaze Gold, Azure Electrum and Tyrian Steel. Plus &6High-Carbon Steel&r: one iron and three coal, 420 durability and +4 damage."
	]
	quest.729F1279CD6A9918.quest_subtitle: "Alloys without the grid, more per ore."
	quest.729F1279CD6A9918.title: "&6Build the Alloy Forge"
	quest.72A517404466EBAB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Modular Routers&r, &6Router&r: ein Puffer von einem Stapel, neun Module (Ziehen, Senden bis 24 Blöcke durch Wände, Saugen, Vernichten, Abbauen, Setzen), alle 20 Ticks ein Durchlauf, mit Upgrades alle 2 Ticks und 64 Stück. Neun Filterplätze je Modul, der Massenfilter 54. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Vier Andesitlegierungen, vier Eisengitter und ein Leeres Modul ergeben vier Router. Siehe Kapitel Rohre und Router, dort steht auch die Sortieranlage."
	]
	quest.72A517404466EBAB.quest_subtitle: "Modular Routers, Router: ein Block, neun Module, jeder Takt ein Stapel."
	quest.72A517404466EBAB.title: "Lies: Modular Routers"
	quest.72A545400BC9E18B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r two &6sticks&r diagonally from bottom left, two &6flint&r on top and right, like a small pair of pliers. A &6Wrench&r."
		""
		"Hold &esneak&r and click the pipe end at a chest with the wrench. Every click switches the connection on: &econnected&r, &eextracting&r (the end gets marked), &edisconnected&r, and back to the start."
		""
		"Disconnected ends are handy when two pipe lines run close together or a pipe should pass a chest without reaching into it."
	]
	quest.72A545400BC9E18B.quest_subtitle: "Without it no pipe extracts."
	quest.72A545400BC9E18B.title: "&7Make a Wrench"
	quest.72A7A5C8817A1244.quest_desc: [
		"Alles mit FE-Speicher füllt sich am Körper von selbst: Mekanisms &6Energietablett&r, &6Atomzerleger&r und &6Freiläufer&r, die &6Drahtlose Konsole&r von AE2 im Schnellzugriff, Oritechs &6Jetpack&r auf dem Rücken."
		""
		"Nicht geladen wird, was keinen Strom nimmt: Der Mekanism-Jetpack fliegt mit Wasserstoff, Create-Rückentanks mit Druckluft. Die bleiben an ihrer Füllstation."
		""
		"Ein Energietablett im Schnellzugriff ist der einfachste Test: Wenn seine Anzeige steigt, läuft das Laden."
	]
	quest.72A7A5C8817A1244.quest_subtitle: "Nie wieder an die Ladestation."
	quest.72A7A5C8817A1244.title: "&dTrag Werkzeug, das sich selbst lädt"
	quest.72ABD48D90A74784.quest_desc: [
		"Like the glass rod, with an &6amethyst shard&r in the middle and a &6gold nugget&r at the top right."
		""
		"Finds gold too. The diamond tier needs quartz and diamond, the best one, the blaze rod, netherite scrap. Rods built with Sulfur are fixed to one ore group."
	]
	quest.72ABD48D90A74784.quest_subtitle: "For rarer ores."
	quest.72ABD48D90A74784.title: "&7Build an Amethyst Divination Rod"
	quest.72AC572B1AB63138.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Terrasteel Ingot&r in the middle, &a4 Gaia Spirits&r at the top, bottom, left and right. Out comes a &aGaia Spirit Ingot&r."
		""
		"The stage 5 goal is called &5The Chaos Guardian&r. It opens no further stage, it wants the things that make the final fight possible:"
		"&6Tech:&r &e64 Awakened Draconium Blocks&r (fixed) and &e100 antimatter pellets&r."
		"&dMagic:&r &e128 Gaia Spirit Ingots&r and &e64 Wilden Tributes&r (fixed)."
		""
		"The Gaia Spirit Ingot is the link: the mages hand it in, the techs need it for every fusion of Awakened Draconium."
	]
	quest.72AC572B1AB63138.quest_subtitle: "The ingot both pillars need."
	quest.72AC572B1AB63138.title: "&5&lForge a Gaia Spirit Ingot"
	quest.72BA1962B9592168.quest_desc: [
		"A &6soul sand&r or &6soul soil&r and a &6gold ingot&r give one &6Soularium Ingot&r in the smelter."
		""
		"The metal of the soul machines: vial, Soul Chain, Ensouled Chassis, Slice'N'Splice. One trip to the Soul Sand Valley lasts a long time."
	]
	quest.72BA1962B9592168.quest_subtitle: "Gold, soaked in soul sand."
	quest.72BA1962B9592168.title: "&6Alloy Soularium"
	quest.72C01A75F410D949.quest_desc: [
		"Jedes Flux-Gerät hat im Reiter &eHome&r den Schalter &eChunk laden&r. Er hält den Chunk des Geräts geladen, solange das Gerät im Netz steht. Auf Kronwerke ist das erlaubt."
		""
		"Das brauchst du am Stecker beim Kraftwerk, sonst steht der Reaktor still, sobald du außer Sicht bist, und die Punkte zu Hause bekommen nichts. Ein Gerät in einem entladenen Chunk zeigt in der Verbindungsliste &eChunk entladen&r."
		""
		"Jeder geladene Chunk kostet den Server. Lade nur den Stecker am Generator und die Fabrikhalle, nicht jeden Punkt einzeln."
	]
	quest.72C01A75F410D949.quest_subtitle: "Der Reaktor läuft, auch wenn keiner da ist."
	quest.72C01A75F410D949.title: "&aHalte Chunks geladen"
	quest.72D0268976563994.quest_desc: [
		"&6Hydraulic Propulsion Unit:&r from &6Free Runners&r, Reinforced Alloy, Energy Tablets, Module Base and polonium. You step up higher blocks without jumping and jump higher yourself."
		""
		"&6Locomotive Boosting Unit:&r top Reinforced Alloy, &6diamond leggings&r, Reinforced Alloy, middle Energy Tablet, Module Base, Energy Tablet, bottom three Polonium Pellets. It makes you faster when sprinting and lets you jump farther."
		""
		"In the Modification Station you set how strongly each module works. Full strength costs more power."
	]
	quest.72D0268976563994.quest_subtitle: "Jump higher, run faster."
	quest.72D0268976563994.title: "&bBuild Leg and Boot Modules"
	quest.72D324DF4C07084C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Nebulous Heart&r, gold nugget, &6Slime Pearl&r and &6Bat Wing&r shapeless in the crafting table give the &6Coin of Fortune&r. Shift right click turns it on."
		""
		"Active, it pulls all items and experience orbs within &e5 blocks&r to you. If you hold right click, it sucks from &e15 blocks&r away. For mob farms, harvest fields and clearing out creeper holes."
	]
	quest.72D324DF4C07084C.quest_subtitle: "Items and experience come by themselves."
	quest.72D324DF4C07084C.title: "&eBuild a Coin of Fortune"
	quest.72DA0FE948C39C39.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mechanical Saw&r: &d4 SU per RPM&r. 128 SU at 32 RPM."
	]
	quest.72DA0FE948C39C39.quest_subtitle: "Also on a contraption."
	quest.72DA0FE948C39C39.title: "&7Saw: 4 SU per RPM"
	quest.72DBEA3925CDE2AE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Blue Aerclouds&r sind blassblau und seltener als die kalten. Wer darauf tritt, wird hoch in die Luft geschleudert. So kommst du auf Inseln, die über dir hängen."
		""
		"Du kannst sie auch herstellen: Eine &6Cold Aercloud&r wird im &6Freezer&r in 20 Sekunden zur Blue Aercloud. &6Blue Swets&r lassen manchmal eine fallen."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Eine Blue Aercloud unten, eine Cold Aercloud oben als Landeplatz, fertig ist der Aufzug ohne Strom."
	]
	quest.72DBEA3925CDE2AE.quest_subtitle: "Die Wolke, die dich in die Luft schleudert."
	quest.72DBEA3925CDE2AE.title: "&9Spring auf eine Blue Aercloud"
	quest.72DC15024652AB79.quest_desc: [
		"&e1 Mana Tablet&r and &e4 Manasteel ingots&r. Works like the tablet but sits in the ring slot instead of the inventory."
		""
		"With a Terrasteel ingot it becomes the Greater Band of Mana with about four times the space. All other jewellery of this stage is in the &eJewellery&r section below."
	]
	quest.72DC15024652AB79.quest_subtitle: "The tablet as a ring."
	quest.72DC15024652AB79.title: "&6Wear the Band of Mana"
	quest.732A6C2688D5B74C.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r glass top left and right, a &6wooden slab&r top middle, glass on the sides and bottom. A &6Jar&r from Supplementaries."
		""
		"It takes fluids from bottles, buckets and bowls, plus cookies and small creatures. Mined, it keeps its contents. A jar with honey, milk or water on the shelf is storage and decoration at the same time."
	]
	quest.732A6C2688D5B74C.quest_subtitle: "Fluid, cookies and small creatures in a glass."
	quest.732A6C2688D5B74C.title: "&7Fill a Jar"
	quest.734258EA63B5DEA8.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 Iesnium ingots&r on top, &e2 sticks&r below, like any pickaxe."
		""
		"It mines Iesnium and other Otherworld ores and lasts long. You need three more for the mining spirits: Foliot, Djinni and Afrit Miner each eat one."
	]
	quest.734258EA63B5DEA8.quest_subtitle: "The pickaxe that lasts."
	quest.734258EA63B5DEA8.title: "&6Forge an Iesnium Pickaxe"
	quest.73453D0E8632678B.quest_desc: [
		"&6PneumaticCraft&r, &6Druckrohr&r: trägt Druckluft von Kompressoren zu Maschinen, sicher bis &e5 Bar&r, das &6Verstärkte Druckrohr&r bis 10 Bar, das &6Fortgeschrittene&r bis 20 Bar (Stufe 3). Darüber platzt es. Module auf dem Rohr: Regler, Sicherheitsventil, Logistik. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Rezepte in EMI. Mekanism-Gase passen nicht hinein, nur die Luft von PneumaticCraft. Eine &6Rohrkreuzung&r lässt zwei Stränge kreuzen, ohne sie zu verbinden."
	]
	quest.73453D0E8632678B.quest_subtitle: "PneumaticCraft, Druckrohr: Luft bis 5 Bar, verstärkt 10, fortgeschritten 20."
	quest.73453D0E8632678B.title: "Lies: PneumaticCraft-Druckrohre"
	quest.734A2C6D76766A84.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &6Mana Pearl&r, &6Manasteel Ingot&r and &6Livingwood Twig&r on top of each other make the &6Soulscribe&r. Hit an &5enderman&r with it and catch the cloud with an Alfglass Flask."
		""
		"Outside the End this only gives &5Diluted Ender Essence&r. It is enough for Corporea Sparks and the Corporea Funnel."
	]
	quest.734A2C6D76766A84.quest_subtitle: "Diluted Ender Essence with the Soulscribe."
	quest.734A2C6D76766A84.title: "&5Tap Endermen"
	quest.734AE798B8886255.quest_desc: [
		"Same path at the smithing table: template, &6Cloggrum Sword&r and Forgotten Ingot make the &6Forgotten Sword&r."
		""
		"Forgotten weapons deal &e1.5 times&r as much damage against Undergarden mobs (except bosses). The &6Forgotten Battleaxe&r needs a Cloggrum Battleaxe, which only the Forgotten drop."
		""
		"All six together are an advancement: axe, battleaxe, hoe, pickaxe, shovel, sword."
	]
	quest.734AE798B8886255.quest_subtitle: "Sword and battleaxe."
	quest.734AE798B8886255.title: "&dForge Forgotten Weapons"
	quest.734F1686C67FA8D3.quest_desc: [
		"Uranium hexafluoride into the &6Isotopic Centrifuge&r. 1 mB gives &e1 mB of fissile fuel&r."
		""
		"From Yellow Cake to fuel: one uranium ingot becomes 1,000 mB of fuel. At first the reactor burns 0.1 mB per tick."
	]
	quest.734F1686C67FA8D3.quest_subtitle: "Step 5: the fuel."
	quest.734F1686C67FA8D3.title: "&a&lSpin Fissile Fuel"
	quest.735694DA2A1998E1.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &6Earth Essence&r and &6iron hoe&r."
		""
		"&eTouch, Harvest&r harvests ripe plants and leaves them standing. With AOE (tier 2) a whole bed."
	]
	quest.735694DA2A1998E1.quest_subtitle: "Harvest fields without replanting."
	quest.735694DA2A1998E1.title: "&dLearn Harvest"
	quest.735B50CF89EA398C.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6plastic&r, one &6Energite&r in the middle, at the bottom Electrum, plating, Electrum."
		""
		"Power goes straight into the addon instead of the machine: &e500,000 RF&r buffer, &e5,000 RF/t&r input. For when the machine's sides are already taken."
	]
	quest.735B50CF89EA398C.quest_subtitle: "Acceptor Addon."
	quest.735B50CF89EA398C.title: "&aAdd a Second Power Input"
	quest.736B78161A7C4DE3.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Iron Fillet Knife&r from two iron ingots and a stick. Knife and fish together in the crafting table: &6Raw Fish Fillet&r."
		""
		"Big fish give more fillets. &6Fish bones&r, which you sometimes pull out, turn into bone meal in the crafting table."
	]
	quest.736B78161A7C4DE3.quest_subtitle: "More food from every fish."
	quest.736B78161A7C4DE3.title: "&6Fillet a fish"
	quest.7377A7885BC0F072.quest_desc: [
		"Ferricore in the corners, a &6bucket&r on top, &6lapis, dropper, lapis&r in the middle, &6redstone&r at the bottom."
		""
		"The &6Simple Fluid Placer&r accepts buckets or a Fluid Canister. When it has at least &e1,000 mB&r in its tank and the space in front of it is free, it places a fluid block. That way it also places the &6Polymorphic Fluid&r or the unfinished fuel next to the goo, without you walking around with buckets."
	]
	quest.7377A7885BC0F072.quest_subtitle: "Places fluids like blocks."
	quest.7377A7885BC0F072.title: "&9Build the Fluid Placer"
	quest.7379A1919AC771B0.quest_desc: [
		"The upgrade base in the middle, &6eight copper blocks&r around it."
		""
		"Stack upgrades don't change the number of slots but how much fits into &eeach&r. The starter tier takes &e1.5 times&r as much; 64 stone per slot become 96."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Taking it out only works if everything still fits afterwards. In the leather backpack it takes up the only slot."
	]
	quest.7379A1919AC771B0.quest_subtitle: "More per slot, without a bigger backpack."
	quest.7379A1919AC771B0.title: "Build a Stack Upgrade Starter Tier"
	quest.737DDD3E3F186391.quest_desc: [
		"Top an &6iron rod&r, middle &6iron ingot, diamond, iron ingot&r, bottom &6three iron ingots&r."
		""
		"Holds &e32&r units and repairs at &e40 percent&r. For hammer and paxel, which wear a lot."
	]
	quest.737DDD3E3F186391.quest_subtitle: "32 units, 40 percent."
	quest.737DDD3E3F186391.title: "&7Build a sturdy Repair Kit"
	quest.73969B96CAA509C8.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/start_here_m_gearbox.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Top: &6Andesite Casing&r, &6Large Cogwheel&r, &6Andesite Casing&r. Middle: &6Mechanical Press&r, &6Infused Iron&r, &6Millstone&r. Bottom: &6Andesite Casing&r, &6Water Wheel&r, &6Andesite Casing&r."
		""
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/item/stone_gearbox.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The obelisk wants &e12&r, a fixed number. One counts &e250 points&r, as much as 125 Andesite Alloy. The twelve make up about half of the tech pillar."
		""
		"&cImportant:&r The obelisk only takes milestones while their goal is active. Stage 2 brings the &6Brass Heart&r and the &6Rune Core&r, &e8&r each."
	]
	quest.73969B96CAA509C8.quest_subtitle: "The milestone of the tech pillar."
	quest.73969B96CAA509C8.title: "&6Build a Stoneworks Gearbox"
	quest.73A257F18B8FB377.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Aviar's Circle."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6Stable Otherworld Sapling&r, an &6oak, birch&r and &6spruce sapling&r, an &6axe&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Its Book of Calling appears with it."
		""
		"Set the work area and the delivery chest with the book. It fells every tree in the area, carries the wood away and replants the saplings."
	]
	quest.73A257F18B8FB377.quest_subtitle: "Fell wood and replant."
	quest.73A257F18B8FB377.title: "&dSummon a Foliot Lumberjack"
	quest.73AE58B371D00F13.quest_desc: [
		"In the chamber: Source Gem inside, &6wither skeleton skull&r, &6bone meal&r, &6golden apple&r on the pedestals, &d3,000 Source&r."
		""
		"Glyphs with it: &dCharm&r (Anima, golden carrot, Sourceberry Pie, cake) turns enemies into allies for a while. &dPhantom Grasp&r (Anima, 2 phantom membranes) heals undead and drains the living. &dArc Propagation&r (Manipulation Essence, Arc Projectile) fires the rest of the spell anew."
	]
	quest.73AE58B371D00F13.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: the eighth essence and its glyphs."
	quest.73AE58B371D00F13.title: "&dMake Anima Essence"
	quest.73B84AA7EAB16619.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Ender, 1 Powdered Diamond&r, cloth."
		""
		"Takes you to the last arrow you shot. Costs &d50 mana&r."
	]
	quest.73B84AA7EAB16619.quest_subtitle: "To your last arrow."
	quest.73B84AA7EAB16619.title: "&5Draw Projectile Displacement"
	quest.73C9BA439B941704.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Spell Prism&r surrounded by &e8 obsidian&r."
		""
		"The normal prism redirects projectile spells, the Void Prism destroys them. In front of the windows it protects against other people's turrets and friends who do not aim precisely with Burst."
	]
	quest.73C9BA439B941704.quest_subtitle: "No spell gets through here."
	quest.73C9BA439B941704.title: "&5Build a Void Prism"
	quest.73CD15EAC74125EC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Energie Upgrade:&r Glas oben und unten, Infundierte Legierung links und rechts, &6Goldstaub&r in die Mitte."
		""
		"Ebenfalls bis zu &e8 Stück&r. Acht senken den Verbrauch pro Tick auf ein Zehntel und vergrößern den Energiespeicher der Maschine. Am Tempo ändern sie nichts."
		""
		"&eZusammen:&r 8 Geschwindigkeit und 8 Energie heben sich beim Strom pro Gegenstand genau auf: zehnmal so schnell für denselben Strom pro Barren, nur eben zehnmal so viel pro Tick. Das ist der Standard-Ausbau jeder Maschine in der Straße."
	]
	quest.73CD15EAC74125EC.quest_subtitle: "Sparsamer, mehr Puffer."
	quest.73CD15EAC74125EC.title: "&aSteck Energie-Upgrades hinein"
	quest.73D34358984F21B7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Lapis lazuli&r, two gold nuggets and gunpowder give 8 &6Seeker Shots&r. They follow the nearest enemy, missing is hardly possible."
		""
		"More kinds: &6Exorcism Shots&r (8 Neutral Shots and a Zombie Heart) deal huge damage to undead, &6Blaze Shots&r (blaze powder, blaze rod, two gold nuggets) set things on fire, but do not help against fireproof enemies."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Empty casings remain after the shot, pick them up."
	]
	quest.73D34358984F21B7.quest_subtitle: "Ammo that finds its target by itself."
	quest.73D34358984F21B7.title: "&9Load Seeker Shots"
	quest.73DE2B54E5F13F87.quest_desc: [
		"Halt einen leeren &6Skyroot Bucket&r an eine lebende &6Aechor Plant&r, und er füllt sich mit Gift. Im &6Altar&r verzaubert wird daraus der &6Skyroot Remedy Bucket&r."
		""
		"Trink ihn, wenn dich Aechor Plants oder Cockatrices vergiftet haben, und das Gift ist weg. Pack immer einen ein, bevor du in einen Dungeon gehst."
	]
	quest.73DE2B54E5F13F87.quest_subtitle: "Das Gegengift des Aethers."
	quest.73DE2B54E5F13F87.title: "&aFüll einen Remedy Bucket"
	quest.73DF9A35D7131F95.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Kleiner Tank&r (Small Tank: vier Eisengitter, vier Druckeisen, ein Glas, 32 000 mB) zwischen zwei &6Druckluftrohren&r oben, ein &6Luftkompressor&r zwischen zwei &6Leder&r unten ergeben den &6Flüssigkeitskompressor&r (Liquid Compressor)."
		""
		"Er verbrennt Flüssigkeiten: &bLava&r geht schon, richtig gut werden Diesel, Kerosin, Benzin und LPG aus der Raffinerie. Der Reiter &eVerfügbare Brennstoffe&r im Fenster listet alles von bestem bis schlechtestem. Eimer rechtsklicken, in den oberen Slot legen oder per Rohr hineinpumpen."
		""
		"Der kleine Tank lohnt sich auch allein: Er behält seinen Inhalt beim Abbauen, und mit dem Schlüssel stapelst du mehrere zu einem großen."
	]
	quest.73DF9A35D7131F95.quest_subtitle: "Für alles, was aus dem Eimer brennt."
	quest.73DF9A35D7131F95.title: "&6Bau einen Flüssigkeitskompressor"
	quest.73E67DE30FC7EE40.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Unattuned Augment&r: &e3 iron ingots&r in the middle column, &e6 Prosperity Shards&r left and right. Put it on the Infusion Altar, on the pedestals &e4 gold ingots&r and &e4 Inferium Essence&r: a &6Luck I Augment&r."
		""
		"In essence armor it improves the loot from fishing and chests. You put it in at the &6Tinkering Table&r, and that needs Soulium from &cstage 2&r. Until then it waits."
	]
	quest.73E67DE30FC7EE40.quest_subtitle: "Ready for the Tinkering Table."
	quest.73E67DE30FC7EE40.title: "&6Attune a Luck Augment"
	quest.73F5AAB79AA73C86.quest_desc: [
		"Top three &6yellow dyes&r, middle &6gold nugget, wheat seeds, gold nugget&r, bottom three &6dirt&r: four fertilizer."
		""
		"The field becomes stable and can no longer be trampled."
	]
	quest.73F5AAB79AA73C86.quest_subtitle: "No more trampling."
	quest.73F5AAB79AA73C86.title: "&eSpread yellow fertilizer"
	quest.7404794505731B28.quest_desc: [
		"&6Plant Sower:&r Pity, 1,000 FE per operation. &6Plant Gatherer:&r Pity, 400 FE."
		"&6Plant Fertilizer:&r Simple, 1,000 FE. &6Hydroponic Bed:&r Simple, 1,000 FE."
		"&6Sewer:&r Pity, 10 FE. &6Sewage Composter:&r Pity, 40 FE/t."
		"&6Animal Feeder:&r Pity, 400 FE. &6Animal Rancher:&r Pity, 400 FE, shears and milks."
		"&6Animal Baby Separator:&r Pity, 400 FE. &6Marine Fisher:&r Simple, 5,000 FE."
	]
	quest.7404794505731B28.quest_subtitle: "Plants and animals, with power use."
	quest.7404794505731B28.title: "&6&lCheck Off the Field and Animal Machines"
	quest.7406572C8402420F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r vier &6Turbine Rotors&r um einen &6Logistics Core&r. Kein PCB, kein Präzisionsgetriebe, kein Programm."
		""
		"Lade sie und setz sie mitten in deine Kisten. Sie bedient jeden Rahmen in einem Würfel von &e33 Blöcken&r Kantenlänge um ihren Startpunkt: holt bei Providern, bringt zu Requestern, räumt in Storage. Mehr kann sie nicht, mehr muss sie nicht."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Speed Upgrades und Inventory Upgrades über die Charging Station (Pfeil über dem Slot) machen sie schneller und lassen sie mehr tragen. Im Requester-Rahmen setzt du eine Mindestmenge, sonst fliegt sie für jedes einzelne Stück."
	]
	quest.7406572C8402420F.quest_subtitle: "Transport ohne eine Zeile Programm."
	quest.7406572C8402420F.title: "&6Setz eine Logistics Drone ein"
	quest.740888978FAE8C47.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sandpaper&r (paper and sand) in the main hand, &6Rose Quartz&r in the off hand, hold the right mouse button. Out comes &6Polished Rose Quartz&r."
		"{image:create:textures/item/polished_rose_quartz.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"On the belt a deployer with sandpaper does it, or the Enchantment Industry grindstone."
	]
	quest.740888978FAE8C47.quest_subtitle: "Sandpaper in hand."
	quest.740888978FAE8C47.title: "&6Polish rose quartz"
	quest.7410F345AE764B6F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/silent_gear_stone_anvil.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Top middle &6one cobblestone&r, below it &6cobblestone, dirt, cobblestone&r."
		""
		"Put a block on it with &eright click&r and then click it with the matching tool. With a hammer, one cobblestone becomes &enine pebbles&r that way."
	]
	quest.7410F345AE764B6F.quest_subtitle: "The work surface for knife and hammer."
	quest.7410F345AE764B6F.title: "&7Set up a Stone Anvil"
	quest.74196A047E1F6006.quest_desc: [
		"&aFlourishing log&r, &6Earth Essence&r, &6iron hoe&r."
		""
		"Casts Harvest on ripe plants nearby again and again, for a little Source per round. A chest right at the brazier takes in the harvest."
	]
	quest.74196A047E1F6006.quest_subtitle: "The fields harvest themselves."
	quest.74196A047E1F6006.title: "&aMake the Harvest tablet"
	quest.7419CDFEA245058F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_alternator.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r In the crafters, four &6copper spools&r, iron sheets, a Mekanism &6Basic Control Circuit&r and two &6andesite alloys&r make the &6Alternator&r."
		""
		"At 256 RPM it supplies &d360 FE per tick&r and draws &d16,384 SU&r for it. A boiler with an alternator is a solid first power plant for Mekanism."
		""
		"You connect &6connectors&r (copper rod, alloy, slimeball) with a copper spool. This addon's accumulator only comes in stage 3; before that you can buffer with a Mekanism Energy Cube."
	]
	quest.7419CDFEA245058F.quest_subtitle: "The Alternator."
	quest.7419CDFEA245058F.title: "&6Make FE from rotation"
	quest.743C38798792643B.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 source gems&r top left and right, &e1 red wool&r top middle, below it a stone in the middle and three stone in the bottom row: the &6Infusion Altar&r."
		""
		"The altar is a multiblock structure: one altar and &e8 Infusion Pedestals&r around it. Place the altar, then it shows you with markers where the pedestals go: &e3 blocks&r away in each cardinal direction and &e2 blocks&r away in each diagonal. All at the same height."
		""
		"Every seed recipe is built the same way: the seed base in the altar, on the pedestals alternating &e4 essence&r and &e4 material&r. Then activate it, with the Wand or a redstone signal."
	]
	quest.743C38798792643B.quest_subtitle: "All seeds are made here."
	quest.743C38798792643B.title: "&d&lBuild the Infusion Altar"
	quest.745BD1BC645BAF3B.quest_desc: [
		"&6Fortune I:&r lapis blocks and iron blocks around a blank module. &6Silk Touch:&r slime balls, gold and a golden apple around a blank module."
		""
		"Fortune for ore, Silk Touch for glass and ore blocks. Per block Fortune I costs &d30 FE&r extra, Silk Touch &d100 FE&r. &cStage 4:&r Fortune III, 7x7, Battery III, Range III and Efficiency III."
	]
	quest.745BD1BC645BAF3B.quest_subtitle: "Only one of the two fits in."
	quest.745BD1BC645BAF3B.title: "&bChoose Fortune or Silk Touch"
	quest.7471697E85315437.quest_desc: [
		"&6Raw Ferricore&r in a furnace or blast furnace gives a &6Ferricore Ingot&r, 10 seconds in the furnace, 5 in the blast furnace. Nine ingots give a block and back."
		""
		"Ferricore goes into every tool, every armor piece, every upgrade and every simple machine of the mod. 32 ingots are enough to start: a pickaxe, four blank upgrades and a generator."
		""
		"{image:justdirethings:textures/item/ferricore_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7471697E85315437.quest_subtitle: "The metal for everything in this chapter."
	quest.7471697E85315437.title: "&7Smelt Ferricore"
	quest.7484223088881FCF.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Toaster&r (Steinknopf oben rechts, Eisenfalltür zwischen zwei Eisen, Lavaeimer zwischen zwei Eisen) macht aus Brot Toast. Der &6Fruchtkorb&r (Holzstufe, Holzdruckplatte, Holzstufe) lagert Obst, das &6Gewürzregal&r (zwei Holzstufen) Zutaten, beide sichtbar an der Wand."
		""
		"Das &6Werkzeugregal&r (drei Holzstufen, zwei Eisenklumpen) hält Werkzeuge, auch das &6Küchenmesser&r von Farmer's Delight, und der Kochtisch benutzt es von dort. Das &6Schneidebrett&r (Eisenaxt über einer Holzstufe) ist die Blockhead-Version für Rezepte, die eines verlangen."
		""
		"Alles davon zählt zur Küche, wenn es die anderen Blöcke berührt."
	]
	quest.7484223088881FCF.quest_subtitle: "Toaster, Fruchtkorb, Gewürzregal, Werkzeugregal."
	quest.7484223088881FCF.title: "&6Häng den Kleinkram auf"
	quest.748D6B68944ABA7C.quest_desc: [
		"The ritual counts the players at the start. With four it has twice the health, but 6 drop for each and 8 for the last hit, together &e26 instead of 8&r."
		""
		"The Lexica advises against more than five, then it gets too chaotic."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The fights for the obelisk run live on stream. Finish the arena, bring Terrasteel."
	]
	quest.748D6B68944ABA7C.quest_subtitle: "More people, more spirits."
	quest.748D6B68944ABA7C.title: "&dFight Together"
	quest.74920690697F14F5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_nouveau_chamber_auto.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6hopper&r above the chamber refills amethyst, a hopper below takes the finished gems into a chest."
		""
		"Several chambers around one jar, each with its own pair of hoppers, multiply the yield. Later a Starbuncle carries everything into a chest."
	]
	quest.74920690697F14F5.quest_subtitle: "Hopper on top, hopper below, and you go to sleep."
	quest.74920690697F14F5.title: "&aAutomate the chamber"
	quest.7492CA8E478271AC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mekanism&r, &6Einfache Tonne&r: &e4 096&r Stück einer Sorte, Fortgeschritten 8 192 (Stufe 3), Elite 32 768 und Ultimativ 262 144 (Stufe 4). Rechtsklick hinein, Linksklick heraus, Auto-Auswurf nach unten. Die &6Persönliche Truhe&r öffnet nur für dich. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"&eStufe 4:&r Das &6QIO-Netz&r: Laufwerke mit Millionen Plätzen, Dashboard und tragbares Dashboard, drahtlos ohne Kabel. Siehe Kapitel Mekanism."
	]
	quest.7492CA8E478271AC.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, Tonne: 4 096 Stück einer Sorte, QIO in Stufe 4."
	quest.7492CA8E478271AC.title: "Lies: Tonne und Persönliche Truhe"
	quest.74995A3FE722D93F.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"keybind\":\"key.pingwheel.ping_location\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" places a \"},{\"text\":\"ping\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" where you are looking. Everyone nearby sees it as a sign in the world, with distance, and an arrow at the edge of the screen shows the direction.\"}]"
		""
		"A ping lasts &e7 seconds&r. If you aim at an item on the ground, it shows its icon. Ideal for \"here is the vein\" or \"watch out, creeper\"."
		""
		"&eTip:&r In Ping Wheel's settings you set a &echannel&r. Then only players on the same channel see your pings."
	]
	quest.74995A3FE722D93F.quest_subtitle: "Ping Wheel: one click, a sign in the world."
	quest.74995A3FE722D93F.title: "&aShow Your Team the Way"
	quest.749BFCFBFE7FBD99.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r oben Redstone, &6Compressed Iron Gear&r, &6Einfacher Steuerschaltkreis&r von Mekanism. Mitte: Redstoneblock, &6Turbine Rotor&r, &6Advanced Pressure Tube&r. Unten Redstone, &6Schmelzofen&r (Blast Furnace), noch ein Steuerschaltkreis."
		""
		"Der Flux Compressor nimmt &dFE&r aus jedem Kabel des Packs und macht daraus Druckluft: &e40 FE pro Tick&r, aus 100 FE werden 40 mL Luft. Er speichert 100 000 FE und nimmt Strom doppelt so schnell auf, wie er ihn verbraucht. Auch er muss gekühlt werden."
		""
		"Den Steuerschaltkreis gibt es nur aus der Infusionsanlage mit einer Elektronenröhre, siehe Kapitel &5Mekanism&r. So hängt PneumaticCraft am Stromnetz des Servers: Ein Mekanism-Kabel oder ein Flux Point an diesen Block, und die Luft kommt aus der Steckdose."
	]
	quest.749BFCFBFE7FBD99.quest_subtitle: "Strom wird zu Luft."
	quest.749BFCFBFE7FBD99.title: "&dBau einen Flux Compressor"
	quest.749C9E514BE7D62F.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r five &6Blazegold Ingots&r and an &6eye of ender&r: ingots top middle and right, in the middle row left and right of the eye, bottom left."
		""
		"The &6Portal Gun&r shoots a blue portal onto the wall with &eleft click&r and an orange one with &eright click&r. Whoever walks through one comes out of the other, items too. Every shot costs &e1,000 FE&r, the storage holds 100,000 FE, it charges in the Pocket Generator."
		""
		"The &6Blazejet Wand&r goes well with it (one Blazegold, two Ferricore diagonally): right click pushes you in the direction you are looking, and as long as it is in your hand you take no fall damage. Repairs itself in lava."
		""
		"&cOutlook:&r The &6Voidshift Wand&r, which teleports you to where you are looking, needs Celestigem and comes in stage 3. The &6Portal Gun V2&r with portal fluid comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.749C9E514BE7D62F.quest_subtitle: "Blue in, orange out."
	quest.749C9E514BE7D62F.title: "&dBuild the Portal Gun"
	quest.74A0A5EEFE6E83AB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Energy Hopper (Starter):&r three paste at the top, Tiny left and right of the casing, paste, a &6hopper&r, paste at the bottom."
		""
		"Like a hopper it faces one direction and charges all powered items in the chest or container in front of it, Starter at &e500 FE/t&r. It gets power by cable."
		""
		"A chest full of Batteries, tablets and tools, a hopper on it, and everything is full the next morning."
	]
	quest.74A0A5EEFE6E83AB.quest_subtitle: "The Energy Hopper."
	quest.74A0A5EEFE6E83AB.title: "&eCharge a whole chest"
	quest.74A151BC31EC2754.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_vault_big.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Place vaults against each other, they merge into one. Footprint up to &e3 by 3&r, length up to three times the width. That is up to 81 blocks and &e1,620 stacks&r in one inventory."
		""
		"An andesite funnel on top fills it from the belt, one at the bottom takes out. No filter, so one vault per line."
	]
	quest.74A151BC31EC2754.quest_subtitle: "Up to 81 blocks, one inventory."
	quest.74A151BC31EC2754.title: "Build a big vault"
	quest.74A4091431F65E22.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Evoker Fort&r stands in hills, forests, plains, deserts and savannas, manned by pillagers, evokers and &6Magehunter Vindicators&r. The &aArchevoker&r waits at the very top."
		""
		"&eLoot:&r 0 to 8 &6Arcane Essence&r, a scroll, 1 to 3 inks, a 50 percent chance of an &6Evocation Rune&r (only if you kill it yourself) and with luck the &6Grimoire of Evokation&r, a unique book with fixed spells, which normal evokers can drop too."
		""
		"The watchtowers hold crossbows, arrows and goat horns. For essence the fort gives less than the towers, for runes all the more."
	]
	quest.74A4091431F65E22.quest_subtitle: "Pillagers, evokers and their leader."
	quest.74A4091431F65E22.title: "&aTake the Evoker Fort"
	quest.74AA7604DA6F2FFC.quest_desc: [
		"Hold a &6gold nugget&r in your hand and the wild Starbuncle won't run away. Throw it to it, it disappears and leaves &6Starbuncle Shards&r behind."
		""
		"Starbuncles live in wooded areas, often in archwood forests."
	]
	quest.74AA7604DA6F2FFC.quest_subtitle: "A gold nugget for a friend."
	quest.74AA7604DA6F2FFC.title: "&6Feed a Starbuncle"
	quest.74B4B0D844DF0F98.quest_desc: [
		"Most relics are found, not crafted. They go into the forge's upper slots and change what it can do:"
		""
		"&6Artisan Relic&r (smith chests in villages, or from the Wandering Trader for 18 emeralds): rituals cost only &e75 percent experience&r. In the Clibano it allows alloys like Obsidiansteel. &eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r four &6Deorum Ingots&r around a &6Precision Mechanism&r from Create, top, bottom, left and right."
		"&6Crimson Stone&r (pillager outposts): rituals need only &ehalf as many souls&r."
		"&6Elementarium&r (jungle temples, desert temples, ocean ruins): unlocks the prisms."
		"&6Maledictus Pact&r (bastion treasure) and &6Divine Pact&r: cursed and divine items, only for the high tiers."
	]
	quest.74B4B0D844DF0F98.quest_subtitle: "What goes into the two upper slots."
	quest.74B4B0D844DF0F98.title: "&6Enhancer Relics"
	quest.74B6FF1C541A1121.quest_desc: [
		"&6Redstone blocks&r in the corners, &6blaze rods&r on the sides, a &6Draconium Core&r in the middle."
		""
		"Four of them, one for each stabilizer. You get the blaze rods from the Nether."
	]
	quest.74B6FF1C541A1121.quest_subtitle: "One per stabilizer."
	quest.74B6FF1C541A1121.title: "&cBuild Particle Generators"
	quest.74BB471BE9492184.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6lectern&r in the middle, &e4 chests&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Dominion Wand: first the chest, then the lectern. At the lectern you see all connected inventories together, take things out and craft straight from them. Inventories may be up to &e30 blocks&r away."
		""
		"How many inventories fit is decided by the &dBookwyrms&r: each Bookwyrm Charm on the lectern allows &e8&r more. An unconnected chest right at the lectern becomes the input, everything in it goes into storage."
	]
	quest.74BB471BE9492184.quest_subtitle: "All chests in one window."
	quest.74BB471BE9492184.title: "&aBuild a Storage Lectern"
	quest.74C1A6A6E06565BE.quest_desc: [
		"Follow the row at the top from left to right: secure a base, collect cobblestone, go to the obelisk, deliver. You know Minecraft; this is only about what is different on Kronwerke."
		""
		"&6Kronwerke Season 2&r: about fifty people, one world, five &6stages&r. Each stage opens for everyone as soon as the server has filled a shared goal at the &6obelisk&r at spawn."
		""
		"Click finished quests to claim the reward. How the book, EMI and the map work is in the chapter &6Tips and Tricks&r."
	]
	quest.74C1A6A6E06565BE.quest_subtitle: "Six short steps to your first delivery at the obelisk."
	quest.74C1A6A6E06565BE.title: "&6Start here"
	quest.74CE32FE8435DCDD.quest_desc: [
		"Kauf ein &6Ceylon-Ebenholz&r (Generation 3, 4 Smaragde). Es trägt keine Früchte, dafür sind seine Bretter fast schwarz. Mit Kapok wird daraus das Gelbe Meranti, daraus mit Kapok der &6Mahagoni&r, der Vater von Brasilholz, Palisander, Greenheart, Gelbholz und Sandelholz."
		""
		"&eDunkel:&r Ceylon-Ebenholz, Myrten-Ebenholz, Wenge, Blauholz. &eHell:&r Balsa, Silberpappel, Espe, Buchsbaum. &eBunt:&r Padauk, Purpleheart, Pink Ivory, Zebrano, Cocobolo, Regenbogeneukalyptus, Blue Mahoe. Jedes Holz hat seine eigenen Bretter, Stufen, Türen und Regale."
		""
		"Die Riesenformen aus 2x2 und 5x5 Setzlingen liefern bei Mahagoni, Ebenholz, Purpleheart und Mammutbaum Stämme im Hunderterpack, ideal für die Create-Säge."
	]
	quest.74CE32FE8435DCDD.quest_subtitle: "Mahagoni, Ebenholz, Teak, Zebrano: Holz zum Angeben."
	quest.74CE32FE8435DCDD.title: "&6Pflanz ein Edelholz"
	quest.74D3A0C742FF5EAF.quest_desc: [
		"Jede neue Art, die du züchtest, ist anfangs ein einziger Setzling. Pflanz ihn, fäll den Baum und leg die Setzlinge, die abfallen, in eine eigene Schublade, mindestens zwei pro Art."
		""
		"Eine Wand aus &6Schubladen&r von Functional Storage ist deine Bank, jede Schublade zeigt vorn, welche Art darin liegt. So hast du für jede Kreuzung beide Eltern zur Hand und musst nie wieder am Markt nachkaufen."
	]
	quest.74D3A0C742FF5EAF.quest_subtitle: "Keine gezüchtete Art geht wieder verloren."
	quest.74D3A0C742FF5EAF.title: "&eLeg eine Setzlingsbank an"
	quest.74F38C1A19E11431.quest_desc: [
		"The farm world is open. The other worlds come with the stages: &cNether&r and &bAether&r in stage 2, &2Undergarden&r and &3Otherside&r in stage 3, &5End&r and &bEternal Starlight&r in stage 4."
		""
		"Every portal in three lines is in the &6Checklist: Dimensions and Travel&r, and every world has its own chapter: &cThe Nether&r, &bThe Aether&r, &2The Undergarden&r, &3Deeper and Darker&r, &5The End&r, &bEternal Starlight&r."
	]
	quest.74F38C1A19E11431.quest_subtitle: "Six dimensions open with the stages."
	quest.74F38C1A19E11431.title: "&5See which worlds are still to come"
	quest.74FCE26DC9255C60.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/powah_reactor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Nimm &636 Reaktorblöcke&r einer Stufe in die Hand und setz einen ab, der 3 x 3 x 4 Reaktor baut sich selbst. &6Uraninit&r hinein, Wasser und Eis oder Trockeneis zum Kühlen, Kohle und Redstone in die Nebenslots für mehr Leistung."
		""
		"&ePowah, Reaktor:&r Brennstoff Uraninit (Erz unter Y 64, Mekanism-Uran in der Kugel). Erzeugung Starter &d250 FE/t&r, Basic 1 000, Hardened 2 500, Blazing 10 000, Niotic 25 000, Spirited 100 000. Puffer 250 000 bis 100 Millionen. Offen ab Stufe 3, Nitro (500 000 FE/t) in Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.74FCE26DC9255C60.quest_subtitle: "Powah, 250 bis 100 000 FE/t aus Uraninit."
	quest.74FCE26DC9255C60.title: "&bZünde den Powah-Reaktor"
	quest.75047AB53B1126D5.quest_desc: [
		"Collect &e16 slag&r from the blast furnace."
		""
		"In the furnace it becomes &6Slag Glass&r, which HV relays take too. In stage 3 it goes into industrial fertiliser and concrete. So put it in a chest, not in the lava."
	]
	quest.75047AB53B1126D5.quest_subtitle: "Waste with a use."
	quest.75047AB53B1126D5.title: "&7Keep the slag"
	quest.751B269F044FA057.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/start_here_m_goldleaf.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Put the &6Brilliant Fiber&r into the crown of a tree. Over time the leaves turn golden. Fully golden leaves drop &6Gold Leaf&r when broken."
		""
		"A golden leaf gives a Gold Leaf with a 75 percent chance. Keep the tree; you need Gold Leaf for each of the next steps and for the Source Keystone."
	]
	quest.751B269F044FA057.quest_subtitle: "A tree that turns golden over time."
	quest.751B269F044FA057.title: "&aHarvest Gold Leaf"
	quest.75252D5A74788A46.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_trains_unprocessed_sheet.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Powdered Obsidian onto a depot or belt under a &6spout&r. It pours &b500 mB of lava&r on it, out comes an &6Unprocessed Obsidian Sheet&r."
		""
		"This is the first step of a sequenced assembly. EMI shows the whole sequence under the Sturdy Sheet."
	]
	quest.75252D5A74788A46.quest_subtitle: "An Unprocessed Obsidian Sheet."
	quest.75252D5A74788A46.title: "&6Pour lava on the powder"
	quest.752AFBB1F67EAA89.quest_desc: [
		"An &6ME Fluid Cell Housing&r and a &61k component&r at the crafting table give the &61k ME Fluid Storage Cell&r. It goes into the drive like every cell."
		""
		"A fluid cell holds only &e5 types&r, but &d8 buckets&r fit into one byte. Lava, water and oil land straight in the network, and you draw them off in the terminal with a bucket or a tank."
		""
		"&eApplied Mekanistics:&r With an &6ME Chemical Cell Housing&r (quartz glass, redstone, three osmium ingots at the bottom) and the same component you store Mekanism gases."
	]
	quest.752AFBB1F67EAA89.quest_subtitle: "You need no buckets any more."
	quest.752AFBB1F67EAA89.title: "&9Store fluids"
	quest.7530435B9DB892CE.quest_desc: [
		"&6Molten Core&r, &6gold ingot&r, &6blaze rod&r and &6Void Tear&r shapeless give the &6Sojourner's Staff&r. It pulls torches, lanterns, soul torches, glowstone and similar lights from your inventory into itself, up to &e1,500 per kind&r."
		""
		"Right click places the chosen light where you aim, up to &e30 blocks&r away. Every 6 blocks of distance costs one extra torch. Shift mouse wheel switches the kind."
	]
	quest.7530435B9DB892CE.quest_subtitle: "1,500 torches in one staff."
	quest.7530435B9DB892CE.title: "&eBuild a Sojourner's Staff"
	quest.753480535AEC8A1A.quest_desc: [
		"An obelisk is a tower of three blocks: an &6Arcane Polished Darkstone&r at the bottom, &e2 Arcane Crystal Blocks&r on top (nine crystals each). Right clicking the tower with &6Mundabitur Dust&r turns it into an &6Arcane Crystal Obelisk&r."
		""
		"The obelisk only works when it stands on &6Gilded Chiseled Polished Darkstone&r, so on one of the forge's eight outer spots. There it gives the forge within 4 blocks &e1 Aureal every 5 seconds&r. Four obelisks fill tier 1 in about 20 minutes."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The finished obelisk can be mined and placed again as a whole block, you only need the dust once."
	]
	quest.753480535AEC8A1A.quest_subtitle: "Aureal that drips by itself."
	quest.753480535AEC8A1A.title: "&dErect Arcane Crystal Obelisks"
	quest.754715686E891103.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &6Mana Pearls&r from Botania in the corners, &6Atomic Alloy&r at the top and bottom, gold left and right, a diamond in the middle."
		""
		"The Teleporter, the Portable Teleporter and the Digital Miner need one, the miner even two. In stage 4 the Quantum Entangloporter and QIO come along."
	]
	quest.754715686E891103.quest_subtitle: "The heart of teleporter and miner."
	quest.754715686E891103.title: "&dBuild a Teleportation Core"
	quest.754E7FB09FAA4529.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Arcane Anvil&r (Quelljuwelblöcke, Diamant, Amboss) nimmt Rüstung plus &6Upgrade Orb&r: bis zu 3 Upgrades für Mana, Abklingzeit, Schutz oder eine Schule. Kugeln brauchen Mithril und Cinder Essence aus dem Nether."
		""
		"Die &cPyromancer&r-Rüstung braucht die Fire Rune aus Lohenruten. Epic Ink mit Diamant- und Netheritbuch kommt in Stufe 3, Legendary und Drachenhaut in Stufe 4. Kapitel &5Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r."
	]
	quest.754E7FB09FAA4529.quest_subtitle: "Iron's Spells: Arcane Anvil und Pyromancer."
	quest.754E7FB09FAA4529.title: "&5Setz eine Upgrade-Kugel ein"
	quest.755591FD0C010404.quest_desc: [
		"Kochtopf: &6Rohe Nudeln&r, ein &6Ei&r, &6Getrockneter Seetang&r und &6rohes Schweinefleisch&r, Schüssel."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/noodle_soup.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.755591FD0C010404.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.755591FD0C010404.title: "&6Koch Nudelsuppe"
	quest.75568FD704BF8034.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hold \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ponder.ponder\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\" over a Create block in your inventory or in EMI. The \"},{\"text\":\"Ponder\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" view opens, a small animated guide to exactly that block.\"}]"
		""
		"Create makes no power but &drotation&r. Water wheels and windmills turn shafts and cogwheels, which drive machines that mill, press, mix and move whole buildings."
		""
		"&eStage 1&r opens the andesite half: water wheels, the press, the mixer without heat, belts, fans, pipes, packages and the first contraptions. Brass, Blaze Burners, deployers and trains come in &6stage 2&r."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r In this stage the obelisk's tech pillar wants &61,500 Andesite Alloy&r (for 30 players) and &612 Stoneworks Gearboxes&r. At the end of this chapter there is a factory that delivers both."
	]
	quest.75568FD704BF8034.quest_subtitle: "Rotation instead of power: that is how every machine runs here."
	quest.75568FD704BF8034.title: "&6&lGet started with Create"
	quest.756E5E64739B4ECC.quest_desc: [
		"Throw &6Mana Diamonds&r into the portal. A &dDragonstone&r comes back for each, a Dragonstone block for a Mana Diamond block."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/dragonstone.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"You need Dragonstone for Corporea, the Crystal Bow and four times for every &dElven Star&r. Gaia armor and Gaia Spreader only come in stage 4."
	]
	quest.756E5E64739B4ECC.quest_subtitle: "Mana Diamond becomes a pink jewel."
	quest.756E5E64739B4ECC.title: "&dTrade Mana Diamonds for Dragonstone"
	quest.7572883DBF11E881.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/alfheim_open.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Right click the core with the &aWand of the Forest&r. Opening costs &d200,000 mana&r from the pools with pylons."
		""
		"&eHow to trade:&r Throw the goods in, the result flies out. &eEvery trade costs 500 mana&r. If a pool runs empty, the portal closes."
		""
		"&cNever throw bread in.&r The elves do not like bread, and the portal explodes."
	]
	quest.7572883DBF11E881.quest_subtitle: "One click with the wand and the middle lights up."
	quest.7572883DBF11E881.title: "&a&lOpen the Portal"
	quest.75750C974114C9C5.quest_desc: [
		"Leg &6Blue Berries&r in den &6Altar&r und feuere mit &6Ambrosium Shards&r. Nach 12,5 Sekunden kommt eine &6Enchanted Berry&r heraus, genau ein Shard pro Beere. Sie füllt &edrei Keulen&r und sättigt stark."
		""
		"{image:aether:textures/item/food/enchanted_berry.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Für Bosskämpfe gibt es Besseres: &6Blue&r und &6Golden Gummy Swets&r aus den Truhen der Bronze- und Silber-Dungeons füllen die &eganze Hungerleiste&r auf einmal. Ein &6Healing Stone&r (Holystone 25 Sekunden im Altar) gibt Regeneration, ein roher &6Ambrosium Shard&r heilt ein halbes Herz."
	]
	quest.75750C974114C9C5.quest_subtitle: "Aus einer Keule werden drei."
	quest.75750C974114C9C5.title: "&dVerzaubere Beeren"
	quest.7575D38155BBCFE2.quest_desc: [
		"Kill an &3Elder Guardian&r in the ocean monument. Every monument has three, and as long as one lives, it paralyses you again and again with Mining Fatigue."
		""
		"Each drops a &6wet sponge&r. Only when all three are dead can you clear out the monument in peace."
	]
	quest.7575D38155BBCFE2.quest_subtitle: "Three guard every ocean monument."
	quest.7575D38155BBCFE2.title: "&3Defeat an Elder Guardian"
	quest.75876391CAC88874.quest_desc: [
		"&6Planks&r, &6Andesite Casing&r and a &6clock&r stacked make the &6Cuckoo Clock&r. Give it rotation and it shows the time."
		""
		"Twice a day it plays a tune: at noon and in the evening, as soon as you can sleep."
	]
	quest.75876391CAC88874.quest_subtitle: "When does night fall?"
	quest.75876391CAC88874.title: "&6Hang up a Cuckoo Clock"
	quest.758BB8B008C59E1B.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r four &6Ferricore Ingots&r in the corners, a &6dropper&r in the middle, &6redstone&r on top and bottom, &6lapis&r left and right."
		""
		"The &6Simple Dropper&r throws items from its inventory in the direction you set, down by default. The number button sets how many fly at once (1 to 64), the &ePickup Delay&r how long nobody can pick them up."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A dropper above a &6Mana Pool&r throws ender pearls in, and the pool turns them into &6Mana Pearls&r, one of this stage's obelisk goals. In stage 3 it feeds the elven portal the same way."
	]
	quest.758BB8B008C59E1B.quest_subtitle: "Throw items into the world, in stacks too."
	quest.758BB8B008C59E1B.title: "&7Build the Dropper"
	quest.758F4761A5439639.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r oben Bretter, &6Steinschneider&r, Bretter, in der Mitte drei &6Andesitlegierungen&r, unten drei Bretter. Das &6Sägewerk&r von &6Productive Trees&r braucht keinen Strom: Stamm hinein, warten, fertig."
		""
		"Jeder Stamm wird zu &e6 Brettern&r statt 4 an der Werkbank, dazu &e2 Sägemehl&r. Acht Sägemehl um einen Wassereimer ergeben zwei &6Papier&r, ein Buch mit einem Sägemehl das Handbuch des Mods."
		""
		"{image:productivetrees:textures/item/sawdust.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Dazu gehört der &6Entrinder&r (Stripper), der mit einer Axt im Inneren Stämme entrindet, auch stapelweise. &6Zeit-Upgrades&r von Productive Lib machen beide Maschinen schneller."
	]
	quest.758F4761A5439639.quest_subtitle: "Sechs Bretter und Sägemehl aus jedem Stamm."
	quest.758F4761A5439639.title: "&6&lBau ein Sägewerk"
	quest.759DFB18CD053CE6.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hexerei_sage_plate.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the heated lava cauldron: &e8 gold ingots&r. Right click with a &6Dried Sage Bundle&r puts it on the plate, a flint and steel lights it."
		""
		"As long as it burns, no monsters spawn naturally within &e48 blocks&r. Right click with an empty hand changes the smoke, one mode shows the range."
		""
		"&eTip:&r One plate in the middle of your settlement protects several houses at once."
	]
	quest.759DFB18CD053CE6.quest_subtitle: "No monsters around the house."
	quest.759DFB18CD053CE6.title: "&2&lSet up a Sage Burning Plate"
	quest.75A880B536E4CBE9.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Flüssigkeitsventil&r: sitzt in einem Rohr und öffnet oder schließt es über eine Welle, die Drehrichtung entscheidet. Mit einer &6Gangschaltung&r an der Welle schaltest du es per Redstone. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Ein Eisenblech und ein Flüssigkeitsrohr, formlos."
	]
	quest.75A880B536E4CBE9.quest_subtitle: "Create, Flüssigkeitsventil: Rohr auf, Rohr zu."
	quest.75A880B536E4CBE9.title: "Setz ein Flüssigkeitsventil"
	quest.75C29E23C9F0E45C.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Timeworn Fabric&r in the corners, one &6clock&r each on top and bottom, one &6flint&r each left and right, a blank &6Spawner Rune&r in the middle."
		""
		"Right clicking a spawner with the rune sets the base values at once: delay &e150 to 600&r ticks, &e7&r monsters per spawn, &e12&r monsters allowed, activation up to &e24&r blocks. Before it was 200 to 800, 4, 6 and 16."
		""
		"The next tier, the &6Wayfarer's Rune&r (Ascent), wants Luminous Crystal Shards, a spawn egg, a Sigil of Socketing and &6nether quartz&r, so stage 2. Summit and Pinnacle need an infused rune at Eterna 70."
	]
	quest.75C29E23C9F0E45C.quest_subtitle: "The base values in one go."
	quest.75C29E23C9F0E45C.title: "&aFrontiersman's Rune"
	quest.75D30FCED20A52EC.quest_desc: [
		"Collect &e9 magma blocks&r at lava lakes or in the basalt deltas and &e4 magma cream&r from the bouncing &6magma cubes&r."
		""
		"Magma cream is the ingredient for the &6Potion of Fire Resistance&r, four of them make a magma block. Nine magma blocks go into the blast bricks of a blast furnace."
		""
		"On magma you burn yourself, unless you sneak."
	]
	quest.75D30FCED20A52EC.quest_subtitle: "Hot under your feet."
	quest.75D30FCED20A52EC.title: "&6Get magma"
	quest.75D70FBDCB7037BA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/botania_mana_void.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&e6 Livingrock&r and &e2 obsidian&r. All mana that flows into it disappears."
		""
		"Under a pool, the pool always accepts and destroys whatever no longer fits. That way Endoflames keep running instead of leaving coal lying around."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r In stage 2 a brass casing belongs under the pearl pool. Use a different pool for the void."
	]
	quest.75D70FBDCB7037BA.quest_subtitle: "A grave for surplus mana."
	quest.75D70FBDCB7037BA.title: "&6Build a Mana Void"
	quest.75E7A2290688BDB6.quest_desc: [
		"Jedes Auge craftest du um ein &6Enderauge&r herum, deshalb erst in Stufe 2. Geworfen fliegt es wie ein Enderauge zum nächsten Bauwerk seiner Art:"
		""
		"&eWüstenauge:&r verfluchte Pyramide. &eFluchauge:&r frostiges Gefängnis. &eAbgrundauge:&r versunkene Stadt. &eMechanisches Auge:&r alte Fabrik. &eSturmauge:&r Akropolis."
		"&eFlammenauge&r und &eMonströses Auge:&r brennende Arena und Seelenschmiede, beide im Nether. &eAuge der Leere:&r die zerstörte Zitadelle im End, Stufe 4."
		""
		"Rezepte und Bosse im Kapitel &cBosse der Oberwelt&r."
	]
	quest.75E7A2290688BDB6.quest_subtitle: "Acht Augen, acht Bauwerke. Stufe 2."
	quest.75E7A2290688BDB6.title: "&cFolge den Augen von Cataclysm"
	quest.75F863DBAD6CF428.quest_desc: [
		"Every school has a focus: &6emerald&r for Evocation, &6ender pearl&r for Ender, &6poisonous potato&r for Nature (eight potatoes around a poisonous one give four), &6Divine Pearl&r for Holy (gold ingot and amethyst shard shapeless) and &6Frozen Bone&r for Ice."
		""
		"{image:irons_spellbooks:textures/item/frozen_bone.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Frozen Bones&r are dropped by strays, the skeletons of the snowy regions, 0 to 3 each and more with Looting. There are some in the Mountain Tower and the Ice Spider Den too. One Frozen Bone gives 3 bone meal, so do not feed them all away."
		""
		"&6Blood Vial&r for Blood: put a cauldron on a campfire and put an animal inside, it gets boiled into blood. &6Bottle o' Lightning&r for Lightning: right click a &echarged creeper&r with an empty glass bottle."
		""
		"&cFire&r needs a &6blaze rod&r from the Nether and comes in stage 2. You can still read fire scrolls from chests. &5Eldritch&r needs echo shards and an assembled manuscript, all its spells are legendary: stage 4."
	]
	quest.75F863DBAD6CF428.quest_subtitle: "One item per school."
	quest.75F863DBAD6CF428.title: "&aCollect the Foci"
	quest.75FBB19CCF2204F0.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Werkzeugkasten&r: fasst große Mengen von &e8 verschiedenen&r Gegenständen und behält den Inhalt, wenn du ihn abbaust. Steht er in &e10 Blöcken&r Umkreis, holst du mit gehaltener &eAlt&r-Taste Dinge aus ihm in deine Hand, ohne ihn zu öffnen. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Zahnrad oben, Goldblech, Truhe, Goldblech in der Mitte, Leder unten. Ideal für Schraubenschlüssel, Brille und Baublöcke an der Fabrik. Gefärbt in 16 Farben."
	]
	quest.75FBB19CCF2204F0.quest_subtitle: "Create, Werkzeugkasten: acht Sorten, erreichbar aus 10 Blöcken."
	quest.75FBB19CCF2204F0.title: "Pack einen Werkzeugkasten"
	quest.761038536A3F396F.quest_desc: [
		"Draconic tier. Catalyst: the &6Wyvern Pickaxe&r. In eight injectors: &64 netherite ingots&r, &61 Wyvern Core&r, &62 Awakened ingots&r, &61 Draconic Energy Controller&r. Costs 32 million energy."
		""
		"Shovel, axe, hoe, sword and bow work the same from their Wyvern counterpart. Take the modules out first if you want to keep them."
	]
	quest.761038536A3F396F.quest_subtitle: "Wyvern becomes Draconic."
	quest.761038536A3F396F.title: "&d&lFuse a Draconic Pickaxe"
	quest.761A5ACAEE9A1588.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ae2_autocraft.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r iron in the corners, quartz glass at the top and bottom, two &6Precision Mechanisms&r left and right, a &6crafting table&r in the middle. Put it directly against the provider."
		""
		"The provider sends ingredients and recipe over, the assembler crafts and hands the result back. One provider can serve several assemblers around it. &6Acceleration Cards&r make it faster."
		""
		"On Kronwerke there is no autocrafting without Create."
	]
	quest.761A5ACAEE9A1588.quest_subtitle: "Crafting table recipes with no hands at all."
	quest.761A5ACAEE9A1588.title: "&a&lPut a Molecular Assembler next to it"
	quest.7621EE6A605A6664.quest_desc: [
		"&6Wooden slab&r, &6brass casing&r and &6Electron Tube&r on top of each other make the &6Clockwork Bearing&r. With rotation it turns the blocks in front of it by the time of day: an hour hand."
		""
		"In front of the hour hand you can place a second structure that turns as the minute hand. The two must not be glued together. Right click the bearing to start and stop the clock."
	]
	quest.7621EE6A605A6664.quest_subtitle: "The Clockwork Bearing."
	quest.7621EE6A605A6664.title: "&6Build a tower clock"
	quest.7626B4C894018396.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_elite_qio_dashboard.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Lead in the corners, ender pearls on the sides, a glass pane at the top, a Teleportation Core at the bottom."
		""
		"It shows everything in the network, with a search box and crafting windows. Give it the same frequency as the Drive Array."
	]
	quest.7626B4C894018396.quest_subtitle: "Your terminal with a crafting table."
	quest.7626B4C894018396.title: "&dSet Up a QIO Dashboard"
	quest.763F899230A030F8.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r drei &6Solar Cells&r oben, &6PCB&r, &6Compressed Iron Gear&r, &6PCB&r in der Mitte, unten &6Advanced Pressure Tube&r, &6Compressed Iron Block&r, Advanced Pressure Tube."
		""
		"Er braucht &efreien Himmel&r und arbeitet nicht nachts, nicht drinnen und nicht im Gewitter. Das Besondere: Er macht Wärme mit, und er läuft erst richtig, wenn er &eheiß&r ist. Volle Leistung bei &c350 °C&r, ab &c425 °C&r überhitzt er und geht kaputt. Dann reparierst du ihn mit Solar Cells."
		""
		"&eEinstellen:&r Heat Sinks und Heat Pipes nehmen Wärme weg, ein Vortex Tube kann welche dazugeben. Ziel ist ein Gleichgewicht knapp unter 425 Grad. Solange er still steht, hält er seine Temperatur von selbst."
	]
	quest.763F899230A030F8.quest_subtitle: "Luft aus Sonne, aber nur bei 350 Grad."
	quest.763F899230A030F8.title: "&6Bau einen Solar Compressor"
	quest.764EA189A25DEF29.quest_desc: [
		"The same shape, a &6Luminous Crystal Shard&r from salvaged &9Rare&r on top: two templates that turn gold gear into diamond gear at the Smithing Table with &e4 diamonds&r."
		""
		"So the path is stone or chain, then iron, then gold, then diamond. For a Rare sword made of gold it is almost always worth it."
	]
	quest.764EA189A25DEF29.quest_subtitle: "The template from Rare material."
	quest.764EA189A25DEF29.title: "&bUpgrade Affix Loot to Diamond"
	quest.7662608598D923AA.quest_desc: [
		"Build all four pieces of &6Cloggrum armor&r plus a &6Cloggrum Shield&r: &66 Cloggrum Ingots&r and a plank in the top middle."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r In stage 3 hostile mobs have &d70 percent&r more health, &d45 percent&r more damage and &d4&r extra armor points. Without full armor the bogs and catacombs get tight quickly."
	]
	quest.7662608598D923AA.quest_subtitle: "Helmet, chestplate, leggings, boots and a shield."
	quest.7662608598D923AA.title: "&7Wear Full Cloggrum Armor"
	quest.766D489304D08574.quest_desc: [
		"Mit &6Stufe 4 (Sternwerk)&r öffnet PneumaticCraft seine Waffenkammer: die &6Pneumatic Armor&r (Helm, Brustplatte, Hose, Stiefel) mit Upgrades für Jetboots, Nachtsicht, Blockscanner, Entity Tracker und das Hacken von Security Stations und Drohnen. Dazu die &6Minigun&r mit Munitionssorten und die &6Micromissiles&r."
		""
		"Bis dahin: Jede Drohne, die du jetzt programmierst, jedes Rohr, das du jetzt legst, läuft dann weiter. Und der Drohnen-Debugger im Helm wird dir zeigen, warum die eine Drohne von damals nie geflogen ist."
	]
	quest.766D489304D08574.quest_subtitle: "Rüstung, Minigun, Raketen."
	quest.766D489304D08574.title: "&dAusblick auf Stufe 4"
	quest.76750A841E948105.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Mana Diamonds&r and &e1 Mana Quartz&r on the altar, plus the runes Autumn and Air as catalysts. &d12,000 mana&r."
		""
		"&eWhat for:&r Vinculotus, in stage 3 the Loonium."
	]
	quest.76750A841E948105.quest_subtitle: "Catalysts: Autumn and Air."
	quest.76750A841E948105.title: "&5Make the Rune of Sloth"
	quest.7675E878710CEEC7.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6gold ingots&r at the top, two &6redstone&r at the bottom make one &6Electrum Ingot&r. The Foundry and Create's heated mixer make it from one gold and one redstone each."
		""
		"Electrum goes into Energy Pipes, the Foundry, the Powered Furnace, the Processing Unit and the laser."
	]
	quest.7675E878710CEEC7.quest_subtitle: "Gold and redstone become a conductor."
	quest.7675E878710CEEC7.title: "&eMake Electrum"
	quest.767C72971E325444.quest_desc: [
		"&dAccelerate&r (powered rail, sugar, clock): projectiles fly faster."
		"&dDecelerate&r (soul sand, cobweb, clock): projectiles fly slower."
		"&dGravity&r (Air Essence, 2 anvils, 3 feathers): blocks and creatures fall, with Extend Time double fall damage."
		"&dExchange&r (Manipulation Essence, block of emerald, 2 ender pearls): swaps blocks for the ones from your hotbar."
	]
	quest.767C72971E325444.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2 checklist: faster, slower, heavier."
	quest.767C72971E325444.title: "&dLearn the movement glyphs"
	quest.768C226660B1EF1E.quest_desc: [
		"A &6chest&r surrounded by &e8 Magebloom Fiber&r."
		""
		"Holds rings, amulets, charms and shards. Opens with a key from the hotbar or curio slot. With blaze powder it becomes the larger Spellcaster Bag from stage 2."
	]
	quest.768C226660B1EF1E.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: order for jewellery and charms."
	quest.768C226660B1EF1E.title: "&6Sew a Trinkets Pouch"
	quest.76A2A93DACC560B1.quest_desc: [
		"With &6stage 3&r the big relics open: the &6Tome of Alkahestry&r doubles iron, gold, diamonds and much more for redstone charge. The &6Rending Gale&r (Bat Wings, Eye of the Storm from a charged creeper, Void Tear) lets you fly, push mobs away and throw lightning in the rain."
		""
		"Plus the &6Emperor's Chalice&r as an endless water bucket, the &6Infernal Chalice&r, which stores lava and protects you from lava, and the &6Touchstone of Midas&r, which repairs gold tools with glowstone. All of them need a Void Tear, so put two aside already."
	]
	quest.76A2A93DACC560B1.quest_subtitle: "What Reliquary still holds back."
	quest.76A2A93DACC560B1.title: "&dOutlook on Stage 3"
	quest.76A6E2A8B8B40BBC.quest_desc: [
		"&6Iron Sheetmetal&r in the corners, &6redstone&r on the sides, a &6copper ingot&r in the middle make four &6Redstone Engineering Blocks&r."
		""
		"Almost every large multiblock has exactly one. A redstone signal on it stops the machine, the screwdriver turns that around."
	]
	quest.76A6E2A8B8B40BBC.quest_subtitle: "The control panel of every multiblock."
	quest.76A6E2A8B8B40BBC.title: "&7Build Redstone Engineering Blocks"
	quest.76A9E0596DD09F35.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_dynamic_tank.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Four steel around a bucket give four &6Dynamic Tanks&r, four of them around a circuit two &6Dynamic Valves&r. Build a hollow box, at least 3 by 3 by 3, walls also from Structural Glass."
		""
		"Pipes and tubes dock onto the valves. It holds one fluid or one gas, according to the server config &e350,000 mB of fluid&r per block of volume."
	]
	quest.76A9E0596DD09F35.quest_subtitle: "A multiblock for whole lakes."
	quest.76A9E0596DD09F35.title: "&9&lBuild a Dynamic Tank"
	quest.76AFF5CF4F2CAC9A.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Abras' Conjure."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6blaze rod&r, &6lava bucket&r, &6magma block&r, &6red nether bricks&r, &6soul campfire&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Afrit book, 180 seconds."
		""
		"It smelts everything in a tenth of the furnace time, without fuel. In the same pentacle: the &dAfrit Crystallizer&r (Gray Paste, lapis block, amethyst block, quartz block, dripstone block), which puts crushed blocks back together."
	]
	quest.76AFF5CF4F2CAC9A.quest_subtitle: "Smelting in a tenth of the time."
	quest.76AFF5CF4F2CAC9A.title: "&5Summon an Afrit Smelter"
	quest.76B04702E169C588.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_power_alternator.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Der &6Alternator&r entsteht in den Handwerkseinheiten aus Kupferspulen, Eisenblechen, einem &6Einfachen Steuerschaltkreis&r und Andesitlegierung. Eine Welle hinein, ein Kabel oder eine Maschine daneben, fertig."
		""
		"&eCrafts & Additions, Alternator:&r Brennstoff Rotation. Bei 256 RPM zieht er &d16 384 SU&r und macht &d360 FE/t&r (480 mal 0,75 Wirkungsgrad), bei 64 RPM entsprechend 4 096 SU und 90 FE/t. Puffer 5 000 FE, Abgabe bis 5 000 FE/t. Der &6Elektromotor&r ist der Rückweg: bis 480 FE/t rein, bis 256 RPM und 16 384 SU raus. Offen ab Stufe 2."
	]
	quest.76B04702E169C588.quest_subtitle: "Crafts & Additions, Alternator: 360 FE/t bei 256 RPM."
	quest.76B04702E169C588.title: "&6Mach aus Rotation Strom"
	quest.76B0AB0DFE921AAC.quest_desc: [
		"Kronwerke hat neben der Oberwelt &esieben Dimensionen&r. Eine ist von Anfang an offen, die anderen kommen mit den Stufen: &6Nether&r und &6Aether&r in Stufe 2, &6Undergarden&r und &6Otherside&r in Stufe 3, &6End&r, &6Eternal Starlight&r und das &6Reality Marble&r in Stufe 4. Der Twilight Forest ist nicht im Pack."
		""
		"Jede Quest hier ist ein Portal in drei Zeilen: wie du es baust, was drüben wartet, was du mitnimmst. Die Einzelheiten stehen im Kapitel der Dimension, hier steht nur, was du zum Losgehen brauchst."
		""
		"Darunter die Reihe &eReisen&r (Wegsteine, Teleporter, Züge, Chunks) und die Reihe &eKarte&r (Wegpunkte, Kompasse, Augen). Lies, hak ab, hol die Belohnung."
	]
	quest.76B0AB0DFE921AAC.quest_subtitle: "Jede Welt des Packs, jeder Weg dorthin, auf einen Blick."
	quest.76B0AB0DFE921AAC.title: "&6Dimensionen und Reisen"
	quest.76B2A47FC48E97A9.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6two blaze rods&r, middle &6Crimson Iron, magma cream, Crimson Iron&r, bottom &6two Crimson Iron&r: one ingot."
		""
		"&6Crimson Steel&r: &e2,400&r durability, speed &e15&r, +6 damage, Malleable V, Hard III."
		""
		"In the Alloy Forge, a block of Crimson Iron with two blaze rods and magma cream gives &ethree&r ingots."
	]
	quest.76B2A47FC48E97A9.quest_subtitle: "2,400 durability, speed 15."
	quest.76B2A47FC48E97A9.title: "&4Forge Crimson Steel"
	quest.76B6BE3C8FF63884.quest_desc: [
		"Next to the big mods the pack holds a dozen small ones that save a few minutes every day: a &6magnet&r, a &6collector&r for farms, &6claims&r and &6chunk loading&r, two maps, EMI, Jade, Ultimine, voice chat, your body after death, trash cans and a sort button for your inventory."
		""
		"This chapter goes through them one by one, with a line on how to use each. None of it is required, but whoever knows the &eMap&r and &eKnowledge&r sections gets through the rest of the book faster."
		""
		"Everything here is open from &estage 1&r. What comes in stage 2 is noted along the way."
	]
	quest.76B6BE3C8FF63884.quest_subtitle: "Small mods, big relief."
	quest.76B6BE3C8FF63884.title: "&6&lSet Up Your Everyday Life"
	quest.76C1C8012DCC11CD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Tempad&r opens with &estage 3&r. The device stores locations and opens a &6time door&r there, into other dimensions too. Every door costs &e1,000 chronons&r for 10 seconds, each additional second 10."
		""
		"Chronons are made by the &6Chronometer&r (one chronon every 36 ticks) or the &6Metronome&r as a block. The Tempad itself holds 6,000 chronons, so six doors."
		""
		"Until then waystones are enough, and whoever collects the material early builds their device on the first evening of stage 3."
	]
	quest.76C1C8012DCC11CD.quest_subtitle: "Doors through time, from stage 3."
	quest.76C1C8012DCC11CD.title: "&dRead What Tempad Can Do"
	quest.76C52AD80485F272.quest_desc: [
		"An open, flat field far from bases, no lava. &eProjectile, Lightning, Amplify&r, Linger fields and bows keep you at a distance."
		""
		"Glide or the Thread of Gliding help against ramming and dives. The tribute lies longer than normal loot, but pick it up at once."
	]
	quest.76C52AD80485F272.quest_subtitle: "Keep your distance, never into the spikes."
	quest.76C52AD80485F272.title: "&5Defeat the Chimera at Range"
	quest.76C7E94B78DE11C2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Lead&r in the corners, &6redstone&r at the top, &6flint&r left and right, a &6piston&r in the middle, a &6Coil Copper&r at the bottom (four copper, two iron)."
		""
		"It grinds ores, ingots and coal into dust, with power from your grid. NuclearCraft opens fully in &6stage 4&r. This chapter leads up to the first running fission reactor."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r With &6Nuclear Radiation&r uranium is radioactive, even in your inventory and in chests. Read the radiation section before you carry stacks of it around."
	]
	quest.76C7E94B78DE11C2.quest_subtitle: "NuclearCraft's grinder."
	quest.76C7E94B78DE11C2.title: "&a&lBuild a Manufactory"
	quest.76C895F54D4751D1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Inner rotor&r: 3 Awakened ingots, a Draconium Core, 2 Draconium Ingots. &6Outer rotor&r: the same with 3 diamonds. &6Rotor assembly&r: 2 inner, 2 outer rotors, a Wyvern Core, 2 Draconium Ingots."
		"&6Focus ring&r: gold, diamonds, 2 Wyvern Cores. &6Stabilizer frame&r: 6 iron, a Wyvern Core, an Awakened ingot."
		""
		"A reactor needs 4 stabilizers, so four of everything."
	]
	quest.76C895F54D4751D1.quest_subtitle: "What already works before the fight."
	quest.76C895F54D4751D1.title: "&6Build the Stabilizer Parts"
	quest.76C94E18EA44655A.quest_desc: [
		"All pieces are &6lead&r with dye: mask, gown and pants with orange, the boots with black. Pants like iron leggings, boots like iron boots, each with the dye in the middle."
		""
		"Each piece blocks part of the radiation, only all four together protect fully. The &6Dosimeter&r (lead in a cross around a redstone) shows with a right click how much you have already taken. The dose wears off again over time."
		""
		"Whoever wears the MekaSuit takes the Radiation Shielding Unit instead of the suit: Infused Alloy, a lead block, Module Base and HDPE."
	]
	quest.76C94E18EA44655A.quest_subtitle: "Four pieces of lead, one dosimeter."
	quest.76C94E18EA44655A.title: "&ePut On the Full Hazmat Suit"
	quest.76CD45A630DA66CA.quest_desc: [
		"Craft the &6Dictionary of Spirits&r shapeless from a &6book&r and &6Demon's Dream Seeds&r (they drop when breaking grass)."
		"Build a &6Sacrificial Bowl&r with it: &e5 Otherstone&r in a U shape. The bowl opens with &6stage 2&r."
		""
		"{image:occultism:textures/item/dictionary_of_spirits.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&5Occultism&r summons spirits: Foliot, Djinni, later Afrit and Marid. They crush ore, smelt, fell wood and carry items. The book shows every ritual and every pentacle, on request as a preview in the world."
		""
		"Spiritfire, Otherstone and the chalk ingredients (the quests on the right) already work in stage 1. Chalk, bowls and books of binding open with &6stage 2&r, Afrit and Marid with &6stage 3&r."
	]
	quest.76CD45A630DA66CA.quest_subtitle: "Spirits from the Otherworld work for you."
	quest.76CD45A630DA66CA.title: "&5&lOpen the Dictionary of Spirits"
	quest.76DFF95BF66289DB.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Hallowed Gold&r over a &6glass&r."
		""
		"Each jar holds a nearly unlimited number of arcana, but only one kind. Eight jars next to the altar keep your inventory free."
	]
	quest.76DFF95BF66289DB.quest_subtitle: "Order for the crystals."
	quest.76DFF95BF66289DB.title: "&7Fill Spirit Jars"
	quest.76EEF29F1CBC1249.quest_desc: [
		"Every log at the daisy becomes a &6Livingwood log&r. Every kind of wood works, including from other mods."
		""
		"From it you build Mana Spreaders (6 logs), twigs and the planks of the Open Crate. In stage 3 the elven portal needs another eight logs, so build up a supply."
	]
	quest.76EEF29F1CBC1249.quest_subtitle: "Wood that can carry mana."
	quest.76EEF29F1CBC1249.title: "&6Collect Livingwood"
	quest.76F04AA589DA5238.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6Blank Module&r and a &6piston&r, shapeless (or bow and arrow). A &6Sender Module Mk1&r."
		""
		"It sends one item from the buffer into a chest up to &e8 blocks&r away in the module's direction. The chest must lie exactly on the axis and the way must be clear, glass, fences and bars do not get in the way."
		""
		"Puller on one side, sender on the other: that is a hopper that jumps eight blocks."
	]
	quest.76F04AA589DA5238.quest_subtitle: "The Sender Module Mk1."
	quest.76F04AA589DA5238.title: "&eSend It On"
	quest.76F9B41791872AB2.quest_desc: [
		"&eBlueprint:&r five Blueprint Paper and two sticks, see EMI. The saw blade needs &efive&r material, plus a rod."
		""
		"The saw fells the whole tree at once. It costs durability per log."
	]
	quest.76F9B41791872AB2.quest_subtitle: "One cut, the whole tree falls."
	quest.76F9B41791872AB2.title: "&7Build a saw"
	quest.7701AFCD425DC02F.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_trains_schedule.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6Sturdy Sheet&r and &6paper&r make four &6Train Schedules&r. Add entries: &eTravel to Station&r, below it the condition for when it goes on."
		"{image:create:textures/item/schedule.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"With &eLoop Forever&r the schedule jumps back to the start. &eMine*&r matches every free station whose name starts with Mine. &eLimit Max Speed&r slows the train down on a section."
	]
	quest.7701AFCD425DC02F.quest_subtitle: "It runs while you are somewhere else."
	quest.7701AFCD425DC02F.title: "&6Write a schedule"
	quest.7708120107D7E9FC.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r a &6smooth stone slab&r on top, &6glass&r in the middle, otherwise seven &6iron ingots&r. Place the &6Bottler&r directly next to the centrifuge, then the honey flows in by itself."
		""
		"Each &e250 mB of honey&r turns a glass bottle into a &6honey bottle&r and a honeycomb into a &6Honey Treat&r. Four honey bottles and a bucket give a &6Honey Bucket&r."
		""
		"&eHoney Generator:&r Honey Bucket, furnace and seven iron ingots. It burns &e2 mB of honey per tick&r for &d60 FE/t&r, so one bucket is 30,000 FE. Honey goes in by pipe, bottle, bucket or honey block."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A &6Feeding Slab&r flooded with honey gives the bees on it Regeneration."
	]
	quest.7708120107D7E9FC.quest_subtitle: "Bottles, treats and power from honey."
	quest.7708120107D7E9FC.title: "&6Bottle Honey"
	quest.7714EBDF3126946C.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6andesite&r and two &6iron nuggets&r (or zinc nuggets) diagonally across in the 2 x 2 grid make one &6Andesite Alloy&r."
		"{image:create:textures/item/andesite_alloy.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r By hand it stays at one alloy per recipe. The &6Mechanical Mixer&r makes &etwo&r from one andesite and one nugget, so four times as thrifty."
		""
		"Alloy turns into shafts, casings, funnels and almost everything else in this chapter."
	]
	quest.7714EBDF3126946C.quest_subtitle: "The heart of every machine in this stage."
	quest.7714EBDF3126946C.title: "&6Mix Andesite Alloy by hand"
	quest.771B84E15147F7F9.quest_desc: [
		"Let your quarry run for a while and collect what it brings. With a Void Module and a storage bus on the ME network only the ore lands in storage."
		""
		"You multiply raw ore best in Mekanism instead of just smelting it. How is in the Mekanism chapters."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r What counts at the obelisk is ingots. A quarry in an iron vein feeds the steel line for a long time."
	]
	quest.771B84E15147F7F9.quest_subtitle: "A quarry pays off."
	quest.771B84E15147F7F9.title: "&6&lFill the Ore Storage"
	quest.772585208CEF616C.quest_desc: [
		"Ein ME-Netz von &bApplied Energistics 2&r braucht ständig Strom für Kabel, Laufwerke und Konsolen. Setz einen &6Flux-Punkt&r an den &6Energieakzeptor&r, der macht aus 2 FE ein AE."
		""
		"Gib dem Punkt eine hohe Priorität. Ein ME-Netz ohne Strom zeigt nichts mehr an, und die Autocrafter stehen."
	]
	quest.772585208CEF616C.quest_subtitle: "Ein Punkt am Energieakzeptor."
	quest.772585208CEF616C.title: "&bVersorg dein ME-Netz"
	quest.772C50BEE6EBD80D.quest_desc: [
		"Werkbank, formlos: &6Gebratene Hammelkoteletts&r, &6Rote Bete&r, &6Gekochter Reis&r, &6Tomate&r und eine Schüssel. Koteletts schneidest du mit dem Messer aus Hammelfleisch und brätst sie im Ofen."
		""
		"{image:farmersdelight:textures/item/roasted_mutton_chops.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.772C50BEE6EBD80D.quest_subtitle: "14 Hunger, 21 Sättigung."
	quest.772C50BEE6EBD80D.title: "&6Richte Hammelkoteletts an"
	quest.772DD64D5BA1304B.quest_desc: [
		"No altar: &e8 Inferium Essence&r around wheat seeds in the crafting table."
		""
		"Inferium Seeds grow on any farmland. On Inferium Farmland there is a chance for a second seed."
	]
	quest.772DD64D5BA1304B.quest_subtitle: "One seed, one checkmark."
	quest.772DD64D5BA1304B.title: "Seed: Inferium"
	quest.7735E940D1430994.quest_desc: [
		"2 Manastahl im Elfenportal ergeben 1 &6Elementium&r, Werkzeuge mit Traumholzzweigen. Kapitel &aBotania: Alfheim&r."
		""
		"720 Haltbarkeit, Diamant-Abbaustufe. Spitzhacke vernichtet Bruchstein und Schutt, Schaufel nimmt ganze Kiessäulen, Axt köpft. Rüstung 15 wie Manastahl, ruft Feen gegen Angreifer."
	]
	quest.7735E940D1430994.quest_subtitle: "Botania: Werkzeuge mit Eigenheiten."
	quest.7735E940D1430994.title: "&dBau Elementium-Werkzeug"
	quest.773F88E559BA2FEA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Chicken Nest&r (hay bale between two planks) into the chicken pen, hopper below: the chickens lay into it. &6Cow in a Jar&r: place a milk jar, lure a cow onto it, drop an anvil on it. After that the jar gives &e1 mB of milk per tick&r."
		""
		"A bucket full every 50 seconds as long as the chunk is loaded, and the cooking table takes the milk straight from the jar."
		""
		"The nest is in the &6Food and Farming&r chapter, the cow in a jar in the &6Cooking&r chapter."
	]
	quest.773F88E559BA2FEA.quest_subtitle: "Eggs and milk without chasing after them."
	quest.773F88E559BA2FEA.title: "&6Nest for the chickens, jar for the cow"
	quest.7742956E268B3FA5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/enderio_cap_bank.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Iron in the corners, four &6Basic Capacitors&r on the sides, a &6block of redstone&r in the middle."
		""
		"The &6Basic Capacitor Bank&r holds &e500,000 µI&r. Several next to each other become one storage. Advanced holds 2 million, Vibrant 4 million, both also as an upgrade of the bank below them."
	]
	quest.7742956E268B3FA5.quest_subtitle: "Half a million µI of buffer."
	quest.7742956E268B3FA5.title: "&eBuild a Capacitor Bank"
	quest.7744C895CC8FF13B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_frame_simple.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"In the Dissolution Chamber: two &6Plastic&r, one &6Simple Frame&r, two &6netherite scrap&r, two &6gold ingots&r, one &6Diamond Gear&r and &e500 mB of Pink Slime&r."
		""
		"You smelt netherite scrap from Ancient Debris in the Nether. The Ore Laser Base, Mob Crusher, Mob Duplicator, Washing Factory and the enchanting machines need this frame."
	]
	quest.7744C895CC8FF13B.quest_subtitle: "Frame tier 3, with Pink Slime."
	quest.7744C895CC8FF13B.title: "&6Build an Advanced Machine Frame"
	quest.7748B438A49E28C1.quest_desc: [
		"Now everything together: kill a monster whose drops you want, freeze the spirit with the &6Vengeance Focus&r and let a &6Box of Eternal Closure&r swallow it. Box into the &6Spirit Furnace&r, blood from the &6Sanguinary Pedestal&r with it, done."
		""
		"&eWhat pays off:&r A &6blaze&r spirit delivers blaze rods and with them blaze powder for all the brass in the stage goal. An &6enderman&r spirit delivers ender pearls for the Mana Pearls. A &6wither skeleton&r spirit drops a skull now and then, without anyone running through the fortress."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Both goals of stage 2, brass and Mana Pearls, depend on blaze powder and ender pearls. A spirit kitchen with two boxes supplies the tech and the magic side at the same time."
	]
	quest.7748B438A49E28C1.quest_subtitle: "A mob farm that never needs a refill."
	quest.7748B438A49E28C1.title: "&5&lCook the First Spirit"
	quest.7748E47A81152158.quest_desc: [
		"&6Space Chamber:&r a Machine Frame, glass on the sides, blue dye in the corners. With two ender pearls and two redstone torches one of them becomes the &6Space Chamber Controller&r. &6Space Chamber Card:&r bricks at the top and bottom, redstone, iron, redstone in the middle."
		""
		"Place the eight corners of a cuboid: seven space chambers and one controller. Sneak right click the controller with the card to remember the chamber, a right click into the air shows what is inside. Up to &e128&r blocks per side."
		""
		"With the card in the Builder, it copies or moves the contents to its target area. That way you move a workshop without breaking a single block by hand."
	]
	quest.7748E47A81152158.quest_subtitle: "Space chambers and the space card."
	quest.7748E47A81152158.title: "&5Move a Building"
	quest.7748E7ADE21A36AB.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6Dense Energy Cells&r around an &6Accumulation Processor&r."
		""
		"It holds as much as eight dense cells in one block. Spatial storage and the Reaction Chamber draw their power all at once, that is what it is for."
	]
	quest.7748E7ADE21A36AB.quest_subtitle: "12.8 million AE of buffer."
	quest.7748E7ADE21A36AB.title: "&eBuild a Superdense Energy Cell"
	quest.774DEEABA69B5920.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eternal_starlight_portal.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Right click the frame of Chiseled Voidstone with the &bOrb of Prophecy&r. Walk through."
		""
		"&eOver there&r it is always night. The most common are &6Nightfall Spiders&r and &6Lonestar Skeletons&r. Build yourself a bright, safe room at the portal. Beds work."
		""
		"&eA new orb:&r crafting table, &65 Blue Starlight Crystal Shards&r as a cross, &64 glass&r in the corners."
	]
	quest.774DEEABA69B5920.quest_subtitle: "The orb on the frame."
	quest.774DEEABA69B5920.title: "&b&lOpen the Portal"
	quest.77598B153AEA326C.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Herkulische Flux-Speicher&r (Herculean) fasst &d16 Millionen FE&r bei &d120.000 FE/t&r und öffnet mit &6Stufe 4&r. Der &6Gigantische Flux-Speicher&r (Gargantuan) fasst &d128 Millionen FE&r bei &d720.000 FE/t&r und kommt in &6Stufe 5&r."
		""
		"Beide baust du wie den einfachen, nur mit sechs Speichern der Stufe darunter statt der Flux-Blöcke. Der Strom der sechs wandert dabei in den neuen Block, nichts geht verloren."
		""
		"Bis dahin: Mehrere einfache Speicher im selben Netz addieren sich einfach."
	]
	quest.77598B153AEA326C.quest_subtitle: "Herkulisch in Stufe 4, Gigantisch in Stufe 5."
	quest.77598B153AEA326C.title: "&9Größere Speicher"
	quest.775C3E702F10EB4F.quest_desc: [
		"Fell &616 Lunar Logs&r. The tall Lunar trees stand in almost every forest."
		""
		"&eThe forest biomes:&r &6Starlight Forest&r, &6Starlight Dense Forest&r, &6Umbral Plains&r, &6Glimmer Scrubland&r, &6Scarlet Forest&r, &6Starlight Taiga&r and &6Torreya Forest&r."
	]
	quest.775C3E702F10EB4F.quest_subtitle: "The forests of the star world."
	quest.775C3E702F10EB4F.title: "&aFell Lunar Trees"
	quest.77663E309333E311.quest_desc: [
		"Die Kammer presst bei &e1 Bar&r &6Stein&r zu &6Druckstein&r (Baumaterial, vier davon ergeben Druckziegel), einen &6Goldbarren&r mit zwei Redstone zu einem &6Turbinenblatt&r und einen &6Milcheimer&r mit vier grünen Farbstoffen zu vier &6Schleimbällen&r."
		""
		"Bei &e1,5 Bar&r wird &6Weizen&r zu drei &6Mehl&r und vier Schneeblöcke zu Eis. Bei &e2 Bar&r werden vier Eis zu Packeis, bei &e2,5 Bar&r vier Packeis zu Blaueis."
		""
		"Und bei &e4 Bar&r werden acht &6Kohleblöcke&r zu einem &6Diamanten&r. Das sind 72 Kohle pro Diamant, teuer, aber ohne Graben. Dafür musst du nah an die 5-Bar-Grenze, also Sicherheitsventil nicht vergessen."
	]
	quest.77663E309333E311.quest_subtitle: "Stein, Mehl, Eis und Diamanten."
	quest.77663E309333E311.title: "&7Die ersten Kammerrezepte"
	quest.776B28B4DB8899BD.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &68 Starlight Flowers&r around an &6ender pearl&r make &616 Seeking Eyes&r. Right click opens a star map, where you choose a target. The eye floats ahead."
		""
		"Click it to get it back. It may break while doing so. Seekers, Thirst Walkers and Twilight Gazes drop eyes too."
	]
	quest.776B28B4DB8899BD.quest_subtitle: "Shows you structures and biomes."
	quest.776B28B4DB8899BD.title: "&dFollow a Seeking Eye"
	quest.77755AA99FCA7C11.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &64 green&r, &61 gray&r petal, &6Runes of Sloth, Gluttony and Envy&r, &6Redstone Root&r, &6Pixie Dust&r."
		""
		"For a lot of mana the Loonium summons loot as if from a dungeon. But each piece is carried by an especially strong monster you have to defeat first."
		""
		"If it stands in a large structure, such as a stronghold or a temple, it gives that structure's loot."
	]
	quest.77755AA99FCA7C11.quest_subtitle: "Treasure loot for mana, with guards."
	quest.77755AA99FCA7C11.title: "&6Plant a Loonium"
	quest.777579350670FC20.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Digital Miner&r from stage 3 only mines what is in its filter and leaves the rest. No hole, no frame."
		""
		"Recipe, filters and upgrades: chapter &dMekanism: Advanced&r. It knows no Fortune, so feed the ore back into the ore ladder."
	]
	quest.777579350670FC20.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism looks for ore specifically."
	quest.777579350670FC20.title: "&7Do You Know the Digital Miner?"
	quest.77882819D90B5AD5.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion."
		"&6Bowls:&r a &6wooden chest&r, &e2 leather&r, &6string&r, &6silver ingot&r."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book."
		""
		"A Foliot bends space a little in the &6Surprisingly Substantial Satchel&r. It holds much more than its size suggests."
	]
	quest.77882819D90B5AD5.quest_subtitle: "A bag that is bigger inside than outside."
	quest.77882819D90B5AD5.title: "&6Bind a Substantial Satchel"
	quest.77893C078BE17CDD.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Aviar's Circle."
		"&6Bowls:&r one &6oak, birch, spruce&r and &6jungle sapling&r each."
		"&cSacrifice:&r none. Start with the Foliot book."
		""
		"Throw &6Unstable Otherworld Saplings&r to it and it gives back &6Stable Otherworld Saplings&r. Anyone can fell their trees without the Third Eye, and they give stable saplings again."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Traders decay. After about &eone hour&r it is gone, so trade a stack right away."
	]
	quest.77893C078BE17CDD.quest_subtitle: "Stable saplings for everyone."
	quest.77893C078BE17CDD.title: "&dSummon the sapling trader"
	quest.779C60A79312779E.quest_desc: [
		"Not everyone wants to join the same team right away. For neighbours there are &eallies&r: in the team window (the &eMy Team&r button in the inventory) you find &eManage Allies&r. There you add players and remove them again."
		""
		"What allies may do in your chunks is set in your team's settings, such as breaking blocks or opening chests. That way your neighbour can supply your factory with ore without sharing your quests or your 500 chunks."
	]
	quest.779C60A79312779E.quest_subtitle: "Let friends into your chunks without sharing a team."
	quest.779C60A79312779E.title: "&6Take in allies"
	quest.77A44B861E5D9B45.quest_desc: [
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wear an affix item on \"},{\"text\":\"head, chest, legs and feet\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\" and hold an affix weapon in your hand. The rarity does not matter, Common is enough. That unlocks \"},{\"text\":\"Frontier\",\"color\":\"gold\"},{\"text\":\", then you have to activate it with \"},{\"keybind\":\"key.apotheosis.open_world_tier_select\",\"color\":\"yellow\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
		""
		"In Frontier &aUncommon&r drops 60 percent of the time, &9Rare&r 10, Common only 29. You get &e20 percent more luck&r and &e35 percent more experience&r, monsters get 4 armor points extra, and &cApothic Invaders&r show up."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Frontier also raises the limit of your enchanting table from level 30 to &e45&r. The Apothic Enchanting section builds on that."
	]
	quest.77A44B861E5D9B45.quest_subtitle: "Four armor pieces and a weapon with affixes."
	quest.77A44B861E5D9B45.title: "&a&lGear Up Fully: Frontier"
	quest.77A7D5A5A2260EED.quest_desc: [
		"At the table, &e160 points&r: the same recipe as Linger."
		""
		"Instead of a field a wall stands, which casts the rest of the spell on everything that passes through. The augments work as with Linger. &eWall, Ignite, Extend Time&r across a corridor."
	]
	quest.77A7D5A5A2260EED.quest_subtitle: "A wall made of magic."
	quest.77A7D5A5A2260EED.title: "&dLearn Wall"
	quest.77AC3082650EDE8D.quest_desc: [
		"&bIce&r means damage and control: those hit get slow and freeze. Common: &6Icicle&r (piercing ice bolt), &6Ray of Frost&r (beam, freezes instantly), &6Cone of Cold&r (hold: cone of cold), &6Ice Spikes&r (line of ice crystals out of the ground), &6Frostwave&r (wave of frost around you)."
		""
		"Focus: Frozen Bone, fully doable in stage 1."
		""
		"&cStage 2:&r Ice Tomb, Snowball, Blizzard, Frost Step, Ice Block, Summon Polar Bear. &cStage 3:&r Frostbite."
	]
	quest.77AC3082650EDE8D.quest_subtitle: "Icicle, Ray of Frost, Cone of Cold and more."
	quest.77AC3082650EDE8D.title: "&bCast an Ice Spell"
	quest.77C937122806F8F9.quest_desc: [
		"Five &6Electrum&r at the top and sides, a &6Magnetic Coil&r in the middle, at the bottom plating, &6Basic Generator&r, plating make the &6Lava Generator&r."
		""
		"It burns &6lava&r into &e64 RF/t&r, twice as much as the Basic Generator, buffer 100,000 RF. It needs &etwo cores&r. &6Sheol Fire&r from the refinery burns much longer than lava."
		""
		"With a Pump and a Fluid Pipe it runs without you."
	]
	quest.77C937122806F8F9.quest_subtitle: "64 RF per tick from lava."
	quest.77C937122806F8F9.title: "&cSet Up a Lava Generator"
	quest.77CD40382C9E4BEA.quest_desc: [
		"Two &6sandstone&r and two &6bricks&r crosswise make two &6Kiln Bricks&r. &e8&r are enough for the kiln."
		""
		"The Alloy Kiln is the cheapest multiblock of the mod and melts two metals into one."
	]
	quest.77CD40382C9E4BEA.quest_subtitle: "Enough for one Alloy Kiln."
	quest.77CD40382C9E4BEA.title: "&6Fire 8 Kiln Bricks"
	quest.77D0A9312611B7B3.quest_desc: [
		"Der &cLifestealer&r hat &e100 Lebenspunkte&r und Rüstung 16. Er läuft nachts umher und zeigt sein wahres Gesicht erst im Kampf. Sein Griff saugt dir Leben ab, halt ihn mit dem Schild auf Abstand."
		""
		"Er lässt &e3 bis 5 Lifestealer-Knochen&r fallen, 7 bis 10 Dunkelmetallstücke und 3 bis 5 &6Chaossamen&r. Zwei Knochen und ein &6Knochenherz&r (4 Knochen um einen verschmolzenen Knochen) ergeben das &6Dunkle Atrium&r: eine Stunde &eDunkler Schutz&r, der dich einmal vor dem Tod rettet."
		""
		"Chaossamen brauchst du auch für das Todestotem und um die Dunkelmetall-Vorlage zu vervielfachen."
	]
	quest.77D0A9312611B7B3.quest_subtitle: "Ein Mantel, darunter etwas anderes."
	quest.77D0A9312611B7B3.title: "&8Besiege den Lifestealer"
	quest.77DEC15445D078C1.quest_desc: [
		"Zwei Zwischenbosse bewachen die Gänge: &cWadjet&r, die Kobra (150 Lebenspunkte, 11 Schaden, ruft Sandstürme für 6 und Steinsäulen für 11), und der &cKobolediator&r (180 Lebenspunkte, Rüstung 10, 14 Schaden)."
		""
		"Wadjet lässt &e2 bis 4 Altmetallbarren&r fallen, der Kobolediator seinen &6Schädel&r, &e3 bis 5 Koboleton-Knochen&r und &e1 bis 3 Altmetallbarren&r."
		""
		"Daraus wird die &6Knochenreptil-Rüstung&r: Helm aus dem Kobolediator-Schädel, 2 Altmetall und 2 Knochen; Brustplatte aus 4 Altmetall und 4 Knochen. Härte 2,5 und Rückstoßwiderstand, ein guter Schritt vor dem großen Kampf."
	]
	quest.77DEC15445D078C1.quest_subtitle: "Die beiden Wächter der Pyramide."
	quest.77DEC15445D078C1.title: "&6Besiege Wadjet und den Kobolediator"
	quest.77E2BA7E6004DF15.quest_desc: [
		"In the mortar: &6Belladonna Flowers&r, &e3 Belladonna Berries&r, &6Sage&r."
		""
		"Crafted shapeless with a candle, the candle gets the effect &aGrowth&r. Burning, it lets plants nearby grow faster."
	]
	quest.77E2BA7E6004DF15.quest_subtitle: "Herbs for the candle."
	quest.77E2BA7E6004DF15.title: "&6Mix the Mindful Trance Blend"
	quest.77F0D85FF6203B4B.quest_desc: [
		"&dFuse&r (Manipulation Essence, Fire Essence, 3 blaze rods): mixes items like a mixer, takes fluids from tanks next to it."
		"&dPolish&r (Manipulation Essence, sandpaper): sands items. &dWhirl&r (Manipulation Essence, 3 Air Essences): a whirl like a fan, with water, torch, Smelt or hexing as processing."
		"&dCarve&r (Manipulation Essence, crafting table, cobblestone stairs, slab, wall): saws stone and wood into stairs. &dInsert&r (2 chests): puts items into containers. &dApply&r (Manipulation Essence, Brass Hand): uses your off hand item like a deployer."
	]
	quest.77F0D85FF6203B4B.quest_subtitle: "Ars Technica: tier 2 checklist."
	quest.77F0D85FF6203B4B.title: "&dLearn the Create glyphs"
	quest.77FEE5209B67A4B4.quest_desc: [
		"&61k&r: 8,128 of one kind. &64k&r: 32,512. &616k&r: 130,048. All three in stage 3, plus fluid cells (8 buckets per byte), chemical cells from Applied Mekanistics and FE cells from Applied Flux in the same sizes."
		"&664k&r: 520,192, an Ingot of the Skies in the component, stage 4. &6256k&r: 2,080,768, draconium, stage 4."
		"&6MEGA 1M&r and &64M&r: draconium and Accumulation Processor, stage 4. &6MEGA 16M&r to &6256M&r and the &6bulk cell&r: awakened draconium, stage 5."
		"Every cell, however large, has &e63 types&r. The large cells are in the chapter &bAE2: Advanced&r."
	]
	quest.77FEE5209B67A4B4.quest_subtitle: "What opens when, and what fits in."
	quest.77FEE5209B67A4B4.title: "&7Know every cell size"
	quest.780E0900D2373001.quest_desc: [
		"&e3 slabs&r on top, &e4 planks&r below as two legs, of mahogany, willow or witch hazel. That is the &6Altar&r."
		""
		"Put the Book of Shadows on it, then you read it standing. It displays other items. Burning candles nearby float around it."
	]
	quest.780E0900D2373001.quest_subtitle: "A lectern for your book."
	quest.780E0900D2373001.title: "&6Build an Altar"
	quest.782143834F309275.quest_desc: [
		"&6Enriched Iron&r with &e10 mB carbon&r gives &6steel dust&r. In the furnace it becomes a &6steel ingot&r, twice as fast in the Energized Smelter."
		""
		"Steel goes into every casing, cable and pipe. &eKronwerke:&r The stage 3 goal wants &e4,000 steel ingots&r. Steel from the Immersive Engineering blast furnace counts just the same."
		""
		"{image:mekanism:textures/item/ingot_steel.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
	]
	quest.782143834F309275.quest_subtitle: "Iron, carbon, carbon once more."
	quest.782143834F309275.title: "&8&lMake steel"
	quest.783B67721615934A.quest_desc: [
		"Kreuz zwei Fundstücke miteinander, immer mit &e5 Prozent&r: Blue Yonder und Firecracker ergeben &6Purple Spiral&r, Blue Yonder und Flickering Sun &6Rippling Willow&r, Firecracker und Flickering Sun &6Thunder Bolt&r, Blue Yonder und Soul Tree &6Water Wonder&r, Firecracker und Soul Tree &6Sparkle Cherry&r."
		""
		"Zweite Runde: Blue Yonder und Rippling Willow ergeben &6Time Traveller&r, Rippling Willow und Soul Tree &6Slimy Delight&r (Schleim aus der Rinde), Purple Spiral und Sparkle Cherry &6Night Fuchsia&r. Mit Black Ember aus Stufe 2: &6Cave Dweller&r und daraus &6Foggy Blast&r."
		""
		"Alle leuchten und sind feuerfest, Cave Dweller, Purple Spiral, Water Wonder und Blue Yonder lassen Blätter rieseln, Foggy Blast und Water Wonder sind durchscheinend. Der Thunder Bolt wächst als Blitzzacke. In Stufe 1 schaffst du Purple Spiral, Rippling Willow, Thunder Bolt und Time Traveller, der Rest wartet auf Soul Tree und Black Ember."
	]
	quest.783B67721615934A.quest_subtitle: "Zehn Bäume, die nur aus Fundstücken entstehen."
	quest.783B67721615934A.title: "&dZüchte die leuchtenden Hybriden"
	quest.783E5DE186B29C16.quest_desc: [
		"&6Create&r, &6Welle&r: trägt Drehkraft geradeaus, &6Zahnräder&r um die Ecke, &6Riemen&r über Abstand, das &6Getriebe&r in alle Richtungen. Belastung in Stresseinheiten, Tempo in Umdrehungen pro Minute, Brille zeigt beides. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"Zwei Andesitlegierungen übereinander ergeben acht Wellen, Welle und Brett ein Zahnrad. Großes Zahnrad auf kleines verdoppelt die Drehzahl."
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r Create Crafts and Additions macht mit &6Alternator&r Strom aus Drehkraft und mit dem &6Elektromotor&r Drehkraft aus Strom; seine &6Verbinder&r mit Kupferspule tragen 1 000 FE/t über 16 Blöcke, die großen 5 000 über 32."
	]
	quest.783E5DE186B29C16.quest_subtitle: "Create, Welle: Drehkraft von Rad zu Maschine."
	quest.783E5DE186B29C16.title: "Leg Wellen"
	quest.783E84F0CBE1A688.quest_desc: [
		"Reiter &eNetzwerkstatistik&r: Anzahl der Stecker, Punkte, Controller und Speicher, Energie-Eingang und -Ausgang pro Tick, der gesamte Puffer, der gespeicherte Strom und ein Verlauf der Änderung. &eAverage Tick&r zeigt, wie viel Rechenzeit dein Netz dem Server kostet."
		""
		"Steht beim Eingang weniger als beim Ausgang, leeren sich die Speicher, und die niedrigste Priorität fällt bald aus. Dann ist Zeit für einen weiteren Generator am Stecker."
		""
		"Im Reiter &eNetzwerkverbindungen&r steht jedes Gerät mit Ort, Priorität und Limit. Mit &eGegenstände auswählen&r bearbeitest du viele auf einmal oder trennst sie vom Netz."
	]
	quest.783E84F0CBE1A688.quest_subtitle: "Was rein, was raus, was übrig."
	quest.783E84F0CBE1A688.title: "&bSchau in die Statistik"
	quest.7842B08C47819192.quest_desc: [
		"&6Two paper&r, &6one plank&r, &6one stone&r, shapeless: &efour upgrade bases&r. A base with red dye gives four &6Red Cards&r."
		""
		"With the Red Card a tool breaks for good like in vanilla. Every upgrade is fitted at the &6smithing table&r with a &6stick&r as the template."
	]
	quest.7842B08C47819192.quest_subtitle: "The base plate for every upgrade."
	quest.7842B08C47819192.title: "&7Build upgrade bases"
	quest.784DBFC35B5250A4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_ores_foundry.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Wirf &6Rohes Erz&r in die &6Gießerei&r von Productive Metalworks (Lava im Tank, Heizspulen im Boden). Ein Rohes Erz gibt &e180 mB&r flüssiges Metall, ein Barren braucht 90 mB: &ezwei Barren&r."
		""
		"Ein Erzblock gibt sogar &e270 mB&r, drei Barren. Staub, Zerkleinertes von Create und Barren geben je 90 mB. Gegossen wird mit der Barrenform auf dem Gießtisch; Bau und Guss stehen im Kapitel &6Productive Bees&r."
		""
		"&eLohnt sich:&r in Stufe 2 als Verdopplung ohne Strom, mit Behutsamkeit als einzige Verdreifachung vor Stufe 3. Dafür gibt es keine Nebenprodukte wie Angereicherten Kohlenstoff, und schnell ist sie nur mit vielen Heizspulen."
	]
	quest.784DBFC35B5250A4.quest_subtitle: "Stufe 2: zwei Barren ohne Strom."
	quest.784DBFC35B5250A4.title: "&cSchmilz Erz in der Gießerei"
	quest.784FBE05FF45B4E4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hostile_networks_scaling.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Eine Kammer, ein Modell, fünf Simulationen pro Minute. Mehr geht nur mit &emehr Kammern&r, und das ist auch der Plan: Kammern sind billig, Modelle kopierst du nicht, aber zehn Zombie-Modelle sind zehnmal 98 Kills."
		""
		"&eBeispiel:&r Zehn Kammern mit Self-Aware-Zombies ziehen 1.280 FE/t, verbrauchen 50 Matrizen pro Minute und werfen 50 Overworld Predictions und 50 Zombie Predictions ab. Das sind an der Werkbank 100 Eisen pro Minute, im Fabrikator noch einmal 400."
		""
		"&eLogistik:&r Matrizen per Rohr oder Transporter in jede Kammer, beide Ausgänge in eine gemeinsame Kiste, die Kiste an die Werkbank-Automatik oder ans AE2-Netz. Eine Reihe Kammern an einer Wand, Flux Points dahinter, fertig."
	]
	quest.784FBE05FF45B4E4.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 3. So wird aus einem Chip eine Fabrik."
	quest.784FBE05FF45B4E4.title: "&d&lViele Kammern, ein Modell je Kammer"
	quest.78745BBBF2444F1F.quest_desc: [
		"The &6drilling machine&r stands over an ore vein, gets a drill and rotation and brings up raw ore as long as it turns. The veins are inexhaustible on Kronwerke."
		""
		"Setup and iron drill: chapter &6Create: Addons&r. This adds the stage 4 side."
	]
	quest.78745BBBF2444F1F.quest_subtitle: "Create Ore Excavation, ore without end."
	quest.78745BBBF2444F1F.title: "&7Do You Know the Drilling Machine?"
	quest.78797DEDDE728B9D.quest_desc: [
		"&eMade by:&r the Pressurized Reaction Chamber from bio fuel, water and hydrogen."
		"&eUsed by:&r the gas generator, and from stage 3 the substrate for HDPE."
	]
	quest.78797DEDDE728B9D.quest_subtitle: "From the Pressurized Reaction Chamber."
	quest.78797DEDDE728B9D.title: "&fEthene"
	quest.78899A6FB15511C3.quest_desc: [
		"Das &6Solar Panel&r braucht freien Himmel, der &6Thermo Generator&r steht auf Lava oder Magma und bekommt Wasser als Kühlmittel in den Tank. EMI zeigt unter Heat Sources, was als Wärmequelle zählt."
		""
		"&ePowah, Solar Panel und Thermo Generator:&r beide Starter &d20 FE/t&r, Basic 60, Hardened 100, Blazing 200, Niotic 400, Spirited 800. Das Solarmodul nur bei Tag, der Thermogenerator rund um die Uhr. Mit einer &6Lens of Ender&r sieht das Solarmodul durch Blöcke über sich. Offen ab Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.78899A6FB15511C3.quest_subtitle: "Powah, 20 bis 800 FE/t ohne Brennstoff."
	quest.78899A6FB15511C3.title: "&bLeg Solarmodule und Thermogeneratoren"
	quest.7891B0DA545DB8D6.quest_desc: [
		"&eRezept:&r sechs &6Wolle&r in zwei Reihen, darunter links ein &6Stock&r. Das ergibt eine &6Flagge&r in der Farbe der Wolle, alle 16 Farben gehen."
		""
		"Setz sie an eine Wand oder auf einen Pfosten, dort weht sie im Wind. Eine Reihe Flaggen in Teamfarbe macht deine Basis auf jedem Stream sofort erkennbar."
	]
	quest.7891B0DA545DB8D6.quest_subtitle: "Zeig, wem die Basis gehört."
	quest.7891B0DA545DB8D6.title: "&aHiss deine Flagge"
	quest.789E312149280497.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r &6Andesite Alloy&r on top, &6Diesel Engine&r between two &6brass sheets&r, &6polished blackstone slab&r at the bottom give the &6Modular Diesel Engine&r."
		""
		"It works like the normal engine, but you can &estack&r several on top of each other. Every block in the stack adds its capacity: one manages &e6,144 SU&r with biodiesel, 8,192 SU with diesel, four of them four times that, all at 96 RPM on one shaft. Each one eats its own millibucket per second, so plan the biodiesel line big enough."
		""
		"&eThis is how it becomes a power plant:&r sugar cane and wheat farm, Bulk Fermenter and press for oil, a mixer for biodiesel, a tank, and the engine stack on it. All without Blaze Burners, without coal, without a forest of water wheels."
		""
		"The &6Huge Diesel Engine&r with 224 RPM and up to 16,384 SU opens in stage 3."
	]
	quest.789E312149280497.quest_subtitle: "Modular engines, stacked."
	quest.789E312149280497.title: "&6&lThe Diesel Power Plant"
	quest.78C129DB3D7AD17D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Copper to Iron Tier Upgrade:&r &6four iron sheets&r from the Create press around a &6lever&r. Or directly in the grid: a barrel in the middle, eight iron ingots around it."
		""
		"&e54 slots&r, &etwo upgrade slots&r. Iron is the best in stage 1. Gold (81 slots, 3 upgrades) comes in stage 2, diamond (108, 4) in stage 3, netherite (132, 5) in stage 4."
	]
	quest.78C129DB3D7AD17D.quest_subtitle: "54 slots and a second upgrade slot."
	quest.78C129DB3D7AD17D.title: "Upgrade to iron"
	quest.78CC54AA23E35C46.quest_desc: [
		"&cStage 3:&r Industrial Foregoing with its plant and animal machines, the Mekanism &6Digital Miner&r, Ender IO, Applied Energistics as storage for every farm, Create Ore Excavation for ore veins, and in Botania the &6Orechid&r (stone to ore) and the &6Kekimurus&r."
		""
		"&cStage 4:&r the RFTools Builder and Quarry Plus for whole stretches of land, Mekanism Elite, the Mystical Agriculture Awakening Altar."
		""
		"Each of them has its own chapter as soon as the stage is open. Until then: everything here keeps running for the whole season."
	]
	quest.78CC54AA23E35C46.quest_subtitle: "The big machines, briefly named."
	quest.78CC54AA23E35C46.title: "&dOutlook: stage 3 and later"
	quest.78D3A72191B3BE31.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_addon_crop.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Five &6carbon fibre&r, one &6Processing Unit&r in the middle, at the bottom Motor, plating, Motor."
		""
		"Destroyers and lasers skip unripe plants, the laser with a Hunter Addon skips young animals too. A frame over the field, a Placer for the seeds: the farm is done."
	]
	quest.78D3A72191B3BE31.quest_subtitle: "The Destroyer becomes a farm."
	quest.78D3A72191B3BE31.title: "&aHarvest Only Ripe Crops with the Crop Filter"
	quest.78DA48D3B9D7F31C.quest_desc: [
		"An &6egg&r, &6sugar&r and &6lapis lazuli&r, compacted by the press over a basin, give the &6cake base&r. A &6Spout&r fills &b1,000 mB of liquid experience&r into it: the &6Enchanting Cake&r is done."
		"{image:create_enchantment_industry:textures/item/experience_cake.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"Give it to a Blaze Enchanter or Blaze Forger, and the blaze seethes: &esuper enchanting&r. The enchanter then goes up to &elevel 60&r instead of 30 and also makes treasure enchantments, the forger combines enchantments beyond the normal maximum level, even conflicting ones. In this state both only accept &6Super Enchanting Templates&r: pressed from a &6Super Experience Block&r, which lightning makes from an Experience Block."
		""
		"&cImportant:&r Super enchanting attracts lightning. Put a &6lightning rod&r next to it, otherwise the machine gets hit. A roof works too, but brings curses or repair costs."
	]
	quest.78DA48D3B9D7F31C.quest_subtitle: "Super enchanting up to level 60, with a lightning rod."
	quest.78DA48D3B9D7F31C.title: "&5Bake an Enchanting Cake"
	quest.78EBEBF019DB5F26.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Ring of Potential&r in the middle, &6source gem block&r, &e2 gold blocks&r, &5End Crystal&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"The &6Enchanter's Bangle&r has a chance to raise your spell damage, unreliably. Attuned to a school it becomes stable."
	]
	quest.78EBEBF019DB5F26.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: spell damage on your wrist."
	quest.78EBEBF019DB5F26.title: "&6Forge a Bangle"
	quest.78F5F9FDE623893B.quest_desc: [
		"Hold all six at the same time: &6Forgotten Battleaxe&r, &6Sword&r, &6Pickaxe&r, &6Axe&r, &6Shovel&r and &6Hoe&r."
		""
		"Each needs a Cloggrum part, a &6Smithing Template&r and a &6Forgotten Ingot&r. The tools mine Undergarden blocks &e1.5 times&r as fast."
	]
	quest.78F5F9FDE623893B.quest_subtitle: "All six Forgotten tools and weapons."
	quest.78F5F9FDE623893B.title: "&d&lComplete the Forgotten Arsenal"
	quest.79033C95CC1B09E6.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Altimeter&r and an empty &6map&r make a &6Slice Map&r. It shows the world as a cross section at the height where you open it, with all caves and tunnels."
		""
		"{image:supplementaries:textures/item/slice_map.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"It covers only a quarter of the area of a normal map. Open it at your mining level, then you see where you have already been."
	]
	quest.79033C95CC1B09E6.quest_subtitle: "A map for underground."
	quest.79033C95CC1B09E6.title: "&6Draw a Slice Map"
	quest.790C817E0454C62E.quest_desc: [
		"Find a small structure from &6Formations Overworld&r or &6Explorify&r and tick this off."
		""
		"&eFormations:&r huts, statues, wells, graveyards, ice palaces, a hobbit hole, meteorites. &eExplorify:&r mausoleums, farmsteads, desert shrines, signposts, a settlement in the dark forest and a pyramid in the badlands."
	]
	quest.790C817E0454C62E.quest_subtitle: "Formations Overworld and Explorify."
	quest.790C817E0454C62E.title: "&aCollect small finds"
	quest.79156144A7641C76.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_safety.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Ein &6Druckmesser&r oben, darunter ein &6Druckluftrohr&r zwischen zwei &6Hebeln&r ergeben das &6Sicherheitsventil&r (Safety Tube Module). Klick es an die Seite eines Rohrs."
		""
		"Steigt der Druck im Rohr auf &e4,9 Bar&r, bläst das Ventil Luft ab. Das Rohr platzt bei 5 Bar, der Kompressor ebenso, also sitzt es genau richtig. Abgeblasene Luft ist verbrannte Kohle, darum ist das Ventil die Notbremse und nicht die Regelung."
		""
		"&eDie Regelung:&r Ein &6Druckanzeige-Modul&r (Pressure Gauge Module: Druckmesser über einem Rohr zwischen zwei Redstone) gibt ein Redstone-Signal mit &eStärke 2 mal Bar&r, bei 3,5 Bar also 7. Damit schaltest du den Kompressor über seinen Redstone-Reiter ab, bevor das Ventil überhaupt anspricht."
		""
		"&cMerk dir:&r Jedes Rohr, jeder Kompressor und jede Maschine in diesem Kapitel hält 5 Bar. Später gibt es Rohre für 10 Bar, in Stufe 3 für 20."
	]
	quest.79156144A7641C76.quest_subtitle: "Ab 4,9 Bar zischt es, statt zu knallen."
	quest.79156144A7641C76.title: "&c&lSetz ein Sicherheitsventil"
	quest.7915DD4065879162.quest_desc: [
		"Like the Deposit Upgrade, only with a &6sticky piston&r on top."
		""
		"Backpack in hand, &esneaking right click&r on a chest, and whatever is in the filter moves into the backpack. Before building: pack torches, slabs and building blocks with one click."
	]
	quest.7915DD4065879162.quest_subtitle: "Fetches supplies from the chest."
	quest.7915DD4065879162.title: "Build a Restock Upgrade"
	quest.792BCE1DD1F2E8CE.quest_desc: [
		"Pflanz &6Ipe&r-Setzlinge (Teak und Schwarzeiche, im Markt für 2 Smaragde) und lass sie wachsen. Mit &e5 Prozent&r wächst statt des Ipe ein &6Weißer Ipe&r, dessen Blätter Setzlinge der neuen Art abwerfen. Aus Weißem Ipe wird so Rosa Ipe, aus Rosa Ipe Lila Ipe, immer 5 Prozent pro gewachsenem Baum."
		""
		"Dieselbe Mutation gibt es bei der &6Buche&r (wird zur &6Blutbuche&r), der &6Schlehe&r (&6Purpurschlehe&r) und der &6Purpur-Kreppmyrte&r (Rote, dann Tuscarora-, dann Moonlight-Magic-Kreppmyrte). Diese fünf Mutationen stehen für je 2 Smaragde im Markt, die drei Ipe-Farben nicht."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Knochenmehl zählt. Pflanz zwanzig Ipe in einer Reihe, dünge durch und schau, welcher aus der Reihe tanzt. Setzlinge gibt es nach dem Fällen aus den Blättern zurück."
	]
	quest.792BCE1DD1F2E8CE.quest_subtitle: "Jeder zwanzigste Baum wird eine andere Art."
	quest.792BCE1DD1F2E8CE.title: "&dLass einen Setzling mutieren"
	quest.792CAC6875EDC6E8.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: &67 Corporea Blocks&r, &61 ender essence&r, &61 redstone&r. That makes the &6Corporea Funnel&r."
		""
		"On a redstone signal it pulls an item from the network into the inventory below. A frame on the funnel decides which, its rotation the amount (1, 2, 4 up to 64)."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A funnel above a dispenser aimed at the portal delivers goods straight from storage into the trade."
	]
	quest.792CAC6875EDC6E8.quest_subtitle: "Items on a redstone signal."
	quest.792CAC6875EDC6E8.title: "&dBuild a Corporea Funnel"
	quest.792DA1D54E1CD7A8.quest_desc: [
		"Eternal Starlight öffnet mit dem End. &6Sensen&r aus Glacite oder Thermal Springstone sind eine eigene Waffenart, &6Hämmer&r lösen bei vollen kritischen Treffern einen Spezialangriff aus."
		""
		"Zubehör legst du wie in ein Bündel in die Waffe. Kapitel &bEternal Starlight&r. Der &6Netheritrucksack&r (120 Plätze, 7 Upgrades) kommt ebenfalls in Stufe 4."
	]
	quest.792DA1D54E1CD7A8.quest_subtitle: "Eternal Starlight: Sense und Hammer."
	quest.792DA1D54E1CD7A8.title: "&bBau eine Sternensense"
	quest.793882229B4D2AC6.quest_desc: [
		"&e/kw goals&r shows all goals and how far each pillar is. &e/kw top&r shows who has contributed the most so far."
		""
		"If you click the obelisk with something it does not need, it tells you in chat what it wants right now."
	]
	quest.793882229B4D2AC6.quest_subtitle: "Every pillar, every number."
	quest.793882229B4D2AC6.title: "&6Tip: /kw goals"
	quest.7949829C7CBC2052.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Wilden Horn&r in the middle, &6Air Essence&r, &e3 gold ingots&r and &e4 source gems&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"Inscribe a spell &ewithout a form&r at the table, for example &eHeal, Amplify&r. The horn casts it on you and every creature nearby. The longer you hold it, the bigger the range, fully charged it also gives you spell damage."
	]
	quest.7949829C7CBC2052.quest_subtitle: "Ars Elemental: one spell for the whole group."
	quest.7949829C7CBC2052.title: "&6Build the Enchanter's Horn"
	quest.79519058384B590D.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Geiger Counter&r shows the radiation around you, the &6Dosimeter&r your dose. The &6Hazmat suit&r protects at the reactor. You store excess waste in the &6Radioactive Waste Barrel&r, which breaks it down slowly."
		""
		"If a pipe leaks or a tank blows up, the radiation contaminates the area. A source of 1,000 Sv/h takes about ten hours to decay."
	]
	quest.79519058384B590D.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism radiation is on."
	quest.79519058384B590D.title: "&eMeasure the Radiation"
	quest.7952E48CECDB3BEC.quest_desc: [
		"Tip potion bottles into a cauldron (one bottle is &e250 mB&r) or brew up to &e2 buckets&r of potion at once in the heated cauldron."
		""
		"If a candle is in the dipper above a potion, it dips it &e3 times&r, &e100 mB&r per candle. Burning, it gives the effect to everyone nearby. The five quests below are the checklist of all candle potions."
	]
	quest.7952E48CECDB3BEC.quest_subtitle: "The cauldron brews and soaks."
	quest.7952E48CECDB3BEC.title: "&5Fill a potion into the cauldron"
	quest.797562CE942E1CCD.quest_desc: [
		"&6Infused Fabric Block:&r one &6Infused Fabric&r and &e7 wool&r in the water cauldron (250 mB), gives eight."
		"&6Broom Seat:&r Small Satchel, &e2 strings&r, &e3 leather&r, &e2 Infused Fabric Blocks&r in the water cauldron (500 mB)."
		""
		"The seat goes into the satchel slot. A second player can get on and fly along. If you sit alone, you sit on it and look ahead."
	]
	quest.797562CE942E1CCD.quest_subtitle: "Flying as a pair."
	quest.797562CE942E1CCD.title: "&6Build a broom seat"
	quest.798C4551585C1E96.quest_desc: [
		"&6Advanced Tier Installer:&r alloy in the corners, Advanced Control Circuits at the top and bottom, osmium left and right, a plank. Right click a basic factory."
		""
		"An advanced factory works on &efive&r items at once. Elite (7) and ultimate (9) come in stage 4."
	]
	quest.798C4551585C1E96.quest_subtitle: "Three slots become five."
	quest.798C4551585C1E96.title: "&a&lUpgrade a factory to advanced"
	quest.798C61E2D65E1512.quest_desc: [
		"&eMain item:&r an &6Edelwood Plank&r. &eOn the pedestals:&r &e4 Arcane Crystal&r and &e4 Spawner Scrap&r. &eEssences:&r 500 Aureal, 6,000 Blood, 10 Souls. The forge must be exactly tier 1."
		""
		"Afterwards it holds &e3,000 Aureal, 50 Souls, 15,000 Blood and 1,350 Experience&r, and the second enhancer slot opens. Tier 2 unlocks the Terrastomp Prism."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r &eForge tier 3&r (4 Arcane Crystal, 4 Deorum, 1,000 Aureal, 9,000 Blood, 50 Souls on a Chiseled Polished Darkstone) is locked until server &6stage 3&r, tiers 4 and 5 until stage 4."
	]
	quest.798C61E2D65E1512.quest_subtitle: "More room for essences, new rituals."
	quest.798C61E2D65E1512.title: "&c&lRaise the Forge to Tier 2"
	quest.799DA40238182256.quest_desc: [
		"Circle without cloth: &e2 diamond, 1 emerald&r. It creates a lake, each extension costs &d30 mana&r. Throw an &eenchanted sword&r in, and for &d5,000 mana&r &6Caliburn&r comes back."
		""
		"It has the damage of the old sword plus a bonus for the enchantments, and undead flee from it. The compendium explains Emrys, Nobu and Replica."
	]
	quest.799DA40238182256.quest_subtitle: "Power Consolidation."
	quest.799DA40238182256.title: "&6Pull the Sword from the Lake"
	quest.79A371DEA1A0E807.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Dark Gem&r on top and bottom, a &6glass&r in the middle, a &6Dark Metal Ingot&r from Born in Chaos left and right give a &6Dark Tank&r. It holds &e16 buckets&r and keeps its contents when you mine it."
		""
		"Put several tanks together in the crafting table, and they become one tank with the sum of all capacities. With Dark Blocks and iron blocks instead of gems and ingots you get a big tank right away."
		""
		"&eHandling:&r Right clicking the placed tank turns it purple, then it fills everything below it. Shift right clicking into the air with the tank in hand turns on Auto-Supply: it then fills every matching container you hold in your hand."
	]
	quest.79A371DEA1A0E807.quest_subtitle: "16 buckets in one block."
	quest.79A371DEA1A0E807.title: "&5Build a Dark Tank"
	quest.79A3A67D91E5D3CB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/eidolon_altar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Codex, chapter &eSigns&r: choose &5Wicked&r three times and sing in front of the altar with the effigy. That is the &5Dark Prayer&r."
		""
		"Each prayer works once a day and brings favor. In return your patron gives &bmana&r for chants, the altar's Power decides how much, its Capacity how much you hold."
	]
	quest.79A3A67D91E5D3CB.quest_subtitle: "Three times Wicked, once a day."
	quest.79A3A67D91E5D3CB.title: "&5Pray to the Dark Lord"
	quest.79AA3AB276C25FB6.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r The &6Wireless Transmitter&r is six enriched iron, an &6ender pearl&r in the top middle, a Machine Casing in the center, an Advanced Processor at the bottom. The &6Wireless Grid&r the same, only with a &6Grid&r instead of the casing."
		""
		"The Wireless Transmitter sits on the cable and reaches &e16 blocks&r, each &6Range Upgrade&r (five enriched iron, three ender pearls, an Upgrade) adds 8 blocks. It needs 16 FE/t. Several transmitters cover a whole base."
		""
		"&eLinking:&r Right click any block of the network with the Wireless Grid. It stores 1,000 FE, every opening and every grab costs 5 FE, and it charges in any charging slot for FE items. A key in the controls settings opens it without reaching for the hotbar."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The &6Portable Grid&r (enriched iron, two Grids, a Controller) takes a storage disk directly and needs no network at all. Good for a Nether trip."
	]
	quest.79AA3AB276C25FB6.quest_subtitle: "Storage in your pocket."
	quest.79AA3AB276C25FB6.title: "&d&lGo Wireless"
	quest.79AF3C572A89ADA2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Schlamm&r lebt in den Blühenden Höhlen und teilt sich beim Tod wie ein Schleim. Nur die &ekleinste Größe&r lässt &6Resonarium&r fallen, 0 bis 1 Stück, mit Plünderung mehr."
		""
		"Resonarium ist das einzige neue Metall der Anderwelt und der Weg zu Werkzeug und Rüstung, die dem Wärter standhalten. Sammle fleißig, eine Platte braucht vier."
	]
	quest.79AF3C572A89ADA2.quest_subtitle: "Die kleinsten lassen Resonarium fallen."
	quest.79AF3C572A89ADA2.title: "&aJage Schlamm"
	quest.79B0BDFCF9C0F6D6.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6coal&r or charcoal, two &6clay&r and a &6lava bucket&r give &e24&r paste. With &6Blaze Powder&r in place of lava (two coal, one clay, one Blaze Powder) it is 16, with no bucket at all."
		""
		"{image:powah:textures/item/dielectric_paste.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Powah&r opens with stage 3. Everything comes in tiers: &7Starter&r, &fBasic&r, &8Hardened&r, &6Blazing&r, &bNiotic&r, &aSpirited&r. &cNitro&r comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.79B0BDFCF9C0F6D6.quest_subtitle: "The base of everything in Powah."
	quest.79B0BDFCF9C0F6D6.title: "&b&lMix Dielectric Paste"
	quest.79B449CE3A34467F.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Machine Frame&r in the middle, &6bricks&r on the sides, &6paper&r in the corners."
		""
		"It makes one card out of several shape cards. You can add, subtract or intersect each shape, rotate and mirror it. A sphere minus a smaller sphere gives a dome, a cuboid minus a cylinder a round shaft."
	]
	quest.79B449CE3A34467F.quest_subtitle: "Combine shapes."
	quest.79B449CE3A34467F.title: "&7Build a Composer"
	quest.79CC4622D9CBF2B3.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6green dye&r over a &6Chunk Marker&r."
		""
		"In the window you set the area in every direction, up to &e256&r blocks away, without placing four Markers. You also set the machine's spot there. For the Chunk Destroyer it is the most comfortable way."
	]
	quest.79CC4622D9CBF2B3.quest_subtitle: "A marker for large areas."
	quest.79CC4622D9CBF2B3.title: "&9Build a Flexible Marker"
	quest.79D63CED3782198B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/deeper_darker_portal.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Geh durch das Portal. Drüben baut dir das Spiel ein Gegenstück aus Verstärktem Tiefenschiefer, &e6 breit und 3 hoch&r."
		""
		"&eWas anders ist:&r Die &5Anderwelt&r hat eine Decke und keinen Himmel, die Welt ist &e128 Blöcke&r hoch und es ist immer Mitternacht. Monster spawnen überall unter &eLichtlevel 7&r, also nimm Fackeln mit. &6Betten&r funktionieren."
		""
		"Ein Block hier ist ein Block in der Oberwelt, als Abkürzung taugt sie also nicht. Dafür liegen unter dem Sculk dieselben Erze wie zu Hause, siehe weiter unten."
	]
	quest.79D63CED3782198B.quest_subtitle: "Immer Mitternacht, immer eine Decke über dir."
	quest.79D63CED3782198B.title: "&5Geh hinüber"
	quest.79E463484896DE27.quest_desc: [
		"Jeder Spieler darf laut Server-Config bis zu &d5&r Netzwerke besitzen, und jedes Gerät gehört genau zu einem."
		""
		"Ein Beispiel: ein &6privates&r Netz für Reaktor und Fabrik, ein &6verschlüsseltes&r für Freunde, in das du nur einen Teil deines Stroms über einen eigenen Stecker abgibst. Was im zweiten Netz passiert, kann dein Hauptnetz nie leer saugen."
		""
		"Die Farbe hilft beim Auseinanderhalten: Gib jedem Netz eine andere."
	]
	quest.79E463484896DE27.quest_subtitle: "Getrennte Kreise, getrennte Regeln."
	quest.79E463484896DE27.title: "&eLeg ein zweites Netz an"
	quest.79EFB06B93DA8A64.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6deepslate&r around a &6Gem Dust&r give eight &6Gem-Fused Slate&r."
		""
		"Every sigil in this section and every spawner rune in the Apothic Spawners section is built from it. You have more than enough deepslate below Y 0, the Gem Dust is the bottleneck."
	]
	quest.79EFB06B93DA8A64.quest_subtitle: "The raw material of all sigils."
	quest.79EFB06B93DA8A64.title: "&8Make Gem-Fused Slate"
	quest.79F94B4509AF8F33.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r &64 steel ingots&r in the corners, &64 stone&r on the sides, &61 ender pearl&r in the middle. That makes the &6Catalyst&r."
		""
		"{image:undergarden:textures/item/catalyst.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The &2Undergarden&r is a dark dimension full of mushrooms, rotspawn and new ores. It is open from &estage 3&r."
	]
	quest.79F94B4509AF8F33.quest_subtitle: "The key to the Undergarden."
	quest.79F94B4509AF8F33.title: "&2&lBuild the Catalyst"
	quest.7A069A8E373778AB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_blaze_burner.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Right click a &6blaze&r with the empty burner in hand, right at the spawner in the fortress too. You are holding a &6Blaze Burner&r."
		""
		"Under a basin it only smoulders. With furnace fuel (coal, wood) it is &cheated&r, with a &6Blaze Cake&r &csuperheated&r for a while. A funnel or an arm feeds it."
	]
	quest.7A069A8E373778AB.quest_subtitle: "The Blaze Burner heats for you."
	quest.7A069A8E373778AB.title: "&6Catch a blaze"
	quest.7A075AC786522F42.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe:&r three &6wool&r vertically on top of each other. A &6Sleeping Bag&r from Comforts, dyed like a bed with dye."
		""
		"Put it down, and you lie down in it right away. It only works &eat night&r and does &enot&r move your spawn point. So your bed at home stays your home."
		""
		"Using it also keeps &6phantoms&r away, just like a bed."
	]
	quest.7A075AC786522F42.quest_subtitle: "Skip the night wherever you are."
	quest.7A075AC786522F42.title: "&6Sew a Sleeping Bag"
	quest.7A096582D8DC418E.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nether_welcome.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eDas Portal:&r Das am Spawn teilen sich alle, ein eigenes an der Basis geht ab Stufe 2 wie gewohnt."
		""
		"&eDrüben:&r Lohenruten für den Lohenbrenner, Netherquarz, Leuchtstein, Magma, Netherwarze, Antiker Schrott. Jeder Block im Nether zählt oben wie &eacht&r, ein Portal pro Basis macht den Server klein."
		""
		"&eMitnehmen:&r einen &6Goldhelm&r gegen die Piglins, einen &6Schild&r gegen Ghasts, Bruchstein für Brücken, ein zweites Feuerzeug. &cKein Bett.&r Alles Weitere im Kapitel &cDer Nether&r."
	]
	quest.7A096582D8DC418E.quest_subtitle: "Zehn Obsidian und ein Funke. Stufe 2."
	quest.7A096582D8DC418E.title: "&cBau ein Netherportal"
	quest.7A0A6746756EA2D4.quest_desc: [
		"Oritech öffnet in Stufe 3. Der &6Jetpack&r fliegt mit Strom oder Turbofuel, mit Turbofuel schneller. Die &6Exo-Rüstung&r: Stiefel ohne Fallschaden, Hose mit mehr Tempo, Brust lädt deine Stromgeräte."
		""
		"&6Exo-Jetpack&r und &6Jetpack-Elytra&r kombinieren beides. Kapitel &eOritech&r."
	]
	quest.7A0A6746756EA2D4.quest_subtitle: "Oritech: Jetpack mit Strom oder Turbofuel."
	quest.7A0A6746756EA2D4.title: "&ePut On the Exo Armor"
	quest.7A0AD641B6612345.quest_desc: [
		"Eight &6vegetable soups&r, eight &6beef stews&r and eight &6fried rice&r."
		""
		"With that, every evening in the mine lasts to the end. Continue in the &6Cooking&r chapter: kitchen, botany pots and the best dishes."
		""
		"In stage 2, &6Create Central Kitchen&r connects the kitchen with Blaze Burner, Mechanical Arm and Deployer."
	]
	quest.7A0AD641B6612345.quest_subtitle: "Cooking for the whole base."
	quest.7A0AD641B6612345.title: "&6&lFill the pantry"
	quest.7A167C2F59DD7CF9.quest_desc: [
		"Any &6Alchemical Salt&r and a &6water bucket&r, shapeless: &6Crystallized Water&r. With a lava bucket: Crystallized Lava."
		""
		"In the accumulator the crystal dissolves back into &e1,000 mB&r of water or lava."
	]
	quest.7A167C2F59DD7CF9.quest_subtitle: "A bucket of water to take along."
	quest.7A167C2F59DD7CF9.title: "&7Crystallize Water"
	quest.7A199D43CFB76F94.quest_desc: [
		"Four reactor blocks of the tier below in the corners, four capacitors of the new tier on the sides (Basic: Large), one &6uraninite&r in the middle, gives four. For one reactor 36 again."
		""
		"&eFE/t:&r Starter 250, Basic 1,000, Hardened 2,500, Blazing 10,000, Niotic 25,000, Spirited 100,000. Nitro with 500,000 comes in stage 4."
	]
	quest.7A199D43CFB76F94.quest_subtitle: "Four old blocks, four new ones."
	quest.7A199D43CFB76F94.title: "&8Upgrade the reactor"
	quest.7A24D44A10ADC82D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pickup&r picks up, &6Magnet&r pulls in, &6Filter&r controls what hoppers may put in, &6Deposit&r empties into chests, &6Restock&r fetches from chests, &6Refill&r tops up the hotbar."
		"&6Void&r deletes, &6Feeding&r feeds, &6Crafting&r and &6Stonecutter&r craft, &6Smelting&r, &6Smoking&r, &6Blasting&r and their auto versions cook, &6Compacting&r presses together."
		"&6Tank&r and &6Pump&r for fluid, &6Battery&r for power, &6XP Pump&r for experience, &6Anvil&r and &6Smithing Table&r to take along, &6Jukebox&r plays records, &6Tool Swapper&r picks the tool."
		"&6Stack upgrades&r: Starter 1.5 times and I twice from stage 1, II four times from stage 2, III eight times from stage 3, IV sixteen times from stage 4. Advanced upgrades open in stage 2, &6Inception&r and &6Everlasting&r in stage 3."
	]
	quest.7A24D44A10ADC82D.quest_subtitle: "One line per upgrade."
	quest.7A24D44A10ADC82D.title: "Know every backpack upgrade"
	quest.7A2522FC4249AE38.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Crushed Dark Gems&r in the corners, four &6iron ingots&r on the sides give the &6Vengeance Ring&r. If you carry it in your inventory, you see &dVengeance Spirits&r: purple ghosts that sometimes appear when a monster dies."
		""
		"The spirits follow you and deal a little damage on contact, then they dissolve. Shift right click arms the ring: you get buffs, but it attracts and provokes all spirits within 10 blocks. Most of them are distorted swarms with no recognizable creature."
		""
		"&eProtection:&r A &6Burning Gem Stone&r (a Dark Block in the furnace) in your inventory turns spirit damage into hunger. A Burning Gem Stone plus a Dark Stick give 4 &6Gemstone Torches&r, which stop spirits from appearing within 15 blocks."
	]
	quest.7A2522FC4249AE38.quest_subtitle: "Make the spirits visible."
	quest.7A2522FC4249AE38.title: "&dBuild a Vengeance Ring"
	quest.7A2C3C1B2D4AD7BE.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/industrial_laser.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Fluid Laser Base:&r like the Ore Laser Base, only with &6buckets&r instead of iron ore. A &6Purple Laser Lens&r inside, a Laser Drill next to it, a &cwither&r directly below."
		""
		"Each operation gives &e10 mB of Ether Gas&r. You hold the wither in place with a Stasis Chamber. The same base drills lava in the Nether with an Orange Lens, and oil for PneumaticCraft above ocean or desert with a Black Lens."
	]
	quest.7A2C3C1B2D4AD7BE.quest_subtitle: "A Fluid Laser Base above a wither."
	quest.7A2C3C1B2D4AD7BE.title: "&5Drill Ether Gas from a Wither"
	quest.7A2D3C0D4467764D.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Küchenverbinder&r (drei Stein oben, sechs Terrakotta darunter) verbindet Küchenblöcke wie eine Theke, nur ohne Lager. Setz eine Reihe davon zwischen die Teile deiner Küche."
		""
		"So stehen Kühlschrank, Spüle und Backofen dort, wo sie Platz haben, und der Kochtisch sieht trotzdem alles. Auch eine Küche über zwei Räume geht."
	]
	quest.7A2D3C0D4467764D.quest_subtitle: "Theken müssen sich nicht berühren."
	quest.7A2D3C0D4467764D.title: "&6Führ die Küche um die Ecke"
	quest.7A34F474AD47630C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_ore_line.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Chest with iron, transporter to the &6Infusing Factory&r with carbon (enriched iron), on to the second Infusing Factory (steel dust), on to the Smelting Factory, then into the chest. Auto eject everywhere, power by cable."
		""
		"An Enrichment Chamber in front turns coal into Enriched Carbon. The ore line from the &5Mekanism: Ore Step by Step&r chapter supplies the iron."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r Hook a chest to the end. What you carry from it to the obelisk counts for you towards the 4,000 steel ingots of stage 3."
	]
	quest.7A34F474AD47630C.quest_subtitle: "Iron in, steel out, without lifting a finger."
	quest.7A34F474AD47630C.title: "&5&lBuild the steel line"
	quest.7A3A77EE8D5A8C2D.quest_desc: [
		"Pure Daisy, generating flowers, Mana Spreaders, Mana Pools. In stage 1 up to the pool, enough for the Mana Diamonds in the Source Keystone."
	]
	quest.7A3A77EE8D5A8C2D.quest_subtitle: "Flowers that make mana."
	quest.7A3A77EE8D5A8C2D.title: "&aOpen Botania"
	quest.7A3EB4D902822D91.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_brass_incomplete.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"A &6brass sheet&r on the belt. Deployer 1 inserts a &6cogwheel&r, deployer 2 an &6Electron Tube&r, deployer 3 an &6iron nugget&r, then a &6press&r stamps it."
		"{image:create:textures/item/incomplete_precision_mechanism.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r After that it is an &6Incomplete Precision Mechanism&r. It has to go &ethree rounds&r through the same line. Give each deployer only its part by filter."
	]
	quest.7A3EB4D902822D91.quest_subtitle: "Sequenced assembly, step by step."
	quest.7A3EB4D902822D91.title: "&6Send a sheet around once"
	quest.7A40E0852DB36EE6.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Gold and 1 Powdered Diamond&r on a cloth."
		""
		"{image:mahoutsukai:textures/item/scroll_mystic_staff.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"The scroll is bound to you. So for each staff one mage gives their own mana."
	]
	quest.7A40E0852DB36EE6.quest_subtitle: "The scroll for the staff."
	quest.7A40E0852DB36EE6.title: "&6Draw Explosive Mana Condensation"
	quest.7A48340A39EAABA5.quest_desc: [
		"Draconium Ingots in the corners, &6diamond axes&r at the top and bottom, Draconium Cores left and right, a Module Core in the middle. Also fuse a &6Wyvern Axe&r like the pickaxe, with a diamond axe in the core."
		""
		"Holding right click on a tree fells it completely. The module reaches &e16 blocks&r and manages &e5 blocks per second&r. It takes leaves along if you set it to."
	]
	quest.7A48340A39EAABA5.quest_subtitle: "The Wyvern Tree Harvester for the axe."
	quest.7A48340A39EAABA5.title: "&dFell Whole Trees"
	quest.7A558B0499746957.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6Starbuncle Shards&r in the middle, &e4 gold ingots&r on the pedestals. Put the &6charm&r on the ground and it appears."
		""
		"{image:ars_nouveau:textures/item/starbuncle_charm.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"It collects items from the ground, harvests Sourceberries and carries items from chest to chest. No Source, no food. A second charm on the same Starbuncle stacks it: it then carries several stacks."
	]
	quest.7A558B0499746957.quest_subtitle: "A delivery service on four paws."
	quest.7A558B0499746957.title: "&d&lSummon your own Starbuncle"
	quest.7A5C573A21DF9229.quest_desc: [
		"Top sourcestone, &6Source Gem&r, sourcestone. Below twice gold nugget, sourcestone, gold nugget."
		""
		"Right click puts an item down, an empty hand takes it back. The apparatus needs up to &e8&r of them, the chamber &e3&r for essences."
	]
	quest.7A5C573A21DF9229.quest_subtitle: "Small tables for ingredients."
	quest.7A5C573A21DF9229.title: "&aBuild Arcane Pedestals"
	quest.7A5F4B8283E4DEDC.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_ores_tripling.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Drei Leitungen, alle aus zwei &6Stahlbarren&r und einem Teil in der Mitte, immer acht Stück: &6Logistiktransporter&r mit Schaltkreis für Gegenstände, &6Druckschlauch&r mit Glas für Gase, &6Rohrleitung&r mit Eimer für Flüssigkeiten."
		""
		"&eWas wohin:&r Rohrleitung von der Pumpe zum Elektrolyseur (Wasser). Druckschlauch vom Elektrolyseur zur Klärkammer (Sauerstoff). Transporter von der Kiste zu Klärkammer, Zerkleinerer, Anreicherungskammer, Schmelzer und in die Kiste. Universalkabel an alles."
		""
		"&eDurchsatz der einfachen Stufe:&r Transporter 1 Gegenstand pro halbe Sekunde, Druckschlauch 750 mB/t, Rohrleitung 250 mB/t. Das reicht für Einzelmaschinen; Fabriken wollen später die fortschrittliche Stufe."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Leitungen verbinden sich mit allem Passenden daneben. Mit dem Konfigurator färbst du Transporter oder stellst eine Seite auf &eKeine&r, dann bleiben zwei Straßen getrennt."
	]
	quest.7A5F4B8283E4DEDC.quest_subtitle: "Transporter, Druckschläuche, Rohrleitungen."
	quest.7A5F4B8283E4DEDC.title: "&eVerlege die Leitungen"
	quest.7A660BD9E9B75D26.quest_desc: [
		"&dCauterize&r (Fire and Abjuration Essence, blaze powder, ghast tear): a little fire damage, in return it removes every effect that milk cures."
		"&dConflagrate&r (gunpowder, Fire Essence, Bombegranate, netherite scrap): burning targets explode and ignite others."
		"&dRage&r (Fire Essence, anima, Wilden Horn, red carpet, fermented spider eye): the target attacks everything nearby."
	]
	quest.7A660BD9E9B75D26.quest_subtitle: "Tier 3 checklist: Ars Elemental, fire."
	quest.7A660BD9E9B75D26.title: "&dLearn Ars Elemental's Fire Glyphs"
	quest.7A7A863777ED7392.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/storage_vault_big.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Two &6Iron Sheets&r around a &6barrel&r make an &6Item Vault&r. It holds &e20 stacks per block&r; vaults placed next to each other merge, up to 3 x 3 blocks across."
		""
		"Vaults have no screen. You fill and empty them with funnels, chutes, belts or packages."
	]
	quest.7A7A863777ED7392.quest_subtitle: "20 stacks per block."
	quest.7A7A863777ED7392.title: "&6Build an Item Vault"
	quest.7A7B18D3CF6E29F4.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Bowl of Promises&r from the tier 1 infuser, a &6gold block&r with &e40 buckets&r of blood in the infuser and an &6ender pearl&r give the &6Promise of Tenacity II&r."
		""
		"Tier 2 opens the recipes for the Spirit Furnace: &6Dark Brick&r plus 1 bucket becomes &6Dark Blood Brick&r, &6Undead Planks&r plus 1 bucket &6Reinforced Undead Planks&r for the Colossal Blood Chest. Plus rotten flesh into 8 spider eyes, cobblestone into netherrack and &6Dull Dust&r (sugar and gunpowder) into redstone."
	]
	quest.7A7B18D3CF6E29F4.quest_subtitle: "40 buckets of blood for a gold block."
	quest.7A7B18D3CF6E29F4.title: "&6Make a Promise of Tenacity II"
	quest.7A8DD7B14F4F4BEC.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Enchantment Library&r needs four &6ender chests&r, four infused shelves and an enchanting table. Ender chests need blaze powder, so it waits for the Nether in &estage 2&r. Collect enchanted books until then."
		""
		"You throw enchanted books into the library, every enchantment is stored as points. One click takes out one level, shift click as many as possible, and the book for it is made by itself. It remembers the highest level that ever went in and gives out level 16 (XVI) at most."
		""
		"&eFurther up:&r Deepshelves (Eterna 70) need infusion at Eterna 60, Sculkshelves (80) the Warden, Endshelves (90) dragon's breath from stage 4. The &6Library of Alexandria&r with level 31 is made by infusion at Eterna 100, so in Pinnacle."
	]
	quest.7A8DD7B14F4F4BEC.quest_subtitle: "Comes in stage 2, worth knowing now."
	quest.7A8DD7B14F4F4BEC.title: "&5The Enchantment Library"
	quest.7A90A5212D250C6C.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Watering Can&r in the middle, &e4 Inferium Ingots&r left, right, top and bottom, &e4 Mystical Fertilizer&r in the corners: the &6Inferium Watering Can&r is done."
		""
		"It waters &e5 by 5&r tiles with a &e30 percent&r chance per tick instead of 25. And it can water &eautomatically&r: shift and right click into the air toggles it, then it waters as long as you hold it and look at the field."
		""
		"&eTip:&r Stand in the middle of a 5 by 5 field with the can and let it run while you are in chat. Together with the accelerators below, the field is ripe in minutes."
	]
	quest.7A90A5212D250C6C.quest_subtitle: "Five by five, and it waters by itself."
	quest.7A90A5212D250C6C.title: "&bUpgrade the Watering Can"
	quest.7AA0054BCF710AF5.quest_desc: [
		"&6Mekanism&r, &6Einfache Rohrleitung&r: zieht &e250 mB pro Tick&r, Fortgeschritten 1 000 (Stufe 3), Elite 8 000 und Ultimativ 32 000 (Stufe 4). &6Flüssigkeitsbehälter&r: &e32 Eimer&r, dann 64, 128 und 256 Eimer, tragbar mit Inhalt. Kein Filter, Seiten mit dem Konfigurator. &eStufe 2.&r"
		""
		"Zwei Stahlbarren und ein Eimer ergeben acht Rohre. Siehe Kapitel Mekanism."
	]
	quest.7AA0054BCF710AF5.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism, Rohrleitung: 250 mB pro Tick, Tank 32 Eimer."
	quest.7AA0054BCF710AF5.title: "Lies: Mekanism-Rohre und -Tanks"
	quest.7AA8D39A5638B696.quest_desc: [
		"&dHex&r (Abjuration Essence, fermented spider eye, 3 blaze rods, wither rose): more damage under poison, wither or fire, half healing and mana regeneration."
		"&dWither&r (Abjuration Essence, 3 wither skeleton skulls): the wither effect."
		"&dRewind&r (Manipulation Essence, 3 clocks): sets a creature back to earlier places and health."
	]
	quest.7AA8D39A5638B696.quest_subtitle: "Tier 3 checklist: curses and time."
	quest.7AA8D39A5638B696.title: "&dLearn Hex, Wither and Rewind"
	quest.7AB490BEF1B45400.quest_desc: [
		"From Frontier on an &cApothic Invader&r now and then replaces a normal monster. A loud sound, a chat message and a beam of light show you where it is. Its name and the color of its outline give away the rarity."
		""
		"Every invader carries exactly one affix item of its rarity, with stronger affixes than usual, and drops it on death &eguaranteed&r. It then carries the invader's name in front. It drops gems more often than other monsters."
		""
		"&6Elites&r are named, strengthened monsters without a beam of light. They show up everywhere and can also drop affix items. Deep underground there are &ccages&r with a captured invader and chests around them, the cage opens when you come closer."
	]
	quest.7AB490BEF1B45400.quest_subtitle: "A beam of light in the sky means: loot."
	quest.7AB490BEF1B45400.title: "&cInvaders and Elites"
	quest.7ACBB7DA76C6A35E.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 iron, 1 ender&r. Creatures that want into the &e11 block&r radius land on the other side of the boundary. Blocks they would suffocate in are pushed away."
		""
		"A free space for the market or the workshop, without building walls."
	]
	quest.7ACBB7DA76C6A35E.quest_subtitle: "Whoever wants in lands outside."
	quest.7ACBB7DA76C6A35E.title: "&5Lay a Displacement Boundary"
	quest.7ADC78E21BD37CA2.quest_desc: [
		"Der Aether öffnet mit dem Nether. &6Handschuhe&r aus Leder, Eisen, Gold, Diamant oder Zanit im Schmuckslot geben Rüstungspunkte dazu."
		""
		"&6Zanit-Werkzeug&r wird schneller, je mehr es abgenutzt ist. &6Heiligstein&r wirft beim Graben Ambrosiumsplitter ab. Gravitit kommt in Stufe 3."
	]
	quest.7ADC78E21BD37CA2.quest_subtitle: "Aether: ein fünfter Rüstungsslot."
	quest.7ADC78E21BD37CA2.title: "&fZieh Handschuhe an"
	quest.7AF03DC556D8D94D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Taboo Book&r, &6Purified Ink&r, &6Awakened Feather&r and &e4 yellow dye&r make the &6Book of Binding: Afrit&r."
		"Then bind it shapeless with the &6Dictionary of Spirits&r, as with Foliot and Djinni."
		""
		"{image:occultism:textures/item/book_of_binding_bound_afrit.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&6Stage 3&r opens the two highest ranks: &cAfrit&r for great artefacts and strong possession, &9Marid&r as the strongest spirits of all. The Dictionary advises summoning Marid only in groups."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The magic goal of stage 3 wants &e150 Afrit Essences&r. Each one is a summoned and defeated Afrit. On top of that, two essences go into every &dElven Star&r."
	]
	quest.7AF03DC556D8D94D.quest_subtitle: "A name that burns."
	quest.7AF03DC556D8D94D.title: "&c&lBind an Afrit name"
	quest.7AF2762A098D411D.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6polished deepslate&r on top, a &6crying obsidian&r in the middle left, three more at the bottom (4 in total). You find crying obsidian at ruined portals in the Overworld."
		""
		"&eHow it works:&r Right click, then put in &6ink&r, &6paper&r and a &6focus&r. The focus decides the school, the ink the rarity. On the right appear all spells of the school that this ink allows. Click one, confirm, and the scroll has the lowest level of that rarity."
		""
		"With Common Ink you get every spell whose lowest level is common. Which ones those are is in the &eCommon Spells&r section. From stage 2 the Arcane Anvil then raises the scrolls higher with better ink."
	]
	quest.7AF2762A098D411D.quest_subtitle: "Ink, paper, focus: the spell you want."
	quest.7AF2762A098D411D.title: "&3&lBuild a Scroll Forge"
	quest.7AF598441903D9C7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Cold Aerclouds&r schweben als weiße Wolkenbänke zwischen &eY 32 und Y 96&r. Bau sie mit irgendeinem Werkzeug ab, mit Skyroot-Werkzeug fallen doppelt so viele. &6Zephyre&r lassen beim Tod 0 bis 2 davon fallen."
		""
		"Wer auf einer Cold Aercloud landet, nimmt keinen Fallschaden. Eine Lage unter deinem Bauplatz, und Stürze sind kein Thema mehr."
	]
	quest.7AF598441903D9C7.quest_subtitle: "Weiche Wolken, die jeden Sturz abfangen."
	quest.7AF598441903D9C7.title: "&fSammle Cold Aerclouds"
	quest.7AF997BBC949C119.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/theurgy_fermentation.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Fermentation Vat&r: copper, copper block, barrel, Sulfur. Click it with Sulfur, &6Sal Ammoniac Bucket&r and &6sugar&r or a crop, close it by sneaking with an empty hand."
		""
		"When it opens again, it is done. Quartz Sulfur becomes &6Common Gems Niter&r, which stands for a whole group."
	]
	quest.7AF997BBC949C119.quest_subtitle: "Sulfur becomes malleable."
	quest.7AF997BBC949C119.title: "&6Ferment Sulfur into Niter"
	quest.7B18B82463F286E4.quest_desc: [
		"At &e98 percent&r the obelisk takes nothing more. The team sets a date, all streamers go live, the last items go in together, and the next stage opens &efor everyone at once&r."
		""
		"You find out the date on &9Discord&r. Keep a small stock back so you can throw something in yourself at the finale."
	]
	quest.7B18B82463F286E4.quest_subtitle: "At 98 percent it stops until everyone is there."
	quest.7B18B82463F286E4.title: "&cBe there for the finale"
	quest.7B1EC7CE50CF798F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Bellethorne&r (3 red, 2 cyan petals, redstone root) next to the landing spot, a &6Mana Pool&r within 10 blocks: it hurts everything except players. Or an &6Encased Fan&r blowing through &clava&r onto the monsters: they catch fire."
		""
		"Both kill without experience. If you want levels, let the monsters land with half a heart and strike yourself. Hoppers or an andesite funnel on the floor collect the loot."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r The Bellethorne also hits villagers and pets. &cStage 2:&r crushing wheels, spawn fluid and the loot collector, see the right side."
	]
	quest.7B1EC7CE50CF798F.quest_subtitle: "A thorn or a hot wind instead of your sword."
	quest.7B1EC7CE50CF798F.title: "&cKill automatically"
	quest.7B2AA4ED5FBC6D2E.quest_desc: [
		"Auch der &8Wither&r (2.560 FE/t, ein &6Netherstern&r pro Vorhersage), der &3Warden&r (2.560 FE/t, Echo-Scherben, Sculk-Katalysatoren, das Herz der Tiefe) und der &5Enderdrache&r (4.096 FE/t, Drachenatem oder ein Drachenei) haben Modelle."
		""
		"Der Drache hat eigene Zahlen: 2 Kills bis Basic, 4 bis Advanced, 10 bis Superior, 20 bis Self Aware. Wither und Warden brauchen die üblichen 98. Das wird ein Serverprojekt für Stufe 4."
		""
		"&cDie Bosse von Cataclysm&r haben kein Datenmodell. Ihre Drops gibt es nur im Kampf, siehe Kapitel &cBosse der Oberwelt&r."
	]
	quest.7B2AA4ED5FBC6D2E.quest_subtitle: "Wither, Warden und Drache, aber nicht Cataclysm."
	quest.7B2AA4ED5FBC6D2E.title: "&cBosse als Modell"
	quest.7B30A0EAE22BB188.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6planks&r and one &6Andesite Alloy&r make a &6Hand Crank&r. Hold the right mouse button on it: it gives &d32 RPM&r and &d256 SU&r."
		""
		"Cranking makes you hungry. Good for testing a setup before the water wheel stands."
	]
	quest.7B30A0EAE22BB188.quest_subtitle: "Muscle power for trying things out."
	quest.7B30A0EAE22BB188.title: "&6Turn the hand crank"
	quest.7B4D78ECE0B99E9F.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Draconium Cores&r: Draconium Ingots in the corners, Deepsilver on the sides, diamond in the middle. They go into the injectors."
		""
		"So per fusion four cores, two Gaia ingots and one heart: seven injectors of the Wyvern tier."
	]
	quest.7B4D78ECE0B99E9F.quest_subtitle: "The ingredients for one fusion."
	quest.7B4D78ECE0B99E9F.title: "&9Prepare Four Draconium Cores"
	quest.7B71ACAFDA314EEF.quest_desc: [
		"Redstone, circuits, bowls and a Steel Casing. It turns any food into &6Nutritional Paste&r, &e50 mB&r per hunger point."
		""
		"You fill the &6Canteen&r (tin around a bowl) with it and drink on the way. Later there is a MekaSuit module for it."
	]
	quest.7B71ACAFDA314EEF.quest_subtitle: "Food from a tube."
	quest.7B71ACAFDA314EEF.title: "&aBuild a Nutritional Liquifier"
	quest.7B9CE2B18B64FD29.quest_desc: [
		"At the crafting table: a &6Wyvern Core&r in the middle, &64 Wyvern Energy Controllers&r on the sides, &64 Awakened ingots&r in the corners."
		""
		"Every Draconic tool and the chestpiece need one. Do not confuse it with the big Energy Core: its tier 8 wants 378 Awakened and 786 normal Draconium Blocks and stores without limit."
	]
	quest.7B9CE2B18B64FD29.quest_subtitle: "The battery for Draconic tools."
	quest.7B9CE2B18B64FD29.title: "&dBuild a Draconic Energy Controller"
	quest.7BA5A8754283846C.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/pneumaticcraft_advanced_frames.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r sieben &6Stöcke&r, ein &6Farbstoff&r in der Mitte und ein &6Logistics Core&r unten in der Mitte ergeben acht Rahmen. Der Core: acht &6Reinforced Brick Tiles&r um ein Redstone, ergibt zwei."
		""
		"Die Farbe bestimmt den Rahmen. &cRot, Passive Provider:&r bietet an, nur Anforderer holen ab. &5Lila, Active Provider:&r schiebt alles aktiv weg in Lager und Anforderer. &9Blau, Requester:&r fordert an, du stellst im Rahmen ein, wie viel vorrätig sein soll. &eGelb, Storage:&r nimmt von Active Providern an und gibt an Requester. &aGrün, Default Storage:&r wie Storage, aber zuletzt."
		""
		"Rahmen klebst du an jede Kiste oder jeden Tank, auch von anderen Mods. Rechtsklick mit dem Rahmen in der Hand oder mit dem &6Logistics Configurator&r (vier Compressed Iron, roter Farbstoff, Air Canister, Hebel) stellt Filter ein, Shift-Rechtsklick nimmt ihn ab."
	]
	quest.7BA5A8754283846C.quest_subtitle: "Rahmen an die Kiste, fertig ist das Netz."
	quest.7BA5A8754283846C.title: "&6Bau Logistics Frames"
	quest.7BB43D4C7CBA97B5.quest_desc: [
		"On top Bat Wing and &6eye of ender&r, in the middle &6Nebulous Heart&r, &6Void Tear&r, Bat Wing, at the bottom stick and Nebulous Heart give the &6Ender Staff&r. It stores up to &e250 ender pearls&r from your inventory."
		""
		"Shift mouse wheel switches the mode: &eCast&r throws a pearl, &eLong Cast&r throws farther, &eBind&r remembers a &6Wraith Node&r (Nebulous Heart plus emerald, placed as a block), &eNode Warp&r jumps there after 3 seconds of right click. Every jump costs a pearl."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r A Wraith Node at the edge of spawn, and the way to the obelisk takes three seconds."
	]
	quest.7BB43D4C7CBA97B5.quest_subtitle: "Throw pearls and jump home."
	quest.7BB43D4C7CBA97B5.title: "&5Build an Ender Staff"
	quest.7BBA588FE89BA602.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/enderio_smelter.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r Top gear, &6furnace&r, gear. Middle furnace, &6Void Chassis&r, furnace. Bottom iron ingot, a &6Brass Casing&r from Create, iron ingot. Capacitor in the slot."
		""
		"At the top of the window you pick the mode: alloying and smelting, alloying only, smelting only. In smelting mode it is an electric furnace. It draws &e20 µI/t&r, and µI is the same as FE."
	]
	quest.7BBA588FE89BA602.quest_subtitle: "Three ingredients in, one ingot out."
	quest.7BBA588FE89BA602.title: "&6&lBuild the Alloy Smelter"
	quest.7BD2437CE352E835.quest_desc: [
		"With &6Easy Anvils&r items stay in the anvil when you close the window. The &eToo Expensive&r limit no longer exists, renaming costs nothing and does not damage the anvil, and books cost half."
		""
		"A damaged anvil becomes whole again with an &6iron block&r in hand and a right click. You label a &6name tag&r without an anvil: sneak and right click."
		""
		"The &6crafting table&r keeps its ingredients too, and you see them lying on the table."
	]
	quest.7BD2437CE352E835.quest_subtitle: "Nothing falls out, nothing is too expensive."
	quest.7BD2437CE352E835.title: "&7Get to Know the New Anvil"
	quest.7BD585B291576480.quest_desc: [
		"Wirf &6Eisenbarren&r auf den Boden, stell &6TNT&r daneben und zünde es. Aus den Barren wird &6Druckeisen&r (Compressed Iron Ingot), etwa &e20 Prozent&r gehen dabei verloren. Ein Eisenblock wird genauso zu einem Druckeisenblock."
		""
		"{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/item/ingot_iron_compressed.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"&bPneumaticCraft&r arbeitet nicht mit Strom, sondern mit &bDruckluft&r in Bar. Kompressoren machen Luft, Rohre leiten sie, Maschinen verbrauchen sie, und wer zu viel Druck auf ein Rohr gibt, bekommt eine Explosion. Druckeisen steckt in fast jedem Rezept dieses Mods."
		""
		"&eWas in Stufe 2 offen ist:&r die Druckkammer, der Luft- und der Flüssigkeitskompressor, Öl und Raffinerie, Hitze, Kunststoff, Aufzug, Tür, Luftkanone, die Maschinen-Upgrades und die erste Platine."
		""
		"&cWas noch wartet:&r Die fortgeschrittenen Kompressoren, die Montagestraße, Drohnen und der Programmierer öffnen in &6Stufe 3&r. Die Druckluftrüstung und die Minigun kommen in Stufe 4."
		""
		"Sobald die Druckkammer steht, machst du Druckeisen ohne Verlust. Für den Anfang reichen ein paar gesprengte Barren."
	]
	quest.7BD585B291576480.quest_subtitle: "PneumaticCraft beginnt mit einem Knall."
	quest.7BD585B291576480.title: "&b&lSprenge Eisen zu Druckeisen"
	quest.7BE5B5BDC535A3FC.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &aBasic&r-Modell gibt &e4 Datenpunkte pro Kill&r und wird bei &e54 Datenpunkten&r zu &9Advanced&r. Das sind &e12 Kills&r nach Basic, insgesamt also 18."
		""
		"Die &eGenauigkeit&r (Accuracy) steigt dabei stufenlos: Basic beginnt bei 5 Prozent, Advanced bei 22 Prozent. Sie entscheidet später, wie oft eine Simulation eine echte Vorhersage abwirft."
	]
	quest.7BE5B5BDC535A3FC.quest_subtitle: "Zwölf weitere Kills."
	quest.7BE5B5BDC535A3FC.title: "&9Bring ein Modell auf Advanced"
	quest.7BE786BD2341276A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Casing&r in the corners, &6Plate Advanced&r at the top and bottom, two &6Basic Electric Circuits&r left and right, the &6Decay Hastener&r in the middle."
		""
		"It sits in the wall and shows cells, moderators, heat sinks and heat. The &6Fission Reactor Designer&r is not available: it needs an &cAnalyzer&r, and that has no recipe in this version. So plan in the controller."
	]
	quest.7BE786BD2341276A.quest_subtitle: "No controller, no reactor."
	quest.7BE786BD2341276A.title: "&b&lBuild the Reactor Controller"
	quest.7BF1D62BA4F855C9.quest_desc: [
		"Jeder Pflanztopf mit Setzling wirft bei jeder Ernte auch ein &6Blatt&r ab. Leite die Blätter in einen &6Komposter&r, und daraus wird &6Knochenmehl&r."
		""
		"Das Knochenmehl geht zurück an die Bäume: Sieben Stück machen ein Fruchtblatt reif, und Setzlinge wachsen damit schneller. So füttert die Plantage sich selbst."
	]
	quest.7BF1D62BA4F855C9.quest_subtitle: "Blätter aus dem Topf, Reife für den Baum."
	quest.7BF1D62BA4F855C9.title: "&aMach Knochenmehl aus Laub"
	quest.7C0F5741A161C056.quest_desc: [
		"Vierte Generation, zweiter Teil."
		""
		"&6Weißtanne&r: Balsamtanne + Gelbkiefer, 10 %"
		"&6Stachelannone&r: Zimtapfel + Banane, 10 %"
		"&6Süßer Holzapfel&r: Red-Delicious-Apfel + Zuckerahorn, 10 %"
		"&6Amberbaum&r: Europäische Lärche + Zuckerahorn, 10 %"
		"&6Sykomore&r: Esche + Zuckerahorn, 10 %"
		"&6Wenge&r: Balsa + Cocobolo, 10 %"
		"&6Gelbes Meranti&r: Ceylon-Ebenholz + Kapok, 10 %"
		"&6Zitronatzitrone&r: Silberlinde + Sauerkirsche, 5 %"
		"&6Dattelpalme&r: Papaya + Kakao, 5 %"
		"&6Purpur-Kreppmyrte&r: Ceylon-Ebenholz + Kirsche, 5 %"
		"&6Zebrano&r: Silberpappel + Ceylon-Ebenholz, 5 %"
	]
	quest.7C0F5741A161C056.quest_subtitle: "11 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.7C0F5741A161C056.title: "&aGeneration 4: Weißtanne bis Zebrano"
	quest.7C15F7F39DE06D46.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/alfheim_open.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eDas Portal:&r Ein aufrechter Rahmen aus &e8 Lebeholz&r und &e3 Schimmerndem Lebeholz&r, unten in der Mitte das &6Elfenportal-Herzstück&r, dazu &e2 Manabecken&r mit &6Naturapylonen&r im Umkreis von 5 Blöcken. Rechtsklick mit dem &6Stab des Waldes&r auf das Herzstück, das Öffnen kostet &d200 000 Mana&r."
		""
		"&eDrüben:&r niemand. Alfheim ist keine Dimension, die du betrittst. Du wirfst Ware hinein, die Elfen werfen Besseres zurück: Traumholz, Elementium, Feenstaub, Drachenstein. Jeder Tausch kostet 500 Mana."
		""
		"&cNiemals Brot hineinwerfen.&r Alles Weitere im Kapitel &aBotania: Alfheim&r."
	]
	quest.7C15F7F39DE06D46.quest_subtitle: "Ein Portal, durch das nur Waren gehen. Stufe 3."
	quest.7C15F7F39DE06D46.title: "&aÖffne das Tor nach Alfheim"
	quest.7C1C3006C7CEECAC.quest_desc: [
		"Hover over an item, in your inventory or in the list on the right, and press &eR&r for its recipes or &eU&r for everything you can make with it. &eEsc&r or backspace takes you back."
		""
		"The &esearch field&r is at the bottom middle. &e@create&r shows only things from Create, &e#ingots&r everything with the ingots tag. In the recipe window the &e+&r button puts the ingredients straight into the crafting table if you have them with you, with Shift a whole stack at once."
		""
		"At the top of the recipe window there are tabs: crafting table, furnace, mixer, infuser, Mana Pool. Every machine in the pack has its own tab, and the arrows switch between several recipes."
	]
	quest.7C1C3006C7CEECAC.quest_subtitle: "EMI: R, U and the search."
	quest.7C1C3006C7CEECAC.title: "&eLook Up a Recipe"
	quest.7C3566938FD7F3EF.quest_desc: [
		"Deactivate the core, raise it one tier with &eTier Up&r in its window, turn on &eToggle Build Guide&r and place the blocks: &66 Draconium Blocks&r, one on each side of the core."
		""
		"&eStorage:&r &e273,000,000&r energy."
	]
	quest.7C3566938FD7F3EF.quest_subtitle: "6 blocks, 273 million."
	quest.7C3566938FD7F3EF.title: "&cCore Tier 2"
	quest.7C3B104A734F0E17.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/oritech_reactor.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Reactor Walls&r (steel, plating, nickel) as a cuboid, the &6Controller&r in one wall, right click assembles it. Inside &6rods&r (plastic over two Energite), above each rod a &6Fuel Port&r in the roof, outside an &6Energy Port&r."
		""
		"Rods make heat. &6Heat Vents&r draw it off, &6Heat Absorbers&r below a &6Coolant Port&r with ice cool everything around them. All inner layers have to look the same."
		""
		"&cWarning:&r Above &e2,000 heat&r it melts down after 30 seconds, the safe mode is off on the server. Start with one rod and four vents."
		""
		"Each Energy Port puts out up to &e25,000 RF/t&r, the buffer holds 50 million. The checklist &ePower&r compares it with other power plants."
	]
	quest.7C3B104A734F0E17.quest_subtitle: "A box, a rod, a lot of cooling."
	quest.7C3B104A734F0E17.title: "&a&lBuild a Nuclear Reactor"
	quest.7C41D3EAD74E25C0.quest_desc: [
		"Vierte Generation, erster Teil. Ab hier nur noch durch Züchten."
		""
		"&6Beliy-Naliv-Apfel&r: Golden-Delicious-Apfel + Granny-Smith-Apfel, 10 %"
		"&6Schwarzkirsche&r: Ceylon-Ebenholz + Sauerkirsche, 10 %"
		"&6Korkeiche&r: Lawson-Zypresse + Eiche, 10 %"
		"&6Holunder&r: Espe + Erle, 10 %"
		"&6Salweide&r: Silberweide + Espe, 10 %"
		"&6Hasel&r: Espe + Buche, 10 %"
		"&6Hainbuche&r: Esche + Mehlbeere, 10 %"
		"&6Pandanus&r: Walnuss + Kokospalme, 10 %"
		"&6Kochbanane&r: Banane + Teak, 10 %"
		"&6Regenbogeneukalyptus&r: Balsa + Rosen-Eukalyptus, 10 %"
		"&6Rote Banane&r: Banane + Kapok, 10 %"
		"&6Eberesche&r: Espe + Erle, 10 %"
	]
	quest.7C41D3EAD74E25C0.quest_subtitle: "12 Kreuzungen, ein Haken pro gezüchteter Art."
	quest.7C41D3EAD74E25C0.title: "&aGeneration 4: Beliy Naliv bis Eberesche"
	quest.7C4E1A4E6B2CA48A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Great Fairy Ring&r (Pixie Dust, 4 Elementium): summons a fairy more often when you are hit."
		"&6Ring of Far Reach&r (Rune of Pride, 4 Elementium): about 3 blocks more reach."
		""
		"The relics Ring of Thor, Loki and Odin only come from the Dice of Fate from Gaia II, stage 5."
	]
	quest.7C4E1A4E6B2CA48A.quest_subtitle: "Two rings of Elementium."
	quest.7C4E1A4E6B2CA48A.title: "&6Wear the Elven Rings"
	quest.7C4F838C1079AFFB.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/mekanism_infuser.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r top iron, furnace, iron. Middle redstone, &6osmium ingot&r, redstone. Bottom &6Manasteel&r, furnace, &6Manasteel&r."
		""
		"It presses an &einfusion type&r (carbon, redstone, later diamond and obsidian) into an item. That makes steel, alloys and circuits. It needs &d20 FE/t&r, which the Heat Generator supplies right away."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r An infusion type stays in the tank until it is used up. To switch, you empty it with the button under the bar."
	]
	quest.7C4F838C1079AFFB.quest_subtitle: "The first machine, the heart of Mekanism."
	quest.7C4F838C1079AFFB.title: "&9&lBuild the Metallurgic Infuser"
	quest.7C68B4CD2CADFA5A.quest_desc: [
		"Nimm das &6Model Framework&r in die Hand und &eklick mit rechts auf einen lebenden Mob&r. Im Chat steht dann &aSuccessfully constructed a ... Data Model&r, und du hältst ein &6Datenmodell&r für genau diese Mobart."
		""
		"Leg das Modell in den &6Deep Learner&r. Es startet als &8Faulty&r mit null Daten. Ab jetzt bringt jeder Kill dieser Mobart Daten, solange der Learner bei dir ist."
		""
		"&eVarianten zählen mit:&r Wüstenzombies und Dorfbewohnerzombies füllen das Zombie-Modell, Eiswanderer und Sumpfskelette das Skelett-Modell. Steht im Chat &cNo known models exist&r, gibt es für diesen Mob kein Modell. Die Liste steht im Abschnitt darunter."
	]
	quest.7C68B4CD2CADFA5A.quest_subtitle: "Rechtsklick, und der Chip kennt sein Ziel."
	quest.7C68B4CD2CADFA5A.title: "&a&lRichte das Gerüst auf einen Mob"
	quest.7C8684CA4CF6D896.quest_desc: [
		"&dCavitate&r (Water Essence, heart of the sea, pufferfish, sponge): a target in a bubble implodes, damage in the area."
		"&dWater Jet&r (Water and Manipulation Essence, prismarine shard, Wilden Spike, breeze rod): pierces the nearest target and ignores armor."
		"&dOxidize&r (Water, Air and Abjuration Essence, oxidized copper): lowers the target's armor."
	]
	quest.7C8684CA4CF6D896.quest_subtitle: "Tier 3 checklist: Ars Elemental, water."
	quest.7C8684CA4CF6D896.title: "&dLearn Ars Elemental's Water Glyphs"
	quest.7C955614AFE47EC9.quest_desc: [
		"&e9 Dunkelmetallstücke&r ergeben einen &6Dunkelmetallhaufen&r, und der wird im &6Schmelzofen&r zum &6Dunkelmetallbarren&r. Einzelne Stücke werden im Schmelzofen zu Nuggets, neun Nuggets sind ein Barren."
		""
		"Jede Waffe braucht einen &6Knochengriff&r: Knochen, Dunkelmetallnugget und eine &6Dunkelrute&r übereinander. Dunkelruten (1 bis 2) lässt der &cDunkle Wirbel&r fallen, ein schwebender Geist mit 35 Lebenspunkten."
		""
		"&6Geschärftes Dunkelmetallschwert&r (2 Barren, Griff): mehr Schaden gegen Untote. &6Große Schnitteraxt&r (4 Barren, 2 Griffe): jeder Kill in Folge steigert deine Raserei, bis fünfmal. Den &6Schädelbrecher&r (Sprungangriffe betäuben) lässt nur der Skelett-Drescher fallen, und das sehr selten."
		""
		"Die &6Dunkelmetall-Rüstung&r braucht Netheritrüstung und eine Vorlage, die etwa jeder zwanzigste Chaosritter fallen lässt. Das ist Stufe 2."
	]
	quest.7C955614AFE47EC9.quest_subtitle: "Neun Stücke, ein Haufen, ein Barren."
	quest.7C955614AFE47EC9.title: "&8Schmilz Dunkelmetall"
	quest.7C973B72686966B2.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/enderio_soul_binder.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Three &6Fused Quartz&r as a bowl, a &6Soularium Ingot&r on top: the &6Soul Vial&r."
		""
		"Right click a mob to put it inside, right click the ground to let it out. Players and bosses do not work."
	]
	quest.7C973B72686966B2.quest_subtitle: "A mob fits into a bottle."
	quest.7C973B72686966B2.title: "&dCatch a Mob in the Vial"
	quest.7CA531D29134EB9C.quest_desc: [
		"&6Draconium Ingots&r in the corners, &6redstone blocks&r on the sides, a &6Draconium Core&r in the middle."
		""
		"{image:draconicevolution:textures/item/components/wyvern_energy_core.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"It goes into the Energy Core (two), the Mob Grinder, the relay crystals and every Wyvern tool. Make more than you think."
	]
	quest.7CA531D29134EB9C.quest_subtitle: "The heart of every battery."
	quest.7CA531D29134EB9C.title: "&cBuild Wyvern Energy Controllers"
	quest.7CA7370EEC499DF0.quest_desc: [
		"Let the latex processing run until &e16 Dry Rubber&r are done."
		""
		"Each piece costs 750 mB of latex. At 1 to 4 mB per extractor operation the extractor is the bottleneck, not the machine. More extractors on acacia or mangrove, more rubber."
	]
	quest.7CA7370EEC499DF0.quest_subtitle: "The step before plastic."
	quest.7CA7370EEC499DF0.title: "&eMake Dry Rubber"
	quest.7CB343338207B5C7.quest_desc: [
		"&e5 wool&r and &e1 petal&r make the &6Flower Pouch&r. It holds a stack of Mystical Flowers of every colour and collects new ones automatically."
		""
		"In your main hand it collects nothing. A sneaking right click on a chest empties it into the chest."
	]
	quest.7CB343338207B5C7.quest_subtitle: "Every colour in one inventory slot."
	quest.7CB343338207B5C7.title: "&6Sew a Flower Pouch"
	quest.7CCBE9415D2A60EF.quest_desc: [
		"Top Ultimate Control Circuit, Configurator, Ultimate Control Circuit, middle HDPE, &6Atomic Disassembler&r, HDPE, bottom polonium, Induction Cell, polonium."
		""
		"Pickaxe, axe, shovel, hoe and sword on power. Modules for mining speed, Silk Touch, Fortune and vein mining. The Teleportation Unit needs antimatter from stage 5."
	]
	quest.7CCBE9415D2A60EF.quest_subtitle: "One tool for everything."
	quest.7CCBE9415D2A60EF.title: "&bBuild the Meka-Tool"
	quest.7CCC047D427FE194.quest_desc: [
		"In Silent Gear's &6Alloy Forge&r an &6Azure Silver block&r, &62 gold ingots&r and an &6ender pearl&r make three &6Azure Electrum Ingots&r."
		""
		"{image:silentgear:textures/item/azure_electrum_ingot.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Azure Electrum is another metal for tool heads and armor. EMI shows what it can do on the ingot, you build the parts as always (chapter &6Silent Gear&r)."
	]
	quest.7CCC047D427FE194.quest_subtitle: "Silent Gear's best metal in stage 4."
	quest.7CCC047D427FE194.title: "&3Alloy Azure Electrum"
	quest.7CCF7BFE0317C5A6.quest_desc: [
		"&6Tier 1:&r pedestal stabiliser, copper block, blaze powder, Spirit Attuned Gem (Eziveus). &6Tier 2:&r tier 1, silver block, ghast tear, 2 gems (Strigeor)."
		"&6Tier 3:&r tier 2, gold block, Totem of Undying, Spirit Attuned Crystal, Afrit Essence (Sevira's Permanent Confinement)."
		"They point at the matrix, at most &e5 blocks&r away, in a straight line."
		""
		"Each stabiliser adds: tier 1 &e64 types&r and 512,000 items, tier 2 &e128&r and 1,024,000, tier 3 &e256&r and 2,048,000. You bind tier 4 with a Marid (Uphyxes Inverted Tower)."
	]
	quest.7CCF7BFE0317C5A6.quest_subtitle: "More room in the storage."
	quest.7CCF7BFE0317C5A6.title: "&6Build storage stabilisers"
	quest.7CCFA741053E0FE5.quest_desc: [
		"&aFlourishing log&r, &6Mendosteen&r, &6Earth Essence&r."
		""
		"Places fully grown oaks and birches in a round 7x7 area and fertilises. Each Source Gem as an addition gives +1 radius, a brown mushroom makes taiga, glow berries jungle. Mendosteen grows on archwood trees."
	]
	quest.7CCFA741053E0FE5.quest_subtitle: "A forest in minutes."
	quest.7CCFA741053E0FE5.title: "&aMake the Overgrowth tablet"
	quest.7CD7F18DC4EE3DD4.quest_desc: [
		"&6Willow&r grows in swamps, &6Mahogany&r in the jungle and bamboo jungle, &6Witch Hazel&r in the birch forest. Fell 8 logs each of willow and mahogany."
		""
		"Each kind becomes a broom of its own. You need the planks for Altar, Coffer, crow flute and courier depots. Take saplings along."
	]
	quest.7CD7F18DC4EE3DD4.quest_subtitle: "Willow, mahogany and witch hazel."
	quest.7CD7F18DC4EE3DD4.title: "&2Fell witch wood"
	quest.7CE20D6AEEE1AA89.quest_desc: [
		"Apothecary: &62 red&r, &62 white&r, &61 pink&r petal, &6Rune of Pride&r, &6Rune of Greed&r, &6Redstone Root&r, &6Pixie Dust&r."
		""
		"With mana it gradually turns &enetherrack&r near it into Nether ores. It only works in the &cNether&r, so bring pools and spreaders."
	]
	quest.7CE20D6AEEE1AA89.quest_subtitle: "Nether ores from netherrack."
	quest.7CE20D6AEEE1AA89.title: "&6Plant an Orechid Ignem"
	quest.7CE5BA05B419B715.quest_desc: [
		"&6Distiller&r: a copper block with three iron ingots over three stone, on the brazier. Click it with almost anything."
		""
		"One Raw Iron gives five shards, ten cobblestone or three crops give one. You need one shard per ingot. All devices also take input by hopper."
	]
	quest.7CE5BA05B419B715.quest_subtitle: "Energy, crystallized."
	quest.7CE5BA05B419B715.title: "&6Distill Mercury Shards"
	quest.7CEC6A06FD70C26D.quest_desc: [
		"Everyone shares the portal at spawn. Your own at the base saves the trip, and every block in the Nether counts as eight up top."
		""
		"Build a cobblestone hut around the other side so ghasts don't shoot it out, and always carry a second flint and steel. The ghasts from &6Born in Chaos&r and &6Cataclysm&r are not the only guests there."
	]
	quest.7CEC6A06FD70C26D.quest_subtitle: "Ten obsidian and a flint and steel."
	quest.7CEC6A06FD70C26D.title: "&5Build your own portal"
	quest.7CEDA7A5E67ADD17.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_apprentice_potions.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Potion Jar&r: shapeless Source Jar and Abjuration Essence. Empty Potion Jar next to the cauldron, click the cauldron with an awkward potion, Nether wart in a chest next to it."
		""
		"The Wixie fills &e3 doses&r per round into the jar. The &6Alchemical Sourcelink&r (brewing stand instead of lava bucket) makes Source from potions in jars next to it; complex potions give more."
	]
	quest.7CEDA7A5E67ADD17.quest_subtitle: "Potions automatically, and Source from them."
	quest.7CEDA7A5E67ADD17.title: "&dLet the Wixie brew potions"
	quest.7CEEFBE845E92B4B.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/create_windmill.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept:&r eine &6Holzstufe&r auf einem &6Stein&r auf einer &6Welle&r ergibt das &6Windmühlenlager&r. Häng mindestens acht &6Segel&r (Wolle oder Create-Segel) daran und klick das Lager mit Rechtsklick an."
		""
		"&eCreate, Windmühle:&r Brennstoff keiner, &d1 RPM pro 8 Segel&r, &d512 SU pro RPM&r. 32 Segel geben 4 RPM und &d2 048 SU&r, 128 Segel 16 RPM und 8 192 SU. Sie dreht sich auch ohne Wind und Wetter, braucht nur freien Platz."
	]
	quest.7CEEFBE845E92B4B.quest_subtitle: "Create, 1 RPM je acht Segel, 512 SU pro RPM."
	quest.7CEEFBE845E92B4B.title: "&6Stell eine Windmühle auf"
	quest.7D06DF94043D09D2.quest_desc: [
		"Rucksack in die Mitte, Kupferbarren oder Eisenbarren drumherum, an der Werkbank. Der Inhalt bleibt drin."
		""
		"Kupfer: 45 Plätze, 1 Upgrade. Eisen: 54 Plätze, 2 Upgrades. Stufe 3 bringt Gold (81, 3) und Diamant (108, 5) mit Inception und Everlasting Upgrade, Stufe 4 Netherit (120, 7). Kapitel &6Lager&r."
	]
	quest.7D06DF94043D09D2.quest_subtitle: "Kupfer und Eisen: 45 und 54 Plätze."
	quest.7D06DF94043D09D2.title: "&6Rüste den Rucksack auf"
	quest.7D20C416931100C8.quest_desc: [
		"Glass in the corners, circuits top and bottom, a Chemical Tank on the left, an Energy Tablet in the middle, a Fluid Tank on the right."
		""
		"A switch in the window picks the direction: &econdensing&r turns gas into fluid 1 to 1 (fillable into buckets), &edecondensing&r turns water into water vapour or liquid gas back into gas."
	]
	quest.7D20C416931100C8.quest_subtitle: "Gas becomes fluid and back."
	quest.7D20C416931100C8.title: "&bBuild a Rotary Condensentrator"
	quest.7D220B21FC4DA04A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nuclearcraft_irradiation.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Irradiation Chamber:&r boron plates in the corners, Plate Advanced at the top and bottom, servos left and right, a chest in the middle. An &6irradiation line&r is cell, moderator, chamber in a row, up to six per chamber."
		""
		"You put the &6Irradiator&r (with magnesium diboride coils) into the wall. Thorium dust becomes TBP, bismuth becomes polonium. The way to polonium pellets for Mekanism is in the chapter &dMekanism: Elite&r."
	]
	quest.7D220B21FC4DA04A.quest_subtitle: "The reactor as a tool."
	quest.7D220B21FC4DA04A.title: "&eIrradiate Materials in the Reactor"
	quest.7D27952BFCAE93F3.quest_desc: [
		"&eDas Gerät:&r Ein &6Seelenanker&r (6 Weinender Obsidian, 3 Leuchtstein) setzt im Nether deinen Spawnpunkt. Lade ihn mit &6Leuchtsteinblöcken&r, jede Ladung ist ein Wiederauferstehen."
		""
		"&eWarum:&r Ein Bett explodiert im Nether. Wer dort eine Festung oder einen Tunnel baut, stirbt mit dem Anker nicht zurück an den Weltspawn, sondern wacht neben der Baustelle auf."
		""
		"&cAchtung:&r In der Oberwelt explodiert dafür der Anker, wenn du ihn benutzt."
	]
	quest.7D27952BFCAE93F3.quest_subtitle: "Betten explodieren dort, der Anker nicht. Stufe 2."
	quest.7D27952BFCAE93F3.title: "&cSchlaf im Nether mit dem Seelenanker"
	quest.7D2EE8FBD6DD201E.quest_desc: [
		"At the table: &fAir Essence&r, &6Wilden Wing&r, &e3 feathers&r, &6blaze rod&r, &6Nether wart&r."
		""
		"&eSelf, Slowfall, Extend Time&r makes every jump harmless. With Leap from tier 1 you travel like this: leap, glide, leap."
	]
	quest.7D2EE8FBD6DD201E.quest_subtitle: "Down like a feather."
	quest.7D2EE8FBD6DD201E.title: "&dLearn Slowfall"
	quest.7D3956C3E885BEE2.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting table: corners &d4 Dragonstones&r, top and bottom &d2 Pixie Dust&r, left and right &c2 Afrit Essence&r, middle &71 Reinforced Alloy&r."
		""
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/item/elven_star.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Afrit Essence comes from a defeated Afrit from Occultism, the Reinforced Alloy from Mekanism's Metallurgic Infuser. Ask the engineers."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r The obelisk wants &e8 Elven Stars&r, plus 400 Elementium and 150 Afrit Essence. Once tech is full too, &6Stage 4 (Star Works)&r opens with the End and the Gaia Guardian."
	]
	quest.7D3956C3E885BEE2.quest_subtitle: "The magic milestone of stage 3."
	quest.7D3956C3E885BEE2.title: "&d&lBuild an Elven Star"
	quest.7D57F90906C9841C.quest_desc: [
		"A &fsnow golem&r drops the &6Frozen Core&r, so build one and slay it. Diamond and Frozen Core on top, &6Void Tear&r and diamond in the middle, iron bottom left give the &6Ice Magus Rod&r."
		""
		"Shift right click sucks up to &e250 snowballs&r from your inventory. Every shot deals &d2&r damage, &d+2&r against fireproof mobs and &d+4&r against blazes. Just right for the Nether."
	]
	quest.7D57F90906C9841C.quest_subtitle: "Snowballs that really hurt."
	quest.7D57F90906C9841C.title: "&bBuild an Ice Magus Rod"
	quest.7D5CFC6BE654DAD1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Powah&r, &6Energiekabel&r: Starter &e500 FE/t&r, Basic 2 000, Hardened 5 000, Blazing 20 000, Niotic 50 000, Spirited &e200 000&r. Die &6Ender-Zelle&r schickt Strom ohne Kabel an jede andere Zelle auf demselben Kanal, Starter 1 000 bis Spirited 400 000 FE/t. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"Nitro mit 1 000 000 FE/t öffnet in Stufe 4. &eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r Die Energizing Orb, die alle Powah-Metalle macht, braucht einen Manadiamanten. Siehe Kapitel Powah."
	]
	quest.7D5CFC6BE654DAD1.quest_subtitle: "Powah, Energiekabel: 500 bis 200 000 FE pro Tick, Ender-Zellen ohne Kabel."
	quest.7D5CFC6BE654DAD1.title: "Lies: Powah-Kabel und Ender-Zellen"
	quest.7D69F29F6C3D572D.quest_desc: [
		"An &6Electric Pump&r with a &6Filter Upgrade&r gets &e10 mB of Heavy Water&r per water block. The Electrolytic Separator turns 2 mB of it into &e2 mB of Deuterium&r and 1 mB of oxygen."
		""
		"As proof, a bucket of liquid Deuterium from the Rotary Condensentrator."
	]
	quest.7D69F29F6C3D572D.quest_subtitle: "Heavy water, split."
	quest.7D69F29F6C3D572D.title: "&bPump Deuterium"
	quest.7D69F4A7ED227A86.quest_desc: [
		"Six horizontal Dielectric Rods at the top and bottom, Blazing Crystal, &6Blazing Capacitor&r, Blazing Crystal in the middle: twelve &6Blazing cables&r with &e20,000 FE/t&r. Hardened cables go the same way with Energized Steel, 5,000 FE/t."
		""
		"A cable is only as strong as its weakest piece. A Basic cable (2,000 FE/t) between a Blazing reactor and a cell slows everything down to a fifth."
	]
	quest.7D69F4A7ED227A86.quest_subtitle: "The line has to grow with the reactor."
	quest.7D69F4A7ED227A86.title: "&6Lay Blazing cables"
	quest.7D6F9AF700A832CA.quest_desc: [
		"&6Crystallized Moths&r fly in the &6Crystallized Desert&r. Feed one enough meat until it is tame."
		""
		"It attacks your enemies with sound waves. A companion that fights along in this dimension is worth a lot."
	]
	quest.7D6F9AF700A832CA.quest_subtitle: "A companion with sound waves."
	quest.7D6F9AF700A832CA.title: "&dTame a Crystallized Moth"
	quest.7D70C7C2027FC92F.quest_desc: [
		"&6Sophisticated Storage&r, &6Packband&r: Rechtsklick auf eine Sophisticated-Truhe, abbauen, und sie fällt mit allem Inhalt als ein Gegenstand. Schleimball und Papier, mehrere Einsätze je Rolle. &eStufe 1.&r"
		""
		"&eStufe 2:&r Der &6Pappkarton&r von Mekanism (Sägespäne) packt jeden Block mit Inhalt ein, auch Maschinen und Öfen. Create-Tresore und Mekanism-Tanks behalten ihren Inhalt beim Abbauen sowieso."
	]
	quest.7D70C7C2027FC92F.quest_subtitle: "Sophisticated Storage, Packband: eine volle Truhe als ein Gegenstand."
	quest.7D70C7C2027FC92F.title: "Kleb eine Truhe zu"
	quest.7D82B0CD4091CC36.quest_desc: [
		"Top &6two Template Boards, iron ingot&r, bottom &6two Template Boards, stick&r."
		""
		"With the kit in hand you pick the part type with &eZ&r and &eC&r, then kit plus tool into the grid. Tool and part come out separately."
	]
	quest.7D82B0CD4091CC36.quest_subtitle: "Take parts out again."
	quest.7D82B0CD4091CC36.title: "&7Build a modkit"
	quest.7D93B92B6079A016.quest_desc: [
		"2 &6Skyroot Planks&r über einem &6Golden Amber&r ergeben den &6Golden Dart Shooter&r. Munition: eine Feder, ein Skyroot Stick und ein Golden Amber übereinander ergeben &e4 Golden Darts&r. Darts fliegen schnurgerade, ohne Bogen."
		""
		"&6Poison Dart Shooter&r: Shooter plus Aechor Petal. 8 Golden Darts um einen &6Skyroot Poison Bucket&r ergeben 8 &6Poison Darts&r, die vergiften. Im Altar wird ein Golden Dart in 2,5 Sekunden zum stärkeren &6Enchanted Dart&r."
		""
		"Gegen Zephyre, Valkyries und alles, was fliegt, ist der Dart Shooter besser als jeder Bogen."
	]
	quest.7D93B92B6079A016.quest_subtitle: "Die Fernwaffe für Dungeons."
	quest.7D93B92B6079A016.title: "&6Bau einen Dart Shooter"
	quest.7D9C8E2E374EDD19.quest_desc: [
		"&6A book&r and &6rotten flesh&r, shapeless: the &6Ars Ecclesia&r."
		""
		"&5Eidolon&r is dark magic: soul shards from the undead, rituals at the brazier, prayers at the altar and tools that harvest souls. The whole mod opens with &6stage 3&r."
		""
		"In the Codex chapter &eSigns&r you will later sing your chants. Take good care of the book."
	]
	quest.7D9C8E2E374EDD19.quest_subtitle: "A book about souls, gods and the undead."
	quest.7D9C8E2E374EDD19.title: "&5&lWrite Yourself the Codex"
	quest.7DAC654AEFC2881A.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/draconic_injectors.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"At the top &6diamond, Draconium Core, diamond&r, in the middle &6stone, iron block, stone&r, at the bottom three &6stone&r."
		""
		"Each injector points its tip at the core, &eat least 2&r and &eat most 16 blocks&r away. Too close and the core reports &e\"One or more injectors are too close!\"&r. Every injector needs a power cable."
		""
		"A recipe needs as many injectors as it has ingredients. With Draconium injectors a fusion charges for 15 seconds and crafts for 15 seconds."
	]
	quest.7DAC654AEFC2881A.quest_subtitle: "Each holds one ingredient."
	quest.7DAC654AEFC2881A.title: "&dSet Up Eight Draconium Injectors"
	quest.7DAF9CEEA0CE6DF8.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Bienennest&r und ein &6Diamanthelm&r formlos. Kapitel &eProductive Bees&r."
		""
		"Schutz wie ein Diamanthelm. Wütende Bienen greifen dich nicht an, und wer dich trifft, bekommt mit 30 Prozent Chance eine &6KamikazBee&r ab."
	]
	quest.7DAF9CEEA0CE6DF8.quest_subtitle: "Productive Bees: die Bienen auf deiner Seite."
	quest.7DAF9CEEA0CE6DF8.title: "&eSetz den Bienennest-Helm auf"
	quest.7DCAC80D27E96240.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Powdered Ender, 1 Powdered Gold&r. With cloth a scroll, without cloth a circle on the ground."
		""
		"The scroll takes you to the highest solid block above you, for &d30 mana&r. As a circle without cloth it sends everything up that lies or stands on it, items and animals too. An elevator out of the mine."
	]
	quest.7DCAC80D27E96240.quest_subtitle: "Out of the cave to the surface."
	quest.7DCAC80D27E96240.title: "&5Draw Ascension"
	quest.7DCB1A7478CBECD6.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6nickel&r at the top, three &6steel&r in the middle, three nickel at the bottom make &efour&r &6Magnetic Coils&r."
		""
		"Coils go into the motor, the generator, the furnace and many addons. Later the Assembler makes six from one steel, two nickel and one copper."
	]
	quest.7DCB1A7478CBECD6.quest_subtitle: "Four coils from nickel and steel."
	quest.7DCB1A7478CBECD6.title: "&bWind Magnetic Coils"
	quest.7DD047C12EEA827D.quest_desc: [
		"&6Archwood&r grows in its own forests with red, blue, green and purple leaves. Every log gives &e4 archwood planks&r, the colour does not matter."
		""
		"Plant a few saplings at home. Chamber, jar, table and pedestals all need archwood."
		""
		"&eTip:&r The same forests are home to the &dStarbuncles&r, and &6Sourceberries&r grow there."
	]
	quest.7DD047C12EEA827D.quest_subtitle: "Colourful forests that everything is built from."
	quest.7DD047C12EEA827D.title: "&6Cut down archwood"
	quest.7DD5A9BCD80E24CF.quest_desc: [
		"&5Pentacle:&r Tibira's Attraction: Abras' circle plus &e8 black&r signs and &e4 wither skeleton skulls&r."
		"&6Bowls:&r &6Aquisitor&r, &6prismarine crystals&r, &6prismarine shard&r, &6ghast tear&r. Marid book (&e4 green dye&r)."
		"&cStart:&r when grey particles appear, use a &6trident&r on the golden bowl. 210 seconds."
		""
		"The Marid arrives aggressive. Summon it in a group. Defeated, it drops &9Marid Essence&r, more with Looting."
	]
	quest.7DD5A9BCD80E24CF.quest_subtitle: "The strongest spirit you can summon."
	quest.7DD5A9BCD80E24CF.title: "&9&lDefeat an Unbound Marid"
	quest.7DEE7B15D6C0B4D0.quest_desc: [
		"Four &6Draconium Blocks&r go into the Fusion Crafting Core as a stack. That is 36 ingots per fusion, 576 for the whole goal."
		""
		"If your draconium line from stage 4 is still running, keep it running."
	]
	quest.7DEE7B15D6C0B4D0.quest_subtitle: "The catalyst."
	quest.7DEE7B15D6C0B4D0.title: "&9Prepare Four Draconium Blocks"
	quest.7DEE88AE42D6F2D4.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Energizing Rods&r von &bPowah&r nehmen ihren Strom von unten. Setz unter jeden Stab einen &6Flux-Punkt&r, und die Kugel lädt so schnell, wie die Stäbe erlauben."
		""
		"Ein Punkt schafft 800 000 FE/t, mehr als jeder Stab dieser Stufe. Gib den Punkten unter den Stäben eine niedrige Priorität, dann lädt die Kugel nur mit dem Strom, den die Fabrik gerade nicht braucht."
	]
	quest.7DEE88AE42D6F2D4.quest_subtitle: "Ein Punkt unter jedem Stab."
	quest.7DEE88AE42D6F2D4.title: "&dSpeis die Energizing Orb per Flux"
	quest.7DEFE07B6F1A33CE.quest_desc: [
		"Kill &65 Rotlings&r and collect &68 Utheric Shards&r. All rotspawn drop shards."
		""
		"&cUtheric Infection:&r Every hit from a rotspawn infects you further. If it gets too strong, it becomes deadly. Keep your distance and do not run into groups."
		""
		"The antidote is &6Rogdorium&r from the Depths, see below."
	]
	quest.7DEFE07B6F1A33CE.quest_subtitle: "The real monsters down here."
	quest.7DEFE07B6F1A33CE.title: "&4Slay the Rotspawn"
	quest.7DF5DF1A7C262E36.quest_desc: [
		"A &6Cogwheel&r and a &6pipe&r make the &6Mechanical Pump&r. Put it into the line and power it; it pushes up to &e16 blocks&r far."
		""
		"The arrow shows the direction; reversed rotation pumps backwards. The more RPM, the more flow, at &d4 SU per RPM&r."
		""
		"&cCommon mistake:&r Two pumps working against each other."
	]
	quest.7DF5DF1A7C262E36.quest_subtitle: "The engine of the pipe network."
	quest.7DF5DF1A7C262E36.title: "&6Pump water"
	quest.7DFD41C194A0DF40.quest_desc: [
		"Three &6steel ingots&r and two sticks, like any pickaxe. Mekanism Tools has whole sets from osmium, bronze, steel, glowstone and obsidian."
		""
		"The &6paxel&r is handy: pickaxe, axe and shovel in one, from the three tools and two ingots."
	]
	quest.7DFD41C194A0DF40.quest_subtitle: "Mekanism Tools: more durable than iron."
	quest.7DFD41C194A0DF40.title: "&7Forge a steel pickaxe"
	quest.7E139C8E79A4891E.quest_desc: [
		"Diamant, &6Smaragd&r, Diamant oben, Kunststoffplatte, &6Seelensand&r, Kunststoffplatte in der Mitte, zwei &6Goldbarren&r unten außen ergeben den &6Memory Stick&r."
		""
		"&eRechtsklick&r legt ein Level in den Stick, &eSchleichen und Rechtsklick&r holt eins zurück. &eLinksklick&r schaltet das Einsammeln ein: Erfahrungskugeln, die du aufhebst, wandern direkt in den Stick."
		""
		"Rechtsklick auf einen Tank füllt die Erfahrung als &bGedächtnis-Essenz&r (Memory Essence) hinein, oder holt sie wieder heraus."
	]
	quest.7E139C8E79A4891E.quest_subtitle: "Level auf Vorrat."
	quest.7E139C8E79A4891E.title: "&aSpeicher Erfahrung im Memory Stick"
	quest.7E1A82B2D5A5882A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Glowstone dust&r into the Osmium Compressor: a &6Refined Glowstone Ingot&r."
		""
		"One of those ingots sits in the middle of every Teleporter Frame recipe. Glowstone comes from the Nether."
	]
	quest.7E1A82B2D5A5882A.quest_subtitle: "Glowstone dust in the compressor."
	quest.7E1A82B2D5A5882A.title: "&eMake Refined Glowstone"
	quest.7E1BE432C8DB6E50.quest_desc: [
		"Place an &6iron block&r directly next to the active goo. After &e2 minutes&r it is a &6Raw Ferricore Block&r. Mine it, and you get &63 to 4 Raw Ferricore&r."
		""
		"Nine iron for three to four Ferricore sounds expensive, but the goo works on all six sides at once, and you only have to place and mine blocks. Silk Touch gives back the whole block, Fortune brings nothing extra."
		""
		"After every finished block the goo dies with a &e10 percent&r chance. Then it is gray again and wants sugar or rotten flesh. It still finishes what it is converting right now."
	]
	quest.7E1BE432C8DB6E50.quest_subtitle: "An iron block becomes Raw Ferricore."
	quest.7E1BE432C8DB6E50.title: "&7Feed the Goo Iron"
	quest.7E2A3C1AEE32A999.quest_desc: [
		"Put &6dripstone blocks&r around the Pure Daisy, they become &6calcite&r."
		""
		"What else it converts: ice to packed ice, packed ice to blue ice, a water source to snow, netherrack to cobblestone, soul sand to sand. The two Nether blocks are available from stage 2."
	]
	quest.7E2A3C1AEE32A999.quest_subtitle: "The daisy can do more than Livingrock."
	quest.7E2A3C1AEE32A999.title: "&6Purify dripstone into calcite"
	quest.7E2CCDB8C5CFB737.quest_desc: [
		"With Apotheosis and many magic mods there are far more enchantments than in vanilla. &6Enchantment Descriptions&r writes what each enchantment does under it in the tooltip."
		""
		"That goes for books, tools, weapons and armour. So before you use up a book on the anvil, take a quick read."
	]
	quest.7E2CCDB8C5CFB737.quest_subtitle: "The description is right in the tooltip."
	quest.7E2CCDB8C5CFB737.title: "&6Read what an enchantment does"
	quest.7E2E2792A015C306.quest_desc: [
		"Find an &6ocean monument&r and tick this off. &6YUNG's Better Ocean Monuments&r builds it bigger and more varied."
		""
		"Bring potions of water breathing, milk against the Elder Guardians' fatigue and doors for air pockets. Sponges and prismarine are the loot."
	]
	quest.7E2E2792A015C306.quest_subtitle: "Bigger, and the Elder Guardians are waiting."
	quest.7E2E2792A015C306.title: "&3Dive to an ocean monument"
	quest.7E3038196807B632.quest_desc: [
		"Give an Alakarkinos on the beach a &6pottery sherd&r and it gives you a token. In the apparatus with a &6brush&r and &e3 pottery sherds&r it becomes the charm."
		""
		"Bind it to a chest with the Dominion Wand, sand or gravel within 3 blocks, Source next to it. It sifts the blocks and puts finds from archaeology loot into the chest."
	]
	quest.7E3038196807B632.quest_subtitle: "A crab that sifts sand."
	quest.7E3038196807B632.title: "&6Summon an Alakarkinos"
	quest.7E3468821B08280E.quest_desc: [
		"A &bdiamond&r gives one &6Niotic Crystal&r for &e300,000 FE&r. By now at the latest Hardened rods pay off."
		""
		"{image:powah:textures/item/crystal_niotic.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"Niotic capacitors come one per recipe. Plan a few extra diamonds."
	]
	quest.7E3468821B08280E.quest_subtitle: "One diamond, three hundred thousand FE."
	quest.7E3468821B08280E.title: "&bCharge Niotic Crystals"
	quest.7E3D25709EF50BAE.quest_desc: [
		"Steel casing, circuits, iron and planks. A log becomes &esix planks&r instead of four, plus some &6sawdust&r now and then."
		""
		"It breaks stairs, doors and chests back down into wood. Sawdust becomes the Cardboard Box, with which you move blocks with their contents."
	]
	quest.7E3D25709EF50BAE.quest_subtitle: "Six planks per log."
	quest.7E3D25709EF50BAE.title: "&eBuild a Precision Sawmill"
	quest.7E411170E8AC41F5.quest_desc: [
		"All with &6Manipulation Essence&r:"
		"&dPlace Block&r (dropper): places blocks from the hotbar. &dToss&r (dispenser): drops an item or puts it into an inventory. &dInteract&r (lever, pressure plate, button): right click from a distance."
		"&dRotate&r (just the essence): rotates blocks. &dDelay&r (repeater, clock): everything to its right acts later."
	]
	quest.7E411170E8AC41F5.quest_subtitle: "Stage 1 checklist: move and switch blocks."
	quest.7E411170E8AC41F5.title: "&dLearn the manipulation glyphs"
	quest.7E4713E15FE7F816.quest_desc: [
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r four &6steel ingots&r in the corners, four &6andesite alloys&r on the sides, an &6osmium ingot&r in the middle. The alloy replaces the glass."
		""
		"From here on almost every machine is a steel casing plus circuits and whatever makes it special. A Create mixer makes two alloys from andesite and a nugget."
	]
	quest.7E4713E15FE7F816.quest_subtitle: "The hull of every machine."
	quest.7E4713E15FE7F816.title: "&7&lBuild steel casings"
	quest.7E4780CE393BFDD3.quest_desc: [
		"&6Empty Heat Sink:&r Tough Alloy in the corners, &6Thermoconducting plates&r at the top and bottom, &6iron bars, bucket, iron bars&r in the middle. Then into the &6Fluid Infuser&r with &e1,000 mB of water&r."
		""
		"A &6Water Heat Sink&r cools &e60 per tick&r when it touches a cell or a moderator. An LEU cell without a moderator makes 50. EMI shows all the rules under &eHeat Sink Placement&r."
	]
	quest.7E4780CE393BFDD3.quest_subtitle: "Without cooling it melts."
	quest.7E4780CE393BFDD3.title: "&bBuild Water Heat Sinks"
	quest.7E484524F4BD7BE5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/occultism_afrit_kandar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&5Kandar's Opened Conjure&r, 17x17: &e40 orange&r, &e36 lime&r, &e16 foundation&r (white, light grey, grey, black) and &e8 dark&r signs (grey or black), &e8 skeleton skulls&r, &e8 candles&r."
		"&7Gray Chalk&r is impure white chalk with Gray Paste, purified in Spiritfire."
		""
		"It summons an Afrit without red chalk but cannot control it. It only comes to fight. Leave the pentacle standing, you need it hundreds of times."
	]
	quest.7E484524F4BD7BE5.quest_subtitle: "A deliberately open pentacle."
	quest.7E484524F4BD7BE5.title: "&5Draw Kandar's Opened Conjure"
	quest.7E4DEB40930E7D49.quest_desc: [
		"In the apparatus: &6glass bottle&r in the middle, &6lava bucket&r, &6bucket&r, &6Allow Item Scroll&r and &6ender pearl&r on the pedestals."
		""
		"If the jar is in your &ehotbar&r, it destroys the items on its list as you pick them up and gives you a little mana for them. Used while sneaking it switches on and off."
		""
		"You add items by using the jar with the item in your off hand, or by putting the jar on the Scribe's Table and clicking the item onto it."
	]
	quest.7E4DEB40930E7D49.quest_subtitle: "Cobblestone that never reaches your inventory."
	quest.7E4DEB40930E7D49.title: "&6Build a Void Jar"
	quest.7E58371A8D3272D9.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Cockatrice&r ist der grüne Hahn mit Schlangenschwanz. Er spuckt &6Poison Needles&r, die &5Inebriation&r auslösen, das Gift des Aethers: Es schadet über Zeit und lässt dein Bild schwanken."
		""
		"&eHeilung:&r Ein &6White Apple&r von den weißen &6Crystal Trees&r oder ein &6Skyroot Remedy Bucket&r (Giftkübel im Altar verzaubert). Pack immer eins davon ein."
		""
		"Er lässt &e2 bis 3 Federn&r fallen, die du für Golden Darts brauchst."
	]
	quest.7E58371A8D3272D9.quest_subtitle: "Sein Gift lässt die Welt schwanken."
	quest.7E58371A8D3272D9.title: "&2Erlege einen Cockatrice"
	quest.7E8C66DED5746CDA.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/undergarden_arrival.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Build a frame like a Nether portal, but from &6stone bricks&r. Right click the frame with the &6Catalyst&r to open the portal. Walk through."
		""
		"Cracked, mossy and chiseled stone bricks work too, as do deepslate bricks and deepslate tiles."
		""
		"&eOver there:&r eternal night, monsters everywhere block light does not reach. &eBeds work&r, place one by the portal right away. One block here is &e4 blocks&r in the Overworld."
	]
	quest.7E8C66DED5746CDA.quest_subtitle: "A stone brick frame, Catalyst on it."
	quest.7E8C66DED5746CDA.title: "&2&lDescend"
	quest.7E94BCD72AFBE5BE.quest_desc: [
		"Into the pot: &6rotten flesh&r, &6bone meal&r, raw meat and &6rice&r."
		""
		"A tamed wolf that eats it gets effects for a while. Which ones is in the tooltip."
	]
	quest.7E94BCD72AFBE5BE.quest_subtitle: "For your best friend."
	quest.7E94BCD72AFBE5BE.title: "&7Cook dog food"
	quest.7EA4571151963D5D.quest_desc: [
		"Die &6Myzel-Generatoren&r baust du an der Werkbank, den Reaktor im Auflösungsapparat. Jeder Generator verbrennt eine eigene Sorte: der Ofen-Generator Brennstoff, der Kulinarische Essen, der Trank-Generator Tränke, der Netherstern-Generator Nethersterne. EMI zeigt unter jedem, was er nimmt."
		""
		"&eIndustrial Foregoing, Myzel-Reaktor:&r Er erzeugt sehr viel Strom, aber nur, solange von &ejeder&r Sorte Myzel-Generator einer gleichzeitig läuft. Ein Langzeitprojekt. Offen ab Stufe 3, siehe Kapitel &aIndustrial Foregoing&r."
	]
	quest.7EA4571151963D5D.quest_subtitle: "Industrial Foregoing: sechzehn Generatoren, jeder frisst etwas anderes."
	quest.7EA4571151963D5D.title: "&aVerfeuere alles in Myzel-Generatoren"
	quest.7EA7F4A9070E15E8.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/hostile_networks_sim_chamber.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRezept auf Kronwerke:&r oben ein &6Netheritbarren&r. Mitte &6Diamant&r, &6Obsidian&r, Diamant. Unten &6Goldbarren&r, &6Engineering-Prozessor&r aus AE2, Goldbarren. Der Prozessor ersetzt den Komparator des Originals."
		""
		"Der &6Loot Fabricator&r nimmt eine &6Mob-Vorhersage&r und macht in &e3 Sekunden&r für &d256 FE/t&r daraus einen Stapel Drops. Welchen, wählst du im Fenster: Links die Vorhersage, in der Mitte die Liste der möglichen Drops, Klick auf einen setzt ihn fest."
		""
		"&eZwei Modi:&r &6Fixed&r macht immer den gewählten Drop. &6Queue&r arbeitet eine Reihenfolge ab, die du anklickst. Er speichert 1 Million FE."
		""
		"&cStufe 4:&r Netherit und der Prozessor sind kein Problem, aber der Fabrikator selbst ist bis zum Sternwerk gesperrt."
	]
	quest.7EA7F4A9070E15E8.quest_subtitle: "Kommt in Stufe 4. Aus der Vorhersage wird der Drop."
	quest.7EA7F4A9070E15E8.title: "&6&lDer Loot-Fabrikator"
	quest.7EB618D817E03CC1.quest_desc: [
		"&6Applied Energistics 2&r, &6ME-Importbus&r und &6Exportbus&r: &e4 Vorgänge pro Sekunde&r, 1 Gegenstand je Vorgang, mit vier Beschleunigungskarten 96. Der &6Speicherbus&r macht jede Truhe zum Netzlager. Filterplätze in jedem Bus. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"&6Refined Storage&r, &6Importeur&r und &6Exporteur&r: je 2 FE pro Tick, neun Filterplätze, Externer Speicher als Gegenstück zum Speicherbus. &eStufe 3.&r"
		""
		"Ein Netz ersetzt alle Rohre zwischen Lager und Maschinen. Siehe Kapitel Applied Energistics 2 und Refined Storage."
	]
	quest.7EB618D817E03CC1.quest_subtitle: "AE2 und Refined Storage: das Lager holt und bringt selbst."
	quest.7EB618D817E03CC1.title: "Lies: Import- und Exportbusse"
	quest.7EB98F0503721016.quest_desc: [
		"Material: &e4 deepslate&r (smelted from cobbled deepslate)."
		""
		"Plus &e4 Inferium Essence&r and a &6Prosperity Seed Base&r in the Infusion Altar."
	]
	quest.7EB98F0503721016.quest_subtitle: "One seed, one checkmark."
	quest.7EB98F0503721016.title: "Seed: Deepslate"
	quest.7EC2D916843CEF39.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/list_dimensions_d_mining.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eDas Portal:&r ein Rahmen aus &6Grubenrahmen&r wie ein Netherportal, 4 breit und 5 hoch, ohne Ecken &e10 Blöcke&r. Rechtsklick mit einem &6Quellstein&r auf die Innenseite, und es öffnet sich."
		""
		"&eDrüben:&r eine eigene Welt nur zum Graben, alle drei Tage neu. Alles Weitere im Kapitel &aErkundung&r."
	]
	quest.7EC2D916843CEF39.quest_subtitle: "Grubenrahmen, ein Quellstein, Stufe 1."
	quest.7EC2D916843CEF39.title: "&6Die Farmwelt"
	quest.7ECA5B60B8219BC7.quest_desc: [
		"&6Attuner:&r lapis in the corners, gold on the sides, middle empty. Shapeless with a &6diamond&r it becomes an &dAttuned Diamond&r."
		""
		"Holding it and right clicking fills it with your mana. Spells draw from all gems in your inventory. Fill it before you sleep."
	]
	quest.7ECA5B60B8219BC7.quest_subtitle: "10,000 mana on the go."
	quest.7ECA5B60B8219BC7.title: "&dAttune a Diamond"
	quest.7ECD8000CD08C7FC.quest_desc: [
		"An &aemerald&r gives one &6Spirited Crystal&r for &e1,000,000 FE&r."
		""
		"&cComing in stage 4:&r Nitro. A nether star, two redstone blocks and a Blazing Crystal Block give sixteen Nitro Crystals for 20 million FE."
	]
	quest.7ECD8000CD08C7FC.quest_subtitle: "The top end in stage 3."
	quest.7ECD8000CD08C7FC.title: "&aCharge Spirited Crystals"
	quest.7EDAADB26F769CA5.quest_desc: [
		"Crafter recipe: four &6andesite alloys&r, four &6copper coils&r, one &6shaft&r make the &6generator induction rotor&r. Place it behind the coupling."
		""
		"Rotors make power when they turn in a magnetic field. Up to &e8&r rotor parts per generator, each costs &d32 SU per RPM&r."
	]
	quest.7EDAADB26F769CA5.quest_subtitle: "The rotating mass, 32 SU per RPM."
	quest.7EDAADB26F769CA5.title: "&3Build an induction rotor"
	quest.7EDF203FE55AF9C1.quest_desc: [
		"Der &6Zerkleinerer&r von Immersive Engineering ist ein Multiblock aus 10 Leichten Ingenieursbausteinen, 10 Stahlgerüsten, 8 Stahlzäunen, 9 Trichtern und einem Redstone-Ingenieursbaustein. Die Ingenieursbausteine öffnen in &6Stufe 3&r (auf Kronwerke mit Messingblech)."
		""
		"&eDie Zahlen:&r Erzblock &e2 Staub&r plus zu 10 Prozent ein Nickelstaub. Rohes Erz 1 Staub plus zu 33 Prozent ein zweiter, also wie die Anreicherungskammer. Block aus Rohem Erz 12 Staub. &e6 000 FE&r pro Erz."
		""
		"&eLohnt sich:&r wenn du IE sowieso spielst und Nickel willst. Gegen die Dreifach-Straße verliert er. Siehe Kapitel Immersive Engineering: Schwerindustrie."
	]
	quest.7EDF203FE55AF9C1.quest_subtitle: "Stufe 3: zwei Staub und etwas Nickel."
	quest.7EDF203FE55AF9C1.title: "&7Zerkleinere mit Immersive Engineering"
	quest.7EE273026055D90E.quest_desc: [
		"All with &6Conjuration Essence&r:"
		"&dSummon Vex&r (Totem of Undying): three vexes fight for a while."
		"&dSummon Undead&r (bone, wither skeleton skull): skeletons, Amplify gives better weapons."
		"&dFangs&r (2 prismarine shards, totem): fangs like the evoker's. &dSummon Decoy&r (4 armor stands): a copy of you that draws monsters."
	]
	quest.7EE273026055D90E.quest_subtitle: "Tier 3 checklist: allies out of nothing."
	quest.7EE273026055D90E.title: "&dLearn the Summons"
	quest.7EF5D341251BB592.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/draconic_stabilizer.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&eRecipe on Kronwerke:&r a &aGaia Spirit&r in the top middle, &6diamonds&r in the four corners, the &6Particle Generator&r in the middle."
		""
		"Four stabilizers are four Gaia Spirits. They only come from the &aGuardian of Gaia&r: every player in the fight gets 6, whoever lands the last hit 8. So one fight with the mages is enough."
		""
		"&eSetup:&r in one plane on four sides of the core, exactly in line with its center, outside its blocks, pointing at the core. If wrong, it reports &e\"Stabilizer configuration invalid\"&r. Then &eActivate&r."
	]
	quest.7EF5D341251BB592.quest_subtitle: "The dragon storage needs Gaia."
	quest.7EF5D341251BB592.title: "&c&lBuild Four Stabilizers with Gaia"
	quest.7EFFC40035977105.quest_desc: [
		"Richte ein Gerüst auf einen &6Mimic&r von Artifacts und töte ihn. Mimics tarnen sich als Truhen in Verliesen und Minenschächten und springen dich an, wenn du sie öffnest."
		""
		"Der Mimic hat eigene Zahlen: &e30 Kills&r bis Basic, dann je 30 bis Advanced und Superior, &e36&r bis Self Aware, insgesamt 126. Das Modell kostet &d2.560 FE/t&r."
		""
		"Dafür wird jede Vorhersage zu einem &6Artefakt deiner Wahl&r: Kreuzkette, Kraftschuhe, Nachtsichtbrille, Wolke in der Flasche, alles, was der Mod hat. Kein anderes Modell gibt dir Ausrüstung."
	]
	quest.7EFFC40035977105.quest_subtitle: "Das seltenste Modell, und das lohnendste."
	quest.7EFFC40035977105.title: "&eLerne den Mimic"
	quest.7F0346A78EA8EE61.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_master_alteration.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"&6Alteration Table&r: Scribe's Table with &e4 Magebloom Fiber&r in a cross. &6Blank Thread&r: 3 fibers each at the top and bottom, 3 gold nuggets in the middle."
		""
		"Robe on the stand, thread on the table, take the robe off. The same threads on two pieces do nothing."
	]
	quest.7F0346A78EA8EE61.quest_subtitle: "Sew threads into the robe."
	quest.7F0346A78EA8EE61.title: "&aBuild an Alteration Table"
	quest.7F0E3492824D8AAD.quest_desc: [
		"Top three &6green dyes&r, middle &6gold nugget, wheat seeds, gold nugget&r, bottom three &6wheat&r: four fertilizer."
		""
		"Farmland fertilized with green gives more yield. Both fertilizers together make the best field."
	]
	quest.7F0E3492824D8AAD.quest_subtitle: "More yield per harvest."
	quest.7F0E3492824D8AAD.title: "&aSpread green fertilizer"
	quest.7F0E750CD5DC2AA1.quest_desc: [
		"Place a &6coal block&r or a block of nine charcoal next to the goo. After 2 minutes it is a &6Raw Primal Coal&r block and gives &63 to 4 Primal Coal&r when mined."
		""
		"One piece of &6Primal Coal&r burns &e4,800 ticks&r, three times as long as coal (1,600), in any furnace. In the generator and the Pocket Generator it also counts double: faster burn, more FE per tick."
		""
		"Nine pieces give a &6Primal Coal Block&r with 48,000 ticks. You need that for the next coal tier."
	]
	quest.7F0E750CD5DC2AA1.quest_subtitle: "Coal that burns three times as long."
	quest.7F0E750CD5DC2AA1.title: "&8Make Primal Coal"
	quest.7F11A7C56DB50529.quest_desc: [
		"Zieh das Teil &eStart&r auf die Fläche. Hier beginnt die Drohne. Es muss genau einmal vorkommen, und alles, was folgen soll, wird &eunten&r angesteckt."
		""
		"Ein roter Rand an einem Teil heißt: Da fehlt etwas. Fahr mit der Maus darüber, der Tooltip sagt dir, was. Ist das letzte Teil abgearbeitet, fängt die Drohne wieder bei Start an."
	]
	quest.7F11A7C56DB50529.quest_subtitle: "Jedes Programm hat genau einen Anfang."
	quest.7F11A7C56DB50529.title: "&7Puzzleteil: Start"
	quest.7F13FB9DC1D1B328.quest_desc: [
		"Each piece: top &6Livingwood Twig&r, season rune, twig, middle Terrasteel, the matching &6Manasteel piece&r, Terrasteel, bottom one Terrasteel. Helmet with Spring, chestplate with Summer, leggings with Autumn, boots with Winter."
		""
		"As strong as netherite and heals damage with mana from the inventory. The full set costs &e12 Terrasteel&r."
		""
		"&cThink of the obelisk:&r Every ingot here is missing there. Build them once the Terrasteel line is running."
	]
	quest.7F13FB9DC1D1B328.quest_subtitle: "Netherite class that repairs itself."
	quest.7F13FB9DC1D1B328.title: "&aForge the Terrasteel armour"
	quest.7F1782BD568028EA.quest_desc: [
		"Connector, diamond, ender pearl, redstone give the &6Advanced Connector&r. Connectors that already stand are upgraded with the &6Connector Upgrade Kit&r (paper, ender pearl, diamond, redstone) by sneak and right click."
		""
		"It addresses every side of the block, which matters for Mekanism machines. Up to &d100,000 RF/t&r in place of 10,000 and &b5,000 mB&r per operation in place of 1,000."
		""
		"&eKronwerke:&r One energy and one item channel supply a whole steel line: power to all Metallurgic Infusers, coal and iron in, steel into the collecting chest for the obelisk."
	]
	quest.7F1782BD568028EA.quest_subtitle: "More throughput, every side."
	quest.7F1782BD568028EA.title: "&eUpgrade to the Advanced Connector"
	quest.7F1BF4EDD42D9C96.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/aether_altar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Erst das Erz: &6Icestone&r liegt wie Ambrosium auf jeder Höhe im Holystone und sieht aus wie vereister Stein. Gesetzt friert es Wasser daneben zu Eis und Lava zu Obsidian."
		""
		"Der &6Freezer&r: oben 3 &6Holystone&r, in der Mitte Holystone, &6Icestone&r, Holystone, unten 3 &6Skyroot Planks&r. Brennstoff ist Icestone, ein Block hält 20 Sekunden."
		""
		"&eRezepte:&r Wassereimer zu &6Eis&r (10 s), Lavaeimer zu &6Obsidian&r (10 s), Eis zu Packeis (15 s), Packeis zu Blaueis (25 s), Cold Aercloud zu &6Blue Aercloud&r (20 s), Skyroot Leaves zu Crystal Leaves, Iron oder Golden Ring und Pendant zu &6Ice Ring&r und &6Ice Pendant&r (40 s)."
	]
	quest.7F1BF4EDD42D9C96.quest_subtitle: "Icestone macht aus Wasser Eis und aus Lava Obsidian."
	quest.7F1BF4EDD42D9C96.title: "&bBau einen Freezer"
	quest.7F29AD01DDC6671A.quest_desc: [
		"Platinum ore lies between &eY -20&r and &eY -60&r. Mine &616 Raw Platinum&r and smelt it into ingots."
		""
		"Platinum goes into the &6Flux Gate&r (Assembler: Processing Unit, two Fluxite, one platinum ingot) and into Duratium. Flux Gates start the second half of Oritech."
	]
	quest.7F29AD01DDC6671A.quest_subtitle: "Deep down, for the Flux Gate."
	quest.7F29AD01DDC6671A.title: "&fMine Platinum"
	quest.7F2FD7A5D5AF43E8.quest_desc: [
		"A &aMana Pylon&r in the middle, &dElementium Ingots&r left and right, &dPixie Dust&r at the top and bottom. You need &e4&r of them."
		""
		"{image:botania:textures/item/gaia_spirit.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
		""
		"With &6Stage 4 (Star Works)&r the &dRitual of Gaia&r opens. At its end stands the &dGuardian of Gaia&r, and its &dGaia Spirits&r open Botania's strongest things."
		""
		"&eComing in stage 5:&r Gaia Spirit Ingots, Ritual of Gaia II, relics of the Aesir."
	]
	quest.7F2FD7A5D5AF43E8.quest_subtitle: "The altar for the elves' ritual."
	quest.7F2FD7A5D5AF43E8.title: "&dBuild Four Gaia Pylons"
	quest.7F35186F803C8F15.quest_desc: [
		"Ferroboron through the Manufactory into dust, then &6ferroboron dust&r and &6lithium dust&r in the Alloy Smelter. Gives two &6Tough Alloy&r."
		""
		"It goes into Plate Advanced, the chassis, armor, heat sinks and the reactor ports."
	]
	quest.7F35186F803C8F15.quest_subtitle: "The most important metal of the chapter."
	quest.7F35186F803C8F15.title: "&6Smelt Tough Alloy"
	quest.7F3AEE771B0AE0B7.quest_desc: [
		"&eSo geht es:&r Rechtsklick auf einen &6Wegstein&r aktiviert ihn. Ab dann reist du von jedem Wegstein zu jedem, den du kennst. Eigene baust du aus einem &6Warpstein&r, 3 Steinziegeln und 3 Obsidian."
		""
		"&eWas es kostet (Serverconfig):&r &e1 Level je 100 Blöcke&r Luftlinie, höchstens &e27&r. In eine andere Dimension immer &e27 Level&r. &eKostenlos&r sind globale Wegsteine, Warpplatten und alle Schriftrollen. Ein Warpstein lädt 1,6 Sekunden, nutzt sich ab und hat eine Abklingzeit."
		""
		"&eTipp:&r Für den Sprung zwischen Dimensionen ist das Portal fast immer billiger. Für den Weg zur Basis in derselben Welt ist die &6Rückkehr-Schriftrolle&r (2 Goldnuggets, Tintenbeutel, 3 Papier) unschlagbar. Alles Weitere im Kapitel &aErkundung&r."
	]
	quest.7F3AEE771B0AE0B7.quest_subtitle: "Ein Level pro 100 Blöcke, höchstens 27."
	quest.7F3AEE771B0AE0B7.title: "&6Reise mit Wegsteinen"
	quest.7F52B57800446C13.quest_desc: [
		"Worktable: &6Shadow Gem&r at the top right, &e2 Arcane Gold&r and a &6stick&r diagonally, Gold Inlay at the bottom left. Extra: &6Lesser Soul Gem&r and &e3 blaze powder&r."
		""
		"A swing fires bright bolts of energy that do solid damage to almost any target. Your first real ranged weapon from Eidolon."
	]
	quest.7F52B57800446C13.quest_subtitle: "The power of the Shadow Gem in your hand."
	quest.7F52B57800446C13.title: "&dBuild the Soulfire Wand"
	quest.7F67F093152DEAD5.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/ars_nouveau_fill_jar.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Place jar and link no more than &e5 blocks&r apart, the chamber no more than &e2 blocks&r next to the jar. Throw logs next to the link."
		""
		"When the jar visibly fills and the chamber works faster, your first Source is running. From now on amethyst is the only bottleneck."
		""
		"&eTip:&r A small archwood tree farm next to the link is the easiest steady source of the first days."
	]
	quest.7F67F093152DEAD5.quest_subtitle: "Logs on the ground, the bar goes up."
	quest.7F67F093152DEAD5.title: "&dFill your first jar"
	quest.7F6A8E3E4A53FCB6.quest_desc: [
		"Ein &6Druckluftrohr&r mit &b50 mB flüssigem Kunststoff&r bei &e1,5 Bar&r in der Anlage ergibt ein &6Verstärktes Druckluftrohr&r (Reinforced Pressure Tube). Es hält &e10 Bar&r aus, fasst wie das einfache 1 000 mL und nimmt dieselben Module."
		""
		"Damit lädst du Werkzeuge im Netz schneller auf ihre 10 Bar. Deine Maschinen bleiben trotzdem bei 5 Bar, also brauchen sie ein &6Regler-Modul&r (Regulator Module: zwei Sicherheitsventile um ein Rohr) vor dem Eingang. Es lässt ohne Redstone-Signal 4,9 Bar durch und sperrt bei vollem Signal ganz."
		""
		"&cStufe 3:&r Das &6Fortgeschrittene Rohr&r für 20 Bar und 4 000 mL kommt aus der Montagestraße."
	]
	quest.7F6A8E3E4A53FCB6.quest_subtitle: "10 Bar statt 5."
	quest.7F6A8E3E4A53FCB6.title: "&bVerstärke deine Rohre"
	quest.7F6C4EF2A2627DB2.quest_desc: [
		"&6Lead&r Y -32 to 80, &6silver&r Y -48 to 32, &6nickel&r below Y 24. Also &6bauxite&r (aluminium) Y 32 to 112 and &6uranium&r Y -64 to -16."
		""
		"Silver goes into electrum, nickel into constantan and Vacuum Tubes, lead into the accumulator. Smelt raw ores in the furnace or send them through Mekanism's Enrichment Chamber."
	]
	quest.7F6C4EF2A2627DB2.quest_subtitle: "The three metals you need in stage 2."
	quest.7F6C4EF2A2627DB2.title: "&7Dig for lead, silver and nickel"
	quest.7F782634B16C196A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Rod of the Lands&r: Livingwood Twig diagonally, &6dirt&r top right, &6Rune of Earth&r bottom left. Places a dirt block for mana, ideal for building bridges."
		"&6Rod of the Skies&r: the same with a &6feather&r and a &6Rune of Air&r. Flings you high into the air and briefly protects you from fall damage afterwards. With elytra it gives a boost like a rocket."
		""
		"Both work in the &6Livingwood Avatar&r too: with the Rod of the Skies it flings up everyone who jumps next to it."
	]
	quest.7F782634B16C196A.quest_subtitle: "Dirt out of nothing, a jump into the sky."
	quest.7F782634B16C196A.title: "&6Carve the first rods"
	quest.7F7B929837385409.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/powah_thermo.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Three paste at the top, two Tiny left and right of the casing, three &6Thermoelectric Plates&r at the bottom (Blaze Powder and redstone around a Tiny)."
		""
		"It stands on a heat source: &6magma block&r 800 degrees, &6lava&r 1,000, Blazing Crystal Block 2,800. As a coolant it takes water. Output like the Solar Panel, but around the clock."
	]
	quest.7F7B929837385409.quest_subtitle: "Heat below, water in."
	quest.7F7B929837385409.title: "&cSet up a Thermo Generator"
	quest.7F834519EF899D38.quest_desc: [
		"&6Router:&r Machine Frame, powered rails, comparator, redstone, iron and an ender pearl. Plus &6Routing Cables&r (string, black dye, redstone, gold nugget, gives 32) and a &6Routing Connector&r at the controller."
		""
		"In the controller you publish a channel, the router passes it on to other controllers, up to &e32&r channels per router. The &6Wireless Router&r with an antenna on top does that without cables."
	]
	quest.7F834519EF899D38.quest_subtitle: "More than eight channels."
	quest.7F834519EF899D38.title: "&eLink controllers with a router"
	quest.7FB207510E507DA1.quest_desc: [
		"&e2 Terrasteel ingots&r and &e1 Livingwood Twig&r. As strong as a netherite sword, fires a beam with the same damage when you strike."
		""
		"Terrasteel armour is made from Manasteel armour, Terrasteel, twigs and one season rune per piece. Every ingot here is missing from the obelisk."
	]
	quest.7FB207510E507DA1.quest_subtitle: "Netherite class, repaired with mana."
	quest.7FB207510E507DA1.title: "&aForge the Terra Blade"
	quest.7FCD2127F1C55ED4.quest_desc: [
		"{image:kronwerke:textures/quests/shots/nuclearcraft_irradiation.png width:224 height:126 align:center}"
		"Thorium dust in the &6Irradiator&r to TBP, then to protactinium 233. The &6Decay Hastener&r makes uranium 233, then &6bismuth dust&r. Bismuth in the Irradiator gives &6polonium dust&r. The &6Melter&r makes 90 mB per dust, the &6Crystallizer&r one &6Polonium Pellet&r from 1,000 mB."
		""
		"About eleven dust per pellet. The Irradiator needs a running fission reactor, see the chapter &aNuclearCraft&r. Mekanism's own path through nuclear waste only comes in stage 5."
		""
		"&cCareful:&r Everything on this path is radioactive. Store it far away from yourself."
	]
	quest.7FCD2127F1C55ED4.quest_subtitle: "A detour through the fission reactor."
	quest.7FCD2127F1C55ED4.title: "&a&lGet Polonium from NuclearCraft"
	quest.7FE8407A69103ADA.quest_desc: [
		"A greater rite with four runes: &5Eldritch&r, &dArcane&r and two &bAqueous&r, on Runewood."
		""
		"The rite weaves a &eRite Locus&r. Over crops it makes time run faster, other plants grow as if with bone meal. Over farmland it works on the plant on top."
	]
	quest.7FE8407A69103ADA.quest_subtitle: "A spark that makes fields grow."
	quest.7FE8407A69103ADA.title: "&2Light the Rite of Soaking"
	quest.7FE94C618861F9CC.quest_desc: [
		"In the heated lava cauldron: a &6Mandrake Root&r, &e5 gold nuggets&r, &e2 gold ingots&r. The &6Crow Blank Amulet&r you put around a crow's neck."
		""
		"In a cauldron with &e250 mB&r of regeneration potion it becomes the &6Crow Ankh Amulet&r with dried Mugwort and Yellow Dock herbs, &e2 glow berries&r and a &6Totem of Undying&r. That saves your crow like a totem."
	]
	quest.7FE94C618861F9CC.quest_subtitle: "Jewellery that saves lives."
	quest.7FE94C618861F9CC.title: "&6Forge a crow amulet"
	quest.7FEE12894DB93C7A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Squeezer:&r sticks on the sides, a &6Mechanical Press&r from Create at the top centre, planks and an iron ingot at the bottom. &6Drying Basin:&r logs, black dye at the top and bottom, iron on the sides."
		""
		"This chapter gathers the mods that move things without a tangle of pipes: &6Integrated Dynamics&r (programmable), &6XNet&r (everything on one controller), &6LaserIO&r (lasers in place of cables), plus the &6Mining Gadget&r. The sections can be done in any order."
		""
		"Simple pipes and routers are in the chapter &bPipes and Routers&r, an overview of everything in the chapter &6Checklist: Transport and Storage&r."
	]
	quest.7FEE12894DB93C7A.quest_subtitle: "The way into Integrated Dynamics."
	quest.7FEE12894DB93C7A.title: "&3&lBuild a Squeezer and a Drying Basin"
